1/1, Instinto feral 1/3, Presteza feral 2/2, Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Balance: Genesis 5/5, Improved Moonfire 2/2, Insect Swarm 1/1, Moonglow 3/3, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Nature's Reach 2/2, Nature's Splendor 1/1. Feral: Brutal Impact 2/2, Feral Charge 1/1, Feral Instinct 1/3, Feral Swiftness 2/2, Heart of the Wild 5/5. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Feral Druid Tank Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Feral Druid PvP Builds","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Feral Druid Tank Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:stats","class:druid:feral:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:211854d235b4e9cf635662913690dc90f0bea247","section:328b04e89feecf0b882a2775543ed6190db786cc"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-feral-tanque-pvp-trispec-parte-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ feral de tres ramas · parte 2/2","title_en":"Feral Tri-Spec PvP Build · Part 2/2","summary_es":"La rama de Recuperación completa la build; un punto retirado queda libre.","summary_en":"Restoration completes the build; a retired talent leaves one point free.","keywords_es":["build recuperación feral pvp","punto libre talento retirado","sanación druida jcj"],"keywords_en":["restoration feral pvp build","retired talent free point","druid pvp healing"],"text_es":"Rama de Recuperación: Furor 5/5, Metamorfosis natural 3/3, Naturalista 5/5, Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Sutileza 3/3, Arreglo rápido 1/1. El talento retirado no cuenta y deja 1 punto libre. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Restoration: Furor 5/5, Natural Shapeshifter 3/3, Naturalist 5/5, Nature's Focus 5/5, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Subtlety 3/3, Swiftmend 1/1. The retired talent is excluded, leaving 1 point free. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Feral Druid Tank Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Feral Druid PvP Builds","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Feral Druid Tank Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:stats","class:druid:feral:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:211854d235b4e9cf635662913690dc90f0bea247","section:328b04e89feecf0b882a2775543ed6190db786cc"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-equilibrio-eclipse-banda","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Alternativa de Eclipse para banda","title_en":"Hard-Cast Eclipse Raid Option","summary_es":"En banda se prefiere el casteo largo con Eclipse y la asignación PvE.","summary_en":"Raids favor hard-cast Eclipse with the PvE allocation.","keywords_es":["equilibrio eclipse banda","build casteo eclipse","alternativa equilibrio raid"],"keywords_en":["balance eclipse raid","hardcast eclipse build","balance raid alternative"],"text_es":"En banda se considera óptima la build de casteo largo centrada en Eclipse. Usa la asignación completa de la tarjeta «Build de Equilibrio JcE para banda/mazmorra»; no es un reparto distinto.","text_en":"For raids, the hard-cast Eclipse build is considered optimal. Use the complete allocation in the “Balance PvE Raid/Dungeon Build” card; it is not a separate point spread.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Balance Druid Talent Tree Builds - Forever › Best Balance Druid PvE Raid and Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:druid:balance:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:e03c13c86b67a2edbcfba6692fe83dc5e521928f"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-restauracion-pvp-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Variante JcJ grupal de Recuperación","title_en":"Restoration Group-PvP Variant","summary_es":"Para más sanación grupal, cambia puntos hacia Recrecimiento mejorado y Crecimiento salvaje.","summary_en":"Shift talents toward Improved Regrowth and Wild Growth for stronger group healing.","keywords_es":["recuperación jcj grupal","build sanación pvp druida","alcance de la naturaleza jcj","crecimiento salvaje pvp"],"keywords_en":["restoration group pvp","druid pvp healing build","nature reach pvp","wild growth pvp"],"text_es":"Para JcJ en grupo con más sanación, recorta Equilibrio hasta Alcance de la naturaleza y profundiza en Recuperación para Recrecimiento mejorado y Crecimiento salvaje. No se detalla una asignación descodificada independiente para esta variante.","text_en":"For group PvP with more healing, trim Balance to Nature’s Reach and invest deeper in Restoration for Improved Regrowth and Wild Growth. No separate decoded point allocation is provided for this variation.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Restoration Druid Talent Tree Builds - Forever › Best Restoration Druid PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:39e7176816c24fd0ae619347680ac7db70093459"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-equilibrio-subir-mixto","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Equilibrio versátil y sanadora (subida)","title_en":"Balance Versatile/Dungeon-Healing Build","summary_es":"Reparto mixto recomendado; la variante sanadora usa los mismos puntos finales.","summary_en":"Recommended mixed allocation; the delayed-healing variant shares these final points.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-equilibrio","talentos druida leveo build-equilibrio","puntos de talento build-equilibrio"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-equilibrio","druid leveling talents build-equilibrio","druid talent points build-equilibrio"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Cólera mejorada 5/5, Génesis 2/5, Brillo lunar 3/3, Fuegolunar mejorado 2/2, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2, Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2, Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1, Enjambre de insectos 1/1, Venganza 5/5, Fuego estelar mejorado 5/5, Gracia de la naturaleza 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Furia de luna 5/5, Forma de lechúcico lunar 1/1. Rama de Recuperación: Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5, Naturalista 5/5, Refracción 3/3. Este reparto sirve tanto para una ruta mixta como para retrasar la forma lunar al curar mazmorras.","text_en":"Balance: Improved Wrath 5/5, Genesis 2/5, Moonglow 3/3, Improved Moonfire 2/2, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Nature's Reach 2/2, Nature's Splendor 1/1, Insect Swarm 1/1, Vengeance 5/5, Improved Starfire 5/5, Nature's Grace 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Moonfury 5/5, Moonkin Form 1/1. Restoration: Nature's Focus 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, Reflection 3/3. This allocation supports both mixed play and delayed Moonkin Form for dungeon healing.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Balance Druid DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:03bd266526dee91d2a4ffc5368d3575c175c83e5"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-equilibrio-subir-segura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build segura de Equilibrio (subida)","title_en":"Risk-Averse Balance Leveling Build","summary_es":"Prioriza control y supervivencia para élites y casteo seguro.","summary_en":"Prioritizes control and safety for elites and uninterrupted casting.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-equilibrio","talentos druida leveo build-equilibrio","puntos de talento build-equilibrio"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-equilibrio","druid leveling talents build-equilibrio","druid talent points build-equilibrio"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Cólera mejorada 5/5, Génesis 2/5, Brillo lunar 3/3, Fuegolunar mejorado 2/2, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2, Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2, Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1, Enjambre de insectos 1/1, Venganza 3/5, Fuego estelar mejorado 5/5, Sobrecrecimiento 2/2, Gracia de la naturaleza 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Furia de luna 5/5, Forma de lechúcico lunar 1/1. Rama de Recuperación: Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5, Naturalista 5/5, Refracción 3/3. Sobrecrecimiento añade control para mantener enemigos a distancia mientras casteas.","text_en":"Balance: Improved Wrath 5/5, Genesis 2/5, Moonglow 3/3, Improved Moonfire 2/2, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Nature's Reach 2/2, Nature's Splendor 1/1, Insect Swarm 1/1, Vengeance 3/5, Improved Starfire 5/5, Overgrowth 2/2, Nature's Grace 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Moonfury 5/5, Moonkin Form 1/1. Restoration: Nature's Focus 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, Reflection 3/3. Overgrowth adds control to keep enemies at range while you cast.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Balance Druid DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:03bd266526dee91d2a4ffc5368d3575c175c83e5"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-equilibrio-subir-multidot","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Equilibrio de multidot (subida)","title_en":"Balance Multi-dot Leveling Build","summary_es":"Potencial para limpiar grupos rápido, pero sacrifica daño a un objetivo y requiere más pruebas.","summary_en":"Potentially fast against packs, but trades away single-target damage and needs more testing.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-equilibrio","talentos druida leveo build-equilibrio","puntos de talento build-equilibrio"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-equilibrio","druid leveling talents build-equilibrio","druid talent points build-equilibrio"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Cólera mejorada 5/5, Génesis 5/5, Brillo lunar 3/3, Fuegolunar mejorado 2/2, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2, Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2, Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1, Enjambre de insectos 1/1, Venganza 5/5, Fuego estelar mejorado 2/5, Gracia de la naturaleza 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Furia de luna 5/5, Forma de lechúcico lunar 1/1. Rama de Recuperación: Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5, Naturalista 5/5, Refracción 3/3. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60. Sacrifica daño a un objetivo por daño periódico en grupo.","text_en":"Balance: Improved Wrath 5/5, Genesis 5/5, Moonglow 3/3, Improved Moonfire 2/2, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Nature's Reach 2/2, Nature's Splendor 1/1, Insect Swarm 1/1, Vengeance 5/5, Improved Starfire 2/5, Nature's Grace 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Moonfury 5/5, Moonkin Form 1/1. Restoration: Nature's Focus 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, Reflection 3/3. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60. It trades single-target damage for damage-over-time against packs.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Balance Druid DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:03bd266526dee91d2a4ffc5368d3575c175c83e5"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-equilibrio-subir-31-7-13","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Equilibrio 31/7/13 (subida)","title_en":"Balance 31/7/13 Leveling Build","summary_es":"Combina daño de Equilibrio, movilidad feral y apoyo de Recuperación.","summary_en":"Combines Balance damage, Feral mobility, and Restoration support.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-equilibrio","talentos druida leveo build-equilibrio","puntos de talento build-equilibrio"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-equilibrio","druid leveling talents build-equilibrio","druid talent points build-equilibrio"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Cólera mejorada 5/5, Brillo lunar 3/3, Fuegolunar mejorado 2/2, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2, Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2, Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1, Enjambre de insectos 1/1, Venganza 5/5, Gracia de la naturaleza 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Furia de luna 5/5, Forma de lechúcico lunar 1/1. Rama de Combate feral: Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5, Presteza feral 2/2. Rama de Recuperación: Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5, Sutileza 2/3, Metamorfosis natural 3/3, Refracción 3/3. La ruta combina la forma lunar con movilidad y apoyo de Recuperación.","text_en":"Balance: Improved Wrath 5/5, Moonglow 3/3, Improved Moonfire 2/2, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Nature's Reach 2/2, Nature's Splendor 1/1, Insect Swarm 1/1, Vengeance 5/5, Nature's Grace 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Moonfury 5/5, Moonkin Form 1/1. Feral: Heart of the Wild 5/5, Feral Swiftness 2/2. Restoration: Nature's Focus 5/5, Subtlety 2/3, Natural Shapeshifter 3/3, Reflection 3/3. The path combines Moonkin Form with mobility and Restoration support.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Balance Leveling (31/7/13)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/balance-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35076","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:balance-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:adf1c6a8080f6c4af9c3293759682010fe41dd7c"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-moonglow-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Moonglow 31/0/20","title_en":"Moonglow 31/0/20 Leveling Build","summary_es":"Sube como Equilibrio y aporta sanación de mazmorra al invertir los últimos puntos en Recuperación.","summary_en":"Level as Balance, then add dungeon healing with the final Restoration points.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-moonglow","talentos druida leveo build-moonglow","puntos de talento build-moonglow"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-moonglow","druid leveling talents build-moonglow","druid talent points build-moonglow"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Cólera mejorada 5/5, Brillo lunar 3/3, Fuegolunar mejorado 2/2, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2, Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2, Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1, Enjambre de insectos 1/1, Venganza 5/5, Gracia de la naturaleza 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Furia de luna 5/5, Forma de lechúcico lunar 1/1. Rama de Recuperación: Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5, Naturalista 5/5, Metamorfosis natural 1/3, Refracción 3/3, Regalo de la Naturaleza 1/5, Rejuvenecimiento mejorado 3/3, Arreglo rápido 1/1. Queda 1 punto libre para gastar por talentos retirados.","text_en":"Balance: Improved Wrath 5/5, Moonglow 3/3, Improved Moonfire 2/2, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Nature's Reach 2/2, Nature's Splendor 1/1, Insect Swarm 1/1, Vengeance 5/5, Nature's Grace 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Moonfury 5/5, Moonkin Form 1/1. Restoration: Nature's Focus 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, Natural Shapeshifter 1/3, Reflection 3/3, Gift of Nature 1/5, Improved Rejuvenation 3/3, Swiftmend 1/1. 1 point remain free to spend because talents were retired.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Moonglow Druid Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Moonglow (31/0/20)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/moonglow-druid-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35081","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:moonglow-druid-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:40cd7a5f0538abf51e904d41c6b5d9a22b09dcf4"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-feral-tanque-9-42-0-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de oso 9/42/0","title_en":"Bear Tank 9/42/0 Leveling Build","summary_es":"Enfocada en amenaza, armadura y aguante en oso; un punto queda libre.","summary_en":"Focuses on Bear threat, armor, and durability; one point remains free.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-feral-tanque-9-42-0","talentos druida leveo build-feral-tanque-9-42-0","puntos de talento build-feral-tanque-9-42-0"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-feral-tanque-9-42-0","druid leveling talents build-feral-tanque-9-42-0","druid talent points build-feral-tanque-9-42-0"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Génesis 5/5, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2, Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2. Rama de Combate feral: Ferocidad 4/5, Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5, Presteza feral 2/2, Instinto feral 3/3, Pellejo grueso 3/3, Furia salvaje 2/2, Carga feral 1/1, Garras afiladas 2/2, Mordisco primigenio 1/1, Golpes depredadores 3/3, Frenesí sangriento 2/2, Líder de la manada 1/1, Instinto natural 2/2, Reacción natural 5/5, Desgarrar y rasgar 5/5. Queda 1 punto libre para gastar por talentos retirados. La prioridad de talentos mejora la amenaza y la defensa en oso.","text_en":"Balance: Genesis 5/5, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Nature's Reach 2/2. Feral: Ferocity 4/5, Heart of the Wild 5/5, Feral Swiftness 2/2, Feral Instinct 3/3, Thick Hide 3/3, Savage Fury 2/2, Feral Charge 1/1, Sharpened Claws 2/2, Primal Bite 1/1, Predatory Strikes 3/3, Blood Frenzy 2/2, Leader of the Pack 1/1, Natural Instinct 2/2, Natural Reaction 5/5, Rend and Tear 5/5. 1 point remain free to spend because talents were retired. Its talent priorities strengthen Bear threat and defense.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Bear Tank Druid Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Feral Bear Tank (9/42/0)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-bear-tank-druid-guide-for-wow-forever-35078","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:feral-bear-tank-druid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:da3a1a808350d60e5a873e6f0fbbdeed38f55b68"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-feral-cat-0-36-15-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build felina 0/36/15 (subida)","title_en":"Feral Cat 0/36/15 Leveling Build","summary_es":"Build de leveo en solitario centrada en Energía, sangrados y daño felino.","summary_en":"Solo leveling build centered on Energy, bleeds, and Cat damage.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-feral-cat-0-36-15","talentos druida leveo build-feral-cat-0-36-15","puntos de talento build-feral-cat-0-36-15"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-feral-cat-0-36-15","druid leveling talents build-feral-cat-0-36-15","druid talent points build-feral-cat-0-36-15"],"text_es":"Rama de Combate feral: Ferocidad 5/5, Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5, Presteza feral 2/2, Ataques trituradores 3/3, Furia salvaje 2/2, Garras afiladas 2/2, Poder cambiante 1/1, Golpes depredadores 3/3, Frenesí sangriento 2/2, Líder de la manada 1/1, Instinto natural 2/2, Desgarrar y rasgar 5/5. Rama de Recuperación: Enfoque de la naturaleza 2/5, Furor 5/5, Naturalista 5/5, Metamorfosis natural 3/3. Quedan 3 puntos libres para gastar por talentos retirados. Favorece el daño felino y deja recursos para recuperarte entre pulls.","text_en":"Feral: Ferocity 5/5, Heart of the Wild 5/5, Feral Swiftness 2/2, Shredding Attacks 3/3, Savage Fury 2/2, Sharpened Claws 2/2, Shifting Power 1/1, Predatory Strikes 3/3, Blood Frenzy 2/2, Leader of the Pack 1/1, Natural Instinct 2/2, Rend and Tear 5/5. Restoration: Nature's Focus 2/5, Furor 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, Natural Shapeshifter 3/3. 3 pointss remain free to spend because talents were retired. It favors Cat damage and leaves tools for recovery between pulls.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Feral Cat (0/36/15)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:0bc5cc481039700a7e7aecf887eff733bcfc5fd1"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-restauracion-11-7-33-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Recuperación 11/7/33","title_en":"Restoration 11/7/33 Leveling Build","summary_es":"Build comunitaria de sanación periódica con puntos de apoyo en Equilibrio y Feral.","summary_en":"Community HoT healing build with Balance and Feral support points.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-restauracion-11-7-33","talentos druida leveo build-restauracion-11-7-33","puntos de talento build-restauracion-11-7-33"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-restauracion-11-7-33","druid leveling talents build-restauracion-11-7-33","druid talent points build-restauracion-11-7-33"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Génesis 5/5, Brillo lunar 3/3, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2, Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1. Rama de Combate feral: Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5, Presteza feral 2/2. Rama de Recuperación: Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5, Naturalista 5/5, Refracción 3/3, Regalo de la Naturaleza 5/5, Rejuvenecimiento mejorado 3/3, Arreglo rápido 1/1, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Espíritu vivo 3/3, Recrecimiento mejorado 5/5, Crecimiento salvaje 1/1. Queda 1 punto libre para gastar por talentos retirados. Refuerza las sanaciones periódicas para mantener vivo al grupo.","text_en":"Balance: Genesis 5/5, Moonglow 3/3, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Nature's Splendor 1/1. Feral: Heart of the Wild 5/5, Feral Swiftness 2/2. Restoration: Nature's Focus 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, Reflection 3/3, Gift of Nature 5/5, Improved Rejuvenation 3/3, Swiftmend 1/1, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Living Spirit 3/3, Improved Regrowth 5/5, Wild Growth 1/1. 1 point remain free to spend because talents were retired. It strengthens healing-over-time effects to keep the party alive.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Restoration Healer (11/7/33)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-druid-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35079","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:restoration-druid-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:59a9c16e1ee6ed868f2b731945f21de4f8f37d51"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-feral-dps-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Feral DPS de leveo","title_en":"Feral DPS Leveling Build","summary_es":"Reparte puntos entre Equilibrio, Combate feral y Recuperación para levear en formas ferales.","summary_en":"Spreads points across Balance, Feral Combat, and Restoration for shapeshift leveling.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-feral-dps","talentos druida leveo build-feral-dps","puntos de talento build-feral-dps"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-feral-dps","druid leveling talents build-feral-dps","druid talent points build-feral-dps"],"text_es":"Rama de Combate feral: Ferocidad 5/5, Presteza feral 2/2, Instinto feral 3/3, Impacto brutal 2/2, Furia salvaje 2/2, Carga feral 1/1, Garras afiladas 2/2, Golpes depredadores 3/3, Lacerar 1/1, Disciplina depredadora 1/1, Frenesí sangriento 2/2, Líder de la manada 1/1, Instinto natural 2/2, Desgarrar y rasgar 5/5, Mordisco primigenio 1/1 y Poder cambiante 1/1. En Recuperación: Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5, Naturalista 5/5, Refracción 3/3, Metamorfosis natural 3/3 y Arreglo rápido 1/1.","text_en":"Feral: Ferocity 5/5, Feral Swiftness 2/2, Feral Instinct 3/3, Brutal Impact 2/2, Savage Fury 2/2, Feral Charge 1/1, Sharpened Claws 2/2, Predatory Strikes 3/3, Lacerate 1/1, Predatory Discipline 1/1, Blood Frenzy 2/2, Leader of the Pack 1/1, Natural Instinct 2/2, Rend and Tear 5/5, Primal Bite 1/1, and Shifting Power 1/1. Restoration: Heart of the Wild 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, Reflection 3/3, Natural Shapeshifter 3/3, and Swiftmend 1/1.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Feral Druid DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:287fff66b2254f75c86f36f0ad86e374aa5aec80"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-feral-tanque-reflection-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Feral Reflection para leveo","title_en":"Feral Reflection Leveling Build","summary_es":"Reduce el gasto de maná para curarte entre combates sin depender de otros.","summary_en":"Reduces mana use so you can heal between fights without relying on others.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-feral-tanque-reflection","talentos druida leveo build-feral-tanque-reflection","puntos de talento build-feral-tanque-reflection"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-feral-tanque-reflection","druid leveling talents build-feral-tanque-reflection","druid talent points build-feral-tanque-reflection"],"text_es":"Rama de Combate feral: Ferocidad 5/5, Furor 5/5, Presteza feral 2/2, Furia salvaje 2/2, Carga feral 1/1, Garras afiladas 2/2, Golpes depredadores 3/3, Lacerar 1/1, Disciplina depredadora 1/1, Frenesí sangriento 2/2, Líder de la manada 1/1, Instinto natural 2/2, Desgarrar y rasgar 5/5, Mordisco primigenio 1/1, Poder cambiante 1/1. Rama de Recuperación: Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5, Naturalista 5/5, Refracción 3/3, Metamorfosis natural 3/3, Arreglo rápido 1/1. La Recuperación adicional reduce pausas para beber y sanar.","text_en":"Feral: Blood Frenzy 2/2, Feral Charge 1/1, Feral Swiftness 2/2, Ferocity 5/5, Furor 5/5, Lacerate 1/1, Leader of the Pack 1/1, Natural Instinct 2/2, Predatory Discipline 1/1, Predatory Strikes 3/3, Primal Bite 1/1, Rend and Tear 5/5, Savage Fury 2/2, Sharpened Claws 2/2, Shifting Power 1/1. Restoration: Bloom 1/1, Heart of the Wild 5/5, Natural Shapeshifter 3/3, Naturalist 5/5, Reflection 3/3. This supports self-healing and mana sustain between fights.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Feral Druid Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:2a5f71ddfebfcce143d28e624acdb44a715f03f1"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-feral-tanque-splendor-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Feral’s Splendor para leveo","title_en":"Feral’s Splendor Leveling Build","summary_es":"Más ofensiva y móvil, aunque consume más maná.","summary_en":"More offensive and mobile, but more mana hungry.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-feral-tanque-splendor","talentos druida leveo build-feral-tanque-splendor","puntos de talento build-feral-tanque-splendor"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-feral-tanque-splendor","druid leveling talents build-feral-tanque-splendor","druid talent points build-feral-tanque-splendor"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Génesis 5/5, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 1/2, Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2. Rama de Combate feral: Ferocidad 5/5, Furor 4/5, Presteza feral 2/2, Furia salvaje 2/2, Carga feral 1/1, Garras afiladas 2/2, Golpes depredadores 3/3, Lacerar 1/1, Disciplina depredadora 1/1, Frenesí sangriento 1/2, Líder de la manada 1/1, Instinto natural 2/2, Desgarrar y rasgar 5/5, Mordisco primigenio 1/1, Poder cambiante 1/1. Rama de Recuperación: Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5, Naturalista 5/5, Floración 1/1. Su inversión en Equilibrio favorece el alcance para atraer objetivos.","text_en":"Balance: Genesis 5/5, Nature’s Majesty 1/2, Nature’s Reach 2/2. Feral: Ferocity 5/5, Furor 4/5, Feral Swiftness 2/2, Savage Fury 2/2, Feral Charge 1/1, Sharpened Claws 2/2, Predatory Strikes 3/3, Lacerate 1/1, Predatory Discipline 1/1, Blood Frenzy 1/2, Leader of the Pack 1/1, Natural Instinct 2/2, Rend and Tear 5/5, Primal Bite 1/1, Shifting Power 1/1. Restoration: Heart of the Wild 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, Bloom 1/1. This option improves range for tagging but spends more mana.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Feral Druid Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:2a5f71ddfebfcce143d28e624acdb44a715f03f1"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-restauracion-hots-dots-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Recuperación HoT/DoT (subida)","title_en":"Restoration HoT/DoT Leveling Build","summary_es":"Adecuada para misiones en solitario y grupos de mazmorra gracias a daño y sanación periódicos.","summary_en":"Fits solo quests and dungeon groups with periodic damage and healing.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-restauracion-hots-dots","talentos druida leveo build-restauracion-hots-dots","puntos de talento build-restauracion-hots-dots"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-restauracion-hots-dots","druid leveling talents build-restauracion-hots-dots","druid talent points build-restauracion-hots-dots"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Cólera mejorada 5/5, Génesis 5/5, Brillo lunar 3/3, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2, Enredaderas 3/3, Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1, Enjambre de insectos 1/1, Sobrecrecimiento 2/2, Gracia de la naturaleza 1/1. Rama de Recuperación: Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5, Naturalista 5/5, Refracción 3/3, Regalo de la Naturaleza 5/5, Floración 1/1, Rejuvenecimiento mejorado 3/3, Arreglo rápido 1/1, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Espíritu vivo 1/3, Recrecimiento mejorado 3/5. Equilibra el daño en solitario con sanación útil en mazmorras.","text_en":"Balance: Improved Wrath 5/5, Genesis 5/5, Moonglow 3/3, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Improved Entangling Roots 3/3, Nature's Splendor 1/1, Insect Swarm 1/1, Overgrowth 2/2, Nature's Grace 1/1. Restoration: Nature's Focus 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, Reflection 3/3, Gift of Nature 5/5, Bloom 1/1, Improved Rejuvenation 3/3, Swiftmend 1/1, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Living Spirit 1/3, Improved Regrowth 3/5. It balances solo damage with useful dungeon healing.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Restoration Druid Healer in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:fcdd0783e2a5d34d8540642f6a6ac34c77bd476b"]},{"id":"clase-druid-build-restauracion-estricta-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de sanación estricta (subida)","title_en":"Strict-Healing Leveling Build","summary_es":"Pensada para un grupo de mazmorra estable; es lenta para el mundo abierto en solitario.","summary_en":"Designed for a steady dungeon group; slow for solo open-world leveling.","keywords_es":["build druida leveo build-restauracion-estricta","talentos druida leveo build-restauracion-estricta","puntos de talento build-restauracion-estricta"],"keywords_en":["druid leveling build build-restauracion-estricta","druid leveling talents build-restauracion-estricta","druid talent points build-restauracion-estricta"],"text_es":"Rama de Equilibrio: Cólera mejorada 5/5, Génesis 5/5, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2, Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1. Rama de Recuperación: Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5, Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5, Naturalista 5/5, Refracción 3/3, Regalo de la Naturaleza 5/5, Floración 1/1, Rejuvenecimiento mejorado 3/3, Arreglo rápido 1/1, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Espíritu vivo 3/3, Recrecimiento mejorado 5/5, Crecimiento salvaje 1/1. Conviene para grupos coordinados que avanzan con rapidez.","text_en":"Balance: Improved Wrath 5/5, Genesis 5/5, Nature's Majesty 2/2, Nature's Splendor 1/1. Restoration: Nature's Focus 5/5, Heart of the Wild 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, Reflection 3/3, Gift of Nature 5/5, Bloom 1/1, Improved Rejuvenation 3/3, Swiftmend 1/1, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Living Spirit 3/3, Improved Regrowth 5/5, Wild Growth 1/1. It suits coordinated groups that move quickly through dungeons.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Restoration Druid Healer in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:fcdd0783e2a5d34d8540642f6a6ac34c77bd476b"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-equilibrio-ruta","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Equilibrio al subir","title_en":"Balance Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Invierte primero en coste, alcance y multidot; retrasa la especialización de casteo largo.","summary_en":"Take mana efficiency, range, and multi-dot talents first; delay the hard-casting package.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos equilibrio leveo","talentos de equilibrio por nivel","build equilibrio nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["balance leveling talent path","balance talents by level","balance level 60 build"],"text_es":"Empieza con Cólera mejorada 5/5; toma pronto Brillo lunar 3/3 y después Fuegolunar mejorado 2/2, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2 y Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2. Añade Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1 y Enjambre de insectos 1/1 para extender el multidot. Más tarde completa Venganza 5/5, Fuego estelar mejorado 5/5 (2/5 en la variante multidot), Eclipse 3/3 y Forma de lechúcico lunar 1/1; elige entre daño a un objetivo, seguridad o sanación de mazmorra.","text_en":"Start with Improved Wrath 5/5; take Moonglow 3/3 early, then Improved Moonfire 2/2, Nature’s Majesty 2/2, and Nature’s Reach 2/2. Nature’s Splendor 1/1 and Insect Swarm 1/1 extend multi-dotting. Later finish Vengeance 5/5, Improved Starfire 5/5 (2/5 in the multi-dot variant), Eclipse 3/3, and Moonkin Form 1/1; choose between single-target damage, safety, or dungeon healing.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Balance Druid DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:03bd266526dee91d2a4ffc5368d3575c175c83e5","section:36e21d4d949262b3b87757defcee873f66e0465a"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-equilibrio-31-7-13-ruta","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta Equilibrio 31/7/13 (subida)","title_en":"Balance 31/7/13 Talent Path (levelling)","summary_es":"Obtén Forma de lechúcico lunar al 40; completa movilidad y apoyo después.","summary_en":"Reach Moonkin Form at 40, then finish mobility and support talents.","keywords_es":["ruta build equilibrio 31 7 13","talentos equilibrio y feral","forma lechucico nivel 40"],"keywords_en":["balance 31 7 13 path","balance feral talent order","moonkin form at 40"],"text_es":"10–14: Cólera mejorada 5/5; 15–17: Brillo lunar 3/3; 18–19: Fuegolunar mejorado 2/2; 20–21: Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2; 22: Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1; 23–24: Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2; 25: Enjambre de insectos 1/1. Después, Venganza 5/5, Gracia de la naturaleza 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Furia de luna 5/5 y Forma de lechúcico lunar 1/1 al 40; completa Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5, Presteza feral 2/2 y Recuperación.","text_en":"10–14: Improved Wrath 5/5; 15–17: Moonglow 3/3; 18–19: Improved Moonfire 2/2; 20–21: Nature’s Majesty 2/2; 22: Nature’s Splendor 1/1; 23–24: Nature’s Reach 2/2; 25: Insect Swarm 1/1. Then take Vengeance 5/5, Nature’s Grace 1/1, Eclipse 3/3, Moonfury 5/5, and Moonkin Form 1/1 at 40; finish Heart of the Wild 5/5, Feral Swiftness 2/2, and Restoration.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Balance: levels 10–40 (31 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/balance-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35076","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Feral Combat: levels 41–47 (7 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/balance-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35076","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Restoration: levels 48–60 (13 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/balance-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35076","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:balance-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:07248f9867f28c5a5906582627df8ceed136ed12","section:abf521ef4585edf62ccf3be0823f38f4e5f794c0","section:e8676394b9a423ddcb898987570b9d17c1687c1d"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-moonglow-ruta","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos Moonglow","title_en":"Moonglow Talent Path","summary_es":"Comparte los primeros 31 puntos de Equilibrio y dedica los últimos 20 a sanar.","summary_en":"Share the first 31 Balance points, then spend the final 20 on healing.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos moonglow","hibrido equilibrio sanador","puntos recuperacion moonglow"],"keywords_en":["moonglow talent path","balance healer hybrid","moonglow restoration points"],"text_es":"Hasta el 40, sigue la ruta de Equilibrio y toma Forma de lechúcico lunar 1/1. Del 41 al 45, Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5; del 46 al 50, Naturalista 5/5; del 51 al 53, Refracción 3/3. Luego sube Regalo de la Naturaleza 1/5, Rejuvenecimiento mejorado 3/3, Arreglo rápido 1/1 y Metamorfosis natural 1/3; al 54 queda 1 punto libre por un talento retirado.","text_en":"Through 40, follow the Balance path and take Moonkin Form 1/1. From 41–45, Nature’s Focus 5/5; 46–50, Naturalist 5/5; 51–53, Reflection 3/3. Then take Gift of Nature 1/5, Improved Rejuvenation 3/3, Swiftmend 1/1, and Natural Shapeshifter 1/3; at 54, 1 point stays free because a talent was retired.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Moonglow Druid Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Moonglow (31/0/20)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/moonglow-druid-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35081","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Moonglow Druid Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › Restoration: levels 41–60 (20 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/moonglow-druid-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35081","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:moonglow-druid-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:409954ae29bb92179e21102bbf17d587a1076aa2","section:40cd7a5f0538abf51e904d41c6b5d9a22b09dcf4"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-oso-9-42-0-ruta-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta oso 9/42/0 · parte 1 (subida)","title_en":"Bear 9/42/0 Path · Part 1 (levelling)","summary_es":"Prioriza eficiencia de Rabia, movilidad, armadura y amenaza felina/oso.","summary_en":"Prioritize Rage efficiency, mobility, armor, and Bear threat.","keywords_es":["ruta oso feral puntos niveles","build tanque 9 42 0","talentos oso por nivel"],"keywords_en":["feral bear leveling path","bear tank 9 42 0","bear talents by level"],"text_es":"10–13: Ferocidad 4/5; 14–18: Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5; 19–20: Presteza feral 2/2; 21–23: Instinto feral 3/3; 24–26: Pellejo grueso 3/3; 27–28: Furia salvaje 2/2; 29: Carga feral 1/1; 30–31: Garras afiladas 2/2; 32: Mordisco primigenio 1/1; 33–35: Golpes depredadores 3/3; 36–37: Frenesí sangriento 2/2; 38: Líder de la manada 1/1; 39–40: Instinto natural 2/2; 41–45: Reacción natural 5/5; 46–50: Desgarrar y rasgar 5/5.","text_en":"10–13: Ferocity 4/5; 14–18: Heart of the Wild 5/5; 19–20: Feral Swiftness 2/2; 21–23: Feral Instinct 3/3; 24–26: Thick Hide 3/3; 27–28: Savage Fury 2/2; 29: Feral Charge 1/1; 30–31: Sharpened Claws 2/2; 32: Primal Bite 1/1; 33–35: Predatory Strikes 3/3; 36–37: Blood Frenzy 2/2; 38: Leader of the Pack 1/1; 39–40: Natural Instinct 2/2; 41–45: Natural Reaction 5/5; 46–50: Rend and Tear 5/5.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Bear Tank Druid Guide for WoW: Forever › Feral Combat: levels 10–51 (42 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-bear-tank-druid-guide-for-wow-forever-35078","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:feral-bear-tank-druid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:fd3c970ec5da7a930ede9c8a9cdcddcf9b2f5021"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-oso-9-42-0-ruta-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta oso 9/42/0 · parte 2 (subida)","title_en":"Bear 9/42/0 Path · Part 2 (levelling)","summary_es":"El punto de talento retirado queda libre; los nueve puntos finales van a Equilibrio.","summary_en":"Leave the retired talent point free; spend the final nine points in Balance.","keywords_es":["ruta rama equilibrio oso nivel 60","talentos génesis oso","alcance druida tanque"],"keywords_en":["bear balance tree leveling","bear genesis talents","druid tank range talents"],"text_es":"El punto del nivel 51 queda libre por un talento retirado. Del 52 al 56, Génesis 5/5; del 57 al 58, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2; del 59 al 60, Alcance de la naturaleza 2/2. Así se completa el reparto 9/42/0 con más daño periódico, crítico y alcance.","text_en":"The point at level 51 stays free because a talent was retired. From 52–56, take Genesis 5/5; 57–58, Nature’s Majesty 2/2; 59–60, Nature’s Reach 2/2. This completes the 9/42/0 allocation with periodic damage, crit, and range.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Bear Tank Druid Guide for WoW: Forever › Balance: levels 52–60 (9 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-bear-tank-druid-guide-for-wow-forever-35078","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Bear Tank Druid Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Feral Bear Tank (9/42/0)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-bear-tank-druid-guide-for-wow-forever-35078","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:feral-bear-tank-druid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:b28f6c98f2b91fe63261850a14590c5084808986","section:da3a1a808350d60e5a873e6f0fbbdeed38f55b68"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-feral-tanque-ruta","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta Feral tanque para subir","title_en":"Feral Tank Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Presteza feral acelera el leveo; elige Recuperación para sostenerte o Equilibrio para más alcance.","summary_en":"Feral Swiftness speeds leveling; choose Restoration for sustain or Balance for range.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos oso druida","feral tank talentos leveo","reflection splendor oso"],"keywords_en":["bear druid talent path","feral tank leveling talents","reflection splendor bear"],"text_es":"Toma Presteza feral 2/2 pronto y prioriza talentos de amenaza, Rabia y supervivencia de las builds de oso. Para jugar solo con menos pausas, la ruta Reflection lleva puntos a Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5, Naturalista 5/5 y Refracción 3/3; la alternativa Splendor invierte en Majestuosidad de la naturaleza y Alcance de la naturaleza, con más gasto de maná. Las asignaciones completas están en las tarjetas de build.","text_en":"Take Feral Swiftness 2/2 early, then prioritize Bear threat, Rage, and survival talents from the Bear builds. For solo play with less downtime, Reflection invests in Heart of the Wild 5/5, Naturalist 5/5, and Reflection 3/3; the Splendor option takes Nature’s Majesty and Nature’s Reach but spends more mana. Full allocations are listed in the build cards.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Feral Druid Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:2a5f71ddfebfcce143d28e624acdb44a715f03f1"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-restauracion-hots-dots-ruta","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de Recuperación HoT/DoT (subida)","title_en":"Restoration HoT/DoT Talent Path (levelling)","summary_es":"Combina daño inicial de Equilibrio, control y sanación periódica para misiones y mazmorras.","summary_en":"Mix early Balance damage, control, and healing-over-time for quests and dungeons.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos recuperacion hots dots","build druida solo y mazmorra","talentos floracion druida"],"keywords_en":["restoration hots dots path","solo and dungeon druid build","druid bloom talents"],"text_es":"Empieza con Cólera mejorada 5/5 para misiones. Pasa a Recuperación para Refracción 3/3 y Floración 1/1; vuelve a Equilibrio por Enjambre de insectos 1/1, Gracia de la naturaleza 1/1 y Sobrecrecimiento 2/2. Después llena Recuperación hasta Arreglo rápido 1/1, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1 y Recrecimiento mejorado 3/5; también puedes detenerte antes y añadir daño de Equilibrio.","text_en":"Start with Improved Wrath 5/5 for questing. Move into Restoration for Reflection 3/3 and Bloom 1/1; return to Balance for Insect Swarm 1/1, Nature’s Grace 1/1, and Overgrowth 2/2. Then fill Restoration toward Swiftmend 1/1, Nature’s Swiftness 1/1, and Improved Regrowth 3/5; you can also stop earlier and add Balance damage.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Restoration Druid Healer in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:fcdd0783e2a5d34d8540642f6a6ac34c77bd476b"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-restauracion-estricta-ruta","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de sanación estricta (subida)","title_en":"Strict-Healing Talent Path (levelling)","summary_es":"Toma Cólera mejorada para apoyar al grupo al principio y después completa la sanación de mazmorra.","summary_en":"Take Improved Wrath for early group damage, then complete the dungeon-healing tree.","keywords_es":["ruta de talentos sanador druida","crecimiento salvaje leveo","recrecimiento mejorado puntos"],"keywords_en":["druid healer talent path","wild growth leveling","improved regrowth points"],"text_es":"Empieza con Cólera mejorada 5/5; después, prioriza Recuperación hasta Crecimiento salvaje 1/1 y Recrecimiento mejorado 5/5. Toma Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1 en Equilibrio y completa Génesis 5/5 con los puntos finales. La ruta rinde en un grupo de mazmorra estable, pero es lenta para misiones en solitario.","text_en":"Start with Improved Wrath 5/5; then prioritize Restoration through Wild Growth 1/1 and Improved Regrowth 5/5. Take Nature’s Splendor 1/1 in Balance and finish Genesis 5/5 with the remaining points. This route suits a steady dungeon group but is slow for solo quests.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Restoration Druid Healer in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:fcdd0783e2a5d34d8540642f6a6ac34c77bd476b"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-restauracion-11-7-33-ruta","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de sanación 11/7/33 · parte 1 (subida)","title_en":"Restoration 11/7/33 Path · Part 1 (levelling)","summary_es":"Completa primero Recuperación; el punto retirado del nivel 28 queda libre.","summary_en":"Fill Restoration first; the retired point at level 28 remains free.","keywords_es":["ruta restoration 11 7 33","talentos sanador por nivel","punto libre talento retirado"],"keywords_en":["restoration 11 7 33 path","healer talents by level","retired talent free point"],"text_es":"10–14: Enfoque de la naturaleza 5/5; 15–19: Naturalista 5/5; 20–22: Refracción 3/3; 23–27: Regalo de la Naturaleza 5/5. El punto del nivel 28 queda libre por el talento retirado. 29–31: Rejuvenecimiento mejorado 3/3; 32: Arreglo rápido 1/1; 33: Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1; 34–36: Espíritu vivo 3/3; 37–41: Recrecimiento mejorado 5/5; 42: Crecimiento salvaje 1/1.","text_en":"10–14: Nature’s Focus 5/5; 15–19: Naturalist 5/5; 20–22: Reflection 3/3; 23–27: Gift of Nature 5/5. The point at level 28 stays free because a talent was retired. 29–31: Improved Rejuvenation 3/3; 32: Swiftmend 1/1; 33: Nature’s Swiftness 1/1; 34–36: Living Spirit 3/3; 37–41: Improved Regrowth 5/5; 42: Wild Growth 1/1.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › Restoration: levels 10–42 (33 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-druid-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35079","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:restoration-druid-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:44594d89fcbf7877991accd3594ef91382ff8b01"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-restauracion-11-7-33-ruta-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de sanación 11/7/33 · parte 2 (subida)","title_en":"Restoration 11/7/33 Path · Part 2 (levelling)","summary_es":"Después de Crecimiento salvaje, añade sanación periódica de Equilibrio y movilidad Feral.","summary_en":"After Wild Growth, add Balance healing-over-time and Feral mobility.","keywords_es":["ruta balance feral sanador","restauracion 11 7 33 final","esplendor y genesis talentos"],"keywords_en":["healer balance feral path","restoration 11 7 33 endgame","nature splendor genesis talents"],"text_es":"Del 43 al 47, Génesis 5/5; 48–50, Brillo lunar 3/3; 51–52, Majestuosidad de la naturaleza 2/2; 53, Esplendor de la naturaleza 1/1. Termina del 54 al 58 con Corazón de lo Salvaje 5/5 y al 59–60 con Presteza feral 2/2. El reparto 11/7/33 mantiene la sanación como función principal.","text_en":"From 43–47, Genesis 5/5; 48–50, Moonglow 3/3; 51–52, Nature’s Majesty 2/2; 53, Nature’s Splendor 1/1. Finish with Heart of the Wild 5/5 from 54–58 and Feral Swiftness 2/2 at 59–60. The 11/7/33 allocation keeps healing as the main role.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › Balance: levels 43–53 (11 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-druid-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35079","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › Feral Combat: levels 54–60 (7 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-druid-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35079","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Restoration Healer (11/7/33)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-druid-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35079","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:extra:restoration-druid-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:43872b1cfe37bb7f70d5d5c3f7f39e6f94ad1a4e","section:59a9c16e1ee6ed868f2b731945f21de4f8f37d51","section:5a6f28c2c0124283b9081f7fd90777026758157d"]},{"id":"clase-druid-entrenar-equilibrio-dano","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rangos de daño de Equilibrio","title_en":"Balance Damage Spell Ranks","summary_es":"Aprende los rangos de Cólera, Fuegolunar, Fuego estelar y Huracán a sus niveles clave.","summary_en":"Train Wrath, Moonfire, Starfire, and Hurricane ranks at their key levels.","keywords_es":["rangos de cólera druida","niveles de fuegolunar","rangos de huracán equilibrio"],"keywords_en":["wrath rank levels druid","moonfire training levels","balance hurricane ranks"],"text_es":"Entrena Cólera en 1, 6, 14, 22, 30, 38, 46 y 54; Fuegolunar en 4, 10, 16, 22, 28, 34, 40, 46, 52 y 58; Fuego estelar en 20, 26, 34, 42, 50, 58 y 60. Enjambre de insectos es talento y luego recibe rangos en 30, 40, 50 y 60; Huracán, en 40, 50 y 60.","text_en":"Train Wrath at 1, 6, 14, 22, 30, 38, 46, and 54; Moonfire at 4, 10, 16, 22, 28, 34, 40, 46, 52, and 58; Starfire at 20, 26, 34, 42, 50, 58, and 60. Insect Swarm is a talent, then gains ranks at 30, 40, 50, and 60; Hurricane at 40, 50, and 60.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever > Mandatory Abilities to Train for Balance Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:c1f9b3c8796c9da85504e92d85f463d8285745e7"]},{"id":"clase-druid-entrenar-equilibrio-curas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rangos de curación de Equilibrio","title_en":"Balance Healing Spell Ranks","summary_es":"Sube las curas para autocuración y apoyo; Toque curativo recibe rangos hasta el 60.","summary_en":"Train healing ranks for self-sustain and backup support; Healing Touch ranks through 60.","keywords_es":["rangos de rejuvenecimiento","entrenar recrecimiento druida","toque curativo niveles"],"keywords_en":["rejuvenation rank levels","train regrowth druid","healing touch training levels"],"text_es":"Rejuvenecimiento: rangos en 4, 10, 16, 22 y 28; después, 34, 40, 46, 52, 58 y 60. Recrecimiento: 12, 18, 24 y 30; los rangos siguientes llegan en 36, 42, 48, 54 y 60. Toque curativo: 1, 8, 14, 20, 26 y 32; rangos posteriores en 38, 44, 50, 56 y 60. Guarda maná para ayudar al grupo si tu sanador necesita apoyo.","text_en":"Rejuvenation ranks come at 4, 10, 16, 22, and 28; later at 34, 40, 46, 52, 58, and 60. Regrowth ranks: 12, 18, 24, and 30; later ranks arrive at 36, 42, 48, 54, and 60. Healing Touch: 1, 8, 14, 20, 26, and 32; later ranks at 38, 44, 50, 56, and 60. Keep mana available to help the group if its healer needs support.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever > Mandatory Abilities to Train for Balance Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:c1f9b3c8796c9da85504e92d85f463d8285745e7"]},{"id":"clase-druid-entrenar-equilibrio-utilidad","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rangos de utilidad de Equilibrio","title_en":"Balance Utility Spell Ranks","summary_es":"Mantén los beneficios y sube las herramientas de control que usas con frecuencia.","summary_en":"Keep buffs current and rank up the control tools you use often.","keywords_es":["rangos de espinas druida","enredaderas rangos","marca de lo salvaje niveles"],"keywords_en":["thorns rank levels druid","entangling roots ranks","mark of the wild training"],"text_es":"Espinas: 6, 14, 24, 34, 44 y 54; Enredaderas: 8, 18, 28, 38, 48 y 58; Fuego feérico: 18, 30, 42 y 54; Marca de lo salvaje: 1, 10, 20 y 30, con rangos posteriores en 40, 50 y 60. Prioriza Enredaderas para apartar enemigos y Fuego feérico cuando el grupo aproveche la reducción de armadura.","text_en":"Thorns ranks: 6, 14, 24, 34, 44, and 54; Entangling Roots: 8, 18, 28, 38, 48, and 58; Faerie Fire: 18, 30, 42, and 54; Mark of the Wild: 1, 10, 20, and 30, with later ranks at 40, 50, and 60. Entangling Roots separates enemies; Faerie Fire helps when the group can use the armor reduction.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever > Mandatory Abilities to Train for Balance Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:c1f9b3c8796c9da85504e92d85f463d8285745e7"]},{"id":"clase-druid-entrenar-equilibrio-opcional","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades opcionales de Equilibrio","title_en":"Optional Balance Abilities to Train","summary_es":"Compra habilidades de oso solo si las usas para regenerar maná antes de Forma de lechúcico lunar.","summary_en":"Train Bear abilities only if you use them to regenerate mana before Moonkin Form.","keywords_es":["habilidades opcionales equilibrio","flagelo para recuperar maná","entrenar habilidades oso druida"],"keywords_en":["optional balance spells","swipe mana regeneration","bear spells to train"],"text_es":"Antes del nivel 40, Flagelo y Clamor desmoralizador permiten seguir peleando en Forma de oso mientras recuperas maná; Enfurecer aporta Rabia y Azote aturde o interrumpe. Diligencia sirve para escapar o recorrer terreno y Tranquilidad puede salvar al grupo si falla el sanador. Después de conseguir la Forma de lechúcico lunar, deja de subir las habilidades exclusivas de Forma de oso que no uses.","text_en":"Train Swipe and Demoralizing Roar only if you use Bear Form for mana recovery before level 40; Enrage adds Rage and Bash stuns or interrupts. Dash helps you escape or travel, and Tranquility can save a group if its healer struggles. Moonkin Form signals when you can stop training Bear Form-only abilities you no longer use.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever > Optional Abilities to Train for Balance Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:c1f9b3c8796c9da85504e92d85f463d8285745e7"]},{"id":"clase-druid-entrenar-feral-dps","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades obligatorias de Feral DPS","title_en":"Feral DPS Mandatory Training","summary_es":"Prioriza las habilidades que sostienen el daño felino, el área y los remates.","summary_en":"Prioritize core Cat damage, AoE, and finishing abilities.","keywords_es":["habilidades feral para entrenar","rangos zarpa y arañazo","destripar niveles druida"],"keywords_en":["feral spells to train","claw and rake rank levels","rip druid training"],"text_es":"Zarpa: 20, 28, 38, 48 y 58; Arañazo: 24, 34, 44 y 54; Augurio de claridad: 20; Destripar: 20, 28, 36, 44, 52 y 60; Mordisco primigenio: 50 y 60; Flagelo: 16, 24, 34, 44 y 54; Fuego feérico: 18, 30, 42 y 54; Pielcorteza: 44. Mantén al día los rangos que apoyan tu forma habitual.","text_en":"Claw: 20, 28, 38, 48, and 58; Rake: 24, 34, 44, and 54; Omen of Clarity: 20; Rip: 20, 28, 36, 44, 52, and 60; Primal Bite: 50 and 60; Swipe: 16, 24, 34, 44, and 54; Faerie Fire: 18, 30, 42, and 54; Barkskin: 44. Keep current the ranks that support your usual form.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Feral Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:78c723d3d0ed3264baeac02dd574e0ce23820c87"]},{"id":"clase-druid-entrenar-feral-dps-opcional","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades opcionales de Feral DPS","title_en":"Optional Feral DPS Training","summary_es":"Ahorra oro retrasando habilidades situacionales y rangos que rara vez usas.","summary_en":"Save gold by delaying situational abilities and ranks you rarely use.","keywords_es":["habilidades feral que puedo saltar","ahorrar oro entrenar druida","rangos opcionales feral"],"keywords_en":["feral spells to skip","save gold druid training","optional feral ranks"],"text_es":"Suprimir veneno suele ser prescindible si ya tienes Curar veneno; Rastrear humanoides, Pavor y Calmar animal son situacionales. Compra el primer rango de Enredaderas, pero puedes retrasar los siguientes. Fuego estelar aporta poco a Feral: al salir de forma, usa Cólera si necesitas daño a distancia.","text_en":"Abolish Poison is often skippable if you already have Cure Poison; Track Humanoids, Cower, and Soothe Animal are situational. Learn the first rank of Entangling Roots, but later ranks can wait. Starfire adds little for Feral; if you leave form for ranged damage, use Wrath.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Useful Abilities to Skip Training for Feral Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ace2b6e6857648a6d7499ba33a005cb4e6d17d07"]},{"id":"clase-druid-entrenar-oso","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades obligatorias de Feral tanque","title_en":"Feral Tank Mandatory Training","summary_es":"Mantén rangos de amenaza, forma de oso y ataques para varios objetivos.","summary_en":"Keep threat, Bear Form, and multi-target attack ranks current.","keywords_es":["habilidades obligatorias oso druida","rangos flagelo tanque","mordisco primigenio niveles"],"keywords_en":["bear tank mandatory spells","swipe druid ranks","primal bite training levels"],"text_es":"Flagelo: 16, 24, 34, 44 y 54; Fuego feérico: 18, 30, 42 y 54; Zarpa: 20, 28, 38, 48 y 58; Augurio de claridad: 20; Destripar: 20, 28, 36, 44, 52 y 60; Arañazo: 24, 34, 44 y 54; Forma de viaje: 30; Mordisco primigenio: 40, 50 y 60; Forma de oso nefasto: 40; Pielcorteza: 44.","text_en":"Swipe: 16, 24, 34, 44, and 54; Faerie Fire: 18, 30, 42, and 54; Claw: 20, 28, 38, 48, and 58; Omen of Clarity: 20; Rip: 20, 28, 36, 44, 52, and 60; Rake: 24, 34, 44, and 54; Travel Form: 30; Primal Bite: 40, 50, and 60; Dire Bear Form: 40; Barkskin: 44.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Feral Druids","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:3564818d26ac3c01ce49fe83e4db3bf6fd54064e"]},{"id":"clase-druid-entrenar-oso-opcional","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades opcionales de Feral tanque","title_en":"Optional Feral Tank Training","summary_es":"Compra rangos adicionales según encuentros y oro disponible.","summary_en":"Train extra ranks according to encounters and available gold.","keywords_es":["habilidades opcionales tanque druida","qué rangos puede saltar oso","hibernar y huracán druida"],"keywords_en":["optional druid tank spells","bear ranks to skip","hibernate hurricane druid"],"text_es":"Suprimir veneno suele sobrar con Curar veneno; Rastrear humanoides, Pavor y Calmar animal son situacionales. El primer rango de Enredaderas ayuda a escapar; los posteriores son opcionales. Fuego estelar aporta poco a Feral, Hibernar controla bestias y dracónidos, y Tranquilidad sirve para una emergencia de grupo. Huracán es daño de área situacional y no se puede lanzar en forma.","text_en":"Abolish Poison is usually unnecessary with Cure Poison; Track Humanoids, Cower, and Soothe Animal are situational. The first rank of Entangling Roots can help you escape; later ranks are optional. Starfire offers little to Feral, Hibernate controls Beasts and Dragonkin, and Tranquility is an emergency group heal. Hurricane is situational AoE and cannot be cast in form.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a4b6a4ef13d8c1b34dbe70b87e0cc67c19304e68"]},{"id":"clase-druid-entrenar-restauracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades obligatorias de Recuperación","title_en":"Restoration Mandatory Training","summary_es":"Mantén al día las curas, mejoras y limpiezas que sostienen a un grupo.","summary_en":"Keep healing, buff, and cleanse ranks current for group support.","keywords_es":["rangos obligatorios recuperación","entrenar enervar druida","rangos de curación druida"],"keywords_en":["restoration mandatory spell ranks","train innervate druid","druid healing spell ranks"],"text_es":"Suprimir veneno: 26 (rango 1); Enredaderas: 58 (6); Toque curativo: 60 (11); Enervar: 40 (1); Marca de lo salvaje: 60 (7); Augurio de claridad: 20 (1). Sube Recrecimiento a 60 (9), Rejuvenecimiento a 60 (11), Deshacer maldición a 24 (1), Renacer a 60 (5), Revivir a 60 (5) y Espinas a 54 (6).","text_en":"Abolish Poison: 26 (rank 1); Entangling Roots: 58 (6); Healing Touch: 60 (11); Innervate: 40 (1); Mark of the Wild: 60 (7); Omen of Clarity: 20 (1). Regrowth reaches rank 9 at 60, Rejuvenation rank 11 at 60, Remove Curse rank 1 at 24, Rebirth rank 5 at 60, Revive rank 5 at 60, and Thorns rank 6 at 54.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Restoration Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:2a81fe731cdee26483106167d9ba0ed61b64fa6b"]},{"id":"clase-druid-entrenar-restauracion-opcional","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades opcionales de Recuperación","title_en":"Optional Restoration Training","summary_es":"Retrasa rangos de daño y control si subes como sanador y necesitas ahorrar oro.","summary_en":"Delay damage and control ranks when leveling as a healer to save gold.","keywords_es":["rangos opcionales recuperación","habilidades de daño sanador","ahorrar oro rangos druida"],"keywords_en":["optional restoration ranks","healer damage spells","save gold druid spells"],"text_es":"Puedes retrasar Pielcorteza (44, rango 1), Azote (46, 3), Diligencia (50, 3), Fuego feérico (54, 4), Hibernar (58, 3), Huracán (60, 3), Fuegolunar (58, 10), Gracia de la naturaleza (58, 6), Fuego estelar (60, 7), Tranquilidad (60, 4) y Cólera (54, 8), según el contenido que hagas.","text_en":"You can delay Barkskin (44, rank 1), Bash (46, 3), Dash (50, 3), Faerie Fire (54, 4), Hibernate (58, 3), Hurricane (60, 3), Moonfire (58, 10), Nature’s Grasp (58, 6), Starfire (60, 7), Tranquility (60, 4), and Wrath (54, 8), depending on your content.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Restoration Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:f5df1177a9880a2869055b91c07ed358f3596924"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-feral-dps-area-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de área Feral DPS al subir","title_en":"Feral DPS Leveling AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Reparte Arañazo, reserva Destripar para prioridades y controla la Energía.","summary_en":"Spread Rake, reserve Rip for priority targets, and manage Energy.","keywords_es":["rotación feral área leveo","arañazo varios objetivos","destripar prioridad feral"],"keywords_en":["feral leveling aoe rotation","rake multiple targets","feral priority rip"],"text_es":"Usa Poder cambiante 1/1 por debajo de 50 de Energía. Gasta 5 puntos de combo en Destripar sobre el objetivo prioritario; aplica Arañazo a tantos enemigos como puedas y no lo renueves antes de que termine. Cuando todos sangren, rellena con Triturar, o Zarpa si estás delante; si llegas a 5 puntos mientras esperas para renovar Arañazo, úsalos en Destripar.","text_en":"Use Shifting Power 1/1 below 50 Energy. Spend 5 combo points on Rip on the priority target; apply Rake to as many enemies as possible and do not refresh it early. Once all targets are bleeding, fill with Shred, or Claw if you are in front; if you reach 5 points while waiting to refresh Rake, spend them on Rip.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Feral Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Cat Druid Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Feral Cat (0/36/15)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35077","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:druid:extra:feral-cat-druid-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever","class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0bc5cc481039700a7e7aecf887eff733bcfc5fd1","section:d459b256f0ca6c9bb5ceee4e02bef132c672cf8b"]},{"id":"clase-druid-rotacion-restauracion-solo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Daño en solitario como Recuperación","title_en":"Restoration Solo Damage Rotation","summary_es":"Aplica periódicos y raíces antes de rellenar con Cólera; cúrate si el enemigo te alcanza.","summary_en":"Apply damage-over-time and roots before filling with Wrath; heal if enemies reach you.","keywords_es":["rotación recuperación leveo solo","daño en solitario druida sanador","enjambre de insectos y cólera"],"keywords_en":["restoration solo leveling rotation","solo damage healer druid","insect swarm wrath rotation"],"text_es":"Mantén Espinas en ti. Aplica Fuegolunar a los enemigos que atraigas y, si tienes Enjambre de insectos 1/1, añádelo; usa Enredaderas en tantos objetivos como puedas y rellena con Cólera. Si te alcanzan, cúrate con Rejuvenecimiento o Recrecimiento.","text_en":"Keep Thorns on yourself. Apply Moonfire to the enemies you pull and add Insect Swarm 1/1 if talented; cast Entangling Roots on as many targets as possible and fill with Wrath. If they reach you, heal with Rejuvenation or Regrowth.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Restoration Druid Healer in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:6a855656df8c517bbedcb87cb12bd225a7811700","section:fcdd0783e2a5d34d8540642f6a6ac34c77bd476b"]},{"id":"clase-druid-camping-equilibrio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de campamento: Equilibrio","title_en":"Balance Camping Buffs","summary_es":"Elige beneficios de profesión para recuperar maná, ganar intelecto o acelerar la experiencia.","summary_en":"Choose profession buffs for mana recovery, intellect, or faster rested leveling.","keywords_es":["beneficios campamento equilibrio","profesiones y buffs druida","experiencia descansada druida"],"keywords_en":["balance camping buffs","druid profession buffs","druid rested experience"],"text_es":"Alquimia aporta regeneración de maná, útil para reducir pausas; Botánica, intelecto; Peletería, 5% de experiencia descansada; Desollar, crítico (útil antes del nivel 40); Costura, espíritu. Escoge los efectos según tus pausas para beber y las mejoras que ya tengas.","text_en":"Alchemy adds mana regeneration to reduce downtime; Herbalism adds Intellect; Leatherworking gives 5% rested experience; Skinning grants crit, useful only before level 40; Tailoring gives Spirit. Choose buffs according to your drinking downtime and effects you already have.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:84029e499dec9c61e87154d37613149d415aa847"]},{"id":"clase-druid-camping-feral-dps","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de campamento: Feral DPS","title_en":"Feral DPS Camping Buffs","summary_es":"Combina crítico, estadísticas, poder de ataque y experiencia descansada.","summary_en":"Combine critical strike, stats, attack power, and rested experience.","keywords_es":["campamento feral dps","cuenco con pescado druida","tienda de campamento feral"],"keywords_en":["feral dps camping buffs","fish bowl druid","feral camp tent"],"text_es":"Para Feral DPS, Silla de campamento (Desollar) da crítico hasta que tengas Líder de la manada. Cuenco con pescado (Pesca) aporta 8% a las estadísticas; Magnetita (Minería), poder de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo; Rueda de afilar (Herrería), fuerza. Tienda de campamento (Peletería) suma 5% de experiencia descansada y gana valor después de 30.","text_en":"For Feral DPS, Camp Chair (Skinning) grants crit until you get Leader of the Pack. Fish Bowl (Fishing) adds 8% stats; Lodestone (Mining) gives melee attack power; Sharpening Wheel (Blacksmithing) adds Strength. Camp Tent (Leatherworking) gives 5% rested experience and becomes more valuable after 30.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Feral Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:25f2d1bbfc12c3f7ed9dd28984fbeaa67f54db68"]},{"id":"clase-druid-camping-feral-tanque","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de campamento: Feral tanque","title_en":"Feral Tank Camping Buffs","summary_es":"Prioriza estadísticas y aguante; añade fuerza, poder de ataque y experiencia descansada.","summary_en":"Prioritize stats and stamina; add Strength, attack power, and rested experience.","keywords_es":["beneficios campamento oso","aguante druida tanque","rueda de afilar magnetita"],"keywords_en":["bear tank camping buffs","druid tank stamina","sharpening wheel lodestone"],"text_es":"Cocina permite mantener más beneficios de campamento. Cuenco con pescado aporta 8% a las estadísticas y Equipo de primeros auxilios, aguante. Añade Rueda de afilar para fuerza, Magnetita para poder de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo y Tienda de campamento para experiencia descansada; Desollar y Encantamiento pueden solaparse con las mejoras de grupo.","text_en":"Cooking lets you keep more camp buffs active. Fish Bowl grants 8% stats and First Aid Kit adds stamina. Sharpening Wheel adds Strength, Lodestone melee attack power, and Camp Tent rested experience; Skinning and Enchanting buffs may overlap with your group buffs.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Feral Druid Tanks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:5f82bef643a012949f4947cc0b36673711b4bf7f"]},{"id":"clase-druid-camping-restauracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de campamento: Recuperación","title_en":"Restoration Camping Buffs","summary_es":"Prioriza regeneración de maná e intelecto; evita efectos que repliquen Marca de lo salvaje.","summary_en":"Prioritize mana regeneration and intellect; avoid effects that duplicate Mark of the Wild.","keywords_es":["campamento recuperación druida","pozo de maná","beneficios profesión sanador"],"keywords_en":["restoration druid camping","mana well druid","healer profession buffs"],"text_es":"Alquimia aporta Pozo de maná para regeneración; Pesca, Cuenco con pescado para estadísticas; Botánica, Vela de incienso para intelecto; Desollar, Silla de campamento para crítico; Costura, Estandarte de facción para espíritu. Evita añadir Laúd encantado de Encantamiento si su efecto reemplaza Marca de lo salvaje.","text_en":"Alchemy provides Mana Well for regeneration; Fishing gives Fish Bowl for stats; Herbalism adds Incense Candle for Intellect; Skinning gives Camp Chair for crit; Tailoring offers Faction Banner for Spirit. Enchanted Lute conflicts with Mark of the Wild, so avoid adding its buff when possible.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a7140ebc9320cba23f96fc184d2f5472a68fd544"]},{"id":"clase-druid-consumibles-feral-dps","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles de leveo Feral DPS","title_en":"Feral DPS Leveling Consumables","summary_es":"Mantén comida de experiencia y cubre fuerza, agilidad, poder de ataque y crítico.","summary_en":"Keep experience food active and cover Strength, Agility, attack power, and crit.","keywords_es":["consumibles feral dps leveo","comida experiencia druida","elixir crítico feral"],"keywords_en":["feral dps leveling consumables","druid experience food","feral crit elixir"],"text_es":"La comida activa da 5% de experiencia por bajas durante 15 min; Gastronomía alarga su duración a 30. Completa fuerza, agilidad y poder de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo con elixires o pergaminos asequibles, incluido al menos un elixir de crítico 2%. Para peleas difíciles, suma frasco, comida y piedra de afilar o de peso.","text_en":"Food grants 5% experience from kills for 15 minutes; Gourmand extends it to 30. When possible, select affordable boosts for strength, agility, and melee attack power, including at least one 2% crit elixir. For difficult fights, add a flask, food, and a sharpening or weight stone.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Feral Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:d2513ec5ece2ae8b9b6e8ce25a644949a751c04c"]},{"id":"clase-druid-consumibles-feral-tanque","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles de leveo Feral tanque","title_en":"Feral Tank Leveling Consumables","summary_es":"Lleva pociones de curación y comida; guarda consumibles caros para retos y mazmorras.","summary_en":"Carry healing potions and food; save expensive consumables for hard quests and dungeons.","keywords_es":["consumibles oso druida leveo","poción curación feral tanque","comida experiencia tanque"],"keywords_en":["bear druid leveling consumables","feral tank healing potion","tank experience food"],"text_es":"Lleva una Poción de curación y mantén comida activa: las bajas dan 5% de experiencia. Usa elixires económicos y reserva los más potentes para retos o mazmorras. Los elixires distintos se acumulan, pero solo puedes tener un beneficio de comida; los consumibles de arma potencian el daño feral, y las pociones comparten reutilización.","text_en":"Carry a Healing Potion and keep food active: kills grant 5% experience. Use affordable elixirs and save stronger buffs for hard quests or dungeons. Different elixirs stack, but only one food buff can be active; weapon consumables scale Feral damage, and all potions share a cooldown.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Feral Druid Tanks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Consumable Stacking","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4c7a34763fe9f55b317b9855a6e4fc8663359cb1","section:ac5e2a40cea244a9b425ad866ed383062121d557"]},{"id":"clase-druid-consumibles-restauracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles de leveo Recuperación","title_en":"Restoration Leveling Consumables","summary_es":"Guarda pociones para emergencias y usa aceites o infusiones si la economía lo permite.","summary_en":"Save potions for emergencies and use oils or teas if affordable.","keywords_es":["consumibles recuperación druida","aceite de maná sanador","elixir de clérigo inferior"],"keywords_en":["restoration leveling consumables","healer mana oil","lesser cleric elixir"],"text_es":"Ten pociones para salud y maná a mano para misiones difíciles y mazmorras. Si tienes oro, Té de paz, Aceite de maná menor y Elixir de clérigo inferior aumentan la sanación; no hace falta mantener estos efectos todo el tiempo.","text_en":"Keep potions for health and mana for difficult quests and dungeons. If affordable, Peace Tea, Minor Mana Oil, and Lesser Cleric’s Elixir boost healing; you do not need to keep these effects active constantly.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4b4fd928916bf963a74bcb13aebdb13c8dd50215"]},{"id":"clase-druid-profesiones-utilidad-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Equipo y utilidad de profesiones","title_en":"Profession Gear and Utility","summary_es":"Peletería ayuda a reemplazar equipo; Ingeniería añade herramientas de emergencia, pero cuesta mantenerla.","summary_en":"Leatherworking helps replace gear; Engineering adds emergency tools but costs to maintain.","keywords_es":["equipo de peletería druida","muñeco diana ingeniería druida","profesiones recuperación costura"],"keywords_en":["druid leatherworking gear","engineering target dummy druid","restoration tailoring profession"],"text_es":"Peletería fabrica kits de armadura y la Tienda de campamento, que da experiencia descansada y gana valor después de 30. Ingeniería aporta el Muñeco-diana avanzado para evitar una carrera al cadáver y explosivos útiles en grupo, aunque puede ser cara; Minería ayuda a rebajar el coste. Para Recuperación, Costura y Peletería ofrecen recetas de equipo, Encantamiento puede resultar caro y Herrería no tiene un uso recomendado.","text_en":"Leatherworking makes armor kits and Camp Tent, which grants rested experience and becomes more valuable after 30. Engineering offers the Advanced Target Dummy to avoid a corpse run and explosives for groups, but can be expensive; Mining helps lower its cost. For Restoration, Tailoring and Leatherworking provide gear recipes, Enchanting can be costly, and Blacksmithing has no recommended use.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Feral Druid Tanks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling","class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1590205fbf3ac677abf9201b074ff553690750b4","section:488b7479faac4db85dbdd180f4ce6b795a779385"]},{"id":"clase-druid-consejos-equilibrio-mazmorras","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Equilibrio como apoyo de mazmorra","title_en":"Balance as a Dungeon Backup Healer","summary_es":"Reserva maná para curas y controla corredores para facilitar el trabajo del grupo.","summary_en":"Save mana for healing and control runners to help your group.","keywords_es":["druida equilibrio sanador apoyo","enredaderas lanzador mazmorra","equilibrio maná grupo"],"keywords_en":["balance druid backup healer","roots caster dungeon","balance mana group"],"text_es":"Equilibrio puede apoyar como sanador de respaldo: conserva maná para Rejuvenecimiento y Recrecimiento en vez de gastarlo todo en daño. Usa Enredaderas para separar a un enemigo que huye o mantener a un lanzador fuera del grupo; prioriza mazmorras por sus mejoras de equipo.","text_en":"In a dungeon, Balance can cover healing duties: keep enough mana for Rejuvenation and Regrowth instead of spending every cast on damage. Root a fleeing enemy or caster before it rejoins the pack; first dungeon clears are worth prioritizing for gear.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Balance Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Balance Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:balance:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:45af757bbdd606585ac13a9c083bf125d303004b"]},{"id":"clase-druid-consejos-feral-antes-del-20","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos Feral antes del 20","title_en":"Feral Tips Before Level 20","summary_es":"El equipo de poder con hechizos y Espinas ayudan antes de obtener las formas ferales.","summary_en":"Spell-power gear and Thorns help before you unlock Feral forms.","keywords_es":["feral antes de forma felina","poder con hechizos druida leveo","tanquear mazmorras druida"],"keywords_en":["feral before cat form","druid spell power leveling","druid tanking dungeons"],"text_es":"Antes del nivel 20, el equipo con poder con hechizos mejora tus hechizos y Espinas, así que puede acelerar los primeros niveles. Aprende pronto a tanquear: te facilita entrar en mazmorras y afrontar élites. Después, cambia entre felino para enemigos débiles y oso para grupos o cuando recibas mucho daño.","text_en":"Before level 20, spell-power gear boosts your spells and Thorns, helping early leveling. Learn to tank early: it helps you enter dungeons and tackle elite quests. Later, switch between Cat for weaker enemies and Bear for packs or heavy incoming damage.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Feral Druid DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid Tank Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Feral Druid Tanks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0039ae8ec6bd72f7f162f2d117334313c8681192","section:210a5f99158e9a74099a49b6453229da94b6d161"]},{"id":"clase-druid-consejos-recuperacion-mana","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos de maná para Recuperación","title_en":"Restoration Mana Tips","summary_es":"Ajusta el rango de cura y aprovecha los procs gratuitos para ahorrar maná.","summary_en":"Match heal ranks to damage and use free procs to conserve mana.","keywords_es":["ahorrar maná druida sanador","augurio de claridad curas","rangos de sanación mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["druid healer mana tips","omen of clarity healing","dungeon heal ranks"],"text_es":"En mazmorras, usa un rango de cura acorde al daño para no gastar maná de más. Guarda Augurio de claridad para un Recrecimiento o Toque curativo grande sin coste y aprovecha pausas sin lanzar para activar la regeneración natural. Para subir en solitario, Equilibrio o Feral suelen ser más rápidos que Recuperación.","text_en":"In dungeons, choose a heal rank suited to the damage to avoid wasting mana. Save Omen of Clarity for a large free Regrowth or Healing Touch, and pause casting when possible to trigger natural regeneration. For solo leveling, Balance or Feral is usually faster than Restoration.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Restoration Druid Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:druid:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:e5eccf2dc535398a36a2948127fda5ebea015d4e"]},{"id":"clase-druid-talentos-feral-dps-hibrido-ruta","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de la build híbrida Feral DPS (subida)","title_en":"Feral DPS Hybrid Build Path (levelling)","summary_es":"La build tiene puntos finales descodificados, pero no una secuencia de asignación por nivel.","summary_en":"The build has a decoded final allocation but no level-by-level point order.","keywords_es":["ruta híbrida feral dps","talentos feral druida leveo","orden de puntos feral"],"keywords_en":["feral dps hybrid path","feral druid leveling talents","feral talent point order"],"text_es":"Esta build híbrida ofrece la distribución final, pero no especifica un orden para asignar los puntos durante el leveo. No se inventa una secuencia; consulta la tarjeta de build para ver todos los talentos y puntos.","text_en":"This hybrid build provides its final allocation but does not specify a level-by-level point order. No sequence is inferred; use the build card for the complete talent distribution.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Feral Druid DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:druid:feral:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:287fff66b2254f75c86f36f0ad86e374aa5aec80"]},{"id":"clase-druid-oso-kit","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades de la Forma de oso","title_en":"Bear Form abilities","summary_es":"Ataques, control y defensas del oso tanque.","summary_en":"Attacks, control and defences of the tank bear.","keywords_es":["habilidades forma de oso","qué hace el oso druida","bramido y clamor","feral tanque habilidades"],"keywords_en":["bear form abilities","what does bear do","growl and roar","feral tank abilities"],"text_es":"Mordisco primigenio, Lacerar (hasta 5 acumulaciones), Machaque y Flagelo (3 enemigos) dan daño y amenaza. Bramido provoca a un objetivo, Clamor desafiante a todos los cercanos durante 6 s, Clamor desmoralizador baja su poder de ataque 30 s y Azote aturde 4 s. Carga feral (oso) cierra distancia, Regeneración frenética convierte Rabia en vida en 10 s y Enfurecer da Rabia a costa de armadura.","text_en":"Primal Bite, Lacerate (up to 5 stacks), Maul and Swipe (3 enemies) provide damage and threat. Growl taunts one target, Challenging Roar all nearby enemies for 6 s, Demoralizing Roar lowers their attack power for 30 s and Bash stuns for 4 s. Feral Charge (Bear) closes distance, Frenzied Regeneration turns Rage into health over 10 s and Enrage grants Rage at the cost of armor.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Tank Druid Abilities Guide - Forever › Bear Form Abilities for Feral Tank Druids in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:druid:feral:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:188c6e3c6e70c2bf75f3a312b20d7e0323495170"]},{"id":"clase-druid-felino-kit","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades de la Forma felina","title_en":"Cat Form abilities","summary_es":"Generadores, remates y utilidades del felino.","summary_en":"Builders, finishers and utilities of the cat.","keywords_es":["habilidades forma felina","cómo funciona el felino","destripar arañazo triturar","zarpa o triturar"],"keywords_en":["cat form abilities","how does cat work","rip rake shred","claw or shred"],"text_es":"Arañazo y Destripar son efectos de daño periódico: no los reaplices hasta que acaben. Triturar solo funciona por la espalda; Zarpa hace lo mismo desde el frente y es el recurso cuando no puedes rodear. Mordedura feroz remata. Poder cambiante convierte maná en 40 de Energía cada 8 s. Furia del tigre sube el daño físico 6 s, Pavor reduce la amenaza, Acechar permite el sigilo y Diligencia acelera.","text_en":"Rake and Rip are damage-over-time effects: do not reapply them until they expire. Shred only works from behind; Claw does the same from the front and is the fallback when you cannot get behind. Ferocious Bite finishes enemies. Shifting Power converts mana into 40 Energy every 8 s. Tiger's Fury raises Physical damage for 6 s, Cower lowers threat, Prowl allows stealth and Dash speeds you up.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS Abilities Guide - Forever › Damage Spells for Feral Druid DPS in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Tank Druid Abilities Guide - Forever › Cat Form Abilities for Feral Tank Druids in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:druid:feral:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:6962d223be50c32f72a2fc8aba8e19bdcb17676f","section:e7ad29f65539709c4dc93df6a17ac692ab7fccc2"]},{"id":"clase-druid-tranquilidad-pielcorteza","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tranquilidad y Pielcorteza","title_en":"Tranquility and Barkskin","summary_es":"Cómo usar la cura de grupo y evitar que te interrumpan.","summary_en":"How to use the group heal without being interrupted.","keywords_es":["tranquilidad druida","pielcorteza qué hace","canalizar sin interrupciones","enfriamiento tranquilidad"],"keywords_en":["druid tranquility","what does barkskin do","channel without interruption","tranquility cooldown"],"text_es":"Tranquilidad cura al grupo cada 2 s mientras la canalizas y tiene 5 min de reutilización; Recuperación puede bajarla a 2 min con su talento y sus pulsos ya pueden ser críticos. Pielcorteza reduce el daño recibido un 20 % y evita que los golpes retrasen tus hechizos, así que se usa a la vez que Tranquilidad o Huracán. Es una cura de emergencia, no de rutina.","text_en":"Tranquility heals the group every 2 s while channeled and has a 5 min cooldown; Restoration can cut it to 2 min with its talent and its ticks can now crit. Barkskin reduces damage taken by 20% and stops hits from delaying your spells, so it is used together with Tranquility or Hurricane. It is an emergency heal, not a routine one.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Abilities Guide - Forever › Healing Spells for Restoration Druids in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Tank Druid Abilities Guide - Forever › Defensive and Resource Abilities","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid Abilities Guide - Forever › Damage Spells for Restoration Druids in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:druid:feral:abilities","class:druid:restoration:abilities"],"source_hashes":["guide:9c637fc73f8b3cafb8b96bba8e8a25e8f1e6c78a","section:b85b1a6770083614760f43794a4956324872ef7b","section:bc8cd426850dcd14e70706250ab9d0e4802b44bc"]},{"id":"clase-druid-resurreccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Revivir y Renacer","title_en":"Revive and Rebirth","summary_es":"Qué resurrecciones tiene el Druida y cuándo se usan.","summary_en":"Which resurrections the Druid has and when to use them.","keywords_es":["druida resucitar","renacer en combate","revivir druida","resurrección en combate"],"keywords_en":["druid resurrect","rebirth in combat","druid revive","combat resurrection"],"text_es":"Todos los Druidas tienen Revivir, una resurrección básica fuera de combate. Renacer resucita a un aliado durante el combate, así que sirve de emergencia en jefes; en cambio, tiene una reutilización larga y conviene reservarla para cuando de verdad haga falta.","text_en":"All Druids have Revive, a baseline out-of-combat resurrection. Rebirth resurrects an ally during combat, so it works as an emergency tool on bosses; it has a long cooldown and is best saved for when it truly matters.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Tank Druid Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Feral Tank Druids in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:druid:feral:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:18d7831a74db18e4f9ab9b9e2b120019264f3cb0"]},{"id":"clase-druid-encantamientos-equilibrio-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos de Equilibrio a nivel 60","title_en":"Balance enchants at level 60","summary_es":"Qué encantar en cada hueco con el Druida Equilibrio a nivel 60.","summary_en":"What to enchant in each slot as a level 60 Balance Druid.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo druida","qué encantamientos pongo de druida","encantamientos para druida","encantamientos druida equilibrio","qué encantar equilibrio","encantar guantes equilibrio","arcano de enfoque druida"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a druid","best enchants for druid","balance druid enchants","what to enchant balance druid","balance druid glove enchant","arcanum of focus druid"],"text_es":"Encantamientos de Equilibrio a nivel 60: Arma a dos manos: Encantar arma 2M: explosión de hechizos (+65 poder con hechizos); a una mano, Encantar arma: poder con hechizos (+30). Cabeza y piernas: Arcano de enfoque (+8, con objeto de nivel 60; sale del Tratado sobre Enfoque de Dire Maul). Torso y pies: Complemento basto para armadura místico. Guantes: poder Arcano para banda (Fuego estelar y Fuegolunar dan casi todo el daño) o poder de la Naturaleza si esa escuela supera el 30% del daño. Brazales: poder con hechizos superior (+16).","text_en":"Balance enchants at level 60: Two-hand weapon: Enchant 2H Weapon - Spellblasting (+65 Spell Power); one-hand, Enchant Weapon - Spell Power (+30). Head and legs: Arcanum of Focus (+8, needs a level 60 item; comes from the Libram of Focus in Dire Maul). Chest and feet: Mystic Rugged Armor Kit. Gloves: Arcane Power for raids (Starfire and Moonfire make most of the damage) or Natural Power if that school passes 30% of your damage. Bracers: Greater Spellpower (+16).","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Balance Druids in WoW: Forever › Best Balance Druid Enchants in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:druid:balance:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:62d687dd854eadbfa9a2e157608232404620dfb7"]},{"id":"clase-druid-encantamientos-equilibrio-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos de Equilibrio al subir","title_en":"Balance enchants while leveling","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Druida Equilibrio entre los niveles 1 y 60.","summary_en":"What to enchant as a Balance Druid between levels 1 and 60.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo druida","qué encantamientos pongo de druida","encantamientos para druida","encantamientos druida equilibrio subiendo","complemento para armadura místico","arma revelación druida","qué encantar leveando equilibrio"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a druid","best enchants for druid","balance druid leveling enchants","mystic armor kit","revelation weapon enchant druid","what to enchant leveling balance"],"text_es":"Encantamientos de Equilibrio al subir: En el arma, Encantar arma: revelación (un golpe sin crítico hace que el siguiente hechizo sea crítico seguro; también activa Gracia de la naturaleza). Torso, piernas, manos o pies: los Complementos para armadura místicos de Peletería (medio, pesado, grueso y basto, hasta +6 poder con hechizos) los puede poner cualquiera. Collar: Encantar collar: poder con hechizos (+6). Brazales: poder de sanación menor o inferior (+3 o +6). Si bebes tras casi cada combate, Encantar torso: intelecto excelente (+8) en lugar de un complemento.","text_en":"Balance enchants while leveling: Weapon: Enchant Weapon - Revelation (a non-crit makes your next spell a guaranteed crit; it also triggers Nature's Grace). Chest, legs, hands or feet: the Mystic Armor Kits from Leatherworking (medium, heavy, thick and rugged, up to +6 Spell Power), which anyone can apply. Neck: Enchant Necklace - Spell Power (+6). Bracers: Minor or Lesser Healing Power (+3 or +6). If you drink after almost every pull, use Enchant Chest - Superior Intellect (+8) instead of a kit.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Balance Druids in WoW: Forever › Best Balance Druid Enchants in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:druid:balance:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:62d687dd854eadbfa9a2e157608232404620dfb7"]},{"id":"clase-druid-consumibles-equilibrio-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles de Equilibrio","title_en":"Balance consumables","summary_es":"Pociones, elixires, aceite y comida para el Druida Equilibrio.","summary_en":"Potions, elixirs, oil and food for the Balance Druid.","keywords_es":["qué consumibles uso siendo druida","qué consumibles uso de druida","consumibles para druida","qué elixires uso de druida","consumibles druida equilibrio","elixires equilibrio","poción de explosión de hechizos","qué comida equilibrio"],"keywords_en":["what consumables as a druid","best consumables for druid","balance druid consumables","balance druid elixirs","spellblasting potion","balance druid food","elixir of the owl"],"text_es":"Consumibles de Equilibrio: Poción de explosión de hechizos sublime (+40 poder con hechizos, nivel 55) y Poción de maná sublime como emergencia; Runa oscura o Runa demoníaca, con su propia reutilización. Elixires: Elixir superior arcano (+35), Elixir de poder de la Naturaleza (nivel 55, solo hechizos de Naturaleza), Elixir del búho (+25 intelecto, +2% crítico) y Elixir de sangre de mago superior (+20 maná cada 5 s). Aceite de zahorí luminoso (+36) en el arma y Salmón al horno (+28 poder con hechizos) de comida.","text_en":"Balance consumables: Major Spellblasting Potion (+40 Spell Power, level 55) and Major Mana Potion for emergencies; Dark or Demonic Rune, on their own cooldown. Elixirs: Greater Arcane Elixir (+35), Elixir of Nature Power (level 55, Nature spells only), Elixir of the Owl (+25 Intellect, +2% crit) and Greater Mageblood Elixir (+20 mana per 5 sec). Brilliant Wizard Oil (+36) on the weapon and Baked Salmon (+28 Spell Power) as food.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Balance Druids in WoW: Forever › Best Balance Druid Consumables in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:druid:balance:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:07dbfe898d919c0de4fe2e78464174eddf9f7598"]},{"id":"clase-druid-consumibles-equilibrio-reglas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles de Equilibrio: qué se acumula","title_en":"Balance consumables: what stacks","summary_es":"Reglas de acumulación y trucos de consumibles del Druida Equilibrio.","summary_en":"Stacking rules and tips for Balance Druid consumables.","keywords_es":["qué consumibles uso siendo druida","qué consumibles uso de druida","consumibles para druida","qué elixires uso de druida","elixires se acumulan","cuántas pociones usar a la vez","runa y poción a la vez","comida bien alimentado equilibrio"],"keywords_en":["what consumables as a druid","best consumables for druid","do elixirs stack","potion and rune together","well fed stacking","balance druid potion cooldown"],"text_es":"Consumibles de Equilibrio: qué se acumula: Casi todos los elixires se acumulan, pero solo cuenta un beneficio de comida. Las pociones comparten reutilización y las runas tienen otra, así que puedes usar una poción y una runa seguidas; ambas runas gastan salud. Elixir del búho es el mejor elixir de crítico para Equilibrio (más Gracia de la naturaleza); Sabios y Ballena cambian intelecto por espíritu. El Druida no tiene mejora de arma propia: usa aceite de zahorí. Sirve cualquier comida con la misma mejora; con comida de intelecto, bebes menos.","text_en":"Balance consumables: what stacks: Most elixirs stack, but only one food buff counts. Potions share one cooldown and runes have another, so you can use a potion and a rune back to back; both runes cost health. Elixir of the Owl is the best crit elixir for Balance (more Nature's Grace procs); Sages and Whale trade Intellect for Spirit. Druids have no weapon imbue of their own: use wizard oil. Any food with the same buff works; Intellect food means less drinking.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Balance Druids in WoW: Forever › Best Balance Druid Consumables in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/balance/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:druid:balance:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:07dbfe898d919c0de4fe2e78464174eddf9f7598"]},{"id":"clase-druid-encantamientos-feral","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos de Feral al subir","title_en":"Feral enchants while leveling","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Druida Feral (daño y tanque) mientras subes.","summary_en":"What to enchant as a Feral Druid (damage and tank) while leveling.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo druida","qué encantamientos pongo de druida","encantamientos para druida","encantamientos druida feral","qué encantar feral","complemento fuerte armadura","encantar arma recuperación"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a druid","best enchants for druid","feral druid enchants","what to enchant feral","forceful armor kit","recovery weapon enchant"],"text_es":"Encantamientos de Feral al subir: Feral de daño: Encantar arma: recuperación y los Complementos para armadura fuertes (pesado, grueso o basto, según el nivel) en torso, manos, piernas y pies. Feral tanque: del 1 al 19, Encantar brazal: fuerza menor y Encantar torso: aguante menor; del 20 al 39, Encantar arma: revelación, Encantar collar: fuerza, Encantar pechera: estadísticas inferiores y Encantar botas: agilidad inferior; del 40 al 60, Encantar pechera: estadísticas y Encantar botas: agilidad.","text_en":"Feral enchants while leveling: Damage Feral: Enchant Weapon - Recovery and the Forceful Armor Kits (heavy, thick or rugged, by level) on chest, hands, legs and feet. Tank Feral: levels 1-19, Enchant Bracer - Minor Strength and Enchant Chest - Inferior Stamina; levels 20-39, Enchant Weapon - Revelation, Enchant Necklace - Strength, Enchant Chest - Lesser Stats and Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility; levels 40-60, Enchant Chest - Stats and Enchant Boots - Agility.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Druid DPS - Best Enchants & Consumables › Best Feral Druid Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Feral Tank Druid Best Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Options by Level","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/feral/enchants-consumables-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:druid:feral:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:47ead1ebe4e9fca3864d69407793877f9c3d7872","section:73fadc03e607b5adc4821e17d897d7513dd2ac58"]},{"id":"clase-druid-encantamientos-restauracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos de Recuperación al subir","title_en":"Restoration enchants while leveling","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Druida Recuperación mientras subes de nivel.","summary_en":"What to enchant as a Restoration Druid while leveling.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo druida","qué encantamientos pongo de druida","encantamientos para druida","encantamientos druida recuperación","qué encantar sanador druida","encantar arma poder de sanación","mano izquierda sabiduría"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a druid","best enchants for druid","restoration druid enchants","what to enchant healer druid","healing power weapon enchant","off-hand wisdom"],"text_es":"Encantamientos de Recuperación al subir: Arma a dos manos: el encantamiento de poder de sanación poderoso; a una mano, Encantar arma: poder de sanación. Mano izquierda: Encantar mano izq.: sabiduría. Collar: Encantar collar: poder de sanación. Torso, manos, piernas y pies: Complemento basto para armadura místico. La lista es selectiva: solo incluye lo que merece el gasto.","text_en":"Restoration enchants while leveling: Two-hand weapon: Enchant 2H Weapon - Mighty Healing Power; one-hand, Enchant Weapon - Healing Power. Off-hand: Enchant Off-Hand - Wisdom. Neck: Enchant Necklace - Healing Power. Chest, hands, legs and feet: Mystic Rugged Armor Kit. The list is selective: it only includes what is worth the cost.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Druid - Best Enchants & Consumables › Best Restoration Druid Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/druid/restoration/enchants-consumables-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:druid:restoration:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:36bcc90f264e2e22ae27f26cbb6ded746252638b"]}]},"04-clase-hunter.json":{"description":"Capítulo 4: Clases. Cazador. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"clase-hunter-que-hace","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace un Cazador","title_en":"What a Hunter Does","summary_es":"Cazador combina un arma a distancia, una mascota y trampas para controlar el combate y sobrevivir.","summary_en":"Hunter combines a ranged weapon, a pet, and traps to control combat and survive.","keywords_es":["qué hace la clase","clase para principiantes","mascota de la clase","combate a distancia","jugar solo"],"keywords_en":["what does hunter do","hunter for beginners","hunter pet","ranged hunter","solo hunter"],"text_es":"El Cazador es un superviviente solitario que combina un arma a distancia, una mascota y trampas. La mascota tanquea y hace daño mientras él controla el combate con rastreo, redirección de amenaza, aguijones, picaduras y trampas. Su recurso es el maná, y gran parte del daño llega de forma pasiva con Tiro automático y la mascota. Es una de las clases más cómodas para subir y jugar solo, y sus tres ramas son de daño: ninguna es tanque ni sanadora.","text_en":"Hunter is a lone survivalist who combines a ranged weapon, a pet, and traps. The pet tanks and deals damage while the Hunter controls the fight with tracking, threat redirection, stings, and traps. Its resource is mana, and much of its damage comes passively from Auto Shot and the pet. It is one of the most comfortable classes for leveling and solo play, and all three trees deal damage: none is a tank or healer.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Hunter Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Hunter in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/hunter-class-overview","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling","class:hunter:general:hunter-class-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:81879758f0929b92eb9dfc3a45eb561d6bf00b39","section:c6da153dc5599024b096fd97b07e326182df761e"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-especializaciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones del Cazador","title_en":"Hunter Specializations","summary_es":"Dominio de bestias se apoya en la mascota; Puntería es el arquero solitario; Supervivencia es melé.","summary_en":"Beast Mastery relies on the pet; Marksmanship is the lone archer; Survival is melee.","keywords_es":["especializaciones de la clase","dominio de bestias","puntería","supervivencia","qué especialización elegir"],"keywords_en":["hunter specializations","beast mastery","marksmanship","survival","which hunter spec"],"text_es":"Dominio de bestias se apoya en la mascota y busca ráfagas con Ira de bestias. Puntería es el arquero solitario: puede renunciar a la mascota con Lobo solitario y castiga con Disparo de francotirador. Supervivencia es melé y combina Golpe de raptor, Mordedura de mangosta, Patada de zancudo y trampas. Las tres hacen daño; Dominio y Puntería atacan a distancia y Supervivencia busca el cuerpo a cuerpo.","text_en":"Beast Mastery relies on the pet and looks for burst with Bestial Wrath. Marksmanship is the lone archer: it can give up the pet with Lone Wolf and punishes with Sniper Shot. Survival is melee and combines Raptor Strike, Mongoose Bite, Strider Kick, and traps. All three deal damage; Beast Mastery and Marksmanship attack at range, while Survival closes in.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Beast Mastery Hunter in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Marksmanship Hunter in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Survival Hunter in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Marksmanship Hunter Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Marksmanship Hunter PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Survival Hunter Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Survival Hunter Melee PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Full Melee Single Target DPS Rotation for Survival Hunter in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:overview","class:hunter:marksmanship:overview","class:hunter:marksmanship:talents","class:hunter:survival:overview","class:hunter:survival:rotation","class:hunter:survival:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:10791531ddc295c18a4c1577ed91e8b12fb7485d","section:32c04eecda9e0252775bbf8bca6167ff719d4161","section:46856ce2300d78ee222b4a49afed77d2c6687cdc","section:b273cb1ec4966348241552f8a1abbb7bd4a8a1da","section:cbb1cb3f670b84fb68bb10ea657eeb04fcef8982","section:da199ff971c8aeed3d43255c4ebfa263db589a4b"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué cambia en Forever para el Cazador","title_en":"What Changes for Hunter in Forever","summary_es":"Supervivencia pasa a melé, Puntería gana Lobo solitario y las mascotas escalan con tus estadísticas.","summary_en":"Survival becomes melee, Marksmanship gains Lone Wolf, and pets scale with your stats.","keywords_es":["cambios de la clase en forever","supervivencia melé","lobo solitario","mascotas escalan","trampas forever"],"keywords_en":["hunter forever changes","survival melee","lone wolf","pets scale","forever traps"],"text_es":"En Forever, Supervivencia pasa a ser una rama de melé que mezcla ataques y trampas, y Puntería gana Lobo solitario y Disparo de francotirador. Dominio de bestias recibe Invocar halcón y sus mascotas escalan con estadísticas del personaje. Las trampas tienen 30 segundos de reutilización base y Atrapamiento las enraíza; además, cada familia de mascota tiene una habilidad propia. El Tiro automático sigue durante otros lanzamientos. Las trampas se colocan en combate sin Fingir muerte, y Multidisparo comparte reutilización con Tiro de puntería.","text_en":"In Forever, Survival becomes a melee tree mixing attacks and traps, while Marksmanship gains Lone Wolf and Sniper Shot. Beast Mastery gets Summon Hawk, and its pets scale with the Hunter stats. Traps have a 30-second base cooldown and Entrapment roots targets; every pet family also has a unique ability. Auto Shot continues during other casts. Traps can be placed in combat without Feign Death, and Multi-Shot shares its cooldown with Aimed Shot.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Beast Mastery Hunter in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Marksmanship Hunter in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Survival Hunter in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Beast Mastery Hunter Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Survival Hunter Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/survival-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Important Abilities","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling","class:hunter:beast-mastery:overview","class:hunter:marksmanship:overview","class:hunter:survival:leveling","class:hunter:survival:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:035db25891b81d9534640b3214221ac20753d0fb","section:180be50b22ce58200948bacf3dd1bada8f0f5b40","section:4939a183f78b0a1c03d678670f7ee1a6229ad897","section:65ee6c79512d806cee42e5c340f8fa6242350e23","section:67a3af4f36e5bc1112f7f05b9b315adbf5ed20f8","section:7934f62052a2fcc15ecbd2ebba4cee1f7b65b02d","section:90b7020bc0f765f1573a07a3a40acc9413f95a2a","section:b8006c8b3204db6f7355bb436c0925f319a4ab08","section:bc385d3f8681b5b7ebedbd573d0d0b979c189466","section:cbb1cb3f670b84fb68bb10ea657eeb04fcef8982","section:d5522ac06733bbf35e8a614677c946d0eef39afa"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-armas-armadura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas y equipo del Cazador","title_en":"Hunter Weapons and Gear","summary_es":"El Cazador usa armas a distancia y Peletería le fabrica equipo; Supervivencia puede usar un arma a dos manos.","summary_en":"Hunter uses ranged weapons and Leatherworking gear; Survival can use a two-handed weapon.","keywords_es":["armas del cazador","equipo del cazador","peletería cazador","arma a dos manos","armadura cazador"],"keywords_en":["hunter weapons","hunter gear","leatherworking hunter","two-handed weapon","hunter armor"],"text_es":"El Cazador combate con arcos, ballestas y armas de fuego, y sus habilidades dependen del arma equipada. Peletería puede fabricar piezas de equipo útiles para él, así que es una profesión natural mientras sube. Supervivencia usa un arma a dos manos en su variante de weaving para aumentar el daño de Mordedura de mangosta. La armadura no cambia el estilo de la rama: el daño sale de las habilidades y del arma.","text_en":"Hunter fights with bows, crossbows, and guns, and its abilities depend on the equipped weapon. Leatherworking can craft useful gear for the class, making it a natural profession while leveling. Survival uses a two-handed weapon in its weaving variant to increase Mongoose Bite damage.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Hunter Leveling Guide:  Specializations, Talent Builds, Professions and More - WoW Forever › Hunter Weapon Skills and Trainers in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/leveling-guide","date":"2026-11-12"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Survival Hunter Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Survival Hunter Weaving PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Hunter Leveling Guide:  Specializations, Talent Builds, Professions and More - WoW Forever › Best Professions For a Hunter in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/leveling-guide","date":"2026-11-12"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:general:leveling-guide","class:hunter:survival:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:0ef2e774df033a39a56e3cc1137ba58774a6b8d8","section:e8412d88f4c0f445dacfd5bdd9ade2891d290077","section:e84e9c7ab1efb3df69df0047185e8629632bc8cf"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-subir-espec","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejor especialización para subir","title_en":"Best Hunter Leveling Spec","summary_es":"Dominio de bestias es la mejor para subir; Puntería queda por debajo; Supervivencia flojea hasta el 32.","summary_en":"Beast Mastery is the best leveler; Marksmanship is below it; Survival lags until level 32.","keywords_es":["mejor especialización para subir cazador","dominio de bestias para nivelar","puntería para subir","supervivencia para subir","cazador leveling"],"keywords_en":["best hunter leveling spec","beast mastery leveling","marksmanship leveling","survival leveling","hunter leveling"],"text_es":"Dominio de bestias es la opción recomendada para subir porque pasa buena parte del daño a la mascota, que también tanquea y reduce el efecto de los errores. Puntería puede subir con mascota, aunque su build de talentos queda por detrás de Dominio. Supervivencia no se recomienda antes del nivel 32: hasta entonces faltan talentos para combatir bien en melé, así que conviene usar un estilo híbrido.","text_en":"Beast Mastery is the recommended leveling choice because much of the damage comes from the pet, which also tanks and reduces the impact of mistakes. Marksmanship can level with a pet, although its leveling talent build falls behind Beast Mastery. Survival is not recommended before level 32: it lacks the talents for effective melee combat, so use a hybrid style until then.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Marksmanship Hunter DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Survival Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling","class:hunter:marksmanship:leveling","class:hunter:survival:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:53a817f4dd17ae8a8405b14a436b0b429e8c2744","section:ad8eb655b1b5f1bf6020502682c0c418111327fa","section:efd8db5e4f29f46ff417a2079019ef89015abce0"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-talentos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos para subir","title_en":"Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"A 10, Aspectos letales; luego de arriba abajo por Dominio; Invocar halcón a 25; Ira de bestias con 31 puntos.","summary_en":"At 10, Deadly Aspects; then top to bottom in Beast Mastery; Summon Hawk at 25; Bestial Wrath at 31 points.","keywords_es":["talentos para subir","ruta de talentos dominio de bestias","aspectos letales","invocar halcón","ira de bestias"],"keywords_en":["leveling talents","beast mastery talent path","deadly aspects","summon hawk","bestial wrath"],"text_es":"Empieza a nivel 10 con Aspectos letales y avanza de arriba abajo por la rama Dominio de bestias, luego Puntería. En las dos primeras filas, reparte los 3 puntos entre Encontrar camino, Revivir mascota mejorado y Entrenamiento en aguante; los 2 de Matanza rápida pueden ir a otra parte, no a Lobo solitario. Invocar halcón es el talento que conviene alcanzar primero (nivel 25). Con 31 puntos en Dominio de bestias, toma Ira de bestias; después dedica 10 puntos a maximizar Ataques letales y Afinar la puntería. Completa con Ojo de águila, Vínculo de espíritu o Rastreo mejorado.","text_en":"Start at level 10 with Deadly Aspects and spend points from top to bottom in Beast Mastery, then Marksmanship. In the first two rows, place the 3 required points in Pathfinding, Improved Revive Pet, or Endurance Training; the 2 in Rapid Killing can go elsewhere, not into Lone Wolf. Summon Hawk is the talent to reach first (level 25). At 31 points in Beast Mastery, take Bestial Wrath; then spend 10 points to max Lethal Attacks and Careful Aim. Finish with Hawk Eye, Spirit Bond, or Improved Tracking.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:53a817f4dd17ae8a8405b14a436b0b429e8c2744","section:772f247ab8739c5881c6d07e81653a401589f50d","section:b6232efb80631488f95a883d5f3343c844e451fd"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-hitos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de habilidad por nivel","title_en":"Ability Milestones by Level","summary_es":"Mascota a 10; guepardo a 20; halcón a 25; Fingir muerte a 30; otras habilidades hasta 60.","summary_en":"Pet at 10; Cheetah at 20; Hawk at 25; Feign Death at 30; other key abilities through 60.","keywords_es":["nivel de las habilidades","cuándo aprendo mascota","aspecto del guepardo nivel","fingir muerte nivel","disparo de francotirador nivel"],"keywords_en":["ability levels","when do I learn pet","aspect of the cheetah level","feign death level","sniper shot level"],"text_es":"La cadena de clase desbloquea la mascota a nivel 10; Aspecto del guepardo se aprende a 20 y Fingir muerte a 30. Invocar halcón se desbloquea con talentos a 25; Recuperación rápida llega a 30 y Aura de disparo certero se puede entrenar desde 30. Fuego rápido se aprende a 26, Trampa de Escarcha a 28, Aspecto de la manada a 40 y Disparo de francotirador a 40. Las tablas de habilidades indican los rangos posteriores.","text_en":"The class quest unlocks the pet at level 10; learn Aspect of the Cheetah at 20 and Feign Death at 30. Summon Hawk is a talent unlock at 25; Rapid Recuperation arrives at 30 and Trueshot Aura can be trained from 30. Learn Rapid Fire at 26, Frost Trap at 28, Aspect of the Pack at 40, and Sniper Shot at 40. The ability tables list later ranks.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Marksmanship Hunter Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/marksmanship-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Beast Mastery Hunter","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling","class:hunter:marksmanship:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:5f4b7821e0aa6e0f194924a2ec964f58e3b53bd0","section:619453fd61682051dc72128ae93f99a648786e91","section:772f247ab8739c5881c6d07e81653a401589f50d","section:ab3d94029b44d479525d929a20e0744a93a697ba"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-mision-clase","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"La misión de clase de nivel 10","title_en":"The Level 10 Class Quest","summary_es":"A nivel 10, la cadena de clase enseña Domesticar bestia y desbloquea la mascota, la mayor mejora de la subida.","summary_en":"At level 10, the class chain teaches Tame Beast and unlocks the pet, the biggest leveling upgrade.","keywords_es":["misión de clase","domesticar bestia","mascota nivel 10","la cadena de nivel 10","domesticar la bestia"],"keywords_en":["hunter class quest","tame beast","pet level 10","hunters path","taming the beast"],"text_es":"A nivel 10, la cadena El camino del cazador enseña Domesticar bestia y desbloquea la mascota; es la mejora más grande de daño, supervivencia y eficiencia. Conviene hacerla en cuanto esté disponible y completar después la misión de alimentación. Domar a la bestia se repite con tres animales y al terminar da la versión permanente de Domesticar bestia. La mascota rinde al máximo cuando está alimentada y feliz.","text_en":"At level 10, The Hunter's Path teaches Tame Beast and unlocks the pet; it is the biggest upgrade to damage, survival, and efficiency. Do it as soon as it is available and then complete the feeding quest. Taming the Beast repeats with three animals and ends by granting the permanent Tame Beast spell. The pet performs best when fed and happy.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Hunter Class Quests Guide › Hunter Class Quest Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/hunter-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › How to Tame a Hunter Pet in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","class:hunter:general:hunter-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:c4d907afb474597ea2747a7e9825999fb2346f92","section:c50a7f4f4aa8a6b2ab1f01089923d0f4487861bd"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-mascotas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo funcionan las mascotas","title_en":"How Hunter Pets Work","summary_es":"La mascota tanquea, hace daño y escala con tus estadísticas; cada familia tiene una habilidad propia.","summary_en":"The pet tanks, deals damage, and scales with your stats; each family has a unique ability.","keywords_es":["mascotas de la clase","cómo funcionan las mascotas","mascota escala","familia de mascota","mascota tanque"],"keywords_en":["hunter pets","how hunter pets work","pet scaling","pet family","pet tank"],"text_es":"La mascota es tanque, fuente de daño y herramienta de utilidad; permite al personaje sobrevivir y matar cosas que otras clases no pueden. Escala con tus estadísticas: recibe salud de tu aguante, armadura, poder de ataque y crítico, y tiene evitación. Cada familia tiene al menos una habilidad propia, y las mascotas no reciben buffs de otras clases. Alimentarla mantiene su felicidad y su daño. La consigues a nivel 10. Cada mascota tiene una clasificación (Ferocidad, Astucia o Tenacidad), pero ninguna cambia su daño: todas hacen el mismo daño base.","text_en":"The pet is a tank, damage source, and utility tool; it lets the Hunter survive and kill things other classes cannot. It scales with your stats: it gains health from Stamina, armor, attack power, and crit, and it has avoidance. Every family has at least one unique ability, and pets cannot receive other classes buffs. Feeding it keeps happiness and damage up. You get it at level 10. Each pet has a classification (Ferocity, Cunning or Tenacity), but none changes its damage: all deal the same base damage.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Beast Mastery Hunter Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › Best Hunter Pets for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Pets - Your Trusty Companions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling","class:hunter:beast-mastery:overview","class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:3fd2c85381c63aa0e591e1c5d659d5d6de616578","section:46fce6253cbf34cd5d9d7b0fe6d482c81867ee53","section:4939a183f78b0a1c03d678670f7ee1a6229ad897","section:c6da153dc5599024b096fd97b07e326182df761e"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-mascota-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué mascota elegir para subir","title_en":"Best Pet for Leveling","summary_es":"Felino y Raptor hacen más daño para subir; Carroñero es la alternativa por su chirrido.","summary_en":"Cat and Raptor deal the most damage for leveling; Carrion Bird is the alternative for its screech.","keywords_es":["mascota para subir","felino o raptor","ave carroñera","mejor mascota para subir","mascota nivel"],"keywords_en":["best leveling pet","cat or raptor","carrion bird","best hunter pet","leveling pet"],"text_es":"Para subir, Felino y Raptor hacen el mayor daño y aguantan la amenaza mientras disparas. El Carroñero es una alternativa con menos daño, pero su Chirrido desmoralizador reduce el poder de ataque enemigo. Todas las familias hacen un daño base parecido: lo que cambia es la habilidad. Alimenta a la mascota para que no pierda felicidad y rinda al máximo. El Oso es una opción más resistente: su Flagelo hace daño leve a 3 objetivos cercanos, útil cuando te atacan varios enemigos.","text_en":"For leveling, Cat and Raptor deal the most damage and hold threat while you shoot. Carrion Bird is an alternative with less damage, but its Demoralizing Screech reduces enemy attack power. Feed the pet so it does not lose happiness and keeps performing at its best. Bears is a sturdier option: its Swipe deals light damage to 3 nearby targets, which helps when several enemies attack.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › Best Hunter Pets for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Abilities Guide - Forever › Specific Pet Abilities for Beast Mastery Hunters in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-abilities","date":"2026-10-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:abilities","class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:3fd2c85381c63aa0e591e1c5d659d5d6de616578","section:a00f780cfdb6b242a4ec3e0e2caa0cb54f4ff449"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-control-mascota","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Controlar a la mascota","title_en":"Controlling Your Pet","summary_es":"Cómo atacar con la mascota sin quitarle la amenaza y qué hacer si muere.","summary_en":"How to fight with your pet without pulling its threat, and what to do if it dies.","keywords_es":["controlar a la mascota","mascota me quita la aggro","macro de mascota","revivir mascota","mi mascota muere"],"keywords_en":["control my pet","pet pulls aggro","pet macro","revive pet","my pet dies"],"text_es":"Manda primero a la mascota y deja que dé un par de golpes antes de disparar: si atacas demasiado pronto, le quitas la amenaza. Una macro que une /petattack con Marca del cazador abre el combate y asegura que la mascota ataque a tu objetivo. Mantenla con vida con Sanar mascota. Si muere, Revivir mascota tarda en lanzarse y la mascota pierde felicidad, así que también hay que alimentarla; si no puedes acabar el combate sin ella, usa Fingir muerte para salir del combate y volver.","text_en":"Send the pet in first and let it land a couple of attacks before you shoot: if you attack too early you pull threat off it. A macro that combines /petattack with Hunter's Mark starts the pull and makes sure the pet attacks your target. Keep it alive with Mend Pet. If it dies, Revive Pet has a long cast and the pet loses happiness, so you also have to feed it; if you cannot finish the fight without it, use Feign Death to drop combat and come back.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › Best Hunter Pets for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Important Pet Macros","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling","class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","class:hunter:marksmanship:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:3fd2c85381c63aa0e591e1c5d659d5d6de616578","section:c6da153dc5599024b096fd97b07e326182df761e","section:d7392779a8c1646212e061bc29342fe12982676f","section:faa25c8f5f2ebd83c6ac41133cb15b6afcf7e4da"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-trampas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Trampas del Cazador","title_en":"Hunter Traps","summary_es":"Trampa congelante, de Escarcha, explosiva y de inmolación; se usan en combate y caben una de fuego y otra de hielo.","summary_en":"Freezing, Frost, Explosive and Immolation Trap; usable in combat, with one fire and one ice trap at once.","keywords_es":["trampas","trampa congelante","trampa de escarcha","trampa explosiva","trampas en combate"],"keywords_en":["traps","freezing trap","frost trap","explosive trap","traps in combat"],"text_es":"Las trampas son parte central del control del Cazador. Trampa congelante encierra a un enemigo y se rompe con daño; Trampa de Escarcha ralentiza a quien entra en la zona; Trampa explosiva es la opción de daño en área y Trampa de inmolación también se usa en la rotación de Supervivencia. En Forever se pueden colocar en combate, sin Fingir muerte, y puedes mantener a la vez una trampa de fuego y otra de hielo, así que no hay que elegir entre daño y supervivencia.","text_en":"Traps are central to Hunter control. Freezing Trap locks an enemy in place and breaks on damage; Frost Trap slows anyone who enters the area; Explosive Trap is the area-damage option and Immolation Trap is also used in the Survival rotation. In Forever they can be placed in combat, without Feign Death, and you can keep a fire trap and an ice trap running together, so you do not have to choose between damage and survival.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Survival Hunter Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/survival-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Survival Hunter DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:survival:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0932b2c4f5955443026575b5d88689aab818fe98","section:65ee6c79512d806cee42e5c340f8fa6242350e23"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-aspectos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Aspectos y movilidad","title_en":"Aspects and Mobility","summary_es":"Aspecto del guepardo da velocidad; el de la manada llega a 40 y comparte esa velocidad con el grupo.","summary_en":"Aspect of the Cheetah gives speed; Aspect of the Pack at 40 shares it with the group.","keywords_es":["aspectos","aspecto del guepardo","aspecto del halcón","aspecto de la manada","movilidad del cazador"],"keywords_en":["aspects","aspect of the cheetah","aspect of the hawk","aspect of the pack","hunter mobility"],"text_es":"Los aspectos son buffs que el Cazador mantiene y cambia según la situación. Aspecto del guepardo da velocidad de movimiento antes de tener montura y, con Encontrar camino, hace al Cazador de los más rápidos antes del nivel 40. Aspecto de la manada, a nivel 40, comparte esa velocidad con todo el grupo. Aspecto del halcón figura entre las habilidades obligatorias de daño, y Aspecto del mono, que se aprende a nivel 4, añade esquiva cuando toca pelear en melé.","text_en":"Aspects are buffs Hunter keeps up and changes to fit the situation. Aspect of the Cheetah gives movement speed before a mount and, with Pathfinding, makes Hunter one of the fastest classes before level 40. Aspect of the Pack, at level 40, shares that speed with the whole group. Aspect of the Hawk is on the mandatory damage list, and Aspect of the Monkey, learned at level 4, adds dodge when you have to fight in melee.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Beast Mastery Hunter","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Beast Mastery Hunter","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:5f4b7821e0aa6e0f194924a2ec964f58e3b53bd0","section:a8b0c719e08e81cde4d68d6ad79d8634e0309f8d","section:ab3d94029b44d479525d929a20e0744a93a697ba"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-rotacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación básica para subir","title_en":"Basic Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Sin mascota, kitea con Tiro automático; después deja tanquear a la mascota y dispara desde lejos.","summary_en":"Without a pet, kite with Auto Shot; then let the pet tank while you attack from range.","keywords_es":["rotación del cazador","marca del cazador","aguijón de serpiente","tiro de puntería","multidisparo"],"keywords_en":["hunter rotation","hunter's mark","serpent sting","aimed shot","multi-shot"],"text_es":"Antes del nivel 10, sin mascota, usa Tiro automático mientras retrocedes y termina en melé con ataques automáticos y Golpe de raptor. Desde el nivel 10, deja que la mascota tanque y ataca a distancia con Tiro automático; mantén Marca del cazador y Aguijón de serpiente, y usa Tiro de puntería cuando puedas. Si atraes la amenaza de la mascota, usa Separación.","text_en":"Before level 10, without a pet, use Auto Shot while backing away, then finish in melee with auto-attacks and Raptor Strike. From level 10, let your pet tank and attack at range with Auto Shot; keep Hunter's Mark and Serpent Sting up, and use Aimed Shot when possible. If you pull threat from your pet, use Disengage.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a1fefdafb92016b202a0ab22c82cc0ce0fb15bed","section:c6da153dc5599024b096fd97b07e326182df761e"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-tips","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Tips","summary_es":"Mata de uno en uno, no pares de atacar, descansa en tabernas, haz cada mazmorra por sus misiones y busca campamentos.","summary_en":"Kill one at a time, keep attacking, rest in inns, do each dungeon for its quests, and look for campsites.","keywords_es":["consejos para subir cazador","experiencia descansada","mazmorras para subir","campamentos cazador","saco de dormir cazador"],"keywords_en":["hunter leveling tips","rested experience","dungeons for leveling","hunter campsites","hunter sleeping bag"],"text_es":"Con mascota, lo más eficiente es no dejar de matar: el Cazador puede encadenar enemigos mientras recupera maná. Conviene acabar de uno en uno, porque la mascota pierde amenaza con varios objetivos. Descansa en una taberna o ciudad para acumular experiencia descansada y haz cada mazmorra una sola vez con sus misiones, ya que las misiones dan mucha más experiencia que repetir enemigos. Los campamentos dan buffs y el Saco de dormir acogedor, desde nivel 14, añade experiencia extra.","text_en":"With a pet, the most efficient approach is to keep killing: Hunter can chain enemies while recovering mana. It is better to finish them one at a time, because the pet loses threat against several targets. Rest in an inn or city to build rested experience and do each dungeon once with its quests, since quests give much more experience than repeating enemies. Campsites give buffs and the Cozy Sleeping Bag, from level 14, adds bonus experience.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:d936cb7836abf09a1f57d8a0109f8998164af072"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Cazador en grupo y mazmorras","title_en":"Hunter in Groups and Dungeons","summary_es":"Las tres ramas hacen daño sin buffs de raid; aportan trampas, picaduras y disrupción.","summary_en":"All three trees deal damage without raid buffs; they bring traps, stings, and disruption.","keywords_es":["clase en grupo","clase en mazmorras","trampas en grupo","picadura de víbora","disparo tranquilizante"],"keywords_en":["hunter in groups","hunter in dungeons","group traps","viper sting","tranquilizing shot"],"text_es":"En grupo, las tres ramas hacen daño; Puntería aporta su aura a toda la banda, pero no mejora el daño cuerpo a cuerpo. En combates con enemigos adicionales, Trampa congelante o Trampa de Escarcha pueden controlarlos; Picadura de víbora drena maná y Disparo tranquilizante elimina enfurecimientos. Dominio de bestias y Puntería atacan a distancia; Supervivencia pelea en melé.","text_en":"In a group, all three trees deal damage; Marksmanship brings its aura to the whole raid, but does not improve melee damage. In fights with extra enemies, Freezing Trap or Frost Trap can control them; Viper Sting drains mana and Tranquilizing Shot removes enrages. Beast Mastery and Marksmanship attack at range; Survival fights in melee.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Beast Mastery Hunter in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Marksmanship Hunter in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Survival Hunter in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:overview","class:hunter:beast-mastery:rotation","class:hunter:marksmanship:overview","class:hunter:survival:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:32c04eecda9e0252775bbf8bca6167ff719d4161","section:46856ce2300d78ee222b4a49afed77d2c6687cdc","section:624f89870b5b6f37b58a63ee43f60872c6b65834","section:88560907f787cadc42eb06c965b31b60556e1bbb"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-dominio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dominio de bestias","title_en":"Beast Mastery","summary_es":"Dominio de bestias concentra el daño en la mascota, con estallido de Cólera y buena movilidad.","summary_en":"Beast Mastery puts damage in the pet, with Bestial Wrath burst and good mobility.","keywords_es":["dominio de bestias","dominio de bestias","cólera de las bestias","invocar halcón","mascota dominio"],"keywords_en":["beast mastery","beast mastery hunter","bestial wrath","summon hawk","beast mastery pet"],"text_es":"Dominio de bestias concentra buena parte del daño en la mascota, ofrece una gran ráfaga con Ira de bestias y es la rama más sencilla de jugar; es muy móvil, con muchos lanzamientos instantáneos y una mascota fuerte. Invocar halcón añade otro ataque y varias mascotas aportan utilidad. Hoy queda por detrás de Puntería y Supervivencia: no da beneficios al grupo, tiene una zona muerta de 8 yardas a distancia y sufre de maná sin Sentencia de Sabiduría de un paladín. Ira de bestias requiere 31 puntos en Dominio.","text_en":"Beast Mastery places much of its damage in the pet, has strong burst with Bestial Wrath, and is the easiest tree to play; it is very mobile, with many instant casts and a strong pet. Summon Hawk adds another attack, and pets provide utility. It currently trails Marksmanship and Survival: it offers no group buffs, ranged attacks have an 8-yard dead zone, and it has mana problems without a Paladin's Judgement of Wisdom. Bestial Wrath requires 31 points in Beast Mastery.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Beast Mastery Hunter in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Beast Mastery Hunter for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling","class:hunter:beast-mastery:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:32c04eecda9e0252775bbf8bca6167ff719d4161","section:b6232efb80631488f95a883d5f3343c844e451fd","section:dce1859a15bacb375c456b0991e680d2e986b1a4"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-punteria","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Puntería","title_en":"Marksmanship","summary_es":"Puntería refuerza tus disparos y la ráfaga; Lobo solitario permite jugar sin mascota.","summary_en":"Marksmanship boosts your shots and burst; Lone Wolf lets you play without a pet.","keywords_es":["puntería","lobo solitario","disparo de francotirador","arquero"],"keywords_en":["marksmanship","marksmanship hunter","lone wolf","sniper shot","archer"],"text_es":"Puntería refuerza los disparos propios y el daño de ráfaga; Lobo solitario permite renunciar a la mascota y Disparo de francotirador define su estilo. Es la rama más difícil de jugar de las tres, sobre todo en solitario, y sufre el callejón de 8 yardas. Su Aura de disparo certero llega a toda la banda, pero ya no da poder de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo. Mientras subes necesitas que la mascota tanquee, así que Lobo solitario aún no es una opción.","text_en":"Marksmanship boosts your own shots and burst damage; Lone Wolf lets you give up the pet, and Sniper Shot defines its style. It is the hardest of the three to play, especially solo, and suffers the 8-yard dead zone. Trueshot Aura benefits the whole raid, but no longer grants melee attack power. While leveling you still need the pet to tank, so Lone Wolf is not an option yet.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Marksmanship Hunter in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Marksmanship Hunter for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Marksmanship Hunter in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Marksmanship Hunter DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:marksmanship:leveling","class:hunter:marksmanship:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:0b6abb163bb13e3a195899f281155a51cbc798e6","section:46856ce2300d78ee222b4a49afed77d2c6687cdc","section:67a3af4f36e5bc1112f7f05b9b315adbf5ed20f8","section:b407236e766d49fd9c2b411d1c74e166293d4c92","section:d5522ac06733bbf35e8a614677c946d0eef39afa","section:efd8db5e4f29f46ff417a2079019ef89015abce0"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-supervivencia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Supervivencia","title_en":"Survival","summary_es":"Supervivencia es melé y mezcla Golpe de raptor, Mordedura de mangosta, Patada de zancudo y trampas.","summary_en":"Survival is melee and mixes Raptor Strike, Mongoose Bite, Strider Kick, and traps.","keywords_es":["supervivencia","cazador supervivencia","golpe de raptor","mordedura de mangosta","patada de zancudo"],"keywords_en":["survival hunter","survival melee","raptor strike","mongoose bite","strider kick"],"text_es":"Supervivencia es la rama de melé: mezcla Golpe de raptor, Mordedura de mangosta, Patada de zancudo y trampas. Su daño sostenido es alto cuando puede encadenar habilidades, y su variante de weaving alterna disparos (Aguijón de serpiente, Tiro Arcano, Multidisparo) con golpes en melé. Empieza a brillar hacia el nivel 32, depende de talentos y compite por armas con Guerrero y Pícaro. No aporta buffs de grupo; su valor es el daño y el control.","text_en":"Survival is the melee tree: it mixes Raptor Strike, Mongoose Bite, Strider Kick, and traps. Its sustained damage is high when it can chain abilities, and its weaving variant alternates shots (Serpent Sting, Arcane Shot, Multi-Shot) with melee strikes. It starts to shine around level 32, depends on talents, and competes for weapons with Warrior and Rogue. It gives no group buffs; its value is damage and control.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Survival Hunter in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Survival Hunter for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Survival Hunter in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Survival Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Full Melee Single Target DPS Rotation for Survival Hunter in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:survival:leveling","class:hunter:survival:overview","class:hunter:survival:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:10791531ddc295c18a4c1577ed91e8b12fb7485d","section:88560907f787cadc42eb06c965b31b60556e1bbb","section:ad8eb655b1b5f1bf6020502682c0c418111327fa","section:c0d0c99db1c69db7b25c9a659a766a412d4acb8e","section:cbb1cb3f670b84fb68bb10ea657eeb04fcef8982"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-stats-dominio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Dominio de bestias","title_en":"Beast Mastery Stats","summary_es":"Prioridad de Dominio: golpe hasta 8%, crítico, agilidad, intelecto, poder de ataque a distancia, espíritu y aguante.","summary_en":"Beast Mastery priority: hit to 8%, crit, agility, intellect, ranged attack power, spirit, and stamina.","keywords_es":["estadísticas dominio de bestias","prioridad de estadísticas cazador","golpe cazador","crítico cazador","agilidad cazador"],"keywords_en":["beast mastery stats","hunter stat priority","hunter hit","hunter crit","hunter agility"],"text_es":"La prioridad de estadísticas de Dominio de bestias es: golpe hasta 8%, golpe crítico, agilidad, intelecto, poder de ataque a distancia, espíritu y aguante. El golpe encabeza la lista porque fallar una habilidad supone una pérdida grande; el intelecto gana valor con Afinar la puntería.","text_en":"The Beast Mastery stat priority is hit to 8%, critical strike, agility, intellect, ranged attack power, spirit, and stamina. Hit ranks first because a missed ability is a major loss; Intellect gains value with Careful Aim.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Beast Mastery Hunter Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:a31034b57f4d960eddf0d2696b069b27b2efc5b2"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-stats-punteria","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Puntería","title_en":"Marksmanship Stats","summary_es":"Prioridad de Puntería: golpe hasta 8%, crítico, agilidad, intelecto, poder de ataque a distancia, espíritu y aguante.","summary_en":"Marksmanship priority: hit to 8%, crit, agility, intellect, ranged attack power, spirit, and stamina.","keywords_es":["estadísticas puntería","prioridad de estadísticas puntería","golpe puntería","crítico puntería","agilidad puntería"],"keywords_en":["marksmanship stats","marksmanship stat priority","marksmanship hit","marksmanship crit","marksmanship agility"],"text_es":"La prioridad propuesta para Puntería, aún especulativa y no probada a nivel 60, es: golpe hasta 8%, golpe crítico, agilidad, intelecto, poder de ataque a distancia, espíritu y aguante. El golpe va primero por el coste de fallar una habilidad; el intelecto también aporta poder de ataque con Afinar la puntería.","text_en":"The proposed Marksmanship order, still speculative and untested at level 60, is hit to 8%, critical strike, agility, intellect, ranged attack power, spirit, and stamina. Hit comes first because missing an ability is costly; Intellect also adds attack power with Careful Aim.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Marksmanship Hunter Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:marksmanship:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:1e2ccf23d7d16c5c87b4d562ad23e19a78373d12"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-stats-supervivencia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Supervivencia","title_en":"Survival Stats","summary_es":"Prioridad de Supervivencia: golpe, crítico, agilidad, fuerza, ataque, intelecto, espíritu y aguante.","summary_en":"Survival priority: hit, crit, agility, strength, attack power, intellect, spirit, and stamina.","keywords_es":["estadísticas supervivencia","prioridad de estadísticas supervivencia","fuerza supervivencia","agilidad supervivencia","golpe supervivencia"],"keywords_en":["survival stats","survival stat priority","survival strength","survival agility","survival hit"],"text_es":"La prioridad propuesta para Supervivencia, aún especulativa y no probada a nivel 60, es: golpe, crítico, agilidad, fuerza, poder de ataque, intelecto, espíritu y aguante. El golpe encabeza la lista; la fuerza aumenta el poder de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo y Afinar la puntería puede convertir intelecto en ataque a distancia.","text_en":"The proposed Survival order, still speculative and untested at level 60, is hit, critical strike, agility, strength, attack power, intellect, spirit, and stamina. Hit comes first; Strength raises melee attack power, while Careful Aim can convert Intellect into ranged attack power.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Survival Hunter Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:survival:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:0023581f8509db29b1faeb7fb4637b665ec09c65"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-rotacion-dominio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Dominio de bestias","title_en":"Beast Mastery Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Marca y Picadura, usa Invocar halcón y Tiro Arcano, y gasta Tiro de puntería y Fuego rápido.","summary_en":"Keep Hunter’s Mark and Serpent Sting, use Summon Hawk and Arcane Shot, and spend Aimed Shot and Rapid Fire.","keywords_es":["rotación dominio de bestias","rotación cazador dominio","marca del cazador","invocar halcón","fuego rápido"],"keywords_en":["beast mastery rotation","beast mastery hunter rotation","hunter’s mark","summon hawk","rapid fire"],"text_es":"Contra un objetivo, mantén Marca del cazador y Aguijón de serpiente; mantén Invocar halcón en uso; en uno de cada tres ciclos, Tiro Arcano ocupa su lugar. Después, usa Tiro de puntería. En área, marca al objetivo prioritario, usa Multidisparo con cuatro objetivos o menos, Trampa explosiva si el maná lo permite y canaliza Lluvia hasta el final. Activa Fuego rápido e Ira de bestias cuando estén disponibles; si puedes, combínalos con abalorios de uso o raciales.","text_en":"Against one target, keep Hunter's Mark and Serpent Sting up; keep Summon Hawk active; in one cycle out of three, Arcane Shot takes its place. Then use Aimed Shot. For area damage, mark the priority target, use Multi-Shot against four or fewer targets, Explosive Trap if mana allows, and channel Volley for its full duration. Use Rapid Fire and Bestial Wrath when ready; combine them with on-use trinkets or racials when possible.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Beast Mastery Hunter in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Beast Mastery Hunter in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Beast Mastery Hunter Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:cdfaa7106d66913948c21767e0596be5f48c1bc1","section:e33613fb4ec1fd1261af9ff5690ca34ce92521bf","section:f9e3312ad781c53dc4fbdd9ebd9b9b35a9510316"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-rotacion-punteria","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Puntería","title_en":"Marksmanship Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Marca y Picadura, usa Tiro Arcano y Tiro de puntería, y añade Disparo de francotirador.","summary_en":"Keep Hunter’s Mark and Serpent Sting, use Arcane Shot and Aimed Shot, and add Sniper Shot.","keywords_es":["rotación puntería","rotación cazador puntería","disparo de puntería","disparo de francotirador","fuego rápido"],"keywords_en":["marksmanship rotation","marksmanship hunter rotation","aimed shot","sniper shot","rapid fire"],"text_es":"Contra un objetivo, mantén Marca del cazador y Aura de disparo certero; sigue este orden: Aguijón de serpiente, Tiro Arcano, Tiro de puntería y Disparo de francotirador cuando tengas el talento. En área, marca al objetivo prioritario, usa Multidisparo con cuatro objetivos o menos, Trampa explosiva si no falta maná ni necesitas otra trampa y canaliza Lluvia hasta el final. Fuego rápido es su único tiempo de reutilización de daño; úsalo cuando esté disponible, idealmente junto a un abalorio de uso o una racial.","text_en":"Against one target, keep Hunter's Mark and Trueshot Aura up; follow this order: Serpent Sting, Arcane Shot, Aimed Shot, and Sniper Shot when talented. For area damage, mark the priority target, use Multi-Shot against four or fewer targets, Explosive Trap if mana is sufficient and no other trap is needed, and channel Volley for its full duration. Rapid Fire is the spec's only DPS cooldown; use it when ready, ideally with an on-use trinket or racial.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Marksmanship Hunter in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Marksmanship Hunter in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Marksmanship Hunter Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Marksmanship Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:marksmanship:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:3edd5dabc49a6d317dce484d01b79c97ccbf7ea3","section:676d3cba2e3813ab6024208de02ec826069a5242","section:7b4ed86599cecb01c7ea30e0b10f678a03de9feb","section:7e23bbd3f11c1d9a3ca93aaec22599032ff11afd"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-rotacion-supervivencia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Supervivencia","title_en":"Survival Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Golpe de raptor, usa Mordedura de mangosta y Patada de zancudo, y apoya con trampas.","summary_en":"Keep Raptor Strike queued, use Mongoose Bite and Strider Kick, and support with traps.","keywords_es":["rotación supervivencia","rotación cazador supervivencia","golpe de raptor","mordedura de mangosta","trampa de inmolación"],"keywords_en":["survival rotation","survival hunter rotation","raptor strike","mongoose bite","immolation trap"],"text_es":"En melé completo, mantén Marca del cazador y Golpe de raptor en cola; usa Mordedura de mangosta, Trampa de inmolación, Patada de zancudo e Invocar halcón si lo tienes. Con el beneficio de Patada de zancudo y sin Aguijón de serpiente, sal, lánzalo con Tiro automático y vuelve. En weaving, alterna: a distancia, Aguijón (si falta), Tiro Arcano y Multidisparo; en melé, lo anterior. En área: Multidisparo con 4 objetivos o menos, Trampa explosiva si hay maná y Lluvia completa. Fuego rápido es su único tiempo de reutilización de daño.","text_en":"In full melee, keep Hunter's Mark up and Raptor Strike queued; use Mongoose Bite, Immolation Trap, Strider Kick, and Summon Hawk if talented. With the Strider Kick buff and no Serpent Sting, step out, cast it with Auto Shot, and return. When weaving, alternate: at range, Serpent Sting (if missing), Arcane Shot, and Multi-Shot; in melee, the abilities above. For area damage: Multi-Shot against 4 or fewer targets, Explosive Trap if mana allows, and a full Volley. Rapid Fire is the spec's only DPS cooldown.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Full Melee Single Target DPS Rotation for Survival Hunter in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Survival Hunter in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Survival Hunter Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:survival:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:099dbbe98c9c184d1506faaf95f53cda69f85ce9","section:10791531ddc295c18a4c1577ed91e8b12fb7485d","section:3c8e743df1e83e3e6af83ab081ebd36faab27a85"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-talentos-dominio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvE de Dominio de bestias (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Beast Mastery PvE Build (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Build de banda con daño de mascota, herencia de estadísticas y gestión de maná.","summary_en":"Raid build for pet damage, stat inheritance, and mana management.","keywords_es":["build dominio de bestias","talentos de dominio de bestias","build cazador banda","talentos mascota cazador"],"keywords_en":["beast mastery build","beast mastery talents","hunter raid build","pet damage talents"],"text_es":"Dominio de bestias: Aspectos letales 5/5, Entrenamiento en aguante 3/5, Fuego enfocado 2/2, Rapidez de bestias 1/1, Furia desatada 5/5, Ferocidad 5/5, Invocar halcón 1/1, Intimidación 1/1, Disciplina de bestias 2/2, Frenesí 5/5 e Ira de bestias 1/1. Esta rama centra la build en el daño de la mascota y el maná; los puntos no invertidos en Dominio no aumentan el daño.","text_en":"Beast Mastery: Deadly Aspects 5/5, Endurance Training 3/5, Focused Fire 2/2, Bestial Swiftness 1/1, Unleashed Fury 5/5, Ferocity 5/5, Summon Hawk 1/1, Intimidation 1/1, Bestial Discipline 2/2, Frenzy 5/5, and Bestial Wrath 1/1. This tree centers on pet damage and mana; unspent Beast Mastery points do not increase damage.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Beast Mastery Hunter Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Beast Mastery Hunter PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:bc95149e5fb3e0b01a9a39c3cc13749860438f87"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-talentos-punteria","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvE de Puntería (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Marksmanship PvE Build (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Build PvE con Lobo solitario, Eficacia y Disparo de francotirador.","summary_en":"PvE build with Lone Wolf, Efficiency, and Sniper Shot.","keywords_es":["build puntería","talentos puntería cazador","build puntería pve","lobo solitario cazador"],"keywords_en":["marksmanship build","marksmanship talents","marksmanship pve build","hunter lone wolf build"],"text_es":"Dominio de bestias: Aspectos letales 5/5. Puntería: Ataques letales 5/5, Picaduras mejoradas 3/3, Eficacia 5/5, Afinar la puntería 5/5, Matanza rápida 2/2, Disparo Arcano mejorado 5/5, Lobo solitario 1/1, Aura de disparo certero 1/1, Disparos mortales 5/5, Recuperación rápida 2/2, Aluvión 1/3, Especialización en armas a distancia 5/5 y Disparo de francotirador 1/1. Supervivencia: Rastreo mejorado 5/5. Lobo solitario permite prescindir de la mascota; Eficacia ayuda a pagar Disparo de francotirador, que consume mucho maná.","text_en":"Beast Mastery: Deadly Aspects 5/5. Marksmanship: Lethal Attacks 5/5, Improved Stings 3/3, Efficiency 5/5, Careful Aim 5/5, Rapid Killing 2/2, Improved Arcane Shot 5/5, Lone Wolf 1/1, Trueshot Aura 1/1, Mortal Shots 5/5, Rapid Recuperation 2/2, Barrage 1/3, Ranged Weapon Specialization 5/5, and Sniper Shot 1/1. Survival: Improved Tracking 5/5. Lone Wolf lets you forgo a pet; Efficiency helps fund Sniper Shot, which has a high mana cost.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Marksmanship Hunter Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Marksmanship Hunter PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:marksmanship:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:b273cb1ec4966348241552f8a1abbb7bd4a8a1da"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-talentos-supervivencia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvE de Supervivencia (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Survival Melee PvE Build (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Build de melé que prioriza daño cuerpo a cuerpo, maná e Invocar halcón.","summary_en":"Melee build prioritizing melee damage, mana, and Summon Hawk.","keywords_es":["build supervivencia","talentos supervivencia cazador","build melé cazador","supervivencia pve"],"keywords_en":["survival build","survival hunter talents","hunter melee build","survival pve"],"text_es":"Dominio de bestias: Aspectos letales 5/5, Entrenamiento en aguante 1/5, Fuego enfocado 2/2, Revivir mascota mejorado 2/2, Furia desatada 5/5 e Invocar halcón 1/1. Puntería: Ataques letales 5/5 y Afinar la puntería 5/5. Supervivencia: Rastreo mejorado 5/5, Golpes salvajes 2/2, Sobrevividor 3/5, Trampas inteligentes 2/2, Pies de plomo 3/3, Filo de depredador 5/5, Ingenio 2/2, Exponer presa 2/2 y Patada de zancudo 1/1. Se centra en daño melé y maná; Reflejos de relámpago y Golpes lacerantes quedan fuera por aportar poco.","text_en":"Beast Mastery: Deadly Aspects 5/5, Endurance Training 1/5, Focused Fire 2/2, Improved Revive Pet 2/2, Unleashed Fury 5/5, and Summon Hawk 1/1. Marksmanship: Lethal Attacks 5/5 and Careful Aim 5/5. Survival: Improved Tracking 5/5, Savage Strikes 2/2, Survivalist 3/5, Clever Traps 2/2, Surefooted 3/3, Predator’s Edge 5/5, Resourcefulness 2/2, Expose Prey 2/2, and Strider Kick 1/1. It focuses on melee damage and mana; Lightning Reflexes and Lacerating Strikes are left out because they add little.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Survival Hunter Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Survival Hunter Melee PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:survival:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:da199ff971c8aeed3d43255c4ebfa263db589a4b"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-mascotas-mazmorra","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mascotas para mazmorras","title_en":"Pets for Dungeons","summary_es":"En mazmorra usa la mascota de más daño y desactiva Bramido para no quitarle amenaza al tanque.","summary_en":"In dungeons use the highest-damage pet and turn off Growl so you do not take threat from the tank.","keywords_es":["mascota para mazmorra","bramido en grupo","mascota tanque","mejor mascota mazmorra","mascota grupo"],"keywords_en":["dungeon pet","growl in groups","pet tank","best dungeon pet","group pet"],"text_es":"En mazmorra casi nunca hace falta una familia concreta: usa la mascota de mayor daño, como Felino o Raptor. Bramido genera amenaza, pero no es una provocación completa como la de un tanque; apágalo para que la mascota no quite enemigos al tanque. Así el tanque mantiene el control y la mascota sigue aportando daño sin arruinar el pull. Si el grupo necesita una habilidad, cambia de familia antes de entrar.","text_en":"Dungeons rarely need a specific family: use the highest-damage pet, such as Cat or Raptor. Growl generates threat, but it is not a full taunt like a tank has; turn it off so the pet does not take enemies from the tank. That keeps the tank in control and lets the pet add damage without ruining the pull. If the group needs an ability, change family before entering.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › Best Hunter Pets for Dungeons in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › How your Hunter Pet Learns New Abilities in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:10e65179a3f1339beeafa43403b4803392d9c602","section:24e1bd0db7d3ec1ed1abe51ab0fa54c60e7a5cbe"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-familias-mascotas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Familias de mascotas y sus habilidades","title_en":"Pet Families and Abilities","summary_es":"Cada familia aporta una habilidad distinta; elige por utilidad y por si tiene Zarpa o Mordedura.","summary_en":"Each family brings a different ability; choose for utility and for whether it has Claw or Bite.","keywords_es":["familias de mascotas","habilidades de mascotas","lobo aullido furioso","araña telaraña","ave de presa"],"keywords_en":["pet families","pet abilities","wolf furious howl","spider web","bird of prey"],"text_es":"Cada familia tiene una habilidad propia, así que elígela según la situación: Aullido furioso (Lobo), Desmembramiento (Crocolisco), ¡Mío! (Ave rapaz), Chirrido desmoralizador (Carroñero), Desgarro salvaje (Raptor), Nube de polvo (Zancudo) y Telaraña (Araña). Felino, Raptor y otras familias usan Zarpa o Mordedura como relleno; las que no tienen en qué gastar el enfoque pierden daño. Revisa la habilidad antes de domar y cambia de familia si el grupo necesita otra cosa.","text_en":"Each family has a unique ability, so pick it for the situation: Furious Howl (Wolf), Dismember (Crocolisk), Mine! (Bird of Prey), Demoralizing Screech (Carrion Bird), Savage Rend (Raptor), Dust Cloud (Tallstrider) and Web (Spider). Cat, Raptor and other families use Claw or Bite as filler; those without a Focus spender lose damage. Check the ability before taming and change family if the group needs something else.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › How your Hunter Pet Learns New Abilities in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › All Hunter Pet Families in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:10e65179a3f1339beeafa43403b4803392d9c602","section:4be41fe9700acaba55d2e3bb8719d4b91c8a924d"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-mascotas-nuevas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Zorros y aves de presa","title_en":"Foxes and Birds of Prey","summary_es":"El Zorro es la familia nueva y el Ave rapaz gana ¡Mío!; ambas son opciones de estilo.","summary_en":"Fox is the new family and Bird of Prey gains Mine!; both are style options.","keywords_es":["zorro mascota","ave de presa","mascotas nuevas","baile de timador","¡mío!"],"keywords_en":["fox pet","bird of prey","new hunter pets","trickster’s dance","mine"],"text_es":"El Zorro es la única familia completamente nueva: hace daño normal y tiene Baile de timador, que se combina con Ira de bestias para una ráfaga fuerte. Le falta Zarpa, así que no gasta el enfoque y queda por debajo de las familias que sí la tienen. El Búho pasa a llamarse Ave rapaz y gana ¡Mío!, que desarma brevemente; también incluye nuevos modelos de ave. Son opciones de estilo, no las mejores para daño.","text_en":"Fox is the only completely new family: it deals standard damage and has Trickster’s Dance, which combines with Bestial Wrath for strong burst. It lacks Claw, so it cannot spend Focus and falls below families that have it. Owl is renamed Bird of Prey and gains Mine!, which briefly disarms; it also includes new bird models. They are style options, not the best for damage.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › Foxes Hunter Pet Family","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › Birds of Prey Hunter Pet Family","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:39c6d201e5b45aeb95dd30d167aa8a6081bd21cc","section:73fd8b39cbbb59fd858cd09977d40ab5a4d0694a"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-domar-entrenar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Domar y entrenar mascotas","title_en":"Taming and Training Pets","summary_es":"Domesticar exige canalizar 10 segundos; las habilidades se compran o se aprenden de otras bestias.","summary_en":"Taming requires a 10-second channel; abilities are bought or learned from other beasts.","keywords_es":["domar mascota","entrenar mascota","domesticar bestia","puntos de entrenamiento","doma de bestias"],"keywords_en":["tame pet","train pet","tame beast","training points","beast training"],"text_es":"A nivel 10, la cadena The Hunter's Path enseña Domesticar bestia y Alimentar mascota. Domesticar requiere canalizar 10 segundos sin actuar y vuelve hostil a la bestia, así que empieza con Disparo de concusión desde la distancia y sin otros enemigos cerca. Las habilidades se compran en Doma de bestias o se aprenden domesticando una bestia que ya las tenga; después se enseñan a otras mascotas compatibles. Algunas habilidades cuestan puntos de entrenamiento.","text_en":"At level 10, The Hunter’s Path teaches Tame Beast and Feed Pet. Taming requires a 10-second channel with no other actions and turns the beast hostile, so open with Concussive Shot from range and make sure no other enemies are near. Abilities are bought through Beast Training or learned by taming a beast that already has them; then they can be taught to compatible pets. Some abilities cost training points.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › How to Tame a Hunter Pet in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › How your Hunter Pet Learns New Abilities in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","class:hunter:marksmanship:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:10e65179a3f1339beeafa43403b4803392d9c602","section:c50a7f4f4aa8a6b2ab1f01089923d0f4487861bd","section:eac9fcbeff65521bacaf32484e2ce2e473ef3335"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-felicidad-lealtad","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Felicidad, comida y lealtad","title_en":"Happiness, Food, and Loyalty","summary_es":"Alimenta a la mascota para que esté feliz y haga daño máximo; la lealtad sube hasta rango 6.","summary_en":"Feed the pet to keep it happy and doing full damage; loyalty rises to rank 6.","keywords_es":["felicidad mascota","alimentar mascota","lealtad mascota","comida mascota","puntos de entrenamiento"],"keywords_en":["pet happiness","feed pet","pet loyalty","pet food","training points"],"text_es":"Alimentar a la mascota la pone feliz y la hace rendir al máximo; si no comes, puede perder felicidad y marcharse. La felicidad baja al morir o al descartarla, así que vuelve a alimentarla. La lealtad sube hasta el rango 6 y da puntos de entrenamiento para habilidades; la dieta depende de la familia. Usa Alimentar mascota y el alimento que se resalta en las bolsas.","text_en":"Feeding the pet makes it happy and lets it deal full damage; if you forget, it can lose happiness and leave. Happiness drops when it dies or is dismissed, so feed it again. Loyalty rises to rank 6 and grants training points for abilities; diet depends on the family. Use Feed Pet and the food highlighted in your bags.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › How to Feed Your Pet in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › How to Tame a Hunter Pet in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:709370c659a2c88493535e2e7599b2407998de46","section:c50a7f4f4aa8a6b2ab1f01089923d0f4487861bd"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-armas-habilidades","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas que puede usar el Cazador","title_en":"Hunter Weapon Skills","summary_es":"El Cazador usa casi todas las armas menos mazas, varitas y escudos; las astas cuestan 1 oro.","summary_en":"Hunter can use almost every weapon except maces, wands, and shields; polearms cost 1 gold.","keywords_es":["armas del cazador","qué armas puede usar cazador","armas de asta","entrenar armas cazador","armas a dos manos"],"keywords_en":["hunter weapons","what weapons can hunter use","polearms","train hunter weapons","two-handed weapons"],"text_es":"El Cazador puede usar arcos, ballestas, armas de fuego, dagas, armas de puño, Hachas de una mano, Espadas de una mano, armas de asta, bastones, armas arrojadizas, Hachas de dos manos y Espadas de dos manos. No puede usar mazas, varitas ni escudos. Aprender una habilidad de armas cuesta 10 de plata; Armas de asta es la excepción: 1 de oro y nivel 20. El maestro de armas de cada ciudad solo enseña algunas, así que comprueba cuál antes de viajar.","text_en":"Weapon skill training usually costs 10 silver. Polearms are the exception: learning them requires level 20 and costs 1 gold. Trainers offer different selections, so check which skills are available before making a trip.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Hunter Leveling Guide:  Specializations, Talent Builds, Professions and More - WoW Forever › Hunter Weapon Skills and Trainers in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/leveling-guide","date":"2026-11-12"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Hunter Leveling Guide:  Specializations, Talent Builds, Professions and More - WoW Forever › Where Hunters Can Train Each Weapon Skill","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/leveling-guide","date":"2026-11-12"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:general:leveling-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:0ef2e774df033a39a56e3cc1137ba58774a6b8d8","section:5f4eb71fd7dde36af5a634ec671e7971a25a4126"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-mascotas-pvp","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mascotas para JcJ","title_en":"Pets for PvP","summary_es":"En JcJ importan las familias con control: Felino, Raptor, Carroñero y Araña.","summary_en":"In PvP families with control matter: Cat, Raptor, Carrion Bird, and Spider.","keywords_es":["mascota para jcj","mascota pvp","araña telaraña","ave carroñera pvp","mascota control"],"keywords_en":["pvp pet","hunter pvp pet","spider web","carrion bird pvp","control pet"],"text_es":"En JcJ las familias con control ganan valor: Felino y Raptor siguen haciendo daño, Carroñero reduce el poder de ataque, Araña enraíza con Telaraña y Ave rapaz desarma con ¡Mío!. No es una lista cerrada: elige la habilidad que responda al rival. La mascota sigue siendo frágil si la enfocan, así que no la dejes sola contra varios enemigos.","text_en":"In PvP, families with control gain value: Cat and Raptor still deal damage, Carrion Bird reduces attack power, Spider roots with Web, and Bird of Prey disarms with Mine!. It is not a closed list: pick the ability that answers the opponent. The pet is still fragile if focused, so do not leave it alone against several enemies.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › Best Hunter Pets for PvP in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › Birds of Prey Hunter Pet Family","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:0e5b0799f752e2b53ba7891e7e53526f094525c3","section:73fd8b39cbbb59fd858cd09977d40ab5a4d0694a"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-mascotas-rapidas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mascotas de ataque rápido","title_en":"Fast-Attacking Pets","summary_es":"Las mascotas rápidas presionan a lanzadores; Diente partido es la referencia y no lo es todo.","summary_en":"Fast pets pressure casters; Broken Tooth is the benchmark but speed is not everything.","keywords_es":["mascota ataque rápido","broken tooth","mascota jcj rápida","velocidad de ataque mascota","the rake"],"keywords_en":["fast attack pet","broken tooth","fast pvp pet","pet attack speed","the rake"],"text_es":"Las mascotas con ataque rápido interrumpen más a los lanzadores y aprovechan efectos que añaden daño por golpe. Diente partido es la referencia, junto con El Rastrillo, León montés hambriento, Puma de las Agujas, Jaguar del pantano, Lupo esclavizante y Escupetripas. La velocidad no lo es todo: una mascota sin Zarpa pierde daño, así que no la elijas solo por el modelo. Úsalas si buscas presión constante, sobre todo en JcJ.","text_en":"Fast-attacking pets interrupt casters more often and benefit from effects that add damage per hit. Broken Tooth is the benchmark, along with The Rake, Starving Mountain Lion, Needles Cougar, Swamp Jaguar, Slavering Worg, and Spiteflayer. Speed is not everything: a pet without Claw loses damage, so do not pick it only for the model. Use them for constant pressure, especially in PvP.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › Hunter Pets with Fastest Attack Speed in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:e940a03032cc174a320f93f47490937b55832cc9"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-rotacion-subida-dominio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Dominio para subir","title_en":"Beast Mastery Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Invocar halcón manda; Tiro Arcano cada tercera vuelta; Tiro de puntería y Tiro automático; Multidisparo en área.","summary_en":"Summon Hawk leads; Arcane Shot every third round; Aimed Shot and Auto Shot; Multi-Shot for area.","keywords_es":["rotación dominio subir","invocar halcón rotación","tiro arcano cada tercera","multidisparo subir","rotación cazador dominio"],"keywords_en":["beast mastery leveling rotation","summon hawk rotation","arcane shot every third","multi-shot leveling","beast mastery hunter rotation"],"text_es":"Contra un objetivo, pon Marca del cazador si da tiempo; deja que la mascota ataque primero y aplica Aguijón de serpiente. Usa Invocar halcón cuando esté disponible, Tiro Arcano cada tercera vuelta si tienes ese talento y Tiro de puntería; sigue con Tiro automático. Si atraes amenaza, usa Separación. En área, marca al objetivo prioritario, usa Multidisparo y Trampa explosiva si es posible; añade Aguijón de serpiente si el combate durará y tienes maná. Con Lluvia, canalízala entera y reserva Multidisparo para cuatro objetivos o menos.","text_en":"Against one target, apply Hunter's Mark if there is time; send the pet in first and apply Serpent Sting. Use Summon Hawk when available, Arcane Shot every third rotation if talented, and Aimed Shot; continue with Auto Shot. If you pull threat, use Disengage. For area damage, mark the priority target, use Multi-Shot and Explosive Trap if possible, then add Serpent Sting if the fight will last and you have mana. Once you have Volley, channel it fully and save Multi-Shot for four or fewer targets.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a1fefdafb92016b202a0ab22c82cc0ce0fb15bed","section:c6da153dc5599024b096fd97b07e326182df761e"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-rotacion-subida-punteria","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Puntería para subir","title_en":"Marksmanship Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Marca y Aguijón, Tiro Arcano y Tiro de puntería; con Matanza rápida, abre con Disparo de francotirador.","summary_en":"Hunter's Mark and Serpent Sting, Arcane Shot and Aimed Shot; with Rapid Killing, open with Sniper Shot.","keywords_es":["rotación puntería subir","matanza rápida rotación","disparo de francotirador subir","tiro arcano puntería","rotación cazador puntería"],"keywords_en":["marksmanship leveling rotation","rapid killing rotation","sniper shot leveling","arcane shot marksmanship","marksmanship hunter rotation"],"text_es":"Contra un objetivo, mantén Marca del cazador y Aguijón de serpiente; con el bonus de Matanza rápida, abre con Disparo de francotirador (o Tiro de puntería si aún no lo has aprendido). Usa Invocar halcón cuando tengas el talento, Tiro Arcano cada tercera vuelta y Tiro de puntería; sigue con Tiro automático. Si atraes amenaza, usa Separación. En área, marca al objetivo prioritario, usa Multidisparo y Trampa explosiva si es posible; añade Aguijón de serpiente si hay tiempo y maná. Con Lluvia, canalízala entera y reserva Multidisparo para cuatro objetivos o menos.","text_en":"Against one target, keep Hunter's Mark and Serpent Sting up; with the Rapid Killing buff, open with Sniper Shot (or Aimed Shot if you have not learned it yet). Use Summon Hawk when talented, Arcane Shot every third rotation, and Aimed Shot; continue with Auto Shot. If you pull threat, use Disengage. For area damage, mark the priority target, use Multi-Shot and Explosive Trap if possible, then add Serpent Sting if the fight will last and you have mana. Once you have Volley, channel it fully and save Multi-Shot for four or fewer targets.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Marksmanship Hunter DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Marksmanship Hunter Leveling Guide › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/marksmanship-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:marksmanship:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:251c90fdb0ac518e5bff6e89b9ef50fa4b1c13ec","section:d5eb540b33a276eb4e90415fad83951c1e7f4b36"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-rotacion-subida-supervivencia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Supervivencia para subir","title_en":"Survival Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Golpe de raptor en cola, Mordedura de mangosta y Patada de zancudo; alterna melé y disparos.","summary_en":"Raptor Strike queued, Mongoose Bite and Strider Kick; weave melee and shots.","keywords_es":["rotación supervivencia subir","golpe de raptor en cola","mordedura de mangosta","patada de zancudo","alternar melé distancia"],"keywords_en":["survival leveling rotation","raptor strike queued","mongoose bite","strider kick","melee weaving"],"text_es":"Contra un objetivo, mantén Marca del cazador y Aguijón de serpiente; pon Golpe de raptor en cola al entrar en melé. En melé, usa Mordedura de mangosta, Patada de zancudo y Contraataque, en ese orden. Aprovecha la velocidad de Patada de zancudo para salir y lanzar Tiro Arcano, Aguijón de serpiente o Tiro de puntería; vuelve cuando Golpe de raptor y Mordedura estén casi listos. Contra varios, usa Multidisparo y Trampa explosiva si puedes; en melé, Trampa de inmolación. Hasta el 32, alterna melé y distancia. Con Lluvia, canalízala entera y usa Multidisparo contra cuatro objetivos o menos.","text_en":"Against one target, keep Hunter's Mark and Serpent Sting up; queue Raptor Strike when entering melee. In melee, use Mongoose Bite, Strider Kick, then Counterattack. Use the movement boost from Strider Kick to leave melee and cast Arcane Shot, Serpent Sting, or Aimed Shot; return when Raptor Strike and Mongoose Bite are nearly ready. Against several targets, use Multi-Shot and Explosive Trap if possible; use Immolation Trap in melee. Until level 32, weave melee and ranged attacks. Once available, channel Volley fully and use Multi-Shot against four or fewer targets.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Survival Hunter DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Survival Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Survival Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever > Mandatory Abilities to Train for Survival Hunter","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Survival Hunter DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:survival:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:c6b4be088eb6e215084a48180f13018f47561f44","section:0932b2c4f5955443026575b5d88689aab818fe98","section:2961a4ed516168b5d1f9e3ec53047b009de6db2b","section:ad8eb655b1b5f1bf6020502682c0c418111327fa"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-habilidades-dano","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades de daño que entrenar","title_en":"Damage Abilities to Train","summary_es":"Prioriza Aguijón, Tiro Arcano, Tiro de puntería, Multidisparo y Fuego rápido; el oro no llega para todo.","summary_en":"Prioritize Serpent Sting, Arcane Shot, Aimed Shot, Multi-Shot and Rapid Fire; gold does not cover everything.","keywords_es":["qué habilidades entrenar","habilidades de daño cazador","nivel de las habilidades","ahorrar oro entrenar","rangos de hechizos"],"keywords_en":["abilities to train","hunter damage abilities","ability levels","save gold training","spell ranks"],"text_es":"Mientras subes, el oro no llega para todas las habilidades, así que prioriza las que dan daño. Entrena Aguijón de serpiente a 4, Tiro Arcano a 6, Marca del cazador a 6, Tiro de puntería a 20, Multidisparo a 18 y Fuego rápido a 26. Golpe de raptor está desde 1 y Mordedura de mangosta a 16, útiles si peleas en melé. Lluvia llega a 40 y sustituye a la rotación de área primitiva. Sube los rangos nuevos cuando puedas, sobre todo los de tus habilidades principales.","text_en":"While leveling, gold does not cover every ability, so prioritize the ones that deal damage. Train Serpent Sting at 4, Arcane Shot at 6, Hunter's Mark at 6, Aimed Shot at 20, Multi-Shot at 18 and Rapid Fire at 26. Raptor Strike is available from 1 and Mongoose Bite at 16, useful if you fight in melee. Volley arrives at 40 and replaces the primitive area rotation. Buy new ranks when you can, especially for your main abilities.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Beast Mastery Hunter","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:5f4b7821e0aa6e0f194924a2ec964f58e3b53bd0","section:a1fefdafb92016b202a0ab22c82cc0ce0fb15bed"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-habilidades-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades de control y supervivencia","title_en":"Control and Survival Abilities","summary_es":"Disparo de concusión, Cortar alas, Aspecto del guepardo, trampas, Sanar mascota y Fingir muerte salvan la subida.","summary_en":"Concussive Shot, Wing Clip, Aspect of the Cheetah, traps, Mend Pet and Feign Death save the leveling run.","keywords_es":["habilidades de control cazador","disparo de concusión","cortar alas","trampas para subir","fingir muerte"],"keywords_en":["hunter control abilities","concussive shot","wing clip","leveling traps","feign death"],"text_es":"Además del daño, entrena las habilidades que te sacan de apuros: Disparo de concusión a 8, Cortar alas a 12, Aspecto del guepardo a 20, Trampa de inmolación a 16, Trampa congelante a 20, Trampa de Escarcha a 28 y Fingir muerte a 30. Sanar mascota a 12 mantiene vivo al compañero, y Aspecto del halcón a 10 es el buff de daño. Trampa explosiva llega a 34 y añade área. Fingir muerte también sirve para reiniciar un combate que se tuerce.","text_en":"Beyond damage, train the abilities that get you out of trouble: Concussive Shot at 8, Wing Clip at 12, Aspect of the Cheetah at 20, Immolation Trap at 16, Freezing Trap at 20, Frost Trap at 28 and Feign Death at 30. Mend Pet at 12 keeps the companion alive, and Aspect of the Hawk at 10 is the damage buff. Explosive Trap arrives at 34 and adds area damage. Feign Death also resets a fight that goes wrong.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Beast Mastery Hunter","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:5f4b7821e0aa6e0f194924a2ec964f58e3b53bd0","section:ab3d94029b44d479525d929a20e0744a93a697ba","section:c6da153dc5599024b096fd97b07e326182df761e"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-habilidades-opcionales","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades opcionales para ahorrar oro","title_en":"Optional Abilities to Save Gold","summary_es":"Rastrear bestias y humanoides, Aspecto del mono, Ojo de águila y Bengala son útiles pero se pueden saltar.","summary_en":"Track Beasts and Humanoids, Aspect of the Monkey, Eagle Eye and Flare are useful but skippable.","keywords_es":["habilidades opcionales cazador","rastrear bestias","aspecto del mono","ojo de águila","bengala"],"keywords_en":["optional hunter abilities","track beasts","aspect of the monkey","eagle eye","flare"],"text_es":"Algunas habilidades son útiles pero se pueden saltar para ahorrar oro. Rastrear bestias a 1, Aspecto del mono a 4, Rastrear humanoides a 10, Ojo de águila a 14 y Bengala a 32. Rastrear bestias y humanoides ayuda a encontrar objetivos o evitar enemigos en el minimapa; la esquiva de Aspecto del mono sirve al pelear en melé y Ojo de águila permite explorar a distancia. Bengala revela enemigos sigilosos o invisibles. Si el oro aprieta, estas son las últimas de la lista.","text_en":"Some abilities are useful but can be skipped to save gold. Track Beasts at 1, Aspect of the Monkey at 4, Track Humanoids at 10, Eagle Eye at 14 and Flare at 32. Tracking beasts and humanoids helps find targets or avoid enemies on the minimap; the dodge from Aspect of the Monkey helps in melee and Eagle Eye lets you scout at range. Flare reveals stealthed or invisible enemies. If gold is tight, these are the last on the list.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Beast Mastery Hunter","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/beast-mastery-hunter-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a8b0c719e08e81cde4d68d6ad79d8634e0309f8d","section:ab3d94029b44d479525d929a20e0744a93a697ba"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-subida-pros-contras","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ventajas y desventajas de subir","title_en":"Leveling Pros and Cons","summary_es":"Mascota, kiting y ataques sin golpes parciales a favor; munición, felicidad y recuperación de la mascota en contra.","summary_en":"Pet, kiting and no glancing blows on ranged attacks for; ammo, happiness and pet recovery against.","keywords_es":["ventajas de subir cazador","desventajas cazador","mascota tanque","munición cazador","kiting cazador"],"keywords_en":["hunter leveling pros","hunter leveling cons","pet tank","hunter ammo","hunter kiting"],"text_es":"Subir como Cazador es cómodo por la mascota, que tanquea y hace daño, y por el kiting con Disparo de concusión, Cortar alas y Trampa de Escarcha. Los ataques a distancia no tienen golpes parciales, así que puede con enemigos de más nivel, y Fingir muerte reinicia un combate. En contra, la munición ocupa bolsas y hay que reponerla; la mascota pierde felicidad y daño si no la alimentas, y si muere en combate toca Revivir mascota, alimentarla, curarla y recuperar maná. Aspecto del guepardo, desde 20, ayuda a moverse.","text_en":"Leveling as Hunter is comfortable thanks to the pet, which tanks and deals damage, and to kiting with Concussive Shot, Wing Clip and Frost Trap. Ranged attacks have no glancing blows, so Hunter can handle higher-level enemies, and Feign Death resets a fight. Against you, ammo fills bags and must be restocked; the pet loses happiness and damage if you do not feed it, and if it dies in combat you have to use Revive Pet, feed it, heal it and recover your mana. Aspect of the Cheetah, from 20, helps you move.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:fedb23334c5f8da252d669c1ea5ee868b4cb2290"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-subida-profesiones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para subir","title_en":"Leveling Professions","summary_es":"Desuello y Peletería se aprovechan de las bestias que matas; Ingeniería no conviene mientras subes.","summary_en":"Skinning and Leatherworking make use of the beasts you kill; Engineering is not worth it while leveling.","keywords_es":["profesiones para subir cazador","desuello y peletería","peletería cazador","ingeniería cazador","fabricar equipo"],"keywords_en":["hunter leveling professions","skinning and leatherworking","leatherworking hunter","hunter engineering","craft gear"],"text_es":"Para subir, Desuello y Peletería son la combinación natural: matas muchas bestias, las desuellas y usas el cuero para fabricar equipo. Peletería tiene piezas azules que solo puede usar quien las fabrica, como Botas de cuero oscuro y Cinturón de cuero de trampero, fuertes para su nivel, y cada pocos niveles puedes hacer algo útil. Ingeniería no se recomienda mientras subes porque obliga a combinarla con Minería; mejor cambiar Desuello por Ingeniería más adelante, cuando tengas oro para comprar los materiales.","text_en":"For leveling, Skinning and Leatherworking are the natural pair: you kill many beasts, skin them and use the leather to craft gear. Leatherworking has blue pieces only the crafter can use, such as Dark Leather Boots and Trapper's Leather Belt, strong for their level, and every few levels you can make something useful. Engineering is not recommended while leveling because it basically requires Mining; replace Skinning later, once you have the gold to buy the materials.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0041cb6a1f6559252001117ffddfb532a74864d2"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-subida-consumibles","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles para subir","title_en":"Leveling Consumables","summary_es":"Vendas de Primeros auxilios, complementos de Peletería, comida con 5% de experiencia, pociones y elixires.","summary_en":"First Aid bandages, Leatherworking armor kits, food with 5% experience, potions and elixirs.","keywords_es":["consumibles para subir cazador","vendas primeros auxilios","comida 5% experiencia","pociones de curación","elixires"],"keywords_en":["hunter leveling consumables","first aid bandages","food 5% experience","healing potions","elixirs"],"text_es":"Reserva la tela que encuentres para Primeros auxilios y prepara vendas al pasar por una ciudad principal. Si eres Peletero, guarda un Complemento para armadura ligera (o uno mejor) y aplícalos al equipo nuevo. Algunas comidas de vendedores o de Cocina aumentan un 5% la experiencia por enemigo; busca también bonus de poder de ataque o agilidad. Lleva comida, bebida, pociones de salud apropiadas para tu nivel (desde Poción de curación menor) y los elixires que obtengas en misiones.","text_en":"Save the cloth you find for First Aid and make bandages when visiting a major city. If you are a Leatherworker, keep an armor kit such as Light Armor Kit or better for new gear. Some vendor or Cooking foods grant 5% more experience per enemy; look for ones that also boost Attack Power or Agility. Carry food, drinks, level-appropriate healing potions (Minor Healing Potion or better), and any elixirs you receive from quests.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4c50fa23aac9cad5b80bbad8cb024c25f287fabc"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-subida-legado","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Puntos Legacy para subir","title_en":"Legacy Points for Leveling","summary_es":"Cosecha generosa para oro; Emoción de la aventura y Talentoso para aguantar; Gastronomía para la comida de experiencia.","summary_en":"Bountiful Harvest for gold; Thrill of Adventure and Talented for endurance; Gourmand for the experience food.","keywords_es":["puntos legacy cazador","cosecha generosa","emoción de la aventura","talentoso","gastronomía"],"keywords_en":["hunter legacy points","bountiful harvest","thrill of adventure","talented","gourmand"],"text_es":"Elige los puntos Legacy según tu objetivo. Cosecha generosa mejora la opción de obtener materiales raros al desollar y puede dar más oro; Emoción de la aventura y Talentoso ayudan a conservar recursos y mantener el rendimiento durante la subida. Gastronomía alarga el efecto de la comida que aumenta la experiencia.","text_en":"Point choices depend on your goal. Bountiful Harvest improves your chance to obtain rare materials from skinning and can bring in more gold; Thrill of Adventure and Talented help you sustain your resources and performance while leveling. Gourmand extends the effect of food that increases experience.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Beast Mastery Hunter Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best use of Legacy Points for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:2192c46f3aa588e05c1b7a044a34b167a31e8301"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-talentos-dominio-pvp","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvP de Dominio de bestias","title_en":"Beast Mastery PvP Build","summary_es":"Variante PvP con control adicional, defensa contra melé e Invocar halcón.","summary_en":"PvP variant with extra control, melee defense, and Summon Hawk.","keywords_es":["build dominio pvp","talentos cazador pvp","dominio de bestias pvp","control cazador"],"keywords_en":["beast mastery pvp build","hunter pvp talents","beast mastery pvp","hunter crowd control"],"text_es":"Dominio de bestias: Aspectos letales 5/5, Fuego enfocado 2/2, Aspecto del Mono mejorado 3/3, Rapidez de bestias 1/1, Furia desatada 5/5, Ferocidad 5/5, Invocar halcón 1/1, Intimidación 1/1, Disciplina de bestias 2/2, Frenesí 5/5 e Ira de bestias 1/1. Puntería: Disparo de concusión mejorado 5/5, Ataques letales 5/5, Afinar la puntería 5/5 y Aura de disparo certero 1/1. Supervivencia: Rastreo mejorado 4/5. Añade control: Disparo de concusión mejorado puede aturdir, Aspecto del mono ayuda contra melé e Invocar halcón no tiene alcance mínimo.","text_en":"Beast Mastery: Deadly Aspects 5/5, Focused Fire 2/2, Improved Aspect of the Monkey 3/3, Bestial Swiftness 1/1, Unleashed Fury 5/5, Ferocity 5/5, Summon Hawk 1/1, Intimidation 1/1, Bestial Discipline 2/2, Frenzy 5/5, and Bestial Wrath 1/1. Marksmanship: Improved Concussive Shot 5/5, Lethal Attacks 5/5, Careful Aim 5/5, and Trueshot Aura 1/1. Survival: Improved Tracking 4/5. It adds disruption: Improved Concussive Shot can stun, Improved Aspect of the Monkey helps against melee opponents, and Summon Hawk has no minimum range.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Beast Mastery Hunter Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Beast Mastery Hunter PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:04cef53106ff7f5dd144fd743ddfa99ea878d110"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-talentos-punteria-pvp","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvP de Puntería","title_en":"Marksmanship PvP Build","summary_es":"Variante PvP con talentos de control, interrupción y defensa.","summary_en":"PvP variant with control, disruption, and defensive talents.","keywords_es":["build puntería pvp","talentos cazador pvp","disparo disperso","disparo de concusión mejorado"],"keywords_en":["marksmanship pvp build","hunter pvp talents","scatter shot build","improved concussive shot"],"text_es":"Puntería: Disparo de concusión mejorado 5/5, Ataques letales 5/5, Picaduras mejoradas 3/3, Afinar la puntería 5/5, Disparo Arcano mejorado 5/5, Lobo solitario 1/1, Aura de disparo certero 1/1, Disparos mortales 5/5, Aluvión 3/3, Disparo disperso 1/1, Especialización en armas a distancia 5/5 y Disparo de francotirador 1/1. Supervivencia: Rastreo mejorado 5/5, Sobrevividor 5/5 y Disuasión 1/1. El control y las defensas ayudan a interrumpir y sobrevivir; los disparos potentes son difíciles de lanzar en JcJ, pero devastadores si impactan.","text_en":"Marksmanship: Improved Concussive Shot 5/5, Lethal Attacks 5/5, Improved Stings 3/3, Careful Aim 5/5, Improved Arcane Shot 5/5, Lone Wolf 1/1, Trueshot Aura 1/1, Mortal Shots 5/5, Barrage 3/3, Scatter Shot 1/1, Ranged Weapon Specialization 5/5, and Sniper Shot 1/1. Survival: Improved Tracking 5/5, Survivalist 5/5, and Deterrence 1/1. Control and defensive talents help disrupt and survive; the powerful shots are hard to cast in PvP, but devastating when they land.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Marksmanship Hunter Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Marksmanship Hunter PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:marksmanship:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:65c5f074ba7165e63d19e16b5a5d0966c4065b11"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-talentos-supervivencia-weaving","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de weaving de Supervivencia (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Survival Weaving PvE Build (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Mezcla ataques a distancia y melé con arma a dos manos y Golpes lacerantes.","summary_en":"Mixes ranged and melee attacks with a two-handed weapon and Lacerating Strikes.","keywords_es":["build weaving cazador","supervivencia weaving","arma a dos manos cazador","golpes lacerantes"],"keywords_en":["survival weaving build","hunter weaving","two-handed hunter","lacerating strikes"],"text_es":"Puntería: Ataques letales 5/5, Picaduras mejoradas 3/3, Afinar la puntería 5/5, Disparo Arcano mejorado 1/5, Lobo solitario 1/1, Aura de disparo certero 1/1 y Disparos mortales 4/5. Supervivencia: Rastreo mejorado 5/5, Golpes salvajes 2/2, Sobrevividor 3/5, Trampas inteligentes 2/2, Pies de plomo 3/3, Filo de depredador 5/5, Ingenio 2/2, Exponer presa 2/2, Patada de zancudo 1/1, Reflejos de relámpago 5/5 y Golpes lacerantes 1/1. Rinde con arma a dos manos: Golpes lacerantes aumenta Mordedura de mangosta y Puntería refuerza los disparos.","text_en":"Marksmanship: Lethal Attacks 5/5, Improved Stings 3/3, Careful Aim 5/5, Improved Arcane Shot 1/5, Lone Wolf 1/1, Trueshot Aura 1/1, and Mortal Shots 4/5. Survival: Improved Tracking 5/5, Savage Strikes 2/2, Survivalist 3/5, Clever Traps 2/2, Surefooted 3/3, Predator’s Edge 5/5, Resourcefulness 2/2, Expose Prey 2/2, Strider Kick 1/1, Lightning Reflexes 5/5, and Lacerating Strikes 1/1. It suits a two-handed weapon: Lacerating Strikes improves Mongoose Bite and Marksmanship boosts ranged attacks.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Survival Hunter Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Survival Hunter Weaving PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:survival:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:e8412d88f4c0f445dacfd5bdd9ade2891d290077"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-talentos-supervivencia-pvp","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvP de Supervivencia","title_en":"Survival PvP Build","summary_es":"Build PvP con Invocar halcón, defensas y herramientas para seguir al objetivo.","summary_en":"PvP build with Summon Hawk, defenses, and tools to stay on target.","keywords_es":["build supervivencia pvp","talentos cazador pvp","supervivencia pvp","control cazador melé"],"keywords_en":["survival pvp build","hunter pvp talents","survival pvp","melee hunter control"],"text_es":"Dominio de bestias: Aspectos letales 5/5, Fuego enfocado 2/2, Aspecto del Mono mejorado 3/3, Rapidez de bestias 1/1, Furia desatada 5/5, Ferocidad 4/5, Invocar halcón 1/1 e Intimidación 1/1. Supervivencia: Rastreo mejorado 5/5, Atrapamiento 2/5, Golpes salvajes 2/2, Cortar alas mejorado 3/3, Pies de plomo 3/3, Disuasión 1/1, Filo de depredador 5/5, Contraataque 1/1, Ingenio 2/2, Exponer presa 2/2, Disciplina de superviviente 2/2 y Patada de zancudo 1/1. Invocar halcón presiona al rival; las defensas mitigan amenazas y las habilidades de melé ayudan a mantenerlo cerca.","text_en":"Beast Mastery: Deadly Aspects 5/5, Focused Fire 2/2, Improved Aspect of the Monkey 3/3, Bestial Swiftness 1/1, Unleashed Fury 5/5, Ferocity 4/5, Summon Hawk 1/1, and Intimidation 1/1. Survival: Improved Tracking 5/5, Entrapment 2/5, Savage Strikes 2/2, Improved Wing Clip 3/3, Surefooted 3/3, Deterrence 1/1, Predator’s Edge 5/5, Counterattack 1/1, Resourcefulness 2/2, Expose Prey 2/2, Survivalist’s Discipline 2/2, and Strider Kick 1/1. Summon Hawk pressures opponents; defensive talents blunt threats and melee abilities help keep targets close.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Survival Hunter Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Survival Hunter PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:survival:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:3a4949b6ad1c81dbdb03c0c677711f375f1537e3"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-talentos-dominio-secundarias","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rama secundaria de Dominio PvE (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Beast Mastery Secondary Tree (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Talentos secundarios de Puntería de la build de banda de Dominio y su aporte a la mascota.","summary_en":"Marksmanship talents in the Beast Mastery raid build and their benefit to the pet.","keywords_es":["talentos secundarios dominio","puntería build dominio","talentos mascota dominio","build dominio banda"],"keywords_en":["beast mastery secondary talents","marksmanship in beast mastery","beast mastery pet talents","beast mastery raid build"],"text_es":"Puntería: Ataques letales 5/5, Picaduras mejoradas 3/3, Afinar la puntería 5/5, Matanza rápida 2/2, Aura de disparo certero 1/1 y Disparos mortales 4/5. Estos talentos de Puntería también mejoran la mascota por la herencia de estadísticas. La explicación prefiere Rastreo mejorado a Disparos mortales como aumento general, aunque el reparto anotado asigna 4/5 a Disparos mortales.","text_en":"Marksmanship: Lethal Attacks 5/5, Improved Stings 3/3, Careful Aim 5/5, Rapid Killing 2/2, Trueshot Aura 1/1, and Mortal Shots 4/5. Several talents from the Marksmanship tree also help the pet through stat inheritance. The explanation favors Improved Tracking over Mortal Shots as a blanket damage increase, although the decoded allocation assigns Mortal Shots 4/5.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Beast Mastery Hunter Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Beast Mastery Hunter PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-16","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:bc95149e5fb3e0b01a9a39c3cc13749860438f87"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-mascotas-raras","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mascotas raras con aspecto único","title_en":"Rare pets with unique looks","summary_es":"Bestias raras domables cuyo modelo o color no tiene ninguna mascota común.","summary_en":"Rare tameable beasts whose model or colour no common pet has.","keywords_es":["mascotas raras cazador","mascota con aspecto único","domar bestia rara","mascota diferente cazador","Colmiespectro"],"keywords_en":["rare hunter pets","unique looking pet","tame rare beast","different hunter pet","Ghostfang"],"text_es":"Si buscas una mascota que se distinga, hay bestias raras domables con modelo o color que no tiene ninguna mascota común: Vulgara el Insaciable, Colmiespectro, Noctigrito, Sarpullefrío, Melenaniebla, Zancador Madrezarpa y Humar el Señor Orgulloso. Elegirlas es cuestión de aspecto, no de daño. Antes de domarla, comprueba que su familia tenga Zarpa, porque sin ella pierde mucho daño.","text_en":"If you want a pet that stands out, some rare tameable beasts have a model or colour no common pet has: Vulgara the Insatiable, Ghostfang, Nightscreech, Coldrasp, Mystmane, Strider Clutchmother and Humar the Pridelord. Picking one is about looks, not damage. Before taming, check that its family has Claw, because without it the pet loses a lot of damage.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › Notable Rare Hunter Pets and Where to Find Them","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › Best Hunter Pets in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:7cfdadc52cd2486647f06636ed2cf6e9a9d1a95f","section:8a956079f821bf48955e82d3cb43628371c06d73"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-mascota-entrenador","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades que enseña el instructor de mascotas","title_en":"Abilities the pet trainer teaches","summary_es":"Habilidades pasivas que se compran con puntos de entrenamiento y tope de 300 puntos.","summary_en":"Passive abilities bought with training points, and the 300-point cap.","keywords_es":["instructor de mascotas","puntos de entrenamiento mascota","armadura natural mascota","resistencias de la mascota","gran aguante mascota"],"keywords_en":["pet trainer abilities","pet training points","natural armor pet","pet resistances","great stamina pet"],"text_es":"El instructor de mascotas de las ciudades enseña Bramido (el único gratis), Armadura natural, Gran aguante y Resistencia al Fuego, Resistencia Arcana, Resistencia a la naturaleza y Resistencia a la Escarcha. Todas menos Bramido cuestan puntos de entrenamiento, y la mascota tiene un máximo de 300 a nivel 60 con lealtad de rango 6, así que no cabe todo. Bramido da mucha amenaza, pero no es una provocación completa. Las resistencias valen contra mucho daño de ese tipo. Se enseñan en Doma de bestias.","text_en":"The pet trainers in cities teach Growl (the only free one), Natural Armor, Great Stamina and Fire Resistance, Arcane Resistance, Nature Resistance and Frost Resistance. All except Growl cost training points, and the pet has a maximum of 300 at level 60 with rank 6 loyalty, so not everything fits. Growl gives a large amount of threat but is not a full taunt. Resistances help against a lot of that damage type. They are taught in Beast Training.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › How your Hunter Pet Learns New Abilities in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:10e65179a3f1339beeafa43403b4803392d9c602"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-mascota-habilidades-familia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades extra de cada familia de mascota","title_en":"Extra abilities of each pet family","summary_es":"Movilidad, control y relleno que aporta cada familia además de lo básico.","summary_en":"Mobility, control and filler each family adds beyond the basics.","keywords_es":["habilidades de familia de mascota","Mordedura mascota","Diligencia o Lanzada","Escudo de caparazón tortuga","Embestir jabalí"],"keywords_en":["pet family abilities","pet Bite","Dash or Dive","turtle Shell Shield","boar Charge"],"text_es":"Zarpa (relleno barato en enfoque) y Mordedura (daño alto con enfriamiento) son las ofensivas; Pavor baja la amenaza y la tienen todas. Diligencia y Lanzada aceleran a la mascota; Acechar es solo del Felino. Control: Embestir (Jabalí) inmoviliza; Pellizco (Cangrejo) y Desgarre de tendón (Hiena) ralentizan. Flagelo (Oso) y Pisotón de trueno (Gorila) dañan en área, Escudo de caparazón (Tortuga) reduce el daño recibido y Veneno de escórpido se apila hasta 5.","text_en":"Claw (cheap focus filler) and Bite (high damage with a cooldown) are the offensive abilities; Cower lowers threat and every family has it. Dash and Dive speed the pet up; Prowl is Cat-only. Control: Charge (Boar) immobilizes; Pinch (Crab) and Tendon Rip (Hyena) slow. Swipe (Bear) and Thunderstomp (Gorilla) deal area damage, Shell Shield (Turtle) cuts damage taken and Scorpid Poison stacks to 5.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Hunter Pets:  Finding the Best Pets and Pet Management for Hunters - WoW: Forever › How your Hunter Pet Learns New Abilities in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/best-pets-and-pet-management-guide","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:general:best-pets-and-pet-management-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:10e65179a3f1339beeafa43403b4803392d9c602"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-disparos-punteria","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Disparos de Puntería: tiempos y límites","title_en":"Marksmanship shots: timings and limits","summary_es":"Lanzamiento y reutilización de Tiro de puntería y compañía.","summary_en":"Cast times and cooldowns for Aimed Shot and others.","keywords_es":["tiro de puntería cuánto tarda","disparo de francotirador reutilización","multidisparo cuántos objetivos","lluvia cazador"],"keywords_en":["aimed shot cast time","sniper shot cooldown","multi-shot targets","volley hunter"],"text_es":"Tiro de puntería tarda 2 s, tiene 6 s de reutilización y el tiro automático sigue durante el lanzamiento; la comparte con Multidisparo, que ahora golpea a 3 objetivos con el daño del tiro normal y no tiene rangos. Disparo de francotirador (talento) tarda 4 s, tiene 15 s de reutilización y es difícil de usar en JcJ. Lluvia no tiene reutilización. Tiro Arcano escala algo con el poder de ataque a distancia.","text_en":"Aimed Shot takes 2 s to cast, has a 6 s cooldown and auto shots continue during the cast; it shares that cooldown with Multi-Shot, which now hits 3 targets for normal auto-shot damage and has no ranks. Sniper Shot (talent) takes 4 s, has a 15 s cooldown and is hard to use in PvP. Volley has no cooldown. Arcane Shot scales slightly with Ranged Attack Power.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter Abilities Guide - Forever › Ranged Damage Spells for Marksmanship Hunters in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/dps-abilities","date":"2026-10-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:marksmanship:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:4b308466c508b12bd478d707965155752c173577"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-melee-supervivencia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ataques cuerpo a cuerpo de Supervivencia","title_en":"Survival melee attacks","summary_es":"Cuándo se usan Patada de zancudo, Contraataque y Mordedura.","summary_en":"When Strider Kick, Counterattack and Mongoose Bite are used.","keywords_es":["patada de zancudo qué hace","contraataque cazador","mordedura de mangosta","supervivencia melé"],"keywords_en":["strider kick what does","hunter counterattack","mongoose bite","survival melee"],"text_es":"Golpe de raptor es el ataque principal. Patada de zancudo (talento) hace el 100 % del daño del arma, acelera un momento y tiene 8 s de reutilización; no interrumpe. Mordedura de mangosta se usa tras esquivar y los talentos de Supervivencia la hacen más fuerte y la liberan de esa condición. Contraataque exige parar un golpe e inmoviliza al objetivo. Las trampas de inmolación y explosiva mejoran con talentos.","text_en":"Raptor Strike is the main attack. Strider Kick (talent) deals 100% weapon damage, grants a brief speed boost and has an 8 s cooldown; it is not an interrupt. Mongoose Bite is used after a dodge, and Survival talents make it stronger and remove that condition. Counterattack requires a parry and immobilizes the target. The Immolation and Explosive Traps improve with talents.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Survival Hunter Abilities Guide - Forever › Melee Damage Spells for Survival Hunters in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/dps-abilities","date":"2026-10-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:survival:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:9578505e3437c0c26cc984e52a61582d96a8aa85"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-picaduras-utilidad","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Picaduras y utilidades del Cazador","title_en":"Stings and Hunter utilities","summary_es":"Para qué sirven Picadura de víbora, Bengala, Separación y más.","summary_en":"What Viper Sting, Flare, Disengage and others are for.","keywords_es":["picadura de víbora","bengala cazador","separación cazador","disparo tranquilizante","ojo de águila"],"keywords_en":["viper sting","hunter flare","disengage hunter","tranquilizing shot","eagle eye"],"text_es":"Picadura de víbora drena maná a lanzadores; Aguijón de escorpido reduce la probabilidad de acertar del objetivo. Disparo tranquilizante quita un efecto de frenesí, Disparo de distracción genera amenaza y Separación la reduce en melé. Bengala revela enemigos ocultos o invisibles y Marca del cazador mantiene visible al objetivo aunque entre en sigilo (útil contra Pícaros y Druidas felinos). Ojo de águila permite explorar a distancia.","text_en":"Viper Sting drains mana from casters; Scorpid Sting lowers the target's hit chance. Tranquilizing Shot removes a Frenzy effect, Distracting Shot generates threat and Disengage reduces it in melee. Flare reveals hidden or invisible enemies and Hunter's Mark keeps the target visible even if it stealths (useful against Rogues and cat Druids). Eagle Eye lets you scout at a distance.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Marksmanship Hunter Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Marksmanship Hunters in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/dps-abilities","date":"2026-10-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:marksmanship:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:9dea30fe6fd002064df9fce6fa3c6bd5aa7308b6"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-encantamientos-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Cazador al subir","title_en":"Hunter enchants while leveling","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Cazador (las tres especializaciones) mientras subes.","summary_en":"What to enchant as a Hunter (all three specs) while leveling.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo cazador","qué encantamientos pongo de cazador","encantamientos para cazador","encantamientos cazador","qué encantar cazador","encantar capa agilidad","complemento fuerte armadura cazador"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a hunter","best enchants for hunter","hunter enchants","what to enchant hunter","cloak agility enchant hunter","forceful armor kit hunter"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Cazador al subir: Las tres especializaciones comparten la lista: Encantar capa: agilidad menor, Encantar brazales: agilidad superior y, en torso, manos, piernas y pies, los Complementos para armadura fuertes (medio, pesado, grueso y basto, según tu nivel). Para el arma a dos manos se recomienda el encantamiento de agilidad inferior.","text_en":"Hunter enchants while leveling: All three specs share the list: Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility, Enchant Bracer - Greater Agility and, on chest, hands, legs and feet, the Forceful Armor Kits (medium, heavy, thick and rugged, by level). For the two-hand weapon, the Lesser Agility enchant is recommended.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Beast Mastery Hunter Enchants & Consumables in WoW: Forever › Best Beast Mastery Hunter Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Marksmanship Hunter Enchants & Consumables in WoW: Forever › Best Marksmanship Hunter Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/marksmanship/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Survival Hunter Enchants & Consumables in WoW: Forever › Best Survival Hunter Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:enchants","class:hunter:marksmanship:enchants","class:hunter:survival:enchants"],"source_hashes":["guide:ca204e82efe3ffeb9eef1cefd614442ae3eb148d","section:935900ac975189f735a4375a0dc241a7d09ec680","section:ad497420cadb24862f58725c2346e2fb72402b8b"]},{"id":"clase-hunter-consumibles-subir-lista","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles del Cazador por especialización","title_en":"Hunter consumables by spec","summary_es":"Pociones, aceites y comida recomendados al Cazador mientras sube.","summary_en":"Potions, oils and food recommended for the Hunter while leveling.","keywords_es":["consumibles cazador","poción de frenesí cazador","qué comida cazador","aceite de maná cazador"],"keywords_en":["hunter consumables","frenzy potion hunter","hunter food leveling","mana oil hunter"],"text_es":"Poción de combate: Poción de frenesí excelente. Salud: Poción de curación sublime o la versión que te toque por nivel. Comida: Estofado de la selva y Filete Golpeveloz. Arma: Aceite de maná inferior; el Supervivencia puede alternar Piedra de afilar sólida o densa y Aceite escarchado.","text_en":"Combat potion: Superior Frenzy Potion. Health: Major Healing Potion or the version for your level. Food: Jungle Stew and Swiftstrike Steak. Weapon: Lesser Mana Oil; Survival can also use Solid or Dense Sharpening Stones and Frost Oil.","tags":["HUNTER"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Beast Mastery Hunter Enchants & Consumables in WoW: Forever › Best Beast Mastery Hunter Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/beast-mastery/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Survival Hunter Enchants & Consumables in WoW: Forever › Best Survival Hunter Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/hunter/survival/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:hunter:beast-mastery:enchants","class:hunter:survival:enchants"],"source_hashes":["guide:ca204e82efe3ffeb9eef1cefd614442ae3eb148d","section:a35421b597505d4cd3e0c77fa7389093690ea1a6"]}]},"04-clase-mage.json":{"description":"Capítulo 4: Clases. Mago. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"clase-mage-que-hace","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace un Mago","title_en":"What a Mage Does","summary_es":"El Mago hace daño a distancia, controla enemigos y ayuda al grupo con conjuraciones y portales.","summary_en":"Mages deal ranged damage, control enemies, and support groups with conjured goods and portals.","keywords_es":["qué hace un mago","mago daño a distancia","mago control de enemigos","mago arcanismo","mago comida y portales"],"keywords_en":["what does a mage do","mage ranged damage","mage crowd control","mage arcane","mage food and portals"],"text_es":"El Mago usa Fuego, Escarcha y Arcano para hacer daño a distancia y controlar enemigos. Polimorfia aparta un objetivo; Nova de Escarcha y Traslación ayudan a manejar el combate. Fuera de combate, puede conjurar comida y agua y transportar al grupo mediante portales.","text_en":"Mages use Fire, Frost, and Arcane to deal ranged damage and control enemies. Polymorph removes one target; Frost Nova and Blink help manage combat. Outside combat, Mages can conjure food and water and transport the group with portals.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Mage Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Mage in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-overview","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:general:mage-class-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:867ea46bc1285e3b11670935d87afcb9bfa70c0f"]},{"id":"clase-mage-especializaciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones del Mago","title_en":"Mage Specializations","summary_es":"Arcano destaca por ráfagas y maná; Fuego por críticos; Escarcha por control y seguridad.","summary_en":"Arcane brings burst and mana play; Fire relies on criticals; Frost offers control and safety.","keywords_es":["especializaciones del mago","mago arcano fuego escarcha","mago daño con fuego","mago escarcha control","qué especialización de mago"],"keywords_en":["mage specializations","mage arcane fire frost","mage fire damage","mage frost control","which mage spec"],"text_es":"Arcano convierte la gestión del maná en daño y puede alcanzar ráfagas altas. Fuego escala con equipo y golpes críticos para activar Ignición y Calentamiento. Escarcha ralentiza y congela; ofrece daño constante y control, a cambio de menos ráfaga que las otras dos ramas.","text_en":"Arcane turns mana management into damage and can deliver powerful bursts. Fire scales with gear and critical strikes to trigger Ignite and Heating Up. Frost slows and freezes, offering steady damage and control at the cost of less burst than the other two trees.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Arcane Mage in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Fire Mage in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Frost Mages in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:overview","class:mage:fire:overview","class:mage:frost:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:13076b6abda599255a51b5b2844ceb7954cf69f1","section:5302603b8b7a44c7903e0a4e315b5c4222234156","section:befaff6edc623d1fd50d0d5d6708181e2244021d"]},{"id":"clase-mage-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambios del Mago en Forever","title_en":"Mage Changes in Forever","summary_es":"Arcano gana una identidad propia; Fuego incorpora Calentamiento y Escarcha suma Lanza de hielo.","summary_en":"Arcane gains its own identity; Fire adds Heating Up and Frost gains Ice Lance.","keywords_es":["cambios del mago en forever","mago arcano viable","mago descarga de pirofrio","mago escarcha lanza de hielo","entender pergamino"],"keywords_en":["mage forever changes","arcane mage viable","frostfire bolt mage","frost ice lance","comprehend scroll"],"text_es":"Arcano deja de ser solo apoyo: Explosión Arcana y Tromba de misiles permiten una rama de daño propia. Fuego obtiene Calentamiento, que reduce el lanzamiento de Piroexplosión, además de Explosión de Fuego mejorada y Descarga de Pirofrío. Escarcha incorpora Lanza de hielo y Dedos de Escarcha; Barrera de hielo también adquiere uso ofensivo.","text_en":"Arcane is no longer only a support tree: Arcane Blast and Missile Barrage enable a dedicated damage build. Fire gains Heating Up, which shortens Pyroblast casts, as well as Improved Fire Blast and Frostfire Bolt. Frost adds Ice Lance and Fingers of Frost; Ice Barrier also gains an offensive use.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Arcane Mage in WoW Forever > New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Fire Mage in WoW Forever > New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes for Frost Mage in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:overview","class:mage:fire:overview","class:mage:frost:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:6baf0cfd8d654fbbea58f486ec3e16abab897d34","guide:b64e31d011df677ff817121016967f50f569da23","section:ac327191622fc9c82a948153cfbf7e8fad69e733"]},{"id":"clase-mage-armas-armadura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Varitas del Mago","title_en":"Mage Wands","summary_es":"Una varita mantiene el daño sin gastar maná mientras se regenera; Especialización en varitas mejora su uso.","summary_en":"A wand keeps damage going without mana while it regenerates; Wand Specialization improves its use.","keywords_es":["armas del mago","armadura del mago","mago varita","mago bastón","mago equipo de tela"],"keywords_en":["mage weapons","mage armor","mage wand","mage staff","mage cloth gear"],"text_es":"Cuando te quedas sin maná, la varita permite seguir dañando y mantener distancia mientras el recurso se recupera. Especialización en varitas aumenta su daño, y las varitas pueden ser especialmente potentes durante los primeros niveles.","text_en":"When mana runs low, a wand lets you keep dealing damage from range while the resource recovers. Wand Specialization increases its damage, and wands can be especially strong at early levels.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arcane Mage Guide › Arcane Mage Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arcane-mage-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:581db85b33ee3e85ded3e59f7d4c52940b198e8c"]},{"id":"clase-mage-subir-espec","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejor especialización para subir","title_en":"Best Mage Spec for Leveling","summary_es":"Escarcha controla mejor; Arcano ahorra pausas; Fuego ofrece alcance y daño individual.","summary_en":"Frost controls best; Arcane reduces downtime; Fire offers range and single-target damage.","keywords_es":["mejor especialización para subir mago","mago escarcha para levear","mago arcano para subir","mago fuego para subir","qué spec de mago usar"],"keywords_en":["best mage leveling spec","frost mage leveling","arcane mage leveling","fire mage leveling","which mage spec to level"],"text_es":"Escarcha es la opción más segura: ralentiza y congela, y Lanza de hielo aprovecha objetivos congelados. Arcano combina buen daño individual y apoyo de maná, por lo que funciona en misiones y mazmorras. Fuego tiene gran alcance y buen daño individual, pero sufre más con el maná y el área y depende del poder con hechizos del equipo. Escarcha tarda en destacar; puedes subir con Arcano y cambiar cerca del 31.","text_en":"Frost is the safest choice: it slows and freezes, while Ice Lance exploits frozen targets. Arcane combines strong single-target damage with mana support, making it suitable for quests and dungeons. Fire has great range and strong single-target damage, but struggles more with mana and AoE and depends on spell power from gear. Frost takes time to come online; you can level as Arcane and switch around 31.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as an Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Fire Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Frost Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Frost Mage Leveling Talent Build for WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling","class:mage:fire:leveling","class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:3b67d44d3b8a1a9973604b7cb24e6eb0186027d4","section:4b9fb6fcdbd18cb1dd31cce98f12aa0102580ffd","section:8e6f1a177a32669927096280bee225a97a167dff","section:bd01a556cd9ed84d3f95d2eeb3e8e0afccea20a2"]},{"id":"clase-mage-talentos-escarcha","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de talentos de Escarcha para subir","title_en":"Frost Leveling Talent Build","summary_es":"Empieza con Especialización en varitas 2/2 y Precisión 2/3; Mordiescarcha 3/3 habilita combos.","summary_en":"Start with Wand Specialization 2/2 and Precision 2/3; Frostbite 3/3 enables combos.","keywords_es":["talentos para subir mago escarcha","ruta de escarcha","precisión mordiescarcha","lanza de hielo nivel","dedos de escarcha"],"keywords_en":["frost mage leveling talents","frost talent path","precision frostbite","ice lance level","fingers of frost"],"text_es":"Arcano: Especialización en varitas 2/2, Recuperación Arcana 3/3 y Sutileza Arcana 2/2. Escarcha: Descarga de Escarcha mejorada 5/5, Precisión 3/3, Fragmentos de hielo 5/5, Mordiescarcha 3/3, Escarcha permanente 3/3, Canalización de Escarcha 3/3, Ventisca mejorada 3/3, Lanza de hielo 1/1, Alcance ártico 2/2, Bloqueo de hielo 1/1, Trizar 3/3, Cono de frío mejorado 3/3, Mordedura helada 1/1, Dedos de Escarcha 2/2, Escalofrío del invierno 5/5 y Barrera de hielo 1/1.","text_en":"Arcane: Wand Specialization 2/2, Arcane Resilience 3/3, and Arcane Subtlety 2/2. Frost: Improved Frostbolt 5/5, Precision 3/3, Ice Shards 5/5, Frostbite 3/3, Permafrost 3/3, Frost Channeling 3/3, Improved Blizzard 3/3, Ice Lance 1/1, Arctic Reach 2/2, Ice Block 1/1, Shatter 3/3, Improved Cone of Cold 3/3, Cold Snap 1/1, Fingers of Frost 2/2, Winter’s Chill 5/5, and Ice Barrier 1/1.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Frost Mage DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Frost Mage Leveling Talent Build for WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:9f2d2de4ab2c35c2a0e8fdf8f82e48a930203324","section:bd01a556cd9ed84d3f95d2eeb3e8e0afccea20a2"]},{"id":"clase-mage-hitos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de habilidades por nivel","title_en":"Ability Milestones by Level","summary_es":"Deflagración Arcana a 14; hechizos y movilidad desde 20; Gemas de maná hasta 58.","summary_en":"Arcane Explosion at 14; spells and mobility from 20; Mana Gems through 58.","keywords_es":["cuándo aprendo hechizos de mago","nivel de las habilidades del mago","hitos del mago","lanza de hielo nivel","pirofrio nivel"],"keywords_en":["when mage spells","mage ability levels","mage milestones","ice lance level","frostfire bolt level"],"text_es":"A 14 se aprende Deflagración Arcana. A 20 llegan Traslación, Evocación, Ventisca, Explosión Arcana, dos teletransportes y Lanza de hielo (talento). Tromba de misiles llega a 25, Cono de frío a 26 y Conjurar ágata de maná a 28. A 30 se aprende otro teletransporte y Dedos de Escarcha (talento de 21 puntos); también se desbloquea Varitas de mago, que recompensa con Varita Furia de Hielo. A 40 llegan Descarga de Pirofrío y los portales; los de Darnassus y Cima del Trueno llegan a 50. La ágata mejora a 38, 48 y 58.","text_en":"Arcane Explosion is learned at 14. Blink, Evocation, Blizzard, Arcane Blast, two teleports, and Ice Lance (a talent) come at 20. Missile Barrage arrives at 25, Cone of Cold at 26, and Conjure Mana Agate at 28. At 30, another teleport and the 21-point Fingers of Frost talent arrive; the Mage’s Wand class quest line also unlocks, rewarding Icefury Wand. Frostfire Bolt and portals come at 40; those to Darnassus and Thunder Bluff arrive at 50. Mana Agate ranks improve at 38, 48, and 58.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Arcane Mage","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arcane Mage Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arcane-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fire Mage Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fire-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Frost Mage Leveling Talent Build for WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fire Mage Leveling Guide › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fire-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling","class:mage:fire:leveling","class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1ce834a8f36871949e1eac51aaa1bdb857add36b","section:47c0c3352730c90d5837da9638028eab2ed610db","section:63991e0ff2f9be81ae3a0e28cf84030a68e417cc","section:65574cf48c680b433e518d65dbf0b3a5faa61118","section:a7a54f40133178813f6fe1cd4f49e0b1b2eb9406","section:bd01a556cd9ed84d3f95d2eeb3e8e0afccea20a2"]},{"id":"clase-mage-mana","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Gestión del maná del Mago","title_en":"Mage Mana Management","summary_es":"Espíritu, talentos y Armadura de mago sostienen el maná; la varita ayuda a evitar gastos innecesarios.","summary_en":"Spirit, talents, and Mage Armor sustain mana; a wand helps avoid unnecessary spending.","keywords_es":["cómo gestionar maná de mago","regeneración de maná","mago sin maná","varita y maná","evocación y gemas de maná"],"keywords_en":["mage mana management","mana regeneration","mage out of mana","wand and mana","evocation mana gems"],"text_es":"Tras gastar maná, la regeneración por Espíritu se reanuda después de 5 segundos sin gastarlo. Meditación Arcana y Armadura de mago permiten regenerarlo durante el combate. La varita hace daño sin coste de maná; Evocación restaura la mayor parte de la reserva en 8 segundos y las Gemas de maná son una reserva de emergencia. Conjurar comida y agua ayuda a reducir las pausas; remata con varita a los enemigos casi derrotados.","text_en":"After spending mana, Spirit regeneration resumes after 5 seconds without spending it. Arcane Meditation and Mage Armor allow mana to regenerate in combat. A wand deals damage without mana cost; Evocation restores most of the pool over 8 seconds, and Mana Gems provide an emergency reserve. Conjured food and water help reduce downtime; finish nearly defeated enemies with a wand.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Frost Mage Single-Target Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arcane Mage Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arcane-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arcane Mage Leveling Guide › Important Abilities","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arcane-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Frost Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling","class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4cbf02e0a32b7557608396491fbeb96293ff6f98","section:5cdaf030dd2bda6d08876cb231e250832aeb043f","section:914bc874590c1cec0b4c7ebd4ed69ce1fa55c2ef","section:dec3246a11fe4b569ca2830f122b9b54dc8040e9"]},{"id":"clase-mage-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Control e interrupciones","title_en":"Control and Interrupts","summary_es":"Polimorfia, Nova de Escarcha, ralentizaciones y Contrahechizo controlan enemigos y lanzamientos.","summary_en":"Polymorph, Frost Nova, slows, and Counterspell control enemies and casts.","keywords_es":["control del mago","polimorfia","nova de escarcha","contrahechizo","mago interrumpir hechizos"],"keywords_en":["mage crowd control","polymorph","frost nova","counterspell","mage interrupt"],"text_es":"Polimorfia aparta a un enemigo, pero cualquier daño puede romperla. Nova de Escarcha congela y Cono de frío ralentiza; Traslación ayuda a escapar y puede romper raíces o aturdimientos. Contrahechizo interrumpe lanzamientos; Bloqueo de hielo y Escudo de maná son defensas de emergencia.","text_en":"Polymorph removes an enemy, but any damage can break it. Frost Nova freezes and Cone of Cold slows; Blink helps you escape and can break roots or stuns. Counterspell interrupts casts; Ice Block and Mana Shield are emergency defenses.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Guide › Would You Like Some Ice With That?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:frost:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:cc9076f1ee8b567457f9a3dedd98d8b5b75ed2e1"]},{"id":"clase-mage-utilidad","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Utilidad del Mago al subir","title_en":"Mage Utility While Leveling","summary_es":"Comida, agua, Intelecto Arcano, teletransportes, portales y Caída lenta apoyan al grupo.","summary_en":"Food, water, Arcane Intellect, teleports, portals, and Slow Fall support the group.","keywords_es":["utilidad del mago","mago comida y agua","mago portal","intelecto arcano","caída lenta"],"keywords_en":["mage utility","mage food and water","mage portal","arcane intellect","slow fall"],"text_es":"Conjurar comida y Conjurar agua abastecen al grupo; Intelecto Arcano mejora el intelecto y las Gemas de maná aportan una reserva de emergencia. Se aprenden teletransportes a dos ciudades a 20 y a una tercera a 30. Los portales se aprenden a 40, salvo los de Darnassus y Cima del Trueno, que llegan a 50. Caída lenta permite bajar sin daño si llevas una Pluma ligera. Entender pergamino permite usar pergaminos que solo el Mago puede activar para desbloquear mejoras y efectos adicionales.","text_en":"Conjure Food and Conjure Water supply the group; Arcane Intellect raises Intellect, and Mana Gems provide an emergency reserve. Teleports to two cities are learned at 20 and another at 30. Portals are learned at 40, except those to Darnassus and Thunder Bluff, which come at 50. Slow Fall allows safe descents with a Light Feather. Comprehend Scroll lets Mages use scrolls that only they can activate to unlock extra buffs and effects.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Arcane Mage","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Arcane Mage","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arcane Mage Leveling Guide › Important Abilities","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arcane-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Frost Mage Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling","class:mage:frost:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:52adeb7f99ce10adf073446dff74caae575749e3","section:65574cf48c680b433e518d65dbf0b3a5faa61118","section:914bc874590c1cec0b4c7ebd4ed69ce1fa55c2ef","section:e0990595135260a100222015ade0ea912423e104"]},{"id":"clase-mage-armaduras","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armaduras y defensas del Mago","title_en":"Mage Armors and Defenses","summary_es":"Escarcha ralentiza, hielo protege y Armadura de mago favorece el maná; las armaduras son excluyentes.","summary_en":"Frost slows, Ice protects, and Mage Armor helps mana; the armors are exclusive.","keywords_es":["armaduras del mago","armadura de escarcha","armadura de hielo","armadura de mago","barrera de hielo"],"keywords_en":["mage armors","frost armor","ice armor","mage armor","ice barrier"],"text_es":"Mantén una armadura activa: Armadura de Escarcha ralentiza a los atacantes y ayuda al subir; Armadura de hielo añade defensa; Armadura de mago favorece la regeneración si no esperas golpes de melé. Empapar magia reduce el daño mágico recibido. Barrera de hielo protege y aumenta el daño de Escarcha durante 1 minuto tras lanzarla; Escudo de maná absorbe daño a costa de maná.","text_en":"Keep one armor active: Frost Armor slows attackers and helps while leveling; Ice Armor adds defense; Mage Armor supports regeneration if you do not expect melee hits. Dampen Magic reduces incoming magic damage. Ice Barrier protects and increases Frost damage for 1 minute after casting; Mana Shield absorbs damage at a mana cost.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Buffs","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Utility","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:182f8e5ef5c8c015001a4166af7f552e108f1fe3","section:78d781f138623ee988315235c6647db6a09cd48b"]},{"id":"clase-mage-rotacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotaciones individuales para subir","title_en":"Single-Target Leveling Rotations","summary_es":"Arcano alterna Explosión Arcana y Misiles; Fuego usa Calentamiento; Escarcha prioriza Descarga y Lanza de hielo.","summary_en":"Arcane alternates Blast and Missiles; Fire uses Heating Up; Frost prioritizes Frostbolt and Ice Lance.","keywords_es":["rotación del mago","rotación para subir mago","descarga de escarcha","explosión arcana","piroexplosión"],"keywords_en":["mage rotation","mage leveling rotation","frostbolt","arcane blast","pyroblast"],"text_es":"Arcano: Descarga de Escarcha y varita; luego Misiles Arcanos. Al 21: si activa Tromba de misiles 2/2, úsalos; si no, Explosión Arcana 1/1 hasta 2 cargas y luego el canalizado; añade Cólera Arcana 1/1 al 26. Fuego: prelanza Piroexplosión (o Descarga de Pirofrío desde 40). Con 3 Calentamiento 1/1, Piroexplosión; Explosión de Fuego, Misiles Arcanos con Tromba de misiles 2/2 y Bola de Fuego. Chamuscar (>20–30 s, con talentos). Escarcha: Descarga de Escarcha; Lanza de hielo 1/1 con congelación o Dedos de Escarcha 2/2; desde 26, Cono de frío ante congelación, Dedos o 3 Escalofrío del invierno 5/5.","text_en":"Arcane: Frostbolt and wand, then Arcane Missiles. From 21, use Missiles with Missile Barrage 2/2; otherwise Arcane Blast 1/1 up to 2 stacks, then Missiles; add Arcane Wrath 1/1 at 26. Fire: pre-cast Pyroblast (Frostfire Bolt from 40); at 3 Heating Up 1/1 stacks, use Pyroblast, then Fire Blast, Missiles with Missile Barrage 2/2, and Fireball. Cast Scorch on enemies living over 20–30 seconds if you have its talents. Frost: Frostbolt; Ice Lance 1/1 on frozen targets or with Fingers of Frost 2/2; from 26, Cone of Cold on frozen targets, with Fingers, or at 3 Winter’s Chill 5/5 stacks.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Arcane Mage DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Fire Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Fire Mage DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Frost Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Frost Mage Leveling Talent Build for WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fire Mage Leveling Guide › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fire-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fire Mage Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fire-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling","class:mage:fire:leveling","class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1ce834a8f36871949e1eac51aaa1bdb857add36b","section:4e76f57b836408d76191e70b024f25e06808113e","section:70db27a356ab4ccd9425439c6cac88327a2f4a6c","section:7d201ebb590e078e799bccc2ee3b36fc94270624","section:a7a54f40133178813f6fe1cd4f49e0b1b2eb9406","section:bd01a556cd9ed84d3f95d2eeb3e8e0afccea20a2","section:c7fb7998359304922e513ebfa01321517c53f328","section:f016d73f244b84f7d7de4e31fe14bdeedd56d4f9"]},{"id":"clase-mage-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de área para subir","title_en":"Leveling AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Prepara Fogonazo y usa Deflagración Arcana; Escarcha controla grupos con Nova y Cono de frío.","summary_en":"Set up Flamestrike and use Arcane Explosion; Frost controls packs with Nova and Cone of Cold.","keywords_es":["mago daño en área","deflagración arcana","ventisca mago","fogonazo","ola explosiva"],"keywords_en":["mage aoe","arcane explosion","mage blizzard","flamestrike","blast wave"],"text_es":"Arcano y Fuego: prelanza Fogonazo si la amenaza no preocupa; usa Cono de frío para ralentizar si hace falta y, normalmente, Deflagración Arcana. Fuego puede añadir Ola explosiva si la ha aprendido. Escarcha: contra 3 o más, agrupa con Nova de Escarcha; usa Mordedura helada si Cono de frío está en reutilización, luego Cono de frío y Lanza de hielo con congelación o Dedos de Escarcha. Usa Deflagración Arcana si los enemigos caerán pronto o Ventisca para mantener distancia. En grupo, vigila la amenaza y defiéndete con Barrera de hielo o Escudo de maná.","text_en":"Arcane and Fire: pre-cast Flamestrike if threat is not a concern; use Cone of Cold to slow if needed and generally cast Arcane Explosion. Fire can add Blast Wave if learned. Frost: against 3 or more targets, group them with Frost Nova; use Cold Snap if Cone of Cold is on cooldown, then Cone of Cold and Ice Lance against frozen targets or with Fingers of Frost. Use Arcane Explosion if enemies will die soon or Blizzard to keep them at range. In groups, watch threat and defend yourself with Ice Barrier or Mana Shield.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Fire Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fire Mage Leveling Guide › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fire-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Frost Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Utility","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Frost Mage AoE Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling","class:mage:fire:leveling","class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:47a2473f5281aacbe62a7575492a0732c8350143","section:78d781f138623ee988315235c6647db6a09cd48b","section:7d201ebb590e078e799bccc2ee3b36fc94270624","section:9f82bf21cf2f43278be17cd00a5448a654534715","section:c7fb7998359304922e513ebfa01321517c53f328","section:f016d73f244b84f7d7de4e31fe14bdeedd56d4f9"]},{"id":"clase-mage-misiones-clase","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de clase del Mago","title_en":"Mage Class Quests","summary_es":"Las misiones de clase no desbloquean habilidades; se hacen por sus recompensas y experiencia.","summary_en":"Class quests unlock no abilities; do them for their rewards and experience.","keywords_es":["misiones de clase del mago","mago misiones de nivel 10","toga fuegohechizo","prendas de encaje abisal","equipo de clase mago"],"keywords_en":["mage class quests","level 10 mage quest","spellfire robes","nether-lace garment","mage class gear"],"text_es":"Las misiones de clase no desbloquean facultades; son opcionales y ofrecen experiencia o equipo. Las cadenas de nivel 10, 15 y 26 dan recompensas distintas según la raza, como orbes, bastones, varitas o prendas de tela. Algunas piezas pueden quedarse obsoletas pronto, así que valora si compensa el esfuerzo.","text_en":"Mage class quests unlock no abilities; they are optional and offer experience or gear. The level 10, 15, and 26 chains have race-specific rewards such as orbs, staves, wands, or cloth pieces. Some items can become outdated quickly, so weigh them against the effort.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mage Class Quests Guide › Mage Class Quest Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-quests","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mage Class Quests Guide › Orc & Troll Mage Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-quests","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mage Class Quests Guide › Undead Mage Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-quests","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mage Class Quests Guide › Human Mage Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-quests","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mage Class Quests Guide › Gnome Mage Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-quests","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mage Class Quests Guide › Skyborne Mage Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-quests","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:general:mage-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:0035466b9afd0fd6d514aaba822d2f2489549820","section:3d5a96e9ba8dc447b6dd2267a74b9e1a8c071856","section:4189b157eb7cc556dd168034a85570907199f4c6","section:6aa53e05d7c115a0c6a3003fe9bc6067d5655a95","section:975574c7928bdd966b5dfb6335fc2bd6a87b4529","section:dc1921e56661f6a253a257212702b5e48caa1f48"]},{"id":"clase-mage-misiones-30-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de clase de nivel 30 a 60","title_en":"Mage Quests from 30 to 60","summary_es":"Varitas de mago a 30, Poder celestial a 35, Destruye a Morphaz a 50 y Magia fragmentada a 60.","summary_en":"Mage’s Wand at 30, Celestial Power at 35, Destroy Morphaz at 50, and Fragmented Magic at 60.","keywords_es":["varitas de mago","poder celestial","destruye a morphaz","magia fragmentada","misiones de mago nivel 30 50 60"],"keywords_en":["mage's wand quest","celestial power","destroy morphaz","fragmented magic","mage quests level 30 50 60"],"text_es":"Varitas de mago, disponible desde 30, ofrece una varita de especialización: Varita Furia de Hielo, Varita de potencia abisal o Varita Ira Ardiente. Poder celestial (35) permite elegir Orbe celestial o Bastón celestial; se recomienda el orbe por su efecto de uso reutilizable. Destruye a Morphaz (50) es una misión de mazmorra con recompensas que varían. Magia fragmentada (60) enseña Polimorfia: cerdo, una variante cosmética.","text_en":"Mage's Wand, available from 30, offers a specialization wand: Icefury Wand, Nether Force Wand, or Ragefire Wand. Celestial Power (35) lets you choose Celestial Orb or Celestial Stave; the orb is recommended for its reusable on-use effect. Destroy Morphaz (50) is a dungeon quest with rewards that vary. Fragmented Magic (60) teaches Polymorph: Pig, a cosmetic variant.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mage Class Quests Guide › Level 30 – Mage's Wand > Mage's Wand","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-quests","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mage Class Quests Guide › Level 35 – Celestial Power","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-quests","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mage Class Quests Guide › Level 50 – Destroy Morphaz","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-quests","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Mage Class Quests Guide › Level 60 – Fragmented Magic","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/mage-class-quests","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:general:mage-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["guide:83f3009e399872b83ae4e35cbbeb0bca84121613","section:14a386927081fa7cb9e77db5ace88ec80e3dc45a","section:2c55e5c3c6f677d1bb40d15d502b68d3a5e73b5f","section:ed4adaf44d89df4b1fff51f8f06d81cec83ae4d3"]},{"id":"clase-mage-tips-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Tips","summary_es":"Usa varita, prepara comida y agua, conserva maná y aprovecha el control y los teletransportes.","summary_en":"Use a wand, prepare food and water, conserve mana, and use control and teleports.","keywords_es":["consejos para subir mago","mago varita pronto","mago comida y agua","sastrería y encantamiento mago","teletransporte mago nivel 20"],"keywords_en":["mage leveling tips","get a wand early","mage food and water","tailoring enchanting mage","mage teleport level 20"],"text_es":"Consigue una varita pronto para rematar enemigos sin gastar maná; prepara comida y agua antes de empezar. Entrena los rangos de daño principales y usa Descarga de Escarcha para mantener distancia. Si atraes enemigos de más, combina Nova de Escarcha y Polimorfia para controlarlos. Usa Evocación cuando baje el maná y aprende pronto los teletransportes. Lleva Poción de maná y Poción de curación, y aprovecha las misiones de mazmorra. Costura y Encantamiento dan mejoras de equipo y varitas; Botánica, Minería y Desollar aportan oro y materiales.","text_en":"Get a wand early to finish enemies without spending mana; prepare food and water before setting out. Train key damage ranks and use Frostbolt to keep your distance. If you pull extra enemies, combine Frost Nova and Polymorph to control them. Use Evocation when mana runs low and learn teleports early. Pack mana-restoring and healing potions, and make use of dungeon quests. Tailoring and Enchanting provide gear upgrades and wands; Herbalism, Mining, and Skinning provide gold and materials.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Fire Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Frost Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arcane Mage Leveling Guide › Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arcane-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best use of Legacy Points for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling","class:mage:fire:leveling","class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0ee05f8b7602d788f68adfcfdb9594ffa8ac9b76","section:31c5609fc30e981608826a7629f1029c648be3e5","section:5cdaf030dd2bda6d08876cb231e250832aeb043f","section:88a03952f5984354db2f328a7dc5dd20af92f5b9","section:8c691e5e76f6e3b1ff05679e0d1322adb36bc793","section:973ff0349de45c993d35fdb60a73a5ce3fdf73c8","section:a64ff3132c27974559d63731180d1d4b37f3a092","section:b951aef5e33b93066794efdee47ce9c7a67f380f"]},{"id":"clase-mage-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Mago en grupo y mazmorras","title_en":"Mage in Groups and Dungeons","summary_es":"Aporta daño, control, interrupciones, comida, agua, mejoras y portales; vigila la amenaza.","summary_en":"Brings damage, control, interrupts, food, water, buffs, and portals; watch threat.","keywords_es":["mago en grupo","mago en mazmorras","polimorfia en grupo","mago portal para el grupo","amenaza del mago"],"keywords_en":["mage in groups","mage in dungeons","polymorph group","mage portal group","mage threat"],"text_es":"El Mago aporta daño a distancia, Polimorfia, Contrahechizo, comida, agua, Intelecto Arcano y portales. Aparta un objetivo con Polimorfia e interrumpe hechizos peligrosos; Escarcha también ralentiza grupos. Las ráfagas de Arcano o los críticos de Fuego pueden atraer la amenaza del tanque, así que espera a que el grupo quede controlado antes de desatar el daño.","text_en":"A Mage brings ranged damage, Polymorph, Counterspell, food, water, Arcane Intellect, and portals. Remove one target with Polymorph and interrupt dangerous casts; Frost can also slow groups. Arcane bursts or Fire criticals can pull threat from the tank, so wait until the group is controlled before unleashing damage.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arcane Mage Guide › Vending Machine, Open Trade?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arcane-mage-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fire Mage Guide › Vending Machine, Open Trade?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fire-mage-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Guide › Would You Like Some Ice With That?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:overview","class:mage:fire:overview","class:mage:frost:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:3072c4116f7564b4942767a489a855671ecd0050","guide:cc9076f1ee8b567457f9a3dedd98d8b5b75ed2e1","guide:f07ae0ce1b6be74eb04f1555d0e87e1e624a8fbc"]},{"id":"clase-mage-arcano","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Arcano: ráfaga y maná","title_en":"Arcane: Burst and Mana","summary_es":"Arcano combina gran ráfaga con una gestión de maná exigente y menor daño en movimiento.","summary_en":"Arcane pairs high burst with demanding mana management and weaker damage while moving.","keywords_es":["mago arcano","arcano ráfaga","explosión arcana","misiles arcanos","poder arcano"],"keywords_en":["arcane mage","arcane burst","arcane blast","arcane missiles","arcane power"],"text_es":"Arcano puede alcanzar una gran ráfaga con Poder Arcano, pero su rendimiento depende de administrar el maná y de la duración del combate. Explosión Arcana y Misiles Arcanos sostienen el daño; al moverte, tiene menos opciones que otras ramas y suele apoyarse en Presencia mental o Explosión de Fuego.","text_en":"Arcane can deliver powerful burst with Arcane Power, but its performance depends on mana management and fight length. Arcane Blast and Arcane Missiles sustain damage; while moving, it has fewer options than other trees and often relies on Presence of Mind or Fire Blast.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Arcane Mage in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arcane Mage Guide › Arcane Mage Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arcane-mage-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Arcane Mage in WoW Forever > New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:b64e31d011df677ff817121016967f50f569da23","section:581db85b33ee3e85ded3e59f7d4c52940b198e8c","section:befaff6edc623d1fd50d0d5d6708181e2244021d"]},{"id":"clase-mage-fuego","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Fuego: críticos y estallido","title_en":"Fire: Criticals and Burst","summary_es":"Fuego escala con equipo y críticos para activar Ignición y Calentamiento; su daño depende del azar.","summary_en":"Fire scales with gear and criticals to trigger Ignite and Heating Up; output has some variance.","keywords_es":["mago fuego","fuego piroexplosión","calentamiento mago","fogonazo fuego","mago fuego área"],"keywords_en":["fire mage","fire pyroblast","heating up mage","fire flamestrike","fire mage aoe"],"text_es":"Fuego tiene un techo de daño alto y escala con el equipo, pero necesita golpes críticos y su rendimiento puede variar. Ignición convierte críticos en daño prolongado; Calentamiento y Explosión de Fuego preparan Piroexplosión rápida. En mazmorras, vigila la amenaza al encadenar críticos y usa herramientas de escape si el enemigo se acerca.","text_en":"Fire has a high damage ceiling and scales with gear, but it needs critical strikes and its output can vary. Ignite turns criticals into damage over time; Heating Up and Fire Blast set up faster Pyroblast casts. In dungeons, watch threat when chaining criticals and keep an escape tool ready if an enemy closes in.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Fire Mage in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Fire Mage Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:fire:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:502f561eb826d854374ac8213be3f23403bd4748","section:5302603b8b7a44c7903e0a4e315b5c4222234156"]},{"id":"clase-mage-escarcha","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Escarcha: control y seguridad","title_en":"Frost: Control and Safety","summary_es":"Escarcha ralentiza y congela para sobrevivir; ofrece daño constante, pero menos ráfaga.","summary_en":"Frost slows and freezes to survive; it deals steady damage but has less burst.","keywords_es":["mago escarcha","escarcha control","descarga de escarcha","lanza de hielo","barrera de hielo"],"keywords_en":["frost mage","frost control","frostbolt","ice lance","ice barrier"],"text_es":"Escarcha destaca por ralentizar y congelar enemigos, lo que facilita mantener distancia y sobrevivir. Lanza de hielo aprovecha objetivos congelados y Dedos de Escarcha permite reaccionar a procs; también aporta daño en área. A cambio, tiene menos ráfaga y puede perder eficacia ante enemigos inmunes o resistentes al daño de Escarcha.","text_en":"Frost excels at slowing and freezing enemies, helping you keep distance and survive. Ice Lance exploits frozen targets and Fingers of Frost rewards reacting to procs; the tree also offers area damage. In return, its burst is lower and it can lose effectiveness against enemies immune or resistant to Frost damage.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Frost Mages in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Overview of Frost Mages in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:frost:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:13076b6abda599255a51b5b2844ceb7954cf69f1","section:e79b13c2d05cdd97fbf0c249381b26d24a67bb1f"]},{"id":"clase-mage-sistema-arcano","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Acumulaciones de Explosión Arcana","title_en":"Arcane Blast Stacks","summary_es":"Cuatro acumulaciones aumentan el daño, pero elevan el coste de Explosión Arcana.","summary_en":"Four stacks increase damage but raise Arcane Blast’s mana cost.","keywords_es":["acumulaciones de explosión arcana","daño de arcano por intelecto","coste de explosión arcana","gestionar maná arcano"],"keywords_en":["arcane blast stacks","arcane damage from intellect","arcane blast mana cost","arcane mana management"],"text_es":"Explosión Arcana acumula hasta 4 efectos durante 18 segundos desde el primero; cada uno añade daño con hechizos equivalente al 12% de tu intelecto. Las acumulaciones también encarecen la siguiente Explosión Arcana, así que puedes construirlas poco a poco o guardarlas para una ventana de daño.","text_en":"Arcane Blast builds up to 4 stacks lasting 18 seconds from the first application; each adds spell damage equal to 12% of your Intellect. Stacks also raise the mana cost of the next Arcane Blast, so build them gradually or save them for a damage window.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Arcane Mage Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Arcane Mage in WoW Forever > New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:b64e31d011df677ff817121016967f50f569da23","section:3086d61e1603bd77328e37a6ed50953d13522230"]},{"id":"clase-mage-stats-arcano","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Arcano","title_en":"Arcane Stat Priority","summary_es":"Propuesta: 17% golpe, daño de hechizos/Arcano, crítico, penetración, celeridad, intelecto, espíritu y aguante.","summary_en":"Proposed order: hit to 17%, spell/Arcane damage, crit, piercing, haste, Intellect, Spirit, Stamina.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas arcano","golpe arcano 17%","penetración de hechizos mago","daño arcano e intelecto"],"keywords_en":["arcane stat priority","17% arcane hit","mage spell piercing","arcane damage intellect"],"text_es":"La prioridad propuesta —especulativa y no probada a nivel 60— es golpe hasta 17%, Poder con hechizos, golpe crítico, penetración de hechizos, celeridad, intelecto, espíritu y aguante. El golpe es lo primero; el poder con hechizos sube el daño de forma directa; Arcano, además, escala con intelecto (Explosión Arcana) y con el maná máximo (Cólera Arcana).","text_en":"The proposed order—speculative and untested at level 60—is hit to 17%, spell damage (Spell Power), critical strike, spell piercing, haste, Intellect, Spirit, and Stamina. Hit comes first; Spell Power raises damage directly; Arcane also scales with Intellect (Arcane Blast) and maximum mana (Arcane Wrath).","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Arcane Mage Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-28"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:mage:arcane:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:1357c896547602d519cc4ed0d222c96dedbfdfcb"]},{"id":"clase-mage-stats-fuego","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Fuego","title_en":"Fire Stat Priority","summary_es":"Propuesta: 17% golpe, daño de hechizos/Fuego, crítico, penetración, celeridad, intelecto, espíritu y aguante.","summary_en":"Proposed order: hit to 17%, spell/Fire damage, crit, piercing, haste, Intellect, Spirit, Stamina.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas fuego","golpe fuego 17%","daño de fuego mago","estadísticas ignición calentamiento"],"keywords_en":["fire stat priority","17% fire hit","mage fire damage stats","ignite heating up stats"],"text_es":"La prioridad propuesta —especulativa y no probada a nivel 60— es golpe hasta 17%, Poder con hechizos y daño de Fuego, golpe crítico, penetración de hechizos, celeridad, intelecto, espíritu y aguante. El golpe evita lanzamientos fallidos; el crítico también potencia Ignición y ayuda a activar Calentamiento.","text_en":"The proposed order—speculative and untested at level 60—is hit to 17%, spell and Fire damage, critical strike, spell piercing, haste, Intellect, Spirit, and Stamina. Hit prevents missed casts; criticals also strengthen Ignite and help trigger Heating Up.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Fire Mage Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Fire Mage in WoW Forever > New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Fire Mage in WoW Forever > New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:fire:overview","class:mage:fire:stats"],"source_hashes":["guide:6baf0cfd8d654fbbea58f486ec3e16abab897d34","section:ed0030c7d2ca489d2b0efe0bb449c9cfddabc5ff"]},{"id":"clase-mage-stats-escarcha","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Escarcha","title_en":"Frost Stat Priority","summary_es":"Prioridad propuesta: golpe hasta 11–12% (5–6% por talentos), crítico, daño, intelecto, espíritu y aguante.","summary_en":"Proposed order: hit to 11–12% (5–6% from talents), crit, spell damage, Intellect, Spirit, Stamina.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas escarcha","golpe escarcha 11 12","talentos golpe escarcha","daño de escarcha crítico"],"keywords_en":["frost stat priority","11 12 frost hit","frost hit talents","frost spell damage crit"],"text_es":"La prioridad propuesta —especulativa y no probada a nivel 60— es golpe hasta 11–12% (5–6% provienen de talentos), golpe crítico, daño con hechizos de Escarcha y Arcano, intelecto, espíritu y aguante. Fuerza, agilidad y poder de ataque no aportan a esta especialización.","text_en":"The proposed order—speculative and untested at level 60—is hit to 11–12% (5–6% comes from talents), critical strike, Frost and Arcane spell damage, Intellect, Spirit, and Stamina. Strength, Agility, and Attack Power do not benefit this specialization.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Frost Mage Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:frost:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:c285c32d9d20f1ea2bb23a7758ad93024201f92f"]},{"id":"clase-mage-rotacion-arcano","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación Arcano-Fuego","title_en":"Arcane Fire Rotation","summary_es":"Piroexplosión con 3 Calentamiento; Explosión de Fuego; Misiles con Tromba; Explosión Arcana y Cólera Arcana.","summary_en":"Pyroblast at 3 Heating Up; Fire Blast; Missiles on Barrage; Arcane Blast and Arcane Wrath.","keywords_es":["rotación arcano fuego","prioridad arcano mage","tres acumulaciones calentamiento","cuándo lanzar piroexplosión"],"keywords_en":["arcane fire rotation","arcane mage priority","three heating up stacks","when to cast pyroblast"],"text_es":"En la build Arcano-Fuego, usa Piroexplosión con 3 acumulaciones de Calentamiento; Explosión de Fuego al estar disponible; Misiles Arcanos cuando se active Tromba de misiles; Explosión Arcana hasta 4 acumulaciones; y Cólera Arcana si no está en reutilización. Chamuscar es la opción final cuando lo anterior no está disponible. Evocación se usa cuando el maná está por agotarse.","text_en":"Single-target priority: use Pyroblast at 3 Heating Up stacks; Fire Blast when available; Arcane Missiles when Missile Barrage triggers; Arcane Blast up to its 4-stack limit; and Arcane Wrath when off cooldown. Scorch is the fallback when none of those are available. Use Evocation when mana is nearly depleted.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Arcane Mages in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Arcane Mage Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:mage:arcane:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:6d749148c52f1075ce3201a7308a11704ff831fe","section:a37d63aac2e8b17dc5e110cde22bf3b8f85bda43","section:d8fbaf701242cbd51b55dd19ff1301ca6918a238"]},{"id":"clase-mage-rotacion-arcano-puro","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Arcano puro","title_en":"Pure Arcane Rotation","summary_es":"Contra inmunidad al Fuego, alterna Tromba de misiles, Cólera Arcana y Explosión Arcana según el maná.","summary_en":"Against Fire immunity, cycle Barrage, Arcane Wrath, and Arcane Blast according to mana.","keywords_es":["rotación arcano puro","arcano contra inmunidad fuego","arcano mucho maná","arcano poco maná"],"keywords_en":["pure arcane rotation","arcane fire immune","heavy mana arcane","low mana arcane"],"text_es":"Contra enemigos inmunes al daño de Fuego, esta variante causa menos daño que Arcano-Fuego, pero evita depender de esa escuela. Con mucho maná, lanza Misiles Arcanos al activarse Tromba de misiles; si no, Explosión Arcana, y usa Cólera Arcana cuando esté disponible. En la variante de menor consumo, limita Explosión Arcana a 4 acumulaciones y usa Misiles Arcanos como relleno.","text_en":"When enemies are immune to Fire damage, this variant deals less than Arcane-Fire but avoids relying on that school. With ample mana, cast Arcane Missiles when Missile Barrage procs; otherwise use Arcane Blast, and use Arcane Wrath when available. In the lower-mana variant, cap Arcane Blast at 4 stacks and use Arcane Missiles as filler.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Arcane Mage DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Arcane Mages in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Arcane Mage PvE Raid and Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Arcane Mage Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:overview","class:mage:arcane:rotation","class:mage:arcane:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:173bb6c1cfa6d703a85019e1abeca832e2c9dc47","section:3086d61e1603bd77328e37a6ed50953d13522230","section:5f9a0cc83d872d8fbc606574696ce8837d5b45b1","section:6d749148c52f1075ce3201a7308a11704ff831fe","section:a37d63aac2e8b17dc5e110cde22bf3b8f85bda43"]},{"id":"clase-mage-rotacion-arcano-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Área y reutilizaciones de Arcano","title_en":"Arcane AoE and Cooldowns","summary_es":"Prelanza Fogonazo si hay tiempo y no atraes amenaza; después, Deflagración Arcana.","summary_en":"Pre-cast Flamestrike if time and threat allow; then Arcane Explosion.","keywords_es":["arcano daño área","deflagración arcana aoe","fogonazo antes del pull","poder arcano secuencia"],"keywords_en":["arcane aoe","arcane explosion rotation","flamestrike precast","arcane power sequence"],"text_es":"En área, prelanza Fogonazo si tienes tiempo y la amenaza lo permite; después usa Deflagración Arcana. Para la ventana de Poder Arcano de Arcano puro, lanza primero Cólera Arcana; después, Explosión Arcana hasta 4 acumulaciones, activa Poder Arcano y continúa con la prioridad de rotación correspondiente.","text_en":"For area damage, pre-cast Flamestrike if you have time and threat allows, then use Arcane Explosion. For Full Arcane, pre-cast Arcane Wrath, then cast Arcane Blast up to 4 stacks, use Arcane Power, and continue with the appropriate rotation priority.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Arcane Mage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Arcane Mage Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:mage:arcane:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:403f62142b48c094f0554aba3efcd34eb8c3bf10","section:d8fbaf701242cbd51b55dd19ff1301ca6918a238"]},{"id":"clase-mage-rotacion-fuego","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Fuego profundo","title_en":"Deep Fire Rotation","summary_es":"Prelanza Piroexplosión; mantén Chamuscar; gestiona Calentamiento, Explosión de Fuego y Tromba de misiles.","summary_en":"Pre-cast Pyroblast; maintain Scorch; manage Heating Up, Fire Blast, and Missile Barrage.","keywords_es":["rotación fuego profundo","prioridad fuego mago","calentamiento tres cargas","chamuscar cinco acumulaciones"],"keywords_en":["deep fire rotation","fire mage priority","three heating up stacks","five scorch stacks"],"text_es":"En Fuego profundo, prelanza Piroexplosión y mantén Chamuscar con 5 acumulaciones. Usa Piroexplosión con 3 Calentamiento, Explosión de Fuego al estar disponible y Misiles Arcanos con Tromba de misiles; usa Bola de Fuego como relleno. La variante teórica añade Explosión Arcana a 1 acumulación y la renueva al expirar; Bola de Fuego si a Explosión de Fuego le quedan más de 3 segundos, Chamuscar si quedan menos.","text_en":"Single-target priority: pre-cast Pyroblast and maintain 5 Scorch stacks. Use Pyroblast at 3 Heating Up stacks, Fire Blast when ready, and Arcane Missiles on Missile Barrage; use Fireball as filler. The theoretical variant adds Arcane Blast at 1 stack and refreshes it when it expires; use Fireball if Fire Blast has over 3 seconds remaining, Scorch if under 3.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Fire Mages in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-31"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:fire:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:08a94efa984bc36e232333b7fb1dd6c9006dbb33"]},{"id":"clase-mage-rotacion-fuego-pirofrio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Pirofrío","title_en":"Frostfire Rotation","summary_es":"Con Dedos de Escarcha, combina Piroexplosión o Descarga de Pirofrío y encola Explosión de Fuego.","summary_en":"With Fingers of Frost, use Pyroblast or Frostfire Bolt and queue Fire Blast.","keywords_es":["rotación pirofrío","descarga pirofrío dedos de escarcha","prioridad fuego escarcha","piroexplosión calentamiento"],"keywords_en":["frostfire rotation","frostfire fingers of frost","fire frost priority","pyroblast heating up"],"text_es":"Una activación de Dedos de Escarcha concede dos cargas: gasta la primera con Piroexplosión si Calentamiento está a 3; si no, Descarga de Pirofrío. En la segunda, usa Piroexplosión si corresponde y encola Explosión de Fuego; después, Explosión de Fuego al estar disponible y Descarga de Pirofrío.","text_en":"A Fingers of Frost proc grants two charges: spend the first on Pyroblast if Heating Up is at 3; otherwise cast Frostfire Bolt. On the second, use Pyroblast if applicable and queue Fire Blast; then use Fire Blast when ready and Frostfire Bolt.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Fire Mages in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-31"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:fire:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:08a94efa984bc36e232333b7fb1dd6c9006dbb33"]},{"id":"clase-mage-rotacion-fuego-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Área y reutilizaciones de Fuego","title_en":"Fire AoE and Cooldowns","summary_es":"Prelanza Fogonazo si puedes agrupar; luego Ola explosiva si tienes talento o Deflagración Arcana.","summary_en":"Pre-cast Flamestrike while gathering; then Blast Wave if talented or Arcane Explosion.","keywords_es":["fuego daño área","fogonazo ola explosiva","combustión fuego cuándo","evocación fuego maná"],"keywords_en":["fire aoe rotation","flamestrike blast wave","when to use combustion","fire evocation mana"],"text_es":"Para área, prelanza Fogonazo durante el tiempo de agrupación si la amenaza lo permite; luego usa Ola explosiva si tienes el talento o Deflagración Arcana. Usa Combustión cuando esté disponible con Chamuscar al máximo y Calentamiento preparado. Activa Evocación cuando estés cerca de agotar el maná; puedes cancelarla si ya tienes suficiente para terminar el combate.","text_en":"For area damage, pre-cast Flamestrike while enemies gather if threat allows; then use Blast Wave if talented or Arcane Explosion. Use Combustion when ready with Scorch fully stacked and Heating Up prepared. Start Evocation when close to running out of mana; cancel early if you already have enough to finish the fight.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Fire Mage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Fire Mage Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-31"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:fire:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:98e680db5fd0d42de2bf422509899b009e957ba9","section:bc060394e015acbcb2bcc483364a3d90852458dd"]},{"id":"clase-mage-rotacion-escarcha","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Escarcha (1–2 objetivos)","title_en":"Frost Rotation (1–2 Targets)","summary_es":"Usa Mordedura helada para reiniciar Cono de frío; aprovecha Dedos de Escarcha, Escalofrío del invierno y Barrera.","summary_en":"Use Cold Snap to reset Cone of Cold; exploit Fingers of Frost, Winter’s Chill, and Barrier.","keywords_es":["rotación escarcha uno dos objetivos","prioridad dedos de escarcha","escalofrío del invierno cinco","mordedura helada cono frío"],"keywords_en":["frost rotation one two targets","fingers of frost priority","five winters chill stacks","cold snap cone of cold"],"text_es":"Antes del pull, usa Barrera de hielo 4 segundos antes y Descarga de Escarcha 2,5 segundos antes. En combate, si falta maná usa Evocación o Rubí de maná; Mordedura helada si Cono de frío tiene más de 7 segundos de reutilización; Cono de frío con 5 Escalofrío del invierno; con 1 Dedos de Escarcha, lanza Descarga de Escarcha y encola Lanza de hielo; mantén Barrera para Poder gélido y rellena con Descarga de Escarcha.","text_en":"Before the pull, use Ice Barrier 4 seconds ahead and Frostbolt 2.5 seconds ahead. In combat, use Evocation or Mana Ruby if mana is low; Cold Snap if Cone of Cold has over 7 seconds left; Cone of Cold at 5 Winter’s Chill stacks; with 1 Fingers of Frost charge, cast Frostbolt and queue Ice Lance; maintain Barrier for Frigid Power and fill with Frostbolt.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Frost Mage DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-02"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:frost:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:d4a0bf840e91b67e7f969d25cd2e65ed753f500f"]},{"id":"clase-mage-rotacion-escarcha-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de área de Escarcha (3+ objetivos)","title_en":"Frost AoE Rotation (3+ Targets)","summary_es":"Con 3 o más objetivos, alterna Ventisca, Cono de frío y Lanza de hielo según Dedos de Escarcha.","summary_en":"Against 3+ targets, cycle Blizzard, Cone of Cold, and Ice Lance around Fingers of Frost.","keywords_es":["rotación área escarcha tres objetivos","ventisca cono frío lanza hielo","dedos de escarcha área","mordedura helada aoe"],"keywords_en":["frost aoe three targets","blizzard cone cold ice lance","fingers of frost aoe","cold snap aoe"],"text_es":"Con 3 o más objetivos, lanza Lanza de hielo con una carga de Dedos de Escarcha y usa Mordedura helada si Cono de frío tiene más de 5 segundos de reutilización y hay una carga. Usa Cono de frío con la carga, renueva Barrera de hielo si cae y canaliza Ventisca; el ciclo principal es Ventisca, Cono de frío y Lanza de hielo.","text_en":"Against 3 or more targets, cast Ice Lance with a Fingers of Frost charge and use Cold Snap if Cone of Cold has over 5 seconds left and a charge is available. Use Cone of Cold with a charge, refresh Ice Barrier if it falls, and channel Blizzard; the main cycle is Blizzard, Cone of Cold, and Ice Lance.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Frost Mage DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-02"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Frost Mage Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-02"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:frost:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:6f5fb9654741f66ad81f74afb12468944e045a77","section:d4a0bf840e91b67e7f969d25cd2e65ed753f500f"]},{"id":"clase-mage-build-arcano-pve","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvE Arcano-Fuego (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Arcane-Fire PvE Build (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Build de banda Arcano-Fuego con Calentamiento, Tromba de misiles y Poder Arcano.","summary_en":"Arcane-Fire raid build with Heating Up, Missile Barrage, and Arcane Power.","keywords_es":["build arcano fuego","talentos arcano fuego","build arcano pve","poder arcano mago"],"keywords_en":["arcane fire build","arcane fire talents","arcane pve build","mage arcane power"],"text_es":"Arcano: Canalización mejorada 5/5, Sutileza Arcana 2/2, Concentración Arcana 5/5, Tromba de misiles 2/2, Impacto Arcano 3/3, Explosión Arcana 1/1, Meditación Arcana 3/3, Cólera Arcana 1/1, Presencia mental 1/1, Mente Arcana 5/5, Inestabilidad Arcana 3/3 y Poder Arcano 1/1. Fuego: Incineración 5/5, Acelerante 2/5, Ignición 5/5, Piroexplosión 1/1, Explosión de Fuego mejorada 2/2 y Calentamiento 1/1. Escarcha: Precisión 3/3. Fuego aporta Piroexplosión y Explosión de Fuego mejorada para acumular Calentamiento; Arcano añade maná, Tromba de misiles y ráfaga.","text_en":"Arcane: Improved Channeling 5/5, Arcane Subtlety 2/2, Arcane Concentration 5/5, Missile Barrage 2/2, Arcane Impact 3/3, Arcane Blast 1/1, Arcane Meditation 3/3, Arcane Wrath 1/1, Presence of Mind 1/1, Arcane Mind 5/5, Arcane Instability 3/3, and Arcane Power 1/1. Fire: Incineration 5/5, Accelerant 2/5, Ignite 5/5, Pyroblast 1/1, Improved Fire Blast 2/2, and Heating Up 1/1. Frost: Precision 3/3. Fire adds Pyroblast and Improved Fire Blast to build Heating Up; Arcane supplies mana support, Missile Barrage, and burst.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arcane Mage Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arcane Mage PvE Raid and Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:mage:arcane:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:173bb6c1cfa6d703a85019e1abeca832e2c9dc47"]},{"id":"clase-mage-build-arcano-puro","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvE de Arcano puro (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Pure Arcane PvE Build (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Alternativa Arcana para encuentros con enemigos inmunes al Fuego.","summary_en":"Arcane alternative for encounters with Fire-immune enemies.","keywords_es":["build arcano puro","arcano inmunidad fuego","talentos arcano puro","build contra fuego inmune"],"keywords_en":["pure arcane build","arcane fire immune","pure arcane talents","fire immune build"],"text_es":"Arcano: Canalización mejorada 5/5, Sutileza Arcana 2/2, Concentración Arcana 5/5, Tromba de misiles 2/2, Geometría Arcana 2/2, Impacto Arcano 3/3, Explosión Arcana 1/1, Contrahechizo mejorado 1/2, Meditación Arcana 3/3, Cólera Arcana 1/1, Presencia mental 1/1, Mente Arcana 5/5, Inestabilidad Arcana 3/3 y Poder Arcano 1/1. Fuego: Incineración 5/5, Acelerante 5/5 y Fogonazo mejorado 3/3. Escarcha: Precisión 3/3. Hace menos daño que Arcano-Fuego, pero sirve contra inmunidad al Fuego; los puntos flexibles añaden área o utilidad.","text_en":"Arcane: Improved Channeling 5/5, Arcane Subtlety 2/2, Arcane Concentration 5/5, Missile Barrage 2/2, Arcane Geometry 2/2, Arcane Impact 3/3, Arcane Blast 1/1, Improved Counterspell 1/2, Arcane Meditation 3/3, Arcane Wrath 1/1, Presence of Mind 1/1, Arcane Mind 5/5, Arcane Instability 3/3, and Arcane Power 1/1. Fire: Incineration 5/5, Accelerant 5/5, and Improved Flamestrike 3/3. Frost: Precision 3/3. It deals less than Arcane-Fire but works against Fire immunity; flexible points add area damage or utility.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arcane Mage Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arcane Mage PvE Raid and Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:173bb6c1cfa6d703a85019e1abeca832e2c9dc47"]},{"id":"clase-mage-build-arcano-pvp","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvP Arcano-Fuego","title_en":"Arcane-Fire PvP Build","summary_es":"Build de ráfaga con Presencia mental, Piroexplosión y herramientas de control.","summary_en":"Burst build with Presence of Mind, Pyroblast, and control tools.","keywords_es":["build arcano pvp","talentos arcano fuego pvp","piroexplosión presencia mental","contrahechizo mejorado mago"],"keywords_en":["arcane pvp build","arcane fire pvp talents","pyroblast presence of mind","improved counterspell mage"],"text_es":"Arcano: Canalización mejorada 5/5, Sutileza Arcana 2/2, Concentración Arcana 5/5, Tromba de misiles 2/2, Geometría Arcana 2/2, Explosión Arcana 1/1, Contrahechizo mejorado 2/2, Meditación Arcana 2/3, Cólera Arcana 1/1, Presencia mental 1/1, Mente Arcana 5/5, Inestabilidad Arcana 3/3 y Poder Arcano 1/1. Fuego: Incineración 5/5, Ignición 5/5, Lanzallamas 2/2, Impacto 3/3, Piroexplosión 1/1, Explosión de Fuego mejorada 2/2 y Calentamiento 1/1. La build busca una ráfaga de Piroexplosión y Cólera Arcana tras el control; Impacto añade una posibilidad de aturdir.","text_en":"Arcane: Improved Channeling 5/5, Arcane Subtlety 2/2, Arcane Concentration 5/5, Missile Barrage 2/2, Arcane Geometry 2/2, Arcane Blast 1/1, Improved Counterspell 2/2, Arcane Meditation 2/3, Arcane Wrath 1/1, Presence of Mind 1/1, Arcane Mind 5/5, Arcane Instability 3/3, and Arcane Power 1/1. Fire: Incineration 5/5, Ignite 5/5, Flame Throwing 2/2, Impact 3/3, Pyroblast 1/1, Improved Fire Blast 2/2, and Heating Up 1/1. The build aims for a Pyroblast and Arcane Wrath burst after control; Impact adds a chance to stun.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arcane Mage Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arcane Mage PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:c594af137d73c3f3701b6490e970f27945624c25"]},{"id":"clase-mage-build-fuego-profundo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvE de Fuego profundo (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Deep Fire PvE Build (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Build de banda de Fuego con apoyo Arcano para maná y Tromba de misiles.","summary_en":"Fire raid build with Arcane mana support and Missile Barrage.","keywords_es":["build fuego profundo","talentos fuego mago","build fuego pve","calentamiento piroexplosión"],"keywords_en":["deep fire build","fire mage talents","fire pve build","heating up pyroblast"],"text_es":"Arcano: Canalización mejorada 5/5, Sutileza Arcana 2/2, Concentración Arcana 5/5, Tromba de misiles 2/2, Explosión Arcana 1/1 y Meditación Arcana 1/3. Fuego: Incineración 5/5, Acelerante 5/5, Ignición 5/5, Piroexplosión 1/1, Explosión de Fuego mejorada 2/2, Chamuscar mejorado 3/3, Calentamiento 1/1, Maestro de los elementos 3/3, Masa crítica 3/3, Poder de Fuego 3/3 y Combustión 1/1. Escarcha: Precisión 3/3. Fuego usa Bola de Fuego y Piroexplosión; Arcano ayuda con maná, penetración y Tromba de misiles.","text_en":"Arcane: Improved Channeling 5/5, Arcane Subtlety 2/2, Arcane Concentration 5/5, Missile Barrage 2/2, Arcane Blast 1/1, and Arcane Meditation 1/3. Fire: Incineration 5/5, Accelerant 5/5, Ignite 5/5, Pyroblast 1/1, Improved Fire Blast 2/2, Improved Scorch 3/3, Heating Up 1/1, Master of Elements 3/3, Critical Mass 3/3, Fire Power 3/3, and Combustion 1/1. Frost: Precision 3/3. Fire uses Fireball and Pyroblast; Arcane adds mana support, spell piercing, and Missile Barrage.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fire Mage Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fire Mage PvE Raid and Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:fire:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:aea8fd1ad475fb67028438860ea3cbc9d9d4b777"]},{"id":"clase-mage-build-fuego-pirofrio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvE de Pirofrío (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Frostfire PvE Build (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Alternativa híbrida de Fuego y Escarcha con Dedos de Escarcha y Descarga de Pirofrío.","summary_en":"Fire-Frost hybrid with Fingers of Frost and Frostfire Bolt.","keywords_es":["build pirofrío","fuego escarcha híbrido","talentos descarga pirofrío","dedos de escarcha fuego"],"keywords_en":["frostfire build","fire frost hybrid","frostfire bolt talents","fingers of frost fire"],"text_es":"Fuego: Incineración 5/5, Acelerante 5/5, Ignición 5/5, Piroexplosión 1/1, Explosión de Fuego mejorada 2/2, Chamuscar mejorado 3/3, Calentamiento 1/1, Maestro de los elementos 1/3, Masa crítica 3/3 y Poder de Fuego 3/3. Escarcha: Custodia de Escarcha 2/2, Precisión 3/3, Fragmentos de hielo 5/5, Canalización de Escarcha 3/3, Ventisca mejorada 1/3, Lanza de hielo 1/1, Alcance ártico 1/2, Bloqueo de hielo 1/1, Trizar 3/3 y Dedos de Escarcha 2/2. La mezcla permite aprovechar Trizar y Dedos de Escarcha; si falta maná, se pueden pasar 2 puntos de Incineración a Maestro de los elementos.","text_en":"Fire: Incineration 5/5, Accelerant 5/5, Ignite 5/5, Pyroblast 1/1, Improved Fire Blast 2/2, Improved Scorch 3/3, Heating Up 1/1, Master of Elements 1/3, Critical Mass 3/3, and Fire Power 3/3. Frost: Frost Warding 2/2, Precision 3/3, Ice Shards 5/5, Frost Channeling 3/3, Improved Blizzard 1/3, Ice Lance 1/1, Arctic Reach 1/2, Ice Block 1/1, Shatter 3/3, and Fingers of Frost 2/2. This hybrid uses Shatter and Fingers of Frost; if mana is a problem, 2 points can move from Incineration to Master of Elements.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fire Mage Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fire Mage PvE Raid and Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:fire:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:aea8fd1ad475fb67028438860ea3cbc9d9d4b777"]},{"id":"clase-mage-build-fuego-pvp","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvP de Fuego","title_en":"Fire PvP Build","summary_es":"Build de largo alcance y ráfaga con Presencia mental, Piroexplosión y control.","summary_en":"Long-range burst build with Presence of Mind, Pyroblast, and control.","keywords_es":["build fuego pvp","talentos fuego mago pvp","presencia mental piroexplosión","impacto fuego mago"],"keywords_en":["fire pvp build","fire mage pvp talents","presence of mind pyroblast","fire mage impact"],"text_es":"Arcano: Canalización mejorada 5/5, Sutileza Arcana 2/2, Concentración Arcana 5/5, Tromba de misiles 2/2, Geometría Arcana 2/2, Contrahechizo mejorado 2/2, Meditación Arcana 2/3 y Presencia mental 1/1. Fuego: Incineración 3/5, Acelerante 5/5, Ignición 5/5, Lanzallamas 2/2, Impacto 3/3, Piroexplosión 1/1, Explosión de Fuego mejorada 2/2, Chamuscar mejorado 3/3, Calentamiento 1/1 y Masa crítica 3/3. Escarcha: Precisión 2/3. Combina Explosión de Fuego mejorada y Calentamiento para Piroexplosión rápida, con Contrahechizo mejorado e Impacto para control.","text_en":"Arcane: Improved Channeling 5/5, Arcane Subtlety 2/2, Arcane Concentration 5/5, Missile Barrage 2/2, Arcane Geometry 2/2, Improved Counterspell 2/2, Arcane Meditation 2/3, and Presence of Mind 1/1. Fire: Incineration 3/5, Accelerant 5/5, Ignite 5/5, Flame Throwing 2/2, Impact 3/3, Pyroblast 1/1, Improved Fire Blast 2/2, Improved Scorch 3/3, Heating Up 1/1, and Critical Mass 3/3. Frost: Precision 2/3. Improved Fire Blast and Heating Up enable quick Pyroblasts, while Improved Counterspell and Impact add control.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fire Mage Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fire Mage PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:fire:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:586afd426ed6c913b3333ad8c6214feebc3c4945"]},{"id":"clase-mage-build-escarcha-pve","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvE de Escarcha (bandas)","title_en":"Frost PvE Build (raids)","summary_es":"Build de banda que también sirve en mazmorras; un punto de Ventisca mejorada habilita área.","summary_en":"Raid build also suited to dungeons; one Improved Blizzard point enables AoE.","keywords_es":["build escarcha pve","talentos escarcha mago","build escarcha raid","ventisca mejorada mago"],"keywords_en":["frost pve build","frost mage talents","frost raid build","improved blizzard mage"],"text_es":"Arcano: Especialización en varitas 2/2, Recuperación Arcana 3/3, Sutileza Arcana 2/2, Concentración Arcana 5/5, Impacto Arcano 3/3 y Meditación Arcana 3/3. Escarcha: Descarga de Escarcha mejorada 5/5, Precisión 3/3, Fragmentos de hielo 5/5, Canalización de Escarcha 3/3, Ventisca mejorada 1/3, Lanza de hielo 1/1, Trizar 3/3, Cono de frío mejorado 3/3, Mordedura helada 1/1, Dedos de Escarcha 2/2, Escalofrío del invierno 5/5 y Barrera de hielo 1/1. Un punto en Ventisca mejorada habilita su opción de área; puedes mover puntos según objetivo, maná y equipo.","text_en":"Arcane: Wand Specialization 2/2, Arcane Resilience 3/3, Arcane Subtlety 2/2, Arcane Concentration 5/5, Arcane Impact 3/3, and Arcane Meditation 3/3. Frost: Improved Frostbolt 5/5, Precision 3/3, Ice Shards 5/5, Frost Channeling 3/3, Improved Blizzard 1/3, Ice Lance 1/1, Shatter 3/3, Improved Cone of Cold 3/3, Cold Snap 1/1, Fingers of Frost 2/2, Winter’s Chill 5/5, and Ice Barrier 1/1. A single rank in Improved Blizzard unlocks its AoE option; points can be adjusted for target type, mana, and gear.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Frost Mage Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Frost Mage PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Frost Mage Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Frost Mage PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:frost:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:23b1cebb8ebcfc07d84800063eeb906585337b8d","section:2b89d0fba8329dcc8e0092a188ed840b01e586a3"]},{"id":"clase-mage-build-escarcha-pvp","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build PvP de Escarcha","title_en":"Frost PvP Build","summary_es":"Variante JcJ que cambia conservación de maná por supervivencia y control.","summary_en":"PvP variant trading mana conservation for survival and control.","keywords_es":["build escarcha pvp","talentos pvp mago","escarcha control pvp","mordiescarcha escarcha permanente"],"keywords_en":["frost pvp build","mage pvp talents","frost control pvp","frostbite permafrost build"],"text_es":"Arcano: Especialización en varitas 2/2, Recuperación Arcana 3/3, Sutileza Arcana 2/2, Concentración Arcana 4/5, Tromba de misiles 2/2, Geometría Arcana 2/2 y Contrahechizo mejorado 2/2. Escarcha: Descarga de Escarcha mejorada 5/5, Fragmentos de hielo 5/5, Mordiescarcha 3/3, Escarcha permanente 3/3, Lanza de hielo 1/1, Alcance ártico 2/2, Bloqueo de hielo 1/1, Trizar 3/3, Cono de frío mejorado 3/3, Mordedura helada 1/1, Dedos de Escarcha 2/2, Escalofrío del invierno 4/5 y Barrera de hielo 1/1. Invierte maná en control y defensa; en JcJ masivo puedes optar por Ventisca mejorada.","text_en":"Arcane: Wand Specialization 2/2, Arcane Resilience 3/3, Arcane Subtlety 2/2, Arcane Concentration 4/5, Missile Barrage 2/2, Arcane Geometry 2/2, and Improved Counterspell 2/2. Frost: Improved Frostbolt 5/5, Ice Shards 5/5, Frostbite 3/3, Permafrost 3/3, Ice Lance 1/1, Arctic Reach 2/2, Ice Block 1/1, Shatter 3/3, Improved Cone of Cold 3/3, Cold Snap 1/1, Fingers of Frost 2/2, Winter’s Chill 4/5, and Ice Barrier 1/1. It trades mana savings for control and survival; for large-scale PvP, Improved Blizzard is an option.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Frost Mage Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Frost Mage PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:frost:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:b22e49ae8248d0699d7eccd92657e013d753ce90"]},{"id":"clase-mage-build-arcano-experimental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build experimental Arcano-Fuego (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Experimental Arcane-Fire Build (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Concepto para combates largos y gestión de maná; sacrifica Poder Arcano y daño en peleas breves.","summary_en":"Concept for long fights and mana control; sacrifices Arcane Power and short-fight damage.","keywords_es":["build experimental arcano fuego","talentos híbridos mago","arcano fuego combates largos","gestionar maná mago"],"keywords_en":["experimental arcane fire build","mage hybrid talents","arcane fire long fights","mage mana management"],"text_es":"Arcano: Canalización mejorada 5/5, Sutileza Arcana 2/2, Concentración Arcana 5/5, Tromba de misiles 2/2, Impacto Arcano 3/3, Explosión Arcana 1/1, Meditación Arcana 2/3, Presencia mental 1/1, Mente Arcana 5/5 e Inestabilidad Arcana 3/3. Fuego: Incineración 5/5, Ignición 5/5, Alma ardiente 2/3, Piroexplosión 1/1, Explosión de Fuego mejorada 2/2, Chamuscar mejorado 3/3 y Calentamiento 1/1; Escarcha: Precisión 3/3. Busca sostener el maná y el daño en combates largos, pero renuncia a Poder Arcano y rinde menos en peleas cortas; sigue siendo un concepto pendiente de probar con equipo adecuado.","text_en":"Arcane: Improved Channeling 5/5, Arcane Subtlety 2/2, Arcane Concentration 5/5, Missile Barrage 2/2, Arcane Impact 3/3, Arcane Blast 1/1, Arcane Meditation 2/3, Presence of Mind 1/1, Arcane Mind 5/5, and Arcane Instability 3/3. Fire: Incineration 5/5, Ignite 5/5, Burning Soul 2/3, Pyroblast 1/1, Improved Fire Blast 2/2, Improved Scorch 3/3, and Heating Up 1/1; Frost: Precision 3/3. It aims to sustain mana and damage in long fights, but gives up Arcane Power and performs worse in short fights; it remains a concept awaiting tests with proper gear.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arcane Mage Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arcane Mage PvE Raid and Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:173bb6c1cfa6d703a85019e1abeca832e2c9dc47"]},{"id":"clase-mage-talentos-arcano-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de talentos de Arcano para subir","title_en":"Arcane Leveling Talent Build","summary_es":"Build 1-60 de Arcano con apoyo de maná y talentos de Fuego y Escarcha.","summary_en":"Arcane leveling build with mana support and Fire and Frost talents.","keywords_es":["build de talentos arcano para subir","talentos arcano nivel 60","tromba de misiles arcano","poder arcano leveo"],"keywords_en":["arcane leveling talent build","arcane level 60 talents","arcane missile barrage","arcane power leveling"],"text_es":"Arcano: Especialización en varitas 2/2, Canalización mejorada 5/5, Sutileza Arcana 2/2, Concentración Arcana 5/5, Tromba de misiles 2/2, Geometría Arcana 2/2, Impacto Arcano 3/3, Explosión Arcana 1/1, Meditación Arcana 3/3, Cólera Arcana 1/1, Presencia mental 1/1, Mente Arcana 5/5, Inestabilidad Arcana 3/3 y Poder Arcano 1/1. Fuego: Incineración 5/5, Acelerante 5/5 y Explosión de Fuego mejorada 2/2. Escarcha: Precisión 3/3.","text_en":"Arcane: Wand Specialization 2/2, Improved Channeling 5/5, Arcane Subtlety 2/2, Arcane Concentration 5/5, Missile Barrage 2/2, Arcane Geometry 2/2, Arcane Impact 3/3, Arcane Blast 1/1, Arcane Meditation 3/3, Arcane Wrath 1/1, Presence of Mind 1/1, Arcane Mind 5/5, Arcane Instability 3/3, and Arcane Power 1/1. Fire: Incineration 5/5, Accelerant 5/5, and Improved Fire Blast 2/2. Frost: Precision 3/3.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Arcane Mage DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4e76f57b836408d76191e70b024f25e06808113e"]},{"id":"clase-mage-talentos-fuego-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de talentos de Fuego para subir","title_en":"Fire Leveling Talent Build","summary_es":"Build 1-60 que combina Calentamiento y daño de Fuego con apoyo Arcano.","summary_en":"Leveling build combining Heating Up and Fire damage with Arcane support.","keywords_es":["build de talentos fuego para subir","talentos fuego nivel 60","calentamiento piroexplosión","build fuego mago leveo"],"keywords_en":["fire leveling talent build","fire level 60 talents","heating up pyroblast","fire mage leveling build"],"text_es":"Arcano: Canalización mejorada 5/5, Sutileza Arcana 2/2, Concentración Arcana 5/5, Tromba de misiles 2/2, Explosión Arcana 1/1 y Meditación Arcana 3/3. Fuego: Incineración 5/5, Acelerante 5/5, Ignición 5/5, Lanzallamas 2/2, Alma ardiente 3/3, Piroexplosión 1/1, Explosión de Fuego mejorada 2/2, Calentamiento 1/1, Masa crítica 3/3, Poder de Fuego 3/3 y Combustión 1/1. Escarcha: Precisión 2/3.","text_en":"Arcane: Improved Channeling 5/5, Arcane Subtlety 2/2, Arcane Concentration 5/5, Missile Barrage 2/2, Arcane Blast 1/1, and Arcane Meditation 3/3. Fire: Incineration 5/5, Accelerant 5/5, Ignite 5/5, Flame Throwing 2/2, Burning Soul 3/3, Pyroblast 1/1, Improved Fire Blast 2/2, Heating Up 1/1, Critical Mass 3/3, Fire Power 3/3, and Combustion 1/1. Frost: Precision 2/3.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Fire Mage DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:fire:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:70db27a356ab4ccd9425439c6cac88327a2f4a6c"]},{"id":"clase-mage-ruta-talentos-arcano","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Arcano (subida)","title_en":"Arcane Talent Path (levelling)","summary_es":"Prioriza varita, Tromba de misiles y apoyo de maná antes de completar la build.","summary_en":"Prioritize wand, Missile Barrage, and mana support before completing the build.","keywords_es":["orden de talentos arcano","ruta de talentos de arcano","especialización en varitas arcano","subir mago arcano"],"keywords_en":["arcane talent order","arcane leveling talent path","arcane wand specialization","leveling arcane mage"],"text_es":"Empieza con Especialización en varitas 2/2 y toma Precisión pronto; prioriza después Canalización mejorada 5/5, Tromba de misiles 2/2 y Sutileza Arcana 2/2. Al desbloquear Explosión Arcana 1/1, úsala para activar Tromba; Cólera Arcana 1/1 se recomienda desde el nivel 26. Después toma Concentración Arcana 5/5 y Meditación Arcana 3/3 para sostener el maná, completa Precisión 3/3 y avanza hacia Poder Arcano 1/1. Termina con los talentos de daño y alcance de la build.","text_en":"Start with Wand Specialization 2/2 and take Precision early; then prioritize Improved Channeling 5/5, Missile Barrage 2/2, and Arcane Subtlety 2/2. When available, use Arcane Blast 1/1 to trigger Barrage; Arcane Wrath 1/1 is recommended from level 26. Then take Arcane Concentration 5/5 and Arcane Meditation 3/3 for mana sustain, finish Precision 3/3, and work toward Arcane Power 1/1. Complete the build with its damage and range talents.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Arcane Mage DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as an Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4e76f57b836408d76191e70b024f25e06808113e","section:8e6f1a177a32669927096280bee225a97a167dff"]},{"id":"clase-mage-ruta-talentos-fuego","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Fuego (subida)","title_en":"Fire Talent Path (levelling)","summary_es":"Acelerante agiliza los lanzamientos; prepara Calentamiento y añade apoyo Arcano.","summary_en":"Accelerant speeds casts; build toward Heating Up and add Arcane support.","keywords_es":["orden de talentos fuego","ruta de talentos de fuego mago","acelerante y calentamiento","explosión de fuego mejorada"],"keywords_en":["fire talent order","fire mage leveling talent path","accelerant and heating up","improved fire blast talent"],"text_es":"Invierte pronto en Acelerante 5/5 para acortar lanzamientos. Cuando se acerquen Calentamiento 1/1 y Piroexplosión 1/1, prepara Explosión de Fuego mejorada 2/2 e Incineración 5/5. Luego sigue con Ignición 5/5, Lanzallamas 2/2, Alma ardiente 3/3, Masa crítica 3/3 y Poder de Fuego 3/3. Canalización mejorada 5/5, Tromba de misiles 2/2 y Sutileza Arcana 2/2 aportan apoyo Arcano; adelanta Concentración Arcana 5/5 y Meditación Arcana 3/3 si necesitas maná.","text_en":"Invest early in Accelerant 5/5 to shorten casts. As Heating Up 1/1 and Pyroblast 1/1 come into reach, prepare Improved Fire Blast 2/2 and Incineration 5/5. Then take Ignite 5/5, Flame Throwing 2/2, Burning Soul 3/3, Critical Mass 3/3, and Fire Power 3/3. Improved Channeling 5/5, Missile Barrage 2/2, and Arcane Subtlety 2/2 add Arcane support; move Arcane Concentration 5/5 and Arcane Meditation 3/3 earlier if you need mana.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Fire Mage DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:fire:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:70db27a356ab4ccd9425439c6cac88327a2f4a6c"]},{"id":"clase-mage-ruta-talentos-escarcha","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Escarcha (subida)","title_en":"Frost Talent Path (levelling)","summary_es":"Empieza con varita; intercala Mordiescarcha y cambia sus puntos al llegar Dedos de Escarcha.","summary_en":"Start with a wand; take Frostbite early and reallocate when Fingers of Frost arrives.","keywords_es":["orden de talentos escarcha","ruta de talentos de escarcha mago","mordiescarcha dedos de escarcha","barrera de hielo escarcha leveo"],"keywords_en":["frost talent order","frost mage leveling talent path","frostbite fingers of frost","ice barrier frost leveling"],"text_es":"Empieza con Especialización en varitas 2/2 y prioriza Precisión (3/3 en la build completa). Intercala Mordiescarcha 3/3 antes de terminar Descarga de Escarcha mejorada 5/5; Fragmentos de hielo 5/5 y Trizar 3/3 potencian los golpes congelados. Lanza de hielo 1/1 se desbloquea a 20. Toma Bloqueo de hielo 1/1 antes de Dedos de Escarcha 2/2; como ambos procs no se acumulan, puedes reasignar Mordiescarcha 3/3 para adelantar Barrera de hielo 1/1 y Cono de frío mejorado 3/3.","text_en":"Start with Wand Specialization 2/2 and prioritize Precision (3/3 in the completed build). Take Frostbite 3/3 before finishing Improved Frostbolt 5/5; Ice Shards 5/5 and Shatter 3/3 strengthen damage against frozen targets. Ice Lance 1/1 unlocks at 20. Take Ice Block 1/1 before Fingers of Frost 2/2; since their procs do not stack, you can reallocate Frostbite 3/3 to reach Ice Barrier 1/1 and Improved Cone of Cold 3/3 sooner.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Frost Mage DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Frost Mage Leveling Talent Build for WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:9f2d2de4ab2c35c2a0e8fdf8f82e48a930203324","section:bd01a556cd9ed84d3f95d2eeb3e8e0afccea20a2"]},{"id":"clase-mage-rangos-hechizos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rangos de hechizos de daño","title_en":"Damage Spell Ranks","summary_es":"Entrena nuevos rangos de Bola de Fuego, Descarga de Escarcha y Explosión de Fuego durante el leveo.","summary_en":"Train new Fireball, Frostbolt, and Fire Blast ranks as you level.","keywords_es":["rangos de hechizos de mago","rangos bola de fuego","rangos descarga de escarcha","rangos explosión de fuego"],"keywords_en":["mage spell ranks","fireball ranks","frostbolt ranks","fire blast ranks"],"text_es":"Bola de Fuego se aprende a 1 y mejora a 6, 12, 18, 24, 30, 36, 42, 48, 54 y 60. Descarga de Escarcha llega a 4 y recibe rangos a 8, 14, 20, 26, 32, 38, 44, 50, 56 y 60. Explosión de Fuego se aprende a 6 y mejora a 14, 22, 30, 38, 46 y 54. Misiles Arcanos llega a 8 y sus primeros rangos nuevos a 16, 24, 32 y 40; prioriza entrenar los hechizos de daño de tu especialización.","text_en":"Fireball is learned at 1 and gains ranks at 6, 12, 18, 24, 30, 36, 42, 48, 54, and 60. Frostbolt comes at 4, with ranks at 8, 14, 20, 26, 32, 38, 44, 50, 56, and 60. Fire Blast is learned at 6 and gains ranks at 14, 22, 30, 38, 46, and 54. Arcane Missiles comes at 8, with its first new ranks at 16, 24, 32, and 40; prioritize the damage spells for your specialization.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Arcane Mage","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Fire Mage","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling","class:mage:fire:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:65574cf48c680b433e518d65dbf0b3a5faa61118","section:9566ca444cd6c91fd887d99fe2ea7a211a7d7ece"]},{"id":"clase-mage-hechizos-opcionales","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hechizos opcionales al subir","title_en":"Optional Spells While Leveling","summary_es":"Si escasea el oro, puedes retrasar defensas y hechizos situacionales según tu estilo.","summary_en":"When gold is tight, delay situational and defensive spells based on your playstyle.","keywords_es":["hechizos opcionales mago","ahorrar oro entrenador mago","nivel de caída lenta","rangos de empapar magia"],"keywords_en":["optional mage spells","save mage training gold","slow fall training level","dampen magic ranks"],"text_es":"Para ahorrar oro, puedes retrasar Caída lenta y Empapar magia (nivel 12), Amplificar magia (18), Escudo de maná y Custodia de Fuego (20), y Custodia de Escarcha y Chamuscar (22). Sus rangos posteriores se aprenden más adelante. En Escarcha, Empapar magia y Amplificar magia aportan poca utilidad durante el leveo; decide según tu contenido.","text_en":"To save gold, you can delay Slow Fall and Dampen Magic (level 12), Amplify Magic (18), Mana Shield and Fire Ward (20), and Frost Ward and Scorch (22). Later ranks are learned at higher levels. For Frost, Dampen Magic and Amplify Magic offer little utility while leveling; choose according to your content.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Arcane Mage","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Best Abilities to Train for Frost Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling","class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:cfdd1fb1edd0569919605d5a27dee82a6b61d41b","section:52adeb7f99ce10adf073446dff74caae575749e3"]},{"id":"clase-mage-profesiones-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Professions","summary_es":"Costura y Encantamiento combinan por equipo y desencantado; recolección ofrece ingresos.","summary_en":"Tailoring and Enchanting pair through gear and disenchanting; gathering earns income.","keywords_es":["profesiones mago para subir","costura y encantamiento mago","profesiones para ganar oro leveo","botánica minería desollar mago"],"keywords_en":["mage leveling professions","tailoring enchanting mage","gold making professions leveling","herbalism mining skinning mage"],"text_es":"Costura y Encantamiento se recomiendan juntas: puedes desencantar las prendas que fabricas, y Encantamiento también permite crear varitas. Si priorizas subir rápido o ganar oro, elige dos profesiones de recolección, como Botánica, Minería o Desollar, para obtener ingresos y materiales; puedes cambiar a fabricación más adelante.","text_en":"Tailoring and Enchanting are a recommended pair: you can disenchant the pieces you craft, and Enchanting also lets you make wands. If you prioritize fast leveling or gold, choose two gathering professions such as Herbalism, Mining, or Skinning for income and materials; you can switch to crafting later.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arcane Mage Leveling Guide › Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arcane-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Frost Mage Leveling Guide › Best Professions for Leveling Frost Mage in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/frost-mage-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling","class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0ee05f8b7602d788f68adfcfdb9594ffa8ac9b76","section:1f08a7887c45d6928f014c652d25ec8f209d2e1b","section:88a03952f5984354db2f328a7dc5dd20af92f5b9"]},{"id":"clase-mage-consumibles-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Consumables","summary_es":"Aceite, elixires, comida con experiencia, Primeros auxilios y pociones ayudan a avanzar.","summary_en":"Oil, elixirs, XP food, First Aid, and potions support leveling.","keywords_es":["consumibles mago leveo","elixir arcano menor","aceite de zahorí menor","comida con experiencia mago"],"keywords_en":["mage leveling consumables","minor arcane elixir","minor wizard oil","mage experience food"],"text_es":"El Elixir Arcano menor y el Aceite de zahorí menor aportan poder con hechizos; sus versiones superiores sirven al avanzar. La comida concede un 5% más de experiencia por enemigos derrotados y puede dar intelecto o poder con hechizos. Mantén Primeros auxilios al día y lleva Poción de maná y Poción de curación para reducir pausas y regresos tras morir.","text_en":"Minor Arcane Elixir and Minor Wizard Oil add spell power; stronger versions help as you progress. Food grants 5% extra experience from kills and can provide Intellect or spell power. Keep First Aid current and carry Mana Potion and Healing Potion to reduce downtime and runbacks after dying.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a64ff3132c27974559d63731180d1d4b37f3a092"]},{"id":"clase-mage-ventajas-limites-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ventajas y límites de cada rama al subir","title_en":"Leveling Spec Strengths and Trade-offs","summary_es":"Arcano aporta maná, Fuego alcance y Escarcha control, con costes distintos en cada rama.","summary_en":"Arcane brings mana, Fire range, and Frost control, each with different trade-offs.","keywords_es":["pros y contras mago leveo","ventajas arcano al subir","desventajas fuego mago leveo","inmunidad escarcha leveo"],"keywords_en":["mage leveling pros and cons","arcane leveling strengths","fire mage leveling drawbacks","frost immune mobs leveling"],"text_es":"Arcano ofrece talentos de maná, ráfaga y buen rendimiento en mazmorras, pero menos herramientas de JcJ y un estilo menos intuitivo. Fuego tiene gran alcance y progresa bien tras los primeros niveles; a cambio, sufre con el maná y el área y depende del poder con hechizos del equipo. Escarcha facilita el kiteo y destaca contra melé en JcJ, aunque la reutilización compartida de 8 segundos entre Lanza de hielo y Explosión de Fuego puede volver repetitiva su rotación, y los inmunes a Escarcha son difíciles hasta acceder a talentos Arcanos.","text_en":"Arcane offers mana talents, burst, and strong dungeon performance, but fewer PvP tools and a less intuitive playstyle. Fire has great range and progresses well after the early levels; in return, it struggles with mana and AoE and depends on spell power from gear. Frost makes kiting easy and excels against melee in PvP, though the shared 8-second cooldown between Ice Lance and Fire Blast can make its rotation feel repetitive, and Frost-immune enemies are difficult until Arcane talents become available.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Fire Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling","class:mage:fire:leveling","class:mage:frost:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1aa5d58ed43b1da8e6f4346578033dffb9994912","section:3b67d44d3b8a1a9973604b7cb24e6eb0186027d4","section:848842a66c33a18556553090e9673380704a3747","section:8678ef51f88c60b1b26990f63a9bffad98bdb648","section:e46de58ad3a89404e24cd17a2093f1c530ace54c","section:ece2959de9e471633c5413eca15bc079ad0c5ff4","section:f3db4ddd15f1f16f94623e129556e1e9a2fcdbd4"]},{"id":"clase-mage-campamento-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejoras de campamento para subir","title_en":"Leveling Camp Buffs","summary_es":"La Tienda de campamento destaca para la experiencia descansada; otros puestos ayudan con maná o estadísticas.","summary_en":"Camp Tent boosts rested XP; other features support mana or stats.","keywords_es":["mejoras de campamento mago","tienda de campamento experiencia","pozo de maná campamento","vela de incienso intelecto"],"keywords_en":["mage camp buffs","camp tent rested xp","mana well camp feature","incense candle intellect"],"text_es":"La Tienda de campamento es la mejora más valiosa para la experiencia descansada. El Estandarte de facción aporta Espíritu y el Pozo de maná repone maná cada 5 segundos. La Vela de incienso aumenta el intelecto, pero no se acumula con Intelecto Arcano; el Equipo de primeros auxilios da aguante. La Silla de campamento aporta Golpe crítico; el Cuenco con pescado y el Laúd encantado mejoran estadísticas, armadura o resistencias.","text_en":"Camp Tent is the most valuable feature for rested experience. Faction Banner grants Spirit and Mana Well restores mana every 5 seconds. Incense Candle increases Intellect but does not stack with Arcane Intellect; First Aid Kit grants Stamina. Camp Chair adds spell critical strike; Fish Bowl and Enchanted Lute improve stats, armor, or resistances.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Arcane Mage DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:mage:arcane:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:c81518b1c41d8cd44c08f0f22f593758592bbc68"]},{"id":"clase-mage-investigar-pergaminos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Investigar y Entender pergamino","title_en":"Research and Comprehend Scroll","summary_es":"Mejoras únicas del Mago que pueden salir mal.","summary_en":"Unique Mage buffs that can backfire.","keywords_es":["investigar mago","entender pergamino","pergaminos del mago","qué hace investigar"],"keywords_en":["mage research","comprehend scroll","mage scrolls","what does research do"],"text_es":"Investigar y Entender pergamino dan al Mago mejoras únicas, para él y para sus aliados, pero pueden salir mal. Úsalas con cuidado, sobre todo antes de un combate difícil.","text_en":"Research and Comprehend Scroll give the Mage unique buffs for themselves and allies, but they can backfire. Use them with care, especially before a hard fight.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Frost Mages in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:mage:frost:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:f6dd8bde6f0bfe29dbd8b65b366a56b97624c75e"]},{"id":"clase-mage-amplificar-empapar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Amplificar y Empapar magia en grupo","title_en":"Amplify and Dampen Magic in groups","summary_es":"Cuándo conviene cada una según el daño del jefe.","summary_en":"When each one fits depending on the boss damage.","keywords_es":["amplificar magia cuándo","empapar magia en grupo","empapar magia sanador","preparar combate mago"],"keywords_en":["when amplify magic","dampen magic in groups","dampen magic healer","mage fight prep"],"text_es":"Amplificar magia aumenta la curación recibida y sirve en combates con mucho daño físico; Empapar magia reduce el daño mágico recibido y sirve cuando el daño es mágico. En grupo, Empapar magia también reduce la curación del sanador, por lo que no conviene salvo que el daño mágico lo justifique. En misiones en solitario es útil mantenerla activa.","text_en":"Amplify Magic increases healing received and fits fights with heavy physical damage; Dampen Magic reduces magic damage taken and fits magic-heavy damage. In a group, Dampen Magic also lowers your healer's healing, so use it only when the magic damage justifies it. In solo questing it is worth keeping active.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Frost Mages in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Abilities Guide - Forever › Defensive Abilities for Arcane Mages in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:mage:arcane:abilities","class:mage:frost:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:c13c305f5763bbea55397f87bf3bf367dc39d2c5","section:f6dd8bde6f0bfe29dbd8b65b366a56b97624c75e"]},{"id":"clase-mage-habilidades-fuego-arcano","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Poder Arcano, Combustión y Piroexplosión","title_en":"Arcane Power, Combustion and Pyroblast","summary_es":"Qué hacen las habilidades clave de Arcano y Fuego.","summary_en":"What the key Arcane and Fire abilities do.","keywords_es":["poder arcano qué hace","combustión mago","piroexplosión calentamiento","explosión de fuego mejorada"],"keywords_en":["arcane power what does","mage combustion","pyroblast heating up","improved fire blast"],"text_es":"Poder Arcano (talento) sube el daño y el coste de maná un 30 % durante 15 s. Combustión (talento) añade 10 % de crítico tras cada impacto hasta lograr 4 críticos de Fuego. Calentamiento reduce el tiempo de lanzamiento de Piroexplosión. Explosión de Fuego mejorada da +50 % de crítico tras matar a un enemigo de nivel adecuado, y es instantánea, así que se usa en movimiento.","text_en":"Arcane Power (talent) raises damage and mana cost by 30% for 15 s. Combustion (talent) adds 10% crit after each hit until you land 4 Fire crits. Heating Up reduces Pyroblast's cast time. Improved Fire Blast gives +50% crit after killing a level-appropriate enemy, and Fire Blast is instant, so it works while moving.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Arcane Mages in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Fire Mages in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Abilities Guide - Forever › Damage Spells for Fire Mages in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:mage:arcane:abilities","class:mage:fire:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:20f78f6f5b5995262856a268dbcd27616112f304","section:c5274d5ead709fb6f52660ce6136bf698590f167","section:ff5ca4780e654b8044625d80f582157df01a0456"]},{"id":"clase-mage-encantamientos-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Mago a nivel 60","title_en":"Mage enchants at level 60","summary_es":"Qué encantar en cada hueco con el Mago a nivel 60, según la escuela.","summary_en":"What to enchant in each slot as a level 60 Mage, by school.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo mago","qué encantamientos pongo de mago","encantamientos para mago","encantamientos mago","encantar guantes mago","qué encantar mago arcano","guantes poder de fuego","arcano de enfoque mago"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a mage","best enchants for mage","mage enchants","mage glove enchant","what to enchant arcane mage","fire power gloves","arcanum of focus mage"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Mago a nivel 60: Arma: Encantar arma: poder con hechizos (+30; hace falta Encantamiento 300). Guantes según la escuela: Encantar guantes: poder Arcano (Arcano) o poder de Fuego (Fuego), ambos +20 de daño. Cabeza o piernas: Arcano de enfoque (+8 poder con hechizos, requiere objeto de nivel 60; se consigue con el Tratado sobre Enfoque en Dire Maul). Botas: Encantar botas: velocidad (+8% velocidad de movimiento) o un complemento místico (+6 poder con hechizos), a tu gusto.","text_en":"Mage enchants at level 60: Weapon: Enchant Weapon - Spell Power (+30; needs 300 Enchanting). Gloves by school: Enchant Gloves - Arcane Power (Arcane) or Fire Power (Fire), both +20 damage. Head or legs: Arcanum of Focus (+8 Spell Power, needs a level 60 item; from the Libram of Focus in Dire Maul). Boots: Enchant Boots - Speed (+8% movement speed) or a Mystic armor kit (+6 Spell Power), by preference.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Arcane Mage Enchants in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Fire Mage Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:mage:arcane:enchants","class:mage:fire:enchants"],"source_hashes":["guide:c8fdc78d63106047e3bf7148f33da57fe7d7f578","section:0cf43476d2a38e08644daafe284bfa902e6d405a"]},{"id":"clase-mage-encantamientos-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Mago al subir","title_en":"Mage enchants while leveling","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Mago por tramos de nivel mientras subes.","summary_en":"What to enchant as a Mage in each level bracket while leveling.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo mago","qué encantamientos pongo de mago","encantamientos para mago","encantamientos mago subiendo","complemento místico mago","arma revelación mago","encantar collar poder con hechizos"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a mage","best enchants for mage","mage leveling enchants","mystic armor kit mage","revelation weapon mage","necklace spell power enchant"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Mago al subir: Niveles 1-19: Encantar arma: revelación (un hechizo sin crítico puede hacer crítico el siguiente), Encantar brazal: poder de sanación menor y el Complemento medio para armadura místico. 20-39: Encantar collar: poder con hechizos y el Complemento pesado. 40-60: Encantar brazal: poder de sanación inferior y los Complementos gruesos o bastos. Para el daño, un complemento místico supera cualquier encantamiento de intelecto en el torso; cualquiera puede ponerlos.","text_en":"Mage enchants while leveling: Levels 1-19: Enchant Weapon - Revelation (a non-crit spell can make the next one crit), Enchant Bracer - Minor Healing Power and the Mystic Medium Armor Kit. 20-39: Enchant Necklace - Spell Power and the Heavy kit. 40-60: Enchant Bracer - Lesser Healing Power and the Thick or Rugged kits. For damage a Mystic kit beats any chest Intellect enchant; anyone can apply them.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Quick Picks by Level","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Arcane Mage Enchants in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:mage:arcane:enchants"],"source_hashes":["guide:c8fdc78d63106047e3bf7148f33da57fe7d7f578","section:50937079dabcb03835c4b6fe63fb7248041fa836"]},{"id":"clase-mage-consumibles-reglas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles del Mago: qué elegir y qué se acumula","title_en":"Mage consumables: what to pick and what stacks","summary_es":"Elixires, comida y reglas de acumulación para el Mago.","summary_en":"Elixirs, food and stacking rules for the Mage.","keywords_es":["qué consumibles uso siendo mago","qué consumibles uso de mago","consumibles para mago","qué elixires uso de mago","elixires mago","qué comida mago","elixir superior arcano mago","sangre de mago mago"],"keywords_en":["what consumables as a mage","best consumables for mage","mage elixirs","mage food","greater arcane elixir mage","mageblood mage","free action potion mage"],"text_es":"Consumibles del Mago: qué elegir y qué se acumula: Los elixires de poder con hechizos dan más daño; los de intelecto, sobre todo maná; los de sangre de mago, menos pausas para beber. Desde el nivel 47, Elixir superior arcano. La comida de poder con hechizos supera a la de intelecto en todos los niveles (Arcano); solo come intelecto si no tienes la otra. Una sola comida activa y todas las pociones comparten reutilización; las gemas de maná tienen la suya. La Poción de acción libre evita nuevos aturdimientos, pero no quita los que ya tienes.","text_en":"Mage consumables: what to pick and what stacks: Spell Power elixirs give the most damage; Intellect ones mostly add mana; Mageblood elixirs mean less drinking. From level 47, Greater Arcane Elixir. Spell Power food beats Intellect food at every level for Arcane; eat Intellect only if you have no Spell Power food. Only one food buff is active and all potions share a cooldown; Mana Gems have their own. Free Action Potion stops new stuns but does not remove ones already on you.","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arcane Mage Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Arcane Mage Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/arcane/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Frost Mage Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:mage:arcane:enchants","class:mage:frost:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:24b5dd64ff6a529931514004c15e87d489210cf5","section:522637122ed02eec6c0fe1036b025a51eea2e378"]},{"id":"clase-mage-pergaminos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Pergaminos exclusivos del Mago","title_en":"Mage-only scrolls","summary_es":"Qué son los pergaminos de mago (familiares, imbuir, crioexplosión) y cómo se acumulan.","summary_en":"What mage scrolls (familiars, imbues, cryoblast) are and how they stack.","keywords_es":["pergaminos de mago","pergamino de familiar gato","pergamino de imbuir llama","pergamino de crioexplosión","imbuir arma mago"],"keywords_en":["mage scrolls","cat familiar scroll","imbue flame scroll","cryoblast scroll","mage weapon imbue"],"text_es":"Pergaminos exclusivos del Mago: Solo los magos usan estos pergaminos, que funcionan como el veneno del pícaro. Los de familiar (rata, rana, gato) dan 2, 6 o 12 de intelecto durante una hora y se acumulan con el aceite de zahorí. Los de imbuir dan a los bastones un bonus de escuela (llama superior, escarcha superior: +20) y compiten con los aceites. Pergamino de crioexplosión inflige daño de Escarcha en área (122 el normal, 508 el superior).","text_en":"Mage-only scrolls: Only Mages can use these scrolls, which work like a Rogue poison. Familiar scrolls (rat, frog, cat) give 2, 6 or 12 Intellect for an hour and stack with wizard oil. Imbue scrolls give staves a school bonus (Greater Flame, Greater Frost: +20) and compete with oils. Scroll of Cryoblast deals area Frost damage (122, or 508 for the Greater one).","tags":["MAGE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Frost Mage Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Frost Mage Scrolls for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/frost/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fire Mage Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Fire Mage Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:mage:fire:enchants","class:mage:frost:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:04a4cb3055600de1317279a8a7a845dcc4226f13","section:f8eedce170a7e5fa926553729e8145d12a257075"]}]},"04-clase-paladin.json":{"description":"Capítulo 4: Clases. Paladín. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"clase-paladin-que-hace","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace un Paladín","title_en":"What a Paladin Does","summary_es":"Paladín usa la Luz para dañar, curar y proteger; sus bendiciones, auras y sellos apoyan al grupo.","summary_en":"Paladin uses the Light to damage, heal, and protect; blessings, auras, and seals support the group.","keywords_es":["qué hace un paladín","paladín daño curación tanque","paladín bendiciones y auras","paladín sellos","paladín clase versátil"],"keywords_en":["what does a paladin do","paladin damage healing tank","paladin blessings auras","paladin seals","versatile paladin class"],"text_es":"El Paladín canaliza la Luz para dañar, curar y proteger al grupo. Sagrado sana, Protección mantiene la amenaza con escudo y Reprensión convierte un arma a dos manos y los sellos en daño cuerpo a cuerpo. Bendiciones, auras e inmunidades aportan apoyo y respuestas defensivas en distintos encuentros.","text_en":"Paladin channels the Light to damage, heal, and protect the group. Holy heals, Protection holds threat with a shield, and Retribution turns a two-handed weapon and seals into melee damage. Blessings, auras, and immunities provide support and defensive answers in varied encounters.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Paladin Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Paladin in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/paladin-class-overview","date":"2026-11-02"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Holy Paladin for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Protection Paladin for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Retribution Paladins for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Paladin Guide › Holy Paladin Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-paladin-healer-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Retribution Paladin Guide › Retribution Paladin Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/retribution-paladin-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:general:paladin-class-overview","class:paladin:holy:overview","class:paladin:protection:overview","class:paladin:retribution:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:2680a27f47a98913eb95d35b2beeab208b5ee5eb","section:44045ad8642aee734fa4bcdf3a770a4f3a086411","section:710e692a4fa67f2192555d97ba03aa902f739fa2","section:8dbae45cd6354046e7fe2b406a62788f6baa7830","section:b49160744e9163b19cedd33a305683db13dc9f99","section:bbd23d7937186416a7c779a4fd77ffefaf43f620"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-especializaciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones del Paladín","title_en":"Paladin Specializations","summary_es":"Sagrado cura, Protección tanquea con escudo y Reprensión hace daño cuerpo a cuerpo con dos manos.","summary_en":"Holy heals, Protection tanks with a shield, and Retribution deals melee damage with two hands.","keywords_es":["especializaciones del paladín","paladín sagrado protección reprensión","paladín sanador","paladín tanque","paladín daño"],"keywords_en":["paladin specializations","paladin holy protection retribution","paladin healer","paladin tank","paladin damage"],"text_es":"Sagrado ofrece curas potentes a un objetivo y Vigilia de la Luz permite responder al daño grupal. Protección tanquea con escudo, Consagración y Sello de furia; destaca ante magia y varios enemigos. Reprensión inflige daño cuerpo a cuerpo con dos manos y apoya al grupo, pero carece de interrupción y ralentización.","text_en":"Holy provides strong single-target healing, while Light's Vigil answers group damage. Protection tanks with a shield, Consecration, and Seal of Fury; it excels against magic and multiple enemies. Retribution deals two-handed melee damage and supports the group, but lacks an interrupt and a slow.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Holy Paladin for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Protection Paladin Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Retribution Paladins in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:overview","class:paladin:protection:overview","class:paladin:retribution:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:576c08dc1e411b0103d71403b3e5d55105fcb5ab","section:6de93a2e5f1db204854d458c82af2491bb1d24fc","section:710e692a4fa67f2192555d97ba03aa902f739fa2","section:88add09bcfaabe1f747809ea349477490af1a14a","section:e96c2c8893d1872f12fd3da623c5f074f0da68bb"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué cambia en Forever para el Paladín","title_en":"What Changes for Paladin in Forever","summary_es":"Protección gana provocación con Sello de furia y Sagrado recibe Vigilia de la Luz para curar en área.","summary_en":"Protection gains taunt through Seal of Fury, and Holy receives Light's Vigil for area healing.","keywords_es":["cambios del paladín en forever","sello de furia","vigilia de la luz","paladín provocar","paladín curación en área"],"keywords_en":["paladin forever changes","seal of fury","light's vigil","paladin taunt","paladin aoe healing"],"text_es":"Sagrado obtiene Vigilia de la Luz para sanar al grupo; Protección suma Sello de furia, que provoca con Sentencia, y Baluarte de templario. Reprensión recibe Golpe Sagrado y Cólera desellada para almacenar efectos del sello y gastarlos al cambiar. Además, Sentencia ya no consume el sello activo, las bendiciones duran 1 hora y Consagración pasa a ser básica en nivel 20. El Paladín conserva sus tres funciones de grupo.","text_en":"Holy gains Light's Vigil for group healing; Protection adds Seal of Fury, which taunts through Judgement, and Templar's Bulwark. Retribution receives Holy Strike and Unsealed Wrath to store seal effects and spend them when switching. Judgement also stops consuming the active seal, blessings last 1 hour, and Consecration becomes baseline at level 20. Paladin retains its three group roles.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:overview","class:paladin:protection:overview","class:paladin:retribution:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:04d4ba591beabf5febf8f89b32f1f47124bcd84e","section:6be8e272d7be3efbb19297610f1c04a8cffd016a","section:6de93a2e5f1db204854d458c82af2491bb1d24fc","section:a6b6f36e9aed025a1659968a005a58a40fdcd11a","section:ae4cd702182a2185ffe2e082a7514a263c0b3c23","section:e96c2c8893d1872f12fd3da623c5f074f0da68bb"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-armas-armadura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas y armadura del Paladín","title_en":"Paladin Weapons and Armor","summary_es":"Lleva malla y placas; Protección usa escudo y Reprensión un arma a dos manos.","summary_en":"Wears mail and plate; Protection uses a shield and Retribution a two-handed weapon.","keywords_es":["armas del paladín","armadura del paladín","paladín escudo","paladín arma a dos manos","paladín placas"],"keywords_en":["paladin weapons","paladin armor","paladin shield","paladin two handed","paladin plate"],"text_es":"Las placas son la armadura característica del Paladín, aunque piezas de otras clases de armadura pueden servirle. Herrería puede fabricar malla o placas con poder con hechizos al subir Protección. Protección tanquea con escudo; Reprensión se orienta a armas a dos manos. Sello de orden favorece armas lentas y Sello de rectitud puede rendir mejor con armas rápidas.","text_en":"Plate is the Paladin’s signature armor, though useful items from other armor classes can also fit. Blacksmithing can craft mail or plate with spell power for Protection while leveling. Protection tanks with a shield; Retribution favors two-handed weapons. Seal of Command favors slower weapons, while Seal of Righteousness can perform better with faster ones.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Paladin Guide › Holy Paladin Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-paladin-healer-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Professions for Protection Paladin in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Retribution Paladin DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:overview","class:paladin:protection:overview","class:paladin:retribution:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:0fdbe3e868618560b3ef766915f734b7d27da2f2","section:33c0c2f10d61ed94116930ebec6ba4e7dbd7fd86","section:b07086cea79a600fea410483650d49bcc16be54c","section:bbd23d7937186416a7c779a4fd77ffefaf43f620"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-subir-espec","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejor especialización para subir","title_en":"Best Specialization for Leveling","summary_es":"Reprensión sube con poco descanso; Protección destaca en grupos y área, y Sagrado cura en mazmorras.","summary_en":"Retribution levels with little downtime; Protection excels in groups and AoE, while Holy heals dungeons.","keywords_es":["mejor especialización para subir paladín","paladín reprensión para levear","paladín protección para subir","paladín sagrado para subir","qué spec de paladín usar"],"keywords_en":["best paladin leveling spec","retribution paladin leveling","protection paladin leveling","holy paladin leveling","which paladin spec to level"],"text_es":"Entre las opciones para subir, Reprensión combina daño explosivo, resistencia y poco descanso, aunque carece de movilidad y alcance; Protección tanquea y limpia grupos con Consagración, pero flojea contra un objetivo y puede quedarse sin maná; Sagrado aguanta y se cura bien, pero mata más despacio. La curación de Sagrado facilita encontrar grupo para mazmorras.","text_en":"Among leveling options, Retribution combines burst, durability, and little downtime, though it lacks mobility and range; Protection tanks and clears packs with Consecration, but struggles against one target and can run low on mana; Holy survives and sustains itself well, but kills more slowly. Holy healing makes dungeon groups easier to find.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Protection Paladin Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Paladin in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Holy Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling","class:paladin:protection:leveling","class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:21fb1a9bd8df40eb8f8b44ff27d615219bb9a5e8","section:51c329549311e5a273c56d8946086f5d06b9c7e3","section:6a1ffdc9139a6c63030b4e76b7440488013de862","section:9dcdaf006d79caed1800da933db4fee5a801076d"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-talentos-represion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Reprensión (subida)","title_en":"Retribution Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Ruta 1–60 de Reprensión: Oración reduce el gasto de maná y Búsqueda de justicia acelera los viajes.","summary_en":"Retribution 1–60 path: Benediction saves mana and Pursuit of Justice speeds up travel.","keywords_es":["talentos para subir paladín reprensión","ruta de reprensión","desvío u oración","sentencia mejorada","búsqueda de justicia"],"keywords_en":["retribution paladin leveling talents","retribution talent path","deflection benediction","improved judgement","pursuit of justice"],"text_es":"Oración 5/5: 10–14; Sentencia mejorada 2/2: 15–16; Sentencia santificada 3/3: 17–19. Sello de orden 1/1: 20; Búsqueda de justicia 2/2: 21–22; Convicción 2/3: 23–24; Enjuiciador Sagrado 1/1: 25; Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3: 26–28; Convicción 3/3: 29; Venganza 3/3: 30–32; Arrepentimiento 1/1: 33; Fe implacable 1/2: 34; Campeón de la Luz 5/5: 35–39; Cólera desellada 1/1: 40; después, Fuerza divina 5/5 (41–45), Sellos mejorados 5/5 (46–50), Conducto Sagrado 2/2 (51–52), Intelecto divino 5/5 (53–57) y Precisión 2/3 (58–60). Como alternativa defensiva, Desvío sustituye a Oración.","text_en":"Benediction 5/5: 10–14; Improved Judgement 2/2: 15–16; Sanctified Judgement 3/3: 17–19. Seal of Command 1/1: 20; Pursuit of Justice 2/2: 21–22; then Conviction 2/3: 23–24; Sacred Arbiter 1/1: 25; Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3: 26–28; Conviction 3/3: 29; Vengeance 3/3: 30–32; then Repentance 1/1: 33; Unyielding Faith 1/2: 34; Champion of the Light 5/5: 35–39; Unsealed Wrath 1/1: 40; then Divine Strength 5/5 (41–45), Improved Seals 5/5 (46–50), Holy Conduit 2/2 (51–52), Divine Intellect 5/5 (53–57), and Precision 2/3 (58–60). A defensive alternative is Deflection instead of Benediction.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:12d6be15e99636475ab49fc55652edcc12c7417a"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-hitos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de habilidad por nivel","title_en":"Ability Milestones by Level","summary_es":"Niveles clave de entrenamiento, misiones de clase y talentos para subir de nivel.","summary_en":"Key levels for training, class quests, and leveling talents.","keywords_es":["cuándo aprendo habilidades de paladín","nivel de las habilidades del paladín","hitos del paladín","consagración nivel","cólera sagrada nivel"],"keywords_en":["when paladin abilities","paladin ability levels","paladin milestones","consecration level","holy wrath level"],"text_es":"Nivel 4: Sentencia; 6: Golpe Sagrado (Protección/Reprensión); 10: Imposición de manos y Bendición de Protección; 12: misión de Redención. A 20 llegan Consagración y Bendición de los Reyes; Reprensión elige Sello de orden a 20 y Búsqueda de justicia 2/2 a 21–22; la Alianza puede iniciar la misión de Puño de Verigan a 20. Después: Arrepentimiento 30, Escudo divino 34, Martillo de cólera 44 y Cólera sagrada 50 (prescindible en Reprensión); Choque Sagrado 41 y Vigilia de la Luz 52 si eliges esos talentos.","text_en":"Level 4: Judgement; 6: Holy Strike (Protection/Retribution); 10: Lay on Hands and Blessing of Protection; 12: Redemption quest. At 20, Consecration and Blessing of Kings become available; Retribution takes Seal of Command at 20 and Pursuit of Justice 2/2 at 21–22; Alliance can start the Verigan’s Fist quest at 20. At 30: Repentance; 34: Divine Shield; 44: Hammer of Wrath; 50: Holy Wrath (skip as Retribution). Holy Shock 41 and Light's Vigil 52 if talented.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Holy Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Protection Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Retribution Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Retribution Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/retribution-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Paladin Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling","class:paladin:protection:leveling","class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:12d6be15e99636475ab49fc55652edcc12c7417a","section:1e41acc97d7aa841820103f515312b147446d28a","section:726235c29476e7b3bfea6f425964453cef449819","section:7d5b056f9256b015fb6d7eb2a81dc93736fe8070","section:93c0e08625078c87de143d01fc1bf916e38ef870","section:b762ccab74541fa9e2c228783a54c000d64e0dbe","section:e659a0e09cc118fc03fdd0c794cd135de02705d2"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-mana","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo gestionar el maná","title_en":"Managing Mana","summary_es":"El maná limita el ritmo: sincroniza ataques, evita Consagración innecesaria y lleva agua.","summary_en":"Mana limits your pace: sync attacks, avoid needless Consecration, and carry water.","keywords_es":["maná del paladín","regeneración de maná paladín","paladín sin maná","regla de cinco segundos","agua para paladín"],"keywords_en":["paladin mana","paladin mana regeneration","paladin out of mana","five second rule","paladin water"],"text_es":"El maná puede frenar la subida, sobre todo si Protección lanza Consagración sin medida. Lleva agua y sincroniza Sentencia con Golpe Sagrado para dejar que actúe la regla de cinco segundos; usa Consagración cuando el maná alcance. En Sagrado, Destello de Luz cura de forma eficiente; Luz Sagrada cura más a cambio de tiempo y maná, y Choque Sagrado sirve para una emergencia. Imposición de manos consume el maná restante: resérvala para salvar a alguien.","text_en":"Mana can slow your leveling, especially if Protection casts Consecration recklessly. Carry water and sync Judgement with Holy Strike to benefit from the five-second rule; use Consecration when mana allows. For Holy healing, Flash of Light is efficient; Holy Light heals more at a cost of time and mana, while Holy Shock is for emergencies. Lay on Hands consumes your remaining mana, so save it to rescue someone.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Protection Paladin Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Holy Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Paladin in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Paladin Leveling Guide › Holy Paladin Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Paladin Leveling Guide › Holy Paladin Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling","class:paladin:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0c917d08d88a04d1629c2dba6d3ba48cf8fbd7e7","section:1b8b67888c33e93268873d806c5db4c20170fafa","section:6a1ffdc9139a6c63030b4e76b7440488013de862","section:9302163ba05ae3d46ad2581a4659c88fc01ca831"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-sellos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sellos y Sentencia","title_en":"Seals and Judgement","summary_es":"Sentencia ya no consume el sello activo; cada especialización lo elige según daño, curación o amenaza.","summary_en":"Judgement no longer consumes your active seal; choose a seal for damage, healing, or threat.","keywords_es":["sellos del paladín","sentencia paladín","sello de rectitud","sello de luz","sello de furia"],"keywords_en":["paladin seals","paladin judgement","seal of righteousness","seal of light","seal of fury"],"text_es":"Sentencia ya no consume el sello activo. Reprensión usa Sello de rectitud hasta 20 y luego Sello de orden con un arma lenta; al tener Cólera desellada 1/1, cambia a Sello de rectitud para un golpe al acumular 2 o más cargas y vuelve a Sello de orden. Protección mantiene Sello de furia al tanquear, pues Sentencia provoca; aplica Sello del Cruzado antes si el objetivo durará. Para curar, Sello de luz suele ser la opción habitual.","text_en":"Judgement no longer consumes your active seal. Retribution uses Seal of Righteousness until 20, then Seal of Command with a slow weapon; with Unsealed Wrath 1/1, switch to Seal of Righteousness for one swing at 2 or more stacks, then return to Seal of Command. Protection keeps Seal of Fury while tanking because Judgement taunts; apply Seal of the Crusader first if the target will live. For healing, Seal of Light is the usual choice.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Retribution Paladin DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single Target Rotation (Unsealed Wrath)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Paladin in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Paladin Leveling Guide › Holy Paladin Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling","class:paladin:protection:leveling","class:paladin:retribution:leveling","class:paladin:retribution:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:33c0c2f10d61ed94116930ebec6ba4e7dbd7fd86","section:51c329549311e5a273c56d8946086f5d06b9c7e3","section:6a1ffdc9139a6c63030b4e76b7440488013de862","section:9302163ba05ae3d46ad2581a4659c88fc01ca831","section:e71be0bcb57335d842099c87e955d7abeebd4add"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-auras-bendiciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Auras y bendiciones","title_en":"Auras and Blessings","summary_es":"Aura de castigo ayuda a matar; coordina las auras y bendiciones para evitar duplicados.","summary_en":"Retribution Aura helps kill enemies; coordinate auras and blessings to avoid duplicates.","keywords_es":["auras del paladín","bendiciones del paladín","aura de castigo","bendición de los reyes","bendición de sabiduría"],"keywords_en":["paladin auras","paladin blessings","retribution aura","blessing of kings","blessing of wisdom"],"text_es":"Usa Aura de castigo para acelerar las bajas; Aura de devoción es una alternativa defensiva. Las auras iguales no se acumulan, así que coordina con otros Paladines. Bendición del poderío beneficia a quienes pelean cuerpo a cuerpo, Sabiduría ayuda con el maná y Reyes aumenta los atributos; reparte las bendiciones según el grupo. Los beneficios de campamento equivalentes no se acumulan con los de clase.","text_en":"Use Retribution Aura to kill enemies faster; Devotion Aura is a defensive alternative. Identical auras do not stack, so coordinate with other Paladins. Blessing of Might helps melee fighters, Wisdom supports mana, and Kings increases attributes; assign blessings to fit the group. Matching camp buffs do not stack with class buffs.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Protection Paladin Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Paladin Leveling Guide › Holy Paladin Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide › Retribution Paladin Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/retribution-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling","class:paladin:protection:leveling","class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0e6f932ed329d40203d6ab3ea732d99b3be47741","section:9302163ba05ae3d46ad2581a4659c88fc01ca831","section:9537a5b7b35f8086d006c9e9137102d51f2b65d4","section:9c1a99726c6c354b5dbcbe9176a6e9c3f096a4ca"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Control, defensas y limpieza","title_en":"Control, Defenses, and Cleansing","summary_es":"Aturde o incapacita para controlar; las bendiciones, inmunidades y limpiezas ayudan en emergencias.","summary_en":"Stun or incapacitate to control enemies; blessings, immunities, and cleanses help in emergencies.","keywords_es":["control del paladín","martillo de justicia","arrepentimiento paladín","bendición de libertad","escudo divino"],"keywords_en":["paladin control","hammer of justice","paladin repentance","blessing of freedom","divine shield"],"text_es":"Martillo de justicia aturde y Arrepentimiento incapacita; aprovecha el control antes de usar Sentencia contra un enemigo aturdido. Bendición de Libertad quita efectos que impiden moverse; Bendición de Protección bloquea daño físico y Escudo divino te vuelve inmune. Purificar elimina una enfermedad y un veneno. El Paladín carece de interrupción de lanzamientos, así que no puede frenar por sí solo a un lanzador.","text_en":"Hammer of Justice stuns and Repentance incapacitates; use the control before Judgement on a stunned enemy. Blessing of Freedom removes movement-impairing effects; Blessing of Protection blocks physical damage and Divine Shield makes you immune. Purify removes a disease and a poison. Paladins lack a cast interrupt, so they cannot stop a caster by themselves.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/retribution-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Paladin Leveling Guide › Holy Paladin Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling","class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:13270161c1737eece59d847b9b0f462e9ce33f14","section:2651f11463721324c15fc97a9cdc8be137b14de1","section:51c329549311e5a273c56d8946086f5d06b9c7e3","section:9302163ba05ae3d46ad2581a4659c88fc01ca831"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-rotacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación básica para subir","title_en":"Basic Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Prioridades de un objetivo para Reprensión y Protección, daño de Sagrado y curación de grupo.","summary_en":"Single-target priorities for Retribution and Protection, Holy damage, and group healing.","keywords_es":["rotación del paladín","rotación para subir paladín","sentencia y golpe sagrado","consagración paladín","destello de luz"],"keywords_en":["paladin rotation","paladin leveling rotation","judgement holy strike","paladin consecration","flash of light"],"text_es":"Reprensión: juzga Sello del Cruzado, cambia a Sello de orden y prioriza Sentencia, Golpe Sagrado, Martillo de cólera bajo 20% y Exorcismo contra demonios o no-muertos. Cólera desellada 1/1 permite gastar 2+ cargas con un golpe de Sello de rectitud y volver a Sello de orden. Protección mantiene Sello de furia; usa Sentencia, Consagración si hay maná, Escudo Sagrado 1/1 y Golpe Sagrado. Sagrado daña con Sello de rectitud, Sentencia y Golpe Sagrado; para curar, Vigilia de la Luz antes del daño grupal, luego Choque Sagrado; Destello de Luz es eficiente y Luz Sagrada sirve para picos.","text_en":"Use Retribution priority: judge Seal of the Crusader, switch to Seal of Command; prioritize Judgement, Holy Strike, Hammer of Wrath below 20%, and Exorcism against a Demon or Undead. Unsealed Wrath 1/1 lets you spend 2+ stacks on one Seal of Righteousness swing, then return to Command. When tanking, Protection keeps Seal of Fury; use Judgement, Consecration if mana allows, Holy Shield 1/1, and Holy Strike. Holy damages with Seal of Righteousness, Judgement, and Holy Strike; heal with Light's Vigil before group damage, then Holy Shock; Flash of Light is efficient and Holy Light for spikes.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single Target Rotation (Unsealed Wrath)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Paladin in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Holy Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling","class:paladin:protection:leveling","class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1b8b67888c33e93268873d806c5db4c20170fafa","section:6a1ffdc9139a6c63030b4e76b7440488013de862","section:e71be0bcb57335d842099c87e955d7abeebd4add"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Daño en área con Consagración","title_en":"Area Damage with Consecration","summary_es":"Consagración es el área principal; ajusta su uso al maná y a los objetivos.","summary_en":"Consecration is the main AoE tool; adjust its use to mana and targets.","keywords_es":["paladín daño en área","consagración paladín","paladín varios enemigos","aura de castigo","martillo de cólera"],"keywords_en":["paladin aoe","paladin consecration","paladin multiple enemies","retribution aura","hammer of wrath"],"text_es":"Reprensión: juzga Sello del Cruzado si el grupo durará, cambia a Sello de orden; usa Sentencia y Consagración con maná, luego Martillo de cólera bajo 20% y Golpe Sagrado. Cólera desellada 1/1 permite gastar 2+ cargas con un golpe de Sello de rectitud y volver a Sello de orden. Consagración tarda 8 s; evítala si los enemigos morirán antes o debes moverte. Protección mantiene Sello de furia, Sentencia y Consagración si hay maná; Aura de castigo acelera bajas y añade amenaza de área. Usa Cólera sagrada contra demonios o no-muertos si no tanqueas; Escudo Sagrado 1/1 si lo elegiste.","text_en":"Retribution: judge Seal of the Crusader if the pack will live, then switch to Seal of Command; use Judgement and Consecration if mana allows, followed by Hammer of Wrath below 20% and Holy Strike. Unsealed Wrath 1/1 lets you spend 2+ stacks with one Seal of Righteousness swing, then return to Command. Consecration takes 8 seconds; skip it if enemies may die first or you need to move. Protection maintains Seal of Fury, Judgement, and Consecration if affordable; Retribution Aura speeds kills and adds AoE threat. Use Holy Wrath against Demon or Undead if not tanking; Holy Shield 1/1 if talented.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation (Unsealed Wrath)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Paladin in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Paladin Leveling Guide › Protection Paladin Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/retribution-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:leveling","class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:36acfd8837a0b06068d42c069d79644d12c5aa34","section:6a1ffdc9139a6c63030b4e76b7440488013de862","section:84dbf68d681a9f82648e3182ec92ca9498ae1f80","section:d813f81c4dc8af9d4a0fdaa05f5fa687cad66b96"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-mision-redencion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"La misión de clase de Redención","title_en":"The Redemption Class Quest","summary_es":"A nivel 12, El Libro de la Divinidad o Una lección de divinidad desbloquean Redención.","summary_en":"At level 12, The Tome of Divinity or A Lesson in Divinity unlock Redemption.","keywords_es":["misión de clase paladín","redención paladín","el libro de la divinidad","una lección de divinidad","resucitar aliados"],"keywords_en":["paladin class quest","paladin redemption","the tome of divinity","a lesson in divinity","resurrect allies"],"text_es":"Alianza: El Libro de la Divinidad usa el Escrito sobre Divinidad y se ofrece al nivel 12; Horda: Una lección de divinidad también comienza a 12 y recorre varias zonas. Ambas cadenas desbloquean Redención. Complétala antes de ir a mazmorras, pues el grupo puede depender de que resucites a un aliado.","text_en":"Alliance: The Tome of Divinity uses a required quest writ and is available at level 12; Horde: A Lesson in Divinity also begins at 12 and takes you around several areas. Both chains unlock Redemption. Finish yours before dungeons, since your group may rely on you to resurrect an ally.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Paladin Class Quests Guide › The Tome of Divinity","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/paladin-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Paladin Class Quests Guide › A Lesson in Divinity","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/paladin-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:general:paladin-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["guide:06acee0a71bcfde6bbe413b68c47daa45e814638"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-misiones-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de clase de nivel 20 y 22","title_en":"Level 20 and 22 Class Quests","summary_es":"La prueba de rectitud u Old Fire-Eye dan un arma a nivel 20; A Strange Artifact da una capa a 22.","summary_en":"The Test of Righteousness or Old Fire-Eye give a weapon at 20; A Strange Artifact gives a cloak at 22.","keywords_es":["misiones de clase paladín nivel 20","la prueba de rectitud","old fire-eye","a strange artifact","arma de clase paladín"],"keywords_en":["paladin class quests level 20","the test of righteousness","old fire-eye","a strange artifact","paladin class weapon"],"text_es":"Alianza: La prueba de rectitud se inicia al nivel 20, reúne piezas en tres mazmorras y recompensa con Puño de Verigan; es más cómoda desde el 22. Horda: Viejo Ojofuego se abre mediante Incidente diplomático al 20 y da un arma. Al 22, Un artefacto extraño comienza al recuperar el Orbe de Althalaxx y da la Capa de la tormenta divina; la cadena recorre varias zonas y la capa acabará reemplazada. Las armas duran varios niveles y puedes avanzar sus cadenas durante las mazmorras.","text_en":"Alliance: The Test of Righteousness starts at 20, gathers pieces from three dungeons, and rewards Verigan’s Fist; it is easier from 22. Horde: Old Fire-Eye opens through Diplomatic Incident at 20 and rewards a weapon. At 22, A Strange Artifact begins by recovering the Althalaxx Orb and rewards the Cloak of the Divine Storm; its chain visits several areas and the cloak will eventually be replaced. The weapons last for several levels, and you can progress their chains during dungeon runs.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Paladin Class Quests Guide › The Test of Righteousness","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/paladin-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Paladin Class Quests Guide › Old Fire-Eye","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/paladin-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Paladin Class Quests Guide › Cloak of the Divine Storm","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/paladin-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:general:paladin-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["guide:06acee0a71bcfde6bbe413b68c47daa45e814638"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-tips-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Tips","summary_es":"Agua, equipo de profesiones, comida con experiencia extra y misiones de mazmorra reducen el tiempo perdido.","summary_en":"Water, profession gear, bonus-XP food, and dungeon quests reduce wasted leveling time.","keywords_es":["consejos para subir paladín","paladín agua y maná","minería y herrería paladín","paladín misiones de mazmorra","descansar en taberna"],"keywords_en":["paladin leveling tips","paladin water mana","mining blacksmithing paladin","paladin dungeon quests","rest in inn"],"text_es":"Lleva agua porque el maná limita el ritmo; las pociones de salud o maná ayudan en apuros. Para fabricar equipo, Herrería con Minería es una opción; Ingeniería aporta bombas y utilidad, aunque cuesta más. Puedes combinar Botánica con Alquimia para preparar pociones, pero Alquimia rinde más al nivel máximo. Cocina y Primeros auxilios permiten obtener comida con experiencia extra, vendas y pociones. Entrena rangos nuevos de Destello de Luz, Luz Sagrada y tus sellos; cierra sesión en una posada y completa las misiones de mazmorra.","text_en":"Carry water because mana limits your pace; health or mana potions help in emergencies. For gear, Blacksmithing with Mining is an option; Engineering offers bombs and utility but costs more. You can pair Herbalism with Alchemy for potions, though Alchemy is more valuable at max level. Cooking and First Aid provide bonus-XP food, bandages, and potions. Train new ranks of Flash of Light, Holy Light, and your seals; log out at an inn and finish dungeon quests.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Protection Paladin Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Holy Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Holy Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Retribution Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide › General Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/retribution-paladin-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling","class:paladin:protection:leveling","class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1e41acc97d7aa841820103f515312b147446d28a","section:2651f11463721324c15fc97a9cdc8be137b14de1","section:2da82f32c8767f3ce332e5bbee22e081465dec65","section:57dda9f53888586675fcba4ea8b413b5a5a54cf1","section:71d846f376cc354db6133010f997bdc93c1da8ec","section:b762ccab74541fa9e2c228783a54c000d64e0dbe","section:d9a4aaaf797b1f72de5421c3d4d63ac1bd56af56","section:daf53d25b584d73af12ac456c5a171a70a224d88"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Paladín en grupo y mazmorras","title_en":"Paladin in Groups and Dungeons","summary_es":"Aporta bendiciones, auras, curación e inmunidades; Protección tanquea, Sagrado cura y Reprensión pega.","summary_en":"Brings blessings, auras, healing and immunities; Protection tanks, Holy heals and Retribution damages.","keywords_es":["paladín en grupo","paladín en mazmorras","bendiciones para el grupo","paladín tanque o sanador","utilidad del paladín"],"keywords_en":["paladin in groups","paladin in dungeons","group blessings","paladin tank or healer","paladin utility"],"text_es":"En mazmorras, Protección mantiene amenaza con Consagración y Sello de furia; Sagrado cura a un objetivo y puede extender Vigilia de la Luz al grupo con Choque Sagrado; Reprensión aporta daño, aturdimientos e inmunidades. Las bendiciones y auras mejoran al grupo, mientras las auras de resistencia alcanzan a la banda. Coordina qué mejoras y efectos de Sentencia conviene llevar.","text_en":"In dungeons, Protection holds threat with Consecration and Seal of Fury; Holy heals one target and can spread Light's Vigil group healing with Holy Shock; Retribution adds damage, stuns, and immunities. Blessings and auras boost the group, while resistance auras reach the raid. Coordinate the buffs and Judgement effects the encounter needs.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Holy Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Holy Paladin Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Protection Paladin Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Protection Paladin Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-02"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:overview","class:paladin:holy:rotation","class:paladin:protection:overview","class:paladin:protection:rotation","class:paladin:retribution:overview","class:paladin:retribution:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:04d4ba591beabf5febf8f89b32f1f47124bcd84e","section:4dc5e022cc927c5a5bfc03d24d3554a4bca4c01a","section:576c08dc1e411b0103d71403b3e5d55105fcb5ab","section:5f74e4ec70a3b103611846256100f72632224a09","section:7e1b704f528234635d164accdb537bf1f5d6592d","section:b07086cea79a600fea410483650d49bcc16be54c"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-sagrado","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sagrado: curación y apoyo","title_en":"Holy: Healing and Support","summary_es":"Sagrado cura con Destello de Luz y Luz Sagrada, usa Choque Sagrado en emergencias y Vigilia para área.","summary_en":"Holy heals with Flash of Light and Holy Light, uses Holy Shock in emergencies and Light's Vigil for area.","keywords_es":["paladín sagrado","paladín sanador","destello de luz","luz sagrada","vigilia de la luz"],"keywords_en":["holy paladin","paladin healer","flash of light","holy light","light's vigil"],"text_es":"Destello de Luz es una cura rápida y barata; Luz Sagrada tarda más, pero cura mucho; Choque Sagrado sirve para una urgencia instantánea o para activar Vigilia de la Luz. Aplica Vigilia a un aliado antes del daño grupal y actívala con Choque Sagrado; los críticos de Destello o Choque activan Infusión de Luz para acelerar la siguiente Luz Sagrada. Tiene curación potente y utilidad muy buscada, por eso suele encontrar grupo, aunque su movilidad y daño en solitario son bajos.","text_en":"Flash of Light is a quick, cheap heal; Holy Light casts more slowly but heals more; Holy Shock handles an instant emergency or activates Light's Vigil. Apply Vigil to an ally before group damage and trigger it with Holy Shock; critical Flash or Shock casts grant Infusion of Light and speed up the next Holy Light. Holy brings strong healing and sought-after utility, so it finds groups easily, but its mobility and solo damage are low.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Holy Paladin for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Holy Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Holy Paladin Rotation in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Paladin Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Paladin Guide › Holy Paladin Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-paladin-healer-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:overview","class:paladin:holy:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:4dc5e022cc927c5a5bfc03d24d3554a4bca4c01a","section:710e692a4fa67f2192555d97ba03aa902f739fa2","section:84402d662ba833a10183a1b121fa0285df2bd9ff","section:9a512485bc7d7c309b2a510821d897d41a371c71","section:bbd23d7937186416a7c779a4fd77ffefaf43f620"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-proteccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: tanque con escudo","title_en":"Protection: Shield Tank","summary_es":"Protección tanquea con escudo, genera amenaza con Consagración y provoca con Sello de furia y Sentencia.","summary_en":"Protection tanks with a shield, builds threat with Consecration, and taunts with Seal of Fury and Judgement.","keywords_es":["paladín protección","paladín tanque","sello de furia","consagración tanque","paladín escudo"],"keywords_en":["protection paladin","paladin tank","seal of fury","consecration tank","paladin shield"],"text_es":"Mantén Sello de furia para provocar con Sentencia y generar amenaza con Consagración; Escudo Sagrado y Golpe Sagrado completan tus acciones cuando están disponibles. Contra demonios o no-muertos, usa Exorcismo. El maná limita los combates largos, así que reserva Baluarte de templario para daño intenso. Protección es muy resistente y puede curarse, destaca contra magia y varios enemigos, pero su amenaza inicial depende de talentos y puede sufrir ante un solo objetivo con mucha vida.","text_en":"Keep Seal of Fury to taunt with Judgement and build threat with Consecration; Holy Shield and Holy Strike fill your actions when available. Exorcism can damage Undead or Demon targets. Mana limits long fights, so reserve Templar's Bulwark for heavy damage. Protection is durable and can heal itself; it excels against magic and groups, but its initial threat depends on talents and it can struggle against a high-health solo target.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Protection Paladin in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Protection Paladin Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-02"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Paladin Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-02"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Protection Paladins DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-02"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:overview","class:paladin:protection:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:3a7de739acf643d114882924fe81c2e8fa171b54","section:5f74e4ec70a3b103611846256100f72632224a09","section:9be04cfb54735c0517c21b976a0e926f9c209149","section:be49b833d37001ac5b86d4da772ecb367bf26525","section:e96c2c8893d1872f12fd3da623c5f074f0da68bb"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-represion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Reprensión: daño con dos manos","title_en":"Retribution: Two-Handed Damage","summary_es":"Reprensión mantiene sellos, usa Sentencia y Golpe Sagrado y añade Consagración contra grupos.","summary_en":"Retribution keeps seals, uses Judgement and Holy Strike, and adds Consecration against groups.","keywords_es":["paladín reprensión","paladín daño cuerpo a cuerpo","sello de orden","sentencia y golpe sagrado","paladín dos manos"],"keywords_en":["retribution paladin","paladin melee damage","seal of command","judgement holy strike","paladin two handed"],"text_es":"Reprensión combina daño físico y sagrado con arma a dos manos. Golpe Sagrado es instantáneo; al invertir 31 puntos (nivel 40), Cólera desellada almacena efectos del sello activo y los gasta al cambiar, sin depender del antiguo ritmo de golpes. Mantén Sello de orden, usa Sentencia y Golpe Sagrado y añade Consagración contra grupos. Imposición de manos y Escudo divino ofrecen curación e inmunidad de emergencia; Búsqueda de justicia mejora la movilidad, pero carece de interrupción y ralentización y su daño en área es débil.","text_en":"Retribution combines physical and Holy damage with a two-handed weapon. Holy Strike is instant; at 31 points (level 40), Unsealed Wrath stores effects from your active Seal and spends them when you switch, without relying on the old swing-timing rhythm. Keep Seal of Command, use Judgement and Holy Strike, and add Consecration against packs. Lay on Hands and Divine Shield provide emergency healing and immunity; Pursuit of Justice improves movement, but the spec lacks an interrupt and a slow and has weak AoE damage.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Retribution Paladin-Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Retribution Paladins in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Retribution Talent Changes in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:overview","class:paladin:retribution:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:6d50402e17783ba758a9eccee614c9fc0338fc7a","section:88add09bcfaabe1f747809ea349477490af1a14a","section:b07086cea79a600fea410483650d49bcc16be54c","section:b57620293c5e08723d5f9c042e8c86a9cc5a56d9"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-build-sagrado-pve-banda","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Sagrado para banda","title_en":"Holy PvE Raid Build","summary_es":"Potencia la sanación de banda con Vigilia de la Luz y añade utilidad de Protección y Reprensión.","summary_en":"Maximizes group healing through Light’s Vigil with Protection and Retribution utility.","keywords_es":["build paladín sagrado jce","talentos paladín sagrado","puntos build paladín sagrado"],"keywords_en":["paladin sagrado build","paladin sagrado talents","paladin sagrado talent points"],"text_es":"Rama de Sagrado: Luz sin límites 2/2, Favor divino 1/1, Precisión divina 2/2, Luz curativa 3/3, Poder Sagrado 5/5, Choque Sagrado 1/1, Iluminación 5/5, Infusión de Luz 2/2, Vigilia de la Luz 1/1, Juramento de luz 1/1, Poder purificador 1/2, Reverencia 2/2, Enfoque espiritual 5/5. Rama de Protección: Intelecto divino 5/5, Deber sagrado 2/2. Rama de Reprensión: Oración 5/5, Convicción 3/3, Búsqueda de justicia 2/2, Sentencia santificada 3/3. La ruta alcanza Vigilia de la Luz y añade mejoras de sanación; los puntos finales aportan utilidad.","text_en":"Holy: Boundless Light 2/2, Divine Favor 1/1, Divine Precision 2/2, Healing Light 3/3, Holy Power 5/5, Holy Shock 1/1, Illumination 5/5, Infusion of Light 2/2, Light's Vigil 1/1, Oath of Light 1/1, Purifying Power 1/2, Reverence 2/2, Spiritual Focus 5/5. Protection: Divine Intellect 5/5, Sacred Duty 2/2. Retribution: Benediction 5/5, Conviction 3/3, Pursuit of Justice 2/2, Sanctified Judgement 3/3. The route reaches Light’s Vigil and healing increases, then uses the last points for utility.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Holy Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Paladin PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:ced35d1b188702e9186a7062770ae6f3ed6e9483"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-build-sagrado-pve-mazmorra","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Sagrado para mazmorras","title_en":"Holy PvE Dungeon Build","summary_es":"Incluye talentos de Consagración para apoyar el daño de área en mazmorras.","summary_en":"Adds Consecration talents to support dungeon AoE damage.","keywords_es":["build paladín sagrado jce","talentos paladín sagrado","puntos build paladín sagrado"],"keywords_en":["paladin sagrado build","paladin sagrado talents","paladin sagrado talent points"],"text_es":"Rama de Sagrado: Luz sin límites 2/2, Suelo consagrado 2/2, Favor divino 1/1, Precisión divina 2/2, Luz curativa 3/3, Conducto Sagrado 2/2, Poder Sagrado 5/5, Choque Sagrado 1/1, Iluminación 5/5, Infusión de Luz 2/2, Vigilia de la Luz 1/1, Juramento de luz 1/1, Reverencia 2/2, Enfoque espiritual 5/5. Rama de Protección: Intelecto divino 5/5. Rama de Reprensión: Oración 5/5, Convicción 3/3, Sentencia mejorada 2/2, Búsqueda de justicia 2/2. Los puntos de Suelo consagrado aumentan el aporte de área sin abandonar el núcleo sanador.","text_en":"Holy: Boundless Light 2/2, Consecrated Ground 2/2, Divine Favor 1/1, Divine Precision 2/2, Healing Light 3/3, Holy Conduit 2/2, Holy Power 5/5, Holy Shock 1/1, Illumination 5/5, Infusion of Light 2/2, Light's Vigil 1/1, Oath of Light 1/1, Reverence 2/2, Spiritual Focus 5/5. Protection: Divine Intellect 5/5. Retribution: Benediction 5/5, Conviction 3/3, Improved Judgement 2/2, Pursuit of Justice 2/2. Consecrated Ground adds AoE while preserving the healing core.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Holy Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Paladin PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:cec97cd2eeb1370f4edf2c642d739c6c32c7ea50"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-build-sagrado-pvp","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Sagrado JcJ","title_en":"Holy PvP Build","summary_es":"Refuerza el poder purificador y el apoyo defensivo para jugar contra otros jugadores.","summary_en":"Improves purification and defensive support for player-versus-player combat.","keywords_es":["build paladín sagrado jcj","talentos paladín sagrado","puntos build paladín sagrado"],"keywords_en":["paladin sagrado build","paladin sagrado talents","paladin sagrado talent points"],"text_es":"Rama de Sagrado: Luz sin límites 2/2, Favor divino 1/1, Precisión divina 2/2, Luz curativa 3/3, Poder Sagrado 5/5, Choque Sagrado 1/1, Iluminación 5/5, Infusión de Luz 2/2, Vigilia de la Luz 1/1, Juramento de luz 1/1, Poder purificador 2/2, Reverencia 2/2, Enfoque espiritual 5/5. Rama de Protección: Intelecto divino 5/5, Favor del Guardián 2/2. Rama de Reprensión: Oración 5/5, Convicción 3/3, Sentencia mejorada 2/2, Búsqueda de justicia 2/2. Poder purificador 2/2 y Favor del Guardián 2/2 añaden herramientas defensivas y ofensivas.","text_en":"Holy: Boundless Light 2/2, Divine Favor 1/1, Divine Precision 2/2, Healing Light 3/3, Holy Power 5/5, Holy Shock 1/1, Illumination 5/5, Infusion of Light 2/2, Light's Vigil 1/1, Oath of Light 1/1, Purifying Power 2/2, Reverence 2/2, Spiritual Focus 5/5. Protection: Divine Intellect 5/5, Guardian's Favor 2/2. Retribution: Benediction 5/5, Conviction 3/3, Improved Judgement 2/2, Pursuit of Justice 2/2. Purifying Power 2/2 and Guardian’s Favor 2/2 add offensive and defensive options.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Holy Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Paladin PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:4186c5a114fd545badbc26a4d8964c4a9b6e380c"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-build-proteccion-estandar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build estándar de Protección (bandas)","title_en":"Standard Protection Build (raids)","summary_es":"Elección equilibrada: defensa fluida con utilidad ofensiva; adapta Dureza según tu equipo.","summary_en":"Balanced choice: smooth defense with offensive utility; adjust Toughness to your gear.","keywords_es":["build paladín proteccion talentos","talentos paladín proteccion","puntos build paladín proteccion"],"keywords_en":["paladin proteccion build","paladin proteccion talents","paladin proteccion talent points"],"text_es":"Rama de Protección: Anticipación 5/5, Escudo Sagrado 1/1, Furia justa mejorada 3/3, Credo férreo 3/3, Precisión 3/3, La hora de la verdad 5/5, Baluarte 5/5, Deber sagrado 2/2, Especialización en escudos 2/2, Juramento de escudo 1/1, Juicio presto 1/1, Baluarte de templario 1/1, Dureza 3/5. Rama de Reprensión: Convicción 3/3, Desvío 5/5, Sentencia mejorada 2/2, Búsqueda de justicia 2/2, Enjuiciador Sagrado 1/1, Sentencia santificada 3/3. Anticipación suaviza el daño recibido. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Protection: Anticipation 5/5, Holy Shield 1/1, Improved Righteous Fury 3/3, Iron Creed 3/3, Precision 3/3, Reckoning 5/5, Redoubt 5/5, Sacred Duty 2/2, Shield Specialization 2/2, Shieldsworn 1/1, Swift Judgement 1/1, Templar's Bulwark 1/1, Toughness 3/5. Retribution: Conviction 3/3, Deflection 5/5, Improved Judgement 2/2, Pursuit of Justice 2/2, Sacred Arbiter 1/1, Sanctified Judgement 3/3. Anticipation smooths incoming damage. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW:  Forever › Standard Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Defense Rating","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-28"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:stats","class:paladin:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5c96f5a98e19f61e93347135fad01ca3a127a3bd","section:fd149a608ef1507bfbcbc646dc051d6c557f3a05"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-build-proteccion-shock","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Protección con Choque Sagrado (bandas)","title_en":"Shockprot Build (raids)","summary_es":"Aumenta amenaza a un objetivo con Choque Sagrado, a cambio de parte de la defensa y más maná.","summary_en":"Raises single-target threat with Holy Shock, trading away some defense and mana.","keywords_es":["build paladín proteccion talentos","talentos paladín proteccion","puntos build paladín proteccion"],"keywords_en":["paladin proteccion build","paladin proteccion talents","paladin proteccion talent points"],"text_es":"Rama de Sagrado: Suelo consagrado 2/2, Favor divino 1/1, Precisión divina 2/2, Fuerza divina 5/5, Conducto Sagrado 2/2, Choque Sagrado 1/1, Iluminación 1/5, Sellos mejorados 5/5, Poder purificador 2/2, Reverencia 2/2. Rama de Protección: Anticipación 1/5, Escudo Sagrado 1/1, Furia justa mejorada 3/3, Credo férreo 2/3, Precisión 3/3, La hora de la verdad 5/5, Baluarte 5/5, Deber sagrado 2/2, Especialización en escudos 2/2, Juicio presto 1/1, Baluarte de templario 1/1, Dureza 2/5.  Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Holy: Consecrated Ground 2/2, Divine Favor 1/1, Divine Precision 2/2, Divine Strength 5/5, Holy Conduit 2/2, Holy Shock 1/1, Illumination 1/5, Improved Seals 5/5, Purifying Power 2/2, Reverence 2/2. Protection: Anticipation 1/5, Holy Shield 1/1, Improved Righteous Fury 3/3, Iron Creed 2/3, Precision 3/3, Reckoning 5/5, Redoubt 5/5, Sacred Duty 2/2, Shield Specialization 2/2, Swift Judgement 1/1, Templar's Bulwark 1/1, Toughness 2/5.  Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW:  Forever › Shockprot Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Defense Rating","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-28"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:stats","class:paladin:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:7daf09ec9d23fd5c577d7275b0b754f653392ff0","section:fd149a608ef1507bfbcbc646dc051d6c557f3a05"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-build-proteccion-hibrida-reprension","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build híbrida Protección/Reprensión (bandas)","title_en":"Retprot Build (raids)","summary_es":"Aporta amenaza de tanque y daño de área mediante talentos de Reprensión.","summary_en":"Combines tank threat and AoE damage through Retribution talents.","keywords_es":["build paladín proteccion talentos","talentos paladín proteccion","puntos build paladín proteccion"],"keywords_en":["paladin proteccion build","paladin proteccion talents","paladin proteccion talent points"],"text_es":"Rama de Protección: Anticipación 1/5, Escudo Sagrado 1/1, Furia justa mejorada 3/3, Precisión 3/3, Baluarte 5/5, Deber sagrado 2/2, Especialización en escudos 2/2, Juicio presto 1/1, Baluarte de templario 1/1, Durez