"paladin represion build","paladin represion talents","paladin represion talent points"],"text_es":"Rama de Sagrado: Fuerza divina 5/5, Conducto Sagrado 2/2, Sellos mejorados 5/5. Rama de Protección: Intelecto divino 5/5, Precisión 3/3. Rama de Reprensión: Campeón de la Luz 5/5, Convicción 3/3, Desvío 5/5, Sentencia mejorada 2/2, Búsqueda de justicia 2/2, Arrepentimiento 1/1, Enjuiciador Sagrado 1/1, Sentencia santificada 3/3, Sello de orden 1/1, Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3, Cólera desellada 1/1, Fe implacable 1/2, Venganza 3/3. Desvío reemplaza Oración; puedes ajustar para defensa o maná en combates largos. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Holy: Divine Strength 5/5, Holy Conduit 2/2, Improved Seals 5/5. Protection: Divine Intellect 5/5, Precision 3/3. Retribution: Champion of the Light 5/5, Conviction 3/3, Deflection 5/5, Improved Judgement 2/2, Pursuit of Justice 2/2, Repentance 1/1, Sacred Arbiter 1/1, Sanctified Judgement 3/3, Seal of Command 1/1, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3, Unsealed Wrath 1/1, Unyielding Faith 1/2, Vengeance 3/3. Deflection replaces Benediction; you can adjust for defense or mana in longer fights. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Retribution Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Retribution PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Retribution Paladins in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:overview","class:paladin:retribution:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:184c5d3524a4c508fbe95f2d0c76d182f7c383ee","section:f7cf7d2fb07e9669ce8b8bd4b64fddc374f0352d"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-build-represion-pvp-shock","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build híbrida JcJ de Choque Sagrado","title_en":"Retribution Shockadin PvP Build","summary_es":"Aporta daño y sanación secundaria, pero depende de sostener el maná.","summary_en":"Provides damage and off-healing, but depends on sustaining mana.","keywords_es":["build paladín represion jcj","talentos paladín represion","puntos build paladín represion"],"keywords_en":["paladin represion build","paladin represion talents","paladin represion talent points"],"text_es":"Rama de Sagrado: Favor divino 1/1, Precisión divina 2/2, Luz curativa 1/3, Conducto Sagrado 2/2, Choque Sagrado 1/1, Sellos mejorados 5/5, Infusión de Luz 2/2, Reverencia 2/2, Enfoque espiritual 5/5. Rama de Reprensión: Campeón de la Luz 5/5, Convicción 3/3, Desvío 5/5, Sentencia mejorada 2/2, Búsqueda de justicia 2/2, Arrepentimiento 1/1, Enjuiciador Sagrado 1/1, Sentencia santificada 3/3, Sello de orden 1/1, Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3, Venganza 3/3, Reivindicación 1/3.  Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Holy: Divine Favor 1/1, Divine Precision 2/2, Healing Light 1/3, Holy Conduit 2/2, Holy Shock 1/1, Improved Seals 5/5, Infusion of Light 2/2, Reverence 2/2, Spiritual Focus 5/5. Retribution: Champion of the Light 5/5, Conviction 3/3, Deflection 5/5, Improved Judgement 2/2, Pursuit of Justice 2/2, Repentance 1/1, Sacred Arbiter 1/1, Sanctified Judgement 3/3, Seal of Command 1/1, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3, Vengeance 3/3, Vindication 1/3.  Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Retribution Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Holy \"Shockadin\" Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Retribution Paladins in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:overview","class:paladin:retribution:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:184c5d3524a4c508fbe95f2d0c76d182f7c383ee","section:feeed618ed1a1afaf6340a18fe1a4bd6328b77f1"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-stats-sagrado","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Sagrado a nivel 60","title_en":"Holy Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Prioridad especulativa: sanación, intelecto, crítico y espíritu; el golpe no afecta a las curas.","summary_en":"Speculative order: healing, intellect, crit, and spirit; hit does not affect heals.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas sagrado paladín","poder de sanación sagrado","intelecto crítico espíritu paladín"],"keywords_en":["holy paladin stat priority","holy healing power","holy intellect crit spirit"],"text_es":"Prioridad especulativa: poder de sanación > intelecto > golpe crítico > espíritu. Las curas no requieren golpe; Precisión divina cubre el golpe de los hechizos ofensivos. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Speculative priority: healing power > intellect > critical strike > spirit. Heals do not need hit; Divine Precision covers offensive spell hit. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Holy Paladin Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:87a602b46b76c9e79276f6db439077c984c8b201"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-stats-proteccion-defensiva","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas defensivas de Protección","title_en":"Protection Defensive Stats","summary_es":"Para aguantar, prioriza aguante y defensa hasta 440 antes de añadir amenaza.","summary_en":"For survival, prioritize stamina and defense to 440 before adding threat.","keywords_es":["estadísticas defensivas paladín tanque","defensa 440 protección","aguante armadura bloqueo"],"keywords_en":["protection defensive stats","paladin defense 440","stamina armor block"],"text_es":"Prioridad defensiva: aguante > defensa hasta 440 > armadura > agilidad > bloqueo > defensa después de 440 > poder con hechizos > parada > esquiva > fuerza > golpe 8% (tope cuerpo a cuerpo) > pericia 6.5% (límite suave) > crítico > golpe 17% (tope de hechizos) > pericia 14% (límite duro) > celeridad > intelecto. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Defensive priority: stamina > defense to 440 > armor > agility > block chance > defense after 440 > spell power > parry > dodge > strength > hit 8% (melee cap) > expertise 6.5% (soft cap) > crit > hit 17% (spell cap) > expertise 14% (hard cap) > haste > intellect. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Defensive Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-28"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Defense Rating","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-28"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:08f4b07c17f536d38b9c4bb5ca32d41496e4c3d2","section:fd149a608ef1507bfbcbc646dc051d6c557f3a05"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-stats-proteccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas equilibradas de Protección","title_en":"Protection Balanced Stats","summary_es":"La prioridad equilibrada sirve como punto de partida entre supervivencia y amenaza.","summary_en":"Use the balanced order as a starting point between survival and threat.","keywords_es":["estadísticas equilibradas protección","amenaza y supervivencia tanque","prioridad paladín prot"],"keywords_en":["protection balanced stats","paladin tank threat survival","protection paladin stat order"],"text_es":"Prioridad equilibrada: aguante > poder con hechizos > golpe 8% (tope cuerpo a cuerpo) > defensa hasta 440 > armadura > pericia 6.5% (límite suave) > agilidad > bloqueo > defensa después de 440 > parada > esquiva > crítico > golpe 17% (tope de hechizos) > pericia 14% (límite duro) > celeridad > fuerza > intelecto. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Balanced priority: stamina > spell power > hit 8% (melee cap) > defense to 440 > armor > expertise 6.5% (soft cap) > agility > block chance > defense after 440 > parry > dodge > crit > hit 17% (spell cap) > expertise 14% (hard cap) > haste > strength > intellect. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Balanced Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-28"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Defense Rating","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-28"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:a968956751c11c716de777351cf649276b7e8e99","section:fd149a608ef1507bfbcbc646dc051d6c557f3a05"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-stats-proteccion-ofensiva","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas ofensivas de Protección","title_en":"Protection Offensive Stats","summary_es":"Para aumentar amenaza, sube poder con hechizos y alcanza primero los topes de golpe y pericia.","summary_en":"For more threat, raise spell power and reach hit and expertise caps first.","keywords_es":["estadísticas amenaza protección","poder con hechizos tanque paladín","golpe y pericia protección"],"keywords_en":["protection threat stats","paladin tank spell power","protection hit expertise"],"text_es":"Prioridad ofensiva: poder con hechizos > golpe 8% (tope cuerpo a cuerpo) > pericia 6.5% (límite suave) > crítico > aguante > golpe 17% (tope de hechizos) > pericia 14% (límite duro) > celeridad > fuerza > agilidad > defensa antes de 440 > armadura > bloqueo > defensa después de 440 > parada > esquiva > intelecto. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Offensive priority: spell power > hit 8% (melee cap) > expertise 6.5% (soft cap) > crit > stamina > hit 17% (spell cap) > expertise 14% (hard cap) > haste > strength > agility > defense before 440 > armor > block chance > defense after 440 > parry > dodge > intellect. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Offensive Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-28"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Defense Rating","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-28"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:6f54b724aa873dedadc830aa783ce64270184c72","section:fd149a608ef1507bfbcbc646dc051d6c557f3a05"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-stats-represion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Reprensión a nivel 60","title_en":"Retribution Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Orden provisional: habilidad y daño del arma, golpe 9%, pericia y daño con hechizos.","summary_en":"Provisional order: weapon skill and damage, 9% hit, expertise, and spell damage.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas reprensión","DPS arma paladín","golpe pericia reprensión"],"keywords_en":["retribution stat priority","paladin weapon dps","retribution hit expertise"],"text_es":"Prioridad especulativa: habilidad con armas > DPS y velocidad del arma > golpe 9% > pericia 6.5% > daño con hechizos > intelecto > fuerza y poder de ataque > agilidad y golpe crítico > aguante. El arma aporta gran parte del daño; golpe y pericia evitan que fallen o esquiven los ataques y los sellos. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Speculative priority: weapon skill > weapon DPS and speed > hit 9% > expertise 6.5% > spell damage > intellect > strength and attack power > agility and critical strike > stamina. Weapon damage drives much of your output; hit and expertise help attacks and seals land. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Retribution Paladin Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-31"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:1e5f41a80eab5fe493b1dfddb16b669a101a669e"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-rotacion-sagrado-curas-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de sanación Sagrado","title_en":"Holy Healing Rotation","summary_es":"Prepara Vigilia para daño grupal; elige cura rápida, potente o de emergencia según la presión.","summary_en":"Prepare Vigil for group damage; choose fast, large, or emergency heals as needed.","keywords_es":["rotación curas paladín sagrado","vigilia de la luz prioridad","choque sagrado sanación"],"keywords_en":["holy paladin healing rotation","lights vigil priority","holy shock healing"],"text_es":"Aplica Sello de luz y usa Sentencia en el enemigo principal. Si prevés daño grupal, marca a un aliado con Vigilia de la Luz 1/1 y actívala con Choque Sagrado 1/1; usa Infusión de Luz 2/2 para acelerar Luz Sagrada. Elige Destello de Luz para curas rápidas, Luz Sagrada para grandes picos y Choque Sagrado cuando no puedas esperar un lanzamiento.","text_en":"Keep Seal of Light judged on the main target. If group damage is coming, apply Light’s Vigil 1/1 to an ally and activate it with Holy Shock 1/1; use Infusion of Light 2/2 to speed up Holy Light. Choose Flash of Light for quick heals, Holy Light for large spikes, and Holy Shock when a cast cannot wait.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Holy Paladin Rotation in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Holy Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Paladin PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:rotation","class:paladin:holy:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:9a512485bc7d7c309b2a510821d897d41a371c71","section:ced35d1b188702e9186a7062770ae6f3ed6e9483"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-rotacion-sagrado-dano-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Daño de Sagrado a nivel 60","title_en":"Holy Paladin Damage Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén el sello, usa Sentencia y Golpe Sagrado; reserva hechizos según el objetivo y el maná.","summary_en":"Maintain your seal and use Judgement and Holy Strike; adapt spells to the target and mana.","keywords_es":["daño sagrado paladín","rotación dps paladín holy","exorcismo contra demonios"],"keywords_en":["holy paladin damage rotation","holy paladin dps","exorcism undead demon"],"text_es":"Mantén Sello de rectitud y usa Sentencia y Golpe Sagrado cuando estén disponibles. Contra demonios o no-muertos, añade Exorcismo; usa Choque Sagrado 1/1 si lo tienes y deja Consagración para cuando el maná permita más daño de área.","text_en":"Keep Seal of Righteousness active and use Judgement and Holy Strike when available. Against Demons or Undead, add Exorcism; use Holy Shock 1/1 if talented, and cast Consecration when mana allows extra area damage.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Damage Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Holy Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Paladin PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:rotation","class:paladin:holy:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:8a5478c8ffd4ef65e1afacfc69d8b9d0b75cecbd","section:ced35d1b188702e9186a7062770ae6f3ed6e9483"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-cooldowns-sagrado-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Enfriamientos de Sagrado","title_en":"Holy Paladin Cooldowns","summary_es":"Reserva Imposición de manos para una emergencia; usa la inmunidad y el silencio según la mecánica.","summary_en":"Save Lay on Hands for emergencies; use immunity and silence protection when needed.","keywords_es":["enfriamientos paladín sagrado","imposición de manos 20 min","voz de la verdad inmunidad"],"keywords_en":["holy paladin cooldowns","lay on hands 20 minutes","voice of truth immunity"],"text_es":"Imposición de manos restaura la salud máxima del objetivo y algo de maná, pero consume tu maná actual y tiene 20 min de reutilización: guárdala para una emergencia. Escudo divino, Protección divina y Bendición de Protección protegen mientras sigues sanando; Voz de la verdad te hace inmune a silencios e interrupciones durante 6 s.","text_en":"Lay on Hands restores the target to maximum health and some mana, but consumes your current mana and has a 20-minute cooldown; save it for an emergency. Divine Shield, Divine Protection, and Blessing of Protection can protect allies while you continue healing; Voice of Truth grants immunity to silence and interrupts for 6 seconds.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Paladin Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:84402d662ba833a10183a1b121fa0285df2bd9ff"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-rotacion-proteccion-objetivo-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de Protección a un objetivo","title_en":"Protection Single-Target Priority","summary_es":"Prepara amenaza y sello; prioriza Sentencia y Consagración sin agotar el maná.","summary_en":"Set up threat and your seal; prioritize Judgement and Consecration without exhausting mana.","keywords_es":["prioridad protección un objetivo","sello de furia tanque paladín","consagración maná prot"],"keywords_en":["protection single target priority","seal of fury tank paladin","protection consecration mana"],"text_es":"Antes del pull, activa Furia justa y Aura de castigo; juzga Sello del Cruzado o de sabiduría si el objetivo vivirá más de 20–30 s. Mantén Sello de furia y usa Sentencia (fuera del tiempo global); lanza Consagración si tienes maná. Después: Choque Sagrado 1/1 si está en tu build, Escudo Sagrado 1/1, Golpe Sagrado, Exorcismo contra demonios o no-muertos y Martillo de cólera si tanqueas 0–1 objetivos.","text_en":"Before the pull, activate Righteous Fury and Retribution Aura; judge Seal of the Crusader or Wisdom if the target will live over 20–30 seconds. Keep Seal of Fury and use Judgement (off the global cooldown); cast Consecration if mana allows. Then use Holy Shock 1/1 if in your build, Holy Shield 1/1, Holy Strike, Exorcism against Demons or Undead, and Hammer of Wrath when tanking 0–1 targets.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Protection Paladins DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-02"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW:  Forever › Standard Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW:  Forever › Shockprot Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:rotation","class:paladin:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5c96f5a98e19f61e93347135fad01ca3a127a3bd","section:7daf09ec9d23fd5c577d7275b0b754f653392ff0","section:be49b833d37001ac5b86d4da772ecb367bf26525"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-rotacion-proteccion-area-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de área de Protección","title_en":"Protection AoE Priority","summary_es":"Mantén el sello y usa Consagración si el maná alcanza; ajusta hechizos a los enemigos y al rol.","summary_en":"Maintain your seal and use Consecration if mana allows; adapt to enemies and your role.","keywords_es":["prioridad área protección paladín","consagración tanque varios enemigos","cólera sagrada tanque"],"keywords_en":["protection paladin aoe priority","consecration multiple enemies","holy wrath protection"],"text_es":"Mantén Sello de furia y usa Sentencia; lanza Consagración si tienes maná. Contra demonios o no-muertos y si no tanqueas activamente, añade Cólera sagrada; luego Escudo Sagrado 1/1 y Choque Sagrado 1/1 si tu build los lleva, Golpe Sagrado y Exorcismo. Martillo de cólera queda para cuando tanquees 0–1 objetivos.","text_en":"Keep Seal of Fury and use Judgement; cast Consecration if mana permits. Against Demons or Undead when you are not actively tanking, add Holy Wrath; then use Holy Shield 1/1 and Holy Shock 1/1 if talented, Holy Strike, and Exorcism. Save Hammer of Wrath for when tanking 0–1 targets.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Protection Paladins DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-02"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW:  Forever › Standard Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW:  Forever › Shockprot Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:rotation","class:paladin:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5c96f5a98e19f61e93347135fad01ca3a127a3bd","section:7daf09ec9d23fd5c577d7275b0b754f653392ff0","section:be49b833d37001ac5b86d4da772ecb367bf26525"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-cooldowns-proteccion-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Enfriamientos de Protección","title_en":"Protection Paladin Cooldowns","summary_es":"Reserva Baluarte para picos; usa las inmunidades y la provocación para recuperar control.","summary_en":"Save Bulwark for spikes; use immunities and taunt to regain control.","keywords_es":["enfriamientos paladín protección","baluarte de templario reutilización","imposición manos tanque"],"keywords_en":["protection paladin cooldowns","templars bulwark cooldown","lay on hands tank"],"text_es":"Durante 8 s, Baluarte de templario 1/1 absorbe una cantidad igual a tu salud máxima (100%); su reutilización base es 5 min y Deber sagrado 2/2 la reduce a 4 min. Imposición de manos restaura toda la salud (100%), pero consume el maná y tiene 20 min de reutilización. Escudo divino dura 12 s y reduce 50% tu daño; Sello de furia y Juicio presto 1/1, que reinicia Sentencia, pueden mantenerte como objetivo mientras eres inmune.","text_en":"For 8 seconds, Templar’s Bulwark 1/1 absorbs an amount equal to your maximum health; the absorb is 100%. Its base cooldown is 5 minutes and Sacred Duty 2/2 reduces it to 4. Lay on Hands restores full health (100%) but consumes your mana and has a 20-minute cooldown. Divine Shield lasts 12 seconds and reduces your damage by 50%; Seal of Fury and Swift Judgement 1/1 can keep the enemy on you while immune.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Tank Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Paladin Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-02"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW:  Forever › Standard Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:rotation","class:paladin:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:3a7de739acf643d114882924fe81c2e8fa171b54","section:5c96f5a98e19f61e93347135fad01ca3a127a3bd"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-rotacion-represion-unsealed-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación Unsealed Wrath a un objetivo","title_en":"Retribution Unsealed Wrath Single-Target","summary_es":"Prepara una Sentencia que dure, mantén Sello de orden y gasta las acumulaciones con cambios de sello.","summary_en":"Set up a lasting Judgement, maintain Seal of Command, and spend stored stacks by switching seals.","keywords_es":["rotación reprensión unsealed un objetivo","cólera desellada acumulaciones","sello de orden rotación"],"keywords_en":["retribution unsealed single target","unsealed wrath stacks","seal of command rotation"],"text_es":"Antes del pull, juzga Sello del Cruzado si el rival vivirá varios segundos y cambia a Sello de orden. Mantén el sello; usa Sentencia y Golpe Sagrado en reutilización, y Martillo de cólera bajo 20% de salud. Con Cólera desellada 1/1, guarda 2–3 acumulaciones y cambia una vez a Sello de rectitud para gastarlas; vuelve después a Sello de orden. Usa Exorcismo contra demonios o no-muertos y evita Consagración si el maná escasea.","text_en":"Before the pull, judge Seal of the Crusader if the target will live several seconds, then switch to Seal of Command. Keep the seal active; use Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown, and Hammer of Wrath below 20% health. With Unsealed Wrath 1/1, store 2–3 stacks, switch once to Seal of Righteousness to spend them, then return to Seal of Command. Use Exorcism against Demons or Undead; skip Consecration if mana is low.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Rotation (Unsealed Wrath)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Retribution Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Retribution (Unsealed Wrath) PvE DPS Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:rotation","class:paladin:retribution:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:062cec4cc958c51481d195c87d6d777770bfef10","section:6eec4bf14a594c37dcd26a8311729531f8e28c68"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-rotacion-represion-area-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de área de Reprensión","title_en":"Retribution AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Prioriza Sentencia y Consagración; convierte las acumulaciones de Cólera desellada en golpes de sello.","summary_en":"Prioritize Judgement and Consecration; convert Unsealed Wrath stacks into extra seal hits.","keywords_es":["reprensión daño área paladín","consagración reprensión varios","rotación sello cólera desellada"],"keywords_en":["retribution paladin aoe rotation","retribution consecration multiple targets","unsealed wrath seal rotation"],"text_es":"Juzga Sello del Cruzado contra objetivos duraderos y cambia a Sello de orden. Mantén ese sello, usa Sentencia y Consagración si el maná lo permite; añade Martillo de cólera bajo 20% de salud y Golpe Sagrado en reutilización. Con Cólera desellada 1/1, gasta 2–3 acumulaciones con un golpe de Sello de rectitud y regresa a Sello de orden; contra demonios o no-muertos, añade Exorcismo o Cólera sagrada.","text_en":"Judge Seal of the Crusader on targets that will live, then switch to Seal of Command. Maintain it, use Judgement and Consecration if mana allows; add Hammer of Wrath below 20% health and Holy Strike on cooldown. With Unsealed Wrath 1/1, spend 2–3 stacks on a Seal of Righteousness swing and return to Seal of Command; against Demons or Undead, add Exorcism or Holy Wrath.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation (Unsealed Wrath)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Retribution Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Retribution (Unsealed Wrath) PvE DPS Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:rotation","class:paladin:retribution:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:0b21960c40e62c874356a0d37ae28c9483afe74c","section:6eec4bf14a594c37dcd26a8311729531f8e28c68"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-rotacion-represion-shockadin-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Reprensión con Choque Sagrado","title_en":"Retribution Holy Shock Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Sello de rectitud, usa Favor divino para críticos y descarga las curas o el daño listos.","summary_en":"Maintain Seal of Righteousness, use Divine Favor for a guaranteed crit, and spend ready heals or attacks.","keywords_es":["rotación reprensión choque sagrado","favor divino choque sagrado","build híbrida dps sanación"],"keywords_en":["retribution holy shock rotation","divine favor holy shock","hybrid dps healing paladin"],"text_es":"Juzga Sello del Cruzado contra objetivos duraderos y cambia a Sello de rectitud. Favor divino 1/1 prepara un crítico garantizado de Choque Sagrado; mantén Suelo consagrado 2/2 con Consagración si hay maná. Usa Golpe Sagrado y Choque Sagrado en reutilización, Martillo de cólera bajo 20% y Exorcismo contra demonios o no-muertos; prioriza el hechizo disponible sin vaciar tu maná.","text_en":"Judge Seal of the Crusader on durable targets, then switch to Seal of Righteousness. Divine Favor 1/1 guarantees a Holy Shock critical; maintain Consecrated Ground 2/2 with Consecration when mana permits. Use Holy Strike and Holy Shock on cooldown, Hammer of Wrath below 20%, and Exorcism against Demons or Undead; cast the highest-priority ready spell without draining mana.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Rotation for Shockadin (Holy Shock)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Retribution Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Holy \"Shockadin\" PvE DPS Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:rotation","class:paladin:retribution:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:1826dea41a37e48de47fc7d976c1155e45b7eba2","section:ffaaa89e6dd1c8566bbc0004f53d9aa449a6ca78"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-cooldowns-represion-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Enfriamientos de Reprensión","title_en":"Retribution Paladin Cooldowns","summary_es":"Reprensión no tiene un gran enfriamiento de daño; usa los recursos de combate al inicio de peleas largas.","summary_en":"Retribution has no major damage cooldown; use combat consumables early in long fights.","keywords_es":["enfriamientos reprensión paladín","favor divino reprensión","pociones ofensivas paladín"],"keywords_en":["retribution paladin cooldowns","divine favor retribution","retribution offensive potions"],"text_es":"Reprensión no dispone de un gran enfriamiento de daño: activa abalorios, pociones ofensivas y raciales al inicio de peleas largas para aprovechar su duración. En la variante con Choque Sagrado, Favor divino 1/1 garantiza el crítico de Choque Sagrado cada 2 min; úsalo antes del pull y repítelo al volver. Imposición de manos 20 min y las inmunidades son herramientas de emergencia, no de daño sostenido.","text_en":"Retribution has no major damage cooldown: use on-use trinkets, offensive potions, and racials at the start of long fights to benefit from their full duration. In the Holy Shock variant, Divine Favor 1/1 guarantees a Holy Shock critical every 2 minutes; use it before the pull and again when ready. Lay on Hands (20 minutes) and immunities are emergency tools, not sustained damage cooldowns.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Retribution Paladin Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Retribution Paladin Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Holy \"Shockadin\" PvE DPS Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:rotation","class:paladin:retribution:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:7213262a00d4aa76a5786c4c9afe516c45d86f98","section:ffaaa89e6dd1c8566bbc0004f53d9aa449a6ca78"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-build-sagrado-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida: Sagrado","title_en":"Holy Leveling Build","summary_es":"Reparto completo para Sagrado, con apoyo de Protección y Reprensión.","summary_en":"Complete Holy build with support talents from Protection and Retribution.","keywords_es":["build sagrado para subir","talentos sagrado paladín leveling","puntos build santo paladín"],"keywords_en":["holy paladin leveling build","holy leveling talents","holy paladin talent points"],"text_es":"Sagrado: Enfoque espiritual 5/5, Luz curativa 3/3, Reverencia 2/2, Favor divino 1/1, Iluminación 5/5, Conducto Sagrado 2/2, Precisión divina 2/2, Infusión de Luz 2/2, Juramento de luz 1/1, Suelo consagrado 2/2, Choque Sagrado 1/1, Luz sin límites 2/2, Poder Sagrado 5/5 y Vigilia de la Luz 1/1. Protección: Intelecto divino 5/5. Reprensión: Oración 5/5, Sentencia mejorada 2/2, Convicción 3/3 y Búsqueda de justicia 2/2. Reverencia mejora el maná; Búsqueda acelera los trayectos, elige según priorices mazmorras o movimiento.","text_en":"Holy: Spiritual Focus 5/5, Healing Light 3/3, Reverence 2/2, Divine Favor 1/1, Illumination 5/5, Holy Conduit 2/2, Divine Precision 2/2, Infusion of Light 2/2, Oath of Light 1/1, Consecrated Ground 2/2, Holy Shock 1/1, Boundless Light 2/2, Holy Power 5/5, and Light’s Vigil 1/1. Protection: Divine Intellect 5/5. Retribution: Benediction 5/5, Improved Judgement 2/2, Conviction 3/3, and Pursuit of Justice 2/2. Reverence improves mana; Pursuit speeds travel, so choose based on whether you prioritize dungeons or movement.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Holy Paladin DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:74323ea3e6b3940e8d2ef0a821b3f03420a55786"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-build-proteccion-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida: Protección","title_en":"Protection Leveling Build","summary_es":"Reparto completo de tanque con talentos de Reprensión para maná y utilidad.","summary_en":"Complete tank build with Retribution talents for mana and utility.","keywords_es":["build protección paladín para subir","talentos tanque leveling","puntos build protección paladín"],"keywords_en":["protection paladin leveling build","tank leveling talents","protection paladin talent points"],"text_es":"Protección: Baluarte 5/5, Precisión 3/3, Favor del Guardián 2/2, Deber sagrado 2/2, Baluarte de templario 1/1, Especialización en escudos 2/2, Dureza 3/5, Juicio presto 1/1, Furia justa mejorada 3/3, Escudo Sagrado 1/1, La hora de la verdad 5/5, Credo férreo 3/3 y Juramento de escudo 1/1. Reprensión: Oración 5/5, Sentencia mejorada 2/2, Convicción 3/3, Sentencia santificada 3/3, Reivindicación 3/3, Búsqueda de justicia 2/2 y Enjuiciador Sagrado 1/1. El reparto prioriza Búsqueda de justicia 2/2 y reduce el gasto de maná en grupo.","text_en":"Protection: Redoubt 5/5, Precision 3/3, Guardian’s Favor 2/2, Sacred Duty 2/2, Templar’s Bulwark 1/1, Shield Specialization 2/2, Toughness 3/5, Swift Judgement 1/1, Improved Righteous Fury 3/3, Holy Shield 1/1, Reckoning 5/5, Iron Creed 3/3, and Shieldsworn 1/1. Retribution: Benediction 5/5, Improved Judgement 2/2, Conviction 3/3, Sanctified Judgement 3/3, Vindication 3/3, Pursuit of Justice 2/2, and Sacred Arbiter 1/1. The build prioritizes Pursuit of Justice 2/2 and reduces group mana costs.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Paladin Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:541400db19159956319eb28cb7b4f5c674055e45"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-build-represion-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida: Reprensión","title_en":"Retribution Leveling Build","summary_es":"Reparto completo para reducir descansos y adquirir talentos de daño al desbloquearse.","summary_en":"Complete build to reduce downtime and take damage talents as they unlock.","keywords_es":["build reprensión paladín para subir","talentos reprensión leveling","puntos build retribution paladin"],"keywords_en":["retribution paladin leveling build","retribution leveling talents","retribution paladin talent points"],"text_es":"Sagrado: Fuerza divina 5/5, Sellos mejorados 5/5 y Conducto Sagrado 2/2. Protección: Intelecto divino 5/5 y Precisión 3/3. Reprensión: Oración 5/5, Sentencia mejorada 2/2, Convicción 3/3, Sentencia santificada 3/3, Fe implacable 1/2, Sello de orden 1/1, Búsqueda de justicia 2/2, Enjuiciador Sagrado 1/1, Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3, Arrepentimiento 1/1, Venganza 3/3, Campeón de la Luz 5/5 y Cólera desellada 1/1. Oración ahorra maná, Búsqueda acelera el viaje y Sello de orden aporta daño explosivo.","text_en":"Holy: Divine Strength 5/5, Improved Seals 5/5, and Holy Conduit 2/2. Protection: Divine Intellect 5/5 and Precision 3/3. Retribution: Benediction 5/5, Improved Judgement 2/2, Conviction 3/3, Sanctified Judgement 3/3, Unyielding Faith 1/2, Seal of Command 1/1, Pursuit of Justice 2/2, Sacred Arbiter 1/1, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3, Repentance 1/1, Vengeance 3/3, Champion of the Light 5/5, and Unsealed Wrath 1/1. Benediction saves mana, Pursuit speeds travel, and Seal of Command adds burst.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as a Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:12d6be15e99636475ab49fc55652edcc12c7417a"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-talentos-sagrado-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos Sagrado (subida)","title_en":"Holy Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Puedes priorizar la regeneración de maná o la velocidad de movimiento al comenzar.","summary_en":"Choose mana regeneration or movement speed as your early priority.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos sagrado paladín subir","reverencia o búsqueda de justicia","talentos sagrado mazmorras"],"keywords_en":["holy paladin leveling talent path","reverence or pursuit of justice","holy dungeon talents"],"text_es":"Los primeros puntos admiten dos órdenes que llegan al mismo reparto: Reverencia 2/2 primero mejora la regeneración de maná al curar mazmorras; Búsqueda de justicia 2/2 primero facilita recorrer el mundo. Elige según priorices sanar grupos o moverte más rápido.","text_en":"Early points allow two orders that reach the same build: taking Reverence 2/2 first improves mana regeneration while healing dungeons; taking Pursuit of Justice 2/2 first makes travel easier. Choose based on whether you prioritize group healing or faster movement.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Holy Paladin DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:74323ea3e6b3940e8d2ef0a821b3f03420a55786"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-talentos-proteccion-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos Protección (subida)","title_en":"Protection Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Prioriza movilidad y maná, y sopesa defensa y regeneración según los enemigos.","summary_en":"Prioritize movement and mana, balancing defense and regeneration by encounter.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos protección paladín","búsqueda de justicia nivel 21","escudo sagrado protección leveo"],"keywords_en":["protection paladin talent path","pursuit of justice level 21","holy shield leveling protection"],"text_es":"Al principio, enfoca Reprensión en Búsqueda de justicia 2/2, que completas al nivel 21. Oración 5/5 suele convenir en grupos porque reduce el gasto de maná. Si quieres tanquear mazmorras, redistribuye a nivel 30 para tomar Escudo Sagrado 1/1, a cambio de subir más despacio. Sentencia santificada 3/3 devuelve maná contra un objetivo; Especialización en escudos 2/2 rinde más frente a varios. Después de elegir Juramento de escudo 1/1, usa Escudo Sagrado antes de Golpe Sagrado.","text_en":"Start the Retribution branch with Pursuit of Justice 2/2; finish it by level 21. Benediction 5/5 is usually better in groups because it reduces mana costs. For more dungeon tanking, respec at level 30 to take Holy Shield 1/1, accepting slower leveling. Sanctified Judgement 3/3 returns mana against one target; Shield Specialization 2/2 helps more against packs. After taking Shieldsworn 1/1, use Holy Shield before Holy Strike.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Paladin Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:541400db19159956319eb28cb7b4f5c674055e45"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-habilidades-sagrado-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades para entrenar: Sagrado","title_en":"Holy Abilities to Train","summary_es":"Aprende las habilidades esenciales y ahorra oro con las opciones de estilo.","summary_en":"Train core spells and save gold on playstyle-dependent options.","keywords_es":["habilidades sagrado paladín entrenar","qué hechizos subir sagrado","habilidades opcionales paladín santo"],"keywords_en":["holy paladin abilities to train","which holy spells to train","optional holy paladin spells"],"text_es":"Aprende el núcleo al desbloquearlo: Sentencia a nivel 4 (rango 1); Aura de castigo a 16; Consagración y Destello de Luz a 20; Sello de luz a 30. Para ahorrar oro, deja para después Sello de furia (10) y Furia justa (16), útiles como apoyo, y Sello de justicia (22) o Ahuyentar a no-muerto (24), de uso situacional; todos son de rango 1.","text_en":"Train the core as it unlocks: learn Judgement at level 4 (rank 1); add Retribution Aura at 16; train Consecration and Flash of Light at 20; take Seal of Light at 30. To save gold, delay Seal of Fury (10) and Righteous Fury (16) as utility, and Seal of Justice (22) or Turn Undead (24) as situational picks; each is rank 1.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Holy Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Holy Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1e41acc97d7aa841820103f515312b147446d28a","section:c993c87971cbcc8aa7f078530bf938d3262baccb"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-habilidades-proteccion-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades para entrenar: Protección","title_en":"Protection Abilities to Train","summary_es":"Prioriza las habilidades de tanque y omite auras situacionales para ahorrar.","summary_en":"Train core tank abilities and skip situational auras to save gold.","keywords_es":["habilidades protección paladín entrenar","rangos golpes protección","auras opcionales tanque paladín"],"keywords_en":["protection paladin abilities to train","protection spell ranks","optional tank auras"],"text_es":"Aprende Sentencia a nivel 4 (rango 1), Golpe Sagrado desde el 6 (rangos 1–8), Sello de furia desde el 10 (1–7) y Aura de castigo desde el 16 (1–5); añade Consagración desde el 20 (1–5). Para ahorrar, puedes saltarte Sello de justicia a 22 (1) y las auras de resistencia: Sombras desde 28, Escarcha desde 32 y Fuego desde 36, todas hasta rango 3.","text_en":"Train Judgement at level 4 (rank 1), Holy Strike from 6 (ranks 1–8), Seal of Fury from 10 (1–7), and Retribution Aura from 16 (1–5); add Consecration from 20 (1–5). To save gold, skip Seal of Justice at 22 (1) and the resistance auras: Shadow from 28, Frost from 32, and Fire from 36, each through rank 3.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Protection Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Protection Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:39d3e735dd6af006f32b775ff1cab1a19120c837","section:e659a0e09cc118fc03fdd0c794cd135de02705d2"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-habilidades-represion-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades obligatorias: Reprensión","title_en":"Retribution Mandatory Abilities","summary_es":"Entrena los hechizos básicos y cada rango nuevo, salvo Sentencia.","summary_en":"Train core spells and each new rank, except Judgement.","keywords_es":["habilidades obligatorias reprensión","qué entrenar paladín retribution","rangos hechizos reprensión"],"keywords_en":["retribution mandatory abilities","what to train retribution paladin","retribution spell ranks"],"text_es":"Nivel 1: Sello de rectitud (todos los rangos hasta 20 y otra vez con Cólera desellada) y Luz Sagrada. Nivel 4: Bendición del poderío y Sentencia; 6: Golpe Sagrado y Sello del Cruzado; 8: Martillo de justicia; 16: Aura de castigo; 18: Bendición de Libertad. Nivel 20: Consagración, Sello de orden, Destello de Luz y Exorcismo contra demonios o no-muertos; 34: Escudo divino; 42: Purgación; 44: Martillo de cólera. Entrena todos los rangos nuevos salvo Sentencia.","text_en":"Level 1: Seal of Righteousness (all ranks through 20, then again with Unsealed Wrath) and Holy Light. Level 4: Blessing of Might and Judgement; 6: Holy Strike and Seal of the Crusader; 8: Hammer of Justice; 16: Retribution Aura; 18: Blessing of Freedom. Level 20: Consecration, Seal of Command, Flash of Light, and Exorcism against Demons or Undead; 34: Divine Shield; 42: Cleanse; 44: Hammer of Wrath. Train every new rank except Judgement.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Retribution Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:b762ccab74541fa9e2c228783a54c000d64e0dbe"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-habilidades-represion-opcionales","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades opcionales: Reprensión","title_en":"Retribution Optional Abilities","summary_es":"Ahorra oro omitiendo hechizos poco útiles salvo que elijas tanqueo o JcJ.","summary_en":"Save gold by skipping low-value spells unless tanking or choosing PvP.","keywords_es":["habilidades opcionales reprensión","hechizos saltar paladín","sello de furia tanque paladín"],"keywords_en":["retribution optional abilities","paladin spells to skip","seal of fury paladin tank"],"text_es":"Para ahorrar, omite Sello de justicia (22), Aura de concentración (22), Ahuyentar a no-muerto (24) y Cólera sagrada (50). Aprende solo el primer rango de Aura de devoción (1) e Imposición de manos (10); compra Sello de furia (10) solo si tanqueas. Bendición de Sacrificio (46) puede omitirse; en JcJ, su primer rango ayuda a romper control.","text_en":"To save gold, skip Seal of Justice (22), Concentration Aura (22), Turn Undead (24), and Holy Wrath (50). Learn only the first rank of Devotion Aura (1) and Lay on Hands (10); train Seal of Fury (10) only if tanking. Blessing of Sacrifice (46) can be skipped; in PvP, its first rank can break crowd control.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Retribution Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:726235c29476e7b3bfea6f425964453cef449819"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-consumibles-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Consumables","summary_es":"Comida con experiencia y pociones reducen descansos; usa mejoras de arma para más daño.","summary_en":"Bonus-XP food and potions reduce downtime; use weapon buffs for damage.","keywords_es":["consumibles paladín subir","comida experiencia paladín","pociones de maná aceite escarchado"],"keywords_en":["paladin leveling consumables","bonus xp food paladin","mana potions frost oil paladin"],"text_es":"La comida con bonificación de experiencia es prioritaria: en Protección otorga 5% extra por cada enemigo muerto. Lleva pociones de maná y curación; Primeros auxilios permite crear las de curación. Reprensión gana daño con Aceite escarchado o aceite de poder con hechizos; las pociones ofensivas ayudan, y el poder con hechizos favorece el área. Sagrado puede usar Encantar arma: revelación y Encantar botas: velocidad menor.","text_en":"Bonus-XP food is a priority: Protection gets 5% extra experience per enemy killed. Carry mana and healing potions; First Aid lets you make healing potions. Retribution gains damage from Frost Oil or spell-power weapon oil; offensive potions help, and spell power favors AoE. Holy can use Enchant Weapon: Revelation and Enchant Boots: Minor Speed.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Holy Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Protection Paladin Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling","class:paladin:protection:leveling","class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:01abc7575493d2ab37e12e95adee3292f8c96e60","section:61bc6b094e02f6ebe9df72c6b5c990c72e700a2d","section:daf53d25b584d73af12ac456c5a171a70a224d88"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-campamentos-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Beneficios de campamento para Paladín","title_en":"Paladin Camping Buffs","summary_es":"Combina atributos de campamento con el rol y evita duplicar beneficios de clase.","summary_en":"Match camp stats to your role and avoid duplicating class buffs.","keywords_es":["beneficios campamento paladín","camp buffs paladín","magnetita rueda afilar paladín"],"keywords_en":["paladin camping buffs","paladin camp professions","lodestone sharpening wheel paladin"],"text_es":"Los beneficios de campamento duran 1 h y no se acumulan con el beneficio de clase equivalente: alterna la bendición. Rueda de afilar (Fuerza) y Magnetita (poder de ataque) apoyan Golpe Sagrado; la Silla de campamento da 2% de crítico y favorece Venganza. Para maná, Pozo de maná y Vela de incienso aportan regeneración o Intelecto; Intelecto también mejora Campeón de la Luz. Desde 22–25, Tienda de campamento gana valor; Cuenco con pescado da 8% a atributos como alternativa a Reyes si usas Poderío.","text_en":"Camp buffs last 1 hour and do not stack with the matching class buff, so rotate blessings. Sharpening Wheel (Strength) and Lodestone (attack power) support Holy Strike; Camp Chair grants 2% crit and benefits Vengeance. For mana, Mana Well and Incense Candle add regeneration or Intellect; Intellect also boosts Champion of the Light. From 22–25, Camp Tent becomes more valuable; Fish Bowl gives 8% to stats as an alternative to Kings when using Might.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Holy Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Protection Paladin Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling","class:paladin:protection:leveling","class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:8cb50821da6a6b7a8e504fe3bb361fef3280fc9b","section:9537a5b7b35f8086d006c9e9137102d51f2b65d4","section:9c6ee4f1cf3d047d42a5559759b3e33ebb1ac38c"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-legado-sagrado-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Puntos de legado: Sagrado","title_en":"Legacy Points: Holy","summary_es":"Prioriza la ventaja de experiencia descansada para acelerar la subida.","summary_en":"Prioritize the rested-experience perk to speed up leveling.","keywords_es":["puntos legado paladín sagrado","experiencia descansada holy","legado sagrado subir"],"keywords_en":["holy paladin legacy points","holy rested experience perk","holy leveling legacy"],"text_es":"Si dispones de puntos de legado, elige pronto Bien descansado: aumenta la experiencia descansada acumulada y ayuda a avanzar durante una subida larga.","text_en":"If you have Legacy Points, choose Well Rested early: it increases accumulated rested experience and helps through a long leveling journey.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best use of Legacy Points for Holy Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:holy:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:dec636c49bb3c328e7fe6427b673137ddf173d45"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-legado-proteccion-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Puntos de legado: Protección","title_en":"Legacy Points: Protection","summary_es":"Distribuye los puntos según cuántos tengas para curarte, ganar experiencia y extender comida.","summary_en":"Spend points by budget on recovery, experience, and longer food buffs.","keywords_es":["puntos legado paladín protección","legado protección experiencia","puntos talento protección legado"],"keywords_en":["protection paladin legacy points","protection legacy experience","protection legacy talent points"],"text_es":"Para un personaje secundario, con 1–5 puntos elige la ventaja que restaura 1% de salud y maná durante 10 s al matar un enemigo no trivial; no funciona en mazmorras, bandas o campos de batalla. Con 5–10 puntos suma experiencia descansada (+4% de acumulación y límite) y gana talentos desde nivel 9 en vez de 10, hasta 51 puntos totales; con 10–15 añade también la restauración. El punto final alarga 33% la comida para conservar su 5% de experiencia.","text_en":"For an alternate character, with 1–5 points choose the perk that restores 1% health and mana over 10 seconds after killing a non-trivial enemy; it does not work in dungeons, raids, or battlegrounds. With 5–10 points, add rested experience (+4% accumulation and cap) and gain talents from level 9 instead of 10, up to 51 total points; with 10–15, add the recovery perk too. The final point extends food by 33% to retain its 5% experience bonus.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best use of Legacy Points for Protection Paladin Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:e04ebf637bbd05d97200a474fc43efcb95764d98"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-legado-represion-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Puntos de legado: Reprensión","title_en":"Legacy Points: Retribution","summary_es":"Reduce descansos con recuperación en mundo abierto y adelanta puntos de talento.","summary_en":"Reduce downtime with open-world recovery and earlier talent points.","keywords_es":["puntos legado paladín reprensión","legado reprensión experiencia","talentos temprano paladín legado"],"keywords_en":["retribution paladin legacy points","retribution legacy leveling","early talent points legacy"],"text_es":"Los puntos de legado se gastan por personaje y hay un máximo de 16 al lanzamiento. Primero, usa hasta 5 rangos de la ventaja que restaura 5% de salud y maná durante 10 s al matar enemigos que dan experiencia en mundo abierto. Después invierte 5 puntos en experiencia descansada y otros 5 para obtener talentos desde nivel 5 en vez de 10; el último punto puede mejorar las rutas de vuelo. A nivel 60, redistribuye los puntos del talento de nivelación.","text_en":"Legacy Points are spent per character, with a launch cap of 16. First, use up to 5 ranks of the perk that restores 5% health and mana over 10 seconds after killing an XP-granting open-world enemy. Then spend 5 points on rested experience and 5 more to gain talents from level 5 instead of 10; the last point can improve flight paths. At level 60, respec the leveling perk.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best use of Legacy Points for Retribution Paladin DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:c363d5818d9bb2d253cf3fad9d2d014ec472dbf3"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-bendiciones-detalle","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace cada bendición","title_en":"What each blessing does","summary_es":"Efecto y duración de cada bendición del Paladín.","summary_en":"Effect and duration of each Paladin blessing.","keywords_es":["qué hace bendición de salvación","bendición de reyes cuánto da","bendición de poderío cazador","bendición de libertad cuánto dura","bendición de sacrificio"],"keywords_en":["what does blessing of salvation do","blessing of kings how much","blessing of might hunters","blessing of freedom duration","blessing of sacrifice"],"text_es":"Solo una bendición por jugador a la vez. Bendición de los Reyes da un 10 % más a todas las estadísticas. Bendición del poderío suma poder en melé (no sirve a los cazadores a distancia). Bendición de Sabiduría da maná cada 5 segundos. Salvación reduce la amenaza generada un 30 % y es la habitual para el daño. Libertad (10 s) evita efectos de movimiento reducido; Sacrificio (30 s) te pasa parte del daño del aliado; Luz mejora Luz Sagrada y Destello de Luz sobre el objetivo.","text_en":"Only one blessing per player at a time. Blessing of Kings gives 10% more to all stats. Blessing of Might adds melee power (it does not help Hunters at range). Blessing of Wisdom gives mana every 5 seconds. Salvation reduces threat generated by 30% and is the usual pick for damage dealers. Freedom (10 s) prevents movement-impairing effects; Sacrifice (30 s) transfers part of an ally's damage to you; Light improves Holy Light and Flash of Light on the target.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Abilities Guide - Forever › Blessing Abilities for Holy Paladins in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Abilities - Forever › Utility Abilities for Protection Paladin in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-abilities","date":"2026-10-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:holy:abilities","class:paladin:protection:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:12d8180750bdfdb9bcf8de714f98a5bb45c4719b","section:dbc001e8e9c6b612daa3c60776adda26e5e0681b"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-sentencia-sellos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Efecto de Sentencia según el sello","title_en":"Judgement effect by seal","summary_es":"Qué deja Sentencia en el enemigo con cada sello.","summary_en":"What Judgement leaves on the enemy for each seal.","keywords_es":["qué hace sentencia","sello de justicia sentencia","sello de luz sentencia","sello del cruzado sentencia","sello de orden daño"],"keywords_en":["what does judgement do","seal of justice judgement","seal of light judgement","seal of the crusader judgement","seal of command damage"],"text_es":"Sentencia aplica el efecto del sello activo sin consumirlo. Rectitud: daño sagrado instantáneo. Orden: daño sagrado, doble si el objetivo está aturdido o incapacitado. Cruzado: el objetivo recibe más daño sagrado. Luz: los atacantes pueden curarse al golpearlo. Sabiduría: los atacantes pueden recuperar maná. Justicia: el enemigo no puede huir. Furia: daño sagrado y provoca al objetivo 4 s. Con Sello de furia equipado un escudo absorbe el 50 % del daño sagrado causado.","text_en":"Judgement applies the active seal's effect without consuming it. Righteousness: instant holy damage. Command: holy damage, doubled if the target is stunned or incapacitated. Crusader: the target takes more holy damage. Light: attackers may heal when hitting it. Wisdom: attackers may restore mana. Justice: the enemy cannot flee. Fury: holy damage and a 4-second taunt. With a shield equipped, Seal of Fury absorbs 50% of the holy damage dealt.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Abilities Guide - Forever › Seal Abilities for Retribution Paladins in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Abilities - Forever › Seal Abilities for Protection Paladins in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-abilities","date":"2026-10-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:protection:abilities","class:paladin:retribution:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:1bfde0db6fac3fdd7552339cdc50bca97ec9e0b4","section:8f6632ca17d9e00a882eecea8a4b98da7cd0ae8d"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-inmunidades","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Inmunidades y Abstención del Paladín","title_en":"Paladin immunities and Forbearance","summary_es":"Protección divina, Escudo divino, Baluarte e Intervención divina.","summary_en":"Divine Protection, Divine Shield, Bulwark and Divine Intervention.","keywords_es":["escudo divino cuánto dura","protección divina paladín","abstención paladín","intervención divina cuándo usar","baluarte de templario"],"keywords_en":["divine shield duration","divine protection paladin","forbearance paladin","when to use divine intervention","templar's bulwark"],"text_es":"Protección divina (8 s) te hace inmune al daño físico, pero no puedes atacar; Escudo divino (12 s) te hace inmune a todo y reduce tu daño un 50 %, y sustituye a la anterior desde el nivel 34. Ambas causan Abstención durante 1 minuto, que impide otra inmunidad. Mientras eres inmune no mantienes amenaza. Baluarte de templario (talento de Protección) da un escudo del 100 % de tu salud máxima 8 s sin perder amenaza. Intervención divina te sacrifica y protege 3 minutos a un aliado inmóvil.","text_en":"Divine Protection (8 s) makes you immune to physical damage but you cannot attack; Divine Shield (12 s) makes you immune to everything and cuts your damage by 50%, and replaces it from level 34. Both cause Forbearance for 1 minute, which blocks another immunity. While immune you do not hold threat. Templar's Bulwark (Protection talent) gives an absorb equal to 100% of your max health for 8 s without losing threat. Divine Intervention sacrifices you to protect an ally, who cannot act, for 3 minutes.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Abilities Guide - Forever › Defensive Abilities for Holy Paladins in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Abilities - Forever › Utility Abilities for Protection Paladin in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-abilities","date":"2026-10-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Retribution Paladins in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:holy:abilities","class:paladin:protection:abilities","class:paladin:retribution:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:367e31360397e05668a73bd4585cbf2c30d3cdff","section:dbc001e8e9c6b612daa3c60776adda26e5e0681b","section:ef64bf288b5afc077bf4771f149954d412126b37"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-resistencias-no-muertos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Auras de resistencia y utilidades contra no-muertos","title_en":"Resistance auras and undead utilities","summary_es":"Resistencias para toda la banda y herramientas contra no-muertos.","summary_en":"Raid-wide resistances and tools against undead.","keywords_es":["aura de resistencia banda","aura de concentración paladín","ahuyentar a no-muerto","captar no-muertes","voz de la verdad"],"keywords_en":["resistance aura raid","concentration aura paladin","turn undead","sense undead","voice of truth"],"text_es":"Las auras de resistencia a Fuego, Escarcha y Sombras afectan a toda la banda cercana, no solo al grupo. Concentración da al grupo un 35 % de ignorar la interrupción al recibir daño. Contra no-muertos: Ahuyentar a no-muerto los hace huir hasta 20 s (se rompe con daño), Captar no-muertes los muestra en el minimapa y Cólera sagrada daña y aturde 2 s a no-muertos y demonios cercanos (Exorcismo les hace daño sagrado). Voz de la verdad (talento Sagrado) te da 6 s de inmunidad a silencio e interrupción.","text_en":"The resistance auras (Fire, Frost, Shadow) affect all nearby raid members, not just the party. Concentration gives the group a 35% chance to ignore interruption when damaged. Against undead: Turn Undead makes them flee up to 20 s (breaks on damage), Sense Undead shows them on the minimap and Holy Wrath damages and stuns nearby undead and demons for 2 s (Exorcism deals holy damage to them). Voice of Truth (Holy talent) gives 6 s of immunity to silence and interrupts.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Abilities - Forever › Auras for Protection Paladins in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-abilities","date":"2026-10-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Abilities Guide - Forever › Crowd Control Abilities for Retribution Paladins in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Holy Paladins in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin DPS Abilities Guide - Forever › Aura Abilities for Retribution Paladins in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Abilities - Forever › Damage Spells for Protection Paladin in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-abilities","date":"2026-10-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:holy:abilities","class:paladin:protection:abilities","class:paladin:retribution:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:095ae28d1fb1c9bd0d3bf64894f4a5cf2229d85f","section:32bc88eac216fbfd72f673682e9fb26026c3c504","section:8bd407cc2578231eec16c528f1cc5ff31aa30c36","section:94180b432c4e5c96b565dc64ef5f5aab82a7af4a","section:9f17eeb8f1d438e9923d3941cbb3c5387d27e61f"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-encantamientos-sagrado","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos y consumibles del Paladín Sagrado","title_en":"Holy Paladin enchants and consumables","summary_es":"Qué encantar y qué consumir con el Paladín Sagrado mientras subes.","summary_en":"What to enchant and consume as a Holy Paladin while leveling.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo paladín","qué encantamientos pongo de paladín","encantamientos para paladín","encantamientos paladín sagrado","qué encantar paladín sanador","consumibles paladín sagrado","aceite de maná paladín"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a paladin","best enchants for paladin","holy paladin enchants","what to enchant healer paladin","holy paladin consumables","mana oil paladin"],"text_es":"Encantamientos y consumibles del Paladín Sagrado: Arma: Encantar arma: revelación. Collar: Encantar collar: poder con hechizos. Torso: Encantar torso: intelecto. Piernas: Complemento pesado para armadura místico. Botas: Encantar botas: velocidad menor. Consumibles: pociones de maná (menor, normal, excelente) y de curación, Aceite de maná (menor, inferior, luminoso) en el arma y comida como Ala de murciélago crujiente o Hachee de murciélago.","text_en":"Holy Paladin enchants and consumables: Weapon: Enchant Weapon - Revelation. Neck: Enchant Necklace - Spell Power. Chest: Enchant Chest - Intellect. Legs: Mystic Heavy Armor Kit. Boots: Enchant Boots - Minor Speed. Consumables: mana potions (minor, regular, superior) and healing potions, Mana Oil (minor, lesser, brilliant) on the weapon and food such as Crispy Bat Wing or Bat Hachee.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Paladin Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/enchants-consumables-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Paladin Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Paladin Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/holy/enchants-consumables-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:holy:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:7bffdc2dbc6376fa423eba999f43a9be1f279af2","section:c9ebeb1ef686666fd6749d86ea7ef7cf35467310"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-encantamientos-proteccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Paladín Protección","title_en":"Protection Paladin enchants","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Paladín Protección por nivel, con aguante y púas de escudo.","summary_en":"What to enchant as a Protection Paladin by level, with Stamina and shield spikes.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo paladín","qué encantamientos pongo de paladín","encantamientos para paladín","encantamientos paladín protección","qué encantar paladín tanque","aguante torso paladín","punta de escudo paladín"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a paladin","best enchants for paladin","protection paladin enchants","what to enchant paladin tank","stamina chest paladin","shield spike paladin"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Paladín Protección: El arma usa Encantar arma: recuperación (cura el 5% de tu salud al esquivarte o pararte un golpe, con reutilización de 10 s) o revelación. Torso: aguante, de menor (2) a sublime (+10 con Encantamiento 275). Brazales: fuerza, hasta excelente (+9). Collar: poder con hechizos (+6). Botas: velocidad menor. Los Complementos para armadura místicos suben con el nivel (15, 30, 40, 50). Las puntas de escudo de herrería suman daño por bloqueo: hierro 8-12, mitril 16-20 y torio 20-30.","text_en":"Protection Paladin enchants: Weapon: Enchant Weapon - Recovery (heals 5% of your health when parried or dodged, 10 sec internal cooldown) or Revelation. Chest: Stamina, from Inferior (2) to Major (+10 at Enchanting 275). Bracers: Strength, up to Superior (+9). Neck: Spell Power (+6). Boots: Minor Speed. Mystic Armor Kits scale with level (15, 30, 40, 50). Blacksmithing shield spikes add damage per block: Iron 8-12, Mithril 16-20, Thorium 20-30.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Best Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Paladin Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/enchants-consumables-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Best Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Options by Level","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/enchants-consumables-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:protection:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:18ec06055fe1144a354c4cf826aaa4dc5595d8cc","section:1dbbbfe3079c01e1d444787726c5a213aed6194a"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-consumibles-proteccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles del Paladín Protección","title_en":"Protection Paladin consumables","summary_es":"Pociones, elixires, aceites y comida del Paladín Protección, con reglas de acumulación.","summary_en":"Potions, elixirs, oils and food for the Protection Paladin, with stacking rules.","keywords_es":["qué consumibles uso siendo paladín","qué consumibles uso de paladín","consumibles para paladín","qué elixires uso de paladín","consumibles paladín protección","elixires paladín tanque","qué comida paladín protección","aceite de zahorí piedra de afilar a la vez"],"keywords_en":["what consumables as a paladin","best consumables for paladin","protection paladin consumables","paladin tank elixirs","protection paladin food","wizard oil sharpening stone together"],"text_es":"Consumibles del Paladín Protección: Los elixires se acumulan entre sí; prioriza los de poder con hechizos en mazmorra y añade fuerza o agilidad (Elixir de gigantes, Elixir de entereza superior). El aceite de zahorí y las piedras de afilar no se combinan, y los aceites no valen la pena antes del nivel 20 (usa Piedra de afilar férrea). Todas las pociones comparten reutilización; las piedras de salud tienen la suya. Una sola comida activa, que además da +5% de experiencia: Salmón al horno a nivel 40-60.","text_en":"Protection Paladin consumables: Elixirs stack with each other; prioritize Spell Power in dungeons and add Strength or Agility (a Strength elixir, Elixir of Greater Fortitude). Wizard oil and sharpening stones cannot be combined, and oils are not worth it before level 20 (use Rough Sharpening Stone). All potions share a cooldown; Healthstones have their own. Only one food buff is active, and it also gives +5% experience: Baked Salmon at levels 40-60.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Best Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Paladin Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/enchants-consumables-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Paladin Best Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Options by Level","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/enchants-consumables-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:protection:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:1dbbbfe3079c01e1d444787726c5a213aed6194a","section:67e6e3013a2a4c9f08cde96997ea4a57b8cb362f"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-encantamientos-represion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Paladín Reprensión","title_en":"Retribution Paladin enchants","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Paladín Reprensión y qué mirar a nivel 60.","summary_en":"What to enchant as a Retribution Paladin and what to watch at level 60.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo paladín","qué encantamientos pongo de paladín","encantamientos para paladín","encantamientos paladín reprensión","qué encantar paladín retribución","encantar arma cruzado","guantes poder sagrado","explosión de hechizos 2 manos"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a paladin","best enchants for paladin","retribution paladin enchants","what to enchant retribution paladin","crusader enchant paladin","holy power gloves","spellblasting two-hand"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Paladín Reprensión: Arma: Encantar arma: cruzado, Encantar arma 2M: explosión de hechizos o arma abrasadora; el de fuerza inferior a dos manos (Encantamiento 220) es el más fácil al subir. Collar: fuerza o poder con hechizos, rinden parecido. Torso: estadísticas superiores. Brazales: fuerza excelente. Guantes: poder sagrado (nivel 50+) o fuerza superior. Cabeza y piernas: Arcano de Voracidad inferior o de Rapidez (nivel 50+). Botas: agilidad superior. A nivel 60, explosión de hechizos da +65 poder con hechizos; vigila poder sagrado en los guantes.","text_en":"Retribution Paladin enchants: Weapon: Enchant Weapon - Crusader, Enchant 2H Weapon - Spellblasting or Fiery Weapon; the two-hand Lesser Strength (Enchanting 220) is the easiest while leveling. Neck: Strength or Spell Power, they perform similarly. Chest: Greater Stats. Bracers: Superior Strength. Gloves: Holy Power (level 50+) or Greater Strength. Head and legs: Lesser Arcanum of Voracity or Rapidity (level 50+). Boots: Greater Agility. At level 60, Spellblasting gives +65 Spell Power; watch Holy Power on gloves.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Retribution Paladin Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:7455568f2708ef08c55908fc3fc45750d1ee308c"]},{"id":"clase-paladin-consumibles-represion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles del Paladín Reprensión","title_en":"Retribution Paladin consumables","summary_es":"Elixires, aceites de arma y comida para el Paladín Reprensión.","summary_en":"Elixirs, weapon oils and food for the Retribution Paladin.","keywords_es":["qué consumibles uso siendo paladín","qué consumibles uso de paladín","consumibles para paladín","qué elixires uso de paladín","consumibles paladín reprensión","elixires paladín retribución","aceite escarchado paladín","qué comida paladín reprensión"],"keywords_en":["what consumables as a paladin","best consumables for paladin","retribution paladin consumables","retribution paladin elixirs","frost oil paladin","retribution paladin food"],"text_es":"Consumibles del Paladín Reprensión: Los elixires duran 30 minutos y se acumulan si dan beneficios distintos: combina uno de poder con hechizos (Elixir superior arcano) con uno de fuerza (Elixir de gigantes) o de ferocidad. En el arma, el Aceite escarchado es el más fuerte hasta niveles altos (escala con tu poder con hechizos), seguido del Aceite de las Sombras; para ahorrar, usa el mejor aceite de zahorí. Come siempre: la comida da experiencia; elige poder con hechizos o fuerza.","text_en":"Retribution Paladin consumables: Elixirs last 30 minutes and stack if they give different buffs: pair a Spell Power one (Greater Arcane Elixir) with a Strength one (a Strength elixir) or Ferocity. On the weapon, Frost Oil is the strongest until high levels (it scales with your spell power), followed by Shadow Oil; to save gold, use the best wizard oil. Always eat: food gives experience; pick spell power or strength.","tags":["PALADIN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Retribution Paladin Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Retribution Paladin Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/retribution/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:paladin:retribution:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:9dc9221da2bd5233159d21379b892cd3d2ef71c7"]}]},"04-clase-priest.json":{"description":"Capítulo 4: Clases. Sacerdote. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"clase-priest-que-hace","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace un Sacerdote","title_en":"What a Priest Does","summary_es":"Puede sanar o hacer daño según su especialización; aporta mejoras, disipación y control al grupo.","summary_en":"Heals or deals damage by specialization, while bringing buffs, dispels, and control to groups.","keywords_es":["qué hace un sacerdote","sacerdote curación y daño","sacerdote escudos","sacerdote sombras","sacerdote apoyo"],"keywords_en":["what does a priest do","priest healing and damage","priest shields","priest shadow","priest support"],"text_es":"El Sacerdote puede curar o hacer daño según su especialización. Disciplina previene daño con escudos, Sagrado restaura a los heridos y Sombra ataca con las Sombras. Palabra de poder: escudo, Renovar y los rezos son herramientas habituales; también aporta mejoras, disipación y control. No tiene movilidad innata para reposicionarse durante el combate; Levitar ayuda a desplazarse por el mundo.","text_en":"A Priest can heal or deal damage depending on specialization. Discipline prevents damage with shields, Holy restores injured allies, and Shadow attacks with Shadow magic. Power Word: Shield, Renew, and prayers are common tools; Priests also bring buffs, dispels, and control. They have no innate combat repositioning skill; Levitate helps with overworld travel.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Priest Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Priest in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/priest-class-overview","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Discipline Priest Guide › Discipline Priest Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/discipline-priest-healer-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Priest Guide › Holy Priest Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-priest-healer-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Guide › Shadow Priest Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Holy Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:overview","class:priest:general:priest-class-overview","class:priest:holy:overview","class:priest:holy:rotation","class:priest:shadow:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:24c425cd620eb7eef6e8079c365fafb2a3de3da7","section:296d2cddc8c19ca6c9ac55c13a6be103faaadb6b","section:3f99cbd7294c823bc796a190ba94668088e14680","section:7aa463342506adf5000be319eaace749f6b794ef","section:aeeb86ce13ca5bfd0d640535f5dcc1f7097e848e","section:dafebaeca9dcb9d3537a430c8073f4d667090174"]},{"id":"clase-priest-especializaciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones del Sacerdote","title_en":"Priest Specializations","summary_es":"Disciplina previene daño; Sagrado ofrece curas flexibles; Sombra hace daño periódico y apoya al grupo.","summary_en":"Discipline prevents damage; Holy offers flexible healing; Shadow deals periodic damage and supports the group.","keywords_es":["especializaciones del sacerdote","sacerdote disciplina sagrado sombra","sacerdote sanador","sacerdote daño sombra","qué especialización de sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["priest specializations","priest discipline holy shadow","priest healer","priest shadow damage","which priest spec"],"text_es":"Disciplina previene daño con escudos y mitigación, y destaca en un objetivo, aunque cura menos en área. Sagrado ofrece curas directas y de grupo, pero consume mucho maná y carece de movilidad. Sombra es daño a distancia con efectos periódicos; Unirse a vampírica aporta curación pasiva y su utilidad ayuda al grupo. Las tres especializaciones dependen del maná.","text_en":"Discipline prevents damage with shields and mitigation and excels at single-target healing, though it has weaker area healing. Holy offers direct and group heals but is mana-intensive and lacks mobility. Shadow deals ranged damage over time; Vampiric Embrace provides passive healing, and its utility supports the group. All three specializations rely on mana.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Discipline Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Holy Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Shadow Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Discipline Priest Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Holy Priest Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Shadow Priest Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:overview","class:priest:discipline:stats","class:priest:holy:overview","class:priest:holy:stats","class:priest:shadow:overview","class:priest:shadow:rotation","class:priest:shadow:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:1aceaeaab70b05a6b2045fb40e1d706f25197370","section:1ddd6f44d686c7563d5a6aaa7750175b3feeb7d3","section:92c8f8685f78a11564eb33397f4aee69cb9db258","section:9510f22c8c31311370b28b66b236b9b6c5c30331","section:daf0fb1eae986fb4ca71cface4e22458dbb52b68","section:dafebaeca9dcb9d3537a430c8073f4d667090174","section:ddf24c444b5df78ebd60cba674da4d3dc336ccf8"]},{"id":"clase-priest-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué cambia en Forever para el Sacerdote","title_en":"What Changes for Priest in Forever","summary_es":"Disciplina gana absorciones, Sagrado nuevas curas compartidas y Sombra mejoras al daño y al maná.","summary_en":"Discipline gains absorbs, Holy adds split heals, and Shadow improves damage and mana.","keywords_es":["cambios del sacerdote en forever","sacerdote disciplina independiente","sanación conjunta","rezo de alivio","sacerdote sombra"],"keywords_en":["priest forever changes","discipline priest healer","binding heal","prayer of mending","shadow priest"],"text_es":"Disciplina conserva Curar como cura de objetivo e incorpora Penitencia, que cura a un aliado o daña a un enemigo, y Égida divina. Meditación mantiene el 50% de la regeneración de Espíritu al lanzar, y Custodia de miedo pasa a todos los Sacerdotes. Sagrado añade Sanación conjunta y Rezo de alivio; Espíritu divino se aprende a 30, en vez de ser un talento de Disciplina. Sombra convierte Peste devoradora en hechizo base y Forma de las Sombras reduce a la mitad el coste de sus hechizos y aumenta un 100% su daño crítico. Unirse a vampírica aporta curación pasiva al grupo.","text_en":"Discipline keeps Heal as an efficient single-target spell and gains Penance, which heals an ally or damages an enemy, plus Divine Aegis. Meditation preserves 50% of Spirit regeneration while casting, and Fear Ward becomes available to all Priests. Holy adds Binding Heal and Prayer of Mending; Divine Spirit is trained at 30 instead of being a Discipline talent. Shadow makes Devouring Plague baseline and reworks Shadowform to halve Shadow spell costs and increase their critical damage by 100%. Vampiric Embrace adds passive group healing.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Healing Rotation for Discipline Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:overview","class:priest:discipline:rotation","class:priest:holy:overview","class:priest:holy:rotation","class:priest:shadow:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:24c425cd620eb7eef6e8079c365fafb2a3de3da7","section:3c0635772a056c230f6dcacc031cce9a2a9c358d","section:4ab4297076a4f7283a7bdb26ce52fbd58242c7fe","section:55d75d07623298cf581bcbac94c37554b9c0a87d","section:759472e8fd55ac080c37e5b56ed7c71dcaa75e8a","section:b61a87e320d0d9897da8a231c446f75b878cce59","section:cc4e7a4f9b61cd7d999b8c4ece9bb0b3d2f3d1bb","section:eb2b60a09f803201595f965fa7043833082763e9"]},{"id":"clase-priest-armas-armadura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas y armadura del Sacerdote","title_en":"Priest Weapons and Armor","summary_es":"La varita evita gastar maná; Encantamiento y equipo de tela ayudan a mejorarla durante el leveo.","summary_en":"A wand deals damage without mana; Enchanting and cloth gear help upgrade your leveling kit.","keywords_es":["armas del sacerdote","armadura del sacerdote","sacerdote varita","sacerdote bastón","sacerdote equipo de tela"],"keywords_en":["priest weapons","priest armor","priest wand","priest staff","priest cloth gear"],"text_es":"El Sacerdote solo viste tela. Puede usar Dagas, Mazas de una mano, Bastones y Varitas; no puede usar otros tipos de armas ni escudos. Todos empiezan con Mazas de una mano y Varitas aprendidas; para aprender Dagas y Bastones hay que acudir a un maestro de armas. Durante la mayor parte del leveo, la varita suele superar en daño a los golpes cuerpo a cuerpo y no consume maná. Costura permite crear equipo de tela y Encantamiento, fabricar varitas.","text_en":"Priests wear cloth only. Their weapon proficiencies are Daggers, One-Handed Maces, Staves, and Wands; shields and all other weapon classes are unavailable. One-Handed Maces and Wands are already trained at character creation, while a Weapon Master teaches Daggers and Staves. For most of leveling, wands outdamage melee attacks without spending mana. Tailoring produces cloth gear, and Enchanting produces wands.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Professions for Discipline Priest in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Priest Leveling Guide: Specializations, Talent Builds & Professions and More - WoW Forever › Priest Weapon Skills and Trainers in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/leveling-guide","date":"2026-11-12"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Priest Leveling Guide: Specializations, Talent Builds & Professions and More - WoW Forever › Priest Starting Weapon Skills","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/leveling-guide","date":"2026-11-12"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Open World Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:discipline:overview","class:priest:general:leveling-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:136fcf472ebb95c1f8001af06728e6d7b8f1ba67","section:ce34cc51ba368a9a4b8c8583cc3da12110aec5b4","section:d1bd6a6912195f57c946093438b21017992da3e8","section:fe5e72833721347304a454d9c8437843f9463070"]},{"id":"clase-priest-subir-espec","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejor especialización para subir","title_en":"Best Specialization for Leveling","summary_es":"Sombra suele ser más rápida en solitario; Disciplina y Sagrado encajan mejor al curar mazmorras.","summary_en":"Shadow is usually faster solo; Discipline and Holy suit dungeon healing better.","keywords_es":["mejor especialización para subir sacerdote","sacerdote sombra para levear","sacerdote disciplina para subir","sacerdote sagrado para subir","qué spec de sacerdote usar"],"keywords_en":["best priest leveling spec","shadow priest leveling","discipline priest leveling","holy priest leveling","which priest spec to level"],"text_es":"Para subir en solitario, Sombra suele ser la más rápida: combina daño y curación y sus DoT permiten afrontar varios enemigos, aunque hay que vigilar el maná. Una varita y los golpes finales que activan Transfusión de espíritu reducen las pausas. Disciplina hace menos daño que Sombra, pero su supervivencia y rendimiento como sanador la hacen sólida en mazmorras. Sagrado es más lento en solitario; encaja si vas con amigos o pasas la mayor parte del tiempo en mazmorras.","text_en":"For solo leveling, Shadow is usually fastest: it combines damage and healing, and its DoTs let you handle several enemies, though mana needs attention. A wand and killing blows that activate Spirit Tap reduce downtime. Discipline deals less damage than Shadow, but its survivability and healing make it strong in dungeons. Holy is slower solo; it suits playing with friends or spending most of your time in dungeons.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Discipline Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling","class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:271b8ebab7ef6dd1b579aa69fc6b3e87ab9681a8","section:6bba6c54196b6b99aa39f72329c5e7185c185e0c","section:9c4f8a9f677581b514a13e7ed5614bdaa6d16c20","section:a8dd7c09bc2e94038de4410ae559595a1b8bbf7e","section:e03e7d2d0c3f83e40d017c7743eebeca568571a4"]},{"id":"clase-priest-talentos-sombra","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Sombra (subida)","title_en":"Shadow Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Ruta: varita y Transfusión de espíritu; Despelleje mental 20, Unirse a vampírica 25 y Forma de las Sombras 40.","summary_en":"Path: wand and Spirit Tap; Mind Flay at 20, Vampiric Embrace at 25, Shadowform at 40.","keywords_es":["talentos para subir sacerdote sombra","ruta de sombra","transfusión de espíritu","despelleje mental","forma de las sombras"],"keywords_en":["shadow priest leveling talents","shadow talent path","spirit tap","mind flay","shadowform"],"text_es":"Disciplina: Especialización en varitas 2/2, Disciplinas gemelas 3/5, Resolución silenciosa 3/3, Fuerza mental 5/5 y Meditación 3/3. Sagrado: Enfoque crepuscular 3/3. Sombra: Enfoque de las Sombras 3/5, Transfusión de espíritu 5/5, Explosión mental mejorada 4/5, Palabra de las Sombras: dolor mejorada 2/2, Alcance de las Sombras 2/2, Despelleje mental 1/1, Tortura mental mejorada 2/2, Unirse a vampírica 1/1, Tejido de las Sombras 3/3, Silencio 1/1, Contagio devorador 2/2, Oscuridad 5/5 y Forma de las Sombras 1/1. Hitos: Despelleje mental 20, Unirse a vampírica 25, Forma de las Sombras 40.","text_en":"Discipline: Wand Specialization 2/2, Twin Disciplines 3/5, Silent Resolve 3/3, Mental Strength 5/5, and Meditation 3/3. Holy: Twilight Focus 3/3. Shadow: Shadow Focus 3/5, Spirit Tap 5/5, Improved Mind Blast 4/5, Improved Shadow Word: Pain 2/2, Shadow Reach 2/2, Mind Flay 1/1, Improved Mind Flay 2/2, Vampiric Embrace 1/1, Shadow Weaving 3/3, Silence 1/1, Devouring Contagion 2/2, Darkness 5/5, and Shadowform 1/1. Milestones: Mind Flay 20, Vampiric Embrace 25, Shadowform 40.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Shadow Priest DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:6c47394a8cc686fb35961e93a0ed6afb061861b7","section:e8df9b820616dab46a4506311a5840529db6ffed","section:fcb8ac9a14e4725882cc65f6081a1f79bd875a06"]},{"id":"clase-priest-hitos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de habilidad por nivel","title_en":"Ability Milestones by Level","summary_es":"Escudo 6; Renovar y Desvanecer 8; facultades raciales 10 y 20; Forma de las Sombras 40.","summary_en":"Shield 6; Renew and Fade 8; racial abilities 10 and 20; Shadowform 40.","keywords_es":["cuándo aprendo habilidades de sacerdote","nivel de las habilidades del sacerdote","hitos del sacerdote","penitencia nivel","forma de las sombras nivel"],"keywords_en":["when priest abilities","priest ability levels","priest milestones","penance level","shadowform level"],"text_es":"Palabra de poder: escudo se aprende a 6; Renovar y Desvanecer, a 8; la primera facultad racial, a 10; Fuego interno, a 12; Curar enfermedad y Alarido psíquico, a 14; Curar, a 16; Disipar magia, a 18. A 20 llegan la segunda racial, Custodia de miedo y Fuego Sagrado; Sombra aprende Peste devoradora y puede desbloquear Despelleje mental. Unirse a vampírica llega a 25. Penitencia, Espíritu divino y Rezo de curación llegan a 30; Suprimir enfermedad y Palabra de las Sombras: muerte, a 32; Curación superior y Forma de las Sombras, a 40.","text_en":"Power Word: Shield is learned at 6; Renew and Fade at 8; the first racial ability at 10; Inner Fire at 12; Cure Disease and Psychic Scream at 14; Heal at 16; Dispel Magic at 18. At 20 come the second racial, Fear Ward, and Holy Fire; Shadow learns Devouring Plague and can unlock Mind Flay. Vampiric Embrace arrives at 25. Penance, Divine Spirit, and Prayer of Healing arrive at 30; Abolish Disease and Shadow Word: Death at 32; Greater Heal and Shadowform at 40.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Holy Priest","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Holy Priest","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Discipline Priest Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/discipline-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Priest Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling","class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:756f100c3998dcfa1b6a3932ca8c339569f82a1f","section:7707b4f79b4f590b0e2707fd103b338e54617a51","section:932c689078bc4fe0efab3c0ea70106289f620257","section:c6ae0efa7408c1fac57754c03bc8c366b4ba0b11","section:d5d9988af0e4b7813a6d87469ae8384b0625a0ff","section:e8df9b820616dab46a4506311a5840529db6ffed"]},{"id":"clase-priest-mana","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo gestionar el maná","title_en":"Managing Mana","summary_es":"La varita no gasta maná y permite dejar pasar cinco segundos para reanudar la regeneración por Espíritu.","summary_en":"Wand attacks cost no mana and let the five-second Spirit-regeneration timer resume.","keywords_es":["maná del sacerdote","regeneración de maná sacerdote","sacerdote sin maná","regla de cinco segundos","varita y maná"],"keywords_en":["priest mana","priest mana regeneration","priest out of mana","five second rule","wand and mana"],"text_es":"Tras gastar maná, la regeneración por Espíritu se reanuda después de 5 segundos sin lanzar hechizos que cuesten maná; Meditación permite regenerar parte del Espíritu mientras lanzas. Transfusión de espíritu acelera la recuperación al dar el golpe final. La varita no cuesta maná ni reinicia el temporizador, así que úsala para rematar enemigos y lleva agua. En mazmorras, conserva maná mientras el grupo esté estable: quedarte sin él puede ponerlo en peligro. Bebe entre combates.","text_en":"After spending mana, Spirit regeneration resumes after 5 seconds without casting mana-costing spells; Meditation lets some Spirit regeneration continue while casting. Spirit Tap speeds recovery when you land the killing blow. Wand attacks cost no mana and do not reset the timer, so use them to finish enemies and carry water. In dungeons, conserve mana while the party is stable; running out can put the group at risk. Drink between pulls.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Discipline Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Dungeon Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Discipline Priest Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/discipline-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Holy Priest in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling","class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:5940d4eaaa3b0a4181733d44fed5e3cc42dbfe59","section:6bba6c54196b6b99aa39f72329c5e7185c185e0c","section:80fac1ee8913cfea611101363504eaa195f7b81f","section:be5149747f6cb6dbbf5e2ec48609adf8963454c5","section:eec8bafa26de119ae4d9bdd21966124bd735cb4e"]},{"id":"clase-priest-escudo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Palabra de poder: escudo","title_en":"Power Word: Shield","summary_es":"Palabra de poder: escudo absorbe daño y evita el retroceso de hechizos; Alma debilitada impide reaplicarlo.","summary_en":"Power Word: Shield absorbs damage and prevents spell pushback; Weakened Soul blocks reapplication.","keywords_es":["palabra de poder escudo","escudo del sacerdote","alma debilitada","protección de lanzamientos","sacerdote escudo"],"keywords_en":["power word shield","priest shield","weakened soul","spell pushback protection","priest bubble"],"text_es":"Palabra de poder: escudo absorbe daño y evita el retroceso de tus hechizos mientras está activo; también impide que los golpes consuman acumulaciones de Fuego interno. Deja Alma debilitada, que bloquea otro escudo sobre el mismo objetivo hasta que desaparece. Dura hasta 30 segundos: úsalo antes del combate para proteger a quien recibirá golpes o para poder terminar una cura.","text_en":"Power Word: Shield absorbs damage and prevents spell pushback while active; it also stops hits from consuming Inner Fire stacks. It applies Weakened Soul, which blocks another shield on the same target until it fades. It lasts up to 30 seconds: cast it before combat to protect someone who will take hits or to complete your cast.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:holy:leveling","class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:60b6481c4b3d06dd385e8139caf43825e87b4aca","section:7d3c08bf4c44983c9f09a0449075cec5737dc4a0","section:dd571119e41238fd97b25c2fcd7090fedfdcc5ed"]},{"id":"clase-priest-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Control, limpieza y utilidad","title_en":"Control, Cleansing, and Utility","summary_es":"Alarido psíquico puede atraer más enemigos; otras facultades controlan humanoides o no-muertos y limpian efectos.","summary_en":"Psychic Scream can pull extra enemies; other spells control humanoids or undead and cleanse effects.","keywords_es":["control del sacerdote","alarido psíquico","control mental","encadenar no-muerto","disipar magia"],"keywords_en":["priest control","psychic scream","mind control","shackle undead","dispel magic"],"text_es":"Alarido psíquico hace huir a los enemigos cercanos y puede atraer otros, así que resérvalo para emergencias en zonas pobladas. Control mental canaliza el control de un humanoide; Encadenar no-muerto inmoviliza a un no-muerto y Calma mental reduce el radio de agresión de un humanoide. Curar enfermedad y Suprimir enfermedad limpian enfermedades; Disipar magia elimina efectos mágicos perjudiciales de aliados o beneficios de enemigos. Desvanecer reduce tu amenaza y Levitar evita daño de caída y permite flotar sobre el agua.","text_en":"Psychic Scream makes nearby enemies flee and can pull others, so save it for emergencies in populated areas. Mind Control channels control of a humanoid; Shackle Undead immobilizes an undead, and Mind Soothe reduces a humanoid’s aggro radius. Cure Disease and Abolish Disease cleanse diseases; Dispel Magic removes harmful magic effects from allies or buffs from enemies. Fade reduces your threat, and Levitate prevents fall damage and lets you float above water.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Important Abilities","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Priest Leveling Guide › Utility, Crowd Control, and Cleanses","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Discipline Priest Leveling Guide › Optional Abilities to Train for Discipline Priest","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/discipline-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling","class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:e7d507477ac574da471748b756f0331abbb6ddbd","section:200c080989530ac5abe34dd72096dc223b80e93f","section:a7936a5e2d7a0e69c6ad4b464a417fcadeefe7e3","section:dd571119e41238fd97b25c2fcd7090fedfdcc5ed"]},{"id":"clase-priest-buffs","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Buffs y apoyo al grupo","title_en":"Buffs and Group Support","summary_es":"Palabra de poder: entereza y Espíritu divino mejoran aliados; Protección de las Sombras reduce ese daño.","summary_en":"Power Word: Fortitude and Divine Spirit buff allies; Shadow Protection reduces that damage.","keywords_es":["buffs del sacerdote","palabra de poder entereza","espíritu divino","protección de las sombras","sacerdote apoyo al grupo"],"keywords_en":["priest buffs","power word fortitude","divine spirit","shadow protection","priest group support"],"text_es":"Palabra de poder: entereza aumenta el aguante y la salud máxima; Rezo de entereza aplica el beneficio al grupo durante 1 hora. Espíritu divino aumenta el Espíritu, que mejora la regeneración de salud y la Regeneración de maná fuera de combate; Rezo de espíritu extiende el efecto a varios aliados. Protección de las Sombras reduce el daño de Sombras. Fuego interno aumenta la armadura y tiene 20 acumulaciones, que se consumen al recibir ataques directos.","text_en":"Power Word: Fortitude increases Stamina and maximum health; Prayer of Fortitude applies the buff to the group for 1 hour. Divine Spirit increases Spirit, which improves health and mana regeneration out of combat; Prayer of Spirit extends the effect to several allies. Shadow Protection reduces Shadow damage. Inner Fire increases armor and has 20 stacks, consumed by direct attacks.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:dd571119e41238fd97b25c2fcd7090fedfdcc5ed"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-sombra","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Sombra para subir","title_en":"Shadow Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Abre con Explosión mental y DoTs; usa Despelleje mental y remata con varita para recuperar maná.","summary_en":"Open with Mind Blast and DoTs; use Mind Flay and finish with a wand to recover mana.","keywords_es":["rotación de sombra","sacerdote sombra para subir","explosión mental","palabra de las sombras dolor","peste devoradora"],"keywords_en":["shadow priest rotation","shadow leveling rotation","mind blast","shadow word pain","devouring plague"],"text_es":"Mantén Palabra de poder: entereza y Fuego interno; antes del combate, usa Palabra de poder: escudo si recibirás golpes. Abre con Explosión mental, aplica Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor y Peste devoradora, y usa Despelleje mental si tienes maná; remata con la varita para recuperar maná y activar Transfusión de espíritu con el golpe final. Contra enemigos resistentes, repite Explosión mental cuando esté disponible y renueva los efectos periódicos. Si escasea el maná, omite Peste devoradora y Despelleje mental; si el objetivo morirá pronto, omite Peste devoradora.","text_en":"Keep Power Word: Fortitude and Inner Fire active; before combat, use Power Word: Shield if you will take hits. Open with Mind Blast, apply Shadow Word: Pain and Devouring Plague, and use Mind Flay if you have mana; finish with the wand to recover mana and activate Spirit Tap with the killing blow. Against durable enemies, cast Mind Blast when available and refresh the DoTs. If mana is low, skip Devouring Plague and Mind Flay; if the target will die soon, skip Devouring Plague.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Shadow Priest DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1fa43c25236b272520b5e2e6099e56288af85bd9","section:6bba6c54196b6b99aa39f72329c5e7185c185e0c","section:6c47394a8cc686fb35961e93a0ed6afb061861b7"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-sanador","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de sanador","title_en":"Healer Rotation","summary_es":"Disciplina prioriza escudo y Penitencia; Sagrado mantiene Renovar y reserva curas rápidas para emergencias.","summary_en":"Discipline prioritizes Shield and Penance; Holy maintains Renew and saves fast heals for emergencies.","keywords_es":["rotación de sanador sacerdote","destello curativo","curar sacerdote","rezo de curación","rezo de alivio"],"keywords_en":["priest healer rotation","flash heal","heal priest","prayer of healing","prayer of mending"],"text_es":"En mazmorras, Disciplina: escuda al tanque antes del combate, mantén Renovar y usa Penitencia 1/1 o Curar; reserva Destello curativo para peligro inmediato y bebe entre combates. Sagrado: mantén Renovar y usa Curar, acelerado por Furia divina 5/5; reserva Destello curativo para emergencias. Sanación conjunta, con Vinculación sagrada 1/1, cura a ti y al tanque si ambos están heridos. Usa Rezo de curación si la mayoría del grupo está bajo; Rezo de alivio rebota entre aliados. Curación superior es una cura grande y lenta disponible a 40.","text_en":"In dungeons, Discipline: shield the tank before combat, maintain Renew, and use Penance 1/1 or Heal; save Flash Heal for immediate danger and drink between pulls. Holy: maintain Renew and use Heal, sped up by Divine Fury 5/5; save Flash Heal for emergencies. Binding Heal, with Holy Binding 1/1, heals you and the tank if both are injured. Use Prayer of Healing when most of the party is low; Prayer of Mending bounces between allies. Greater Heal is a large, slow heal available at 40.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Dungeon Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Discipline Priest in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Holy Priest in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:00ee99ee77ac0b309d4dc67c1fe2d57abbb22c3f","section:80fac1ee8913cfea611101363504eaa195f7b81f","section:943a7e5d8a7092c71a66f6640c2b7b1c892beb71","section:eec8bafa26de119ae4d9bdd21966124bd735cb4e"]},{"id":"clase-priest-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Daño en área y sus límites","title_en":"Area Damage and Its Limits","summary_es":"Sombra reparte Dolor en varios enemigos; Sagrado usa Nova Sagrada con Luz abrasadora, pero el área cuesta maná.","summary_en":"Shadow spreads Pain across enemies; Holy uses Holy Nova with Searing Light, but AoE costs mana.","keywords_es":["sacerdote daño en área","nova sagrada","sombra sin área","palabra de las sombras dolor varios","sacerdote varios enemigos"],"keywords_en":["priest aoe","holy nova","shadow no aoe","shadow word pain multiple","priest multiple enemies"],"text_es":"Sombra no tiene daño en área tradicional: reparte Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor entre objetivos y céntrate en uno; con Contagio devorador, Peste devoradora puede propagarse. Atacar a varios enemigos consume antes las acumulaciones de Fuego interno y aumenta el gasto de maná. Para Sagrado, Nova Sagrada es su único daño en área; es poco eficiente hasta Luz abrasadora y conviene usarla cuando se activa para dañar y curar. Sana al grupo con Rezo de curación cuando la mayoría esté herida y deja que Rezo de alivio rebote.","text_en":"Shadow has no traditional AoE damage: spread Shadow Word: Pain across targets and focus on one; with Devouring Contagion, Devouring Plague can spread. Fighting several enemies consumes Inner Fire stacks faster and increases mana use. For Holy, Holy Nova is its only AoE damage; it is inefficient until Searing Light and is best used when it procs to damage and heal. Heal the group with Prayer of Healing when most members are injured, and let Prayer of Mending bounce.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Priest Leveling Guide › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Holy Priest Leveling Guide › Healing Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/holy-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Important Abilities","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:holy:leveling","class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:00ee99ee77ac0b309d4dc67c1fe2d57abbb22c3f","section:1fa43c25236b272520b5e2e6099e56288af85bd9","section:200c080989530ac5abe34dd72096dc223b80e93f","section:3968bf55418d8c303b469cfc4429e847caf4aee4","section:7c944cfab1b348e87f69c4d0d5c69a25d6a85646","section:a7ab49caa92a5166df20b1e1f5d28eda16373444"]},{"id":"clase-priest-misiones-clase","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de clase y facultades raciales","title_en":"Class Quests and Racial Abilities","summary_es":"Las cadenas raciales dan una túnica a 4 y las facultades propias del Sacerdote a 10 y 20.","summary_en":"Racial quest chains give a robe at 4 and Priest-specific abilities at 10 and 20.","keywords_es":["misiones de clase sacerdote","facultades raciales sacerdote","misión de nivel 10 sacerdote","misión de nivel 20 sacerdote","sacerdote habilidades raciales"],"keywords_en":["priest class quests","priest racial abilities","level 10 priest quest","level 20 priest quest","priest racials"],"text_es":"Las cadenas del Sacerdote varían según la raza. La de nivel 4 termina en una túnica; las de nivel 10 y 20 conceden la primera y segunda facultad racial. Por ejemplo, el Elfo de la noche obtiene Fragmentos estelares a 10 y Gracia de Elune a 20; el Humano, Gracia divina y Rebote; el Enano, Rezo desesperado y Castigar. En varias razas puedes acudir directamente al instructor para aprender la facultad sin terminar la cadena.","text_en":"Priest quest chains vary by race. The level 4 chain ends with a robe; level 10 and 20 quests grant the first and second Priest racial abilities. For example, Night Elves get Starshards at 10 and Elune’s Grace at 20; Humans get Divine Grace and Feedback; Dwarves get Desperate Prayer and Chastise. For several races, you can go straight to the trainer to learn the ability instead of completing the full chain.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Discipline Priest Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Priest Class Quests Guide › Night Elf Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/priest-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Priest Class Quests Guide › Human Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/priest-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Priest Class Quests Guide › Dwarf Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/priest-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:overview","class:priest:general:priest-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:4b348d89aab5f2fc93e36a3c141b9766cfb31752","section:68fd1999e550345adf3f7202992e6bd1eacaa8ac","section:9bc0185ab6aeef419c0e7fbadd4b25281b5bb440","section:ab278e3dc61c255c9cbf8f2392471be4d78a3c51"]},{"id":"clase-priest-tips-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Tips","summary_es":"Mejora la varita, lleva agua, entrena rangos útiles y prepara las misiones de mazmorra antes de entrar.","summary_en":"Upgrade your wand, carry water, train useful ranks, and collect dungeon quests before entering.","keywords_es":["consejos para subir sacerdote","sacerdote varita pronto","sacerdote agua y maná","sastrería y encantamiento sacerdote","sacerdote misiones de mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["priest leveling tips","get a wand early","priest water mana","tailoring enchanting priest","priest dungeon quests"],"text_es":"Consigue pronto Varita de prácticas de novicio (1), Varita mágica inferior (5) y Varita mágica superior (13); Encantamiento permite fabricarlas. Lleva agua y pociones de salud y maná; evita hechizos innecesarios y remata con la varita para reanudar la regeneración tras 5 segundos. Entrena rangos clave cada pocos niveles. Mantén las mejoras, completa las cadenas de la zona y recoge sus misiones de mazmorra antes de entrar; cierra sesión en una posada para obtener experiencia descansada. Costura da equipo; Alquimia y Herboristería ayudan con consumibles.","text_en":"Get Novice’s Practice Wand (1), Lesser Magic Wand (5), and Greater Magic Wand (13) early; Enchanting lets you craft them. Carry water and health and mana potions; avoid unnecessary casts and finish enemies with the wand so regeneration resumes after 5 seconds. Train key ranks every few levels. Keep buffs up, complete zone quest chains and collect their dungeon quests before entering; log out at an inn for rested experience. Tailoring provides gear; Alchemy and Herbalism help with consumables.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Discipline Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Gear and Where to Level","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Leveling Guide › Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling","class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:351fb239ae2e54544fded848e9df439ede5812b8","section:6e0cc1d8193ee90f5362ddca78e311a807cb609c","section:7d3c08bf4c44983c9f09a0449075cec5737dc4a0","section:b0b6c75f4eebebafee9d0fd52e2d192dad0a7be4","section:b94f5c3dd7227a413bc41b95204780037e012e4b","section:be5149747f6cb6dbbf5e2ec48609adf8963454c5"]},{"id":"clase-priest-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Sacerdote en grupo y mazmorras","title_en":"Priest in Groups and Dungeons","summary_es":"Disciplina protege al tanque, Sagrado cubre curas de grupo y Sombra aporta daño y apoyo pasivo.","summary_en":"Discipline protects the tank, Holy covers group healing, and Shadow adds damage and passive support.","keywords_es":["sacerdote en grupo","sacerdote en mazmorras","sacerdote sanador de grupo","sacerdote sombra en grupo","utilidad del sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["priest in groups","priest in dungeons","priest group healer","shadow priest group","priest utility"],"text_es":"Disciplina mantiene seguro al tanque con Palabra de poder: escudo, Penitencia y Curar. Sagrado combina curas directas con Rezo de curación para el grupo y Rezo de alivio entre aliados. Sombra aporta daño y ayuda a los sanadores con Unirse a vampírica y la bonificación de Espíritu de Inspiración macabra. El Sacerdote ofrece Palabra de poder: entereza, Espíritu divino, disipación y control; si atraes amenaza, Desvanecer permite al tanque recuperarla.","text_en":"Discipline keeps the tank safe with Power Word: Shield, Penance, and Heal. Holy combines direct heals with Prayer of Healing for the group and Prayer of Mending between allies. Shadow adds damage and helps healers with Vampiric Embrace and the Spirit bonus from Dark Inspiration. Priests provide Power Word: Fortitude, Divine Spirit, dispels, and control; if you draw aggro, Fade lets the tank regain it.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Discipline Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Discipline Priest in WoW Forever > Strengths and Weaknesses of Discipline Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Priest Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:overview","class:priest:discipline:rotation","class:priest:holy:rotation","class:priest:shadow:rotation"],"source_hashes":["guide:e57d30324b2e84947222413010eb0ee1aa1964b0","section:172ecffc65bca32e7ba55402e80c0d09b9243431","section:24c425cd620eb7eef6e8079c365fafb2a3de3da7","section:736b430ab05b03d69b44f392e5ebe3a3649358ee","section:92c8f8685f78a11564eb33397f4aee69cb9db258"]},{"id":"clase-priest-disciplina","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Disciplina: escudos y prevención","title_en":"Discipline: Shields and Prevention","summary_es":"Disciplina previene daño con escudos y destaca en un objetivo, pero tiene menos curación en área.","summary_en":"Discipline prevents damage with shields and excels at single targets, but has weaker area healing.","keywords_es":["sacerdote disciplina","disciplina escudos","penitencia","sacerdote sanador preventivo","disciplina en grupo"],"keywords_en":["discipline priest","discipline shields","penance","preventive healer","discipline group"],"text_es":"Disciplina es un sanador preventivo: Palabra de poder: escudo y Égida divina absorben daño; Penitencia cura a un aliado o daña a un enemigo. Destaca al mantener a salvo a un objetivo y aporta utilidad en mazmorras, pero la curación en área es su punto débil. Es más exigente que Sagrado, aunque su supervivencia y daño permiten jugar en solitario.","text_en":"Discipline is a proactive healer: Power Word: Shield and Divine Aegis absorb damage, while Penance heals an ally or damages an enemy. It excels at keeping one target safe and brings dungeon utility, but area healing is its main weakness. It is more challenging than Holy, though its survivability and damage support solo play.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Discipline Priest in WoW Forever > New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Discipline Priest in WoW Forever > Strengths and Weaknesses of Discipline Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Discipline Priest Guide › Discipline Priest Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/discipline-priest-healer-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:e57d30324b2e84947222413010eb0ee1aa1964b0","section:aeeb86ce13ca5bfd0d640535f5dcc1f7097e848e"]},{"id":"clase-priest-sagrado","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sagrado: curación reactiva","title_en":"Holy: Reactive Healing","summary_es":"Sagrado es un sanador flexible de grupo, con curas para daño repartido y buen apoyo de banda.","summary_en":"Holy is a flexible group healer with split-damage tools and strong raid support.","keywords_es":["sacerdote sagrado","sacerdote sanador","destello curativo","rezo de curación","sanación conjunta"],"keywords_en":["holy priest","priest healer","flash heal","prayer of healing","binding heal"],"text_es":"Renovar mantiene curación gradual en el tanque y Curar es la cura eficiente; Destello curativo sirve de emergencia y Curación superior para daño fuerte. Rezo de curación atiende al grupo cuando varios están heridos; Rezo de alivio rebota, y Sanación conjunta cura al Sacerdote y a un aliado. Letanía de la Luz devuelve maná al alternar curas. Sagrado es accesible para quien empieza y ofrece curación flexible, pero sufre ante daño físico, poca movilidad y alto gasto de maná.","text_en":"Renew maintains gradual healing on the tank and Heal is the efficient spell; Flash Heal is for emergencies and Greater Heal for heavy damage. Prayer of Healing covers the group when several allies are injured; Prayer of Mending bounces, and Binding Heal restores the Priest and an ally. Litany of Light refunds mana when alternating heals. Holy is approachable for new players and offers flexible healing, but is vulnerable to physical damage, has little mobility, and uses a lot of mana.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Holy Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Holy Priest for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:holy:overview","class:priest:holy:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:24c425cd620eb7eef6e8079c365fafb2a3de3da7","section:3c0635772a056c230f6dcacc031cce9a2a9c358d","section:5e2a24f575de2ad01bd08b4bcd074a1e0d6baa1c","section:dafebaeca9dcb9d3537a430c8073f4d667090174"]},{"id":"clase-priest-sombra","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sombra: daño con DoTs","title_en":"Shadow: Damage with DoTs","summary_es":"Sombra hace daño periódico a distancia y ayuda al grupo con curación pasiva y Espíritu.","summary_en":"Shadow deals ranged damage over time and supports the group with passive healing and Spirit.","keywords_es":["sacerdote sombra","sombra dots","palabra de las sombras dolor","peste devoradora","unirse a vampírica"],"keywords_en":["shadow priest","shadow dots","shadow word pain","devouring plague","vampiric embrace"],"text_es":"Sombra es daño a distancia basado en efectos periódicos: mantiene Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor y Peste devoradora, y completa con Explosión mental y Despelleje mental. Unirse a vampírica cura al grupo según el daño infligido; Inspiración macabra aporta Espíritu. También ofrece Palabra de poder: entereza, Espíritu divino y Protección de las Sombras. El maná cuesta más de sostener hasta obtener Forma de las Sombras; Transfusión de espíritu y la varita ayudan; en Forma no puede lanzar hechizos de sanación y carece de área potente.","text_en":"Shadow is ranged damage based on damage-over-time effects: maintain Shadow Word: Pain and Devouring Plague, then fill with Mind Blast and Mind Flay. Vampiric Embrace heals the group based on damage dealt; Dark Inspiration grants Spirit. Shadow also brings Power Word: Fortitude, Divine Spirit, and Shadow Protection. Mana is harder to sustain until Shadowform; Spirit Tap and a wand help; in Shadowform, healing spells are unavailable, and Shadow lacks strong AoE.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Shadow Priest in WoW Forever > Strengths and Weaknesses of Shadow Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Shadow Priest in WoW Forever > Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shadow Priest Guide › Shadow Priest Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shadow-priest-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:shadow:overview","class:priest:shadow:rotation"],"source_hashes":["guide:c0eb91cf44af61f121b0b431e7209b525013181c","section:3f99cbd7294c823bc796a190ba94668088e14680","section:92c8f8685f78a11564eb33397f4aee69cb9db258"]},{"id":"clase-priest-stats-disciplina-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Disciplina a nivel 60","title_en":"Discipline Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Orden propuesto de sanación, maná, crítico y aguante; no probado a nivel 60.","summary_en":"Suggested healing, mana, crit, and stamina order; untested at level 60.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas disciplina sacerdote","sanación con hechizos disciplina","intelecto y espíritu disciplina","estadísticas Disciplina nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["discipline priest stat priority","discipline healing power","discipline intellect and spirit","discipline level 60 stats"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Sanación con hechizos > Intelecto > Espíritu > Crítico con hechizos > Poder con hechizos > Aguante. La Sanación con hechizos aporta alrededor de un tercio de ese valor al daño. Cada punto de Intelecto da 15 de maná y unos 59 puntos, 1% de crítico; cada punto de Aguante, 10 de salud. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Priority: Healing Power > Intellect > Spirit > Crit Chance > Spell Damage > Stamina. Healing Power adds about one-third of its value to damage. You gain 15 Mana per Intellect point; about 59 points yield 1% spell crit; each Stamina gives 10 health. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Discipline Priest Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Healing Power","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Intellect","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Stamina","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:1aceaeaab70b05a6b2045fb40e1d706f25197370","section:8394a63953d4fd7c46f9f6c2ff4c352b032bc719","section:ce77a0abb7e9ab59316d1eecb644bc95f0367fa8","section:d2d60e83b740efd54bd7daa992b8bf1c196674c9"]},{"id":"clase-priest-stats-sagrado-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Sagrado a nivel 60","title_en":"Holy Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Sanación y maná encabezan el orden; Golpe con hechizos no mejora las curas.","summary_en":"Healing and mana lead the order; Spell Hit does not improve heals.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas sagrado sacerdote","sanación con hechizos sagrado","regeneración maná sacerdote sagrado","estadísticas Holy Priest nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["holy priest stat priority","holy healing power stats","holy priest mana regeneration","holy priest level 60 stats"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Sanación con hechizos > Intelecto > Regeneración de maná cada 5 s > Espíritu > Golpe crítico (Crítico con hechizos) > Aguante. Intelecto da 15 de maná por punto y unos 59,2 puntos, 1% de crítico; 1 Aguante da 10 de salud. La regeneración cada 5 s sigue al lanzar y Golpe con hechizos no aumenta las curas. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Priority: Healing Power > Intellect > Mana per 5 seconds > Spirit > Spell Critical Strike > Stamina. Intellect gives 15 Mana per point and about 59.2 points give 1% spell crit; 1 Stamina gives 10 health. MP5 continues while casting, and Spell Hit does not improve heals. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Holy Priest Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Intellect","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Stamina","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Mana per 5 seconds","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Spell Hit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:holy:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:08d427a4a2ec69fc1d4054866cc19a436eac86a3","section:9510f22c8c31311370b28b66b236b9b6c5c30331","section:bb760c46522bd425d9832920c964eb0ce25ca4ba","section:e0a1937013b1b26e8fe9841f2021017c218ab80e","section:f4e72ab3c8770f71e1458dca48fe3d0b0e7725b0"]},{"id":"clase-priest-stats-sombra-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Sombra a nivel 60","title_en":"Shadow Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Llega a 17% de golpe; después prioriza crítico, daño de Sombras, intelecto y espíritu.","summary_en":"Reach 17% hit, then prioritize crit, Shadow damage, Intellect, and Spirit.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas sombra sacerdote","golpe Sombra hasta 17","crítico Forma de las Sombras","estadísticas Shadow Priest nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["shadow priest stat priority","shadow hit 17 percent","shadowform spell crit","shadow priest level 60 stats"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Prob. de golpe hasta 17% > Golpe crítico > Poder con hechizos o daño de Sombras > Intelecto > Espíritu > Aguante. Enfoque de las Sombras deja 12% de golpe por cubrir con equipo contra jefes. Intelecto da 15 de maná por punto; en Forma de las Sombras, el crítico inflige 200% del efecto normal. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Priority: Hit Chance to 17% > Spell Critical Strike > Spell Power or Shadow Damage > Intellect > Spirit > Stamina. Shadow Focus leaves 12% hit to cover with gear against bosses. Intellect gives 15 Mana per point; in Shadowform, spell crits deal 200% of their normal effect. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Shadow Priest Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Intellect","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Spell Critical Strike Chance","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Hit Chance","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:shadow:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:9844cf4fcd38a98cfbada85a218cd59485a3c990","section:b9d97deae5800e31b3ecef65c873349abec10bb7","section:ca4309e8635f3b84d08993c8ad434ad910e9dee4","section:ddf24c444b5df78ebd60cba674da4d3dc336ccf8"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-disciplina-tanque-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Disciplina: objetivo único","title_en":"Discipline Single-Target Rotation","summary_es":"Escuda al tanque, usa Penitencia y Renovar; reserva las curas caras para daño fuerte.","summary_en":"Shield the tank, use Penance and Renew, and save costly heals for heavy damage.","keywords_es":["rotación Disciplina tanque nivel 60","Penitencia Disciplina prioridad","Curar Sacerdote Disciplina","escudo tanque sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["discipline tank healing rotation","discipline penance priority","discipline priest heal priority","priest tank shield"],"text_es":"Abre con Palabra de poder: escudo en el tanque; Alma debilitada dura 15 s y los críticos de sanación acortan el efecto. Si está herido, usa Penitencia; mantén Renovar y, si Penitencia se recarga y aún falta salud, lanza Curar. Reserva Curación superior para daño fuerte, reduce su rango para ahorrar maná y cancélala si el objetivo se cura antes. Usa Palabra de poder: escudo ante peligro urgente.","text_en":"Open with Power Word: Shield on the tank; Weakened Soul lasts 15 seconds and healing crits shorten the effect. If the tank is injured, use Penance; maintain Renew, then cast Heal if Penance is on cooldown and the target is still hurt. Save Greater Heal for heavy damage, downrank to save Mana, and cancel if the target is healed before the cast finishes. Shield urgent targets.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Healing Rotation for Discipline Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:b61a87e320d0d9897da8a231c446f75b878cce59"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-disciplina-grupo-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Disciplina: daño de grupo","title_en":"Discipline Group-Healing Rotation","summary_es":"Rezo de curación es la cura de grupo principal; escuda a quien esté en peligro urgente.","summary_en":"Prayer of Healing is the main group heal; shield anyone in immediate danger.","keywords_es":["rotación área Disciplina nivel 60","Rezo de curación Disciplina","escudo urgente grupo sacerdote","curación múltiple Disciplina"],"keywords_en":["discipline group healing rotation","discipline prayer of healing","priest emergency shield group","discipline area healing"],"text_es":"Cuando el grupo reciba daño, lanza Rezo de curación sobre el grupo del aliado herido. Si alguien está en peligro inmediato, usa Palabra de poder: escudo: es menos eficiente que un Rezo de curación completo, pero instantáneo y dirigido. Disciplina tiene pocas alternativas para sanar en área, así que reserva el escudo para urgencias.","text_en":"When the group takes damage, cast Prayer of Healing on the party of an injured ally. If someone is in immediate danger, use Power Word: Shield: it is less efficient than a full Prayer of Healing, but instant and targeted. Discipline has few other area-healing options, so save the shield for urgent situations.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE Healing Rotation for Discipline Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:f9a2a9b7b64eeae717385ec2625fb51eaf225d95"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-sagrado-individual-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Sagrado: objetivo único","title_en":"Holy Single-Target Rotation","summary_es":"Renovar y Curar sostienen al tanque; Destello curativo y Curación superior responden a urgencias.","summary_en":"Renew and Heal sustain the tank; Flash Heal and Greater Heal answer emergencies.","keywords_es":["rotación Sagrado objetivo único","Curar Sacerdote Sagrado nivel 60","Destello curativo emergencia tanque","Renovar Sagrado sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["holy single target rotation","holy priest heal priority","flash heal tank emergency","holy renew rotation"],"text_es":"Mantén Renovar en el tanque y usa Curar como cura eficiente; reduce el rango ante daño previsible. Lanza Destello curativo si el tanque está en peligro inmediato: es rápido, pero caro. Usa Sanación conjunta cuando tú y el tanque estéis heridos, y Rezo de alivio para que rebote. Curación superior cubre una gran pérdida de salud, pero cuesta mucho maná; alterna curas con Letanía de la Luz para recuperar parte del coste.","text_en":"Keep Renew on the tank and use Heal as the efficient spell; downrank for predictable damage. Cast Flash Heal if the tank is in immediate danger: it is fast but expensive. Use Binding Heal when both you and the tank are injured, and Prayer of Mending to let it bounce. Greater Heal covers a large health loss but costs substantial Mana; alternate heals with Litany of Light to refund part of the cost.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Healing for Holy Priests in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:holy:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:1c568a38c2d43fcb8b258948ba4b89c32034e4ef","section:24c425cd620eb7eef6e8079c365fafb2a3de3da7"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-sagrado-grupo-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Sagrado: curación de grupo","title_en":"Holy Group-Healing Rotation","summary_es":"Rezo de alivio rebota; usa Rezo de curación con el grupo bajo y Nova Sagrada si está agrupado.","summary_en":"Prayer of Mending bounces; use Prayer of Healing when the group is low and Holy Nova when stacked.","keywords_es":["rotación de grupo Sagrado nivel 60","Rezo de curación grupo sacerdote","Rezo de alivio sacerdote","Nova Sagrada sanación"],"keywords_en":["holy group healing rotation","prayer of healing group","prayer of mending priest","holy nova group heal"],"text_es":"Mantén Renovar en el tanque y lanza Rezo de alivio sobre un aliado herido para que rebote. Usa Rezo de curación cuando la mayoría del grupo esté baja: tarda 3 s, consume mucho maná y sana al grupo del objetivo en un radio de 40 m desde él. Si el grupo está junto, Nova Sagrada cura a todos en 10 m sin generar amenaza. Cuando cese el daño de grupo, vuelve a las curas individuales.","text_en":"Keep Renew on the tank and cast Prayer of Mending on an injured ally so it can bounce. Use Prayer of Healing when most of the group is low: it has a 3-second cast, costs a lot of Mana, and heals the target’s party within 40 yards of that target. If the group is stacked, Holy Nova heals everyone within 10 yards without threat. Return to single-target heals when group damage ends.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Group Healing for Holy Priests in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-10-31"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:holy:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:8bf3ec20272d54aa9e5de94025c20839e6275495"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-sombra-objetivo-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Sombra: objetivo único","title_en":"Shadow Single-Target Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Dolor y Peste devoradora; usa Explosión mental y Palabra de las Sombras: muerte en reutilización.","summary_en":"Maintain Pain and Devouring Plague; cast Mind Blast and Shadow Word: Death on cooldown.","keywords_es":["rotación de Sombra nivel 60","Palabra de las Sombras Dolor prioridad","Peste devoradora rotación","Despelleje mental sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["shadow priest single target rotation","shadow word pain priority","devouring plague rotation","mind flay shadow priest"],"text_es":"Prelanza Explosión mental, aplica Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor y Peste devoradora, luego Palabra de las Sombras: muerte y Unirse a vampírica; vuelve a Explosión mental y canaliza Despelleje mental completo. Después, renueva Dolor y Peste al expirar, usa Explosión mental y Palabra de las Sombras: muerte en reutilización, mantén Unirse a vampírica si necesitas sanar al grupo y completa los huecos con Despelleje mental sin interrumpirlo.","text_en":"Pre-cast Mind Blast, apply Shadow Word: Pain and Devouring Plague, then Shadow Word: Death and Vampiric Embrace; cast Mind Blast again and fully channel Mind Flay. After the opener, refresh Pain and Plague as they expire, use Mind Blast and Shadow Word: Death on cooldown, keep Vampiric Embrace up when group healing is needed, and fill with full Mind Flay channels.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Shadow Priests in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Shadow Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Shadow Priest PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:shadow:rotation","class:priest:shadow:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:3d5c5d8e34af44a03bbf4d44543e22b8aaa51ca3","section:498f16903f5b9ebc87d616a94822228f7036d0a4"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-sombra-area-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Sombra: varios objetivos","title_en":"Shadow Multi-Target Rotation","summary_es":"Reparte Dolor en objetivos relevantes, reserva Peste devoradora para el principal y vigila el maná.","summary_en":"Spread Pain to relevant targets, reserve Devouring Plague for the primary, and watch mana.","keywords_es":["rotación área Sombra nivel 60","multidot Sacerdote Sombra","Dolor varios objetivos","Contagio devorador varios enemigos"],"keywords_en":["shadow aoe rotation","shadow priest multidot","shadow word pain multiple targets","devouring contagion spread"],"text_es":"Abre como contra un objetivo y aplica Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor también a los secundarios. Mantén Dolor en enemigos relevantes y Peste devoradora en el principal; usa Explosión mental y Palabra de las Sombras: muerte en reutilización, luego Unirse a vampírica y canaliza Despelleje mental. Repartir Dolor cuesta mucho maná; con Contagio devorador, Peste puede saltar desde un enemigo con poca salud. Transfusión de espíritu ayuda a recuperar maná si muere un objetivo afectado por Unirse a vampírica.","text_en":"Open as on a single target and apply Shadow Word: Pain to secondary enemies too. Shadow Word: Pain should remain active on relevant targets and Devouring Plague on the primary; use Mind Blast and Shadow Word: Death on cooldown, then Vampiric Embrace and channel Mind Flay. Multi-dotting Pain is mana-intensive; with Devouring Contagion, Plague can spread from a low-health enemy. Spirit Tap helps recover mana when an enemy affected by Vampiric Embrace dies.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Shadow Priests in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Shadow Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Shadow Priest PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:shadow:rotation","class:priest:shadow:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:2d3d01911376e581d3144b5e55fdcbffb0010634","section:e2c8b74f0c350195f76810c4fa9e22aee188ee61"]},{"id":"clase-priest-build-disciplina-banda-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Disciplina","title_en":"Discipline Raid Build","summary_es":"Build de sanación de banda con Infusión de poder y talentos esenciales de Sagrado.","summary_en":"Raid-healing build with Power Infusion and key Holy talents.","keywords_es":["build Disciplina banda sacerdote","talentos Disciplina raid nivel 60","Infusión de poder Disciplina","build sanador Disciplina PvE"],"keywords_en":["discipline raid build","discipline priest raid talents","power infusion discipline build","discipline healer pve build"],"text_es":"Disciplina: Disciplinas gemelas 5/5, Fuerza mental 5/5, Agilidad mental 3/3, Enfoque interno 1/1, Poder de la palabra mejorado: escudo 3/3, Meditación 3/3, Amparo de alma 1/1, Penitencia 1/1, Esperanza renovada 5/5, Égida divina 3/3 e Infusión de poder 1/1. Sagrado: Renovar mejorado 3/3, Especialización Sagrada 5/5, Furia divina 5/5, Recuperación bendita 1/3, Inspiración 3/3 y Curación mejorada 3/3. Es la variante de sanación de banda con Infusión de poder.","text_en":"Discipline: Twin Disciplines 5/5, Mental Strength 5/5, Mental Agility 3/3, Inner Focus 1/1, Improved Power Word: Shield 3/3, Meditation 3/3, Soul Warding 1/1, Penance 1/1, Renewed Hope 5/5, Divine Aegis 3/3, and Power Infusion 1/1. Holy: Improved Renew 3/3, Holy Specialization 5/5, Divine Fury 5/5, Blessed Recovery 1/3, Inspiration 3/3, and Improved Healing 3/3. This is the raid-healing variant with Power Infusion.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Discipline Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Discipline Priest PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:23e527cfb138257bf9ab7d4f39d17d70e17e488a"]},{"id":"clase-priest-build-disciplina-mazmorra-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de mazmorra de Disciplina","title_en":"Discipline Dungeon Build","summary_es":"Incluye varita para aportar daño e Inspiración para mejorar la defensa del tanque.","summary_en":"Adds wand damage and Inspiration to improve the tank’s defense.","keywords_es":["build Disciplina mazmorra","talentos Disciplina sacerdote mazmorra","Especialización en varitas sacerdote","Inspiración tanque sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["discipline dungeon build","discipline priest dungeon talents","priest wand specialization build","inspiration tank priest"],"text_es":"Disciplina: Especialización en varitas 2/2, Disciplinas gemelas 5/5, Precisión Sagrada 1/3, Fuerza mental 5/5, Agilidad mental 2/3, Enfoque interno 1/1, Poder de la palabra mejorado: escudo 3/3, Meditación 3/3, Amparo de alma 1/1, Penitencia 1/1, Esperanza renovada 5/5, Égida divina 3/3 e Infusión de poder 1/1. Sagrado: Renovar mejorado 1/3, Especialización Sagrada 5/5, Furia divina 5/5, Nova Sagrada 1/1, Inspiración 3/3 y Curación mejorada 3/3. La varita aporta daño cuando no curas; Inspiración refuerza la defensa del tanque.","text_en":"Discipline: Wand Specialization 2/2, Twin Disciplines 5/5, Holy Precision 1/3, Mental Strength 5/5, Mental Agility 2/3, Inner Focus 1/1, Improved Power Word: Shield 3/3, Meditation 3/3, Soul Warding 1/1, Penance 1/1, Renewed Hope 5/5, Divine Aegis 3/3, and Power Infusion 1/1. Holy: Improved Renew 1/3, Holy Specialization 5/5, Divine Fury 5/5, Holy Nova 1/1, Inspiration 3/3, and Improved Healing 3/3. The wand adds damage while healing is not needed; Inspiration improves tank defense.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Discipline Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Discipline Priest PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:f7aabffbecde3192bbb5b6824c3cc47c96a9bad1"]},{"id":"clase-priest-build-disciplina-pvp-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Disciplina","title_en":"Discipline PvP Build","summary_es":"Prioriza supervivencia y control; el punto de Sanación conjunta retirada queda libre.","summary_en":"Prioritizes survival and control; the removed Binding Heal point remains free.","keywords_es":["build JcJ Disciplina sacerdote","talentos PvP Disciplina","Desmayo sacerdote JcJ","Sanación conjunta talento retirado"],"keywords_en":["discipline pvp build","discipline priest pvp talents","blackout priest pvp","retired binding heal talent"],"text_es":"Disciplina: Disciplinas gemelas 5/5, Resolución silenciosa 3/3, Martirio 2/2, Enfoque interno 1/1, Poder de la palabra mejorado: escudo 3/3, Meditación 3/3, Fuego interno mejorado 3/3, Quemar maná mejorado 2/2, Amparo de alma 1/1, Penitencia 1/1 y Esperanza renovada 5/5. Sagrado: Enfoque crepuscular 3/3, Renovar mejorado 2/3, Custodia de hechizos 5/5, Nova Sagrada 1/1, Recuperación bendita 3/3 e Inspiración 2/3. Sombra: Desmayo 5/5. Prioriza supervivencia; el punto del antiguo talento Sanación conjunta, hoy hechizo de Sagrado, queda libre.","text_en":"Discipline: Twin Disciplines 5/5, Silent Resolve 3/3, Martyrdom 2/2, Inner Focus 1/1, Improved Power Word: Shield 3/3, Meditation 3/3, Improved Inner Fire 3/3, Improved Mana Burn 2/2, Soul Warding 1/1, Penance 1/1, and Renewed Hope 5/5. Holy: Twilight Focus 3/3, Improved Renew 2/3, Spell Warding 5/5, Holy Nova 1/1, Blessed Recovery 3/3, and Inspiration 2/3. Shadow: Blackout 5/5. This favors survival; the point of the old Binding Heal talent, now a Holy spell, is free to spend.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Discipline Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Discipline Priest PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:2e97167c8c8a35ecf45cefe3a0d579f873fba6af"]},{"id":"clase-priest-build-sagrado-banda-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Sagrado","title_en":"Holy Raid Build","summary_es":"Build de banda con Nova Sagrada, Rezo de alivio y apoyo de Disciplina.","summary_en":"Raid build with Holy Nova, Prayer of Mending, and Discipline support.","keywords_es":["build banda Sagrado sacerdote","talentos Holy raid nivel 60","Rezo de alivio build Sagrado","sanador Sagrado banda"],"keywords_en":["holy priest raid build","holy raid talents level 60","prayer of mending holy build","holy raid healer"],"text_es":"Disciplina: Disciplinas gemelas 5/5, Fuerza mental 5/5, Enfoque interno 1/1, Poder de la palabra mejorado: escudo 3/3, Meditación 3/3 y Amparo de alma 1/1. Sagrado: Enfoque crepuscular 1/3, Especialización Sagrada 5/5, Furia divina 5/5, Nova Sagrada 1/1, Inspiración 3/3, Alcance Sagrado 2/2, Curación mejorada 3/3, Letanía de la Luz 2/2, Espíritu de redencción 1/1, Guía espiritual 5/5, Curación espiritual 3/3 y Rezo de alivio 1/1. Enfoque interno conserva Espíritu mientras lanzas e Inspiración aporta armadura con curas críticas. Queda libre el punto del antiguo talento Sanación conjunta.","text_en":"Discipline: Twin Disciplines 5/5, Mental Strength 5/5, Inner Focus 1/1, Improved Power Word: Shield 3/3, Meditation 3/3, and Soul Warding 1/1. Holy: Twilight Focus 1/3, Holy Specialization 5/5, Divine Fury 5/5, Holy Nova 1/1, Inspiration 3/3, Holy Reach 2/2, Improved Healing 3/3, Litany of Light 2/2, Spirit of Redemption 1/1, Spiritual Guidance 5/5, Spiritual Healing 3/3, and Prayer of Mending 1/1. Inner Focus preserves Spirit while casting, and Inspiration adds armor on critical heals. The point of the old Binding Heal talent is free.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Holy Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Priest PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:holy:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:4037307f45331e0434800aa97f6d1271a30fbd3a"]},{"id":"clase-priest-build-sagrado-mazmorra-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de mazmorra de Sagrado","title_en":"Holy Dungeon Build","summary_es":"Build híbrida con Penitencia y Especialización en varitas para grupos pequeños.","summary_en":"Hybrid build with Penance and Wand Specialization for small groups.","keywords_es":["build mazmorra Sagrado sacerdote","build híbrida Disciplina Sagrado","Penitencia Nova Sagrada build","varita sacerdote mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["holy dungeon build","discipline holy hybrid build","penance holy nova build","priest wand dungeon build"],"text_es":"Disciplina: Especialización en varitas 2/2, Disciplinas gemelas 5/5, Fuerza mental 5/5, Enfoque interno 1/1, Poder de la palabra mejorado: escudo 3/3, Meditación 3/3, Amparo de alma 1/1 y Penitencia 1/1. Sagrado: Renovar mejorado 3/3, Especialización Sagrada 5/5, Furia divina 5/5, Nova Sagrada 1/1, Inspiración 3/3, Curación mejorada 3/3, Letanía de la Luz 2/2, Guía espiritual 5/5 y Curación espiritual 3/3. La combinación aporta daño de varita y herramientas para grupos pequeños.","text_en":"Discipline: Wand Specialization 2/2, Twin Disciplines 5/5, Mental Strength 5/5, Inner Focus 1/1, Improved Power Word: Shield 3/3, Meditation 3/3, Soul Warding 1/1, and Penance 1/1. Holy: Improved Renew 3/3, Holy Specialization 5/5, Divine Fury 5/5, Holy Nova 1/1, Inspiration 3/3, Improved Healing 3/3, Litany of Light 2/2, Spiritual Guidance 5/5, and Spiritual Healing 3/3. The hybrid adds wand damage and tools for small groups.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Holy Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Priest PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:holy:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:56949b23e5ded6fb206b22db1b635a51d35cdb95"]},{"id":"clase-priest-build-sagrado-pvp-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Sagrado","title_en":"Holy PvP Build","summary_es":"Build JcJ que invierte en supervivencia y control además de curación.","summary_en":"PvP build investing in survival and control alongside healing.","keywords_es":["build JcJ Sagrado sacerdote","talentos PvP Holy","Penitencia Disciplina JcJ","supervivencia sanador PvP"],"keywords_en":["holy priest pvp build","holy pvp talents","discipline penance pvp","priest healer pvp survival"],"text_es":"Disciplina: Disciplinas gemelas 5/5, Resolución silenciosa 3/3, Fuerza mental 5/5, Martirio 2/2, Enfoque interno 1/1, Poder de la palabra mejorado: escudo 3/3, Meditación 3/3, Fuego interno mejorado 3/3, Amparo de alma 1/1, Penitencia 1/1, Esperanza renovada 3/5, Égida divina 3/3 e Infusión de poder 1/1. Sagrado: Enfoque crepuscular 3/3, Especialización Sagrada 2/5, Furia divina 5/5, Nova Sagrada 1/1, Recuperación bendita 1/3, Inspiración 3/3 y Curación mejorada 2/3. Prima aguante y utilidad sobre sanación máxima.","text_en":"Discipline: Twin Disciplines 5/5, Silent Resolve 3/3, Mental Strength 5/5, Martyrdom 2/2, Inner Focus 1/1, Improved Power Word: Shield 3/3, Meditation 3/3, Improved Inner Fire 3/3, Soul Warding 1/1, Penance 1/1, Renewed Hope 3/5, Divine Aegis 3/3, and Power Infusion 1/1. Holy: Twilight Focus 3/3, Holy Specialization 2/5, Divine Fury 5/5, Holy Nova 1/1, Blessed Recovery 1/3, Inspiration 3/3, and Improved Healing 2/3. It favors survival and utility over maximum healing throughput.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Holy Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Holy Priest PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/talent-builds-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:holy:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:66c9fd757f8e31fab71ff57d095ed8a2d422bf22"]},{"id":"clase-priest-build-sombra-banda-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Sombra","title_en":"Shadow Raid Build","summary_es":"En banda, Explosión mental mejorada 4/5 basta: el quinto punto no acelera la rotación.","summary_en":"For raids, Improved Mind Blast 4/5 is enough; the fifth point does not speed up the rotation.","keywords_es":["build banda Sombra sacerdote","talentos Shadow raid nivel 60","Explosión mental mejorada 4/5","Inspiración macabra raid"],"keywords_en":["shadow priest raid build","shadow raid talents level 60","improved mind blast 4/5","dark inspiration raid"],"text_es":"Disciplina: Disciplinas gemelas 5/5, Resolución silenciosa 3/3, Fuerza mental 4/5 y Meditación 3/3. Sagrado: Enfoque crepuscular 3/3. Sombra: Enfoque de las Sombras 5/5, Explosión mental mejorada 4/5, Palabra de las Sombras: dolor mejorada 2/2, Alcance de las Sombras 2/2, Despelleje mental 1/1, Tortura mental mejorada 2/2, Inspiración macabra 5/5, Unirse a vampírica 1/1, Tejido de las Sombras 3/3, Contagio devorador 2/2, Oscuridad 5/5 y Forma de las Sombras 1/1. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Discipline: Twin Disciplines 5/5, Silent Resolve 3/3, Mental Strength 4/5, and Meditation 3/3. Holy: Twilight Focus 3/3. Shadow: Shadow Focus 5/5, Improved Mind Blast 4/5, Improved Shadow Word: Pain 2/2, Shadow Reach 2/2, Mind Flay 1/1, Improved Mind Flay 2/2, Dark Inspiration 5/5, Vampiric Embrace 1/1, Shadow Weaving 3/3, Devouring Contagion 2/2, Darkness 5/5, and Shadowform 1/1. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Shadow Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Shadow Priest PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Shadow Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Shadow Priests in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Shadow Priest Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:shadow:stats","class:priest:shadow:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:80714cd8f9dbf9c5a64814e47bffa13627e04da6","section:498f16903f5b9ebc87d616a94822228f7036d0a4","section:ddf24c444b5df78ebd60cba674da4d3dc336ccf8"]},{"id":"clase-priest-build-sombra-mazmorra-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de mazmorra de Sombra","title_en":"Shadow Dungeon Build","summary_es":"Transfusión de espíritu sostiene el maná al repartir Dolor entre varios enemigos.","summary_en":"Spirit Tap sustains mana while spreading Pain across several enemies.","keywords_es":["build mazmorra Sombra sacerdote","Transfusión de espíritu multienemigo","talentos Shadow mazmorra","multidot Sombra sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["shadow priest dungeon build","spirit tap multi-target","shadow dungeon talents","shadow priest multidot"],"text_es":"Disciplina: Disciplinas gemelas 5/5, Resolución silenciosa 3/3, Fuerza mental 2/5 y Meditación 3/3. Sombra: Enfoque de las Sombras 5/5, Transfusión de espíritu 5/5, Explosión mental mejorada 4/5, Palabra de las Sombras: dolor mejorada 2/2, Alcance de las Sombras 2/2, Despelleje mental 1/1, Tortura mental mejorada 2/2, Inspiración macabra 5/5, Unirse a vampírica 1/1, Tejido de las Sombras 3/3, Contagio devorador 2/2, Oscuridad 5/5 y Forma de las Sombras 1/1. Transfusión de espíritu apoya el maná al repartir Dolor.","text_en":"Discipline: Twin Disciplines 5/5, Silent Resolve 3/3, Mental Strength 2/5, and Meditation 3/3. Shadow: Shadow Focus 5/5, Spirit Tap 5/5, Improved Mind Blast 4/5, Improved Shadow Word: Pain 2/2, Shadow Reach 2/2, Mind Flay 1/1, Improved Mind Flay 2/2, Dark Inspiration 5/5, Vampiric Embrace 1/1, Shadow Weaving 3/3, Devouring Contagion 2/2, Darkness 5/5, and Shadowform 1/1. Spirit Tap supports mana while multi-dotting.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Shadow Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Shadow Priest PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:shadow:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:e2c8b74f0c350195f76810c4fa9e22aee188ee61"]},{"id":"clase-priest-build-sombra-pvp-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Sombra","title_en":"Shadow PvP Build","summary_es":"Build de control con Desmayo, Alarido psíquico mejorado y Silencio.","summary_en":"Control build with Blackout, Improved Psychic Scream, and Silence.","keywords_es":["build JcJ Sombra sacerdote","Desmayo Sacerdote PvP","Alarido psíquico mejorado JcJ","Silencio build Sombra"],"keywords_en":["shadow priest pvp build","blackout priest pvp","improved psychic scream pvp","shadow silence build"],"text_es":"Disciplina: Disciplinas gemelas 5/5, Resolución silenciosa 3/3, Martirio 2/2, Poder de la palabra mejorado: escudo 3/3 y Meditación 3/3. Sagrado: Enfoque crepuscular 3/3. Sombra: Enfoque de las Sombras 5/5, Desmayo 5/5, Palabra de las Sombras: dolor mejorada 2/2, Alcance de las Sombras 2/2, Alarido psíquico mejorado 2/2, Despelleje mental 1/1, Tortura mental mejorada 2/2, Unirse a vampírica 1/1, Tejido de las Sombras 3/3, Silencio 1/1, Contagio devorador 2/2, Oscuridad 5/5 y Forma de las Sombras 1/1. Desmayo y Alarido psíquico mejorado aportan control.","text_en":"Discipline: Twin Disciplines 5/5, Silent Resolve 3/3, Martyrdom 2/2, Improved Power Word: Shield 3/3, and Meditation 3/3. Holy: Twilight Focus 3/3. Shadow: Shadow Focus 5/5, Blackout 5/5, Improved Shadow Word: Pain 2/2, Shadow Reach 2/2, Improved Psychic Scream 2/2, Mind Flay 1/1, Improved Mind Flay 2/2, Vampiric Embrace 1/1, Shadow Weaving 3/3, Silence 1/1, Devouring Contagion 2/2, Darkness 5/5, and Shadowform 1/1. Blackout and Improved Psychic Scream add control.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Shadow Priest Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Shadow Priest PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:shadow:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:b04814265e62c3c471f3112b9303b702be8a6fec"]},{"id":"clase-priest-pros-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ventajas y límites del Sacerdote al subir","title_en":"Priest Leveling Strengths and Limits","summary_es":"El Sacerdote cura desde el inicio y aporta daño y sanación al grupo, pero su movilidad y maná limitan el leveo.","summary_en":"Priests can heal early and contribute damage or healing in groups, but mobility and mana can limit leveling.","keywords_es":["ventajas sacerdote leveo","desventajas sacerdote","sacerdote movilidad","sacerdote maná al subir"],"keywords_en":["priest leveling pros","priest leveling cons","priest mobility","priest mana leveling"],"text_es":"El Sacerdote dispone de curas desde el nivel 1 y puede alternar entre daño y sanación en mazmorras; la varita sostiene el daño inicial sin gastar maná. Disciplina combina supervivencia con buen daño para un sanador, y Sombra puede afrontar varios enemigos con efectos periódicos. Al subir, la movilidad escasea y el maná limita los lanzamientos; Sombra no tiene daño en área tradicional y las especializaciones de sanación matan más despacio en solitario.","text_en":"Priests have healing spells from level 1 and can switch between damage and healing in dungeons; a wand sustains early damage without mana. Discipline combines survivability with good damage for a healer, while Shadow can handle several enemies with damage-over-time effects. Leveling is limited by low mobility and mana; Shadow has no traditional AoE, and the healing specializations kill more slowly solo.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Discipline Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling","class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:271b8ebab7ef6dd1b579aa69fc6b3e87ab9681a8","section:703e651fcf0881d07e4fa202c924f037bb76638f","section:e03e7d2d0c3f83e40d017c7743eebeca568571a4","section:e4e93c108ebf5c1b6d88b7b2fca5e41c1212a9cc"]},{"id":"clase-priest-talentos-disciplina-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Disciplina (subida)","title_en":"Discipline Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Empieza con varita y regeneración de maná; después de Penitencia, añade talentos Sagrados para lanzar hechizos.","summary_en":"Start with wand damage and mana regeneration; after Penance, add Holy talents to shift toward casting.","keywords_es":["talentos disciplina subir","especialización en varitas","penitencia talentos","furia divina sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["discipline leveling talents","wand specialization","penance talents","divine fury priest"],"text_es":"Disciplina: Poder en la Luz 5/5, Especialización en varitas 2/2, Precisión Sagrada 1/3, Fuerza mental 5/5, Agilidad mental 3/3, Enfoque interno 1/1, Poder de la palabra mejorado: escudo 3/3 (Palabra de poder: escudo), Meditación 3/3, Fuego interno mejorado 3/3, Amparo de alma 1/1 y Penitencia 1/1. Sagrado: Enfoque crepuscular 3/3, Especialización Sagrada 5/5, Furia divina 5/5, Nova Sagrada 1/1, Recuperación bendita 1/3, Alcance Sagrado 1/2 y Luz abrasadora 2/2. Sombra: Transfusión de espíritu 5/5. Empieza con varita; Meditación sostiene el maná y Penitencia abre la fase de lanzar hechizos.","text_en":"Discipline: Power in Light 5/5, Wand Specialization 2/2, Holy Precision 1/3, Mental Strength 5/5, Mental Agility 3/3, Inner Focus 1/1, Improved Power Word: Shield 3/3 (Power Word: Shield), Meditation 3/3, Improved Inner Fire 3/3, Soul Warding 1/1, and Penance 1/1. Holy: Twilight Focus 3/3, Holy Specialization 5/5, Divine Fury 5/5, Holy Nova 1/1, Blessed Recovery 1/3, Holy Reach 1/2, and Searing Light 2/2. Shadow: Spirit Tap 5/5. Start with wanding; Meditation supports mana, and Penance opens the casting phase.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Discipline Priest in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Open World Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:943a7e5d8a7092c71a66f6640c2b7b1c892beb71","section:d1bd6a6912195f57c946093438b21017992da3e8"]},{"id":"clase-priest-talentos-sagrado-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Sagrado (subida)","title_en":"Holy Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Para misiones, toma Especialización en varitas 2/2; para sanar mazmorras, puedes omitirla.","summary_en":"For questing, take Wand Specialization 2/2; for dungeon healing, you can skip it.","keywords_es":["talentos sagrado leveo","especialización en varitas sagrado","renovar mejorado","rezo de alivio talento"],"keywords_en":["holy leveling talents","wand specialization holy","improved renew","prayer of mending talent"],"text_es":"Si subes en solitario, toma primero Especialización en varitas 2/2: aporta mucho daño mientras la varita sea tu fuente principal; si curas mazmorras la mayor parte del tiempo, puedes omitirla. En Sagrado, prioriza Renovar mejorado 3/3, Especialización Sagrada 5/5 y Furia divina 5/5; después añade Nova Sagrada 1/1 y Vinculación sagrada 1/1. Rezo de alivio 1/1 es el último talento del árbol y llega a comienzos de los cuarenta; luego puedes invertir en Disciplina con Enfoque interno 1/1 y Meditación 3/3. Esta ruta pura puede llegar a 60 sin cambiar talentos.","text_en":"If you level solo, take Wand Specialization 2/2 first: it adds substantial damage while the wand is your main source; if you heal dungeons most of the time, you can skip it. In Holy, prioritize Improved Renew 3/3, Holy Specialization 5/5, and Divine Fury 5/5; then add Holy Nova 1/1 and Holy Binding 1/1. Prayer of Mending 1/1 is the tree’s final talent and arrives in the early forties; afterward, you can invest in Discipline with Inner Focus 1/1 and Meditation 3/3. This pure route can reach 60 without respeccing.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Holy Priest in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:holy:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:80fac1ee8913cfea611101363504eaa195f7b81f"]},{"id":"clase-priest-ruta-sombra-disciplina-40","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de Disciplina a Sombra a nivel 40","title_en":"Discipline-to-Shadow Route at 40","summary_es":"Empezar en Disciplina con Meditación suaviza el maná inicial; cambiar a Sombra a 40 adelanta Forma de las Sombras.","summary_en":"Starting Discipline with Meditation eases early mana; switching to Shadow at 40 gets Shadowform sooner.","keywords_es":["disciplina a sombra nivel 40","cambiar talentos sacerdote","meditación antes de sombra","forma de las sombras leveo"],"keywords_en":["discipline to shadow level 40","priest respec leveling","meditation before shadow","shadowform leveling"],"text_es":"Si el maná y las pausas te frenan antes del 40, puedes empezar en Disciplina y tomar Meditación 3/3; después cambia a Sombra al 40 para acceder a Forma de las Sombras. La ruta de Sombra sin cambio de talentos llega a 60, pero Especialización en varitas 2/2 retrasa Forma de las Sombras dos niveles. Elige el cambio si priorizas daño y supervivencia cuanto antes; conserva la ruta sin cambio si prefieres evitar el coste de reasignar talentos.","text_en":"If mana and drinking breaks slow you before 40, you can start in Discipline and take Meditation 3/3, then switch to Shadow at 40 to access Shadowform. With no reset, a Shadow build reaches 60, but Wand Specialization 2/2 delays Shadowform by two levels. Choose the reset to gain damage and survivability sooner; keep the no-reset route if you prefer to avoid the respec cost.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Shadow Priest DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:6c47394a8cc686fb35961e93a0ed6afb061861b7","section:9c4f8a9f677581b514a13e7ed5614bdaa6d16c20"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-disciplina-solo-1-40","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Disciplina en solitario: niveles 1-40","title_en":"Discipline Solo Rotation: Levels 1-40","summary_es":"Hasta cerca del 40, la varita hace la mayor parte del trabajo; usa Penitencia desde 30 o Dolor para marcar deprisa.","summary_en":"Until around 40, the wand does most of the work; use Penance from 30 or Pain for a quick tag.","keywords_es":["rotación disciplina solo","disciplina niveles 1 40","penitencia leveo","varita sacerdote solo"],"keywords_en":["discipline solo rotation","discipline levels 1 40","penance leveling","priest wand solo"],"text_es":"Antes del combate, mantén Palabra de poder: entereza y Fuego interno, y usa Palabra de poder: escudo. Hasta cerca del 40, la varita aporta la mayor parte del daño; desde 30, abre con Penitencia si no compites por el objetivo, o usa Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor para marcarlo rápido si hay otros jugadores. Ataca con la varita hasta derrotarlo, renueva Dolor si aún tiene mucha salud y usa Renovar si te falta vida. Repón maná cada uno o dos enemigos.","text_en":"Before combat, keep Power Word: Fortitude and Inner Fire active, and cast Power Word: Shield. Until around 40, the wand supplies most of your damage; from 30, open with Penance if the target is uncontested, or use Shadow Word: Pain for a quick tag when other players are present. Wand until the enemy dies, refresh Pain if it still has substantial health, and use Renew if you are low. Refill mana every one or two enemies.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Open World Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:d1bd6a6912195f57c946093438b21017992da3e8"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-disciplina-solo-41-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Disciplina en solitario: niveles 41-60","title_en":"Discipline Solo Rotation: Levels 41-60","summary_es":"Desde cerca del 41, combina Fuego Sagrado, Penitencia y Acometida; usa Dolor para marcar objetivos disputados.","summary_en":"From around 41, combine Holy Fire, Penance, and Smite; use Pain to tag contested targets.","keywords_es":["rotación disciplina 41","disciplina leveo avanzado","fuego sagrado penitencia","acometida sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["discipline rotation 41","discipline leveling late","holy fire penance","smite priest"],"text_es":"Mantén Palabra de poder: entereza, Espíritu divino y Fuego interno; antes del pull usa Palabra de poder: escudo. Desde cerca del 41, abre con Fuego Sagrado y Penitencia si el objetivo está libre; si hay competencia, marca con Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor. Lanza Acometida mientras Penitencia se recarga y renueva Fuego Sagrado cuando termina su daño periódico; omite el ciclo si el enemigo está a punto de caer. Usa Renovar si te falta salud; según el equipo, la varita aún puede competir durante un tramo.","text_en":"Keep Power Word: Fortitude, Divine Spirit, and Inner Fire active; cast Power Word: Shield before the pull. From around 41, open with Holy Fire and Penance if the target is uncontested; if others are competing, tag it with Shadow Word: Pain. Cast Smite while Penance recharges and refresh Holy Fire when its damage-over-time ends; skip the cycle if the enemy is nearly dead. Use Renew if you are low; depending on gear, the wand may still remain competitive for a while.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Open World Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:d1bd6a6912195f57c946093438b21017992da3e8"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-sagrado-solo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Sagrado en solitario","title_en":"Holy Solo Rotation","summary_es":"Abre con Explosión mental o Fuego Sagrado desde 20, aplica Dolor y termina con la varita.","summary_en":"Open with Mind Blast or Holy Fire from 20, apply Pain, and finish with the wand.","keywords_es":["rotación sagrado solo","levear sacerdote sagrado","explosión mental sacerdote","fuego sagrado nivel 20"],"keywords_en":["holy solo rotation","level holy priest","mind blast priest","holy fire level 20"],"text_es":"Mantén Palabra de poder: entereza y Fuego interno, y usa Palabra de poder: escudo antes del pull. Abre con Explosión mental, o con Fuego Sagrado desde 20; aplica Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor y lanza Acometida si al enemigo todavía le queda mucha salud. Termina con la varita y repite Explosión mental cuando esté disponible si el combate se alarga; usa Renovar si recibes golpes. Contra un enemigo débil que cae con pocos ataques de varita, puedes omitir Dolor para no retrasar la regeneración de maná.","text_en":"Keep Power Word: Fortitude and Inner Fire active, and cast Power Word: Shield before the pull. Open with Mind Blast, or with Holy Fire from 20; apply Shadow Word: Pain and cast Smite if the enemy still has substantial health. Finish with the wand and recast Mind Blast when available if the fight lasts; use Renew if you take hits. Against a weak enemy that dies to a few wand attacks, skip Pain so you do not delay mana regeneration.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:holy:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:00ee99ee77ac0b309d4dc67c1fe2d57abbb22c3f"]},{"id":"clase-priest-entrenar-hechizos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué rangos de hechizos entrenar","title_en":"Which Spell Ranks to Train","summary_es":"Con poco oro, prioriza curas y defensas de uso frecuente; puedes retrasar utilidades y algunos rangos de daño.","summary_en":"With little gold, prioritize frequent heals and defenses; utility and some damage ranks can wait.","keywords_es":["entrenar rangos sacerdote","hechizos obligatorios sacerdote","rangos curas y daño","ahorrar oro entrenador"],"keywords_en":["priest spell ranks","mandatory priest spells","healing and damage ranks","save gold trainer"],"text_es":"Con poco oro, prioriza rangos recientes de curas y defensas; Sombra debe mantener al día sus hechizos de daño. Sagrado también usa Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor y Explosión mental en misiones en solitario; actualiza sus curas si sanas mazmorras. Disciplina entrena todos los rangos de Renovar, Palabra de poder: escudo, Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor, Peste devoradora, Fuego Sagrado y Acometida, aunque puede saltarse algunos de estos dos últimos mientras la varita sea más eficaz, hasta cerca de 40. Los rangos altos hacen más daño y cuestan más maná; retrasa utilidades si falta oro.","text_en":"With little gold, prioritize current ranks of rotational heals and defenses; Shadow should keep its damage spells current. Holy also uses Shadow Word: Pain and Mind Blast for solo questing; update healing ranks if you heal dungeons. Discipline trains all ranks of Renew, Power Word: Shield, Shadow Word: Pain, Devouring Plague, Holy Fire, and Smite, but can skip some of the last two while the wand is more effective, until around 40. Higher ranks deal more damage but cost more mana; delay utility spells if gold is tight.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Discipline Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Discipline Priest","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling","class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:628b2e1e68dbaa8e9b35135f3b30906598527a79","section:6a0ae65cee81c24ec47cc141bc290e8a6f8a07ee","section:9e9442a5fbb345fbe5ff6e817a113d7444aaa85c","section:d05a5ef314c97953d17cd27ca13f6d3643053f55"]},{"id":"clase-priest-profesiones-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones recomendadas para subir","title_en":"Recommended Leveling Professions","summary_es":"Costura mejora el equipo de tela y Encantamiento fabrica varitas; hay alternativas para consumibles y oro.","summary_en":"Tailoring improves cloth gear and Enchanting crafts wands; alternatives support consumables and gold.","keywords_es":["profesiones sacerdote leveo","costura y encantamiento","alquimia sacerdote","primeros auxilios sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["priest leveling professions","tailoring enchanting","priest alchemy","priest first aid"],"text_es":"Costura y Encantamiento combinan bien: la primera convierte la tela que sueltan los enemigos en equipo útil, y la segunda fabrica varitas que aumentan el daño y permite encantar objetos. Alquimia ofrece consumibles; las profesiones de recolección ayudan a vender materiales, e Ingeniería da opciones útiles para JcJ. Primeros auxilios es una profesión secundaria adicional: permite fabricar vendas y pociones de salud.","text_en":"Tailoring and Enchanting work well together: Tailoring turns enemy cloth drops into useful gear, while Enchanting crafts damage-boosting wands and adds item enchants. Alchemy provides consumables; gathering professions help sell materials, and Engineering offers useful PvP options. First Aid is an additional secondary profession that lets you craft bandages and health potions.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Discipline Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadow Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Shadow Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling","class:priest:shadow:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:3ab8a56f1171836925a70eb6deb08ef30499f061","section:542995445c19a7dd1394b04b666d48aaa4c5ca79","section:e29968562b631fcb0956f81f0b5906c052936625"]},{"id":"clase-priest-consumibles-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles para subir","title_en":"Leveling Consumables","summary_es":"Agua y pociones de salud y maná reducen las pausas; comida con experiencia aporta una bonificación útil.","summary_en":"Water and health and mana potions reduce downtime; experience food adds a useful bonus.","keywords_es":["agua sacerdote leveo","pociones salud maná","comida experiencia sacerdote","consumibles baratos leveling"],"keywords_en":["priest leveling water","health mana potions","priest experience food","leveling consumables cost"],"text_es":"Prioriza agua y pociones de salud y maná; aparecen bebidas mejores aproximadamente cada 5 niveles y conviene llevar 3 montones de 20, bebiendo cada 1-2 enemigos. La comida de salud importa menos porque el Sacerdote puede curarse, pero el Huevo cocido con hierbas aporta 5% de experiencia. Reserva las pociones para emergencias: Alquimia fabrica las de maná y Primeros auxilios las de salud. Elixires, frascos y potenciadores de combate suelen ser demasiado caros para mantenerlos durante el leveo.","text_en":"Prioritize water and health and mana potions; stronger drinks become available about every 5 levels, and carrying 3 stacks of 20 lets you drink every 1-2 enemies. Health food matters less because your healing spells restore health, but Herb Baked Egg grants 5% experience. Save potions for emergencies: Alchemy crafts mana potions and First Aid crafts health potions. Elixirs, flasks, and combat boosts are usually too expensive to keep stocked while leveling.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Discipline Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4126a142676700d6c0ed24a5a9656f569deca0ed","section:b94f5c3dd7227a413bc41b95204780037e012e4b"]},{"id":"clase-priest-campamento-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de campamento para subir","title_en":"Leveling Campfire Bonuses","summary_es":"Al volver a la ciudad, aprovecha la hoguera: hay bonificaciones de experiencia, maná, intelecto y estadísticas.","summary_en":"Use campfires when returning to town for experience, mana, intellect, and stat bonuses.","keywords_es":["bonificaciones campamento sacerdote","tienda de campamento","pozo de maná","laúd encantado vela incienso"],"keywords_en":["priest camping buffs","camp tent bonus","mana well","enchanted lute incense candle"],"text_es":"Al regresar a la ciudad, descansa junto a una hoguera para recibir los objetos que hayan dejado otros jugadores. La Tienda de campamento, de Peletería, aumenta la experiencia descansada hasta 5% de un nivel; el Pozo de maná de Alquimia da regeneración de maná cada 5 s. El Laúd encantado de Encantamiento aporta armadura, estadísticas principales y resistencias; la Vela de incienso de Herboristería mejora el Intelecto. Estas bonificaciones no se acumulan con sus mejoras de clase correspondientes.","text_en":"When you return to town, rest by a campfire to receive items other players have left there. Camp Tent from Leatherworking increases rested experience by up to 5% of a level; Mana Well from Alchemy grants mana regeneration every 5 seconds. Enchanted Lute from Enchanting adds armor, primary stats, and resistances; Incense Candle from Herbalism increases Intellect. These bonuses do not stack with their corresponding class buffs.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Discipline Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:366fc480e602eb185119f424a2f8d3a4de18478e","section:c4beb1d72eb3d91765e7b0895e9846e047f8d06d"]},{"id":"clase-priest-legado-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Puntos de Legado para subir","title_en":"Legacy Points for Leveling","summary_es":"Al llegar el primer punto a 25, prioriza experiencia descansada, talentos adicionales y recuperación tras cada muerte.","summary_en":"When the first point arrives at 25, prioritize rested experience, extra talents, and recovery after each kill.","keywords_es":["puntos de legado sacerdote","bien descansado talentoso","emoción de la aventura","legado para levear sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["priest legacy points","well rested talented","thrill of adventure","legacy leveling priest"],"text_es":"El primer punto de Legado llega a 25. Para acelerar el leveo, prioriza Bien descansado y Talentoso en la rama Aventura: la experiencia descansada y los puntos de talento adicionales ayudan a avanzar y alcanzar nodos clave antes. Emoción de la aventura también reduce las pausas porque cura y devuelve maná tras cada muerte. Si morir en mazmorras te hace perder tiempo, Este muerto está muy vivo facilita volver; en un reino JcJ, Alerta máxima ayuda contra enemigos en sigilo al aire libre, pero no sirve en campos de batalla.","text_en":"The first Legacy Point arrives at 25. To speed leveling, prioritize Well Rested and Talented in the Adventure tree: rested experience and extra talent points help you progress and reach key nodes sooner. Thrill of Adventure also reduces downtime by healing and restoring mana after each kill. If dungeon deaths cost time, The Quick and the Dead eases the run back; on a PvP realm, High Alert helps against stealth enemies in the open world but does not work in battlegrounds.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best use of Legacy Points for Discipline Priest DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best use of Legacy Points for Holy Priest in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling","class:priest:holy:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:213cb4d5d89ec5702a87be3c227e5c5bf144351e","section:5ae3e95c5648e48c77683cdd3d90446ef7dfceb5"]},{"id":"clase-priest-rotacion-disciplina-area-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Daño en área de Disciplina al subir","title_en":"Discipline AoE While Leveling","summary_es":"Disciplina carece de un área eficiente al subir; suele rendir mejor concentrar el daño en un enemigo.","summary_en":"Discipline lacks efficient leveling AoE; focusing damage on one enemy is usually more effective.","keywords_es":["disciplina daño área","nova sagrada disciplina leveo","varios enemigos disciplina","rotación AoE sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["discipline AoE damage","holy nova discipline leveling","multiple enemies discipline","priest AoE rotation"],"text_es":"La Nova Sagrada requiere invertir en Sagrado y resulta poco eficiente para Disciplina por el maná y los talentos que consume. Repartir Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor entre varios enemigos también puede vaciar el maná; suele ser mejor centrarse en un objetivo y usar la varita. Considera Nova Sagrada solo si ya tienes los talentos y el coste compensa la situación.","text_en":"Holy Nova requires investment in Holy and is inefficient for Discipline because of its mana and talent cost. Multiple applications of Shadow Word: Pain can also consume mana; focusing on one target and using the wand is usually better. Holy Nova is worth considering only when you already have its talents and the cost suits the situation.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Discipline Priest Leveling Guide › AoE DPS Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/discipline-priest-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:priest:discipline:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ac2500827c8dd08f9a6f1bda7121540adb346938"]},{"id":"clase-priest-raciales-detalle","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades raciales del Sacerdote","title_en":"Priest racial abilities","summary_es":"Las dos habilidades de cada raza, con enfriamientos.","summary_en":"Each race's two abilities, with cooldowns.","keywords_es":["gracia divina humano","castigar enano","destello desconcertante gnomo","plan de contingencia","toque de debilidad no-muerto","maleficio de debilidad trol"],"keywords_en":["divine grace human","chastise dwarf","confounding flash gnome","contingency plan","touch of weakness undead","hex of weakness troll"],"text_es":"Humano: Gracia divina (cura a un aliado con menos del 50 % de salud, no a ti; 10 min) y Rebote (15 s; 3 min). Enano: Castigar (daño sagrado e inmoviliza 2 s a humanoides; 2 min) y Rezo desesperado (10 min). Elfo de la noche: Gracia de Elune (-50 % de golpes recibidos, 15 s; 5 min) y Fragmentos estelares (canalizado 6 s; 30 s). Gnomo: Destello desconcertante (confunde a 5 enemigos 3 s; 2 min) y Plan de contingencia (10 min). Trol: Maleficio de debilidad (2 min) y Guardia de las Sombras (3 cargas). No-muerto: Toque de debilidad y Sacrificio oscuro (vida a maná en 15 s; 10 min).","text_en":"Human: Divine Grace (heals an ally below 50% Health, not yourself; 10 min) and Feedback (15 s; 3 min). Dwarf: Chastise (Holy damage and a 2-second immobilize on Humanoids; 2 min) and Desperate Prayer (10 min). Night Elf: Elune's Grace (-50% chance to be hit, 15 s; 5 min) and Starshards (6-second channel; 30 s). Gnome: Confounding Flash (confuses 5 enemies for 3 s; 2 min) and Contingency Plan (10 min). Troll: Hex of Weakness (2 min) and Shadowguard (3 charges). Undead: Touch of Weakness and Dark Sacrifice (health to mana over 15 s; 10 min).","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Abilities Guide - Forever › Priest Racial Spells for Discipline Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Abilities Guide - Forever › Priest Racial Spells for Holy Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:priest:discipline:abilities","class:priest:holy:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:249bb217677664c5ae2b493178fd2de1b98770ec","section:dad67f1383ccb93851d79cf349d2a4a94fa71b22"]},{"id":"clase-priest-hechizos-dano-detalle","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hechizos de daño del Sacerdote","title_en":"Priest damage spells","summary_es":"Palabra de las Sombras: muerte, Peste devoradora y otros.","summary_en":"Shadow Word: Death, Devouring Plague and others.","keywords_es":["palabra de las sombras muerte nivel","peste devoradora cualquier raza","quemar maná sacerdote","fuego sagrado cuánto dura","explosión mental enfriamiento"],"keywords_en":["shadow word death level","devouring plague any race","priest mana burn","holy fire duration","mind blast cooldown"],"text_es":"Palabra de las Sombras: muerte es nueva en Forever: la entrenan todos los sacerdotes desde el nivel 32, es instantánea (15 s de enfriamiento) y, si el objetivo sobrevive, recibes un retroceso del 10 % de tu salud máxima. Peste devoradora ya no es solo de no-muertos: te cura con el daño que hace (1 min). Explosión mental tarda 1,5 s y se recarga en 8 s. Fuego Sagrado hace daño instantáneo y luego 10 s de daño periódico. Quemar maná drena maná del objetivo y le daña según lo quemado.","text_en":"Shadow Word: Death is new in Forever: every Priest trains it from level 32, it is instant (15-second cooldown) and, if the target survives, you take backlash equal to 10% of your max health. Devouring Plague is no longer Undead-only: it heals you for the damage dealt (1-minute cooldown). Mind Blast has a 1.5-second cast and an 8-second cooldown. Holy Fire deals instant damage then 10 seconds of damage over time. Mana Burn burns the target's mana and hurts it in proportion to what was burned (Shadow).","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Abilities Guide - Forever › Damage Spells for Holy Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Abilities Guide - Forever › Damage Spells for Discipline Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:priest:discipline:abilities","class:priest:holy:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:419decbdcc4d300945ee617d4fc4e581edabaeaf","section:af09198a1ef2f886685c6b456412c9c61d7ca969"]},{"id":"clase-priest-utilidades-detalle","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Utilidades del Sacerdote: niveles y duraciones","title_en":"Priest utilities: levels and durations","summary_es":"Custodia de miedo, Espíritu de redención, disipaciones y más.","summary_en":"Fear Ward, Spirit of Redemption, dispels and more.","keywords_es":["custodia de miedo todas las razas","espíritu de redencción cuánto dura","disipar magia cuántos efectos","desvanecer enfriamiento","infusión de poder"],"keywords_en":["fear ward all races","spirit of redemption duration","dispel magic how many effects","fade cooldown","power infusion"],"text_es":"Custodia de miedo ya no es solo de enanos: todos la entrenan a nivel 20 (3 min de duración y enfriamiento; bloquea el siguiente miedo). Espíritu divino se entrena a nivel 30 y ya no es talento; sus versiones de grupo llegan a los niveles 60 (espíritu) y 56 (protección de las Sombras). Disipar magia rango 2 quita dos efectos. Suprimir enfermedad limpia durante 20 s. Desvanecer baja la amenaza 10 s (30 s de enfriamiento). Espíritu de redencción dura 15 s y cura sin maná. Infusión de poder da +20 % de daño y curación 15 s a otro jugador.","text_en":"Fear Ward is no longer Dwarf-only: every Priest trains it at level 20 (3-minute duration and cooldown; blocks the next Fear). Divine Spirit is trained at level 30 and is no longer a talent; the group versions arrive at level 60 (Spirit) and 56 (Shadow Protection). Rank 2 Dispel Magic removes two effects. Abolish Disease keeps cleansing for 20 s. Fade lowers threat for 10 s (30-second cooldown). Spirit of Redemption lasts 15 s and casts healing for free. Power Infusion gives +20% spell damage and healing for 15 s to another player.","tags":["PRIEST"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Holy Priest Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Holy Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/holy/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Discipline Priest Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Discipline Priests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:priest:discipline:abilities","class:priest:holy:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:988af43449b6925b1792b892aee30b6b7957c598","section:f65f813698141282638417bacc02687b553ff093"]}]},"04-clase-rogue.json":{"description":"Capítulo 4: Clases. Pícaro. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"clase-rogue-que-hace","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace un Pícaro","title_en":"What a Rogue Does","summary_es":"El Pícaro combina sigilo, daño individual e interrupciones; carece de autocuración y área amplia.","summary_en":"Rogue combines stealth, single-target damage, and interrupts, but lacks self-healing and broad AoE.","keywords_es":["qué hace un pícaro","pícaro cuerpo a cuerpo","pícaro sigilo","pícaro control","pícaro daño individual"],"keywords_en":["what does a rogue do","rogue melee","rogue stealth","rogue control","rogue single target"],"text_es":"El Pícaro es un combatiente cuerpo a cuerpo que combina Sigilo, Energía y puntos de combo para preparar ataques y remates. Aporta daño individual, interrupciones y control, pero no una mejora de banda significativa. Carece de autocuración y área amplia; Evasión, Esfumar, Amago y Ceguera ayudan a sobrevivir y controlar los combates.","text_en":"Rogue is a melee fighter who combines Stealth, Energy, and Combo Points to set up attacks and finishers. It brings single-target damage, interrupts, and control, but no significant raid buff. It lacks self-healing and broad AoE; defensive tools such as Evasion, Vanish, Feint, and Blind help it survive and control fights.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Rogue Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Rogue in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/rogue-class-overview","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Assassination Rogue Guide › Assassination Rogue Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/assassination-rogue-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Assassination Rogue Guide › Endless Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/assassination-rogue-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Assassination Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Combat Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Subtlety Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Subtlety Rogue for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:overview","class:rogue:combat:overview","class:rogue:general:rogue-class-overview","class:rogue:subtlety:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:c64ca868aebbdf48d4cb5d3fe8641a354692d9dd","section:1b2e8c83c872a9f18591f0866c2202d1ea5af6d2","section:1d19d39dea22145e568b1cb8e1bf4dd7503be785","section:26f0593f8706f85629d54f49efb7cdb77b8fd167","section:49c1965775a197c5e9e74095fbac7469ab414c5c","section:eb91ef8afdf934dd4289c209cdb2ab19758e547a","section:f65fb692110f1f996cc73439c0e31148133b5203"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-especializaciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones del Pícaro","title_en":"Rogue Specializations","summary_es":"Asesinato potencia venenos; Combate favorece ataques automáticos y cleave; Sutileza combina sigilo y sangrados.","summary_en":"Assassination empowers poisons; Combat favors auto-attacks and cleave; Subtlety combines stealth and bleeds.","keywords_es":["especializaciones pícaro","diferencia asesinato combate sutileza","pícaro venenos","pícaro sangrados","cleave combate pícaro"],"keywords_en":["rogue specializations","assassination combat subtlety difference","rogue poisons","rogue bleeds","combat rogue cleave"],"text_es":"Asesinato potencia venenos y daño individual; Mutilar hace un 20% más de daño a enemigos envenenados y la inmunidad a venenos lo perjudica. Combate tiene tres builds: Golpe siniestro y Veneno rinden parecido; la de Puñalada queda algo atrás. Genera con Golpe siniestro o Puñalada y usa Ráfaga con espada y Eviscerar. Mientras, Sutileza combina Sigilo y sangrados; genera con Hemorragia y gasta en Hacer picadillo o Ruptura. Sus dos builds flexibles priorizan Marca de muerte y Cuchillo de bota o profundizan en Asesinato para Golpes despiadados, Veneno y Sello del destino; esta última rinde más.","text_en":"Assassination Rogues focus on poisons and single-target damage; Mutilate hits poisoned enemies 20% harder, and poison immunity hinders them. Combat has three builds: Sinister Strike and Venom perform similarly; the dagger/Backstab variant falls behind. It uses auto-attacks and Blade Flurry for cleave. Meanwhile, Subtlety combines stealth and bleeds, building with Hemorrhage and spending on Slice and Dice or Rupture. Its two flexible builds favor Death Mark and Boot Knife or go deeper into Assassination for Relentless Strikes, Venom, and Seal Fate; the latter performs best.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Assassination Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Assassination Rogue DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Combat Rogue for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Opening Rotation for Combat Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Combat Rogue Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Combat Rogue PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Subtlety Rogue for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Subtlety Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Subtlety Rogue Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Subtlety Rogue PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Subtlety Rogue DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Guide › Subtlety Rogue Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:overview","class:rogue:assassination:rotation","class:rogue:combat:overview","class:rogue:combat:rotation","class:rogue:combat:talents","class:rogue:subtlety:overview","class:rogue:subtlety:rotation","class:rogue:subtlety:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:0efe35de8a6b61a43cf4a3e6c89f9c8065ffd7e3","section:1b2e8c83c872a9f18591f0866c2202d1ea5af6d2","section:1d19d39dea22145e568b1cb8e1bf4dd7503be785","section:1d8b87b5fcb88cb20c7e4c10f3926d07849698c9","section:26f0593f8706f85629d54f49efb7cdb77b8fd167","section:38a49afdc60164a2c4f34e9dae4992d445306b02","section:46f72368175181fb8a617195f4ebec1f48ab8701","section:59c963bc3f26b484bec395601436b95523309c52","section:7a35a5ea33258d3f9008e77fed51f8733c66be6e","section:8173dc81cac36120bade5a8c57750e3c4168611c","section:fc6cb0ee129267ab10ce1ec541798d3774aee642"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué cambia en Forever para el Pícaro","title_en":"What Changes for Rogue in Forever","summary_es":"Forever actualiza la Energía, los puntos de combo, Apuñalar y las sinergias de venenos y armas.","summary_en":"Forever updates Energy, Combo Points, Shank, and poison and weapon synergies.","keywords_es":["cambios pícaro forever","energía continua pícaro","puntos de combo objetivo","apuñalar energía","talentos pícaro forever"],"keywords_en":["rogue forever changes","smooth energy regeneration","combo points target","shank energy","rogue talent changes"],"text_es":"En Forever, la Energía se regenera de forma continua y los puntos de combo siguen en su objetivo al cambiar, mientras no generes puntos en otro. Ahora se pueden empuñar hachas; Amago reduce la amenaza y Apuñalar devuelve Energía. Los venenos pueden combinarse con Tótem Viento Furioso y piedras de afilar, y escalan con poder de ataque. Asesinato añade Mutilar, Veneno y Salpicadura de sangre; Combate unifica las especializaciones de arma en Cortar y rebanar y mantiene Golpe siniestro, Eviscerar y Ráfaga con espada; Sutileza incorpora Marca de muerte, Cuchillo de bota y Evasión rápida.","text_en":"Forever brings smooth Energy regeneration and Combo Points stay on their target when you switch, unless you generate points on another. Rogues can now wield axes; Feint reduces threat and Shank restores Energy. Poisons can be used with Windfury Totem and sharpening stones and scale with Attack Power. Assassination adds Mutilate, Venom, and Blood Splatter; its Combat tree combines weapon specializations in Hack and Slash and retains Sinister Strike, Eviscerate, and Blade Flurry; Subtlety adds Death Mark, Boot Knife, and Quick Getaway.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Assassination Rogue in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Combat Rogue for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Combat Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:overview","class:rogue:combat:overview","class:rogue:combat:rotation","class:rogue:subtlety:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:46f72368175181fb8a617195f4ebec1f48ab8701","section:5806c2cca19edf13e5438fdc4ac4ef97f6ccf982","section:59c963bc3f26b484bec395601436b95523309c52","section:9f9842e7fd775db7ceb7ca6a639ade43221cd0e4","section:ab56e54f8c623814ea7b1f18dcd17652b85822ef","section:ef5b18a83c64beca3f3af6c357e88d60522b996e"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-armas-armadura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas y armadura del Pícaro","title_en":"Rogue Weapons and Armor","summary_es":"Qué armas convienen a cada especialización y qué protección ofrece el cuero.","summary_en":"Which weapons suit each specialization and how much protection leather provides.","keywords_es":["armas del pícaro","armadura del pícaro","pícaro dagas","pícaro doble empuñadura","pícaro equipo de cuero"],"keywords_en":["rogue weapons","rogue armor","rogue daggers","rogue dual wield","rogue leather gear"],"text_es":"La armadura de cuero ofrece poca defensa física. Asesinato necesita dos dagas para usar Mutilar y prioriza el daño del arma. Combate aprovecha un arma lenta y de mucho daño máximo en la mano principal para potenciar Estocada. Sutileza puede abrir con daga y cambiar a un arma lenta; Hemorragia funciona con ambos tipos.","text_en":"Leather armor provides little physical defense. Assassination needs two daggers to use Mutilate and prioritizes weapon damage. Combat benefits from a slow, high-top-end-damage main-hand weapon to strengthen Riposte. Subtlety can open with a dagger and swap to a slow weapon; Hemorrhage works with either type.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide › Stats","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/assassination-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Combat Rogue Leveling Guide › Key Combat Leveling Talents","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/combat-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:284ab926085e3d99a2b34ff11e3b160c74d8c104","section:4d7950e1c327ba43fcd2bbeb061b7153f2a738ee","section:4dd4a468d57e6c953206041e0dfc99b90c4d9b0d","section:9a9897324eadd0ed2b0193d0fca3ad16c5368441"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-subir-espec","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejor especialización para subir","title_en":"Best Specialization for Leveling","summary_es":"Compara la supervivencia de Combate, el inicio lento de Asesinato y el daño explosivo de Sutileza.","summary_en":"Compare Combat’s survivability, Assassination’s slow start, and Subtlety’s burst damage.","keywords_es":["mejor especialización para subir pícaro","pícaro combate para levear","pícaro asesinato para subir","pícaro sutileza para subir","qué spec de pícaro usar"],"keywords_en":["best rogue leveling spec","combat rogue leveling","assassination rogue leveling","subtlety rogue leveling","which rogue spec to level"],"text_es":"Combate ofrece una subida fluida gracias a sus defensas y herramientas para reducir el daño recibido. Asesinato es la opción menos viable, sobre todo antes de desbloquear los venenos al 20 y su habilidad clave al 30. Sutileza se centra en el daño explosivo y puede derrotar rápido a muchos enemigos; Emboscada y Sigilo potencian su apertura.","text_en":"Combat levels smoothly thanks to its defenses and tools for reducing incoming damage. Assassination is the least viable choice, especially before unlocking poisons at 20 and its key ability at 30. Subtlety focuses on burst damage and can defeat many enemies quickly; Ambush and Stealth strengthen its opener.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as an Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Combat Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Subtlety Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Subtlety Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:06b17a90aeaaca5fd4f294071299b79656c1dcd2","section:123f459cee2b872cb875c2b160fa3ba2d6a63b36","section:417f86e451fc3fc6502a5c3e9499cb23efccf995","section:4d7950e1c327ba43fcd2bbeb061b7153f2a738ee","section:53fc29f80db3ebc044def6e5878ce03c749d9e5a"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-talentos-combate","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Combate (subida)","title_en":"Combat Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Ruta de Combate: 4 puntos iniciales, reinicio al 20 y talentos clave al 30 y 40.","summary_en":"Combat path: first 4 points, a level-20 respec, and key talents at 30 and 40.","keywords_es":["talentos para subir pícaro combate","ruta de combate","golpes eficientes","estocada","ráfaga con espada"],"keywords_en":["combat rogue leveling talents","combat talent path","efficient strikes","riposte","blade flurry"],"text_es":"Los 4 primeros puntos son Golpes eficientes 2/2 y Ataques implacables 2/2. Al 20, reinicia para priorizar Estocada 1/1 y luego recupera Ataques implacables 2/2. La build descodificada también asigna Precisión 3/3, Ejecución impecable 1/1 y Cortar y rebanar 5/5; busca Ráfaga con espada 1/1 al 30 y Subidón de adrenalina 1/1 al 40.","text_en":"Spend the first 4 points on Efficient Strikes 2/2 and Remorseless Attacks 2/2. At 20, respec to prioritize Riposte 1/1, then restore Remorseless Attacks 2/2. The decoded build also assigns Precision 3/3, Flawless Execution 1/1, and Hack and Slash 5/5; aim for Blade Flurry 1/1 at 30 and Adrenaline Rush 1/1 at 40.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Combat Rogue DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Combat Rogue Leveling Guide › Key Combat Leveling Talents","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/combat-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Combat Rogue Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/combat-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:combat:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:337b9f6e75b0a3dc64c854181d6f70f4bdd3537c","section:4dd4a468d57e6c953206041e0dfc99b90c4d9b0d","section:d1cf6716626bede2367a1ff6e4ebdf5b33d80be3"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-hitos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de habilidad por nivel","title_en":"Ability Milestones by Level","summary_es":"Hitos de armas, misiones de clase y habilidades de las tres especializaciones.","summary_en":"Weapon, class-quest, and ability milestones for all three specializations.","keywords_es":["cuándo aprendo habilidades de pícaro","nivel de las habilidades del pícaro","hitos del pícaro","mutilar nivel","esfumar nivel"],"keywords_en":["when rogue abilities","rogue ability levels","rogue milestones","mutilate level","vanish level"],"text_es":"Al 10 puedes llevar dos armas; al 15, haz la misión de Ganzúa; al 18 aprendes Emboscada y al 20, la misión para crear venenos. Después: Esfumar al 22, Apuñalar al 24, Golpe bajo al 26; al 30, Hemorragia (Sutileza), Veneno (Asesinato) y Ráfaga con espada (Combate); Ceguera al 34; Mutilar (Asesinato) y Subidón de adrenalina (Combate) al 40; cadena de misiones disponible al 50.","text_en":"At 10 you can wield two weapons; at 15, complete the Lockpicking quest; learn Ambush at 18 and the poison-crafting quest at 20. Then: Vanish at 22, Shank at 24, Cheap Shot at 26; at 30, Hemorrhage (Subtlety), Venom (Assassination), and Blade Flurry (Combat); Blind at 34; Mutilate (Assassination) and Adrenaline Rush (Combat) at 40; the Ravenholdt chain becomes available at 50.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/assassination-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Combat Rogue Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/combat-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4665fcaf304501c786511b2500d79650fbbd914a","section:8fc11b4903c4e76d43556dc2b0e96da363e18f67","section:9a9897324eadd0ed2b0193d0fca3ad16c5368441","section:d1cf6716626bede2367a1ff6e4ebdf5b33d80be3"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-energia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Energía y puntos de combo","title_en":"Energy and Combo Points","summary_es":"La Energía fluye de forma continua; los puntos de combo permanecen ligados a su objetivo.","summary_en":"Energy regenerates smoothly; Combo Points remain attached to their target.","keywords_es":["energía pícaro","puntos de combo","regeneración energía pícaro","apuñalar energía","remates pícaro"],"keywords_en":["rogue energy","combo points","rogue energy regeneration","shank energy","rogue finishers"],"text_es":"La Energía se recupera de forma continua, no en pulsos; la celeridad aumenta los ataques automáticos, pero no esa regeneración. Los puntos de combo permanecen en su objetivo al cambiar, salvo que generes otros en uno distinto. Apuñalar cuesta 5 de Energía, tiene 10 s de reutilización y devuelve 25 a rango máximo. Entre los generadores están Golpe siniestro, Puñalada, Mutilar y Hemorragia; Eviscerar, Hacer picadillo, Ruptura y Exponer armadura gastan puntos.","text_en":"Energy recovers continuously rather than in ticks; Haste speeds up auto-attacks but not Energy regeneration. Combo Points stay on their target when you switch unless you generate points on another. Shank costs 5 Energy, has a 10-second cooldown, and returns 25 at max rank. Builders include Sinister Strike, Backstab, Mutilate, and Hemorrhage. Finishers such as Eviscerate, Slice and Dice, Rupture, and Expose Armor spend points.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Assassination Rogue in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Assassination Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Assassination Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Combat Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Subtlety Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:overview","class:rogue:assassination:rotation","class:rogue:combat:overview","class:rogue:combat:rotation","class:rogue:subtlety:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:1d19d39dea22145e568b1cb8e1bf4dd7503be785","section:274e4cfa6da8235973d3422fab57111f23e58e96","section:4a9f5acc678a5ea8e23694e0e99d23e4c63ffa4e","section:9f9842e7fd775db7ceb7ca6a639ade43221cd0e4","section:b13c881fc830d0834ed759e20e3f6b36d3b5973a","section:c9868236e59b71e4901d2007c94a4a0acf699bb0"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-sigilo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo funciona el sigilo","title_en":"How Stealth Works","summary_es":"Cómo afectan el nivel, los talentos y la dirección del enemigo a Sigilo.","summary_en":"How level, talents, and enemy facing affect Stealth.","keywords_es":["sigilo del pícaro","cómo funciona sigilo","emboscada desde sigilo","zapar","detección de sigilo"],"keywords_en":["rogue stealth","how stealth works","ambush opener","sap","stealth detection"],"text_es":"Sigilo reduce el radio al que te detectan; cuánto puedes acercarte depende de tu nivel frente al enemigo y de talentos que refuerzan Sigilo, aunque algunos rivales pueden detectarte igualmente. Distraer hace que miren hacia un punto elegido; como detectan peor desde atrás, puedes usarlo para escabullirte.","text_en":"Stealth reduces the range at which enemies detect you; how close you can get depends on your level relative to theirs and talents that strengthen Stealth, though some enemies can still detect you. Distract makes them look toward a chosen spot; since detection is weaker from behind, use it to sneak past.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide › What Is Stealth?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/assassination-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Subtlety Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:417f86e451fc3fc6502a5c3e9499cb23efccf995","section:59ffa16799a4031c06c7e5386d28adffb03d13be","section:b39de9a76fd21b81b6da8cfa7fa299d9dae03d2c"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-venenos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Venenos y Té de cardo","title_en":"Poisons and Thistle Tea","summary_es":"A 20 se desbloquean venenos y Té de cardo; Asesinato combina venenos instantáneos y mortales.","summary_en":"At 20, poisons and Thistle Tea unlock; Assassination combines Instant and Deadly Poison.","keywords_es":["venenos del pícaro","misión de venenos nivel 20","veneno instantáneo","veneno mortal","té de cardo energía"],"keywords_en":["rogue poisons","level 20 poison quest","instant poison","deadly poison","thistle tea energy"],"text_es":"La misión de clase de nivel 20 desbloquea fabricar y usar venenos y Té de cardo, que recupera Energía. Los venenos pueden combinarse con Tótem Viento Furioso y piedras de afilar, y escalan con poder de ataque. Asesinato suele llevar Veneno instantáneo en la mano principal y Veneno mortal en la secundaria; cambia las manos si se caen sus acumulaciones. La inmunidad a venenos reduce mucho el daño de Asesinato.","text_en":"The level-20 class quest unlocks poison crafting and use, and Thistle Tea, which restores Energy. Poisons can be combined with Windfury Totem and sharpening stones, and scale with Attack Power. Assassination usually applies Instant Poison to the main hand and Deadly Poison to the off-hand; swap them if its stacks fall off. Poison immunity greatly reduces Assassination damage.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Assassination Rogue in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Assassination Rogue Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/assassination-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:assassination:overview","class:rogue:assassination:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:0bd24538b9743ed0473c0c28028e439cf34b5dda","section:30b3b5946f7a692694ec7f1f17855b3e7d207cb6","section:58f33469a53581103d105211abba0691ba5ef85d","section:9f9842e7fd775db7ceb7ca6a639ade43221cd0e4"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Control, defensas y utilidad","title_en":"Control, Defenses, and Utility","summary_es":"Qué habilidades del Pícaro controlan enemigos, interrumpen o ayudan a sobrevivir.","summary_en":"Which Rogue abilities control enemies, interrupt, or help you survive.","keywords_es":["control del pícaro","zapar","golpe bajo","golpe a los riñones","evasión y esfumar"],"keywords_en":["rogue control","sap","cheap shot","kidney shot","evasion vanish"],"text_es":"Desde Sigilo, Zapar mantiene a un rival fuera un rato y Golpe bajo lo aturde. Incapacitación y Ceguera interrumpen o desorientan, pero el daño rompe sus efectos; Patada corta lanzamientos. Golpe a los riñones aturde según los puntos de combo y Evasión aumenta la esquiva. Esfumar permite escapar o reiniciar la amenaza; Desactivar trampa sirve en mazmorras.","text_en":"When stealthed, Sap keeps an enemy out briefly and Cheap Shot stuns it. Gouge and Blind interrupt or disorient, but damage breaks their effects; Kick stops casts. Kidney Shot stuns based on Combo Points, and Evasion increases dodge. Vanish can help you escape or reset threat; Disarm Trap is useful in dungeons.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide › Important Abilities","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/assassination-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4d7950e1c327ba43fcd2bbeb061b7153f2a738ee","section:b39de9a76fd21b81b6da8cfa7fa299d9dae03d2c","section:d65c37503230e2adda93963dee6e8f9bda5a80ee"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-rotacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación básica para subir","title_en":"Basic Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Prioridad de apertura, generadores y remates al subir con cada especialización.","summary_en":"Opener, builders, and finishers while leveling each specialization.","keywords_es":["rotación del pícaro","rotación para subir pícaro","golpe siniestro","eviscerar","hacer picadillo"],"keywords_en":["rogue rotation","rogue leveling rotation","sinister strike","eviscerate","slice and dice"],"text_es":"Asesinato: abre desde Sigilo con Golpe bajo si aturde; mantén venenos y genera con Puñalada desde atrás o Golpe siniestro (Mutilar desde 40). Gasta puntos en Hacer picadillo si habrá más objetivos; si no, Eviscerar con 5. Combate: Estocada al activarse, Golpe siniestro para generar; Hacer picadillo si habrá otro objetivo, si no Eviscerar con 5. Sutileza: Emboscada al abrir, Golpe fantasmal y Apuñalar al estar disponibles; Hemorragia genera puntos desde 30, Ruptura remata a rivales duraderos y Eviscerar a los casi derrotados.","text_en":"Assassination: open from Stealth with Cheap Shot if it stuns; keep poisons active and build with Backstab from behind or Sinister Strike (Mutilate from 40). Spend points on Slice and Dice if more targets will follow; otherwise use Eviscerate at 5. Combat: use Riposte when it procs, build with Sinister Strike, then Slice and Dice if another target is nearby or Eviscerate at 5. Subtlety: open with Ambush, use Ghostly Strike and Shank when available; build with Hemorrhage from 30, finish durable targets with Rupture and nearly defeated ones with Eviscerate.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Assassination Rogue DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Combat Rogue DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Subtlety Rogue DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/assassination-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Combat Rogue Leveling Guide › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/combat-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0bd24538b9743ed0473c0c28028e439cf34b5dda","section:0beb366310a39deab682bbb3874ef98e2979077d","section:2ab55b40b8c23bd6621934047831504474f28761","section:8fc11b4903c4e76d43556dc2b0e96da363e18f67","section:d68b68bdea216929d6d03549586a641d20f2e94a","section:f85c7ec49379127e67d3bfa11770f19547082c68","section:f8eb46b413fa6073e90b220f6159e76e4e3083da"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Daño en área y sus límites","title_en":"Area Damage and Its Limits","summary_es":"Qué hacer cuando hay varios enemigos y qué aporta Ráfaga con espada.","summary_en":"What to do against several enemies and what Blade Flurry adds.","keywords_es":["pícaro daño en área","ráfaga con espada","pícaro sin área","pícaro varios enemigos","combate cleave"],"keywords_en":["rogue aoe","blade flurry","rogue no aoe","rogue multiple enemies","combat cleave"],"text_es":"Asesinato y Sutileza no tienen daño de área real, así que mantienen la prioridad de objetivo único. Combate tampoco tiene una rotación de área propia: desde el 30, Ráfaga con espada permite golpear brevemente a un segundo objetivo cercano; por lo demás, usa la misma secuencia que contra un solo enemigo.","text_en":"Assassination and Subtlety have no true area damage, so they keep their single-target priority. Combat has no separate AoE rotation either: from 30, Blade Flurry briefly lets you hit a second nearby target; otherwise, use the same sequence as against one enemy.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/assassination-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Combat Rogue Leveling Guide › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/combat-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:41d5d2e9cd32f1380334d158b1d9a55b7ed9ad46","section:cb6c9a7f0888cef76b4c1513afd5f3fbb41ebc82","section:d94bd1d420a44bc59386f036aad2e344b9a6dc01"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-misiones-clase","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de clase del Pícaro","title_en":"Rogue Class Quests","summary_es":"Las misiones raciales empiezan en torno a 10; la cadena necesaria para venenos se completa a 20.","summary_en":"Racial class quests start around 10; the required poison chain is completed at 20.","keywords_es":["misiones de clase pícaro","hoja de astucia","misión de venenos pícaro","misión pícaro alianza","misión pícaro horda"],"keywords_en":["rogue class quests","blade of cunning","rogue poison quest","alliance rogue quest","horde rogue quest"],"text_es":"Las misiones de clase de nivel 10 suelen recompensar con Hoja de Astucia. La cadena obligatoria de nivel 20 cambia por facción: en la Alianza, el Maestro Mathias Shaw te envía desde Ventormenta a robar el Calendario de envíos Defias al Maestro de embarcadero Defias usando Sigilo; hacen falta Robar y Ganzúa a 75. La Horda empieza con Shenthul; necesitas Ganzúa 75 para abrir la caja. Al completarla, aprendes a fabricar y usar venenos y preparar Té de cardo.","text_en":"Level 10 class quests usually reward Blade of Cunning. The required level 20 chain varies by faction: for the Alliance, Master Mathias Shaw in Stormwind sends you to pickpocket the Defias Shipping Schedule from the Defias Dockmaster using Stealth; Pick Pocket and Pick Lock must be at 75. Shenthul starts the Horde chain; Pick Lock 75 is needed to open the chest. Completing the chain teaches you to craft and use poisons and make Thistle Tea.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Rogue Class Quests Guide › Rogue Class Quest Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/rogue-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Rogue Class Quests Guide › Dwarf and Gnome Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/rogue-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Rogue Class Quests Guide › Human Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/rogue-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Rogue Class Quests Guide › Night Elf Rogue Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/rogue-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Rogue Class Quests Guide › Orc and Troll Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/rogue-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Rogue Class Quests Guide › Undead Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/rogue-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Rogue Class Quests Guide › Level 20 - Mathias and the Defias","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/rogue-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Rogue Class Quests Guide › Level 20 - The Shattered Salute","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/rogue-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:general:rogue-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["guide:750a4d44d622fe222033c933c67db06e64ebac63","section:2deebdfa09f8b5ea73b69b8fb16a90710c4f5c20","section:9291c0a1567088ebcda427d197769e8dd3f5847e","section:97ea5215bb255d449e3850afe35289127840165e","section:a4f7c78ee6cbaf81bc11212ca33df04f23e4762c","section:d394a1c0da0b8efd1ee28fa31eac8ee7ce916467","section:f4ba15b50fe19e66fe4f522375a6acec035ad3af"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-tips-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Tips","summary_es":"Consejos de supervivencia, profesiones y experiencia descansada para subir.","summary_en":"Survival, profession, and rested-experience tips for leveling.","keywords_es":["consejos para subir pícaro","pícaro primeros auxilios","pícaro vendas","peletería y desuello pícaro","buffs de campamento"],"keywords_en":["rogue leveling tips","rogue first aid","rogue bandages","leatherworking skinning rogue","campfire buffs"],"text_es":"Lleva comida, pociones y vendas: la poca armadura y la falta de autosanación hacen peligrosos los golpes; Incapacitación o Ceguera pueden darte tiempo para vendarte. Para equipo, combina Desollar y Peletería; para oro para hechizos, bolsas y montura al 40, elige dos entre Minería, Desollar y Botánica. Botánica y Alquimia también son buena pareja; Ingeniería sirve para JcJ. Aprovecha los beneficios de campamento y descansa en posadas para acumular experiencia descansada. Si te falta Energía, usa Incapacitación y espera a recuperarla antes de volver al combate.","text_en":"Carry food, potions, and bandages: low armor and no self-healing make hits dangerous; Gouge or Blind can give you time to bandage. Skinning and Leatherworking let you craft gear; for gold for spells, bags, and your mount at 40, choose two of Mining, Skinning, and Herbalism. Herbalism and Alchemy also pair well; Engineering suits PvP. Use camp buffs and rest in inns to build rested experience. If energy runs low, use Gouge and wait to recover before re-engaging.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Combat Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Combat Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/assassination-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:207e32a73ea335cdb4be3ebfce3aae634b4bc491","section:599696816f2db96955fefa01f60abd9ab4ba3139","section:6757e928b65b15b96514fa59eb01a29950e1b371","section:7612697b96f6cc8dd7586d0ebdd7e5d43c4254a0","section:856eb9ca8bfa9214789bf113de89a3b00ea9c645","section:96346404802623b8cee963f049da5a9a315f612e"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Pícaro en grupo y mazmorras","title_en":"Rogue in Groups and Dungeons","summary_es":"El Pícaro aporta daño individual, interrupciones y control, pero no una mejora de banda importante.","summary_en":"Rogue brings single-target damage, interrupts, and control, but no significant raid buff.","keywords_es":["pícaro en grupo","control pícaro mazmorras","interrumpir con patada","exponer armadura pícaro","ráfaga con espada cleave"],"keywords_en":["rogue in groups","rogue dungeon control","kick interrupt","rogue expose armor","blade flurry cleave"],"text_es":"En grupo, el Pícaro aporta daño a un objetivo, interrupciones y control. Patada, Incapacitación, Golpe a los riñones, Golpe bajo y Esfumar pueden frenar lanzamientos; Zapar y Ceguera amplían el control. No ofrece una mejora de banda significativa y Exponer armadura no aporta nada único si ya está Hender armadura. Combate destaca por el cleave de Ráfaga con espada. Entre las defensas está Evasión.","text_en":"In groups, Rogue brings single-target damage, interrupts, and control. Kick, Gouge, Kidney Shot, Cheap Shot, and Vanish can stop casts; Sap and Blind add further control. Rogue offers no significant raid buff, and Expose Armor adds no unique contribution when Sunder Armor is present. Combat stands out for Blade Flurry cleave. Its defensive toolkit also includes Evasion.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Combat Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Combat Rogue DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Assassination Rogue Guide › Endless Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/assassination-rogue-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:overview","class:rogue:assassination:rotation","class:rogue:combat:overview","class:rogue:combat:rotation","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:c64ca868aebbdf48d4cb5d3fe8641a354692d9dd","section:391665810b424d5a804dbad8408d63137dca2abf","section:58f33469a53581103d105211abba0691ba5ef85d","section:b39de9a76fd21b81b6da8cfa7fa299d9dae03d2c","section:f65fb692110f1f996cc73439c0e31148133b5203"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-asesinato","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Asesinato: venenos y un objetivo","title_en":"Assassination: Poisons and One Target","summary_es":"Asesinato combina venenos y Mutilar para daño individual, pero sufre ante inmunidades.","summary_en":"Assassination combines poisons and Mutilate for single-target damage, but struggles against immunities.","keywords_es":["pícaro asesinato","mutilar enemigos envenenados","veneno talento asesinato","eviscerar asesinato","daño un objetivo asesinato"],"keywords_en":["assassination rogue","mutilate poisoned target","venom talent assassination","assassination eviscerate","assassination single target"],"text_es":"Asesinato se centra en daño a un objetivo: Mutilar genera puntos y golpea un 20% más a enemigos envenenados; cambia a Combate si necesitas cleave. Mantén Hacer picadillo y gasta puntos sobrantes en Eviscerar, preferiblemente con 4 o más puntos; usa Hacer picadillo con 1 cuando sea posible. El talento pasivo Veneno potencia el daño y la aplicación de venenos durante 6 s tras Apuñalar. Puede aplicar Exponer armadura si hace falta; no tiene área verdadera y la inmunidad a venenos reduce mucho su daño.","text_en":"Assassination focuses on single-target damage: the builder Mutilate generates Combo Points and hits poisoned enemies 20% harder; switch to Combat if you need cleave. Maintain Slice and Dice and spend excess points on Eviscerate, preferably at 4 or more points; use Slice and Dice at 1 point when possible. The passive Venom talent boosts poison damage and application for 6 seconds after Shank. It can apply Expose Armor when needed; it has no true AoE, and poison immunity greatly reduces its damage.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Assassination Rogue for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Assassination Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Assassination Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Assassination Rogue DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Assassination Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Assassination Rogue Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:overview","class:rogue:assassination:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:0efe35de8a6b61a43cf4a3e6c89f9c8065ffd7e3","section:1d19d39dea22145e568b1cb8e1bf4dd7503be785","section:2fd53293a8a7ef3554511cba908a39e31b041006","section:30b3b5946f7a692694ec7f1f17855b3e7d207cb6","section:46f72368175181fb8a617195f4ebec1f48ab8701","section:b34f64d9602aa96c512e23ff5fc9fa620f7f4604","section:c9868236e59b71e4901d2007c94a4a0acf699bb0"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-combate","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Combate: daño sostenido y Ráfaga","title_en":"Combat: Sustained Damage and Blade Flurry","summary_es":"Tres builds: arma lenta y Golpe siniestro, daga y Puñalada, o Veneno.","summary_en":"Three builds: slow weapon with Sinister Strike, dagger with Backstab, or Venom.","keywords_es":["pícaro combate","golpe siniestro","puñalada combate","ráfaga con espada","build combate daga"],"keywords_en":["combat rogue","sinister strike","combat backstab","blade flurry","combat dagger build"],"text_es":"Combate se apoya en ataques automáticos y tiene el cleave más fuerte del Pícaro, sin depender de venenos ni sangrados. Hay tres builds: Golpe siniestro con arma principal lenta y Veneno rinden de forma parecida; la variante de daga usa Puñalada y queda algo por detrás. Mantén Hacer picadillo, gasta puntos sobrantes en Eviscerar y combina Ráfaga con espada con Subidón de adrenalina; ambas mejoran el daño de ráfaga. Sangre fría potencia el primer Eviscerar de 5 puntos, salvo en la build de Puñalada. Evasión ayuda a sobrevivir.","text_en":"Combat relies on auto-attacks and has the strongest cleave among Rogue specs, without relying on poisons or bleeds. It has three builds: Sinister Strike with a slow main-hand weapon and Venom perform similarly; the dagger variant uses Backstab and falls somewhat behind. Keep Slice and Dice active, spend excess points on Eviscerate, and pair Blade Flurry with Adrenaline Rush for cleave and burst; both support burst damage. Cold Blood boosts the first 5-point Eviscerate except in the Backstab build. The defensive toolkit includes Evasion.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Combat Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Combat Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Combat Rogue Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Combat Rogue PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Combat Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Combat Rogue Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:combat:overview","class:rogue:combat:rotation","class:rogue:combat:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:75dd3cb0581f3218022b13f1aec0023dc6cb3f2f","section:8173dc81cac36120bade5a8c57750e3c4168611c","section:b001d36e7ab5e20464e5f7ca533b0148806c4d09","section:b13c881fc830d0834ed759e20e3f6b36d3b5973a","section:f65fb692110f1f996cc73439c0e31148133b5203"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-sutileza","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sutileza: sigilo y sangrados","title_en":"Subtlety: Stealth and Bleeds","summary_es":"Sutileza combina sigilo y sangrados con una rotación exigente y poca área.","summary_en":"Subtlety combines stealth and bleeds in a demanding, low-AoE playstyle.","keywords_es":["pícaro sutileza","hemorragia y garrote","marca de muerte","premeditación preparación","inmunidad sangrados"],"keywords_en":["subtlety rogue","hemorrhage and garrote","death mark","premeditation preparation","bleed immunity"],"text_es":"Sutileza es la más compleja: combina Sigilo y sangrados. Tiene dos builds flexibles: Marca de muerte/Cuchillo de bota, y otra profunda en Asesinato con Sello del destino, que rinde más. Hemorragia genera puntos; renueva Garrote y mantén Hacer picadillo, Ruptura y Marca de muerte; la segunda build usa Eviscerar. Hemorragia se aprende al 30 y permite atacar desde delante; antes, Puñalada exige colocarse detrás. Premeditación da 2 puntos cada 2 min; Preparación reinicia reutilizaciones como Esfumar. Evasión ayuda a sobrevivir; no tiene área verdadera y la inmunidad a sangrados la perjudica.","text_en":"Subtlety is the most complex, combining Stealth and bleeds. It has two flexible builds: Death Mark/Boot Knife, and one deep into Assassination with Seal Fate that performs better. Hemorrhage builds points; refresh Garrote and maintain Slice and Dice, Rupture, and Death Mark; the second build uses Eviscerate. Hemorrhage is learned at 30 and works from the front; before then, Backstab requires striking from behind. Premeditation grants 2 points every 2 minutes; Preparation resets cooldowns such as Vanish. Evasion helps survival; the spec has no true AoE and bleed immunity hinders it.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Subtlety Rogue for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Subtlety Rogues in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › All Subtlety Rogue DPS Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Subtlety Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Subtlety Rogue Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Subtlety Rogue Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Subtlety Rogue PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Guide › Subtlety Rogue Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide › Subtlety Rogue Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/subtlety-rogue-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:subtlety:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:overview","class:rogue:subtlety:rotation","class:rogue:subtlety:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:0d4447ef4a83b8e6f53f5c50e1e36cf2fd807b50","section:1b2e8c83c872a9f18591f0866c2202d1ea5af6d2","section:1d8b87b5fcb88cb20c7e4c10f3926d07849698c9","section:1fdd19165d66aead9faa422abc42fa9a91ee12ba","section:26f0593f8706f85629d54f49efb7cdb77b8fd167","section:274e4cfa6da8235973d3422fab57111f23e58e96","section:38a49afdc60164a2c4f34e9dae4992d445306b02","section:ef5b18a83c64beca3f3af6c357e88d60522b996e","section:fc6cb0ee129267ab10ce1ec541798d3774aee642"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-asesinato-pve-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcE de Asesinato (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Assassination PvE Build (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Build de venenos que prioriza Hacer picadillo y remata puntos sobrantes con Eviscerar.","summary_en":"Poison build that prioritizes Slice and Dice and spends excess points on Eviscerate.","keywords_es":["build asesinato pícaro","talentos asesinato pve","veneno talento pícaro","eviscerar asesinato"],"keywords_en":["assassination rogue build","assassination pve talents","rogue venom talent","assassination eviscerate"],"text_es":"Asesinato: Maldad 5/5, Crueldad 3/3, Hacer picadillo mejorado 3/3, Vigor 1/2, Salpicadura de sangre 1/1, Letalidad 2/2, Venenos inmundos 3/5, Sangre fría 1/1, Venenos mejorados 2/5, Golpes despiadados 5/5, Veneno 1/1, Sello del destino 3/3 y Mutilar 1/1. Combate: Golpe de gracia 3/3, Golpes eficientes 2/2, Heridas punzantes 3/3, Precisión 3/3, Robustez 2/2, Compostura 2/2, Ejecución impecable 1/1 y Agresión 3/3. Sutileza: Oportunidad 1/5. Es la build uniforme de Asesinato para JcE.","text_en":"Assassination: Malice 5/5, Ruthlessness 3/3, Improved Slice and Dice 3/3, Vigor 1/2, Blood Splatter 1/1, Lethality 2/2, Vile Poisons 3/5, Cold Blood 1/1, Improved Poisons 2/5, Relentless Strikes 5/5, Venom 1/1, Seal Fate 3/3, and Mutilate 1/1. Combat: Coup de Grace 3/3, Efficient Strikes 2/2, Puncturing Wounds 3/3, Precision 3/3, Endurance 2/2, Composure 2/2, Flawless Execution 1/1, and Aggression 3/3. Subtlety: Opportunity 1/5. This is the uniform Assassination PvE build.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Assassination Rogue Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Assassination Rogue PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:009f8f2850c8b4e91c2570dd6f303d47feba8192"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-asesinato-mutilar-pvp-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Asesinato con Mutilar","title_en":"Assassination Mutilate PvP Build","summary_es":"Variante JcJ de Asesinato con Mutilar, venenos y control.","summary_en":"Assassination PvP variant using Mutilate, poisons, and control.","keywords_es":["build mutilar pvp","talentos asesinato jce","asesinato control jcj","venenos pícaro pvp"],"keywords_en":["mutilate pvp build","assassination pvp talents","assassination rogue control","rogue pvp poisons"],"text_es":"Asesinato: Incapacitación mejorada 3/3, Maldad 5/5, Crueldad 2/3, Vigor 2/2, Salpicadura de sangre 1/1, Letalidad 2/2, Venenos inmundos 5/5, Sangre fría 1/1, Venenos mejorados 3/5, Veneno 1/1, Golpe a los riñones mejorado 2/2, Sello del destino 3/3 y Mutilar 1/1. Combate: Golpe de gracia 3/3, Golpes eficientes 2/2 y Heridas punzantes 3/3. Sutileza: Maestro de la decepción 2/3, Oportunidad 5/5, Camuflaje 3/3, Premeditación 1/1 y Espadas dentadas 1/3. La variante combina Mutilar con talentos de veneno y control.","text_en":"Assassination: Improved Gouge 3/3, Malice 5/5, Ruthlessness 2/3, Vigor 2/2, Blood Splatter 1/1, Lethality 2/2, Vile Poisons 5/5, Cold Blood 1/1, Improved Poisons 3/5, Venom 1/1, Improved Kidney Shot 2/2, Seal Fate 3/3, and Mutilate 1/1. Combat: Coup de Grace 3/3, Efficient Strikes 2/2, and Puncturing Wounds 3/3. Subtlety: Master of Deception 2/3, Opportunity 5/5, Camouflage 3/3, Premeditation 1/1, and Serrated Blades 1/3. The variant combines Mutilate with poison and control talents.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Assassination Rogue Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Assassination Rogue PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:3001b0631f42bfe11e71f14d1f11a2039407f836"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-pvp-compartida-60-parte1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ compartida del Pícaro: Parte 1","title_en":"Shared Rogue PvP Build: Part 1","summary_es":"Primera parte de la build JcJ común: talentos de Asesinato y Combate.","summary_en":"First part of the shared PvP build: Assassination and Combat talents.","keywords_es":["build pícaro pvp","talentos pvp asesinato","talentos pvp combate","build jcj compartida"],"keywords_en":["rogue pvp build","assassination pvp talents","combat pvp talents","shared pvp build"],"text_es":"Asesinato: Incapacitación mejorada 3/3, Ataques implacables 2/2, Maldad 5/5, Vigor 2/2 y Letalidad 2/2. Combate: Golpe de gracia 3/3, Golpes eficientes 2/2, Heridas punzantes 3/3 y Correr mejorado 2/2. Esta parte combina amplificadores de daño con movilidad y control.","text_en":"Assassination: Improved Gouge 3/3, Remorseless Attacks 2/2, Malice 5/5, Vigor 2/2, and Lethality 2/2. Combat: Coup de Grace 3/3, Efficient Strikes 2/2, Puncturing Wounds 3/3, and Improved Sprint 2/2. This part combines damage amplifiers with mobility and control.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Assassination Rogue Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Assassination Rogue PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Combat Rogue Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Combat Rogue PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Subtlety Rogue Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Subtlety Rogue PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:talents","class:rogue:combat:talents","class:rogue:subtlety:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:14115a83c8ad7482041b577a8ce3d21483ecda29","section:3001b0631f42bfe11e71f14d1f11a2039407f836","section:b9965080ae040aebb70c78fbae4b43b226bc0460"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-pvp-compartida-60-parte2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ compartida del Pícaro: Parte 2","title_en":"Shared Rogue PvP Build: Part 2","summary_es":"Continuación de la build común con los talentos de Sutileza para JcJ.","summary_en":"Continuation of the shared build with Subtlety talents for PvP.","keywords_es":["build sutileza pvp","talentos control pícaro","preparación sutileza","hemorragia sutileza pvp"],"keywords_en":["subtlety pvp build","rogue control talents","preparation subtlety","hemorrhage subtlety pvp"],"text_es":"Sutileza: Maestro de la decepción 3/3, Oportunidad 2/5, Trabajos sucios 2/2, Camuflaje 2/3, Emboscada mejorada 3/3, Jugarretas 2/2, Iniciativa 3/3, Premeditación 1/1, Espadas dentadas 3/3, Elusión 2/2, Golpe fantasmal 1/1, Evasión rápida 1/2, Preparación 1/1 y Hemorragia 1/1. Esta rama aporta las herramientas de Sigilo, control y preparación que completan la build JcJ.","text_en":"Subtlety: Master of Deception 3/3, Opportunity 2/5, Dirty Deeds 2/2, Camouflage 2/3, Improved Ambush 3/3, Dirty Tricks 2/2, Initiative 3/3, Premeditation 1/1, Serrated Blades 3/3, Elusiveness 2/2, Ghostly Strike 1/1, Quick Getaway 1/2, Preparation 1/1, and Hemorrhage 1/1. This branch adds the stealth, control, and setup tools that complete the PvP build.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Assassination Rogue Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Assassination Rogue PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Combat Rogue Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Combat Rogue PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Subtlety Rogue Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Subtlety Rogue PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:talents","class:rogue:combat:talents","class:rogue:subtlety:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:14115a83c8ad7482041b577a8ce3d21483ecda29","section:3001b0631f42bfe11e71f14d1f11a2039407f836","section:b9965080ae040aebb70c78fbae4b43b226bc0460"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-combate-siniestro-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcE de Combate: Golpe siniestro (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Combat PvE Build: Sinister Strike (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Build de Combate con arma principal lenta y Golpe siniestro como generador.","summary_en":"Combat build with a slow main hand and Sinister Strike as builder.","keywords_es":["build combate golpe siniestro","talentos combate pve","arma lenta pícaro","especialización armas combate"],"keywords_en":["combat sinister strike build","combat pve talents","slow weapon rogue","combat weapon specialization"],"text_es":"Asesinato: Maldad 5/5, Crueldad 3/3, Hacer picadillo mejorado 3/3, Vigor 2/2, Letalidad 2/2 y Sangre fría 1/1. Combate: Golpe de gracia 3/3, Golpes eficientes 2/2, Desvío 1/3, Precisión 3/3, Correr mejorado 2/2, Robustez 2/2, Compostura 2/2, Ejecución impecable 1/1, Experiencia con armas 2/2, Agresión 3/3, Especialización en doble empuñadura 2/2, Ráfaga con espada 1/1, Cortar y rebanar 5/5, Destello de acero 5/5 y Subidón de adrenalina 1/1. Usa un arma principal lenta y genera puntos con Golpe siniestro.","text_en":"Assassination: Malice 5/5, Ruthlessness 3/3, Improved Slice and Dice 3/3, Vigor 2/2, Lethality 2/2, and Cold Blood 1/1. Combat: Coup de Grace 3/3, Efficient Strikes 2/2, Deflection 1/3, Precision 3/3, Improved Sprint 2/2, Endurance 2/2, Composure 2/2, Flawless Execution 1/1, Weapon Expertise 2/2, Aggression 3/3, Dual Wield Specialization 2/2, Blade Flurry 1/1, Hack and Slash 5/5, Flash of Steel 5/5, and Adrenaline Rush 1/1. Use a slow main-hand weapon and build with Sinister Strike.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Combat Rogue Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Combat Rogue PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:combat:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:8173dc81cac36120bade5a8c57750e3c4168611c"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-combate-punalada-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcE de Combate: Puñalada (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Combat PvE Build: Backstab (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Variante JcE con daga en la mano principal, Puñalada y Oportunidad.","summary_en":"PvE variant using a main-hand dagger, Backstab, and Opportunity.","keywords_es":["build combate puñalada","build pícaro daga principal","oportunidad combate","heridas punzantes combate"],"keywords_en":["combat backstab build","rogue main-hand dagger build","combat opportunity","combat puncturing wounds"],"text_es":"Asesinato: Maldad 5/5, Crueldad 3/3, Hacer picadillo mejorado 3/3 y Letalidad 2/2. Combate: Golpe de gracia 3/3, Golpes eficientes 2/2, Heridas punzantes 3/3, Precisión 3/3, Robustez 2/2, Compostura 2/2, Ejecución impecable 1/1, Experiencia con armas 2/2, Agresión 2/3, Especialización en doble empuñadura 2/2, Ráfaga con espada 1/1, Cortar y rebanar 4/5, Destello de acero 5/5 y Subidón de adrenalina 1/1. Sutileza: Oportunidad 5/5. Equipa una daga en la mano principal y genera puntos con Puñalada.","text_en":"Assassination: Malice 5/5, Ruthlessness 3/3, Improved Slice and Dice 3/3, and Lethality 2/2. Combat: Coup de Grace 3/3, Efficient Strikes 2/2, Puncturing Wounds 3/3, Precision 3/3, Endurance 2/2, Composure 2/2, Flawless Execution 1/1, Weapon Expertise 2/2, Aggression 2/3, Dual Wield Specialization 2/2, Blade Flurry 1/1, Hack and Slash 4/5, Flash of Steel 5/5, and Adrenaline Rush 1/1. Subtlety: Opportunity 5/5. Equip a main-hand dagger and build with Backstab.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Combat Rogue Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Combat Rogue PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:combat:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:8173dc81cac36120bade5a8c57750e3c4168611c"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-sutileza-hemorragia-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcE de Sutileza: Deep Sub (bandas y mazmorras)","title_en":"Subtlety PvE Build: Deep Sub (raids and dungeons)","summary_es":"Build flexible con Marca de muerte y Cuchillo de bota; genera puntos con Hemorragia.","summary_en":"Flexible build with Death Mark and Boot Knife; builds points with Hemorrhage.","keywords_es":["build sutileza hemorragia","talentos sutileza pve","marca de muerte sutileza","cuchillo de bota pícaro"],"keywords_en":["subtlety hemorrhage build","subtlety pve talents","subtlety death mark","rogue boot knife"],"text_es":"Asesinato: Maldad 5/5, Crueldad 3/3, Hacer picadillo mejorado 3/3 y Salpicadura de sangre 1/1. Combate: Golpe de gracia 3/3, Golpes eficientes 2/2 y Precisión 3/3. Sutileza: Establecer 3/3, Oportunidad 5/5, Trabajos sucios 2/2, Camuflaje 3/3, Iniciativa 3/3, Premeditación 1/1, Espadas dentadas 3/3, Elusión 2/2, Golpe fantasmal 1/1, Preparación 1/1, Hemorragia 1/1, Cuchillo de bota 5/5 y Marca de muerte 1/1. Esta variante prioriza Marca de muerte y Cuchillo de bota; admite distintas armas.","text_en":"Assassination: Malice 5/5, Ruthlessness 3/3, Improved Slice and Dice 3/3, and Blood Splatter 1/1. Combat: Coup de Grace 3/3, Efficient Strikes 2/2, and Precision 3/3. Subtlety: Setup 3/3, Opportunity 5/5, Dirty Deeds 2/2, Camouflage 3/3, Initiative 3/3, Premeditation 1/1, Serrated Blades 3/3, Elusiveness 2/2, Ghostly Strike 1/1, Preparation 1/1, Hemorrhage 1/1, Boot Knife 5/5, and Death Mark 1/1. This variant focuses on Death Mark and Boot Knife and can use different weapons.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Subtlety Rogue Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Subtlety Rogue PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:subtlety:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:38a49afdc60164a2c4f34e9dae4992d445306b02"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-rotacion-asesinato-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Asesinato a nivel 60","title_en":"Assassination Level-60 Rotation","summary_es":"Prioriza Hacer picadillo, genera con Mutilar y ajusta Sangre fría a los remates.","summary_en":"Prioritize Slice and Dice, build with Mutilate, and time Cold Blood for finishers.","keywords_es":["rotación asesinato nivel 60","prioridad mutilar pícaro","ráfaga con espada asesinato","venenos asesinato pve"],"keywords_en":["assassination level 60 rotation","mutilate rogue priority","assassination blade flurry","assassination pve poisons"],"text_es":"Mantén Hacer picadillo, preferiblemente con 1 punto de combo, y genera con Mutilar; usa Eviscerar con 4 o más puntos. Mantén Apuñalar en reutilización para recuperar Energía y potenciar el daño y la aplicación de venenos; usa Té de cardo cuando permita lanzar más Eviscerar. Combina Sangre fría con Eviscerar a 5 puntos, salvo que puedas usarla una segunda vez en el combate: en ese caso, úsala antes con 4 o más.","text_en":"Keep Slice and Dice, preferably with 1 Combo Point, and build with Mutilate; use Eviscerate at 4 or more points. Keep Shank on cooldown for Energy and increased poison damage and application; use Thistle Tea when it enables extra casts of Eviscerate. Use Cold Blood with a 5-point Eviscerate unless the fight allows a second use, in which case use it earlier at 4 or more points.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Assassination Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Assassination Rogue Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:30b3b5946f7a692694ec7f1f17855b3e7d207cb6","section:c9868236e59b71e4901d2007c94a4a0acf699bb0"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-rotacion-combate-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Combate a nivel 60","title_en":"Combat Level-60 Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Hacer picadillo; genera según la build y coordina los enfriamientos y remates.","summary_en":"Maintain Slice and Dice, build by variant, and coordinate cooldowns and finishers.","keywords_es":["rotación combate nivel 60","prioridad golpe siniestro","rotación puñalada combate","ráfaga con espada subidón"],"keywords_en":["combat level 60 rotation","sinister strike priority","combat backstab rotation","blade flurry adrenaline rush"],"text_es":"Mantén Hacer picadillo con pocos puntos y genera con Golpe siniestro o Puñalada según la build; con Puñalada, usa Eviscerar a partir de 4. Apuñalar va en reutilización para recuperar Energía. Usa juntas Ráfaga con espada y Subidón de adrenalina; la primera aporta un 20% de velocidad de ataque y cleave. Sangre fría potencia el primer Eviscerar de 5 puntos, salvo en la build de Puñalada; la de Veneno omite Subidón de adrenalina y potencia Apuñalar durante 6 s. Usa Té de cardo cuando se agote la Energía tras acabar Subidón de adrenalina.","text_en":"Keep Slice and Dice with as few points as possible and build with Sinister Strike or Backstab by variant; use Eviscerate at 4 or more points with Backstab. Keep Shank on cooldown for Energy. Use Blade Flurry and Adrenaline Rush together; Blade Flurry grants 20% attack speed and cleave. Cold Blood empowers the first 5-point Eviscerate, except the Backstab build does not take it; the Venom build skips Adrenaline Rush and empowers Shank for 6 seconds. Use Thistle Tea when Energy runs low after Adrenaline Rush ends.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Combat Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Combat Rogue Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:combat:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:b001d36e7ab5e20464e5f7ca533b0148806c4d09","section:b13c881fc830d0834ed759e20e3f6b36d3b5973a"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-rotacion-sutileza-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Sutileza a nivel 60","title_en":"Subtlety Level-60 Rotation","summary_es":"Prioridades, remates y enfriamientos para las variantes Marca de muerte y Sello del destino.","summary_en":"Priorities, finishers, and cooldowns for the Death Mark and Seal Fate variants.","keywords_es":["rotación sutileza nivel 60","garrote y hemorragia","premeditación sutileza","preparación esfumar"],"keywords_en":["subtlety level 60 rotation","garrote hemorrhage rotation","premeditation subtlety","preparation vanish"],"text_es":"Deep Sub: renueva Garrote con Golpe fantasmal; Esfumar respalda si falla. Mantén Hacer picadillo y Ruptura; genera con Hemorragia. Usa Hacer picadillo a pocos puntos, Ruptura a 3+ y Marca de muerte a 4+ (normalmente 5, según efectos). Apuñalar da 2 puntos en reutilización; Té de cardo va con Marca de muerte. Premeditación va en reutilización; Preparación restaura enfriamientos. Sello del destino: mantén Garrote, Hacer picadillo y Ruptura; genera con Hemorragia y gasta a 4+ en Ruptura o Eviscerar. Apuñalar en reutilización recupera Energía y potencia venenos; Té de cardo permite más Eviscerar.","text_en":"Deep Sub: refresh Garrote with Ghostly Strike; save Vanish if it misses. Keep Slice and Dice and Rupture up; build with Hemorrhage. Use Slice and Dice with few points, Rupture at 3+, and Death Mark at 4+ (usually 5 based on remaining effects). Shank on cooldown grants 2 points; use Thistle Tea during Death Mark. Use Premeditation on cooldown; Preparation restores cooldowns. Seal Fate: keep Garrote, Slice and Dice, and Rupture; build with Hemorrhage and spend at 4+ on Rupture or Eviscerate. Shank on cooldown restores Energy and boosts poisons; Thistle Tea enables extra Eviscerate casts.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Subtlety Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Subtlety Rogue Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:subtlety:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:0d4447ef4a83b8e6f53f5c50e1e36cf2fd807b50","section:274e4cfa6da8235973d3422fab57111f23e58e96"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-stats-asesinato","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Asesinato a nivel 60","title_en":"Assassination Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Orden especulativo: golpe y pericia, habilidad de arma y luego agilidad y daño.","summary_en":"Speculative order: hit and expertise, weapon skill, then agility and damage.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas asesinato 60","golpe venenos pícaro","pericia asesinato","agilidad y crítico asesinato"],"keywords_en":["assassination level 60 stats","rogue poison hit cap","assassination expertise","assassination agility crit"],"text_es":"Prioridad especulativa: Prob. de golpe 8% (cap. de habilidades) > Pericia 6.5% > Habilidad con armas 308 > Prob. de golpe 17% (cap. de venenos) > Agilidad > Golpe crítico > Celeridad > Fuerza > Poder de ataque > Aguante. El arma principal y Poder de ataque dominan el daño. El golpe conserva valor hasta 27% con Doble empuñadura; Pericia 6.5% elimina esquivas de jefes. Sello del destino refuerza el crítico; Crítico y Celeridad valen parecido, pero Celeridad aparece menos en equipo. La disponibilidad de Habilidad con armas es incierta. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Speculative priority: Hit to the 8% ability cap > Expertise to 6.5% > Weapon Skill 308 > Hit to the 17% poison cap > Agility > Critical Strike Chance > Haste > Strength > Attack Power > Stamina. Main-hand weapon DPS and Attack Power drive damage. Hit remains useful to 27% with dual wield; 6.5% Expertise removes boss dodges. Seal Fate raises Crit value; Crit and Haste are similar, but Haste is rarer on gear. Weapon Skill availability is uncertain. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Assassination Rogue Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Crit Chance","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:811030e51c4d823ab1ca796c598aeec2205de6f2","section:e2121cc7dbb5453f3023532f0f489c48a61458a4"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-stats-combate","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Combate a nivel 60","title_en":"Combat Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Orden especulativo: golpe, pericia y habilidad de arma antes de agilidad y estadísticas de daño.","summary_en":"Speculative order: hit, expertise, and weapon skill before agility and damage stats.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas combate 60","golpe combate pícaro","pericia combate","arma principal combate"],"keywords_en":["combat level 60 stats","combat rogue hit cap","combat expertise","combat main hand damage"],"text_es":"Prioridad especulativa: Prob. de golpe hasta 8% (habilidades) > Pericia 6.5% > Habilidad con armas 308 > Prob. de golpe hasta 17% (venenos) > Agilidad > Golpe crítico > Celeridad > Fuerza > Poder de ataque > Aguante. Ataques y habilidades escalan con el DPS de la mano principal; Poder de ataque lo amplifica. El golpe mantiene valor hasta 27% con doble empuñadura y Pericia 6.5% quita esquivas de jefes. Crítico y Celeridad valen parecido, aunque Celeridad es más difícil de encontrar. La disponibilidad de Habilidad con armas es incierta. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Speculative priority: Hit to the 8% ability cap > Expertise to 6.5% > Weapon Skill 308 > Hit to the 17% poison cap > Agility > Critical Strike Chance > Haste > Strength > Attack Power > Stamina. Auto-attacks and abilities scale with main-hand weapon DPS; Attack Power amplifies it. Hit retains value to 27% dual-wield, and 6.5% Expertise removes boss dodges. Crit and Haste are similarly valuable, though Haste is harder to find. Weapon Skill availability is uncertain. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Combat Rogue Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:combat:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:1348cd603dd9baaa9d8370a3e3491408fc78e51b"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-stats-sutileza","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Sutileza a nivel 60","title_en":"Subtlety Level-60 Stats","summary_es":"Orden especulativo: golpe, pericia y habilidad de arma; después prioriza agilidad, crítico y celeridad.","summary_en":"Speculative order: hit, expertise, and weapon skill; then prioritize agility, crit, and haste.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas sutileza 60","golpe sutileza","pericia pícaro","agilidad sutileza"],"keywords_en":["subtlety level 60 stats","subtlety hit priority","rogue expertise","subtlety agility"],"text_es":"Prioridad especulativa: Prob. de golpe hasta 8% (habilidades) > Pericia 6.5% > Habilidad con armas 308 > Prob. de golpe hasta 17% (venenos) > Agilidad > Golpe crítico > Celeridad > Fuerza > Poder de ataque > Aguante. El arma principal concentra gran parte del daño y Poder de ataque lo potencia. Golpe sigue aportando hasta 27% con doble empuñadura; Pericia 6.5% elimina esquivas de jefes. Crítico y Celeridad tienen valor similar, aunque Celeridad escasea en equipo. La disponibilidad de Habilidad con armas es incierta. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Speculative priority: Hit to the 8% ability cap > Expertise to 6.5% > Weapon Skill 308 > Hit to the 17% poison cap > Agility > Critical Strike Chance > Haste > Strength > Attack Power > Stamina. Main-hand weapon damage is the largest factor, with Attack Power adding value. Hit remains useful to 27% with dual wield; 6.5% Expertise removes boss dodges. Crit and Haste are similarly valuable, but Haste is scarce on gear. Weapon Skill availability is uncertain. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Attribute and Stat Priority - WoW: Forever › Subtlety Rogue Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-30"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:subtlety:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:9d81690bbd497d8907f7e3fdba450521e9ccee72"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-talentos-asesinato-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Talentos de Asesinato al subir","title_en":"Assassination Leveling Talents","summary_es":"Al 30, reinicia para potenciar los venenos; prioriza Oportunidad y Heridas punzantes.","summary_en":"At 30, respec to strengthen poisons; prioritize Opportunity and Puncturing Wounds.","keywords_es":["talentos asesinato leveo","build asesinato nivel 30","venenos asesinato","oportunidad y heridas punzantes"],"keywords_en":["assassination leveling talents","level 30 assassination build","assassination poisons","opportunity puncturing wounds"],"text_es":"Durante los primeros 30 niveles, sigue la ruta inicial compartida. Al 30, reinicia para adquirir la habilidad de venenos y los talentos iniciales que la potencian; después prioriza Oportunidad y Heridas punzantes. La build descodificada asigna Venenos mejorados 4/5, Veneno 1/1, Maldad 5/5 y Hacer picadillo mejorado 3/3.","text_en":"For the first 30 levels, use the shared opening route. At 30, respec to acquire the poison ability and early talents that strengthen it; then prioritize Opportunity and Puncturing Wounds. The decoded build assigns Improved Poisons 4/5, Venom 1/1, Malice 5/5, and Improved Slice and Dice 3/3.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:e909da805b09e4c7cfc227a032edd6c4c8fc34aa"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-talentos-sutileza-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Talentos de Sutileza al subir","title_en":"Subtlety Leveling Talents","summary_es":"Al 18, reinicia para potenciar Emboscada; la build invierte fuerte en talentos de Sutileza.","summary_en":"At 18, respec to strengthen Ambush; the build invests deeply in Subtlety talents.","keywords_es":["talentos sutileza leveo","build sutileza nivel 18","emboscada mejorada","talentos de sigilo"],"keywords_en":["subtlety leveling talents","level 18 subtlety build","improved ambush","stealth talents"],"text_es":"Hasta el 18, sigue la ruta inicial compartida. Cuando aprendas Emboscada al 18, reinicia para potenciarla. En la build descodificada, Sutileza lleva Emboscada mejorada 3/3, Oportunidad 5/5, Maestro de la decepción 2/3, Camuflaje 2/3 e Iniciativa 3/3; también incluye Premeditación 1/1 y Hemorragia 1/1.","text_en":"Through 18, use the shared opening route. At 18, respec to amplify Ambush. In the decoded build, Subtlety has Improved Ambush 3/3, Opportunity 5/5, Master of Deception 2/3, Camouflage 2/3, and Initiative 3/3; it also includes Premeditation 1/1 and Hemorrhage 1/1.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Subtlety Rogue DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:33904b741654bce18d86fb423db0d77b84e1d575"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-entrenar-obligatorias","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades que conviene entrenar","title_en":"Abilities Worth Training","summary_es":"Entrena las habilidades esenciales y sus rangos; Sutileza también requiere Emboscada.","summary_en":"Train core abilities and their ranks; Subtlety also needs Ambush.","keywords_es":["habilidades obligatorias pícaro","rangos de habilidades rogue","qué entrenar pícaro","entrenar emboscada sutileza"],"keywords_en":["mandatory rogue abilities","rogue ability ranks","what to train rogue","subtlety ambush training"],"text_es":"Entrena desde nivel 1: Sigilo (rangos 20/40/60), Golpe siniestro (6/14/22/30/38/46/54) y Eviscerar (8/16/24/32/40/48/56/60). Aprende Evasión al 8; Hacer picadillo, Correr y Zapar al 10; Patada al 12 y Esfumar al 22. Sus rangos nuevos llegan, respectivamente, al 42; 34/58; 28/48; 26/42/58 y 42. Sutileza también debe entrenar Emboscada desde el 18 (rangos 26/34/42/50/58).","text_en":"Train from level 1: Stealth (ranks 20/40/60), Sinister Strike (6/14/22/30/38/46/54), and Eviscerate (8/16/24/32/40/48/56/60). Learn Evasion at 8; Slice and Dice, Sprint, and Sap at 10; Kick at 12 and Vanish at 22. Their next ranks are at 42; 34/58; 28/48; 26/42/58; and 42, respectively. Subtlety should also train Ambush from 18 (ranks 26/34/42/50/58).","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Assassination Rogue","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Combat Rogue","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Subtlety Rogue","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0f669dd005c439475f91acddf72d204e9c9675da","section:a9743ecb5b8d22adf02cdb422add0629ec4006a2","section:ff8a5df8433db4a658b6703313eaac0f493194b3"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-entrenar-opcionales-dano","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Entrenamiento opcional de daño","title_en":"Optional Damage Training","summary_es":"Puedes saltarte habilidades de daño según tu estilo para ahorrar oro.","summary_en":"Skip optional damage abilities according to your playstyle to save gold.","keywords_es":["habilidades opcionales pícaro","rangos de puñalada","entrenar emboscada","entrenar ruptura"],"keywords_en":["optional rogue abilities","backstab ranks","ambush training","rupture training"],"text_es":"Salvo Emboscada en Sutileza, son útiles pero puedes omitirlas según tu estilo para ahorrar oro: Robar y Puñalada al 4 (rangos de Puñalada 12/20/28/36/44/52/60); Exponer armadura al 14 (26/36/46/56), Amago al 16 (28/40/52/60), Emboscada al 18 (26/34/42/50/58) y Ruptura al 20 (28/36/44/52/60).","text_en":"Except for Ambush in Subtlety, these are useful but you can skip them based on your playstyle to save gold: Pick Pocket and Backstab at 4 (Backstab ranks 12/20/28/36/44/52/60); Expose Armor at 14 (26/36/46/56), Feint at 16 (28/40/52/60), Ambush at 18 (26/34/42/50/58), and Rupture at 20 (28/36/44/52/60).","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Assassination Rogue","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Combat Rogue","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Subtlety Rogue","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:2b1609218c0e9e02fbadb2be14112cde70aa268e","section:63b90cfe33a1534f32d873d1a1f571989c995618","section:f8393c1f354fc05fda84d93ea8cdfa82622382ba"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-entrenar-opcionales-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Entrenamiento opcional de control","title_en":"Optional Control Training","summary_es":"Las habilidades de control son opcionales y puedes omitir rangos para ahorrar oro.","summary_en":"Control abilities are optional, and you can skip ranks to save gold.","keywords_es":["control opcional pícaro","entrenar incapacitación","entrenar detectar trampas","rangos golpe a los riñones"],"keywords_en":["optional rogue crowd control","train gouge","train detect traps","kidney shot ranks"],"text_es":"Para ahorrar oro, puedes omitir habilidades opcionales de control: Incapacitación al 6 (rangos 18/32/46/60), Distraer al 22, Detectar trampas al 24, Golpe bajo al 26, Golpe a los riñones y Desactivar trampa al 30 (rango 50 para Golpe a los riñones), y Ceguera al 34.","text_en":"To save gold, you can skip optional control abilities: Gouge at 6 (ranks 18/32/46/60), Distract at 22, Detect Traps at 24, Cheap Shot at 26, Kidney Shot and Disarm Trap at 30 (Kidney Shot rank 50), and Blind at 34.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Assassination Rogue","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Combat Rogue","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Subtlety Rogue","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:2b1609218c0e9e02fbadb2be14112cde70aa268e","section:63b90cfe33a1534f32d873d1a1f571989c995618","section:f8393c1f354fc05fda84d93ea8cdfa82622382ba"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-consumibles-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles recomendados al subir","title_en":"Leveling Consumables","summary_es":"Agilidad, Té de cardo, venenos y piedras de afilar refuerzan el leveo.","summary_en":"Agility, Thistle Tea, poisons, and sharpening stones support leveling.","keywords_es":["consumibles pícaro leveo","elixir agilidad menor rogue","filete de coyote rogue","té de cardo y venenos"],"keywords_en":["rogue leveling consumables","minor agility elixir rogue","coyote steak rogue","thistle tea and poisons"],"text_es":"Al subir, elige consumibles que aumenten Agilidad, como Elixir de agilidad menor y Filete de coyote. La misión de clase da acceso a Té de cardo, útil para disponer enseguida de más Energía. Para mejorar las armas, usa Veneno instantáneo y Piedra de afilar burda.","text_en":"While leveling, pick Agility-boosting items like Elixir of Minor Agility and Coyote Steak. The class quest provides Thistle Tea, a quick Energy boost when needed. For weapon enhancements, use Instant Poison and Coarse Sharpening Stone.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Combat Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Subtlety Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4ea51891a8d67fcd4adf8197f21f8360d78d1a34","section:82a004dce1aaeb295d1053e6377c5df107dad1d6","section:fef37e489c064ca845a5fa40364feac4c5833ab5"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-buffs-campamento","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Buffs de campamento para Pícaro","title_en":"Rogue Camp Buffs","summary_es":"Silla de campamento, Rueda de afilar y Magnetita son las tres mejoras recomendadas.","summary_en":"Camp Chair, Sharpening Wheel, and Lodestone are the three recommended buffs.","keywords_es":["mejores buffs campamento pícaro","silla de campamento crítico","rueda de afilar fuerza","magnetita poder de ataque"],"keywords_en":["best rogue camp buffs","camp chair crit","sharpening wheel strength","lodestone attack power"],"text_es":"Busca la Silla de campamento (+2% de golpe crítico), la Rueda de afilar (Fuerza, que aumenta el poder de ataque) y la Magnetita (poder de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo). Se recomiendan porque los jugadores que dan beneficios suelen ofrecérselos a quienes encuentran mientras recorren el mundo.","text_en":"Look for Camp Chair (+2% Critical Strike), Sharpening Wheel (Strength, which increases Attack Power), and Lodestone (melee Attack Power). They are recommended because players who provide buffs often share them with others they meet while out in the world.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Combat Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Subtlety Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:9a6deed9dce97c453d2da8f7a5b440c194d03e87","section:a6a5fd4cc610afa8ed056527a1ccbd59fc9000ed","section:d0da2c8461b07a6f8f630f58c7656145a369b9ab"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-robar-oro-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Robar para ganar oro al subir","title_en":"Pick Pocket for Leveling Gold","summary_es":"Incluye Robar en la apertura para obtener oro extra durante el leveo.","summary_en":"Add Pick Pocket to your opener for extra gold while leveling.","keywords_es":["ganar oro con robar","macro robar pícaro","oro pícaro al subir"],"keywords_en":["earn gold with pick pocket","rogue pick pocket macro","rogue leveling gold"],"text_es":"Puedes incluir Robar en una macro de apertura para conseguir oro extra mientras subes de nivel.","text_en":"You can add Pick Pocket to an opener macro to earn extra gold while leveling.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Combat Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Subtlety Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:417f86e451fc3fc6502a5c3e9499cb23efccf995","section:4d7950e1c327ba43fcd2bbeb061b7153f2a738ee","section:82f132004710ecc912c6a23078523fd381b9612e"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-limitacion-combos-asesinato","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Límite de combos de Asesinato al subir","title_en":"Assassination Combo-Point Leveling Limit","summary_es":"Un generador de Asesinato cuesta 60 de Energía y dificulta acumular puntos de combo.","summary_en":"An Assassination builder costs 60 Energy, making Combo Points harder to build.","keywords_es":["coste energía asesinato leveo","generar puntos de combo asesinato","limitación asesinato nivelación"],"keywords_en":["assassination leveling energy cost","build assassination combo points","assassination leveling weakness"],"text_es":"El generador de puntos de combo de esta especialización cuesta 60 de Energía, así que acumularlos puede ser lento. Es una limitación que reduce la fluidez de Asesinato durante la subida.","text_en":"The builder described for this specialization costs 60 Energy, so accumulating points can be slow. This makes leveling less smooth for Assassination.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4d7950e1c327ba43fcd2bbeb061b7153f2a738ee"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-grupos-mazmorra-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Grupos de mazmorra al subir","title_en":"Dungeon Groups While Leveling","summary_es":"Sin mejoras grupales, cuesta encontrar grupo; Patada e Incapacitación ayudan a reducir daño.","summary_en":"Without group buffs, groups can be harder to find; Kick and Gouge help limit damage.","keywords_es":["buscar grupo mazmorra pícaro","pícaro leveo en grupo","interrumpir lanzamientos pícaro"],"keywords_en":["rogue leveling dungeon groups","rogue group leveling","rogue interrupt casts"],"text_es":"Puede costar encontrar grupo para mazmorras mientras subes, porque el Pícaro no ofrece mejoras grupales. Compensa interrumpiendo con Patada e Incapacitación para frenar lanzamientos y limitar el daño que recibe el grupo.","text_en":"Dungeon groups can be harder to find while leveling because Rogue offers no group buffs. Make yourself useful by interrupting casts with Kick and Gouge to limit damage to the party.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Combat Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Subtlety Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling","class:rogue:combat:leveling","class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:417f86e451fc3fc6502a5c3e9499cb23efccf995","section:4d7950e1c327ba43fcd2bbeb061b7153f2a738ee","section:82f132004710ecc912c6a23078523fd381b9612e"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-correr-combate-leveo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Robustez reduce el tiempo de Correr","title_en":"Endurance Reduces Sprint Cooldown","summary_es":"La build de Combate lleva Robustez 1/2, que puede bajar Correr a 2 minutos.","summary_en":"The Combat build has Endurance 1/2, which can reduce Sprint to 2 minutes.","keywords_es":["robustez combate pícaro","reutilización correr rogue","talento para correr pícaro"],"keywords_en":["combat rogue endurance","rogue sprint cooldown","combat sprint talent"],"text_es":"La build descodificada de Combate lleva Robustez 1/2. Este talento puede reducir la reutilización de Correr a 2 minutos, útil para recorrer distancias largas o escapar de un encuentro.","text_en":"The decoded Combat build has Endurance 1/2. This talent can lower the Sprint cooldown to 2 minutes, helping with long runs or escapes.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Combat Rogue DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Combat Rogue DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:combat:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:337b9f6e75b0a3dc64c854181d6f70f4bdd3537c","section:82f132004710ecc912c6a23078523fd381b9612e"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-asesinato-subir-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Asesinato al subir · parte 1/2","title_en":"Assassination Leveling Build · Part 1/2","summary_es":"Talentos descodificados de Asesinato para subir, parte 1/2.","summary_en":"Decoded Assassination leveling talents, part 1/2.","keywords_es":["build asesinato leveo parte 1","talentos asesinato rama asesinato","puntos talentos asesinato"],"keywords_en":["assassination leveling build part 1","assassination asesinato talents","assassination talent points"],"text_es":"Asesinato: Ataques implacables 2/2, Maldad 5/5, Hacer picadillo mejorado 3/3, Vigor 2/2, Salpicadura de sangre 1/1, Letalidad 2/2, Sangre fría 1/1, Venenos mejorados 4/5, Veneno 1/1.","text_en":"Assassination: Remorseless Attacks 2/2, Malice 5/5, Improved Slice and Dice 3/3, Vigor 2/2, Blood Splatter 1/1, Lethality 2/2, Cold Blood 1/1, Improved Poisons 4/5, Venom 1/1.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:e909da805b09e4c7cfc227a032edd6c4c8fc34aa"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-asesinato-subir-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Asesinato al subir · parte 2/2","title_en":"Assassination Leveling Build · Part 2/2","summary_es":"Talentos descodificados de Asesinato para subir, parte 2/2.","summary_en":"Decoded Assassination leveling talents, part 2/2.","keywords_es":["build asesinato leveo parte 2","talentos asesinato rama combate","puntos talentos asesinato"],"keywords_en":["assassination leveling build part 2","assassination combate talents","assassination talent points"],"text_es":"Combate: Golpe de gracia 3/3, Golpes eficientes 2/2, Desvío 3/3, Precisión 3/3, Robustez 1/2, Estocada 1/1, Compostura 2/2, Ejecución impecable 1/1, Experiencia con armas 2/2, Agresión 3/3, Especialización en doble empuñadura 2/2, Ráfaga con espada 1/1, Cortar y rebanar 1/5, Destello de acero 5/5.","text_en":"Combat: Coup de Grace 3/3, Efficient Strikes 2/2, Deflection 3/3, Precision 3/3, Endurance 1/2, Riposte 1/1, Composure 2/2, Flawless Execution 1/1, Weapon Expertise 2/2, Aggression 3/3, Dual Wield Specialization 2/2, Blade Flurry 1/1, Hack and Slash 1/5, Flash of Steel 5/5.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Assassination Rogue DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:e909da805b09e4c7cfc227a032edd6c4c8fc34aa"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-combate-subir-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Combate al subir · parte 1/2","title_en":"Combat Leveling Build · Part 1/2","summary_es":"Talentos descodificados de Combate para subir, parte 1/2.","summary_en":"Decoded Combat leveling talents, part 1/2.","keywords_es":["build combate leveo parte 1","talentos combate rama asesinato","puntos talentos combate"],"keywords_en":["combat leveling build part 1","combat asesinato talents","combat talent points"],"text_es":"Asesinato: Ataques implacables 2/2, Maldad 5/5, Crueldad 1/3, Hacer picadillo mejorado 3/3, Vigor 2/2, Letalidad 2/2, Sangre fría 1/1.","text_en":"Assassination: Remorseless Attacks 2/2, Malice 5/5, Ruthlessness 1/3, Improved Slice and Dice 3/3, Vigor 2/2, Lethality 2/2, Cold Blood 1/1.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Combat Rogue DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:combat:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:337b9f6e75b0a3dc64c854181d6f70f4bdd3537c"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-combate-subir-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Combate al subir · parte 2/2","title_en":"Combat Leveling Build · Part 2/2","summary_es":"Talentos descodificados de Combate para subir, parte 2/2.","summary_en":"Decoded Combat leveling talents, part 2/2.","keywords_es":["build combate leveo parte 2","talentos combate rama combate","puntos talentos combate"],"keywords_en":["combat leveling build part 2","combat combate talents","combat talent points"],"text_es":"Combate: Golpe de gracia 3/3, Golpes eficientes 2/2, Desvío 3/3, Precisión 3/3, Robustez 1/2, Estocada 1/1, Compostura 2/2, Ejecución impecable 1/1, Experiencia con armas 2/2, Agresión 3/3, Especialización en doble empuñadura 2/2, Ráfaga con espada 1/1, Cortar y rebanar 5/5, Destello de acero 5/5, Subidón de adrenalina 1/1.","text_en":"Combat: Coup de Grace 3/3, Efficient Strikes 2/2, Deflection 3/3, Precision 3/3, Endurance 1/2, Riposte 1/1, Composure 2/2, Flawless Execution 1/1, Weapon Expertise 2/2, Aggression 3/3, Dual Wield Specialization 2/2, Blade Flurry 1/1, Hack and Slash 5/5, Flash of Steel 5/5, Adrenaline Rush 1/1.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Combat Rogue DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:combat:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:337b9f6e75b0a3dc64c854181d6f70f4bdd3537c"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-sutileza-subir-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Sutileza al subir · parte 1/2","title_en":"Subtlety Leveling Build · Part 1/2","summary_es":"Talentos descodificados de Sutileza para subir, parte 1/2.","summary_en":"Decoded Subtlety leveling talents, part 1/2.","keywords_es":["build sutileza leveo parte 1","talentos sutileza rama asesinato","puntos talentos sutileza"],"keywords_en":["subtlety leveling build part 1","subtlety asesinato talents","subtlety talent points"],"text_es":"Asesinato: Ataques implacables 2/2. Combate: Golpe de gracia 3/3, Golpes eficientes 2/2, Desvío 3/3, Precisión 3/3, Robustez 2/2, Estocada 1/1, Compostura 2/2, Ejecución impecable 1/1, Experiencia con armas 2/2, Agresión 1/3, Especialización en doble empuñadura 2/2, Ráfaga con espada 1/1, Cortar y rebanar 2/5, Destello de acero 2/5.","text_en":"Assassination: Remorseless Attacks 2/2. Combat: Coup de Grace 3/3, Efficient Strikes 2/2, Deflection 3/3, Precision 3/3, Endurance 2/2, Riposte 1/1, Composure 2/2, Flawless Execution 1/1, Weapon Expertise 2/2, Aggression 1/3, Dual Wield Specialization 2/2, Blade Flurry 1/1, Hack and Slash 2/5, Flash of Steel 2/5.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Subtlety Rogue DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:33904b741654bce18d86fb423db0d77b84e1d575"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-sutileza-subir-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Sutileza al subir · parte 2/2","title_en":"Subtlety Leveling Build · Part 2/2","summary_es":"Talentos descodificados de Sutileza para subir, parte 2/2.","summary_en":"Decoded Subtlety leveling talents, part 2/2.","keywords_es":["build sutileza leveo parte 2","talentos sutileza rama sutileza","puntos talentos sutileza"],"keywords_en":["subtlety leveling build part 2","subtlety sutileza talents","subtlety talent points"],"text_es":"Sutileza: Maestro de la decepción 2/3, Oportunidad 5/5, Camuflaje 2/3, Emboscada mejorada 3/3, Iniciativa 3/3, Premeditación 1/1, Espadas dentadas 3/3, Golpe fantasmal 1/1, Preparación 1/1, Hemorragia 1/1.","text_en":"Subtlety: Master of Deception 2/3, Opportunity 5/5, Camouflage 2/3, Improved Ambush 3/3, Initiative 3/3, Premeditation 1/1, Serrated Blades 3/3, Ghostly Strike 1/1, Preparation 1/1, Hemorrhage 1/1.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Subtlety Rogue DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:rogue:subtlety:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:33904b741654bce18d86fb423db0d77b84e1d575"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-sutileza-hemo-sello-destino-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcE de Sutileza: Hemorragia y Sello del destino","title_en":"Subtlety PvE Build: Hemo Seal Fate","summary_es":"Build flexible que combina Hemorragia con Veneno y Sello del destino.","summary_en":"Flexible build combining Hemorrhage with Venom and Seal Fate.","keywords_es":["build sutileza hemorragia","sello del destino pícaro","talentos veneno sutileza","build JcE sutileza"],"keywords_en":["subtlety hemo seal fate build","rogue seal fate talents","subtlety venom talents","subtlety pve build"],"text_es":"Asesinato: Maldad 5/5, Crueldad 3/3, Hacer picadillo mejorado 3/3, Vigor 1/2, Salpicadura de sangre 1/1, Letalidad 2/2, Venenos inmundos 1/5, Sangre fría 1/1, Venenos mejorados 3/5, Golpes despiadados 5/5, Veneno 1/1 y Sello del destino 2/3. Combate: Golpes eficientes 2/2. Sutileza: Maestro de la decepción 3/3, Oportunidad 5/5, Trabajos sucios 2/2, Iniciativa 3/3, Premeditación 1/1, Espadas dentadas 3/3, Elusión 2/2, Golpe fantasmal 1/1 y Hemorragia 1/1. Es flexible en armas y su apertura es más sencilla que la de Deep Sub.","text_en":"Assassination: Malice 5/5, Ruthlessness 3/3, Improved Slice and Dice 3/3, Vigor 1/2, Blood Splatter 1/1, Lethality 2/2, Vile Poisons 1/5, Cold Blood 1/1, Improved Poisons 3/5, Relentless Strikes 5/5, Venom 1/1, and Seal Fate 2/3. Combat: Efficient Strikes 2/2. Subtlety: Master of Deception 3/3, Opportunity 5/5, Dirty Deeds 2/2, Initiative 3/3, Premeditation 1/1, Serrated Blades 3/3, Elusiveness 2/2, Ghostly Strike 1/1, and Hemorrhage 1/1. It is weapon-flexible and has a simpler opener than Deep Sub.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Subtlety Rogue Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Subtlety Rogue PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:subtlety:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:38a49afdc60164a2c4f34e9dae4992d445306b02"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-build-combate-veneno-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcE de Combate: Veneno","title_en":"Combat PvE Build: Venom","summary_es":"Build de Combate con Veneno y sin Subidón de adrenalina.","summary_en":"Combat build with Venom and without Adrenaline Rush.","keywords_es":["build combate veneno","talentos veneno pícaro","subidón de adrenalina combate","build JcE combate"],"keywords_en":["combat venom build","rogue venom talents","combat adrenaline rush","combat pve build"],"text_es":"Asesinato: Maldad 5/5, Crueldad 3/3, Hacer picadillo mejorado 3/3, Vigor 2/2, Letalidad 2/2, Venenos inmundos 4/5, Sangre fría 1/1 y Veneno 1/1. Combate: Golpe de gracia 3/3, Golpes eficientes 2/2, Desvío 1/3, Precisión 3/3, Correr mejorado 2/2, Robustez 2/2, Compostura 2/2, Ejecución impecable 1/1, Experiencia con armas 2/2, Agresión 3/3, Especialización en doble empuñadura 2/2, Ráfaga con espada 1/1, Cortar y rebanar 1/5 y Destello de acero 5/5. La variante obtiene Veneno y no incluye Subidón de adrenalina.","text_en":"Assassination: Malice 5/5, Ruthlessness 3/3, Improved Slice and Dice 3/3, Vigor 2/2, Lethality 2/2, Vile Poisons 4/5, Cold Blood 1/1, and Venom 1/1. Combat: Coup de Grace 3/3, Efficient Strikes 2/2, Deflection 1/3, Precision 3/3, Improved Sprint 2/2, Endurance 2/2, Composure 2/2, Flawless Execution 1/1, Weapon Expertise 2/2, Aggression 3/3, Dual Wield Specialization 2/2, Blade Flurry 1/1, Hack and Slash 1/5, and Flash of Steel 5/5. This variant takes Venom and omits Adrenaline Rush.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Combat Rogue Talent Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Combat Rogue PvE Dungeon and Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:combat:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:8173dc81cac36120bade5a8c57750e3c4168611c"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-apertura-asesinato-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Apertura de Asesinato a nivel 60","title_en":"Assassination Level-60 Opener","summary_es":"Secuencia de apertura de Asesinato con Mutilar, Apuñalar y Sangre fría.","summary_en":"Assassination opener using Mutilate, Shank, and Cold Blood.","keywords_es":["apertura asesinato 60","inicio combate pícaro asesinato","sangre fría eviscerar"],"keywords_en":["assassination level 60 opener","assassination rogue pull","cold blood eviscerate"],"text_es":"Usa Poción de frenesí sublime al inicio si no debes guardarla; después, Mutilar, Esfumar y Garrote. Sigue con Apuñalar y Hacer picadillo, genera 4–5 puntos con Mutilar y remata con Sangre fría y Eviscerar. Si solo podrás usar Sangre fría una vez, resérvala para un Eviscerar de 5 puntos.","text_en":"Use Major Frenzy Potion at the start if it need not be saved, then Mutilate, Vanish, and Garrote. Follow with Shank and Slice and Dice, build 4–5 points with Mutilate, and finish with Cold Blood and Eviscerate. If you will only use Cold Blood once, save it for a 5-point Eviscerate.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Opening Rotation for Assassination Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:5635b5289c83c10aa0158d944310d0090fbffd4d"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-apertura-combate-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Apertura de Combate a nivel 60","title_en":"Combat Level-60 Opener","summary_es":"Secuencia de apertura y ajustes según las tres builds de Combate.","summary_en":"Opener sequence and adjustments for the three Combat builds.","keywords_es":["apertura combate 60","inicio combate pícaro","rotación inicial combate"],"keywords_en":["combat level 60 opener","combat rogue pull","combat opening rotation"],"text_es":"Usa Poción de frenesí sublime seguida de Ráfaga con espada si no debes reservarlas; genera con Golpe siniestro o Puñalada, usa Esfumar y Garrote. Sigue con Apuñalar, Hacer picadillo y Subidón de adrenalina; genera hasta 5 puntos con Golpe siniestro o 4–5 con Puñalada y remata con Sangre fría y Eviscerar. La build de Puñalada omite Sangre fría y la de Veneno omite Subidón de adrenalina.","text_en":"Use Major Frenzy Potion followed by Blade Flurry if they need not be saved; build with Sinister Strike or Backstab, use Vanish, and apply Garrote. Follow with Shank, Slice and Dice, and Adrenaline Rush; build to 5 points with Sinister Strike or 4–5 with Backstab, then use Cold Blood and Eviscerate. The Backstab build skips Cold Blood, and the Venom build skips Adrenaline Rush.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Opening Rotation for Combat Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:combat:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:7a35a5ea33258d3f9008e77fed51f8733c66be6e"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-apertura-sutileza-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Apertura de Sutileza a nivel 60","title_en":"Subtlety Level-60 Opener","summary_es":"Apertura distinta para las variantes de Marca de muerte y Hemorragia.","summary_en":"Different openers for the Death Mark and Hemorrhage variants.","keywords_es":["apertura sutileza 60","inicio combate pícaro sutileza","hemorragia sello del destino"],"keywords_en":["subtlety level 60 opener","subtlety rogue pull","hemorrhage seal fate"],"text_es":"Antes del combate, usa Premeditación para activar Hacer picadillo; añade una poción si no debes guardarla y usa Esfumar y Garrote. La variante de Marca de muerte continúa con Preparación, Premeditación, Marca de muerte, Hemorragia, Apuñalar y Ruptura. La de Hemorragia y Sello del destino sigue con Hemorragia, Apuñalar y Ruptura; luego genera 4–5 puntos y usa Sangre fría con Eviscerar, reservándola para 5 puntos si solo tendrás un uso.","text_en":"Before the pull, use Premeditation to activate Slice and Dice; add a potion if it need not be saved, then Vanish and Garrote. Deep Sub continues with Preparation, Premeditation, Death Mark, Hemorrhage, Shank, and Rupture. The other variant uses Hemorrhage, Shank, and Rupture, then builds 4–5 points for Cold Blood and Eviscerate; save Cold Blood for 5 points if you will only use it once.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Opening Rotation for Subtlety Rogues in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:rogue:subtlety:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:606e1bea454d5a818f1b4d35e20dc27f4d7aa893"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-constructores-finalizadores","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Constructores y finalizadores: costes y efectos","title_en":"Builders and finishers: costs and effects","summary_es":"Energía, puntos y requisitos de cada ataque de combo.","summary_en":"Energy, points and requirements of each combo move.","keywords_es":["cuánta energía cuesta mutilar","puñalada requisitos","hemorragia daga","venom pícaro qué hace","hacer picadillo mantener"],"keywords_en":["how much energy does mutilate cost","backstab requirements","hemorrhage dagger","rogue venom what does it do","slice and dice uptime"],"text_es":"Mutilar (60 de energía, 2 puntos) exige dagas en ambas manos y pega un 20 % más a objetivos envenenados. Puñalada (60, 1 punto) exige estar detrás y daga en la mano principal. Golpe siniestro cuesta 45. Hemorragia cuesta 35 y hace un 15 % más de daño con Ruptura. Todas las especializaciones mantienen Hacer picadillo casi siempre, más un finalizador: Veneno en Asesinato (+30 % de daño y +10 % de aplicación de venenos, hasta 21 s), Eviscerar en Combate y Ruptura en Sutileza.","text_en":"Mutilate (60 Energy, 2 points) needs daggers in both hands and hits Poisoned targets 20% harder. Backstab (60, 1 point) needs you behind the target and a dagger in the main hand. Sinister Strike costs 45. Hemorrhage costs 35 and makes Rupture deal 15% more damage. Every spec keeps Slice and Dice up almost always, plus one finisher: Venom for Assassination (+30% poison damage and +10% poison chance, up to 21 s), Eviscerate for Combat and Rupture for Subtlety.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Abilities Guide - Forever › Combo Point Builders for Assassination Rogues","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Abilities Guide - Forever › Combo Point Finishers for Assassination Rogues","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Abilities Guide - Forever › Combo Point Finishers for Subtlety Rogues","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-abilities","date":"2026-10-08"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue Abilities Guide - Forever › Combo Point Finishers for Combat Rogues","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:abilities","class:rogue:combat:abilities","class:rogue:subtlety:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:11547b4d6f97d0cd90a1fd5fdbcebd305a9d5711","section:1a030b0fdff8690bf2e0c7880daab798e81c0ea7","section:80b3d8e56582876a64350a20c449290ab83b5940","section:b8c1fb66676ec20fde07275d0fc83daf4c721cd4"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-aperturas-sigilo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Aperturas desde el sigilo","title_en":"Stealth openers","summary_es":"Cuándo conviene Golpe bajo, Garrote, Emboscada o Zapar.","summary_en":"When Cheap Shot, Garrote, Ambush or Sap are worth it.","keywords_es":["qué abrir desde sigilo","golpe bajo cuánto aturde","zapar cuánto dura","garrote cuánta energía","emboscada pícaro"],"keywords_en":["rogue stealth opener","cheap shot stun duration","sap duration","garrote energy cost","ambush rogue"],"text_es":"Golpe bajo aturde 4 s, cuesta 60 y da 2 puntos; es la apertura más práctica si el enemigo se puede aturdir. Emboscada (250 % de daño; detrás, daga, 60 de energía) sale cara para JcE. Garrote (50, detrás) deja un sangrado de 18 s; en Sutileza, Trabajos sucios lo baja a 30 y también abarata Golpe bajo. Zapar incapacita hasta 25 s a humanoides sin combate y ya no te saca del sigilo, así que sirve para separar grupos.","text_en":"Cheap Shot stuns for 4 s, costs 60 and gives 2 points; it is the most practical opener if the enemy can be stunned. Ambush (250% damage; behind, dagger, 60 Energy) is expensive for PvE. Garrote (50, from behind) leaves an 18-second bleed; in Subtlety, Dirty Deeds lowers it to 30 and also cheapens Cheap Shot. Sap incapacitates humanoids out of combat for up to 25 s and no longer breaks Stealth, so it works to split packs.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Abilities Guide - Forever › Stealth Abilities for Assassination Rogues","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Abilities Guide - Forever › Stealth Abilities for Subtlety Rogues","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/dps-abilities","date":"2026-10-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:abilities","class:rogue:subtlety:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:ea3780c392cb9d82d7cb0aa2029b44be26ce79c8","section:f9e48a867ad0234339d3be0a5dad221f7d381a0e"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-utilidades-detalle","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Duración y uso de las utilidades del Pícaro","title_en":"Rogue utility durations and uses","summary_es":"Patada, Incapacitación, Correr, Evasión, Ceguera, Esfumar.","summary_en":"Kick, Gouge, Sprint, Evasion, Blind, Vanish.","keywords_es":["cuánto dura evasión","patada silencia escuela","correr pícaro cuánto dura","esfumar qué hace","cambiar de objetivo puntos de combo"],"keywords_en":["how long does evasion last","kick school lockout","sprint duration rogue","what does vanish do","switch target combo points"],"text_es":"Patada interrumpe y, si corta un hechizo, bloquea esa escuela 5 s; los puntos de combo no se pierden al cambiar de objetivo mientras no generes nuevos. Incapacitación (4 s) exige que el objetivo te mire. Correr (15 s) no rompe el sigilo. Evasión da +50 % de esquiva 15 s. Ceguera (hasta 10 s) se rompe con daño. Esfumar (10 s) quita efectos de movimiento, reinicia amenaza y permite usar Golpe bajo en combate. Amago baja algo la amenaza; Distraer (10 s) reduce su detección.","text_en":"Kick interrupts and, if it stops a spell, locks that school for 5 s; Combo Points are not lost when you switch targets as long as you do not generate new ones. Gouge (4 s) needs the target to face you. Sprint (15 s) does not break Stealth. Evasion gives +50% dodge for 15 s. Blind (up to 10 s) breaks on damage. Vanish (10 s) removes movement-impairing effects, drops threat and allows Cheap Shot in combat. Feint lowers threat a little; Distract (10 s) reduces their detection.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Assassination Rogues","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:11e04f50868ce963fecdc3155df580ef89718f24"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-venenos-detalle","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace cada veneno","title_en":"What each poison does","summary_es":"Probabilidad y efecto de los cinco venenos.","summary_en":"Chance and effect of the five poisons.","keywords_es":["veneno mortal cuántas cargas","veneno atroz efecto","veneno de aturdimiento mental","envenenar herida jcj","qué veneno usar"],"keywords_en":["deadly poison stacks","crippling poison effect","mind-numbing poison","wound poison pvp","which poison to use"],"text_es":"Veneno atroz (30 %): ralentiza 50 % durante 12 s y evita que huyan. Veneno de aturdimiento mental (20 %): +40 % al tiempo de lanzamiento 10 s, útil contra lanzadores. Veneno instantáneo (20 %): daño de naturaleza inmediato. Veneno mortal (30 %): daño de naturaleza durante 12 s, hasta 5 cargas; Asesinato lo prefiere para su +20 % de Mutilar. Envenenar herida (30 %): reduce la curación recibida 15 s, hasta 5 cargas; más útil en JcJ. Los venenos escalan con poder de ataque.","text_en":"Crippling Poison (30%): slows 50% for 12 s and stops fleeing. Mind-numbing Poison (20%): +40% casting time for 10 s, useful against casters. Instant Poison (20%): immediate Nature damage. Deadly Poison (30%): Nature damage over 12 s, up to 5 stacks; Assassination prefers it for the +20% on Mutilate. Wound Poison (30%): reduces healing received for 15 s, up to 5 stacks; more useful in PvP. Poisons scale with Attack Power.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Rogue Abilities Guide - Forever › Weapon poisons for Assassination Rogues","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:7697ee5b79c120ec3e1dd0c923d8411a2b0bc756"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-encantamientos-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Pícaro al subir","title_en":"Rogue enchants while leveling","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Pícaro (las tres especializaciones) mientras subes.","summary_en":"What to enchant as a Rogue (all three specs) while leveling.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo pícaro","qué encantamientos pongo de pícaro","encantamientos para pícaro","encantamientos pícaro","qué encantar pícaro","encantar botas velocidad menor","arma recuperación pícaro"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a rogue","best enchants for rogue","rogue enchants","what to enchant rogue","minor speed boots rogue","recovery weapon rogue"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Pícaro al subir: Las tres especializaciones usan la misma lista: Encantar arma: recuperación, Encantar collar: agilidad, Encantar capa: agilidad inferior, Encantar pechera: estadísticas inferiores, Encantar brazal: fuerza superior, Encantar guantes: velocidad menor y Encantar botas: velocidad menor. En las piernas, un Complemento pesado para armadura fuerte o el equivalente a tu nivel. Cabeza y hombros no necesitan nada.","text_en":"Rogue enchants while leveling: All three specs use the same list: Enchant Weapon - Recovery, Enchant Necklace - Agility, Enchant Cloak - Lesser Agility, Enchant Chest - Lesser Stats, Enchant Bracer - Greater Strength, Enchant Gloves - Minor Haste and Enchant Boots - Minor Speed. On the legs, a Forceful Heavy Armor Kit or the equivalent for your level. Head and shoulders need nothing.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Assassination Rogue Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Enchants and Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Combat Rogue Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Enchants and Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Subtlety Rogue Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:enchants","class:rogue:combat:enchants","class:rogue:subtlety:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:961ca421bd83223b6aaa739b4ebd78b46a68a2f1","section:f436d0349617149498789bcff537126b20caaf65","section:f6ba31519b0357c2f5b4b3f32db0ae55939c33a9"]},{"id":"clase-rogue-consumibles-por-nivel","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles del Pícaro por nivel","title_en":"Rogue consumables by level","summary_es":"Elixires, piedras de afilar, comida y veneno recomendados al Pícaro por nivel.","summary_en":"Elixirs, sharpening stones, food and poison recommended for the Rogue by level.","keywords_es":["qué consumibles uso siendo pícaro","qué consumibles uso de pícaro","consumibles para pícaro","qué elixires uso de pícaro","consumibles pícaro","elixir de la mangosta","piedra de afilar pícaro","té de cardo"],"keywords_en":["what consumables as a rogue","best consumables for rogue","rogue consumables","elixir of the mongoose","rogue sharpening stone","thistle tea","rogue food","instant poison leveling"],"text_es":"Consumibles del Pícaro por nivel: Elixires de agilidad que escalan: nivel 2 menor, 18 inferior, 27 Elixir de agilidad, 38 superior, 46 Elixir de la mangosta y 55 Elixir de ferocidad. Piedras de afilar: burda (5), pesada (15), sólida (25), densa (35) y elemental (50). Comida: Filete de coyote (5), Chuletas de león picantes (15), Costillas de lobo picantes (25), Chuleta de lobo tierno (35), Filete Golpeveloz (45) y Filete de falda (55). Poción de curación a tu nivel, Té de cardo y el mejor Veneno instantáneo en ambas manos.","text_en":"Rogue consumables by level: Agility elixirs by level: 2 Minor, 18 Lesser, 27 Elixir of Agility, 38 Greater, 46 Elixir of the Mongoose and 55 Elixir of Ferocity. Sharpening stones: Coarse (5), Heavy (15), Solid (25), Dense (35) and Elemental (50). Food: Coyote Steak (5), Hot Lion Chops (15), Hot Wolf Ribs (25), Tender Wolf Steak (35), Swiftstrike Steak (45) and Filet o' Flank (55). Healing Potion for your level, Thistle Tea and the best Instant Poison on both hands.","tags":["ROGUE"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Assassination Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Assassination Rogue Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Combat Rogue DPS Enchants and Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Combat Rogue Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/combat/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Subtlety Rogue Enchants and Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Subtlety Rogue Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/rogue/subtlety/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:rogue:assassination:enchants","class:rogue:combat:enchants","class:rogue:subtlety:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:093b382761e9f258e85af4d65666b345f658135b","section:6ec4d1ac51cc36b36f31bae69adfb56929d692f1","section:ff4d1f3527fd317d001668e4335b22abb59e087d"]}]},"04-clase-shaman.json":{"description":"Capítulo 4: Clases. Chamán. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"clase-shaman-que-hace","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace un Chamán","title_en":"What a Shaman Does","summary_es":"El Chamán canaliza los elementos, apoya con tótems y puede atacar, curar o controlar.","summary_en":"Shaman channels the elements, supports with totems, and can attack, heal, or control.","keywords_es":["qué hace un chamán","chamán elementos","chamán totems","chamán curación","chamán cuerpo a cuerpo"],"keywords_en":["what does a shaman do","shaman elements","shaman totems","shaman healing","shaman melee"],"text_es":"El Chamán canaliza fuego, agua, aire y tierra para atacar a distancia, combatir cuerpo a cuerpo o sanar. Sus tótems dejan efectos en un radio fijo que fortalecen aliados, dañan enemigos o aportan control. También dispone de Escudo de agua, purgas, interrupción y resurrección; gestionar tótems y maná es esencial.","text_en":"Shaman channels fire, water, air, and earth to attack at range, fight in melee, or heal. Its totems create fixed-radius effects that buff allies, damage enemies, or control them. It also has Water Shield, dispels, an interrupt, and resurrection; totem and mana management are essential.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Elemental Shaman for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Enhancement Shaman for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Restoration Shaman for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Elemental Shaman in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Shaman Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Shaman in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shaman-class-overview","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Enhancement Shaman Guide › Enhancement Shaman Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enhancement-shaman-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:overview","class:shaman:enhancement:overview","class:shaman:general:shaman-class-overview","class:shaman:restoration:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:54b33e866b653415f62f3443937e721fd23af2dc","section:788f981f22d9bc94be4370be85be069010bdba4e","section:cd4867699d620eef2476b89815b4eab2cb7c742a","section:d54b421712ee117d67f46e8635928ec56c1c9d68","section:eb2fdd7d79281957c674f5d4a7402f7477f9d887","section:f9995ca43545f452582214580ee3c2244fa4e73c"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-especializaciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones del Chamán","title_en":"Shaman Specializations","summary_es":"Elemental destaca a distancia y en área; Mejora pelea a dos manos; Recuperación cura en grupo.","summary_en":"Elemental excels at ranged AoE; Enhancement fights with a two-hander; Restoration heals groups.","keywords_es":["especializaciones del chamán","chamán elemental mejora recuperación","chamán daño a distancia","chamán cuerpo a cuerpo","chamán sanador"],"keywords_en":["shaman specializations","shaman elemental enhancement restoration","shaman ranged damage","shaman melee","shaman healer"],"text_es":"Elemental lanza Descarga de relámpagos y Choque de llamas a distancia; Cadena de relámpagos y Nova de Fuego dan cleave y área, con alto coste de maná y menos daño a un objetivo. Mejora combate con dos manos; Golpe de tormenta aporta ráfagas y la rama sube bien, aunque su área exige maná. Para sanar, Recuperación es la Especialización en sanación: Onda de curación cubre un objetivo y Mareas vivas potencia Curación en cadena; es eficaz en grupos, no para subir en solitario. Las tres ramas usan tótems y maná.","text_en":"Elemental casts Lightning Bolt and Flame Shock at range; Chain Lightning and Fire Nova bring cleave/AoE, while single-target output is more modest and mana costs high. Enhancement uses a two-hander and gains burst from Stormstrike; the spec levels well, though its AoE needs mana. For healing, Restoration is the healer branch: Healing Wave covers one target and Riptide boosts Chain Heal; it excels in groups, not solo leveling. All three rely on totems and mana.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Elemental Shaman for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Enhancement Shamans in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Enhancement Shamans in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Restoration Shaman in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Restoration Shaman for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Enhancement Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:overview","class:shaman:elemental:rotation","class:shaman:enhancement:overview","class:shaman:enhancement:rotation","class:shaman:restoration:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:1ce71735cc97a9e743e76903eb30d978c01da8b8","section:2981a5842596f99788abac67015ad6ea1739e497","section:417cce8f5eb0abe0dec3ea0b79a906ebf9e31645","section:54b33e866b653415f62f3443937e721fd23af2dc","section:cbfa4ca42d8d3108c72126038f3475700dd4f7f5","section:d54b421712ee117d67f46e8635928ec56c1c9d68","section:f589633e3b329c3a5ecba8f5518feccd9e3ea0d7"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué cambia en Forever para el Chamán","title_en":"What Changes for Shaman in Forever","summary_es":"Forever cambia la movilidad, las armas de Mejora, el área Elemental y las herramientas de Recuperación.","summary_en":"Forever changes mobility, Enhancement weapons, Elemental AoE, and Restoration tools.","keywords_es":["cambios del chamán en forever","lobo fantasmal forever","chamán elemental área","viento furioso arma y tótem","chamán recuperación"],"keywords_en":["shaman forever changes","ghost wolf forever","elemental shaman aoe","windfury weapon totem","restoration shaman"],"text_es":"Lobo fantasmal se lanza en 1 s; Lobo fantasmal mejorado 2/2 lo hace instantáneo y usable en interiores. Elemental recibe Nova de Fuego como hechizo básico y Vinculado a la tierra enraíza 5 s con Tótem Nexo Terrestre. Mejora queda en dos manos; Golpe de tormenta llega a 25 y Arma vorágine permite lanzar Descarga de relámpagos al instante con 5 cargas. Arma tótem Viento Furioso se acumula con Tótem Viento Furioso. Recuperación gana Escudo de agua, Mareas vivas y Conciencia; Mareas vivas potencia Curación en cadena un 25% y Tótem Marea de maná (Tótem de marea de maná) ayuda al grupo.","text_en":"Ghost Wolf has a 1-second cast; Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2 makes it instant and usable indoors. Elemental gains baseline Fire Nova, and Earthbound roots for 5 seconds with Earthbind Totem. Enhancement becomes two-handed only and gains Stormstrike at 25; Maelstrom Weapon makes Lightning Bolt instant at 5 stacks. Windfury Weapon stacks with Windfury Totem. Restoration gains Water Shield, Riptide, and Mindfulness; Riptide boosts Chain Heal by 25%, and Mana Tide Totem supports the group.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Elemental Shaman in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Enhancement Shaman in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Restoration Shaman in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Elemental Shaman Guide › Elemental Shaman Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Enhancement Shaman Guide › Enhancement Shaman Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enhancement-shaman-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Restoration Shaman Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:overview","class:shaman:enhancement:overview","class:shaman:restoration:overview","class:shaman:restoration:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:15c57f7d8e2f3474d630c1126cea331be603e32c","section:2dcd1aeb649e9a6b067eb25845d75562a2ffcf46","section:4da9bfedc6695d6ca5c1d966c0774041bc29d7f5","section:4e0be73eb57053f6974b86b526385526b67f635c","section:925caa62d6c0f95b48313677afdc0512dbff0fa4","section:cd4867699d620eef2476b89815b4eab2cb7c742a","section:ec9461f42f0086478c70c2fdf1e74705d8f21ca2","section:f15ba0e6ffeec55586623162f1ad6e950c25f82e","section:f589633e3b329c3a5ecba8f5518feccd9e3ea0d7","section:f9995ca43545f452582214580ee3c2244fa4e73c"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-armas-armadura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas y equipo para subir","title_en":"Leveling Weapons and Gear","summary_es":"Mejora aprovecha un arma lenta a dos manos con Viento Furioso; Peletería fabrica equipo útil para subir.","summary_en":"Enhancement uses a slow two-hander with Windfury; Leatherworking crafts useful leveling gear.","keywords_es":["armas del chamán","armadura del chamán","chamán dos manos","chamán escudo","chamán malla"],"keywords_en":["shaman weapons","shaman armor","shaman two hander","shaman shield","shaman mail"],"text_es":"Desde el nivel 30, Mejora puede usar Arma tótem Viento Furioso con un arma lenta a dos manos. Mantén el arma cerca de tu nivel: los nuevos hallazgos mejoran el daño incluso con las imbuiciones. Peletería fabrica equipo de cuero y malla con poder con hechizos y complementos de armadura para varias ranuras.","text_en":"From level 30, Enhancement can use Windfury Weapon with a slow two-handed weapon. Keep your weapon close to your level: new finds improve damage even with imbues. Leatherworking crafts leather and mail gear with spell power, plus armor kits for several slots.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Levels 20–39: Flurry and Maelstrom Weapon","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35070","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Enhancement Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:enhancement:leveling","class:shaman:extra:enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:7f1e5e355784be87eeb25a6e9883cc79362b5366","section:8c800dc281a111963a7346ee5a3c569837efad7f","section:9b40d5c7f5d3dc44d6f297beb0437a160f58e03d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-subir-espec","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejor especialización para subir","title_en":"Best Specialization for Leveling","summary_es":"Mejora y Spellhance rinden en solitario; Elemental cuesta más maná y Recuperación funciona mejor en grupo.","summary_en":"Enhancement and Spellhance suit solo play; Elemental is mana-hungry, while Restoration suits groups.","keywords_es":["mejor especialización para subir chamán","chamán mejora para levear","chamán elemental para subir","chamán recuperación para subir","qué spec de chamán usar"],"keywords_en":["best shaman leveling spec","enhancement shaman leveling","elemental shaman leveling","restoration shaman leveling","which shaman spec to level"],"text_es":"Para subir solo, Mejora es flexible y se sostiene con sus curas; Spellhance, híbrida de cuerpo a cuerpo y hechizos, se recomienda como la opción más rápida y eficiente en maná. Elemental ofrece daño de área y apoyo en grupo, pero sufre por el coste de maná y el daño bajo a un objetivo. Recuperación cura bien en grupo, aunque su daño bajo hace lenta la subida en solitario.","text_en":"For solo leveling, Enhancement is flexible and sustains itself with heals; Spellhance, a melee-and-spell hybrid, is recommended as the faster, more mana-efficient option. Elemental offers AoE damage and group support, but struggles with mana costs and low single-target damage. Restoration heals groups well, but its low damage makes solo leveling slow.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Enhancement Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Restoration Shaman Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:enhancement:leveling","class:shaman:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:02edca8cefc6a8955b596cb9dc24d17c8c3bb8d8","section:46f798a58b64565a4b8008794494ae84739c49d2","section:84702d1e106cbfa4c71f55027da7e4f66b3ecb24","section:888472ae699639df6186441b5df56e8bd5f76d07"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-talentos-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Mejora (subida)","title_en":"Enhancement Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Mejora invierte primero 34 puntos en su rama y termina con 17 de Elemental para maná y daño.","summary_en":"Enhancement spends its first 34 points in its tree, then 17 in Elemental for mana and damage.","keywords_es":["talentos para subir chamán mejora","ruta de mejora","enfoque chamanístico","golpe de tormenta","conciencia"],"keywords_en":["enhancement shaman leveling talents","enhancement talent path","shamanistic focus","stormstrike","mindfulness"],"text_es":"La ruta de Mejora prioriza Golpes de trueno 5/5 y Maña mental 3/3 (10–17), Lobo fantasmal mejorado 2/2 y Enfoque chamanístico 1/1 (18–20), Armas elementales 3/3 y Aluvión 5/5 (21–29), Presura mental 2/2 y Arma vorágine 5/5 (30–39), y Golpe de tormenta 1/1, Ira del clarividente 1/1 y Golpe de tormenta mejorado 2/2 (40–43). Después: Convección 5/5, Devastación elemental 3/3, Reverberación 5/5, Llamada de la llama 3/3 y Enfoque elemental 1/1 (44–60), para abaratar hechizos y mejorar sus golpes.","text_en":"This route prioritizes Thundering Strikes 5/5 and Mental Dexterity 3/3 (10–17), Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2 and Shamanistic Focus 1/1 (18–20), Elemental Weapons 3/3 and Flurry 5/5 (21–29), Mental Quickness 2/2 and Maelstrom Weapon 5/5 (30–39), then Stormstrike 1/1, Rage of the Farseer 1/1, and Improved Stormstrike 2/2 (40–43). Next take Convection 5/5, Elemental Devastation 3/3, Reverberation 5/5, Call of Flame 3/3, and Elemental Focus 1/1 (44–60) to reduce spell costs and improve attacks.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Enhancement: levels 10–43 (34 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35070","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Elemental: levels 44–60 (17 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35070","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:3f68b1740dd8834721b7f43bfec2dc03ffe7c63c","section:7fd980b9d9af043aff41f0f473797dac29d20a4b"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-hitos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de habilidades por nivel","title_en":"Ability Milestones by Level","summary_es":"Las misiones de tótems llegan a 4, 10, 20 y 30; Lobo fantasmal se aprende a 20.","summary_en":"Totem quests arrive at 4, 10, 20, and 30; Ghost Wolf is learned at 20.","keywords_es":["cuándo aprendo habilidades de chamán","nivel de las habilidades del chamán","hitos del chamán","golpe de tormenta nivel","lobo fantasmal nivel"],"keywords_en":["when shaman abilities","shaman ability levels","shaman milestones","stormstrike level","ghost wolf level"],"text_es":"A nivel 4 llega la misión del tótem de tierra; a 10, la de fuego; a 20, la de agua y Lobo fantasmal; a 30, la de aire y Arma tótem Viento Furioso. A 32 se aprenden Tótem Viento Furioso y Cadena de relámpagos. Golpe de tormenta se obtiene como talento de Mejora a 40, no antes.","text_en":"At level 4 comes the earth totem quest; at 10, fire; at 20, water and Ghost Wolf; at 30, air and Windfury Weapon. Windfury Totem and Chain Lightning are learned at 32. Stormstrike is obtained as an Enhancement talent at 40, not earlier.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Elemental Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Leveling toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35070","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Enhancement: levels 10–43 (34 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35070","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:extra:enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:1f4871849a8c35aa4ff3d2a427d2defbbb8a426a","section:7fd980b9d9af043aff41f0f473797dac29d20a4b","section:8c636c1229fe6a624e2d10dad255be89f2d7cb4b","section:d3a29cfa972b6a9b0ec4f3c3c61fe08d738eff57"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-totems","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Uso táctico de los tótems","title_en":"Using Totems Tactically","summary_es":"Coloca tótems donde sirvan durante varios combates y usa los de control para frenar o distraer enemigos.","summary_en":"Place totems where they can help across several fights, and use control totems to slow or distract enemies.","keywords_es":["totems del chamán","cómo funcionan los totems","totem de tierra fuego agua aire","regreso totémico","llamada de los elementos"],"keywords_en":["shaman totems","how totems work","earth fire water air totem","totemic recall","call of the elements"],"text_es":"Los tótems se quedan donde los colocas, así que sitúa los de mejora para aprovecharlos en varios combates. Tótem Nexo Terrestre frena y Vinculado a la tierra puede enraizar; Tótem Garra de piedra desvía la atención y Tótem derribador intercepta hechizos. Llamada de los elementos coloca los cuatro con 3 s de lanzamiento; Regreso totémico los recoge fuera del tiempo global de reutilización para recolocarlos al moverte.","text_en":"Totems stay where you place them, so position buffs to use them across several fights. Earthbind Totem slows and Earthbound can root; Stoneclaw Totem draws attention, while Grounding Totem intercepts spells. Call of the Elements places all four with a 3-second cast; Totemic Recall picks them up off the global cooldown so you can reposition when moving.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Enhancement Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide › Elemental Shaman Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide › FAQ Should I use Call of the Elements and Totemic Projection?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:enhancement:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:17d5818b63371f552189fd40c345f393ea5e733c","section:426a25cddbcd00c8dd5cd18426e2363d24658f7d","section:8c800dc281a111963a7346ee5a3c569837efad7f","section:a2e862ebc4be5233a4180903c8463d797bf6bb61","section:f92fffdac32c60a02c0162051405b4c4ea32d664"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-choques","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Choques: daño, interrupción y control","title_en":"Shocks: Damage, Interrupt, and Control","summary_es":"Choque de llamas daña en el tiempo, Choque de tierra interrumpe y Choque de Escarcha ralentiza.","summary_en":"Flame Shock deals damage over time, Earth Shock interrupts, and Frost Shock slows.","keywords_es":["choques del chamán","choque de llamas","choque de tierra","choque de escarcha","chamán interrumpir"],"keywords_en":["shaman shocks","flame shock","earth shock","frost shock","shaman interrupt"],"text_es":"Los choques comparten reutilización, así que elegir uno retrasa los otros. Choque de llamas aplica daño de fuego en el tiempo; Choque de tierra inflige daño e interrumpe un lanzamiento; Choque de Escarcha ralentiza durante 8 s y sirve para controlar o alejarse de un enemigo. Elige según necesites daño, interrupción o control.","text_en":"These three spells share a cooldown, so using one delays the others. Flame Shock applies fire damage over time; Earth Shock deals damage and interrupts a cast; Frost Shock slows for 8 seconds and helps control or kite an enemy. Choose based on whether you need damage, an interrupt, or control.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Elemental Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:d3a29cfa972b6a9b0ec4f3c3c61fe08d738eff57","section:f92fffdac32c60a02c0162051405b4c4ea32d664"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-escudos-mana","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Escudos y gestión de maná","title_en":"Shields and Mana Management","summary_es":"Cada gasto de maná pausa su regeneración de espíritu durante 5 s; los escudos ayudan a conservarlo.","summary_en":"Spending mana pauses Spirit regeneration for 5 seconds; shields help conserve it.","keywords_es":["maná del chamán","escudo de relámpagos","escudo de agua","regeneración de maná chamán","regla de cinco segundos"],"keywords_en":["shaman mana","lightning shield","water shield","shaman mana regeneration","five second rule"],"text_es":"Gastar maná —también con tótems o hechizos instantáneos— pausa su regeneración de espíritu durante 5 s. Para aprovecharlo, remata con ataques automáticos y renueva Escudo de relámpagos al terminar. Mantén ese escudo para hacer daño eficiente hasta obtener Escudo de agua; después, conserva uno de los dos activo. Tótem Fuente de maná y Tótem de marea de maná también ayudan a sostener el maná del grupo.","text_en":"Spending mana—including on totems or instant spells—pauses Spirit regeneration for 5 seconds. To make use of this, finish with auto-attacks and refresh Lightning Shield after the fight. Keep that shield up for efficient damage until you get Water Shield; then maintain one of the two. Mana Spring Totem and Mana Tide Totem also help sustain the group's mana.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide › Elemental Shaman Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Elemental Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › Healing toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35071","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:extra:restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:4298e9a6b9f493543c1a290cb540b1e0313bc66d","section:a2e862ebc4be5233a4180903c8463d797bf6bb61","section:bd0a7038c7ca9f7efc5e6dd3528d0d3224a04549","section:d3a29cfa972b6a9b0ec4f3c3c61fe08d738eff57"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-lobo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Lobo fantasmal y movilidad","title_en":"Ghost Wolf and Mobility","summary_es":"Lobo fantasmal se aprende a 20 y da un 40% de velocidad al aire libre; su talento lo hace instantáneo e interior.","summary_en":"Ghost Wolf is learned at 20 and grants 40% outdoor speed; its talent makes it instant and usable indoors.","keywords_es":["lobo fantasmal","movilidad del chamán","lobo fantasmal mejorado","chamán velocidad","cambiar de forma"],"keywords_en":["ghost wolf","shaman mobility","improved ghost wolf","shaman speed","shapeshift"],"text_es":"Desde el nivel 20, Lobo fantasmal aumenta un 40% la velocidad al aire libre, sin duración ni reutilización. Lobo fantasmal mejorado 2/2 hace que su lanzamiento sea instantáneo y permite usarlo en interiores. Mientras estás transformado no puedes lanzar hechizos.","text_en":"From level 20, Ghost Wolf increases outdoor movement speed by 40%, with no duration or cooldown. Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2 makes its cast instant and lets you use it indoors. You cannot cast spells while transformed.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Leveling toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35070","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Enhancement: levels 10–43 (34 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35070","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide › Important Abilities","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:extra:enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:19f3ce9f398fddf010a3c95602d4b0accae85584","section:7fd980b9d9af043aff41f0f473797dac29d20a4b","section:8c636c1229fe6a624e2d10dad255be89f2d7cb4b"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-utilidad-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Utilidad y control del Chamán","title_en":"Shaman Utility and Control","summary_es":"Tótems controlan enemigos y protegen al grupo; Purgar, las curas de aflicciones y las resurrecciones dan apoyo.","summary_en":"Totems control enemies and protect the group; Purge, affliction cures, and resurrection provide support.","keywords_es":["utilidad del chamán","tótem nexo terrestre","tótem garra de piedra","reencarnación","purgar chamán"],"keywords_en":["shaman utility","earthbind totem","stoneclaw totem","reincarnation","shaman purge"],"text_es":"Tótem Nexo Terrestre ralentiza y Vinculado a la tierra enraíza 5 s; Tótem Garra de piedra provoca criaturas y Tótem derribador intercepta un hechizo. Tótem de tremor elimina miedo, sueño y encantamiento. Purgar quita hasta dos efectos mágicos beneficiosos; Curar veneno y Curar enfermedad limpian aliados. Reencarnación te resucita con un 20% de salud y maná, con 1 h de reutilización; Espíritu ancestral resucita a un aliado tras lanzarse.","text_en":"Earthbind Totem slows and Earthbound roots for 5 seconds; Stoneclaw Totem taunts creatures, and Grounding Totem intercepts a spell. Tremor Totem removes fear, sleep, and charm. Purge removes up to two beneficial magic effects; Cure Poison and Cure Disease cleanse allies. Reincarnation revives you with 20% health and mana on a 1-hour cooldown; Ancestral Spirit resurrects an ally after its cast.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:426a25cddbcd00c8dd5cd18426e2363d24658f7d","section:f92fffdac32c60a02c0162051405b4c4ea32d664"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-rotacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridades de combate para subir","title_en":"Leveling Combat Priorities","summary_es":"Elemental lanza a distancia, Mejora combate con ataques automáticos y Recuperación prioriza curar.","summary_en":"Elemental casts at range, Enhancement relies on auto-attacks, and Restoration prioritizes healing.","keywords_es":["rotación del chamán","rotación para subir chamán","descarga de relámpagos","golpe de tormenta","onda de curación"],"keywords_en":["shaman rotation","shaman leveling rotation","lightning bolt","stormstrike","healing wave"],"text_es":"Elemental: arma imbuida, escudo y tótems de grupo; Tótem abrasador, Choque de llamas y Golpe de tormenta si tienes el talento. Usa Cadena de relámpagos con Conjuro libre o maná suficiente; Descarga de relámpagos es la opción a distancia. Mejora: arma imbuida, abre con Descarga de relámpagos o Choque de llamas; Golpe de tormenta si lo tienes, Choque de tierra y ataques automáticos. Recuperación: arma, escudo y tótems de grupo; Mareas vivas al aliado más herido, luego Onda de curación; Curación en cadena para el grupo y Onda inferior de curación en emergencias.","text_en":"Elemental: imbued weapon, shield, and group totems; Searing Totem, Flame Shock, and Stormstrike if talented. Use Chain Lightning with Clearcasting or enough mana; Lightning Bolt is the ranged option. Enhancement: imbued weapon, open with Lightning Bolt or Flame Shock; Stormstrike if talented, Earth Shock, and auto-attacks. Restoration: weapon, shield, and group totems; Riptide on the most injured ally, then Healing Wave; Chain Heal for the group and Lesser Healing Wave in emergencies.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Enhancement Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Restoration Shaman Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Restoration Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:enhancement:leveling","class:shaman:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4298e9a6b9f493543c1a290cb540b1e0313bc66d","section:76ff15a95d17c1cccc55cc99ad44c19594898bc4","section:7dfcf958249908df66fcbba96a2d5d3d72afca50","section:e541687890b15e2c3b9062567d601729859bdfb6"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Daño en área con Nova de Fuego","title_en":"Area Damage with Fire Nova","summary_es":"Elemental prioriza Tótem de magma y Nova de Fuego; Mejora coloca un tótem y reparte Choque de llamas.","summary_en":"Elemental prioritizes Magma Totem and Fire Nova; Enhancement drops a totem and spreads Flame Shock.","keywords_es":["chamán daño en área","nova de fuego","cadena de relámpagos","tótem de magma","chamán varios enemigos"],"keywords_en":["shaman aoe","fire nova","chain lightning","magma totem","shaman multiple enemies"],"text_es":"Elemental: mantén imbuición, escudo y tótems de mejora; coloca Tótem de magma para daño de área y lanza Nova de Fuego, que aporta la mayor parte del daño pero consume mucho maná. Cadena de relámpagos se usa con la configuración Elemental a distancia; puedes omitir los choques. Mejora: coloca un tótem de fuego, usa Nova de Fuego y reparte Choque de llamas; espera a que el tanque genere amenaza y remata a un objetivo débil con ataques automáticos.","text_en":"Elemental: maintain an imbue, shield, and buff totems; place Magma Totem for AoE damage and cast Fire Nova, which deals most of the damage but uses a lot of mana. Chain Lightning is used with the ranged Elemental build; you can skip Shocks. Enhancement: place a Fire Totem, use Fire Nova, and spread Flame Shock; let the tank establish threat first and finish a weak target with auto-attacks.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Enhancement Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:enhancement:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4298e9a6b9f493543c1a290cb540b1e0313bc66d","section:7dfcf958249908df66fcbba96a2d5d3d72afca50"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-misiones-totems","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de clase de los totems","title_en":"Totem Class Quests","summary_es":"Las misiones de tótems se desbloquean entre niveles 3 y 30; El azote de la tormenta es difícil al 30.","summary_en":"Totem quests unlock from levels 3 to 30; The Tempest’s Weapons is difficult at 30.","keywords_es":["misiones de clase chamán","clamor de tierra","la llamada del fuego","la llamada del agua","the tempest's weapons"],"keywords_en":["shaman class quests","call of earth","call of fire","call of water","the tempest's weapons"],"text_es":"La llamada de la tierra (Clamor de Tierra para Orco/Trol) se desbloquea al nivel 3 para Cielonato y 4 para otras razas; La llamada del Fuego llega a 10, La llamada del agua a 20 y La llamada del aire a 30. Desbloquean Tótem piel de piedra, Tótem abrasador, Tótem de las llamas cargadas, Tótem Corriente de sanación y Tótem de aire. La cadena del Agua es larga y puede hacerse poco a poco. La llamada del aire abre El azote de la tormenta; pasa por zonas de nivel 35–40 y termina contra élites. Da Guardia de elementalista y un arma a elegir; conviene esperar o pedir ayuda.","text_en":"Call of Earth unlocks at level 3 for Skyborne and 4 for other races; Call of Fire comes at 10, Call of Water at 20, and Call of Air at 30. They unlock Stoneskin Totem, Searing Totem, Totem of Charged Flames, Healing Stream Totem, and Air Totem. The Water chain is long and can be done gradually. Call of Air opens The Tempest's Weapons; it crosses level 35–40 zones and ends with elites. It awards Elementalist's Guard and a weapon choice, so wait or get help.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shaman Class Quests Guide › Dwarf Shaman Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shaman-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shaman Class Quests Guide › Orc & Troll Shaman Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shaman-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shaman Class Quests Guide › Tauren Shaman Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shaman-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shaman Class Quests Guide › Skyborne Shaman Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shaman-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:general:shaman-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:0d3236d10ec99ecdb4990a055e073ce537ea9ce1","section:24a222bfc6cc719bb19ce5271c072364730cc56d","section:842b5981355c53b89462805ed9809cd44bfbf004","section:9a7e74fe43c6c3b4ce2aac75256934a86273bbfa"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-tips-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Tips","summary_es":"Ahorra maná, entrena rangos con regularidad y aprovecha profesiones, comida y consumibles.","summary_en":"Conserve mana, train ranks regularly, and make use of professions, food, and consumables.","keywords_es":["consejos para subir chamán","chamán agua y maná","peletería y desuello chamán","tótems para subir","buffs de campamento chamán"],"keywords_en":["shaman leveling tips","shaman water mana","leatherworking skinning shaman","totems leveling","shaman campfire buffs"],"text_es":"Haz pulls pausados y ahorra maná: Mejora causa mucho daño con ataques automáticos; si escasea, reduce los choques. Lleva agua, visita al instructor cada dos niveles y aprende las habilidades de arma que usarás. Peletería con Desuello da equipo; Alquimia con Herboristería facilita pociones y Pozo de maná. La comida activa da un 5% más de experiencia por enemigos muertos; el aceite de zahorí añade poder con hechizos y se acumula con imbuiciones. Coloca tótems antes de luchar, aprovecha las mejoras de campamento y cierra sesión en una posada para acumular experiencia descansada.","text_en":"Pull slowly and conserve mana: Enhancement deals much of its damage with auto-attacks; when low, reduce the use of shocks. Carry water, visit your trainer every two levels, and learn the weapon skills you will use. Leatherworking with Skinning provides gear; Alchemy with Herbalism helps supply potions and Mana Well. Food grants 5% more experience from kills; Wizard Oil adds spell power and stacks with imbues. Place totems before fighting, use camp buffs, and log out at an inn to build rested experience.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Enhancement Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:enhancement:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:8c800dc281a111963a7346ee5a3c569837efad7f","section:9b40d5c7f5d3dc44d6f297beb0437a160f58e03d","section:b2d262a96c15f0a8e2d6eb5061a4c24997cb1e4d","section:fe7a5492abf841706c41ec240e08643af945c19d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Chamán en grupo y mazmorras","title_en":"Shaman in Groups and Dungeons","summary_es":"Tótems aportan mejoras y control; Choque de tierra interrumpe y Recuperación devuelve maná al grupo.","summary_en":"Totems provide buffs and control; Earth Shock interrupts and Restoration restores group mana.","keywords_es":["chamán en grupo","chamán en mazmorras","tótems para el grupo","chamán interrupción","chamán resurrección"],"keywords_en":["shaman in groups","shaman in dungeons","group totems","shaman interrupt","shaman resurrection"],"text_es":"En grupo, Tótem Fuerza de la tierra y Tótem Viento Furioso apoyan a los aliados; Tótem derribador, Tótem de tremor y Tótem Nexo Terrestre aportan utilidad o control. Choque de tierra interrumpe, Purgar elimina beneficios enemigos y Reencarnación permite volver tras morir. Mejora aporta Tótem Viento Furioso al grupo cuerpo a cuerpo; Recuperación cura con Onda de curación y Curación en cadena, y Tótem Marea de maná (Tótem de marea de maná) devuelve maná al grupo. Coloca y reubica los tótems para mantener a los aliados en su radio.","text_en":"In groups, Strength of Earth and Windfury totems support allies; Grounding Totem, Tremor Totem, and Earthbind Totem provide utility or control. Earth Shock interrupts, Purge removes enemy buffs, and Reincarnation helps recover after a wipe; in melee groups, Enhancement supplies Windfury Totem, while Restoration heals with Healing Wave and Chain Heal and supplies Mana Tide Totem. Place and move totems to keep allies in range.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Elemental Shaman for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Enhancement Shamans in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Restoration Shaman Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Shaman Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Shaman in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shaman-class-overview","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Enhancement Shaman Guide › Enhancement Shaman Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enhancement-shaman-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Restoration Shaman Guide › Restoration Shaman Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/restoration-shaman-healer-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:overview","class:shaman:enhancement:overview","class:shaman:general:shaman-class-overview","class:shaman:restoration:overview","class:shaman:restoration:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:417cce8f5eb0abe0dec3ea0b79a906ebf9e31645","section:4da9bfedc6695d6ca5c1d966c0774041bc29d7f5","section:c3e8367744114cdbbbdc3e66cfdca208a42333fc","section:d54b421712ee117d67f46e8635928ec56c1c9d68","section:eb2fdd7d79281957c674f5d4a7402f7477f9d887","section:f9995ca43545f452582214580ee3c2244fa4e73c"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Elemental: daño a distancia","title_en":"Elemental: Ranged Damage","summary_es":"Elemental lanza relámpagos y fuego; sobresale en área, aunque consume mucho maná.","summary_en":"Elemental casts lightning and fire; it excels at AoE but consumes much mana.","keywords_es":["chamán elemental","elemental relámpagos","cadena de relámpagos","nova de fuego","chamán daño a distancia"],"keywords_en":["elemental shaman","elemental lightning","chain lightning","fire nova","shaman ranged damage"],"text_es":"Elemental lanza Descarga de relámpagos y Choque de llamas a distancia; Cadena de relámpagos y Nova de Fuego aportan cleave y área. Los talentos profundos aumentan su daño, pero al inicio es flojo y consume mucho maná. Es útil en mazmorras por el daño flexible, los tótems y la curación de apoyo. Vinculado a la tierra enraíza 5 s con Tótem Nexo Terrestre; Choque de tierra interrumpe.","text_en":"Elemental uses Lightning Bolt and Flame Shock at range; Chain Lightning and Fire Nova provide cleave and AoE. Deep talents raise its damage, but it is weak early and consumes much mana. It helps in dungeons with flexible damage, totems, and off-healing. Earthbound roots for 5 seconds with Earthbind Totem; Earth Shock interrupts.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Elemental Shaman for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Elemental Shaman Guide › Elemental Shaman Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/elemental-shaman-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:overview","class:shaman:elemental:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:15c57f7d8e2f3474d630c1126cea331be603e32c","section:4e0be73eb57053f6974b86b526385526b67f635c","section:cbfa4ca42d8d3108c72126038f3475700dd4f7f5","section:d54b421712ee117d67f46e8635928ec56c1c9d68"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejora: daño con armas imbuidas","title_en":"Enhancement: Imbued Weapon Damage","summary_es":"Mejora pelea con dos manos, aporta ráfagas y se mueve con Lobo fantasmal, pero debe cuidar maná y amenaza.","summary_en":"Enhancement fights with a two-hander and brings burst and mobility, but must manage mana and threat.","keywords_es":["chamán mejora","mejora cuerpo a cuerpo","golpe de tormenta","arma tótem viento furioso","mejora autocuración"],"keywords_en":["enhancement shaman","enhancement melee","stormstrike","windfury weapon","enhancement self healing"],"text_es":"Mejora combate con dos manos, sin doble empuñadura; imbuye con Arma comerrocas, Arma lengua de Fuego o Arma tótem Viento Furioso. Golpe de tormenta llega a 25; Choque de tierra y otros choques completan los ataques. Arma vorágine permite Descarga de relámpagos instantánea y gratis con 5 cargas. Tiene ráfaga, autocuración y movilidad con Lobo fantasmal mejorado, pero maná y amenaza aprietan antes de Armas de espíritu; Nova de Fuego aporta área y Tótem Viento Furioso apoya a melee.","text_en":"Enhancement fights with a two-hander and no dual-wielding; it imbues weapons with Rockbiter Weapon, Flametongue Weapon, or Windfury Weapon. The spec gains Stormstrike at 25; Earth Shock and other Shocks fill out its attacks. Maelstrom Weapon gives a free instant Lightning Bolt at 5 stacks. It has burst and self-healing; mobility comes from Ghost Wolf and Improved Ghost Wolf, while mana and threat are concerns before Spirit Weapons. Fire Nova adds AoE and Windfury Totem supports melee.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Enhancement Shaman in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Enhancement Shamans in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Enhancement Shaman Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Enhancement Shaman Guide › Enhancement Shaman Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enhancement-shaman-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:enhancement:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:16aa001fb34ed869b408af1d65c3258b20aaec42","section:2dcd1aeb649e9a6b067eb25845d75562a2ffcf46","section:417cce8f5eb0abe0dec3ea0b79a906ebf9e31645","section:925caa62d6c0f95b48313677afdc0512dbff0fa4","section:ec9461f42f0086478c70c2fdf1e74705d8f21ca2","section:f9995ca43545f452582214580ee3c2244fa4e73c"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-restauracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recuperación: sanación de grupo","title_en":"Restoration: Group Healing","summary_es":"Recuperación cura grupos con Mareas vivas, Onda de curación y Curación en cadena.","summary_en":"Restoration heals groups with Riptide, Healing Wave, and Chain Heal.","keywords_es":["chamán recuperación","chamán sanador","onda de curación","curación en cadena","las mareas vivas"],"keywords_en":["restoration shaman","shaman healer","healing wave","chain heal","riptide"],"text_es":"Recuperación es la Especialización en sanación y funciona mejor en grupo que subiendo en solitario. Onda de curación cubre un objetivo, mientras Mareas vivas deja una cura de 15 s y aumenta 25% Curación en cadena sobre ese aliado. Escudo de agua y Conciencia ayudan con el maná, mientras Tótem Marea de maná (Tótem de marea de maná) lo devuelve al grupo. Rapidez de la Naturaleza es una herramienta de emergencia; la misión del Agua desbloquea Tótem Corriente de sanación.","text_en":"Restoration is the healer branch and works better in groups than solo leveling. Healing Wave handles one target, while Riptide leaves a 15-second heal over time and increases Chain Heal by 25% on that ally. Water Shield and Mindfulness help mana, while Mana Tide Totem restores it to the group. Nature's Swiftness is an emergency tool; the Water quest unlocks Healing Stream Totem.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Restoration Shaman in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Guide - WoW: Forever › Restoration Shaman for New Players in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/overview-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Restoration Shaman Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Restoration Shaman Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Shaman Class Quests Guide › Dwarf Shaman Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/shaman-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:general:shaman-class-quests","class:shaman:restoration:overview","class:shaman:restoration:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:24a222bfc6cc719bb19ce5271c072364730cc56d","section:4da9bfedc6695d6ca5c1d966c0774041bc29d7f5","section:54b33e866b653415f62f3443937e721fd23af2dc","section:7bbe7934096210d22cb876d984f9d5ac73f7499e","section:c526035c7faddaa4605a2b39ef51786b87984df2","section:f15ba0e6ffeec55586623162f1ad6e950c25f82e","section:f589633e3b329c3a5ecba8f5518feccd9e3ea0d7"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-stats-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Elemental","title_en":"Elemental Stat Priority","summary_es":"Prioridad de daño aproximada; equilibra sus atributos para sostener el maná.","summary_en":"Approximate damage priority; balance stats to sustain mana.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas elemental chamán","golpe 17 elemental","penetración con hechizos chamán"],"keywords_en":["elemental shaman stat priority","17% hit elemental","shaman spell penetration"],"text_es":"Prioridad aproximada: Penetración de hechizo > celeridad/velocidad de lanzamiento > golpe hasta 17% > daño con hechizos > Golpe crítico > daño de Naturaleza/Fuego > intelecto > espíritu > fuerza (solo al subir) > aguante. Equilibra daño e intelecto/espíritu para poder seguir lanzando.","text_en":"Approximate priority: spell penetration > haste/cast speed > hit to 17% > spell damage > critical strike > Nature/Fire damage > intellect > spirit > strength (leveling only) > stamina. Balance throughput with intellect and spirit so you can keep casting.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Elemental Shaman Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:b21cb60a2c2eff0256f60db5600276836fdb9802"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-stats-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Mejora","title_en":"Enhancement Stat Priority","summary_es":"Llega al 8% de golpe cuerpo a cuerpo y luego equilibra atributos híbridos.","summary_en":"Reach 8% melee hit, then balance hybrid stats.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas mejora chamán","golpe 8 mejora","pericia 6.5 mejora"],"keywords_en":["enhancement shaman stat priority","8% hit enhancement","6.5% expertise enhancement"],"text_es":"Prioridad aproximada: golpe hasta 8% > pericia hasta 6.5% > Golpe crítico > fuerza > intelecto > Penetración de hechizo > celeridad > agilidad > daño con hechizos > poder de ataque > espíritu > aguante. El daño híbrido permite aprovechar intelecto y poder con hechizos; no sigas priorizando golpe tras el 8% inicial. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Approximate priority: hit to 8% > expertise to 6.5% > critical strike > strength > intellect > spell penetration > haste > agility > spell damage > attack power > spirit > stamina. Its hybrid damage makes intellect and spell damage useful; do not keep prioritizing hit after the initial 8%. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Enhancement Shaman Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:enhancement:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:4a0aa9c822a7a37a25ac5af64fe005a154a90da1"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-stats-restauracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Recuperación","title_en":"Restoration Stat Priority","summary_es":"Prioriza sanación y crítico; las estadísticas de daño solo aplican al subir.","summary_en":"Prioritize healing and crit; damage stats apply only while leveling.","keywords_es":["prioridad estadísticas recuperación chamán","poder sanación mp5","crítico celeridad healer chamán"],"keywords_en":["restoration shaman stat priority","spell healing mp5","healer shaman crit haste"],"text_es":"Prioridad aproximada: poder de sanación > Golpe crítico > celeridad/velocidad de lanzamiento > intelecto > espíritu > MP5 > daño con hechizos (solo al subir) > golpe hasta 17% (solo al subir) > Penetración de hechizo (solo al subir) > fuerza (solo al subir) > aguante. Golpe crítico e intelecto también ayudan a sostener el maná.","text_en":"Approximate priority: spell healing > critical strike > haste/cast speed > intellect > spirit > MP5 > spell damage (leveling only) > hit to 17% (leveling only) > spell penetration (leveling only) > strength (leveling only) > stamina. Crit and intellect also support mana sustain.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Restoration Shaman Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/stat-priority-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:restoration:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:c5b3c589032f7c7f2d00448518125e7a022170ae"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-rotacion-elemental-objetivo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación Elemental a un objetivo","title_en":"Elemental Single-Target Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén tótems y Choque de llamas; condiciona Cadena de relámpagos al maná y al proc.","summary_en":"Maintain totems and Flame Shock; gate Chain Lightning on mana and procs.","keywords_es":["rotación elemental un objetivo","maestría relámpago cadena","choque de llamas tótem abrasador"],"keywords_en":["elemental single target rotation","lightning mastery chain lightning","flame shock searing totem"],"text_es":"Mantén Tótem Fuerza de la tierra y Tótem Viento Furioso para el grupo; usa Tótem abrasador por eficiencia o Tótem de magma si hay maná; reaplica Choque de llamas cuando expire. Usa Maestría de Relámpago y otros enfriamientos; lanza Cadena de relámpagos mientras Maestría no esté activa si tienes Conjuro libre o maná suficiente, y rellena con Descarga de relámpagos. Baja rangos si necesitas ahorrar maná.","text_en":"Keep Strength of Earth Totem and Windfury Totem active for the party; use Searing Totem for efficiency or Magma Totem if mana allows; reapply Flame Shock after it expires. Use Lightning Mastery and other cooldowns; cast Chain Lightning while Mastery is inactive if Clearcasting procs or mana permits, then fill with Lightning Bolt. Downrank spells to conserve mana.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Elemental Shamans in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:f7ea7e7c63aa57d578e2783ec590a556433f6e38"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-rotacion-elemental-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación Elemental en área","title_en":"Elemental AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Prioriza tótems, Maestría y Nova; limita lanzamientos si el maná baja.","summary_en":"Prioritize totems, Mastery and Nova; limit casts when mana falls.","keywords_es":["rotación elemental área","nova fuego elemental varios enemigos","tótem magma chamán área"],"keywords_en":["elemental aoe rotation","fire nova elemental multiple targets","shaman magma totem aoe"],"text_es":"Mantén tótems de mejora y coloca Tótem de magma. Activa Maestría de Relámpago y otros enfriamientos; lanza Cadena de relámpagos y Nova de Fuego en cuanto estén disponibles. Mantén Choque de llamas en hasta 3 objetivos y usa Descarga de relámpagos si alcanza el maná. El área consume mucho: reduce Choque de llamas o Descarga si hace falta.","text_en":"Maintain buff totems and place Magma Totem. Use Lightning Mastery and other cooldowns; cast Chain Lightning and Fire Nova whenever ready. Keep Flame Shock on up to 3 targets and use Lightning Bolt if mana allows. AoE is costly: reduce Flame Shock or Lightning Bolt casts when needed.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Elemental Shamans in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:e4ac0656bf5d3ee5d30a40e2162dad08c5658a63"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-cooldowns-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Enfriamientos de Elemental","title_en":"Elemental Cooldowns","summary_es":"Usa Maestría después de poner tótems y Choque de llamas para aprovechar sus 15 s.","summary_en":"Use Mastery after setting totems and Flame Shock to use its 15 seconds well.","keywords_es":["enfriamiento elemental maestría relámpago","cooldown chamán elemental","maestría relámpago 15 segundos"],"keywords_en":["elemental shaman cooldowns","lightning mastery cooldown","lightning mastery 15 seconds"],"text_es":"Maestría de Relámpago ofrece una ventana de ráfaga de 15 s. Coloca primero los tótems y aplica Choque de llamas; después actívala para dedicar más tiempo a Descarga de relámpagos y Cadena de relámpagos. Combínala con abalorios, pociones ofensivas y habilidades raciales disponibles.","text_en":"Lightning Mastery creates a 15-second burst window. Drop totems and apply Flame Shock first, then activate it to spend more time casting Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning. Pair it with available trinkets, offensive potions, and racial abilities.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Elemental Shaman Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:99fcc090294af963f9ba232b690e5d78c164c472"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-rotacion-mejora-objetivo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación Mejora a un objetivo","title_en":"Enhancement Single-Target Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Magma y Choque de llamas; gasta pronto las cinco cargas de Arma vorágine.","summary_en":"Maintain Magma and Flame Shock; promptly spend five Maelstrom stacks.","keywords_es":["rotación mejora un objetivo","arma vorágine cinco cargas","prioridad golpe tormenta mejora"],"keywords_en":["enhancement single target rotation","five maelstrom weapon stacks","stormstrike priority enhancement"],"text_es":"Mantén Tótem de magma y Choque de llamas; usa Golpe de tormenta en reutilización. Al llegar a 5 cargas de Arma vorágine, lanza Descarga de relámpagos pronto para no desperdiciarlas. Si aún no tienes 5, usa Choque de tierra; reserva Nova de Fuego como relleno para cuando nada más esté listo y sobre maná.","text_en":"Maintain Magma Totem and Flame Shock; use Stormstrike on cooldown. At 5 Maelstrom Weapon stacks, cast Lightning Bolt promptly to avoid wasting them. Before 5 stacks, use Earth Shock; use Fire Nova as a filler only when nothing else is ready and mana is available.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Enhancement Shamans in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:enhancement:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:7b9af064236352ca897ab8a629946e0f7c8300ba"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-rotacion-mejora-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación Mejora en área","title_en":"Enhancement AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Posiciona Magma para alcanzar varios enemigos; Nova y Choque de llamas encabezan el área.","summary_en":"Position Magma to hit several enemies; Nova and Flame Shock lead AoE.","keywords_es":["rotación mejora área chamán","nova fuego tótem magma","choque llamas varios enemigos mejora"],"keywords_en":["enhancement aoe rotation","fire nova magma totem","flame shock multiple enemies"],"text_es":"Coloca Tótem de magma donde alcance a tantos enemigos como sea posible; usa Nova de Fuego en reutilización mientras el maná aguante. Aplica Choque de llamas a todos los objetivos posibles. Completa con prioridades de un objetivo: Golpe de tormenta, Descarga de relámpagos con 5 cargas de Arma vorágine y Choque de tierra.","text_en":"Place Magma Totem to reach as many enemies as possible; use Fire Nova on cooldown while mana allows. Apply Flame Shock to as many targets as possible. Continue with single-target priorities: Stormstrike, Lightning Bolt at 5 Maelstrom stacks, and Earth Shock.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Enhancement Shamans in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:enhancement:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:3e88653c404db60d8a2d233fb02fe0e39f9b8dc5"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-cooldowns-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Enfriamientos de Mejora","title_en":"Enhancement Cooldowns","summary_es":"Usa Ira del clarividente con procs y efectos activos; guárdala para fases potenciadas.","summary_en":"Pair Rage of the Farseer with procs and on-use effects; hold it for damage windows.","keywords_es":["ira clarividente enfriamiento mejora","cooldown enhancement shaman","rage of the farseer"],"keywords_en":["enhancement shaman cooldowns","rage of the farseer cooldown","enhancement burst cooldown"],"text_es":"Ira del clarividente es el enfriamiento principal: dura 25 s y se reutiliza cada 3 min. Combínala con procs y efectos de uso del equipo. Si el jefe crea una ventana de daño aumentado, guarda los efectos hasta entonces; si no, úsala para acelerar su siguiente fase.","text_en":"Rage of the Farseer is the main cooldown: it lasts 25 seconds and has a 3-minute cooldown. Pair it with gear procs and on-use effects. If a boss creates a damage-amplification window, hold your effects for it; otherwise, use them to push the next phase faster.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Enhancement Shaman Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:enhancement:overview","class:shaman:enhancement:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:2dcd1aeb649e9a6b067eb25845d75562a2ffcf46","section:31ba24c66fb573e7a98fd9ceec6bd50393d509d6"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-rotacion-restauracion-objetivo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de sanación: un objetivo","title_en":"Restoration Single-Target Healing","summary_es":"Mareas vivas al aliado más herido y Onda de curación para sanación eficiente.","summary_en":"Riptide on the most injured ally; Healing Wave provides efficient healing.","keywords_es":["prioridad curación chamán un objetivo","mareas vivas onda de curación","rangos onda curación maná"],"keywords_en":["restoration single target healing priority","riptide healing wave","downrank healing wave mana"],"text_es":"Mantén tótems de apoyo y Tótem abrasador para daño pasivo. Aplica Mareas vivas al aliado más herido y usa Onda de curación para sanar un objetivo. Baja su rango para ahorrar maná; si esperas a que el aliado esté muy herido antes de lanzar el rango máximo, pasas más tiempo sin lanzar y regeneras espíritu tras la regla de cinco segundos.","text_en":"Maintain support totems and Searing Totem for passive damage. Apply Riptide to the most injured ally and use Healing Wave for single-target healing. Downrank it to save mana; waiting until the ally is deeply injured before using the highest rank gives more time not casting and regenerating Spirit after the five-second rule.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Rotation for Restoration Shamans in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:restoration:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:f9284b90e4350e1759270c6cbfa2589807b00db4"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-rotacion-restauracion-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de sanación: área","title_en":"Restoration AoE Healing","summary_es":"Reparte Mareas vivas y enfoca Curación en cadena en aliados con su efecto.","summary_en":"Spread Riptide and prioritize Chain Heal on allies with its buff.","keywords_es":["prioridad curación en cadena chamán","mareas vivas varios aliados","sanación en área restauración"],"keywords_en":["restoration aoe healing priority","riptide multiple allies","chain heal restoration aoe"],"text_es":"Mantén tótems de apoyo y aplica Mareas vivas a los aliados más heridos; Curación en cadena conviene sobre objetivos lesionados con Mareas vivas. Cuando el maná lo permita, añade Tótem de magma y Nova de Fuego solo si sanar no es urgente; baja el rango de Curación en cadena si necesitas conservarlo.","text_en":"Maintain support totems and apply Riptide to the most injured allies; cast Chain Heal on injured targets with Riptide when possible. Magma Totem and Fire Nova add damage when mana allows, but skip them if healing is urgent; downrank Chain Heal to conserve mana.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation for Restoration Shamans in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:restoration:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:e3c0ad23637be40f6a9dd3ba1d5b93dc1a91eaeb"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-cooldowns-restauracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Enfriamientos de Recuperación","title_en":"Restoration Cooldowns","summary_es":"Lanza el Tótem de marea cuando el grupo ronda 80% de maná; reserva Rapidez para emergencias.","summary_en":"Use Mana Tide near 80% group mana; save Nature’s Swiftness for emergencies.","keywords_es":["tótem marea maná 80% chamán","rapidez de la naturaleza emergencia","enfriamientos chamán restauración"],"keywords_en":["mana tide totem 80 percent mana","nature swiftness emergency heal","restoration shaman cooldowns"],"text_es":"Usa Tótem Marea de maná cuando el grupo ronde el 80% de maná, siempre que nadie vaya a exceder su máximo. Reserva Rapidez de la Naturaleza para una emergencia y combínala con Onda de curación si el tanque cae de forma crítica.","text_en":"Use Mana Tide Totem when the group is around 80% mana, provided no one will overcap. Save Nature’s Swiftness for an emergency and pair it with Healing Wave if the tank suddenly becomes critical.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healer Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Restoration Shaman Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/rotation-cooldowns-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:restoration:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:c526035c7faddaa4605a2b39ef51786b87984df2"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-elemental-mana-tide","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Elemental de banda: Marea de maná","title_en":"Elemental Mana Tide Raid Build","summary_es":"Reparto completo de build elemental de banda: marea de maná, con talentos agrupados por rama.","summary_en":"Complete elemental mana tide raid build talent allocation grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["build chaman elemental para raides","talentos chamán build completa","puntos talentos chamán nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["shaman ele complete build","shaman talent points level 60","shaman build raid pvp"],"text_es":"Elemental: Llamada de la llama 3/3, Llamada del trueno 1/1, Concusión 5/5, Convección 5/5, Prontitud elemental 3/3, Enfoque elemental 1/1, Furia elemental 5/5, Ojo de la tormenta 3/3, Maestría de Relámpago 1/1, Sobrecarga de relámpagos 3/3, Prueba de fuego 1/2. Mejora: Golpes de trueno 4/5. Recuperación: Tótem de marea de maná 1/1, Conciencia 3/3, Gracia natural 1/3, Enfoque de las mareas 5/5, Enfoque totémico 5/5, Escudo de agua 1/1. Apoya a grupos de lanzadores con Tótem de marea de maná, aunque el maná sigue siendo un límite.","text_en":"Elemental: Call of Flame 3/3, Call of Thunder 1/1, Concussion 5/5, Convection 5/5, Elemental Alacrity 3/3, Elemental Focus 1/1, Elemental Fury 5/5, Eye of the Storm 3/3, Lightning Mastery 1/1, Lightning Overload 3/3, Trial by Fire 1/2. Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 4/5. Restoration: Mana Tide Totem 1/1, Mindfulness 3/3, Natural Grace 1/3, Tidal Focus 5/5, Totemic Focus 5/5, Water Shield 1/1. Supports caster groups with Mana Tide Totem, though mana remains a constraint.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Elemental Shaman Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Elemental Shaman PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:da12c85d9f9fe755ff0ea3a5588b7f0db1b4970a"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-elemental-shamanistic-focus","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Elemental de maná estable (bandas)","title_en":"Elemental Shamanistic Focus Build (raids)","summary_es":"Reparto completo de build elemental de maná estable, con talentos agrupados por rama.","summary_en":"Complete elemental shamanistic focus build talent allocation grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["build chaman elemental para raides","talentos chamán build completa","puntos talentos chamán nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["shaman ele complete build","shaman talent points level 60","shaman build raid pvp"],"text_es":"Elemental: Llamada de la llama 3/3, Concusión 5/5, Convección 5/5, Prontitud elemental 3/3, Enfoque elemental 1/1, Furia elemental 5/5, Ojo de la tormenta 3/3, Maestría de Relámpago 1/1, Sobrecarga de relámpagos 3/3, Prueba de fuego 2/2. Mejora: Conocimiento ancestral 5/5, Armas elementales 1/3, Golpes de trueno 5/5. Recuperación: Conciencia 3/3, Enfoque de las mareas 5/5. Reduce costes y amplía el maná; también se recomienda para mazmorras. La calculadora descarta un talento retirado; queda 1 punto libre.","text_en":"Elemental: Call of Flame 3/3, Concussion 5/5, Convection 5/5, Elemental Alacrity 3/3, Elemental Focus 1/1, Elemental Fury 5/5, Eye of the Storm 3/3, Lightning Mastery 1/1, Lightning Overload 3/3, Trial by Fire 2/2. Enhancement: Ancestral Knowledge 5/5, Elemental Weapons 1/3, Thundering Strikes 5/5. Restoration: Mindfulness 3/3, Tidal Focus 5/5. Cuts mana costs and increases the mana pool; also suited to dungeons. The calculator drops a retired talent; 1 point remains free.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Elemental Shaman Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Elemental Shaman PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Elemental Shaman Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Elemental Shaman PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:d1fc6fd0f78b6b5024de44d2d98fd95cfd8a074c","section:da12c85d9f9fe755ff0ea3a5588b7f0db1b4970a"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-elemental-pvp-deep-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Elemental JcJ de ráfaga (1/2)","title_en":"Elemental Deep PvP Build (1/2)","summary_es":"Reparto completo de build elemental jcj de ráfaga, con talentos agrupados por rama.","summary_en":"Complete elemental deep pvp build talent allocation grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["build chaman clase-shaman-build-elemental-pvp-deep parte 1","talentos chamán puntos completos","build nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["shaman ele_tal build part 1","shaman talent points","level 60 shaman build"],"text_es":"Elemental: Llamada de la llama 3/3, Llamada del trueno 1/1, Concusión 5/5, Convección 5/5, Vinculado a la tierra 1/1, Prontitud elemental 3/3, Enfoque elemental 1/1, Furia elemental 5/5, Alcance elemental 2/2, Ojo de la tormenta 3/3, Maestría de Relámpago 1/1, Sobrecarga de relámpagos 3/3. Mejora: Anticipación 3/3, Garra de la Tierra 2/2, Tótems del Guardián 2/2, Lobo fantasmal mejorado 2/2, Escudo de relámpagos mejorado 2/3, Enfoque chamanístico 1/1, Golpes de trueno 5/5.","text_en":"Elemental: Call of Flame 3/3, Call of Thunder 1/1, Concussion 5/5, Convection 5/5, Earthbound 1/1, Elemental Alacrity 3/3, Elemental Focus 1/1, Elemental Fury 5/5, Elemental Reach 2/2, Eye of the Storm 3/3, Lightning Mastery 1/1, Lightning Overload 3/3. Enhancement: Anticipation 3/3, Earth's Grasp 2/2, Guardian Totems 2/2, Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2, Improved Lightning Shield 2/3, Shamanistic Focus 1/1, Thundering Strikes 5/5.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Elemental Shaman Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Elemental Shaman PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:c5978de2369610891e8842982b103fc4deedff8d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-elemental-pvp-deep-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Elemental JcJ de ráfaga (2/2)","title_en":"Elemental Deep PvP Build (2/2)","summary_es":"Reparto completo de build elemental jcj de ráfaga, con talentos agrupados por rama.","summary_en":"Complete elemental deep pvp build talent allocation grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["build chaman clase-shaman-build-elemental-pvp-deep parte 2","talentos chamán puntos completos","build nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["shaman ele_tal build part 2","shaman talent points","level 60 shaman build"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Enfoque de las mareas 1/5. Maestría de Relámpago es el enfriamiento principal y los talentos de tierra añaden control.","text_en":"Restoration: Tidal Focus 1/5. Lightning Mastery is the main cooldown, with Earth talents adding control.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Elemental Shaman Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Elemental Shaman PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:c5978de2369610891e8842982b103fc4deedff8d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-elemental-pvp-natures-swiftness-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build híbrida Elemental/Recuperación JcJ (1/2)","title_en":"Elemental/Restoration Nature’s Swiftness PvP Build (1/2)","summary_es":"Reparto completo de build híbrida elemental/recuperación jcj, con talentos agrupados por rama.","summary_en":"Complete elemental/restoration nature’s swiftness pvp build talent allocation grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["build chaman clase-shaman-build-elemental-pvp-natures-swiftness parte 1","talentos chamán puntos completos","build nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["shaman ele_tal build part 1","shaman talent points","level 60 shaman build"],"text_es":"Elemental: Llamada de la llama 3/3, Concusión 5/5, Convección 3/5, Vinculado a la tierra 1/1, Prontitud elemental 3/3, Enfoque elemental 1/1, Furia elemental 5/5, Alcance elemental 1/2, Ojo de la tormenta 3/3, Sobrecarga de relámpagos 3/3, Prueba de fuego 1/2.","text_en":"Elemental: Call of Flame 3/3, Concussion 5/5, Convection 3/5, Earthbound 1/1, Elemental Alacrity 3/3, Elemental Focus 1/1, Elemental Fury 5/5, Elemental Reach 1/2, Eye of the Storm 3/3, Lightning Overload 3/3, Trial by Fire 1/2.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Elemental Shaman Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Elemental Shaman PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:c5978de2369610891e8842982b103fc4deedff8d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-elemental-pvp-natures-swiftness-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build híbrida Elemental/Recuperación JcJ (2/2)","title_en":"Elemental/Restoration Nature’s Swiftness PvP Build (2/2)","summary_es":"Reparto completo de build híbrida elemental/recuperación jcj, con talentos agrupados por rama.","summary_en":"Complete elemental/restoration nature’s swiftness pvp build talent allocation grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["build chaman clase-shaman-build-elemental-pvp-natures-swiftness parte 2","talentos chamán puntos completos","build nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["shaman ele_tal build part 2","shaman talent points","level 60 shaman build"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Curación ancestral 3/3, Enfoque curativo 3/3, Reencarnación mejorada 2/2, Tótem de marea de maná 1/1, Conciencia 3/3, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Enfoque de las mareas 5/5, Enfoque totémico 2/5, Escudo de agua 1/1. Prioriza Rapidez de la Naturaleza y la s