1/1, Aluvión 5/5, Golpe de tormenta 1/1, Armas de espíritu 1/1, Presura mental 2/2, Golpe de tormenta mejorado 2/2, Arma vorágine 5/5, Ira del clarividente 1/1.","text_en":"Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 2/5, Mental Dexterity 3/3, Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2, Elemental Weapons 3/3, Shamanistic Focus 1/1, Flurry 5/5, Stormstrike 1/1, Spirit Weapons 1/1, Mental Quickness 2/2, Improved Stormstrike 2/2, Maelstrom Weapon 5/5, Rage of the Farseer 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Branch B: Community Enhancement (8/33/10)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35070","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:329bd4cd67cd00cd2bfd37207b091317a2b4f124"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-mejora-comunidad-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Mejora de grupo · Recuperación (subida)","title_en":"Group Enhancement Build · Recuperación (levelling)","summary_es":"Reparto completo de Mejora de grupo, agrupado por rama.","summary_en":"Complete Group Enhancement allocation, grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["talentos mejora de grupo chamán","build mejora de grupo completa","puntos talentos chamán"],"keywords_en":["mejora de grupo shaman talents","complete mejora de grupo build","shaman talent points"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Onda de curación mejorada 5/5, Enfoque totémico 5/5.","text_en":"Restoration: Improved Healing Wave 5/5, Totemic Focus 5/5.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Branch B: Community Enhancement (8/33/10)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35070","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:329bd4cd67cd00cd2bfd37207b091317a2b4f124"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-recuperacion-subir-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Recuperación para subir · Recuperación","title_en":"Leveling Restoration Build · Recuperación","summary_es":"Reparto completo de Recuperación para subir, agrupado por rama.","summary_en":"Complete Leveling Restoration allocation, grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["talentos recuperación para subir chamán","build recuperación para subir completa","puntos talentos chamán"],"keywords_en":["recuperación para subir shaman talents","complete recuperación para subir build","shaman talent points"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Onda de curación mejorada 1/5, Enfoque de las mareas 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Reencarnación mejorada 2/2, Curación ancestral 3/3, Enfoque curativo 3/3, Escudo de agua 1/1, Maestría de las mareas 5/5, Tótem de marea de maná 1/1, Forma curativa 3/3, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Purificación 5/5, Mareas vivas 1/1.","text_en":"Restoration: Improved Healing Wave 1/5, Tidal Focus 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Improved Reincarnation 2/2, Ancestral Healing 3/3, Healing Focus 3/3, Water Shield 1/1, Tidal Mastery 5/5, Mana Tide Totem 1/1, Healing Way 3/3, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Purification 5/5, Riptide 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Restoration Shaman Healer in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ba4ecbe5b079aa61b083a6da96b16b03fab0eeef"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-recuperacion-subir-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Recuperación para subir · Mejora","title_en":"Leveling Restoration Build · Mejora","summary_es":"Reparto completo de Recuperación para subir, agrupado por rama.","summary_en":"Complete Leveling Restoration allocation, grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["talentos recuperación para subir chamán","build recuperación para subir completa","puntos talentos chamán"],"keywords_en":["recuperación para subir shaman talents","complete recuperación para subir build","shaman talent points"],"text_es":"Mejora: Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 5/5, Maña mental 3/3, Armas elementales 1/3, Enfoque chamanístico 1/1, Lobo fantasmal mejorado 2/2.","text_en":"Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 5/5, Mental Dexterity 3/3, Elemental Weapons 1/3, Shamanistic Focus 1/1, Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Restoration Shaman Healer in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ba4ecbe5b079aa61b083a6da96b16b03fab0eeef"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-wavebreaker-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Wavebreaker · Mejora","title_en":"Wavebreaker Build · Mejora","summary_es":"Reparto completo de Wavebreaker, agrupado por rama.","summary_en":"Complete Wavebreaker allocation, grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["talentos wavebreaker chamán","build wavebreaker completa","puntos talentos chamán"],"keywords_en":["wavebreaker shaman talents","complete wavebreaker build","shaman talent points"],"text_es":"Mejora: Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 5/5, Lobo fantasmal mejorado 2/2, Armas elementales 2/3, Enfoque chamanístico 1/1, Dureza 4/5, Golpe de tormenta 1/1.","text_en":"Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 5/5, Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2, Elemental Weapons 2/3, Shamanistic Focus 1/1, Toughness 4/5, Stormstrike 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wavebreaker Shaman Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Wavebreaker (0/20/31)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wavebreaker-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35074","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:wavebreaker-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:c4fd4b369f62079754a9a9153256c5694c9fdb5b"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-wavebreaker-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Wavebreaker · Recuperación","title_en":"Wavebreaker Build · Recuperación","summary_es":"Reparto completo de Wavebreaker, agrupado por rama.","summary_en":"Complete Wavebreaker allocation, grouped by tree.","keywords_es":["talentos wavebreaker chamán","build wavebreaker completa","puntos talentos chamán"],"keywords_en":["wavebreaker shaman talents","complete wavebreaker build","shaman talent points"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Onda de curación mejorada 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Enfoque totémico 5/5, Enfoque curativo 1/3, Escudo de agua 1/1, Maestría de las mareas 5/5, Tótem de marea de maná 1/1, Forma curativa 3/3, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Purificación 5/5, Mareas vivas 1/1.","text_en":"Restoration: Improved Healing Wave 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Totemic Focus 5/5, Healing Focus 1/3, Water Shield 1/1, Tidal Mastery 5/5, Mana Tide Totem 1/1, Healing Way 3/3, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Purification 5/5, Riptide 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wavebreaker Shaman Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Wavebreaker (0/20/31)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wavebreaker-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35074","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:wavebreaker-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:c4fd4b369f62079754a9a9153256c5694c9fdb5b"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-ruta-spellhance","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos Spellhance","title_en":"Spellhance Talent Path","summary_es":"Spellhance prioriza maná y movilidad antes de reinvertir en Mejora.","summary_en":"Spellhance prioritizes mana and mobility before respeccing into Enhancement.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos spellhance","subir con spellhance","talentos chamán híbrido"],"keywords_en":["spellhance talent path","leveling spellhance","hybrid shaman talents"],"text_es":"Del 10 al 31 prioriza Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 2/5, Maña mental 3/3 y Enfoque chamanístico 1/1; invierte también en Enfoque de las mareas 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Enfoque totémico 2/5 y Escudo de agua 1/1 para el maná. Al 31 (26 con puntos de Legado), cambia de talentos y acelera Golpe de tormenta mejorado 2/2; después toma Presura mental 2/2 y Armas de espíritu 1/1, vuelve a Recuperación y termina Elemental.","text_en":"From levels 10–31, prioritize Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 2/5, Mental Dexterity 3/3, and Shamanistic Focus 1/1; also invest in Tidal Focus 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Totemic Focus 2/5, and Water Shield 1/1 for mana. At 31 (26 with Legacy Points), respec and rush Improved Stormstrike 2/2; then take Mental Quickness 2/2 and Spirit Weapons 1/1, return to Restoration, and finish Elemental.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:84702d1e106cbfa4c71f55027da7e4f66b3ecb24"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-ruta-elemental-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta Elemental para subir","title_en":"Elemental Leveling Path","summary_es":"Elemental a distancia obtiene primero daño y luego movilidad y aguante.","summary_en":"Ranged Elemental takes damage talents first, then mobility and survival.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos elemental subir","talentos elemental niveles","elemental en solitario chamán"],"keywords_en":["elemental leveling talent path","elemental talents by level","solo elemental shaman"],"text_es":"Para subir solo, toma Concusión 5/5 (10–14), Llamada de la llama 3/3 (15–17), Reverberación 2/5 (18–19), Enfoque elemental (20), Prontitud elemental 3/3 (21–23), Convección 5/5 (24–28), Ojo de la tormenta 1/3 (29); al 30, deja libre el punto de Ráfaga de lava, talento retirado. Después, Sobrecarga de relámpagos 3/3 (31–33), Alcance elemental 1/2 (34), Furia elemental 5/5 (35–39) y Maestría de Relámpago (40); después invierte 20 puntos en Mejora.","text_en":"For solo leveling, take Concussion 5/5 (10–14), Call of Flame 3/3 (15–17), Reverberation 2/5 (18–19), Elemental Focus (20), Elemental Alacrity 3/3 (21–23), Convection 5/5 (24–28), Eye of the Storm 1/3 (29); at 30, leave the retired Lava Burst point free. Then take Lightning Overload 3/3 (31–33), Elemental Reach 1/2 (34), Elemental Fury 5/5 (35–39), and Lightning Mastery (40); then spend 20 points in Enhancement.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Branch A: Elemental Leveling (31/20/0)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35069","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Elemental: levels 10–40 (31 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35069","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:225561441426488627cfe3a666cecec8bf9cae1c","section:67e2d069a5028829448c129e17e24744a2954d81"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-ruta-elemental-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta Elemental para grupos","title_en":"Elemental Group Talent Path","summary_es":"La variante de grupo añade control, alcance y resistencia al retroceso.","summary_en":"The group variant adds control, range, and pushback resistance.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos elemental grupo","build elemental mazmorra","vinculado a la tierra talentos"],"keywords_en":["elemental group talent path","elemental dungeon build","earthbound talents"],"text_es":"La variante de grupo toma Convección 5/5 (10–14), Concusión 5/5 (15–19), Reverberación 5/5 (20–24), Llamada de la llama 3/3 (25–27), Enfoque elemental (28), Prontitud elemental 3/3 (29–31), Ojo de la tormenta 3/3 (32–34), Vinculado a la tierra (35), Alcance elemental 2/2 (36–37), Sobrecarga de relámpagos 3/3 (38–40); el punto de Ráfaga de lava, talento retirado, queda libre. Sigue Furia elemental 5/5 (42–46) y Maestría de Relámpago (47); luego invierte 13 puntos en Mejora.","text_en":"The group variant takes Convection 5/5 (10–14), Concussion 5/5 (15–19), Reverberation 5/5 (20–24), Call of Flame 3/3 (25–27), Elemental Focus (28), Elemental Alacrity 3/3 (29–31), Eye of the Storm 3/3 (32–34), Earthbound (35), Elemental Reach 2/2 (36–37), Lightning Overload 3/3 (38–40); leave the retired Lava Burst point free. Then take Elemental Fury 5/5 (42–46), and Lightning Mastery (47); then spend 13 points in Enhancement.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Branch B: Community Elemental (38/13/0)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35069","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Elemental: levels 10–47 (38 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35069","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:596c858853686fb0561dcebeb56de4ac51e0bb98","section:a5763c73e49add292dbb65e0640348eb399d3da4"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-habilidades-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades para entrenar: Elemental","title_en":"Elemental Abilities to Train","summary_es":"Prioriza hechizos eficientes y tótems; algunos rangos opcionales ahorran oro.","summary_en":"Prioritize efficient spells and totems; selected optional ranks save gold.","keywords_es":["habilidades elemental entrenar","rangos chamán elemental","hechizos elemental por nivel"],"keywords_en":["elemental abilities to train","elemental shaman spell ranks","elemental spells by level"],"text_es":"Entrena Descarga de relámpagos para atraer enemigos, Choque de tierra para interrumpir, Tótem Fuerza de la tierra, Tótem Nexo Terrestre, Escudo de relámpagos, Choque de llamas, Tótem abrasador y Arma lengua de Fuego. Añade Nova de Fuego, Lobo fantasmal y Choque de Escarcha al 20, Tótem de magma al 26 y Cadena de relámpagos al 32. Si falta oro, puedes dejar Descarga por encima del rango 4 para más adelante; los tótems de resistencia son poco útiles al subir.","text_en":"Train Lightning Bolt for pulling, Earth Shock to interrupt, Strength of Earth Totem, Earthbind Totem, Lightning Shield, Flame Shock, Searing Totem, and Flametongue Weapon. Learn Fire Nova, Ghost Wolf and Frost Shock at 20, Magma Totem at 26, and Chain Lightning at 32. If short on gold, defer Lightning Bolt ranks above Rank 4; resistance totems are rarely useful while leveling.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Elemental Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:d3a29cfa972b6a9b0ec4f3c3c61fe08d738eff57"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-habilidades-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades para entrenar: Mejora","title_en":"Enhancement Abilities to Train","summary_es":"Mejora prioriza choques, escudos, imbuyentes y tótems de grupo.","summary_en":"Enhancement prioritizes Shocks, shields, imbues, and group totems.","keywords_es":["habilidades mejora entrenar","rangos mejora chamán","tótems mejora obligatorios"],"keywords_en":["enhancement abilities to train","enhancement shaman spell ranks","mandatory enhancement totems"],"text_es":"Entrena Choque de tierra rango 7, Choque de llamas rango 6, Arma tótem Viento Furioso rango 4, Escudo de relámpagos rango 7, Nova de Fuego rango 5 y Tótem Fuerza de la tierra rango 5. Aprende también Tótem de purificación de veneno, Tótem purgador de enfermedades y Tótem Viento Furioso rango 1. Llamada de los elementos, Llamada de los ancestros, Llamada de los espíritus y Llamada totémica son opcionales.","text_en":"Train Earth Shock rank 7, Flame Shock rank 6, Windfury Weapon rank 4, Lightning Shield rank 7, Fire Nova rank 5, and Strength of Earth Totem rank 5. Also learn Poison Cleansing Totem, Disease Cleansing Totem, and Windfury Totem rank 1. Optional totem tools include Totemic Call and the Ancestors and Spirits calls; Call of the Elements can summon a full set.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Enhancement Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Enhancement Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:enhancement:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:7227eb6ea429859184ccd320a0dd63e51db35ca1","section:972655c2252ae550ee03bed42176294c46798500"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-habilidades-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades para entrenar: Recuperación","title_en":"Restoration Abilities to Train","summary_es":"Recuperación prioriza curas, tótems y limpieza de veneno y enfermedad.","summary_en":"Restoration prioritizes heals, totems, and poison and disease removal.","keywords_es":["habilidades recuperación entrenar","hechizos sanador chamán","curar veneno enfermedad chamán"],"keywords_en":["restoration abilities to train","shaman healer spells","shaman cure poison disease"],"text_es":"Entrena Onda de curación, Descarga de relámpagos, Choque de tierra, Tótem Fuerza de la tierra, Tótem Nexo Terrestre y Escudo de relámpagos. Aprende Curar veneno y Curar enfermedad para limpiar esas aflicciones. Añade Tótem abrasador, Arma lengua de Fuego, Tótem de tremor, Lobo fantasmal, Onda inferior de curación, Tótem Corriente de sanación y Tótem Fuente de maná al 26; al 40, Curación en cadena es la cura de área. Descarga de relámpagos por encima del rango 4 puede esperar.","text_en":"Train Healing Wave, Lightning Bolt, Earth Shock, Strength of Earth Totem, Earthbind Totem, and Lightning Shield. Learn Cure Poison and Cure Disease to remove those afflictions. Learn Searing Totem, Flametongue Weapon, Tremor Totem, Ghost Wolf, Lesser Healing Wave, Healing Stream Totem, and Mana Spring Totem at 26; at 40, Chain Heal is the area heal. Lightning Bolt ranks above Rank 4 can wait.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Restoration Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Restoration Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › Healing toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35071","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever","class:shaman:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:76ff15a95d17c1cccc55cc99ad44c19594898bc4","section:a0f4eec7f5f82319baf397ae3b974fff3afed5cb","section:bd0a7038c7ca9f7efc5e6dd3528d0d3224a04549"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-profesiones-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para subir: Elemental","title_en":"Elemental Leveling Professions","summary_es":"Peletería ofrece equipo y kits; otras profesiones aportan comida y consumibles.","summary_en":"Leatherworking provides gear and kits; other professions add food and consumables.","keywords_es":["profesiones elemental subir","peletería chamán elemental","cocina pesca chamán"],"keywords_en":["elemental leveling professions","elemental shaman leatherworking","shaman cooking fishing"],"text_es":"Peletería y Desuello combinan bien: Peletería fabrica equipo de cuero y malla con poder con hechizos y complementos de armadura. Cocina da comida con un 5% más de experiencia por muertes, y Pesca facilita subir Cocina. Encantamiento crea aceites y reliquias, aunque cuesta oro; Alquimia con Herboristería ayuda a producir pociones de maná. Ingeniería aporta explosivos y Minería sus materiales.","text_en":"Leatherworking and Skinning pair well: Leatherworking crafts leather and mail gear with spell power and armor kits. Cooking provides food granting 5% more experience from kills, and Fishing speeds up Cooking. Enchanting makes oils and relics but costs gold; Alchemy with Herbalism helps supply mana potions. Engineering offers explosives, and Mining supplies its materials.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:9b40d5c7f5d3dc44d6f297beb0437a160f58e03d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-profesiones-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para subir: Mejora","title_en":"Enhancement Leveling Professions","summary_es":"Peletería fabrica equipo; Desuello y Minería generan materiales vendibles.","summary_en":"Leatherworking crafts gear; Skinning and Mining provide sellable materials.","keywords_es":["profesiones mejora subir","peletería desuello chamán","encantamiento maná chamán"],"keywords_en":["enhancement leveling professions","shaman leatherworking skinning","shaman enchanting mana"],"text_es":"Peletería fabrica equipo útil para cubrir huecos entre botines; combínala con Desollar o compra cuero. Encantamiento puede crear el Icono de madera a la deriva pulido, que ayuda con el maná. Minería genera materiales para Herrería e Ingeniería, mientras Desuello abastece Peletería. Botánica con Alquimia también puede servir si se necesitan consumibles.","text_en":"Leatherworking crafts useful gear to fill gaps between drops; pair it with Skinning or buy leather. Enchanting can make the Polished Driftwood Icon, which helps with mana. Mining supplies materials for Blacksmithing and Engineering, while Skinning supplies Leatherworking. Herbalism with Alchemy can also help if consumables are needed.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Enhancement Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:enhancement:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:263b2aa2b0c4464aa8750351627ac13e90b0fbde"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-consumibles-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles para subir","title_en":"Leveling Consumables","summary_es":"Comida, aceites, kits, pociones y elixires mejoran experiencia o atributos.","summary_en":"Food, oils, kits, potions, and elixirs improve experience or stats.","keywords_es":["consumibles chamán subir","comida experiencia 5%","aceite zahorí complemento armadura"],"keywords_en":["shaman leveling consumables","5% experience food","wizard oil armor kit"],"text_es":"Mantén comida activa: incluso la más sencilla aumenta un 5% la experiencia de enemigos derrotados. El Aceite de zahorí menor añade poder con hechizos y se acumula con las imbuyiciones; dura varias horas. Los kits de armadura de Peletería añaden poder con hechizos y armadura en pecho, piernas, manos o pies. Pociones y elixires de Alquimia aportan atributos, aunque comprarlos puede ser caro.","text_en":"Keep food active: even basic food increases experience from kills by 5%. Minor Wizard Oil adds spell power and stacks with weapon imbues; it lasts for hours. Leatherworker-made armor kits add spell power and armor to chest, legs, hands, or feet. Alchemy potions and elixirs add stats, though buying them can be costly.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:fe7a5492abf841706c41ec240e08643af945c19d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-campamento-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejoras de campamento para subir","title_en":"Leveling Camp Buffs","summary_es":"La tienda aporta experiencia descansada; el cuenco aumenta atributos.","summary_en":"The tent adds rested experience; the fish bowl increases stats.","keywords_es":["mejoras campamento chamán","tienda campamento experiencia","cuenco con pescado atributos"],"keywords_en":["shaman camping buffs","camp tent experience","fish bowl stats"],"text_es":"La Tienda de campamento de Peletería da hasta un 5% de experiencia descansada. La Silla de campamento de Desuello otorga golpe crítico y la Vela de incienso otorga intelecto para ampliar el maná y potenciar Presura mental. El Cuenco con pescado aumenta un 8% los atributos principales y no se acumula con Bendición de los Reyes.","text_en":"Camp Tent made by Leatherworking grants up to 5% rested experience. Camp Chair linked to Skinning gives critical strike, while Incense Candle grants Intellect to expand mana and benefit Mental Quickness. Fish Bowl from Fishing increases primary stats by 8% and does not stack with Blessing of Kings.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:48f74c4b00facfb3c9822e6d40a05ff049a16907"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-rotacion-subir-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación Elemental para subir","title_en":"Elemental Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Choque de llamas prepara Ráfaga de lava; Descarga de relámpagos rellena.","summary_en":"Flame Shock sets up Lava Burst; Lightning Bolt fills.","keywords_es":["rotación elemental subir","ráfaga de lava choque llamas","descarga relámpagos elemental"],"keywords_en":["elemental leveling rotation","lava burst flame shock","elemental lightning bolt"],"text_es":"Antes de combatir, mantén Escudo de relámpagos o Escudo de agua, imbuye el arma y coloca tótems. Abre a distancia con Descarga de relámpagos; aplica Choque de llamas antes de Ráfaga de lava para que esta inflija un 20% más. Sigue con Descarga de relámpagos; usa Choque de tierra para rematar o interrumpir. Con Enfoque elemental gasta el lanzamiento gratuito en un hechizo caro. Contra varios enemigos, Nova de Fuego y Cadena de relámpagos consumen mucho maná.","text_en":"Before combat, maintain Lightning Shield or Water Shield, imbue your weapon, and place totems. Open at range with Lightning Bolt; apply Flame Shock before Lava Burst so it deals 20% more damage. Continue with Lightning Bolt; use Earth Shock to finish or interrupt. Spend the free cast from Elemental Focus on an expensive spell. Against several enemies, Fire Nova and Chain Lightning use substantial mana.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Leveling playstyle > Levels 30–39: Lava Burst and Lightning Overload","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35069","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:extra:elemental-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:caf0104f2905d0760d58f53077e8af84b116680c","section:4298e9a6b9f493543c1a290cb540b1e0313bc66d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-rotacion-subir-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación Mejora para subir","title_en":"Enhancement Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Los ataques automáticos hacen gran parte del daño; ahorra maná.","summary_en":"Auto-attacks deal much of the damage; conserve mana.","keywords_es":["rotación mejora subir","arma vorágine cinco cargas","ataques automáticos chamán"],"keywords_en":["enhancement leveling rotation","five maelstrom stacks","shaman auto attacks"],"text_es":"Mantén Escudo de relámpagos y una imbuición; usa Arma lengua de Fuego desde el nivel 10. Coloca tótems de fuerza y fuego, aplica Choque de llamas y deja que los ataques automáticos hagan daño; usa Choque de tierra si el enemigo lanza. Desde 30, Arma tótem Viento Furioso funciona con un arma lenta a dos manos. Al llegar a 5 cargas de Arma vorágine, lanza Descarga de relámpagos. Desde 40, usa Golpe de tormenta y después un choque o Descarga de relámpagos potenciado.","text_en":"Keep Lightning Shield active and an imbue; use Flametongue Weapon from level 10. Place the strength totem and a fire-damage totem, apply Flame Shock, and let auto-attacks deal damage; use Earth Shock when the enemy casts. From 30, Windfury Weapon works with a slow two-hander. At 5 Maelstrom Weapon stacks, cast Lightning Bolt. From 40, use Stormstrike, then an empowered Shock or Lightning Bolt.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide for WoW: Forever › Leveling playstyle > Levels 20–39: Flurry and Maelstrom Weapon","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever-35070","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:enhancement-shaman-leveling-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:07a352d85df768c9964fecc3e859e13237476e22"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-ventajas-desventajas-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ventajas y límites al subir","title_en":"Leveling Strengths and Weaknesses","summary_es":"Elemental aporta área y tótems; Mejora es flexible, pero consume maná.","summary_en":"Elemental brings AoE and totems; Enhancement is flexible but mana-hungry.","keywords_es":["ventajas chamán subir","desventajas elemental mejora","mejor clase chamán solo"],"keywords_en":["shaman leveling strengths","elemental enhancement weaknesses","best solo shaman spec"],"text_es":"Elemental combina daño de área y utilidad de grupo, aunque sufre contra un objetivo y por el coste de maná. Spellhance ofrece una subida más rápida y eficiente en maná. Mejora aprovecha muchos atributos y puede dañar, sanar, tanquear y apoyar; sus límites son el maná, la amenaza y manejar más de uno o dos enemigos. Recuperación cura bien en grupo, pero su daño bajo hace lenta la subida en solitario.","text_en":"Elemental combines AoE damage with group utility, but struggles against one target and with mana costs. Spellhance offers faster, more mana-efficient leveling. Enhancement benefits from many stats and can damage, heal, tank, and support; its limits are mana, threat, and handling more than one or two enemies. Restoration heals well in groups, but its low damage makes solo leveling slow.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Elemental Shaman DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Restoration Shaman Healer in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:leveling","class:shaman:enhancement:leveling","class:shaman:restoration:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:02edca8cefc6a8955b596cb9dc24d17c8c3bb8d8","section:1f55aa0f10d791edc1307c8beba6736badcac940","section:20d0146f2c49a66f4e08ec437aa53046a8a91074","section:394499396437b37cce434672c721334cb1a5577b","section:46f798a58b64565a4b8008794494ae84739c49d2"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-recuperacion-sanador-uso","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build Recuperación sanadora de grupo","title_en":"Restoration Group-Healing Build","summary_es":"La distribución 5/10/36 está pensada para sanar grupos.","summary_en":"The 5/10/36 allocation is designed for group healing.","keywords_es":["build recuperación sanador de grupo","build chamán 5 10 36","para qué sirve build recuperación"],"keywords_en":["restoration group healer build","shaman 5 10 36 build","restoration build purpose"],"text_es":"La distribución 5/10/36 está pensada para sanar grupos.","text_en":"The 5/10/36 allocation is designed for group healing.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35071","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:20e08b00d69c5db09623617fdc422bee13485ce9"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-recuperacion-sanador-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build sanadora 5/10/36 · Elemental","title_en":"5/10/36 Healing Build · Elemental","summary_es":"Talentos de la rama Elemental para la build sanadora de grupo.","summary_en":"Elemental talents for the group-healing build.","keywords_es":["build sanadora elemental chamán","talentos elemental 5 10 36","convección chamán sanador"],"keywords_en":["shaman healer elemental build","5 10 36 elemental talents","restoration healer convection"],"text_es":"Elemental: Convección 5/5.","text_en":"Elemental: Convection 5/5.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Restoration Healer (5/10/36)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35071","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:cc8464af6fa2f613426aa168627782258f685061"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-recuperacion-sanador-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build sanadora 5/10/36 · Mejora","title_en":"5/10/36 Healing Build · Enhancement","summary_es":"Talentos de la rama Mejora para la build sanadora de grupo.","summary_en":"Enhancement talents for the group-healing build.","keywords_es":["build sanadora mejora chamán","talentos mejora 5 10 36","golpes de trueno sanador chamán"],"keywords_en":["shaman healer enhancement build","5 10 36 enhancement talents","thundering strikes healer"],"text_es":"Mejora: Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 5/5.","text_en":"Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 5/5.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Restoration Healer (5/10/36)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35071","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:cc8464af6fa2f613426aa168627782258f685061"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-recuperacion-sanador-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build sanadora 5/10/36 · Recuperación","title_en":"5/10/36 Healing Build · Restoration","summary_es":"Talentos de Recuperación para la build sanadora de grupo.","summary_en":"Restoration talents for the group-healing build.","keywords_es":["build sanadora recuperación chamán","talentos recuperación 5 10 36","build de sanador grupo chamán"],"keywords_en":["shaman restoration healer build","5 10 36 restoration talents","group healer shaman build"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Onda de curación mejorada 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Enfoque totémico 5/5, Enfoque curativo 1/3, Escudo de agua 1/1, Maestría de las mareas 5/5, Tótens restauradores 5/5, Tótem de marea de maná 1/1, Forma curativa 3/3, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Purificación 5/5, Mareas vivas 1/1.","text_en":"Restoration: Improved Healing Wave 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Totemic Focus 5/5, Healing Focus 1/3, Water Shield 1/1, Tidal Mastery 5/5, Restorative Totems 5/5, Mana Tide Totem 1/1, Healing Way 3/3, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Purification 5/5, Riptide 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Healing Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Restoration Healer (5/10/36)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever-35071","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:restoration-shaman-healing-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:cc8464af6fa2f613426aa168627782258f685061"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-tanque-mazmorras","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tanquear mazmorras con Chamán","title_en":"Shaman Dungeon Tanking","summary_es":"Hay una build para nuevos jugadores y otra que requiere equipo BiS.","summary_en":"One build is for new players; the other requires BiS gear.","keywords_es":["chamán tanque mazmorra","tanquear mazmorras con chamán","build tanque chamán Forever"],"keywords_en":["shaman dungeon tank","tank dungeons as shaman","Forever shaman tank build"],"text_es":"En WoW: Forever, un Chamán puede tanquear mazmorras. Hay una configuración para jugadores nuevos (17/23/11) y otra para jugadores expertos con equipo BiS (0/20/31).","text_en":"In WoW: Forever, a Shaman can tank dungeons. One build is for new players (17/23/11); the other is for experienced players with BiS gear (0/20/31).","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-tanque-nuevos-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build tanque para nuevos jugadores · Elemental","title_en":"New-Player Tank Build · Elemental","summary_es":"Talentos Elementales de la build tanque 17/23/11.","summary_en":"Elemental talents for the 17/23/11 tank build.","keywords_es":["build tanque chamán nuevos jugadores","talentos elemental tanque chamán","build chamán 17 23 11"],"keywords_en":["new player shaman tank build","elemental tank talents shaman","shaman 17 23 11 build"],"text_es":"Elemental: Convección 5/5, Concusión 5/5, Llamada de la llama 3/3, Enfoque elemental 1/1, Custodia elemental 1/3, Prueba de fuego 2/2.","text_en":"Elemental: Convection 5/5, Concussion 5/5, Call of Flame 3/3, Elemental Focus 1/1, Elemental Warding 1/3, Trial by Fire 2/2.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-tanque-nuevos-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build tanque para nuevos jugadores · Mejora","title_en":"New-Player Tank Build · Enhancement","summary_es":"Talentos de Mejora de la build tanque 17/23/11.","summary_en":"Enhancement talents for the 17/23/11 tank build.","keywords_es":["build tanque mejora chamán","talentos mejora tanque nuevos jugadores","build chamán 17 23 11"],"keywords_en":["shaman enhancement tank build","new player tank enhancement talents","shaman 17 23 11 build"],"text_es":"Mejora: Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 5/5, Armas elementales 1/3, Enfoque chamanístico 1/1, Anticipación 3/3, Dureza 5/5, Golpe de tormenta 1/1, Armas de espíritu 1/1, Golpe de tormenta mejorado 1/2.","text_en":"Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 5/5, Elemental Weapons 1/3, Shamanistic Focus 1/1, Anticipation 3/3, Toughness 5/5, Stormstrike 1/1, Spirit Weapons 1/1, Improved Stormstrike 1/2.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-tanque-nuevos-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build tanque para nuevos jugadores · Recuperación","title_en":"New-Player Tank Build · Restoration","summary_es":"Talentos de Recuperación de la build tanque 17/23/11.","summary_en":"Restoration talents for the 17/23/11 tank build.","keywords_es":["build tanque recuperación chamán","talentos recuperación tanque nuevos jugadores","build chamán 17 23 11"],"keywords_en":["shaman restoration tank build","new player tank restoration talents","shaman 17 23 11 build"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Enfoque de las mareas 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Reencarnación mejorada 2/2, Escudo de agua 1/1.","text_en":"Restoration: Tidal Focus 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Improved Reincarnation 2/2, Water Shield 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-tanque-pro-mejora","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build tanque experta · Mejora","title_en":"Pro Tank Build · Enhancement","summary_es":"Talentos de Mejora de la build tanque 0/20/31 para equipo BiS.","summary_en":"Enhancement talents for the 0/20/31 BiS tank build.","keywords_es":["build tanque chamán equipo BiS","talentos mejora tanque experto","build chamán 0 20 31"],"keywords_en":["shaman BiS tank build","pro enhancement tank talents","shaman 0 20 31 build"],"text_es":"Mejora: Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 5/5, Armas elementales 1/3, Enfoque chamanístico 1/1, Anticipación 3/3, Dureza 4/5, Golpe de tormenta 1/1.","text_en":"Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 5/5, Elemental Weapons 1/3, Shamanistic Focus 1/1, Anticipation 3/3, Toughness 4/5, Stormstrike 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-tanque-pro-recuperacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build tanque experta · Recuperación","title_en":"Pro Tank Build · Restoration","summary_es":"Talentos de Recuperación de la build tanque 0/20/31 para equipo BiS.","summary_en":"Restoration talents for the 0/20/31 BiS tank build.","keywords_es":["build tanque recuperación equipo BiS","talentos recuperación tanque experto","build chamán 0 20 31"],"keywords_en":["shaman BiS restoration tank build","pro restoration tank talents","shaman 0 20 31 build"],"text_es":"Recuperación: Enfoque de las mareas 5/5, Conciencia 3/3, Enfoque totémico 1/5, Reencarnación mejorada 2/2, Curación ancestral 3/3, Escudo de agua 1/1, Maestría de las mareas 1/5, Tótens restauradores 4/5, Tótem de marea de maná 1/1, Forma curativa 3/3, Rapidez de la Naturaleza 1/1, Purificación 5/5, Mareas vivas 1/1.","text_en":"Restoration: Tidal Focus 5/5, Mindfulness 3/3, Totemic Focus 1/5, Improved Reincarnation 2/2, Ancestral Healing 3/3, Water Shield 1/1, Tidal Mastery 1/5, Restorative Totems 4/5, Mana Tide Totem 1/1, Healing Way 3/3, Nature's Swiftness 1/1, Purification 5/5, Riptide 1/1.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shaman Tank Dungeon guide - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever-34915","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:shaman:extra:shaman-tank-dungeon-guide-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["guide:6360ff7576bcd5403ae15a17987c08cf98dddb33"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-build-stormcaller","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Stormcaller: Elemental con Golpe de tormenta (31/20/0)","title_en":"Stormcaller: Elemental with Stormstrike (31/20/0)","summary_es":"Build 31/20/0 que lanza hechizos y remata en melé con Golpe de tormenta.","summary_en":"31/20/0 build that casts spells and finishes in melee with Stormstrike.","keywords_es":["build stormcaller chamán","chamán híbrido elemental mejora","golpe de tormenta chamán subir","31/20/0 chamán","chamán lanzador en melé"],"keywords_en":["stormcaller shaman build","hybrid elemental enhancement shaman","stormstrike shaman leveling","31/20/0 shaman","caster shaman in melee"],"text_es":"Stormcaller gasta 31 puntos en Elemental, igual que la build Elemental (Ráfaga de lava a nivel 40), y 20 en Mejora: Golpes de trueno 5/5, Conocimiento ancestral 5/5, Lobo fantasmal mejorado 2/2, Enfoque chamanístico, Armas elementales 2/3, Golpe de tormenta a nivel 56 y Dureza 4/5. Es un lanzador cómodo en melé que sube igual que la Elemental. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Stormcaller spends 31 points in Elemental, same as the Elemental build (Lava Burst at level 40), and 20 in Enhancement: Thundering Strikes 5/5, Ancestral Knowledge 5/5, Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2, Shamanistic Focus, Elemental Weapons 2/3, Stormstrike at level 56 and Toughness 4/5. It is a caster comfortable in melee that levels like Elemental. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stormcaller Shaman Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › The build: Stormcaller (31/20/0)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stormcaller-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35072","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stormcaller Shaman Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › Enhancement: levels 41–60 (20 points)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stormcaller-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35072","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:shaman:extra:stormcaller-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:9dadd101902afc940109f9f21ae7e050b0ac7066","section:f8c90e0461ffed6ad9221bf0c578c19d3e52df7c"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-stormcaller-juego","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo se juega Stormcaller","title_en":"How to play Stormcaller","summary_es":"Rotación a distancia y en melé con Golpe de tormenta y los choques.","summary_en":"Ranged and melee rotation with Stormstrike and the shocks.","keywords_es":["rotación stormcaller","golpe de tormenta potencia choque de tierra","jugar chamán elemental en melé","cadena de relámpagos pocos enemigos","Choque de Escarcha huir"],"keywords_en":["stormcaller rotation","stormstrike empowers earth shock","play elemental shaman in melee","chain lightning few enemies","frost shock runner"],"text_es":"Pon Escudo de relámpagos y Arma lengua de Fuego, y suelta un Tótem abrasador. Abre con Descarga de relámpagos, luego Choque de llamas y Ráfaga de lava mientras dura la quemadura. Cuando el enemigo llegue, Golpe de tormenta y después Choque de tierra o Descarga de relámpagos, que hacen un 20% más. Choque de Escarcha para el que huya y Cadena de relámpagos con dos o tres enemigos encima. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Put up Lightning Shield and Flametongue Weapon, and drop a Searing Totem. Start with Lightning Bolt, then use Flame Shock and Lava Burst while the burn is ticking. When the enemy arrives, Stormstrike it, then Earth Shock or Lightning Bolt, which deal 20% more. Slow anything that runs with Frost Shock, and switch to Chain Lightning once two or three enemies reach you. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stormcaller Shaman Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › Playstyle","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stormcaller-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35072","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stormcaller Shaman Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › Toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stormcaller-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35072","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:shaman:extra:stormcaller-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:465a3a9cca0ef5f31fbbed5b05c60d2a23e4421d","section:f6a50542e3e2189a06ba544ad2c677adfbac11be"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-stormcaller-vs-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Stormcaller o Elemental: en qué se diferencian","title_en":"Stormcaller or Elemental: the difference","summary_es":"Las dos builds coinciden hasta el nivel 53; cambian Anticipación por Armas elementales y Golpe de tormenta.","summary_en":"Both builds match until level 53; Anticipation is swapped for Elemental Weapons and Stormstrike.","keywords_es":["stormcaller o elemental","diferencia build elemental stormcaller","anticipación chamán","armas elementales chamán","elegir build 31/20/0"],"keywords_en":["stormcaller or elemental","elemental vs stormcaller build","anticipation shaman","elemental weapons shaman","choose 31/20/0 build"],"text_es":"Las dos builds 31/20/0 coinciden hasta el nivel 53. Stormcaller sustituye Anticipación por Armas elementales y Golpe de tormenta. La Elemental se queda a distancia y toma esquiva para cuando los enemigos llegan; Stormcaller quiere que lleguen, para rematarlos con Golpe de tormenta y un Choque de tierra o una Descarga de relámpagos potenciados. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Both 31/20/0 builds match until level 53. Stormcaller swaps Anticipation for Elemental Weapons and Stormstrike. Elemental stays at range and takes dodge for when enemies arrive; Stormcaller wants them to arrive, to finish them with Stormstrike and an empowered Earth Shock or Lightning Bolt. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stormcaller Shaman Hybrid Guide for WoW: Forever › Stormcaller or Elemental?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stormcaller-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever-35072","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:shaman:extra:stormcaller-shaman-hybrid-guide-for-wow-forever"],"source_hashes":["section:e9c449acd6f3073a923a1f9926fff14324b12312"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-totems-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tótems de mejora para el grupo","title_en":"Group buff totems","summary_es":"Qué da cada tótem de tierra, fuego y aire, y cuáles no se acumulan.","summary_en":"What each earth, fire and air totem gives and which do not stack.","keywords_es":["tótem fuerza de la tierra","tótem gracia del aire","tótem piel de piedra","tótem lengua de fuego viento furioso","tótem de resistencia banda"],"keywords_en":["strength of earth totem","grace of air totem","stoneskin totem","flametongue totem windfury","resistance totem raid"],"text_es":"Fuerza de la tierra da fuerza y Gracia del aire da agilidad a los que pegan o tanquean con ataques físicos. Piel de piedra reduce el daño cuerpo a cuerpo, sobre todo en grandes grupos de enemigos. Lengua de Fuego añade daño de fuego a los ataques del grupo y Viento Furioso les da un golpe extra; no se acumulan y Viento Furioso tiene prioridad (muy buscado por el daño físico). Los tótems de resistencia a Fuego, Escarcha y Naturaleza protegen a toda la banda: mantenlos si llega mucho daño de ese tipo.","text_en":"Strength of Earth gives Strength and Grace of Air gives Agility to physical damage dealers and tanks. Stoneskin reduces melee damage, mostly in big pulls. Flametongue adds fire damage to the group's attacks and Windfury gives them an extra strike; they do not stack and Windfury takes priority (highly sought by physical damage dealers). The resistance totems (Fire, Frost, Nature) protect the whole raid: keep them up when a lot of that damage is incoming.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Abilities Guide- Forever › Earth Totem Abilities for Elemental Shamans in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Abilities Guide- Forever › Fire Totem Abilities for Elemental Shamans in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Abilities Guide- Forever › Air Totem Abilities for Elemental Shamans in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Abilities Guide - Forever › Fire Totem Abilities for Enhancement Shamans in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:abilities","class:shaman:enhancement:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:22f8997439aad61626ec629fe2ea099efe50257f","section:4f23427d39fda9eaf37b3cdfdd642ac53f18a2a9","section:96cda570c1b4275a0dcc5ebdd5c473b6a779809a","section:de44c1a263895eaff619714246ffa84b7390386c"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-totems-limpieza-agua","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tótems de limpieza y de agua","title_en":"Cleansing and water totems","summary_es":"Purgador de enfermedades y veneno, Fuente de maná y Corriente de sanación.","summary_en":"Disease and poison cleansing, Mana Spring and Healing Stream.","keywords_es":["tótem purgador de enfermedades","tótem de purificación de veneno","tótem fuente de maná","tótem corriente de sanación cuánto cura"],"keywords_en":["disease cleansing totem","poison cleansing totem","mana spring totem","healing stream totem how much"],"text_es":"Tótem purgador de enfermedades y Tótem de purificación de veneno curan a los aliados cercanos al soltarlos y cada 5 segundos, y valen mucho contra jefes con esos efectos. Tótem Fuente de maná da muy poco maná al grupo y Tótem Corriente de sanación cura poco de forma periódica, pero se acumula durante el combate (con Tótens restauradores sube un 50 %). Las curas Curar enfermedad y Curar veneno suelen quedar por detrás de estos tótems.","text_en":"Disease Cleansing Totem and Poison Cleansing Totem cure nearby allies when dropped and every 5 seconds, and are valuable against bosses with those effects. Mana Spring Totem gives a tiny amount of mana to the group and Healing Stream Totem heals a little periodically, but it adds up over a fight (with Restorative Totems it rises 50%). Cure Disease and Cure Poison usually come second to these totems.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Abilities Guide- Forever › Water Totem Abilities for Elemental Shamans in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Abilities Guide- Forever › Utility Abilities for Elemental Shamans in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Abilities Guide - Forever › Healing Spells for Restoration Shamans in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/healer-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:abilities","class:shaman:restoration:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:046f77b19d0548abbf79eddde491b3c9ea82a71f","section:26c69f73df4a04912152f74a215e51ae8d173322","section:f1a4031c7157b8ca0de17aadf077a36848712916"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-danio-cooldowns-detalle","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Chamán: enfriamientos y golpes de daño","title_en":"Shaman damage cooldowns and strikes","summary_es":"Maestría de Relámpago, Ira del clarividente y Golpe de tormenta.","summary_en":"Lightning Mastery, Rage of the Farseer and Stormstrike.","keywords_es":["maestría de relámpago cuánto dura","ira del clarividente","golpe de tormenta 20 %","cadena de relámpagos cuántos objetivos","nova de fuego tótem"],"keywords_en":["lightning mastery duration","rage of the farseer","stormstrike 20%","chain lightning targets","fire nova totem"],"text_es":"Maestría de Relámpago (Elemental) reduce el tiempo de lanzamiento de Descarga de relámpagos y quita el enfriamiento de Cadena de relámpagos durante 15 s, cada 3 min. Ira del clarividente (Mejora) sube un 30 % la velocidad de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo y de hechizos durante 25 s, cada 3 min. Golpe de tormenta aumenta un 20 % el siguiente Descarga de relámpagos, Cadena de relámpagos o Choque de tierra. Cadena de relámpagos golpea hasta a 3 objetivos con menos daño en cada salto. Nova de Fuego aprovecha tu tótem de fuego activo.","text_en":"Lightning Mastery (Elemental) makes Lightning Bolt cast faster and Chain Lightning free of cooldown for 15 s, every 3 min. Rage of the Farseer (Enhancement) speeds up both your melee swings and your spells by 30% for 25 s, every 3 min. Stormstrike increases the next Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning or Earth Shock by 20%. Chain Lightning hits up to 3 targets with less damage on each jump. Fire Nova uses your active Fire Totem.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Abilities Guide- Forever › Damage Spells for Elemental Shamans in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman DPS Abilities Guide - Forever › Damage Spells for Enhancement Shamans in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:abilities","class:shaman:enhancement:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:273db8b45c6b514c04f7b379c2659398844ab3d0","section:eb07e9e84ff5d145e0e7cb4d1e33740a80361b2d"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-encantamientos-elemental","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Chamán Elemental","title_en":"Elemental Shaman enchants","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Chamán Elemental mientras subes.","summary_en":"What to enchant as an Elemental Shaman while leveling.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo chamán","qué encantamientos pongo de chamán","encantamientos para chamán","encantamientos chamán elemental","qué encantar elemental","guantes poder de la naturaleza chamán","arcano de enfoque chamán"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a shaman","best enchants for shaman","elemental shaman enchants","what to enchant elemental","natural power gloves shaman","arcanum of focus shaman"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Chamán Elemental: Arma: Encantar arma: revelación. Cabeza y piernas: Arcano de Enfoque (o un complemento místico en las piernas). Collar: Encantar collar: poder con hechizos (por fórmula). Capa: encantar capa: sutileza (por fórmula). Brazales: poder con hechizos superior. Manos: Encantar guantes: poder de la Naturaleza. Torso y pies: el Complemento para armadura místico que corresponda a tu nivel (medio, pesado, grueso o basto).","text_en":"Elemental Shaman enchants: Weapon: Enchant Weapon - Revelation. Head and legs: Arcanum of Focus (or a Mystic armor kit on the legs). Neck: Enchant Necklace - Spell Power (from a formula). Back: Enchant Cloak - Subtlety (from a formula). Bracers: Greater Spellpower. Hands: Enchant Gloves - Natural Power. Chest and feet: the Mystic Armor Kit for your level (medium, heavy, thick or rugged).","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Elemental Shaman Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:3829811c2c41e7677f039c664716cc2125af4eac"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-encantamientos-mejora-restauracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Chamán Mejora y Restauración","title_en":"Enhancement and Restoration Shaman enchants","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Chamán Mejora y el Chamán Restauración al subir.","summary_en":"What to enchant as an Enhancement or Restoration Shaman while leveling.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo chamán","qué encantamientos pongo de chamán","encantamientos para chamán","encantamientos chamán mejora","encantamientos chamán restauración","encantar escudo ley de la naturaleza","mano izquierda sabiduría chamán"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a shaman","best enchants for shaman","enhancement shaman enchants","restoration shaman enchants","law of nature shield enchant","off-hand wisdom shaman"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Chamán Mejora y Restauración: Mejora solo recomienda Encantar arma: revelación; cabeza, hombros, torso, piernas y botas no necesitan nada. Restauración: Encantar arma: poder de sanación, en la mano izquierda sabiduría o, con escudo, Encantar escudo: ley de la naturaleza; Encantar collar: poder de sanación; Arcano de Enfoque en la cabeza; brazales y guantes con poder de curación; y complementos místicos en torso, piernas y pies.","text_en":"Enhancement and Restoration Shaman enchants: Enhancement only recommends Enchant Weapon - Revelation; head, shoulders, chest, legs and boots need nothing. Restoration: Enchant Weapon - Healing Power, Wisdom in the off-hand or, with a shield, Enchant Shield - Law of Nature; Enchant Necklace - Healing Power; Arcanum of Focus on the head; bracers and gloves with Healing Power; and Mystic armor kits on chest, legs and feet.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Enhancement Shaman Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Restoration Shaman Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/enchants-consumables-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:shaman:enhancement:enchants","class:shaman:restoration:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:0c574b89b972d06d9f02fecb0aa3372521ff8328","section:f78e055bf8206a0d86dbe2b96349e8a261a55935"]},{"id":"clase-shaman-consumibles-por-especializacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles del Chamán por especialización","title_en":"Shaman consumables by spec","summary_es":"Elixires, aceites y comida recomendados al Chamán según su especialización.","summary_en":"Elixirs, oils and food recommended for the Shaman by spec.","keywords_es":["qué consumibles uso siendo chamán","qué consumibles uso de chamán","consumibles para chamán","qué elixires uso de chamán","consumibles chamán","elixires chamán elemental","consumibles chamán mejora","consumibles chamán restauración"],"keywords_en":["what consumables as a shaman","best consumables for shaman","shaman consumables","elemental shaman elixirs","enhancement shaman consumables","restoration shaman consumables","elixir of the grizzly"],"text_es":"Consumibles del Chamán por especialización: Elemental: elixires de poder con hechizos (hasta Elixir superior arcano) y de intelecto (Elixir del búho), Aceite de zahorí luminoso y Salmón al horno o Estofado de langosta. Mejora: Elixir de los pardos, Poción de maná sublime, Piedra de afilar elemental y Salmón al horno. Restauración: de Elixir de clérigo inferior a Elixir de clérigo superior, Aceites de maná (hasta luminoso) y Té de paz o Té de salvia; en ambos sanadores y lanzadores, cualquier poción de maná.","text_en":"Shaman consumables by spec: Elemental: Spell Power elixirs (up to Greater Arcane Elixir) and Intellect elixirs (Elixir of the Owl), Brilliant Wizard Oil and Baked Salmon or Lobster Stew. Enhancement: Elixir of the Grizzly, Major Mana Potion, Elemental Sharpening Stone and Baked Salmon. Restoration: Lesser to Greater Cleric's Elixir, Mana Oils (up to Brilliant) and Peace or Sage's Tea; casters and healers alike can use any mana potion.","tags":["SHAMAN"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Elemental Shaman Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Elemental Shaman Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/elemental/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enhancement Shaman Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Enhancement Shaman Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/enhancement/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Restoration Shaman Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Restoration Shaman Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/enchants-consumables-pve-healer","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:shaman:elemental:enchants","class:shaman:enhancement:enchants","class:shaman:restoration:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:01e4e44eab551f1e4f7327597e9070baa2604804","section:2f9be9f75232a86d7e70c5353755a8a10a4a2222","section:6d2378592923f1bce040e242dea3f298c73d53dc"]}]},"04-clase-warlock.json":{"description":"Capítulo 4: Clases. Brujo. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"clase-warlock-que-hace","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace un Brujo","title_en":"What a Warlock Does","summary_es":"Inflige daño de Fuego y Sombras y apoya al grupo con demonios, maldiciones y piedras.","summary_en":"Deals Fire and Shadow damage and supports the group with demons, curses, and stones.","keywords_es":["qué hace un brujo","daño de brujo","utilidad del brujo","demonios del brujo","maldiciones del brujo"],"keywords_en":["what does a warlock do","warlock damage","warlock utility","warlock demons","warlock curses"],"text_es":"El Brujo inflige daño de Fuego y Sombras con efectos periódicos, hechizos directos y demonios. Transfusión de vida convierte salud en maná; Crear piedra de salud, Ritual de invocación y las maldiciones aportan apoyo al grupo. Aflicción, Demonología y Destrucción ofrecen distintos estilos: gestionar varios efectos, luchar con un demonio o centrar el daño en lanzamientos.","text_en":"Warlocks deal Fire and Shadow damage with damage-over-time effects, direct spells, and demons. Life Tap trades health for mana; Create Healthstone, Ritual of Summoning, and curses provide group support. Affliction, Demonology, and Destruction offer different playstyles: managing several effects, fighting with a demon, or focusing damage on casts.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warlock Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warlock in World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:general:warlock-class-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:68d4afc3e198df667cbca5caa503b1b201ba63a2"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-especializaciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones del Brujo","title_en":"Warlock Specializations","summary_es":"Aflicción gestiona efectos periódicos; Demonología se centra en el demonio y Destrucción enlaza Fuego y Sombras.","summary_en":"Affliction manages damage-over-time effects; Demonology centers on its demon, and Destruction links Fire and Shadow.","keywords_es":["especializaciones del brujo","brujo aflicción","brujo demonología","brujo destrucción","estilos del brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock specializations","affliction warlock","demonology warlock","destruction warlock","warlock playstyles"],"text_es":"Aflicción mantiene efectos de daño en el tiempo y usa drenajes; Arruinar acelera los efectos periódicos del objetivo mientras se canaliza. Demonología gira en torno al demonio: Pacto demoníaco permite mantener uno mientras se aprovecha Sacrificio demoníaco. Destrucción combina Fuego y Sombras; Incinerar es su nuevo hechizo de relleno y Sombras y llamas enlaza ambas escuelas. Las tres comparten demonios, maldiciones y herramientas de apoyo, pero ofrecen estilos de daño distintos.","text_en":"Affliction maintains damage-over-time effects and uses drains; channeling Wrack speeds up the target's periodic effects. Demonology revolves around its demon: Demonic Pact lets you keep one summoned while benefiting from Demonic Sacrifice. Destruction combines Fire and Shadow; Incinerate is its new filler, and Shadow and Flame links both schools. All three share demons, curses, and group tools, but offer different damage styles.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Affliction Warlock Specific Systems in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Demonology Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Destruction Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warlock Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warlock in World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:overview","class:warlock:demonology:overview","class:warlock:destruction:overview","class:warlock:general:warlock-class-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:0139ca37032359782a7de7e3dc75a8f3e46a8d63","section:68d4afc3e198df667cbca5caa503b1b201ba63a2","section:cef868b49045ced15dae7827f315484f5c42190e","section:d3a5b6ab1fd735b5fb8e1fcd7aec8e6b231de92e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué cambia en Forever para el Brujo","title_en":"What Changes for Warlock in Forever","summary_es":"El Brujo equilibra salud, maná y fragmentos; los grimorios enseñan habilidades a los demonios.","summary_en":"Warlocks balance health, mana, and soul shards; grimoires teach abilities to their demons.","keywords_es":["cambios del brujo en forever","recursos del brujo","fragmentos de alma","demonios escalan","grimorios del brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock forever changes","warlock resources","soul shards","demons scale","warlock grimoires"],"text_es":"El Brujo administra salud, maná y fragmentos de alma. Transfusión de vida, disponible a 6, convierte salud en maná; el Espíritu aumenta la cantidad transferida. Drenar alma se aprende a 10 y puede generar fragmentos; Drenar vida recupera salud. Los fragmentos no se apilan y una bolsa de fragmentos ocupa el hueco de reactivos. Las habilidades del demonio se compran en grimorios y se entrenan por separado.","text_en":"Warlocks manage health, mana, and soul shards. Life Tap, learned at 6, converts health into mana; Spirit increases the amount transferred. Drain Soul is learned at 10 and can generate shards, while Drain Life restores health. Shards do not stack, and a shard bag uses the reagent-bag slot. Demon abilities come from grimoires and are trained separately.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Warlock Resources","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Demons and Pet Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ac2ef2af02b12a4ea71eb4aba3d6c68a4dbebb96","section:e0deaae2fa6142988aac9593911b5690ef71fb91"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-armas-armadura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas y armadura del Brujo","title_en":"Warlock Weapons and Armor","summary_es":"La varita hace daño sin maná y sirve de relleno; busca bastones, orbes y varitas al mejorar equipo.","summary_en":"A wand deals damage without mana and works as filler; look for staves, orbs, and wands as upgrades.","keywords_es":["armas del brujo","armadura del brujo","brujo bastón","brujo varita","brujo orbe"],"keywords_en":["warlock weapons","warlock armor","warlock staff","warlock wand","warlock orb"],"text_es":"La varita inflige daño sin gastar maná, por lo que sirve de relleno durante la subida; hay que quedarse quieto brevemente antes de dispararla y el Poder con hechizos no aumenta su daño. Consigue una Varita mágica inferior para nivel 5 y una Varita mágica superior para nivel 13 mediante comercio o con un encantador; mantenla actualizada hasta 30. Entre el equipo de subida también hay bastones, orbes y otras armas.","text_en":"A wand deals damage without spending mana, making it useful as leveling filler; you must stand still briefly before firing, and Spell Power does not increase its damage. An enchanter can make the Lesser Magic Wand for level 5; at 13, the Greater Magic Wand is another inexpensive option through trade, and keep one current until 30. Leveling gear also includes staves, orbs, and other weapons.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Gear and Where to Level","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Solo Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:99fbf29026d32be5654d9ec808e0c7e2c53cb7f0","section:e38116b280415566ac9e5c92db357e0ead03492a","section:fdb152ff765284c28444da661d480884e3562ca7"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-subir-espec","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejor especialización para subir","title_en":"Best Specialization for Leveling","summary_es":"Aflicción minimiza descansos; Demonología gana fuerza con Marca demoníaca y Destrucción rinde más en mazmorras.","summary_en":"Affliction limits downtime; Demonology improves with Demonic Brand, while Destruction suits dungeons better.","keywords_es":["mejor especialización para subir brujo","brujo aflicción para levear","brujo demonología para subir","brujo destrucción para subir","qué spec de brujo usar"],"keywords_en":["best warlock leveling spec","affliction warlock leveling","demonology warlock leveling","destruction warlock leveling","which warlock spec to level"],"text_es":"Para subir en solitario, Aflicción es eficiente: mata algo más despacio, pero descansa poco y puede llevar dos o tres enemigos a la vez. Demonología empieza más floja, pero el abisario ayuda contra élites y misiones de grupo; Marca demoníaca potencia al demonio al obtener el talento. Destrucción es la más lenta en solitario porque sus talentos dan estallido, no aguante; ese daño explosivo resulta más útil en mazmorras, donde importa menos conservar maná.","text_en":"For solo leveling, Affliction is efficient: kills take a little longer, but downtime is low and it can handle two or three enemies at once. Demonology starts weaker, but the Voidwalker helps against elites and group quests; Demonic Brand empowers the demon when it unlocks. Destruction is the slowest solo option because its talents provide burst rather than sustain; that burst is more useful in dungeons, where mana conservation matters less.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Demonology Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Demonology Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide › Strengths","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/demonology-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:2d3090210a1699a629e9d89b14935a1c9285fc6e","section:1fd813698db91b3c574e8c0e2a23e65200da4f29","section:7121d4606aded21f57d20e9078f95d32b2e69553","section:78fcf26e7bd6166d52aca9c362d101229fdad4ba","section:9ca8551261493de0fe9d2f6c74a01b954136b8d4","section:b0e0d83b6d4968bfaf969f058061c04cf8db7164","section:eb898b3d29358f0af7e4320583d8af78d3fcffc3"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-talentos-afliccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Aflicción (subida)","title_en":"Affliction Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"La ruta de Aflicción prioriza daño periódico instantáneo, drenajes y Arruinar a nivel 47.","summary_en":"The Affliction path prioritizes instant damage-over-time effects, drains, and Wrack at level 47.","keywords_es":["talentos para subir brujo aflicción","ruta de aflicción","supresión brujo","ocaso brujo","arruinar brujo"],"keywords_en":["affliction warlock leveling talents","affliction talent path","suppression warlock","nightfall warlock","wrack warlock"],"text_es":"Para subir sin reasignar talentos, prioriza Corrupción mejorado 5/5 para lanzar Corrupción al instante, Supresión 5/5 para reducir resistencias y Poder profano 5/5 para potenciar al demonio. Después toma Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Pandemia 3/3, Succionar vida 1/1 y Succión de alma 3/3; reserva Arruinar 1/1 para el nivel 47, cuando ya tienes 30 puntos en Aflicción. Las razones son movilidad, fiabilidad de los efectos, daño y autocuración.","text_en":"For leveling without respeccing, prioritize Improved Corruption 5/5 for instant Corruption, Suppression 5/5 to reduce resists, and Unholy Power 5/5 to strengthen your demon. Then take Improved Drains 3/3, Pandemic 3/3, Siphon Life 1/1, and Soul Siphon 3/3; take Wrack 1/1 at level 47, when you have 30 points in Affliction. These choices support mobility, reliable effects, damage, and self-healing.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Core Talents","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ace72ab599c1d2952f57c6a945d66879bf8f831f","section:b2f4f5642588f6bbe171264068b0c28987b2c99c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-hitos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de habilidad por nivel","title_en":"Ability Milestones by Level","summary_es":"Hitos de subida: Transfusión de vida 6, abisario 10, súcubo/íncubo 20 y manáfago 30.","summary_en":"Leveling milestones: Life Tap at 6, Voidwalker at 10, Succubus/Incubus at 20, and Felhunter at 30.","keywords_es":["cuándo aprendo habilidades de brujo","nivel de las habilidades del brujo","hitos del brujo","transfusión de vida nivel","manáfago nivel"],"keywords_en":["when warlock abilities","warlock ability levels","warlock milestones","life tap level","felhunter level"],"text_es":"Aprendes Corrupción a 4, Transfusión de vida a 6, y Miedo y Terror de agonía a 8. A 10 llegan Drenar alma, Crear piedra de salud y la misión del abisario; Drenar vida se aprende a 14, igual que Maldición de Temeridad. A 18 obtienes Dolor abrasador y Crear piedra de alma; a 20, Ritual de invocación, Maldición de los Elementos, Lluvia de Fuego, Armadura demoníaca y la súcubo o el íncubo. A 30 llegan Piroinferno y la misión del manáfago; el corcel nefasto se aprende a 40.","text_en":"Learn Corruption at 4, Life Tap at 6, and Fear and Bane of Agony at 8. At 10, you get Drain Soul, Create Healthstone, and the Voidwalker quest; Drain Life and Curse of Recklessness are learned at 14. At 18, you get Searing Pain and Create Soulstone; at 20, Ritual of Summoning, Curse of the Elements, Rain of Fire, Demon Armor, and the Succubus or Incubus. Hellfire and the Felhunter quest come at 30; Felsteed is learned at 40.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Demonology Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Abilities to Skip While Leveling","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:021e27e37591bfc474fad3dbe184a9c4732ada4c","section:7ab3a96fb19d9dcc2eec555cbbf8424f8578099a","section:befc3dbf03db585c712bb92be35cb7b52070c5a7","section:fa1446d859c0451265edfcc0b23e257610eb68c5"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-misiones-clase","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de clase del Brujo","title_en":"Warlock Class Quests","summary_es":"Las cadenas de clase desbloquean los demonios por nivel y una misión ofrece elegir entre un bastón y un orbe.","summary_en":"Class quest chains unlock demons by level, and one quest offers a choice between a staff and an orb.","keywords_es":["misiones de clase brujo","misión del diablillo","misión del abisario","misión del manáfago","orbe de Soran'ruk"],"keywords_en":["warlock class quests","imp quest","voidwalker quest","felhunter quest","The Orb of Soran'ruk"],"text_es":"Las misiones iniciales de cada raza dan el diablillo: El libro robado, Novato, Familiares viles o Descubrir el misterio. A nivel 10 se desbloquea el abisario; a 20, cadenas distintas dan súcubo o íncubo, como Corazones puros, El amor duele, ¿Qué es el amor? y Los corazones de los amantes. Buscando a Strahad, a 30, desbloquea al manáfago. El orbe de Soran'ruk, desde 20, permite elegir entre un bastón y un orbe.","text_en":"Each race’s starting quests grant the Imp: The Stolen Tome, Beginnings, Vile Familiars, or Piercing the Veil. The level 10 quest unlocks the Voidwalker; at 20, separate chains grant the Succubus or Incubus, such as Hearts of the Pure, Love Hurts, What Is Love?, and Hearts of the Lovers. Seeking Strahad unlocks the Felhunter at 30. The Orb of Soran'ruk quest is available from 20 and lets you choose a staff or an orb.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Human Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Gnome Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Orc and Troll Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Undead Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Shared Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:general:warlock-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:13ddaaef2385ef8948507b9d4dbb4067227fb335","section:2938b9e105042a5c31b0a4b4abc8677df21a6e8b","section:593b77a3081bf9c5b31ab3406fab66dcafd6a5ea","section:a1a1f97b6285f9693879ed668ab41b4bebd5e648","section:acf75ef1abfcd7345c2fe0167471109ecccf9570"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-demonios","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Demonios y sus roles","title_en":"Demons and Their Roles","summary_es":"El abisario aguanta, súcubo e íncubo atacan cuerpo a cuerpo y el diablillo apoya a grupos.","summary_en":"The Voidwalker tanks, Succubus and Incubus deal melee damage, and the Imp supports groups.","keywords_es":["demonios del brujo","diablillo brujo","abisario brujo","súcubo íncubo brujo","manáfago brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock demons","warlock imp","warlock voidwalker","warlock succubus incubus","warlock felhunter"],"text_es":"El abisario puede tanquear mientras lanzas; mantén Tormento actualizado, usa Sacrificio como escudo y Consumir sombras para curarlo entre combates. La súcubo y el íncubo aportan daño cuerpo a cuerpo y Seducción para controlar humanoides. El diablillo ataca a distancia y aporta Pacto de sangre y Escudo de Fuego al grupo. La misión del manáfago se desbloquea a 30; puede quitar efectos mágicos con Devorar magia y, desde 36, interrumpir con Bloqueo de hechizo.","text_en":"The Voidwalker can tank while you cast; keep Torment current, use Sacrifice as a shield, and heal it with Consume Shadows to heal it between fights. Succubus and Incubus deal melee damage and have Seduction to control humanoids. The Imp attacks at range and provides Blood Pact and Fire Shield to the group. The Felhunter quest unlocks at 30; it can remove Magic effects with Devour Magic and, from 36, interrupt with Spell Lock.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Demon Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Demon Abilities to Train for Destruction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Demons and Pet Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide › Demons and Pet Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/demonology-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1076390133b9b95d185f78ec00fdcd3ef3f3cd6e","section:3cfcc1595573710aae60f86110eecfdf64f9f581","section:cf1926e01a84ce174e96633ede8a8deac9216ae1","section:e0deaae2fa6142988aac9593911b5690ef71fb91"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-control-mascota","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Control del demonio","title_en":"Demon Control","summary_es":"Entrena grimorios, posiciona al demonio con Move To y usa manualmente sus habilidades de control.","summary_en":"Train grimoires, position your demon with Move To, and manually control its utility abilities.","keywords_es":["control del demonio brujo","grimorios del brujo","move to mascota","seducción brujo","bloqueo de hechizo"],"keywords_en":["warlock demon control","warlock grimoires","pet move to","warlock seduction","spell lock"],"text_es":"Compra grimorios al entrenador de demonios y enseña las habilidades con el demonio correspondiente invocado; se entrenan aparte de tus hechizos. Move To permite enviarlo hasta 100 yardas, y conviene tener a mano las órdenes Atacar y Seguir. Asigna Seducción y Bloqueo de hechizo a teclas para usarlos manualmente; en mazmorras, desactiva Tormento automático si el tanque ya tiene al enemigo y usa modo pasivo para elegir cuándo atacar. Cambiar de demonio lo aturde durante la invocación: hazlo antes de luchar.","text_en":"Buy grimoires from the Demon Trainer and teach abilities with the matching demon summoned; they are trained separately from your spells. Move To can send it up to 100 yards away, and Attack and Follow commands should be easy to reach. Put Seduction and Spell Lock on manual keybinds; in dungeons, turn off Torment autocast if the tank already has the enemy, and use passive mode to choose when to attack. Changing demons stuns it during the summon cast, so switch before a fight.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Demons and Pet Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:e0deaae2fa6142988aac9593911b5690ef71fb91"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-maldiciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Maldiciones y terrores","title_en":"Curses and Banes","summary_es":"Combina Terror de agonía con una maldición útil y elige esta según el enemigo o el grupo.","summary_en":"Pair Bane of Agony with a utility Curse, choosing the Curse for the enemy or group.","keywords_es":["maldiciones del brujo","terror de agonía","maldición de los elementos","maldición de debilidad","maldición de las lenguas"],"keywords_en":["warlock curses","bane of agony","curse of the elements","curse of weakness","curse of tongues"],"text_es":"Puedes mantener un terror de daño y una maldición sobre el mismo enemigo. Terror de agonía aumenta su daño hacia el final, así que deja que termine antes de renovarlo; a nivel 40, Maldición de los Elementos añade un 10% de daño mágico recibido. Maldición de la lengua ralentiza lanzamientos; Maldición de Temeridad impide que un enemigo huya y también evita Miedo y Horror. No aprendas Maldición de debilidad para subir: no ayuda a llegar a 60.","text_en":"You can keep one damage Bane and one Curse on the same enemy. Bane of Agony deals more damage toward the end, so let it finish before refreshing; at level 40, Curse of the Elements adds 10% Magic damage taken. Curse of Tongues slows casts; Curse of Recklessness stops an enemy from fleeing and also prevents Fear and Horror. Do not train Curse of Weakness for leveling; it does not help you reach 60.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Abilities to Skip While Leveling","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Single Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:6314b58a862f872163d7aa23f0152d902f6418ca","section:021e27e37591bfc474fad3dbe184a9c4732ada4c","section:7ab3a96fb19d9dcc2eec555cbbf8424f8578099a","section:befc3dbf03db585c712bb92be35cb7b52070c5a7","section:c5051c21bf40a8f33983ccb5fc1278a140e60058","section:c5a9693436796cb0859b87ef7b5e258f7fe80e4c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-salud-mana","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Salud, maná y Transfusión de vida","title_en":"Health, Mana, and Life Tap","summary_es":"Equilibra Transfusión de vida con Drenar vida, comida, bebida y vendas para reducir descansos.","summary_en":"Balance Life Tap with Drain Life, food, drink, and bandages to reduce downtime.","keywords_es":["maná del brujo","transfusión de vida","drenar vida brujo","piedra de salud","recuperar salud brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock mana","life tap","warlock drain life","healthstone","warlock health recovery"],"text_es":"Transfusión de vida convierte salud en maná y el Espíritu aumenta ambas cantidades. Úsala cuando tengas salud disponible, sin esperar a vaciar la barra de maná; Drenar vida te cura durante el combate y Succionar vida añade daño periódico y curación cuando tienes ese talento. Si ambas barras están bajas, come y bebe a la vez entre combates; una venda también ayuda tras Transfusión de vida.","text_en":"Life Tap converts health into mana, and Spirit increases both amounts. Use it when you have health to spare instead of waiting for an empty mana bar; Drain Life heals you during combat, and Siphon Life adds damage over time and healing once you have the talent. If both bars are low, eat and drink together between fights; a bandage also helps after Life Tap.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Warlock Resources","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as an Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:6d38eb11ef46ac120cdffe9092bfc5184d7611f4","section:99fbf29026d32be5654d9ec808e0c7e2c53cb7f0","section:ac2ef2af02b12a4ea71eb4aba3d6c68a4dbebb96"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-fragmentos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Fragmentos de alma","title_en":"Soul Shards","summary_es":"Drenar alma genera fragmentos de alma; guarda una reserva para invocaciones y piedras.","summary_en":"Drain Soul generates soul shards; keep a supply for summons and stones.","keywords_es":["fragmentos de alma brujo","drenar alma","bolsa de fragmentos de alma","ritual de invocación","invocar demonio brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock soul shards","drain soul","soul shard bag","ritual of summoning","summon warlock demon"],"text_es":"Drenar alma, disponible a nivel 10, puede generar un fragmento con sus ticks y también cuando muere un enemigo apto mientras lo canalizas. Los fragmentos no se apilan y la bolsa de fragmentos ocupa el hueco de reactivos. Se gastan al invocar demonios, crear piedras y lanzar Ritual de invocación; guarda algunos antes de ir a una mazmorra para poder ofrecer una invocación.","text_en":"Drain Soul, available at level 10, can generate a shard from its ticks and when an eligible enemy dies while you channel it. Shards do not stack, and a shard bag uses the reagent-bag slot. They are spent to summon demons, create stones, and cast Ritual of Summoning; keep some before a dungeon so you can offer a summon.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Warlock Resources","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Dungeon Tips","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:7b381e7e500e3d782e9e3a2974a8bf78019162e0","section:ac2ef2af02b12a4ea71eb4aba3d6c68a4dbebb96"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-piedras-apoyo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Piedras, invocaciones y apoyo","title_en":"Stones, Summons, and Support","summary_es":"Crea piedras de salud y de alma; elixires, comida y pociones de maná ayudan en combates largos.","summary_en":"Create healthstones and soulstones; elixirs, food, and mana potions help in long fights.","keywords_es":["piedra de salud brujo","piedra de alma brujo","ritual de invocación brujo","fuerza inmortal","detectar invisibilidad"],"keywords_en":["warlock healthstone","warlock soulstone","ritual of summoning","unending breath","detect invisibility"],"text_es":"Crear piedra de salud (10) ofrece curación gratuita; Crear piedra de alma (18) permite resucitar con el efecto activo. Cauce de salud (12) cura al demonio, aunque entre combates suele rendir más una venda o volver a invocarlo. Fuerza inmortal (16) otorga Respiración subacuática durante 10 min; Ritual de invocación (20) requiere un fragmento y dos ayudantes. Detectar invisibilidad (26) no revela enemigos en sigilo. Los elixires de Poder con hechizos y la comida aceleran las bajas; Bien alimentado da +5% de experiencia por enemigo y las pociones de maná convienen en peleas largas.","text_en":"Create Healthstone (10) provides free healing; Create Soulstone (18) lets its bearer resurrect while the effect is active. Health Funnel (12) heals your demon, though bandaging or resummoning is usually better between fights. Unending Breath (16) grants 10 minutes of underwater breathing; Ritual of Summoning (20) requires a shard and two helpers. Detect Invisibility (26) does not reveal stealthed enemies. Spell Power elixirs and food speed up kills; Well Fed gives +5% experience per kill, and mana potions are useful in long fights.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:021e27e37591bfc474fad3dbe184a9c4732ada4c","section:070cae6be37ea31385f07629d002d8ec591b3fe2","section:7ab3a96fb19d9dcc2eec555cbbf8424f8578099a","section:c5051c21bf40a8f33983ccb5fc1278a140e60058"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Miedo, control y emergencias","title_en":"Fear, Control, and Emergencies","summary_es":"Miedo controla un enemigo con riesgo de atraer otros; reserva Aullido de terror y Desterrar para emergencias.","summary_en":"Fear controls one enemy but may pull others; save Howl of Terror and Banish for emergencies.","keywords_es":["miedo brujo","aullido de terror","espiral de la muerte","desterrar brujo","subyugar demonio"],"keywords_en":["warlock fear","howl of terror","death coil","warlock banish","subjugate demon"],"text_es":"Miedo, disponible a 8, hace huir a un enemigo; vigila su recorrido porque puede atraer otro grupo, y los no-muertos y las máquinas son inmunes. Aullido de terror (40) afecta hasta cinco enemigos cercanos y puede abrir espacio si te rodean. Espiral mortal (42) daña, te cura y causa tres segundos de Horror. Desterrar (28) aparta temporalmente a un demonio o elemental. Subyugar demonio (30) controla un demonio hasta cinco minutos, pero no lo aprendas al subir.","text_en":"Fear, available at 8, makes one enemy flee; watch its path because it may pull another group, and Undead and Machines are immune. Howl of Terror (40) affects up to five nearby enemies and can create space if surrounded. Death Coil (42) damages, heals you, and causes three seconds of Horror. Banish (28) temporarily removes a demon or elemental from the fight. Subjugate Demon (30) controls a demon for up to five minutes, but skip it while leveling.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Abilities to Skip While Leveling","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:021e27e37591bfc474fad3dbe184a9c4732ada4c","section:7ab3a96fb19d9dcc2eec555cbbf8424f8578099a","section:befc3dbf03db585c712bb92be35cb7b52070c5a7","section:c5051c21bf40a8f33983ccb5fc1278a140e60058"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-piedras-arma","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Piedras de fuego y de hechizo","title_en":"Firestones and Spellstones","summary_es":"Aflicción suele usar piedra de hechizo; elige piedra de fuego o hechizo según la rama y su daño.","summary_en":"Affliction generally uses Spellstone; choose Firestone or Spellstone to match your spec and damage.","keywords_es":["piedra de fuego brujo","piedra de hechizo brujo","aceite de zahorí","imbuido de arma brujo","crear piedra de fuego"],"keywords_en":["warlock firestone","warlock spellstone","wizard oil","warlock weapon imbue","create firestone"],"text_es":"Crear piedra de fuego se aprende a 28; Crear piedra de hechizos, a 36. La piedra de fuego aumenta el daño de Fuego y Golpe crítico con hechizos; la Piedra de hechizos aumenta el daño de Sombras y un poco la celeridad. Aflicción obtiene más de la piedra de hechizo porque la mayoría de su daño es de Sombras. En Demonología de subida también es más fuerte desde 36; vuelve a la piedra de fuego al subir en mazmorras con Destrucción desde 40, cuando predomina el daño de Fuego. Puedes combinarlas con Aceite zahorí; reaplícalas al cambiar de arma o cuando expiren.","text_en":"Create Firestone is learned at 28; Create Spellstone at 36. Firestone increases Fire damage and spell critical strike, while Spellstone increases Shadow damage and a little Haste. Affliction benefits more from Spellstone because most of its damage is Shadow. It is also stronger for leveling Demonology from 36; switch back to Firestone for dungeon-leveling Destruction from 40, when Fire damage dominates. They can be combined with Wizard Oil; reapply them when changing weapons or when they expire.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Affliction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Demonology Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Must-Have Abilities to Train for Destruction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Firestones and Spellstones","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:021e27e37591bfc474fad3dbe184a9c4732ada4c","section:1652e6032b90619b9225273ebb5d8068986cd71a","section:a415ff3fff19a2f2e7fd929962dad8649a6fc3eb","section:ace72ab599c1d2952f57c6a945d66879bf8f831f","section:fa1446d859c0451265edfcc0b23e257610eb68c5"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Daño en área y varios enemigos","title_en":"Area Damage and Multiple Enemies","summary_es":"Aflicción reparte efectos periódicos y Miedo entre dos enemigos; en mazmorra, el grupo puede usar Piroinferno.","summary_en":"Affliction spreads damage-over-time effects and Fear across two enemies; use Hellfire in dungeon packs.","keywords_es":["brujo daño en área","lluvia de fuego","piroinferno","brujo varios enemigos","repartir dots brujo"],"keywords_en":["warlock aoe","rain of fire","hellfire","warlock multiple enemies","spread dots warlock"],"text_es":"En solitario, Aflicción puede aplicar Corrupción y Terror de agonía a un enemigo y luego usar Miedo, mientras el abisario o el diablillo distraen a otro; los efectos siguen dañando al cambiar de objetivo. Terror de agonía solo merece la pena si el enemigo vivirá hasta sus últimos ticks. Lluvia de Fuego se aprende a 20, pero no ayuda a subir; en mazmorra, con el tanque sujetando el grupo, canaliza Piroinferno desde 30 y renueva efectos solo en enemigos duraderos. Avisa al sanador: Piroinferno también te daña.","text_en":"While solo, Affliction can apply Corruption and Agony damage over time to one enemy and then Fear it while the Voidwalker or Imp distracts another; the effects keep ticking as you switch targets. Use the damage curse only if the enemy will live through its final ticks. Rain of Fire is learned at 20 but does not help with leveling; in dungeons, with the tank holding the pack, channel Hellfire from 30 and refresh effects only on durable enemies. Tell the healer first: Hellfire also damages you.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Fear Juggle (Two Mobs)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Fear Juggle (Two Mobs)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Abilities to Skip While Leveling","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Demon Abilities to Train for Demonology Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Demon Abilities to Train for Destruction Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:06caefe3eaeafd39ddc3b82943318222c7b6f978","guide:6314b58a862f872163d7aa23f0152d902f6418ca","guide:af1e73748ba8b481d20982b7af36cc91d6ad18da","section:1686715485aadbbd1f53233844e262533ad65e6b","section:befc3dbf03db585c712bb92be35cb7b52070c5a7","section:c5051c21bf40a8f33983ccb5fc1278a140e60058","section:cf1926e01a84ce174e96633ede8a8deac9216ae1"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-afliccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Aflicción","title_en":"Affliction Rotation","summary_es":"Envía al demonio, aplica los efectos que duren y rellena con Drenar vida desde 30 o varita.","summary_en":"Send in your demon, apply effects that will last, and fill with Drain Life from 30 or your wand.","keywords_es":["rotación de aflicción","rotación del brujo aflicción","terror de agonía rotación","drenar vida rotación","varita brujo"],"keywords_en":["affliction rotation","affliction warlock rotation","bane of agony rotation","drain life rotation","warlock wand"],"text_es":"Envía al demonio y aplica Maldición de los Elementos primero desde 40 contra un enemigo duradero, luego Corrupción; añade Terror de agonía si vivirá hasta sus últimos ticks, Inmolar si tiene mucha salud y Succionar vida cuando aprendas ese talento. No renueves Terror de agonía antes de que termine. Antes de 30, rellena con varita o Drenar vida; desde 30, usa Drenar vida de rango 3 o superior. Con Ocaso, aprovecha Trance de las Sombras para lanzar Descarga de las Sombras instantáneamente; Arruinar sirve para dañar cuando empiezas con salud y maná altos.","text_en":"Send in your demon and apply Curse of the Elements first from 40 against a durable enemy, then Corruption; add Bane of Agony if it will live through the final ticks, Immolate if it has high health, and Siphon Life after you learn that talent. Do not refresh Bane of Agony early. Before 30, fill with your wand or Drain Life; from 30, use rank 3 or higher Drain Life. With Nightfall, use Shadow Trance for an instant Shadow Bolt; Wrack is for damage on a pull started with high health and mana.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:6314b58a862f872163d7aa23f0152d902f6418ca","section:ace72ab599c1d2952f57c6a945d66879bf8f831f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-demonologia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Demonología","title_en":"Demonology Rotation","summary_es":"Marca al objetivo con Dolor abrasador, aplica efectos duraderos y rellena con drenaje o varita.","summary_en":"Brand the target with Searing Pain, apply long-lasting effects, and fill with a drain or wand.","keywords_es":["rotación de demonología","rotación del brujo demonología","marca demoníaca","dolor abrasador rotación","cauce de salud"],"keywords_en":["demonology rotation","demonology warlock rotation","demonic brand","searing pain rotation","health funnel"],"text_es":"En Demonología, envía al demonio y, al obtener Marca demoníaca, usa Dolor abrasador contra su objetivo; renueva el efecto tras seis ataques. A 40, ofrece un diablillo a Sacrificio demoníaco y después llama a la súcubo o al íncubo: Pacto demoníaco conserva Sombra ardiente. Contra enemigos duraderos, aplica Maldición de los Elementos desde 40, Corrupción y Terror de agonía; añade Inmolar si tienen mucha salud. Rellena con varita antes de 30 y Drenar vida desde 30.","text_en":"As Demonology, send in your demon; once Demonic Brand is available, use Searing Pain on its target and renew it after six hits. At 40, use an Imp for Demonic Sacrifice, then summon a Succubus or Incubus: Demonic Pact preserves Burning Shadow. Against durable enemies, apply Curse of the Elements from 40, Corruption, and Bane of Agony; add Immolate if they have high health. Fill with your wand before 30 and Drain Life from 30.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Demonology Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:af1e73748ba8b481d20982b7af36cc91d6ad18da","section:78fcf26e7bd6166d52aca9c362d101229fdad4ba"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-destruccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Destrucción","title_en":"Destruction Rotation","summary_es":"Inmolar prepara Conflagrar; termina con Quemadura de las Sombras y elige relleno según la configuración.","summary_en":"Immolate sets up Conflagrate; finish with Shadowburn and choose filler for your build.","keywords_es":["rotación de destrucción","rotación del brujo destrucción","conflagrar","quemadura de las sombras","incinerar"],"keywords_en":["destruction rotation","destruction warlock rotation","conflagrate","shadowburn","incinerate"],"text_es":"En Destrucción, deja que el demonio gane amenaza y aplica Inmolar; desde 25, usa Conflagrar cerca del final. En solitario, Conflagrar consume Inmolar; con Sombras y llamas 5/5 en mazmorra, no. Aplica Terror de agonía y Corrupción a enemigos duraderos; Aterrar 5/5 acelera Inmolar y Descarga de las Sombras. Remata con Quemadura de las Sombras. Antes de 30, rellena con varita o Drenar vida; desde 30, usa Drenar vida de rango 3. En mazmorras, Descarga de las Sombras hasta 40 y luego Incinerar; deja que el tanque genere amenaza primero.","text_en":"As Destruction, send in the demon, let it build threat, then cast Immolate. From 25, use Conflagrate near the end. It consumes Immolate in the solo build but not with 5/5 Shadow and Flame in the dungeon build. Use Bane of Agony and Corruption on durable enemies; 5/5 Bane shortens Immolate and Shadow Bolt casts. Finish with Shadowburn. Before 30, fill with wand or Drain Life; from 30, use rank 3 Drain Life. For dungeons, Shadow Bolt until 40, then Incinerate; let the tank build threat first.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:06caefe3eaeafd39ddc3b82943318222c7b6f978","section:a41d84a98887df06285a814d449ad60b10a4cc3e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-consejos-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para subir de nivel","title_en":"Leveling Tips","summary_es":"Compra una varita pronto, mantén vivo al demonio y evita gastar maná en enemigos casi muertos.","summary_en":"Get a wand early, keep your demon alive, and avoid spending mana on nearly dead enemies.","keywords_es":["consejos para subir brujo","varita brujo","comida y agua brujo","grimorios del demonio","experiencia de descanso"],"keywords_en":["warlock leveling tips","warlock wand","warlock food water","demon grimoires","rested experience"],"text_es":"Vende equipo y comida inicial para pagar Inmolar de rango 1 a nivel 1. Usa la Varita mágica inferior (5) y la Varita mágica superior (13), y mantenla al día hasta 30. Entre combates, suele ser mejor vendar al demonio o volver a invocarlo que usar Cauce de salud. Enlaza efectos periódicos y Miedo a un objetivo de foco, no renueves efectos en enemigos casi muertos y termina con la varita. Drenar alma puede darte un fragmento al matar: canalízalo al final, no contra un enemigo con toda la salud. Programa visitas al entrenador y cierra sesión en una posada para acumular experiencia de descanso.","text_en":"Sell your starting gear and food to pay for rank 1 Immolate, which is useful from level 1; get a Lesser Magic Wand at 5 and a Greater Magic Wand at 13, and keep it current until 30. Between fights, bandaging or resummoning your demon is usually better than using Health Funnel. Bind damage-over-time effects and Fear to a focus target, do not refresh them on nearly dead enemies, and finish with your wand. Drain Soul can grant a shard on a killing blow: channel it near the end, not on a full-health enemy. Plan trainer visits and log out at an inn to build rested experience.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Solo Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Solo Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Solo Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:2492e114a2cda3a0ca0136a08df444178c07eccd","section:99fbf29026d32be5654d9ec808e0c7e2c53cb7f0","section:e6f5f6f4350062c34277eff5d1b70ce059bce69c","section:fdb152ff765284c28444da661d480884e3562ca7"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Brujo en grupo y mazmorras","title_en":"Warlock in Groups and Dungeons","summary_es":"Aporta piedras, invocaciones y maldiciones; coordina el Terror y la maldición y protege al demonio.","summary_en":"Brings stones, summons, and curses; coordinate the Bane and Curse and protect the demon.","keywords_es":["brujo en grupo","brujo en mazmorras","utilidad del brujo","maldiciones en banda","demonio en combate"],"keywords_en":["warlock in groups","warlock in dungeons","warlock utility","raid curses","demon in combat"],"text_es":"En grupos, el Brujo aporta piedras de salud y de alma, Ritual de invocación, maldiciones y Desterrar, que aparta a un demonio o elemental de un pull difícil. Coordina tu maldición: usa la asignada o, si no hay una, Maldición de los Elementos cuando haya más lanzadores; puede coexistir con Terror de agonía. En Demonología, mantén vivo y fuera de las áreas peligrosas al demonio, porque buena parte del daño depende de él.","text_en":"In groups, Warlocks bring health stones and soul stones, Ritual of Summoning, curses, and Banish, which removes a Demon or Elemental from a difficult pull. Coordinate your Curse: use the assigned one or, if none is assigned, Curse of the Elements when the raid has more casters; it can coexist with Bane of Agony. As Demonology, keep your demon alive and out of dangerous areas, because much of your damage depends on it.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warlock Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warlock in World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Guide › Affliction Warlock Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Affliction Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:overview","class:warlock:affliction:rotation","class:warlock:demonology:overview","class:warlock:general:warlock-class-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:613b699a225e90853da48de95c6282bc2ac79d16","section:68a86ca3337957eb0595d58bfb592787f30dd9b6","section:68d4afc3e198df667cbca5caa503b1b201ba63a2","section:aaa309fb5c340fcb1a5dd7dd3f8a8ab2c193bd3c","section:e204be83f9bac6cb4a1f4336722a0ceea4f473af"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-roles","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rol de cada especialización en grupo","title_en":"Each Specialization’s Group Role","summary_es":"Aflicción rinde en peleas largas, Demonología depende de su demonio y Destrucción destaca por daño directo y área.","summary_en":"Affliction excels in long fights, Demonology relies on its demon, and Destruction brings direct and area damage.","keywords_es":["rol de aflicción en grupo","rol de demonología en grupo","rol de destrucción en grupo","daño sostenido del brujo","daño en área del brujo"],"keywords_en":["affliction group role","demonology group role","destruction group role","warlock sustained damage","warlock area damage"],"text_es":"Aflicción destaca en combates largos y contra varios objetivos; sus efectos periódicos tardan en rendir, pero siguen dañando mientras se mueve. Demonología ofrece buen daño a un objetivo con su demonio, aunque depende de mantenerlo vivo y bien colocado; el abisario puede aguantar enemigos mientras lanzas. Destrucción combina buen daño a un objetivo y en área; Conflagrar y Quemadura de las Sombras dan estallidos instantáneos, y Terror de caos transfiere parte del daño a un segundo objetivo. Su área más potente, Piroinferno, exige acercarse y también te daña.","text_en":"Affliction excels in long fights and against multiple targets; its periodic effects take time to pay off but keep dealing damage while you move. Demonology deals strong single-target damage with its demon, but depends on keeping it alive and well positioned; the Voidwalker can hold enemies while you cast. Destruction combines strong single-target and area damage; Conflagrate and Shadowburn provide instant burst, and Bane of Havoc transfers some damage to a second target. Its strongest area spell, Hellfire, requires close range and also damages you.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Destruction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Destruction Warlock Specific Systems in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warlock Class Quests Guide › Human Warlock Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warlock-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Guide › Affliction Warlock Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-ranged-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:overview","class:warlock:demonology:overview","class:warlock:destruction:overview","class:warlock:general:warlock-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:204cd5a2aa40c9a9e31a1c21d73a3e8f06489cf4","section:593b77a3081bf9c5b31ab3406fab66dcafd6a5ea","section:613b699a225e90853da48de95c6282bc2ac79d16","section:aaa309fb5c340fcb1a5dd7dd3f8a8ab2c193bd3c","section:bdc468605d13da4eb3f4f6fec521e8fbf7864e3e","section:f3424175a486b8c8eff6a0771032e6a6130d77e2"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-profesiones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para el Brujo","title_en":"Professions for Warlock","summary_es":"Costura combina con Encantamiento; recolección da oro y las profesiones aportan mejoras al campamento.","summary_en":"Tailoring pairs with Enchanting; gathering earns gold, and professions add camp benefits.","keywords_es":["profesiones para brujo","sastrería brujo","encantamiento brujo","primeros auxilios brujo","cocina y pesca"],"keywords_en":["warlock professions","warlock tailoring","warlock enchanting","warlock first aid","cooking and fishing"],"text_es":"Costura y Encantamiento combinan porque puedes desencantar tus propias creaciones; Costura también da armadura de tela y bolsas, y Encantamiento permite fabricar varitas tempranas. Botánica, Minería y Desollar dan materiales vendibles al subir. Cada profesión añade una función y una mejora al campamento: Botánica da Intelecto, Primeros auxilios Aguante e Ingeniería permite comprar componentes y reparar equipo. Botánica aporta ingredientes para pociones de sanación de Primeros auxilios; las vendas ayudan tras Transfusión de vida. Cocina y Pesca se suben juntas, aunque requieren tiempo.","text_en":"Tailoring and Enchanting pair well because you can disenchant your own crafts; Tailoring also provides cloth armor and bags, and Enchanting can make early wands. For gathering, Herbalism, Mining, and Skinning provide materials to sell while questing. Each profession adds a camp feature and buff: Herbalism grants Intellect, First Aid grants Stamina, and Engineering lets you buy reagents and repair gear. Herbalism provides ingredients that First Aid uses to make Healing Potions; bandages help after Life Tap. Cooking and Fishing level together, though they take time.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Professions for Affliction Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide › Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/affliction-warlock-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:11fdf0f2821f8d9bc6a32e723958dc711660befd","section:2871904a139b125189e2e3a5bef11b168dc9a207"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-stats-afliccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Aflicción a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Affliction Stats","summary_es":"Prioriza Poder con hechizos, crítico y golpe; el límite de golpe de banda es 12% con Supresión 5/5.","summary_en":"Prioritize spell power, crit, and hit; the raid hit cap is 12% with 5/5 Suppression.","keywords_es":["estadísticas aflicción brujo","prioridad de Aflicción","golpe de brujo","crítico de brujo"],"keywords_en":["affliction warlock stats","affliction priority","warlock hit cap","warlock crit"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Poder con hechizos o daño de Sombras, golpe crítico, índice de golpe hasta 12% de equipo con Supresión 5/5, celeridad, penetración con hechizos, intelecto y espíritu. El poder de Sombras casi iguala al poder con hechizos; 1% de crítico vale cerca de 9 de poder con hechizos en Arruinar y 11 en SM Ruina, mientras 1% de golpe vale 7,5 y 9 respectivamente. Tras el límite, cambia golpe por poder con hechizos o crítico.","text_en":"Priority: Spell Power or Shadow Damage, Crit, Hit up to 12% from gear with 5/5 Suppression, Haste, Spell Pierce, Intellect, then Spirit. Shadow Damage is nearly equal to Spell Power; 1% Crit is worth about 9 Spell Power for Wrack and 11 for SM Ruin, while 1% Hit is worth 7.5 and 9 respectively. Past the cap, trade Hit for Spell Power or Crit.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Affliction Warlock Stat Priority in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:4f9046e3d0ec8374207f93f245ee192e9e38353d"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-stats-demonologia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Demonología a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Demonology Stats","summary_es":"Poder con hechizos, golpe, crítico, celeridad, penetración, intelecto y espíritu; prioridad provisional.","summary_en":"Spell power, hit, crit, haste, spell pierce, intellect, and spirit; provisional priority.","keywords_es":["estadísticas demonología brujo","prioridad de Demonología","golpe de Demonología","poder con hechizos brujo"],"keywords_en":["demonology warlock stats","demonology priority","demonology hit","warlock spell power"],"text_es":"Prioridad provisional: Poder con hechizos o daño de Fuego/Sombras según la rama, golpe hasta 17% (resta 1% por cada punto de Supresión), crítico, celeridad, penetración con hechizos, intelecto y espíritu. El golpe ayuda también al demonio y cada 1% se estima en unos 10 puntos de poder con hechizos. En Sombras, 1% de crítico aporta alrededor de 10 puntos de poder con hechizos; en Fuego, unos 7. Por cada 1% de celeridad, las estimaciones son 7 y 6 respectivamente. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Provisional priority: Spell Power or Fire/Shadow Damage to match the build, Hit to 17% (subtract 1% per Suppression point), Crit, Haste, Spell Pierce, Intellect, then Spirit. Hit benefits your demon too, with each 1% estimated at about 10 Spell Power. The shadow setup estimates 1% Crit at roughly 10 Spell Power, while the fire setup puts it near 7. Each 1% Haste is valued at 7 and 6 respectively. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Demonology Warlock Stat Priority in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:8b0cd7bebb1a51df49ed8877c540f2e19e574792"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-stats-destruccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estadísticas de Destrucción a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Destruction Stats","summary_es":"Poder con hechizos, crítico, golpe hasta 12%, celeridad, penetración, intelecto y espíritu; prioridad provisional.","summary_en":"Spell power, crit, hit to 12%, haste, spell pierce, intellect, and spirit; provisional priority.","keywords_es":["estadísticas destrucción brujo","prioridad de Destrucción","golpe de Destrucción","daño de Fuego brujo"],"keywords_en":["destruction warlock stats","destruction priority","destruction hit cap","warlock fire damage"],"text_es":"Prioridad provisional: Poder con hechizos o daño de Fuego, crítico, golpe hasta 12% de equipo con Supresión 5/5, celeridad, penetración con hechizos, intelecto y espíritu. Como referencia, el daño de Fuego aporta aproximadamente dos tercios del valor del poder con hechizos. Crítico y golpe están casi empatados, alrededor de 9 puntos de poder con hechizos por cada 1%, con el crítico ligeramente por delante. Tras el límite, cambia golpe por poder con hechizos o crítico. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Provisional priority: Spell Power or Fire Damage, Crit, Hit to 12% from gear with 5/5 Suppression, Haste, Spell Pierce, Intellect, then Spirit. As a rough comparison, Fire Damage provides about two-thirds of the value of Spell Power. Crit and Hit are close, at around 9 Spell Power for each 1%, with Crit slightly ahead. Past the cap, trade Hit for Spell Power or Crit. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Destruction Warlock Stat Priority in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:fb5448c7d927aad8112336a122be0e61e790fa71"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-afliccion-arruinar-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Aflicción con Arruinar","title_en":"Affliction Wrack Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén los tres efectos periódicos, aplica la maldición asignada y canaliza Arruinar como relleno.","summary_en":"Maintain three damage-over-time effects, apply your assigned Curse, and channel Wrack as filler.","keywords_es":["rotación Aflicción Arruinar","rotación de banda brujo","Trance de las Sombras","Succión de alma"],"keywords_en":["affliction Wrack rotation","warlock raid rotation","Shadow Trance","Soul Siphon"],"text_es":"Prioridad de banda: Terror de agonía, maldición asignada, Corrupción, Succionar vida; usa Descarga de las Sombras solo con Trance de las Sombras y Transfusión de vida tras un Arruinar completo si necesitas maná; rellena con Arruinar. Amplificar maldición potencia Terror de agonía cuando esté disponible; no renueves el efecto con menos de 12 s de combate. Mantén los tres efectos periódicos para que Arruinar y Succión de alma los aprovechen; no uses Terror de fatalidad en esta configuración.","text_en":"Raid priority: Bane of Agony, assigned Curse, Corruption, Siphon Life; use Shadow Bolt only on a Shadow Trance proc and Life Tap after a full Wrack if mana is needed; fill with Wrack. Amplify Curse boosts Bane of Agony when ready; do not refresh the Bane with under 12 seconds left. Keep all three DoTs active for Wrack and Soul Siphon; do not use Bane of Doom with this build.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Wrack Rotation for Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:fb1469b7e573a2b2271824d8e33ac81ea1d58c45"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-afliccion-sm-ruin-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Aflicción SM Ruina","title_en":"Affliction SM Ruin Rotation","summary_es":"Alterna los efectos periódicos con Descarga de las Sombras; reserva Terror de fatalidad para peleas largas.","summary_en":"Maintain damage-over-time effects and fill with Shadow Bolt; use Bane of Doom in long fights.","keywords_es":["rotación Aflicción SM Ruina","Descarga de las Sombras Aflicción","Terror de fatalidad brujo","rotación Aflicción raid"],"keywords_en":["SM Ruin Affliction rotation","Affliction Shadow Bolt","warlock Bane of Doom","Affliction raid rotation"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Terror de fatalidad si queda al menos un minuto; si no, Amplificar maldición con Terror de agonía; después, maldición asignada, Corrupción, Succionar vida e Inmolar. Lanza primero Descarga de las Sombras si falta el efecto de Descarga de Sombras mejorada y luego úsala como relleno; con Trance de las Sombras, es instantánea y se lanza enseguida. Usa Transfusión de vida entre renovaciones o al moverte; cerca del final, solo si no puedes pagar el siguiente hechizo.","text_en":"Priority: Bane of Doom if a minute or more remains; otherwise Amplify Curse with Bane of Agony; then your assigned Curse, Corruption, Siphon Life, and Immolate. Cast Shadow Bolt first if Improved Shadow Bolt is down, then use it as filler; a Shadow Trance proc makes it instant, so cast it at once. Life Tap between refreshes or while moving; near the end, use it only if you cannot pay for the next spell.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target SM Ruin Rotation for Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:fe00ce1abd33f551894a5ccf35fd4dba83b2aec5"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-demonologia-fuego-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Demonología de Fuego","title_en":"Demonology Fire Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Marca demoníaca y los efectos periódicos; usa Fuego de alma durante Exterminio.","summary_en":"Maintain Demonic Brand and damage-over-time effects; cast Soul Fire during Decimation.","keywords_es":["rotación Demonología Fuego","Exterminio brujo","Marca demoníaca rotación","Fuego de alma brujo"],"keywords_en":["Demonology Fire rotation","warlock Decimation","Demonic Brand rotation","warlock Soul Fire"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Dolor abrasador si falta Marca demoníaca; Terror de fatalidad si queda al menos un minuto (si no, Terror de agonía); maldición asignada, Inmolar y Corrupción. Lanza Fuego de alma mientras Exterminio esté activo. Usa Transfusión de vida antes de quedarte sin maná y para reponer el del diablillo con Energías demoníacas; rellena con Dolor abrasador.","text_en":"Priority: Searing Pain if Demonic Brand is missing; Bane of Doom with at least a minute left (otherwise Bane of Agony); assigned Curse, Immolate, and Corruption. Cast Soul Fire while Decimation is active. Life Tap before you run out of mana and to refill the Imp through Demonic Energies; fill with Searing Pain.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Fire Rotation for Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:3fb546c88bdac6b48500c01acae0cc8aa85e3e74"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-demonologia-sombras-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Demonología de Sombras","title_en":"Demonology Shadow Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Marca demoníaca y efectos periódicos; rellena con Descarga de las Sombras.","summary_en":"Maintain Demonic Brand and damage-over-time effects; fill with Shadow Bolt.","keywords_es":["rotación Demonología Sombras","Descarga de las Sombras Demonología","Marca demoníaca","Terror de fatalidad brujo"],"keywords_en":["Demonology Shadow rotation","Demonology Shadow Bolt","Demonic Brand","warlock Bane of Doom"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Terror de fatalidad si queda al menos un minuto; si no, Terror de agonía; maldición asignada; Dolor abrasador si falta Marca demoníaca; Inmolar y Corrupción; luego Transfusión de vida entre renovaciones o al moverte y Descarga de las Sombras como relleno. Marca demoníaca dura 10 s o 6 ataques de la súcubo/íncubo, lo que ocurra primero: renueva Dolor abrasador al caer. Fuego de alma no forma parte de esta rotación, ni siquiera durante Exterminio.","text_en":"Priority: Bane of Doom with a minute or more remaining; otherwise Bane of Agony; assigned Curse; Searing Pain if Demonic Brand is missing; Immolate and Corruption; then Life Tap between refreshes or while moving and Shadow Bolt as filler. Demonic Brand lasts 10 seconds or 6 Sayaad attacks, whichever comes first: refresh Searing Pain when it drops. Soul Fire is not part of this rotation, even during Decimation.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target Shadow Rotation for Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:8baa576d03192b6e7414ab683140aa57ba67e3de"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-destruccion-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Destrucción a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Destruction Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Inmolar y Corrupción, lanza Conflagrar y Quemadura de las Sombras al recargar y rellena con Incinerar.","summary_en":"Maintain Immolate and Corruption, cast Conflagrate and Shadowburn on cooldown, and fill with Incinerate.","keywords_es":["rotación Destrucción nivel 60","Incinerar rotación","Conflagrar al recargar","Quemadura de las Sombras banda"],"keywords_en":["level 60 Destruction rotation","Incinerate rotation","Conflagrate cooldown","raid Shadowburn"],"text_es":"Prioridad: Terror de fatalidad si queda al menos un minuto; si no, Amplificar maldición y Terror de agonía; maldición asignada, Inmolar, Corrupción, Conflagrar, Quemadura de las Sombras, Transfusión de vida entre renovaciones o al moverte e Incinerar como relleno. Con 5/5 Sombras y llamas, Conflagrar no consume Inmolar y Quemadura de las Sombras devuelve su fragmento; lanza ambas al estar disponibles. En enemigos que mueren en segundos, no gastes tiempo en Corrupción ni en el terror.","text_en":"Priority: Bane of Doom with a minute or more left; otherwise Amplify Curse and Bane of Agony; assigned Curse, Immolate, Corruption, Conflagrate, Shadowburn, Life Tap between refreshes or while moving, then Incinerate as filler. With 5/5 Shadow and Flame, Conflagrate does not consume Immolate and Shadowburn refunds its shard; cast both when ready. For enemies that fall quickly, save casts by leaving Corruption and the Bane out.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Destruction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Destruction Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:overview","class:warlock:destruction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:0139ca37032359782a7de7e3dc75a8f3e46a8d63","section:0150cc1b0cad035c038be93a57fd2d6aaf9f30ee"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-area-afliccion-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Área de Aflicción a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Affliction AoE","summary_es":"Reparte efectos en peleas largas; canaliza Piroinferno en grupos de tres o más si puedes acercarte.","summary_en":"Spread damage-over-time effects in long fights; channel Hellfire on 3+ targets when safe to approach.","keywords_es":["área Aflicción nivel 60","Piroinferno brujo","Lluvia de Fuego brujo","Aflicción varios objetivos"],"keywords_en":["level 60 Affliction AoE","warlock Hellfire","warlock Rain of Fire","Affliction multiple targets"],"text_es":"Contra 2 objetivos, mantén la rotación de un solo objetivo en el principal; pon Corrupción, Terror de agonía y Succionar vida en el segundo si vivirá al menos medio minuto. Piroinferno no compensa contra dos. Con 3 o más, canalízalo en cuanto el grupo esté cerca si morirá en unos 20 s; si durará más, reparte antes los tres efectos periódicos. Si no puedes estar junto al grupo, usa Lluvia de Fuego desde lejos.","text_en":"Against 2 targets, keep your single-target rotation on the main one; apply Corruption, Bane of Agony, and Siphon Life to the second if it will live at least half a minute. Hellfire is not worth using on two. With 3 or more, channel it as soon as the pack is close if it will die in about 20 seconds; if it will live longer, spread the three DoTs first. Use Rain of Fire from range when you cannot safely stand in the pack.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:38d07754537b9afb8193289da56f2f9e8d48efae"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-area-demonologia-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Área de Demonología a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Demonology AoE","summary_es":"Piroinferno golpea más con Fuego; usa Lluvia de Fuego desde lejos y cambia de demonio para área larga en Sombras.","summary_en":"Hellfire hits harder with the Fire build; use Rain of Fire at range and swap demons for long Shadow-build AoE.","keywords_es":["área Demonología nivel 60","Piroinferno Demonología","Lluvia de Fuego Demonología","demonio Demonología área"],"keywords_en":["level 60 Demonology AoE","Demonology Hellfire","Demonology Rain of Fire","Demonology demon AoE"],"text_es":"Con 2 objetivos, mantén la rotación principal y pon Corrupción e Inmolar en el segundo; añade Terror de agonía si vivirá al menos medio minuto. Contra 3 o más, canaliza Piroinferno cuando estén a tu lado; mientras se acercan, reparte Terror de agonía y, si da tiempo, Maldición de los Elementos. Si no puedes acercarte, usa Lluvia de Fuego. En área larga con la rama de Sombras, sacrifica a la súcubo/íncubo y saca al diablillo para potenciar el daño de Fuego.","text_en":"Against 2 targets, keep your main rotation and apply Corruption and Immolate to the second; add Bane of Agony if it will live at least half a minute. Against 3 or more, channel Hellfire once they are next to you; while they run in, spread Bane of Agony and, if time allows, Curse of the Elements. Use Rain of Fire if you cannot get close. For sustained AoE with the Shadow build, sacrifice the Sayaad and summon the Imp to boost Fire damage.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:40762d07d25d5e60449986d4866e2f8d148853e7"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-area-destruccion-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Área de Destrucción a nivel 60","title_en":"Level 60 Destruction AoE","summary_es":"Usa Terror de caos contra un objetivo secundario y Piroinferno en grupos de tres o más.","summary_en":"Use Bane of Havoc on a secondary target and Hellfire against packs of 3 or more.","keywords_es":["área Destrucción nivel 60","Terror de caos","Piroinferno Destrucción","Destrucción varios objetivos"],"keywords_en":["level 60 Destruction AoE","Bane of Havoc","Destruction Hellfire","Destruction multiple targets"],"text_es":"Contra 2 objetivos, aplica Terror de caos al secundario y usa la rotación normal en el principal; el marcado recibe 15% del daño que infliges al principal. Si vivirá al menos un minuto, añade maldición, Corrupción e Inmolar al secundario. Contra 3 o más, coloca Terror de caos y canaliza Piroinferno cuando el grupo esté junto; mientras se acerca, aplica Terror de agonía al resto y Maldición de los Elementos si da tiempo. Usa Lluvia de Fuego si no puedes acercarte.","text_en":"Against 2 targets, put Bane of Havoc on the secondary and use your normal rotation on the main target; 15% of damage to the main target is also dealt to the marked one. Add your Curse, Corruption, and Immolate there too if the marked enemy is expected to survive for a minute or longer. Against 3 or more, apply Bane of Havoc and channel Hellfire once the pack is together; while it runs in, apply Bane of Agony to the others and Curse of the Elements if time allows. Use Rain of Fire if you cannot get close.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Destruction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:29cd8c54a8c86337d11b7b247201e0032b7acaab"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-arruinar-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Aflicción con Arruinar","title_en":"Affliction Wrack Raid Build","summary_es":"Distribución exacta de talentos para la build de banda de Arruinar, que sacrifica al diablillo por daño de Sombras.","summary_en":"Exact Wrack raid talent setup, sacrificing the Imp for Shadow damage.","keywords_es":["build Arruinar Aflicción","talentos Aflicción banda","talentos Brujo nivel 60","sacrificio demoníaco Aflicción"],"keywords_en":["Affliction Wrack build","Affliction raid talents","level 60 Warlock talents","Affliction Demonic Sacrifice"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Ocaso 2/2, Succionar vida 1/1, Succión de alma 3/3, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5, Arruinar 1/1; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1; Destrucción: Descarga de Sombras mejorada 5/5. Sacrifica al diablillo: +15% de daño de Sombras. Arruinar potencia DoTs. Transfusión de vida mejorada ayuda al maná. SM Ruina usa Aterrar 5/5 para acelerar Descarga de las Sombras.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Nightfall 2/2, Siphon Life 1/1, Soul Siphon 3/3, Shadow Mastery 5/5, Wrack 1/1; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1; Destruction: Improved Shadow Bolt 5/5. Sacrifice the Imp for +15% Shadow damage. Wrack boosts DoTs. Improved Life Tap supports mana. SM Ruin uses Bane 5/5 to speed Shadow Bolt.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:d81ab77a5526144ee1ed26b2be4f0ecf34111ff8"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-sm-ruina-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Aflicción SM Ruina","title_en":"Affliction SM Ruin Raid Build","summary_es":"Build con Descarga de las Sombras como relleno y demonio activo; pierde daño frente a Arruinar.","summary_en":"Shadow Bolt filler with a demon active; lower damage than Wrack.","keywords_es":["build SM Ruina Aflicción","talentos Descarga de las Sombras","build Aflicción demonio","talentos banda Brujo"],"keywords_en":["Affliction SM Ruin build","Shadow Bolt talents","Affliction demon build","Warlock raid talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Terror de agonía mejorado 1/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Ocaso 2/2, Succionar vida 1/1, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5; Destrucción: Descarga de Sombras mejorada 5/5, Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Ruina 5/5, Llamas agonizantes 3/3. Mantén a la súcubo/íncubo y rellena con Descarga de las Sombras; Transfusión de vida mejorada ayuda a gestionar el maná. Elige esta build si prefieres lanzar en vez de canalizar Arruinar.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Bane of Agony 1/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Nightfall 2/2, Siphon Life 1/1, Shadow Mastery 5/5; Destruction: Improved Shadow Bolt 5/5, Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Ruin 5/5, Agonizing Flames 3/3. Keep the Sayaad and fill with Shadow Bolt; Improved Life Tap helps manage mana. Choose this build if you prefer casts to channeling Wrack.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:d81ab77a5526144ee1ed26b2be4f0ecf34111ff8"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-mazmorra","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de mazmorra de Aflicción","title_en":"Affliction Dungeon Build","summary_es":"Build SM Ruina con Quemadura de las Sombras para moverse y rematar objetivos.","summary_en":"SM Ruin setup with Shadowburn for movement and finishing targets.","keywords_es":["build mazmorra Aflicción","talentos Aflicción mazmorra","Quemadura de las Sombras brujo","build de movilidad Brujo"],"keywords_en":["Affliction dungeon build","Affliction dungeon talents","Warlock Shadowburn","Warlock mobility build"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Terror de agonía mejorado 1/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Ocaso 2/2, Succionar vida 1/1, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5; Destrucción: Descarga de Sombras mejorada 5/5, Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 2/3, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3. Cambia un punto de Cataclismo por Quemadura de las Sombras: el lanzamiento instantáneo ayuda a recolocarse y rematar enemigos huidizos.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Bane of Agony 1/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Nightfall 2/2, Siphon Life 1/1, Shadow Mastery 5/5; Destruction: Improved Shadow Bolt 5/5, Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 2/3, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3. Trade one Cataclysm point for Shadowburn: its instant cast helps reposition and finish fleeing enemies.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:37a5c2a2bed831ffd339a408d567d41f0dc71cf0"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-pvp-sm-sl-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ SM/SL de Aflicción (1/2)","title_en":"Affliction SM/SL PvP Build (1/2)","summary_es":"Primera parte de los talentos de Aflicción de la build SM/SL para campos de batalla.","summary_en":"First part of the Affliction talents in the SM/SL Battleground build.","keywords_es":["build JcJ Aflicción SM SL","talentos Vínculo de alma","build brujo campos de batalla","talentos Brujo PvP"],"keywords_en":["Affliction SM SL PvP build","Soul Link talents","Warlock Battleground build","Warlock PvP talents"],"text_es":"Parte 1/2, talentos de Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 2/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 4/5, Ocaso 2/2, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1, Succionar vida 1/1, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5. Esta parte contiene los talentos de Aflicción.","text_en":"Part 1/2, Affliction talents: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 2/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 4/5, Nightfall 2/2, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1, Siphon Life 1/1, Shadow Mastery 5/5. This part lists the Affliction talents.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30d1baf6851822e1831ff020125427a5d165f3c4"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-pvp-sm-sl-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ SM/SL de Aflicción (2/2)","title_en":"Affliction SM/SL PvP Build (2/2)","summary_es":"Talentos de Demonología y propósito de la build SM/SL para campos de batalla en solitario.","summary_en":"Demonology talents and purpose of the SM/SL solo Battleground build.","keywords_es":["build JcJ Aflicción SM SL","talentos Vínculo de alma","build brujo campos de batalla","talentos Brujo PvP"],"keywords_en":["Affliction SM SL PvP build","Soul Link talents","Warlock Battleground build","Warlock PvP talents"],"text_es":"Parte 2/2, Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Abisario mejorado 3/3, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 1/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1. Mantén vivo al demonio y aguanta el foco con Vínculo de alma; está pensada para campos de batalla en solitario y requiere poca microgestión de la mascota.","text_en":"Part 2/2, demonology branch: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Improved Voidwalker 3/3, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 1/3, Soul Link 1/1. Keep the demon alive and withstand focus with Soul Link; this build is aimed at solo Battlegrounds and needs little pet micromanagement.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30d1baf6851822e1831ff020125427a5d165f3c4"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-pvp-sm-ruina","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Aflicción SM Ruina","title_en":"Affliction SM Ruin PvP Build","summary_es":"Build JcJ de estallido para grupos que te quiten presión, con Ruina y Conflagrar.","summary_en":"Burst PvP build for groups that keep pressure off you, with Ruin and Conflagrate.","keywords_es":["build JcJ Aflicción Ruina","build Conflagrar Brujo PvP","talentos Ruina brujo","estallido brujo JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Affliction Ruin PvP build","Warlock Conflagrate build","Warlock Ruin talents","Warlock PvP burst"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 1/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Ocaso 2/2, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1, Succionar vida 1/1, Maestría de las Sombras 4/5; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1. Se orienta al estallido de Descarga de las Sombras y Conflagrar; el equipo debe protegerte porque renuncia a la defensa del demonio.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 1/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Nightfall 2/2, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1, Siphon Life 1/1, Shadow Mastery 4/5; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1. It emphasizes Shadow Bolt and Conflagrate burst; teammates should protect you because it gives up the pet-based defense.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30d1baf6851822e1831ff020125427a5d165f3c4"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-pvp-arruinar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Aflicción con Arruinar","title_en":"Affliction Wrack PvP Build","summary_es":"Build JcJ de drenajes para equipo fuerte; concentración vil evita interrupciones al canalizar.","summary_en":"Drain-focused PvP build for geared characters; Fel Concentration prevents channel pushback.","keywords_es":["build JcJ Arruinar brujo","drenajes Aflicción PvP","Concentración vil brujo","talentos brujo drenaje"],"keywords_en":["Warlock Wrack PvP build","Affliction PvP drains","Warlock Fel Concentration","Warlock drain talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Concentración vil 3/3, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 1/5, Ocaso 2/2, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1, Succionar vida 1/1, Succión de alma 3/3, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5, Arruinar 1/1; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Descarga de Sombras mejorada 5/5, Piel de arrabio 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1. Potencia drenajes y evita su retroceso; se recomienda si disfrutas ese estilo y ya tienes equipo fuerte.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Improved Drains 3/3, Fel Concentration 3/3, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 1/5, Nightfall 2/2, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1, Siphon Life 1/1, Soul Siphon 3/3, Shadow Mastery 5/5, Wrack 1/1; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Improved Shadow Bolt 5/5, Molten Skin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1. This option suits geared characters who want to center their play on drains; Fel Concentration reduces channel interruption.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Affliction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30d1baf6851822e1831ff020125427a5d165f3c4"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-fuego-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Demonología de Fuego","title_en":"Demonology Fire Raid Build","summary_es":"Build de Fuego: diablillo activo, súcubo sacrificada y Dolor abrasador como relleno.","summary_en":"Fire setup: Imp active, Sayaad sacrificed, with Searing Pain as filler.","keywords_es":["build Demonología Fuego","talentos Demonología banda","build diablillo brujo","Pacto demoníaco Fuego"],"keywords_en":["Demonology Fire build","Demonology raid talents","Warlock Imp build","Fire Demonic Pact"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Supresión 1/5, Corrupción mejorado 1/5; Demonología: Diablillo mejorado 3/3, Poder profano 5/5, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Marca demoníaca 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 3/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Llamas agonizantes 3/3. Sacrifica a la súcubo/íncubo y mantén al diablillo: Pacto demoníaco conserva el bonus de sacrificio mientras el demonio activo aporta daño de Fuego.","text_en":"Affliction: Suppression 1/5, Improved Corruption 1/5; Demonology: Improved Imp 3/3, Unholy Power 5/5, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Demonic Brand 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 3/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Agonizing Flames 3/3. Sacrifice the Sayaad and keep the Imp: Demonic Pact preserves the sacrifice bonus while the active demon adds Fire damage.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvE Raid Build > Fire or Shadow?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:81e15fe80d6f15039d1402fc8b5c9c586ce226fc"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-sombras-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Demonología de Sombras","title_en":"Demonology Shadow Raid Build","summary_es":"Build de Sombras: súcubo activa, diablillo sacrificado y Descarga de las Sombras como relleno.","summary_en":"Shadow setup: Sayaad active, Imp sacrificed, with Shadow Bolt as filler.","keywords_es":["build Demonología Sombras","talentos Demonología Sombras","build súcubo brujo","Descarga de las Sombras Demonología"],"keywords_en":["Demonology Shadow build","Shadow Demonology talents","Warlock Sayaad build","Demonology Shadow Bolt"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Supresión 1/5, Corrupción mejorado 1/5; Demonología: Poder profano 5/5, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sayaad mejorado 3/3, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Marca demoníaca 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 3/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1; Destrucción: Descarga de Sombras mejorada 5/5, Aterrar 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Llamas agonizantes 3/3. Sacrifica al diablillo y mantén a la súcubo/íncubo; elige esta rama si el equipo favorece Sombras o los combates son cortos. Aterrar acelera Descarga de las Sombras.","text_en":"Affliction: Suppression 1/5, Improved Corruption 1/5; Demonology: Unholy Power 5/5, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Improved Sayaad 3/3, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Demonic Brand 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 3/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1; Destruction: Improved Shadow Bolt 5/5, Bane 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Agonizing Flames 3/3. Sacrifice the Imp and keep the Sayaad; choose this build when gear favors Shadow or fights are short. Bane shortens Shadow Bolt casts.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvE Raid Build > Fire or Shadow?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:81e15fe80d6f15039d1402fc8b5c9c586ce226fc"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-mazmorra","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de mazmorra de Demonología","title_en":"Demonology Dungeon Build","summary_es":"Usa la build de banda de Fuego por su daño de área; mueve talentos para ganar habilidades instantáneas si hace falta.","summary_en":"Use the Fire raid build for AoE; trade talents for instant casts if needed.","keywords_es":["build Demonología mazmorra","talentos Demonología área","Demonología Fuego mazmorra","movilidad brujo mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["Demonology dungeon build","Demonology AoE talents","Demonology Fire dungeon","Warlock dungeon mobility"],"text_es":"Para mazmorras, usa la build de banda de Fuego: conserva exactamente Aflicción: Supresión 1/5, Corrupción mejorado 1/5; Demonología: Diablillo mejorado 3/3, Poder profano 5/5, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Marca demoníaca 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 3/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Llamas agonizantes 3/3. Si necesitas movilidad, puedes cambiar puntos para Quemadura de las Sombras y Conflagrar, a costa de daño a un objetivo.","text_en":"For dungeons, use the Fire raid build unchanged: Affliction: Suppression 1/5, Improved Corruption 1/5; Demonology: Improved Imp 3/3, Unholy Power 5/5, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Demonic Brand 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 3/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Agonizing Flames 3/3. You may trade points for Shadowburn and Conflagrate for mobility, at the cost of single-target damage.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:318126bb2d84e75cc44cc1c6fa690951d3d9fcaf"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-pacto-afliccion-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de drenajes (1/2)","title_en":"Demonology Drain PvP Build (1/2)","summary_es":"Primera parte de los talentos de la build de drenajes y Pacto demoníaco para JcJ.","summary_en":"First part of the drain and Demonic Pact PvP talent build.","keywords_es":["build Demonología drenajes JcJ","Pacto demoníaco PvP","Drenar maná brujo","talentos brujo duelos"],"keywords_en":["Demonology drain PvP build","Demonic Pact PvP","Warlock Drain Mana","Warlock duel talents"],"text_es":"Parte 1/2, Aflicción: Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Concentración vil 3/3, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Ocaso 2/2, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1. Esta parte recoge los talentos de Aflicción.","text_en":"Part 1/2, Affliction: Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Improved Drains 3/3, Fel Concentration 3/3, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Nightfall 2/2, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1. This part lists the Affliction talents.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-pacto-afliccion-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de drenajes (2/2)","title_en":"Demonology Drain PvP Build (2/2)","summary_es":"Talentos de Demonología y objetivo de la build de drenajes con Pacto demoníaco.","summary_en":"Demonology talents and purpose of the drain-focused Demonic Pact build.","keywords_es":["build Demonología drenajes JcJ","Pacto demoníaco PvP","Drenar maná brujo","talentos brujo duelos"],"keywords_en":["Demonology drain PvP build","Demonic Pact PvP","Warlock Drain Mana","Warlock duel talents"],"text_es":"Parte 2/2, Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Abisario mejorado 3/3, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 1/3, Manáfago mejorado 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 1/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1. Está pensada para duelos y JcJ de mundo: Drenajes mejorados también vacía maná y Pacto permite cambiar de demonio sin perder el bonus de sacrificio.","text_en":"Part 2/2, Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Improved Voidwalker 3/3, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 1/3, Improved Felhunter 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 1/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1. It is aimed at duels and world PvP: Improved Drains also removes mana, and Pact lets you swap demons without losing the sacrifice bonus.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-pacto-quemadura-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ con Quemadura (1/2)","title_en":"Demonology Shadowburn PvP Build (1/2)","summary_es":"Primera parte de los talentos de la build JcJ con Vínculo de alma y Quemadura de las Sombras.","summary_en":"First part of the Soul Link and Shadowburn PvP build talents.","keywords_es":["build Quemadura de las Sombras JcJ","Demonología Vínculo de alma","talentos brujo burst PvP","Pacto demoníaco JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Shadowburn PvP build","Demonology Soul Link","Warlock PvP burst talents","Demonic Pact PvP"],"text_es":"Parte 1/2, Aflicción: Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Abisario mejorado 3/3, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 1/3, Manáfago mejorado 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 3/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1. Esta parte reúne las ramas de Aflicción y Demonología.","text_en":"Part 1/2, Affliction: Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Improved Voidwalker 3/3, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 1/3, Improved Felhunter 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 3/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1. This part lists the Affliction and Demonology trees.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-pacto-quemadura-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ con Quemadura (2/2)","title_en":"Demonology Shadowburn PvP Build (2/2)","summary_es":"Talentos de Destrucción y objetivo de la build JcJ con Quemadura de las Sombras.","summary_en":"Destruction talents and purpose of the Shadowburn PvP build.","keywords_es":["build Quemadura de las Sombras JcJ","Demonología Vínculo de alma","talentos brujo burst PvP","Pacto demoníaco JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Shadowburn PvP build","Demonology Soul Link","Warlock PvP burst talents","Demonic Pact PvP"],"text_es":"Parte 2/2, Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Piel de arrabio 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1. Añade estallido y un remate instantáneo a Vínculo de alma; el daño del demonio y Piel de arrabio refuerzan el daño y la supervivencia.","text_en":"Part 2/2, Destruction: Bane 5/5, Molten Skin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1. Adds burst and an instant finisher to Soul Link; demon damage and Molten Skin improve damage and survival.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-trispec-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ trispec (1/2)","title_en":"Demonology Tri-Spec PvP Build (1/2)","summary_es":"Primera parte de los talentos de la build trispec para campos de batalla.","summary_en":"First part of the tri-spec Battleground talent build.","keywords_es":["build trispec brujo","build campos de batalla brujo","Maldición de agotamiento talentos","talentos Demonología JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Warlock tri-spec build","Warlock Battleground build","Curse of Exhaustion talents","Demonology PvP talents"],"text_es":"Parte 1/2, Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 2/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 2/3, Manáfago mejorado 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1. Esta parte contiene las ramas de Aflicción y Demonología.","text_en":"Part 1/2, Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 2/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 2/3, Improved Felhunter 3/3, Soul Link 1/1. This part lists the Affliction and Demonology trees.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-sayaad-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Destrucción con súcubo","title_en":"Destruction Sayaad Raid Build","summary_es":"Build de banda de mayor daño con súcubo activa y talentos de golpe y efectos periódicos.","summary_en":"Highest-damage raid setup with an active Sayaad and hit and DoT talents.","keywords_es":["build Destrucción súcubo","talentos Destrucción banda","Incinerar Destrucción","talentos Brujo nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["Destruction Sayaad build","Destruction raid talents","Destruction Incinerate","level 60 Warlock talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 3/5, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3; Demonología: Poder profano 4/5; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Mantén a la súcubo/íncubo: es la opción de más daño si sobrevive. Incinerar hace 25% más con Inmolar activo; Transfusión de vida ayuda con el maná.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 3/5, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3; Demonology: Unholy Power 4/5; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. Keep the Sayaad for highest damage when it survives; Incinerate deals 25% more while Immolate is active. Improved Life Tap helps manage mana.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:29fabf304908242c5dd204bf19f845522e4813b1"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-diablillo-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Destrucción con diablillo","title_en":"Destruction Imp Raid Build","summary_es":"Variante de banda a distancia: conserva el diablillo y le transfiere maná con Transfusión de vida.","summary_en":"Ranged raid variant: keep the Imp and feed it mana through Life Tap.","keywords_es":["build Destrucción diablillo","talentos Destrucción diablillo","Energías demoníacas","Descarga de Fuego brujo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction Imp build","Destruction Imp talents","Demonic Energies","Warlock Firebolt"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 3/5, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3; Demonología: Diablillo mejorado 3/3, Poder profano 2/5, Energías demoníacas 1/2; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 3/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Frente a la variante de súcubo, el diablillo ataca a distancia y Pacto de sangre da aguante al grupo; Transfusión de vida sostiene sus lanzamientos.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 3/5, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3; Demonology: Improved Imp 3/3, Unholy Power 2/5, Demonic Energies 1/2; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 3/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. This ranged-pet variant uses the Imp, whose Blood Pact adds party Stamina; Life Tap sustains its casts.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:29fabf304908242c5dd204bf19f845522e4813b1"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-sacrificio-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda de Destrucción con sacrificio","title_en":"Destruction Demonic Sacrifice Raid Build","summary_es":"Build sin demonio activo: sacrifica a la súcubo por 15% de daño de Fuego.","summary_en":"No-pet setup: sacrifice the Sayaad for 15% Fire damage.","keywords_es":["build Destrucción sacrificio demoníaco","Destrucción sin demonio","sacrificar súcubo brujo","talentos Destrucción banda"],"keywords_en":["Destruction Demonic Sacrifice build","no-pet Destruction","sacrifice Sayaad","Destruction raid talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Corrupción mejorado 5/5; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Sacrifica a la súcubo/íncubo por 15% de daño de Fuego y juega sin demonio. Transfusión de vida ayuda con el maná.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Improved Corruption 5/5; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. Sacrifice the Sayaad for 15% Fire damage and play without a demon. Improved Life Tap helps manage mana.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:29fabf304908242c5dd204bf19f845522e4813b1"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-sayaad-sin-demonologia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Variante de Destrucción sin Demonología (bandas)","title_en":"Destruction No-Demonology Variant (raids)","summary_es":"Alternativa a la build de súcubo: cambia Poder profano y Amplificar maldición por talentos de Aflicción.","summary_en":"Sayaad-build alternative: trade Unholy Power and Amplify Curse for Affliction talents.","keywords_es":["Destrucción sin Demonología","variante build súcubo","Malevolencia Destrucción","talentos Corrupción brujo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction no-Demonology build","Sayaad build alternative","Destruction Malevolence","Warlock Improved Corruption talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 3/5; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Omite Demonología para mejorar Corrupción y el crítico de Sombras; su rendimiento es parecido. Transfusión de vida también mejora el maná.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 3/5; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. This version skips Demonology in favor of Corruption and Shadow crits; performance is similar. Improved Life Tap also supports mana.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvE Raid Build > Which Build Should You Pick?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["guide:29fabf304908242c5dd204bf19f845522e4813b1"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-mazmorra","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de mazmorra de Destrucción","title_en":"Destruction Dungeon Build","summary_es":"Versión de la build de súcubo con Corrupción instantánea y menos puntos en Supresión.","summary_en":"Sayaad build variant with instant Corruption and fewer Suppression points.","keywords_es":["build Destrucción mazmorra","Corrupción instantánea brujo","Supresión mazmorra brujo","talentos Destrucción PvE"],"keywords_en":["Destruction dungeon build","instant Warlock Corruption","Warlock dungeon Suppression","Destruction PvE talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 3/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3; Demonología: Poder profano 4/5; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Respecto a la build de banda de súcubo, mueve 2 puntos de Supresión a Corrupción mejorado para volver Corrupción instantánea, útil al moverte y repartirla.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 3/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3; Demonology: Unholy Power 4/5; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. Compared with the Sayaad raid build, move 2 Suppression points to Improved Corruption for an instant Corruption that is useful while moving and spreading it.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:7cd758bfd4f0dd0e5f9584f5b5c37de026a9e892"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-pvp-vinculo-conflagrar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Destrucción SL/Conflagrar","title_en":"Destruction SL/Conflagrate PvP Build","summary_es":"Build de aguante y estallido que combina Vínculo de alma con Conflagrar.","summary_en":"Durable burst build combining Soul Link with Conflagrate.","keywords_es":["build SL Conflagrar brujo","Destrucción JcJ supervivencia","talentos Vínculo de alma","talentos brujo PvP"],"keywords_en":["Warlock SL Conflagrate build","Destruction PvP survival","Soul Link talents","Warlock PvP talents"],"text_es":"Demonología: Cauce de salud mejorado 1/2, Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 1/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Piel de arrabio 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3. Para aguantar y conservar estallido, en grupo o en solitario; Vínculo de alma y Piel de arrabio protegen, Conflagrar y Quemadura rematan.","text_en":"Demonology: Improved Health Funnel 1/2, Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 1/3, Soul Link 1/1; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Molten Skin 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3. Built for durability plus burst in groups or solo; Soul Link and Molten Skin protect while Conflagrate and Shadowburn finish targets.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:753e4f7c8f8406ac78849cbeea8fdcae598a3f0c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-pvp-vinculo-conflagrar-alcance","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ SL/Conflagrar con Alcance macabro","title_en":"SL/Conflagrate PvP Build with Grim Reach","summary_es":"Variante de SL/Conflagrar con más alcance para los hechizos de Aflicción.","summary_en":"SL/Conflagrate variant with extra range on Affliction spells.","keywords_es":["build JcJ brujo Alcance macabro","Vínculo de alma Conflagrar alcance","variante SL/Conflagrar"],"keywords_en":["warlock PvP Grim Reach build","Soul Link Conflagrate range","SL/Conflagrate variant"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2; Demonología: Cauce de salud mejorado 1/2, Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Exterminio 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 1/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Fuego y azufre 1/3. Cambia Piel de arrabio y 2 rangos de Fuego y azufre por más alcance.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2; Demonology: Improved Health Funnel 1/2, Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Decimation 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 1/3, Soul Link 1/1; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 1/3. It gives up Molten Skin and 2 ranks of Fire and Brimstone for extra range.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:753e4f7c8f8406ac78849cbeea8fdcae598a3f0c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-pvp-dominio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Destrucción con Dominio","title_en":"Destruction Fel Domination PvP Build","summary_es":"Build de estallido máximo con Dominio de lo maldito para invocar de nuevo al demonio rápidamente.","summary_en":"Maximum-burst build with Fel Domination for a quick demon resummon.","keywords_es":["build Dominio de lo maldito JcJ","Destrucción burst PvP","talentos brujo control demonio","Conflagrar JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Fel Domination PvP build","Destruction PvP burst","Warlock demon control talents","Conflagrate PvP"],"text_es":"Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 5/5, Égida demoníaca 2/2, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Intensidad 3/3, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Elige esta build por su estallido y control: Dominio de lo maldito acelera la nueva invocación si muere el demonio, e Intensidad reduce las interrupciones al lanzar.","text_en":"Demonology: Demonic Embrace 5/5, Demonic Aegis 2/2, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Intensity 3/3, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. Choose this for burst and control: Fel Domination speeds a resummon if your demon dies, while Intensity reduces cast pushback.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:753e4f7c8f8406ac78849cbeea8fdcae598a3f0c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-pvp-agotamiento","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ de Destrucción con Agotamiento","title_en":"Destruction Curse of Exhaustion PvP Build","summary_es":"Build para mantener a los enemigos cuerpo a cuerpo a distancia con Maldición de agotamiento.","summary_en":"Kiting build that keeps melee enemies at range with Curse of Exhaustion.","keywords_es":["build Maldición de agotamiento brujo","Destrucción JcJ kite","Ocaso talentos brujo","build brujo contra cuerpo a cuerpo"],"keywords_en":["Warlock Curse of Exhaustion build","Destruction PvP kiting","Warlock Nightfall talents","Warlock anti-melee build"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 2/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Alcance macabro 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Ocaso 2/2, Maldición de agotamiento 1/1; Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Piel de arrabio 1/5, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Está pensada para mantener a raya a enemigos cuerpo a cuerpo: Maldición de agotamiento ralentiza mientras la rama de Destrucción aporta estallido.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 2/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Grim Reach 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Nightfall 2/2, Curse of Exhaustion 1/1; Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Molten Skin 1/5, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1. Built to keep melee enemies at range: Curse of Exhaustion slows them while Destruction supplies burst.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Destruction Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:753e4f7c8f8406ac78849cbeea8fdcae598a3f0c"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-pvp-trispec-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build JcJ trispec (2/2)","title_en":"Demonology Tri-Spec PvP Build (2/2)","summary_es":"Talentos de Destrucción y objetivo de la build trispec de supervivencia para campos de batalla.","summary_en":"Destruction talents and purpose of the durable tri-spec Battleground build.","keywords_es":["build trispec brujo","build campos de batalla brujo","Maldición de agotamiento talentos","talentos Demonología JcJ"],"keywords_en":["Warlock tri-spec build","Warlock Battleground build","Curse of Exhaustion talents","Demonology PvP talents"],"text_es":"Parte 2/2, Destrucción: Alcance destructivo 2/2, Aterrar 5/5, Piel de arrabio 3/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1. La build ralentiza grupos con Maldición de agotamiento y combina aguante con daño explosivo; Manáfago mejorado reduce 6 s el tiempo de reutilización de Bloqueo de hechizo.","text_en":"Part 2/2, Destruction: Destructive Reach 2/2, Bane 5/5, Molten Skin 3/5, Shadowburn 1/1. The build slows groups with Curse of Exhaustion and combines durability with burst; Improved Felhunter cuts the Spell Lock cooldown by 6 seconds.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Demonology Warlock Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:5e26056bbefb1d9f5dd16ff8da5bed33715be91f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-sistema-afliccion-arruinar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo funciona Arruinar en Aflicción","title_en":"How Affliction Wrack Works","summary_es":"Arruinar acelera tres efectos periódicos y Succión de alma escala con cada uno activo.","summary_en":"Wrack speeds up three DoTs, while Soul Siphon scales with each one active.","keywords_es":["Arruinar Aflicción","Succión de alma brujo","efectos periódicos Aflicción","mecánicas brujo nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["Affliction Wrack","Warlock Soul Siphon","Affliction DoTs","level 60 Warlock mechanics"],"text_es":"Arruinar tiene una canalización de 6 s e inflige daño de Sombras a intervalos de un segundo. Durante el canal, Corrupción, Succionar vida y Terror de agonía duplican su frecuencia de pulsos en el objetivo. Succión de alma añade 12% al daño de Arruinar y de los drenajes por cada uno de esos efectos activos, hasta 36%; aplica los tres antes de empezar. Terror de fatalidad y las maldiciones quedan fuera de este cálculo.","text_en":"Wrack channels for 6 seconds, dealing shadow damage at one-second intervals. During the channel, Corruption, Siphon Life, and Bane of Agony pulse twice as often on the target. Soul Siphon adds 12% to Wrack and drain damage for each of those effects present, up to 36%; get all three running first. Bane of Doom and curses are excluded from this calculation.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Affliction Warlock Specific Systems in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Affliction Warlock in WoW: Forever > New Abilities and Talents in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:919fe2a12b2d2cbf596a42099800dba7eecba7b7","section:cef868b49045ced15dae7827f315484f5c42190e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-sistema-demonologia-pacto","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Pacto demoníaco y sacrificios","title_en":"Demonic Pact and Sacrifice","summary_es":"Pacto demoníaco permite conservar el bonus de sacrificio con otro demonio activo.","summary_en":"Demonic Pact lets you keep a sacrifice bonus with another demon active.","keywords_es":["Pacto demoníaco","sacrificio demoníaco Demonología","bonus de daño brujo","demonio activo brujo"],"keywords_en":["Demonic Pact","Demonology Demonic Sacrifice","Warlock damage bonus","active Warlock demon"],"text_es":"Pacto demoníaco permite sacrificar un demonio y mantener otro activo con sus beneficios. Si sacrificas al diablillo y mantienes a la súcubo/íncubo, aumenta el daño de Sombras; si sacrificas a la súcubo/íncubo y mantienes al diablillo, aumenta el de Fuego: la combinación mejora cerca de 30% el daño de la escuela elegida. Volver a invocar al demonio sacrificado cancela el efecto.","text_en":"This talent lets you sacrifice one demon and keep another fighting with the bonus active. Giving up the Imp while keeping the Sayaad improves shadow damage; giving up the Sayaad and keeping the Imp instead improves fire damage, by about 30% overall. Resummoning the sacrificed demon ends the effect.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Demonology Warlock Specific Systems in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Demonology Warlock in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:08a8122db597212c503fb5cfa23838727425af7d","section:d3a5b6ab1fd735b5fb8e1fcd7aec8e6b231de92e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-sistema-demonologia-exterminio","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Exterminio y Fuego de alma","title_en":"Decimation and Soul Fire","summary_es":"Por debajo de 35% de salud, Exterminio potencia Fuego de alma durante 10 segundos.","summary_en":"Below 35% health, Decimation empowers Soul Fire for 10 seconds.","keywords_es":["Exterminio brujo","Fuego de alma Demonología","fase de ejecución brujo","talento Exterminio"],"keywords_en":["Warlock Decimation","Demonology Soul Fire","Warlock execute phase","Decimation talent"],"text_es":"Con menos de 35% de salud en el objetivo, un impacto de Dolor abrasador activa Exterminio durante 10 s. Mientras dura, Fuego de alma se lanza 40% más rápido, no cuesta un fragmento de alma y tiene 6 s de reutilización. En la build de Fuego, lánzalo al estar disponible y usa Dolor abrasador entre lanzamientos para renovar Exterminio; en Sombras, sigue con Descarga de las Sombras, que iguala o supera su daño por segundo.","text_en":"Hitting an enemy under 35% health with Searing Pain grants 10 seconds of Decimation. While it lasts, Soul Fire casts 40% faster, consumes no Soul Shard, and can be cast every 6 seconds. Fire setups should use Soul Fire whenever available, with Searing Pain in between to renew Decimation; Shadow setups continue with Shadow Bolt, which deals at least as much damage per second.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › The Execute Phase (Fire Build)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:659b0887e2dd9fc021550b5dd856434c3a7079bf"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-sistema-destruccion-sombras-llamas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sombras y llamas en Destrucción","title_en":"Shadow and Flame in Destruction","summary_es":"Con 5/5, Conflagrar y Quemadura de las Sombras se potencian entre sí y conservan sus efectos.","summary_en":"At 5/5, Conflagrate and Shadowburn boost each other and preserve their effects.","keywords_es":["Sombras y llamas","Conflagrar brujo","Quemadura de las Sombras","mecánicas Destrucción"],"keywords_en":["Shadow and Flame","Warlock Conflagrate","Shadowburn","Destruction mechanics"],"text_es":"Al completar Sombras y llamas (5/5), Conflagrar deja Inmolar activo y concede 20% más de daño de Sombras durante 20 s; Quemadura de las Sombras devuelve el fragmento de alma y aumenta 20% el daño de Fuego durante el mismo tiempo. Cada hechizo activa la mejora del tipo de daño contrario, por lo que conviene lanzar ambos en cuanto estén disponibles. Cada punto del talento añade, además, 20% de probabilidad de conservar Inmolar y devolver el fragmento.","text_en":"At 5/5 Shadow and Flame, Conflagrate leaves Immolate active and grants 20% more Shadow damage for 20 seconds; Shadowburn returns its Soul Shard and raises Fire damage by 20% for the same duration. Each spell activates the opposite damage bonus, so cast both as soon as available. Each talent point also adds a 20% chance to preserve Immolate and return the shard.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Destruction Warlock Specific Systems in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:204cd5a2aa40c9a9e31a1c21d73a3e8f06489cf4"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-sistema-destruccion-terror-caos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Terror de caos y daño a otro objetivo","title_en":"Bane of Havoc and Secondary-Target Damage","summary_es":"Terror de caos transfiere 15% del daño que haces a otros enemigos al objetivo marcado.","summary_en":"Bane of Havoc transfers 15% of damage dealt to other enemies to its marked target.","keywords_es":["Terror de caos brujo","daño a dos objetivos Destrucción","cleave Destrucción","talento Terror de caos"],"keywords_en":["Warlock Bane of Havoc","Destruction two-target damage","Destruction cleave","Bane of Havoc talent"],"text_es":"Aplica Terror de caos a un objetivo secundario: mientras esté activo, 15% del daño que infliges a otros objetivos también se le inflige a él. Contra dos enemigos, mantén la rotación de un solo objetivo en el principal; el secundario no puede recibir otro terror. Si vivirá al menos un minuto, añade allí tu maldición, Corrupción e Inmolar.","text_en":"Apply Bane of Havoc to a secondary target: while it is active, 15% of damage you deal to other targets is also dealt to it. Against two enemies, keep your single-target rotation on the main one; the secondary target cannot have another Bane. If it will live at least a minute, also apply your Curse, Corruption, and Immolate there.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Destruction Warlocks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:29cd8c54a8c86337d11b7b247201e0032b7acaab"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-subir-sin-reasignar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Aflicción sin cambios","title_en":"Affliction Leveling Build Without Respec","summary_es":"Distribución completa de talentos de Aflicción sin reasignar puntos al subir.","summary_en":"Complete Affliction talent allocation for leveling without respeccing.","keywords_es":["build Aflicción sin reasignar","talentos de brujo Aflicción","talentos de Aflicción para subir"],"keywords_en":["Affliction no-respec build","Affliction warlock talents","Affliction leveling talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Concentración vil 3/3, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Ocaso 2/2, Succionar vida 1/1, Succión de alma 3/3, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5, Arruinar 1/1; Demonología: Poder profano 5/5, Energías demoníacas 2/2; Destrucción: Descarga de Sombras mejorada 3/5.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Drains 3/3, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Fel Concentration 3/3, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Nightfall 2/2, Siphon Life 1/1, Soul Siphon 3/3, Shadow Mastery 5/5, Wrack 1/1; Demonology: Unholy Power 5/5, Demonic Energies 2/2; Destruction: Improved Shadow Bolt 3/5.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ace72ab599c1d2952f57c6a945d66879bf8f831f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-afliccion-subir-respec-40","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de Aflicción tras reasignar a 40 (subida)","title_en":"Affliction Build After a Level-40 Respec","summary_es":"Build completa de Aflicción que adelanta Arruinar al reasignar talentos a 40.","summary_en":"Complete Affliction build that gets Wrack sooner after a level-40 respec.","keywords_es":["reasignar talentos brujo nivel 40","build Aflicción Arruinar temprano","talentos Aflicción respec"],"keywords_en":["warlock level 40 respec","early Wrack Affliction build","Affliction respec talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Succionar vida 1/1, Succión de alma 3/3, Maestría de las Sombras 5/5, Arruinar 1/1. Reasigna a nivel 40 para obtener Arruinar siete niveles antes; los puntos de Demonología quedan libres para gastar.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Drains 3/3, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Siphon Life 1/1, Soul Siphon 3/3, Shadow Mastery 5/5, Wrack 1/1. Respec at level 40 to get Wrack seven levels earlier; the Demonology points are left free to spend.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:ace72ab599c1d2952f57c6a945d66879bf8f831f"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-demonologia-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Demonología","title_en":"Demonology Leveling Build","summary_es":"Distribución completa de talentos de Demonología para subir sin reasignar puntos.","summary_en":"Complete Demonology talent allocation for leveling without respeccing.","keywords_es":["build Demonología para subir","talentos brujo Demonología leveo","talentos Marca demoníaca"],"keywords_en":["Demonology leveling build","Demonology warlock leveling talents","Demonic Brand talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 1/5; Demonología: Abrazo demoníaco 1/5, Poder profano 5/5, Vitalidad vil 3/3, Energías demoníacas 2/2, Sayaad mejorado 3/3, Sacrificio demoníaco 1/1, Maestro invocador 2/2, Dominio de lo maldito 1/1, Marca demoníaca 3/3, Vínculo de alma 1/1, Conocimiento demoníaco 3/3, Maestro demonogista 5/5, Pacto demoníaco 1/1. Mejora Transfusión de vida.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Improved Drains 3/3, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 1/5; Demonology: Demonic Embrace 1/5, Unholy Power 5/5, Fel Vitality 3/3, Demonic Energies 2/2, Improved Sayaad 3/3, Demonic Sacrifice 1/1, Master Summoner 2/2, Fel Domination 1/1, Demonic Brand 3/3, Soul Link 1/1, Demonic Knowledge 3/3, Master Demonologist 5/5, Demonic Pact 1/1. This improves Life Tap.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Demonology Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:78fcf26e7bd6166d52aca9c362d101229fdad4ba"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-solo-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida en solitario de Destrucción","title_en":"Destruction Solo Leveling Build","summary_es":"Distribución completa de talentos de Destrucción para misiones y combates en solitario.","summary_en":"Complete Destruction talent allocation for solo questing and leveling.","keywords_es":["build solo Destrucción para subir","talentos brujo Destrucción leveo","talentos Quemadura de las Sombras brujo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction solo leveling build","Destruction warlock leveling talents","Warlock Shadowburn talents"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Drenajes mejorados 3/3, Terror de agonía mejorado 2/2, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 5/5, Succión de alma 2/3; Demonología: Poder profano 5/5; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Piel de arrabio 2/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3. Mejora Transfusión de vida.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Drains 3/3, Improved Bane of Agony 2/2, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 5/5, Soul Siphon 2/3; Demonology: Unholy Power 5/5; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Molten Skin 2/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3. This improves Life Tap.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a41d84a98887df06285a814d449ad60b10a4cc3e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-build-destruccion-mazmorra-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de mazmorra de Destrucción para subir","title_en":"Destruction Dungeon Leveling Build","summary_es":"Distribución completa para subir en mazmorras y llegar a Incinerar a 40.","summary_en":"Complete dungeon-leveling build that reaches Incinerate at 40.","keywords_es":["build de mazmorra Destrucción","talentos Destrucción para mazmorras","Incinerar nivel 40 brujo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction dungeon leveling build","Destruction dungeon talents","Warlock Incinerate level 40"],"text_es":"Aflicción: Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Supresión 5/5, Corrupción mejorado 5/5, Amplificar maldición 1/1, Pandemia 3/3, Malevolencia 1/5; Demonología: Diablillo mejorado 3/3; Destrucción: Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 3/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3, Sombras y llamas 5/5, Incinerar 1/1. Mejora Transfusión de vida.","text_en":"Affliction: Improved Life Tap 2/2, Suppression 5/5, Improved Corruption 5/5, Amplify Curse 1/1, Pandemic 3/3, Malevolence 1/5; Demonology: Improved Imp 3/3; Destruction: Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 3/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, Shadow and Flame 5/5, Incinerate 1/1.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a41d84a98887df06285a814d449ad60b10a4cc3e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-talentos-demonologia-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de talentos de Demonología para subir","title_en":"Demonology Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Prioriza el demonio y Marca demoníaca; después añade talentos de Aflicción para sostenerte.","summary_en":"Prioritize the demon and Demonic Brand, then add Affliction talents for sustain.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos Demonología leveo","Marca demoníaca talentos subir","Pacto demoníaco nivel 40"],"keywords_en":["Demonology leveling talent path","Demonic Brand leveling talents","Demonic Pact level 40"],"text_es":"Invierte primero en Poder profano 5/5, Energías demoníacas 2/2 y Vitalidad vil 3/3 para reforzar al demonio; avanza hasta Marca demoníaca 3/3 entre los niveles 25 y 27 y llega a Pacto demoníaco 1/1 a 40. Completa después Aflicción: Corrupción mejorado 5/5 vuelve instantánea Corrupción, Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2 mejora Transfusión de vida y Drenajes mejorados 3/3 potencia el daño y la curación de Drenar vida.","text_en":"Invest first in Unholy Power 5/5, Demonic Energies 2/2, and Fel Vitality 3/3 to strengthen your demon; work toward Demonic Brand 3/3 at levels 25–27 and Demonic Pact 1/1 at 40. Then finish Affliction: Improved Corruption 5/5 makes Corruption instant, Improved Life Tap 2/2 improves Life Tap, and Improved Drains 3/3 increases Drain Life damage and healing.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Demonology Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Core Talents","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:demonology:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:78fcf26e7bd6166d52aca9c362d101229fdad4ba","section:a2bc59d4855f5a559f8e2d98ad4860a1b9fa9eee"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-talentos-destruccion-solo-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de Destrucción para subir en solitario","title_en":"Destruction Solo Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"Prioriza remates de Destrucción, daño del demonio y después drenajes para sostenerte.","summary_en":"Prioritize Destruction finishers, demon damage, and then drains for sustain.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos Destrucción solo","talentos Conflagrar subir brujo","talentos brujo solo leveo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction solo leveling talent path","Conflagrate leveling talents","warlock solo leveling talents"],"text_es":"Empieza por Aterrar 5/5 y Cataclismo 3/3; sigue con Secuelas 5/5 y Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1 para obtener el remate instantáneo, y Conflagrar 1/1 para consumir Inmolar con un golpe fuerte. Luego toma Poder profano 5/5 para el demonio y talentos de Aflicción como Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2, Transfusión de vida, Supresión 5/5 y Drenajes mejorados 3/3, que favorecen el maná y la supervivencia.","text_en":"Start with Bane 5/5 and Cataclysm 3/3; continue with Aftermath 5/5 and Shadowburn 1/1 for an instant finisher, then Conflagrate 1/1 to consume Immolate for a heavy hit. Next take Unholy Power 5/5 for your demon and Affliction talents such as Improved Life Tap 2/2, Life Tap, Suppression 5/5, and Improved Drains 3/3 to support mana and sustain.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Core talents","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:06caefe3eaeafd39ddc3b82943318222c7b6f978","section:a41d84a98887df06285a814d449ad60b10a4cc3e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-talentos-destruccion-mazmorra-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruta de Destrucción para subir en mazmorras","title_en":"Destruction Dungeon Leveling Talent Path","summary_es":"En mazmorras, concentra los puntos en Destrucción hasta obtener Incinerar a 40.","summary_en":"For dungeon leveling, invest in Destruction until Incinerate at 40.","keywords_es":["ruta Destrucción mazmorras","Incinerar talentos nivel 40","talentos brujo subir en grupo"],"keywords_en":["Destruction dungeon talent path","Incinerate level 40 talents","warlock group leveling talents"],"text_es":"Si subes sobre todo en mazmorras con un tanque, dedica cada punto a Destrucción hasta Incinerar 1/1 a nivel 40. Prioriza Aterrar 5/5, Cataclismo 3/3, Secuelas 5/5, Ruina 3/5, Quemadura de las Sombras 1/1, Llamas agonizantes 3/3, Conflagrar 1/1, Terror de caos 1/1, Fuego y azufre 3/3 y Sombras y llamas 5/5; este último evita que Conflagrar consuma Inmolar al completarlo. Transfusión de  vida mejorada 2/2 mejora Transfusión de vida.","text_en":"If you mostly level in dungeons with a tank, put every point into Destruction until Incinerate 1/1 at level 40. Bane 5/5, Cataclysm 3/3, Aftermath 5/5, Ruin 3/5, Shadowburn 1/1, Agonizing Flames 3/3, Conflagrate 1/1, Bane of Havoc 1/1, Fire and Brimstone 3/3, and Shadow and Flame 5/5 form the core; at full rank, the latter stops Conflagrate from consuming Immolate. Improved Life Tap 2/2 improves Life Tap mana.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Destruction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:a41d84a98887df06285a814d449ad60b10a4cc3e"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-rotacion-destruccion-mazmorra-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Destrucción en mazmorras al subir","title_en":"Destruction Dungeon Leveling Rotation","summary_es":"Prioridad de daño de Destrucción en mazmorras, desde Descarga de las Sombras hasta Incinerar.","summary_en":"Destruction dungeon priority, from Shadow Bolt filler to Incinerate.","keywords_es":["rotación Destrucción mazmorras leveo","Incinerar rotación brujo","Terror de caos mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["Destruction dungeon leveling rotation","warlock Incinerate rotation","Bane of Havoc dungeon"],"text_es":"Con la build de mazmorra, invoca al diablillo. En jefes y enemigos duraderos, aplica Terror de agonía o Terror de caos a un segundo objetivo del grupo, Maldición de los Elementos desde 40 si otro Brujo no la mantiene, Inmolar y Corrupción; después Conflagrar y Quemadura de las Sombras, y rellena con Descarga de las Sombras hasta 40 o Incinerar desde entonces. Con Aterrar 5/5 y Sombras y llamas 5/5, Conflagrar no consume Inmolar; deja que el tanque genere amenaza antes de estallar.","text_en":"With the dungeon build, summon the Imp. On bosses and durable targets, apply Bane of Agony or Bane of Havoc to a second mob in the pack, Curse of the Elements from 40 if another Warlock is not maintaining it, Immolate, and Corruption; then use Conflagrate and Shadowburn, filling with Shadow Bolt until 40 or Incinerate afterward. Bane 5/5 plus Shadow and Flame 5/5 means Conflagrate does not consume Immolate; let the tank build threat before bursting.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Core talents","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:06caefe3eaeafd39ddc3b82943318222c7b6f978"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-ventajas-limites-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ventajas y límites al subir","title_en":"Leveling Strengths and Tradeoffs","summary_es":"Compara el aguante, la dependencia del equipo y el daño de las tres ramas durante la subida.","summary_en":"Compare each spec's sustain, gear dependence, and damage while leveling.","keywords_es":["ventajas Aflicción leveo","desventajas Demonología brujo","Destrucción pros y contras leveo","comparar ramas brujo subir"],"keywords_en":["Affliction leveling pros and cons","Demonology warlock leveling weaknesses","Destruction leveling strengths and weaknesses","compare warlock leveling specs"],"text_es":"Aflicción descansa poco, resiste bien gracias al demonio y puede atender a varios enemigos, pero exige manejar Miedo y efectos periódicos y su daño depende del equipo. Demonología reduce la dependencia del equipo y genera mucha amenaza con el demonio desde Marca demoníaca, aunque tarda en arrancar y perder la mascota cuesta daño y tiempo. Destrucción remata al instante y destaca en mazmorras por su estallido, pero es la más lenta en solitario y Conflagrar consume Inmolar en la build individual.","text_en":"Affliction has little downtime, stays safe behind its demon, and can handle several enemies, but managing Fear and damage-over-time effects takes practice and its damage depends on gear. Demonology is less gear-dependent and its demon builds strong threat with Demonic Brand, but it starts slowly and losing the pet costs damage and time. Destruction has an instant finisher and strong dungeon burst, but levels slowest solo, and Conflagrate consumes Immolate in the solo build.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Demonology Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Destruction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling","class:warlock:demonology:leveling","class:warlock:destruction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1fd813698db91b3c574e8c0e2a23e65200da4f29","section:22e54acd4ccf47f910aa893925c606ac8b761d17","section:32d9f19f2afd10bd65c043644e6f85554b73b3fa","section:95090a3611a5ecfd15a311af75356522f3b882e1","section:ad387259f2abc78e6f718ae78d72c3859bb46f74","section:eb898b3d29358f0af7e4320583d8af78d3fcffc3"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-mejoras-campamento-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mejoras del campamento para subir","title_en":"Leveling Camp Buffs","summary_es":"Prioriza la tienda para experiencia de descanso y usa otras mejoras según tus necesidades.","summary_en":"Prioritize the tent for rested experience and choose other buffs for your needs.","keywords_es":["mejoras campamento leveo","tienda campamento experiencia descanso","pozo de maná Brujo","mejoras intelecto brujo"],"keywords_en":["leveling camp buffs","camp tent rested experience","warlock mana well","warlock intellect camp buff"],"text_es":"La Tienda de campamento aporta la mejora más importante para subir: más experiencia de descanso. Como apoyos opcionales, el Pozo de maná restaura maná cada 5 s, la Vela de incienso aumenta el Intelecto y el Equipo de primeros auxilios da Aguante para gastar más salud con Transfusión de vida; la Silla de campamento aporta Golpe crítico con hechizos, útil para los efectos periódicos.","text_en":"Camp Tent is the most important leveling camp feature because it increases rested experience. Optional support includes Mana Well, which restores mana every 5 seconds; Incense Candle, which adds Intellect; and First Aid Kit, which grants Stamina so you can spend more health on Life Tap. Camp Chair adds spell crit, which benefits damage-over-time effects.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Affliction Warlock DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:0ff0ca66bcb4231400cfcb8f42f50a6558078a1d"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-habilidades-demonio-detalle","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades de los demonios: cuáles usar","title_en":"Demon abilities: which to use","summary_es":"Bloqueo de hechizo, Beso calmante, Tormento, Sacrificio y más.","summary_en":"Spell Lock, Soothing Kiss, Torment, Sacrifice and more.","keywords_es":["beso calmante autocast","tormento abisario","paranoia manáfago","sacrificio abisario escudo","invisibilidad inferior súcubo"],"keywords_en":["soothing kiss autocast","torment voidwalker","paranoia felhunter","voidwalker sacrifice shield","lesser invisibility succubus"],"text_es":"Pon en tus atajos Bloqueo de hechizo, Devorar magia, Seducción y Consumir sombras en vez de dejarlas en la barra de la mascota. Beso calmante (súcubo) conviene en automático para que no robe enemigos al tanque. Tormento (abisario) se deja en automático solo si quieres que retenga al enemigo. Sacrificio mata al abisario y te da un escudo; mientras aguanta, el daño no interrumpe tus hechizos. Paranoia del manáfago consume maná de la mascota: apágala fuera de JcJ. Cambio de fase hace al diablillo inatacable salvo que ataque.","text_en":"Keybind Spell Lock, Devour Magic, Seduction and Consume Shadows instead of leaving them on the pet bar. Soothing Kiss (Succubus) is best on autocast so she does not pull mobs off the tank. Torment (Voidwalker) should be on autocast only when you want it holding a mob. Sacrifice kills the Voidwalker and gives you a shield; while it holds, damage cannot interrupt your casts. The Felhunter's Paranoia costs pet mana: turn it off outside PvP. Phase Shift makes the Imp unattackable unless it attacks.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Abilities Guide - Forever › Pet Abilities for Affliction Warlocks in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:b2e91890d3da7b6a7b81cfc0c4ae5b3c271548da"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-invocaciones-especiales","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Infernal, Ritual de condena y Piedra de alma","title_en":"Inferno, Ritual of Doom and Soulstone","summary_es":"Invocaciones especiales y utilidades de banda del Brujo.","summary_en":"Special summons and raid utilities of the Warlock.","keywords_es":["infernal brujo reactivo","ritual de condena guardia vil","subyugar demonio","piedra de alma resurrección","ritual de invocación cuántos"],"keywords_en":["warlock inferno reagent","ritual of doom doomguard","subjugate demon","soulstone resurrection","ritual of summoning how many"],"text_es":"Inferno invoca un Infernal que aturde en área y pelea por ti un tiempo limitado antes de perder el control; exige un reactivo y tiene mucho enfriamiento. Ritual de condena invoca un Guardia vil con otros cuatro del grupo: sacrifica a un participante al azar y debes subyugarlo enseguida con Subyugar demonio o se vuelve contra el grupo. Crear piedra de alma es, con Renacer del Druida, la única resurrección en combate. Ritual de invocación trae a un compañero con ayuda de otros dos. Ojo de Kilrogg es un ojo invisible para explorar.","text_en":"Inferno brings an Infernal that stuns nearby enemies and fights under your command until you lose control of it; it consumes a reagent and recharges slowly. Ritual of Doom summons a Doomguard with four other party members: it sacrifices a random participant and you must subjugate it immediately with Subjugate Demon or it turns on the group. Create Soulstone is, along with the Druid's Rebirth, the only battle resurrection. Ritual of Summoning brings a party member with help from two others. Eye of Kilrogg is an invisible eye for scouting.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Abilities Guide - Forever › Demons for Affliction Warlocks in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Affliction Warlock Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility Abilities for Affliction Warlocks in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:0dca83f80f537509e99a7fd41f618be172f8d3c0","section:7c13e57718a0ddb04dadfc60c80b04c72e72f5fe"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-encantamientos-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Brujo al subir","title_en":"Warlock enchants while leveling","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Brujo por hueco y nivel mientras subes.","summary_en":"What to enchant as a Warlock by slot and level while leveling.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo brujo","qué encantamientos pongo de brujo","encantamientos para brujo","encantamientos brujo","qué encantar brujo","complemento místico brujo","encantar collar poder con hechizos brujo","torso intelecto brujo"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a warlock","best enchants for warlock","warlock enchants","what to enchant warlock","mystic armor kit warlock","necklace spell power warlock","chest intellect warlock"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Brujo al subir: Arma: Encantar arma: revelación (si un hechizo que no es DoT no crítica, el siguiente tiene +100% de crítico) o, a dos manos, intelecto inferior (+5). Collar: poder con hechizos (+6). Brazales: poder de sanación menor o inferior (+3 y +6). Botas: velocidad menor. Guantes: velocidad menor (+1%), algo mejor que un complemento en Demonología y Destrucción. Complementos para armadura místicos (nivel 15, 30, 40 y 50; hasta +6 poder con hechizos) en torso, piernas, manos o pies: 1-19 medio, 20-39 pesado, 40-60 grueso y basto; superan al intelecto de torso.","text_en":"Warlock enchants while leveling: Weapon: Enchant Weapon - Revelation (when a non-DoT spell fails to crit, your next spell gets +100% Crit chance) or, two-hand, Lesser Intellect (+5). Neck: Spell Power (+6). Bracers: Minor or Lesser Healing Power (+3 and +6). Boots: Minor Speed. Gloves: Minor Haste (+1%), a bit better than a kit for Demonology and Destruction. Mystic Armor Kits (levels 15, 30, 40 and 50; up to +6 Spell Power) on chest, legs, hands or feet: 1-19 medium, 20-39 heavy, 40-60 thick and rugged; they beat chest Intellect.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Destruction Warlocks in WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever › Quick Picks by Level","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:enchants","class:warlock:demonology:enchants","class:warlock:destruction:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:96ef05f176a97eb9a9ab8c3f1663213d244a7cdd","section:9c35a8d9f283a0597b9654c1a3596a44bc509160","section:c71a7d741e9929ecfcc36088a4a1afdbe78f7af4","section:dd50c9f405cff34594d9401126d40b3085da82fc"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-encantamientos-60","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Brujo a nivel 60","title_en":"Warlock enchants at level 60","summary_es":"Mejoras de nivel 60 del Brujo: arma, guantes por escuela y Arcano de enfoque.","summary_en":"Level 60 Warlock upgrades: weapon, school gloves and Arcanum of Focus.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo brujo","qué encantamientos pongo de brujo","encantamientos para brujo","encantamientos brujo nivel 60","guantes poder de las Sombras brujo","guantes poder de Fuego brujo","arcano de enfoque brujo","qué encantar brujo destrucción"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a warlock","best enchants for warlock","warlock level 60 enchants","shadow power gloves warlock","fire power gloves warlock","arcanum of focus warlock","what to enchant destruction warlock"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Brujo a nivel 60 (Encantamiento 300): Arma: Encantar arma: poder con hechizos (+30) o, a dos manos, poder con hechizos poderoso (+55). Brazales: poder con hechizos superior (+16). Guantes según tu escuela: Encantar guantes: poder de las Sombras (Aflicción, +20 de daño de las Sombras) o poder de Fuego (Destrucción y a veces Demonología, +20 de daño de Fuego). Cabeza o piernas: Arcano de enfoque (+8 poder con hechizos, objeto de nivel 60; sale del Tratado sobre Enfoque en Dire Maul).","text_en":"Warlock enchants at level 60 (Enchanting 300): Weapon: Enchant Weapon - Spell Power (+30) or, two-hand, Mighty Spell Power (+55). Bracers: Greater Spellpower (+16 Spell Power). Gloves by school: Enchant Gloves - Shadow Power (Affliction, +20 Shadow damage) or Fire Power (Destruction and sometimes Demonology, +20 Fire damage). Head or legs: Arcanum of Focus (+8 Spell Power, level 60 item; from the Libram of Focus in Dire Maul).","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever › Level 60 Upgrades","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever › Level 60 Upgrades","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Destruction Warlocks in WoW: Forever › Level 60 Upgrades","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:enchants","class:warlock:demonology:enchants","class:warlock:destruction:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:4401aaf1cd230542f03930641f7bc4d906607521","section:cbdef02d46f05a835f5ab649fb649395138ef795","section:fad9e501915c86897772608523a3ef316610a7f2"]},{"id":"clase-warlock-consumibles","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles del Brujo: elixires, piedras y reglas","title_en":"Warlock consumables: elixirs, stones and rules","summary_es":"Elixires, piedras de hechizo y de fuego, pociones y qué se acumula para el Brujo.","summary_en":"Elixirs, spellstones, firestones, potions and what stacks for the Warlock.","keywords_es":["qué consumibles uso siendo brujo","qué consumibles uso de brujo","consumibles para brujo","qué elixires uso de brujo","consumibles brujo","piedra de hechizos brujo","pirorroca brujo","elixir de poder de las Sombras"],"keywords_en":["what consumables as a warlock","best consumables for warlock","warlock consumables","spellstone warlock","firestone warlock","elixir of shadow power","healthstone warlock","life tap mana"],"text_es":"Consumibles del Brujo: elixires, piedras y reglas: Consumibles del Brujo: Elixires por tramos: Elixir Arcano menor (1-19), Elixir Arcano inferior y Elixir de sangre de mago inferior (20-39), Elixir de poder de las Sombras, Elixir superior arcano y Poción de sangre de mago (40-60). Arma: aceite de zahorí y, además, Piedra de hechizos (o Pirorroca para Demonología); se acumulan. Los elixires se acumulan entre sí; una sola comida (Salmón al horno a nivel 40-60); las pociones comparten reutilización y las piedras de salud tienen la suya. Transfusión de vida cubre casi todo el maná al subir.","text_en":"Warlock consumables: elixirs, stones and rules: Elixirs by bracket: Minor Arcane Elixir (1-19), Lesser Arcane Elixir and Lesser Mageblood Elixir (20-39), Elixir of Shadow Power, Greater Arcane Elixir and Mageblood Elixir (40-60). Weapon: wizard oil plus a Spellstone (or Firestone for Demonology); they stack. Elixirs stack with each other; only one food (Baked Salmon at 40-60); potions share a cooldown and Healthstones have their own. Life Tap covers most of your mana while leveling: save mana potions for long fights and dungeons.","tags":["WARLOCK"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Affliction Warlocks in WoW: Forever › Best Affliction Warlock Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Demonology Warlocks in WoW: Forever › Best Demonology Warlock Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Enchants & Consumables for Destruction Warlocks in WoW: Forever › Best Destruction Warlock Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:warlock:affliction:enchants","class:warlock:demonology:enchants","class:warlock:destruction:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:16bcfbb616d9b19b35ac270dc54de51fdf9809b5","section:6dedc507fbce2ab3acb88c4147e2cc1ceef0b3e6","section:d56c28d752c7a00923bdc530407729ddecde6e26"]}]},"04-clase-warrior.json":{"description":"Capítulo 4: Clases. Guerrero. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"clase-warrior-que-hace","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué hace un Guerrero","title_en":"What a Warrior Does","summary_es":"El Guerrero combate cuerpo a cuerpo, gasta furia y puede hacer daño o tanquear.","summary_en":"Warrior fights in melee, spends Rage, and can deal damage or tank.","keywords_es":["qué hace un guerrero","guerrero daño o tanque","cómo funciona el guerrero","guerrero cuerpo a cuerpo","grito de guerra"],"keywords_en":["what does a warrior do","warrior damage or tank","how does warrior work","warrior melee class","battle shout"],"text_es":"El Guerrero combate cuerpo a cuerpo y usa furia para ejecutar sus facultades. Puede especializarse en hacer daño o tanquear; Grito de guerra y Hender armadura ayudan al daño físico del grupo. Sus tres especializaciones cubren el arma a dos manos, la doble empuñadura y el tanque con escudo.","text_en":"Warrior fights in melee and spends Rage on its abilities. It can specialize in dealing damage or tanking; Battle Shout and Sunder Armor support the group's physical damage. Its three specializations cover two-handed weapons, dual wielding, and shield tanking.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warrior Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warrior in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:general:warrior-class-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:e6f2064724d7c518d632e82dea9d11d4281d5b56"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-especializaciones","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones del Guerrero","title_en":"Warrior Specializations","summary_es":"Armas lucha con dos manos; Furia empuña dos armas; Protección tanquea con escudo.","summary_en":"Arms fights two-handed; Fury dual-wields; Protection tanks with a shield.","keywords_es":["especializaciones del guerrero","guerrero armas furia protección","guerrero con escudo","guerrero dos armas","qué especialización elegir"],"keywords_en":["warrior specializations","warrior arms fury protection","warrior with shield","warrior dual wield","which warrior spec"],"text_es":"Armas pelea con un arma a dos manos y combina golpes potentes con hemorragias y activaciones de Abrumar; Golpes de barrido favorece los combates contra dos enemigos. Furia empuña dos armas y destaca contra pocos objetivos con Mellar y Huracán, aunque sufre en combates prolongados contra uno. Protección usa espada y escudo para tanquear y aplicar potentes perjuicios.","text_en":"Arms fights with a two-handed weapon, combining heavy attacks with bleeds and Overpower procs; Sweeping Strikes helps against two enemies. Fury dual-wields and excels against a few targets with Cleave and Whirlwind, but struggles in prolonged single-target fights. Protection uses sword and shield to tank and apply powerful debuffs.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warrior Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warrior in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Arms Warrior in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Arms Warrior in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Fury Warriors in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview","class:warrior:fury:overview","class:warrior:general:warrior-class-overview","class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:45f42514601b5b2f27a9cbe823095945f92d0a75","section:4c249d48afa3e1ebfaf913f80a148d06d0ca8685","section:7c4a5a6fdfe1f929e9ba564eff3004e1bf543f92","section:b601b7a7c59b51284dbe2bc25a9030cbf6800a01","section:e6f2064724d7c518d632e82dea9d11d4281d5b56"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia y autoataques en Forever","title_en":"Rage and Auto-attacks in Forever","summary_es":"Los críticos dan furia adicional y los fallos no generan furia.","summary_en":"Critical hits generate extra Rage, while misses generate none.","keywords_es":["furia del guerrero","furia por autoataques","crítico y furia","fallo de ataque","furia al recibir daño"],"keywords_en":["warrior rage","auto-attack rage","critical hit rage","missed attack","rage from damage taken"],"text_es":"En Forever, la furia de los autoataques está normalizada: hacer más daño con un golpe no aumenta por sí solo la furia que genera. Los autoataques críticos generan el doble y los fallidos no generan nada. Mantén entrenada la habilidad del arma para reducir fallos; la furia por daño recibido no disminuye por llevar equipo que lo mitigue o absorba.","text_en":"Auto-attack Rage is normalized: dealing more damage with a swing does not by itself increase the Rage it generates. Critical auto-attacks generate double Rage, while misses generate none. Keep your weapon skill trained to reduce misses; Rage from incoming damage is not reduced by gear that mitigates or absorbs it.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Protection Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:013a89de454282218e0589804a7d6057e60b2459","section:0775d05837dca6535518349d4ee13f453a6c86b8","section:e995767953b72c764ea6dd9e79cc923aacb64134"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-armadura","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas y equipo al subir","title_en":"Weapons and Gear While Leveling","summary_es":"Armas usa un arma a dos manos; Furia necesita dos y Protección aprovecha el escudo.","summary_en":"Arms uses a two-hander, Fury needs two weapons, and Protection benefits from a shield.","keywords_es":["armas del guerrero","arma a dos manos","doble empuñadura guerrero","escudo para protección","mejorar arma al subir"],"keywords_en":["warrior weapons","two-handed weapon","warrior dual wield","protection shield","weapon upgrades while leveling"],"text_es":"Armas se centra en un arma a dos manos; Maestro de armas permite aprovechar hachas, espadas, mazas, armas de asta y bastones. Depende mucho del daño del arma, así que busca mejoras con frecuencia. Furia desbloquea la doble empuñadura a nivel 20 y depende de actualizar ambas armas. Protección pelea con escudo y usa facultades defensivas; el entrenamiento con placas llega a nivel 40.","text_en":"Arms focuses on a two-handed weapon; Weaponmaster can benefit from axes, swords, maces, polearms, and staves. It relies heavily on weapon damage, so look for upgrades often. Fury unlocks dual wield at level 20 and depends on keeping both weapons current. Protection fights with a shield and uses defensive abilities; Plate Armor training becomes available at level 40.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","guide:baf6ab9f1243adfa8aac49ced45104e22290f803","section:914fe68c6a13605373012e0c0071db0725195aab","section:b85595a9798bbd357d92bde3973597e58262b7c4","section:cd2bb478ad28c47ef109a76e587c4be7f3eb8ce3"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-subir-espec","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especialización para subir","title_en":"Specialization for Leveling","summary_es":"Protección destaca por su aguante; Armas depende del equipo y Furia requiere dos armas.","summary_en":"Protection stands out for durability; Arms relies on gear and Fury needs two weapons.","keywords_es":["mejor especialización para subir guerrero","protección para subir","armas para subir","furia para subir","elegir especialización guerrero"],"keywords_en":["best warrior leveling spec","protection leveling","arms leveling","fury leveling","choose warrior specialization"],"text_es":"Protección es la opción más llevadera para muchos: escudo y Revancha ayudan contra varios enemigos; sus talentos también generan furia al bloquear, esquivar o parar. La ruta profunda de Protección ofrece un estilo relajado. Armas es buena alternativa si prefieres un arma a dos manos y destaca en grupo, aunque depende del equipo y sufre contra varios enemigos. Furia da buen daño a dos objetivos, aunque necesita dos armas y los fallos pueden dejarla sin furia.","text_en":"Protection is the more manageable choice for many: its shield and Revenge help against several enemies, and its talents also generate Rage when blocking, dodging, or parrying. Deep Protection offers a more relaxed style. Arms is a good alternative if you prefer a two-handed weapon and excels in groups, though it relies on gear and struggles against several enemies. Fury deals good two-target damage but needs two weapons, and misses can leave it short on Rage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Viability for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling as a Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Pros","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Cons","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Guide","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:15c6fc0284f09ccbd836683986e81dee9e9c5977","section:19250d3558329b68117fd796f4a08b24e8c224e8","section:341d8ea89c1c009dd102d64ca06b19952aac0795","section:84fe82acf132633997a33a0a47596e096cd9a780","section:8b8bef9304c8d146945b3cd66c7ed0f61e9eb46e","section:a131ffc0286822744e43f8d04950e1295481c5a3","section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe","section:b85595a9798bbd357d92bde3973597e58262b7c4","section:ee48a1345e67bf2a6c80b1d1c0cb273a6e721914","section:f36370189c35ee9903e9c97168482bbcc22d5a3d"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-talentos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de talentos al subir","title_en":"Leveling Talent Priorities","summary_es":"Protección prioriza Especialización en escudos, Revancha mejorada y Maestro de defensa.","summary_en":"Protection prioritizes Shield Specialization, Improved Revenge, and Master of Defense.","keywords_es":["talentos para subir guerrero","ruta de talentos protección","especialización en escudos","revancha mejorada","maestro de defensa"],"keywords_en":["warrior leveling talents","protection talent path","shield specialization","improved revenge","master of defense"],"text_es":"Protección: 10-14 Especialización en escudos 5/5; 15-17 Revancha mejorada 3/3; 20-21 Maestro de defensa 2/2; 23 Última posición 1/1; 24, 29 y 34 Desafío 3/3 para mazmorras; 25 Vanguardia 1/1 permite Embestir sin cambiar de actitud; 30-32 Ira enfocada 3/3; 33 Golpe de concusión 1/1. Sin mazmorras, cambia Desafío por Sanguinario mejorado 2/2 y Muro de escudo mejorado 2/2.","text_en":"Protection: 10-14 Shield Specialization 5/5; 15-17 Improved Revenge 3/3; 20-21 Master of Defense 2/2; 23 Last Stand 1/1; 24, 29, and 34 Defiance 3/3 for dungeons; 25 Vanguard 1/1 lets you Charge without changing stances; 30-32 Focused Rage 3/3; 33 Concussion Blow 1/1. If you skip dungeons, swap Defiance for Improved Bloodrage 2/2 and Improved Shield Wall 2/2.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe","section:cd2bb478ad28c47ef109a76e587c4be7f3eb8ce3","section:f36370189c35ee9903e9c97168482bbcc22d5a3d"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-hitos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de habilidades al subir","title_en":"Leveling Ability Milestones","summary_es":"A nivel 20 llegan Embate y Ataque de la victoria; a 30, Actitud rabiosa; a 40, ataques clave.","summary_en":"Slam and Victory Rush arrive at 20; Berserker Stance at 30; key attacks at 40.","keywords_es":["hitos del guerrero","habilidades por nivel guerrero","nivel de Revancha","nivel de Huracán","nivel de Golpe mortal"],"keywords_en":["warrior milestones","warrior abilities by level","Revenge level","Whirlwind level","Mortal Strike level"],"text_es":"A nivel 10, la misión de clase da Actitud defensiva, Irritar y Hender armadura; a 12, Abrumar y Azote de escudo; a 14, Revancha y Maestría táctica; a 16, Bloquear con escudo. A 20 llegan Embate, Ataque de la victoria y Represalias; Furia desbloquea la doble empuñadura. A 30, la misión da Actitud rabiosa y se obtienen Interceptar e Ira rabiosa; Armas puede tener Golpes de barrido con su build. Huracán llega a 36, Zurrar a 38 y, a 40, Armas aprende Golpe mortal, Furia Sed de sangre y Protección Embate con escudo; también se entrenan placas.","text_en":"At level 10, the class quest grants Defensive Stance, Taunt, and Sunder Armor; at 12, Overpower and Shield Bash; at 14, Revenge and Tactical Mastery; at 16, Shield Block. Slam, Victory Rush, and Retaliation arrive at 20; Fury unlocks dual wield. At 30, the class quest grants Berserker Stance, alongside Intercept and Berserker Rage; the Arms build can have Sweeping Strikes. Whirlwind comes at 36, Pummel at 38, and at 40 Arms learns Mortal Strike, Fury learns Bloodthirst, and Protection learns Shield Slam; Plate Armor training is also available.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Arms Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Protection Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:5ce00d93595f1847fe9bc8701d47bbb805d3e581","guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","guide:baf6ab9f1243adfa8aac49ced45104e22290f803","section:2c64089c5c27f6503e330b5d26e9956ec7aa80cb","section:48ce2da4d26adbe9f5e2474761e99d0cff01d95c","section:91e6054df3a6e6bb797bc953f8dc6aea6292b7ee"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-mision-clase","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"La misión de clase de nivel 10","title_en":"The Level 10 Class Quest","summary_es":"A nivel 10, la misión de clase desbloquea Actitud defensiva, Irritar y Hender armadura.","summary_en":"At level 10, the class quest unlocks Defensive Stance, Taunt, and Sunder Armor.","keywords_es":["misión de clase guerrero","misión de nivel 10 guerrero","actitud defensiva","desbloquear irritar","hender armadura"],"keywords_en":["warrior class quest","level 10 warrior quest","defensive stance","unlock taunt","sunder armor"],"text_es":"Las misiones de Guerrero de nivel 10 varían según la raza. Entre ellas están Bartleby, el borracho, Vence a Bartleby y La jarra de Bartleby; también Camino de defensa. En la mayoría se obtienen Actitud defensiva, Irritar y Hender armadura, herramientas para empezar a tanquear; la recompensa del Cielonato es distinta. Completa la misión antes de ir a una mazmorra para tener tu postura defensiva.","text_en":"Level 10 Warrior quests vary by race. They include Bartleby the Drunk, Beat Bartleby, and Bartleby's Mug; Path of Defense is another. Most grant Defensive Stance, Taunt, and Sunder Armor, tools for beginning to tank; the Skyborne reward differs. Complete the quest before entering a dungeon so you have your defensive stance.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Warrior Class Quest Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Human Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Dwarf and Gnome Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Night Elf Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Orc, Troll and Tauren Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Undead Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Skyborne Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:general:warrior-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:30482ad54cb34be7a694c19ce95893be9cc967c8","section:51857bde8e99e4f74153998c0818f9ab397b6abe","section:a520c5c6a0e6bd11cb495b4bf5bbfab4daf3d014","section:ceee286bb7d13fb1731f6eedd34f658f5a43f123","section:cf04eca6554699ceaa657e09d3299029db8c0460","section:d9dc740b72050adf1c947476c3d8cba4145261f8","section:ebf1a34cd2e26c2f6773904572dae61c652a571a"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-misiones-nivel-20","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de armadura de nivel 20","title_en":"Level 20 Armor Quests","summary_es":"Las cadenas de nivel 20 dan escudo y piezas de armadura; la malla completa pide una mazmorra.","summary_en":"The level 20 chains give a shield and armor pieces; the full chestpiece needs a dungeon.","keywords_es":["misiones de armadura guerrero","misión de nivel 20 guerrero","armadura de mallas endurecida con fuego","armadura brutal","escudo de misión"],"keywords_en":["warrior armor quests","level 20 warrior quest","fire hardened mail","brutal armor","quest shield"],"text_es":"A nivel 20, las cadenas de la Alianza y la Horda entregan un escudo al principio: Favor de Furen y Bastión de Ruga, respectivamente. Las misiones Armadura de mallas endurecida con fuego y Armadura brutal requieren materiales y una mazmorra; puedes reunirlos mientras subes y terminar la cadena con un grupo más adelante. También hay encargos opcionales para piezas de cabeza, manos y piernas.","text_en":"At level 20, the Alliance and Horde chains give a shield near the start: Furen's Favor and Ruga's Bulwark, respectively. The quests Fire Hardened Mail and Brutal Armor require materials and a dungeon; you can gather them while leveling and finish the chain with a group later. Optional follow-ups also offer head, hand, and leg pieces.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Shared Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:general:warrior-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:1080ed6271ea0c6efdc91a2d171c39fe0ce28cd1"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-misiones-nivel-30","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de nivel 30: actitud y arma","title_en":"Level 30 Quests: Stance and Weapon","summary_es":"La misión de arena da Actitud rabiosa; la cadena opcional ofrece un arma de dos manos.","summary_en":"The arena quest grants Berserker Stance; the optional chain offers a two-handed weapon.","keywords_es":["misión de nivel 30 guerrero","actitud rabiosa","misión de arena guerrero","cadena de arma de dos manos","misiones de clase nivel 30"],"keywords_en":["level 30 warrior quest","berserker stance","the affray","whirlwind weapon","warrior class quests"],"text_es":"A nivel 30, La Reyerta desbloquea Actitud rabiosa. Después, El Cazavientos abre la cadena opcional del arma torbellino, que termina con un élite de nivel 40 y permite elegir Hacha espirálica, Espada espirálica o Martillo de guerra espirálico. Puedes pedir ayuda para el combate final o esperar a tener más nivel.","text_en":"At level 30, The Affray unlocks Berserker Stance. The Windwatcher then opens the optional Whirlwind weapon questline, which ends with a level 40 elite and lets you choose Whirlwind Axe, Whirlwind Sword, or Whirlwind Warhammer. Bring help for the final fight or wait until you are a higher level.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Warrior Class Quests Guide › Shared Warrior Class Quests","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-quests","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:general:warrior-class-quests"],"source_hashes":["section:1080ed6271ea0c6efdc91a2d171c39fe0ce28cd1"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-gestion-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Generar y reservar furia","title_en":"Generate and Pool Rage","summary_es":"Reserva furia para el siguiente combate; Golpe heroico y Mellar sacrifican la furia del autoataque.","summary_en":"Save Rage for the next fight; Heroic Strike and Cleave forfeit auto-attack Rage.","keywords_es":["cómo generar furia","reservar furia guerrero","furia entre combates","golpe heroico furia","mellar furia"],"keywords_en":["generate Rage","pool warrior Rage","Rage between fights","Heroic Strike Rage","Cleave Rage"],"text_es":"La furia va de 0 a 100: autoataques, daño recibido, Embestir y Sanguinario la generan. No se rellena esperando y empieza a decaer al terminar el combate. Reserva parte para abrir el siguiente o pagar una facultad importante. Golpe heroico y Mellar reemplazan el siguiente autoataque, que así no genera su furia habitual; úsalos cuando sobre recurso. Control de furia ralentiza el decaimiento, e Ira persistente lo retrasa si la build la incluye.","text_en":"Rage ranges from 0 to 100: auto-attacks, incoming damage, Charge, and Bloodrage generate it. It does not refill while waiting and starts to decay after combat. Save some for the next pull or an important ability. Heroic Strike and Cleave replace the next auto-attack, so that swing generates no normal Rage; use them when you have extra. Anger Management slows decay, and Lingering Rage delays it if your build includes the talent.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation > Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Arms Warrior DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Protection Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","section:013a89de454282218e0589804a7d6057e60b2459","section:11f3d5bcbe6b40ef73886ccc0c7b8535f00a20d2","section:71c80ce73e7da9c3913b8f0970220892c41b1479","section:e995767953b72c764ea6dd9e79cc923aacb64134"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-actitudes","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Actitudes del Guerrero","title_en":"Warrior Stances","summary_es":"Batalla sirve a Armas; Rabiosa habilita facultades ofensivas y Defensiva ayuda a sobrevivir.","summary_en":"Battle supports Arms; Berserker enables offensive abilities, while Defensive helps you survive.","keywords_es":["actitudes del guerrero","actitud de batalla","actitud rabiosa","actitud defensiva","cambiar de actitud"],"keywords_en":["warrior stances","Battle Stance","Berserker Stance","Defensive Stance","stance swapping"],"text_es":"Armas pelea sobre todo en Actitud de batalla, necesaria para Embestir, Desgarrar, Abrumar, Golpes de barrido, Lanzazo, Golpe mortal y Embate. Actitud rabiosa suma un 3% de golpe crítico, pero aumenta un 10% el daño recibido; permite Interceptar, Ira rabiosa, Huracán y Zurrar. Actitud defensiva reduce un 10% el daño infligido y recibido, aumenta la amenaza y habilita Irritar y Desactivar. Cambiar de actitud descarta la furia por encima del límite de Maestría táctica.","text_en":"Arms mostly fights in Battle Stance, required for Charge, Rend, Overpower, Sweeping Strikes, Spearing Strike, Mortal Strike, and Slam. Berserker Stance adds 3% Critical Strike Chance but increases damage taken by 10%; it enables Intercept, Berserker Rage, Whirlwind, and Pummel. Defensive Stance reduces damage dealt and taken by 10%, increases threat, and enables Taunt and Disarm. Changing stances discards Rage above the Tactical Mastery limit.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation > FAQ How Do Warrior Stances Work?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Protection Warrior Leveling Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","section:013a89de454282218e0589804a7d6057e60b2459","section:e995767953b72c764ea6dd9e79cc923aacb64134"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-rotacion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridades de combate al subir","title_en":"Leveling Combat Priorities","summary_es":"Prioriza ataques según la especialización y guarda furia para las facultades principales.","summary_en":"Prioritize attacks by specialization and save Rage for core abilities.","keywords_es":["rotación de guerrero para subir","prioridad de habilidades","rotación Armas","rotación Furia","rotación Protección"],"keywords_en":["warrior leveling rotation","ability priority","Arms rotation","Fury rotation","Protection rotation"],"text_es":"Armas (Embate mejorado 2/2, Golpe mortal 1/1): Embestir, Grito de guerra; Ataque de la victoria si falta salud; Grito desmoralizador pronto; Desgarrar si el enemigo vivirá, Abrumar al activarse y luego Golpe mortal (desde 40) y Embate (desde 20); prioriza Lanzazo contra gigantes y dragonantes. Furia (Sed de sangre 1/1): Golpes temerarios si superas el 30% de salud, Sed de sangre, Ataque de la victoria y Abrumar; Huracán en grupos. Protección (Embate con escudo 1/1): Bloquear con escudo, Revancha y Embate con escudo; mantén Trueno y gritos en grupo.","text_en":"Arms (Improved Slam 2/2, Mortal Strike 1/1): Charge, Battle Shout; Victory Rush if health is missing; Demoralizing Shout early; Rend if the enemy will live, Overpower when it activates, then Mortal Strike (from 40) and Slam (from 20); prioritize Spearing Strike against Giants and Dragonkin. Fury (Bloodthirst 1/1): use Reckless Swings above 30% health, then Bloodthirst, Victory Rush, and Overpower; Whirlwind on packs. Protection (Shield Slam 1/1): Shield Block, Revenge, and Shield Slam; maintain Thunder Clap and Shouts in groups.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Arms Warrior DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Arms Warrior Leveling Rotation > Single-Target Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Single Target Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Arms Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","guide:969650dd594ecf165b52b59987abf4407320f7da","section:11f3d5bcbe6b40ef73886ccc0c7b8535f00a20d2","section:173e0f59a81fa77a5e06fcf57a33d6f5baab9c23","section:60912d4380d6d5944b83c7f828b03ad767e7af08","section:71c80ce73e7da9c3913b8f0970220892c41b1479","section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe","section:cd2bb478ad28c47ef109a76e587c4be7f3eb8ce3","section:dd7ba003c5e6818f2bde2adf5fc132f4f296978c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Daño contra varios enemigos","title_en":"Damage Against Multiple Enemies","summary_es":"Armas aprovecha Golpes de barrido; Furia usa Huracán y Protección empieza con Trueno.","summary_en":"Arms uses Sweeping Strikes; Fury uses Whirlwind and Protection opens with Thunder Clap.","keywords_es":["guerrero daño en área","varios enemigos guerrero","golpes de barrido","Mellar y Huracán","Trueno protección"],"keywords_en":["warrior area damage","multiple enemies warrior","Sweeping Strikes","Cleave and Whirlwind","Protection Thunder Clap"],"text_es":"Armas puede guardar furia y combinar Golpes de barrido 1/1 para alcanzar a un segundo enemigo con Golpe mortal y Mellar; el daño a varios enemigos cuesta mucha furia. Furia usa Golpes temerarios si supera el 30% de salud, Huracán y añade Mellar cuando puede pagarlo. Protección usa Trueno para ralentizar los ataques, activa Bloquear con escudo y luego usa Revancha; Embate con escudo 1/1 también es prioritario si se ha aprendido, y Represalias ayuda contra varios atacantes.","text_en":"Arms can pool Rage and use Sweeping Strikes 1/1 to hit a second enemy with Mortal Strike and Cleave; its multi-target damage costs a lot of Rage. Fury uses Reckless Swings above 30% health, Whirlwind, and adds Cleave when affordable. Protection uses Thunder Clap to slow enemy attacks, then Shield Block and Revenge; Shield Slam 1/1 is also a priority if learned, and Retaliation helps against several attackers.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Arms Warrior DPS in Burning Crusade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Rotation for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Rotation for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Protection Warrior Leveling Rotation > AoE Rotation","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Arms Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:5ce00d93595f1847fe9bc8701d47bbb805d3e581","guide:969650dd594ecf165b52b59987abf4407320f7da","section:11f3d5bcbe6b40ef73886ccc0c7b8535f00a20d2","section:65cdbc0282a9e192365c4bb6f95957447ac8e5af","section:71c80ce73e7da9c3913b8f0970220892c41b1479","section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe","section:cd2bb478ad28c47ef109a76e587c4be7f3eb8ce3","section:dd7ba003c5e6818f2bde2adf5fc132f4f296978c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-control","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Interrumpir y controlar enemigos","title_en":"Interrupt and Control Enemies","summary_es":"Azote de escudo interrumpe desde 12; Zurrar llega a 38 y requiere Actitud rabiosa.","summary_en":"Shield Bash interrupts from 12; Pummel arrives at 38 and requires Berserker Stance.","keywords_es":["interrumpir con guerrero","Azote de escudo","Zurrar nivel 38","Seccionar","Grito intimidador"],"keywords_en":["Warrior interrupt","Shield Bash","Pummel level 38","Hamstring","Intimidating Shout"],"text_es":"Azote de escudo, disponible a nivel 12, necesita escudo y sirve en Actitud de batalla o Actitud defensiva; conserva furia para interrumpir antes de gastarla. Zurrar, disponible a 38, cuesta 10 de furia y exige Actitud rabiosa. Seccionar ralentiza a quien huye, Desactivar reduce el daño de algunos enemigos armados y Grito intimidador puede abrir una oportunidad para escapar; el daño puede romper su efecto sobre el objetivo principal.","text_en":"Shield Bash, available at level 12, requires a shield and works in Battle or Defensive Stance; save Rage for an interrupt before spending it. Pummel, available at 38, costs 10 Rage and requires Berserker Stance. Hamstring slows a fleeing enemy, Disarm reduces the damage of some armed enemies, and Intimidating Shout can create a chance to escape; damage can break its effect on the main target.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Arms Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Arms Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Abilities to Train for Protection Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Important Abilities > Utility and Crowd Control","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e76df9ec6765aca0de4cb9efcdd8cbfa15cc14f","section:1c25e003ba1bffe75d7fee38f86dd473b2f6a332","section:48ce2da4d26adbe9f5e2474761e99d0cff01d95c","section:91e6054df3a6e6bb797bc953f8dc6aea6292b7ee"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-tips-subir","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para subir","title_en":"Leveling Tips","summary_es":"Prioriza armas actualizadas, comida con experiencia extra y profesiones que aporten recursos.","summary_en":"Prioritize current weapons, food with bonus experience, and useful gathering or crafting professions.","keywords_es":["consejos para subir guerrero","comida para experiencia","profesiones del guerrero","mejorar armas","consumibles para subir"],"keywords_en":["warrior leveling tips","experience food","warrior professions","weapon upgrades","leveling consumables"],"text_es":"Mejora el arma y entrena su habilidad y los nuevos rangos de Grito de guerra, Desgarrar, Revancha y Golpe mortal. La comida de Forever da un 5% de experiencia por muertes; Ataque de la victoria y las vendas ayudan a recuperarte, y lleva pociones de curación para emergencias. Minería combina con Herrería para fabricar equipo; Botánica con Alquimia surte consumibles y Primeros auxilios permite usar vendas y pociones. Descansa en una posada al cerrar sesión y recupérate antes de otro combate. En grupo, recoge las misiones de mazmorra: la experiencia está en ellas, no en sus enemigos.","text_en":"Upgrade your weapon, train its skill, and learn new ranks of Battle Shout, Rend, Revenge, and Mortal Strike. Forever food gives 5% experience from kills; Victory Rush and bandages help you recover, and carry healing potions for emergencies. Mining pairs with Blacksmithing for gear; Herbalism and Alchemy supply consumables, while First Aid provides bandages and potions. Log out in an inn and recover before another fight. In groups, collect dungeon quests: experience comes from those quests, not the dungeon mobs.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Arms Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Leveling Tips for Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Leveling Guide › Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Tips","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:5ce00d93595f1847fe9bc8701d47bbb805d3e581","section:0775d05837dca6535518349d4ee13f453a6c86b8","section:1a716c4566656006960e01f51bc5699dd9310cfa","section:27e90d55933440b4e9b3bb6d36b9d24ef6249359","section:2be53e9134d496ec923f26ce2c14265f594f7397","section:65cdbc0282a9e192365c4bb6f95957447ac8e5af","section:99409b757ee9c64b29cac2b01d826c01bbec3778","section:9c4abde0ae7ee8a3e6258cb6391a461987773f71","section:e08f7247b85ce6c3d15263348a981da09455f27b","section:f2dc3dd24950c1a7f8f919b2f0563c5006720044"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-grupo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Guerrero en grupo y mazmorras","title_en":"Warrior in Groups and Dungeons","summary_es":"Apoya con Grito de guerra y Hender armadura, interrumpe y, si hace falta, cambia a escudo.","summary_en":"Support with Battle Shout and Sunder Armor, interrupt, and switch to a shield if needed.","keywords_es":["guerrero en grupo","guerrero en mazmorras","apoyo del guerrero","guerrero tanque de emergencia","amenaza en grupo"],"keywords_en":["warrior in groups","warrior in dungeons","warrior group support","emergency tank warrior","group threat"],"text_es":"Grito de guerra y Hender armadura apoyan el daño físico del grupo. Protección destaca como tanque principal, con perjuicios potentes como Trueno y Grito desmoralizador, y mucha amenaza inicial de Embate con escudo. Azote de escudo interrumpe sin salir de Actitud defensiva; Irritar y Grito desafiante ayudan a recuperar enemigos si el combate se desordena. Armas y Furia pueden equipar un escudo para cubrir a un enemigo en una emergencia, aunque carecen de las herramientas de amenaza y furia de Protección.","text_en":"Battle Shout and Sunder Armor support the group's physical damage. Protection excels as a main tank, with powerful debuffs such as Thunder Clap and Demoralizing Shout, plus high snap threat from Shield Slam. Shield Bash interrupts without leaving Defensive Stance; Taunt and Challenging Shout help recover enemies when a fight goes wrong. Arms and Fury can equip a shield to cover an enemy in an emergency, but lack Protection's threat and Rage tools.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warrior Class Guide › Comprehensive Guide to Warrior in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/warrior-class-overview","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Arms Warrior Guide › Arms Warrior Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/arms-warrior-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Guide › Fury Warrior Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-melee-dps-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Guide › Protection Warrior Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-tank-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Viability of Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview","class:warrior:fury:overview","class:warrior:general:warrior-class-overview","class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:11eb2cbc57cacd353c1c0f6d757414126745a6bc","section:6617c74babb4ae1d4c935cf916c5adf5b020009d","section:b601b7a7c59b51284dbe2bc25a9030cbf6800a01","section:e6f2064724d7c518d632e82dea9d11d4281d5b56","section:f7711b113329381caf8bf53cbeb12a5e154c2d10"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: daño con arma a dos manos","title_en":"Arms: Two-Handed Damage","summary_es":"Armas combina Golpe mortal, Embate y Abrumar; destaca contra dos enemigos con Golpes de barrido.","summary_en":"Arms combines Mortal Strike, Slam, and Overpower; it excels against two enemies with Sweeping Strikes.","keywords_es":["guerrero armas","guerrero arma a dos manos","golpe mortal","golpes de barrido","daño con armas"],"keywords_en":["arms warrior","warrior two handed","mortal strike","sweeping strikes","arms damage"],"text_es":"Armas pelea con un arma a dos manos. Mantén Desgarrar y organiza Golpe mortal, Abrumar y Embate según estén disponibles; Golpe heroico sirve de relleno si sobra furia. Para el daño en área, guarda furia y combina Golpes de barrido con los ataques principales; Mellar y Huracán añaden daño contra grupos mayores. Destaca contra dos enemigos, pero puede quedarse sin furia si sus golpes fallan o los paran.","text_en":"Arms fights with a two-handed weapon. Keep Rend active and fit Mortal Strike, Overpower, and Slam around their availability; Heroic Strike is a filler when Rage allows. For area damage, pool Rage and combine Sweeping Strikes with your main attacks; Cleave and Whirlwind add damage against larger groups. Arms excels against two enemies, but can run short on Rage when attacks miss or are parried.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Arms Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Arms Warrior  in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Arms Warrior in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview","class:warrior:arms:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:0c70116265461cda8340e2ffb2c8b3f769e409c9","section:45f42514601b5b2f27a9cbe823095945f92d0a75","section:532975479cc58ee984311a2f966d8e5fa76013bc"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: daño con dos armas","title_en":"Fury: Dual-Wield Damage","summary_es":"Furia usa Sed de sangre y Huracán, acelera sus golpes con críticos y sufre más fallos con dos armas.","summary_en":"Fury uses Bloodthirst and Whirlwind, speeds up with critical hits, and suffers more misses with two weapons.","keywords_es":["guerrero furia","guerrero dos armas","sed de sangre","huracán furia","daño furia"],"keywords_en":["fury warrior","warrior dual wield","bloodthirst","fury whirlwind","fury damage"],"text_es":"Furia empuña dos armas y centra su daño en Sed de sangre y Huracán; Mellar ayuda contra grupos pequeños. Los críticos activan Aluvión y aceleran los ataques, pero no dan furia adicional: esta se normaliza y ya no escala con el daño del arma. Deseo de la Muerte da una ventana de daño alto a cambio de recibir más daño. Los fallos de la doble empuñadura pueden dejarte esperando furia; sufre en combates largos contra uno si recibes pocos golpes.","text_en":"Fury dual-wields and builds its damage around Bloodthirst and Whirlwind; Cleave helps against small groups. Critical hits activate Flurry and speed up attacks, but grant no extra Rage: Rage is normalized and no longer scales with weapon damage. Death Wish provides a burst window at the cost of taking more damage. Dual-wield misses can leave you waiting for Rage; Fury struggles in long single-target fights when little damage is incoming.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Fury Warrior in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best PvE Rotation for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior - Spec, Builds, and Talents › Bloodthirst Dual Wield Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-melee-dps-pve-spec-builds-talents","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Strengths and Weaknesses of Fury Warriors in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:overview","class:warrior:fury:rotation","class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:4df882c92a2e87e0bd554ee080418c8cf0409ea6","section:525edb75d9da8ac214dddf6ad77a7bfda9ef3b57","section:6e3ca74abc16c1df80663f7ba1fd31a8167f9d4d","section:7c4a5a6fdfe1f929e9ba564eff3004e1bf543f92","section:b7bca2ae0c7f74df9db2d5d801391942976b4ae4"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: tanque con escudo","title_en":"Protection: Shield Tank","summary_es":"Protección genera amenaza con Embate con escudo y Revancha, y convierte bloqueos, esquivas y paradas en furia.","summary_en":"Protection builds threat with Shield Slam and Revenge, and turns blocks, dodges, and parries into Rage.","keywords_es":["guerrero protección","guerrero tanque","embate con escudo","revancha","tanque con escudo"],"keywords_en":["protection warrior","warrior tank","shield slam","revenge","shield tank"],"text_es":"Protección tanquea con escudo: Embate con escudo genera mucha amenaza inicial y Revancha combina daño y amenaza; Bloquear con escudo reduce el daño recibido y los bloqueos, esquivas y paradas generan furia. Trueno se puede usar en Actitud defensiva, afecta hasta 4 enemigos, reduce su velocidad de ataque un 20% y tiene 6 s de reutilización. Desafío y la actitud defensiva refuerzan la amenaza; Irritar y Grito desafiante ayudan a recuperar enemigos. Sin ataques recibidos, escasean la furia y la amenaza.","text_en":"Protection tanks with a shield: Shield Slam creates high snap threat, while Revenge deals damage and builds threat; Shield Block reduces incoming damage, and blocks, dodges, and parries generate Rage. Thunder Clap can be used in Defensive Stance, affects up to 4 enemies, slows their attack speed by 20%, and has a 6-second cooldown. Defiance and Defensive Stance boost threat; Taunt and Challenging Shout help recover enemies. Without incoming attacks, Rage and threat run short.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Protection Warrior Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Protection Warrior Guide › Protection Warrior Guide for World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-warrior-tank-pve-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6ab3846bb01dd45fc7a7179ccbf05954caa4f41d","section:ed18dc14ad220dad5d4e9b5e30bd9c617535799c","section:f7711b113329381caf8bf53cbeb12a5e154c2d10"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-stats","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de estadísticas de Armas","title_en":"Arms Stat Priority","summary_es":"Armas prioriza golpe hasta 8%, pericia hasta 6,5% y después crítico y atributos.","summary_en":"Arms prioritizes hit to 8%, expertise to 6.5%, then crit and attributes.","keywords_es":["estadísticas de Armas","prioridad de estadísticas guerrero","golpe 8% Armas","pericia Armas","crítico de Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms stats","warrior stat priority","Arms 8% hit","Arms expertise","Arms crit"],"text_es":"Prioriza probabilidad de golpe hasta 8%, pericia hasta 6,5%, golpe crítico, fuerza, agilidad, celeridad y, por último, más golpe. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Prioritize hit chance to 8%, expertise to 6.5%, critical strike, Strength, Agility, Haste, and finally additional Hit. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Arms Warrior Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:3ed6c034ea262b0996b6e976e399412e433f47fb"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-stats","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de estadísticas de Furia","title_en":"Fury Stat Priority","summary_es":"Furia prioriza habilidad con armas hasta 305, golpe hasta 9% y crítico.","summary_en":"Fury prioritizes weapon skill to 305, hit to 9%, and critical strike.","keywords_es":["estadísticas de Furia","prioridad de estadísticas guerrero","habilidad con armas 305","golpe 9% Furia","aguante Furia"],"keywords_en":["Fury stats","warrior stat priority","weapon skill 305","Fury 9% hit","Fury stamina"],"text_es":"Prioriza habilidad con armas hasta 305, probabilidad de golpe hasta 9%, golpe crítico, fuerza, agilidad y aguante. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Prioritize weapon skill to 305, hit chance to 9%, critical strike, Strength, Agility, and Stamina. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Stat Priority & Attributes - WoW: Forever › Fury Warrior Stat Priority in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/stat-priority-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:4c3b204d4bbfdf55456789f44584c4d46b7f9cac"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-stats","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de estadísticas de Protección","title_en":"Protection Stat Priority","summary_es":"Protección puede priorizar defensa, equilibrio o amenaza según el contenido.","summary_en":"Protection can prioritize defense, balance, or threat depending on content.","keywords_es":["estadísticas de Protección","prioridad defensiva guerrero","prioridad equilibrada tanque","prioridad ofensiva Protección","defensa 440"],"keywords_en":["Protection stats","defensive warrior priority","balanced tank priority","offensive Protection priority","440 defense"],"text_es":"Defensiva: aguante, defensa hasta 440, armadura, agilidad, defensa por encima de 440, parada, esquiva, pericia (6,5%), bloqueo, poder de ataque/fuerza, golpe (8%), crítico, pericia (14%) y celeridad. Equilibrada: aguante, pericia (6,5%), golpe (8%), defensa hasta 440, pericia (14%), armadura, poder de ataque/fuerza, agilidad, defensa por encima de 440, parada, esquiva, crítico, bloqueo y celeridad. Ofensiva: pericia (6,5%), golpe (8%), pericia (14%), crítico, poder de ataque/fuerza, aguante, celeridad, agilidad, defensa hasta 440, armadura, defensa por encima de 440, parada, esquiva y bloqueo.","text_en":"Defensive priority: Stamina, Defense to 440, Armor, Agility, Defense above 440, Parry, Dodge, Expertise (6.5%), Block, Attack Power/Strength, Hit (8%), Crit, Expertise (14%), Haste. Balanced: Stamina, Expertise (6.5%), Hit (8%), Defense to 440, Expertise (14%), Armor, Attack Power/Strength, Agility, Defense above 440, Parry, Dodge, Crit, Block, Haste. Offensive: Expertise (6.5%), Hit (8%), Expertise (14%), Crit, Attack Power/Strength, Stamina, Haste, Agility, Defense to 440, Armor, Defense above 440, Parry, Dodge, Block.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Defensive Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Balanced Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Attribute and Stat Guide - WoW: Forever › Offensive Priority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/stat-priority-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:stats"],"source_hashes":["section:08d41dbf9a45cb10c735308c5f7cd8edb73320d5","section:9c558038c02f90c314b38b031c6915b4d6378ce5","section:a29e9d1087c5328cfd3a328b9baad88bc72fb9da"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-rotacion-single","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Armas contra un objetivo","title_en":"Arms Single-Target Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Desgarrar y prioriza Golpe mortal, Abrumar y Embate sin quedarte sin furia.","summary_en":"Maintain Rend and prioritize Mortal Strike, Overpower, and Slam without running out of Rage.","keywords_es":["rotación Armas un objetivo","prioridad Armas nivel 60","Desgarrar y Golpe mortal","Golpe heroico 40 furia","Ejecutar Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms single target rotation","level 60 Arms priority","Rend and Mortal Strike","Heroic Strike 40 Rage","Arms Execute"],"text_es":"Mantén Desgarrar. Prioriza Golpe mortal, Abrumar cuando esté disponible y Lanzazo antes de Embate contra gigantes o dragonantes, después Embate; mantén 5 acumulaciones de Hender armadura. Usa Golpe heroico por encima de 40 de furia y Trueno y Grito desmoralizador para mantener sus perjuicios. Desde el 20% de salud del enemigo, intercala Ejecutar y conserva furia para Golpe mortal.","text_en":"Maintain Rend. Use Mortal Strike, Overpower when available, and Spearing Strike before Slam against giants or Dragonkin, then Slam; keep 5 Sunder Armor stacks. Use Heroic Strike above 40 Rage, and maintain Thunder Clap and Demoralizing Shout debuffs. Below 20% enemy health, weave in Execute and save Rage for Mortal Strike.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Arms Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:532975479cc58ee984311a2f966d8e5fa76013bc"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-rotacion-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Armas en área","title_en":"Arms AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Guarda furia para Golpes de barrido y combina los ataques prioritarios.","summary_en":"Pool Rage for Sweeping Strikes and combine it with priority attacks.","keywords_es":["rotación Armas área","Armas varios objetivos","Golpes de barrido rotación","Mellar más de 45 furia","Huracán Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms AoE rotation","Arms multiple targets","Sweeping Strikes rotation","Cleave above 45 Rage","Arms Whirlwind"],"text_es":"Mantén Desgarrar en el objetivo principal y guarda furia antes de Golpes de barrido; combínalo con Golpe mortal y Abrumar cuando esté disponible. Usa Mellar por encima de 45 de furia si faltan más de 5 s para que vuelva Golpes de barrido, y luego Huracán. Contra gigantes o dragonantes, usa Lanzazo antes de Embate; mantén 5 acumulaciones de Hender armadura en el objetivo prioritario y los perjuicios de Trueno y Grito desmoralizador.","text_en":"Maintain Rend on the primary target and pool Rage before Sweeping Strikes; combine it with Mortal Strike and Overpower when available. Use Cleave above 45 Rage if Sweeping Strikes has more than 5 seconds left, then Whirlwind. Against giants or Dragonkin, use Spearing Strike before Slam; keep 5 Sunder Armor stacks on the priority target and maintain Thunder Clap and Demoralizing Shout debuffs.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Arms Warrior  in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:0c70116265461cda8340e2ffb2c8b3f769e409c9"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-rotacion-single","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Furia contra un objetivo","title_en":"Fury Single-Target Rotation","summary_es":"Mantén Grito de guerra y ordena los ataques según la furia disponible.","summary_en":"Maintain Battle Shout and order attacks around available Rage.","keywords_es":["rotación Furia un objetivo","prioridad Furia nivel 60","Sed de sangre y Huracán","Golpe heroico 65 furia","Seccionar 85 furia"],"keywords_en":["Fury single target rotation","level 60 Fury priority","Bloodthirst and Whirlwind","Heroic Strike 65 Rage","Hamstring 85 Rage"],"text_es":"Mantén Grito de guerra y, si el grupo lo aplica, Hender armadura. Prioriza Ejecutar, Sed de sangre y Huracán; usa Abrumar por debajo de 30 de furia, Golpe heroico por encima de 65 y Seccionar por encima de 85.","text_en":"Maintain Battle Shout and, if your party uses it, Sunder Armor. Prioritize Execute, Bloodthirst, and Whirlwind; use Overpower below 30 Rage, Heroic Strike above 65, and Hamstring above 85.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Single Target DPS Rotation for Fury Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:7a15b9090ffd3175f3b9dd6346b6944f21b4b687"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-rotacion-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rotación de Furia en área","title_en":"Fury AoE Rotation","summary_es":"Huracán encabeza el área; reserva Mellar para más de 60 de furia.","summary_en":"Whirlwind leads the AoE priority; save Cleave for above 60 Rage.","keywords_es":["rotación Furia área","Furia varios objetivos","Huracán en área","Mellar 60 furia","Ejecutar objetivo prioritario"],"keywords_en":["Fury AoE rotation","Fury multiple targets","Whirlwind AoE","Cleave 60 Rage","Execute priority target"],"text_es":"Mantén Grito de guerra y, si el grupo lo usa, Hender armadura en el objetivo principal. Prioriza Huracán; usa Ejecutar si hay un objetivo prioritario, después Sed de sangre y Abrumar por debajo de 30 de furia. Mellar se usa por encima de 60 de furia.","text_en":"Maintain Battle Shout and, if your party uses it, Sunder Armor on the primary target. Prioritize Whirlwind; use Execute if there is a priority target, then Bloodthirst and Overpower below 30 Rage. Use Cleave above 60 Rage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › AoE DPS Rotation for Fury Warrior in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/rotation-cooldowns-pve-dps","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:f6ca9739f660e472addc67a9bb4230b70ab9ee11"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-rotacion-single","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de Protección contra un objetivo","title_en":"Protection Single-Target Priority","summary_es":"Bloquear con escudo y Revancha encabezan la prioridad, con perjuicios de grupo.","summary_en":"Shield Block and Revenge lead the priority, alongside group debuffs.","keywords_es":["rotación Protección un objetivo","prioridad tanque guerrero","Bloquear con escudo Revancha","Hender armadura tanque","Golpe heroico 30 furia"],"keywords_en":["Protection single target rotation","warrior tank priority","Shield Block Revenge","tank Sunder Armor","Heroic Strike 30 Rage"],"text_es":"Es una prioridad adaptable: usa Bloquear con escudo, Revancha y Embate con escudo si tienes el talento; Sed de sangre también si está aprendida. En grupo, mantén 5 acumulaciones de Hender armadura, Trueno, Grito de guerra y Grito desmoralizador. Usa Desgarrar si ya tienes mucha amenaza, rellena con Hender armadura si sobra furia y acciones, y Golpe heroico por encima de 30 de furia. A menos del 20% de salud, Ejecutar exige salir de Actitud defensiva.","text_en":"Treat this as an adaptable priority: use Shield Block, Revenge, and Shield Slam if talented; Bloodthirst too if learned. In a group, maintain 5 Sunder Armor stacks, Thunder Clap, Battle Shout, and Demoralizing Shout. Use Rend when threat is already high, fill with Sunder Armor if Rage and globals allow, and Heroic Strike above 30 Rage. Below 20% health, Execute requires leaving Defensive Stance.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior Tank Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:8851f1cc060989d5f47e83645a5062f52fac0924"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-rotacion-area","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de Protección en área","title_en":"Protection AoE Priority","summary_es":"Trueno abre la prioridad de área; Bloquear con escudo y Revancha siguen.","summary_en":"Thunder Clap starts the AoE priority, followed by Shield Block and Revenge.","keywords_es":["rotación Protección área","tanquear varios enemigos","Trueno Protección","Mellar 30 furia","Represalias con dos manos"],"keywords_en":["Protection AoE rotation","tank multiple enemies","Protection Thunder Clap","Cleave 30 Rage","two-handed Retaliation"],"text_es":"Usa Trueno, Bloquear con escudo, Revancha y Embate con escudo si tienes el talento; Sed de sangre también si está aprendida. Mantén 5 acumulaciones de Hender armadura en un objetivo prioritario si estás en grupo, además de Grito de guerra y Grito desmoralizador. Mellar se usa por encima de 30 de furia. Represalias causa mucho daño contra varios enemigos; cambiar a un arma de dos manos durante el efecto aumenta su daño.","text_en":"Use Thunder Clap, Shield Block, Revenge, and Shield Slam if talented; Bloodthirst too if learned. In a group, maintain 5 Sunder Armor stacks on a priority target, plus Battle Shout and Demoralizing Shout. Use Cleave above 30 Rage. Retaliation deals high damage against several enemies; switching to a two-handed weapon during the effect increases its damage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior Tank Rotations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:8851f1cc060989d5f47e83645a5062f52fac0924"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-cambios-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambios de Armas en Forever","title_en":"Arms Changes in Forever","summary_es":"Desgarrar escala con poder de ataque y puede dar críticos y activar Abrumar.","summary_en":"Rend scales with Attack Power, can crit, and can trigger Overpower.","keywords_es":["cambios Armas Forever","Desgarrar crítico","Fragor de la sangre","activar Abrumar","Heridas profundas crítico"],"keywords_en":["Arms Forever changes","Rend crit","Bloodthrill","trigger Overpower","Deep Wounds crit"],"text_es":"En Armas, Desgarrar ahora escala mejor con el poder de ataque y puede asestar críticos; Heridas profundas también puede hacerlo. Con puntos en Fragor de la sangre, Desgarrar tiene la posibilidad de activar Abrumar durante 6 s; más puntos aumentan esa posibilidad.","text_en":"Rend now scales better with Attack Power for Arms and can critically strike; Deep Wounds can also crit. With points in Bloodthrill, Rend can activate Overpower for 6 seconds, and additional points increase the chance.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Arms Warrior in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:4c249d48afa3e1ebfaf913f80a148d06d0ca8685"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-lanzazo-embate","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Lanzazo y Embate mejorado","title_en":"Spearing Strike and Improved Slam","summary_es":"Lanzazo desmonta; Embate mejorado reduce su lanzamiento y evita reiniciar el golpe.","summary_en":"Spearing Strike dismounts; Improved Slam shortens its cast and avoids resetting the swing.","keywords_es":["Lanzazo desmontar","daño de Lanzazo","Embate mejorado","tiempo de lanzamiento Embate","reiniciar golpe cuerpo a cuerpo"],"keywords_en":["Spearing Strike dismount","Spearing Strike damage","Improved Slam","Slam cast time","melee swing reset"],"text_es":"Lanzazo, exclusivo de Armas, desmonta y causa un 40% del daño del arma; contra gigantes, dragonantes y objetivos montados añade daño equivalente al 80% del daño del arma. Embate tiene 15 s de reutilización, reducidos a 10 s con 2 puntos en Embate mejorado; el talento también hace que lanzarlo ya no interrumpa el tiempo entre golpes cuerpo a cuerpo.","text_en":"Arms-only Spearing Strike dismounts and deals 40% weapon damage; against Giants, Dragonkin, and mounted targets, it adds damage equal to 80% of weapon damage. Slam has a 15-second cooldown, reduced to 10 seconds with 2 points in Improved Slam; the talent also makes casting it no longer interrupt melee swing time.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6ebba8e13a11e6a4374f526e70415b6dad7b4772","section:9ff89aea476a4470ebe9817cf1b5ad906c38856b"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-maestro-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especialización Maestro de armas","title_en":"Weaponmaster Specialization","summary_es":"Maestro de armas unifica especializaciones y permite cambiar de tipo de arma con más libertad.","summary_en":"Weaponmaster combines weapon specializations and allows more freedom to change weapon types.","keywords_es":["Maestro de armas guerrero","especialización de armas","mazas ignoran armadura","bastones guerrero","cambiar tipo de arma"],"keywords_en":["warrior Weaponmaster","weapon specialization","maces ignore armor","warrior staves","change weapon type"],"text_es":"Maestro de armas combina las especializaciones de hachas, espadas, armas de asta y mazas, e incluye bastones. Las mazas y los bastones ignoran armadura. Al concentrar esos efectos en un solo talento, puedes cambiar de tipo de arma con más libertad mientras subes de nivel.","text_en":"Weaponmaster combines specializations for axes, swords, polearms, and maces, and includes staves. Maces and staves ignore armor. Combining these effects in one talent lets you switch weapon types more freely while leveling.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6ebba8e13a11e6a4374f526e70415b6dad7b4772"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-furia-normalizada","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia normalizada en Furia","title_en":"Normalized Rage for Fury","summary_es":"El daño del arma y los críticos ya no aumentan la furia generada por Furia.","summary_en":"Weapon damage and critical hits no longer increase Fury's Rage generation.","keywords_es":["furia normalizada Furia","generación de furia guerrero","críticos no dan furia","furia del arma","Furia Forever cambios"],"keywords_en":["Fury normalized Rage","warrior Rage generation","crit gives no Rage","weapon Rage","Fury Forever changes"],"text_es":"En Furia, la generación de furia está normalizada: los ataques dan una cantidad fija dentro de un intervalo calculado, no según el daño del arma. Los críticos no generan furia adicional y el equipo no aumenta la furia obtenida; para generar más, hay que recibir daño.","text_en":"Rage generation for Fury is normalized: attacks grant a fixed amount within a calculated range, not based on weapon damage. Critical hits grant no extra Rage, and gear does not increase Rage gained; taking damage is the way to generate more.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Fury Warrior in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:b7bca2ae0c7f74df9db2d5d801391942976b4ae4"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-muro-escudo","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambios de Muro de escudo y Represalias","title_en":"Shield Wall and Retaliation Changes","summary_es":"Muro de escudo dura 12 s y reduce 60% el daño; las reutilizaciones ya no se comparten.","summary_en":"Shield Wall lasts 12 seconds and reduces damage by 60%; cooldowns are no longer shared.","keywords_es":["Muro de escudo cambios","reutilización Represalias","Muro de escudo 60%","reducción de daño guerrero","reutilizaciones separadas"],"keywords_en":["Shield Wall changes","Retaliation cooldown","Shield Wall 60%","warrior damage reduction","separate cooldowns"],"text_es":"Muro de escudo ahora reduce un 60% el daño recibido durante 12 s y tiene 15 min de reutilización base, reducible con talentos. Represalias tiene 15 min de reutilización. Temeridad, Represalias y Muro de escudo dejaron de compartir reutilización; Temeridad conserva 30 min.","text_en":"Shield Wall now reduces damage taken by 60% for 12 seconds and has a 15-minute base cooldown, reducible with talents. Retaliation has a 15-minute cooldown. Recklessness, Retaliation, and Shield Wall no longer share cooldowns; Recklessness remains at 30 minutes.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Rotation and Cooldowns - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior Cooldown Usage in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/rotation-cooldowns-pve-tank","date":"2026-10-29"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview","class:warrior:protection:rotation"],"source_hashes":["section:c8ff2acd84722e39fa2c1ae6985614ff2a651913","section:ed18dc14ad220dad5d4e9b5e30bd9c617535799c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-cambio-actitudes-combate","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambiar de actitud durante el combate","title_en":"Stance Dancing in Combat","summary_es":"Cambia brevemente a otra actitud para usar una facultad y vuelve a la anterior.","summary_en":"Briefly switch stances to use an ability, then return to the previous stance.","keywords_es":["cambiar actitud combate","cambio rápido de actitud","usar Abrumar","Actitud rabiosa y batalla","furia al cambiar actitud"],"keywords_en":["stance dancing","switch stance in combat","use Overpower","Berserker and Battle Stance","Rage stance change"],"text_es":"Cambiar de actitud durante el combate permite usar una facultad restringida y volver enseguida a la actitud anterior. Por ejemplo, pasa de Actitud rabiosa a Actitud de batalla para lanzar Abrumar cuando esté disponible y regresa después. Si necesitas reducir el daño recibido al tanquear un enemigo en una mazmorra, puedes cambiar a Actitud defensiva.","text_en":"Stance dancing lets you use an ability restricted to another stance and quickly return to the previous one. For example, switch from Berserker Stance to Battle Stance to cast Overpower when available, then switch back. To reduce incoming damage while tanking an enemy in a dungeon, you can switch to Defensive Stance.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Arms Warrior Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:082f291835995244fcef68e69006f4fd916c5ebb"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-ataque-victoria","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ataque de la victoria","title_en":"Victory Rush","summary_es":"Tras matar a un enemigo no trivial, Ataque de la victoria inflige daño y cura un 10% de salud máxima.","summary_en":"After killing a non-trivial enemy, Victory Rush deals damage and heals 10% of maximum health.","keywords_es":["Ataque de la victoria Guerrero","curación Ataque de la victoria","activar Ataque de la victoria","curarse tras matar","facultad nueva Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Warrior Victory Rush","Victory Rush healing","activate Victory Rush","heal after a kill","new Warrior ability"],"text_es":"Ataque de la victoria está disponible para las tres especializaciones. Puedes usarlo tras matar a un enemigo no trivial; inflige daño y restaura un 10% de tu salud máxima.","text_en":"Victory Rush is available to all three specializations. You can use it after killing a non-trivial enemy; it deals damage and restores 10% of your maximum health.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview","class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6ebba8e13a11e6a4374f526e70415b6dad7b4772","section:ac4ce0b3e17e24a7f6d6341bd70ec2b76caa77c8"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-gritos-duracion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Duración de los gritos del Guerrero","title_en":"Warrior Shout Durations","summary_es":"Grito de guerra dura 3 minutos y Grito desmoralizador, 45 segundos.","summary_en":"Battle Shout lasts 3 minutes and Demoralizing Shout lasts 45 seconds.","keywords_es":["duración Grito de guerra","duración Grito desmoralizador","gritos Guerrero Forever","Grito de guerra 3 minutos","Grito desmoralizador 45 segundos"],"keywords_en":["Battle Shout duration","Demoralizing Shout duration","Forever Warrior shouts","Battle Shout 3 minutes","Demoralizing Shout 45 seconds"],"text_es":"En Forever, Grito de guerra dura 3 minutos en vez de 2, y Grito desmoralizador dura 45 segundos en vez de 30. Esto alarga el tiempo entre renovaciones de ambos efectos.","text_en":"In Forever, Battle Shout lasts 3 minutes instead of 2, and Demoralizing Shout lasts 45 seconds instead of 30. This lengthens the time between refreshing either effect.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:9ff89aea476a4470ebe9817cf1b5ad906c38856b"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-otros-cambios","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Otros cambios de Furia","title_en":"Other Fury Changes","summary_es":"Enfurecer se activa con daño directo y Sed de sangre gana daño fijo por rango.","summary_en":"Enrage activates from direct damage, and Bloodthirst gains flat damage per rank.","keywords_es":["cambios habilidades Furia","Enfurecer daño directo","Sed de sangre daño fijo","Especialización en doble empuñadura furia","armadura jefes Furia"],"keywords_en":["Fury ability changes","Enrage direct damage","Bloodthirst flat damage","Fury Dual Wield Specialization","Fury boss armor"],"text_es":"Enfurecer ahora se activa con cualquier instancia de daño directo recibido, no solo con críticos. Sed de sangre añade daño fijo que aumenta con cada rango, y Especialización en doble empuñadura aumenta ligeramente la furia generada por el arma secundaria. Además, Fuego feérico y Maldición de Temeridad ya no acumulan sus efectos de reducción de armadura en los enemigos.","text_en":"Enrage now activates from any instance of direct damage taken, not only critical hits. Bloodthirst adds flat damage that increases with each rank, and Dual Wield Specialization slightly increases Rage generated by the off-hand weapon. Also, Faerie Fire and Curse of Recklessness no longer stack their armor-reduction effects on enemies.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Fury Warrior in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:b7bca2ae0c7f74df9db2d5d801391942976b4ae4","section:e48d63f79fa1907b0e696fc9a928601c50eeb1b0"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-bloquear-cambios","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambios de Bloquear con escudo","title_en":"Shield Block Changes","summary_es":"Bloquear con escudo dura 7 segundos y puede bloquear dos ataques por uso.","summary_en":"Shield Block lasts 7 seconds and can block two attacks per use.","keywords_es":["Bloquear con escudo cambios","duración Bloquear con escudo","dos bloqueos","habilidades Protección Forever","bloquear ataques Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Shield Block changes","Shield Block duration","two blocks","Forever Protection abilities","Warrior block attacks"],"text_es":"En Forever, Bloquear con escudo aumenta un 75% la probabilidad de bloqueo durante 7 s y puede bloquear 2 ataques, en vez de durar 5 s y bloquear solo 1. Úsalo para reducir el daño y activar efectos que dependen de bloquear.","text_en":"In Forever, Shield Block increases block chance by 75% for 7 seconds and can block 2 attacks, rather than lasting 5 seconds and blocking only 1. Use it to reduce damage and trigger effects that depend on blocking.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:ed18dc14ad220dad5d4e9b5e30bd9c617535799c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-trueno","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambio de Trueno en Armas","title_en":"Arms Thunder Clap Change","summary_es":"Trueno reduce un 20% la velocidad de ataque, frente al 10% anterior.","summary_en":"Thunder Clap slows attack speed by 20%, up from 10%.","keywords_es":["Trueno Armas Forever","reducción de velocidad Trueno","Trueno 20 por ciento","cambios Guerrero Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms Thunder Clap Forever","Thunder Clap attack speed reduction","20 percent Thunder Clap","Arms Warrior changes"],"text_es":"En Forever, Trueno reduce un 20% la velocidad de ataque de los enemigos, en vez del 10% anterior.","text_en":"In Forever, Thunder Clap reduces enemies' attack speed by 20%, up from 10% previously.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:9ff89aea476a4470ebe9817cf1b5ad906c38856b"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-precision-furiosa","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Precisión furiosa","title_en":"Furious Precision","summary_es":"Precisión furiosa aumenta el golpe de los ataques del arma secundaria.","summary_en":"Furious Precision increases hit chance for off-hand attacks.","keywords_es":["Precisión furiosa Guerrero","golpe arma secundaria","acierto doble empuñadura","cambios Furia Forever"],"keywords_en":["Warrior Furious Precision","off-hand hit chance","dual-wield hit","Fury Forever changes"],"text_es":"Precisión furiosa aumenta el golpe de los ataques con el arma secundaria; esta facultad compensa la retirada de la cola de Golpe heroico.","text_en":"Furious Precision increases hit chance for off-hand attacks; the ability compensates for the removal of the Heroic Strike queue.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior DPS Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/overview-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:e8123f5c62b4208e1a01cf77ca355b993a1a94f4"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-maestria-tactica","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Maestría táctica básica","title_en":"Baseline Tactical Mastery","summary_es":"Maestría táctica permite conservar hasta 10 puntos de furia al cambiar de actitud.","summary_en":"Tactical Mastery lets Warriors retain up to 10 Rage when changing stances.","keywords_es":["Maestría táctica Guerrero","furia al cambiar de actitud","retener furia Guerrero","Maestría táctica básica"],"keywords_en":["Warrior Tactical Mastery","Rage when changing stances","retain Warrior Rage","baseline Tactical Mastery"],"text_es":"Maestría táctica es una facultad básica del Guerrero en Forever: al cambiar de actitud, permite conservar hasta 10 puntos de furia.","text_en":"Tactical Mastery is a baseline Warrior ability in Forever: when changing stances, it lets you retain up to 10 Rage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Protection Warrior Specific Systems in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6ab3846bb01dd45fc7a7179ccbf05954caa4f41d"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-nuevas-herramientas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Nuevas herramientas de Protección","title_en":"New Protection Tools","summary_es":"Cuatro talentos amplían la movilidad, el daño, la furia y la defensa con escudo.","summary_en":"Four talents expand mobility, damage, Rage, and shield-based defense.","keywords_es":["nuevos talentos Protección Forever","Vanguardia Guerrero","Bastión Guerrero","Maestro de defensa Guerrero","Ira enfocada Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["new Protection talents Forever","Warrior Vanguard talent","Warrior Bastion talent","Warrior Master of Defense","Warrior Focused Rage"],"text_es":"Vanguardia habilita Embestir desde Actitud defensiva. Bastión eleva una décima parte el daño que infliges al llevar escudo; Maestro de defensa te da 5 de furia si esquivas o paras en esas condiciones. Ira enfocada resta 3 puntos de furia al coste de tus facultades ofensivas.","text_en":"Vanguard enables Charge from Defensive Stance. With a shield on, Bastion raises your damage dealt by one tenth; a successful dodge or parry then yields 5 Rage through Master of Defense. Focused Rage subtracts 3 Rage from offensive ability costs.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › New Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:ac4ce0b3e17e24a7f6d6341bd70ec2b76caa77c8"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-cambios-talentos","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambios en talentos de Protección","title_en":"Protection Talent Changes","summary_es":"Especialización en escudos, Anticipación, Revancha mejorada y Desafío cambian en Forever.","summary_en":"Shield Specialization, Anticipation, Improved Revenge, and Defiance change in Forever.","keywords_es":["cambios talentos Protección","furia por bloquear Guerrero","Anticipación defensa","Revancha mejorada daño","Desafío con escudo"],"keywords_en":["Protection talent changes","Rage from blocking Warrior","Anticipation Defense","Improved Revenge damage","Defiance with shield"],"text_es":"En Forever, Especialización en escudos genera 5 de furia al bloquear; Anticipación aporta 20 de defensa. Revancha mejorada aumenta un 60% el daño de Revancha en vez de dar una posibilidad de aturdir, y Desafío añade un 15% de amenaza en Actitud defensiva mientras llevas escudo.","text_en":"In Forever, Shield Specialization grants 5 Rage when you block, and Anticipation adds 20 Defense. Improved Revenge increases Revenge damage by 60% instead of adding a stun chance, while Defiance adds 15% threat in Defensive Stance when a shield is equipped.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Tank Guide - WoW: Forever › Changes to Existing Abilities and Talents in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/overview-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:ed18dc14ad220dad5d4e9b5e30bd9c617535799c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-talentos-pve-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: talentos PvE (1/2)","title_en":"Arms: PvE talents (1/2)","summary_es":"Build de daño PvE que conserva Golpe mortal.","summary_en":"PvE damage build that keeps Mortal Strike.","keywords_es":["talentos Armas PvE","build Guerrero Armas","Golpe mortal Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms PvE talents","Arms Warrior build","Arms Mortal Strike"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Lanzazo 1/1, Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Fragor de la sangre 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5, Embate mejorado 2/2, Golpe mortal 1/1.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Spearing Strike 1/1, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3, Impale 2/2, Bloodthrill 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, Improved Slam 2/2, Mortal Strike 1/1.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arms Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior PVE Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:cc3795f907595a5f68dbd003bf8acdb1b8eb71c8"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-talentos-pve-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: talentos PvE (2/2)","title_en":"Arms: PvE talents (2/2)","summary_es":"Build de daño PvE que conserva Golpe mortal.","summary_en":"PvE damage build that keeps Mortal Strike.","keywords_es":["talentos Armas PvE","build Guerrero Armas","Golpe mortal Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms PvE talents","Arms Warrior build","Arms Mortal Strike"],"text_es":"Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Ira persistente 5/5, Enfurecer 5/5, Ejecutar mejorado 2/2. Protección: Sanguinario mejorado 2/2. La build invierte mucho en Armas para conservar Golpe mortal; Deseo de la Muerte exigiría renunciar a él. Enfurecer es flexible: si no recibes ataques, Voz retumbante ayuda a mantener gritos o Cólera desbocada a generar furia.","text_en":"Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Lingering Rage 5/5, Enrage 5/5, Improved Execute 2/2. Protection: Improved Bloodrage 2/2. The build invests heavily in Arms to keep Mortal Strike; Death Wish would require giving it up. Enrage is flexible: if you will not take attacks, Booming Voice supports shouts or Unbridled Wrath adds Rage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arms Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior PVE Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:cc3795f907595a5f68dbd003bf8acdb1b8eb71c8"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-talentos-pvp-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: talentos JcJ (1/2)","title_en":"Arms: PvP talents (1/2)","summary_es":"Build JcJ de Armas que cambia mejora de Golpe heroico por supervivencia.","summary_en":"Arms PvP build that trades Heroic Strike improvements for survivability.","keywords_es":["talentos Armas JcJ","build PvP Guerrero Armas","Desvío Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Arms PvP talents","Arms Warrior PvP build","Warrior Deflection"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 3/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Lanzazo 1/1, Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Fragor de la sangre 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5, Embate mejorado 2/2, Seccionar mejorado 3/3.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 3/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Spearing Strike 1/1, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3, Impale 2/2, Bloodthrill 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, Improved Slam 2/2, Improved Hamstring 3/3.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arms Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior PVP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:d0e1a506b0a8e6ad9bf7433f7696f730bfb09fe7"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-talentos-pvp-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: talentos JcJ (2/2)","title_en":"Arms: PvP talents (2/2)","summary_es":"Build JcJ de Armas que cambia mejora de Golpe heroico por supervivencia.","summary_en":"Arms PvP build that trades Heroic Strike improvements for survivability.","keywords_es":["talentos Armas JcJ","build PvP Guerrero Armas","Desvío Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Arms PvP talents","Arms Warrior PvP build","Warrior Deflection"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe mortal 1/1. Furia: Voz retumbante 5/5, Crueldad 5/5, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Enfurecer 5/5. La furia escasea en JcJ, así que Golpe heroico se usa poco y sus puntos pasan a Desvío. Lanzazo puede omitirse en campos de batalla; Enfurecer rinde más contra cuerpo a cuerpo que contra lanzadores.","text_en":"Arms: Mortal Strike 1/1. Fury: Booming Voice 5/5, Cruelty 5/5, Piercing Howl 1/1, Enrage 5/5. Rage is scarce in PvP, so Heroic Strike is rarely used and its points move to Deflection. Spearing Strike can be dropped for battlegrounds; Enrage is stronger against melee than casters.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arms Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior PVP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:d0e1a506b0a8e6ad9bf7433f7696f730bfb09fe7"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-talentos-raid","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: talentos de banda","title_en":"Fury: Raid talents","summary_es":"Build de banda con Sed de sangre, Aluvión y Deseo de la Muerte.","summary_en":"Raid build with Bloodthirst, Flurry, and Death Wish.","keywords_es":["talentos Furia banda","build Guerrero Furia PvE","Deseo de la Muerte"],"keywords_en":["Fury raid talents","Fury Warrior PvE build","Fury Death Wish"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Precisión furiosa 3/3, Enfurecer 4/5, Especialización en doble empuñadura 5/5, Golpes temerarios 1/1, Ejecutar mejorado 2/2, Ira rabiosa mejorada 2/2, Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Torbellino mejorado 2/2, Aluvión 3/3, Sed de sangre 1/1. Maestría táctica mejorada y Abrumar mejorado aprovechan mejor la furia limitada; Clavar potencia los críticos.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Furious Precision 3/3, Enrage 4/5, Dual Wield Specialization 5/5, Reckless Swings 1/1, Improved Execute 2/2, Improved Berserker Rage 2/2, Death Wish 1/1, Improved Whirlwind 2/2, Flurry 3/3, Bloodthirst 1/1. Improved Tactical Mastery and Improved Overpower make limited Rage go further; Impale boosts critical strikes.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fury Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior PvE Raid Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:20d126321f16ce0eeb33fb5eb813f3ba5149b749"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-talentos-mazmorra-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: talentos de mazmorra (1/2)","title_en":"Fury: Dungeon talents (1/2)","summary_es":"Build de mazmorra que refuerza Enfurecer ante daño frecuente.","summary_en":"Dungeon build that strengthens Enrage against frequent damage.","keywords_es":["talentos Furia mazmorra","build Furia dungeons","Ira persistente Furia"],"keywords_en":["Fury dungeon talents","Fury dungeon build","Fury Lingering Rage"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Ira persistente 1/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Precisión furiosa 3/3, Enfurecer 5/5, Especialización en doble empuñadura 5/5.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Lingering Rage 1/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Furious Precision 3/3, Enrage 5/5, Dual Wield Specialization 5/5.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fury Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:8dd9ac0843806c40e574fd87a7a1d64a5f41c73e"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-talentos-mazmorra-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: talentos de mazmorra (2/2)","title_en":"Fury: Dungeon talents (2/2)","summary_es":"Build de mazmorra que refuerza Enfurecer ante daño frecuente.","summary_en":"Dungeon build that strengthens Enrage against frequent damage.","keywords_es":["talentos Furia mazmorra","build Furia dungeons","Ira persistente Furia"],"keywords_en":["Fury dungeon talents","Fury dungeon build","Fury Lingering Rage"],"text_es":"Furia: Golpes temerarios 1/1, Ejecutar mejorado 2/2, Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Torbellino mejorado 2/2, Aluvión 3/3, Sed de sangre 1/1. Omite Ira rabiosa mejorada, menos útil ante enemigos de nivel bajo y al guardar furia entre grupos; maximiza Enfurecer para aprovechar el daño frecuente en mazmorras.","text_en":"Fury: Reckless Swings 1/1, Improved Execute 2/2, Death Wish 1/1, Improved Whirlwind 2/2, Flurry 3/3, Bloodthirst 1/1. It skips Improved Berserker Rage, less useful against lower-level mobs and when saving Rage between packs; it maximizes Enrage for frequent dungeon damage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fury Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:8dd9ac0843806c40e574fd87a7a1d64a5f41c73e"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-talentos-pvp-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: talentos JcJ (1/2)","title_en":"Fury: PvP talents (1/2)","summary_es":"Build JcJ de Furia con aguante, movilidad y control.","summary_en":"Fury PvP build with sustain, mobility, and control.","keywords_es":["talentos Furia JcJ","build PvP Guerrero Furia","Intercepción mejorada"],"keywords_en":["Fury PvP talents","Fury Warrior PvP build","Improved Intercept"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 3/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2. Furia: Voz retumbante 5/5, Crueldad 5/5, Precisión furiosa 1/3, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Manía sangrienta 3/3, Enfurecer 5/5, Golpes temerarios 1/1, Ira rabiosa mejorada 2/2.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 3/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2. Fury: Booming Voice 5/5, Cruelty 5/5, Furious Precision 1/3, Piercing Howl 1/1, Blood Craze 3/3, Enrage 5/5, Reckless Swings 1/1, Improved Berserker Rage 2/2.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fury Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30926ec8c1fd5fc1e111d0dc61ea65449911a4eb"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-talentos-pvp-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: talentos JcJ (2/2)","title_en":"Fury: PvP talents (2/2)","summary_es":"Build JcJ de Furia con aguante, movilidad y control.","summary_en":"Fury PvP build with sustain, mobility, and control.","keywords_es":["talentos Furia JcJ","build PvP Guerrero Furia","Intercepción mejorada"],"keywords_en":["Fury PvP talents","Fury Warrior PvP build","Improved Intercept"],"text_es":"Furia: Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Bebedor de entrañas 2/2, Intercepción mejorada 2/2, Torbellino mejorado 2/2, Aluvión 3/3, Sed de sangre 1/1. Aunque Furia es más débil que Armas en JcJ, la build añade aguante, permite quitar raíces y ralentizaciones con Ira rabiosa mejorada y acorta la reutilización de Interceptar.","text_en":"Fury: Death Wish 1/1, Gore Drinker 2/2, Improved Intercept 2/2, Improved Whirlwind 2/2, Flurry 3/3, Bloodthirst 1/1. In PvP, this build is weaker than Arms but adds sustain, removes roots and slows with Improved Berserker Rage, and reduces Intercept cooldown.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Fury Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:30926ec8c1fd5fc1e111d0dc61ea65449911a4eb"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-raid-estandar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos de banda estándar","title_en":"Protection: Standard raid talents","summary_es":"Build estándar que equilibra defensa y amenaza.","summary_en":"Standard build balancing defense and threat.","keywords_es":["talentos Protección banda","build tanque Guerrero","amenaza y defensa Protección"],"keywords_en":["Protection raid talents","Warrior tank build","Protection threat and defense"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 4/5. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Enfurecer 5/5. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5, Anticipación 5/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1, Muro de escudo mejorado 2/2, Golpe de concusión 1/1, Ira enfocada 3/3, Bastión 5/5, Embate con escudo 1/1. Es la opción general equilibrada entre defensa y amenaza. Ira enfocada mejora daño y amenaza; Desvío y Golpe heroico mejorado compiten por preferencia.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 4/5. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Enrage 5/5. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5, Anticipation 5/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, Vanguard 1/1, Improved Shield Wall 2/2, Concussion Blow 1/1, Focused Rage 3/3, Bastion 5/5, Shield Slam 1/1. This is the general balanced option for defense and threat. Focused Rage improves damage and threat; Deflection and Improved Heroic Strike compete as a matter of preference.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Standard Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:e48cff342bad17be85694aa1551cc4b092f41799"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-raid-clavar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos de banda con Clavar","title_en":"Protection: Impale raid talents","summary_es":"Build de banda con Clavar y Heridas profundas para escalar mejor.","summary_en":"Raid build with Impale and Deep Wounds for stronger scaling.","keywords_es":["Protección Clavar banda","Heridas profundas tanque","talentos Protección crítico"],"keywords_en":["Protection Impale raid","tank Deep Wounds","Protection critical talents"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 1/3, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2. Furia: Crueldad 2/5. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5, Anticipación 5/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1, Muro de escudo mejorado 2/2, Golpe de concusión 1/1, Ira enfocada 3/3, Bastión 5/5, Embate con escudo 1/1. Clavar y Heridas profundas favorecen el escalado; Desgarrar gana valor porque ahora escala con poder de ataque. Vanguardia aporta movilidad útil fuera de jefes de banda.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 1/3, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2. Fury: Cruelty 2/5. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5, Anticipation 5/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, Vanguard 1/1, Improved Shield Wall 2/2, Concussion Blow 1/1, Focused Rage 3/3, Bastion 5/5, Shield Slam 1/1. Impale and Deep Wounds improve scaling; Rend gains value because it now scales with Attack Power. Vanguard adds useful mobility outside raid bosses.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Impale Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:e5d76a7ca689aee3281877fcc7b08504de22aa85"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-raid-fury-prot-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos Furia-Protección (1/2) (bandas)","title_en":"Protection: Fury-Prot talents (1/2) (raids)","summary_es":"Variante que sacrifica algo de defensa a cambio de daño.","summary_en":"Variant trading some defense for damage.","keywords_es":["Furia Protección banda","build fury prot Guerrero","tanque más ofensivo"],"keywords_en":["Fury-Prot raid build","Warrior fury prot build","offensive tank"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Manía sangrienta 3/3, Enfurecer 5/5, Golpes temerarios 1/1, Ejecutar mejorado 2/2, Ira rabiosa mejorada 2/2, Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Bebedor de entrañas 2/2, Aluvión 3/3, Sed de sangre 1/1. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Piercing Howl 1/1, Blood Craze 3/3, Enrage 5/5, Reckless Swings 1/1, Improved Execute 2/2, Improved Berserker Rage 2/2, Death Wish 1/1, Gore Drinker 2/2, Flurry 3/3, Bloodthirst 1/1. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Fury-prot Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:3e4f0c7fc199f2edc54bac93a8f0801ee2e68736"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-raid-fury-prot-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos Furia-Protección (2/2) (bandas)","title_en":"Protection: Fury-Prot talents (2/2) (raids)","summary_es":"Variante que sacrifica algo de defensa a cambio de daño.","summary_en":"Variant trading some defense for damage.","keywords_es":["Furia Protección banda","build fury prot Guerrero","tanque más ofensivo"],"keywords_en":["Fury-Prot raid build","Warrior fury prot build","offensive tank"],"text_es":"Protección: Anticipación 2/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1. Hace más daño y escala mejor con Aluvión a costa de algo de supervivencia; es más adecuada con equipo superior. En mazmorras se puede incluir Bebedor de entrañas quitando puntos de Ira rabiosa mejorada o Ejecutar mejorado.","text_en":"Protection: Anticipation 2/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, Vanguard 1/1. It deals more damage and scales better with Flurry at the cost of survivability; it suits a somewhat overgeared character. In dungeons, Gore Drinker can replace Improved Berserker Rage or Improved Execute.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Fury-prot Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:3e4f0c7fc199f2edc54bac93a8f0801ee2e68736"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-raid-doble-arma","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos de banda con doble empuñadura","title_en":"Protection: Dual-Wield raid talents","summary_es":"Variante con dos armas para enemigos con ataques no bloqueables.","summary_en":"Dual-wield variant for enemies with unblockable attacks.","keywords_es":["Protección doble empuñadura","tanque dos armas Guerrero","ataques no bloqueables"],"keywords_en":["Protection dual wield","Warrior dual-wield tank","unblockable attacks"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Precisión furiosa 3/3, Enfurecer 5/5, Especialización en doble empuñadura 5/5, Golpes temerarios 1/1, Ejecutar mejorado 2/2, Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Aluvión 3/3, Sed de sangre 1/1. Solo sirve contra enemigos con ataques no bloqueables. En un jefe normal aumenta un 50% el daño recibido y reduce la amenaza, a cambio de alrededor de un 15% más de daño infligido.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Furious Precision 3/3, Enrage 5/5, Dual Wield Specialization 5/5, Reckless Swings 1/1, Improved Execute 2/2, Death Wish 1/1, Flurry 3/3, Bloodthirst 1/1. It is only for enemies with unblockable attacks. Against a normal boss it increases damage taken by 50% and lowers threat in exchange for about 15% more damage dealt.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Dual Wield Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:c4ab3e82e109253f40107d580110cb028040a952"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-mazmorra-estandar","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos de mazmorra estándar","title_en":"Protection: Standard dungeon talents","summary_es":"Build profunda para tanquear en actitud defensiva en mazmorras.","summary_en":"Deep build for dungeon tanking in Defensive Stance.","keywords_es":["Protección talentos mazmorra","build tanque mazmorra","Protección actitud defensiva"],"keywords_en":["Protection dungeon talents","dungeon tank build","Protection Defensive Stance"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 4/5. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Enfurecer 5/5. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5, Anticipación 2/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Trueno mejorado 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1, Muro de escudo mejorado 2/2, Golpe de concusión 1/1, Ira enfocada 3/3, Bastión 5/5, Embate con escudo 1/1. Facilita permanecer en Actitud defensiva y mantener Enfurecer contra varios enemigos. Para ralentizar en área mientras huyes, puedes mover un punto de Desvío a Aullido penetrante.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 4/5. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Enrage 5/5. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5, Anticipation 2/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Improved Thunder Clap 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, Vanguard 1/1, Improved Shield Wall 2/2, Concussion Blow 1/1, Focused Rage 3/3, Bastion 5/5, Shield Slam 1/1. It supports staying in Defensive Stance and maintaining Enrage against several enemies. For an area slow while kiting, move one Deflection point to Piercing Howl.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:1ad251111b57b621f1e1ef5ce8801606eb82e4fc"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-mazmorra-area-1","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos de mazmorra de área (1/2)","title_en":"Protection: AoE dungeon talents (1/2)","summary_es":"Build de tanque con Golpes de barrido para extender Revancha y Mellar.","summary_en":"Tank build using Sweeping Strikes to spread Revenge and Cleave.","keywords_es":["Protección daño en área","Golpes de barrido tanque","Mellar Revancha Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Protection AoE damage","tank Sweeping Strikes","Warrior Cleave Revenge"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5, Embate mejorado 2/2. Furia: Crueldad 5/5. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, Improved Slam 2/2. Fury: Cruelty 5/5. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5, Improved Revenge 3/3.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:1ad251111b57b621f1e1ef5ce8801606eb82e4fc"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-mazmorra-area-2","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos de mazmorra de área (2/2)","title_en":"Protection: AoE dungeon talents (2/2)","summary_es":"Build de tanque con Golpes de barrido para extender Revancha y Mellar.","summary_en":"Tank build using Sweeping Strikes to spread Revenge and Cleave.","keywords_es":["Protección daño en área","Golpes de barrido tanque","Mellar Revancha Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Protection AoE damage","tank Sweeping Strikes","Warrior Cleave Revenge"],"text_es":"Protección: Trueno mejorado 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1. Golpes de barrido extiende Revancha y Mellar: un Mellar puede golpear cuatro veces en total, no dos. Requiere cambiar de actitud, pero es la build de tanque con más daño y se beneficia de un arma lenta.","text_en":"Protection: Improved Thunder Clap 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, Vanguard 1/1. Sweeping Strikes spreads Revenge and Cleave: one Cleave can hit four times total, not two. It requires stance dancing, but is the highest-damage tank build and benefits from a slow weapon.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior PvE Dungeon Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:1ad251111b57b621f1e1ef5ce8801606eb82e4fc"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-talentos-pvp","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Protección: talentos JcJ","title_en":"Protection: PvP talents","summary_es":"Build JcJ con aturdimiento, silencio, desarme y aguante.","summary_en":"PvP build with stun, silence, disarm, and sustain.","keywords_es":["talentos Protección JcJ","build PvP Guerrero tanque","Desarmar mejorado Protección"],"keywords_en":["Protection PvP talents","Warrior tank PvP build","Protection Improved Disarm"],"text_es":"Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Manía sangrienta 3/3, Enfurecer 5/5. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5, Voluntad férrea 5/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desarmar mejorado 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1, Azote de escudo mejorado 2/2, Golpe de concusión 1/1, Ira enfocada 3/3, Bastión 5/5, Embate con escudo 1/1. Destaca en duelos contra cuerpo a cuerpo; controla con aturdimiento de 5 s, silencio de 3 s y Desactivar cada 40 s. Embate con escudo disipa magia y Manía sangrienta aporta autocuración.","text_en":"Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Piercing Howl 1/1, Blood Craze 3/3, Enrage 5/5. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5, Iron Will 5/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Improved Disarm 3/3, Vanguard 1/1, Improved Shield Bash 2/2, Concussion Blow 1/1, Focused Rage 3/3, Bastion 5/5, Shield Slam 1/1. It excels in duels against melee; it controls with a 5-second stun, 3-second silence, and Disarm every 40 seconds. Shield Slam dispels magic, and Blood Craze provides self-healing.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Protection Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior PvP Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/talent-builds-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:4b1b8219a698e5db02374eb1808b71dabb1b6434"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-talentos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas: talentos para subir de nivel","title_en":"Arms: leveling talents","summary_es":"Build de 51 puntos de Armas para subir de nivel.","summary_en":"51-point Arms build for leveling.","keywords_es":["talentos Armas para subir","build Guerrero leveo Armas","Embestir mejorado Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Arms leveling talents","Arms leveling build","Improved Charge Warrior"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Embestir mejorado 2/2, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Fragor de la sangre 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5, Embate mejorado 2/2, Golpe mortal 1/1. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Ira persistente 5/5, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Enfurecer 5/5. Para subir, omite Sanguinario mejorado y Golpe heroico mejorado: Golpe heroico gasta y frena la furia, mientras Sanguinario convierte furia en salud de forma ineficiente.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Charge 2/2, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3, Impale 2/2, Bloodthrill 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, Improved Slam 2/2, Mortal Strike 1/1. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Lingering Rage 5/5, Piercing Howl 1/1, Enrage 5/5. For leveling, skip Improved Bloodrage and Improved Heroic Strike: Heroic Strike spends and stops Rage generation, while Bloodrage converts Rage to health inefficiently.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Best Arms Warrior Talent Tree Builds - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior Leveling Build","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/talent-builds-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:talents"],"source_hashes":["section:effba622a066684f324b0597eef88936f72d40d4"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-build-subir-wowhead","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Armas","title_en":"Arms Leveling Build","summary_es":"Build de subida de Armas con talentos de las ramas Armas y Furia.","summary_en":"Arms leveling build with talents from the Arms and Fury trees.","keywords_es":["build de subida Armas","talentos Armas 1-60","build Guerrero para subir"],"keywords_en":["Arms leveling build","Arms talents 1-60","Warrior leveling build"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Embestir mejorado 2/2, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Lanzazo 1/1, Especialización en armas de dos manos 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Fragor de la sangre 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5, Embate mejorado 2/2 y Golpe mortal 1/1. Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Ira persistente 5/5 y Enfurecer 5/5.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Charge 2/2, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Spearing Strike 1/1, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 3/3, Impale 2/2, Bloodthrill 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, Improved Slam 2/2, and Mortal Strike 1/1. Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Lingering Rage 5/5, and Enrage 5/5.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Arms Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:dd7ba003c5e6818f2bde2adf5fc132f4f296978c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-build-subir-pve-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Furia (Armas)","title_en":"Fury Leveling Build (Arms)","summary_es":"Talentos de Armas para la build de subida de Furia de 16/35/0.","summary_en":"Arms talents for the 16/35/0 Fury leveling build.","keywords_es":["build subida Furia rama Armas","talentos Armas Furia leveo","Furia 16 35 0"],"keywords_en":["Fury leveling Arms build","Fury Arms talents leveling","Fury 16 35 0"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 2/3, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Control de furia 1/1 y Heridas profundas 3/3.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 2/3, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, Anger Management 1/1, and Deep Wounds 3/3.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling and PvE Guide › The build: Fury Leveling and PvE (16/35/0)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide-35029","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:extra:wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:a25783a78348023d064550f019a484b59cd79c18"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-build-subir-pve-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Furia (Furia)","title_en":"Fury Leveling Build (Fury)","summary_es":"Talentos de Furia para la build de subida 16/35/0.","summary_en":"Fury talents for the 16/35/0 leveling build.","keywords_es":["build subida Furia talentos","talentos rama Furia leveo","Furia 35 puntos"],"keywords_en":["Fury leveling talents","Fury tree leveling build","Fury 35 points"],"text_es":"Furia: Voz retumbante 1/5, Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Precisión furiosa 3/3, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Manía sangrienta 2/3, Especialización en doble empuñadura 5/5, Torbellino mejorado 1/2, Enfurecer 5/5, Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Aluvión 3/3 y Sed de sangre 1/1.","text_en":"Fury: Booming Voice 1/5, Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Furious Precision 3/3, Piercing Howl 1/1, Blood Craze 2/3, Dual Wield Specialization 5/5, Improved Whirlwind 1/2, Enrage 5/5, Death Wish 1/1, Flurry 3/3, and Bloodthirst 1/1.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling and PvE Guide › The build: Fury Leveling and PvE (16/35/0)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide-35029","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:extra:wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:a25783a78348023d064550f019a484b59cd79c18"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-build-subir-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Furia: rama Armas","title_en":"Fury Leveling Build: Arms Tree","summary_es":"Talentos de Armas en la build de subida principal de Furia.","summary_en":"Arms talents in the main Fury leveling build.","keywords_es":["Furia build subir rama Armas","talentos Armas Furia","Desvío y Maestría táctica"],"keywords_en":["Fury leveling Arms tree","Fury Arms talents","Deflection and Tactical Mastery"],"text_es":"Armas: Desvío 5/5, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Abrumar mejorado 2/2 y Control de furia 1/1.","text_en":"Arms: Deflection 5/5, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Improved Overpower 2/2, and Anger Management 1/1.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:60912d4380d6d5944b83c7f828b03ad767e7af08"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-build-subir-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Furia: rama Furia","title_en":"Fury Leveling Build: Fury Tree","summary_es":"Talentos de la rama Furia de la build de subida principal.","summary_en":"Fury-tree talents from the main leveling build.","keywords_es":["build Furia para subir","talentos rama Furia leveo","Sed de sangre build subida"],"keywords_en":["Fury leveling build","Fury tree talents leveling","Bloodthirst leveling build"],"text_es":"Furia: Crueldad 5/5, Cólera desbocada 5/5, Precisión furiosa 3/3, Manía sangrienta 3/3, Enfurecer 5/5, Especialización en doble empuñadura 5/5, Golpes temerarios 1/1, Ejecutar mejorado 2/2, Ira rabiosa mejorada 2/2, Deseo de la Muerte 1/1, Bebedor de entrañas 2/2, Torbellino mejorado 2/2, Aluvión 3/3 y Sed de sangre 1/1.","text_en":"Fury: Cruelty 5/5, Unbridled Wrath 5/5, Furious Precision 3/3, Blood Craze 3/3, Enrage 5/5, Dual Wield Specialization 5/5, Reckless Swings 1/1, Improved Execute 2/2, Improved Berserker Rage 2/2, Death Wish 1/1, Gore Drinker 2/2, Improved Whirlwind 2/2, Flurry 3/3, and Bloodthirst 1/1.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:60912d4380d6d5944b83c7f828b03ad767e7af08"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-build-subir-profunda-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Protección: Furia","title_en":"Protection Leveling Build: Fury","summary_es":"Talentos de Furia de la build profunda de Protección.","summary_en":"Fury talents in the deep Protection leveling build.","keywords_es":["build subir Protección Furia","talentos Furia tanque leveo","Protección profunda Furia"],"keywords_en":["Protection leveling Fury talents","Fury tank leveling build","deep Protection Fury"],"text_es":"Furia: Voz retumbante 5/5, Crueldad 5/5, Aullido penetrante 1/1, Manía sangrienta 3/3 y Enfurecer 5/5.","text_en":"Fury: Booming Voice 5/5, Cruelty 5/5, Piercing Howl 1/1, Blood Craze 3/3, and Enrage 5/5.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-build-subir-profunda-proteccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Protección: Protección","title_en":"Protection Leveling Build: Protection","summary_es":"Talentos de Protección de la ruta profunda para subir.","summary_en":"Protection talents in the deep leveling route.","keywords_es":["build subir Protección talentos","talentos Protección 1-60","Embate con escudo build subida"],"keywords_en":["Protection leveling talent build","Protection talents 1-60","Shield Slam leveling build"],"text_es":"Protección: Sanguinario mejorado 2/2, Especialización en escudos 5/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Trueno mejorado 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3, Vanguardia 1/1, Muro de escudo mejorado 2/2, Golpe de concusión 1/1, Ira enfocada 3/3, Bastión 5/5 y Embate con escudo 1/1.","text_en":"Protection: Improved Bloodrage 2/2, Shield Specialization 5/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Improved Thunder Clap 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, Vanguard 1/1, Improved Shield Wall 2/2, Concussion Blow 1/1, Focused Rage 3/3, Bastion 5/5, and Shield Slam 1/1.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-build-subir-alternativa-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Protección: Armas","title_en":"Protection Leveling Build: Arms","summary_es":"Talentos de Armas de la alternativa de Protección centrada en cleave.","summary_en":"Arms talents in the cleave-focused Protection alternative.","keywords_es":["Protección build subida Armas","talentos Armas tanque leveo","Golpes de barrido Protección"],"keywords_en":["Protection Arms leveling build","Arms talents tank leveling","Protection Sweeping Strikes"],"text_es":"Armas: Golpe heroico mejorado 3/3, Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3, Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3, Control de furia 1/1, Heridas profundas 3/3, Clavar 2/2, Golpes de barrido 1/1, Maestro de armas 5/5 y Embate mejorado 2/2.","text_en":"Arms: Improved Heroic Strike 3/3, Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3, Anger Management 1/1, Deep Wounds 3/3, Impale 2/2, Sweeping Strikes 1/1, Weaponmaster 5/5, and Improved Slam 2/2.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-build-subir-alternativa-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de subida de Protección: Furia y Protección","title_en":"Protection Leveling Build: Fury and Protection","summary_es":"Talentos de Furia y Protección de la alternativa de cleave.","summary_en":"Fury and Protection talents in the cleave-focused alternative.","keywords_es":["build Protección Furia","talentos Protección subida alternativa","Crueldad tanque Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Protection Fury build","Protection alternative leveling talents","Warrior tank Cruelty"],"text_es":"Furia: Crueldad 5/5. Protección: Especialización en escudos 5/5, Revancha mejorada 3/3, Trueno mejorado 3/3, Última posición 1/1, Maestro de defensa 2/2, Desafío 3/3 y Vanguardia 1/1.","text_en":"Fury: Cruelty 5/5. Protection: Shield Specialization 5/5, Improved Revenge 3/3, Improved Thunder Clap 3/3, Last Stand 1/1, Master of Defense 2/2, Defiance 3/3, and Vanguard 1/1.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-habilidades-entrenar-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades que entrenar: Armas","title_en":"Abilities to Train: Arms","summary_es":"Prioriza los rangos esenciales de Armas y ahorra en facultades opcionales.","summary_en":"Prioritize essential Arms ranks and save gold on optional abilities.","keywords_es":["habilidades entrenar Armas","rangos Armas Guerrero","ahorrar oro entrenador Armas"],"keywords_en":["Arms abilities to train","Warrior Arms ranks","save gold Arms trainer"],"text_es":"Entrena los rangos de Golpe heroico, Grito de guerra, Embestir, Desgarrar, Hender armadura, Abrumar, Mellar y Golpe mortal; aprende Ataque de la victoria y Temeridad. Trueno, Seccionar, Grito desmoralizador y Falsa arremetida son opcionales y puedes saltarte sus rangos para ahorrar oro.","text_en":"Train the ranks of Heroic Strike, Battle Shout, Charge, Rend, Sunder Armor, Overpower, Cleave, and Mortal Strike; learn Victory Rush and Recklessness. Thunder Clap, Hamstring, Demoralizing Shout, and Mocking Blow are optional, and you can skip their ranks to save gold.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Arms Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Arms Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:1c25e003ba1bffe75d7fee38f86dd473b2f6a332","section:91e6054df3a6e6bb797bc953f8dc6aea6292b7ee"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-habilidades-entrenar-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades que entrenar: Furia","title_en":"Abilities to Train: Fury","summary_es":"Furia prioriza Desgarrar, Abrumar, Grito de guerra y Zurrar.","summary_en":"Fury prioritizes Rend, Overpower, Battle Shout, and Pummel.","keywords_es":["habilidades entrenar Furia","rangos Guerrero Furia","entrenar Zurrar Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Fury abilities to train","Fury Warrior ranks","train Warrior Pummel"],"text_es":"Como esenciales, entrena Desgarrar, Abrumar, Grito de guerra y Zurrar (un rango). Falsa arremetida, Mellar, Embate y Trueno son opcionales; puedes prescindir de algunos rangos según tu estilo y ahorrar oro.","text_en":"Train Rend, Overpower, Battle Shout, and one rank of Pummel as core abilities. Mocking Blow, Cleave, Slam, and Thunder Clap are optional; skip some ranks depending on your playstyle to save gold.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Fury Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Fury Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4fbdda66e2c1f4c4395c8dbfabc49559c8396b44","section:9896b463388e4a01390a80f605d8ab1a8ce8afe8"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-habilidades-entrenar-proteccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Habilidades que entrenar: Protección","title_en":"Abilities to Train: Protection","summary_es":"Protección prioriza los gritos, Revancha, Bloquear con escudo y Embate con escudo.","summary_en":"Protection prioritizes Shouts, Revenge, Shield Block, and Shield Slam.","keywords_es":["habilidades entrenar Protección","rangos tanque Guerrero","entrenar Revancha escudo"],"keywords_en":["Protection abilities to train","Warrior tank ranks","train Revenge Shield Block"],"text_es":"Entrena Golpe heroico, Grito de guerra, Embestir, Desgarrar, Trueno, Hender armadura, Revancha, Grito desmoralizador, Bloquear con escudo, Mellar, Ataque de la victoria y Embate con escudo. Desactivar, Embate, Grito intimidador, Abrumar, Huracán y Zurrar son opcionales y sus rangos se pueden omitir para ahorrar.","text_en":"Train Heroic Strike, Battle Shout, Charge, Rend, Thunder Clap, Sunder Armor, Revenge, Demoralizing Shout, Shield Block, Cleave, Victory Rush, and Shield Slam. Disarm, Slam, Intimidating Shout, Overpower, Whirlwind, and Pummel are optional, and their ranks can be skipped to save gold.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Mandatory Abilities to Train for Protection Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Optional Abilities to Train for Protection Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:2c64089c5c27f6503e330b5d26e9956ec7aa80cb","section:e6d673cb048ff24093997836994c87b743d5dbae"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-profesiones-subida-forever","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones útiles al subir","title_en":"Useful Leveling Professions","summary_es":"Minería, Herrería, Peletería y Desollar ofrecen distintas ventajas durante la subida.","summary_en":"Mining, Blacksmithing, Leatherworking, and Skinning offer different leveling benefits.","keywords_es":["profesiones Guerrero subida","Peletería Tienda de campamento","Desollar oro subir","Minería y Herrería Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Warrior leveling professions","Leatherworking Camp Tent","Skinning leveling gold","Warrior Mining Blacksmithing"],"text_es":"Minería y Herrería combinan: los materiales permiten fabricar mejoras de equipo y vender armas. Para acelerar la subida, Peletería a nivel 20 habilita Tienda de campamento, que aporta experiencia descansada; no hace falta subirla más si no te interesa. Desollar también da oro pronto con poco esfuerzo.","text_en":"Mining pairs with Blacksmithing: gathered materials can become gear upgrades, and crafted weapons can be sold. To level faster, Leatherworking at skill 20 unlocks Camp Tent for rested experience; there is little reason to level it further if that is your only goal. Skinning also provides early gold with little effort.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:99409b757ee9c64b29cac2b01d826c01bbec3778","section:d0fd04480985006e6e07422a445fa18c6b59a2d3"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-consumibles-subida-comida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Comida y consumibles para subir","title_en":"Food and Consumables for Leveling","summary_es":"La comida aporta experiencia por muertes; las pociones y piedras ayudan en combate.","summary_en":"Food grants kill experience; potions and sharpening stones help in combat.","keywords_es":["comida Guerrero experiencia","consumibles de subida Guerrero","Pargo de lodo boquilargo","piedra de afilar Guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Warrior food experience","Warrior leveling consumables","Longjaw Mud Snapper","Warrior sharpening stone"],"text_es":"Mantén un beneficio de comida: la comida otorga un 5% más de experiencia al matar enemigos. Pargo de lodo boquilargo es una opción barata y temprana que además da 10 de poder de ataque. En tu primer personaje, prioriza pociones de curación para emergencias; las piedras de afilar o de peso también aumentan el daño.","text_en":"Keep a food buff active: food grants 5% more experience from kills. Longjaw Mud Snapper is an inexpensive early option that also gives 10 Attack Power. On your first character, prioritize Healing Potions for emergencies; sharpening or weightstones also increase damage.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Consumables for Protection Warrior Tank in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:leveling","class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:27e90d55933440b4e9b3bb6d36b9d24ef6249359","section:3b42332d7eb3f16b1b3a348e27b7ed13458597c3"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-armas-ruta-talentos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de talentos de Armas al subir","title_en":"Arms Talent Priorities While Leveling","summary_es":"La build de subida potencia la furia, la supervivencia y sus ataques clave.","summary_en":"The leveling build improves Rage, survivability, and key attacks.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos Armas subir","prioridad de talentos Armas","Embate mejorado build subir"],"keywords_en":["Arms leveling talent path","Arms talent priorities","Improved Slam leveling build"],"text_es":"La build de subida prioriza Desvío 5/5 para aguantar, Abrumar mejorado 2/2, Fragor de la sangre 2/2 y Embate mejorado 2/2 para elevar el daño; Golpe mortal 1/1 es otro salto importante. No uses Embate hasta tener Embate mejorado, que lo incorpora a la rotación.","text_en":"The leveling build prioritizes Deflection 5/5 for survivability, Improved Overpower 2/2, Bloodthrill 2/2, and Improved Slam 2/2 for damage; Mortal Strike 1/1 is another major spike. Avoid Slam until you have Improved Slam, which brings it into the rotation.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Arms Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:dd7ba003c5e6818f2bde2adf5fc132f4f296978c"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-ruta-talentos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prioridad de talentos de Furia al subir","title_en":"Fury Talent Priorities While Leveling","summary_es":"Sed de sangre y Bebedor de entrañas reducen el tiempo de inactividad.","summary_en":"Bloodthirst and Gore Drinker reduce downtime.","keywords_es":["ruta talentos Furia subir","prioridad de talentos Furia","Bebedor de entrañas y Sed de sangre"],"keywords_en":["Fury leveling talent path","Fury talent priorities","Gore Drinker and Bloodthirst"],"text_es":"Avanza pronto por Furia para obtener Bebedor de entrañas 2/2 y Sed de sangre 1/1, talentos centrales para reducir las pausas. Después completa Aluvión 3/3 para aprovechar los críticos; luego pasa a Armas por Desvío 5/5, Desgarrar mejorado 3/3 y Abrumar mejorado 2/2.","text_en":"Move quickly through Fury to reach Gore Drinker 2/2 and Bloodthirst 1/1, core talents for reducing downtime. Then complete Flurry 3/3 to benefit from critical strikes, before moving into Arms for Deflection 5/5, Improved Rend 3/3, and Improved Overpower 2/2.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:60912d4380d6d5944b83c7f828b03ad767e7af08"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-proteccion-rutas-talentos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rutas de talentos de Protección al subir","title_en":"Protection Leveling Talent Routes","summary_es":"Protección profunda es más relajada; Armas añade complejidad y Furia, autosuficiencia.","summary_en":"Deep Protection is more relaxed; Arms adds complexity and Fury adds self-sufficiency.","keywords_es":["rutas talentos Protección leveo","Protección profunda subir","build Armas Protección experto","talentos Furia Protección"],"keywords_en":["Protection leveling talent routes","deep Protection leveling","experienced Arms Protection build","Fury Protection talents"],"text_es":"La ruta profunda de Protección es la recomendada para la mayoría por su estilo más relajado. La alternativa de Armas añade daño contra varios enemigos y cambios de actitud, con más complejidad para guerreros experimentados. También puedes elegir Furia para sumar daño y autosuficiencia más adelante.","text_en":"The deep Protection route is recommended for most players because it offers a more relaxed style. The Arms alternative adds cleave and stance switching, making it more complex and suited to experienced Warriors. Fury is another option for adding damage and self-sufficiency later on.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Protection Warrior Tank in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:protection:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:af995e062014605042edf9e56de75be041d3d1fe"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-hitos-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de subida de Furia","title_en":"Fury Leveling Milestones","summary_es":"Actitud rabiosa llega a 30; Huracán a 36 y Sed de sangre a 40.","summary_en":"Berserker Stance arrives at 30; Whirlwind at 36 and Bloodthirst at 40.","keywords_es":["hitos Furia subir","nivel Huracán Guerrero","nivel Sed de sangre Furia","Golpes temerarios nivel 31"],"keywords_en":["Fury leveling milestones","Warrior Whirlwind level","Fury Bloodthirst level","Reckless Swings level 31"],"text_es":"A nivel 30, completa la misión de clase para Actitud rabiosa y alcanza Deseo de la Muerte; a 36 aprende Huracán, y a 40, Sed de sangre. Temeridad se entrena a 50.","text_en":"At level 30, complete the class quest for Berserker Stance and reach Death Wish; learn Whirlwind at 36 and Bloodthirst at 40. Train Recklessness at 50.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling and PvE Guide › Leveling playstyle","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide-35029","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling and PvE Guide › Toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide-35029","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Milestones > Important Unlocks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:extra:wow-forever-fury-warrior-leveling-and-pve-guide","class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["guide:baf6ab9f1243adfa8aac49ced45104e22290f803","section:72e2b8d0788e2809d2b9de2a8ec4ed5efd153a1f","section:ee54209c7f2dc45a83973674d89ad8a567e23705"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-campamento-subida","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Beneficios de campamento al subir","title_en":"Camp Buffs While Leveling","summary_es":"Tienda de campamento da experiencia descansada; otras mejoras aportan ataque o crítico.","summary_en":"Camp Tent grants rested experience; other buffs add Attack Power or crit.","keywords_es":["beneficio de campamento Guerrero","Tienda de campamento experiencia","Magnetita Poderío","Silla de campamento crítico"],"keywords_en":["Warrior camp buff","Camp Tent rested experience","Lodestone Attack Power","Camp Chair crit"],"text_es":"Si solo eliges un beneficio para subir, Tienda de campamento aporta hasta un 5% de experiencia descansada; requiere Peletería 20 y no sirve si ya superas ese límite de descanso. Magnetita suma poder de ataque cuerpo a cuerpo, y Silla de campamento otorga un 2% de crítico; elige según los beneficios que ya recibas.","text_en":"If you choose only one leveling camp buff, Camp Tent grants up to 5% rested experience; it requires Leatherworking 20 and has no effect once you exceed that rested amount. Lodestone adds melee Attack Power, while Camp Chair grants 2% crit; choose based on buffs you already have.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Leveling Guide  - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Professions for Arms Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Leveling Camping Buffs for Fury Warrior DPS in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:arms:leveling","class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:4d5800361970694b00f44fdffec84b47eb3a0f33","section:99409b757ee9c64b29cac2b01d826c01bbec3778","section:d936d2284a3f840ab2c1e6ef0b2e6d6819d088ae"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-furia-orden-talentos-1-52","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Furia: orden de talentos hasta nivel 52 (subida)","title_en":"Fury: Talent Order Through Level 52","summary_es":"Orden de talentos de Furia desde los primeros puntos hasta Maestría táctica mejorada.","summary_en":"Fury talent order from its early points through Improved Tactical Mastery.","keywords_es":["orden talentos Furia","ruta Furia nivel 52","talentos Guerrero nivel por nivel"],"keywords_en":["Fury talent order","Fury level 52 path","Warrior talents by level"],"text_es":"10-14: Crueldad 5/5; 15-19: Cólera desbocada 5/5; 20-22: Precisión furiosa 3/3; 25-29: Especialización en doble empuñadura 5/5; 30: Deseo de la Muerte 1/1; 31: Golpes temerarios 1/1; 32-33: Ira rabiosa mejorada 2/2; 35-36: Huracán mejorado 2/2; 37-39: Aluvión 3/3; 40: Sed de sangre 1/1; 50-52: Maestría táctica mejorada 3/3. Entrena doble empuñadura a nivel 20.","text_en":"Levels 10-14: Cruelty 5/5; 15-19: Unbridled Wrath 5/5; 20-22: Furious Precision 3/3; 25-29: Dual Wield Specialization 5/5; 30: Death Wish 1/1; 31: Reckless Swings 1/1; 32-33: Improved Berserker Rage 2/2; 35-36: Improved Whirlwind 2/2; 37-39: Flurry 3/3; 40: Bloodthirst 1/1; 50-52: Improved Tactical Mastery 3/3. Train dual wield at level 20.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fury Warrior Leveling Guide › Leveling Talent Build","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fury-warrior-leveling","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Leveling Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Talent Builds for Leveling as Fury Warrior DPS in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/dps-leveling-tips","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-17","topics":["class:warrior:fury:leveling"],"source_hashes":["section:60912d4380d6d5944b83c7f828b03ad767e7af08","section:dd91363c3dfc033c1a7f4fafcfae70faeba7e950"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-cooldowns-defensivos-detalle","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Guerrero: cifras de enfriamientos y defensas","title_en":"Warrior cooldown and defense numbers","summary_es":"Temeridad, Represalias, Muro de escudo, Bloquear con escudo.","summary_en":"Recklessness, Retaliation, Shield Wall, Shield Block.","keywords_es":["temeridad cuánto dura","represalias guerrero","muro de escudo cuánto reduce","bloquear con escudo cuántos ataques","ira rabiosa cuánto dura"],"keywords_en":["recklessness duration","retaliation warrior","shield wall how much","shield block how many attacks","berserker rage duration"],"text_es":"En Forever los grandes enfriamientos del Guerrero ya no comparten reutilización. Temeridad: 100 % de crítico e inmunidad al miedo 15 s, pero recibes un 20 % más de daño. Represalias: contraataca cada golpe cuerpo a cuerpo 15 s (máximo 30 ataques; no desde la espalda). Muro de escudo: -60 % de daño 12 s. Bloquear con escudo: +75 % de bloqueo 7 s, pero solo 2 ataques. Ira rabiosa: inmunidad a miedo e incapacitación 10 s. Sanguinario: 10 de ira ya y otros 10 en 10 s a costa del 10 % de salud.","text_en":"In Forever the Warrior's big cooldowns no longer share a cooldown. Recklessness: 100% crit and fear immunity for 15 s, but you take 20% more damage. Retaliation: counterattacks every melee hit for 15 s (maximum 30 attacks; not from behind). Shield Wall: -60% damage for 12 s. Shield Block: +75% block for 7 s, but only 2 attacks. Berserker Rage: immunity to fear and incapacitate for 10 s. Bloodrage: 10 Rage now and 10 more over 10 s at the cost of 10% health.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Abilities Guide - Forever › Major Cooldowns for Arms Warriors in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Abilities Guide - Forever › Defensive abilities for Arms Warriors in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility spells for Arms Warriors in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:warrior:arms:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:441acce4c725e2f0734e6c496e47abebcf03a007","section:90020f650779da78173bc22dd899285d3d1446ee","section:f9b6e44a22aeb829b94a3357873f2ece55edff39"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-utilidades-numeros","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Guerrero: duraciones de debilitaciones y movilidad","title_en":"Warrior debuff and mobility durations","summary_es":"Trueno, Grito desmoralizador, Seccionar, Embestir e Interceptar.","summary_en":"Thunder Clap, Demoralizing Shout, Hamstring, Charge and Intercept.","keywords_es":["trueno cuánto dura","grito desmoralizador cuánto dura","embestir aturde cuánto","interceptar aturdimiento","ataque de la victoria cuándo"],"keywords_en":["thunder clap duration","demoralizing shout duration","charge stun duration","intercept stun","victory rush when"],"text_es":"Trueno reduce un 20 % la velocidad de ataque enemiga 26 s; Grito desmoralizador baja su poder de ataque 45 s (10 m). Seccionar ralentiza un 50 % 15 s. Grito intimidador asusta a 5 enemigos 8 s. Mellar y Golpe heroico potencian el siguiente ataque automático. Embestir aturde 1 s y da 15 de ira, pero no vale en combate; Interceptar aturde 3 s. Ataque de la victoria cura el 10 % de tu salud y solo se puede usar 20 s después de matar a un enemigo no trivial. Zurrar interrumpe y bloquea la escuela 4 s.","text_en":"Thunder Clap lowers enemy attack speed by 20% for 26 s; Demoralizing Shout reduces their attack power for 45 s (10 yd). Hamstring slows by 50% for 15 s. Intimidating Shout fears 5 enemies for 8 s. Cleave and Heroic Strike empower your next auto attack. Charge stuns for 1 s and gives 15 Rage but cannot be used in combat; Intercept stuns for 3 s. Victory Rush heals 10% of your health and is only usable within 20 s after killing a non-trivial enemy. Pummel interrupts and locks the school for 4 s.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Abilities Guide - Forever › Utility spells for Arms Warriors in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Abilities Guide - Forever › Mobility Abilities for Arms Warriors in Forever Classic","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Abilities Guide - Forever › Damage Spells for Arms Warriors in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/dps-abilities","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:warrior:arms:abilities"],"source_hashes":["section:715b1b5821d4546fc2ab5d978495472d2f0def9a","section:90020f650779da78173bc22dd899285d3d1446ee","section:e08d728f0d2cdba7d756a5fc95b0bfefe91f5c58"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-encantamientos-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Guerrero Armas","title_en":"Arms Warrior enchants","summary_es":"Qué encantar con el Guerrero Armas por hueco y nivel mientras subes.","summary_en":"What to enchant as an Arms Warrior by slot and level while leveling.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo guerrero","qué encantamientos pongo de guerrero","encantamientos para guerrero","encantamientos guerrero armas","qué encantar guerrero","complemento fuerte armadura guerrero","encantar arma recuperación guerrero","fuerza inferior arma 2M"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a warrior","best enchants for warrior","arms warrior enchants","what to enchant warrior","forceful armor kit warrior","recovery weapon warrior","lesser strength 2h"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Guerrero Armas: Arma: Encantar arma: recuperación (restaura el 5% de tu salud al parar o esquivar, 10 s de reutilización) o el de fuerza inferior a dos manos (+15 fuerza, Encantamiento 220). Collar: fuerza (210). Torso: estadísticas (+3 a todo, Encantamiento 245). Brazales: fuerza menor, fuerza, fuerza superior o excelente (+9). Botas: agilidad inferior o velocidad menor (+8%). En torso, piernas, manos o pies, Complementos para armadura fuertes: +4, +6, +8 y +10 de poder de ataque en los niveles 15, 30, 40 y 50.","text_en":"Arms Warrior enchants: Weapon: Enchant Weapon - Recovery (restores 5% of your health when you parry or dodge, 10 sec cooldown) or the two-hand Lesser Strength (+15 Strength, Enchanting 220). Neck: Strength (210). Chest: Stats (+3 to all, Enchanting 245). Bracers: Minor Strength, Strength, Greater or Superior Strength (+9). Boots: Lesser Agility or Minor Speed (+8%). On chest, legs, hands or feet, Forceful Armor Kits: +4, +6, +8 and +10 Attack Power at levels 15, 30, 40 and 50.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Enchants & Consumables Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Enchants & Consumables Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Options by Level","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:warrior:arms:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:3a08d49986cd3e617fb1668e251d5e6e859af96b","section:b1673b6dba95baf7ea5c45849816739c1ad8be9b"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-consumibles-armas","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consumibles del Guerrero Armas","title_en":"Arms Warrior consumables","summary_es":"Elixires, piedras de afilar y comida del Guerrero Armas por nivel, y qué se acumula.","summary_en":"Elixirs, sharpening stones and food for the Arms Warrior by level, and what stacks.","keywords_es":["qué consumibles uso siendo guerrero","qué consumibles uso de guerrero","consumibles para guerrero","qué elixires uso de guerrero","consumibles guerrero armas","elixires guerrero","piedra de afilar guerrero","qué comida guerrero fuerza"],"keywords_en":["what consumables as a warrior","best consumables for warrior","arms warrior consumables","warrior elixirs","warrior sharpening stone","warrior strength food","weightstone mace"],"text_es":"Consumibles del Guerrero Armas: Elixires de fuerza (nivel 1 Elixir de fuerza de león, 20 Elixir de fuerza de ogro, 48 Elixir de gigantes, +25) y de agilidad (hasta Elixir de agilidad superior, nivel 38, +25); todos se acumulan. Piedra de afilar sube de basta a densa (+8 de daño a nivel 35) y elemental a nivel 50 (+2% crítico); con maza o bastón, la Piedrafuerte. Se pueden combinar con tótems como Viento Furioso. Comida de fuerza, hasta +20 (Bolas de masa del desierto ahumadas, nivel 45); da +5% de experiencia.","text_en":"Arms Warrior consumables: Strength elixirs (level 1 Elixir of Minor Strength, 20 Ogre Strength, 48 Elixir of Giants, +25) and Agility elixirs (up to Greater Agility at level 38, +25); all stack. Sharpening stones go from Rough to Dense (+8 damage at level 35) and Elemental at level 50 (+2% crit); with a mace or staff, use Weightstones. They can be combined with totems such as Windfury. Strength food, up to +20 (Smoked Desert Dumplings, level 45); it gives +5% experience.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Arms Warrior Enchants & Consumables Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Arms Warrior Consumables for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/arms/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:warrior:arms:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:21628619b68b2bd14bfb2be7a0e2b7a96f5697d8"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-encantamientos-furia","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos del Guerrero Furia","title_en":"Fury Warrior enchants","summary_es":"Qué encantar y consumir con el Guerrero Furia mientras subes.","summary_en":"What to enchant and consume as a Fury Warrior while leveling.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo guerrero","qué encantamientos pongo de guerrero","encantamientos para guerrero","encantamientos guerrero furia","qué encantar guerrero furia","capa agilidad inferior guerrero","piedrafuerte densa"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a warrior","best enchants for warrior","fury warrior enchants","what to enchant fury warrior","lesser agility cloak warrior","dense weightstone"],"text_es":"Encantamientos del Guerrero Furia: Arma: Encantar arma: recuperación. Capa: Encantar capa: agilidad inferior. Torso: Encantar pechera: estadísticas inferiores. Botas: Encantar botas: velocidad menor. En el arma, Piedra de afilar densa o Piedrafuerte densa, o la piedra que te toque por nivel.","text_en":"Fury Warrior enchants: Weapon: Enchant Weapon - Recovery. Cloak: Enchant Cloak - Lesser Agility. Chest: Enchant Chest - Lesser Stats. Boots: Enchant Boots - Minor Speed. On the weapon, Dense Sharpening Stone or Dense Weightstone, or the stone for your level.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fury Warrior Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Fury Warrior Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/enchants-consumables-pve-dps","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:warrior:fury:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:1bbd93e33b0b24c0cfe934bfa603acda8d15ec28"]},{"id":"clase-warrior-encantamientos-proteccion","chapter":4,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamientos y consumibles del Guerrero Protección","title_en":"Protection Warrior enchants and consumables","summary_es":"Qué encantar y consumir con el Guerrero Protección al subir, con aguante y escudo.","summary_en":"What to enchant and consume as a Protection Warrior while leveling, with Stamina and shield.","keywords_es":["qué encanto siendo guerrero","qué encantamientos pongo de guerrero","encantamientos para guerrero","encantamientos guerrero protección","qué encantar guerrero tanque","arma abrasadora guerrero","punta de escudo guerrero","consumibles guerrero protección"],"keywords_en":["what to enchant as a warrior","best enchants for warrior","protection warrior enchants","what to enchant warrior tank","fiery weapon warrior","shield spike warrior","protection warrior consumables"],"text_es":"Encantamientos y consumibles del Guerrero Protección: Arma: Encantar arma: arma abrasadora (golpea a menudo con 40 de daño de fuego, Encantamiento 265). Torso: aguante, hasta excelente; Encantar botas: aguante superior y Encantar escudo: aguante superior a nivel 40-60. Collar y brazales de fuerza; botas de velocidad menor. Las puntas de escudo de herrería añaden daño por bloqueo (hierro 8-12). Los complementos fuertes en torso, piernas, manos y pies. Los consumibles siguen las mismas reglas que Armas: elixires acumulables, una comida, pociones con reutilización común.","text_en":"Protection Warrior enchants and consumables: Weapon: Enchant Weapon - Fiery Weapon (often strikes for 40 fire damage, Enchanting 265). Chest: Stamina, up to Superior; Enchant Boots - Greater Stamina and Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina at levels 40-60. Strength on neck and bracers; Minor Speed boots. Blacksmithing shield spikes add damage per block (Iron 8-12). Forceful kits on chest, legs, hands and feet. Consumables follow the Arms rules: elixirs stack, one food, potions share a cooldown.","tags":["WARRIOR"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Best Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Protection Warrior Enchants for Leveling in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/enchants-consumables-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Protection Warrior Best Enchants & Consumables - WoW: Forever › Best Options by Level","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/protection/enchants-consumables-pve-tank","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["class:warrior:protection:enchants"],"source_hashes":["section:666c517cd680ae56270ab15a2add13e20933e260","section:666c8adc9561cd131329851f88c2b220489e3086"]}]},"05-profesiones.json":{"description":"Capítulo 5: Profesiones. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"prof-cuantas-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cuántas profesiones puedes tener","title_en":"How Many Professions You Can Have","summary_es":"Puedes aprender dos profesiones primarias y las tres secundarias en cada personaje.","summary_en":"Each character can learn two primary professions and all three secondary ones.","keywords_es":["cuántas profesiones puedo tener","dos profesiones primarias","tres profesiones secundarias","límite de profesiones"],"keywords_en":["how many professions","two primary professions","three secondary professions","profession limit"],"text_es":"Forever mantiene dos plazas para profesiones primarias y permite aprender las tres secundarias en el mismo personaje. En total hay nueve primarias y tres secundarias; las primarias abarcan oficios de recolección y artesanía.","text_en":"Forever keeps two primary profession slots and lets one character learn all three secondary professions. There are nine primary and three secondary professions in total; primary trades cover gathering and crafting.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › How professions work in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What Are Professions?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:2b6fe843dc55f7d7ec882b53313f1528d5307543","section:7493349a100772d00e3bd12aae9821b8f638d4f9"]},{"id":"prof-profesiones-recoleccion","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones de recolección","title_en":"Gathering Professions","summary_es":"Herboristería, Minería y Desuello reúnen materiales del mundo para otros oficios.","summary_en":"Herbalism, Mining, and Skinning gather world materials for other trades.","keywords_es":["profesiones de recolección","herboristería","minería","desuello","reunir materiales"],"keywords_en":["gathering professions","herbalism","mining","skinning","gather materials"],"text_es":"Las tres profesiones primarias de recolección son Herboristería, Minería y Desuello. Reúnen hierbas, mineral y cuero o pieles de bestias, que sirven de materiales para otros oficios.","text_en":"The three primary gathering professions are Herbalism, Mining, and Skinning. They collect herbs, ore, and leather or hides from beasts, supplying materials for other trades.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What Are Professions?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:7493349a100772d00e3bd12aae9821b8f638d4f9"]},{"id":"prof-profesiones-artesania","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones de artesanía","title_en":"Crafting Professions","summary_es":"Seis profesiones primarias transforman materiales en equipo, consumibles y mejoras.","summary_en":"Six primary professions turn materials into gear, consumables, and enhancements.","keywords_es":["profesiones de artesanía","alquimia","herrería","encantamiento","ingeniería","peletería","sastrería"],"keywords_en":["crafting professions","alchemy","blacksmithing","enchanting","engineering","leatherworking","tailoring"],"text_es":"Las profesiones primarias de artesanía son Alquimia, Herrería, Encantamiento, Ingeniería, Peletería y Sastrería. Convierten materiales en equipo, consumibles, mejoras u otros objetos útiles.","text_en":"The primary crafting professions are Alchemy, Blacksmithing, Enchanting, Engineering, Leatherworking, and Tailoring. They turn materials into gear, consumables, enhancements, and other useful items.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What Are Professions?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:7493349a100772d00e3bd12aae9821b8f638d4f9"]},{"id":"prof-combinaciones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Combinaciones de profesiones útiles","title_en":"Useful Profession Pairings","summary_es":"Combina un oficio de artesanía con el de recolección que le suministra materiales.","summary_en":"Pair a crafting trade with the gathering profession that supplies its materials.","keywords_es":["profesiones que combinan bien","minería y herrería","herboristería y alquimia","desuello y peletería","sastrería y encantamiento"],"keywords_en":["professions that pair well","mining and blacksmithing","herbalism and alchemy","skinning and leatherworking","tailoring and enchanting"],"text_es":"Minería suministra materiales a Herrería e Ingeniería; Herboristería, a Alquimia; y Desuello, a Peletería. Sastrería no necesita una profesión recolectora, pues la tela se obtiene de humanoides, y puede combinarse con Encantamiento para desencantar el equipo fabricado.","text_en":"Mining supplies Blacksmithing and Engineering; Herbalism supplies Alchemy; and Skinning supplies Leatherworking. Tailoring needs no gathering profession because cloth comes from humanoids, and it can pair with Enchanting to disenchant crafted gear.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What Are Professions?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › Choosing and Changing Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:7493349a100772d00e3bd12aae9821b8f638d4f9","section:854c8bfa49fabb8cdb3ba79996870cceba973307"]},{"id":"prof-cambiar-profesion","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cambiar o abandonar una profesión","title_en":"Changing or Dropping a Profession","summary_es":"Puedes sustituir una primaria, pero abandonar el oficio borra habilidad y recetas.","summary_en":"You can replace a primary, but dropping it removes its skill and recipes.","keywords_es":["cambiar profesión","abandonar profesión","perder recetas","volver a subir profesión","profesión primaria"],"keywords_en":["change profession","drop profession","lose recipes","relevel profession","primary profession"],"text_es":"Puedes sustituir una profesión primaria cuando quieras, pero al abandonarla pierdes toda la habilidad y las recetas aprendidas. Si vuelves a elegirla tendrás que subirla de nuevo. Las secundarias no ocupan esas plazas primarias.","text_en":"You can replace a primary profession at any time, but dropping it removes all of its skill and learned recipes. If you pick it up again, you must level it again. Secondary professions do not take primary slots.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › Choosing and Changing Professions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:854c8bfa49fabb8cdb3ba79996870cceba973307"]},{"id":"prof-aprender-profesion","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dónde aprender una profesión","title_en":"Where to Learn a Profession","summary_es":"Los instructores enseñan oficios; las zonas iniciales facilitan empezar a recolectar.","summary_en":"Trainers teach professions; starting zones make it easier to begin gathering.","keywords_es":["dónde aprender profesión","instructor de profesión","zona inicial","manual de recolección","ventana de profesión"],"keywords_en":["where to learn profession","profession trainer","starting zone","gathering manual","profession window"],"text_es":"Aprende el oficio con su instructor, que enseña también las primeras recetas. Las primeras zonas tienen instructores júnior y misiones que entregan manuales para empezar Herboristería, Minería o Desuello con algo de habilidad. La ventana propia de profesiones muestra recetas y materiales.","text_en":"Learn a trade from its trainer, who also teaches the first recipes. Starting zones have junior trainers and quests that award manuals to begin Herbalism, Mining, or Skinning with a small skill boost. A dedicated profession window shows recipes and materials.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › What changed from Classic Era:","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › How to Learn a Profession","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:01f642ac6c1c2b54dc7112494b3332244cb3baf2","section:cb06e7b570d821973b4188030d9b587c8ce9a9e8"]},{"id":"prof-subir-rango","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rangos y habilidad de profesión","title_en":"Profession Ranks and Skill","summary_es":"La habilidad va aparte del nivel de personaje; los rangos elevan su límite.","summary_en":"Profession skill is separate from character level; ranks raise its cap.","keywords_es":["subir profesión","rangos de profesión","tope de habilidad","instructor de rango","probabilidad de subir profesión"],"keywords_en":["level profession","profession ranks","skill cap","rank trainer","profession skill-up chance"],"text_es":"La habilidad profesional sube al fabricar objetos o recolectar materiales, y es independiente del nivel del personaje. Hay cuatro rangos; cada uno amplía el tope y los siguientes requieren habilidad y nivel de personaje. Aprende el rango siguiente con el instructor cuando puedas. El indicador de una receta señala la probabilidad de ganar habilidad: el naranja garantiza el punto, el amarillo suele darlo, el verde lo da menos a menudo y el gris no lo da.","text_en":"Profession skill rises by crafting items or gathering materials and is separate from character level. There are four ranks; each raises the cap, and later ranks require profession skill and character level. Learn the next rank from a trainer when available. A recipe indicator shows the chance of a skill point: orange guarantees one, yellow usually grants one, green does so less often, and gray grants none.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Professions Overview in WoW: Forever › How to Level your Professions in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/overview","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › How to Level a Profession","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:11f1cd6de7fb973b9ed5779176fefe37eb359c33","section:966af58f8ea300502e2f550ebb5a25bc87987126"]},{"id":"prof-puntos-legado","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Puntos Legacy de profesiones","title_en":"Profession Legacy Points","summary_es":"Al alcanzar ciertos hitos de habilidad ganas puntos para ventajas Legacy.","summary_en":"Reaching profession skill milestones awards points for Legacy perks.","keywords_es":["puntos legacy profesiones","hitos de habilidad","árbol legacy profesiones","ventajas de recolección"],"keywords_en":["profession legacy points","skill milestones","profession legacy tree","gathering perks"],"text_es":"La primera vez que una profesión alcanza 150, 225 y 300 de habilidad, obtienes puntos Legacy. El árbol de profesiones es compartido por la cuenta, pero sus puntos se gastan por personaje; sus ventajas pueden mejorar la subida de habilidad o la recolección.","text_en":"The first time a profession reaches 150, 225, and 300 skill, you earn Legacy Points. The profession tree is shared account-wide, but points are spent per character; its perks can improve skill gains or gathering.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What's New for Professions in WoW Forever?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › What changed from Classic Era:","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Professions Overview in WoW: Forever › Profession Legacy Points and Perks","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/overview","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:01f642ac6c1c2b54dc7112494b3332244cb3baf2","section:08e6205b85b1ff854ffe6795abe3f39dfcb1424d","section:f1c4ab71829391b5f6b34bbd881b73ac5ef11082"]},{"id":"prof-novedades-forever","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Nuevas recetas de profesión en Forever","title_en":"New Profession Recipes in Forever","summary_es":"Forever incorpora más de 600 recetas nuevas a las profesiones.","summary_en":"Forever adds more than 600 new recipes to the professions.","keywords_es":["recetas nuevas profesiones","novedades profesiones forever","más recetas","recetas de Forever"],"keywords_en":["new profession recipes","profession changes forever","more recipes","Forever recipes"],"text_es":"Forever añade más de 600 recetas nuevas a las profesiones. Herrería, Peletería y Sastrería reciben la mayor parte de las recetas nuevas.","text_en":"Forever adds more than 600 new recipes to the professions. Blacksmithing, Leatherworking, and Tailoring receive the largest share of the new recipes.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Professions Overview in WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/overview","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › What changed from Classic Era:","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:47c0523f81dc93287226de972469f7c719609f2b","section:01f642ac6c1c2b54dc7112494b3332244cb3baf2"]},{"id":"prof-alquimia","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Alquimia: consumibles y transmutaciones","title_en":"Alchemy: Consumables and Transmutes","summary_es":"Prepara consumibles y transmutaciones; Herboristería aporta los ingredientes más habituales.","summary_en":"Makes consumables and transmutes; Herbalism supplies its most common ingredients.","keywords_es":["alquimia","pociones","elixires","frascos","transmutaciones","alquimia y herboristería"],"keywords_en":["alchemy","potions","elixirs","flasks","transmutes","alchemy and herbalism"],"text_es":"En Forever, Alquimia prepara pociones, elixires y frascos de efecto temporal, además de tintes, aceites y materiales para otros artesanos. Las transmutaciones convierten materiales baratos en otros más valiosos y pueden dar oro; muchos consumibles también se venden. Herboristería combina bien porque casi todas las recetas usan hierbas y reunirlas abarata la subida; Forever añade más de 50 recetas, útiles también durante la subida. Las pociones de curación estándar son de Primeros auxilios; Alquimia conserva pociones descoloridas que curan y luego dañan al bebedor.","text_en":"In Forever, Alchemy makes potions, elixirs, and flasks with temporary effects, plus dyes, oils, and materials for other crafters. Transmutes turn cheaper materials into more valuable ones and can earn gold; many consumables can also be sold. Herbalism pairs well because nearly every recipe uses herbs, and gathering them lowers leveling costs; Forever adds over 50 recipes, useful while leveling too. Standard healing potions belong to First Aid; Alchemy still makes discolored potions that heal and then harm the drinker.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alchemy Profession Overview in Forever - Transmutes, New Recipes, and Trainers › Why Choose Alchemy?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/alchemy-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alchemy Profession Overview in Forever - Transmutes, New Recipes, and Trainers › Best Profession to Pair with Alchemy","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/alchemy-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Alchemy Guide › What Is Alchemy?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/alchemy","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alchemy Profession Overview in Forever - Transmutes, New Recipes, and Trainers › Making Gold with Alchemy in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/alchemy-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Alchemy Guide › What Is Alchemy?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/alchemy","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:alchemy:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:312a0359920853afca7d42a8d7ea8c1f091b3a55","section:8e02b7b675566c75bb3921be5fe36ae014501a5e","section:c86415ca4577d5e8c429888d9efcd31a3d799ed9","section:d6f61af74f0ec7530d096400004fe8dd84430e88"]},{"id":"prof-herreria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Herrería: armas, armaduras y mejoras","title_en":"Blacksmithing: Weapons, Armor, and Upgrades","summary_es":"Forja equipo y mejoras; Minería aporta metales y piedra, mientras Ingeniería comparte materiales.","summary_en":"Forges gear and upgrades; Mining supplies metal and stone, while Engineering shares materials.","keywords_es":["herrería","armas y escudos","armadura de malla","armadura de placas","mejoras de armas","herrería y minería"],"keywords_en":["blacksmithing","weapons and shields","mail armor","plate armor","weapon upgrades","blacksmithing and mining"],"text_es":"Herrería forja armas, escudos y armaduras de malla y placas con metal y piedra. Las piedras de afilar y de peso aumentan temporalmente el daño, mientras que las púas de escudo y cadenas de arma son mejoras permanentes. También crea varas para Encantamiento, llaves para cerraduras y Aguijones de mitril que aceleran la montura. Casi todo requiere martillo y yunque; algunas recetas piden una forja. Minería aporta mena y piedra; si puedes elegir, Ingeniería aprovecha materiales comunes al subir y añade bombas y artilugios. Puedes especializarte en armaduras o armas, con recetas exclusivas.","text_en":"Blacksmithing forges weapons, shields, and mail and plate armor from metal and stone. Sharpening stones and weightstones temporarily increase weapon damage, while shield spikes and weapon chains are permanent upgrades. It also makes Enchanting rods, keys for locked doors and chests, and Mithril Spurs that increase mounted movement speed. Most crafts need a hammer and anvil; some require a forge. Mining supplies ore and stone, but Engineering may be preferable: it shares leveling materials and adds bombs and gadgets. You can specialize in Armorsmithing or Weaponsmithing for exclusive recipes.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blacksmithing Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › What is Blacksmithing in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/blacksmithing/overview","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blacksmithing Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Best Profession to Pair with Blacksmithing in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/blacksmithing/overview","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Blacksmithing Guide › What Is Blacksmithing? ","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/blacksmithing","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Blacksmithing Guide › Best Profession to Pair with Blacksmithing","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/blacksmithing","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Blacksmithing Guide › What Is Blacksmithing?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/blacksmithing","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:blacksmithing:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:372012d5ab7d78fb5f961b057097e6eb29ddc355","section:4bdee846684dff8d2177da487bfd0e7042df4050","section:b64722490a531b3412dfa847b7ebd452484f6176","section:d8cc68aa35d154a6f5cb8f7666082b1027f621bb"]},{"id":"prof-encantamiento","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Encantamiento: desencantar y mejorar equipo","title_en":"Enchanting: Disenchanting and Enhancing Gear","summary_es":"Desencanta objetos para conseguir materiales y crear mejoras permanentes, varitas y otros objetos.","summary_en":"Disenchants items for materials and makes permanent enhancements, wands, and other gear.","keywords_es":["encantamiento","desencantar objetos","mejoras permanentes","varitas","varas de encantamiento","sastrería y encantamiento"],"keywords_en":["enchanting","disenchant items","permanent enhancements","wands","enchanting rods","tailoring and enchanting"],"text_es":"Encantamiento destruye equipo poco común o superior para obtener polvo, esencias y fragmentos, y así mejorar armas y armaduras de forma permanente (aguante en brazales, agilidad en botas). Además crea varitas, bastones, objetos de mano secundaria, reliquias y aceites de arma. Los encantamientos requieren varas: la primera, Vara de cobre con runas, usa materiales de vendedor; las posteriores suelen venir de Herrería. Sastrería combina bien porque permite crear equipo de tela para desencantar. Magos, Sacerdotes y Brujos pueden usar el oficio desde que lo aprenden.","text_en":"Enchanting destroys uncommon or better gear for dust, essences, and shards, then permanently improves weapons and armor (Stamina on bracers, Agility on boots). It also makes wands, staves, off-hand items, class relics, and weapon oils. Enchants need rods: the first, a Runed Copper Rod, can be made from vendor materials; later ones usually come from Blacksmithing. It pairs well with Tailoring because it lets you make cloth gear to disenchant. It suits Mages, Priests, and Warlocks as soon as they learn it.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enchanting Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Enchanting Materials and Disenchanting in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/enchanting/overview","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enchanting Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Enchanting Rods in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/enchanting/overview","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enchanting Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › What is Enchanting in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/enchanting/overview","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Enchanting Guide › What Is Enchanting?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enchanting","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Enchanting Guide › Best Profession to Pair with Enchanting","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enchanting","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Enchanting Guide › What Is Enchanting?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enchanting","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Enchanting Guide › Who Should Pick Enchanting?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enchanting","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:enchanting:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:14950165a5bde07e142afd9ac2a894db71d17da0","section:188160cad5bd40e46fdd5e4fe0c5bd604f07ecc2","section:4eb130bacaf4283f58cfdd77959e3238506ab86e","section:9f87c6748300509a4b072d499bc1fafea9504e83","section:c0dc9a26332e48ed7dfd786f5871e6a53d425800","section:ca2daf66569cd84787eacb8fd61e1e421b4b87a8"]},{"id":"prof-ingenieria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ingeniería: explosivos y artilugios","title_en":"Engineering: Explosives and Gadgets","summary_es":"Crea bombas, armas, munición y herramientas; Minería suele aportar los materiales.","summary_en":"Makes bombs, weapons, ammunition, and tools; Mining commonly supplies the materials.","keywords_es":["ingeniería","bombas y granadas","armas de fuego","munición","miras","ingeniería y minería"],"keywords_en":["engineering","bombs and grenades","guns","ammunition","scopes","engineering and mining"],"text_es":"Ingeniería se centra en bombas, artefactos y herramientas, aunque también crea armas de fuego, munición, miras y gafas. La Granada de hierro inflige daño de Fuego y aturde a enemigos cercanos hasta tres segundos; la Capa de paracaidista frena una caída y las Pinzas de batería goblin dan una oportunidad de reanimar a un aliado fuera de combate. Minería es una pareja práctica porque aporta metales y piedra para fabricar. También puede combinarse con Herrería si llevas malla o placas y quieres aprovechar materiales compartidos.","text_en":"Engineering focuses on bombs, gadgets, and tools, but also makes guns, ammunition, scopes, and goggles. An Iron Grenade deals Fire damage and stuns nearby enemies for up to three seconds; Parachute Cloak slows a fall, and Goblin Jumper Cables give a chance to revive an ally out of combat. Mining is a practical partner because it supplies metal and stone for crafting. Blacksmithing can also pair well if you wear mail or plate and want to share materials.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Engineering Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › What is Engineering in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/engineering-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Engineering Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Best Profession to Pair with Engineering in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/engineering-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Engineering Guide › What Is Engineering?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/engineering","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Engineering Guide › Best Profession to Pair with Engineering","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/engineering","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:engineering:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:434386817cee87af4ffd1071456dce3b8204225b","section:64ddf24400e04f6cef99d6a2e60403fbac5b1cc4","section:9bbed3c91fa48e86a80574c35454f4743f0d9aec","section:e27fdd5ec52d509a27d5a592cfa500a3e5dc9187"]},{"id":"prof-peleteria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Peletería: armaduras, kits y tienda","title_en":"Leatherworking: Armor, Kits, and Tent","summary_es":"Fabrica armaduras de cuero y malla, kits y bolsas; Desuello aporta materiales.","summary_en":"Makes leather and mail armor, kits, and bags; Skinning supplies materials.","keywords_es":["peletería","armadura de cuero","armadura de malla","kits de armadura","tienda de campamento","peletería y desuello"],"keywords_en":["leatherworking","leather armor","mail armor","armor kits","camp tent","leatherworking and skinning"],"text_es":"Peletería crea armaduras de cuero y malla, capas, bolsas y kits permanentes para pecho, piernas, manos o pies. Algunas recetas usan cuero tal cual; otras requieren pieles curtidas con Sal. Sus carcajes y bolsas de munición aceleran los ataques a distancia. Desuello es su pareja directa porque aporta materiales; Ingeniería y Encantamiento son alternativas para artilugios o desencantar lo fabricado. Escamas de dragón, Elemental y Tribal desbloquean patrones propios; Escamas de dragón permite hacer malla. Su tienda de campamento concede un 5% de experiencia de descanso.","text_en":"Leatherworking makes leather and mail armor, cloaks, bags, and kits that permanently improve chest, legs, hands, or feet. Some recipes use leather as-is; others need hides cured with Salt. It also makes quivers and ammo pouches that increase ranged attack speed. Leatherworking pairs directly with Skinning for its materials; Engineering and Enchanting are alternatives if you prefer gadgets or disenchanting your crafts. Dragonscale, Elemental, and Tribal have their own patterns; Dragonscale can make mail. Its campsite tent grants 5% rested experience.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Leatherworking Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Leatherworking Profession Perks in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/leatherworking-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Leatherworking Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Best Profession to Pair with Leatherworking in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/leatherworking-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Leatherworking Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Leatherworking Specializations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/leatherworking-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Leatherworking Guide › What Is Leatherworking?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/leatherworking","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Leatherworking Guide › Who Should Pick Leatherworking?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/leatherworking","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Leatherworking Guide › Best Profession to Pair with Leatherworking","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/leatherworking","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:leatherworking:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:3090895d83e59c89cf5b56fe75bf311b0b058bcf","section:6a2f079e05d3a06356377848cd7b56ebea6cb46b","section:75aa5d57847f7d1016ed99340fdd538582e5ac46","section:86e384a82c9f2fc23475d6baf7d72bbb76a71f98","section:afa09c2c4d5f412954b42e57e3ed33c0fd675918","section:f8635431be6eb66fc483941d4dee48b6a07a774f"]},{"id":"prof-sastreria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sastrería: armaduras y bolsas","title_en":"Tailoring: Armor and Bags","summary_es":"Convierte tela en armaduras y bolsas; Encantamiento aprovecha las piezas sobrantes.","summary_en":"Turns cloth into armor and bags; Enchanting makes use of spare crafted pieces.","keywords_es":["sastrería","armadura de tela","bolsas","bolsa de componentes","sastrería y encantamiento"],"keywords_en":["tailoring","cloth armor","bags","reagent bag","tailoring and enchanting"],"text_es":"Sastrería transforma tela en armaduras, capas, camisas y bolsas; como gran parte cae de humanoides, no hace falta una profesión de recolección para conseguirla. La Bolsa de lino tiene seis huecos y la Bolsa de paño rúnico, catorce. Forever reserva además un espacio independiente para bolsa de componentes: las de lino admiten seis montones y las de tejido mágico, doce, sin ocupar las bolsas normales. Encantamiento combina bien porque puedes desencantar las piezas de tela que no vayas a usar. Con 35 de habilidad puedes confeccionar cinturones que se equipan a nivel 10.","text_en":"This trade turns cloth into armor, cloaks, shirts, and bags; since much of it drops from humanoids, no gathering profession is needed to obtain it. A Linen Bag has six slots and a Runecloth Bag has fourteen. Forever also provides a separate reagent-bag slot: linen bags hold six stacks and mageweave bags hold twelve without using regular bag space. Enchanting pairs well because you can disenchant cloth pieces you do not plan to use. At 35 skill, you can make waist items usable at level 10.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Tailoring Overview:  Trainers, New Recipes & Locations - WoW Forever › What is Tailoring in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/tailoring-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-01"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Tailoring Guide › What Is Tailoring?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/tailoring","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Tailoring Guide › Best Profession to Pair with Tailoring","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/tailoring","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Tailoring Overview:  Trainers, New Recipes & Locations - WoW Forever › Waist - Level 10","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/tailoring-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-01"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:tailoring:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:140038c7bee8f76e4fb55460efcdb3b81cfb73fa","section:49cb5003db3f578b6e218c222bf66c280191a21c","section:5e67072fa18387943904fe4fefa30267db8e18a7","section:e0e2dc1f3cdc8873cd0c3df065ab70f1d15c19a8"]},{"id":"prof-subir-alquimia","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos para subir Alquimia","title_en":"Alchemy Leveling Milestones","summary_es":"Algunos niveles permiten cambiar de método o conseguir subidas garantizadas.","summary_en":"Some skill ranges allow a different route or guaranteed skill gains.","keywords_es":["subir alquimia","Alquimia de 1 a 300","Alquimia 225","piedra de filósofo","subida de habilidad"],"keywords_en":["level Alchemy","Alchemy 1 to 300","Alchemy 225","Philosopher’s Stone","skill gains"],"text_es":"Puedes subir Alquimia hasta 300, aunque la ruta puede variar según el coste de los materiales. Entre 195 y 205, el Elixir de defensa es una alternativa si sale más conveniente. Al alcanzar 225 puedes aprender a fabricar la Piedra de filósofo; mientras aún dé puntos, garantiza una subida hasta 240 y también hace falta para las transmutaciones. Si la Flor de peste resulta cara, puedes continuar con una poción de maná de rango superior hasta aproximadamente 280–285.","text_en":"You can level Alchemy to 300, but the route can vary with material prices. Between 195 and 205, Elixir of Defense is an alternative if it is more economical. At 225, you can learn to make a Philosopher’s Stone; while it still grants points, it guarantees a skill-up through 240 and is also required for transmutes. If Plaguebloom is expensive, you can continue with a higher-rank mana potion until around 280–285.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alchemy Leveling Guide: 1-300 Leveling and Required Materials - WoW: Forever › Best Alchemy Leveling Path for Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/alchemy/leveling-1-300","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:alchemy:leveling-1-300"],"source_hashes":["section:24583e0c5252e13146864823985f6f2c089bce55"]},{"id":"prof-especializaciones-peleteria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones de Peletería","title_en":"Leatherworking Specializations","summary_es":"Escamas de dragón, Elemental y Tribal desbloquean patrones distintos.","summary_en":"Dragonscale, Elemental, and Tribal unlock different patterns.","keywords_es":["especializaciones de peletería","Escamas de dragón","peletería elemental","peletería tribal","armadura de malla"],"keywords_en":["Leatherworking specializations","Dragonscale","Elemental Leatherworking","Tribal Leatherworking","mail armor"],"text_es":"Peletería ofrece las especializaciones Escamas de dragón, Elemental y Tribal, cada una con patrones propios. Si quieres fabricar armaduras de malla, Escamas de dragón es la opción indicada.","text_en":"Leatherworking offers Dragonscale, Elemental, and Tribal specializations, each with its own patterns. If you want to make mail armor, Dragonscale is the relevant choice.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Leatherworking Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Leatherworking Specializations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/leatherworking-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Leatherworking Guide › What Is Leatherworking?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/leatherworking","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:leatherworking:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6a2f079e05d3a06356377848cd7b56ebea6cb46b","section:86e384a82c9f2fc23475d6baf7d72bbb76a71f98"]},{"id":"prof-entrenadores-artesania","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Instructores de profesiones artesanales","title_en":"Crafting Profession Trainers","summary_es":"Ciudades y zonas iniciales tienen instructores; los rangos altos pueden requerir otros.","summary_en":"Cities and starter areas have trainers; higher ranks may require different ones.","keywords_es":["instructor de Alquimia","instructor de Ingeniería","instructor de Encantamiento","instructor de Sastrería","entrenar rangos"],"keywords_en":["Alchemy trainer","Engineering trainer","Enchanting trainer","Tailoring trainer","train profession ranks"],"text_es":"Puedes encontrar instructores de profesiones en ciudades y, para algunos oficios, en pueblos de zonas iniciales; pregunta a un guardia para que señale uno cercano. Alquimia se enseña en las ciudades principales, aunque los rangos Experto y Artesano requieren instructores concretos. En Forever, algunos instructores de Ingeniería capaces de enseñar Experto también enseñan los rangos anteriores, pero uno de Oficial no enseña Experto. El rango de Encantador artesano se aprende de un instructor situado en una mazmorra.","text_en":"Profession trainers are available in cities and, for some trades, in starter-zone towns; ask a guard to mark a nearby one. Alchemy is taught in major cities, though Expert and Artisan ranks require specific trainers. In Forever, some Engineering trainers who teach Expert can also teach earlier ranks, but a Journeyman trainer cannot teach Expert. Artisan Enchanting is taught by a trainer located in a dungeon.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alchemy Profession Overview in Forever - Transmutes, New Recipes, and Trainers › Where to Learn Alchemy in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/alchemy-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Engineering Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Engineering Trainer Locations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/engineering-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enchanting Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Enchanting Trainer Locations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/enchanting/overview","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enchanting Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Learning Artisan Enchanting: Uldaman Dungeon","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/enchanting/overview","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Tailoring Overview:  Trainers, New Recipes & Locations - WoW Forever › Tailoring Trainers in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/tailoring-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-01"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enchanting Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Enchanting Trainers in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/enchanting/overview","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:alchemy:overview","profession:enchanting:overview","profession:engineering:overview","profession:tailoring:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:193821c71575b94d6b05cd39cabc6b43acbfcf79","section:713494633cbacf236b184658f7d90d66a2488742","section:9a079d55d62a589ec63b2814fc411338b4dbfa5a","section:ac11a9ced94339370ddfc9b3d014ca9e21a33f3d","section:b1052d53a2f29f3f9cc8fe75b541212176563787","section:fadfc3e00eb49cce1e1dfef403e4bf8965ffc961"]},{"id":"prof-subir-encantamiento","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Primeros pasos para subir Encantamiento","title_en":"Getting Started with Enchanting","summary_es":"Desencantar objetos encontrados puede aportar los primeros puntos y materiales.","summary_en":"Disenchanting found gear can provide early skill points and materials.","keywords_es":["subir encantamiento","primeros puntos de Encantamiento","desencantar equipo","varas de encantamiento"],"keywords_en":["level Enchanting","early Enchanting skill","disenchant gear","enchanting rods"],"text_es":"Al aprender Encantamiento también recibes la facultad Desencantar. Puedes usarla con objetos poco comunes o mejores que encuentres para obtener los primeros 40 puntos de habilidad y reunir materiales para seguir avanzando; no necesitas una vara de inmediato. El rango Experto se puede aprender a nivel 20 de personaje con 125 de habilidad en Encantamiento.","text_en":"Training also teaches Disenchant. Use it on uncommon or better items you find to gain the first 40 skill points and collect materials for further progress; you do not need a rod right away. You can learn Expert at character level 20 with 125 Enchanting skill.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enchanting Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Enchanting Trainer Locations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/enchanting/overview","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Enchanting Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Enchanting Rods in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/enchanting/overview","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:enchanting:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:193821c71575b94d6b05cd39cabc6b43acbfcf79","section:4eb130bacaf4283f58cfdd77959e3238506ab86e"]},{"id":"prof-especializaciones-herreria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones de Herrería","title_en":"Blacksmithing Specializations","summary_es":"Puedes especializarte en fabricar armaduras o armas con recetas propias.","summary_en":"You can specialize in armor or weapons and gain exclusive recipes.","keywords_es":["especializaciones de herrería","armaduras de herrería","armas de herrería","elegir especialización"],"keywords_en":["Blacksmithing specializations","armor specialization","weapon specialization","choose a specialization"],"text_es":"Al avanzar en Herrería puedes escoger entre centrarte en armaduras o en armas. Cada especialización da acceso a recetas exclusivas, así que elige según el tipo de equipo que quieras fabricar.","text_en":"As you advance in Blacksmithing, you can choose to focus on armor or weapons. Each specialization gives access to exclusive recipes, so choose based on the gear you want to make.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blacksmithing Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Blacksmithing Specializations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/blacksmithing/overview","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:blacksmithing:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:f7977deba152fa5123f3644791cf0c0002155902"]},{"id":"prof-especializaciones-ingenieria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Especializaciones de Ingeniería","title_en":"Engineering Specializations","summary_es":"Con nivel 30 y 200 de habilidad puedes elegir Ingeniería goblin o Ingeniería gnoma.","summary_en":"At level 30 and 200 skill, choose Goblin or Gnomish Engineering.","keywords_es":["ingeniería goblin","ingeniería gnómica","especialización de ingeniería","nivel 30","200 de ingeniería"],"keywords_en":["Goblin Engineering","Gnomish Engineering","Engineering specialization","level 30","200 Engineering"],"text_es":"Al llegar al nivel 30 de personaje y a 200 de Ingeniería, puedes elegir entre Ingeniería goblin e Ingeniería gnoma. Cada una se desbloquea mediante una cadena de tres pasos y abre recetas distintas. La tarjeta de miembro correspondiente da acceso a los esquemas de su instructor; dura 14 días de tiempo de juego y hay que renovarla para conservar ese acceso.","text_en":"At character level 30 and 200 Engineering, you can choose Goblin or Gnomish Engineering. Each is unlocked through a three-step quest chain and offers different recipes. The matching membership card grants access to its trainer’s schematics; it lasts 14 days of in-game time and must be renewed to keep that access.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Engineering Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Goblin Engineering Specialization Quests","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/engineering-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Engineering Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Gnomish Engineering Specialization Quests","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/engineering-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Engineering Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Goblin Engineer Membership Card and Renewal","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/engineering-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Engineering Overview: Trainers, New Recipes, Specializations & Locations - WoW Forever › Gnomish Engineer Membership Card and Renewal","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/engineering-overview-trainer-locations-recipes","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:engineering:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:c465b957ec611d34bbfe3e7788343f1d5ab5e4ba","section:03e213fcc5df0348d49cf9563732055c9c86ad7e","section:66d57c6c50ec295ad8182a961da080aefc248d13"]},{"id":"prof-herboristeria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Herboristería: recolección de hierbas","title_en":"Herbalism: Herbs and Scarce Materials","summary_es":"Herboristería recoge hierbas de nodos visibles en el minimapa y no requiere herramienta.","summary_en":"Herbalism gathers herbs from nodes shown on the minimap and requires no tool.","keywords_es":["herboristeria","recoger hierbas","buscar hierbas","materiales raros","marefoil","demonsage","death lotus"],"keywords_en":["herbalism","gather herbs","find herbs","scarce materials","marefoil","demonsage","death lotus"],"text_es":"Herboristería permite recolectar hierbas por Azeroth y enseña Buscar hierbas para localizar nodos en el minimapa; no requiere herramienta. Un instructor la enseña, y también puedes elegir Cosecha salvaje como premio de una misión inicial. Alquimia y Primeros auxilios aprovechan hierbas, así que Alquimia es una buena pareja.","text_en":"Herbalism lets you gather herbs across Azeroth and teaches Find Herbs to locate nodes on the minimap; no tool is needed. A trainer can teach it, or you can choose Wild Harvest as an early quest reward. Alchemy and First Aid use herbs, so Alchemy is a useful pairing.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Herbalism Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Herbs, and Trainers › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/herbalism/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Herbalism Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Herbs, and Trainers › Where to Learn Herbalism in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/herbalism/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Herbalism Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Herbs, and Trainers › How to Gather Herbs","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/herbalism/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Herbalism Guide › What Is Herbalism?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/herbalism","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:herbalism:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:14b5cdea3f6e739d8b183e325e44c25f9ef8e7da","section:148215be5c37d4c5ffb5c6235d52f185cadd2bf2","section:24b5d0c06e49ff2b2ec6e6adade1357b8ebfa1f6","section:c5c0e734d0e045de51055de230fdaba23dc2cd66"]},{"id":"prof-mineria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Minería: menas, piedra y gemas","title_en":"Mining: Ore, Stone, and Gems","summary_es":"Minería extrae menas y las funde en barras para otros oficios.","summary_en":"Mining extracts ore and smelts it into bars for other trades.","keywords_es":["mineria","menas","fundir","barras","gemas","mineria y herreria","mineria e ingenieria"],"keywords_en":["mining","ore","smelting","bars","gems","mining and blacksmithing","mining and engineering"],"text_es":"Minería extrae menas y enseña la facultad Fundir para convertirlas en barras junto a una forja; por eso combina con Herrería o Ingeniería, que aprovechan esos materiales. Necesitas un Pico de minero y conviene activar Buscar minerales para ver los filones en el minimapa. Un instructor puede enseñarla, y también puedes elegir Minería para torpes como premio de una misión inicial. Al extraer, existe la posibilidad de obtener materiales escasos adicionales.","text_en":"Mining extracts ore and teaches Smelting to turn it into bars at a forge; its materials supply trades such as Blacksmithing and Engineering. You need a Mining Pick, and Find Minerals helps show veins on the minimap. A trainer can teach the skill, or an early quest can reward Mining for Dummies. Mining can yield additional scarce materials.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Mining Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Ores, and Trainers › Why Choose Mining?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/mining/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Mining Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Ores, and Trainers › Where to Learn Mining in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/mining/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Mining Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Ores, and Trainers › How to Mine in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/mining/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Mining Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Ores, and Trainers › Smelting Bars in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/mining/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:mining:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:447f673ea37d441073b9cfecbe0d860f3655757b","section:50b021a6a21b7cee7864db3afb12c7de018bd0f0","section:8e404b9e5407e39d0e7918238df7db700fd691e2","section:be46e43d6f4deceb79a58fb98710834cf355e06b"]},{"id":"prof-desuello","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Desuello: cuero, pieles y escamas","title_en":"Skinning: Leather, Hides, and Scales","summary_es":"Desuello recoge cuero, pieles y escamas de cadáveres con un cuchillo sencillo.","summary_en":"Skinning gathers leather, hides, and scales from corpses with a simple knife.","keywords_es":["desuello","cuero","pieles","escamas","cuchillo de desuello","requisito de desuello","desuello y peleteria"],"keywords_en":["skinning","leather","hides","scales","skinning knife","skinning requirement","skinning and leatherworking"],"text_es":"Desuello obtiene cuero, pieles y escamas de bestias muertas cuyo botín ya se recogió; también puedes aprovechar cadáveres saqueados por otros jugadores. Lleva un Cuchillo para desollar, que no hace falta equipar, y recuerda que cada cadáver solo se puede desollar una vez. El requisito depende del nivel de la criatura: del 11 al 20 se calcula como (nivel menos 10) por 10, y desde el 21 como nivel por 5. Peletería aprovecha estos materiales.","text_en":"Skinning gathers leather, hides, and scales from dead beasts after their loot has been collected; corpses looted by other players are also available. Carry a Skinning Knife, but you do not need to equip it; each corpse can only be skinned once. Required skill depends on mob level: from 11 to 20, use (level minus 10) times 10; from 21 onward, use level times 5. Leatherworking uses these materials.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Skinning Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Tips, and Trainers › Why Choose Skinning?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/skinning/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Skinning Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Tips, and Trainers › How to Skin in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/skinning/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Skinning Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Tips, and Trainers › Best Profession to Pair with Skinning","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/skinning/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Skinning Guide › How to Skin Creatures","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/skinning","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:skinning:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:a2ba4098cfb948814dbdbc30d9dc441c7b011eed","section:b70df239543fb05fc2657c51df492402db797818","section:b8c99854e4fc091876fc989d9bbe29c6687091fb","section:fc8126ea46958bdc40f94a89c81ec6dded6332bc"]},{"id":"prof-cocina","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cocina: comida, buffs y experiencia","title_en":"Cooking: Food, Buffs, and Experience","summary_es":"Toda comida cocinada en Forever da un 5% de experiencia extra por enemigos derrotados.","summary_en":"All cooked food in Forever grants 5% extra experience from kills.","keywords_es":["cocina","comida","buffs de comida","experiencia por muertes","well fed","master chef","cocina y pesca"],"keywords_en":["cooking","food","food buffs","experience from kills","well fed","master chef","cooking and fishing"],"text_es":"Cocina, una profesión secundaria, prepara alimentos con beneficios temporales y puede ahorrar tiempo y oro al subir o al llegar al nivel máximo. En Forever, toda comida cocinada otorga Bonificación de PE de bien alimentado: un 5% más de experiencia por enemigos derrotados, no por misiones. Para recibir el beneficio de una comida, suele bastar con permanecer sentado unos 10 segundos; la mayoría dura 15 minutos. Pesca combina bien porque muchas recetas usan pescado.","text_en":"Cooking is a secondary profession that prepares food with temporary benefits and can save time and gold while leveling or at endgame. In Forever, all cooked food grants Well Fed XP Boost: 5% more experience from kills, not quests. To receive a food benefit, you usually need to remain seated for about 10 seconds; most last 15 minutes. Fishing pairs well because many recipes use fish.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cooking Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Recipes, and Trainers › Why Level Cooking?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/cooking/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cooking Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Recipes, and Trainers › Making Gold with Cooking in Forever > Best Profession to Pair with Cooking","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/cooking/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Cooking Guide › Food Buffs and How They Work","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/cooking","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:cooking:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:a85040364124570b4f1863a72a547ad2bbc6e915","section:301e7d5b23570c59b2bc991a9abaac2e8a94d7ef","section:fb50e1fc32313e5b04eb835a3df7d014c315b507"]},{"id":"prof-primeros-auxilios","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Primeros auxilios: vendas y remedios","title_en":"First Aid: Bandages and Remedies","summary_es":"Primeros auxilios fabrica vendas, pociones de curación y remedios contra efectos dañinos.","summary_en":"First Aid makes bandages, healing potions, and remedies for harmful effects.","keywords_es":["primeros auxilios","vendas","pociones de curación","antitoxina","cataplasma","torniquete","recién vendado"],"keywords_en":["first aid","bandages","healing potions","anti-venom","poultice","tourniquet","recently bandaged"],"text_es":"Primeros auxilios es una profesión secundaria que fabrica vendas para curarse o ayudar a un aliado cercano. Forever trasladó a este oficio desde Alquimia las seis recetas estándar de pociones de curación y añadió remedios contra enfermedades y sangrados. También permite fabricar el Equipo de primeros auxilios, el Estudio sobre toxinas y el Laboratorio de doctor de peste para campamentos. Las vendas se canalizan sin moverse ni recibir daño y dejan Vendado recientemente durante un minuto.","text_en":"First Aid is a secondary profession that makes bandages to heal yourself or a nearby ally. Forever moved the six standard healing-potion recipes from Alchemy and added remedies for diseases and bleeds. It also lets you craft the First Aid Kit, Toxin Study, and Plague Doctor's Laboratory for campsites. Bandages channel without movement or damage and apply Recently Bandaged for one minute.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: First Aid Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Recipes, and Trainers › Why Level First Aid?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/first-aid/overview","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever First Aid Guide › What Is First Aid?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/first-aid","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever First Aid Guide › Bandages","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/first-aid","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:first-aid:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:4ddbb935b85411c38817a1e3a16d5be0c5a8e3be","section:8bb86bf3ff4096e786c9e53db463c4b559dd2f6e","section:915feb449029dab1b9f107165c51d84067f817e8"]},{"id":"prof-pesca","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Pesca: peces para Cocina y Alquimia","title_en":"Fishing: Fish for Cooking and Alchemy","summary_es":"Pesca captura peces en aguas abiertas o escuelas, y combina con Cocina.","summary_en":"Fishing catches fish in open water or schools, and pairs with Cooking.","keywords_es":["pesca","pescar","peces","escuelas de peces","cebos","pesca y cocina","pesca y alquimia"],"keywords_en":["fishing","catch fish","fish","fishing schools","lures","fishing and cooking","fishing and alchemy"],"text_es":"Pesca, secundaria y sin plaza primaria, captura peces para Cocina, venta y algunas recetas de Alquimia. Usa una Caña de pescar y recoge la captura cuando salpique el corcho; en las escuelas, debe caer dentro y cada una ofrece un número limitado de peces. Los restos flotantes pueden contener otros objetos. El pescado se puede cocinar en platos útiles; Pesca combina directamente con Cocina.","text_en":"Fishing is a secondary profession with no primary slot, catching fish for Cooking, sale, and some Alchemy recipes. Use a Fishing Pole and collect the catch when the bobber splashes; at schools, it must land inside, and each school has a limited number of fish. Floating wreckage can contain other items. Fish can become useful meals, so Fishing pairs directly with Cooking.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fishing Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Fishing Boosts, and Trainers › Why Level Fishing?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/fishing/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fishing Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Fishing Boosts, and Trainers › How to Fish in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/fishing/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fishing Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Fishing Boosts, and Trainers › How to Fish in Forever > Fishing Level Boosts in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/fishing/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fishing Guide › What Is Fishing?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fishing","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fishing Guide › Fishing Schools and Floating Wreckage","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fishing","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fishing Guide › Best Profession to Pair with Fishing","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fishing","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:fishing:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:45aed11a543a42b3687de9e0a2b0d696a66a2743","section:428e623fd1d4af51c6a56d00a2ff677f61a5dbe1","section:6f878c41aad61bfab2188d7dbc2a50caff1c01b4","section:702611c693f14dd11307f4db3c7806a366a6d8d3","section:7c918288ee664f0cb398b3587ebdc3368b6c3bf8","section:99dd5c11ab2f37bf822c5ed8b45cf21c016e20e8"]},{"id":"prof-secundarias-sin-slots","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones secundarias y plazas","title_en":"Secondary Professions and Slots","summary_es":"Cocina, Primeros auxilios y Pesca no ocupan las dos plazas primarias.","summary_en":"Cooking, First Aid, and Fishing do not take either primary slot.","keywords_es":["profesiones secundarias","dos plazas primarias","cocina primeros auxilios pesca","aprender secundarias"],"keywords_en":["secondary professions","two primary slots","cooking first aid fishing","learn secondary professions"],"text_es":"Cocina, Primeros auxilios y Pesca son las tres profesiones secundarias. Puedes aprenderlas todas en el mismo personaje; no ocupan las dos plazas reservadas a profesiones primarias.","text_en":"Cooking, First Aid, and Fishing are the three secondary professions. You can learn all of them on one character; they do not use the two slots reserved for primary professions.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › How professions work in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › What Are Professions?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:2b6fe843dc55f7d7ec882b53313f1528d5307543","section:7493349a100772d00e3bd12aae9821b8f638d4f9"]},{"id":"prof-campamento-cocina","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Campamentos: cocina y tamaño de la hoguera","title_en":"Campsites: Cooking and Campfire Size","summary_es":"Cocina crea la hoguera; el tamaño del campamento limita cuántas características pueden añadirse.","summary_en":"Cooking creates the campfire; campsite size limits how many features can be added.","keywords_es":["campamento","hoguera","cocina y campamento","características del campamento","tamaño de hoguera","descansar en campamento"],"keywords_en":["campsite","campfire","cooking and camping","campsite features","campfire size","rest at camp"],"text_es":"Cocina permite crear el Equipo de hoguera básica con una Madera simple y un Sílex y yesca reutilizable. Los equipos de oficial y experto amplían la capacidad del campamento y la potencia posible de sus beneficios. También puedes añadir el Festín de Cocinitas, que ofrece comida que aumenta el aguante, o un Horno de hierro, necesario para recetas avanzadas.","text_en":"Cooking lets you make the Basic Campfire Kit with one Simple Wood and reusable Flint and Tinder. Journeyman and Expert kits expand campsite capacity and the potential strength of its benefits. You can also add Cookie's Feast, which provides Stamina-boosting food, or an Iron Oven, required for advanced recipes.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cooking Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Recipes, and Trainers › Why Level Cooking?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/cooking/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cooking Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Recipes, and Trainers › How to Cook in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/cooking/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Cooking Guide › Cooking Campfire Items and Buffs","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/cooking","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:cooking:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:301e7d5b23570c59b2bc991a9abaac2e8a94d7ef","section:38525ca2ce54112e409d10109f78f55d315fe9f3","section:c9b783787b269a1f3695609c03a7422ebb62edd7"]},{"id":"prof-campamento-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Campamentos: qué aporta cada profesión","title_en":"Campsites: What Each Profession Adds","summary_es":"Cada profesión añade buffs, vendedores, reparación o estaciones de trabajo al campamento.","summary_en":"Each profession adds buffs, vendors, repairs, or crafting stations to a campsite.","keywords_es":["características de profesión en campamento","pozo de maná","rueda de afilar","robot de reactivos","tienda de campaña","estación de trabajo"],"keywords_en":["profession campsite features","mana well","sharpening wheel","reagent bot","camp tent","crafting station"],"text_es":"Cada profesión aporta características al campamento a 20, 140 y 300 de habilidad. La primera suele ser un buff o una ventaja, y las siguientes conservan ese beneficio y añaden vendedores, reparación o estaciones de trabajo. Por ejemplo, Alquimia pone un Pozo de maná, Herrería una Rueda de afilar e Ingeniería un Robot de componentes. Algunas características sirven como estación para recetas que la necesitan. Puedes usar la característica de otro jugador sin tener esa profesión, y los objetos se pueden comerciar o vender, aunque colocarlos exige la habilidad correspondiente.","text_en":"Each profession adds campsite features at 20, 140, and 300 skill. The first is usually a buff or benefit, and later ones keep that benefit and add vendors, repairs, or crafting stations. For example, Alchemy brings a Mana Well, Blacksmithing a Sharpening Wheel, and Engineering a Reagent Bot. Some features act as stations for recipes that need them. You can use another player's feature without having that profession, and the items can be traded or sold, though placing them requires the right skill.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Warcraft Forever Camping System Guide › Professions and Camping in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/camping","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["general:camping"],"source_hashes":["section:030fb5b5deec1b20f31ec84690bd8c749ec090ea"]},{"id":"prof-campamento-legado","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Campamentos y ventajas Legacy","title_en":"Campsites and Legacy Perks","summary_es":"Guía de campo reduce la espera entre características y Permanencia alarga sus beneficios.","summary_en":"Field Guide shortens the wait between features, and Permanence extends their benefits.","keywords_es":["field guide campamento","permanence campamento","reagent economy","ventajas legacy campamento","reutilización de características"],"keywords_en":["field guide camping","permanence camping","reagent economy","campsite legacy perks","feature cooldown"],"text_es":"Guía de campo reduce hasta un 25% la espera para añadir características, de 1 hora a 45 minutos en su rango máximo. Permanencia alarga hasta un 100% la duración de los beneficios obtenidos al descansar en el campamento.","text_en":"At maximum rank, Field Guide changes the 1-hour wait to add campsite features to 45 minutes, a reduction of up to 25%. Permanence can increase the duration of resting benefits by 100%.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Cooking Guide › Cooking Campfire Items and Buffs","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/cooking","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:cooking:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:c9b783787b269a1f3695609c03a7422ebb62edd7"]},{"id":"prof-recetas","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"De dónde salen las recetas","title_en":"Where Profession Recipes Come From","summary_es":"Además de instructores, hay recetas de vendedores, misiones, reputación y botín.","summary_en":"Besides trainers, recipes come from vendors, quests, reputation, and drops.","keywords_es":["recetas de profesión","dónde conseguir recetas","recetas de vendedor","recetas de misión","planos de campamento"],"keywords_en":["profession recipes","where to get recipes","vendor recipes","quest recipes","camp blueprints"],"text_es":"Los instructores enseñan muchas recetas, pero otras se compran a vendedores, se obtienen en misiones o reputación, o caen de enemigos. Los planos de los objetos de campamento de rangos superiores pueden conseguirse de jefes de mazmorra y desbloquean sus funciones.","text_en":"Trainers teach many recipes, but others come from vendors, quests, reputation, or enemy drops. Blueprints for higher-tier campsite objects can drop from dungeon bosses and unlock their features.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Profession Guide › How to Learn a Profession","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/professions-overview","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › What changed from Classic Era:","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","profession:_all:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:01f642ac6c1c2b54dc7112494b3332244cb3baf2","section:cb06e7b570d821973b4188030d9b587c8ce9a9e8"]},{"id":"prof-ventajas-recoleccion","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ventajas Legacy de recolección","title_en":"Gathering Legacy Perks","summary_es":"Cosecha generosa aumenta los materiales raros que obtienen Herboristería, Minería y Desuello.","summary_en":"Bountiful Harvest increases the scarce materials from Herbalism, Mining, and Skinning.","keywords_es":["bountiful harvest","ventajas de recolección","materiales raros de hierbas","materiales raros de minería","materiales raros de desuello"],"keywords_en":["bountiful harvest","gathering perks","scarce herb materials","scarce mining materials","scarce skinning materials"],"text_es":"Las ventajas Legacy de Herboristería, Minería y Desuello mejoran la recolección de distintas formas: pueden acelerar la subida de habilidad o aumentar la cantidad de materiales escasos obtenidos. El efecto concreto depende de la profesión y de las ventajas elegidas.","text_en":"Legacy perks for Herbalism, Mining, and Skinning improve gathering in different ways: they can speed skill gains or increase the amount of scarce materials collected. The specific effect depends on the profession and perks chosen.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Herbalism Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Herbs, and Trainers › Herbalism Legacy Perks","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/herbalism/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Mining Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Ores, and Trainers › Mining Legacy Perks","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/mining/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Skinning Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Tips, and Trainers › Skinning Legacy Perks","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/skinning/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:herbalism:overview","profession:mining:overview","profession:skinning:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:020a765b34202f08df3630c622960115736f7844","section:a9159f81a5370ec0563f9d67c38a1c45e086f9e6","section:b5feb7023b18f9d065ec30623c1076367aa51167"]},{"id":"prof-ventajas-artesania","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ventajas Legacy de artesanía","title_en":"Crafting Legacy Perks","summary_es":"Las ventajas Legacy pueden mejorar la habilidad, las capturas, la comida y el uso de vendas.","summary_en":"Master Chef, Luremaster, Working Overtime, Dedicated Study, Gourmand, and Field Medicine improve specific trades.","keywords_es":["master chef","luremaster","working overtime","dedicated study","gourmand","field medicine"],"keywords_en":["master chef","luremaster","working overtime","dedicated study","gourmand","field medicine"],"text_es":"Maestro cocinero puede producir una ración extra, con una probabilidad de hasta el 50%; Gastronomía alarga hasta un 100% los beneficios de comida. Maestro de los cebos puede dar una captura adicional si usas un cebo. Horas extra aumenta hasta un 20% la posibilidad de ganar habilidad y Estudio dedicado concede un punto cada 23 horas a tu profesión de menor nivel. Medicina de campo reduce hasta 10 segundos Vendado recientemente al usar una venda, excepto en mazmorras, bandas y campos de batalla.","text_en":"Master Chef can trigger an extra serving while Cooking, with a chance of 50% at maximum rank; Gourmand extends food benefits by up to 100%. Luremaster can grant an additional catch while you use a lure. Working Overtime increases the chance to gain skill by up to 20%, and Dedicated Study grants one point every 23 hours to your lowest profession. Field Medicine reduces Recently Bandaged by up to 10 seconds when you use a bandage, except in dungeons, raids, and battlegrounds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Cooking Guide › Cooking Speed and Legacy Perks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/cooking","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Cooking Guide › Food Buffs and How They Work","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/cooking","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fishing Guide › Fishing Lures","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fishing","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever First Aid Guide › Bandages","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/first-aid","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:cooking:overview","profession:first-aid:overview","profession:fishing:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:5c71cd4eea732083207dba8dca155e9f4cc0a024","section:8bb86bf3ff4096e786c9e53db463c4b559dd2f6e","section:cd69f812a3ae2ac59f44c344c87723e6a6dcb89c","section:fb50e1fc32313e5b04eb835a3df7d014c315b507"]},{"id":"prof-clases-armadura","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones según tu clase y armadura","title_en":"Professions by Class and Armor Type","summary_es":"Elige según el equipo que quieras fabricar y las ventajas que usarás.","summary_en":"Choose based on the gear you want to make and the benefits you will use.","keywords_es":["profesión para guerrero","profesión para cazador","profesión para druida","profesión para mago","profesión según armadura"],"keywords_en":["professions for warriors","professions for hunters","professions for druids","professions for mages","professions by armor"],"text_es":"Herrería encaja con Guerreros y Paladines que quieren fabricar armas, escudos y armadura pesada; Peletería permite a Druidas y Pícaros hacer equipo de cuero, y también sirve a Cazadores y Chamanes que pasan a malla. Sastrería ofrece equipo de tela para Magos, Sacerdotes y Brujos. Encantamiento resulta útil a cualquier clase que quiera aprovechar equipo sin uso para obtener materiales, mientras que Ingeniería deja a los Cazadores fabricar armas de fuego y munición.","text_en":"Blacksmithing suits Warriors and Paladins who want to make weapons, shields, and heavy armor; Leatherworking lets Druids and Rogues make leather gear and also serves Hunters and Shamans who move to mail. Tailoring offers cloth gear for Mages, Priests, and Warlocks, and Enchanting helps any class that wants materials from unwanted gear. and Engineering lets Hunters make guns and ammunition.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Blacksmithing Guide › Who Should Pick Blacksmithing?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/blacksmithing","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Leatherworking Guide › Who Should Pick Leatherworking?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/leatherworking","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Tailoring Guide › Who Should Pick Tailoring?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/tailoring","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Enchanting Guide › Who Should Pick Enchanting?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/enchanting","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Engineering Guide › Who Should Pick Engineering?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/engineering","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:blacksmithing:overview","profession:enchanting:overview","profession:engineering:overview","profession:leatherworking:overview","profession:tailoring:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:0975884f443d8117de463b717dd4d8f54af051c4","section:14950165a5bde07e142afd9ac2a894db71d17da0","section:3090895d83e59c89cf5b56fe75bf311b0b058bcf","section:6b42ad67fd238b74019e20c4b3f5377640c11f72","section:c64a47a0abb3a552836a97273fb783a6a8ddeba2"]},{"id":"prof-herramientas-estaciones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estaciones de profesión en campamentos","title_en":"Profession Stations at Campsites","summary_es":"Los planos desbloquean estaciones o utilidades en los rangos superiores de campamento.","summary_en":"Blueprints unlock stations or utilities at higher campsite tiers.","keywords_es":["estaciones de profesión","planos de campamento","estación de trabajo","yunque portátil","rangos de campamento"],"keywords_en":["profession stations","camp blueprints","workstation","portable anvil","campsite tiers"],"text_es":"El objeto de campamento inicial de cada profesión se desbloquea con una misión introductoria o un instructor al llegar a 20 de habilidad. Los planos habilitan los rangos de 140 y 300; conservan el beneficio inicial y añaden una estación de trabajo o una utilidad, como un yunque portátil o reparaciones.","text_en":"Each profession’s first campsite object unlocks at 20 skill through an introductory quest or a trainer. Blueprints unlock the 140 and 300 tiers; they keep the initial benefit and add a workstation or utility, such as a portable anvil or repairs.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › What each profession brings to a camp","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082"],"source_hashes":["section:113cacd85c3ec3370272100e16d40b627a40610f"]},{"id":"prof-guerrero-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para Guerrero","title_en":"Professions for Warriors","summary_es":"Herrería con Minería mejora la subida; Ingeniería con Minería aporta herramientas al final.","summary_en":"Blacksmithing with Mining supports leveling; Engineering with Mining adds endgame tools.","keywords_es":["profesiones para guerrero","herrería para guerrero","ingeniería para guerrero","subir herrería"],"keywords_en":["professions for warrior","blacksmithing for warrior","engineering for warrior","leveling blacksmithing"],"text_es":"Para subir, combina Herrería y Minería: el Guerrero depende mucho del equipo y muchos planos nuevos de Herrería quedan ligados al recogerlos. Al final, Ingeniería con Minería aporta bombas y artilugios para iniciar combates, escapar y causar daño de área.","text_en":"For leveling, pair Blacksmithing with Mining: Warriors depend heavily on gear, and many new Blacksmithing plans are bind-on-pickup. At endgame, Engineering with Mining adds bombs and gadgets for pulls, escapes, and area damage.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082"],"source_hashes":["section:1dcdfd8a19db8d263fb82e9482fd1b0681e383fc"]},{"id":"prof-paladin-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para Paladín","title_en":"Professions for Paladins","summary_es":"Herrería ayuda a subir; la combinación final depende de la especialización.","summary_en":"Blacksmithing supports leveling; the endgame pairing depends on specialization.","keywords_es":["profesiones para paladín","herrería para paladín","ingeniería para paladín","alquimia para paladín"],"keywords_en":["professions for paladin","blacksmithing for paladin","engineering for paladin","alchemy for paladin"],"text_es":"Sube con Herrería y Minería para fabricar equipo de placas. Protección y Reprensión pueden pasar a Ingeniería con Minería al final, pues las bombas y los artilugios compensan la falta de movilidad. Para Sagrado, Herboristería con Alquimia ayuda con el maná y aporta una fuente de regeneración para el grupo.","text_en":"Level with Blacksmithing and Mining to craft plate gear. Protection and Retribution can switch to Engineering with Mining at endgame, since bombs and gadgets help offset limited mobility. Herbalism with Alchemy is the mana-focused choice, supplying personal consumables and group regeneration.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › Plate: Warrior and Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082"],"source_hashes":["section:644bc67d5e81ab7c867f4592690dccd5e13e9cc3","section:876e9a1ce8c1db3293315877adfa4faf0e8a0b3f"]},{"id":"prof-cazador-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para Cazador","title_en":"Professions for Hunters","summary_es":"Peletería y Desuello sirven al subir; Ingeniería con Minería destaca al final.","summary_en":"Leatherworking and Skinning help while leveling; Engineering with Mining stands out later.","keywords_es":["profesiones para cazador","peletería para cazador","desuello para cazador","ingeniería para cazador"],"keywords_en":["professions for hunter","leatherworking for hunter","skinning for hunter","engineering for hunter"],"text_es":"Peletería con Desuello acompaña la subida: puedes fabricar equipo de agilidad y kits de armadura mientras obtienes cuero de las bestias que cazas. Al final, Ingeniería con Minería permite crear armas de fuego, miras y munición, reduciendo la presión de munición y bolsas.","text_en":"Level with Leatherworking and Skinning: you can craft Agility gear and armor kits while gathering leather from the beasts you hunt. At endgame, Engineering with Mining lets you make guns, scopes, and ammunition, easing ammo and bag pressure.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › Hunter","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082"],"source_hashes":["section:35c70b118929d2e6ce2fa574c9a14951c4ee04db"]},{"id":"prof-chaman-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para Chamán","title_en":"Professions for Shamans","summary_es":"Peletería ayuda durante la subida; al final conviene elegir según especialización.","summary_en":"Leatherworking helps while leveling; choose an endgame pair by specialization.","keywords_es":["profesiones para chamán","peletería para chamán","alquimia para chamán","ingeniería para chamán"],"keywords_en":["professions for shaman","leatherworking for shaman","alchemy for shaman","engineering for shaman"],"text_es":"Peletería sirve durante la subida en las tres especializaciones, con patrones de agilidad y de poder con hechizos. Al final, Elemental y Restauración pueden combinar Herboristería con Alquimia para obtener pociones y apoyo de maná; Mejora puede elegir Ingeniería con Minería por sus bombas y artilugios de combate.","text_en":"Leatherworking suits all three specializations while leveling, with patterns for Agility and spell power. At endgame, Elemental and Restoration can pair Herbalism with Alchemy for potions and mana support; Enhancement can choose Engineering with Mining for combat bombs and gadgets.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082"],"source_hashes":["section:3c9273f39d8ed6b26ef848e572cac5288f5ece22"]},{"id":"prof-picaro-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para Pícaro","title_en":"Professions for Rogues","summary_es":"Peletería y Desuello ayudan a subir; Ingeniería destaca en JcJ y Alquimia en JcE.","summary_en":"Leatherworking and Skinning help leveling; Engineering suits PvP, Alchemy PvE.","keywords_es":["profesiones para pícaro","peletería para pícaro","ingeniería para pícaro","alquimia para pícaro"],"keywords_en":["professions for rogue","leatherworking for rogue","engineering for rogue","alchemy for rogue"],"text_es":"Peletería con Desuello aporta piezas de cuero útiles durante la subida. Para el final, Ingeniería con Minería ofrece granadas y reflectores que se suman al control del Pícaro, sobre todo en JcJ. En JcE, Alquimia es una alternativa porque el Pícaro carece de autocuración y depende de pociones en combates largos.","text_en":"Leatherworking with Skinning provides useful leather pieces while leveling. At endgame, Engineering with Mining adds grenades and reflectors to a Rogue’s crowd control, especially in PvP. In PvE, Alchemy is an alternative because Rogues lack self-healing and rely on potions in long fights.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › Rogue","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082"],"source_hashes":["section:ec51098fd32c8fe3ca93e440ccc7bf8d9cd08a38"]},{"id":"prof-druida-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para Druida","title_en":"Professions for Druids","summary_es":"Peletería sirve para cualquier función y Herboristería con Alquimia al final.","summary_en":"Leatherworking fits every role; take Herbalism and Alchemy at endgame.","keywords_es":["profesiones para druida","peletería para druida","herboristería para druida","alquimia para druida"],"keywords_en":["professions for druid","leatherworking for druid","herbalism for druid","alchemy for druid"],"text_es":"Peletería con Desuello cubre las funciones del Druida durante la subida. Al final, Herboristería con Alquimia aprovecha que puede recolectar hierbas en forma de viaje y usar pociones mientras está transformado; el sigilo también le permite acercarse a nodos.","text_en":"Leatherworking with Skinning covers Druid roles while leveling. At endgame, Herbalism with Alchemy takes advantage of gathering herbs in travel form and using potions while shapeshifted; stealth also helps reach nodes.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › Leather: Rogue and Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082"],"source_hashes":["section:a2d5d68402b84f968fee3ed5404b5908595b93a4","section:ac85ff53ad09813da68418631e2dd22f7f46947f"]},{"id":"prof-mago-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para Mago","title_en":"Professions for Mages","summary_es":"Sastrería y Encantamiento ofrecen una combinación equilibrada; Ingeniería sirve para JcJ.","summary_en":"Tailoring and Enchanting are a balanced pair; Engineering is useful for PvP.","keywords_es":["profesiones para mago","sastrería para mago","encantamiento para mago","ingeniería para JcJ"],"keywords_en":["professions for mage","tailoring for mage","enchanting for mage","engineering for PvP"],"text_es":"Sastrería con Encantamiento es la combinación recomendada para una experiencia equilibrada. Sastrería añade equipo con poder con hechizos y Encantamiento fabrica bastones y objetos de mano secundaria, además de mejorar equipo. Ingeniería sigue siendo una opción útil para JcJ.","text_en":"Tailoring with Enchanting is the recommended pair for well-rounded play. Tailoring adds spell-power gear, while Enchanting makes staves and off-hands as well as gear enhancements. Engineering remains a useful PvP option.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › Mage","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082"],"source_hashes":["section:e98c2c3b5a668b6a4b8f984fd78784f0ffbc2b7b"]},{"id":"prof-sacerdote-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para Sacerdote","title_en":"Professions for Priests","summary_es":"Sastrería y Encantamiento funcionan al subir; Ingeniería añade movilidad y defensa.","summary_en":"Tailoring and Enchanting work for leveling; Engineering adds mobility and defense.","keywords_es":["profesiones para sacerdote","sastrería para sacerdote","encantamiento para sacerdote","ingeniería para sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["professions for priest","tailoring for priest","enchanting for priest","engineering for priest"],"text_es":"Sastrería con Encantamiento sirve durante la subida. Al final, Ingeniería es una alternativa si buscas movilidad o defensa, especialmente en JcJ o al afrontar combates difíciles; quien cura en bandas puede conservar Encantamiento para mejorar su propio equipo.","text_en":"Tailoring with Enchanting works while leveling. At endgame, Engineering is an alternative for mobility or defense, especially in PvP or messy fights; a raid healer can keep Enchanting to improve their own gear.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › Priest","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082"],"source_hashes":["section:f60ba6da081ed74173c4a5aa5aa564f7bdaa6b4d"]},{"id":"prof-brujo-profesiones","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profesiones para Brujo","title_en":"Professions for Warlocks","summary_es":"Sastrería y Encantamiento son la opción principal; Alquimia sirve para consumibles de banda.","summary_en":"Tailoring and Enchanting are the main choice; Alchemy supplies raid consumables.","keywords_es":["profesiones para brujo","sastrería para brujo","encantamiento para brujo","alquimia para brujo"],"keywords_en":["professions for warlock","tailoring for warlock","enchanting for warlock","alchemy for warlock"],"text_es":"Sastrería con Encantamiento es la combinación recomendada: los estandartes de campamento aumentan Espíritu, que potencia la herramienta de maná central del Brujo. Herboristería con Alquimia es una alternativa para reunir consumibles de banda y hacer transmutaciones.","text_en":"Tailoring with Enchanting is the recommended pair: campsite banners boost Spirit, which supports its mana strategy. Herbalism with Alchemy is an alternative for gathering raid consumables and making transmutes.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Profession Pairings by Class › Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:wow-forever-profession-pairings-by-class-35082"],"source_hashes":["section:274062ae52a7fa2aedeba857399ac5d1313108bb"]},{"id":"prof-escrituras-artesano","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Escrituras del artesano","title_en":"Craftsman’s Writs","summary_es":"Son objetos comerciables que inician misiones diarias y aparecen como botín del mundo.","summary_en":"Tradable items that start daily quests and drop out in the world.","keywords_es":["escrituras del artesano","conseguir escrituras","botín de escrituras","misiones diarias de profesión"],"keywords_en":["Craftsman’s Writs","get writs","writ drops","daily profession quests"],"text_es":"Las Escrituras del artesano son objetos comerciables de calidad rara que inician una misión. Se encuentran como botín por el mundo; la zona y el nivel influyen en cuáles aparecen mientras subes. Cada misión puede completarse una vez al día.","text_en":"Craftsman’s Writs are tradable, rare-quality items that start a quest. They drop throughout the world; zone and level influence which ones appear while leveling. Each quest can be completed once per day.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Craftsman's Writs:  Recipes, Rewards & Routes - WoW: Forever › What Are Craftsman's Writs in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/craftsmans-writs-overview-recipes-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:_all:craftsmans-writs-overview-recipes-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:22a2e02ad9b69a25615de15af83d549544c6e27a"]},{"id":"prof-recompensas-escrituras","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de las escrituras","title_en":"Writ Rewards","summary_es":"Completar una escritura da reputación de facción y una Faltriquera de monedas.","summary_en":"Completing a writ grants faction reputation and a Coin Pouch.","keywords_es":["recompensas de escrituras","faltriquera de monedas","reputación por escrituras","recompensa misión diaria"],"keywords_en":["writ rewards","Coin Pouch","writ reputation","daily quest reward"],"text_es":"Al completar una Escritura del artesano recibes reputación para la organización comercial de tu facción y una Faltriquera de monedas.","text_en":"Completing a Craftsman’s Writ grants reputation with the trade organization for your faction and a Coin Pouch.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Craftsman's Writs:  Recipes, Rewards & Routes - WoW: Forever › Rewards from Craftsman's Writs in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/craftsmans-writs-overview-recipes-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:_all:craftsmans-writs-overview-recipes-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:06f5d75130a587152993646517a0e1923ab12893"]},{"id":"prof-habilidad-armas","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Límite y coste de habilidad con armas","title_en":"Weapon Skill Cap and Cost","summary_es":"La habilidad máxima depende del nivel; Armas de asta exige nivel 20 y cuesta más.","summary_en":"The cap scales with level; Polearms require level 20 and cost more.","keywords_es":["habilidad con armas","límite habilidad de armas","coste maestro de armas","armas de asta nivel 20","entrenar habilidad de arma"],"keywords_en":["weapon skill","weapon skill cap","weapon trainer cost","Polearms level 20","train weapon skill"],"text_es":"La habilidad máxima con cada tipo de arma equivale a cinco veces el nivel del personaje, hasta 300 al nivel 60. Se puede aprender desde el nivel 10, por 10 monedas de plata; Armas de asta requiere nivel 20 y cuesta 1 moneda de oro.","text_en":"The weapon-skill cap for each type is five times character level, with a maximum of 300 at character level 60. Skills can be trained from level 10, for 10 silver; Polearms require level 20 and cost 1 gold.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Weapon Trainer & Skill Guide:  Trainer Locations and Cost - WoW: Forever › Overview of Weapon Skill in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/weapon-trainer-skill-locations","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Weapon Trainer & Skill Guide:  Trainer Locations and Cost - WoW: Forever › Weapon Skill Training Cost","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/weapon-trainer-skill-locations","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:weapon-trainer-skill-locations"],"source_hashes":["section:2968169caa0ea313930d2b6403b151d46b97cf55","section:6c41f77a12bb5c008f60829ac578aa8f9bc379e1"]},{"id":"prof-maestros-armas","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dónde entrenar habilidades de armas","title_en":"Where to Train Weapon Skills","summary_es":"Los maestros están en las capitales y cada uno enseña armas distintas.","summary_en":"Weapon masters are in capital cities and each teaches different weapons.","keywords_es":["maestros de armas","dónde aprender armas","entrenadores de armas","instructor de armas por ciudad","habilidades de armas"],"keywords_en":["weapon masters","where to learn weapons","weapon trainers","weapon trainer cities","weapon skills"],"text_es":"Hay maestros de armas en las capitales principales de ambas facciones: Darnassus, Forjaz, Ventormenta, Orgrimmar, Cima del Trueno y Entrañas. Cada maestro enseña una selección distinta; su diálogo indica adónde acudir para entrenar una habilidad concreta.","text_en":"Weapon masters are available in the major capitals of both factions: Darnassus, Ironforge, Stormwind, Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, and Undercity. Each teaches a different selection; their dialogue points you to the right trainer for a specific skill.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Weapon Trainer & Skill Guide:  Trainer Locations and Cost - WoW: Forever › Weapon Skill Trainer Locations in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/weapon-trainer-skill-locations","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Weapon Trainer & Skill Guide:  Trainer Locations and Cost - WoW: Forever › Weapon Trainer Locations","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/weapon-trainer-skill-locations","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:weapon-trainer-skill-locations"],"source_hashes":["section:4a3c1ea188d62c22017a96d8e9e83c21c63bb492","section:b93978a39df2928607cf33e24192536c9c840eb5"]},{"id":"prof-subir-botanica","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Subir Herboristería por tramos","title_en":"Leveling Herbalism by Range","summary_es":"Empieza en zonas iniciales y cambia de hierbas conforme desbloqueas habilidad.","summary_en":"Start in starter zones and switch herbs as your skill unlocks them.","keywords_es":["subir herboristería","hierbas por nivel","herboristería zonas iniciales","alga estranguladora","dónde recolectar hierbas"],"keywords_en":["level Herbalism","herbs by skill","starter zones Herbalism","Stranglekelp","where to gather herbs"],"text_es":"Cualquier zona inicial sirve: al principio recoge Flor de paz y Hojaplata; desde 15, también Raíz de tierra. A 70, busca Marregal y Brezospina, además de Alga estranguladora bajo el agua. Desde 115 céntrate en Hierba cardenal y Acérita salvaje; desde 125, Sangrerregia, y al superar 150, Vidarraíz. A 185, avanza a hierbas de nivel superior; Ivernalia crece en la nieve de las Montañas de Alterac.","text_en":"Any starter zone works: begin with Peacebloom and Silverleaf, then add Earthroot at 15. At 70, look for Mageroyal and Briarthorn, plus underwater Stranglekelp. From 115, focus on Bruiseweed and Wild Steelbloom; add Kingsblood at 125 and Liferoot above 150. At 185, move on to higher-tier herbs; Wintersbite grows in the snow of Alterac Mountains.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Herbalism Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Herbs, and Trainers › Leveling Herbalism in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/herbalism/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Herbalism Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Herbs, and Trainers › Where to Find Herb Nodes in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/herbalism/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:herbalism:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:36a328ec5c1fb3c5de57223fc8bbffc97b1cd53f","section:8afef725b1f80ff7d68527ae3e9c2ddbe8c2c505"]},{"id":"prof-nuevas-hierbas","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hierbas y materiales nuevos","title_en":"New Herbs and Materials","summary_es":"Forever añade tres hierbas de nivel máximo y materiales escasos de recolección.","summary_en":"Forever adds three endgame herbs and scarce materials from gathering.","keywords_es":["hierbas nuevas","Hojapesadilla","Salvia demoníaca","Loto mortal","materiales escasos de herboristería"],"keywords_en":["new herbs","Marefoil","Demonsage","Death Lotus","scarce Herbalism materials"],"text_es":"Forever incorpora Hojapesadilla, Salvia demoníaca y Loto mortal para recetas de nivel máximo; todavía no se conocen sus ubicaciones ni requisitos de recolección. También pueden aparecer semillas y materiales escasos adicionales al recoger hierbas, como Liquen con volantes, Sombrerrosa y Estranguladora; no se sabe qué hierbas dan cada material.","text_en":"Forever adds Marefoil, Demonsage, and Death Lotus for endgame recipes; their gathering locations and skill requirements are not yet known. Gathering can also yield seeds and scarce materials such as Frilled Lichen, Rosecap, and Stranglevine; which herbs produce each material is unknown.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Herbalism Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Herbs, and Trainers › New Herbs in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/herbalism/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Herbalism Guide › New Herbs in WoW Forever > New Scarce Herbalism Materials","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/herbalism","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:herbalism:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:860d982c71851e35dbb4275bb301aa515330e9e9","section:c989cc14a70f369e6692b14c4b10f93916fa969c"]},{"id":"prof-subir-mineria","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Subir Minería por tramos","title_en":"Leveling Mining by Range","summary_es":"Fundir ayuda hasta 185; después, sube la habilidad extrayendo filones.","summary_en":"Smelting helps up to 185; after that, level by mining veins.","keywords_es":["subir minería","fundir para subir","filón de estaño","minería habilidad 185","zonas de minería"],"keywords_en":["level Mining","level by smelting","Tin Vein","Mining skill 185","Mining zones"],"text_es":"Al principio puedes extraer Filón de cobre; desbloqueas estaño a 65, plata a 75 e hierro a 125. El oro se puede extraer desde 155. Fundir menas puede dar habilidad hasta 185, pero no hay barras que la suban entre 140 y 155, así que toca minar. Después de 185, solo extraer filones permite progresar; cambia a zonas con la mena de mayor requisito que ya puedas recoger.","text_en":"Copper Vein is the first available deposit; Tin unlocks at 65, Silver at 75, and Iron at 125. Gold can be mined from 155. Smelting can raise skill up to 185, but no bar grants skill between 140 and 155, so mine during that stretch. Beyond 185, mining veins is the only way to progress; move to zones with the highest-requirement ore you can gather.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Mining Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Ores, and Trainers › 1-225 Mining Leveling by Mining in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/mining/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Mining Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Ores, and Trainers › Smelting Bars in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/mining/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:mining:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:5ddcb4f953541519cc01aeb969783d6f0e9e077e","section:8e404b9e5407e39d0e7918238df7db700fd691e2"]},{"id":"prof-nuevos-minerales","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Nuevas menas y barras","title_en":"New Ores and Bars","summary_es":"Nuevas barras y materiales escasos de Minería alimentan recetas avanzadas.","summary_en":"New Mining bars and scarce materials supply advanced recipes.","keywords_es":["barras nuevas minería","torio pesado","azerothium","legionita","materiales escasos minería"],"keywords_en":["new Mining bars","Heavy Thorium","Azerothium","Legionite","scarce Mining materials"],"text_es":"Forever añade Mena de torio pesado, Barra de torio pesado, Barra de azerothium y Barra de legionita para recetas avanzadas; aún no se conocen las zonas donde aparece la mena nueva. Al minar también puedes obtener Pirita, Bauxita o Uraninita junto al mineral normal. La fuente de Uraninita en filones de nivel alto sigue sin confirmarse.","text_en":"Forever adds a new heavy-thorium ore and bars for advanced recipes involving thorium, Azerothium, and Legionite; the ore's locations are not known yet. Mining can also yield Pyrite, Bauxite, or Pitchblende alongside regular ore. Pitchblende from higher-level veins remains unconfirmed.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Mining Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Ores, and Trainers › New Ores and Bars in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/mining/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:mining:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:70f63a2a1e0fca8ef85c62661bfb418975c84a23"]},{"id":"prof-subir-desollar","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Subir Desuello por zonas","title_en":"Leveling Skinning by Zone","summary_es":"Empieza en una zona inicial y cambia a áreas con bestias de más nivel.","summary_en":"Start in a starter zone and move to areas with higher-level beasts.","keywords_es":["subir desollar","zonas para desollar","desollar en Durotar","desollar en Los Baldíos","habilidad de desuello 200"],"keywords_en":["level Skinning","Skinning zones","Skinning in Durotar","Skinning in the Barrens","Skinning skill 200"],"text_es":"Cualquier zona inicial permite empezar. En Durotar avanza hacia el norte; en el Bosque de Elwynn, desuella al sur de Villadorada y luego cerca del Campamento del Este hasta 75. Después pasa a Los Baldíos o Loch Modan y continúa por Laderas de Trabalomas o Los Humedales; al acercarte a 175, considera cambiar de zona. Desde 200, Tierras Altas de Arathi, Vega de Tuercespina y Las Mil Agujas ofrecen bestias para aprender el rango Artesano.","text_en":"Any starter zone works. Durotar's route moves north as gains slow; Elwynn Forest starts south of Goldshire, then shifts around Eastvale Logging Camp until 75. Next, move to the Barrens or Loch Modan and continue through Hillsbrad Foothills or Wetlands; consider changing zones as you approach 175. From 200, Arathi Highlands, Stranglethorn Vale, and Thousand Needles have beasts for the highest rank.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Skinning Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Tips, and Trainers › Leveling Skinning in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/skinning/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Skinning Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Tips, and Trainers › Where to Learn Skinning in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/skinning/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:skinning:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6b891bbfd12f2a81a6ee7afc83410f8305fda9b2","section:9865bdc210d4405ed01d1e748ce3e170a49e075c"]},{"id":"prof-nuevos-materiales-desollar","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Nuevos materiales de Desuello","title_en":"New Skinning Materials","summary_es":"Cuero vil, Pellejo vil y materiales prístinos aparecen en recetas de nivel máximo.","summary_en":"Fel and Pristine materials appear in endgame recipes.","keywords_es":["materiales nuevos desollar","cuero vil","pellejo vil","cuero prístino","escama prístina"],"keywords_en":["new Skinning materials","Fel Leather","Fel Hide","Pristine Leather","Pristine Scale"],"text_es":"Cuero vil y Pellejo vil se usan en recetas de nivel máximo, aunque todavía no se conocen sus ubicaciones ni requisitos. Al desollar también hay una probabilidad de obtener Cuero prístino, Pellejo prístino o Escama prístina además del botín habitual; aún faltan datos de probabilidad y nivel requerido.","text_en":"Fel Leather and Fel Hide are used in endgame recipes, but their locations and skill requirements are not known yet. Extra loot may include any of these: Pristine Leather, Pristine Hide, or Pristine Scale. Their drop chances and skill thresholds are still undocumented.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Skinning Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Tips, and Trainers › New Skinning Materials in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/skinning/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:skinning:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:32a417c2b062b3b68bde8a513b97481332a70ce4"]},{"id":"prof-rangos-cocina","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rangos de Cocina","title_en":"Cooking Ranks","summary_es":"Los rangos Expertos y Artesano requieren un libro y una misión, no solo instructor.","summary_en":"Expert and Artisan ranks require a book and a quest, not just a trainer.","keywords_es":["rangos de cocina","libro de cocina para expertos","cocina 225","aprender cocina artesano"],"keywords_en":["Cooking ranks","Expert Cookbook","Cooking 225","learn Artisan Cooking"],"text_es":"Los instructores enseñan Aprendiz (1-75) y Oficial (75-150). Para Experto, compra el Libro de cocina para expertos, que permite avanzar de 150 a 225. Con nivel de personaje 35 y Cocina 225, completa Sorpresa de almejates para aprender Artesano, hasta 300.","text_en":"Trainers teach Apprentice (1-75) and Journeyman (75-150). To learn Expert, obtain the Expert Cookbook, which covers 150-225. At character level 35 and Cooking 225, complete Clamlette Surprise to learn Artisan, up to 300.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cooking Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Recipes, and Trainers › Where to Learn Cooking in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/cooking/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cooking Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Recipes, and Trainers › Expert Cooking Book (150-225)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/cooking/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cooking Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Recipes, and Trainers › Artisan Cooking Quest (225-300)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/cooking/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:cooking:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:3204b1fe5f31c3ebf2fe4df301f43774abc4e787","section:ca3102df0c5db963d47350f8767ea8e5529d1fe1","section:e7410028339d494df0f5cc55eaaf494251cebff7"]},{"id":"prof-subir-cocina","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Subir Cocina con pescado","title_en":"Leveling Cooking with Fish","summary_es":"Cocinar pescado suele ser una ruta sencilla para progresar y aprovechar las capturas.","summary_en":"Cooking fish is often a simple route that makes use of your catches.","keywords_es":["subir cocina","cocina con pescado","materiales para cocina","recetas de cocina para subir"],"keywords_en":["level Cooking","Cooking with fish","Cooking materials","Cooking leveling recipes"],"text_es":"Cocinar pescado suele ser una ruta conveniente para subir: las recetas son fáciles de conseguir, el pescado crudo suele costar poco y casi todas las preparaciones usan pocos ingredientes secundarios. La cantidad necesaria varía según los puntos que obtengas; revisa las recetas disponibles antes de comprar materiales.","text_en":"Cooking fish is often a convenient leveling route: the recipes are easy to obtain, raw fish is usually inexpensive, and most dishes need few extra ingredients. The amount required varies with skill gains, so check available recipes before buying materials.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cooking Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Recipes, and Trainers › Leveling Cooking in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/cooking/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:cooking:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:f04e1c58af7aa674257ac89978b035309962f7f4"]},{"id":"prof-herramientas-cocina","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Fuegos y herramientas de Cocina","title_en":"Cooking Fires and Tools","summary_es":"Cocina necesita fuego, especias de vendedor y puede acelerarse con una vara especial.","summary_en":"Cooking needs a fire and vendor spices, and a special rod can speed it up.","keywords_es":["fuego para cocinar","especias de cocina","vara para remover galletas","horno de hierro"],"keywords_en":["cooking fire","Cooking spices","Cookie's Stirring Rod","Iron Oven"],"text_es":"Para cocinar, acércate a una hoguera, chimenea u horno; las recetas avanzadas pueden exigir el Horno de hierro. Los vendedores de suministros venden especias comunes. La Vara para remover galletas aumenta un 25% la velocidad de Cocina mientras la llevas equipada.","text_en":"Cook near a fire, fireplace, or oven; advanced recipes may require an Iron Oven. Supplies vendors sell common spices. Cookie's Stirring Rod increases Cooking speed by 25% while equipped.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Cooking Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Recipes, and Trainers › How to Cook in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/cooking/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Cooking Guide › How to Cook > Cooking Speed and Legacy Perks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/cooking","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:cooking:overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:ddc95dce1de74935a05544b91418223b29bdaa80","section:38525ca2ce54112e409d10109f78f55d315fe9f3"]},{"id":"prof-rangos-primeros-auxilios","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rangos de Primeros auxilios","title_en":"First Aid Ranks","summary_es":"Los instructores enseñan los primeros rangos; los siguientes requieren libro y misión.","summary_en":"Trainers teach the first ranks; later ones require a book and a quest.","keywords_es":["rangos primeros auxilios","manual primeros auxilios expertos","primeros auxilios 225","misión Atenciones médicas"],"keywords_en":["First Aid ranks","Expert First Aid book","First Aid 225","Triage quest"],"text_es":"Los instructores enseñan Aprendiz (1-75) y Oficial (75-150). El libro Primeros auxilios para expertos: Entre vendas abre el rango Experto (150-225). Con personaje de nivel 35 y habilidad 225, completa Atenciones médicas para la Alianza u Orden de gravedad para la Horda y aprende Artesano (225-300).","text_en":"Trainers teach Apprentice (1-75) and Journeyman (75-150). The book Expert First Aid - Under Wraps unlocks Expert (150-225). At character level 35 and skill 225, complete Triage to learn Artisan (225-300); the required quest differs by faction.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: First Aid Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Recipes, and Trainers › Where to Learn First Aid in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/first-aid/overview","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: First Aid Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Recipes, and Trainers › Expert First Aid Book (150-225)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/first-aid/overview","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: First Aid Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Recipes, and Trainers › Artisan First Aid Quest (225-300)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/first-aid/overview","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:first-aid:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:640123afcf911201d1cb401ea62b6992537e485c","section:837092bf000150f738652892223b919612ef71e1","section:e80066893347cb142ae414a6cf322132eaf42d49"]},{"id":"prof-subir-primeros-auxilios","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Subir Primeros auxilios","title_en":"Leveling First Aid","summary_es":"Las vendas suelen ser la opción económica; a 225 hace falta completar una misión.","summary_en":"Bandages are usually the economical option; at 225, complete a quest.","keywords_es":["subir primeros auxilios","telas para vendas","primeros auxilios 225","Atenciones médicas"],"keywords_en":["level First Aid","cloth for bandages","First Aid 225","Triage"],"text_es":"Las vendas suelen ser la forma más barata de subir Primeros auxilios, aunque también hay pociones y cataplasmas que dan puntos. Al llegar a habilidad 225 y nivel de personaje 35, completa Atenciones médicas para la Alianza u Orden de gravedad para la Horda; sin ese paso no podrás aprender Artesano ni avanzar hasta 300.","text_en":"Bandages are usually the cheapest way to level First Aid, though potions and poultices can also grant skill. At 225 skill and character level 35, complete the faction-specific Triage quest; without it you cannot learn Artisan or progress to 300.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: First Aid Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Recipes, and Trainers › Leveling First Aid in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/first-aid/overview","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: First Aid Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Recipes, and Trainers › Materials List","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/first-aid/overview","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: First Aid Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Recipes, and Trainers › Artisan First Aid Quest (225-300)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/first-aid/overview","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:first-aid:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:686310df3e286fe2b2a2b39dbecf591d5111f667","section:837092bf000150f738652892223b919612ef71e1","section:a5828bdabef30937030138c7783bc901f88e7543"]},{"id":"prof-remedios-primeros-auxilios","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Remedios de Primeros auxilios","title_en":"First Aid Remedies","summary_es":"Antídotos, cataplasmas y torniquetes contrarrestan venenos, enfermedades y sangrados.","summary_en":"Anti-venoms, poultices, and tourniquets counter poisons, diseases, and bleeds.","keywords_es":["remedios primeros auxilios","antídoto fuerte","cataplasmas","torniquetes","vendas de primeros auxilios"],"keywords_en":["First Aid remedies","Strong Anti-Venom","poultices","tourniquets","First Aid bandages"],"text_es":"Los antídotos eliminan venenos y se pueden usar en combate; las cataplasmas curan enfermedades y los torniquetes detienen sangrados, pero estos dos remedios requieren estar fuera de combate. Comparten un minuto de reutilización. Una venda canalizada restaura salud, pero moverte o recibir daño puede interrumpirla; el objetivo queda con Vendado recientemente durante un minuto.","text_en":"Anti-venoms remove poisons and can be used in combat; poultices cure diseases and tourniquets stop bleeds, but those two remedies require being out of combat. All three share a one-minute cooldown. A channeled bandage restores health, but movement or damage can interrupt it; the target then has Recently Bandaged for one minute.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever First Aid Guide › Removing Poisons, Diseases, and Bleeds","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/first-aid","date":"2026-11-03"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever First Aid Guide › Bandages","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/first-aid","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:first-aid:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:8bb86bf3ff4096e786c9e53db463c4b559dd2f6e","section:cc7ff2943a7dac635b931eeb6bf3f045a7471b12"]},{"id":"prof-rangos-pesca","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rangos de Pesca","title_en":"Fishing Ranks","summary_es":"Para Expertos necesitas un libro y Artesano se desbloquea con una misión.","summary_en":"Expert requires a book, and Artisan unlocks through a quest.","keywords_es":["rangos de pesca","pesca para expertos","pesca 225","aprender pesca artesano"],"keywords_en":["Fishing ranks","Expert Fishing book","Fishing 225","learn Artisan Fishing"],"text_es":"Los instructores enseñan Aprendiz (1-75) y Oficial (75-150). El libro Pesca para expertos: La lubina y tú permite llegar a 225. Con nivel 35 y Pesca 225, inicia Nat Pagle, pescador del extremo para aprender Artesano, hasta 300.","text_en":"Trainers teach Apprentice (1-75) and Journeyman (75-150). The book Expert Fishing - The Bass and You lets you reach 225. At level 35 and Fishing 225, start Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme to learn Artisan, up to 300.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fishing Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Fishing Boosts, and Trainers › Where to Learn Fishing in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/fishing/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fishing Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Fishing Boosts, and Trainers › Expert Fishing Book (150-225)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/fishing/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fishing Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Fishing Boosts, and Trainers › Artisan Fishing Quest (225-300)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/fishing/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:fishing:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:05f5f67fa1aba2b33d223198224a7444f625d7f6","section:370d6766cba911b6cce5fdb0ff3704da881144d9","section:7e9d9e2f32cf4397964e4483d45a0c945f4b329c"]},{"id":"prof-subir-pesca","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Subir Pesca por zonas","title_en":"Leveling Fishing by Zone","summary_es":"Las aguas iniciales sirven para subir; zonas de mayor nivel permiten pescar otras capturas.","summary_en":"Starter waters can level the skill; higher-level zones offer different catches.","keywords_es":["subir pesca","zonas para pescar","cebo para pesca","pesca en Vega de Tuercespina","pesca en Tanaris"],"keywords_en":["level Fishing","fishing zones","Fishing lure","Fishing in Stranglethorn Vale","Fishing in Tanaris"],"text_es":"Hasta Pesca 25, usa un Adorno lustroso; luego las zonas iniciales ya permiten una captura segura sin cebo. A 75, aprende Oficial y sigue pescando. Para 150-225, la Vega de Tuercespina suele convenir a la Horda y el Marjal Revolcafango a la Alianza; usa cebos para alcanzar el requisito de captura segura. Tras la misión de Artesano, continúa allí o ve a Tanaris; allí necesitas 300 para asegurar las capturas.","text_en":"Use a Shiny Bauble until Fishing 25; after that, starter zones allow reliable catches without a lure. At 75, learn Journeyman and keep fishing. For 150-225, Stranglethorn Vale generally suits Horde, while Dustwallow Marsh is more accessible to Alliance; use lures to meet the guaranteed-catch requirement. After completing the rank quest, continue there or move to Tanaris, where 300 skill is needed for guaranteed catches. Starter waters also remain an option for skill gains through 300.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fishing Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Fishing Boosts, and Trainers › Leveling Fishing in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/fishing/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fishing Guide › Increasing Your Fishing Skill","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fishing","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:fishing:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:5bb931b4c2d710950648a7cd88aa4c7e5abbc8b1","section:94c23b519c10e9d0c2d857161f7953a680a7730a"]},{"id":"prof-torneo-pesca","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Torneo de Pesca de Tuercespina","title_en":"Stranglethorn Fishing Tournament","summary_es":"Forever amplía a 50 los ganadores y añade una moneda de recompensa.","summary_en":"Forever expands the winners to 50 and adds a reward coin.","keywords_es":["torneo de pesca","Maestro pescador","moneda espectáculo extravagante","recompensas pesca Tuercespina"],"keywords_en":["Fishing tournament","Master Angler","Extravagant Extravaganza Coin","Stranglethorn fishing rewards"],"text_es":"En el torneo de pesca de la Vega de Tuercespina, los primeros 50 jugadores que completen Maestro pescador reciben la Caña de pescar de arcanita y una Moneda de espectáculo extravagante. Puedes canjear la moneda por recompensas como el Gancho del maestro Pescador, los Zapatos de surfero o el Cebito amargo.","text_en":"Forever names the first 50 players who complete the tournament quest as winners; each receives an Arcanite Fishing Pole and an Extravagant Extravaganza Coin. Exchange the coin for rewards such as Hook of the Master Angler, Surfer Shoes, or Bitter Baitling.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fishing Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Fishing Boosts, and Trainers › Fishing Tournament in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/fishing/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:fishing:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:0020c55435ed9c5a3bdc6e22ab451345c384a470"]},{"id":"prof-campamento-recoleccion","chapter":5,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Campamento de profesiones recolectoras","title_en":"Gathering Professions at Camp","summary_es":"Herboristería, Minería, Desuello y Pesca ofrecen beneficios distintos en el campamento.","summary_en":"Herbalism, Mining, Skinning, and Fishing add different campsite benefits.","keywords_es":["campamento herboristería","campamento minería","campamento desollar","campamento pesca","recetas de campamento"],"keywords_en":["Herbalism campsite","Mining campsite","Skinning campsite","Fishing campsite","camp recipes"],"text_es":"En el campamento, Herboristería puede aportar la Vela de incienso con un efecto parecido a Intelecto Arcano; Minería, Magnetita con un efecto similar a Bendición del poderío; y Desuello, Silla de campamento con un efecto como Aura de lechúcico lunar. Pesca añade el Cuenco con pescado, que mejora las estadísticas de quienes se sientan cerca; los objetos avanzados ofrecen utilidades adicionales.","text_en":"At camp, Herbalism can provide an Incense Candle with an Arcane Intellect-like effect; Mining, a Lodestone with a Blessing of Might-like effect; and Skinning, a Camp Chair with a Moonkin Aura-like effect. Fishing adds a Fish Bowl that improves nearby players' stats; advanced items offer further utilities.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Herbalism Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Herbs, and Trainers › Why Choose Herbalism?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/herbalism/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Mining Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, New Ores, and Trainers › Why Choose Mining?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/mining/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Skinning Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Tips, and Trainers › Why Choose Skinning?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/skinning/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Fishing Profession Overview in Forever - Leveling, Fishing Boosts, and Trainers › Why Level Fishing?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/professions/fishing/overview-leveling","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Fishing Guide › Fishing Campfire Items and Buffs","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/fishing","date":"2026-11-03"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["profession:fishing:overview","profession:herbalism:overview","profession:mining:overview","profession:skinning:overview"],"source_hashes":["section:0d3cb81dd2f879e0067466d7c1c547503262ff5a","section:428e623fd1d4af51c6a56d00a2ff677f61a5dbe1","section:447f673ea37d441073b9cfecbe0d860f3655757b","section:b70df239543fb05fc2657c51df492402db797818","section:c96483ff916d5db958e1639f34a49a3c06de1f15"]}]},"06-misiones.json":{"description":"Capítulo 6: Misiones especiales. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"general-misiones-templo-atalhakkar-druida","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misión del Templo: Druida","title_en":"Sunken Temple Quest: Druid","summary_es":"La cadena de nivel 50 del Druida culmina en el Templo de Atal'Hakkar y da tres recompensas.","summary_en":"The level 50 Druid chain ends in the Sunken Temple and grants three rewards.","keywords_es":["misión de Druida nivel 50","recompensas del Druida","misión del Templo de Atal'Hakkar"],"keywords_en":["level 50 Druid quest","Druid quest rewards","Sunken Temple class quest"],"tags":["DRUID"],"text_es":"Desde un instructor de clase, reúne 8 unidades de Aguijón Gorishi y 8 Champiñones de sangre en Un'Goro. Después usa la púa de demosaurio sobre un Demosaurio y, en el Templo de Atal'Hakkar, derrota a Atal'alarion para obtener la Viña podrida. Al entregar la misión recibes Pelambre canoso, Abrazo del bosque y Bastón Sombra Lunar.","text_en":"Start with a class trainer, then gather 8 Gorishi Sting items and 8 Bloodcaps in Un'Goro. Apply a Devilsaur Barb to a Devilsaur, then defeat Atal'alarion in the Sunken Temple for Putrid Vine. Turning in the quest grants Grizzled Pelt, Forest's Embrace, and Moonshadow Stave.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide:  Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Druid Sunken Temple Quest Chain in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:02b891c2fc67ea3ffcd377e68661c8ec0b1834ba"]},{"id":"general-misiones-templo-atalhakkar-cazador","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misión del Templo: Cazador","title_en":"Sunken Temple Quest: Hunter","summary_es":"La cadena de nivel 50 del Cazador requiere cuernos y escamas antes de entrar al Templo.","summary_en":"The level 50 Hunter chain requires antlers and scales before entering the temple.","keywords_es":["misión de Cazador nivel 50","recompensas del Cazador","cuernos de corcel","escamas de vándalo marino"],"keywords_en":["level 50 Hunter quest","Hunter quest rewards","courser antlers","wavethrasher scales"],"tags":["HUNTER"],"text_es":"La cadena empieza con tu instructor de clase. En Azshara acepta Cuernos de corcel y consigue 2 Cuernos perfectos y luego 6 Escamas de vándalo marino; después derrota a Morphaz en el Templo de Atal'Hakkar y entrega su Diente de Morphaz. Recibes Lanza de caza, Ojo de demosaurio y Diente de demosaurio.","text_en":"Start the chain with your class trainer. In Azshara, take the Courser Antlers quest, collect 2 Perfect Courser Antler items and then 6 Wavethrasher Scale items; next defeat Morphaz in the Sunken Temple and turn in his Tooth of Morphaz. Your rewards are Hunting Spear, Devilsaur Eye, and Devilsaur Tooth.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide:  Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Hunter Sunken Temple Quest Chain in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:151a8e731a5fa0575e3aeff55917af00900ffcd5"]},{"id":"general-misiones-templo-atalhakkar-mago","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misión del Templo: Mago","title_en":"Sunken Temple Quest: Mage","summary_es":"El Mago reúne polvo y coral encantado antes de enfrentarse a Morphaz.","summary_en":"The Mage gathers dust and enchanted coral before facing Morphaz.","keywords_es":["misión de Mago nivel 50","recompensas del Mago","polvo relumbrante","coral encantado"],"keywords_en":["level 50 Mage quest","Mage quest rewards","Glittering Dust","Enchanted Coral"],"tags":["MAGE"],"text_es":"La cadena comienza con tu instructor. En Azshara reúne 10 unidades de Polvo relumbrante y 6 de Coral encantado; luego entra al Templo de Atal'Hakkar, derrota a Morphaz y entrega el Fragmento Arcano. La recompensa incluye Punta glacial, Colgante de cristal Arcano y Rubí de fuego.","text_en":"Begin with your class trainer. In Azshara, gather 10 Glittering Dust and 6 Enchanted Coral; then enter the Sunken Temple, defeat Morphaz, and turn in the Arcane Shard. The rewards are Glacial Spike, Arcane Crystal Pendant, and Fire Ruby.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide:  Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Mage Sunken Temple Quest Chain in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:5884920041df15a243acf7f240bca8fd75b4b614"]},{"id":"general-misiones-templo-atalhakkar-paladin","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misión del Templo: Paladín","title_en":"Sunken Temple Quest: Paladin","summary_es":"El Paladín reúne piedras de la Plaga y plumas vudú para su cadena de nivel 50.","summary_en":"The Paladin gathers Scourgestones and Voodoo Feathers for the level 50 chain.","keywords_es":["misión de Paladín nivel 50","recompensas del Paladín","plumas vudú","piedras de la Plaga"],"keywords_en":["level 50 Paladin quest","Paladin quest rewards","Voodoo Feathers","Scourgestones"],"tags":["PALADIN"],"text_es":"La cadena parte de Lord Grisillo Quiebrasombras y te lleva hasta el Campamento del Orvallo. Reúne 20 unidades de Piedra de la Plaga de esbirro, consigue una Piedra de la Plaga inerte y, en el Templo de Atal'Hakkar, saquea dos de cada tipo de pluma vudú de los seis jefes trol. Obtienes Hoja forjada con luz, Orbe santificado y Sello caballeresco.","text_en":"The chain starts with Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker and sends you to Chillwind Camp. Gather 20 Minion's Scourgestone items and obtain an Inert Scourgestone; then loot two of each Voodoo Feather type from the six troll bosses in the Sunken Temple. You receive Lightforged Blade, Sanctified Orb, and Chivalrous Signet.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide:  Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Paladin Sunken Temple Quest Chain in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:caf4e1ff883bd21035ca125d4b32e36bb21d5019"]},{"id":"general-misiones-templo-atalhakkar-sacerdote","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misión del Templo: Sacerdote","title_en":"Sunken Temple Quest: Priest","summary_es":"El Sacerdote reúne glándulas e icor antes de derrotar a Morphaz.","summary_en":"The Priest gathers glands and ichor before defeating Morphaz.","keywords_es":["misión de Sacerdote nivel 50","recompensas del Sacerdote","glándula de corcel sano","icor de no-muerto"],"keywords_en":["level 50 Priest quest","Priest quest rewards","Healthy Courser Gland","Ichor of Undeath"],"tags":["PRIEST"],"text_es":"La cadena comienza con tu instructor y continúa en Azshara: reúne 4 unidades de Glándula de corcel sano y después un Icor de no-muerto. Acepta La sangre de Morphaz, derrota a Morphaz en el Templo de Atal'Hakkar y entrégale la Sangre de Morphaz a Greta Pezuñamusgo, en el Santuario Esmeralda de Frondavil. Recibes Cuentas de oración benditas, Bastón de aflicción y Círculo de Esperanza.","text_en":"Start with your class trainer and continue in Azshara: collect 4 Healthy Courser Gland items, then an Ichor of Undeath. Blood of Morphaz is the final quest: defeat Morphaz in the Sunken Temple and deliver the item to Greta Mosshoof at the Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood. You receive Blessed Prayer Beads, Woestave, and Circle of Hope.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide:  Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Priest Sunken Temple Quest Chain in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:34cfbc79d2107cfebe3548b3018d9f0e93cc7e64"]},{"id":"general-misiones-templo-atalhakkar-picaro","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misión del Templo: Pícaro","title_en":"Sunken Temple Quest: Rogue","summary_es":"El Pícaro consigue una bolsa sellada y fragmentos codificados antes del Templo.","summary_en":"The Rogue obtains a sealed bag and encoded fragments before entering the temple.","keywords_es":["misión de Pícaro nivel 50","recompensas del Pícaro","Bolsa azur sellada","fragmentos codificados"],"keywords_en":["level 50 Rogue quest","Rogue quest rewards","Sealed Azure Bag","Encoded Fragments"],"tags":["ROGUE"],"text_es":"Desde tu instructor, viaja a las Montañas de Alterac para empezar la cadena. En Azshara consigue una Bolsa azur sellada; acepta Los fragmentos codificados y reúne 10 unidades de Fragmento codificado, que puedes obtener matando o robando a los enemigos indicados. Después derrota a Morphaz en el Templo de Atal'Hakkar y entrega la Llave azur. Recompensas: Máscara de ébano, Botas Caminasusurro y Mantón Murciumbrío.","text_en":"Start with your class trainer and travel to Alterac Mountains. In Azshara, obtain a Sealed Azure Bag and take the Encoded Fragments quest; then gather 10 Encoded Fragment items by killing or pickpocketing the listed enemies. Next, defeat Morphaz in the Sunken Temple and turn in the Azure Key. Rewards: Ebon Mask, Whisperwalk Boots, and Duskbat Drape.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide:  Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Rogue Sunken Temple Quest Chain in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:83d5a6430861ccba07f4dccbce786ee716d32b68"]},{"id":"general-misiones-templo-atalhakkar-chaman","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misión del Templo: Chamán","title_en":"Sunken Temple Quest: Shaman","summary_es":"El Chamán reúne elementos, ojos y garras antes de conseguir plumas vudú.","summary_en":"The Shaman gathers elemental items, eyes, and claws before collecting Voodoo Feathers.","keywords_es":["misión de Chamán nivel 50","recompensas del Chamán","plumas vudú","Garra negra gruesa"],"keywords_en":["level 50 Shaman quest","Shaman quest rewards","Voodoo Feathers","Thick Black Claw"],"tags":["SHAMAN"],"text_es":"Empieza con tu instructor y reúne un Elemental de aire, un Elemental de tierra, un Elemental de agua y un Elemental de Fuego. Después consigue 8 Ojos de araña tiro de sangre y 8 Garras negras gruesas; al final, saquea dos de cada tipo de pluma vudú de los seis jefes trol del Templo de Atal'Hakkar. Las recompensas son Puños azurita, Bastón salvaje y Espíritu de agua enamorado.","text_en":"Start with your class trainer and gather one each of Elemental Air, Elemental Fire, Elemental Earth, and Elemental Water. Then collect 8 Bloodshot Spider Eyes and 8 Thick Black Claws; finally, loot two of each Voodoo Feather type from the six troll bosses in the Sunken Temple. Rewards are Azurite Fists, Wildstaff, and Enamored Water Spirit.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide:  Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Shaman Sunken Temple Quest Chain in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:460097f65379c27de7ea52c4e660344d28513f5c"]},{"id":"general-misiones-templo-atalhakkar-brujo","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misión del Templo: Brujo","title_en":"Sunken Temple Quest: Warlock","summary_es":"El Brujo entrega tela y materiales de Frondavil, y termina con las plumas vudú.","summary_en":"The Warlock turns in cloth and Felwood materials before collecting Voodoo Feathers.","keywords_es":["misión de Brujo nivel 50","recompensas del Brujo","Tela de inferi","plumas vudú"],"keywords_en":["level 50 Warlock quest","Warlock quest rewards","Felcloth","Voodoo Feathers"],"tags":["WARLOCK"],"text_es":"La cadena empieza con tu instructor; lleva Tela de inferi a Diblis en Frondavil. Luego reúne 10 unidades de Madera putrefacta y 4 unidades de Esencia de veneno de sangre. Después saquea dos de cada tipo de pluma vudú de los seis jefes trol del Templo de Atal'Hakkar y entrega la misión. Obtienes Cosechador de almas, Fragmento abisal y Togas de Servidumbre.","text_en":"Start with your class trainer and take Felcloth to Impsy in Felwood. Next, gather 10 Rotting Wood and 4 Bloodvenom Essence items. Then loot two of each Voodoo Feather type from the six troll bosses in the Sunken Temple and turn in the quest. You receive Soul Harvester, Abyss Shard, and Robes of Servitude.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide:  Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Warlock Sunken Temple Quest Chain in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:1418ba93c9b1b3300857b8332abdc57e005ae0bd"]},{"id":"general-misiones-templo-atalhakkar-guerrero","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misión del Templo: Guerrero","title_en":"Sunken Temple Quest: Warrior","summary_es":"El Guerrero derrota a jabinfernos y Sombra Jurada antes de reunir las plumas.","summary_en":"The Warrior defeats Helboars and Shadowsworn before collecting the feathers.","keywords_es":["misión de Guerrero nivel 50","recompensas del Guerrero","Jabinferno","plumas vudú"],"keywords_en":["level 50 Warrior quest","Warrior quest rewards","Helboar","Voodoo Feathers"],"tags":["WARRIOR"],"text_es":"Empieza con tu instructor y sigue la cadena en el Pantano de las Penas y las Tierras Devastadas: derrota 7 Jabinfernos y después 20 Adepto Sombra Jurada, 10 Cultor Sombra Jurada y 20 Matón Sombra Jurada. Luego recoge dos de cada tipo de pluma vudú de los seis jefes trol del Templo de Atal'Hakkar. Recibes Visor de furia, Frasco de diamante y Hombreras acero afilado.","text_en":"Start with your class trainer and follow the chain through Swamp of Sorrows and Blasted Lands: slay 7 Helboar, then 20 Shadowsworn Adept, 10 Shadowsworn Cultist, and 20 Shadowsworn Thug. Next, collect two of each Voodoo Feather type from the six troll bosses in the Sunken Temple. You receive Fury Visor, Diamond Flask, and Razorsteel Shoulders.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide:  Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Warrior Sunken Temple Quest Chain in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:a6c87fd43df428f59f1ad39dfdbb01c874184f1d"]},{"id":"general-misiones-templo-atalhakkar-requisitos","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cuándo empiezan las misiones del Templo","title_en":"When Sunken Temple Class Quests Begin","summary_es":"Las nueve cadenas de clase se desbloquean a nivel 50 y terminan con tres objetos.","summary_en":"All nine class chains unlock at level 50 and end with three items.","keywords_es":["misiones de clase nivel 50","recompensas del Templo","misiones del Templo de Atal'Hakkar"],"keywords_en":["level 50 class quests","Sunken Temple rewards","class quests"],"text_es":"A nivel 50 puedes aceptar la misión de tu clase en un instructor. Cada cadena te envía al Templo de Atal'Hakkar y, al completarla, recibes sus tres recompensas; no tienes que escoger solo una. Algunas partes pueden resultar difíciles, así que quizá te convenga esperar hasta tener un nivel algo mayor.","text_en":"At level 50, you can pick up your class quest from a class trainer. Each chain sends you into the Sunken Temple and grants all three rewards when completed, rather than making you choose one. Some parts can be difficult, so consider waiting until you are a little higher level.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide:  Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide:  Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Sunken Temple Class Quest Rewards in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["guide:c599945a3d0f8faeb06c41b19829f206cff60d46","section:3c7871247e6137a21c97f0fbdd2bf93ec8d436ea"]},{"id":"general-misiones-templo-atalhakkar-plumas-vudu","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Plumas vudú del Templo","title_en":"Sunken Temple Voodoo Feathers","summary_es":"Cuatro cadenas de clase piden dos plumas de cada color de los seis jefes trol.","summary_en":"Four class chains require two feathers of each color from six troll bosses.","keywords_es":["plumas vudú del Templo","pluma vudú ámbar","pluma de vudú azul","pluma de vudú verde"],"keywords_en":["Sunken Temple Voodoo Feathers","Amber Voodoo Feather","Blue Voodoo Feather","Green Voodoo Feather"],"text_es":"Las cadenas del Paladín, Chamán, Brujo y Guerrero requieren dos unidades de Pluma vudú ámbar, dos de Pluma de vudú azul y dos de Pluma de vudú verde. Se saquean de seis jefes trol secundarios del Templo de Atal'Hakkar; acuérdate de recogerlas durante la visita.","text_en":"The Paladin, Shaman, Warlock, and Warrior chains each require two Amber Voodoo Feather items, two Blue Voodoo Feather items, and two Green Voodoo Feather items. They drop from six troll minibosses in the Sunken Temple, so remember to loot them during the run.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Sunken Temple Class Quests Guide: Quests, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Sunken Temple Voodoo Feathers in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:sunken-temple-level-50-class-quest-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:5e9e9d07adf606086710cc26942f45b2fee52c63"]},{"id":"general-misiones-dawn-waker-inicio","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dawn Waker: cómo empezar","title_en":"Dawn Waker: Getting Started","summary_es":"Consigue el anillo Ancient Heirloom y usa la antorcha del vigilante para revelar la empuñadura.","summary_en":"Get the Ancient Heirloom ring and use the Night Watchman's Torch to reveal the hilt.","keywords_es":["secreto Dawn Waker","anillo Ancient Heirloom","antorcha del vigilante","empezar misión secreta"],"keywords_en":["Dawn Waker secret","Ancient Heirloom ring","Night Watchman's Torch","start secret quest"],"text_es":"Para iniciar la cadena, consigue el anillo Ancient Heirloom: con acceso al Cielonato, acepta Edad adulta con Ailee Corazón Lejano y entrégala a Rorian el Buscadía; sin ese acceso, el anillo también aparece en el piso superior de un edificio cercano. Equipa el anillo y usa Antorcha de vigilante nocturno en las Ruinas de Ban'aethal para revelar Ancient Hilt; después llévala a Ealaane Caminanimbo.","text_en":"To begin the chain, obtain the Ancient Heirloom ring: with Skyborne access, accept Coming of Age from Ailee Farheart and turn it in to Rorian the Dayseeker; without that access, the ring can also be found on the upper floor of a nearby building. Equip the ring and use the Night Watchman's Torch at the Ruins of Ban'aethal to reveal the Ancient Hilt, then take it to Ealaane Nimbuswalker.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret: Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Step 1: Accept Coming of Age","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret: Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Step 2: Get the Ancient Heirloom Ring","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret: Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Step 3: Uncover the Ancient Hilt","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret: Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Step 4: Take the Ancient Hilt to Ealaane","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:3c6d4e7831f06dd16ea95dc42d9d2f33530cb1ce","section:425ad8a1932a13ff93e1144e30bd5daf160ffc6a","section:50b0a8103d2b2d79ed5046e63e51ac7badeeda82","section:6ddd08f2f977186f6935bcc8a68c042877d2181b"]},{"id":"general-misiones-dawn-waker-orbe","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dawn Waker: conseguir el orbe","title_en":"Dawn Waker: Getting the Globe","summary_es":"Alianza y Horda obtienen el globo de agua por rutas distintas y luego vuelven a hablar con su contacto.","summary_en":"Alliance and Horde obtain the water globe through different routes, then speak to their contact again.","keywords_es":["Dawn Waker Alianza","Dawn Waker Horda","globo de agua","Amuleto de Mathystra"],"keywords_en":["Dawn Waker Alliance","Dawn Waker Horde","water globe","Mathystral Amulet"],"text_es":"Para la Alianza, reúne 20 fragmentos del amuleto de Mathystra, combínalos y usa el amuleto para invocar y derrotar al Barón Marinous; entrega el globo a Onus y vuelve a hablar con él para recuperarlo. La ruta de la Horda consiste en derrotar al Barón Aquanis en las Cavernas de Brazanegra, entregar el globo a Je'neu en Vallefresno y hablar con él otra vez para que te lo devuelva.","text_en":"Alliance players collect 20 Mathystral Amulet Fragments, combine them, and use the amulet to summon and defeat Baron Marinous; turn the globe in to Onu, then speak to him again to get it back. Horde players defeat Baron Aquanis in BFD, turn the globe in to Je'neu in Ashenvale, then speak to him again to retrieve it.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret: Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Obtaining the Befouled Water Globe in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret: Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Alliance: Darkshore — Step 1: Mathystra Amulet","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret: Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Horde: Ashenvale — Step 1: Baron Aquanis","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["guide:3f76dadec3fd37a5f944ffb03ec6cbb405658a46"]},{"id":"general-misiones-dawn-waker-ritual","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dawn Waker: limpieza del globo","title_en":"Dawn Waker: Cleansing the Globe","summary_es":"El anillo equipado permite seguir al espíritu y reunir tres componentes para limpiar el globo.","summary_en":"With the ring equipped, follow the spirit and gather three components to cleanse the globe.","keywords_es":["limpiar el globo Dawn Waker","espíritu de los Altonato","componentes de limpieza","Dawn Waker"],"keywords_en":["cleanse Dawn Waker globe","Highborne Spirit","cleansing items","Dawn Waker"],"text_es":"Mantén equipado Ancient Heirloom y lleva el globo en la bolsa; habla con el espíritu de los Altonato en la costa de Zoram, que te enviará a una torre de Costa Oscura. Allí derrota a Narassin, recoge el tomo y vuelve al espíritu. Después lleva la empuñadura antigua, Eluvi'ana y el tomo a Mordent Sombrapar; reúne una Estrella de Elune, una Mota abisal y Lágrimas de angustia, y usa el globo en el Santuario de la Coalescencia, en Monte Hyjal.","text_en":"Keep the Ancient Heirloom equipped and carry the globe; speak to the Highborne Spirit at Zoram Strand, who sends you to a tower in Darkshore. At the tower, defeat Narassin, take the tome, and return to the spirit. Then take the Ancient Hilt, Eluvi'ana, and the tome to Mordent Evenshade; gather a Star of Elune, an Abyssal Mote, and Tears of Anguish, then use the globe at the Shrine of Coalescence in Hyjal.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret: Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › The Highborne Spirit at Zoram Strand in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret: Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Synthesis in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret: Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › The Cleansing Ritual in Hyjal in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["guide:3f76dadec3fd37a5f944ffb03ec6cbb405658a46"]},{"id":"general-misiones-dawn-waker-estado","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dawn Waker: estado de la cadena","title_en":"Dawn Waker: Quest Chain Status","summary_es":"La ruta conocida está probada hasta la conversación con el príncipe, pero todavía no tiene final confirmado.","summary_en":"The known route is tested through the prince's dialogue, but has no confirmed ending yet.","keywords_es":["final Dawn Waker","cadena incompleta","secreto aún sin resolver","príncipe Tortheldrin"],"keywords_en":["Dawn Waker ending","unfinished chain","unsolved secret","Prince Tortheldrin"],"text_es":"La cadena conocida llega hasta Príncipe Tortheldrin, en La Masacre, que menciona dos espadas. Aunque los pasos publicados se han reproducido, la continuación y la recompensa final aún no están confirmadas; no se conoce el desenlace del secreto.","text_en":"The known chain reaches Prince Tortheldrin in Dire Maul, who mentions two blades. Although the published steps have been reproduced, the continuation and final reward are not confirmed; the secret's ending is still unknown.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret:  Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Dawn Waker Secret:  Steps, Locations and Rewards - WoW: Forever › Step 1: Speak to Prince Tortheldrin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:dawn-waker-secret-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["guide:3f76dadec3fd37a5f944ffb03ec6cbb405658a46","section:7f8216543db88ba85c89a816e897f84a072c2c04"]},{"id":"general-misiones-antorcha-vigilante","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Conseguir la Antorcha de vigilante nocturno","title_en":"Getting the Night Watchman's Torch","summary_es":"Acepta y entrega de inmediato la misión del guardia caído en el Bosque del Ocaso.","summary_en":"Accept and immediately turn in the quest from the slain guard in Duskwood.","keywords_es":["Night Watchman's Torch","misión del guardia caído","antorcha del vigilante","Bosque del Ocaso"],"keywords_en":["Night Watchman's Torch quest","slain guard","Duskwood torch","An Unfortunate End"],"text_es":"En el Bosque del Ocaso busca al Miembro de la Guardia Nocturna muerto: ofrece la misión Un final desafortunado, que se completa al aceptarla y entregársela enseguida. La recompensa es Antorcha de vigilante nocturno, disponible para ambas facciones incluso desde nivel 1; puede costar llegar allí a ese nivel. Su luz ayuda en zonas oscuras, pero no se puede usar dentro de posadas ni ciudades capitales.","text_en":"In Duskwood, find the slain Night Watch Guard, who offers An Unfortunate End. Accept the quest and turn it in to him immediately. The reward is the Night Watchman's Torch, available to both factions from level 1, though reaching the area at that level may be difficult. Its light helps in dark places, but it cannot be used inside inns or capital cities.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: How to Acquire the Night Watchman's Torch - WoW: Forever › How to Get the Night Watchman's Torch in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/night-watchmans-torch-guide-quest-location","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: How to Acquire the Night Watchman's Torch - WoW: Forever › What the Night Watchman's Torch Does in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/night-watchmans-torch-guide-quest-location","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:night-watchmans-torch-guide-quest-location"],"source_hashes":["section:2064a70dbd917cc3810987fa00831b32678aa3fd","section:d7a806a2862912416d15cd106a363c77be01440c"]},{"id":"general-misiones-disfraz-agente-alcaz","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Juguete de disfraz de Alcaz","title_en":"Alcaz Disguise Toy","summary_es":"Libera al prisionero, conserva la caja de documentos y reúne seis Insignias fracturadas.","summary_en":"Free the prisoner, keep the document box, and gather six Fractured Insignias.","keywords_es":["juguete disfraz Alcaz","Insignia fracturada","Prisión de Alcaz","caja de documentos"],"keywords_en":["Alcaz disguise toy","Fractured Insignia","Alcaz Prison","Document Box"],"text_es":"En la mazmorra Prisión de Alcaz, evita matar al primer jefe y limpia el resto; al final, Mason Connery te pedirá que vuelvas por la llave. Mata a El Interrogador, llévale la llave y sigue la cadena hasta una caja en el piso superior de la posada de Arroyo de la Luna, en Páramos de Poniente. No la vendas: entrégala a Renzik «Cuchillo» en Ventormenta o a Rix Xizzix en Bahía del Botín para recibir una Insignia fracturada. Seis insignias crean el juguete de disfraz; puedes comprar o intercambiar las otras cinco.","text_en":"Run the Alcaz Prison dungeon without killing the first boss, The Questioner, and clear the rest; Mason Connery waits at the end and asks you to return for the key. Kill The Questioner, bring Mason the key, then follow the chain to a box on the inn's upper floor in Moonbrook, Westfall. Keep the box and turn it in to Renzik \"The Shiv\" in Stormwind or Rix Xizzix in Booty Bay for a Fractured Insignia. Combine six insignias for the disguise toy; buy or trade for the other five.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: How to Acquire the Alcaz Operative Disguise Toy:  Quests and Locations - WoW Forever › The Alcaz Operative Disguise Toy in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-operative-disguise-toy-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: How to Acquire the Alcaz Operative Disguise Toy:  Quests and Locations - WoW Forever › Step 1: Free Mason Connery in Alcaz Prison","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-operative-disguise-toy-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: How to Acquire the Alcaz Operative Disguise Toy:  Quests and Locations - WoW Forever › More Valuable than Gold in Westfall","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-operative-disguise-toy-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: How to Acquire the Alcaz Operative Disguise Toy:  Quests and Locations - WoW Forever › State Secrets in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-operative-disguise-toy-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: How to Acquire the Alcaz Operative Disguise Toy:  Quests and Locations - WoW Forever › Combine the Fractured Insignia","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-operative-disguise-toy-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:alcaz-operative-disguise-toy-secret-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["guide:80784edc6cb15e3cefa3767eb9871fc03b0580d4","section:ebb9f98dbb75a843031fe59045660c503a6f4b9b"]},{"id":"general-misiones-generador-arcoiris","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Juguete Generador de arcoíris","title_en":"Traveler's Symbols Toy","summary_es":"En Profundidades de Roca Negra, salta desde el puente al saliente oculto para hallar el juguete.","summary_en":"In Blackrock Depths, jump from the bridge to a hidden ledge to find the toy.","keywords_es":["Generador de arcoíris","juguete secreto de Roca Negra","saliente oculto","Profundidades de Roca Negra"],"keywords_en":["Traveler's Symbols","Blackrock Depths secret toy","hidden ledge","signpost toy"],"text_es":"En Profundidades de Roca Negra, ve al puente al este del Anillo y mira hacia abajo a la izquierda. Despeja a los enemigos del puente; junto al brasero, sube a la barandilla, salta a la plataforma pegada al muro y avanza hasta el rincón de la pared para dejarte caer al saliente. Allí está Generador de arcoíris, un juguete de cartel con mensajes seleccionables que permanece una hora y es visible para otros jugadores.","text_en":"In Blackrock Depths, go to the bridge east of the Ring and look down to the left. Clear the enemies on the bridge; near the brazier, climb onto the railing, jump to the wall-side platform, and move into the corner before dropping to the ledge. There you can find Traveler's Symbols, a signpost toy with selectable messages that remains for one hour and is visible to other players.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: How to Acquire Traveler's Symbols Toy from Blackrock Depths in WoW: Forever › Secret Toy Rewards in Blackrock Depths in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/travelers-symbols-toy-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: How to Acquire Traveler's Symbols Toy from Blackrock Depths in WoW: Forever › How to Find the Hidden Ledge in Blackrock Depths in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/travelers-symbols-toy-secret-walkthrough","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:travelers-symbols-toy-secret-walkthrough"],"source_hashes":["section:0fb30754f307eee141daaebdd29b598da5a7da66","section:99359e1001e7d2c9af2a474e6640114bdd0e6596"]},{"id":"general-misiones-libros-biblioteca","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Coleccionar y entregar libros","title_en":"Collecting and Turning In Books","summary_es":"Cualquier clase puede encontrar libros y entregarlos al bibliotecario de su facción por recompensas.","summary_en":"Any class can find books and turn them in to their faction librarian for rewards.","keywords_es":["libros de biblioteca","entregar libros","bibliotecario de facción","recompensas por libros"],"keywords_en":["library books","turn in books","faction librarian","book rewards"],"text_es":"Cualquier clase puede encontrar libros por el mundo y entregarlos al bibliotecario de su facción. Garion Wendell está en la Torre de los Magos de Ciudad de Ventormenta y Owen Thadd, en el Barrio de la Magia de Entrañas. Las entregas conocidas se desbloquean al alcanzar distintos recuentos y ofrecen una elección de equipo; entre las recompensas hay colgantes, anillos y otras piezas.","text_en":"All classes can find books throughout the world and turn them in to their faction librarian. Garion Wendell is in the Mage Tower in Stormwind City, and Owen Thadd is in the Magic Quarter in Undercity. Known turn-ins unlock at different book totals and offer a choice of gear; rewards include pendants, rings, and other pieces.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Collecting Library Books: Locations and Rewards - WoW Forever › intro","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/library-book-locations-and-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Collecting Library Books: Locations and Rewards - WoW Forever › Where to Hand In Your Books in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/library-book-locations-and-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Collecting Library Books: Locations and Rewards - WoW Forever › Quests & Rewards for Collecting Books in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/library-book-locations-and-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:library-book-locations-and-rewards"],"source_hashes":["guide:5c4a3919993b930d21f27f8cacb8b4f40bb41d1f","section:3fca766dd6c946fd296df6b962dd5954c264989c","section:d07eb0204f695ffd7033fc5ba3132f681c6a6bc6"]},{"id":"general-misiones-libros-recompensas","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hitos de recompensa por libros","title_en":"Book Reward Milestones","summary_es":"Hay entregas por 10, 20 y 25 libros; el último hito conocido aún no tiene cifra publicada.","summary_en":"Turn-ins exist at 10, 20, and 25 books; the latest known milestone has no published count.","keywords_es":["recompensa 10 libros","recompensa 20 libros","recompensa 25 libros","misiones bibliotecario"],"keywords_en":["10 book reward","20 book reward","25 book reward","librarian quests"],"text_es":"Los hitos conocidos de entrega son 10, 20 y 25 libros; cada misión permite elegir entre varias recompensas de equipo. Hay una cuarta misión que requiere nivel 50, pero todavía no se conoce el número de libros que pide. No hace falta buscar una lista completa de ubicaciones para entender el sistema: encuentra libros y llévalos a tu bibliotecario de facción.","text_en":"Known book turn-in milestones are 10, 20, and 25 books; each quest lets you choose from several gear rewards. A fourth quest requires level 50, but its required book count is not yet known. You do not need a complete location list to understand the system: find books and take them to your faction librarian.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Collecting Library Books: Locations and Rewards - WoW Forever › Quests & Rewards for Collecting Books in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/library-book-locations-and-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:library-book-locations-and-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:d07eb0204f695ffd7033fc5ba3132f681c6a6bc6"]},{"id":"general-misiones-estandarte-escarlata","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rompecabezas del Estandarte Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Banner Puzzle","summary_es":"Reúne cuatro ecos de tumbas y actívalos en el orden indicado en la Biblioteca Escarlata.","summary_en":"Collect four grave echoes and activate them in order in Scarlet Monastery Library.","keywords_es":["rompecabezas Estandarte Escarlata","Estandarte Escarlata","ecos de tumbas","orden de estatuas"],"keywords_en":["Scarlet Banner puzzle","grave echoes","statue order","Scarlet Monastery Library"],"text_es":"El secreto del Estandarte Escarlata consiste en reunir cuatro ecos de tumbas repartidas por distintas zonas y llevarlos a la Biblioteca del Monasterio Escarlata. Actívalos en este orden: Eco del pantano en la estatua del Guerrero, Eco de Arathi en la del Mago, Eco de Theramore en la del Paladín y Eco del cementerio en la del Sacerdote. Si lo haces bien, aparece el Estandarte Escarlata para recogerlo.","text_en":"The Scarlet Banner secret requires collecting four grave echoes across different zones and taking them to the Scarlet Monastery Library. Activate them in this order: Swamp Echo at the Warrior statue, Arathi Echo at the Mage statue, Theramore Echo at the Paladin statue, and Graveyard Echo at the Priest statue. Complete the sequence to make the Scarlet Banner appear for you to loot.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Acquiring the Scarlet Banner for your Campsite - WoW: Forever › intro","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/collections/scarlet-banner-puzzle-locations","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Acquiring the Scarlet Banner for your Campsite - WoW: Forever › Scarlet Monastery Library Statue Order in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/collections/scarlet-banner-puzzle-locations","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["collection:scarlet-banner-puzzle-locations"],"source_hashes":["guide:b3490aeb69cf62244ea6de502aaec21f6e85c3af","section:557d82400bf5f5edd53b5fb1d3d77c94dd7ff9a2"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-calendario","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cuándo aparece la Feria de la Luna Negra","title_en":"When the Darkmoon Faire Appears","summary_es":"La feria alterna entre Bosque de Elwynn y Mulgore y abre de lunes a domingo.","summary_en":"The Faire alternates between Elwynn Forest and Mulgore and opens Monday through Sunday.","keywords_es":["cuándo abre la Feria de la Luna Negra","calendario de la Feria","dónde está la Feria de la Luna Negra"],"keywords_en":["when Darkmoon Faire opens","Darkmoon Faire schedule","where Darkmoon Faire is"],"text_es":"La Feria de la Luna Negra llega cada mes y alterna entre el sur de Villadorada, en el Bosque de Elwynn, y el suroeste de Cima del Trueno, en Mulgore. Se instala desde el primer viernes del mes, pero abre el lunes y cierra el domingo siguiente; durante el montaje no funcionan los puestos, juegos ni misiones.","text_en":"The Darkmoon Faire arrives monthly, alternating between south of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest and southwest of Thunder Bluff in Mulgore. Setup begins on the month's first Friday, but the Faire opens on Monday and closes the following Sunday; vendors, games, and quest NPCs are unavailable during setup.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Darkmoon Faire Schedule in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:7303c654847ea2913c68b0d47c54475b86cbb677"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-fichas-obtencion","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo conseguir fichas de la Feria","title_en":"How to Earn Faire Tickets","summary_es":"Los encargos repetibles aceptan piezas de animales y objetos de tres profesiones.","summary_en":"Repeatable turn-ins accept animal parts and items from three professions.","keywords_es":["conseguir fichas de la Feria","encargos repetibles de la Feria","objetos para la Feria de la Luna Negra"],"keywords_en":["earn Darkmoon Faire tickets","repeatable Faire turn-ins","items for the Darkmoon Faire"],"text_es":"Durante la Feria puedes repetir encargos de piezas de animales y de objetos de Ingeniería, Peletería o Herrería. No hace falta conocer esas profesiones ni fabricar los objetos: también puedes comprarlos o pedir que los prepare otro personaje. No son misiones diarias y cada entrega concede reputación además de fichas.","text_en":"During its open week, repeatable turn-ins take animal parts or goods produced with Engineering, Leatherworking, and Blacksmithing. You need neither a profession nor the crafting skill: the items may be bought or supplied by another character. The quests have no daily limit, and every delivery also improves your standing with the event.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Darkmoon Faire Tickets in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:6806db3c054ceef8aa4af68f3759ee28c7056576"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-fichas-tramos","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Niveles y tramos de fichas","title_en":"Ticket Tiers and Level Requirements","summary_es":"Cinco tramos entregan de 1 a 20 fichas según nivel y reputación.","summary_en":"Five tiers award 1 to 20 tickets according to level and reputation.","keywords_es":["cuántas fichas da cada encargo","nivel mínimo encargos de la Feria","tramos de reputación Feria de la Luna Negra"],"keywords_en":["tickets per Faire turn-in","Faire quest minimum level","Darkmoon Faire reputation cutoffs"],"text_es":"Los cinco tramos requieren niveles 1, 10, 20, 30 y 40, y entregan respectivamente 1, 4, 8, 12 y 20 fichas. Cada entrega da 100 puntos de reputación, pero solo hasta el límite de su tramo: 500/3000, 1100/3000, 1700/3000 y 2500/3000 de Neutral, y 5999/6000 de Amistoso para el último. Al alcanzar el límite, el encargo desaparece.","text_en":"The five tiers require levels 1, 10, 20, 30, and 40, and award 1, 4, 8, 12, and 20 tickets respectively. Each turn-in grants 100 reputation, but only up to its tier's cutoff: 500/3000, 1100/3000, 1700/3000, and 2500/3000 Neutral, then 5999/6000 Friendly for the final tier. Once the cutoff is reached, that quest disappears.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Earning Darkmoon Faire Prize Tickets and Reputation in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:bd30246609a007f82d409b4eee718d3985f87746"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-gastar-fichas","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"En qué gastar las fichas de la Feria","title_en":"What to Spend Faire Tickets On","summary_es":"La caja de 14 casillas cuesta 50 fichas; dos objetos de nivel 55 cuestan 1200.","summary_en":"The 14-slot bag costs 50 tickets; two level-55 items cost 1200.","keywords_es":["premios por fichas de la Feria","bolsa de la Luna Negra","caja para guardar de la Luna Negra"],"keywords_en":["Faire ticket rewards","Darkmoon bag","Darkmoon Storage Box"],"text_es":"Entre los premios, la Caja para guardar de la Luna Negra destaca como bolsa de 14 casillas: cuesta 50 fichas, se puede comprar desde nivel 6 y es única, así que solo obtienes una. También hay dos objetos que cuestan 1200 fichas y requieren nivel 55. Las cajas de premio pueden contener equipo, bolsas, gemas y, en las de mayor nivel, recetas o armas.","text_en":"One standout reward is the Darkmoon Storage Box, a 14-slot bag costing 50 tickets; it is available at level 6 and is unique, so you can only get one. Two other rewards cost 1200 tickets and require level 55. Prize boxes can contain gear, bags, and gems, while the higher-level box can also include recipes or weapons.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Spending Darkmoon Faire Tickets in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:eb9e7037bb344188c458a325a2c2d8deb7434474"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-reputacion","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Para qué sirve la reputación de la Feria","title_en":"What Faire Reputation Does","summary_es":"La reputación afecta a los precios; tras Amistoso, solo sube entregando barajas.","summary_en":"Reputation affects prices; after Friendly, only deck turn-ins raise it.","keywords_es":["reputación Feria de la Luna Negra","subir reputación de la Feria","recompensas de reputación Feria"],"keywords_en":["Darkmoon Faire reputation","raise Faire reputation","Faire reputation rewards"],"text_es":"La reputación con la Feria de la Luna Negra solo mejora los precios de sus vendedores; no ofrece otras ventajas. Empiezas en Neutral, y los encargos de materiales permiten avanzar hasta 5999 de 6000 en Amistoso. A partir de ahí, entregar una baraja de la Luna Negra es la única forma de ganar reputación: cada una concede 150 puntos.","text_en":"Darkmoon Faire reputation only improves its vendors' prices; it grants no other benefits. You start at Neutral, and material turn-ins can raise reputation to 5999 of 6000 at Friendly. After that, turning in a Darkmoon deck is the only way to gain more reputation, awarding 150 points each.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Darkmoon Faire Reputation in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:8cc610a378f0d7b5fdee3c6167c2d27ccd277b5e"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-bendiciones","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bendiciones y augurios de la Feria","title_en":"Faire Buffs and Fortunes","summary_es":"Dos respuestas determinan una de ocho mejoras de dos horas.","summary_en":"Two answers determine one of eight buffs lasting two hours.","keywords_es":["mejoras de la Feria de la Luna Negra","bendición de Sayge","cómo elegir una mejora de la Feria"],"keywords_en":["Darkmoon Faire buffs","Sayge's fortune buff","choose a Faire buff"],"text_es":"Las respuestas a dos preguntas determinan cuál de ocho mejoras recibes: cinco aumentan una estadística, dos son secundarias y una mejora el daño. Duran 2 horas y puedes pedir otro augurio y mejora tras 4 horas de tiempo conectado. También recibes un augurio, aunque la mayoría solo contiene un dicho.","text_en":"Your answers to two questions determine which of eight buffs you receive: five increase a stat, two are secondary buffs, and one increases damage. They last 2 hours, and you can request another fortune and buff after 4 hours of logged time. You also receive a fortune, though most contain only a saying.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Darkmoon Faire Buffs and Fortunes in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › How to Answer to get the World Buff you want in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:83148abe170ab214ff2644e66247b1a79e63baf5","section:c17ae127951c5b8b634a80b8dfcd9b62ef821874"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-juegos","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Juegos de la Feria","title_en":"Darkmoon Faire Games","summary_es":"La feria ofrece un cañón de lanzamiento y combates entre tanques teledirigidos.","summary_en":"The Faire offers a launch cannon and remote-controlled tank battles.","keywords_es":["juegos de la Feria","cañón de la Feria de la Luna Negra","tanques teledirigidos de la Feria"],"keywords_en":["Darkmoon Faire games","Faire cannon game","Faire remote-controlled tanks"],"text_es":"Puedes probar dos actividades: lanzarte con un cañón hacia un blanco acuático o manejar un tanque teledirigido contra los de otros jugadores. Son juegos recreativos, no dan premios. El tanque dura hasta 5 minutos o hasta que lo destruyan o salga de su zona de control.","text_en":"Two activities are available: launch yourself from a cannon toward a water target, or drive a remote-controlled tonk against other players' tonks. They are for fun and award no prizes. A tonk lasts up to 5 minutes, or until it is defeated or leaves its operating area.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Fun and Games: The Human Cannonball and Tank Battle Simulator","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › The Humanoid Cannonball","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Tank Battle Simulator","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:1e2f74a32a07e007907b2aa726ae979bf72d81c9","section:39d8e32c2357242ad62a665525cd533c7b5fa1f4","section:84fe43d9af800e4137c17aa6ace496ba42898503"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-canon","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Consejos para el cañón de la Feria","title_en":"Darkmoon Faire Cannon Tips","summary_es":"Aterrizar en el blanco acuático evita morir; si fallas, toca volver a pie.","summary_en":"Landing in the water target prevents death; a miss means running back.","keywords_es":["fallar el cañón de la Feria","blanco acuático Feria de la Luna Negra","evitar daños con el cañón"],"keywords_en":["miss the Faire cannon target","Darkmoon Faire water target","avoid cannon repair costs"],"text_es":"El objetivo del cañón es caer en el blanco situado en el agua; si lo alcanzas, sobrevives, pero fallarlo te mata. Antes de subir, quítate las piezas de armadura y armas que puedan estropearse para evitar gastos de reparación. No hay transporte de vuelta: tendrás que regresar corriendo.","text_en":"The cannon's target is a patch of water: landing in it keeps you alive, while missing kills you. Remove breakable armor and weapons first to avoid repair costs. There is no ride back, so you will need to run to the cannon again.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › The Humanoid Cannonball","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:84fe43d9af800e4137c17aa6ace496ba42898503"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-barajas","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo funcionan las barajas de la Luna Negra","title_en":"How Darkmoon Decks Work","summary_es":"Ocho cartas, del As al Ocho, se combinan para entregar una baraja.","summary_en":"Eight cards, Ace through Eight, combine into a deck for turn-in.","keywords_es":["completar baraja de la Luna Negra","cartas As a Ocho","entregar baraja de la Luna Negra"],"keywords_en":["complete a Darkmoon deck","Ace through Eight cards","turn in a Darkmoon deck"],"text_es":"Cada baraja se forma reuniendo sus ocho cartas, numeradas del As al Ocho, y combinándolas. Las cartas pueden intercambiarse o venderse, pero el abalorio creado al entregar la baraja queda ligado al personaje. La misión de entrega se realiza con el Profesor Tadeo Paleo en la Feria.","text_en":"Build each deck by collecting and combining its eight cards, numbered Ace through Eight. The cards can be traded or sold, but the trinket awarded for turning in a deck becomes soulbound. Take the turn-in quest to Professor Thaddeus Paleo at the Faire.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Darkmoon Decks and Cards in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:a8808dad1d12d262ebb519b550de3cf632cba8c3"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-abalorios","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Abalorios de las barajas de la Feria","title_en":"Faire Deck Trinkets","summary_es":"Hay cuatro barajas clásicas; sus abalorios requieren nivel 60.","summary_en":"There are four classic decks; their trinkets require level 60.","keywords_es":["abalorios de la Luna Negra","barajas clásicas de la Feria","Ases de la Luna Negra"],"keywords_en":["Darkmoon deck trinkets","classic Faire decks","Darkmoon Aces"],"text_es":"Las cuatro barajas clásicas crean abalorios que requieren nivel 60. Los Ases se obtienen de jefes concretos, mientras que las cartas del Dos al Ocho pueden caer de humanoides o no muertos de nivel 45 a 60. Los abalorios están ocultos hasta que alguien los encuentra, así que sus efectos no siempre se conocen de antemano.","text_en":"The four classic decks create trinkets that require level 60. Aces drop from specific bosses, while cards Two through Eight can drop from level 45 to 60 Humanoids and Undead. The trinkets remain obscured until discovered, so their effects are not always known in advance.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Darkmoon Faire Trinkets in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Where to Find Classic 2-8 Darkmoon Cards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide"],"source_hashes":["guide:8e9f155f42da895f637b3940d942a9bba75335de","section:20917c7abaf057e78dbe7868b3f6913fde99ffc8"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-mascotas-ranas","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ranas de compañía de la Feria","title_en":"Darkmoon Faire Companion Frogs","summary_es":"Dos cajas de rana cuestan 1 de oro cada una y no exigen reputación.","summary_en":"Two frog boxes cost 1 gold each and require no reputation.","keywords_es":["mascotas rana de la Feria","Caja de rana de madera","Carcasa de rana de árbol"],"keywords_en":["Faire frog pets","Wood Frog Box","Tree Frog Box"],"text_es":"Durante la Feria puedes comprar la Caja de rana de madera o la Carcasa de rana de árbol por 1 de oro cada una. No necesitas reputación con la Feria para adquirirlas. La primera tiene existencias limitadas, mientras que la segunda se vende sin límite.","text_en":"During the festival, you can buy a Wood Frog Box or Tree Frog Box for 1 gold each. Reputation is not a requirement. The first has limited stock, while the second is available without a stock limit.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Companion Pets","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Darkmoon Faire","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:1e1b7c7ed959de79f3674f0e7f61a998aa03b75c","section:c14cb0e1d500fad159b54b44a45f9b7a5eaed9b9"]},{"id":"general-misiones-feria-huevo-jubling","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Conseguir el huevo de Jubling","title_en":"Getting the Jubling Egg","summary_es":"Deja una jarra junto a Morja y entrega una segunda cuando aparezca la misión.","summary_en":"Place a mug by Morja, then turn in a second one when the quest appears.","keywords_es":["Huevo sin abrir de Jubling","mascota de la Feria de la Luna Negra","misión Spawn of Jubjub"],"keywords_en":["Unhatched Jubling Egg","Darkmoon Faire pet","Spawn of Jubjub quest"],"text_es":"Para obtener el Huevo sin abrir de Jubling, lleva 2 unidades de Jarra de cerveza tradicional Hierro Negro a la Feria. Sin hablar primero con Morja, deja una jarra en el suelo y espera a que la rana se acerque; entonces acepta Huevo de Jubjub y entrega la segunda jarra. El huevo eclosiona tras 7 días.","text_en":"Bring 2 mugs to the festival to obtain the Unhatched Jubling Egg. Do not speak to Morja first: place a Dark Iron Ale Mug on the ground and wait for the frog to approach. Then accept Spawn of Jubjub and hand in the other mug; the egg hatches after 7 days.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkmoon Faire Event Overview Guide:  Location, Dates, Quests & Rewards - Wow: Forever › Companion Pets","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Darkmoon Faire","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:darkmoon-faire-event-overview-guide","general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:1e1b7c7ed959de79f3674f0e7f61a998aa03b75c","section:c14cb0e1d500fad159b54b44a45f9b7a5eaed9b9"]},{"id":"general-misiones-coleccionables-categorias","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Qué se puede coleccionar en Forever","title_en":"What You Can Collect in Forever","summary_es":"Las colecciones incluyen monturas, mascotas de compañía, juguetes y apariencias cosméticas.","summary_en":"Collectibles include mounts, companion pets, toys, and cosmetic appearances.","keywords_es":["qué se puede coleccionar en Forever","coleccionar monturas y mascotas","juguetes y apariencias cosméticas"],"keywords_en":["what to collect in Forever","collect mounts and pets","toys and cosmetic appearances"],"text_es":"En Forever puedes perseguir monturas, mascotas de compañía, juguetes y apariencias cosméticas. Se obtienen de distintas maneras: vendedores y reputación, misiones, botines, profesiones, eventos y puntos de un sistema de actividades únicas. Hay coleccionables ligados a contenido difícil o limitado; conviene centrarse en el tipo de objeto o método que buscas, no en una lista exhaustiva.","text_en":"Forever has mounts, companion pets, toys, and cosmetic appearances to collect. They come from varied sources, including vendors and reputation, quests, drops, professions, events, and points for one-time activities. Some collectibles are tied to challenging or limited content, so it helps to focus on the item type or acquisition method rather than a complete catalog.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Welcome to the Lord of the Reins Forever Collectibles Guide!","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Mounts","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Companion Pets","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Toys","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Cosmetic Transmog","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:579fadad2118f5b1d8447c18da80ddf4bbaf5569","section:7cd9c5f03a4c63ba46572e39add355dea3c07348","section:818dc100f0914f34107fb18e7a75f0678f99cfb9","section:c7234a53baf80f0b504a14b20aa6f1a3c0e9a440","section:fcb780d8557a01eec9055c8bc8456755e7ad5795"]},{"id":"general-misiones-monturas-raza","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Monturas raciales y niveles","title_en":"Racial Mounts and Levels","summary_es":"Las monturas terrestres raras y épicas se consiguen a nivel 40 y 60.","summary_en":"Rare and epic ground mounts become available at levels 40 and 60.","keywords_es":["montura racial nivel 40","montura épica nivel 60","comprar monturas raciales"],"keywords_en":["racial mount level 40","epic mount level 60","buy racial mounts"],"text_es":"Las monturas raciales pueden comprarse al alcanzar el nivel 40 para la versión rara y el 60 para la épica, o al llegar a Exaltado con la facción correspondiente mediante misiones. Las versiones raras cuestan 100 de oro y las épicas 1000; además, recibes una montura gratis.","text_en":"Racial mounts can be purchased at level 40 for the rare version and level 60 for the epic one, or after reaching Exalted with the relevant faction through quests. Rare versions cost 100 gold and epic ones cost 1000; you also receive one mount for free.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Alliance Faction Mounts","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Horde Faction Mounts","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:2842959cb4b9cf6eeaafe4e6f439fd519b6f3489","section:8bb3c44d3ea759dc18f9eb71c6d3e2819a55c831"]},{"id":"general-misiones-monturas-reputacion","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Montura de reputación de Cuna del Invierno","title_en":"Winterspring Reputation Mount","summary_es":"El Sable de Hielo requiere Exaltado y una larga serie de encargos repetibles.","summary_en":"The Frostsaber requires Exalted reputation and a long chain of repeatable turn-ins.","keywords_es":["montura Sable de Hielo de Cuna del Invierno","Entrenadores de Sableinvernales reputación","Riendas del Sable de Hielo de Cuna del Invierno"],"keywords_en":["Winterspring Frostsaber mount","Wintersaber Trainers reputation","Reins of the Winterspring Frostsaber"],"text_es":"Las Riendas del Sable de Hielo de Cuna del Invierno se compran por 1125 de oro al alcanzar Exaltado con los Entrenadores de Sableinvernales. La reputación se consigue con encargos repetibles que otorgan 50 puntos cada uno, y no todos están disponibles desde el comienzo. Se recomienda invertir puntos en Estudio dedicado antes de empezar, porque reduce el esfuerzo de esta búsqueda.","text_en":"Reins of the Winterspring Frostsaber cost 1125 gold and become available at Exalted with the Wintersaber Trainers. Repeatable turn-ins grant 50 reputation each, and not all are available at the start. Investing points in Diplomat beforehand is recommended because it reduces the effort of this grind.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Winterspring Frostsaber","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:bc087c31ba9ff9125691f8526f8c9a57b2bc6f6d"]},{"id":"general-misiones-montura-osahendido","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Montura de Barón Osahendido","title_en":"Baron Rivendare's Mount","summary_es":"Las Riendas de Hemocargador pueden obtenerse de Barón Osahendido en Stratholme.","summary_en":"Deathcharger's Reins can drop from Baron Rivendare in Stratholme.","keywords_es":["Riendas de Hemocargador","montura de Stratholme","botín de Barón Osahendido"],"keywords_en":["Deathcharger's Reins","Stratholme mount drop","Baron Rivendare loot"],"text_es":"Las Riendas de Hemocargador se saquean de Barón Osahendido, en el ala de los no-muertos de Stratholme. La probabilidad de obtenerlas es extremadamente baja, así que puede hacer falta repetir la mazmorra.","text_en":"Deathcharger's Reins can be looted from Baron Rivendare in the undead wing of Stratholme. The drop chance is extremely low, so you may need to run the dungeon repeatedly.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Rivendare's Deathcharger","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:800c2053cdae9411baa7d704b7e5b46e5b7eb595"]},{"id":"general-misiones-recompensas-legado","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Coleccionables por puntos Legacy","title_en":"Legacy Point Collectibles","summary_es":"El total de puntos Legacy desbloquea una montura, una mascota o un juguete.","summary_en":"Legacy point totals unlock a mount, a pet, or a toy.","keywords_es":["recompensas de puntos de Legado","oso espectral montura","mascota cachorro espectral"],"keywords_en":["Legacy point rewards","Spectral Bear mount","Spectral Bear Cub pet"],"text_es":"El sistema de Legacy entrega coleccionables por alcanzar ciertos totales de puntos, obtenidos con actividades únicas: la Réplica de rifle de aire comprimido de Forjaz enfundado con 15, el Cachorro de oso espectral con 25 y las Riendas del oso espectral con 55. Son recompensas de categorías distintas, no una lista de monturas.","text_en":"The Legacy system awards collectibles at specific point totals earned through one-time activities: the Holstered Replica Ironforge Air Rifle at 15, Spectral Bear Cub at 25, and Reins of the Spectral Bear at 55. These rewards span different collectible types rather than being a mount list.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Ironforge Air Rifle","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Spectral Bear Cub","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Spectral Bear","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:11ab87b50a66546d1afe2d73aeea61ee9fbf8d15","section:19315fbae1d2c0f6f804b1227fcbc128ba55ce67","section:64d4dd2c29976eff17dd8f3e5cf022425c80d363"]},{"id":"general-misiones-mascotas-reputacion","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mascota por reputación Garranoche","title_en":"Nightclaw Reputation Pet","summary_es":"La Ardilla ventosombra se compra al llegar a Reverenciado con los Druidas Garranoche.","summary_en":"The Shadowgale Squirrel is sold at Revered with the Nightclaw Druids.","keywords_es":["Ardilla ventosombra","mascota Druidas Garranoche","subir reputación en Isla de Zephras"],"keywords_en":["Shadowgale Squirrel","Nightclaw Druids pet","Zephras Isle reputation"],"text_es":"La Ardilla ventosombra se compra en la Isla de Zephras al alcanzar Reverenciado con los Druidas Garranoche. Puedes ganar reputación entregando unidades de Oreja de cultor Al'Aketh: cada 5 conceden 200 puntos. El acceso a la isla depende del paquete heroico de Cielonato, aunque otros personajes pueden llegar en dirigible desde Dalaran o Cima del Trueno.","text_en":"Buy Shadowgale Squirrel on Zephras Isle after reaching Revered with the Nightclaw Druids. Turn in Al'Aketh Cultist's Ear items for reputation: every 5 grant 200 points. Island access depends on the Skyborne Heroic Pack, though other characters can travel there by airship from Dalaran or Thunder Bluff.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Shadowgale Squirrel","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:5a7374de66eea34f58f5ae17a609bbd3854a06e4"]},{"id":"general-misiones-mascotas-gallina","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mascota Huevo de gallina","title_en":"Chicken Egg Companion Pet","summary_es":"Alimenta a una gallina en Páramos de Poniente para que ponga el huevo mascota.","summary_en":"Feed a chicken in Westfall to make it lay the companion pet egg.","keywords_es":["Huevo de gallina mascota","misión ¡CLOQUEA!","mascota de Páramos de Poniente"],"keywords_en":["Chicken Egg pet","CLUCK quest","Westfall companion pet"],"text_es":"En Páramos de Poniente, selecciona una gallina y usa repetidamente /chicken hasta que te ofrezca ¡CLOQUEA!. Compra Comida para pollos especial al Granjero Saldean y entrégasela; la gallina pondrá un Huevo de gallina que puedes recoger como mascota. Si no puedes interactuar con ella, usa /cheer con otra gallina.","text_en":"In Westfall, target a chicken and repeatedly use /chicken until it offers CLUCK!. Buy Special Chicken Feed from Farmer Saldean and give it to the chicken; it will lay a Chicken Egg that you can loot as a pet. If the chicken is not interactable, use /cheer on another one.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Prairie Chicken","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:bc73e454b8de56b911d33a7ba9817f01ecba821d"]},{"id":"general-misiones-mascota-pollo-mecanico","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mascota Pollo mecánico","title_en":"Mechanical Chicken Companion Pet","summary_es":"Completa las tres escoltas OOX para desbloquear la misión del Pollo mecánico.","summary_en":"Complete the three OOX escorts to unlock the Mechanical Chicken quest.","keywords_es":["Pollo mecánico mascota","misiones de escolta OOX","localizadores de emergencia OOX"],"keywords_en":["Mechanical Chicken pet","OOX escort quests","OOX Distress Beacons"],"text_es":"El Pollo mecánico se obtiene al completar Tu propio OOX, disponible tras terminar las tres misiones de escolta OOX. Cada una empieza al encontrar un Localizador de emergencia OOX en su zona; después de las escoltas, entrega las misiones en Bahía del Botín para desbloquear la recompensa.","text_en":"The Mechanical Chicken comes from An OOX of Your Own, unlocked after completing all three OOX escort quests. Each begins when you find an OOX Distress Beacon in its zone; after finishing the escorts, turn in the quests in Booty Bay to unlock the reward.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Mechanical Chicken","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:103ad9320b9fc5b128b15b13ea0ce3cfa6f47b52"]},{"id":"general-misiones-juguetes-transformacion","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Juguetes que transforman al personaje","title_en":"Character-Transforming Toys","summary_es":"Algunos juguetes cambian tu tamaño o apariencia; su obtención varía.","summary_en":"Some toys change your size or appearance, and their acquisition methods vary.","keywords_es":["juguetes de transformación","Vara de transformación de Dartol","Orbe de engaño juguete"],"keywords_en":["transformation toys","Dartol's Rod of Transformation","Orb of Deception toy"],"text_es":"Entre los juguetes cosméticos, la Vara de transformación de Dartol convierte al personaje en un furbolg y el Orbe de engaño lo transforma en una raza de la facción contraria. El orbe puede caer de enemigos de nivel 55 o superior, con más probabilidad en jefes de banda. La vara se prepara durante La limpieza de Raene, pero no está claro si se conserva al completar la última misión.","text_en":"Among cosmetic toys, Dartol's Rod of Transformation turns your character into a furbolg, while the Orb of Deception changes you into a race from the opposite faction. The orb can drop from enemies level 55 or higher, with a better chance from raid bosses. The rod is made during Raene's Cleansing, but it is unclear whether it remains after turning in the final quest.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Dartol's Rod","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Orb of Deception","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:ce65a68e7a8420436dd4b43dd0db9ef5b16feeff","section:ec99db57ab70a133a6ad97f5e28021b62397fccb"]},{"id":"general-misiones-juguetes-coleccion","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo se obtienen los juguetes","title_en":"How Toys Are Acquired","summary_es":"Los juguetes aparecen como recompensas de misiones, reputación, profesiones y eventos.","summary_en":"Toys come from quests, reputation, professions, and events.","keywords_es":["conseguir juguetes en Forever","juguetes de Ingeniería","juguetes por reputación y misiones"],"keywords_en":["get toys in Forever","Engineering toys","reputation and quest toys"],"text_es":"Los juguetes no proceden de una sola actividad: pueden ser recetas de profesión, recompensas de reputación o misiones, botines, premios de eventos y desbloqueos de Legacy. Por ejemplo, la Ingeniería fabrica el Amplificador de mundo; una misión de Festival Lunar entrega el Farol de Elune, y el sistema de Legacy concede una réplica de rifle de Forjaz.","text_en":"Toys come from several activities rather than one collection path: profession recipes, reputation or quest rewards, drops, events, and Legacy unlocks. For example, Engineering makes the World Enlarger, a Lunar Festival quest awards Elune's Lantern, and the Legacy system grants a replica Ironforge rifle.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Toys","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Gnomish Engineering","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Lunar Festival","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Ironforge Air Rifle","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:19315fbae1d2c0f6f804b1227fcbc128ba55ce67","section:494fb69cecbe49c275272e7766b53647b5c127a4","section:c7234a53baf80f0b504a14b20aa6f1a3c0e9a440","section:d273f27f2791907f434e9c72aa9e7ee80caaa1b4"]},{"id":"general-misiones-transfiguraciones-reputacion","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Apariencias cosméticas por reputación","title_en":"Reputation Cosmetic Appearances","summary_es":"Las reputaciones desbloquean prendas cosméticas, como las del cartel goblin y Velasangre.","summary_en":"Reputation unlocks cosmetic clothing, including Goblin Cartel and Bloodsail pieces.","keywords_es":["apariencias por reputación","cosméticos Bucaneros Velasangre","prendas cosméticas goblin"],"keywords_en":["reputation cosmetic appearances","Bloodsail Buccaneers cosmetics","Goblin Cartel clothing"],"text_es":"Las reputaciones ofrecen apariencias cosméticas: varias facciones goblin venden piezas para la cabeza al llegar a Reverenciado. Con los Bucaneros Velasangre, alcanza Amistoso y Odioso con Bahía del Botín, y completa las misiones ¡Adelante, almirante! y Vístete como tal para recibir cinco prendas cosméticas. Es una opción de colección que puede exigir deteriorar la relación con otra facción.","text_en":"Reputations can unlock cosmetic appearances: several Goblin Cartel factions sell headpieces at Revered. With the Bloodsail Buccaneers, reach Friendly and become Hated with Booty Bay, then complete Avast Ye, Admiral! and Dressing the Part to receive five cosmetic pieces. This collection route can damage your standing with another faction.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Goblin Cartel Headpieces","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Bloodsail Buccaneers","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:8fc32bf5594dde338771383d366c6b6a9b3a3e39","section:e04228c82e26c0e2283a5b1377fcda2ff92f2208"]},{"id":"general-misiones-transfiguraciones-eventos","chapter":6,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Apariencias cosméticas de eventos","title_en":"Event Cosmetic Appearances","summary_es":"Varios eventos ofrecen prendas o adornos que solo se consiguen en temporada.","summary_en":"Several events offer clothing or adornments available during the season.","keywords_es":["apariencias cosméticas de eventos","ropa del Festival Lunar","ropa del Festival de Invierno"],"keywords_en":["event cosmetic appearances","Lunar Festival clothing","Winter Veil clothing"],"text_es":"Los eventos estacionales también ofrecen prendas y adornos para coleccionar: algunas recompensas se intercambian por Moneda de linaje, otras pueden aparecer en un Huevo de color vivo escondido en las zonas iniciales, y ciertos vendedores ofrecen patrones temporales para fabricar ropa y botas. Estas oportunidades dependen de que el evento correspondiente esté activo.","text_en":"Seasonal events also offer clothing and adornments to collect: some rewards are exchanged for Coin of Ancestry, others may appear in a hidden Brightly Colored Egg in starting zones, and certain vendors offer temporary patterns for making clothes and boots. These opportunities depend on the relevant event being active.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Lunar Festival","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Noblegarden","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: LOTR: A Collector's Guide to WoW: Forever › Winter Veil","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:lotr-a-collectors-guide-to-wow-forever-34946"],"source_hashes":["section:455ab3fc5199b5601b02353aa2ad7defbfe50e54","section:b41a12e090fb271fe578acb97ccba0311f196015","section:d273f27f2791907f434e9c72aa9e7ee80caaa1b4"]}]},"07-mazmorras.json":{"description":"Capítulo 7: Mazmorras. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"mazmorra-general","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Las mazmorras de Forever","title_en":"Dungeons in Forever","summary_es":"Hay 35 mazmorras en 28 instancias, de nivel 13 a 60; nueve nuevas cubren huecos entre tramos clásicos.","summary_en":"There are 35 dungeons across 28 instances, levels 13 to 60; nine new ones fill gaps between Classic brackets.","keywords_es":["mazmorras de forever","cuántas mazmorras hay","niveles de mazmorras","mazmorras nuevas","mazmorras por nivel"],"keywords_en":["wow forever dungeons","how many dungeons","dungeon levels","new dungeons","dungeon level ranges"],"text_es":"Forever reúne 35 mazmorras en 28 instancias, con rangos desde el nivel 13 hasta el 60. Las nueve nuevas están disponibles desde el lanzamiento y rellenan huecos entre los tramos clásicos; el Salón de los Feudales y las Ruinas de Lordaeron empiezan antes del nivel 20. La información de botín y misiones de las mazmorras altas se va completando conforme se descubre jugando.","text_en":"Forever has 35 dungeons across 28 instances, with level ranges from 13 to 60. Its nine new dungeons are available at launch and fill gaps between Classic brackets; Hall of Thanes and Ruins of Lordaeron start before level 20. Loot and quest information for higher-level dungeons is being filled in as players discover it in game.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dungeons Overview for Forever - Locations, Guides and Details › New and Existing Dungeon Levels in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dungeons-overview-locations-details","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: World of Warcraft: Forever Overview - New Features, Zones, Raids › New Dungeons in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/overview-features-zones-raids","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: All Available Dungeons in WoW Forever › WoW Forever Dungeons Overview","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/dungeons-overview","date":"2026-11-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:dungeons-overview","raid:overview-features-zones-raids"],"source_hashes":["section:1af863846ee4e5073a1a5c8fcfdb1da5df54711e","section:736131dd24e2ea87b18ea31f8668656a2a4ae655","section:e0346c58ee0bacc7443d3baaede59af6c961c063"]},{"id":"mazmorra-preparacion","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Preparar una mazmorra","title_en":"Preparing for a Dungeon","summary_es":"Forma un grupo de cinco con tanque, sanador y tres DPS; las misiones de grupo no cuentan en una banda.","summary_en":"Build a five-player group with a tank, healer, and three DPS; party quests do not count in a raid.","keywords_es":["preparar mazmorra","grupo de mazmorra","tanque sanador dps","misiones de mazmorra en banda","tamaño de grupo"],"keywords_en":["dungeon preparation","dungeon party size","tank healer dps","dungeon quests in raid","five-player group"],"text_es":"La composición habitual es de cinco: un tanque, un sanador y tres DPS. Se puede entrar en la mayoría de las mazmorras como banda de hasta diez, pero Profundidades de Roca Negra, ambas partes de Stratholme y Scholomance limitan el grupo a cinco; el límite de las nuevas mazmorras aún no está confirmado. Si vas a completar misiones de grupo, mantén el grupo en cinco, porque no progresan dentro de una banda. Algunas mazmorras tienen misiones para una sola facción aunque la otra pueda entrar por botín.","text_en":"The usual party has five players: one tank, one healer, and three DPS. Most dungeons allow entry as a raid of up to ten, but Blackrock Depths, both sides of Stratholme, and Scholomance limit the group to five; caps for new dungeons are not confirmed yet. If you plan to complete party quests, keep the group at five because they do not progress in a raid. Some dungeons have quests for only one faction even though the other can enter for loot.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dungeons Overview for Forever - Locations, Guides and Details › Dungeon Party Roles in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dungeons-overview-locations-details","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dungeons Overview for Forever - Locations, Guides and Details › Dungeon Party Sizes in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dungeons-overview-locations-details","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dungeons Overview for Forever - Locations, Guides and Details › Ragefire Chasm Dungeon in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dungeons-overview-locations-details","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dungeons Overview for Forever - Locations, Guides and Details › The Deadmines Dungeon in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dungeons-overview-locations-details","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:dungeons-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:06738a32b32b0c29127e014941916c0e4bf83652","section:33ee285728741050d77cd6037d03bb0f41233745","section:3a3dda5f921dc13cce0f8dc7cd4b8093a8fdb718","section:4938de8ff141ddd50eed85b0af491894a025b80f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-nuevas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Las nuevas mazmorras de Forever","title_en":"Forever's New Dungeons","summary_es":"Nueve mazmorras nuevas llegan en el lanzamiento y rellenan tramos de nivel poco cubiertos.","summary_en":"Nine new dungeons arrive at launch and fill less-covered level brackets.","keywords_es":["mazmorras nuevas forever","nuevas mazmorras al lanzamiento","mazmorra nueva antes del nivel 20","tramos de nivel de mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["new forever dungeons","new dungeons at launch","dungeon before level 20","dungeon level brackets"],"text_es":"Las nueve mazmorras nuevas de Forever están disponibles desde el lanzamiento y suavizan la subida al cubrir huecos entre los rangos clásicos. Por ejemplo, el Salón de los Feudales cubre los niveles 13-18 y las Ruinas de Lordaeron, 15-20; ambas permiten empezar a explorar mazmorras antes del nivel 20.","text_en":"Forever’s nine new dungeons are available at launch and smooth leveling by filling gaps between Classic level ranges. For example, Hall of Thanes covers levels 13-18 and Ruins of Lordaeron 15-20; both let players begin exploring dungeons before level 20.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dungeons Overview for Forever - Locations, Guides and Details › New and Existing Dungeon Levels in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dungeons-overview-locations-details","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: World of Warcraft: Forever Overview - New Features, Zones, Raids › New Dungeons in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/overview-features-zones-raids","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:dungeons-overview","raid:overview-features-zones-raids"],"source_hashes":["section:736131dd24e2ea87b18ea31f8668656a2a4ae655","section:e0346c58ee0bacc7443d3baaede59af6c961c063"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ragefire-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sima Ígnea: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Ragefire Chasm: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 13-18; la entrada está en el fondo del Risco de las Sombras, en Orgrimmar.","summary_en":"Level 13-18; the entrance is deep in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.","keywords_es":["sima ígnea","ragefire chasm","cómo llegar a sima ígnea","sima ígnea misiones","sima ígnea jefes"],"keywords_en":["ragefire chasm","ragefire chasm entrance","ragefire chasm quests","ragefire chasm bosses","orgrimmar dungeon"],"text_es":"Sima Ígnea es una mazmorra de nivel 13-18 bajo Orgrimmar; el portal está en el fondo del Risco de las Sombras. La Horda puede entrar desde la ciudad. Para la Alianza, la ruta descrita pasa por el barco a Trinquete y la entrada occidental de Orgrimmar; la zona está muy defendida.","text_en":"Ragefire Chasm is a level 13-18 dungeon beneath Orgrimmar; its portal lies deep in the Cleft of Shadow. Horde can enter from the city. Alliance players can take the boat to Ratchet and approach through the western entrance to Orgrimmar; the area is heavily guarded.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ragefire Chasm Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ragefire-chasm-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-26"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Ragefire Chasm in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ragefire-chasm-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:ragefire-chasm"],"source_hashes":["section:bc8d6ced758340692b622c857e0fbfe24136ef11","section:c65030e3e81f84222bf9fdf46ff5e54144162f15"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ragefire-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Sima Ígnea","title_en":"Recommended Ragefire Chasm Quests","summary_es":"Enemigos ocultos culmina con dos jefes; otras misiones se recogen en Orgrimmar y Cima del Trueno.","summary_en":"Hidden Enemies ends with two bosses; other quests start in Orgrimmar and Thunder Bluff.","keywords_es":["misiones de sima ígnea","midiendo fuerzas con el enemigo","enemigos ocultos","matar a la bestia","misiones horda sima ígnea"],"keywords_en":["ragefire chasm quests","testing an enemy's strength","hidden enemies","slaying the beast","horde ragefire quests"],"text_es":"Todas son de Horda. Enemigos ocultos se recoge con Thrall en Orgrimmar; Matar a la bestia, con Neeru Hojafuego, también allí. Buscando la cartera perdida empieza con Rahauro en Cima del Trueno y continúa dentro de la instancia. Poder destructivo se inicia con Varimathras en Entrañas.","text_en":"All are Horde-only. Hidden Enemies starts with Thrall in Orgrimmar; Slaying the Beast starts with Neeru Fireblade there. Searching for the Lost Satchel begins with Rahauro in Thunder Bluff and continues inside. The Power to Destroy starts with Varimathras in Undercity.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ragefire-chasm-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:ragefire-chasm"],"source_hashes":["section:d632ef6b4b2c1a8ef01b320cb18d1bf722a3d08a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ragefire-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de Sima Ígnea","title_en":"Ragefire Chasm Bosses","summary_es":"Controla los troggs de Ogglesílex y aparta a Taragaman del borde; elimina adds en los otros jefes.","summary_en":"Control Oggleflint’s troggs and keep Taragaman away from the edge; clear adds on the other bosses.","keywords_es":["ragefire jefes","jefes de sima ígnea","controla los troggs de ogglesílex y aparta a tarag"],"keywords_en":["ragefire jefes","ragefire chasm bosses","control oggleflint’s troggs and keep taragaman awa"],"text_es":"Ogglesílex comparte sala con dos troggs: controla uno y elimina primero al otro. Aparta a Taragaman el Hambriento del borde de la lava; mantén a distancia a los atacantes por su nova de fuego. Jergosh el Conjurador tiene dos esbirros: controla uno y derrota al otro antes. Bazzalan pega fuerte; puedes separar uno de sus esbirros antes del combate.","text_en":"Oggleflint shares a room with two troggs: control one and kill the other first. Keep Taragaman the Hungerer away from the lava’s edge; ranged players should stay back because of his fire nova. Jergosh the Invoker has two adds: control one and defeat the other first. Bazzalan hits hard; one of his adds can be separated before the fight.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Oggleflint","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ragefire-chasm-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-26"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Taragaman the Hungerer","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ragefire-chasm-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-26"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Jergosh the Invoker","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ragefire-chasm-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-26"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bazzalan","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ragefire-chasm-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:ragefire-chasm"],"source_hashes":["section:05302fc6abca5226acd4b520bfbbda8ca068a3cc","section:238ce9fd6f90277bd7aeba31de231529f4516835","section:315197f42e5bb45c5456cd0b470d28f913251749","section:f43dc5ab6b221645043d1a7962d327a1bc945cd1"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ragefire-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Sima Ígnea","title_en":"Ragefire Chasm Rewards","summary_es":"La cadena Enemigos ocultos ofrece armas para elegir; también destacan objetos de Taragaman y Jergosh.","summary_en":"The Hidden Enemies chain offers a choice of weapons; Taragaman and Jergosh also have notable drops.","keywords_es":["ragefire recompensas","recompensas de sima ígnea","la cadena enemigos ocultos ofrece armas para elegi"],"keywords_en":["ragefire recompensas","ragefire chasm rewards","the hidden enemies chain offers a choice of weapon"],"text_es":"La misión Enemigos ocultos ofrece armas como el Puñal hindú de Orgrimmar y el Bastón de Orgrimmar. Entre los botines de jefe figuran el Manteo subterráneo y la Toga de Evocación.","text_en":"Weapons offered include Kris of Orgrimmar and Staff of Orgrimmar. Boss drops include Subterranean Cape and Robe of Evocation.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ragefire-chasm-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-26"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ragefire Chasm Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ragefire Chasm Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ragefire-chasm-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:ragefire-chasm"],"source_hashes":["section:8ea752e85911f44028cfc10cde5280ddac839d90","section:a4a839fc643ba259ca257b9794c554ab03efdd9f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-hall-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Salón de los Feudales: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Hall of Thanes: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 13-18, bajo la Sala del Trono de Forjaz; la Horda afronta un largo trayecto.","summary_en":"Level 13-18 beneath Ironforge’s High Seat; Horde faces a long journey.","keywords_es":["salón de los feudales","hall of thanes","cómo llegar al salón de los feudales","salón de los feudales jefes","mazmorra nueva forjaz"],"keywords_en":["hall of thanes","hall of thanes entrance","hall of thanes bosses","new ironforge dungeon","hall of thanes quests"],"text_es":"El Salón de los Feudales es de nivel 13-18 y está bajo la Sala del Trono de Forjaz, en la Vieja Forjaz. Al entrar en la Sala del Trono, toma la puerta abierta a la izquierda y sigue el camino hasta abajo. Desde Molino Tarren, la Horda debe cruzar las Tierras Altas de Arathi, Los Humedales y Loch Modan; los guardias de Forjaz hacen peligroso el acceso.","text_en":"Hall of Thanes is level 13-18, beneath the High Seat of Ironforge in Old Ironforge. After entering the High Seat, take the open doorway on the left and follow the path down. From Tarren Mill, Horde must cross Arathi Highlands, the Wetlands, and Loch Modan; Ironforge’s guards make the approach dangerous.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Hall of Thanes Overview in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of The Hall of Thanes in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:hall-of-thanes"],"source_hashes":["section:a42c20eae6fa1e19479b52fbc3fcedd80d6d5681","section:b4b14aa240c957eec82c50dc81b954e5dc55a37a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-hall-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables del Salón de los Feudales","title_en":"Recommended Hall of Thanes Quests","summary_es":"Reliquias importantes y Un agravio antiguo sirven a ambas facciones; otras misiones son de Alianza.","summary_en":"Important Heirlooms and An Ancient Grudge are open to both factions; other quests are Alliance-only.","keywords_es":["misiones del salón de los feudales","un agravio antiguo","reliquias importantes","incursión en la antigua forjaz","misiones alianza salón"],"keywords_en":["hall of thanes quests","an ancient grudge","important heirlooms","old ironforge incursion","alliance hall of thanes"],"text_es":"Hay cinco misiones: tres son exclusivas de la Alianza. Reliquias importantes se recoge con Thom Filch en la Vieja Forjaz y permite buscar reliquias en las cámaras; Un agravio antiguo empieza dentro, con el Auxiliar fantasmal. Incursión en la Antigua Forjaz se inicia con Videnterra Farsen en la cantera Gol’Golar y pide derrotar a Durgen Martillo Funesto.","text_en":"There are five quests; three are Alliance-only. Important Heirlooms starts with Thom Filch in Old Ironforge and sends you to search the vaults; An Ancient Grudge starts inside with the Ghostly Attendant. Old Ironforge Incursion begins with Earthseer Farsen at Gol’Golar Quarry and asks you to defeat Durgen Dirgehammer.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Every Quest for the Hall of Thanes in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Important Heirlooms","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › An Ancient Grudge","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Old Ironforge Incursion","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:hall-of-thanes"],"source_hashes":["section:10a770a023a207a68e6bdd9186ea65c9cc3a1a2b","section:5f8ae15c22f2c0e7c3aa051b4973ef05c6ef0dcf","section:8de9b78a11e40b741bea33b1fb7bcd9389e43da8","section:c6c3c1f2721b0edc1ae82012b2d5c39271e1cacb"]},{"id":"mazmorra-hall-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes del Salón de los Feudales","title_en":"Hall of Thanes Bosses","summary_es":"Aísla a los jefes de sus adds, esquiva el empuje de Pillaje y controla los gólems de Durgen.","summary_en":"Separate bosses from their adds, avoid Plunder’s knockback, and control Durgen’s golems.","keywords_es":["hall jefes","jefes del salón de los feudales","aísla a los jefes de sus adds, esquiva el empuje d"],"keywords_en":["hall jefes","hall of thanes bosses","separate bosses from their adds, avoid plunder’s k"],"text_es":"Limpia la zona antes de atraer a Faldrim Yunquemar, que lanza Explosión mental y maldice al tanque. Con Magmatus, aparta al jefe del grupo y elimina al invocador. Lleva a Pillaje a un lugar seguro para que el empuje no atraiga enemigos. Antes de Durgen Martillo Funesto, limpia los saqueadores y derrota a los gólems de uno en uno: el jefe usa miedo y Desgarrar.","text_en":"Clear the area before Faldrim Anvilmar, who casts Mind Blast and curses the tank. Keep Magmatus away from the group and kill the summoner. Place Plunder where his knockback will not draw enemies. Clear the looters before Durgen Dirgehammer and defeat the golems one at a time; the boss uses fear and Rend.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bosses","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bosses","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bosses","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bosses","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:hall-of-thanes"],"source_hashes":["section:8fdcf89284d9a535b7db4e7c67ce6a696991cbbe"]},{"id":"mazmorra-hall-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas del Salón de los Feudales","title_en":"Hall of Thanes Rewards","summary_es":"Las misiones y los jefes ofrecen equipo; destacan reliquias de cámara y botines de nombre conocido.","summary_en":"Quests and bosses offer gear, including vault heirlooms and notable named drops.","keywords_es":["hall recompensas","recompensas del salón de los feudales","las misiones y los jefes ofrecen equipo; destacan "],"keywords_en":["hall recompensas","hall of thanes rewards","quests and bosses offer gear, including vault heir"],"text_es":"Reliquias importantes pide reunir reliquias en las cámaras y ofrece un tomo para la mano secundaria. Entre los botines de jefe con nombre oficial en español están la Gargantilla efímera de Faldrim, la Faja de gema luciente de Magmatus y el Hacha creciente de Durgen.","text_en":"Important Heirlooms asks you to gather heirlooms in the vaults and offers an off-hand tome. Notable boss drops include Ephemeral Choker, Kindlegem Girdle, and Durgen’s Crescent Axe.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Important Heirlooms","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Hall of Thanes Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Hall of Thanes Loot","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/hall-of-thanes-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:hall-of-thanes"],"source_hashes":["section:10a770a023a207a68e6bdd9186ea65c9cc3a1a2b","section:47df1d503f2317a36fb3716e486a5a6045d7dceb"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ruinas-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ruinas de Lordaeron: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Ruins of Lordaeron: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 16-22, sobre Entrañas; la Horda tiene acceso directo y la Alianza debe rodear el lago.","summary_en":"Level 16-22 above Undercity; Horde has direct access while Alliance must travel around the lake.","keywords_es":["ruinas de lordaeron","ruins of lordaeron","cómo llegar a las ruinas de lordaeron","ruinas de lordaeron jefes","mazmorra nueva entrañas"],"keywords_en":["ruins of lordaeron","ruins of lordaeron entrance","ruins of lordaeron bosses","new undercity dungeon","ruins of lordaeron quests"],"text_es":"Las Ruinas de Lordaeron son de nivel 16-22. La Horda entra por las ruinas no instanciadas sobre Entrañas, al sur de Rémol. Para la Alianza el viaje es largo: desde Trabalomas hay que rodear Dalaran, cruzar el lago Lordamere a nado hasta Tirisfal y seguir hasta la entrada.","text_en":"Ruins of Lordaeron is level 16-22. Horde enters through the uninstanced ruins above Undercity, south of Brill. Alliance has a long trip: from Hillsbrad, go around Dalaran, swim across Lordamere Lake to Tirisfal, then follow the road to the entrance.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Ruins of Lordaeron Overview in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of The Ruins of Lordaeron in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:ruins-of-lordaeron"],"source_hashes":["section:5ffaf0f72424ca9a0ad8aa9ef56285842c2d1ff0","section:67aaabab603d68c4ab683195025299b3895a8bf9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ruinas-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de las Ruinas de Lordaeron","title_en":"Recommended Ruins of Lordaeron Quests","summary_es":"La cólera de Rath’mael empieza en Tirisfal; varias misiones se activan dentro de las ruinas.","summary_en":"The Wrath of Rath’mael starts in Tirisfal; several quests begin inside the ruins.","keywords_es":["misiones de las ruinas de lordaeron","abominable creatures","justicia de la luz","la cólera de rath'mael","el blasón de lordaeron"],"keywords_en":["ruins of lordaeron quests","abominable creatures","light's justice","wrath of rath'mael","crest of lordaeron"],"text_es":"Hay seis misiones de Horda y cuatro de Alianza. La cólera de Rath’mael empieza con Guardia de la Muerte Kristof en Tirisfal y pide derrotar al jefe. Criaturas abominables se recoge con el Capitán Truman junto a la entrada; El blasón de Lordaeron empieza al hallar el objeto dentro y puede entregarse en Ventormenta o Entrañas.","text_en":"There are six Horde quests and four Alliance quests. The Wrath of Rath’mael starts with Deathguard Kristof in Tirisfal and asks you to defeat the boss. Abominable Creatures starts with Captain Truman by the entrance; Crest of Lordaeron begins when you find its item inside and can be turned in at Stormwind or Undercity.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Every Quest for the Ruins of Lordaeron in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Wrath of Rath'mael","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Abominable Creatures","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Crest of Lordaeron/Crest of Lordaeron","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:ruins-of-lordaeron"],"source_hashes":["section:5c3007348360bd9bfc0b7a22261f963d98663161","section:908c7997a5b49654ca7f8588f6a9c8fd657f16ea","section:c44ef6e12cef6c85632bb41729aeb7314a224ab0","section:ded121018481b245d31fb60eb2e39c56a1fbced5"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ruinas-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de las Ruinas de Lordaeron","title_en":"Ruins of Lordaeron Bosses","summary_es":"Vigila el veneno y las oleadas; muévete del Fogonazo de Rath’mael.","summary_en":"Watch for poison and waves; move out of Rath’mael’s Flamestrike.","keywords_es":["ruinas jefes","jefes de las ruinas de lordaeron","vigila el veneno y las oleadas; muévete del fogona"],"keywords_en":["ruinas jefes","ruins of lordaeron bosses","watch for poison and waves; move out of rath’mael’"],"text_es":"Colmimarchito viene con arañas y aplica Veneno parasitario. El barón golpea con fuerza y puede perder la amenaza del tanque; atúrdelo si es posible. Viktor el Abyecto aparece tras cinco oleadas; El Abandonado, tras tres. Bjork activa un escudo antimagia breve. En Rath’mael, sal de la zona del Fogonazo durante su lanzamiento.","text_en":"Witherfang comes with spiders and applies Leech Poison. The Baron hits hard and can drop the tank’s threat; stun him if possible. Viktor the Vile appears after five waves; The Abandoned after three. Bjork briefly activates an anti-magic shield. Move out of the target area during the final boss’s fire cast.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Witherfang","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Baron","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Viktor The Vile","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Abandoned","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bjork","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Wrath of Rath'mael","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:ruins-of-lordaeron"],"source_hashes":["section:081781218e62c36c6269453133c72ec157d4fca7","section:198ac46a48fba6c7a5e7b60bd17edb391102f109","section:40898223c82527df3832d15d7324b5d6a9a3c53e","section:4fcebdc5930d0e9fe7f49fae45f92a57c999dcb0","section:c44ef6e12cef6c85632bb41729aeb7314a224ab0","section:edfebdda3b76c84951c651726943955cb72a6a57"]},{"id":"mazmorra-ruinas-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de las Ruinas de Lordaeron","title_en":"Ruins of Lordaeron Rewards","summary_es":"El blasón inicia una misión secreta; las misiones y jefes ofrecen equipo.","summary_en":"The Crest starts a secret quest; quests and bosses offer gear.","keywords_es":["ruinas recompensas","recompensas de las ruinas de lordaeron","el blasón inicia una misión secreta; las misiones "],"keywords_en":["ruinas recompensas","ruins of lordaeron rewards","the crest starts a secret quest; quests and bosses"],"text_es":"El blasón de Lordaeron es un objeto oculto que inicia una misión y puede entregarse en Ventormenta o Entrañas. La cólera de Rath’mael y Criaturas abominables también recompensan con equipo. Las misiones ofrecen armas y armaduras, y la tabla de botín incluye equipo de varios tipos.","text_en":"Crest of Lordaeron is a hidden item that starts a quest and can be turned in at Stormwind or Undercity. The Wrath of Rath’mael and Abominable Creatures also reward gear. Boss loot includes weapons and armor of several types.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Crest of Lordaeron/Crest of Lordaeron","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Ruins of Lordaeron Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Ruins of Lordaeron Loot","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/ruins-of-lordaeron-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:ruins-of-lordaeron"],"source_hashes":["section:7599dec2c6790f4c37cbae499c3b6a365da8e5fd","section:908c7997a5b49654ca7f8588f6a9c8fd657f16ea","section:af543354c4f67cafa45778e5bccbbb7720387962"]},{"id":"mazmorra-wailing-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cuevas de los Lamentos: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Wailing Caverns: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 15-25 en el oasis Agua Clara; la ruta es sencilla desde el Cruce para la Horda.","summary_en":"Level 15-25 at Lushwater Oasis; the route from the Crossroads is easy for Horde.","keywords_es":["cuevas de los lamentos","wailing caverns","cómo llegar a cuevas de los lamentos","cuevas de los lamentos jefes","mutanus"],"keywords_en":["wailing caverns","wailing caverns entrance","wailing caverns bosses","mutanus","wailing caverns quests"],"text_es":"Las Cuevas de los Lamentos son de nivel 15-25. La entrada está en una caverna del oasis Agua Clara, al suroeste del Cruce; desde allí la Horda llega fácilmente. La Alianza puede viajar al este desde Astranaar, en Vallefresno, y luego bajar hacia Los Baldíos, o tomar el barco de Bahía del Botín a Trinquete y continuar hacia el oeste.","text_en":"Wailing Caverns is level 15-25. Its entrance is in a cave at Lushwater Oasis, southwest of the Crossroads; Horde can reach it easily from there. Alliance can travel east from Astranaar in Ashenvale and then south into the Barrens, or take the boat from Booty Bay to Ratchet and continue west.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Wailing Caverns Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Wailing Caverns in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:wailing-caverns"],"source_hashes":["section:24872ad63a4e8db940e0ae44decd5603c8af879b","section:f01d14d241a3d5c5a9d7b6a5add479b4be48f32a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-wailing-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Cuevas de los Lamentos","title_en":"Recommended Wailing Caverns Quests","summary_es":"Líderes del Colmillo da a elegir un arma; otras misiones empiezan en Trinquete y junto a la entrada.","summary_en":"Leaders of the Fang offers a weapon choice; other quests start in Ratchet and by the entrance.","keywords_es":["misiones de cuevas de los lamentos","pellejo de los descarriados","líderes del colmillo","erradicación de descarriados","repitilia"],"keywords_en":["wailing caverns quests","deviate hides","leaders of the fang","deviate eradication","serpentbloom"],"text_es":"Líderes del Colmillo se recoge con Nara Bravacrín en Cima del Trueno tras una cadena que empieza con Tonga Tótem de Runa en Los Baldíos; permite elegir el Bastón creciente o la Espada de ala. Pellejo de los descarriados empieza con Nalpak, en la cueva sobre la entrada. El objeto Fragmento resplandeciente cae de Mutanus el Devorador y permite iniciar la misión El fragmento brillante.","text_en":"Leaders of the Fang starts with Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff after a chain that begins with Tonga Runetotem in the Barrens; it offers a choice of the Crescent Staff or Wingblade. Deviate Hides starts with Nalpak in the cave above the entrance. The Glowing Shard is obtained after defeating Mutanus the Devourer.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Event: Mutanus the Devourer","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:wailing-caverns"],"source_hashes":["section:68fbd13eceb5bd2dbcdc79be0c59c98fdea47cc7","section:af2cf055eded432a7b3bbed6ab76417c6b298d46"]},{"id":"mazmorra-wailing-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de Cuevas de los Lamentos","title_en":"Wailing Caverns Bosses","summary_es":"Interrumpe Dormir en los druidas; el evento final exige proteger al discípulo de Naralex.","summary_en":"Interrupt Sleep on the druids; the final event requires protecting Naralex’s disciple.","keywords_es":["wailing jefes","jefes de cuevas de los lamentos","interrumpe dormir en los druidas; el evento final "],"keywords_en":["wailing jefes","wailing caverns bosses","interrupt sleep on the druids; the final event req"],"text_es":"Kresh puede atontar al objetivo. Interrumpe Dormir de los druidas del Colmillo y controla sus acompañantes; Serpentis se puede atraer sin adds. El Dragón feérico descarriado aparece con otros tres élites, incluidos dos druidas. Skum encadena rayos entre combatientes cercanos. Verdan el Eterno enraíza a quienes están cerca. Tras derrotar a los cuatro líderes, protege al Discípulo de Naralex durante las oleadas y contra Mutanus el Devorador; si falla, hay que reiniciar la mazmorra.","text_en":"Kresh can daze its target. Interrupt Sleep from the Druids of the Fang and control their companions; Serpentis can be pulled without adds. A rare Deviate Faerie Dragon appears with three other elites, including two druids. Skum chains lightning between nearby melee. Verdan the Everliving roots nearby players. After defeating the four leaders, protect the Disciple of Naralex through the waves and against Mutanus the Devourer; if the event fails, the dungeon must be reset.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lady Andacondra","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lord Cobrahn","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lord Pythas","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Skum","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lord Serpentis","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Verdan the Everliving","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Event: Mutanus the Devourer","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Kresh","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Deviate Faerie Dragon (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:wailing-caverns"],"source_hashes":["section:03440eb6547578cf23bbb178396435208cac6149","section:11df9a66c63bbcc040f7b7b232d8882ddb7f3eb8","section:12a94357d66dcad17b3f158ef90108cfbcc2889e","section:46487708030977b1e69abccb9dca880d218a8310","section:68fbd13eceb5bd2dbcdc79be0c59c98fdea47cc7","section:7c194a46264704ff1cda4caf477d244a9126d4eb","section:8adb5f1a1484093a047ead04a5074b16e0a816cc","section:96ab571786f9f0744919d8b7b8828a99c0aa7b39","section:dba240a362b266fae87ae3bc684d4700fc867e7b"]},{"id":"mazmorra-wailing-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Cuevas de los Lamentos","title_en":"Wailing Caverns Rewards","summary_es":"Líderes del Colmillo permite elegir arma; los jefes dejan equipo como el Cinturón del Colmillo.","summary_en":"Leaders of the Fang offers a weapon choice; bosses drop gear such as the Belt of the Fang.","keywords_es":["wailing recompensas","recompensas de cuevas de los lamentos","líderes del colmillo permite elegir arma; los jefe"],"keywords_en":["wailing recompensas","wailing caverns rewards","leaders of the fang offers a weapon choice; bosses"],"text_es":"Líderes del Colmillo permite elegir entre el Bastón creciente y la Espada de ala. Entre los objetos destacados de los jefes están el Cinturón del Colmillo, la Armadura del Colmillo y la Víbora hiriente.","text_en":"Leaders of the Fang lets you choose between the Crescent Staff and Wingblade. Notable boss drops include the Belt of the Fang, Armor of the Fang, and Stinging Viper.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Wailing Caverns Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Wailing Caverns Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wailing-caverns-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-27"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:wailing-caverns"],"source_hashes":["section:5679092155d1dc4a0e2f524b85474b8de76ec76f","section:ae4bc8e4fec7981365dd7e5ee6b5899566df143a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-deadmines-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Minas de la Muerte: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Deadmines: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel recomendado 18-23; la entrada está dentro de una casa en Moonbrook, Páramos de Poniente.","summary_en":"Recommended level 18-23; the entrance is inside a house in Moonbrook, Westfall.","keywords_es":["minas de la muerte","deadmines","cómo llegar a minas de la muerte","minas de la muerte jefes","van cleef"],"keywords_en":["deadmines","deadmines entrance","deadmines bosses","van cleef","deadmines quests"],"text_es":"Las Minas de la Muerte se recomiendan para nivel 18-23. La entrada está dentro de un edificio en Moonbrook, al sur de Páramos de Poniente. La Alianza puede volar a la Colina del Centinela y viajar al sur. La ruta larga de la Horda parte del campamento Grom’gol y sigue la costa hacia el norte hasta Páramos de Poniente.","text_en":"Deadmines is recommended for level 18-23. The entrance is inside a building in Moonbrook, in southern Westfall. Alliance can fly to Sentinel Hill and travel south. Horde has a long route from Grom’gol Base Camp, following the coast north to Westfall.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › The Deadmines Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Location of The Deadmines in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:deadmines"],"source_hashes":["section:379eac59c53fb5facbbcd7b53e591c9734cf9083","section:99e3a40739fc43d37f565ee6c87331034cca5c83"]},{"id":"mazmorra-deadmines-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de las Minas de la Muerte","title_en":"Recommended Deadmines Quests","summary_es":"La hermandad de los Defias empieza en Colina del Centinela; otras misiones se recogen en Ventormenta.","summary_en":"The Defias Brotherhood starts at Sentinel Hill; other quests begin in Stormwind.","keywords_es":["misiones de minas de la muerte","la hermandad de los defias","pañuelos rojos de seda","la carta sin enviar","misiones alianza deadmines"],"keywords_en":["deadmines quests","the defias brotherhood","red silk bandanas","the unsent letter","alliance deadmines quests"],"text_es":"Las misiones son de la Alianza. La hermandad de los Defias empieza con Gryan Mantorrecio en Colina del Centinela y culmina con la cabeza de VanCleef, a cambio de equipo. Asalto subterráneo se recoge con Shoni el Shilenshioso en Ventormenta y requiere el objeto de Trituradora de Sneed. La carta sin enviar cae de Edwin VanCleef dentro y sirve de requisito para El motín de las Mazmorras.","text_en":"The quests are Alliance-only. The Defias Brotherhood starts with Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill and ends with VanCleef’s head, rewarding gear. Underground Assault starts with Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind and requires the item from Sneed’s Shredder. The Unsent Letter drops from Edwin VanCleef inside and is a prerequisite for The Stockade Riots.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Every Quest in the Deadmines in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › The Defias Brotherhood","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Underground Assault","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › The Unsent Letter","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:deadmines"],"source_hashes":["section:4f4dac61a811b9a8f6aee7685e51e9784c76f394","section:5e1f48cf6e26cbb153036005815e667262e440bf","section:9d57702ab486c7cf30beb56b92987566aa3ecaab","section:e9ddb58b357568f712aa1b29a816132c5978630f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-deadmines-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de las Minas de la Muerte","title_en":"Deadmines Bosses","summary_es":"Limpia adds antes de los combates; cuidado con los aturdimientos de Don Mamporro y las oleadas de VanCleef.","summary_en":"Clear adds before fights; watch Mr. Smite’s stuns and VanCleef’s waves.","keywords_es":["deadmines jefes","jefes de las minas de la muerte","limpia adds antes de los combates; cuidado con los"],"keywords_en":["deadmines jefes","deadmines bosses","clear adds before fights; watch mr. smite’s stuns "],"text_es":"Separa a los vigilantes de Rhahk’Zor y limpia la sala antes de Trituradora de Sneed, cuyo miedo puede atraer enemigos. Con el Minero Johnson, elimina mineros y vigila la armadura del tanque. Con Gilnid, controla al ingeniero que invoca robots. Don Mamporro aturde al grupo al 66% y 33%: mata primero a los guardias. Capitán Verdetez comparte zona con adds; controla al Formarrasca Defias y evita Mellar. VanCleef llama más adds al 50%; lleva a El Chef hacia la salida e interrumpe su curación.","text_en":"Separate the watchmen from Rhahk’Zor and clear the room before Sneed’s Shredder, whose fear can pull enemies. Miner Johnson is surrounded by miners and reduces the tank’s armor. Gilnid is accompanied by an engineer who can summon robots; control the engineer. Mr. Smite stuns the group at 66% and 33%: kill the guards first. Captain Greenskin shares the area with adds; control the Defias Squallshaper and avoid the cleave. VanCleef summons more adds at 50%; pull Cookie toward the exit and interrupt his healing.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Rhahk'Zor","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Sneed's Shredder","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Mr. Smite","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Captain Greenskin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Edwin VanCleef","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Cookie","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Miner Johnson (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Gilnid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:deadmines"],"source_hashes":["section:2d9627004b8fbd26f34b5c7bff8f279bd1ec0ce6","section:3139f69b21bfed60009dbdbe575110c4ec8d8e42","section:5037147df8f4d0f750478bb1e6e2af67702d993d","section:52c2ffce2f7c9a500f28a84dd0e09f5c4e2c3978","section:c299effacb2fca22940128a7b397c4ec058a79b2","section:ce13906e14871b28f395ea3ccf8f5686db4a9932","section:df91b23985a9b37e0e6105105be2fba0bf407156","section:f2535df09c467be5f5e843b5db8be1fba79ea518"]},{"id":"mazmorra-deadmines-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de las Minas de la Muerte","title_en":"Deadmines Rewards","summary_es":"La hermandad de los Defias da equipo a elegir; VanCleef deja armas y armaduras destacadas.","summary_en":"The Defias Brotherhood offers a gear choice; VanCleef drops notable weapons and armor.","keywords_es":["deadmines recompensas","recompensas de las minas de la muerte","la hermandad de los defias da equipo a elegir; van"],"keywords_en":["deadmines recompensas","deadmines rewards","the defias brotherhood offers a gear choice; vancl"],"text_es":"La hermandad de los Defias ofrece equipo a elegir, como el Bastón de Páramos de Poniente y la Túnica de Páramos de Poniente. Entre los botines destacados de Edwin VanCleef figuran la Púa cruel y el Manteo de la Hermandad.","text_en":"The Defias Brotherhood offers a gear choice, including the Staff of Westfall and Tunic of Westfall. Notable drops from Edwin VanCleef include Cruel Barb and Cape of the Brotherhood.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Deadmines Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Deadmines Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-deadmines-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:deadmines"],"source_hashes":["section:29897727840766790103a1fceeb56426698786c6","section:d3795cb7a6cac45f02abd925107d434c7ae616d7"]},{"id":"mazmorra-shadowfang-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Castillo de Colmillo Oscuro: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Shadowfang Keep: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 22-30, en Bosque de Argénteos; el acceso es sencillo para la Horda y largo para la Alianza.","summary_en":"Levels 22-30 in Silverpine Forest; easy to reach for Horde and a long trip for Alliance.","keywords_es":["castillo de colmillo oscuro","shadowfang keep","entrada de colmillo oscuro","cómo llegar a colmillo oscuro","nivel de colmillo oscuro"],"keywords_en":["shadowfang keep","shadowfang keep entrance","shadowfang keep levels","shadowfang keep location","how to reach shadowfang keep"],"text_es":"Castillo de Colmillo Oscuro (22-30) está en Bosque de Argénteos, al norte de la aldea cercana. La Horda vuela a El Sepulcro y sigue la carretera al sur y luego al oeste. Para la Alianza, la ruta es larga y pasa en barco por Puerto de Menethil y Costasur antes de continuar por tierra; los Cielonatos pueden teletransportarse a Dalaran desde la Torre de los Magos de Ventormenta y cruzar Molino Ámbar.","text_en":"Shadowfang Keep (22-30) is in Silverpine Forest, north of the nearby village. Horde flies to the Sepulcher and follows the road south, then west. Alliance has a long trip by boat through Menethil Harbor to Southshore, then overland; Skyborne can teleport to Dalaran from Stormwind City’s Mage Tower and cut through Ambermill.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Shadowfang Keep Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Shadowfang Keep in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:shadowfang-keep"],"source_hashes":["section:be4d70274cb69a0a8e88d42f5c3f5b7cfaa7d9df","section:fe2cc19de563075459cf30c1037a3f6ca39a32e2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-shadowfang-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Colmillo Oscuro","title_en":"Recommended Shadowfang Keep Quests","summary_es":"La Horda puede recoger misiones en Entrañas y el Sepulcro; también hay objetivos de clase.","summary_en":"Horde can pick up quests in Undercity and the Sepulcher; class-specific objectives are available too.","keywords_es":["misiones de colmillo oscuro","arugal debe morir","mortacechadores en colmillo oscuro","el libro de ur","el orbe de soran’ruk"],"keywords_en":["shadowfang keep quests","arugal must die","deathstalkers in shadowfang","the book of ur","the orb of soran’ruk"],"text_es":"La Horda puede recoger Arugal debe morir con Dalar Tejalba y Mortacechadores en Colmillo Oscuro con Sumo Ejecutor Hadrec, ambos en el Sepulcro; El Libro de Ur empieza con Vigilante Bel'dugur en Entrañas. El orbe de Soran'ruk es exclusivo de Brujo y empieza en Los Baldíos, cerca del Campamento Taurajo. La prueba de rectitud es para Paladines y comienza con Jordan Fontana en Forjaz; Una hoja tocada por la luna es otra misión de Paladín, disponible en el Sepulcro.","text_en":"Horde can pick up Arugal Must Die from Dalar Dawnweaver and Deathstalkers in Shadowfang from High Executor Hadrec, both at the Sepulcher; The Book of Ur starts with Keeper Bel'dugur in Undercity. The Orb of Soran'ruk is Warlock-only and starts in the Barrens near Camp Taurajo. The Test of Righteousness is for Paladins and starts with Jordan Stilwell in Ironforge; A Moon-Kissed Blade is another Paladin quest available at the Sepulcher.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Arugal Must Die!","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Deathstalkers in Shadowfang","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Book of Ur","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:shadowfang-keep"],"source_hashes":["guide:dad68cac26118a2b979c94698461a58b5e49e93b","section:b1961f5726ca0e91d80cb1b9b18b921511fe2a3e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-shadowfang-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de Colmillo Oscuro: primeras salas","title_en":"Shadowfang Keep: Early Bosses","summary_es":"Controla los adds, aparta el silencio y ayuda a sanar cuando el tanque recibe Velo de Sombras.","summary_en":"Control adds, keep the silence away, and help heal when the tank is hit by Veil of Shadow.","keywords_es":["jefes de colmillo oscuro","barón filargenta","comandante vallefont","odo el cegato","corcel nefasto"],"keywords_en":["shadowfang keep bosses","baron silverlaine","commander springvale","odo the blindwatcher","fel steeds"],"text_es":"Los tres corceles vienen juntos: controla uno y asigna una mascota a otro. Despeja sala y patrullas antes de Zarpador. En la sala inicial, elimina dos adds y controla o derrota el último. Velo de Sombras de Barón Filargenta reduce la sanación recibida un 75%, así que otras clases con sanación deben apoyar al tanque. Con Comandante Vallefont, mata al sirviente e interrumpe sus curas; aparta al Custodio de los Lamentos por el silencio. Odo el Cegato comparte combate con dos enemigos Murciovil: sepáralos del grupo y mátalos primero. El Capitán Juramorte es raro: aléjalo de la banda por Mellar.","text_en":"The three fel steeds come together: control one and have a pet tank another. Clear the room and patrols before Razorclaw. In the first boss room, clear two adds and control or defeat the last. Baron Silverlaine casts Veil of Shadow, reducing healing received by 75%; hybrid classes should help the tank. Commander Springvale comes with two enemies: kill the servitor and interrupt his heals; keep the Wailing Guardsman away for its area silence. Odo the Blindwatcher has two Vile Bat adds: separate them and kill them first. The rare Deathsworn Captain should be tanked away because of Cleave.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Fel Steeds / Shadow Charger","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Razorclaw the Butcher","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Rethilgore","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Baron Silverlaine","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Commander Springvale","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Odo the Blindwatcher","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Deathsworn Captain (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:shadowfang-keep"],"source_hashes":["section:32ee0650d9d8344eadbd4e9bd9021695a5bb5c16","section:37edceea0db84b05517aff87e3f4d65742e24ba6","section:9304520c73bb45120196e58f5a6df4863a91294f","section:b61af2882eec994f6acd83887c6aedd08c22a0de","section:dd23955aacf62fe0d43c7f6c7c24eb03c69e8755","section:df60b5cff2045172fb09926aeb1404e742706cd9","section:fb985078c4da22e1621f241a773b6a0c767c5a21"]},{"id":"mazmorra-shadowfang-jefes-finales","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes finales de Colmillo Oscuro","title_en":"Shadowfang Keep: Later Bosses","summary_es":"Prioriza los lobos invocados por Nandos; en Arugal, ataca desde la plataforma tras sus teletransportes.","summary_en":"Kill Nandos’s summoned wolves first; at Arugal, attack from the platform after his teleports.","keywords_es":["fenrus el devorador","maestro de lobos nandos","archimago arugal","jefes finales de colmillo oscuro","descarga abisal"],"keywords_en":["fenrus the devourer","wolf master nandos","archmage arugal","shadowfang keep final bosses","void bolt"],"text_es":"Fenrus el Devorador es sencillo, pero aplica Saliva tóxica. Antes de Maestro de lobos Nandos, elimina los lobos de la sala y vuelve a matar enseguida los que invoque. Archimago Arugal pega con Descarga abisal y se teletransporta: el grupo a distancia puede atacar desde la plataforma de entrada; los combatientes cuerpo a cuerpo esperan allí a que vuelva para no arrastrar al sanador.","text_en":"Fenrus the Devourer is straightforward but applies Toxic Saliva. Wolf Master Nandos has wolves in the room; kill them, then immediately kill those he summons. Archmage Arugal hits hard with Void Bolt and teleports: ranged players can attack from the entrance platform; melee should wait there for him to return rather than pull the healer along.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Fenrus the Devourer","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Wolf Master Nandos","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Archmage Arugal","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:shadowfang-keep"],"source_hashes":["section:179ff95437dfa3e570d3b917f305041c60a59cc2","section:93ad87f264039d948319bd9bd929c2a5f648d63a","section:ee494da930e48e10dd0095cb66aa7e92c584967a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-shadowfang-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Colmillo Oscuro","title_en":"Shadowfang Keep Rewards","summary_es":"Arugal debe morir da un anillo; los jefes también pueden dejar armas y equipo apreciados.","summary_en":"Arugal Must Die rewards a ring; bosses can also drop sought-after weapons and gear.","keywords_es":["recompensas de colmillo oscuro","lacre de sylvanas","colmillo oscuro","anochecedor","botín de arugal"],"keywords_en":["shadowfang keep rewards","seal of sylvanas","shadowfang","duskbringer","arugal loot"],"text_es":"Arugal debe morir recompensa con el Lacre de Sylvanas. Entre el equipo destacado de los jefes están Anochecedor y Colmillo oscuro; Archimago Arugal también puede dejar el Fragmento de meteorito. Son ejemplos, no una lista completa del botín.","text_en":"Arugal Must Die rewards the Seal of Sylvanas. Notable boss gear includes Duskbringer and Shadowfang; Archmage Arugal can also drop Meteor Shard. These are examples, not a complete loot list.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Arugal Must Die!","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shadowfang Keep Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Shadowfang Keep Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/shadowfang-keep-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-10-11"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:shadowfang-keep"],"source_hashes":["guide:dad68cac26118a2b979c94698461a58b5e49e93b","section:4a0503c1c7540d5c2f33634d2e3ad4966a613814"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackfathom-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cavernas de Brazanegra: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Blackfathom Deeps: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 24-32; se accede por un pozo submarino en la costa de Zoram.","summary_en":"Levels 24-32; enter through an underwater shaft at the Zoram Strand.","keywords_es":["cavernas de brazanegra","blackfathom deeps","entrada de brazanegra","cómo llegar a brazanegra","nivel de brazanegra"],"keywords_en":["blackfathom deeps","blackfathom entrance","blackfathom levels","blackfathom deeps location","how to reach blackfathom"],"text_es":"Cavernas de Brazanegra (24-32) está en Vallefresno; la entrada es un pozo con escaleras al que se llega nadando. La Alianza puede volar a Astranaar y avanzar al noroeste por el camino principal. La Horda puede volar al puesto de Zorem’gar, en la costa de Zoram, y dirigirse al norte.","text_en":"Blackfathom Deeps (24-32) is in Ashenvale; its entrance is a stair-lined shaft reached by swimming. Alliance can fly to Astranaar and follow the main path northwest. Horde can fly to Zorem’gar Outpost on the Zoram Strand and head north.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blackfathom Deeps Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Blackfathom Deeps in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackfathom-deeps"],"source_hashes":["section:7edc6850a5349e0f528598694acf46ee10a505cd","section:fbde4f34e11b4b39f1909777a876422e05da46e8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackfathom-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de la Alianza en Brazanegra","title_en":"Alliance Quests for Blackfathom","summary_es":"La Alianza puede recoger varias misiones antes; Buscando a Thaelrid precede a La vileza de Brazanegra.","summary_en":"Alliance can pick up several quests beforehand; In Search of Thaelrid precedes Blackfathom Villainy.","keywords_es":["misiones alianza brazanegra","el conocimiento de las profundidades","cascada del crepúsculo","investigaciones acerca de la corrupción","buscando a thaelrid"],"keywords_en":["blackfathom alliance quests","knowledge in the deeps","twilight falls","researching the corruption","in search of thaelrid"],"text_es":"Antes de entrar, la Alianza puede recoger El conocimiento de las profundidades en Forjaz, Cascada del Crepúsculo en Darnassus e Investigaciones acerca de la corrupción en Costa Oscura. Buscando a Thaelrid, requisito de La vileza de Brazanegra, empieza en Darnassus; La vileza se recoge dentro, tras encontrar a la Guardia Argenta Thaelrid.","text_en":"Before entering, Alliance can pick up Knowledge in the Deeps in Ironforge, Twilight Falls in Darnassus, and Researching the Corruption in Darkshore. In Search of Thaelrid, a prerequisite for Blackfathom Villainy, starts in Darnassus; Blackfathom Villainy is obtained inside after finding Argent Guard Thaelrid.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Knowledge In The Deeps","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Researching The Corruption","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Twilight Falls","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blackfathom Villainy","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackfathom-deeps"],"source_hashes":["guide:481531f874edc1671e7bd106a883b8f799549bf1","section:89f25705f8660a005b0a527255f9063d0518f6a2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackfathom-misiones-horda","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de la Horda en Brazanegra","title_en":"Horde Quests for Blackfathom","summary_es":"La Horda puede iniciar cadenas en Sierra Espolón y la costa de Zoram, además de una misión de Brujo.","summary_en":"Horde can start quests in Stonetalon and the Zoram Strand, along with a Warlock quest.","keywords_es":["misiones horda brazanegra","la esencia de aku’mai","lealtad a los dioses antiguos","entre ruinas","el orbe de soran’ruk"],"keywords_en":["blackfathom horde quests","the essence of aku’mai","allegiance to the old gods","amongst the ruins","the orb of soran’ruk"],"text_es":"La esencia de Aku'Mai empieza en Sierra Espolón y continúa en la costa de Zoram; Entre ruinas también se recoge allí. Lealtad a los dioses antiguos empieza con una nota que puede caer cerca de la entrada. Los Brujos pueden preparar El orbe de Soran'ruk cerca del Campamento Taurajo, en Los Baldíos.","text_en":"The Essence of Aku'Mai starts in Stonetalon and continues at the Zoram Strand; Amongst the Ruins also starts there. Allegiance to the Old Gods begins with a note that can drop near the entrance. Warlocks can pick up The Orb of Soran'ruk near Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Essence Of Aku'Mai","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Allegiance To The Old Gods","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Amongst The Ruins","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackfathom-deeps"],"source_hashes":["guide:481531f874edc1671e7bd106a883b8f799549bf1","section:89f25705f8660a005b0a527255f9063d0518f6a2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackfathom-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de Brazanegra: primeros combates","title_en":"Blackfathom Deeps: Early Bosses","summary_es":"Despeja las salas antes de los combates y protege al tanque si el sanador queda dormido.","summary_en":"Clear Sarevess’s and Gelihast’s rooms; protect the tank if Kelris sleeps the healer.","keywords_es":["jefes de brazanegra","lady sarevess","gelihast","señor crepuscular kelris","estrategia brazanegra"],"keywords_en":["blackfathom bosses","lady sarevess","gelihast","twilight lord kelris","blackfathom strategy"],"text_es":"El primer jefe tiene mucha armadura: dispersa al grupo ante Atropello. En la cueva de la naga que patrulla con dos acompañantes, despeja la zona, controla a un acompañante y céntrate en los adds. La sala de Gelihast, rodeado de múrlocs, debe limpiarse antes: su Red puede complicar la siguiente acción del tanque. Si el Señor Crepuscular Kelris usa Dormir contra el sanador, mantén con vida al tanque y ayuda a curarlo.","text_en":"The first boss has heavy armor: spread out for Trample. Clear the cave where the naga patrols with two bodyguards, clear the area, control one bodyguard, and focus the adds. Gelihast’s room is full of murlocs: clear it beforehand, since his Net can complicate the tank’s next pull. Twilight Lord Kelris can sleep the healer; keep the tank alive and help heal.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ghamoo-Ra","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lady Sarevess","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Gelihast","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Twilight Lord Kelris","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackfathom-deeps"],"source_hashes":["section:0dbca0be07b8aaaf5a034e05baadcab2a263eb6e","section:826239e5c13a99106190b030c78c7d3075dbe82f","section:9002b89fe3698ae67c477137fa6a7f8d3bf91ec5","section:e582d6671bf68f350b2393980ff823d050622dd8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackfathom-jefes-finales","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Evento final y jefes de Brazanegra","title_en":"Blackfathom Deeps: Final Event and Bosses","summary_es":"Activa los cuatro braseros tras el Señor Crepuscular Kelris; controla las tortugas y evita la nube de veneno.","summary_en":"Activate all four braziers after Kelris; control the turtle wave and avoid the final poison cloud.","keywords_es":["evento de aku’mai","braseros de brazanegra","viejo serra’kis","aku’mai","oleada de tortugas"],"keywords_en":["aku’mai event","blackfathom braziers","old serra’kis","aku’mai","turtle wave"],"text_es":"Tras derrotar al Señor Crepuscular Kelris, activa los cuatro braseros y vence cada oleada para abrir la puerta final; la de tortugas es la más peligrosa y conviene que un segundo tanque o alguien a distancia las aparte. En el combate submarino de Viejo Serra’kis vigila el aire. En el combate final, mantén al grupo fuera de Nube de veneno y ayuda a sanar al tanque cuando Ira frenética aumente el daño.","text_en":"After defeating Kelris, activate all four braziers and defeat each wave to open the final door; the turtle wave is most dangerous, so an off-tank or ranged player should draw them away. Watch your breath during the underwater fight with Old Serra’kis. The group must stay out of Poison Cloud and help heal the tank when Frenzied Rage raises the damage.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Fire of Aku’Mai Event","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Old Serra’kis","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Aku’mai","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackfathom-deeps"],"source_hashes":["section:544af85cffa84d60c68cf7c783358f18eb43f236","section:87902021b05b2f03bec769c50f221ce480017c6f","section:a0a650fc84e8597728d35bbb63b40ed61964101a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackfathom-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Brazanegra","title_en":"Blackfathom Deeps Rewards","summary_es":"Las misiones ofrecen equipo a elegir; los jefes dejan armas y armaduras destacadas.","summary_en":"Quests offer a choice of gear; bosses drop notable weapons and armor.","keywords_es":["recompensas de brazanegra","rodela ártica","cetro de lápida","vara del insomne","golpe de la hidra"],"keywords_en":["blackfathom rewards","arctic buckler","gravestone scepter","rod of the sleepwalker","strike of the hydra"],"text_es":"La vileza de Brazanegra permite elegir la Rodela ártica o el Cetro de lápida. Entre los botines destacables están la Vara del Insomne del Señor Crepuscular Kelris y Golpe de la hidra del jefe final; el Bastón del Profeta bendito también es un hallazgo valioso para sanadores de nivel bajo.","text_en":"Blackfathom Villainy lets you choose Arctic Buckler or Gravestone Scepter. Notable drops include Rod of the Sleepwalker and Strike of the Hydra; Staff of the Blessed Seer is also a valuable find for lower-level healers.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Twilight Lord Kelris","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Aku’mai","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackfathom Deeps Dungeon Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blackfathom Deeps Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackfathom-deeps-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackfathom-deeps"],"source_hashes":["section:3e8d4ca9eafb0db2589c46a7796e0c236bfa903f","section:826239e5c13a99106190b030c78c7d3075dbe82f","section:82c3056f8e1aa0d36b0c3c785dd8cc6e4bbdefe3","section:87902021b05b2f03bec769c50f221ce480017c6f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stockade-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Las Mazmorras: nivel y entrada","title_en":"The Stockade: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 24-30 en Ciudad de Ventormenta; la Alianza llega con facilidad y la Horda afronta un trayecto arriesgado.","summary_en":"Levels 24-30 in Stormwind City; easy for Alliance to reach, while Horde faces a risky journey.","keywords_es":["las mazmorras de ventormenta","stockade","entrada de las mazmorras","cómo llegar a las mazmorras de ventormenta","nivel de las mazmorras"],"keywords_en":["the stockade","stockade entrance","stockade levels","stormwind stockade location","how to reach the stockade"],"text_es":"Las Mazmorras (24-30) están en Ciudad de Ventormenta, justo fuera del Barrio de los Magos. Para la Alianza basta con ir a la esquina norte exterior del barrio. La Horda puede llegar desde el campamento Grom’gol, nadar por la costa hasta Páramos de Poniente, cruzar Bosque de Elwynn y continuar a Ventormenta; el trayecto por la ciudad puede exigir varias carreras como espíritu.","text_en":"The Stockade (24-30) is in Stormwind City, just outside the Mage Quarter. Alliance can simply go to the quarter’s outer north corner. Horde can travel from Grom’gol Base Camp, swim along the coast to Westfall, cross Elwynn Forest, and continue to Stormwind; crossing the city may require several corpse runs.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Stockade Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of The Stockade in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stockade"],"source_hashes":["section:5b95a20862f5fbfec3f3021cd3cc76e41503860d","section:95c294746b35dc8b7cf52efba2e4e83ec73bf23f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stockade-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Las Mazmorras","title_en":"Recommended Stockade Quests","summary_es":"Las misiones son de la Alianza; algunas empiezan en Ventormenta y otras requieren cadenas previas.","summary_en":"The quests are Alliance-only; some start in Stormwind and others require prior chains.","keywords_es":["misiones de las mazmorras de ventormenta","detener el motín","el motín de las mazmorras","lo que sucece alrededor","la furia mora en las profundidades"],"keywords_en":["stockade quests","quell the uprising","the stockade riots","what comes around","the fury runs deep"],"text_es":"Las misiones son de la Alianza. Detener el motín se recoge con el Alcaide Thelagua, junto a la entrada. El motín de las Mazmorras requiere la cadena que empieza con La carta sin enviar, obtenida en Minas de la Muerte. El color de la sangre se recoge en Ventormenta; Crimen y castigo empieza con Consejero Tallolino en Bosque del Ocaso. Lo que sucece alrededor… empieza con Guardia Berton en Villa del Lago, Montañas Crestagrana; La furia mora en las profundidades se recoge en Dun Modr, Los Humedales, tras La guerra contra los Hierro Negro.","text_en":"The quests are Alliance-only. Quell the Uprising is picked up from Warden Thelwater by the entrance. The Stockade Riots requires the chain that begins with The Unsent Letter, obtained in the Deadmines. The Color of Blood starts in Stormwind; Crime and Punishment begins with Councilman Millstipe in Duskwood. What Comes Around… starts with Guard Berton in Lakeshire, Redridge Mountains; The Fury Runs Deep is picked up in Dun Modr, Wetlands, after The Dark Iron War.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Stockade Riots","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quell the Uprising","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › What Comes Around","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Fury Runs Deep","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stockade"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e3bfe58c8572623e753a1fd4d170a5a3f52cae9","section:32d2dd76f181006adb663e8b54a1338793f0a21e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stockade-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de Las Mazmorras","title_en":"The Stockade Bosses","summary_es":"Controla a los Defias; dispersa al grupo ante Cadena de relámpagos y limpia antes de Grito intimidador.","summary_en":"Control the Defias; spread out for Chain Lightning and clear adds before Intimidating Shout.","keywords_es":["jefes de las mazmorras","targor el pavoroso","kam furiahonda","cadena de relámpagos","dextren tutor"],"keywords_en":["stockade bosses","targorr the dread","kam deepfury","chain lightning","dextren ward"],"text_es":"En las salas de Targor el Pavoroso y Kam Furiahonda, controla a un Defias y derrota primero al otro. El jefe que usa Cadena de relámpagos castiga a los grupos apiñados: dispersa a los combatientes cuerpo a cuerpo. Bazil Thredd puede aturdir con Bomba de humo; mantén sano al tanque. Antes de Dextren Tutor, despeja los pasillos para que su Grito intimidador no atraiga más enemigos. Bruegal Nudoferro es poco frecuente: limpia sus adds antes de atacarlo.","text_en":"In the rooms with Targorr the Dread and Kam Deepfury, control one Defias and kill the other first. The boss using Chain Lightning punishes clustered groups: spread out melee. Bazil Thredd can stun with Smoke Bomb; keep the tank healthy. Clear the corridors before Dextren Ward so Intimidating Shout does not draw more enemies. Bruegal Ironknuckle is rare; clear his adds before engaging.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Targorr the Dread","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Kam Deepfury","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Hamhock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bazil Thredd","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Dextren Ward","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bruegal Ironknuckle (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stockade"],"source_hashes":["section:3b35a962e0d38a19de9e237ae9919ddabe78f0ed","section:3dd28b76aeb97c520db1e63ec3d401cb65b5676d","section:5f4459cacec58b7ab24d043f59754c3760f44fb9","section:733de7883acefc8e813825a297a8694075d00533","section:ad38688c3c7d0333a6020e7904fb93adc6ab0245","section:f54b05059b8e5ac365fdcc4751953d7d3515a40f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stockade-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Las Mazmorras","title_en":"The Stockade Rewards","summary_es":"La furia mora en las profundidades ofrece una recompensa a elegir; destacan algunos botines de jefe.","summary_en":"The Fury Runs Deep offers a choice of reward; several boss drops are notable.","keywords_es":["recompensas de las mazmorras","azota cabezas","cinturón de confirmación","bastón de kam","botín de bruegal nudoferro"],"keywords_en":["stockade rewards","headbasher","belt of vindication","kam’s walking stick","bruegal ironknuckle loot"],"text_es":"La furia mora en las profundidades permite elegir entre el Cinturón de Confirmación y Azota cabezas. Entre los botines con nombre oficial en español están el Bastón de Kam, los Nudillos de hierro y las Esposas forzadas de Bruegal Nudoferro.","text_en":"The Fury Runs Deep lets you choose between Belt of Vindication and Headbasher. Notable drops include Kam’s Walking Stick, Iron Knuckles, and Jimmied Handcuffs.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Fury Runs Deep","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Stockade Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Stockade Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-stockade-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stockade"],"source_hashes":["guide:7e3bfe58c8572623e753a1fd4d170a5a3f52cae9","section:4cb1ef0aaaf4b0441a6c8235e1c6f59eb291f2aa","section:6a07afb50b438dbd8ab263bf34c34185572103c3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-excavation-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Excavación: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Excavation Site: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 26-32 en Los Humedales; la Alianza llega desde Menethil y la Horda desde Trabalomas.","summary_en":"Levels 26-32 in the Wetlands; Alliance comes from Menethil and Horde from Hillsbrad.","keywords_es":["excavación los humedales","nivel de excavación","entrada de excavación","cómo llegar a excavación"],"keywords_en":["excavation site wetlands","excavation level","excavation entrance","how to reach excavation"],"text_es":"Excavación: Los Humedales se recomienda para niveles 26-32 y su entrada queda en lo alto de una colina, por un camino nuevo de Los Humedales. La Alianza puede partir de Puerto de Menethil o llegar a pie desde Loch Modan; la Horda cruza a pie Laderas de Trabalomas y Tierras Altas de Arathi, con una Ruta de vuelo en Molino Tarren.","text_en":"Excavation Site: Wetlands is recommended for levels 26-32; its entrance is at the top of a hill along a new path in the Wetlands. Alliance can start at Menethil Harbor or walk from Loch Modan; Horde travels overland through Hillsbrad Foothills and Arathi Highlands, with a flight path at Tarren Mill.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Excavation Site Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Excavation Site Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/excavation-site-wetlands-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Excavation Site Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Excavation Site in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/excavation-site-wetlands-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:excavation-site-wetlands"],"source_hashes":["section:549102b03ac79247a336c75d14de940626922881","section:d49ea374f64754ca41cda73a00d859a48a5c85a4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-excavation-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Excavación","title_en":"Recommended Excavation Site Quests","summary_es":"Recoge misiones en Menethil, Crestagrana y Los Humedales; la cadena Faucedraco empieza en Hammerfall.","summary_en":"Pick up quests in Menethil, Redridge, and the Wetlands; the Dragonmaw chain starts at Hammerfall.","keywords_es":["misiones de excavación","pellejos de las tierras altas","en busca de filosón","horrores en las tierras altas","cambio de paladar","rumores de los faucedraco"],"keywords_en":["excavation quests","highland hides","songblade search","horrors in the highland","changing tastes","dragonmaw rumors"],"text_es":"Antes de entrar, la Alianza puede recoger Pellejos de las Tierras Altas en Puerto de Menethil, En busca de Filosón con Dorin Filosón en Montañas Crestagrana y Horrores en las Tierras Altas con Rethiel el Guardaverde en Los Humedales. La Horda puede aceptar Cambio de paladar con Borstan en Orgrimmar y comenzar Rumores de los Faucedraco con Zaruk en Sentencia, requisito de Abre las Fauces.","text_en":"Before entering, Alliance can pick up Highland Hides in Menethil Harbor, Songblade Search from Dorin Songblade in Redridge Mountains, and Horrors in the Highland from Rethiel the Greenwarden in the Wetlands. Horde can take Changing Tastes from Borstan in Orgrimmar and start Dragonmaw Rumors with Zaruk at Hammerfall, a prerequisite for Open the Maw.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Excavation Site Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/excavation-site-wetlands-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Excavation Site Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Highland Hides","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/excavation-site-wetlands-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Excavation Site Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Open the Maw","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/excavation-site-wetlands-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:excavation-site-wetlands"],"source_hashes":["section:775887e4c5793264783c973a87af78a3d2b17b24","section:9865b76b869e956ded202352ea3a1ca35967fd1c","section:ca1c0175c06945150450fd1eb8c4581ce701cb0e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dalaran-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ciudad de Dalaran: nivel y entrada","title_en":"City of Dalaran: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 28-34 en Montañas de Alterac; la Alianza entra por las cloacas y la Horda necesita llave.","summary_en":"Levels 28-34 in Alterac Mountains; Alliance enters through the sewers, Horde needs a key.","keywords_es":["ciudad de dalaran","nivel ciudad dalaran","entrada de dalaran","llave de las cloacas","cómo llegar a dalaran"],"keywords_en":["city of dalaran","city of dalaran level","dalaran dungeon entrance","dalaran sewer key","how to reach dalaran"],"text_es":"La Ciudad de Dalaran se recomienda para niveles 28-34 y está en Montañas de Alterac. La Alianza llega desde Laderas de Trabalomas y entra por las cloacas de la ciudad. La Horda puede nadar desde Bosque de Argénteos hasta El Sepulcro y caminar desde allí; para abrir el túnel especial, alguien del grupo debe tener la Llave de las cloacas de Dalaran.","text_en":"City of Dalaran is recommended for levels 28-34 and lies in the Alterac Mountains. Alliance travels from Hillsbrad Foothills and enters through the city sewers. Horde can swim from Silverpine Forest to the Sepulcher and walk from there; opening the special tunnel requires someone in the group to have the Dalaran Sewer Key.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › City of Dalaran Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of City of Dalaran in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Unlocking the City of Dalaran in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:city-of-dalaran"],"source_hashes":["section:12a7a47f2d750e9be76d8c55ad31b9c984ca6a02","section:137f047711a785c1a63a709b12d6c009ae2ebf77","section:22a6a33453f15996b0effd3d0105a74e2273d8f2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dalaran-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Ciudad de Dalaran","title_en":"Recommended City of Dalaran Quests","summary_es":"La Horda inicia una cadena en Molino Tarren; la Alianza empieza con una petición en Costasur.","summary_en":"Horde starts a chain at Tarren Mill; Alliance begins with a request in Southshore.","keywords_es":["misiones de ciudad de dalaran","colarse en la cárcel","la llave de la ciudad","el corazón de la perturbación","una petición alarmante","sangre en las calles"],"keywords_en":["city of dalaran quests","prison break in","key to the city","heart of disruption","an alarming request","blood in the streets"],"text_es":"La cadena de la Horda empieza con Colarse en la cárcel, que da Magus Wordeen Vacuamirada en Molino Tarren; continúa con La llave de la ciudad y Las patrullas de Dalaran. Después, Sangre en las calles lleva hasta la Imagen de la archimaga Modera, que entrega El corazón de la perturbación y la Llave de las cloacas de Dalaran. La Alianza inicia su ruta con Una petición alarmante, de Emisario Jacques en Costasur, y sigue con El corazón de la perturbación.","text_en":"Horde’s chain begins with Prison Break In from Magus Wordeen Voidglare at Tarren Mill, followed by Key to the City and Dalaran Patrols. Blood in the Streets then leads to the Image of Archmage Modera, who gives Heart of Disruption and the Dalaran Sewer Key. Alliance starts its route with An Alarming Request from Emissary Jacques in Southshore, followed by Heart of Disruption.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Initial Quests to Accept","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Hand in and accept next quests","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Hand in and accept next quest","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Every Quest in City of Dalaran in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:city-of-dalaran"],"source_hashes":["section:7192b1db753e5a122669c285a30f87d7b709ce53","section:833ffb142d3f33ea7193ec965187c006b5c0d8cf","section:871fe72f081ef1bc336f4801d223f0ac16b95f0c","section:8c7bbc9965284c3ab494e6cc0f9d2e2524c929cf"]},{"id":"mazmorra-gnomeregan-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Gnomeregan: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Gnomeregan: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 29-38 en Dun Morogh; la Alianza llega desde Forjaz y la Horda puede teletransportarse.","summary_en":"Level 29-38 in Dun Morogh; Alliance approaches from Ironforge and Horde can teleport in.","keywords_es":["entrada de Gnomeregan","cómo llegar a Gnomeregan","teletransporte de Gnomeregan","llave del taller"],"keywords_en":["Gnomeregan entrance","how to reach Gnomeregan","Gnomeregan teleport","Workshop Key"],"text_es":"Gnomeregan se recomienda para niveles 29-38 y está en Dun Morogh; la Alianza llega viajando al oeste desde Forjaz. La Horda puede iniciar la cadena con Sovik en Orgrimmar, tomar el barco desde Trinquete a Bahía del Botín y completarla con Pedrito para usar el Transpondedor goblin. El depósito de trenes tiene una entrada frontal y otra trasera: esta última requiere la Llave de taller o un Pícaro con 150 puntos de Ganzúa.","text_en":"Gnomeregan is recommended for levels 29-38 in Dun Morogh; Alliance approaches by traveling west from Ironforge. Horde can start the chain with Sovik in Orgrimmar, take the boat from Ratchet to Booty Bay, and complete it with Scooty to use the Goblin Transponder. The Train Depot has a front and a back entrance; the latter requires the Workshop Key or a Rogue with 150 Lockpicking.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Gnomeregan Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Gnomeregan in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Chief Engineer Scooty & Gnomer-gooooone!","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:gnomeregan"],"source_hashes":["guide:de36979c78b1121c3dad84ad593023535076926a","section:09719f91a9f5b04a89de113da16de1433465a7a3","section:18ad5e57efa55fd2034aee8b4a42413c871618d0"]},{"id":"mazmorra-gnomeregan-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Gnomeregan","title_en":"Recommended Gnomeregan Quests","summary_es":"Recoge misiones de Alianza en Forjaz y activa la cadena de teletransporte de la Horda antes de entrar.","summary_en":"Pick up Alliance quests in Ironforge and start the Horde teleport chain before entering.","keywords_es":["misiones de Gnomeregan","misiones de Alianza","misiones de Horda","teletransporte goblin"],"keywords_en":["Gnomeregan quests","Alliance quests","Horde quests","Goblin teleport"],"text_es":"La Alianza puede recoger ¡Salva el cerebro de Techrobot! con el Maestro manitas Sobrechispa en Forjaz; la misión pide recuperar el cerebro de Tecnobot. La gran traición se recoge con Manitas mayor Mekkatorque, también en Forjaz. Para la Horda, Las guerras de la plataforma se recoge con Nogg en Orgrimmar; Sovik ofrece después Scooty, ingeniero jefe, y Pedrito en Bahía del Botín da ¡Gnomer-yaaaaa!, que permite usar el Transpondedor goblin para teletransportarse a la mazmorra.","text_en":"Alliance can pick up Save Techbot’s Brain! from Tinkmaster Overspark and The Grand Betrayal from High Tinker Mekkatorque, both in Ironforge. For Horde, Rig Wars starts with Nogg in Orgrimmar; Sovik then offers Chief Engineer Scooty, and Scooty in Booty Bay gives Gnomer-gooooone!, which lets you use the Goblin Transponder to teleport to the dungeon.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Chief Engineer Scooty & Gnomer-gooooone!","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:gnomeregan"],"source_hashes":["guide:de36979c78b1121c3dad84ad593023535076926a","section:dacd72b167750d4d0ca171ede6e7dbcfd5621de0"]},{"id":"mazmorra-gnomeregan-grubbis","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Grubbis: evento de aparición","title_en":"Grubbis: Spawn Event","summary_es":"Inicia el evento con el Maestro Destructor Emi Plomocorto y acaba con las oleadas antes de que se cierre la cueva.","summary_en":"Start the event with Blastmaster Emi Shortfuse and clear the waves before the cave is sealed.","keywords_es":["Grubbis","evento de Grubbis","jefes de Gnomeregan"],"keywords_en":["Grubbis","Grubbis event","Gnomeregan bosses"],"text_es":"Habla con el Maestro Destructor Emi Plomocorto para activar el evento. Elimina las oleadas que salen de la cueva: Grubbis aparece en la segunda antes de que las explosiones la sellen.","text_en":"Speak to Blastmaster Emi Shortfuse to start the event. Clear the waves coming from the cave: Grubbis appears from the second one before the explosives seal it.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Grubbis","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:gnomeregan"],"source_hashes":["section:4553f84751c575f5c7a612ae5849da385eb3bdf8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-gnomeregan-radiactivo-viscoso","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Radiactivo viscoso: combate","title_en":"Viscous Fallout: Fight","summary_es":"Limpia los enemigos cercanos a Radiactivo viscoso para poder atraerlo sin adds.","summary_en":"Clear nearby enemies around Viscous Fallout so you can pull it without adds.","keywords_es":["Radiactivo viscoso","jefe de Gnomeregan","adds de mazmorra"],"keywords_en":["Viscous Fallout","Gnomeregan boss","dungeon adds"],"text_es":"Radiactivo viscoso patrulla el nivel irradiado del Salón de los Engranajes. Limpia los enemigos de alrededor antes de atraerlo para evitar sumar adds al combate.","text_en":"Viscous Fallout patrols the irradiated ground level of the Hall of Gears. Clear the surrounding enemies before pulling it to avoid adding them to the fight.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Viscous Fallout","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:gnomeregan"],"source_hashes":["section:faf980afeab60e67dc6e4dbdb506d374cf9ac4a6"]},{"id":"mazmorra-gnomeregan-electrocutor","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Electrocutor 6000: rayos","title_en":"Electrocutioner 6000: Lightning","summary_es":"Mantén al grupo separado, evita el cono de Megavoltio y vigila al tanque durante Choque.","summary_en":"Spread out, avoid Megavolt’s cone, and watch the tank during Shock.","keywords_es":["Electrocutor 6000","Megavoltio","Descarga en cadena"],"keywords_en":["Electrocutioner 6000","Megavolt","Chain Bolt"],"text_es":"El Electrocutor 6000 usa Descarga en cadena, Megavoltio y Choque. Mantén distancia entre jugadores para reducir el daño encadenado, evita el cono frontal de Megavoltio y vigila la salud del tanque durante Choque.","text_en":"Electrocutioner 6000 uses Chain Bolt, Megavolt, and Shock. Spread players out to reduce chained damage, avoid the frontal cone from Megavolt, and watch the tank’s health during Shock.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Electrocutioner 6000","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Gnomeregan Dungeon Guide › Gnomeregan Boss Strategy","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/gnomeregan-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:gnomeregan"],"source_hashes":["section:0306cafa1ca4a8886f73ea322c27c3d4fee583f6","section:fbeb16d20a28c6956c8dd606519fe13d12373193"]},{"id":"mazmorra-gnomeregan-golpeamasa","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Golpeamasa 9-60: golpes de área","title_en":"Crowd Pummeler 9-60: Area Attacks","summary_es":"Evita el cono de Machaque arqueado y aléjate de Paliza popular y Atropello.","summary_en":"Avoid Arcing Smash’s cone and move away from Crowd Pummel and Trample.","keywords_es":["Golpeamasa 9-60","Machaque arqueado","Paliza popular"],"keywords_en":["Crowd Pummeler 9-60","Arcing Smash","Crowd Pummel"],"text_es":"Enfréntate a Golpeamasa 9-60 evitando el cono frontal de Machaque arqueado. Paliza popular interrumpe a quienes lanzan hechizos cerca, y tanto esta como Atropello causan daño de área alrededor del jefe.","text_en":"Crowd Pummeler 9-60 has a frontal cone from Arcing Smash; avoid it. Crowd Pummel interrupts nearby casters, and both Crowd Pummel and Trample deal area damage around the boss.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Crowd Pummeler 9-60","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Gnomeregan Dungeon Guide › Gnomeregan Boss Strategy","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/gnomeregan-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:gnomeregan"],"source_hashes":["section:0306cafa1ca4a8886f73ea322c27c3d4fee583f6","section:134af3301069530e895d471701c3f8a19c0cb9a8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-gnomeregan-embajador-hierro-negro","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Embajador Hierro Negro: jefe raro","title_en":"Dark Iron Ambassador: Rare Boss","summary_es":"Si aparece, limpia el pasillo; interrumpe Bola de Fuego y elimina rápido a su sirviente ardiente.","summary_en":"If it spawns, clear the corridor; interrupt Fireball and quickly kill its Burning Servant.","keywords_es":["Embajador Hierro Negro","jefe raro de Gnomeregan","Bola de Fuego"],"keywords_en":["Dark Iron Ambassador","Gnomeregan rare boss","Fireball"],"text_es":"El Embajador Hierro Negro es raro y puede no aparecer; suele patrullar el pasillo norte hacia la Corte de los Manitas. Si está, despeja la zona antes de combatir, interrumpe Bola de Fuego y elimina al sirviente ardiente que invoque.","text_en":"Dark Iron Ambassador is a rare spawn and may not appear; it tends to patrol the north side of the tunnel leading to the Tinkers’ Court. If present, clear the area before engaging, interrupt Fireball, and kill any Burning Servant it summons.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Dark Iron Ambassador (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Gnomeregan Dungeon Guide › Gnomeregan Boss Strategy","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/gnomeregan-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:gnomeregan"],"source_hashes":["section:0306cafa1ca4a8886f73ea322c27c3d4fee583f6","section:ab419433f1e3f96d1fd685de422b7a69280efa28"]},{"id":"mazmorra-gnomeregan-termochufe","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mekigeniero Termochufe: bombas","title_en":"Mekgineer Thermaplugg: Bombs","summary_es":"Desactiva los seis dispensadores de bombas o destruye las bombas andantes antes de que alcancen al grupo.","summary_en":"Disable the six bomb dispensers or destroy the Walking Bombs before they reach the group.","keywords_es":["Mekigeniero Termochufe","bombas andantes","dispensadores de Gnomeregan"],"keywords_en":["Mekgineer Thermaplugg","Walking Bombs","Gnomeregan dispensers"],"text_es":"Los seis dispensadores de Mekigeniero Termochufe generan bombas andantes. El grupo puede destruirlas antes de que lleguen o asignar a alguien para pulsar el botón a la derecha de cada dispensador; el jefe también puede apartar al tanque con Mamporro.","text_en":"Six dispensers in the final room spawn Walking Bombs. The group can destroy them before they reach the party or assign someone to press the button on the right side of each dispenser; the boss can also knock the tank away with Knock Away.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Mekgineer Thermaplugg","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Gnomeregan Dungeon Guide › Gnomeregan Boss Strategy","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/gnomeregan-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:gnomeregan"],"source_hashes":["section:0306cafa1ca4a8886f73ea322c27c3d4fee583f6","section:0e8f9220f9a645dc1dc9b86917bd4037f9dd42da"]},{"id":"mazmorra-gnomeregan-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Gnomeregan","title_en":"Gnomeregan Rewards","summary_es":"Entre los botines destacados están Garras Grubbis, Botos ácidos y el Manual de Muchedumbre de Puñetazos.","summary_en":"Notable drops include Grubbis Paws, Acidic Walkers, and Manual Crowd Pummeler.","keywords_es":["botín de Gnomeregan","Garras Grubbis","Botos ácidos","Manual de Muchedumbre de Puñetazos"],"keywords_en":["Gnomeregan loot","Grubbis Paws","Acidic Walkers","Manual Crowd Pummeler"],"text_es":"Entre los botines de los jefes están Garras Grubbis y Botos ácidos. También destacan Manual de Muchedumbre de Puñetazos y Núcleo central de Termochufe.","text_en":"Boss drops include Grubbis Paws and Acidic Walkers. Manual Crowd Pummeler and Thermaplugg’s Central Core are also notable.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gnomeregan Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Gnomeregan Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/gnomeregan-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:gnomeregan"],"source_hashes":["section:b4158b348bb65b9eab77b0600906fe6b170553dc"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Horado Rajacieno: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Razorfen Kraul: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 30-40, al sur de Los Baldíos; la Horda llega desde Camp Taurajo y la Alianza puede ir por Trinquete.","summary_en":"Level 30-40 in the southern Barrens; Horde approaches from Camp Taurajo and Alliance can travel via Ratchet.","keywords_es":["entrada del Horado Rajacieno","nivel Horado Rajacieno","cómo llegar al Horado Rajacieno","mazmorra en Los Baldíos"],"keywords_en":["Razorfen Kraul entrance","Razorfen Kraul level","how to reach Razorfen Kraul","Barrens dungeon"],"text_es":"El Horado Rajacieno se recomienda para niveles 30-40. La entrada está en el sur de Los Baldíos, poco antes del Gran Elevador. La Horda puede volar a Campamento Taurajo y avanzar hacia el sur, girando al oeste antes del elevador. La Alianza puede tomar un barco hasta Trinquete; las rutas de acceso implican trayectos largos o cruzar una zona peligrosa a bajo nivel.","text_en":"Razorfen Kraul is recommended for levels 30-40. Its entrance is in the southern part of the Barrens, just before the Great Lift. Horde can fly to Camp Taurajo and head south, turning west before the lift. Alliance can take a boat to Ratchet; the approaches involve long travel or crossing a dangerous area at low level.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Razorfen Kraul Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Razorfen Kraul in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["section:4bb299065f9908399ba361c5a24eed3622699c0d","section:8c8824876f35f36b0799e71a4dfbcde385eb9ffa"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables del Horado Rajacieno","title_en":"Recommended Razorfen Kraul Quests","summary_es":"Misiones previas en Los Baldíos, Entrañas y Cima del Trueno; la cadena de Alianza empieza junto al Gran Elevador.","summary_en":"Before entering, pick up quests in the Barrens, Undercity, or Thunder Bluff; an Alliance chain starts by the Great Lift.","keywords_es":["misiones del Horado Rajacieno","Los tubérculos hojazul","Guano del Horado","La bruja del Horado"],"keywords_en":["Razorfen Kraul quests","Blueleaf Tubers","Going Going Guano","The Crone of the Kraul"],"text_es":"La Horda puede recoger Guano del Horado con el Maestro boticario Faranell en Entrañas y Un destino vengador con Auld Picopiedra en Cima del Trueno. Para la Alianza, La bruja del Horado requiere primero El diario de Henrig Soliceja: recoge el diario junto al Gran Elevador y sigue la cadena con Díscolo Falfildel. Los tubérculos hojazul empieza con Mebok Mizzyrix en Trinquete; recoge allí los tres objetos necesarios. Decaída mortal se acepta dentro, con Heralath Arroyobarbecho.","text_en":"Horde can pick up Going, Going, Guano! from Master Apothecary Faranell in Undercity and A Vengeful Fate from Auld Stonespire in Thunder Bluff. Alliance can take The Crone of the Kraul after Lonebrow’s Journal: loot the journal by the Great Lift, then continue the chain with Falfindel Waywarder. Blueleaf Tubers starts with Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet; collect its three required items there. Mortality Wanes is accepted inside from Heralath Fallowbrook.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blueleaf Tubers","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Crone of the Kraul","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › A Vengeful Fate","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Going, Going, Guano!","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Mortality Wanes","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["guide:26b786610d8a153ffe5cbfa4027f2115b249baff","section:5e4dbe723bd9f840317f4a7ce1a73261a15233c2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-roogug","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Roogug: limpia los enemigos cercanos","title_en":"Roogug: Clear Nearby Enemies","summary_es":"Roogug es opcional; limpia la zona y controla al elemental cercano para reducir el daño al tanque.","summary_en":"Roogug is optional; clear the area and control the nearby elemental to reduce damage to the tank.","keywords_es":["Roogug","jefe opcional de Horado Rajacieno","elemental de tierra"],"keywords_en":["Roogug","optional Razorfen Kraul boss","Earth Elemental"],"text_es":"Roogug es opcional y forma parte de misiones de clase de Guerrero. Antes de atacarlo, limpia los enemigos de alrededor y controla los que puedas; si hay un Brujo, puede desterrar al elemental cercano para reducir el daño recibido por el tanque.","text_en":"Roogug is optional and is part of Warrior class quests. Before engaging, clear the surrounding enemies and control what you can; a Warlock can Banish the nearby elemental to reduce damage to the tank.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Roogug","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["section:e668aff97b8408a46796bc5999f6cd725d763451"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-aggem","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Aggem Malaespina: elimina al jabalí","title_en":"Aggem Thorncurse: Kill the Boar","summary_es":"Cuando Aggem invoque al espíritu de jabalí, elimínalo antes de volver a atacar al jefe.","summary_en":"When Aggem summons the Boar Spirit, kill it before switching back to the boss.","keywords_es":["Aggem Malaespina","espíritu de jabalí","jefes de Horado Rajacieno"],"keywords_en":["Aggem Thorncurse","Boar Spirit","Razorfen Kraul bosses"],"text_es":"Aggem Malaespina puede invocar un espíritu de jabalí durante el combate. Cambia el objetivo para derrotar primero al espíritu y después vuelve al jefe.","text_en":"Aggem Thorncurse can summon a Boar Spirit during the fight. Switch targets to defeat the spirit first, then return to the boss.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Aggem Thorncurse","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["section:6e97257f9dd0fd89fa163a95dd9c759bf29a033a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-jargba","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Médium Jargba: controla a sus acompañantes","title_en":"Death Speaker Jargba: Control the Adds","summary_es":"Controla a los dos lanzadores que acompañan a Jargba y acaba rápido con él para evitar Dominación mental.","summary_en":"Control Jargba’s two caster adds and defeat him quickly to prevent Dominate Mind.","keywords_es":["Médium Jargba","Dominación mental","jefes de Horado Rajacieno"],"keywords_en":["Death Speaker Jargba","Dominate Mind","Razorfen Kraul bosses"],"text_es":"Médium Jargba aparece con dos enemigos lanzadores que causan mucho daño. Controla a uno o a ambos si puedes, elimina pronto a Jargba para reducir el peligro de Dominar mente y luego acaba con los demás.","text_en":"Death Speaker Jargba comes with two caster enemies that deal heavy damage. Control one or both if possible, kill Jargba quickly to reduce the Dominate Mind threat, then finish the others.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Death Speaker Jargba","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["section:ce5004724fa17e555160368aba8c0638378b9582"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-colmicarnero","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Señor Supremo Colmicarnero: controla los adds","title_en":"Overlord Ramtusk: Control the Adds","summary_es":"Controla a los dos Cuerolanza de Rajacieno y centra el daño en Colmicarnero, que golpea con fuerza.","summary_en":"Control the two Razorfen Spearhides and focus Ramtusk, who hits hard.","keywords_es":["Señor Supremo Colmicarnero","Cuerolanza de Rajacieno","daño al tanque"],"keywords_en":["Overlord Ramtusk","Razorfen Spearhide","tank damage"],"text_es":"El Señor Supremo Colmicarnero inflige mucho daño de un solo objetivo y lucha junto a dos adds peligrosos. Controla a ambos si es posible y concentra el daño en el jefe.","text_en":"Overlord Ramtusk deals heavy single-target damage and fights beside two dangerous adds. Crowd-control both if possible and focus damage on the boss.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Overlord Ramtusk","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["section:a0fe28d398b549d0b16d9e16314fd19bd8c9db32"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-agathelos","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Agathelos el Furioso: protege al tanque","title_en":"Agathelos the Raging: Protect the Tank","summary_es":"Agathelos causa mucho daño a un objetivo; el sanador debe centrarse en mantener vivo al tanque.","summary_en":"Agathelos deals heavy single-target damage; the healer should focus on keeping the tank alive.","keywords_es":["Agathelos el Furioso","daño al tanque","jefes de Horado Rajacieno"],"keywords_en":["Agathelos the Raging","tank damage","Razorfen Kraul bosses"],"text_es":"Agathelos el Furioso es un combate sencillo, pero inflige mucho daño a un solo objetivo. El sanador y quienes puedan curar como apoyo deben ayudar a mantener vivo al tanque.","text_en":"Agathelos the Raging is a straightforward fight, but he deals heavy single-target damage. The healer and any party members able to off-heal should help keep the tank alive.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Agathelos the Raging","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["section:e0bd61eda3f683ab1e30b6bf5f6011aa5152ce3a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-cazador-ciego","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cazador ciego: detén los lanzamientos","title_en":"Blind Hunter: Stop Casting","summary_es":"Este jefe raro puede no aparecer; cuando lance Ráfaga sónica, los lanzadores deben dejar de lanzar hechizos.","summary_en":"This rare boss may not spawn; casters should stop casting when it begins Sonic Burst.","keywords_es":["Cazador ciego","jefe raro de Horado Rajacieno","Ráfaga sónica"],"keywords_en":["Blind Hunter","Razorfen Kraul rare boss","Sonic Burst"],"text_es":"El Cazador ciego es raro y aparece en la Cueva de los Murciélagos, pero puede no estar en cada visita. Cuando empiece a lanzar Ráfaga sónica, los lanzadores deben dejar de lanzar hechizos para evitar su silencio de área.","text_en":"Blind Hunter is a rare boss in the Bat Cave and may not be present on every run. When it begins casting Sonic Burst, casters should stop casting to avoid its area silence.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blind Hunter (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Razorfen Kraul Dungeon Guide › Razorfen Kraul Boss Strategy","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/razorfen-kraul-guide","date":"2026-10-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["section:25faf11bacf51bf846a15d5d3678ba90dc8dd509","section:2ee6021c09229fd07292b0d04ea670fad2e6f921"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-halmgar","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clamor de Tierra Halmgar: controla el elemental","title_en":"Earthcaller Halmgar: Control the Elemental","summary_es":"Si aparece el jefe raro, limpia la plataforma, prioriza sus tótems y controla al elemental.","summary_en":"If the rare boss spawns, clear the platform, prioritize his totems, and control the elemental.","keywords_es":["Clamor de Tierra Halmgar","jefe raro de Horado Rajacieno","Tótem Nexo Terrestre"],"keywords_en":["Earthcaller Halmgar","Razorfen Kraul rare boss","Earthbind Totem"],"text_es":"Clamor de Tierra Halmgar es un jefe raro. Limpia la plataforma antes del combate y prioriza sus tótems; si hay un Brujo, puede desterrar al elemental, o el grupo puede derrotar primero al elemental y luego al jefe.","text_en":"Earthcaller Halmgar is a rare boss. Clear the platform before engaging and prioritize his totems; a Warlock can Banish the elemental, or the group can kill the elemental before Halmgar.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Earthcaller Halmgar","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["section:0721d4d29d1cc13d7e3e7f4435b1a5674d575137"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-charlga","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Charlga Filonavaja: interrumpe sus hechizos","title_en":"Charlga Razorflank: Interrupt Her Spells","summary_es":"Baja a Charlga de su choza, sepárate del grupo e interrumpe sus lanzamientos; puede volverse inmune y curarse.","summary_en":"Pull Charlga down from her hut, spread out, and interrupt her casts; she can become immune and heal.","keywords_es":["Charlga Filonavaja","jefe final del Horado Rajacieno","interrumpir hechizos"],"keywords_en":["Charlga Razorflank","Razorfen Kraul final boss","interrupt casts"],"text_es":"Charlga Filonavaja es una lanzadora con poca armadura, pero causa bastante daño. Atráela desde la choza a la plataforma inferior, separa al grupo e interrumpe sus hechizos; a veces se vuelve inmune y se cura.","text_en":"Charlga Razorflank is a caster with low armor but deals substantial damage. Pull her from the hut to the platform below, spread the group, and interrupt her casts; she sometimes becomes immune and heals.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Charlga Razorflank","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["section:cc388e16c02c47995af5a62091b79a80e444d081"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas del Horado Rajacieno","title_en":"Razorfen Kraul Rewards","summary_es":"Entre los botines destacados están Pincho de espinas, Togas de médium y Crea cadáveres.","summary_en":"Notable drops include Thornspike, Death Speaker Robes, and Corpsemaker.","keywords_es":["botín del Horado Rajacieno","Pincho de espinas","Togas de médium","Crea cadáveres"],"keywords_en":["Razorfen Kraul loot","Thornspike","Death Speaker Robes","Corpsemaker"],"text_es":"Entre los botines de los jefes están Pincho de espinas y Togas de médium. También destacan Crea cadáveres y Garra de Agamaggan.","text_en":"Boss drops include Thornspike and Death Speaker Robes. Corpsemaker and Agamaggan’s Clutch are also notable.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Kraul Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Razorfen Kraul Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razerfen-kraul-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-kraul"],"source_hashes":["section:880a270434035d5becc265f2defaaf4c22e73e50"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-graveyard-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Monasterio Escarlata: Cementerio","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard","summary_es":"Nivel 26-36; portal izquierdo sin llave. La Horda llega desde Entrañas; la Alianza cruza desde Laderas de Trabalomas.","summary_en":"Level 26-36; left portal, no key. Horde comes from Undercity; Alliance crosses from Hillsbrad Foothills.","keywords_es":["cementerio del monasterio escarlata","nivel del cementerio escarlata","entrada del cementerio escarlata","cómo llegar al monasterio escarlata"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery graveyard","graveyard level range","graveyard entrance","how to reach scarlet monastery"],"text_es":"El Cementerio es el ala más sencilla del Monasterio Escarlata, recomendada para niveles 26-36 y poblada sobre todo por no-muertos. Su portal está a la izquierda del salón central y no requiere llave. La Horda puede partir de Entrañas; la Alianza puede llegar desde Laderas de Trabalomas, cruzando a nado el lago hasta Tirisfal y siguiendo hacia el este y luego al noreste.","text_en":"The Graveyard is the easiest Scarlet Monastery wing, recommended for levels 26-36 and populated mostly by undead. Its portal is to the left of the central hall and requires no key. Horde can start from Undercity; Alliance can travel from Hillsbrad Foothills, swim across the lake to Tirisfal, then head east and northeast.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Scarlet Monastery Graveyard Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of the Scarlet Monastery in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-graveyard"],"source_hashes":["section:59264f2466bc3dd6c9e28157eb896c8cb9678939","section:dae0ecb060f5076b5d976b0ea4e70cc4c099e27a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-graveyard-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones del Cementerio Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Graveyard Quests","summary_es":"Prepara Corazones de fervor y La venganza de Vorrel; también hay cadenas que abarcan varias alas.","summary_en":"Prepare Hearts of Zeal and Vorrel’s Revenge; other quest chains span several wings.","keywords_es":["misiones del cementerio escarlata","Corazones de fervor","La venganza de Vorrel","En el nombre de la Luz","misiones Horda y Alianza"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery graveyard quests","Hearts of Zeal","Vorrel’s Revenge","In the Name of the Light","Horde and Alliance quests"],"text_es":"De Horda, En el Monasterio Escarlata se recoge con Varimathras en Entrañas y abarca objetivos de varias alas. La venganza de Vorrel empieza dentro del Cementerio y continúa en Montañas de Alterac. Corazones de fervor se obtiene con el Maestro boticario Faranell en Entrañas, tras Guano del Horado en Horado Rajacieno. La Alianza puede preparar En el nombre de la Luz con Raleigh el Devoto en Laderas de Trabalomas; la cadena empieza con Hermano Antón.","text_en":"Available to Horde characters, Into the Scarlet Monastery starts with Varimathras in Undercity and spans several wings. Vorrel’s Revenge begins inside the Graveyard and continues in the Alterac Mountains. Hearts of Zeal is picked up from Master Apothecary Faranell in Undercity, after Going, Going, Guano! in Razorfen Kraul. Alliance can prepare In the Name of the Light with Raleigh the Devout in Hillsbrad Foothills; its chain starts with Brother Anton.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Every Quest in Scarlet Monastery Graveyard in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-graveyard"],"source_hashes":["section:95cb9b04998f6fa0362a6b8e6f3e97ccb2f30c91","section:ba3bd1debf2d4e9791e95b182de28f34a0596898"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-graveyard-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes del Cementerio Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Graveyard Bosses","summary_es":"Vigila las áreas de fuego de Thalnos, el miedo de Azshir y el veneno de Dorsacerado.","summary_en":"Watch Thalnos’s fire areas, Azshir’s fear, and Ironspine’s poison.","keywords_es":["jefes del cementerio escarlata","estrategia Interrogador Vishas","Mago sangriento Thalnos","Azshir el Insomne","Dorsacerado"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery graveyard bosses","Interrogator Vishas strategy","Bloodmage Thalnos","Azshir the Sleepless","Ironspine"],"text_es":"Interrogador Vishas usa Inmolar; evita atraer enemigos adicionales. Mago sangriento Thalnos inflige mucho daño mágico y lanza áreas de fuego, así que los atacantes a distancia deben separarse y hay que vigilar al tanque y al cuerpo a cuerpo. Azshir el Insomne puede provocar miedo: despeja la zona antes de combatirlo. Campeón caído usa Mellar; los DPS deben colocarse detrás. Dorsacerado lanza Nube de veneno, por lo que el sanador debe vigilar la salud del grupo.","text_en":"Interrogator Vishas uses Immolate; avoid pulling extra enemies. Bloodmage Thalnos deals heavy magic damage and casts fire areas, so ranged players should spread out and the tank and melee need attention. Azshir the Sleepless can fear the group, so clear the area before engaging. Fallen Champion uses Cleave; DPS should stand behind him. Ironspine casts Poison Cloud, so the healer should watch the party’s health.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Interrogator Vishas","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bloodmage Thalnos","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Azshir the Sleepless","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Fallen Champion","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ironspine","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-graveyard"],"source_hashes":["section:1f2e7e43f663a898b6fe941830d271f76fdbd701","section:37876a7d7aa1f924b484ced7b4b6cecc082d2629","section:58e1fe59aa4c2c4cbd17660fc7c01acb4d6414e8","section:c2f022d5dd9dbbc7b6894595b66af0c29670bfd3","section:d5f654a7cec95589245b06c6144b5865c638e701"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-graveyard-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas del Cementerio Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Graveyard Rewards","summary_es":"Destacan los Nudillos de latón sangrientos, el Manto de mago de sangre y el Orbe del profeta olvidado.","summary_en":"Notable items include Bloody Brass Knuckles, Bloodmage Mantle, and Orb of the Forgotten Seer.","keywords_es":["recompensas del cementerio escarlata","Nudillos de latón sangrientos","Atizador de tortura","Manto de mago de sangre","Orbe del profeta olvidado"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery graveyard rewards","Bloody Brass Knuckles","Torturing Poker","Bloodmage Mantle","Orb of the Forgotten Seer"],"text_es":"Interrogador Vishas puede dejar los Nudillos de latón sangrientos o el Atizador de tortura. De Mago sangriento Thalnos destacan el Manto de mago de sangre y el Orbe del profeta olvidado.","text_en":"Interrogator Vishas can drop Bloody Brass Knuckles or Torturing Poker. Notable drops from Bloodmage Thalnos include Bloodmage Mantle and Orb of the Forgotten Seer.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Scarlet Monastery Graveyard Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-graveyard-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-graveyard"],"source_hashes":["section:1a7c76e1e6c1b71126d677da9f312fd364457087"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-library-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Monasterio Escarlata: Biblioteca","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery: Library","summary_es":"Nivel 29-39; portal derecho sin llave. La Horda llega desde Entrañas y la Alianza desde Laderas de Trabalomas.","summary_en":"Level 29-39; right portal, no key. Horde comes from Undercity and Alliance from Hillsbrad Foothills.","keywords_es":["biblioteca del monasterio escarlata","nivel de la biblioteca escarlata","entrada de la biblioteca escarlata","llave Escarlata"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery library","library level range","library entrance","Scarlet Key"],"text_es":"La Biblioteca es el ala de nivel 29-39 del Monasterio Escarlata. Su portal está a la derecha del salón central y no requiere llave; la Llave Escarlata se obtiene aquí, en la caja fuerte cercana a Arcanista Doan, y abre las alas de la Armería y la Catedral. Arcanista Doan es el jefe final. La Horda puede partir de Entrañas; la Alianza puede cruzar desde Laderas de Trabalomas hasta Tirisfal y seguir hacia el este y el noreste.","text_en":"The Library is the level 29-39 wing of Scarlet Monastery. Its portal is to the right of the central hall and requires no key; the Scarlet Key is obtained here, from the strongbox near Arcanist Doan, and opens the Armory and Cathedral wings. Arcanist Doan is the final boss. Horde can start from Undercity; Alliance can cross from Hillsbrad Foothills to Tirisfal, then head east and northeast.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Library Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Scarlet Monastery Library Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-library-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Library Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of the Scarlet Monastery in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-library-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-library"],"source_hashes":["section:791f532bd0f04c79d4b3187d940c16353b98158b","section:d9cce8b7e8af1b9afa782e8db99bc69687dd339a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-library-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de la Biblioteca Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Library Quests","summary_es":"Prepara Mitología de los Titanes, El Compendio de los Caídos o Prueba de conocimiento; los magos tienen otra cadena.","summary_en":"Prepare Mythology of the Titans, Compendium of the Fallen, or Test of Lore; mages have another chain.","keywords_es":["misiones de la biblioteca escarlata","Mitología de los Titanes","El Compendio de los Caídos","Rituales de poder","Fuera de plazo"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery library quests","Mythology of the Titans","Compendium of the Fallen","Rituals of Power","Past Due"],"text_es":"Hay 3 de Alianza, 4 de Horda y una cadena para magos. Mitología de los Titanes se recoge con la Bibliotecaria Mae Palipolvo en Forjaz; Fuera de plazo, en Dalaran, en Montañas de Alterac. El Compendio de los Caídos empieza con el Sabio Buscaverdad en Cima del Trueno (no para no-muertos); Corazones de fervor, con el Maestro boticario Faranell en Entrañas; En el Monasterio Escarlata, también allí. Prueba de conocimiento comienza con Prueba de fe y Dorn Acechallanos en Las Mil Agujas y continúa en Entrañas. Rituales de poder (magos, nivel 30) empieza con Secretos escondidos en Marjal Revolcafango.","text_en":"There are 3 Alliance and 4 Horde quests, plus a mage chain. Mythology of the Titans starts with Librarian Mae Paledust in Ironforge; Past Due starts in Dalaran in the Alterac Mountains. Compendium of the Fallen starts with Sage Truthseeker in Thunder Bluff (not for Undead); Hearts of Zeal starts with Master Apothecary Faranell in Undercity; Into the Scarlet Monastery also starts there. Test of Lore begins with Test of Faith and Dorn Plainstalker in Thousand Needles, then continues in Undercity. Rituals of Power (mages, level 30) starts with Hidden Secrets in Dustwallow Marsh.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Library Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-library-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Library Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Every Quest in Scarlet Monastery Library in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-library-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-library"],"source_hashes":["section:05184e6925a0856fb7710a0cbab2ba6d1a70b1e5","section:ac71c640d893426dc66985b91d0224ed7e1f01b4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-library-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de la Biblioteca Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Library Bosses","summary_es":"Elimina los sabuesos de Loksey antes de centrarse en él y huye de la Detonación de Doan.","summary_en":"Kill Loksey’s hounds before focusing him, and run from Doan’s Detonation.","keywords_es":["jefes de la biblioteca escarlata","Domador de jaurías Loksey","Arcanista Doan","Detonación de Doan"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery library bosses","Houndmaster Loksey","Arcanist Doan","Doan Detonation"],"text_es":"Domador de jaurías Loksey está acompañado por tres sabuesos: controla uno, derrota a los otros y luego céntrate en el jefe, que usa Ansia de sangre cuando tiene poca salud. Con Arcanista Doan, aléjate hacia los bordes cuando lance Detonación; también inflige daño de área y puede usar Silencio.","text_en":"Houndmaster Loksey is accompanied by three hounds: control one, defeat the others, then focus the boss, who uses Bloodlust at low health. Arcanist Doan can be tanked in the center; move to the edges when he casts Detonation; he also deals area damage and can use Silence.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Library Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Houndmaster Loksey","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-library-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Library Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Arcanist Doan","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-library-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-library"],"source_hashes":["section:718835d67354ced19207d66cdff30a1991742d9e","section:ab8657ce98616cc7bd9ea593abe7d2f45d2f2887"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-library-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de la Biblioteca Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Library Rewards","summary_es":"Destacan la Vara ilusionaria, la Hoja hipnótica y las piezas del conjunto de Doan.","summary_en":"Notable rewards include the Illusionary Rod, Hypnotic Blade, and Doan’s set pieces.","keywords_es":["recompensas de la biblioteca escarlata","Vara ilusionaria","Hoja hipnótica","Manto de Doan","Toga de Doan"],"keywords_en":["scarlet monastery library rewards","Illusionary Rod","Hypnotic Blade","Mantle of Doan","Robe of Doan"],"text_es":"Entre los botines de Arcanista Doan destacan la Vara ilusionaria, la Hoja hipnótica, el Manto de Doan y la Toga de Doan. También destaca el Silbato para perros.","text_en":"Notable drops from Arcanist Doan include the Illusionary Rod, Hypnotic Blade, Mantle of Doan, and Robe of Doan. Another notable reward is the Dog Whistle.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Library Dungeon Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Scarlet Monastery Library Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-library-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-library"],"source_hashes":["section:f313621e9294e1b4aab08b03a8907fd60937aa79"]},{"id":"mazmorra-excavation-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de Excavación","title_en":"Excavation Site Bosses","summary_es":"Despeja la zona de Espinasal, controla los acompañantes de Sombradiente y ralentiza al Guardián.","summary_en":"Clear Saltspine’s area, control Shadetooth’s adds, and slow the Guardian.","keywords_es":["jefes de excavación","espinasal","sombradiente","guardián de reliquias","estrategia excavación"],"keywords_en":["excavation site bosses","saltspine","shadetooth","relic guardian","excavation strategy"],"text_es":"Limpia los enemigos cercanos antes de Espinasal y aléjate de su Tormenta de polvo si lanzas hechizos. Sombradiente llega con dos acompañantes: contrólalos o elimínalos antes; su miedo puede atraer raptores de la hierba, así que despeja el área. Activa al Guardián de reliquias con el panel archivístico; ralentízalo y usa control para reducir la presión sobre el tanque.","text_en":"Clear nearby enemies before Saltspine and move away from Dust Storm if you cast spells. Shadetooth comes with two adds: control or kill them first; his fear can draw raptors from the grass, so clear the area. Press the panel beside the inactive Relic Guardian to begin the fight; slow it and use crowd control to ease pressure on the tank.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Excavation Site Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Saltspine","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/excavation-site-wetlands-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Excavation Site Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Shadetooth","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/excavation-site-wetlands-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Excavation Site Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Relic Guardian","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/excavation-site-wetlands-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:excavation-site-wetlands"],"source_hashes":["section:78000c8454fd32a204ffd8c07fc341e70beb1dda","section:a7ed0ed5dc7c83272c8b320a97365cb21a95d52d","section:bcd646428301e139759bf4536cd303b9b99c48f4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-excavation-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Excavación","title_en":"Excavation Site Rewards","summary_es":"Las misiones de reliquias ofrecen armas; Cambio de paladar y Tejido en el corazón dan una cartera.","summary_en":"The relic quests offer weapons; Changing Tastes and Heartwoven reward a satchel.","keywords_es":["recompensas de excavación","bastón de sanador","martillo arrojadizo","cartera de pociones","reliquia titánica"],"keywords_en":["excavation rewards","healer staff","heavehammer","satchel of potions","titan relic"],"text_es":"Eco terráneo y Prisma prehistórico ofrecen elegir entre el Bastón de sanador y el Martillo arrojadizo. Cambio de paladar y Tejido en el corazón recompensan con una Cartera de pociones. Para iniciar la cadena de reliquias, se obtiene la Reliquia titánica dentro de la mazmorra.","text_en":"Earthen Echo and Prehistoric Prism offer a choice between Healer’s Staff and Heavehammer. Changing Tastes and Heartwoven reward a Satchel of Potions. Titan Relic, needed to start the relic quest chain is found inside the dungeon.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Excavation Site Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/excavation-site-wetlands-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Excavation Site Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lost Relic Carry","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/excavation-site-wetlands-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Excavation Site Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/excavation-site-wetlands-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:excavation-site-wetlands"],"source_hashes":["section:2c40f66abfc00cdde0d1db3180163195141836bf","section:775887e4c5793264783c973a87af78a3d2b17b24","section:f477135a6e34e37bcc768d9df0c25c61b6af3b55"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dalaran-jefes-cloacas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de Dalaran: cloacas","title_en":"Dalaran Bosses: Sewers","summary_es":"Elimina los esqueletos de Atrexis y evita el rayo giratorio de la Anomalía y los adds del Enigma.","summary_en":"Kill Atrexis’s skeletons, dodge the Anomaly’s rotating beam, and handle the Enigma’s adds.","keywords_es":["jefes de dalaran","atrexis el caballero de la tumba","anomalía arcana","enigma arcano","centinela inestable"],"keywords_en":["dalaran bosses","atrexis the grave knight","arcane anomaly","arcanic enigma","unstable sentinel"],"text_es":"Atrexis el Caballero de la Tumba invoca esqueletos; espera a que el tanque fije la amenaza antes de usar daño en área. La Anomalía Arcana barre la sala con Explosión focal: esquívala y evita los adds del borde. Contra el Enigma Arcano, elimina primero los Fantasmas de maná, disipa Manamorfo y mantén al sanador lejos del Silencio. Aléjate cuando el Centinela inestable prepara Avería, que daña a quienes están a 25 yardas.","text_en":"Atrexis the Grave Knight summons skeletons; let the tank establish threat before using area damage. Arcane Anomaly sweeps the room with Focal Blast: dodge it and avoid the adds at the edge. Arcanic Enigma is accompanied by adds; kill Mana Phantoms first, dispel Manamorph, and keep the healer away from Silence. Unstable Sentinel uses Malfunction; anyone within 25 yards takes damage, so move away.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Atrexis the Grave Knight","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Arcane Anomaly","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Arcanic Enigma","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Unstable Sentinel","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:city-of-dalaran"],"source_hashes":["section:30d8f61e6b23fcd0ae5f33d6d6c9e2acce0c6351","section:a2e215cff02b3a1cfca94b85a88ab365ce7009cf","section:b4891f6c527e94da0e620d327afb7b57e3b0b8a6","section:c86328cdc7d2efa2743ea63b23d8c5054b093193"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dalaran-jefes-superficie","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de Dalaran: superficie","title_en":"Dalaran Bosses: Surface","summary_es":"Limpia la zona del Devorador, rompe raíces del Anciano y esquiva los ataques de Lyn y la Sombra.","summary_en":"Clear the Devourer’s area, break the Ancient’s roots, and dodge Lyn and the Shade’s attacks.","keywords_es":["jefes de dalaran","devorador de maná","anciano vil","lyn el ignorado","sombra del archimago"],"keywords_en":["dalaran bosses","mana devourer","fel ancient","lyn the ignored","shade of the archmage"],"text_es":"Limpia todos los enemigos antes del Devorador de maná: Debilitar daña al grupo y drena maná. En el Anciano vil, sal de las áreas de Maderas viles y rompe las raíces de Enredar. La Maldición de espinas de Lyn el Ignorado daña a quien ataca; disípala y elimina sus esqueletos. Contra la Sombra del archimago, sepárate para evitar Maná rebotador; al agotarse su maná, usa Polimorfia en masa y Evocación.","text_en":"Clear all enemies before Mana Devourer: Debilitate damages the group and drains mana. Fel Ancient creates Fel Timbers; leave Fel Timbers and break free from Entangle. Lyn the Ignored applies Curse of Thorns, which damages attackers; dispel it and kill his skeletons. Spread out against Shade of the Archmage to avoid Bounding Mana; when his mana runs out, he uses Mass Polymorph and Evocation.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Mana Devourer","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Fel Ancient","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lyn the Ignored","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Shade of the Archmage","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:city-of-dalaran"],"source_hashes":["section:411f50dba898e8b8129432d07a30348f53fbfc28","section:444abfaf4f73dfaae85f1667d0d27d73afe3df07","section:9ca65ddd8896205b3e96adfe4d60a86cadddc564","section:ec11fcb253d5c1d64ef12086a95e86f589857340"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dalaran-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Ciudad de Dalaran","title_en":"City of Dalaran Rewards","summary_es":"El Centinela deja el Plano: rueca y la Sombra del archimago, el Plano: recuperador Arcano.","summary_en":"The Sentinel drops Blueprint: Spinning Wheel; the Shade drops Blueprint: Arcane Salvager.","keywords_es":["recompensas de ciudad de dalaran","plano rueca","plano recuperador arcano","botín de dalaran"],"keywords_en":["city of dalaran rewards","spinning wheel blueprint","arcane salvager blueprint","dalaran loot"],"text_es":"Entre las recompensas destacables están el Plano: rueca, de Centinela inestable, y el Plano: recuperador Arcano, de la Sombra del archimago.","text_en":"Notable rewards include Blueprint: Spinning Wheel from Unstable Sentinel and Blueprint: Arcane Salvager from Shade of the Archmage.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: City of Dalaran Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › City of Dalaran Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/city-of-dalaran-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-09"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:city-of-dalaran"],"source_hashes":["section:34e3d909a6bd28a8e8d5108fd32545f5126136e5"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-armory-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Monasterio Escarlata: Armería","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery: Armory","summary_es":"Nivel 32-42; la puerta cerrada de la Armería exige «La llave Escarlata».","summary_en":"Levels 32-42; the locked Armory door requires the Scarlet Key.","keywords_es":["Armería del Monasterio Escarlata","nivel de la Armería Escarlata","entrada de la Armería Escarlata","La llave Escarlata"],"keywords_en":["Scarlet Monastery Armory","Armory level range","Armory entrance","Scarlet Key"],"text_es":"La Armería se recomienda para niveles 32-42. Está tras una puerta cerrada del salón al final de las escaleras del Monasterio Escarlata y exige el objeto «La llave Escarlata», que se obtiene en la Biblioteca, en la caja fuerte cercana a Arcanista Doan. La Horda llega desde Entrañas por el camino al este y luego al noreste; la Alianza puede partir de Laderas de Trabalomas, cruzar a nado el lago hasta Tirisfal y seguir hacia el este y noreste.","text_en":"The Armory is recommended for levels 32-42. It lies behind a locked door in the hall at the top of the Scarlet Monastery stairs and requires the Scarlet Key, found in the Library in the strongbox near Arcanist Doan. Horde can travel east from Undercity, then northeast; Alliance can start in Southshore, swim across the lake to Tirisfal, then head east and northeast.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery Armory Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Scarlet Monastery Armory Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-armory-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery Armory Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of the Scarlet Monastery in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-armory-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-armory"],"source_hashes":["section:4d2468bb8e5d29c8f1fdaded890b77e106a44588","section:61298b623fc4f1eddc0f987e124b4d82a24b9130"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-armory-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de la Armería Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Armory Quests","summary_es":"Prepara En el Monasterio Escarlata o En el nombre de la Luz según tu facción.","summary_en":"Prepare Into the Scarlet Monastery or In the Name of the Light for your faction.","keywords_es":["misiones de la Armería Escarlata","En el Monasterio Escarlata","En el nombre de la Luz","Corazones de fervor"],"keywords_en":["Scarlet Monastery Armory quests","Into the Scarlet Monastery","In the Name of the Light","Hearts of Zeal"],"text_es":"En el Monasterio Escarlata, misión de la Horda, se recoge con Varimathras en Entrañas e incluye objetivos de varias alas. También se puede preparar Corazones de fervor con el Maestro boticario Faranell en Entrañas, tras Guano del Horado en Horado Rajacieno. Para la Alianza, En el nombre de la Luz se obtiene con Raleigh el Devoto en Laderas de Trabalomas, después de la cadena que empieza con Hermano Antón.","text_en":"Horde can pick up Into the Scarlet Monastery from Varimathras in Undercity; its objectives span several wings. They can also prepare Hearts of Zeal with Master Apothecary Faranell in Undercity, after Going, Going, Guano! in Razorfen Kraul. Alliance can get In the Name of the Light from Raleigh the Devout in Hillsbrad Foothills, after the chain that starts with Brother Anton.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery Armory Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-armory-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery Armory Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Every Quest in Scarlet Monastery Armory in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-armory-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-armory"],"source_hashes":["section:4175aa04779bcbe7aadf07161a3fc04adb905fd4","section:feb3ca09206b5f56adf7edecdd7ae670a3dc8db1"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-armory-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de la Armería Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Armory Bosses","summary_es":"Aléjate del Huracán del jefe y agrúpate tras su derrota para afrontar a los practicantes.","summary_en":"Move away from the boss’s Whirlwind and regroup after his defeat for the trainees.","keywords_es":["jefes de la Armería Escarlata","estrategia de Herod","Huracán de Herod","Practicante Escarlata"],"keywords_en":["Scarlet Monastery Armory bosses","Herod strategy","Herod Whirlwind","Scarlet Trainees"],"text_es":"El jefe es Herod: mantenlo en el centro y coloca a los atacantes a distancia en las escaleras. Cuando empiece a girar con Huracán, se vuelve inmune a la magia: sal del centro y no intentes tanquearlo. Al derrotarlo, agrupaos para afrontar a los más de 20 Practicantes Escarlata que entran en la sala.","text_en":"The boss is Herod. Keep the boss in the center and place ranged players on the stairs. When he begins spinning with Whirlwind, he becomes immune to magic: move out of the center and do not try to tank him. After he falls, regroup to handle the more than 20 trainees who run into the room.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery Armory Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Herod, The Scarlet Champion","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-armory-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-armory"],"source_hashes":["section:bf41de3c3217e4bb37453a37b1c9d65d17468488"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-armory-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de la Armería Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Armory Rewards","summary_es":"Destacan el Yelmo de rabioso enfurecido, el Hombro de Herod y Devastador.","summary_en":"Notable rewards include Raging Berserker’s Helm, Herod’s Shoulder, and Ravager.","keywords_es":["recompensas de la Armería Escarlata","Yelmo de rabioso enfurecido","Hombro de Herod","Devastador"],"keywords_en":["Scarlet Monastery Armory rewards","Raging Berserker's Helm","Herod's Shoulder","Ravager"],"text_es":"Entre los objetos destacados del jefe están el Yelmo de rabioso enfurecido, el Hombro de Herod y Devastador. También puede caer el Tabardo de la Cruzada Escarlata de los Practicantes Escarlata.","text_en":"Notable boss drops include Raging Berserker's Helm, Herod's Shoulder, and Ravager. These trainees can also drop the Tabard of the Scarlet Crusade.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery Armory Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Scarlet Monastery Armory Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-armory-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-armory"],"source_hashes":["section:b6800fec216e44ab2bd160c2998cc360c9d6ced0"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-cathedral-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Monasterio Escarlata: Catedral","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral","summary_es":"Nivel 35-45; la puerta cerrada de la Catedral exige «La llave Escarlata».","summary_en":"Levels 35-45; the locked Cathedral door requires the Scarlet Key.","keywords_es":["Catedral del Monasterio Escarlata","nivel de la Catedral Escarlata","entrada de la Catedral Escarlata","La llave Escarlata"],"keywords_en":["Scarlet Monastery Cathedral","Cathedral level range","Cathedral entrance","Scarlet Key"],"text_es":"La Catedral se recomienda para niveles 35-45 y es el ala más difícil. Su puerta cerrada está al final de las escaleras del Monasterio Escarlata y exige el objeto «La llave Escarlata», que se obtiene en la Biblioteca, en la caja fuerte cercana a Arcanista Doan. La Horda puede llegar desde Entrañas por el camino al este y luego al noreste; la Alianza puede partir de Laderas de Trabalomas, nadar por el lago hasta Tirisfal y seguir hacia el este y noreste.","text_en":"The Cathedral is recommended for levels 35-45 and is the most difficult wing. Its locked door is at the top of the Scarlet Monastery stairs and requires the Scarlet Key, found in the Library in the strongbox near Arcanist Doan. Horde can travel east from Undercity, then northeast; Alliance can start in Southshore, swim across the lake to Tirisfal, then head east and northeast.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Scarlet Monastery Cathedral Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-cathedral-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of the Scarlet Monastery in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-cathedral-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-cathedral"],"source_hashes":["section:57543d2a972816222b8017710feec0b66102d3f4","section:9ffd74f60dd08b342dc516159b70cfdd3ff42894"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-cathedral-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de la Catedral Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Cathedral Quests","summary_es":"Prepara En el Monasterio Escarlata o En el nombre de la Luz según tu facción.","summary_en":"Prepare Into the Scarlet Monastery or In the Name of the Light for your faction.","keywords_es":["misiones de la Catedral Escarlata","En el Monasterio Escarlata","En el nombre de la Luz","Hermano Antón"],"keywords_en":["Scarlet Monastery Cathedral quests","Into the Scarlet Monastery","In the Name of the Light","Brother Anton"],"text_es":"La Horda puede recoger En el Monasterio Escarlata con Varimathras en Entrañas; sus objetivos abarcan varias alas. Para la Alianza, En el nombre de la Luz se obtiene con Raleigh el Devoto en Laderas de Trabalomas tras una cadena que empieza con Hermano Antón. Esta última misión pide derrotar a los jefes finales de varias alas, incluida la Catedral.","text_en":"Horde can take Into the Scarlet Monastery from Varimathras in Undercity; its objectives span several wings. Alliance can pick up In the Name of the Light from Raleigh the Devout in Hillsbrad Foothills after a chain that starts with Brother Anton. The quest requires defeating the final bosses of several wings, including the Cathedral.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-cathedral-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Every Quest in Scarlet Monastery Cathedral in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-cathedral-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-cathedral"],"source_hashes":["section:6e8fd3fd6329e562a09360a80954139d574a5b81","section:6ed811a8919ba347c37c5fd8ce1e0aba006515d7"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-cathedral-jefes","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefes de la Catedral Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Cathedral Bosses","summary_es":"Vigila al Comandante Escarlata Mograine y a la Alta inquisidora Melenablanca.","summary_en":"Watch Mograine’s stun and Whitemane’s Scarlet Resurrection.","keywords_es":["jefes de la Catedral Escarlata","Comandante Escarlata Mograine","Alta inquisidora Melenablanca","Resurrección Escarlata"],"keywords_en":["Scarlet Monastery Cathedral bosses","Scarlet Commander Mograine","High Inquisitor Whitemane","Scarlet Resurrection"],"text_es":"El Comandante Escarlata Mograine puede aturdir con Martillo de justicia y protegerse con Escudo divino; al caer, comienza el combate con Alta inquisidora Melenablanca. Ella inflige daño con Acometida Sagrada y, cuando está debilitada, duerme al grupo y resucita al Comandante Escarlata Mograine, además de curar a ambos. El tanque debe recoger al Comandante Escarlata Mograine; derrotad primero a Alta inquisidora Melenablanca y luego al Comandante Escarlata Mograine. Otro jefe yace en el suelo hasta que lo atacas; interrumpe su Curar y vigila Miedo, Dormir y Maldición de sangre.","text_en":"Scarlet Commander Mograine can stun with Hammer of Justice and protect himself with Divine Shield; when he falls, the fight with High Inquisitor Whitemane begins. She deals damage with Holy Smite and, when weakened, puts the party to sleep and resurrects Mograine, healing them both. The tank should pick up Mograine; defeat Whitemane first, then Mograine. Another boss lies on the ground until attacked; interrupt his Heal and watch for Fear, Sleep, and Curse of Blood.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Scarlet Commander Mograine","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-cathedral-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › High Inquisitor Whitemane","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-cathedral-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › High Inquisitor Fairbanks","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-cathedral-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-cathedral"],"source_hashes":["section:118ac93e221079a99150633ee430f02b1ac8ec65","section:3f0c98b764b08458c8fb17026d5dda077645840a","section:be07443fbbb4d48fdcdb8c211c300e6aa133804b"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scarlet-cathedral-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de la Catedral Escarlata","title_en":"Scarlet Monastery Cathedral Rewards","summary_es":"Destacan la Égida del Comandante Escarlata, el Sombrero de Melenablanca y la Mano de Rectitud.","summary_en":"Notable rewards include Aegis of the Scarlet Commander, Whitemane's Chapeau, and Hand of Righteousness.","keywords_es":["recompensas de la Catedral Escarlata","Égida del Comandante Escarlata","Sombrero de Melenablanca","Mano de Rectitud"],"keywords_en":["Scarlet Monastery Cathedral rewards","Aegis of the Scarlet Commander","Whitemane's Chapeau","Hand of Righteousness"],"text_es":"Entre los objetos destacados de los jefes están la Égida del Comandante Escarlata y el Poderío de Mograine. De Alta inquisidora Melenablanca pueden caer el Sombrero de Melenablanca, la Mano de Rectitud y el Amuleto Triune.","text_en":"Notable boss drops include the Aegis of the Scarlet Commander and Mograine's Might. High Inquisitor Whitemane can drop Whitemane's Chapeau, Hand of Righteousness, and Triune Amulet.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Scarlet Monastery Cathedral Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scarlet-monastery-cathedral-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scarlet-monastery-cathedral"],"source_hashes":["section:2cb83c90f2fb5cd2e724819bade5159fa078222e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-downs-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Zahúrda Rajacieno: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Razorfen Downs: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 37-43, en Los Baldíos; la Alianza llega desde Trinquete y la Horda desde Cima Taurajo.","summary_en":"Levels 37-43 in the Barrens; Alliance comes from Ratchet and Horde from Camp Taurajo.","keywords_es":["zahúrda rajacieno","razorfen downs","nivel de zahúrda rajacieno","entrada de zahúrda rajacieno","cómo llegar a zahúrda rajacieno"],"keywords_en":["razorfen downs","razorfen downs level","razorfen downs entrance","razorfen downs location","how to reach razorfen downs"],"text_es":"Zahúrda Rajacieno se recomienda para niveles 37-43 y está al sur de Los Baldíos, junto al límite con Las Mil Agujas. La Alianza puede tomar el barco desde Bahía del Botín a Trinquete; la Horda vuela al Campamento Taurajo. Desde allí, ve al sur y gira al este antes del Gran Elevador.","text_en":"Razorfen Downs is recommended for levels 37-43, in the southern Barrens near the Thousand Needles border. Alliance can take the boat from Booty Bay to Ratchet; Horde can fly to Camp Taurajo. From there, head south and turn east before the Great Lift.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Razorfen Downs Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Razorfen Downs in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-downs"],"source_hashes":["section:97adc3bec40136ef3f1f92d95571c72706134e9d","section:f5420bac1595d2e6b8cc130abef9f8eb3d021526"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-downs-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Zahúrda Rajacieno","title_en":"Recommended Razorfen Downs Quests","summary_es":"Recoge Trae la Luz, Acaba con la amenaza y El ojo del Gélido antes de entrar.","summary_en":"Pick up Bring the Light, Bring the End, and The Coldbringer's Eye before entering.","keywords_es":["misiones de zahúrda rajacieno","trae la luz","acaba con la amenaza","el ojo del gélido","un anfitrión del mal"],"keywords_en":["razorfen downs quests","bring the light","bring the end","the coldbringer's eye","a host of evil"],"text_es":"La Alianza puede recoger Trae la Luz con el Arzobispo Benedictus, en la Catedral de Ventormenta; la Horda, Acaba con la amenaza en Entrañas. El ojo del Gélido se obtiene con el Archimago Lan'dalock en Dalaran o Sutara Acechaprados en Mulgore. Un anfitrión del mal empieza con Myriam Lunacanta, junto a la entrada.","text_en":"Alliance can pick up Bring the Light from Archbishop Benedictus in the Cathedral of Light in Stormwind City; Horde can get Bring the End in Undercity. The Coldbringer's Eye is available from Archmage Lan'dalock in Dalaran or Sutara Plainstalker in Mulgore. A Host of Evil starts with Myriam Moonsinger beside the entrance.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bring the Light","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bring the End","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Coldbringer's Eye","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › A Host of Evil","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-downs"],"source_hashes":["guide:e1bf55dbecb8be10a0d0064408ea7e490785aa4f","section:3518296201693445cb21c22a4dafb193572c72b4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-downs-tutenkash","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tuten'kash: evita la telaraña","title_en":"Tuten'kash: Avoid the Web Spray","summary_es":"Aléjalo del grupo para reducir el efecto del Pulverizador de tela de araña.","summary_en":"Face it away from the group to reduce the impact of Web Spray.","keywords_es":["tuten'kash","jefe de las arañas de zahúrda rajacieno","pulverizador de tela de araña"],"keywords_en":["tuten'kash","razorfen downs spider boss","web spray"],"text_es":"Tuten'kash aparece tras las oleadas de arañas: vuelve a tocar el gong después de cada una. Mantén al jefe de espaldas al grupo para evitar que el Pulverizador de tela de araña alcance a todos; sus otros ataques son menos peligrosos.","text_en":"Tuten'kash appears after the spider waves; ring the gong again after each one. Face him away from the group to keep Web Spray from hitting everyone; his other attacks are less dangerous.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Tuten'kash","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-downs"],"source_hashes":["section:a70f19fdc1015e0fe71d9d3e270e31253265baa5"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-downs-mordresh","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mordresh Ojo de Fuego: interrumpe la Bola de Fuego","title_en":"Mordresh Fire Eye: Interrupt Fireball","summary_es":"Limpia los esqueletos que bailan y corta la Bola de Fuego cuando puedas.","summary_en":"Clear the dancing skeletons and interrupt Fireball when possible.","keywords_es":["mordresh ojo de fuego","bola de fuego","zahúrda rajacieno jefe"],"keywords_en":["mordresh fire eye","fireball","razorfen downs boss"],"text_es":"Elimina los esqueletos junto a la pila de huesos antes de luchar: la última oleada activa al jefe. Como tiene poca armadura, el daño cuerpo a cuerpo puede acabar con él rápido; interrumpe su Bola de Fuego, que golpea con fuerza.","text_en":"Clear the skeletons by the bone pile first; the final wave engages the boss. Its low armor makes it vulnerable to melee damage, and its hard-hitting Fireball should be interrupted.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Mordresh Fire Eye","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-downs"],"source_hashes":["section:48ab8a09775ed058731c26a5defe1add0c5516d9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-downs-glutton","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Glotón: evita la Nube enfermiza","title_en":"Glutton: Avoid Disease Cloud","summary_es":"Sal de la Nube enfermiza y ayuda a sanar al tanque durante Enfurecer.","summary_en":"Move out of Disease Cloud and help heal the tank during Enrage.","keywords_es":["glotón zahúrda rajacieno","nube enfermiza","enfurecer"],"keywords_en":["glutton razorfen downs","disease cloud","enrage"],"text_es":"El combate es directo, pero aparta al grupo de la Nube enfermiza. Cuando el jefe usa Enfurecer, el tanque recibe mucho daño: el sanador debe estar preparado para reforzar la curación.","text_en":"The fight is straightforward, but keep the group out of Disease Cloud. When the boss uses Enrage, the tank takes heavy damage, so the healer should be ready to increase healing.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Glutton","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-downs"],"source_hashes":["section:e0b5fbe6d1ff3b1175062a4b1e29bd987d3f867b"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-downs-ragglesnout","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Morrandrajos: contrarresta Dominar mente","title_en":"Ragglesnout: Counter Dominate Mind","summary_es":"Responde al control mental y corta sus curas y Descargas de las Sombras.","summary_en":"Respond to mind control and interrupt its heals and Shadow Bolts.","keywords_es":["morrandrajos","ragglesnout","dominar mente","jefe raro de zahúrda rajacieno"],"keywords_en":["ragglesnout","dominate mind","razorfen downs rare boss"],"text_es":"Dominar mente es su habilidad más peligrosa. Si controla al tanque o al sanador, que los personajes híbridos cubran su función; interrumpe Curar para acortar el combate y corta las Descargas de las Sombras para reducir el daño.","text_en":"Dominate Mind is the encounter's main danger. If it controls the tank or healer, hybrids should cover their role; interrupt Heal to shorten the fight and stop Shadow Bolts to reduce incoming damage.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ragglesnout (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-downs"],"source_hashes":["section:aba2469f166acd88e799d52a48c6affaddff4d6d"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-downs-amnennar","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Amnennar el Gélido: posición y adds","title_en":"Amnennar the Coldbringer: Positioning and Adds","summary_es":"Colócalo mirando a la tienda, agrupa al equipo y cambia al espectro al aparecer.","summary_en":"Face it toward the tent, stack the group, and switch to the specter when it appears.","keywords_es":["amnennar el gélido","jefe final de zahúrda rajacieno","espectros de la escarcha"],"keywords_en":["amnennar the coldbringer","razorfen downs final boss","frost specters"],"text_es":"Orienta al jefe hacia la tienda para neutralizar su Ira de Amnennar y agrupa al equipo sobre el tanque para reducir el efecto de Nova de Escarcha. Interrumpe Descarga de Escarcha y cambia al espectro invocado en cuanto aparezca.","text_en":"Face the boss toward the tent to neutralize Amnennar's Wrath, and stack on the tank to lessen Frost Nova. Interrupt Frostbolt and switch to the summoned specter as soon as it appears.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Amnennar the Coldbringer","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-downs"],"source_hashes":["section:010db28d92bb39695290e01d80206bbcdc8c046f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-downs-plaguemaw","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Fauzpeste el Putrefacto: protege el ritual","title_en":"Plaguemaw the Rotting: Protect the Ritual","summary_es":"Durante la misión de escolta, elimina cada aparición y evita que maten a Belnistrasz.","summary_en":"During the escort quest, defeat each spawn and keep Belnistrasz alive.","keywords_es":["fauzpeste el putrefacto","extinguir el ídolo","evento de zahúrda rajacieno"],"keywords_en":["plaguemaw the rotting","extinguishing the idol","razorfen downs event"],"text_es":"Este jefe aparece al final del evento opcional de escolta. Mientras Belnistrasz realiza el ritual de Extinguir el ídolo, derrota a los enemigos que van llegando; un segundo tanque puede apartarlos de él. Después, el jefe se combate de forma sencilla.","text_en":"This boss appears at the end of the optional escort event. During the ritual, defeat each group as it arrives and keep Belnistrasz alive; an off-tank can pull enemies away from him. The boss fight itself is straightforward.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Plaguemaw the Rotting Event","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Extinguishing the Idol","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-downs"],"source_hashes":["guide:e1bf55dbecb8be10a0d0064408ea7e490785aa4f","section:48b20f7a32d93ffbb09543e81e0fbcc99b82d9dd"]},{"id":"mazmorra-razorfen-downs-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Zahúrda Rajacieno","title_en":"Razorfen Downs Rewards","summary_es":"Trae la Luz o Acaba con la amenaza ofrecen la Espada del vencedor; destacan varias piezas de jefe.","summary_en":"Bring the Light or Bring the End offers Vanquisher's Sword; several boss drops stand out.","keywords_es":["recompensas de zahúrda rajacieno","espada del vencedor","caparazón de tuten'kash","ojo resplandeciente de mordresh","daga rabiafría"],"keywords_en":["razorfen downs rewards","vanquisher's sword","carapace of tuten'kash","glowing eye of mordresh","coldrage dagger"],"text_es":"Trae la Luz y Acaba con la amenaza ofrecen la Espada del vencedor. Entre los botines destacables están el Caparazón de Tuten'kash, el Ojo resplandeciente de Mordresh y la Daga rabiafría de Amnennar el Gélido.","text_en":"Bring the Light and Bring the End offer Vanquisher's Sword. Notable drops include Carapace of Tuten'kash, Glowing Eye of Mordresh, and Coldrage Dagger from Amnennar the Coldbringer.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Razorfen Downs Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Razorfen Downs Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/razorfen-downs-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:razorfen-downs"],"source_hashes":["section:2d4c1173de6b061d3459dd379cbce7b28da0a220","section:98e329e341ecd5e7a7a254587f790e6b3ebd7376"]},{"id":"mazmorra-uldaman-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Uldaman: nivel y entradas","title_en":"Uldaman: Level and Entrances","summary_es":"Nivel 40-45; tiene dos entradas en Tierras Inhóspitas, con rutas distintas para cada facción.","summary_en":"Levels 40-45; it has two entrances in the Badlands, with different routes for each faction.","keywords_es":["uldaman","nivel de uldaman","entrada de uldaman","entrada trasera de uldaman","cómo llegar a uldaman"],"keywords_en":["uldaman","uldaman levels","uldaman entrance","uldaman back entrance","how to reach uldaman"],"text_es":"Uldaman se recomienda para niveles 40-45 y tiene dos accesos: la entrada principal está al sur del límite entre Loch Modan y Tierras Inhóspitas; la trasera, en un túnel al este del yacimiento. La Alianza vuela a Thelsamar, en Loch Modan, y avanza al sur; la Horda vuela a Kargath. Sin ese punto, llega desde Sentencia, en Tierras Altas de Arathi, y cruza Los Humedales y Loch Modan.","text_en":"Uldaman is recommended for levels 40-45 and has a main entrance south of the Loch Modan-Badlands border and a back entrance in the Dustwind Gulch tunnel. Alliance can fly to Thelsamar and travel south; Horde can fly to Kargath. Without that flight point, travel from Hammerfall through the Wetlands and Loch Modan.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Uldaman Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Location of Uldaman in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:uldaman"],"source_hashes":["section:2d54645c600c0ce8a9597e150e4ddfd799da3a58","section:f71834d1344336c095fdd84153716fa9cea400a5"]},{"id":"mazmorra-uldaman-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Uldaman","title_en":"Recommended Uldaman Quests","summary_es":"Antes de entrar, recoge Las piedras de energía y La solución a la maldición en Tierras Inhóspitas.","summary_en":"Before entering, pick up Power Stones and Solution to Doom in the Badlands.","keywords_es":["misiones de uldaman","las piedras de energía","la solución a la maldición","los tesoros reclamados","poder en uldaman"],"keywords_en":["uldaman quests","power stones","solution to doom","reclaimed treasures","power in uldaman"],"text_es":"En Tierras Inhóspitas, Aparejez ofrece Las piedras de energía y Theldurin el Perdido, La solución a la maldición; ambas sirven para las dos facciones. La Alianza puede preparar Los tesoros reclamados con Krom Brazorrecio en Forjaz y Los enanos desaparecidos con Prospector Pico Tormenta. Poder en Uldaman es una cadena para Magos que empieza con Regreso al pantano.","text_en":"In the Badlands, Rigglefuzz offers Power Stones and Theldurin the Lost offers Solution to Doom; both are available to either faction. Alliance can prepare Reclaimed Treasures with Krom Stoutarm in Ironforge and The Lost Dwarves with Prospector Stormpike. Power in Uldaman is a Mage quest chain that begins with Return to the Marsh.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Solution to Doom","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Power Stones","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Reclaimed Treasures (Alliance)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › The Lost Dwarves","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Power in Uldaman (Mage Quest)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:uldaman"],"source_hashes":["guide:1b3ca3db32c890af2f2f25d2f84742f4f97f9871","section:10c1f677aaa22e6060caf78f63edbf15fe159ec4","section:45dd3b49a30dfdb0d3bba3647598ec0b508961f3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-uldaman-enanos-desaparecidos","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Los enanos desaparecidos: controla el grupo","title_en":"The Lost Dwarves: Control the Group","summary_es":"Para la Horda son hostiles; controla al tirador y derrota primero a Eric el Suave.","summary_en":"They are hostile to Horde; control the ranged dwarf and defeat the stunning melee dwarf first.","keywords_es":["los enanos desaparecidos","the lost dwarves","baelog","olaf","eric el suave"],"keywords_en":["the lost dwarves","baelog","olaf","eric the swift","uldaman dwarves boss"],"text_es":"El grupo es amistoso con la Alianza y hostil con la Horda. Controla al enano que ataca a distancia, deja que el tanque ocupe al que lleva escudo y derrota primero a Eric el Suave, cuyo Interceptar puede aturdir a un miembro del grupo.","text_en":"The group is friendly to Alliance and hostile to Horde. Crowd-control the ranged dwarf, have the tank hold the shield-bearer, and defeat the stunning melee dwarf first because its Intercept can stun a party member.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › The Lost Dwarves","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:uldaman"],"source_hashes":["section:10c1f677aaa22e6060caf78f63edbf15fe159ec4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-uldaman-revelosh","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Revelosh: interrumpe Cadena de relámpagos","title_en":"Revelosh: Interrupt Chain Lightning","summary_es":"Atrae al trogg con sus dos acompañantes y prioriza interrumpir Cadena de relámpagos.","summary_en":"Pull the trogg with its two companions and prioritize interrupting Chain Lightning.","keywords_es":["revelosh","cadena de relámpagos","jefe trogg de uldaman"],"keywords_en":["revelosh","chain lightning","uldaman trogg boss"],"text_es":"Revelosh está vinculado a dos Masticapiedras Grutacanto, que se suman al combate. Controla a uno si es posible; si no, concentra el daño en Revelosh e interrumpe Cadena de relámpagos, que puede herir a todo el grupo.","text_en":"Revelosh is linked to two rockchewer adds, which join the fight. Crowd-control one if possible; otherwise focus Revelosh and interrupt Chain Lightning, which can damage the whole party.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Revelosh","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:uldaman"],"source_hashes":["section:8663063c0ceb8615c89f18639e25d5931fc0f6cf"]},{"id":"mazmorra-uldaman-ironaya","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hierraya: oriéntala lejos del grupo","title_en":"Ironaya: Face Her Away from the Group","summary_es":"El tanque debe apartarla para evitar Machaque arqueado; los demás deben dispersarse.","summary_en":"The tank should face her away to avoid Arcing Smash; ranged players should spread out.","keywords_es":["hierraya","ironaya","machaque arqueado","jefe de uldaman"],"keywords_en":["ironaya","arcing smash","uldaman boss"],"text_es":"Al activarla, el tanque debe mantener a Hierraya de espaldas al resto para evitar Machaque arqueado. Los personajes a distancia se separan; el jefe tiene mucha armadura y salud, y no recibe daño con el tiempo.","text_en":"When activated, the tank should face Ironaya away from the group to avoid Arcing Smash. Ranged players should spread out; the boss has high armor and health and is immune to damage-over-time effects.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Ironaya","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:uldaman"],"source_hashes":["section:5f1ecaa036a3a0367fb3f936d6c13d00620a0039"]},{"id":"mazmorra-uldaman-obsidian-sentinel","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Centinela Obsidiano: elimina los fragmentos","title_en":"Obsidian Sentinel: Kill the Shards","summary_es":"Al 66% y 33% de salud invoca dos fragmentos no élite: elimínalos antes de volver al gólem.","summary_en":"At 66% and 33% health it summons two non-elite shards; kill them before returning to the golem.","keywords_es":["centinela obsidiano","obsidian sentinel","fragmento de obsidiana","jefe de uldaman"],"keywords_en":["obsidian sentinel","obsidian shard","uldaman boss"],"text_es":"El gólem invoca dos Fragmentos de obsidiana no élite cuando baja al 66% y al 33% de salud. Cambia el daño a esos adds y vuelve al jefe cuando hayan caído; tiene mucha armadura y salud.","text_en":"The golem summons two non-elite shards at 66% and 33% health. Switch to those adds and return to the boss after they die; it has high armor and health.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Obsidian Sentinel","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:uldaman"],"source_hashes":["section:535fb7480462078e0bcfe92b751b30fd3995b135"]},{"id":"mazmorra-uldaman-ancient-stone-keeper","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Vigilante pétreo anciano: evita la tormenta","title_en":"Ancient Stone Keeper: Avoid the Storm","summary_es":"Sus Tormentas de arena ralentizan y silencian en área; prepárate para salir de su alcance.","summary_en":"Its Sand Storms slow and silence in an area; be ready to move out of range.","keywords_es":["vigilante pétreo anciano","ancient stone keeper","tormentas de arena","jefe de uldaman"],"keywords_en":["ancient stone keeper","sand storms","uldaman boss"],"text_es":"El gólem tiene mucha armadura y salud, y es inmune al daño con el tiempo. Aléjate de Tormentas de arena: esta habilidad ralentiza y silencia a los jugadores en área.","text_en":"The golem has high armor and health and is immune to damage-over-time effects. Move away from Sand Storms, which slows and silences players in an area.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Ancient Stone Keeper","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:uldaman"],"source_hashes":["section:25bd1f9cd5aff871e2a79a66eeed9818ac5737ac"]},{"id":"mazmorra-uldaman-galgann","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Galgann Flamartillo: separa al jefe de sus adds","title_en":"Galgann Firehammer: Separate the Boss from Adds","summary_es":"Aparta al jefe y controla a un geólogo; disipa los efectos que potencian el daño de fuego.","summary_en":"Separate the boss and control one geologist; dispel effects that amplify fire damage.","keywords_es":["galgann flamartillo","galgann firehammer","geólogo forjatiniebla","jefe de uldaman"],"keywords_en":["galgann firehammer","shadowforge geologist","uldaman boss"],"text_es":"El jefe aparece con dos Geólogos Forjatiniebla. El tanque debe separarlo del grupo y mantenerlo de espaldas; controla a un geólogo, elimina al otro y luego al controlado. Si puedes, disipa los efectos de fuego que aumentan el daño.","text_en":"The boss comes with two geologist adds. The tank should separate it from the group and face it away; control one add, kill the other, then defeat the controlled one. Dispel fire effects that increase damage when possible.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Galgann Firehammer","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:uldaman"],"source_hashes":["section:28e3fd4edb8abef5878cf15cd135ea13ee9372a1"]},{"id":"mazmorra-uldaman-grimlok","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Grimlok: controla un acompañante","title_en":"Grimlok: Crowd-Control an Add","summary_es":"El jefe llega con tres adds; controla uno y concentra el daño para evitar Encoger en área.","summary_en":"The boss comes with three adds; control one and focus damage to prevent its area Shrink.","keywords_es":["grimlok","jefe trogg de uldaman","encoger"],"keywords_en":["grimlok","uldaman trogg boss","shrink"],"text_es":"Grimlok aparece junto a un Geomántico Grutacanto, un Camorrista Grutacanto y un Basilisco Dorsaljade. Controla a uno y céntrate en Grimlok: derrotarlo rápido puede evitar que lance Encoger sobre el grupo. Después elimina primero al geomántico.","text_en":"Grimlok is joined by a Stonevault Geomancer, a Stonevault Brawler, and a Jadespine Basilisk. Crowd-control one and focus Grimlok; defeating him quickly may prevent his group Shrink. Then kill the geomancer first.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Grimlok","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:uldaman"],"source_hashes":["section:d642a88277b2e817ed454ae5db1e6fd330554688"]},{"id":"mazmorra-uldaman-archaedas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Archaedas: prioriza a los adds","title_en":"Archaedas: Prioritize the Adds","summary_es":"Elimina los adds que invoca; al 20% aparecen cuatro élites que desaparecen al morir el jefe.","summary_en":"Kill its summoned adds; at 20%, four elites appear and die when the boss does.","keywords_es":["archaedas","jefe final de uldaman","guardianes terráneos","guarda de la cámara acorazada"],"keywords_en":["archaedas","uldaman final boss","earthen guardians","vault warder"],"text_es":"Archaedas tiene mucha salud e invoca adds no élite durante el combate; elimínalos con rapidez. Al 20% aparecen cuatro adds élite que mueren cuando cae Archaedas, así que el grupo puede concentrarse entonces en rematarlo.","text_en":"Archaedas has high health and summons non-elite adds throughout the fight; kill them quickly. At 20%, four elite adds appear and die with Archaedas, so the group can focus on finishing him then.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Archaedas","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:uldaman"],"source_hashes":["section:27e86596714aa9d20893cc48030cad8c5a519adf"]},{"id":"mazmorra-uldaman-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Uldaman","title_en":"Uldaman Rewards","summary_es":"Los discos de platino pueden dar el Saco de pelambre descongelada; destacan el Péndulo de Condena y Destripapiedras.","summary_en":"The Platinum Discs can reward the Thawpelt Sack; Pendulum of Doom and Stoneslayer also stand out.","keywords_es":["recompensas de uldaman","saco de pelambre descongelada","péndulo de condena","destripapiedras","el machacador de rocas"],"keywords_en":["uldaman rewards","thawpelt sack","pendulum of doom","stoneslayer","the rockpounder"],"text_es":"Los discos de platino pueden recompensar con el Saco de pelambre descongelada, de 14 casillas. Entre los objetos destacables están el Péndulo de Condena, Destripapiedras y El machacador de rocas.","text_en":"The Platinum Discs can reward the 14-slot Thawpelt Sack. Notable items include Pendulum of Doom, Stoneslayer, and The Rockpounder.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Uldaman Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Uldaman Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/uldaman-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:uldaman"],"source_hashes":["section:bd1932ad9f4cac77f723b21c07f15ecce8286d5e","section:e18ae42acc7cf3ef5dc246657c6751151b06e896"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-jefe-noxxion","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Noxxion","title_en":"Noxxion","summary_es":"Noxxion usa Lluvia tóxica y Gancho, y se divide en copias pequeñas.","summary_en":"Noxxion uses Toxic Volley and Uppercut, then splits into smaller copies.","keywords_es":["noxxion maraudon","jefe noxxion","jefes de maraudon"],"keywords_en":["noxxion maraudon","noxxion boss","maraudon bosses"],"text_es":"Noxxion golpea con Lluvia tóxica y Gancho; después se divide en copias pequeñas. Elimínalas para que vuelva a formarse. El grupo puede atraerlo fuera de la poza para facilitar el combate contra las copias.","text_en":"Noxxion uses Toxic Volley and Uppercut, then splits into smaller copies. Defeat them so he reforms. The group can pull him out of the pool to make fighting the copies easier.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Noxxion","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["section:0b317be7ca857b66d7c6452ca5e06d5b6682dfe6"]},{"id":"mazmorra-alcaz-prison-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Prisión de Alcaz: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Alcaz Prison: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Niveles 49-54; llega desde Poblado Murohelecho o Isla de Theramore.","summary_en":"Levels 49-54; reach it from Brackenwall Village or Theramore.","keywords_es":["prisión de alcaz","nivel prisión de alcaz","entrada de alcaz","cómo llegar a alcaz"],"keywords_en":["alcaz prison","alcaz prison level","alcaz prison entrance","how to reach alcaz"],"text_es":"La Prisión de Alcaz se recomienda para niveles 49-54. La entrada está en el sótano de la fortaleza, al norte de Isla de Alcaz, en el Marjal Revolcafango. La Horda puede volar a Poblado Murohelecho o partir de Trinquete; la Alianza toma el barco desde Puerto de Menethil a Isla de Theramore y sigue al norte.","text_en":"Alcaz Prison is recommended for levels 49-54. The entrance is in the keep’s basement, north on Alcaz Island in Dustwallow Marsh. Horde can fly to Brackenwall Village or set out from Ratchet; Alliance takes the boat from Menethil Harbor to Theramore and travels north.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alcaz Prison Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Alcaz Prison Overview in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-prison-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alcaz Prison Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Alcaz Prison in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-prison-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:alcaz-prison"],"source_hashes":["section:5110902ca629554bac34b63e04c0aff689daf45a","section:b9865b6871f048418525568ab6dd85436a91b2a7"]},{"id":"mazmorra-alcaz-prison-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Prisión de Alcaz","title_en":"Recommended Alcaz Prison Quests","summary_es":"La Alianza inicia una cadena en Ventormenta; la Horda recoge misiones en Isla de Alcaz.","summary_en":"Alliance begins a chain in Stormwind; Horde picks up quests on Alcaz Island.","keywords_es":["misiones prisión de alcaz","el diario del dragón","ningún orco se queda atrás","pañuelos rojo sangre"],"keywords_en":["alcaz prison quests","the dragon’s journal","no orc left behind","blood red bandanas"],"text_es":"La Alianza puede aceptar El diario del dragón con el Archimago Lan’dalock en Dalaran. Un poquito de trabajo sucio sigue a Nuestro hombre en Theramore, que empieza con el Maestro Mathias Shaw en Ciudad de Ventormenta. Para la Horda, Ningún orco se queda atrás y Pañuelos rojo sangre se recogen con el Sargento Ulka en Isla de Alcaz; ambas cadenas parten de Los Kor’kron perdidos, de Eitrigg en Orgrimmar.","text_en":"Alliance can pick up The Dragon’s Journal from Archmage Lan’dalock in Dalaran. A Bit of Wet Work follows Our Man in Theramore, which starts with Master Mathias Shaw in Stormwind City. For Horde, No Orc Left Behind and Blood Red Bandanas are picked up from Sergeant Ulka on Alcaz Island; both chains begin with The Missing Kor’kron from Eitrigg in Orgrimmar.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alcaz Prison Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-prison-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:alcaz-prison"],"source_hashes":["section:28f92362a581fb52106a3c126515270190b077a2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-alcaz-prison-jefe-cazass","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Maestra de las mareas Ca’zass","title_en":"Tidemistress Ca’zass","summary_es":"Controla a las Encantadoras Strashaz y aparta a Ca’zass de Ventisca.","summary_en":"Control the Strashaz Enchantresses and move Ca’zass out of Blizzard.","keywords_es":["maestra de las mareas ca’zass","ca’zass alcaz","jefe prisión de alcaz"],"keywords_en":["tidemistress ca’zass","ca’zass alcaz","alcaz prison boss"],"text_es":"La Maestra de las mareas Ca’zass lucha junto a dos acompañantes: elimínalas o contrólalas. Mantén a Ca’zass fuera de Ventisca y disipa Nova de Escarcha para que nadie quede atrapado; interrumpe Salva de descarga de Escarcha cuando puedas.","text_en":"Tidemistress Ca’zass fights alongside two adds: defeat or control them. Keep the boss out of Blizzard and dispel Frost Nova so no one is trapped; interrupt Frostbolt Volley when possible.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alcaz Prison Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Tidemistress Ca'zass","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-prison-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:alcaz-prison"],"source_hashes":["section:e188213695a5dc82d9eaba60662f8101175bdf7b"]},{"id":"mazmorra-alcaz-prison-jefe-wrex","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sobrestante Wrex","title_en":"Overseer Wrex","summary_es":"Limpia las tres celdas cercanas antes de enfrentarte a Wrex.","summary_en":"Clear the three nearby cells before engaging Wrex.","keywords_es":["sobrestante wrex","wrex alcaz","jefe prisión de alcaz"],"keywords_en":["overseer wrex","wrex alcaz","alcaz prison boss"],"text_es":"Sobrestante Wrex patrulla las celdas y, si lo atraes, llama a los enemigos de las tres cámaras próximas. Espera a que pase, limpia esas salas y luego enfréntalo. Golpe mortal hiere mucho al tanque y reduce la sanación recibida; también usa Grito de guerra.","text_en":"Overseer Wrex patrols the cells and calls enemies from the three nearby chambers if pulled. Wait for him to pass, clear those rooms, then engage. Mortal Strike hits the tank hard and reduces healing received; he also uses Battle Shout.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alcaz Prison Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Overseer Wrex","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-prison-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:alcaz-prison"],"source_hashes":["section:cf1bdbb305d128609ddfb8a2619db47446fed8d4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-alcaz-prison-jefe-interrogador","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Interrogador","title_en":"The Questioner","summary_es":"No mates al Interrogador hasta despejar el resto de la mazmorra.","summary_en":"Do not kill the Questioner until the rest of the dungeon is clear.","keywords_es":["el interrogador alcaz","jefe interrogador","jefe prisión de alcaz"],"keywords_en":["the questioner alcaz","questioner boss","alcaz prison boss"],"text_es":"El Interrogador es sencillo, pero no lo mates antes de despejar el resto de la mazmorra. Puedes atraer primero a algunos esbirros. Sus habilidades son Desgarrar y Drenar vida; Paladines y Sacerdotes pueden disipar el efecto de Drenar vida.","text_en":"The Questioner is straightforward, but do not kill him before clearing the rest of the dungeon. You can pull some adds first. His abilities are Rend and Drain Life; Paladins and Priests can dispel the Drain Life effect.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alcaz Prison Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Questioner","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-prison-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:alcaz-prison"],"source_hashes":["section:60c641cfe973fb941058bcb5b396883d5f6fbf3b"]},{"id":"mazmorra-alcaz-prison-jefe-katerina","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Katerina la Limpiadora","title_en":"Katerina the Cleaner","summary_es":"Controla a los Capellanes de Alcaz y disipa Veneno mortal.","summary_en":"Control the Alcaz Chaplains and dispel Deadly Poison.","keywords_es":["katerina la limpiadora","katerina alcaz","jefe prisión de alcaz"],"keywords_en":["katerina the cleaner","katerina alcaz","alcaz prison boss"],"text_es":"Katerina la Limpiadora está acompañada por dos Capellanes de Alcaz; contrólalos o elimínalos para impedir que sanen. Garrote doloroso drena la salud de un jugador hasta que lo sanen por encima del 90%. Retira cuanto antes Veneno mortal del objetivo principal de amenaza.","text_en":"Katerina is accompanied by two Alcaz Chaplains; control or defeat them to stop their healing. Grievous Garrote drains a player’s health until they are healed above 90%. Deadly Poison must be cleared from the primary threat target promptly.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alcaz Prison Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Katerina the Cleaner","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-prison-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:alcaz-prison"],"source_hashes":["section:b1bdacbc29f7c0383a203718cc1f5821648a490d"]},{"id":"mazmorra-alcaz-prison-jefe-rugell","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ama Rugell y Rugellama","title_en":"Zarla Ober and Blazeroar","summary_es":"Ama Rugell se transforma en Rugellama al 30%; el dragón golpea y aterroriza al grupo.","summary_en":"Ama Rugell transforms into Blazeroar at 30%; the dragon hits hard and fears the group.","keywords_es":["ama rugell","rugellama","jefe final de alcaz"],"keywords_en":["zarla ober","blazeroar","alcaz final boss"],"text_es":"Ama Rugell tiene una fase humana y, al llegar al 30%, revela su forma de Rugellama y recupera toda la salud. Esquiva Fogonazo; como dragón, Rugellama daña continuamente con Escamas abrasadoras, golpea al tanque con Aliento de llamarada y Vapulear, y aterroriza al resto.","text_en":"Zarla Ober has a human phase and, at 30%, reveals her Blazeroar form and returns to full health. Avoid Flamestrike; as a dragon, Blazeroar deals ongoing damage with Searing Scales, hits the tank with Flame Breath and Thrash, and fears everyone else.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alcaz Prison Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Zarla Ober/Blazeroar","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-prison-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:alcaz-prison"],"source_hashes":["section:c0ee273e7a4003196f1aa814d0641dfb0195e94d"]},{"id":"mazmorra-alcaz-prison-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas destacadas de Prisión de Alcaz","title_en":"Notable Alcaz Prison Rewards","summary_es":"Wrex, El Interrogador y Ama Rugell dejan objetos con nombre esES.","summary_en":"Wrex, the Questioner, and Zarla Ober drop items with esES names.","keywords_es":["recompensas prisión de alcaz","llavero de sobrestante","llave de grilletes ornamental","diario de zarla"],"keywords_en":["alcaz prison rewards","overseer’s keyring","key for the shackles","zarla’s journal"],"text_es":"Entre los objetos destacados están el Llavero de sobrestante de Sobrestante Wrex, la Llave de grilletes ornamental de El Interrogador y el Diario de Zarla de Ama Rugell y Rugellama.","text_en":"Notable items include a keyring dropped by Wrex, a key for the shackles from the Questioner, and Zarla’s Journal from Zarla Ober and Blazeroar.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Alcaz Prison Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Alcaz Prison Loot","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/alcaz-prison-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:alcaz-prison"],"source_hashes":["section:a407caf0db6fa63c2cd882fa8cdd06399a6da398"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Maraudon: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Maraudon: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel recomendado 45-52; la entrada está en el Valle de las Lanzas, en Desolace.","summary_en":"Recommended level 45-52; the entrance is in the Valley of Spears, in Desolace.","keywords_es":["maraudon","nivel maraudon","entrada maraudon","cómo llegar a maraudon"],"keywords_en":["maraudon","maraudon level","maraudon entrance","how to reach maraudon"],"text_es":"Maraudon se recomienda para niveles 45-52. Busca la entrada en el Valle de las Lanzas, en Desolace. Queda al norte de Aldea Cazasombras y al oeste respecto al Cementerio de los Kodos; los centauros custodian el camino. Aldea Cazasombras sirve de localidad de referencia para la Horda y Punta de Nijel ofrece misiones para la Alianza. Hay accesos de cristales naranjas y morados; el Cetro de Celebras permite crear un portal hacia otra sección.","text_en":"Maraudon is recommended for levels 45-52. Find the entrance at Valley of Spears in Desolace. It is north of Shadowprey Village and lies on the western side relative to the Kodo Graveyard; centaurs guard the approach. Shadowprey Village serves as a reference town for Horde, and Alliance players can pick up quests in Nijel’s Point. There are orange- and purple-crystal entrances; the Scepter of Celebras creates a portal to another section.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Maraudon Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Location of Maraudon in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["section:3fbe1cded61501728f36ded637cc04a4faa0ae75","section:44b490170017b16c7b993875a33a266ab2e575c2","section:5ce76ba7db76bb860d935ebb1da6c666d36fd181"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Maraudon","title_en":"Recommended Maraudon Quests","summary_es":"Las instrucciones del Paria empiezan en Desolace; El Cetro de Celebras requiere una cadena previa.","summary_en":"The Pariah’s Instructions starts in Desolace; the Scepter of Celebras requires a prior quest chain.","keywords_es":["misiones maraudon","las instrucciones del paria","leyendas de maraudón","el cetro de celebras"],"keywords_en":["maraudon quests","the pariah’s instructions","legends of maraudon","the scepter of celebras"],"text_es":"Las instrucciones del Paria para Maraudon empiezan con el Paria Centauro en Desolace y conducen a la mazmorra. Leyendas de Maraudón se recoge en la ruta naranja; al completarla, Celebras el Maldito da paso a El Cetro de Celebras en la ruta morada. Completa esta cadena para obtener el Cetro de Celebras, que permite abrir un portal de acceso a otra sección.","text_en":"The Pariah’s Instructions for Maraudon starts with the Centaur Pariah in Desolace and leads into the dungeon. Legends of Maraudon is picked up on the orange path; completing it leads from Celebras the Cursed to The Scepter of Celebras on the purple path. Finish this chain to obtain the Scepter of Celebras, which opens a portal to another section.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › The Pariah's Instructions","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Legends of Maraudon","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › The Scepter of Celebras","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["guide:edd4d03eb0a783dcb8986fe9a4c266c7907a0825","section:5ce76ba7db76bb860d935ebb1da6c666d36fd181"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-misiones-lista","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Todas las misiones de Maraudon","title_en":"All Maraudon quests","summary_es":"Lista de misiones de Maraudon con nivel, bando y dónde se recogen.","summary_en":"Maraudon quest list with level, faction and where to pick each one up.","keywords_es":["qué misiones hay en maraudon","misiones de maraudon","la semilla de la vida","fragmentos oscuros","la corrupción de lenguavil","los males de maraudón"],"keywords_en":["maraudon quests list","what quests are in maraudon","seed of life","shadowshard fragments","vyletongue corruption","twisted evils"],"text_es":"Misiones de Maraudon: Fragmentos Oscuros (39; Horda con Uthel'nay en Orgrimmar, Alianza con el Archimago Tervosh en Theramore), La corrupción de Lenguavil (41) y Corrupción de la tierra y de la semilla (45), ambas en Desolace, y Los males de Maraudón (41) con Willow. La semilla de la vida (39) la da el Espíritu de Zaetar tras matar a la Princesa Theradras. Nuevas para la Horda: Resplandor de An'she (43), con Olana Pezuña Reluciente en Mulgore, y Podredumbre y remordimiento (35, difícil, sin bando), en Shen'dralas.","text_en":"Maraudon quests: Shadowshard Fragments (39; Horde from Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar, Alliance from Archmage Tervosh in Theramore), Vyletongue Corruption (41) and Corruption of Earth and Seed (45), both in Desolace, and Twisted Evils (41) from Willow. Seed of Life (39) comes from Zaetar's Spirit after killing Princess Theradras. New: An'she's Radiance (43, Horde), from Olana Brighthoof in Mulgore, and Rot and Regret (35, hard, no faction), in Shen'dralas.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["section:5ce76ba7db76bb860d935ebb1da6c666d36fd181"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-jefe-lenguavil","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Lord Lenguavil","title_en":"Lord Vyletongue","summary_es":"Apila al grupo junto a Lenguavil para evitar sus disparos; vuelve a acercarte tras Traslación.","summary_en":"Stack on Vyletongue to avoid his shots; regroup after Blink.","keywords_es":["lord lenguavil","jefe lord lenguavil","jefes de maraudon"],"keywords_en":["lord vyletongue","lord vyletongue boss","maraudon bosses"],"text_es":"Apila al grupo junto a Lord Lenguavil para evitar Multidisparo; volved a acercaros cuando Traslación lo aparte. Elimina primero al jefe, que se mueve por la sala, y después acaba con sus dos guardias ocultos Acechasombras Putridus.","text_en":"Stack on Lord Vyletongue to avoid Multi-Shot; regroup when Blink moves him away. Defeat the mobile boss first, then finish his two stealthed Putridus Shadowstalker guards.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Lord Vyletongue","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["section:ccbfe94e24b5cf9f062c779666983c3039c157be"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-jefe-latisable","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Latisable","title_en":"Razorlash","summary_es":"Pinchar aplica daño periódico; los combatientes a distancia deben mantenerse fuera de Mellar.","summary_en":"Puncture deals damage over time; ranged players should stay out of Cleave range.","keywords_es":["latisable maraudon","jefe latisable","jefes de maraudon"],"keywords_en":["razorlash maraudon","razorlash boss","maraudon bosses"],"text_es":"Latisable puede omitirse para avanzar. Pinchar causa daño periódico durante 10 segundos y Mellar alcanza a quienes están en cuerpo a cuerpo; los lanzadores deben atacar desde máxima distancia.","text_en":"Razorlash can be skipped to progress. Puncture deals damage over time for 10 seconds and Cleave hits nearby players; casters should attack from maximum range.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Razorlash","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["section:cb5ced422bc5c1ab9d2968c4f52fca12aa1ebb09"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-jefe-meshlok","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Meshlok el Cosechador","title_en":"Meshlok the Harvester","summary_es":"Meshlok es un jefe raro; el tanque debe apartarlo y los sanadores vigilar Choque de tierra.","summary_en":"Meshlok is a rare boss; the tank should separate him and healers should watch for Earth Shock.","keywords_es":["meshlok el cosechador","jefe meshlok","jefes de maraudon"],"keywords_en":["meshlok the harvester","meshlok boss","maraudon bosses"],"text_es":"Meshlok el Cosechador es un jefe raro que patrulla por el agua. El tanque debe mantenerlo apartado del grupo; los demás pueden separarse para evitar Pisotón de guerra. Choque de tierra puede interrumpir los lanzamientos de los sanadores.","text_en":"Meshlok the Harvester is a rare boss patrolling the water. The tank should keep him away from the group; others can spread out to avoid War Stomp. Earth Shock can interrupt healers’ casts.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Meshlok the Harvester (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["section:12ca3b66519c56d23bbd54b07f7f689f2d19d29d"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-jefe-celebras","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Celebras el Maldito","title_en":"Celebras the Cursed","summary_es":"Interrumpe Cólera y céntrate en Celebras antes de despejar las criaturas invocadas.","summary_en":"Interrupt Wrath and focus Celebras before clearing his summoned adds.","keywords_es":["celebras el maldito","jefe celebras","jefes de maraudon"],"keywords_en":["celebras the cursed","celebras boss","maraudon bosses"],"text_es":"Celebras el Maldito invoca criaturas continuamente. Su lanzamiento de Cólera se puede interrumpir: céntrate primero en Celebras y luego elimina los esbirros restantes.","text_en":"Celebras the Cursed continually summons adds. His Wrath cast can be interrupted; focus Celebras first, then clear the remaining creatures.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Celebras the Cursed","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["section:3d4c34dab3fe2a2f7d86ac3e9999e0cb7fdf8b6a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-jefe-derrumblo","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Derrumblo","title_en":"Landslide","summary_es":"Mantén a Derrumblo junto a su posición, con el tanque de espaldas a una pared.","summary_en":"Keep Landslide near his position, with the tank’s back to a wall.","keywords_es":["derrumblo maraudon","jefe derrumblo","jefes de maraudon"],"keywords_en":["landslide maraudon","landslide boss","maraudon bosses"],"text_es":"Derrumblo usa atropellos y empujones e invoca esbirros. Mantén al jefe cerca de su posición, con el tanque de espaldas a una pared; los atacantes a distancia deben alejarse para evitar empujones y aturdimientos. Los esbirros desaparecen al morir el jefe.","text_en":"Landslide uses charges and knockbacks and summons adds. Keep the boss near his position with the tank’s back to a wall; ranged players should stay far away to avoid knockbacks and stuns. The adds despawn when the boss dies.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Landslide","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["section:2e17280ca78cd5cbb479dfea8dce5805a509bdb4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-jefe-theradras","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Princesa Theradras","title_en":"Princess Theradras","summary_es":"La Mirada repulsiva aterroriza; los atacantes a distancia pueden evitar Campo de polvo desde lejos.","summary_en":"Repulsive Gaze causes fear; ranged players can avoid Dust Field from a distance.","keywords_es":["princesa theradras","jefe princesa theradras","jefes de maraudon"],"keywords_en":["princess theradras","princess theradras boss","maraudon bosses"],"text_es":"La Princesa Theradras puede aterrorizar al grupo con Mirada repulsiva y empujar y dañar con Campo de polvo. Lucha en la parte posterior de la caverna para disponer de espacio; los atacantes a distancia pueden mantenerse lejos para evitar el empujón.","text_en":"Princess Theradras can fear the group with Repulsive Gaze and knock back and damage players with Dust Field. Fight near the back of the cavern for room; ranged players can stay back to avoid the knockback.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Princess Theradras","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["section:0365d4b4f9d9154a332c026a96c036a50dcdf066"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-jefe-escamapodrida","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Escamapodrida","title_en":"Rotgrip","summary_es":"Escamapodrida golpea con fuerza; asegura la amenaza del tanque y mantén al grupo con salud.","summary_en":"Rotgrip hits hard; secure the tank’s threat and keep the group healthy.","keywords_es":["escamapodrida maraudon","jefe escamapodrida","jefes de maraudon"],"keywords_en":["rotgrip maraudon","rotgrip boss","maraudon bosses"],"text_es":"Escamapodrida golpea con fuerza y patrulla por el agua. Asegura que el tanque tenga la amenaza antes de atacar y que el grupo se mantenga con salud: Pinchar causa daño periódico y Mordida fatal puede infligir mucho daño.","text_en":"Rotgrip hits hard and patrols in the water. Make sure the tank has threat before the group engages and keep everyone healthy: Puncture deals damage over time and Fatal Bite can inflict heavy damage.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Rotgrip","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["section:cfff1e5ec2ea3dcff8e99d99c9bd8344019b4113"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-jefe-gizlock","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Manitas Gizlock","title_en":"Tinkerer Gizlock","summary_es":"Gira a Gizlock de espaldas al grupo y agrupa a los demás en cuerpo a cuerpo.","summary_en":"Face Gizlock away from the group and have everyone else stack in melee range.","keywords_es":["manitas gizlock","jefe manitas gizlock","jefes de maraudon"],"keywords_en":["tinkerer gizlock","tinkerer gizlock boss","maraudon bosses"],"text_es":"Manitas Gizlock usa Escopeta dragón goblin para dañar al grupo. El tanque debe orientarlo de espaldas a los demás; el resto se agrupa cerca, en cuerpo a cuerpo, para impedir que use sus ataques a distancia.","text_en":"Tinkerer Gizlock uses Goblin Dragon Gun to damage the group. The tank should face him away from everyone else; the rest should stack nearby in melee range to prevent his ranged attacks.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Tinkerer Gizlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["section:e481d81d0362972d8304b39ae72231d857325d40"]},{"id":"mazmorra-maraudon-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas destacadas de Maraudon","title_en":"Notable Maraudon Rewards","summary_es":"Las instrucciones del Paria ofrecen la Marca del Elegido; Celebras y Theradras tienen objetos destacados.","summary_en":"The Pariah’s Instructions rewards Mark of the Chosen; Celebras and Theradras have notable items.","keywords_es":["recompensas maraudon","marca del elegido","hoja de oscuridad eterna","cetro de la princesa theradras"],"keywords_en":["maraudon rewards","mark of the chosen","blade of eternal darkness","princess theradras scepter"],"text_es":"Las instrucciones del Paria recompensa con la Marca del Elegido. Entre los objetos destacados están la Hoja de Oscuridad eterna y el Cetro de Celebras. La misión El Cetro de Celebras también ofrece un atajo hacia otra sección.","text_en":"The Pariah’s Instructions rewards Mark of the Chosen. Notable items include the Blade of Eternal Darkness and the Scepter of Celebras. The Scepter of Celebras quest also provides a shortcut to another section.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › The Pariah's Instructions","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Maraudon Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Maraudon Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › The Scepter of Celebras","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/maraudon-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:maraudon"],"source_hashes":["guide:edd4d03eb0a783dcb8986fe9a4c266c7907a0825","section:a5b0fdb55c56e6a17628ef4d0c90a0ef415ad84f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Zul'Farrak: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Zul'Farrak: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel recomendado 44-54; ambas facciones vuelan a Gadgetzan y siguen hacia el oeste.","summary_en":"Recommended level 44-54; both factions fly to Gadgetzan and travel west.","keywords_es":["nivel de Zul'Farrak","entrada de Zul'Farrak","cómo llegar a Zul'Farrak","volar a Gadgetzan","mazmorra de Tanaris"],"keywords_en":["Zul'Farrak level range","Zul'Farrak entrance","how to reach Zul'Farrak","fly to Gadgetzan","Tanaris dungeon"],"text_es":"Zul'Farrak se recomienda para niveles 44-54 y está en Tanaris. Tanto la Horda como la Alianza suelen volar a Gadgetzan y viajar hacia el oeste hasta la entrada.","text_en":"Zul'Farrak is recommended for levels 44-54 and is in Tanaris. Horde and Alliance players usually fly to Gadgetzan and travel west to the entrance.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Zul'Farrak Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Location of Zul'Farrak in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:15059dc08a14b7519662cfa1cb401af35faff956","section:854af25a1c8491709de8e12efd2f7c69304c2979"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Zul'Farrak","title_en":"Recommended Zul'Farrak Quests","summary_es":"Recoge misiones en Gadgetzan y prepara las cadenas de Diosa araña y Medallón de Nekrum.","summary_en":"Pick up quests in Gadgetzan and prepare the Spider God and Nekrum's Medallion chains.","keywords_es":["misiones de Zul'Farrak","Diosa araña","Medallón de Nekrum","Cetro Divinomático","La profecía de Mosh'aru","Tiara de la Profundidad"],"keywords_en":["Zul'Farrak quests","The Spider God quest","Nekrum's Medallion quest","Divino-matic Rod quest","Prophecy of Mosh'aru","Tiara of the Deep quest"],"text_es":"En Gadgetzan puedes recoger Cetro Divinomático y Temple trol; La profecía de Mosh'aru también parte de Tanaris, tras Los espíritus de los estriadores. Tiara de la Profundidad se obtiene en Marjal Revolcafango. Diosa araña es una cadena de Horda que culmina con Maestro Gadrin en Poblado Sen'jin; Medallón de Nekrum es de Alianza y su cadena pasa por Thadius Sombramacabra en las Tierras Devastadas. Gahz'rilla se recoge con Wizzle Pernolatón en Las Mil Agujas.","text_en":"In Gadgetzan, pick up Divino-matic Rod and Troll Temper; The Prophecy of Mosh'aru also starts in Tanaris, after Screecher Spirits. Tiara of the Deep is obtained in Dustwallow Marsh. Horde players can complete The Spider God chain with Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village; Alliance players can advance Nekrum's Medallion with Thadius Grimshade in the Blasted Lands. Gahz'rilla starts with Wizzle Brassbolts in Thousand Needles.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:3c54aacce5ee108ce4c0c80fd2d6573628f4396a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-invocar-gahzrilla","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo invocar a Gahz'rilla","title_en":"How to Summon Gahz'rilla","summary_es":"Consigue la Marra sacra en Tierras del Interior y transfórmala en Jintha'Alor.","summary_en":"Get the Sacred Mallet in the Hinterlands and transform it at Jintha'Alor.","keywords_es":["invocar a Gahz'rilla","Marra de Zul'Farrak","Marra sacra","Altar de Jintha'Alor"],"keywords_en":["summon Gahz'rilla","Mallet of Zul'Farrak","Sacred Mallet","Jintha'Alor altar"],"text_es":"Para invocar a Gahz'rilla, un miembro del grupo debe conseguir la Marra de Zul'Farrak de Qiaga el Vigilante en Tierras del Interior. Actívala en el gong junto al acueducto; solo hace falta que una persona del grupo tenga la marra.","text_en":"Get the Mallet of Zul'Farrak from Qiaga the Keeper in the Hinterlands and use it on the gong by the aqueduct to summon Gahz'rilla. Only one party member needs to have the mallet.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Gahz'rilla","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:1f39a35c3d253336620058a654ec48191de0171b","section:3c54aacce5ee108ce4c0c80fd2d6573628f4396a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-antusul","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Antu'sul: esbirros y tótems","title_en":"Antu'sul: Adds and Totems","summary_es":"Elimina primero sus esbirros, interrumpe las curaciones y destruye los tótems.","summary_en":"Kill his adds first, interrupt his heals, and destroy the totems.","keywords_es":["jefe Antu'sul","esbirros de Antu'sul","tótems de Antu'sul","estrategia Antu'sul"],"keywords_en":["Antu'sul boss","Antu'sul adds","Antu'sul totems","Antu'sul strategy"],"text_es":"Antu'sul invoca una Estirpe de Sul'lithuz y un Sirviente de Antu'sul. Elimínalos antes de volver a atacar al jefe, interrumpe sus curaciones y destruye los tótems en cuanto aparezcan.","text_en":"Antu'sul summons a Sul'lithuz Broodling and a Servant of Antu'sul; defeat both before returning to the boss. Interrupt his healing and destroy the totems as they appear.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Antu'sul <Overseer of Sul>","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:94f4c8f7a6632fee747c0b3cd9a16ff7e07476f4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-theka","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Theka el Mártir: inmunidad y escarabajos","title_en":"Theka the Martyr: Immunity and Scarabs","summary_es":"Al 30% se vuelve inmune durante 30 segundos y atrae escarabajos; acaba con él primero.","summary_en":"At 30%, he becomes immune for 30 seconds and draws scarabs; finish him first.","keywords_es":["Theka el Mártir","jefe Theka Zul'Farrak","inmunidad de Theka","escarabajos de Theka"],"keywords_en":["Theka the Martyr","Theka Zul'Farrak boss","Theka immunity","Theka scarabs"],"text_es":"Theka el Mártir se vuelve inmune al daño físico y de las Sombras al llegar al 30%, durante 30 segundos. En esa fase atrae a los escarabajos cercanos: céntrate en Theka antes de acabar con ellos.","text_en":"Theka the Martyr becomes immune to physical and Shadow damage at 30% health for 30 seconds. During that phase, he draws nearby scarabs; focus on Theka before finishing them.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Theka the Martyr","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:f392e43d5870c857bc49ce50712d29cf69b8eba2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-zumrah","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Médico brujo Zum'rah: interrupciones y adds","title_en":"Witch Doctor Zum'rah: Interrupts and Adds","summary_es":"Interrumpe su salva, elimina rápido a los zombis y prioriza su tótem.","summary_en":"Interrupt his volley, quickly kill the zombies, and prioritize his totem.","keywords_es":["Médico brujo Zum'rah","jefe Zum'rah","zombis de Zum'rah","tótem de Zum'rah"],"keywords_en":["Witch Doctor Zum'rah","Zum'rah boss","Zum'rah zombies","Zum'rah totem"],"text_es":"El Médico brujo Zum'rah lanza una salva de Descarga de las Sombras, que conviene interrumpir. Elimina deprisa a los zombis que invoca desde las tumbas y cambia al tótem cuando aparezca.","text_en":"Witch Doctor Zum'rah casts Shadow Bolt Volley, which should be interrupted. Quickly kill the zombies he summons from nearby graves, and switch to his totem when it appears.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Witch Doctor Zum'rah","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:ad37cf753b97a20c619fd72a9a932fca931cb53f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-nekrum-sezzziz","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Nekrum Cometripas y Sacerdote oscuro Sezz'ziz","title_en":"Nekrum Gutchewer and Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz","summary_es":"En la última oleada de las escaleras, derrota primero a Nekrum e interrumpe la curación de Sezz'ziz.","summary_en":"In the final stairs wave, kill Nekrum first and interrupt Sezz'ziz's heal.","keywords_es":["Nekrum Cometripas","Sacerdote oscuro Sezz'ziz","evento de las escaleras Zul'Farrak","interrumpir curación Sezz'ziz"],"keywords_en":["Nekrum Gutchewer","Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz","Zul'Farrak stairs event","interrupt Sezz'ziz heal"],"text_es":"Nekrum Cometripas y el Sacerdote oscuro Sezz'ziz aparecen en la última oleada del evento de las escaleras. Elimina primero a Nekrum y, mientras tanto, interrumpe la curación de Sezz'ziz.","text_en":"Nekrum Gutchewer and Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz appear in the final wave of the stairs event. Nekrum should be the first target while Sezz'ziz's healing is interrupted.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Nekrum Gutchewer and Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:a4c4ff81c27548c7eed76e141d1773cda4e3a8e8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-bly","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sargento Bly: prioriza a sus acompañantes","title_en":"Sergeant Bly: Prioritize His Escorts","summary_es":"Derrota primero a Oro Bocojo y Murta Tripuriosa por su daño de área y sus curaciones.","summary_en":"Kill Oro Eyegouge and Murta Grimgut first for their area damage and healing.","keywords_es":["Sargento Bly","jefe Sargento Bly","Oro Bocojo","Murta Tripuriosa"],"keywords_en":["Sergeant Bly","Sergeant Bly boss","Oro Eyegouge","Murta Grimgut"],"text_es":"El Sargento Bly lucha acompañado por Oro Bocojo y Murta Tripuriosa. El daño de área de Oro y las curaciones de Murta hacen recomendable derrotarlos antes de centrarse en Bly.","text_en":"Sergeant Bly is accompanied by Oro Eyegouge and Murta Grimgut. Oro's area damage and Murta's healing make it best to defeat them before focusing on Bly.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Sergeant Bly","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:804ff95edf6f7a6da3d149ff9893ab870e292e92"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-velratha","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hidromántica Velratha: atráela sola","title_en":"Hydromancer Velratha: Pull Her Alone","summary_es":"Patrulla entre élites; sepárala del resto y corta sus lanzamientos.","summary_en":"She patrols among elites; pull her away from them and interrupt her casts.","keywords_es":["Hidromántica Velratha","jefe Velratha","patrulla de Velratha","interrumpir a Velratha"],"keywords_en":["Hydromancer Velratha","Velratha boss","Velratha patrol","interrupt Velratha"],"text_es":"La Hidromántica Velratha patrulla por una sala con élites Furiarena. Atráela sola para evitar sumar enemigos e interrumpe sus lanzamientos.","text_en":"Hydromancer Velratha patrols through a room filled with elite Sandfury. Pull her alone to avoid additional enemies, and interrupt her casts.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Hydromancer Velratha","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:33489ec2a174bb1d5f3eb1f66440e9f03d1c346b"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-ukorz","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefe Ukorz Cabellarena: posición y orden","title_en":"Chief Ukorz Sandscalp: Positioning and Order","summary_es":"Elimina primero a su acompañante, mantén al jefe de espaldas y evita Mellar.","summary_en":"Kill his companion first, face the boss away, and avoid Cleave.","keywords_es":["Jefe Ukorz Cabellarena","jefe Ukorz Zul'Farrak","estrategia de Ukorz","Mellar de Ukorz"],"keywords_en":["Chief Ukorz Sandscalp","Ukorz Zul'Farrak boss","Ukorz strategy","Ukorz Cleave"],"text_es":"El Jefe Ukorz Cabellarena va acompañado por Ruuzlu; acaba primero con su acompañante. Enfrenta a ambos lejos del grupo y deja que los combatientes cuerpo a cuerpo ataquen por detrás para evitar Mellar.","text_en":"Chief Ukorz Sandscalp is accompanied by Ruuzlu; kill his companion first. Face both away from the group and have melee attack from behind to avoid Cleave.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Chief Ukorz Sandscalp","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:e95822f102cd3e26ecfb93ce651498cfd92feb90"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-zerillis","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Zerillis: llévalo al cuerpo a cuerpo","title_en":"Zerillis: Pull Into Melee Range","summary_es":"Este élite poco común patrulla por la mazmorra; acércalo al grupo cuerpo a cuerpo.","summary_en":"This rare elite patrols the dungeon; pull it into melee range.","keywords_es":["Zerillis","jefe raro Zul'Farrak","patrulla Zerillis","estrategia Zerillis"],"keywords_en":["Zerillis","Zul'Farrak rare boss","Zerillis patrol","Zerillis strategy"],"text_es":"Zerillis es un élite poco común que patrulla por Zul'Farrak. Atráelo enseguida al cuerpo a cuerpo; puede hacer falta usar la línea de visión para acercarlo.","text_en":"Zerillis is a rare elite that patrols Zul'Farrak. Pull it into melee range immediately; using line of sight may help bring it in.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Zerillis","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:dbb884dced9617e56a9d9f45f296d031174354e3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-gahzrilla","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Gahz'rilla: evita que te lance por el aire","title_en":"Gahz'rilla: Avoid Being Thrown","summary_es":"Limpia la sala, apoya al tanque contra una pared y agrúpate para evitar el lanzamiento.","summary_en":"Clear the room, back the tank against a wall, and stack to avoid the knock-up.","keywords_es":["Gahz'rilla","jefe Gahz'rilla","estrategia Gahz'rilla","evitar lanzamiento Gahz'rilla"],"keywords_en":["Gahz'rilla","Gahz'rilla boss","Gahz'rilla strategy","avoid Gahz'rilla knock-up"],"text_es":"Antes de luchar contra Gahz'rilla, despeja la sala de invocación. El tanque debe colocarse de espaldas a una pared y el grupo agruparse sobre él para evitar que el jefe lo lance por el aire.","text_en":"Before fighting Gahz'rilla, clear the summoning room. The tank should stand with their back to a wall and the group should stack on them to avoid being thrown into the air.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Gahz'rilla","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:1f39a35c3d253336620058a654ec48191de0171b"]},{"id":"mazmorra-zulfarrak-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas destacadas de Zul'Farrak","title_en":"Notable Zul'Farrak Rewards","summary_es":"La misión de Gahz'rilla da una mejora de montura; los jefes ofrecen equipo destacado.","summary_en":"Gahz'rilla's quest rewards a mount-speed boost; bosses offer notable gear.","keywords_es":["recompensas de Zul'Farrak","Zanahoria pinchada en un palo","Mandiletes de maña","Máscara de mojo malo","Colmillo de Gahz'rilla"],"keywords_en":["Zul'Farrak rewards","Carrot on a Stick","Vice Grips","Bad Mojo Mask","Gahz'rilla Fang"],"text_es":"La misión Gahz'rilla ofrece la Zanahoria pinchada en un palo, que aumenta la velocidad de montura. Entre el equipo destacado de la mazmorra están los Mandiletes de maña, la Máscara de mojo malo y el Colmillo de Gahz'rilla.","text_en":"Carrot on a Stick is the Gahz'rilla quest reward and increases mount speed. Notable dungeon gear includes Vice Grips, Bad Mojo Mask, and Gahz'rilla Fang.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zul'Farrak Dungeon Strategy Guide - WoW: Forever › Zul'Farrak Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zulfarrak-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:zulfarrak"],"source_hashes":["section:25d7eeb2209d562b3793dc38c8ef074da1005e86","section:2e7e0a83f1323b8fc4af56fd68e937c6c2514abd"]},{"id":"mazmorra-drowned-city-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"La Ciudad Sumergida: nivel y entrada","title_en":"The Drowned City: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 35-42; entrada submarina al oeste de Tuercespina, con acceso distinto por facción.","summary_en":"Levels 35-42; underwater entrance west of Stranglethorn Vale, with faction-specific access.","keywords_es":["nivel de La Ciudad Sumergida","entrada de La Ciudad Sumergida","cómo llegar a la mazmorra","respirar bajo el agua"],"keywords_en":["Drowned City level range","Drowned City entrance","how to reach the dungeon","underwater breathing"],"text_es":"La Ciudad Sumergida se recomienda para niveles 35-42 y tiene un tramo largo bajo el agua; un Brujo o un Chamán ayuda con Respiración subacuática. La entrada está en una cueva submarina frente a la costa occidental de Tuercespina, al sur de la Isla Encantada. La Horda puede ir en zepelín a Campamento Grom'gol o en barco desde Trinquete hasta Bahía del Botín; la Alianza puede volar a Villa Oscura si aún no tiene ese punto de vuelo, aunque Bahía del Botín queda más cerca.","text_en":"The Drowned City is recommended for levels 35-42 and has a long underwater section; a Warlock or Shaman helps with underwater breathing. Its entrance is in an underwater cave off the western coast of Stranglethorn Vale, south of the Haunted Isle. Horde can take the zeppelin to Grom'gol or the boat from Ratchet to Booty Bay; Alliance can fly to Darkshire if it lacks that flight point, though Booty Bay is closer.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Drowned City Overview in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of The Drowned City in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:drowned-city"],"source_hashes":["section:446c22c9f436f51f6c8d19db63e06f0d8c20d5cc","section:916e0320209e56c3fcc9e9427e689909f6e85e57"]},{"id":"mazmorra-drowned-city-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de La Ciudad Sumergida","title_en":"Recommended Drowned City Quests","summary_es":"Prepara las cadenas de Dibbs para la Alianza y las misiones de Grom'gol para la Horda.","summary_en":"Prepare Dibbs's Alliance chains and the Horde quests at Grom'gol.","keywords_es":["misiones de La Ciudad Sumergida","La magia de la Ciudad Sumergida","Segunda prueba con el agua","misiones de Horda en Grom'gol","Videntesal sospechosos"],"keywords_en":["Drowned City quests","Magics of the Drowned City","Take Two With Water","Horde quests at Grom'gol","Shady Saltseers"],"text_es":"La Alianza puede preparar «La magia de la Ciudad Sumergida» y «Segunda prueba con el agua» con el Maestro cultural Dibbs en Costasur, tras «La segunda rebelión» o «Mala medicina» y «Brujería trol». Para la Horda, «La Ciudad Sumergida» empieza con Kin'weelay en Campamento Grom'gol, después de «El Arrecife Mortal»; «El único Escamasalada bueno...» se recoge allí con el Comandante Aggro'gosh tras «Enemigos en el agua». Ambas facciones pueden recoger «Videntesal sospechosos» y «El capitán Videntesal» con Krazek en Bahía del Botín.","text_en":"Alliance can prepare Magics of the Drowned City and Take Two With Water from Loremaster Dibbs in Southshore, after The Second Rebellion or Bad Medicine and Troll Witchery. For Horde, The Drowned City starts with Kin'weelay at Grom'gol after The Vile Reef; The Only Good Brinescale... is available there from Commander Aggro'gosh after Enemies in the Water. Both factions can pick up Shady Saltseers and The Saltseer Captain from Krazek in Booty Bay.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:drowned-city"],"source_hashes":["section:9428a09cadf42cea8bb160c1a7622f89cd924a55"]},{"id":"mazmorra-drowned-city-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de La Ciudad Sumergida","title_en":"The Drowned City Rewards","summary_es":"Las misiones destacan equipo para mano secundaria, una pechera de malla y un yelmo de cuero.","summary_en":"Notable quest rewards include off-hand gear, a mail chest, and a leather helm.","keywords_es":["recompensas de La Ciudad Sumergida","Descubrimientos para la Liga de Expedicionarios","Videntesal sospechosos","botín de misiones"],"keywords_en":["Drowned City rewards","Findings for the Explorer's League","Shady Saltseers","quest loot"],"text_es":"Entre las recompensas de «Descubrimientos para la Liga de Expedicionarios» se destacan un objeto para la mano secundaria y una pechera de malla; «Videntesal sospechosos» ofrece un yelmo de cuero.","text_en":"Notable rewards from Findings for the Explorer's League include an off-hand item and a mail chest; Shady Saltseers offers a leather helm.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:drowned-city"],"source_hashes":["section:f5c74d3e91fc50ef98a77eae3019ee23ffc11cca"]},{"id":"mazmorra-drowned-city-zulalai","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Zul'Alai: aturde y disipa el golpe","title_en":"Zul'Alai: Stun and Dispel the Strike","summary_es":"Zul'Alai aturde cerca, ralentiza al grupo y se acelera al quedar con poca salud.","summary_en":"Zul'Alai stuns nearby players, slows the group, and speeds up at low health.","keywords_es":["Zul'Alai","jefe de La Ciudad Sumergida","Embate monstruoso","Golpe podrido"],"keywords_en":["Zul'Alai","Drowned City boss","Monstrous Slam","Rotted Strike"],"text_es":"Zul'Alai golpea con fuerza al objetivo principal. Embate monstruoso aturde durante 3 segundos a quienes estén cerca; como no se mueve mientras lo lanza, el cuerpo a cuerpo puede apartarse. Golpe podrido reduce la velocidad de movimiento y ataque: disípalo primero del tanque. Al 30% de salud, Juramento imperecedero aumenta un 30% su velocidad de ataque y le restaura un 3% de salud cada 5 segundos.","text_en":"Zul'Alai hits its main target hard. Monstrous Slam stuns nearby players for 3 seconds; it does not move while casting, so melee can step away. Rotted Strike reduces movement and attack speed: dispel it from the tank first. At 30% health, Undying Oath increases its attack speed by 30% and restores 3% health every 5 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Zul'Alai","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:drowned-city"],"source_hashes":["section:24924454ccfa0cca2069b47efc8372031ef463d8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-drowned-city-vartaka","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Var'Taka: controla a las sacerdotisas","title_en":"Var'Taka: Control the Priestesses","summary_es":"Las sacerdotisas curan; Var'Taka atrae jugadores y golpea en un cono frontal.","summary_en":"The priestesses heal; Var'Taka pulls players in and attacks with a frontal cone.","keywords_es":["Var'Taka","sacerdotisas Escamasaladas","jefe de La Ciudad Sumergida","Arpón"],"keywords_en":["Var'Taka","Brinescale Priestesses","Drowned City boss","Harpoon"],"text_es":"Var'Taka combate junto a dos Sacerdotisas Escamasaladas, que intentan curarse y curarlo: elimínalas primero o contrólalas. Su Arpón atrae a un jugador aleatorio hasta el jefe, que también usa Mellar frontal; el tanque debe orientarlo de espaldas al grupo. Tras vencer, haz clic en la Perla resplandeciente para desactivar la barrera.","text_en":"Var'Taka fights with two priestess adds that try to heal themselves and him; kill or crowd-control them first. Harpoon pulls a random player to the boss, who also uses a frontal Cleave; the tank should face him away from the group. After the fight, click the Glowing Pearl to disrupt the barrier.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Var'Taka","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:drowned-city"],"source_hashes":["section:95ed658f403ed894dd999141f9c594a405f5c04b"]},{"id":"mazmorra-drowned-city-elemental-primigenio","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Elemental primigenio: combate opcional","title_en":"Primeval Elemental: Optional Boss","summary_es":"Activa al Elemental primigenio eliminando las ofrendas; vigila el aire en sus túneles acuáticos.","summary_en":"Activate Primeval Elemental by killing the offerings; watch your breath in its water tunnels.","keywords_es":["Elemental primigenio","jefe opcional","Ofrenda imperecedera","Descarga acuática"],"keywords_en":["Primeval Elemental","optional boss","Undying Offering","Waterbolt"],"text_es":"El Elemental primigenio es opcional y está en los túneles acuáticos de los Archivos Profundos. Mata todas las Ofrendas imperecederas de su cámara para activarlo. Descarga acuática golpea al objetivo principal y Congelar agua causa daño de área; controla el aire y sube a respirar si hace falta.","text_en":"Primeval Elemental is optional and lies in the water tunnels of the Deep Archives. Kill all Undying Offerings in its chamber to activate it. Waterbolt hits the main target and Freeze Water deals area damage; watch your breath and swim up if needed.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Primeval Elemental","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:drowned-city"],"source_hashes":["section:6369c26b7be532d4e189c20e34af30230d486699"]},{"id":"mazmorra-drowned-city-capitan-alzapavor","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Capitán Alzapavor: rompe la burbuja","title_en":"Captain Dreadrise: Break the Bubble","summary_es":"Libera al jugador atrapado en la burbuja e interrumpe la salva de agua.","summary_en":"Free the player trapped in a bubble and interrupt the water volley.","keywords_es":["Capitán Alzapavor","Embrinar","burbuja abisal","Salva de descarga acuática"],"keywords_en":["Captain Dreadrise","Embrine","Abyssal Bubble","Waterbolt Volley"],"text_es":"El Capitán Alzapavor atrapa a un jugador aleatorio —también puede ser el tanque— en una Burbuja abisal; destrúyela antes de que se ahogue. Interrumpe Salva de descarga acuática para evitar el daño a todo el grupo. Antes de iniciar el combate, despeja la zona para no atraer patrullas.","text_en":"Captain Dreadrise traps a random player—including the tank—in an Abyssal Bubble; destroy it before the player drowns. Waterbolt Volley should be interrupted to prevent damage to the whole party. Clear the area before engaging so patrols do not join the fight.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Captain Dreadrise","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:drowned-city"],"source_hashes":["section:65f82cd5d092d1471da755e895798254e408e034"]},{"id":"mazmorra-drowned-city-tuetano-inextinguible","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tuétano Inextinguible: gestiona las oleadas","title_en":"Deathless Marrow: Handle the Adds","summary_es":"Tuétano invoca enemigos sin pausa; elimina a los guardianes que aturden y reparte el daño.","summary_en":"Marrow summons enemies continuously; kill the stunning guardians and cleave the adds.","keywords_es":["Tuétano Inextinguible","jefe de La Ciudad Sumergida","Descarga de sangre","Embate con escudo"],"keywords_en":["Deathless Marrow","Drowned City boss","Bloodbolt","Shield Slam"],"text_es":"Tuétano Inextinguible lanza Descarga de sangre contra todo el grupo e invoca guardianes y hechiceros durante el combate. Prioriza a los guardianes porque su Embate con escudo aturde; después, reparte daño de área sobre los esbirros mientras mantienes el foco en el jefe. Si se acumulan, usa control de masas.","text_en":"Deathless Marrow casts Bloodbolt on the whole party and summons Deathless Guardians and Sorcerors throughout the fight. Prioritize the guardians because Shield Slam stuns; then cleave the adds while keeping damage on the boss. Use crowd control if they build up.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Deathless Marrow","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:drowned-city"],"source_hashes":["section:74a9d1d1d00e083e85a9086cde257d2a68a53a19"]},{"id":"mazmorra-drowned-city-minloth-serpiente","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Min'loth la Serpiente: dos fases","title_en":"Min'loth the Serpent: Two Phases","summary_es":"En su segunda forma, Min'loth envenena a todos y puede provocar miedo.","summary_en":"In its second form, Min'loth poisons everyone and can cause fear.","keywords_es":["Min'loth la Serpiente","jefe de La Ciudad Sumergida","Inundación","Salva de descarga de veneno"],"keywords_en":["Min'loth the Serpent","Drowned City boss","Deluge","Poison Bolt Volley"],"text_es":"Min'loth la Serpiente tiene dos fases: al llegar a cero de salud en forma de trol, cambia a forma de serpiente y recupera toda la salud. En la primera, Empapar golpea al objetivo principal e Inundación causa daño de área canalizado. En la segunda, limpia cuanto antes Salva de descarga de veneno y preparaos para Miedo sobre un objetivo aleatorio.","text_en":"Min'loth the Serpent has two phases: at zero health in troll form, it changes to serpent form and restores all its health. In phase one, Drench hits the main target and Deluge channels area damage. In phase two, cleanse Poison Bolt Volley quickly and prepare for Fear on a random target.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Min'loth The Serpent","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:drowned-city"],"source_hashes":["section:8c06a82e1d3455ba24697c441dad47da876d1615"]},{"id":"mazmorra-drowned-city-umbra","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Umbra: jefe raro con múrlocs","title_en":"Umbra: Rare Boss with Murlocs","summary_es":"Los cinco múrlocs que acompañan a Umbra aplican sangrado; centraos en el jefe primero.","summary_en":"Umbra's five murloc adds cause bleeding; focus the boss first.","keywords_es":["Umbra","jefe raro de La Ciudad Sumergida","múrlocs Escamasal","sangrado"],"keywords_en":["Umbra","Drowned City rare boss","Saltscale Murlocs","Bleed"],"text_es":"Umbra es un jefe poco frecuente que aparece acompañado por cinco múrlocs. Estos pueden aplicar sangrado y causar daño rápido; centra el daño en Umbra para acabar pronto con la amenaza y luego elimina a los múrlocs restantes.","text_en":"Umbra is a rare boss accompanied by five Saltscale Murlocs. They can apply Bleed and deal rapid damage; focus Umbra to remove the main threat quickly, then finish the remaining murlocs.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Umbra (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:drowned-city"],"source_hashes":["section:519efb7039ad326fc57979aba72fb51773a63260"]},{"id":"mazmorra-drowned-city-branquia","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Branquia: cuidado con los enemigos cercanos","title_en":"Gill: Watch for Nearby Enemies","summary_es":"Branquia lanza dinamita al objetivo principal; evita atraer a los enemigos de alrededor.","summary_en":"Gill throws dynamite at the main target; avoid pulling nearby enemies.","keywords_es":["Branquia","jefe raro de La Ciudad Sumergida","Lanzar dinamita","Archivos Profundos"],"keywords_en":["Gill","Drowned City rare boss","Throw Dynamite","Deep Archives"],"text_es":"Branquia es un jefe raro del camino hacia el Elemental primigenio, en los Archivos Profundos. Lanza dinamita al objetivo principal; el combate es sencillo si no atraes también a los enemigos cercanos.","text_en":"Gill is a rare boss on the path to Primeval Elemental in the Deep Archives. It throws dynamite at the main target; the fight is simple as long as nearby enemies are not pulled in too.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Drowned City Overview Guide:  Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Gill (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-drowned-city-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:drowned-city"],"source_hashes":["section:2cc94ff15b42b924d23291e1d6ea242d62459e5f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-kroldok-stronghold-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bastión Krol'dok: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Krol'dok Stronghold: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 40-45 y enorme; la entrada está al norte de Clarosol, en Riverglades.","summary_en":"Levels 40-45 and very large; the entrance is north of Sunnyglade in Riverglades.","keywords_es":["nivel del Bastión Krol'dok","entrada del Bastión Krol'dok","cómo llegar","mazmorra de Riverglades"],"keywords_en":["Krol'dok Stronghold level range","Krol'dok Stronghold entrance","how to reach it","Riverglades dungeon"],"text_es":"El Bastión Krol'dok se recomienda para niveles 40-45 y es una mazmorra muy extensa. La entrada queda al norte de Clarosol, en Clarofluvial, al este de la entrada cerrada de la ciudad. La Horda puede volar a Rog'Mar o entrar desde las Tierras Inhóspitas si aún no tiene ese punto de vuelo; la Alianza puede volar a Farholde Keep o llegar desde las Montañas Crestagrana.","text_en":"Krol'dok Stronghold is recommended for levels 40-45 and is a very large dungeon. Its entrance is north of Sunnyglade in Riverglades, east of the capital's closed city entrance. Horde can fly to Rog'Mar or enter from the Badlands if it lacks that flight point; Alliance can fly to Farholde Keep or approach from Redridge Mountains.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Krol'dok Stronghold Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Krol'dok Stronghold Overview in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/kroldok-stronghold-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Krol'dok Stronghold Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Krol'dok Stronghold in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/kroldok-stronghold-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:kroldok-stronghold"],"source_hashes":["section:1c4e5d4e528e32746a6f686e0947607c072a074d","section:a0d66e90ea95f7935ec8709af04c4f4c4f4f15f2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-kroldok-stronghold-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables del Bastión Krol'dok","title_en":"Recommended Krol'dok Stronghold Quests","summary_es":"La Alianza recoge misiones en Dalaran y Farholde; la Horda, en los alrededores de Krol'dok y Rom'gar.","summary_en":"Alliance quests start in Dalaran and Farholde; Horde quests start around Krol'dok and Rom'gar.","keywords_es":["misiones del Bastión Krol'dok","La venganza del Altonato","Recuerdos Crepusculares","El ojo de Mugg","misiones de Horda"],"keywords_en":["Krol'dok Stronghold quests","Vengeance of the Highborne","Twilight Mementos","Eye of Mugg","Horde quests"],"text_es":"La Alianza puede recoger «La venganza del Altonato» con Ranath Zancanoche en Dalaran. En Farholde Keep, «Recuerdos Crepusculares», «El ojo de Mugg» y «El escrito del Crepúsculo» parten de una cadena iniciada con Ashe Salámbar y Demar Brant. Para la Horda, «Una prueba de venganza» empieza con Da'grosh, y «El ojo de Mugg» y «El escrito del Crepúsculo» con Krom'rosh o Tran'gul en Rom'gar; antes hay que avanzar la cadena de Krom'rosh hasta «El guerrero díscolo».","text_en":"Alliance can pick up Vengeance of the Highborne from Ranath Nightstride in Dalaran. Twilight Mementos, Eye of Mugg, and Tome of Twilight are also available at Farholde Keep, following a chain started with Ashe Amberhall and Demar Brant. For Horde, A Token of Vengeance starts with Da'grosh; Eye of Mugg and Tome of Twilight start with Krom'rosh or Tran'gul in Rom'gar. Advance the chain from Krom'rosh through The Wayward Warrior first.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Krol'dok Stronghold Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/kroldok-stronghold-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:kroldok-stronghold"],"source_hashes":["section:11d3b9c255a18580377212ef4390735f8c98c78a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-kroldok-stronghold-grox","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Machacaesclavos Grox: controla a los prisioneros","title_en":"Slavecrusher Grox: Control the Prisoners","summary_es":"Grox recibe ayuda de prisioneros, aumenta su velocidad de ataque y derriba al tanque.","summary_en":"Grox calls prisoners to help, increases his attack speed, and knocks down the tank.","keywords_es":["Machacaesclavos Grox","jefe del Bastión Krol'dok","Ansia de sangre","Sumisión"],"keywords_en":["Slavecrusher Grox","Krol'dok Stronghold boss","Bloodlust","Force Compliance"],"text_es":"Machacaesclavos Grox patrulla las minas y llama a prisioneros cercanos para que se unan al combate. Elimina rápidamente a esos enemigos no élite y luego céntrate en Grox. Ansia de sangre aumenta su velocidad de ataque y Derribo aturde al objetivo principal; despeja una zona antes de iniciar el combate.","text_en":"Slavecrusher Grox patrols the mines and calls nearby prisoners to join the fight. Quickly kill those non-elite enemies, then focus Grox. Bloodlust increases his attack speed and Knockdown stuns the main target; clear an area before starting the encounter.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Krol'dok Stronghold Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Slavecrusher Grox","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/kroldok-stronghold-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:kroldok-stronghold"],"source_hashes":["section:0d0de74948c6becac873f5131fcd70e9758469df"]},{"id":"mazmorra-kroldok-stronghold-zarmok","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Comandante Crepuscular Zarmok: evita el remolino","title_en":"Twilight Commander Zarmok: Avoid the Whirl","summary_es":"Limpia a los miembros del Martillo Crepuscular; aléjate del remolino de Zarmok.","summary_en":"Clear Twilight's Hammer members; move away from Zarmok's whirl.","keywords_es":["Comandante Crepuscular Zarmok","Remolino desgarrador","jefe del Bastión Krol'dok"],"keywords_en":["Twilight Commander Zarmok","Rending Whirl","Krol'dok Stronghold boss"],"text_es":"El Comandante Crepuscular Zarmok patrulla rodeado de miembros del Martillo Crepuscular. Despeja a los enemigos cercanos antes de atraerlo para no sumar adds a un combate con mucho daño al grupo. Remolino desgarrador golpea con fuerza a quienes estén a menos de 8 m; Golpear afecta al objetivo principal.","text_en":"Twilight Commander Zarmok patrols with Twilight's Hammer members around him. Clear the nearby enemies before pulling him to avoid adds during a fight with heavy party-wide damage. Rending Whirl hits players within 8 yards hard; Strike targets the main threat.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Krol'dok Stronghold Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Twilight Commander Zarmok","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/kroldok-stronghold-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:kroldok-stronghold"],"source_hashes":["section:f12c359f45ec702066d52ed804eb4d441394f8af"]},{"id":"mazmorra-kroldok-stronghold-ashka","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cuidadora de guerra Ashka: acaba con sus lobos","title_en":"War Handler Ashka: Kill Her Wolves","summary_es":"Ashka pelea con dos lobos; elimínalos o atúrdeles antes de centrarte en ella.","summary_en":"Ashka fights with two wolves; kill or stun them before focusing her.","keywords_es":["Cuidadora de guerra Ashka","Colmillo Gruñente","Aullaterror","Orden: ¡matar!"],"keywords_en":["War Handler Ashka","Snarlfang","Terrorhowl","Command: Kill"],"text_es":"La Cuidadora de guerra Ashka está acompañada por Colmillo Gruñente y Aullaterror. Elimina a los lobos primero y usa aturdimientos para facilitarlo; después céntrate en Ashka. Ella golpea al objetivo principal y ordena a sus lobos atacar a un jugador aleatorio durante 10 segundos.","text_en":"War Handler Ashka is accompanied by Snarlfang and Terrorhowl. Kill the wolves first, using stuns to make it easier, then focus Ashka. She strikes the main target and orders her wolves to attack a random player for 10 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Krol'dok Stronghold Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › War Handler Ashka","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/kroldok-stronghold-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:kroldok-stronghold"],"source_hashes":["section:13848ad0765d40fa0b4a23bad82558c467c4a16e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-kroldok-stronghold-nargurk","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Nar'gurk: rompe el control al 50%","title_en":"Nar'gurk: Break Control at 50%","summary_es":"Controla a los tres lanzadores; baja al 50% de salud al jugador convertido.","summary_en":"Control the three casters; reduce a converted player's health to 50%.","keywords_es":["Nar'gurk","Convertir","Salva de descarga de las Sombras","jefe del Bastión Krol'dok"],"keywords_en":["Nar'gurk","Convert","Shadow Bolt Volley","Krol'dok Stronghold boss"],"text_es":"Nar'gurk combate con un Tejemaldiciones Pielsombra y dos Brujos Crepusculares; contrólalos o elimínalos primero para reducir el daño. El jefe lanza Salva de descarga de las Sombras al grupo y usa Convertir sobre un jugador. Para romper el control, hay que bajarle la salud al 50%.","text_en":"Nar'gurk fights with a Shadowhide Curseweaver and two Twilight Warlocks; control or kill them first to reduce damage. The boss casts Shadow Bolt Volley on the party and uses Convert on one player. Reduce that player's health to 50% to break the control.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Krol'dok Stronghold Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Nar'gurk","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/kroldok-stronghold-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:kroldok-stronghold"],"source_hashes":["section:71847921d59c0f3a4fd067f79dbc8210383bb34f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-kroldok-stronghold-toof","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefazo Toof: controla a los chamanes","title_en":"Bossman Toof: Control the Shamans","summary_es":"Gestiona las oleadas de brutos y controla a los dos chamanes que acompañan a Toof.","summary_en":"Handle the brute waves and control the two shamans accompanying Toof.","keywords_es":["Jefazo Toof","Bruto Krol'Dok","Chamán Krol'Dok","jefe del Bastión Krol'dok"],"keywords_en":["Bossman Toof","Krol'dok Brute","Krol'dok Shaman","Krol'dok Stronghold boss"],"text_es":"El combate de Jefazo Toof empieza con oleadas periódicas de dos Brutos Krol'Dok; antes del jefe hay que superar otro grupo con dos centuriones y un chamán. Al llegar a Toof, controla a los dos Chamanes Krol'Dok que lo acompañan. Sus golpes son Golpe mortal, Trueno y Grito desmoralizador; los adds hacen más peligrosa la reducción de salud de Golpe mortal.","text_en":"Bossman Toof calls periodic waves of two Krol'dok Brutes; another group of two centurions and a shaman stands before the boss. Crowd-control the two shamans accompanying Toof. His attacks are Mortal Strike, Thunderclap, and Demoralizing Shout; adds make Mortal Strike's health reduction more dangerous.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Krol'dok Stronghold Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bossman Toof","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/kroldok-stronghold-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:kroldok-stronghold"],"source_hashes":["section:0e865c7e01b08786d4b4b12f3bb5770f441b96bd"]},{"id":"mazmorra-kroldok-stronghold-mugg","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Señor supremo Mugg: controla a los centuriones","title_en":"Overlord Mugg: Control the Centurions","summary_es":"Controla o elimina a los centuriones; Mugg aumenta su velocidad y daño en fases.","summary_en":"Control or kill the centurions; Mugg gains attack speed and damage in stages.","keywords_es":["Señor supremo Mugg","Embate aplastante","Furia de Mugg","Par de grandes mazas"],"keywords_en":["Overlord Mugg","Crushing Slam","Mugg's Fury","Set of Mauls"],"text_es":"El Señor supremo Mugg pelea con dos Centuriones Krol'Dok; contrólalos o elimínalos antes de centrar el daño en el jefe. Embate aplastante salta sobre un jugador y derriba a quienes estén cerca. Durante el combate, Furia de Mugg acumula velocidad de ataque y Mugg cambia de armas; al final, Par de grandes mazas aumenta su daño un 50%.","text_en":"Overlord Mugg fights with two Krol'dok Centurions; control or kill them before focusing the boss. Crushing Slam jumps to a player and knocks back those nearby. During the fight, Mugg's Fury stacks attack speed and Mugg changes weapons; Set of Mauls at the end increases his damage by 50%.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Krol'dok Stronghold Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Overlord Mugg","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/kroldok-stronghold-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:kroldok-stronghold"],"source_hashes":["section:fce0b1cd801d9129787d4e9a0db0c1f6dcbaad21"]},{"id":"mazmorra-kroldok-stronghold-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas del Bastión Krol'dok","title_en":"Krol'dok Stronghold Rewards","summary_es":"Entre las recompensas de jefe está la Llave de ogro Krol'Dok, de Mugg.","summary_en":"One notable boss reward is the Krol'dok Ogre Key from Mugg.","keywords_es":["recompensas del Bastión Krol'dok","Llave de ogro Krol'Dok","botín del Señor supremo Mugg"],"keywords_en":["Krol'dok Stronghold rewards","Krol'dok Ogre Key","Overlord Mugg loot"],"text_es":"El Señor supremo Mugg puede dejar la Llave de ogro Krol'Dok. La misión «El ojo de Mugg» también ofrece una elección de recompensa.","text_en":"Overlord Mugg can drop the Krol'dok Ogre Key. Eye of Mugg also offers a choice of reward.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Krol'dok Stronghold Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/kroldok-stronghold-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Krol'dok Stronghold Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Krol'dok Stronghold Loot","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/kroldok-stronghold-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-14"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:kroldok-stronghold"],"source_hashes":["section:e356748bf8ff5e2944176f8e1dba23680caf4fcc","section:eda548b3c6b4fa0208067852e31d7f7dfdb39e39"]},{"id":"mazmorra-temple-of-atalhakkar-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Templo de Atal'Hakkar: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Temple of Atal'Hakkar: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 50-55, semisumergido en el Pantano de las Penas; se llega nadando desde ambas facciones.","summary_en":"Levels 50-55, partly submerged in the Swamp of Sorrows; both factions swim to it.","keywords_es":["nivel del Templo de Atal'Hakkar","entrada del Templo de Atal'Hakkar","Templo Sumergido","cómo llegar al templo"],"keywords_en":["Temple of Atal'Hakkar level","Temple of Atal'Hakkar entrance","Sunken Temple","how to reach the temple"],"text_es":"El Templo de Atal'Hakkar se recomienda para niveles 50-55 y también se conoce como Templo Sumergido. Está semisumergido en un lago del Pantano de las Penas; la entrada mira al sur y se alcanza por una escalera. La Alianza puede partir del Bastión de Nethergarde y la Horda volar a Rocal; ambos grupos cruzan el lago a nado.","text_en":"Temple of Atal'Hakkar is recommended for levels 50-55 and is also known as Sunken Temple. It is partly submerged in a central lake in the Swamp of Sorrows; its south-facing entrance is reached by climbing stairs. Alliance can start from Nethergarde Keep and Horde can fly to Stonard; both factions swim across the lake.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Temple of Atal'Hakkar Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Temple of Atal'Hakkar in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:temple-of-atalhakkar"],"source_hashes":["section:46d0b507fb6a693a77587cebec94411874318922","section:76d7d6b05a551320e47112bd2404d8376261aac6"]},{"id":"mazmorra-temple-of-atalhakkar-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables del Templo de Atal'Hakkar","title_en":"Recommended Temple of Atal'Hakkar Quests","summary_es":"Prepara las misiones de facción, El secreto del círculo y la cadena que permite invocar al Avatar de Hakkar.","summary_en":"Prepare faction quests, Secret of the Circle, and the chain that summons Avatar of Hakkar.","keywords_es":["misiones del Templo de Atal'Hakkar","En El Templo de Atal'Hakkar","El secreto del círculo","El dios Hakkar","El profeta Jammal'an"],"keywords_en":["Temple of Atal'Hakkar quests","Into the Temple of Atal'Hakkar","Secret of the Circle","The God Hakkar","Jammal'an the Prophet"],"text_es":"Alianza: «En El Templo de Atal'Hakkar» empieza con Brohann Barriliga en Ventormenta y requiere «En búsqueda del templo». Horda: «El Templo de Atal'Hakkar» empieza con Fel'zerul en el Pantano de las Penas, tras «Charca de Lágrimas». «El secreto del círculo» empieza con Marvon Buscarroblones en Tanaris, tras «El Templo Sumergido». Para invocar al Avatar de Hakkar, alguien debe completar «Los espíritus de los estriadores», «La profecía de Mosh'aru», «El huevo antiguo» y «El dios Hakkar», de Yeh'kinya en Tanaris. «El profeta Jammal'an» se recoge con el Exiliado Atal'ai en Tierras del Interior.","text_en":"Alliance: Into the Temple of Atal'Hakkar starts with Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind and requires In Search of the Temple. Horde: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar starts with Fel'zerul in the Swamp of Sorrows, after Pool of Tears. Secret of the Circle starts with Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris, after The Sunken Temple. To summon Avatar of Hakkar, someone must complete Screecher Spirits, The Prophecy of Mosh'aru, The Ancient Egg, and The God Hakkar from Yeh'kinya in Tanaris. Jammal'an the Prophet starts with the Atal'ai Exile in the Hinterlands.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Every Quest in Temple of Atal'Hakkar in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:temple-of-atalhakkar"],"source_hashes":["section:8c4c10803b61c54a6bb60234cfe5131472f74e86","section:f2b07ad21182dca3880eb65a416169589f287c2e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-temple-of-atalhakkar-atalalarion","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Atal'alarion: activa las seis capillas","title_en":"Atal'alarion: Activate the Six Shrines","summary_es":"Activa las capillas en orden para invocar a Atal'alarion; el jefe despeja amenaza y lanza por el aire.","summary_en":"Activate the shrines in order to summon Atal'alarion; the boss wipes threat and launches players.","keywords_es":["Atal'alarion","activación de las capillas","capillas de Atal'ai","Mamporro de barrido"],"keywords_en":["Atal'alarion","Pit of Refuse","Atal'ai Shrines","Sweeping Slam"],"text_es":"Para invocar a Atal'alarion, activa las seis capillas en este orden: sur, norte, suroeste, sureste, noroeste y noreste; una capilla incorrecta maldice al jugador que la activa. Atal'alarion puede borrar su amenaza y lanzar a los jugadores por el aire, que reciben daño al caer. Lleva al jefe junto a una pared y mantén a sanadores y atacantes a distancia alejados.","text_en":"To summon Atal'alarion, activate the six shrines in this order: south, north, southwest, southeast, northwest, northeast; an incorrect shrine curses the player who clicks it. Atal'alarion can clear threat and launch players into the air, causing fall damage. Tank the boss near a wall and keep healers and ranged players at a distance.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Atal’alrion <Guardian of the Idol>","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:temple-of-atalhakkar"],"source_hashes":["section:b58dcdd7643d2ca26345b474e5a8239e8edac631"]},{"id":"mazmorra-temple-of-atalhakkar-defensores","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Loh'ro, Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Zul'Lor y Hukku","title_en":"Loro, Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Zul'Lor, and Hukku","summary_es":"Los seis defensores Atal'ai desbloquean el paso a Jammal'an y cada uno tiene una habilidad distinta.","summary_en":"The six Atal'ai Defenders open the way to Jammal'an and each has a distinct ability.","keywords_es":["defensores Atal'ai","Loh'ro","Gasher","Mijan","Zolo","Zul'Lor","Hukku"],"keywords_en":["Atal'ai Defenders","Loro","Gasher","Mijan","Zolo","Zul'Lor","Hukku"],"text_es":"Los seis Defensores Atal'ai deben caer para abrir el camino a Jammal'an. Loh'ro usa Punta de escudo; Gasher, Doble empuñadura; Mijan, Resguardo de sanación superior; Zolo, Cadena de relámpagos; Zul'Lor, Endeblez; Hukku, Descarga de las Sombras e invocaciones de demonios. Los combates son breves si el grupo está preparado.","text_en":"The six Atal'ai Defenders must fall to open the way to Jammal'an. Loro uses Shield Spike; Gasher uses two weapons; Mijan, Greater Healing Ward; Zolo, Chain Lightning; Zul'Lor, Frailty; and Hukku, Shadow Bolt and demon summons. The fights are short if the group is prepared.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Atal'ai Defenders","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Loro","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Gasher","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Mijan","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Zolo","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Zul'lor","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Hukku","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:temple-of-atalhakkar"],"source_hashes":["section:22ee8cdefdbfce598f41fdbafc70ac752eb6032b","section:3f1bfdde9604119b387634878e9e580cbe11117d","section:4b7e5be3862c3217eebdc185bdc983f0266fd458","section:ba995aabc1c0255c9b5085b0b3ae42818864fc78","section:c4e9d0e9642f950b243626ec6b52010493076db3","section:c90439060c863a856ae383d0fe2ebaf0b85e16a7","section:f9c5e8106c595cfdb4a7a54e840cd91171d2ebe8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-temple-of-atalhakkar-jammalan-ogom","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jammal'an y Ogom el Desdichado: sepáralos","title_en":"Jammal'an and Ogom the Wretched: Split Them","summary_es":"Derrota pronto a Ogom y dispersa al grupo ante el maleficio de Jammal'an.","summary_en":"Kill Ogom quickly and spread out for Jammal'an's hex.","keywords_es":["Jammal'an el Profeta","Ogom el Desdichado","Maleficio de Jammal'an","Templo de Atal'Hakkar"],"keywords_en":["Jammal'an the Prophet","Ogom the Wretched","Hex of Jammal'an","Temple of Atal'Hakkar"],"text_es":"Jammal'an el Profeta lucha junto a Ogom el Desdichado, que tiene menos salud: sepáralo y acaba con él primero. Dispersa al grupo cuando Jammal'an lance Maleficio de Jammal'an, que transforma a un jugador en un guerrero Atal'ai hostil. Evita sus golpes y concentra el daño en Jammal'an cuando termine el efecto.","text_en":"Jammal'an the Prophet fights with Ogom the Wretched, who has less health: separate and kill him first. Spread out when Jammal'an casts Hex of Jammal'an, which turns a player into a hostile Atal'ai Berserker. Avoid its attacks and focus Jammal'an when the effect ends.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Jammal'an the Prophet & Ogom the Wretched","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:temple-of-atalhakkar"],"source_hashes":["section:cc2574b2cb1298ac4f3fc7629c95f23f1df45260"]},{"id":"mazmorra-temple-of-atalhakkar-weaver-dreamscythe","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sastrón y Guadañasueños: evita el cono","title_en":"Weaver and Dreamscythe: Avoid Their Cone","summary_es":"Los dracos atacan en cono y empujan; tanquéalos de espaldas a una pared.","summary_en":"The drakes use a cone and knockback; tank them with backs to a wall.","keywords_es":["Sastrón","Guadañasueños","dracos del Templo de Atal'Hakkar","Garganta ácida","Aleteo"],"keywords_en":["Weaver","Dreamscythe","Temple of Atal'Hakkar drakes","Acid Breath","Wing Flap"],"text_es":"Sastrón y Guadañasueños aparecen en el Pozo del Sacrificio después de derrotar a Jammal'an. Sus ataques de cono frontal y empuje pueden sacar al grupo de posición; el tanque debe colocarlos de espaldas a una pared y orientarlos lejos del resto.","text_en":"Weaver and Dreamscythe spawn in the Pit of Sacrifice after Jammal'an is defeated. Their frontal cone and knockback can displace the party; the tank should place them with their backs to a wall and facing away from everyone else.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Weaver and Dreamscythe","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:temple-of-atalhakkar"],"source_hashes":["section:d51ff29473d94137da90a52a7c39270097c7487f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-temple-of-atalhakkar-hazzas-morphaz","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hazzas y Morphaz: evita atraer a los dos","title_en":"Hazzas and Morphaz: Avoid Pulling Both","summary_es":"Hazzas y Morphaz comparten los ataques de los dracos; no los atraigas junto con los enemigos cercanos.","summary_en":"Hazzas and Morphaz share the drake attacks; avoid pulling them with nearby enemies.","keywords_es":["Hazzas","Morphaz","jefes del Templo de Atal'Hakkar","Garganta ácida","Aleteo"],"keywords_en":["Hazzas","Morphaz","Temple of Atal'Hakkar bosses","Acid Breath","Wing Flap"],"text_es":"Hazzas y Morphaz aparecen en el pasillo próximo a la Cámara del Soñador tras derrotar a Sastrón y Guadañasueños. Aplica la misma táctica contra los ataques de cono y empuje de los dracos: evita los enemigos cercanos y procura no atraer a ambos a la vez.","text_en":"Hazzas and Morphaz spawn in the hallway near the Chamber of the Dreamer after Weaver and Dreamscythe are defeated. Use the same approach to the drakes' cone and knockback attacks: avoid nearby enemies and try not to pull both at once.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Hazzas and Morphaz","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:temple-of-atalhakkar"],"source_hashes":["section:ef3aa4c6366908ebd75ca92ade4273a38245c16e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-temple-of-atalhakkar-sombra-eranikus","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sombra de Eranikus: despeja los dragones","title_en":"Shade of Eranikus: Clear the Dragonkin","summary_es":"Sombra de Eranikus atrae a los dragones que queden; aléjate de Pisotón de guerra y evita su frente.","summary_en":"Shade of Eranikus calls remaining dragonkin; avoid War Stomp and stay out of its front.","keywords_es":["Sombra de Eranikus","jefe final del Templo de Atal'Hakkar","Pisotón de guerra","Somnolencia profunda"],"keywords_en":["Shade of Eranikus","Temple of Atal'Hakkar final boss","War Stomp","Deep Slumber"],"text_es":"Antes de atacar a la Sombra de Eranikus, limpia los enemigos dragonantes que queden: el jefe los invoca durante el combate. Los atacantes a distancia deben mantenerse fuera del alcance de Pisotón de guerra; el cuerpo a cuerpo no debe colocarse delante. Somnolencia profunda afecta al objetivo con más amenaza, así que controla quién mantiene el aggro.","text_en":"Before engaging Shade of Eranikus, clear any remaining dragonkin; the boss summons them during the fight. Ranged players should stay beyond War Stomp range, and melee should not stand in front. Deep Slumber affects the highest-threat target, so manage who holds aggro.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Shade of Eranikus","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:temple-of-atalhakkar"],"source_hashes":["section:3dfd4de967b78d3a65f17df8599541597028a2e6"]},{"id":"mazmorra-temple-of-atalhakkar-avatar-hakkar","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Avatar de Hakkar: apaga los braseros","title_en":"Avatar of Hakkar: Extinguish the Braziers","summary_es":"Reúne sangre Hakkari para apagar los cuatro braseros y controla al jugador afectado por locura.","summary_en":"Collect Hakkari Blood to extinguish all four braziers and control the player hit by insanity.","keywords_es":["Avatar de Hakkar","El dios Hakkar","Vigilasangre Hakkari","Provocar locura"],"keywords_en":["Avatar of Hakkar","The God Hakkar","Hakkari Bloodkeeper","Cause Insanity"],"text_es":"Para invocar al Avatar de Hakkar, alguien del grupo necesita el Huevo de Hakkar de «El dios Hakkar» o el Pergamino de Yeh'kinya tras completar esa misión. Elimina enemigos hasta que aparezca un Vigilasangre Hakkari, recoge la Sangre Hakkari y úsala para apagar los cuatro braseros. Durante el combate, aturde o controla al jugador afectado por Provocar locura y usa Disipar sombra contra Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor si es posible.","text_en":"To summon Avatar of Hakkar, someone in the group needs the Egg of Hakkar from The God Hakkar or Yeh'kinya's Scroll after completing that quest. Kill enemies until a Hakkari Bloodkeeper appears, loot Hakkari Blood, and use it to extinguish the four braziers. During the fight, stun or control the player hit by Cause Insanity and dispel Shadow Word: Pain if possible.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Avatar of Hakkar","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:temple-of-atalhakkar"],"source_hashes":["section:7e1e5e4cdb13735f74f4839cfe2bb71c7728eb8a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-temple-of-atalhakkar-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas del Templo de Atal'Hakkar","title_en":"Temple of Atal'Hakkar Rewards","summary_es":"Las misiones dan objetos como Esencia encadenada de Eranikus; destacan la Piedra draco y Llamada de dragón.","summary_en":"Quests offer items such as Chained Essence of Eranikus; Drakestone and Dragon's Call stand out.","keywords_es":["recompensas del Templo de Atal'Hakkar","Esencia encadenada de Eranikus","Piedra draco","Llamada de dragón","Yelmo de Exilio"],"keywords_en":["Temple of Atal'Hakkar rewards","Chained Essence of Eranikus","Drakestone","Dragon's Call","Helm of Exile"],"text_es":"Entre las recompensas de misión destacadas están el Yelmo de Exilio, el Yelmo de guardia vengador y la Esencia encadenada de Eranikus. Entre el botín de los jefes destacan la Piedra draco, Llamada de dragón y Diente de Eranikus.","text_en":"Notable quest rewards include Helm of Exile, Avenguard Helm, and Chained Essence of Eranikus. Notable boss drops include Drakestone, Dragon's Call, and Tooth of Eranikus.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Every Quest in Temple of Atal'Hakkar in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: The Temple of Atal'Hakkar Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Temple of Atal'Hakkar Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/the-temple-of-atalhakkar-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:temple-of-atalhakkar"],"source_hashes":["section:78d89cb3980ab6e948f7af9f8f113afc4724a46b","section:8c4c10803b61c54a6bb60234cfe5131472f74e86","section:c630709b91d4de90e685cbc01e1732f5c5c9fed9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Profundidades de Roca Negra: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Blackrock Depths: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 52-60; la entrada está en Montaña Roca Negra.","summary_en":"Levels 52-60; the entrance is in Blackrock Mountain.","keywords_es":["profundidades de roca negra","nivel de roca negra","entrada de roca negra"],"keywords_en":["blackrock depths","blackrock depths level","blackrock depths entrance"],"text_es":"Se recomienda para niveles 52-60 y está dentro de Montaña Roca Negra, accesible desde La Garganta de Fuego o Las Estepas Ardientes. La Alianza puede volar a Puesto del Torio o Vigilia de Morgan; la Horda, a Kargath, Puesto del Torio o Flame Crest, y luego seguir las cadenas hasta el portal.","text_en":"Recommended for levels 52-60, it lies inside Blackrock Mountain, reached from Searing Gorge or Burning Steppes. Alliance can fly to Thorium Point or Morgan’s Vigil; Horde can use Kargath, Thorium Point, or Flame Crest, then follow the chains to the portal.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blackrock Depths Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Blackrock Depths in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:de160c3dc1b2fe5313fc74e91caedb9dc2adb69c","section:eaf7cd56cafcabec89ec0ca90e2df7cf9631b8f8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones neutrales de Roca Negra","title_en":"Neutral Blackrock Depths Quests","summary_es":"El legado de los Hierro Negro da la llave; otras misiones empiezan en las Estepas Ardientes.","summary_en":"Dark Iron Legacy grants the key; other quests start in the Burning Steppes.","keywords_es":["misiones de roca negra","el legado de los hierro negro","el corazón de la montaña"],"keywords_en":["blackrock depths quests","dark iron legacy","the heart of the mountain"],"text_es":"El legado de los Hierro Negro empieza con Franclorn Forjador, visible como fantasma en Montaña Roca Negra: complétala para obtener la Llave Sombratiniebla, que permite abrir atajos. El corazón de la montaña se recoge con Maxwort Suprandor en Las Estepas Ardientes y requiere recuperar el objeto tras derrotar a Vigía Presaletal. Un sabor a llamarada se prepara con Cyrus Therepentio en Las Estepas Ardientes, tras la cadena que empieza con Kalaran Espada del Viento en La Garganta de Fuego.","text_en":"Dark Iron Legacy starts with Franclorn Forgewright, visible as a ghost in Blackrock Mountain; completing it grants the Shadowforge Key, which opens shortcuts. The Heart of the Mountain starts with Maxwort Uberglint in the Burning Steppes and requires retrieving the item after defeating Watchman Doomgrip. Prepare A Taste of Flame with Cyrus Therepentous in the Burning Steppes after the chain that starts with Velarok Windblade in Searing Gorge.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blackrock Depths Layout and Navigation in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:35a58e82f37ac27ee6cfc888ca849aceb9234dec","section:db8b2d2cae374d2a0f0bc5fb1154fcd6d55b401e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-misiones-alianza","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones clave de la Alianza","title_en":"Key Alliance Quests","summary_es":"¡Incendius! y El destino del reino son objetivos útiles para la Alianza.","summary_en":"Incendius! and The Fate of the Kingdom are useful Alliance objectives.","keywords_es":["misiones alianza roca negra","¡incendius!","el destino del reino"],"keywords_en":["alliance blackrock quests","incendius quest","the fate of the kingdom"],"text_es":"¡Incendius! se obtiene con Jalinda Espiga en Las Estepas Ardientes después de Gran maestro Pyron y lleva a derrotar a Lord Incendius. La cadena de Kharan Martillazo parte de Forjaz; El destino del reino pide derrotar al Emperador Dagran Thaurissan sin matar a la Princesa Moira Barbabronce.","text_en":"Incendius! starts with Jalinda Sprig in the Burning Steppes after Overmaster Pyron and sends you to defeat Lord Incendius. Kharan Mighthammer’s chain begins in Ironforge; The Fate of the Kingdom asks you to defeat Emperor Dagran Thaurissan without killing Princess Moira Bronzebeard.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:db8b2d2cae374d2a0f0bc5fb1154fcd6d55b401e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-misiones-horda","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones clave de la Horda","title_en":"Key Horde Quests","summary_es":"La Horda puede preparar La revuelta de las máquinas y El rescate real.","summary_en":"Horde can prepare The Rise of the Machines and The Royal Rescue.","keywords_es":["misiones horda roca negra","la revuelta de las máquinas","el rescate real"],"keywords_en":["horde blackrock quests","the rise of the machines","the royal rescue"],"text_es":"La revuelta de las máquinas empieza con Hierofante Theodora Mulvadania en Kargath y culmina con el Señor gólem Argelmach. El rescate real se recoge con Thrall en Orgrimmar tras la cadena del Comandante Gor’shak; requiere derrotar al Emperador Dagran Thaurissan y salvar a la Princesa Moira Barbabronce. La receta perdida de Cebatruenos empieza con Boticaria Zinge en Entrañas y continúa con Maga oscura Vivian Latumba en Kargath; Hurley Negrálito aparece al romper los tres barriles del Tragapenas.","text_en":"The Rise of the Machines starts with Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania in Kargath and culminates with Golem Lord Argelmach. The Royal Rescue starts with Thrall in Orgrimmar after Commander Gor’shak’s chain; it requires defeating Emperor Dagran Thaurissan and rescuing Princess Moira Bronzebeard. Lost Thunderbrew Recipe starts with Apothecary Zinge in Undercity and continues with Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath; Hurley Blackbreath spawns when the three Grim Guzzler kegs are broken.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:db8b2d2cae374d2a0f0bc5fb1154fcd6d55b401e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas destacadas de Roca Negra","title_en":"Notable Blackrock Depths Rewards","summary_es":"La llave abre atajos; las misiones y algunos jefes ofrecen equipo destacado.","summary_en":"The key opens shortcuts; quests and selected bosses offer notable gear.","keywords_es":["recompensas de roca negra","llave sombratiniebla","mano de justicia"],"keywords_en":["blackrock depths rewards","shadowforge key","hand of justice"],"text_es":"El legado de los Hierro Negro da la Llave Sombratiniebla, útil para saltarse parte de la mazmorra. Entre las recompensas de misión destacan Piedracanto de Forjaz y Ojo de Orgrimmar; entre los botines de jefe, Mano de Justicia, Fuerza de voluntad y Ferromazo.","text_en":"Dark Iron Legacy grants the Shadowforge Key, which helps skip part of the dungeon. Notable quest rewards include Songstone of Ironforge and Eye of Orgrimmar; notable boss drops include Hand of Justice, Force of Will, and Ironfoe.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blackrock Depths Layout and Navigation in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blackrock Depths Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:35a58e82f37ac27ee6cfc888ca849aceb9234dec","section:65bdf9cd189a2e249dd920f30f4026af83650cb4","section:ca6f862de1e52ac74f94aa0bdf9ba5b159f1fe03"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-gerstahn","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Alta interrogadora Gerstahn","title_en":"High Interrogator Gerstahn","summary_es":"Su miedo puede atraer otros grupos; interrumpe Quemar maná.","summary_en":"Her fear can pull nearby packs; interrupt Mana Burn.","keywords_es":["alta interrogadora gerstahn","jefe gerstahn","quemar maná"],"keywords_en":["high interrogator gerstahn","gerstahn boss","mana burn"],"text_es":"Alta interrogadora Gerstahn lanza Alarido psíquico, que puede atraer grupos cercanos; coloca al equipo en una esquina para reducir el desplazamiento. Disipa Palabra de las Sombras: Dolor e interrumpe Quemar maná.","text_en":"High Interrogator Gerstahn casts Psychic Scream, which can pull nearby packs; position the group in a corner to limit movement. Remove the effect of Shadow Word: Pain and interrupt Mana Burn.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › High Interrogator Gerstahn","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:6d5270e1e8fb5fcf4fe2617a93339cbbb93092c5"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-roccor","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Lord Roccor","title_en":"Lord Roccor","summary_es":"Vigila Choque de tierra, que puede interrumpir los lanzamientos.","summary_en":"Watch for Earth Shock, which can interrupt casts.","keywords_es":["lord roccor","jefe roccor","choque de tierra roccor"],"keywords_en":["lord roccor","roccor boss","earth shock roccor"],"text_es":"Lord Roccor es un combate sencillo; su principal interrupción es Choque de tierra. No hace falta una táctica especial adicional.","text_en":"Lord Roccor is a straightforward fight; Earth Shock is his main interrupt. No additional special tactic is needed.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lord Roccor","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:55b3bbf7cdb01db7a2a7deb877ab6269f05e3718"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-grebmar","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Domador de jaurías Grebmar","title_en":"Houndmaster Grebmar","summary_es":"Limpia las jaurías a ambos lados de su patrulla antes de enfrentarlo.","summary_en":"Clear the hound packs on both sides of his patrol before engaging.","keywords_es":["domador de jaurías grebmar","jefe grebmar","patrulla de grebmar"],"keywords_en":["houndmaster grebmar","grebmar boss","grebmar patrol"],"text_es":"Domador de jaurías Grebmar patrulla entre dos grupos de sabuesos. Elimina el grupo opuesto a su ruta y espera a que se aleje para limpiar el otro antes de atacarlo.","text_en":"Houndmaster Grebmar patrols between two hound packs. Clear the pack opposite his route, then wait for him to move away before clearing the other one and engaging him.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Houndmaster Grebmar","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:9c02754e4e976daaf88159eb8a66354a45c966c7"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-gorosh","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Gorosh el Endemoniado","title_en":"Gorosh the Dervish","summary_es":"Huracán y Golpe mortal presionan al sanador durante el combate.","summary_en":"Whirlwind and Mortal Strike pressure the healer during the fight.","keywords_es":["gorosh el endemoniado","anillo de la ley","golpe mortal gorosh"],"keywords_en":["gorosh the dervish","ring of the law","gorosh mortal strike"],"text_es":"Gorosh el Endemoniado usa Huracán y Golpe mortal. Mantén la sanación para compensar el efecto de Golpe mortal.","text_en":"Gorosh the Dervish uses Whirlwind and Mortal Strike. Keep healing ready to offset the effect of Mortal Strike.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ring of the Law","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:724ecf67657e2316d307fd665758ce70a92f9ba3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-grisez","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Grisez","title_en":"Grizzle","summary_es":"Tremor terrenal y Enfurecer son sus habilidades destacadas.","summary_en":"Ground Tremor and Enrage are his notable abilities.","keywords_es":["grisez","anillo de la ley","tremor terrenal"],"keywords_en":["grizzle","ring of the law","ground tremor"],"text_es":"Grisez apenas requiere preparación: vigila Tremor terrenal y Enfurecer durante el combate. No necesita una estrategia especial.","text_en":"Grizzle needs little preparation: watch for Ground Tremor and Enrage during the fight. No special strategy is needed.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ring of the Law","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:724ecf67657e2316d307fd665758ce70a92f9ba3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-eviscerador","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Eviscerador","title_en":"Eviscerator","summary_es":"Su Salva de descarga de las Sombras puede mitigarse con protección sombría.","summary_en":"Shadow Bolt Volley can be mitigated with shadow protection.","keywords_es":["eviscerador","anillo de la ley","salva de descarga de las sombras"],"keywords_en":["eviscerator","ring of the law","shadow bolt volley"],"text_es":"Eviscerador destaca por Salva de descarga de las Sombras y Escudo antimagia. La Protección de las Sombras reduce el peligro de su daño sombrío.","text_en":"Eviscerator is notable for Shadow Bolt Volley and Anti-Magic Shield. Shadow Protection reduces the danger from his shadow damage.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ring of the Law","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:724ecf67657e2316d307fd665758ce70a92f9ba3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-okthor","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ok’thor el Rompedor","title_en":"Ok’thor the Breaker","summary_es":"Disipa Polimorfia y mantén al grupo a distancia por Deflagración Arcana.","summary_en":"Dispel Polymorph and keep the group at range for Arcane Explosion.","keywords_es":["ok’thor el rompedor","anillo de la ley","polimorfia okthor"],"keywords_en":["ok’thor the breaker","ring of the law","okthor polymorph"],"text_es":"Ok’thor el Rompedor es uno de los resultados más duros del Anillo de la Ley. Disipa Polimorfia y mantén a tantos miembros como sea posible a distancia para reducir el impacto de Deflagración Arcana.","text_en":"Ok’thor the Breaker is one of the tougher Ring of the Law outcomes. Remove any polymorph effect and keep as many party members at range as possible to reduce the impact of Arcane Explosion.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ring of the Law","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:724ecf67657e2316d307fd665758ce70a92f9ba3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-anubshiah","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Anub’Shiah","title_en":"Anub’Shiah","summary_es":"Disipa de inmediato Maldición de la lengua y Tela envolvente.","summary_en":"Immediately dispel Curse of Tongues and Enveloping Web.","keywords_es":["anub’shiah","anillo de la ley","maldición de la lengua"],"keywords_en":["anub’shiah","ring of the law","curse of tongues"],"text_es":"Anub’Shiah puede aplicar Maldición de la lengua y Tela envolvente. Disipa ambos efectos cuanto antes; el resto del combate requiere poca preparación.","text_en":"Anub’Shiah can apply Curse of Tongues and Enveloping Web. Dispel both effects quickly; the rest of the fight needs little preparation.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ring of the Law","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:724ecf67657e2316d307fd665758ce70a92f9ba3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-hedrum","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hedrum el Trepador","title_en":"Hedrum the Creeper","summary_es":"Limpia sus venenos y elimina el efecto de inmovilización.","summary_en":"Cleanse his poisons and remove the immobilizing effect.","keywords_es":["hedrum el trepador","anillo de la ley","veneno paralizante"],"keywords_en":["hedrum the creeper","ring of the law","paralyzing poison"],"text_es":"Hedrum el Trepador es un combate directo si se limpian sus venenos y se libera a quienes queden inmovilizados. Vigila Veneno aterrador y Veneno paralizante.","text_en":"Hedrum the Creeper is straightforward if his poisons are cleansed and immobilized players are freed. Watch for Baneful Poison and Paralyzing Poison.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ring of the Law","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:724ecf67657e2316d307fd665758ce70a92f9ba3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-theldren","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Theldren","title_en":"Theldren","summary_es":"Se invoca en el Anillo de la Ley con el Estandarte de provocación.","summary_en":"Summon him in the Ring of the Law with the Banner of Provocation.","keywords_es":["theldren","estandarte de provocación","jefe anillo de la ley"],"keywords_en":["theldren","banner of provocation","ring of the law boss"],"text_es":"Theldren se invoca en el Anillo de la Ley con el Estandarte de provocación, obtenido durante la cadena de misiones de nivel 0,5. Tras completar esa misión se recibe otro estandarte para volver a invocarlo.","text_en":"Theldren is summoned in the Ring of the Law with the Banner of Provocation, obtained during the level 0.5 quest chain. Completing that quest grants another banner for future summons.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ring of the Law","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:724ecf67657e2316d307fd665758ce70a92f9ba3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-fineso-virunegro","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Finoso Virunegro","title_en":"Fineous Darkvire","summary_es":"Interrumpe su curación y despeja los enemigos del camino.","summary_en":"Interrupt his healing and clear the enemies along the path.","keywords_es":["finoso virunegro","jefe de roca negra","interrumpir su curación"],"keywords_en":["fineous darkvire","blackrock depths boss","interrupt his heal"],"text_es":"Finoso Virunegro golpea con fuerza y puede curarse. Interrumpe Luz Sagrada y despeja los enemigos del camino para evitar atraerlos durante el combate.","text_en":"Fineous Darkvire hits hard and can heal himself. Stop his healing cast and clear the enemies along the path to avoid pulling them during the fight.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Fineous Darkvire","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:81bf833a73fc273301ab7b3c60450f6137c7b7ec"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-piromantico-cultugrano","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Piromántico Cultugrano","title_en":"Pyromancer Loregrain","summary_es":"Destruye su tótem chamuscador; es un encuentro opcional sencillo.","summary_en":"Destroy his Scorching Totem; this optional encounter is simple.","keywords_es":["piromántico cultugrano","jefe opcional roca negra","tótem chamuscador"],"keywords_en":["pyromancer loregrain","optional blackrock boss","scorching totem"],"text_es":"Piromántico Cultugrano es opcional y fácil. Destruye el Tótem chamuscador para neutralizar su principal molestia.","text_en":"Pyromancer Loregrain is optional and easy. Remove his totem to stop his main nuisance.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Pyromancer Loregrain","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:9e395f823074cda80cc661b81190c5dcdeeee2e3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-baelgar","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bael’Gar","title_en":"Bael’Gar","summary_es":"Elimina sus apariciones y oriéntalo lejos del grupo.","summary_en":"Kill his spawns and face him away from the group.","keywords_es":["bael’gar","jefe baelgar","gapó de magma"],"keywords_en":["bael’gar","baelgar boss","magma splash"],"text_es":"Bael’Gar invoca apariciones que hay que eliminar. El tanque debe orientarlo en dirección opuesta al grupo para evitar que Gapo de magma alcance a los demás.","text_en":"Bael’Gar summons spawns that must be killed. The tank should face him away from the group so Magma Splash does not hit the others.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bael'gar","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:503098a9ed7e45ba5909bef01e35cb4723861af9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-lord-incendius","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Lord Incendius","title_en":"Lord Incendius","summary_es":"Evita que el empuje te arroje de la plataforma.","summary_en":"Avoid being knocked off the platform.","keywords_es":["lord incendius","jefe incendius","plataforma incendius"],"keywords_en":["lord incendius","incendius boss","incendius platform"],"text_es":"Lord Incendius no es difícil, pero su empuje puede arrojar a jugadores fuera de la plataforma. Colócate con cuidado: no hay forma de volver arriba sin morir.","text_en":"Lord Incendius is not difficult, but his knockback can throw players off the platform. Position carefully: there is no way back up without dying.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lord Incendius","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:788a7182b7f6a4dfd981a13ad5d5dd06361ccb78"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-guarda-stilgiss-verek","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Guarda Stilgiss y Verek","title_en":"Warder Stilgiss and Verek","summary_es":"En su aparición poco común, derrota primero al Guarda Stilgiss.","summary_en":"In their rare spawn, defeat Warder Stilgiss first.","keywords_es":["guarda stilgiss","verek","caja fuerte de roca negra"],"keywords_en":["warder stilgiss","verek","blackrock vault"],"text_es":"Guarda Stilgiss aparece junto a Verek en una aparición poco común. Derrota primero al Guarda Stilgiss y después a Verek; el combate no debería ser difícil para un grupo de cinco.","text_en":"Warder Stilgiss appears with Verek in a rare spawn. Defeat him first, then Verek; the encounter should not be difficult for a five-player group.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Vault - Dark Iron Coffers","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:8643b787ad6865c2522a59cb9050d91ba9ae46c3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-vigia-presaletal","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Vigía Presaletal","title_en":"Watchman Doomgrip","summary_es":"Abrir las doce arcas activa el combate y revela la caja fuerte secreta.","summary_en":"Opening all twelve coffers triggers the fight and reveals the Secret Safe.","keywords_es":["vigía presaletal","caja fuerte secreta","arcas de reliquias"],"keywords_en":["watchman doomgrip","secret safe","relic coffers"],"text_es":"Vigía Presaletal aparece al abrir las doce Arcas de reliquias. Derrota a los enemigos para abrir el acceso oculto a la Caja fuerte secreta, donde también aparece El corazón de la montaña.","text_en":"Watchman Doomgrip appears after all twelve coffers are opened. Defeat the enemies to reveal the hidden access to the Secret Safe and the Heart of the Mountain.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Vault - Dark Iron Coffers","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:8643b787ad6865c2522a59cb9050d91ba9ae46c3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-general-forjira","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"General Forjira","title_en":"General Angerforge","summary_es":"Elimina con daño de área los adds que invoca durante el combate.","summary_en":"Use area damage to kill the adds he summons during the fight.","keywords_es":["general forjira","jefe forjira","adds de forjira"],"keywords_en":["general angerforge","angerforge boss","angerforge adds"],"text_es":"General Forjira se comporta como un guerrero y llama adds durante el encuentro. Ataca al jefe y elimina los enemigos invocados con daño de área; el combate se complica si el grupo carece de ese daño.","text_en":"General Angerforge fights like a warrior and calls adds during the encounter. Attack the boss and kill the summoned enemies with area damage; the fight is harder without it.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › General Angerforge","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:139121c1b50bfc306c836f82a85b155e090b64a5"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-senor-golem-argelmach","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Señor gólem Argelmach","title_en":"Golem Lord Argelmach","summary_es":"Separa al grupo para que Cadena de relámpagos no rebote entre jugadores.","summary_en":"Spread out so Chain Lightning does not bounce between players.","keywords_es":["señor gólem argelmach","jefe argelmach","cadena de relámpagos"],"keywords_en":["golem lord argelmach","argelmach boss","chain lightning"],"text_es":"Señor gólem Argelmach usa Cadena de relámpagos, que puede saltar entre los miembros agrupados y causar mucho daño. Mantén distancia entre jugadores durante el combate.","text_en":"Golem Lord Argelmach uses Chain Lightning, which can bounce between clustered players and deal heavy damage. Keep party members spread out during the fight.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Golem Lord Argelmach","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:0b81a5925ff12767339e0cb9b2f3258084107f89"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-falange","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Falange","title_en":"Phalanx","summary_es":"Entrega jarras al Soldado Sinroca para abrir la puerta y prepárate para Falange.","summary_en":"Give mugs to Private Rocknot to open the door and prepare for Phalanx.","keywords_es":["falange","soldado sinroca","tragapenas"],"keywords_en":["phalanx","private rocknot","grim guzzler"],"text_es":"Compra seis Jarras de cerveza tradicional Hierro Negro a Plugger Aropatoso y entrégaselas al Soldado Sinroca; tras tres entregas, Falange se activa y se abre la puerta. Falange golpea con Arremetida poderosa, así que el grupo debe estar listo para combatir.","text_en":"Buy six mugs from Plugger Spazzring and give them to Private Rocknot; after three turn-ins, Phalanx activates and the door opens. Phalanx hits with Mighty Blow, so the group should be ready to fight.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Grim Guzzler","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:15e15fd7ef71365a6bb27a3485923f4e089cdfd2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-hurley-negralito","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hurley Negrálito","title_en":"Hurley Blackbreath","summary_es":"Rompe los tres barriles para hacerlo aparecer; controla a sus guardias.","summary_en":"Break the three kegs to spawn him; control his guards.","keywords_es":["hurley negrálito","receta de cebatruenos perdida","barriles tragapenas"],"keywords_en":["hurley blackbreath","lost thunderbrew recipe","grim guzzler kegs"],"text_es":"Hurley Negrálito aparece al romper los tres barriles de la despensa del Tragapenas y llega con tres guardias. Controla a los guardias y centra el daño en Hurley.","text_en":"Hurley Blackbreath appears after the three kegs in the Grim Guzzler storage room are broken and arrives with three guards. Control the guards and focus damage on Hurley.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Grim Guzzler","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:15e15fd7ef71365a6bb27a3485923f4e089cdfd2","section:db8b2d2cae374d2a0f0bc5fb1154fcd6d55b401e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-ribbly-llavenrosca","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ribbly Llavenrosca","title_en":"Ribbly Screwspigot","summary_es":"Es un combate sencillo; la misión pide recuperar su cabeza.","summary_en":"This is a simple fight; the quest asks you to retrieve his head.","keywords_es":["ribbly llavenrosca","misión de ribbly","tragapenas"],"keywords_en":["ribbly screwspigot","ribbly quest","grim guzzler"],"text_es":"Ribbly Llavenrosca es un encuentro sencillo, sin una mecánica especial que requiera preparación. La misión homónima se recoge con Yuka Llavenrosca en Las Estepas Ardientes y pide recuperar su cabeza.","text_en":"Ribbly Screwspigot is a simple encounter with no special mechanic requiring preparation. The quest of the same name starts with Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes and asks you to retrieve his head.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Grim Guzzler","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:15e15fd7ef71365a6bb27a3485923f4e089cdfd2","section:db8b2d2cae374d2a0f0bc5fb1154fcd6d55b401e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-plugger-aropatoso","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Plugger Aropatoso","title_en":"Plugger Spazzring","summary_es":"Puede volverse hostil si saqueas demasiadas jarras; despeja el bar antes.","summary_en":"He can turn hostile if too many mugs are looted; clear the bar first.","keywords_es":["plugger aropatoso","jefe del tragapenas","faca de camarero"],"keywords_en":["plugger spazzring","grim guzzler boss","barman shanker"],"text_es":"Plugger Aropatoso puede volverse hostil si saqueas demasiadas jarras de su mesa o le robas la llave. Despeja primero a los clientes para evitar que se unan al combate y vigila su Descarga de las Sombras.","text_en":"Plugger Spazzring can turn hostile if too many mugs are looted from his table or his key is pickpocketed. Clear the patrons first so they do not join the fight, and watch for his Shadow Bolt.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Grim Guzzler","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:15e15fd7ef71365a6bb27a3485923f4e089cdfd2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-embajador-latifuego","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Embajador Latifuego","title_en":"Ambassador Flamelash","summary_es":"Elimina los espíritus antes de que alcancen al jefe y aumenten su poder.","summary_en":"Kill the spirits before they reach the boss and empower him.","keywords_es":["embajador latifuego","espíritu ardiente","jefe roca negra"],"keywords_en":["ambassador flamelash","burning spirit","blackrock depths boss"],"text_es":"Embajador Latifuego invoca espíritus que lo fortalecen si llegan hasta él. Elimínalos lejos del jefe para mantener bajas sus acumulaciones.","text_en":"Ambassador Flamelash summons spirits that empower him if they reach him. Kill them away from the boss to keep his stacks low.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ambassador Flamelash","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:8783abfe2086d837a5c1ebedbf54f7920e1deeac"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-panzor","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Panzor el Invencible","title_en":"Panzor the Invincible","summary_es":"Los lanzadores de hechizos deben tener cuidado con Refracción de hechizos.","summary_en":"Casters should watch for Spell Reflection.","keywords_es":["panzor el invencible","jefe poco común roca negra","refracción de hechizos"],"keywords_en":["panzor the invincible","blackrock rare boss","spell reflection"],"text_es":"Panzor el Invencible es una aparición poco común de la Fundición de Moldes. Quienes lancen hechizos deben vigilar Refracción de hechizos; fuera de eso, el encuentro es sencillo.","text_en":"Panzor the Invincible is a rare spawn in the Mold Foundry. Spellcasters should watch for Spell Reflection; otherwise, the encounter is simple.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Panzor the Invincible","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:6e9f7d8da233ebffeb0a0d75bb26f64a0a29db14"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-cofre-de-los-siete","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cofre de los Siete","title_en":"Chest of the Seven","summary_es":"Derrota rápido cada una de las siete oleadas para evitar que se acumulen.","summary_en":"Defeat each of the seven waves quickly so they do not overlap.","keywords_es":["cofre de los siete","siete oleadas roca negra","espíritus enanos"],"keywords_en":["chest of the seven","seven waves blackrock","dwarven spirits"],"text_es":"Cofre de los Siete activa siete oleadas de espíritus enanos. Acaba rápido con cada uno: aparecen según un temporizador y pueden sumarse varios enemigos si el grupo tarda demasiado.","text_en":"Chest of the Seven triggers seven waves of dwarven spirits. Kill each quickly: they spawn on a timer, so multiple enemies can overlap if the group takes too long.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Chest of the Seven - Summoners' Tomb","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:80f7dec498b7a5a00b6eb297ab967c191f18a16f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-liceo","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Liceo: carrera de antorchas","title_en":"The Lyceum: Torch Gauntlet","summary_es":"Consigue dos antorchas rápido y esquiva el fuego mientras avanzas.","summary_en":"Get two torches quickly and avoid the fire as you move through.","keywords_es":["liceo roca negra","antorcha sombratiniebla","vigilante de la llama forjatiniebla"],"keywords_en":["blackrock lyceum","shadowforge torch","shadowforge flame keeper"],"text_es":"En la zona del Liceo, el Vigilante de la Llama Forjatiniebla suelta las antorchas necesarias para encender los braseros. Atrae pocos grupos normales y consigue dos antorchas antes de que reaparezcan; esquiva las llamas al cruzar.","text_en":"Two flame keepers drop the torches needed to light the braziers. Pull few normal packs and get two torches before they respawn; dodge the flames while crossing.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Lyceum Gauntlet","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:b1762171898240d6c1a6373fbb4dc74045920c7a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-magmus","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Magmus","title_en":"Magmus","summary_es":"La posición del jefe evita las llamas laterales de la cámara.","summary_en":"Position the boss to avoid the chamber’s side flames.","keywords_es":["magmus","jefe magmus","llamas del liceo"],"keywords_en":["magmus","magmus boss","lyceum flames"],"text_es":"Magmus combate al final de una cámara con gólems que expulsan fuego desde ambos lados. El tanque debe colocarlo en una posición segura para que las llamas no alcancen al grupo.","text_en":"Magmus fights at the end of a chamber where golems spew fire from both sides. The tank should position him safely so the flames do not hit the group.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Magmus","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:105ea477fe405b2be3e9796b1a33ae5cbe4fd2e8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-blackrock-depths-emperador-dagran-thaurissan","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Emperador Dagran Thaurissan","title_en":"Emperor Dagran Thaurissan","summary_es":"Para completar las misiones, mantén ocupada a Moira y no la mates.","summary_en":"For the quests, keep Moira occupied and do not kill her.","keywords_es":["emperador dagran thaurissan","princesa moira","jefe final roca negra"],"keywords_en":["emperor dagran thaurissan","princess moira","blackrock final boss"],"text_es":"Emperador Dagran Thaurissan es el encuentro final. Si quieres salvar a la Princesa Moira Barbabronce, asígnale un tanque secundario o interrumpe sus hechizos; mantenerla viva permite completar las misiones de ambas facciones.","text_en":"Emperor Dagran Thaurissan is the final encounter. To save Princess Moira Bronzebeard, assign an off-tank or interrupt her casts; keeping her alive allows both factions’ quests to be completed.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Emperor Dagran Thaurissan","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Blackrock Depths Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blackrock Depths Layout and Navigation in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/blackrock-depths-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:blackrock-depths"],"source_hashes":["section:35a58e82f37ac27ee6cfc888ca849aceb9234dec","section:fe7586bfc20030b3396e7626e4be39bd5b56f9f8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cumbre de Roca Negra inferior: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Lower Blackrock Spire: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Recomendada para niveles 55-60; el acceso está en Montaña Roca Negra.","summary_en":"Recommended for levels 55-60; the entrance is in Blackrock Mountain.","keywords_es":["Cumbre de Roca Negra inferior","LBRS","entrada de Cumbre de Roca Negra","nivel de Cumbre de Roca Negra"],"keywords_en":["lower blackrock spire","LBRS entrance","lower blackrock spire level","blackrock mountain dungeon"],"text_es":"Cumbre de Roca Negra inferior (LBRS) se recomienda para niveles 55-60 y está en Montaña Roca Negra. La Alianza puede volar a Puesto del Torio o Vigilia de Morgan; la Horda, a Kargath, Puesto del Torio o Peñasco Llamarada. Desde la entrada común, toma la rampa derecha del puente para llegar a LBRS; la izquierda conduce a la parte superior.","text_en":"Lower Blackrock Spire (LBRS) is recommended for levels 55-60 and lies in Blackrock Mountain. Alliance can fly to Thorium Point or Morgan’s Vigil; Horde can fly to Kargath, Thorium Point, or Flame Crest. From the shared entrance, take the bridge’s right ramp for LBRS; the left leads to the upper dungeon.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lower Blackrock Spire Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Lower Blackrock Spire in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:18a80ee19e8c52f4910af53845c7be97bb40040d","section:696af7405429746336a7bfa4478d6d966b99356c"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Cumbre de Roca Negra inferior","title_en":"Recommended Lower Blackrock Spire Quests","summary_es":"Recoge en Kargath las cadenas de Horda; Kibler y John Andrajoso ofrecen objetivos para ambas facciones.","summary_en":"Pick up Horde chains in Kargath; Kibler and Ragged John offer objectives for both factions.","keywords_es":["misiones de LBRS","La orden del Señor de la Guerra","La espía Bijou","Bestia amaestrada","La leche de la madre"],"keywords_en":["LBRS quests","Warlord’s Command","Operative Bijou","En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why","Mother’s Milk"],"text_es":"Antes de entrar, la Horda puede recoger La orden del Señor de la Guerra, La espía Bijou y La maestra de la manada en Kargath. Para ambas facciones, Kibler en Las Estepas Ardientes ofrece Bestia amaestrada y Las mascotas exótica de Kibler; John Andrajoso, también allí, da La leche de la madre. La Alianza puede aceptar Acaba con el origen de la amenaza con Helendis Rivacuerno en Las Estepas Ardientes. El Lacre de ascensión sin adornar inicia otra misión, El Sello de ascensión, al obtenerse dentro de la mazmorra.","text_en":"Before entering, Horde can pick up Warlord’s Command, Operative Bijou, and The Pack Mistress in Kargath. For either faction, Kibler in the Burning Steppes offers En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why and Kibler’s Exotic Pets; Ragged John, also there, gives Mother’s Milk. Alliance can accept Put Her Down from Helendis Riverhorn in the Burning Steppes. An unadorned seal can start Seal of Ascension after you find it inside the dungeon.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Pack Mistress (H)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Operative Bijou (H)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Warlord's Command (H)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Put Her Down (A)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Kibler's Exotic Pets","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Mother's Milk","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Seal of Ascension","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["guide:8d26ada1c7db1b095d38af442c8f080d1dfa3166","section:60255357bb190000743f8abbc3d6a28b7c79d2f4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Cumbre de Roca Negra inferior","title_en":"Lower Blackrock Spire Rewards","summary_es":"Las misiones ofrecen equipo a elegir; destacan objetos de jefes como Corazón de Vermisthalak.","summary_en":"Quests offer gear choices; notable boss drops include items such as Heart of Wyrmthalak.","keywords_es":["recompensas LBRS","botín de Cumbre de Roca Negra inferior","Corazón de Vermisthalak","Marca del Señor Dragón"],"keywords_en":["LBRS rewards","lower blackrock spire loot","Heart of Wyrmthalak","Mark of the Dragon Lord"],"text_es":"Las misiones ofrecen equipo, como los objetos a elegir de La misión de Maxwell. Entre los botines destacados están el Corazón de Vermisthalak y la Marca del Señor Dragón de Señor supremo Vermiothalak, además del Diseño: segadora de arcanita de Bannok Hachamacabra. Son ejemplos, no la lista completa de botín.","text_en":"Quests offer gear, including the choice of items from Maxwell’s Mission. Notable drops include Heart of Wyrmthalak and Mark of the Dragon Lord from Overlord Wyrmthalak, as well as Plans: Arcanite Reaper from Bannok Grimaxe. These are examples, not the complete loot list.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lower Blackrock Spire Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Mor Grayhoof","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bannok Grimaxe <Firebrand Legion Champion> (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:0a80801b12952331abb7a5c35cc345b826026e55","section:68faead6226360b19de33182962e730db4f4b6f2","section:7a4aff812952bf57ab69f8ed05ec7ffcb902677f","section:af1cf8a1ef93749ab23fa0f64b113ae4234df9e7"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-spirestone-carnicero","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Carnicero Cumbrerroca","title_en":"Spirestone Butcher","summary_es":"Este ogro de élite de nivel 57 aparece en la ruta hacia Omokk.","summary_en":"This level-57 elite ogre appears on the route to Omokk.","keywords_es":["Carnicero Cumbrerroca","Spirestone Butcher","jefe raro de LBRS","Delantal de carnicero"],"keywords_en":["Spirestone Butcher","LBRS rare boss","Butcher’s Apron","Rivenspike"],"text_es":"Carnicero Cumbrerroca es un ogro de élite de nivel 57. Sigue despejando el pasillo hacia la cámara de Alto Señor Omokk; en el grupo anterior al jefe puede aparecer el raro Señor de batalla Cumbrerroca. Entre los objetos asociados al Carnicero están el Delantal de carnicero y la Puafilada.","text_en":"Spirestone Butcher is a level-57 elite ogre. Continue along the passage; the rare Spirestone Battle Lord may appear in the group before the boss. Loot examples are Butcher’s Apron and Rivenspike.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Spirestone Butcher (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lower Blackrock Spire Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:0311a9e6e9307af8ab94261f75d11a8ea8026bbf","section:0a80801b12952331abb7a5c35cc345b826026e55"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-senor-de-batalla-cumbrerroca","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Señor de batalla Cumbrerroca","title_en":"Spirestone Battle Lord","summary_es":"Si aparece con dos lanzadores, elimínalos primero o mantenlos bajo control.","summary_en":"If he spawns with two casters, kill or control them first.","keywords_es":["Señor de batalla Cumbrerroca","Spirestone Battle Lord","jefe raro LBRS","Botas de batalla Dardoveloz"],"keywords_en":["Spirestone Battle Lord","LBRS rare boss strategy","casters in LBRS","Spirestone Battle Lord loot"],"text_es":"Señor de batalla Cumbrerroca puede aparecer en la sala cercana a Alto Señor Omokk acompañado de dos lanzadores. El grupo suele acabar primero con ellos o controlarlos; el tanque debe mantener la amenaza sobre el jefe antes de que el resto ataque. Entre sus objetos notables están las Botas de batalla Dardoveloz y La Cercenadora de Roca Negra.","text_en":"Spirestone Battle Lord can spawn in the room near Highlord Omokk with two casters. The group usually kills or controls them first; the tank should establish threat on the boss before the others attack. Notable items include Swiftdart Battleboots and The Blackrock Slicer.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Spirestone Battle Lord (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lower Blackrock Spire Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:0a80801b12952331abb7a5c35cc345b826026e55","section:bfb0c946279d79999eab20c412882994a63b8c33"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-alto-senor-omokk","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Alto Señor Omokk","title_en":"Highlord Omokk","summary_es":"Controla a sus dos ogros y mantén al jefe de espaldas a una pared por su empujón.","summary_en":"Control his two ogres and keep the boss backed against a wall to handle his knockback.","keywords_es":["Alto Señor Omokk","jefe Omokk","Mamporro de Omokk","estrategia LBRS"],"keywords_en":["Highlord Omokk","Omokk boss","Knock Away","LBRS strategy"],"text_es":"Alto Señor Omokk combate junto a dos ogros: controla al menos a uno y decide si eliminar primero al otro. El tanque debe darle la espalda a una pared para evitar que Mamporro lo lance lejos; vigila también su Enfurecer. Su cabeza sirve, junto con una Pica despiadada, para invocar a Urok Aullapocalipsis.","text_en":"Highlord Omokk faces the group with two ogres at his side. Control at least one and decide whether to kill the other first. The tank should keep its back to a wall against Knock Away and watch for Enrage. His head combines with a Roughshod Pike to summon Urok.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Highlord Omokk","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:e841f5a94b91e1db68c933231a6c54dacafe65a9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-cazador-de-las-sombras-voshgajin","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cazador de las Sombras Vosh’gajin","title_en":"Shadow Hunter Vosh’gajin","summary_es":"Controla a sus acompañantes y aparta al jefe para limitar Maleficio.","summary_en":"Control her companions and pull the boss away to limit Hex.","keywords_es":["Cazador de las Sombras Vosh’gajin","Vosh’gajin LBRS","Maleficio","Maldición de sangre"],"keywords_en":["Shadow Hunter Vosh’gajin","Vosh’gajin LBRS","Hex","Curse of Blood"],"text_es":"Cazador de las Sombras Vosh’gajin va acompañada de dos Sacerdotes de las Sombras Espina Ahumada. Controla a uno y elimina primero a los sacerdotes; aleja a Vosh’gajin del grupo porque Maleficio puede afectar a varios personajes. Un Mago o Druida puede quitar Maldición de sangre.","text_en":"Two Smolderthorn Shadow Priests fight beside Shadow Hunter Vosh’gajin. Control one and defeat the priests first; draw Vosh’gajin away from the group because Hex can affect several players. A Mage or Druid can dispel the curse.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Shadow Hunter Vosh’gajin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:5e51306cd54f50502dee8e88505056ba30095875"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-maestro-de-guerra-voone","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Maestro de guerra Voone","title_en":"War Master Voone","summary_es":"Golpea con fuerza: espera a que el tanque genere amenaza y colócalo junto a una pared.","summary_en":"He hits hard: let the tank build threat and position him by a wall.","keywords_es":["Maestro de guerra Voone","War Master Voone","Voone LBRS","Mellar de Voone"],"keywords_en":["War Master Voone","Voone LBRS","Voone Cleave","LBRS boss strategy"],"text_es":"Maestro de guerra Voone no tiene guardias, pero golpea con fuerza y usa Mellar. Espera a que el tanque genere amenaza antes de atacar; conviene mantenerlo junto a una pared. Si cambia de objetivo, detén el daño hasta que el tanque recupere la amenaza.","text_en":"War Master Voone has no guards, but hits hard and uses Cleave. Wait for the tank to build threat before attacking; keep him near a wall. If he changes targets, stop dealing damage until the tank regains threat.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › War Master Voone","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:73708aeff4a99789d7812707f06b6f61a7caa2c7"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-mor-ruciapezuna","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Mor Ruciapezuña","title_en":"Mor Grayhoof","summary_es":"Se invoca en la sala de Voone con el Blandón de Señalización de una misión de conjunto.","summary_en":"Summon him in Voone’s room using the Brazier of Beckoning from a tier-set quest.","keywords_es":["Mor Ruciapezuña","Mor Grayhoof","invocar a Mor Ruciapezuña","Blandón de Señalización"],"keywords_en":["Mor Grayhoof","summon Mor Grayhoof","Brazier of Beckoning","LBRS boss"],"text_es":"Mor Ruciapezuña se invoca en la sala del Maestro de guerra Voone usando el Blandón de Señalización, que se obtiene en una de las misiones de conjunto de nivel 0,5 que pide derrotarlo. Si no recibiste una de esas misiones, puedes invocarlo más adelante con el Blandón de Invocación, al terminar la cadena correspondiente.","text_en":"Mor Grayhoof is summoned in War Master Voone’s room with the Brazier of Beckoning, obtained from one of the tier 0.5 quests that asks you to defeat him. If you did not receive one of those quests, you can summon him later with the Brazier of Invocation after completing the corresponding quest chain.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Mor Grayhoof","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:68faead6226360b19de33182962e730db4f4b6f2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-bannok-hachamacabra","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bannok Hachamacabra","title_en":"Bannok Grimaxe","summary_es":"Este raro puede aparecer antes de Madre Telabrasada y soltar el Diseño: segadora de arcanita.","summary_en":"This rare can spawn before Mother Smolderweb and drop Plans: Arcanite Reaper.","keywords_es":["Bannok Hachamacabra","Bannok Grimaxe","Diseño: segadora de arcanita","jefe raro LBRS"],"keywords_en":["Bannok Grimaxe","Plans: Arcanite Reaper","LBRS rare boss","Bannok loot"],"text_es":"Bannok Hachamacabra puede aparecer entre los grupos de orcos en la sala antes de Madre Telabrasada. Es un enemigo poco común buscado por la posibilidad de obtener el Diseño: segadora de arcanita.","text_en":"Bannok Grimaxe can spawn among the orc packs in the room before Mother Smolderweb. He is a rare enemy sought for the chance to obtain Plans: Arcanite Reaper.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Bannok Grimaxe <Firebrand Legion Champion> (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:af1cf8a1ef93749ab23fa0f64b113ae4234df9e7"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-madre-telabrasada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Madre Telabrasada","title_en":"Mother Smolderweb","summary_es":"Aparta su cono frontal y vigila Leche materna, que aturde al objetivo y a quienes estén cerca.","summary_en":"Avoid her frontal cone and watch Mother’s Milk, which stuns the target and nearby players.","keywords_es":["Madre Telabrasada","Mother Smolderweb","Cristalizar","Leche materna"],"keywords_en":["Mother Smolderweb","Crystallize","Mother’s Milk","LBRS spider boss"],"text_es":"Madre Telabrasada lanza Cristalizar, un aturdimiento frontal en área: el tanque debe orientarla lejos del grupo. Leche materna es un veneno que aturde al objetivo y a quienes estén cerca; la Glándula de veneno de inmaduro puede curarlo. Al saquear huevos para Bestia amaestrada pueden aparecer más arañitas.","text_en":"Mother Smolderweb casts Crystallize, a frontal area stun: the tank should face her away from the group. Mother’s Milk is a poison that stuns its target and nearby players; an Immature Venom Sac can cure it. Looting eggs for En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why can spawn more spiderlings.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Mother Smolderweb","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:16d18a867433f3eda600f569fff6a2556753e984"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-colmillo-de-cristal","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Colmillor de cristal","title_en":"Crystal Fang","summary_es":"Este raro aparece en el área de arañas próxima a la guarida de Madre Telabrasada.","summary_en":"This rare spawns in the spider area near Mother Smolderweb’s lair.","keywords_es":["Colmillor de cristal","Crystal Fang","jefe raro de LBRS","Colmillo de la Araña de cristal"],"keywords_en":["Crystal Fang","LBRS rare boss","Fang of the Crystal Spider","Crystal Fang location"],"text_es":"Colmillor de cristal es una aparición poco común en el área de arañas de Cumbre de Roca Negra inferior. Entre sus objetos destacados está el Colmillo de la Araña de cristal.","text_en":"Crystal Fang is a rare spawn in the dungeon’s spider passages. A notable item from it is the Fang of the Crystal Spider.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Crystal Fang (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lower Blackrock Spire Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Mor Grayhoof","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:0a80801b12952331abb7a5c35cc345b826026e55","section:68faead6226360b19de33182962e730db4f4b6f2","section:8413e277d89f04cb6437ea34f9897fa08d16d758"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-urok-aullapocalipsis","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Urok Aullapocalipsis","title_en":"Urok Doomhowl","summary_es":"Durante las oleadas, usa la pica para eliminar un ogro cada 30 segundos y añade control de masas.","summary_en":"During the waves, use the pike to kill one ogre every 30 seconds and add crowd control.","keywords_es":["Urok Aullapocalipsis","Urok Doomhowl","invocar a Urok","Pica despiadada"],"keywords_en":["Urok Doomhowl","summon Urok","Roughshod Pike","Urok waves"],"text_es":"Invoca a Urok Aullapocalipsis colocando la Cabeza de Omokk combinada con una Pica despiadada en la pila de tributo. Primero llegan varias oleadas de ogros de élite: cada 30 segundos puedes usar la pica contra un ogro para matarlo al instante, y el control ayuda a contener a los demás. Urok aparece tras las oleadas y puede usar Clamor intimidador, que provoca miedo.","text_en":"Summon Urok Doomhowl by placing Omokk’s Head combined with a Roughshod Pike on the tribute pile. Several waves of elite ogres arrive first: every 30 seconds, you can use the pike on one ogre to kill it instantly, and crowd control helps manage the others. Urok appears after the waves and can use Intimidating Roar, which causes fear.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Urok Doomhowl","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:eb582f4a5ad1d0b636388f210ebfeae248435b20"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-intendente-zigris","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Intendente Zigris","title_en":"Quartermaster Zigris","summary_es":"Patrulla por la sala tras el combate de Urok; despeja la habitación antes del siguiente jefe.","summary_en":"He patrols the room after Urok; clear the area before the next boss.","keywords_es":["Intendente Zigris","Quartermaster Zigris","Zigris LBRS","botín de Zigris"],"keywords_en":["Quartermaster Zigris","Zigris LBRS","Quartermaster Zigris loot","LBRS patrol"],"text_es":"Intendente Zigris patrulla por una sala después de Urok Aullapocalipsis. Despeja la habitación antes de atraer al jefe siguiente. Entre sus objetos notables están el Diseño: aniquilador y el Baúl del intendente Zigris.","text_en":"Quartermaster Zigris patrols a room after Urok Doomhowl. Clear the area before pulling the next boss. Notable drops include Plans: Annihilator and the quartermaster’s footlocker.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quartermaster Zigris","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lower Blackrock Spire Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Mor Grayhoof","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:0a80801b12952331abb7a5c35cc345b826026e55","section:68faead6226360b19de33182962e730db4f4b6f2","section:e5e17278619b2ff8ede4a2afb4b6cef5ba81d606"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-halycon","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Halycon","title_en":"Halycon","summary_es":"El jefe llega con cachorros de huargo: el grupo debe eliminarlos antes de centrarse en Halycon.","summary_en":"The boss comes with worg pups: kill them before focusing on Halycon.","keywords_es":["Halycon","jefe Halycon LBRS","Cachorro de huargo","Collar de pinchos de Halycon"],"keywords_en":["Halycon","Halycon boss LBRS","Worg Pup","Halycon loot"],"text_es":"Halycon aparece con varios esbirros de tipo Cachorro de huargo. El tanque recoge a Halycon mientras el resto los elimina; después, el grupo se centra en el jefe, que usa Desgarrar y Vapulear.","text_en":"Halycon appears with Worg Pup adds. The tank picks up Halycon while the rest defeat them; then the group focuses on the boss, who uses Rend and Thrash.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Halycon","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lower Blackrock Spire Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:0a80801b12952331abb7a5c35cc345b826026e55","section:285982c1d0bf48103748458ee970f906983278fd"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-gizrul-el-esclavista","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Gizrul el esclavista","title_en":"Gizrul the Slavener","summary_es":"Vigila Mordida fatal, que lo cura, y Mordida infectada, que inflige daño periódico de Naturaleza.","summary_en":"Watch Fatal Bite, which heals him, and Infected Bite, which deals nature damage over time.","keywords_es":["Gizrul el esclavista","Gizrul the Slavener","Mordida fatal","Mordida infectada"],"keywords_en":["Gizrul the Slavener","Fatal Bite","Infected Bite","Gizrul LBRS"],"text_es":"Gizrul el esclavista golpea con fuerza. Mordida fatal lo cura y Mordida infectada causa daño de Naturaleza periódico; el tanque debe fijar la amenaza antes de que el grupo desate el daño.","text_en":"Gizrul the Slavener hits hard. Fatal Bite heals him and Infected Bite causes nature damage over time; the tank should establish threat before the group attacks.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Gizrul the Slavener","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:4d0a3340856639df6de4245a689414fc2f777da8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-lower-blackrock-spire-senor-supremo-vermiothalak","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Señor supremo Vermiothalak","title_en":"Overlord Wyrmthalak","summary_es":"A mitad de salud invoca esbirros; contrólalos y concentra el daño en el jefe.","summary_en":"At half health he summons adds; control them and focus damage on the boss.","keywords_es":["Señor supremo Vermiothalak","Overlord Wyrmthalak","jefe final LBRS","esbirros de Vermiothalak"],"keywords_en":["Overlord Wyrmthalak","final LBRS boss","Wyrmthalak adds","Wyrmthalak strategy"],"text_es":"Señor supremo Vermiothalak es el jefe final de Cumbre de Roca Negra inferior. Al llegar al 50% de salud invoca esbirros; lo habitual es controlarlos y derrotar al jefe antes de ocuparse de ellos. El tanque debe mantenerlo apartado del grupo y con la espalda contra una pared.","text_en":"The last fight in LBRS is against Overlord Wyrmthalak. At 50% health he summons adds; control them and focus on him before dealing with them. The tank should keep him away from the group and backed against a wall.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Lower Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Overlord Wyrmthalak","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/lower-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:lower-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:a3f3fb77c019ab5b26e8cecf9054ba0157b8be85"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cumbre de Roca Negra superior: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Upper Blackrock Spire: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Recomendada para niveles 55-60; la entrada común está en Montaña Roca Negra.","summary_en":"Recommended for levels 55-60; the shared entrance is in Blackrock Mountain.","keywords_es":["Cumbre de Roca Negra superior","UBRS","entrada de Cumbre de Roca Negra","nivel de Cumbre de Roca Negra"],"keywords_en":["upper blackrock spire","UBRS entrance","upper blackrock spire level","blackrock mountain dungeon"],"text_es":"Cumbre de Roca Negra superior (UBRS) se recomienda para niveles 55-60. La entrada común está en Montaña Roca Negra, accesible desde La Garganta de Fuego o Las Estepas Ardientes. La Alianza puede volar a Puesto del Torio o Vigilia de Morgan; la Horda, a Kargath, Puesto del Torio o Peñasco Llamarada. Sube por la cadena hasta el balcón y, dentro, toma la rampa izquierda del puente.","text_en":"Upper Blackrock Spire (UBRS) is recommended for levels 55-60. The shared entrance is in Blackrock Mountain, reached from Searing Gorge or Burning Steppes. Alliance can fly to Thorium Point or Morgan’s Vigil; Horde can fly to Kargath, Thorium Point, or Flame Crest. Climb the chain to the balcony and, inside, take the bridge’s left ramp.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Upper Blackrock Spire Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Upper Blackrock Spire in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:684345153f0795925d9346520d3e50231ffd99f3","section:f1eaa3ae435817360a9fdf533794892771e32347"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de Cumbre de Roca Negra superior","title_en":"Recommended Upper Blackrock Spire Quests","summary_es":"Prepara Ojo de brasadivino y La orden de Puño Negro antes de entrar.","summary_en":"Pick up Eye of the Emberseer and Blackhand’s Command before entering.","keywords_es":["misiones de UBRS","Ojo de brasadivino","La orden de Puño Negro","Muerte al general Drakkisath","misiones de Cumbre de Roca Negra superior"],"keywords_en":["UBRS quests","Eye of the Emberseer","Blackhand’s Command","General Drakkisath’s Demise","upper blackrock spire quests"],"text_es":"Antes de entrar, recoge La orden de Puño Negro, que deja el Intendente Escudo del Estigma fuera de la mazmorra y comienza la sintonización de Guarida de Alanegra. Ambas facciones pueden aceptar Ojo de brasadivino con Duque Hydraxis en Azshara, tras Sirocosos y reptarenas y Agua envenenada. La Alianza puede preparar Muerte al general Drakkisath con Mariscal Maxwell en Vigilia de Morgan; la Horda puede iniciar ¡Por la Horda! con Thrall en Orgrimmar después de La orden del Señor de la Guerra y La sabiduría de Eitrigg.","text_en":"Before entering, pick up Blackhand’s Command, dropped by the Scarshield Quartermaster outside the dungeon; it begins the attunement for Blackwing Lair. Either faction can accept Eye of the Emberseer from Duke Hydraxis in Azshara after Stormers and Rumblers and Poisoned Water. Alliance can prepare General Drakkisath’s Demise with Marshal Maxwell at Morgan’s Vigil; Horde can start For The Horde! with Thrall in Orgrimmar after Warlord’s Command and Eitrigg’s Wisdom.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Eye of the Emberseer","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blackhand's Command","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › General Drakkisath's Demise","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › For The Horde!","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["guide:ca541b946422cc9eb23983b39ef1010aaf7c01e5","section:2da2c50da4d24f91677fe46546c3e6771b4b449f"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-piroguardian-brasadivino","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Piroguardián brasadivino","title_en":"Pyroguard Emberseer","summary_es":"Aparta al Piroguardián brasadivino del grupo para reducir el daño de su nova de fuego.","summary_en":"Keep Pyroguard Emberseer away from the group to limit fire nova damage.","keywords_es":["Piroguardián brasadivino","jefe Pyroguard Emberseer","estrategia de UBRS","nova de fuego de Emberseer"],"keywords_en":["Pyroguard Emberseer","Emberseer boss strategy","UBRS boss","Emberseer fire nova"],"text_es":"El Piroguardián brasadivino queda libre al activar el altar y derrotar a los carceleros. El tanque debe mantenerlo apartado del grupo para que su nova de fuego no alcance a varios jugadores.","text_en":"Pyroguard Emberseer is freed by activating the altar and defeating the jailers. The tank should keep Pyroguard Emberseer away from the group so his fire nova does not hit several players.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Pyroguard Emberseer - Hall of Binding","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:f93d0dc0fa4e92a33fcc4a1b265044b67111f87a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-solakar-corona-de-fuego","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Solakar Corona de Fuego","title_en":"Solakar Flamewreath","summary_es":"En el evento, elimina rápido a quienes rompen huevos y mantén al grupo a distancia de Solakar.","summary_en":"During the event, quickly kill egg-breakers and keep the group at range from Solakar.","keywords_es":["Solakar Corona de Fuego","evento de Llama padre","jefe de la sala de los huevos","estrategia de Solakar"],"keywords_en":["Solakar Flamewreath","Father Flame event","Rookery boss","Solakar strategy"],"text_es":"El evento envía varias oleadas; prioriza a los enemigos que rompen huevos y deja a los guardianes para los tanques. Solakar Corona de Fuego aparece después; el tanque debe mantenerlo junto a la pared y el grupo a distancia para evitar su Pisotón de guerra.","text_en":"The event sends several waves; prioritize the enemies that break eggs and leave the guardians to the tanks. Solakar Flamewreath appears afterward; the tank should hold him by the wall while the group stays at range to avoid his War Stomp.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Rookery - Father Flame","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:7599b45fd5910b0e9d51d5c784b12445f41efb73"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-goraluk-yunquegrieta","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Goraluk Yunquegrieta","title_en":"Goraluk Anvilcrack","summary_es":"El tanque puede mantener a Goraluk Yunquegrieta junto a una pared y lejos del grupo.","summary_en":"The tank can hold Goraluk Anvilcrack by a wall and away from the group.","keywords_es":["Goraluk Yunquegrieta","jefe de UBRS Goraluk","estrategia de Yunquegrieta","Goraluk Anvilcrack"],"keywords_en":["Goraluk Anvilcrack","Goraluk UBRS boss","Anvilcrack strategy","UBRS blacksmith boss"],"text_es":"Goraluk Yunquegrieta es un combate sencillo: el tanque puede colocarlo junto a una pared y separado del resto del grupo. Jed Observarrunas puede aparecer como jefe opcional en la misma zona.","text_en":"Goraluk Anvilcrack is a straightforward fight: the tank can place Goraluk Anvilcrack by a wall, apart from the rest of the group. Jed Runewatcher may also appear as an optional boss in the same area.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Goraluk Anvilcrack","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:56d712861f4dccaa4338ba1e4aba53daa0dbb35d"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-jed-observarrunas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jed Observarrunas","title_en":"Jed Runewatcher","summary_es":"Mantén a Jed Observarrunas contra la pared y al grupo a distancia.","summary_en":"Keep Jed Runewatcher against the wall and the group at range.","keywords_es":["Jed Observarrunas","jefe raro de UBRS","estrategia de Jed Runewatcher","Jed Runewatcher"],"keywords_en":["Jed Runewatcher","UBRS rare boss","Jed Runewatcher strategy","Jed boss"],"text_es":"Jed Observarrunas es un jefe raro opcional. El tanque puede mantenerlo junto a una pared mientras el resto del grupo ataca a distancia para facilitar el combate.","text_en":"Jed Runewatcher is an optional rare boss. The tank can keep Jed Runewatcher against a wall while the rest of the group attacks from range to simplify the fight.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Jed Runewatcher (Rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:25e31091f758b585f5c2250c2b27ddd30002e5fe"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-gyth","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Gyth","title_en":"Gyth","summary_es":"Orienta a Gyth lejos del grupo y derrótalo antes de cambiar el objetivo a Rend.","summary_en":"Face Gyth away from the group and defeat him before switching to Rend.","keywords_es":["Gyth","jefe Gyth de UBRS","aliento de Gyth","evento de Rend y Gyth"],"keywords_en":["Gyth","Gyth UBRS boss","Gyth breath attack","Rend and Gyth event"],"text_es":"Tras siete u ocho oleadas aparecen Gyth y Jefe de Guerra Desgarro Puño Negro. El tanque debe orientar a Gyth de espaldas al grupo para que su aliento no lo alcance; cuando Rend cae al llegar al 20%, derrota primero a Gyth y después cambia de objetivo.","text_en":"After seven to eight waves, Gyth and Warchief Rend Blackhand appear. The tank should face Gyth away from the group so his breath does not hit them; when Rend is knocked off at 20%, defeat Gyth first and then switch targets.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Warchief Rend Blackhand and Gyth","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:b628e0c05279ee44127e56620a0d441dcf19f8ea"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-jefe-de-guerra-desgarro-puno-negro","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefe de Guerra Desgarro Puño Negro","title_en":"Warchief Rend Blackhand","summary_es":"Al caer de Gyth, asigna un segundo tanque a Rend y evita sus ataques giratorios y frontales.","summary_en":"When Rend falls from Gyth, assign a second tank and avoid his spinning and frontal attacks.","keywords_es":["Jefe de Guerra Desgarro Puño Negro","Rend Blackhand","jefe de UBRS Rend","evento de Rend y Gyth"],"keywords_en":["Warchief Rend Blackhand","Rend Blackhand boss","UBRS Rend encounter","Rend and Gyth event"],"text_es":"Jefe de Guerra Desgarro Puño Negro cae de Gyth al llegar al 20%; un segundo tanque debe recogerlo y apartarlo a un lado. Acaba primero con Gyth; después, los combatientes cuerpo a cuerpo deben evitar los ataques giratorios y frontales.","text_en":"Warchief Rend Blackhand is knocked off Gyth at 20%; a second tank should pick him up and move him to one side. Kill Gyth first; then melee players should avoid the spinning and frontal attacks.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Warchief Rend Blackhand and Gyth","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:b628e0c05279ee44127e56620a0d441dcf19f8ea"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-la-bestia","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"La Bestia","title_en":"The Beast","summary_es":"Mantén la amenaza con el tanque y separa al grupo para reducir el miedo y el daño de área.","summary_en":"Keep threat on the tank and spread the group to limit fear and area damage.","keywords_es":["La Bestia de UBRS","jefe La Bestia","estrategia contra La Bestia","miedo de The Beast"],"keywords_en":["The Beast UBRS","The Beast boss","The Beast strategy","The Beast fear"],"text_es":"La Bestia carga contra un objetivo y vuelve hacia quien tenga más amenaza, así que el tanque principal debe conservarla. El grupo debe separarse y mantenerse a distancia para reducir el efecto del miedo; el tanque puede ponerse de espaldas a una pared para evitar el empujón de su nova de fuego.","text_en":"The Beast charges a target and returns to the one with the most threat, so the main tank should hold aggro. The group should spread out and stay at range to limit the fear; the tank can stand with their back to a wall to avoid the knockback from its fire nova.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Beast","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:0023d96c1eaabeed21fd35d88c601937499b3b9c"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-general-drakkisath","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"General Drakkisath","title_en":"General Drakkisath","summary_es":"El método de cometa separa a General Drakkisath de sus dos guardias cromáticos.","summary_en":"Kiting separates General Drakkisath from his two chromatic guards.","keywords_es":["General Drakkisath","jefe final de UBRS","estrategia contra Drakkisath","guardias cromáticos de Drakkisath"],"keywords_en":["General Drakkisath","UBRS final boss","Drakkisath strategy","Drakkisath chromatic guards"],"text_es":"General Drakkisath es el jefe final; la estrategia de cometa lo aparta de los guardias cromáticos. Un Cazador lo atrae hacia la sala de La Bestia y usa Fingir muerte para devolverlo al grupo, mientras los tanques eliminan a los guardias. Después, el tanque principal debe orientarlo lejos del grupo para evitar su aliento de fuego.","text_en":"General Drakkisath is the final boss; kiting separates him from the chromatic guards. A Hunter pulls him toward The Beast’s room and uses Feign Death to return him to the group while the tanks kill the guards. The main tank then faces him away from the group to avoid his fire breath.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › General Drakkisath","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:fd6b5f7ec5b20558e15f18dc8569588befdcd2f2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-lord-valthalak","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Lord Valthalak","title_en":"Lord Valthalak","summary_es":"La misión de invocación permite llamar a Lord Valthalak en la sala de La Bestia.","summary_en":"The summoning quest lets you call Lord Valthalak in The Beast’s room.","keywords_es":["Lord Valthalak","invocar a Lord Valthalak","misión de invocación de Valthalak","Blandón de Señalización"],"keywords_en":["Lord Valthalak","summon Lord Valthalak","Valthalak summoning quest","Brazier of Beckoning"],"text_es":"La misión de invocación proporciona el Blandón de Señalización para llamar a Lord Valthalak en la sala de La Bestia. Al completar la cadena se obtiene un Blandón de Invocación para volver a llamarlo más adelante.","text_en":"The summoning quest provides the Brazier of Beckoning to call Lord Valthalak in The Beast’s room. Completing the questline grants a Brazier of Invocation to summon him again later.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Beast","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:0023d96c1eaabeed21fd35d88c601937499b3b9c"]},{"id":"mazmorra-upper-blackrock-spire-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Cumbre de Roca Negra superior","title_en":"Upper Blackrock Spire Rewards","summary_es":"Las misiones ofrecen abalorios a elegir; destacan también piezas de Gyth y Rend.","summary_en":"Quests offer a choice of trinkets; notable drops also come from Gyth and Rend.","keywords_es":["recompensas de UBRS","botín de Cumbre de Roca Negra superior","Marca de Tiranía","Carga sacra de Dal'Rend","Caparazón cromático"],"keywords_en":["UBRS rewards","upper blackrock spire loot","Mark of Tyranny","Dal'Rend's Sacred Charge","Chromatic Carapace"],"text_es":"¡Por la Horda! y Muerte al general Drakkisath permiten elegir entre Marca de Tiranía, Ojo de la bestia y Amplitud de Puño Negro. Entre los botines destacados están el Caparazón cromático de Gyth y la Sierra apocalíptica de Puño Negro de Jefe de Guerra Desgarro Puño Negro. Son ejemplos, no la lista completa.","text_en":"For The Horde! and General Drakkisath’s Demise offer a choice of Mark of Tyranny, Eye of the Beast, or Blackhand’s Breadth. Notable drops include Chromatic Carapace from Gyth and Blackhand Doomsaw from Warchief Rend Blackhand. These are examples, not the complete list.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Gyth","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Upper Blackrock Spire Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Warchief Rend Blackhand","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/upper-blackrock-spire-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:upper-blackrock-spire"],"source_hashes":["section:a88692ec09f34fc81685778edf9edd2ff698ee81","section:ac490d016e6e5d37f0f1b5d1a6c9fabb163722b5","section:e2738ef0e2b7cd00338ffee768de63a6628277f6"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-west-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jardines de la Capital: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Capital Gardens: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Niveles 54-60; llega a La Masacre por Feralas y toma el portal del muro oeste de la arena.","summary_en":"Levels 54-60; reach Dire Maul through Feralas and take the portal on the arena's west wall.","keywords_es":["Jardines de la Capital","nivel de La Masacre oeste","entrada de La Masacre oeste","cómo llegar a La Masacre","mazmorra de Feralas"],"keywords_en":["Capital Gardens","Dire Maul West level","Dire Maul West entrance","how to reach Dire Maul","Feralas dungeon"],"text_es":"Los Jardines de la Capital se recomiendan para niveles 54-60. La entrada de La Masacre está al norte de Feralas: la Alianza puede volar a Thalanaar o al Bastión Plumaluna, y la Horda a Campamento Mójache; desde allí sigue el camino hasta el cruce norte. Dentro del complejo, el portal de los Jardines está en un hueco del muro oeste de la arena.","text_en":"Capital Gardens is recommended for levels 54-60. Dire Maul lies north of Feralas: Alliance can fly to Thalanaar or Feathermoon Stronghold, while Horde can fly to Camp Mojache; follow the road to the northern junction. Inside the complex, the Gardens portal is in a recess on the arena's west wall.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Dire Maul Capital Gardens Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Dire Maul Capital Gardens in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-capital-gardens-west"],"source_hashes":["section:1c2923e22693356a5b716e1158aa1fca04c95cdc","section:62ea41ad5ea164af55672e5b24331ff015a93609"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-west-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de los Jardines","title_en":"Recommended Capital Gardens Quests","summary_es":"Locura interior se recoge dentro, con el Anciano Shen'dralar, y requiere derrotar a dos jefes.","summary_en":"The Madness Within starts inside with the Shen'dralar Ancient and requires defeating two bosses.","keywords_es":["misiones de los Jardines de la Capital","Locura interior","Anciano Shen'dralar","misiones de La Masacre oeste"],"keywords_en":["Capital Gardens quests","The Madness Within","Shen'dralar Ancient","Dire Maul West quests"],"text_es":"Locura interior se recoge con el Anciano Shen'dralar, en el segundo piso de la instancia; acepta la misión al llegar y derrota a Immol'thar y al Príncipe Tortheldrin. Al completarla, el Anciano ofrece El tesoro de los Shen'dralar, que se busca en la zona del Príncipe.","text_en":"Pick up The Madness Within from the Shen'dralar Ancient on the instance's second floor; the quest requires defeating Immol'thar and Prince Tortheldrin. After completing it, the Ancient offers The Treasure of the Shen'dralar, found where Prince Tortheldrin is fought.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Every Quest in Dire Maul Capital Gardens in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-capital-gardens-west"],"source_hashes":["section:720589bee86f00934e59b8458b16928ff4d1089e","section:bca566b990962c44be2806f8d24527d6b28f7d91"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-west-tendris","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tendris Madeguerra: limpia los ancianos","title_en":"Tendris Warpwood: Clear the Ancients","summary_es":"Elimina los ancianos cercanos antes del combate y evita el derribo de Atropello.","summary_en":"Clear nearby ancients before the fight and avoid Trample's knockdown.","keywords_es":["Tendris Madeguerra","Tendris Warpwood","Atropello","jefe de los Jardines de la Capital"],"keywords_en":["Tendris Warpwood","Trample","Capital Gardens boss"],"text_es":"Antes de enfrentarte a Tendris Madeguerra, elimina a los ancianos cercanos para que no se unan al combate. Mantén a distancia a los atacantes para evitar Atropello y disipa Enredar cuando sea posible.","text_en":"Before fighting Tendris Warpwood, clear the nearby ancients so they do not join the encounter. Keep ranged players back to avoid Trample and dispel Entangle when possible.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Tendris Warpwood","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-capital-gardens-west"],"source_hashes":["section:025e211dabde1e8533ca6eefa4c05a119c30478d"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-west-kalendris","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Magister Kalendris: corta sus hechizos","title_en":"Magister Kalendris: Interrupt His Spells","summary_es":"Interrumpe al sacerdote de las Sombras y disipa sus efectos mágicos.","summary_en":"Interrupt the Shadow priest and dispel his magical effects.","keywords_es":["Magister Kalendris","jefe de los Jardines","Dominar mente","resistencia a las Sombras"],"keywords_en":["Magister Kalendris","Capital Gardens boss","Dominate Mind","Shadow resistance"],"text_es":"Magister Kalendris combate como un sacerdote de las Sombras: interrumpe sus hechizos y disipa los efectos mágicos. La resistencia a las Sombras ayuda a reducir el daño mientras el grupo lo derrota.","text_en":"Magister Kalendris fights like a Shadow priest: interrupt his spells and dispel magical effects. Shadow resistance helps reduce damage while the group defeats him.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Magister Kalendris","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-capital-gardens-west"],"source_hashes":["section:85eb21d5c3498bf2c479bde08df967d81b17bca5"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-west-tzu-see","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tzu'see: deja que el tanque inicie","title_en":"Tzu'see: Let the Tank Engage First","summary_es":"Tzu'see golpea con fuerza; espera a que el tanque genere amenaza y disipa Ceguera.","summary_en":"Tzu'see hits hard; let the tank build threat and dispel Blind.","keywords_es":["Tzu'see","Tsu'zee","jefe de los Jardines","Ceguera"],"keywords_en":["Tzu'see","Tsu'zee","Capital Gardens boss","Blind"],"text_es":"Tzu'see golpea con fuerza. Deja que el tanque consiga la amenaza antes de atacar y disipa Ceguera de los compañeros si puedes.","text_en":"Tzu'see hits hard. Let the tank establish threat before attacking, and dispel Blind from party members when possible.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Tzu'see","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-capital-gardens-west"],"source_hashes":["section:207f11353b744737ee48342e904b1f3160245b62"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-west-illyanna","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Illyanna Roblecuervo: combate cuerpo a cuerpo","title_en":"Illyanna Ravenoak: Fight at Melee Range","summary_es":"Acércate para evitar varios disparos y derrota primero a Illyanna, luego a Ferra.","summary_en":"Move into melee to avoid several shots; defeat Illyanna first, then Ferra.","keywords_es":["Illyanna Roblecuervo","Illyanna Ravenoak","Ferra","jefe de los Jardines"],"keywords_en":["Illyanna Ravenoak","Ferra","Capital Gardens boss","Immolation Trap"],"text_es":"Illyanna Roblecuervo lucha junto a su oso Ferra. Acércate a Illyanna para neutralizar la mayoría de sus disparos, aunque aún debes vigilar Trampa de inmolación; el grupo suele derrotarla antes que a Ferra.","text_en":"Illyanna Ravenoak fights alongside her bear Ferra. Stay in melee range to negate most of her shots, but still watch for Immolation Trap; groups usually defeat her before Ferra.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Illyanna Ravenoak","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-capital-gardens-west"],"source_hashes":["section:57337fd3a7b38a5e3017e499d378620183457e3a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-west-immolthar","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Immol'thar: destruye los ojos","title_en":"Immol'thar: Destroy the Eyes","summary_es":"Asigna a un atacante a distancia para eliminar los ojos y prepárate para Enfurecer al 50%.","summary_en":"Assign a ranged player to destroy the eyes and prepare for Enrage at 50%.","keywords_es":["Immol'thar","jefe de los Jardines","Ojo de Immol'thar","Enfurecer"],"keywords_en":["Immol'thar","Capital Gardens boss","Eye of Immol'thar","Enrage"],"text_es":"Immol'thar invoca ojos por la sala; asigna a alguien, preferiblemente a distancia, para eliminarlos. Al 50% de salud se enfurece y puede teletransportar jugadores al centro, así que el tanque debe recuperar la amenaza si también es desplazado.","text_en":"Immol'thar summons eyes around the room; assign someone, preferably a ranged player, to destroy them. He enrages at 50% health and can teleport players to the center, so the tank must regain threat if displaced too.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Immol'thar","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-capital-gardens-west"],"source_hashes":["section:3b50d0afe1bc6f004c8ecd7aca196630ec40b6c0"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-west-tortheldrin","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Príncipe Tortheldrin: evita el reinicio","title_en":"Prince Tortheldrin: Prevent Threat Resets","summary_es":"Colócalo en una esquina y detén el daño después de Explosión Arcana hasta recuperar la amenaza.","summary_en":"Tank him in a corner and stop damage after Arcane Blast until threat is restored.","keywords_es":["Príncipe Tortheldrin","jefe final de los Jardines","Explosión Arcana","amenaza del tanque"],"keywords_en":["Prince Tortheldrin","Capital Gardens final boss","Arcane Blast","threat reset"],"text_es":"El Príncipe Tortheldrin golpea con rapidez y su Explosión Arcana empuja y reinicia la amenaza. El tanque debe colocarlo en una esquina; tras cada lanzamiento, el resto deja de atacar hasta que el tanque recupere la amenaza.","text_en":"Prince Tortheldrin hits quickly, and Arcane Blast knocks players back and resets threat. The tank should hold him in a corner; after each cast, everyone else should stop attacking until the tank regains threat.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Prince Tortheldrin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-capital-gardens-west"],"source_hashes":["section:9984104ebf8821944995d3b98a5a1db15e178636"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-west-helnurath","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Lord Hel'nurath: sobrevive al ritual","title_en":"Lord Hel'nurath: Survive the Ritual","summary_es":"Un Brujo debe activar tres objetos durante las oleadas; al final, derrota a Hel'nurath antes del corcel.","summary_en":"A Warlock must keep three items active through the waves; then defeat Hel'nurath before the steed.","keywords_es":["Lord Hel'nurath","jefe especial de los Jardines","ritual del corcel","misión de montura épica de Brujo"],"keywords_en":["Lord Hel'nurath","Capital Gardens special boss","Dreadsteed ritual","Warlock epic mount quest"],"text_es":"Lord Hel'nurath solo aparece durante la misión de montura épica del Brujo. El grupo debe sobrevivir a varias oleadas mientras el Brujo mantiene activos los tres objetos del ritual; al aparecer Hel'nurath, derrótalo antes que al Corcel de la Muerte Xorothiano.","text_en":"Lord Hel'nurath appears only during the Warlock epic mount quest. The group must survive several waves while the Warlock keeps all three ritual items active; when Hel'nurath appears, defeat him before the Xorothian Dreadsteed.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Special Boss: Lord Hel'nurath","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-capital-gardens-west"],"source_hashes":["section:45b54de8dcff19f33c1b1c6f3c8b2d14fb6ebb84"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-west-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas destacadas de los Jardines","title_en":"Notable Capital Gardens Rewards","summary_es":"La misión da a elegir equipo; destacan objetos de Tendris Madeguerra, Immol'thar y el Príncipe.","summary_en":"A quest offers a gear choice; notable drops come from Tendris, Immol'thar, and the Prince.","keywords_es":["recompensas de los Jardines de la Capital","Locura interior","Toga de Noche perpetua","Daga de distracción","botín de Immol'thar"],"keywords_en":["Capital Gardens rewards","The Madness Within","Robe of Everlasting Night","Distracting Dagger","Immol'thar loot"],"text_es":"Entre el equipo que dejan los jefes están la Toga de Noche perpetua de Immol'thar y la Daga de distracción del Príncipe Tortheldrin.","text_en":"Boss loot includes Robe of Everlasting Night from Immol'thar and Distracting Dagger from Prince Tortheldrin.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Capital Gardens Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Dire Maul Capital Gardens Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-capital-gardens-west-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-capital-gardens-west"],"source_hashes":["section:9bc42c79a5f23e49931fb4745b1249969894458b"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-north-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recinto de los Gordok: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Gordoks Commons: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Niveles 54-60; toma el portal del muro norte de la arena de La Masacre.","summary_en":"Levels 54-60; take the portal on the north wall of Dire Maul's arena.","keywords_es":["Recinto de los Gordok","nivel de La Masacre norte","entrada de La Masacre norte","cómo llegar a La Masacre","Feralas"],"keywords_en":["Gordoks Commons","Dire Maul North level","Dire Maul North entrance","how to reach Dire Maul","Feralas"],"text_es":"El Recinto de los Gordok se recomienda para niveles 54-60. La entrada de La Masacre está al norte de Feralas: la Alianza puede volar a Thalanaar o al Bastión Plumaluna, y la Horda a Campamento Mójache; sigue el camino hasta el cruce norte. En el complejo, el portal del Recinto está en un hueco del muro norte de la arena.","text_en":"Gordoks Commons is recommended for levels 54-60. Dire Maul lies north of Feralas: Alliance can fly to Thalanaar or Feathermoon Stronghold, while Horde can fly to Camp Mojache; follow the road to the northern junction. Inside the complex, the Commons portal is in a recess on the arena's north wall.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Dire Maul Gordoks Commons in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north"],"source_hashes":["section:8f3937c5118b25d37dc0a9fe0a7574d58f0a47eb","section:e4f1f7699aae28bcb47a79ffca5aa56362de003d"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-north-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables del Recinto","title_en":"Recommended Gordoks Commons Quests","summary_es":"Leyendas élficas se recoge en Feralas; dentro puedes preparar ¡Libera a Knot! y El traje de ogro Gordok.","summary_en":"Elven Legends starts in Feralas; inside, prepare Free Knot! and The Gordok Ogre Suit.","keywords_es":["misiones del Recinto de los Gordok","Leyendas élficas","¡Libera a Knot!","El traje de ogro Gordok","Cártel Bonvapor"],"keywords_en":["Gordoks Commons quests","Elven Legends","Free Knot!","The Gordok Ogre Suit","Steamwheedle Cartel"],"text_es":"Antes de ir, recoge Leyendas élficas: la Horda la obtiene del Sabio Korolusk en Campamento Mójache y la Alianza del Erudito Runaespina en el Bastión Plumaluna. Ya dentro, Knot Llavededo ofrece ¡Libera a Knot! y El traje de orgo Gordok, que requiere materiales para fabricar el Taje ogro de Gordok, útil en una ruta de tributo.","text_en":"Before going, pick up Elven Legends: Horde gets it from Sage Korolusk at Camp Mojache, and Alliance from Scholar Runethorn at Feathermoon Stronghold. Inside, Knot Thimblejack offers Free Knot! and The Gordok Ogre Suit; the latter requires materials to make a disguise useful for a Tribute Run.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Every Quest in Dire Maul Gordoks Commons in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dire Maul Tribute Run Strategy in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north"],"source_hashes":["section:2385dcdb8ba8926778c157533fd3f429c3ec08c7","section:3442b0142a91d61c25b7c6685864a01961f2db16","section:61382b0869118410262f14ef1a9891890c748b0a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-north-moldar","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Guardia Mol'dar: evita Mamporro","title_en":"Guard Mol'dar: Avoid Knock Away","summary_es":"En una ruta normal, deja que el tanque lo fije y mantén atrás a los atacantes a distancia.","summary_en":"On a normal run, let the tank establish threat and keep ranged players back.","keywords_es":["Guardia Mol'dar","jefe del Recinto de los Gordok","Mamporro","ruta de tributo"],"keywords_en":["Guard Mol'dar","Gordoks Commons boss","Knock Away","Tribute Run"],"text_es":"En una ruta normal, Guardia Mol'dar usa ataques cuerpo a cuerpo; deja que el tanque consiga la amenaza y mantén atrás a los atacantes a distancia para evitar Mamporro y Embestida con escudo. En una ruta de tributo, no lo mates y busca una forma de abrir la puerta interior.","text_en":"On a normal run, Guard Mol'dar uses melee attacks; let the tank establish threat and keep ranged players back to avoid Knock Away and Shield Charge. On a Tribute Run, do not kill him, and arrange a way to open the inner door.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Guard Mol'dar","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north"],"source_hashes":["section:b0d8eaf59dc5d48643edf72cd6c2687d7a8146e5"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-north-kreeg","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Vapuleador Kreeg: cuidado con Gapo alcohólico","title_en":"Stomper Kreeg: Watch Booze Spit","summary_es":"Gapo alcohólico reduce mucho la probabilidad de acertar; la ruta de tributo requiere dejarlo vivo.","summary_en":"Booze Spit greatly reduces hit chance; a Tribute Run requires leaving him alive.","keywords_es":["Vapuleador Kreeg","jefe del Recinto de los Gordok","Gapo alcohólico","ruta de tributo"],"keywords_en":["Stomper Kreeg","Gordoks Commons boss","Booze Spit","Tribute Run"],"text_es":"Vapuleador Kreeg salpica al grupo con Gapo alcohólico, que reduce un 75% la probabilidad de acertar; después, el combate es principalmente cuerpo a cuerpo. En una ruta de tributo, no lo mates: espera a que se duerma y pasa sin acercarte.","text_en":"Stomper Kreeg hits the group with Booze Spit, reducing hit chance by 75%; otherwise, the fight is mainly melee. On a Tribute Run, do not kill him: wait for him to fall asleep and sneak past without approaching.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Stomper Kreeg","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north"],"source_hashes":["section:f87b50cf85c40513d81c66d27bf44e965524168c"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-north-fengus","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Guardia Fengus: saquea el cofre","title_en":"Guard Fengus: Loot the Chest","summary_es":"En una ruta de tributo, espera a que patrulle lejos y recoge la Llave de patio de Gordok.","summary_en":"On a Tribute Run, wait for his patrol to move away and take the Gordok Courtyard Key.","keywords_es":["Guardia Fengus","jefe del Recinto","Cofre de Fengus","Llave de patio de Gordok"],"keywords_en":["Guard Fengus","Gordoks Commons boss","Fengus's Chest","Gordok Courtyard Key"],"text_es":"En una ruta normal, Guardia Fengus usa ataques cuerpo a cuerpo: el tanque fija la amenaza y los atacantes a distancia evitan Mamporro y Embestida con escudo. En una ruta de tributo, no lo mates; espera a que se aleje y saquea el cofre para obtener la Llave de patio de Gordok.","text_en":"On a normal run, Guard Fengus uses melee attacks: the tank establishes threat while ranged players avoid Knock Away and Shield Charge. On a Tribute Run, do not kill him; wait for him to move away and loot the chest for the Gordok Courtyard Key.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Guard Fengus","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north"],"source_hashes":["section:dec98d138eb8d1401c3be0bb2adcdd41618b3091"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-north-slipkik","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Guardia Slip'kik: congélalo en la trampa","title_en":"Guard Slip'kik: Freeze Him in the Trap","summary_es":"Repara la trampa con Aceite escarchado y Trastos wow de torio para completar la ruta de tributo.","summary_en":"Repair the trap with Frost Oil and Thorium Widgets to complete the Tribute Run.","keywords_es":["Guardia Slip'kik","jefe del Recinto","trampa rota","ruta de tributo"],"keywords_en":["Guard Slip'kik","Gordoks Commons boss","Broken Trap","Tribute Run"],"text_es":"En una ruta normal, Guardia Slip'kik usa ataques cuerpo a cuerpo; mantén atrás a los atacantes a distancia para evitar Mamporro y Embestida con escudo. Para la ruta de tributo, no lo mates: repara la Trampa rota con Aceite escarchado y Trastos wow de torio, y deja que quede congelado al volver a patrullar.","text_en":"On a normal run, Guard Slip'kik uses melee attacks; keep ranged players back to avoid Knock Away and Shield Charge. For a Tribute Run, do not kill him: repair the Broken Trap with Frost Oil and a Thorium Widget, then let him be frozen when he patrols back.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Guard Slip'kik","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north"],"source_hashes":["section:4c0285dcbc6279527fd5233bd6a81497f0e8125c"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-north-kromcrush","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Capitán Kromcrush: controla sus adds","title_en":"Captain Kromcrush: Control His Adds","summary_es":"Golpea con fuerza, causa miedo y llama a dos atracadores al perder salud; controla los adds.","summary_en":"He hits hard, fears the group, and summons two reavers at low health; control the adds.","keywords_es":["Capitán Kromcrush","jefe del Recinto","Grito intimidador","Atracador Gordok","ruta de tributo"],"keywords_en":["Captain Kromcrush","Gordoks Commons boss","Intimidating Shout","Gordok Reaver","Tribute Run"],"text_es":"El Capitán Kromcrush golpea con fuerza, puede aterrorizar al grupo y, cerca de la mitad de salud, llama a dos Atracadores Gordok. Controla a los adds y mantén la amenaza del jefe; en una ruta de tributo, un jugador con el Taje ogro de Gordok debe engañarlo en vez de matarlo.","text_en":"Captain Kromcrush hits hard, can fear the party, and summons two Gordok Reavers at around half health. Crowd-control the adds and keep threat on the boss; on a Tribute Run, a player wearing the Gordok Ogre Suit must fool him instead of killing him.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Captain Kromcrush","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north"],"source_hashes":["section:38065a64e048b8a0f68f5c2b27870d0de6c5ed57"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-north-rey-gordok-chorush","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Rey Gordok y Cho'Rush el Observador","title_en":"King Gordok and Cho'Rush the Observer","summary_es":"Interrumpe las curas del Rey Gordok; en tributo, deja vivo a Cho'Rush y acaba con el Rey primero.","summary_en":"Interrupt King Gordok's heals; on Tribute, keep Cho'Rush alive and kill the King first.","keywords_es":["Rey Gordok","Cho'Rush el Observador","jefes del Recinto","ruta de tributo","Curar"],"keywords_en":["King Gordok","Cho'Rush the Observer","Gordoks Commons bosses","Tribute Run","Heal"],"text_es":"El Rey Gordok puede curarse: interrumpe sus hechizos, sobre todo Curar. En una ruta normal suele ser más fácil derrotar primero a Cho'Rush el Observador mientras el tanque fija al Rey; en una ruta de tributo, mantén ocupado e interrumpe a Cho'Rush, pero déjalo vivo y mata primero al Rey.","text_en":"King Gordok can heal himself, so interrupt his spells, especially Heal. On a normal run, it is usually easier to defeat Cho'Rush the Observer first while the tank holds the King; on a Tribute Run, keep Cho'Rush occupied and interrupt him, but leave him alive and kill the King first.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › King Gordok & Cho'Rush the Observer","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north"],"source_hashes":["section:acaea65baf3adad84560bf61a17ecbc0f63d86c6"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-north-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas del Recinto de los Gordok","title_en":"Gordoks Commons Rewards","summary_es":"Leyendas élficas da acceso a tratados; la ruta de tributo mejora el cofre según los jefes que sobreviven.","summary_en":"Elven Legends unlocks librams; the Tribute chest improves with more surviving bosses.","keywords_es":["recompensas del Recinto de los Gordok","tratado sobre protección","cofre de tributo","Yelmo provinciano","Taje ogro de Gordok"],"keywords_en":["Gordoks Commons rewards","Libram of Protection","Tribute chest","Backwood Helm","Gordok Ogre Suit"],"text_es":"Completar Leyendas élficas permite acceder a misiones de tratados como El tratado sobre protección. La ruta de tributo crea el Tributo a Gordok, cuyo contenido mejora cuantos más jefes se dejen vivos; como ejemplos de equipo destacan la Corona del Rey ogro y la Maza Aplastacalaveras.","text_en":"You can become eligible for libram quests such as Libram of Protection after completing Elven Legends. A Tribute Run creates the Gordok Tribute, whose contents improve with more bosses left alive; notable gear includes Crown of the Ogre King and Skullcracking Mace.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dire Maul Tribute Run Strategy in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Dire Maul Gordoks Commons Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-gordoks-commons-north"],"source_hashes":["section:3442b0142a91d61c25b7c6685864a01961f2db16","section:61382b0869118410262f14ef1a9891890c748b0a","section:ef5bec890332964c9e3f065fd9b9bc3f256451e9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-east-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cuartel Alabeo: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Warpwood Quarter: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Niveles 52-60; entra por el portal este de la arena o por una puerta secreta del Pabellón de Lariss.","summary_en":"Levels 52-60; enter through the arena's east portal or a secret door at Lariss Pavilion.","keywords_es":["Cuartel Alabeo","nivel de La Masacre este","entrada de La Masacre este","Pabellón de Lariss","cómo llegar a La Masacre"],"keywords_en":["Warpwood Quarter","Dire Maul East level","Dire Maul East entrance","Lariss Pavilion","how to reach Dire Maul"],"text_es":"El Cuartel Alabeo se recomienda para niveles 52-60. La Masacre está al norte de Feralas: la Alianza puede volar a Thalanaar o al Bastión Plumaluna, y la Horda a Campamento Mójache; sigue el camino hasta el cruce norte. El portal este está en un hueco del muro oriental de la arena; también hay una entrada secreta tras una puerta en el Pabellón de Lariss.","text_en":"Warpwood Quarter is recommended for levels 52-60. Dire Maul lies north of Feralas: Alliance can fly to Thalanaar or Feathermoon Stronghold, while Horde can fly to Camp Mojache; follow the road to the northern junction. The east portal is in a recess on the arena's eastern wall; a secret entrance is also behind a door at Lariss Pavillion.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Foreve › Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Foreve › Location of Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east"],"source_hashes":["section:04b194f2c8524e630a020a115489d4b97280b8b5","section:5fe66a3bbff0c62d4ab185b9984be4e9067f85c8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-east-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables del Cuartel Alabeo","title_en":"Recommended Warpwood Quarter Quests","summary_es":"La Membrana de Lethtendris se recoge en Feralas; Pusillín y el ancestro Azj'Tordin empieza en el Pabellón.","summary_en":"Lethtendris's Web starts in Feralas; Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin starts at the Pavilion.","keywords_es":["misiones del Cuartel Alabeo","La Membrana de Lethtendris","Pusillín y el ancestro Azj'Tordin","Fragmentos de gangrevid","El refresco arcano"],"keywords_en":["Warpwood Quarter quests","Lethtendris's Web","Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin","Shards of the Felvine","Arcane Refreshment"],"text_es":"Antes de entrar, recoge La Membrana de Lethtendris: la Alianza la obtiene con Latronicus Lanzaluna en el Bastión Plumaluna y la Horda con Talo Pezuñahendida en Campamento Mójache. Pusillín y el ancestro Azj'Tordin empieza con Azj'Tordin en el Pabellón de Lariss; Fragmentos de gangrevid requiere antes Un relicario de pureza en Claro de la Luna.","text_en":"Before entering, pick up Lethtendris's Web: Alliance gets it from Latronicus Moonspear at Feathermoon Stronghold, and Horde from Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache. Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin starts with Azj'Tordin at Lariss Pavilion; Shards of the Felvine requires completing A Reliquary of Purity first in Moonglade.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Foreve › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Foreve › Every Quest in Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east"],"source_hashes":["section:1908698e54964b685f7e62377f7f94ba8e1c5959","section:7ae2dc250714e7d074f24d35c4f59b7bba1ae8cf"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-east-pusillin","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Pusillín: consigue la Llave creciente","title_en":"Pusillin: Get the Crescent Key","summary_es":"Síguelo por la mazmorra; al final invoca diablillos que conviene eliminar e interrumpir sus hechizos de fuego.","summary_en":"Follow him through the dungeon; he summons imps at the end, and his fire spells can be interrupted.","keywords_es":["Pusillín","jefe del Cuartel Alabeo","Llave creciente","Libro sobre Conjuros","Pusillín y el ancestro Azj'Tordin"],"keywords_en":["Pusillin","Warpwood Quarter boss","Crescent Key","Book of Incantations","Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin"],"text_es":"Pusillín huye por tramos de la mazmorra; síguelo hasta el enfrentamiento final, donde invoca cuatro enemigos llamados Diablillo Mala Hierba. Elimínalos e interrumpe sus hechizos de fuego; al derrotarlo obtienes la Llave creciente y el Libro sobre Conjuros para Pusillín y el ancestro Azj'Tordin.","text_en":"Pusillin flees through sections of the dungeon; follow him to the final encounter, where he summons four Wildspawn Imp creatures. Defeat the imps and interrupt his fire spells; killing him gives the Crescent Key and Book of Incantations for Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Foreve › Pusillin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east"],"source_hashes":["section:23118eb2a739e88257fe0650b7d52b67e9d35890"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-east-lethtendris","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Lethtendris: prioriza a Pimgib","title_en":"Lethtendris: Prioritize Pimgib","summary_es":"Derrota primero al diablillo y después interrumpe los hechizos de Lethtendris y disipa sus maldiciones.","summary_en":"Defeat the imp first, then interrupt Lethtendris's spells and dispel her curses.","keywords_es":["Lethtendris","Pimgib","jefe del Cuartel Alabeo","Descarga abisal","La Membrana de Lethtendris"],"keywords_en":["Lethtendris","Pimgib","Warpwood Quarter boss","Void Bolt","Lethtendris's Web"],"text_es":"Lethtendris combate con su diablillo Pimgib, que tiene menos salud y también lanza hechizos de fuego: céntrate primero en él. Después interrumpe Descarga abisal y otros lanzamientos de Lethtendris, y disipa las maldiciones del grupo.","text_en":"Lethtendris fights alongside her imp Pimgib, who has less health and also casts fire spells; focus on him first. Then interrupt Void Bolt and her other casts, and remove the party's curses.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Foreve › Lethtendris","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east"],"source_hashes":["section:d3367d0bb8498a09c1f5e1dbd3396d800e829357"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-east-hydrospawn","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Hidromilecio: decide cuándo eliminar la hidrolinga","title_en":"Hydrospawn: Decide When to Kill the Hydroling","summary_es":"La hidrolinga puede causar más daño que el jefe; elimínala o céntrate en el jefe vigilando al sanador.","summary_en":"The hydroling can deal more damage than the boss; kill it or burn the boss while watching the healer.","keywords_es":["Hidromilecio","Hydrospawn","Hidrolinga","jefe del Cuartel Alabeo","Esencia de Hidromilecio"],"keywords_en":["Hydrospawn","Hydroling","Warpwood Quarter boss","Hydrospawn Essence"],"text_es":"Hidromilecio invoca una Hydrolinga: puedes eliminarla en área o concentrar el daño en el jefe, pero la criatura suele hacer más daño. Si optas por derrotar rápido a Hidromilecio, vigila la salud del sanador e interrumpe sus hechizos cuando puedas.","text_en":"Hydrospawn summons a Hydroling: you can defeat it with area damage or focus the boss, but the add tends to deal more damage. If you burn Hydrospawn quickly, watch the healer's health and interrupt spells when possible.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Foreve › Hydrospawn","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east"],"source_hashes":["section:650b240de14b8413862ec5cb8036dd58917c3380"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-east-zevrim","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Zevrim Pezuñahendida: sana a quien sacrifique","title_en":"Zevrim Thornhoof: Heal the Sacrifice Target","summary_es":"Sana mucho al jugador que teletransporte para Sacrificio y disipa Calor intenso.","summary_en":"Heavily heal the player teleported for Sacrifice and dispel Intense Pain.","keywords_es":["Zevrim Pezuñahendida","jefe del Cuartel Alabeo","Sacrificio","Calor intenso"],"keywords_en":["Zevrim Thornhoof","Warpwood Quarter boss","Sacrifice","Intense Pain"],"text_es":"Zevrim Pezuñahendida teletransporta periódicamente a un miembro del grupo a su altar y le lanza Sacrificio; el sanador debe reforzar mucho su curación. Calor intenso daña en área y se puede disipar, así que los atacantes a distancia deben mantenerse lejos.","text_en":"Zevrim Thornhoof periodically teleports a party member to his altar and casts Sacrifice on them; the healer must provide heavy healing. Intense Pain deals area damage and can be dispelled, so ranged players should stay back.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Foreve › Zevrim Thornhoof","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east"],"source_hashes":["section:47ade0afa0b4b60279766af1c048bad7b1788e93"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-east-alzzin","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Alzzin el Formaferal: limpia cada cambio de forma","title_en":"Alzzin the Wildshaper: Handle Each Form","summary_es":"Disipa Enervar y Marchitar; al cambiar de forma, el tanque debe recuperar la amenaza.","summary_en":"Dispel Enervate and Wither; the tank must regain threat after each transformation.","keywords_es":["Alzzin el Formaferal","jefe final del Cuartel Alabeo","Enervar","Marchitar","Fragmentos de gangrevid"],"keywords_en":["Alzzin the Wildshaper","Warpwood Quarter final boss","Enervate","Wither","Shards of the Felvine"],"text_es":"Alzzin el Formaferal cambia entre formas, por lo que el tanque debe recuperar la amenaza tras cada transformación. En forma de sátiro, interrumpe y disipa Enervar y Marchitar; al 35% de salud aparecen adds detrás del muro. Si tienes Fragmentos de gangrevid, recoge el objeto de misión tras derrotarlo.","text_en":"Alzzin the Wildshaper changes forms, so the tank must regain threat after each transformation. In satyr form, interrupt and dispel Enervate and Wither; at 35% health, adds emerge from behind the wall. If you have Shards of the Felvine, collect the quest item after defeating him.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Foreve › Alzzin the Wildshaper","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east"],"source_hashes":["section:52c40d885639fbb6cecefd766e2037e0fa29b691"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-east-isalien","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Isalien: invócala con el blandón","title_en":"Isalien: Summon Her with the Brazier","summary_es":"Este jefe especial se invoca en la sala de Alzzin con el Blandón de Señalización de una misión.","summary_en":"This special boss is summoned in Alzzin's room with a quest's Brazier of Beckoning.","keywords_es":["Isalien","jefe especial del Cuartel Alabeo","Blandón de Señalización","Blandón de Invocación"],"keywords_en":["Isalien","Warpwood Quarter special boss","Brazier of Beckoning","Brazier of Invocation"],"text_es":"Isalien no aparece en una ruta normal: se invoca en la sala de Alzzin con el Blandón de Señalización que entrega una misión para derrotarla. Si no recibiste esa misión, la cadena correspondiente puede darte un Blandón de Invocación para llamarla más adelante.","text_en":"Isalien can be summoned in the room where Alzzin is fought with the Brazier of Beckoning from a quest to defeat her. If you did not receive that quest, the related chain can give you a Brazier of Invocation to summon her later.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Foreve › Isalien","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east"],"source_hashes":["section:fa82e9ba8beacca89a4fff283bdc908ca9eb6b84"]},{"id":"mazmorra-dire-maul-east-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas del Cuartel Alabeo","title_en":"Warpwood Quarter Rewards","summary_es":"Los jefes dejan equipo como la Varita de Lethtendris y la Vara energética.","summary_en":"Bosses drop gear such as Lethtendris's Wand and Energetic Rod.","keywords_es":["recompensas del Cuartel Alabeo","Varita de Lethtendris","Botas del canalón","Vara energética","equipo de La Masacre este"],"keywords_en":["Warpwood Quarter rewards","Lethtendris's Wand","Waterspout Boots","Energetic Rod","Dire Maul East gear"],"text_es":"Entre los objetos que dejan los jefes están la Varita de Lethtendris, las Botas del canalón de Hidromilecio y la Vara energética de Alzzin el Formaferal.","text_en":"Boss loot includes Lethtendris's Wand, Waterspout Boots from Hydrospawn, and Energetic Rod from Alzzin the Wildshaper.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Foreve › Dire Maul Warpwood Quarter Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:dire-maul-warpwood-quarter-east"],"source_hashes":["section:2bd254cb6194b4739fd2a1b4ba3f5054a5c4c188"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Scholomance: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Scholomance: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Niveles 55-60; la entrada está en Castel Darrow y la puerta requiere llave, ganzúa o ayuda.","summary_en":"Levels 55-60; the entrance is at Caer Darrow, and the gate needs a key, lockpicking, or help.","keywords_es":["nivel de Scholomance","entrada de Scholomance","cómo llegar a Scholomance","puerta de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Scholomance level","Scholomance entrance","how to reach Scholomance","Scholomance gate"],"text_es":"Scholomance se recomienda para niveles 55-60 y está en una isla de las Tierras de la Peste del Oeste. La Alianza puede volar al Campamento del Orvallo; también puede acercarse desde la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz o Pico Nidal. La Horda puede partir de Entrañas o Molino Tarren. La puerta se abre con Llave esqueleto, Carga de seforio potente, Ganzúa de 280 o alguien al otro lado que accione la antorcha.","text_en":"Scholomance is recommended for levels 55-60 and lies on an island in the Western Plaguelands. Alliance can fly to Chillwind Camp, or approach from Light’s Hope Chapel or Aerie Peak. Horde can travel from Undercity or Tarren Mill. The gate can be opened with a Skeleton Key, a Powerful Seaforium Charge, 280 Lockpicking, or by someone using the torch from the other side.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Scholomance Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Scholomance in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:6ce33f1ae958588dfda84ab1cbef11d8baa2592f","section:cb7cc642b4d3a0d744d9a121547881c9dd74ccb9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones recomendables de Scholomance","title_en":"Recommended Scholomance Quests","summary_es":"Recoge Crías infestadas y las cadenas de Eva Sarkhoff o de la Llave esqueleto antes de entrar.","summary_en":"Pick up Plagued Hatchlings and Eva Sarkhoff’s or the Skeleton Key quest chain before entering.","keywords_es":["misiones de Scholomance","Crías infestadas","Llave esqueleto","misiones de Eva Sarkhoff","misiones previas a Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Scholomance quests","Plagued Hatchlings","Skeleton Key","Eva Sarkhoff quests","Scholomance pre-quests"],"text_es":"Antes de entrar, recoge Crías infestadas con Betina Bigglezink en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz. La cadena de la Llave esqueleto pasa por el Campamento del Orvallo para la Alianza o El Baluarte para la Horda. En Tierras de la Peste del Oeste, Eva Sarkhoff ofrece Doctor Theolen Krastinov, el Carnicero y su continuación, que permite invocar a Kirtonos el Heraldo; después, Magistrado Marduke da El Lich, Ras Levescarcha y exige llevar Esencia espectral.","text_en":"Before entering, pick up Plagued Hatchlings from Betina Bigglezink at Light’s Hope Chapel. The Skeleton Key quest chain runs through Chillwind Camp for Alliance or the Bulwark for Horde. In the Western Plaguelands, Eva Sarkhoff offers Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher and its follow-up, which lets you summon Kirtonos the Herald; afterward, Magistrate Marduke offers The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper, which requires wearing Spectral Essence.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Key to Scholomance Questline","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Plagued Hatchlings","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Kirtonos the Herald","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["guide:eb599ec89b76fca07367b823c9565b42fcc9ad49","section:92b1b69ee03d39bc793d100da9bb225e2e749e5b","section:af4855b05cb43518c2ff3710d54cd195528a70f8","section:cd4b0435c8f6764768e649f47b638f81a32c1452"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Scholomance","title_en":"Scholomance Rewards","summary_es":"La misión de Ras Levescarcha ofrece equipo a elegir; Kirtonos deja objetos como la Rosa de Penelope.","summary_en":"Ras Frostwhisper’s quest offers a gear choice; Kirtonos drops items such as Penelope’s Rose.","keywords_es":["recompensas de Scholomance","Rosa de Penelope","Canción de Mirah","Espada de guerra de Castel Darrow","botín de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Scholomance rewards","Penelope’s Rose","Mirah’s Song","Warblade of Caer Darrow","Scholomance loot"],"text_es":"La misión El Lich, Ras Levescarcha permite elegir equipo como la Espada de guerra de Castel Darrow, la Corona de Castel Darrow, el Pico Darrow o la Guarda fuerte de Villa Darrow. La misión de Kirtonos el Heraldo ofrece la Rosa de Penelope o la Canción de Mirah; entre sus botines destacan el Corazón del Mefisto y las Ajorcas de guardia amenazante.","text_en":"The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper quest offers a gear choice such as Warblade of Caer Darrow, Crown of Caer Darrow, Darrowspike, or Darrowshire Strongguard. The quest for Kirtonos the Herald offers Penelope’s Rose or Mirah’s Song; notable drops from him include Heart of the Fiend and Loomguard Armbraces.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Kirtonos the Herald","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Scholomance Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["guide:eb599ec89b76fca07367b823c9565b42fcc9ad49","section:4c8f366fdae86292729fc0e655c900643b0671e4","section:a6ee0b9bc629661afe63991effe6d2cbb3efdce2","section:cd4b0435c8f6764768e649f47b638f81a32c1452"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-blood-steward-of-kirtonos","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Administradora de sangre de Kirtonos","title_en":"Blood Steward of Kirtonos","summary_es":"Vigila el veneno paralizante, que aturde durante 8 segundos.","summary_en":"Watch for Paralyzing Poison, which stuns for 8 seconds.","keywords_es":["Administradora de sangre de Kirtonos","Veneno paralizante","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Blood Steward of Kirtonos","Paralyzing Poison","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"La Administradora de sangre de Kirtonos puede lanzar maldiciones y Veneno paralizante. Disipa las maldiciones y prepárate para el aturdimiento de 8 segundos del veneno.","text_en":"Blood Steward of Kirtonos can cast curses and Paralyzing Poison. Dispel the curses and prepare for the poison’s 8-second stun.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Blood Steward of Kirtonos","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:29759545fd2885e1d7a1c69cb2b0c79f16d45ab7"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-kirtonos-the-herald","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Kirtonos el Heraldo: dos formas","title_en":"Kirtonos the Herald: Two Forms","summary_es":"Mantén al tanque junto a una pared y disipa sus maldiciones, sobre todo en forma humana.","summary_en":"Keep the tank by a wall and dispel his curses, especially in human form.","keywords_es":["Kirtonos el Heraldo","invocar a Kirtonos","formas de Kirtonos","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Kirtonos the Herald","summon Kirtonos","Kirtonos forms","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"Kirtonos el Heraldo solo aparece si alguien lleva Sangre de los inocentes para invocarlo. El tanque debe mantener la espalda contra una pared para evitar el empuje; en forma humana, disipa sus maldiciones, y en forma de gárgola conserva la amenaza.","text_en":"Kirtonos the Herald appears only when someone brings Blood of Innocents to summon him. The tank should keep their back to a wall to prevent knockback; dispel his curses in human form, and maintain threat in gargoyle form.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Kirtonos the Herald","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:cd4b0435c8f6764768e649f47b638f81a32c1452"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-jandice-barov","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jandice Barov: ilusiones","title_en":"Jandice Barov: Illusions","summary_es":"Elimina sus copias una a una o céntrate en Jandice; disipa Maldición de sangre.","summary_en":"Kill her copies one by one or focus Jandice; dispel Curse of Blood.","keywords_es":["Jandice Barov","ilusiones de Jandice","Maldición de sangre","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Jandice Barov","Jandice illusions","Curse of Blood","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"Jandice Barov crea copias que no se pueden eliminar con daño de área: selecciónalas una a una o concentraos en la jefa. Disipa Maldición de sangre.","text_en":"Jandice Barov creates copies that cannot be defeated with area damage: target them individually or focus the boss. Have a Mage or Druid remove her curse.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Jandice Barov","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:d9e0ef6fd185528e5eab843940b69facc3c3ab93"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-rattlegore","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Traquesangre: ataques cuerpo a cuerpo","title_en":"Rattlegore: Melee Attacks","summary_es":"Despeja la zona, aleja al jefe del grupo y mantén a distancia a quienes atacan desde lejos.","summary_en":"Clear the area, face the boss away from the group, and keep ranged players back.","keywords_es":["Traquesangre","estrategia de Traquesangre","Llave de la Sala de visión","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Rattlegore","Rattlegore strategy","Viewing Room Key","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"Traquesangre golpea con fuerza y sus ataques son cuerpo a cuerpo. Despeja la zona antes de atraerlo, oriéntalo de espaldas al grupo y mantén lejos a quienes atacan a distancia; al derrotarlo deja la Llave de la Sala de visión.","text_en":"Rattlegore hits hard with melee-focused attacks. Clear the area before pulling him, face him away from the group, and keep ranged players back; he drops the Viewing Room Key.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Rattlegore","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:ea5110eb0ed7b2c42b938c7027aea28484bfeeb3"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-marduk-blackpool","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Marduz Pozonegro: aura y escudo","title_en":"Marduk Blackpool: Aura and Shield","summary_es":"Deja a los atacantes a distancia fuera del aura y evita golpear mientras el escudo esté activo.","summary_en":"Keep ranged players outside the aura and avoid attacking while the shield is active.","keywords_es":["Marduz Pozonegro","Aura profanadora","Escudo de las Sombras","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Marduk Blackpool","Defiling Aura","Shadow Shield","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"Marduz Pozonegro usa Aura profanadora, que daña a quienes están cerca, y Escudo de las Sombras, que devuelve daño cuando lo golpean. El tanque debe mantenerlo en su sitio mientras los atacantes a distancia se apartan del aura.","text_en":"Marduk Blackpool uses Defiling Aura, which damages nearby players, and Shadow Shield, which deals damage when he is attacked. The tank should hold him in place while ranged players stay outside the aura.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Marduk Blackpool","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:735a286d9e3b986f205e622cadd2a8ee98a7ab8d"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-vectus","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Vectus: ataques de fuego","title_en":"Vectus: Fire Attacks","summary_es":"Aléjate de las áreas de fuego de Vectus.","summary_en":"Move out of Vectus’s fire areas.","keywords_es":["Vectus","Fogonazo","Ola explosiva","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Vectus","Flamestrike","Blast Wave","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"Vectus lanza hechizos de fuego y ataques de área como Fogonazo y Ola explosiva. Sal de las zonas afectadas mientras el grupo lo derrota.","text_en":"Vectus casts fire spells and area attacks such as Flamestrike and Blast Wave. Move out of affected areas while the group defeats him.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Vectus","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:d2d31f7c1d480a52ad5099065ef005069331029c"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-ras-frostwhisper","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ras Levescarcha: magia de Escarcha","title_en":"Ras Frostwhisper: Frost Magic","summary_es":"Despeja el entorno, oriéntalo lejos del grupo e interrumpe sus hechizos.","summary_en":"Clear the area, face him away from the group, and interrupt his spells.","keywords_es":["Ras Levescarcha","Miedo de Ras Levescarcha","hechizos de Escarcha","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Ras Frostwhisper","Ras Frostwhisper fear","frost spells","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"Despeja la zona alrededor de Ras Levescarcha antes del combate y oriéntalo de espaldas al grupo. Vigila Miedo y organiza interrupciones para reducir sus lanzamientos de Escarcha.","text_en":"Clear the area around Ras Frostwhisper before the fight and face him away from the group. Watch for Fear and coordinate interrupts to reduce his frost casts.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ras Frostwhisper","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:1a85b918ecc1b9efbe3ee2b863ef153da0bbde56"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-kormok","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Kormok: invocación","title_en":"Kormok: Summoning","summary_es":"Kormok se invoca en la sala de Ras con un blandón de misión o de cadena.","summary_en":"Kormok is summoned in Ras’s room with a quest or quest-chain brazier.","keywords_es":["Kormok","invocar a Kormok","Blandón de Señalización","Blandón de Invocación"],"keywords_en":["Kormok","summon Kormok","Brazier of Beckoning","Brazier of Invocation"],"text_es":"Kormok no aparece por sí solo: se invoca en la sala de Ras Levescarcha con el Blandón de Señalización de una misión. Si no recibes esa misión, la cadena que termina con el Blandón de Invocación permite llamarlo más adelante.","text_en":"Kormok does not appear on his own: summon him in Ras Frostwhisper’s room with the Brazier of Beckoning from a quest. If you do not receive that quest, the chain that ends with the Brazier of Invocation lets you summon him later.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Kormok","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:8dcc657b5f62a827b3defa250a64d336b1d3960e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-instructor-malicia","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Instructor Malicia: interrumpe sus curas","title_en":"Instructor Malicia: Interrupt Her Heals","summary_es":"Interrumpe sus curas y disipa Llamada de la tumba.","summary_en":"Interrupt her heals and dispel Call of the Grave.","keywords_es":["Instructor Malicia","Llamada de la tumba","interrumpir a Malicia","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Instructor Malicia","Call of the Grave","interrupt Malicia","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"Instructor Malicia tiene varias curas: organiza interrupciones para frenar sus lanzamientos. Disipa Llamada de la tumba y céntrate en derrotarla.","text_en":"Instructor Malicia has several heals: coordinate interrupts to stop her casts. Have a Mage or Druid remove Call of the Grave and focus on defeating her.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Instructor Malicia","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:206b012b38ba9cfbc68f585e557d133ac1f24540"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-doctor-theolen-krastinov","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Doctor Theolen Krastinov: aumenta sus ataques","title_en":"Doctor Theolen Krastinov: Faster Attacks","summary_es":"Al 50% de salud aumenta mucho su velocidad de ataque; reserva defensas y curas.","summary_en":"At 50% health his attack speed rises sharply; save defensive abilities and healing.","keywords_es":["Doctor Theolen Krastinov","el Carnicero de Scholomance","velocidad de ataque de Krastinov"],"keywords_en":["Doctor Theolen Krastinov","Scholomance Butcher","Krastinov attack speed"],"text_es":"Doctor Theolen Krastinov usa ataques cuerpo a cuerpo y aumenta mucho su velocidad de ataque al llegar al 50% de salud. El tanque debe atraerlo junto a una pared; reserva defensas y curas para ese momento.","text_en":"Doctor Theolen Krastinov uses melee attacks and sharply increases his attack speed at 50% health. The tank should pull him to a wall; save defensive abilities and healing for that point.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Doctor Theolen Krastinov","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:489a80ec78c70cf24d120a848ee72ed32f10fc4b"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-lorekeeper-polkelt","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tradicionalista Polkelt: infección volátil","title_en":"Lorekeeper Polkelt: Volatile Infection","summary_es":"Mantén distancia ante sus ataques tóxicos y sepárate si te afecta Infección volátil.","summary_en":"Keep away from his toxic attacks and spread out if Volatile Infection affects you.","keywords_es":["Tradicionalista Polkelt","Infección volátil","Ácido corrosivo","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Lorekeeper Polkelt","Volatile Infection","Corrosive Acid","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"Tradicionalista Polkelt usa ataques tóxicos de área que dañan a quienes se acercan. Si alguien recibe Infección volátil, debe separarse del grupo.","text_en":"Lorekeeper Polkelt uses damaging toxic area attacks. Anyone affected by Volatile Infection should move away from the group.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lorekeeper Polkelt","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:42a665f83bfea7273e4707bfd088e245335efb41"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-the-ravenian","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Devorador: ataques de área","title_en":"The Ravenian: Area Attacks","summary_es":"Pon al jefe de espaldas al grupo y espera a que el tanque genere amenaza.","summary_en":"Face the boss away from the group and let the tank build threat.","keywords_es":["El Devorador","jefe de Scholomance","Mella hendida","Atropello"],"keywords_en":["The Ravenian","Scholomance boss","Sundering Cleave","Trample"],"text_es":"El Devorador golpea fuerte y rápido con ataques cuerpo a cuerpo y de área. El tanque debe orientarlo contra una pared, de espaldas al grupo, y generar amenaza antes de que los demás ataquen.","text_en":"The Ravenian hits hard and fast with melee and area attacks. The tank should face him toward a wall and away from the group, building threat before others attack.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Ravenian","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:0eec8bd1f988333f28fe0e908ba6500cc590954e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-lord-alexei-barov","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Lord Alexei Barov: aura y guardaespaldas","title_en":"Lord Alexei Barov: Aura and Guards","summary_es":"Aparta a Alexei por su aura; controla a sus dos guardias y evita el líquido verde.","summary_en":"Pull Alexei away for his aura; control his two guards and avoid the green liquid.","keywords_es":["Lord Alexei Barov","Aura profana","Velo de Sombras","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Lord Alexei Barov","Unholy Aura","Veil of Shadow","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"Lord Alexei Barov viene con dos guardias esqueléticos que pueden controlarse con Encadenar no-muerto o Ahuyentar a no-muerto. No pises el líquido verde; el tanque debe mantener al jefe lejos del grupo por Aura profana y disipar Velo de Sombras si es posible.","text_en":"Lord Alexei Barov has two skeletal guards that can be controlled with Shackle Undead or Turn Undead. Avoid the green liquid; the tank should keep the boss away from the group because of Unholy Aura and dispel Veil of Shadow if possible.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lord Alexei Barov","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:e779f264d0b0350a21fcfa13e2c4f5a188ece981"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-lady-illucia-barov","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Lady Illucia Barov: Dominación mental","title_en":"Lady Illucia Barov: Dominate Mind","summary_es":"Aturde o controla a quien sufra Dominación mental y despeja la sala antes del combate.","summary_en":"Stun or control anyone hit by Dominate Mind and clear the room before the fight.","keywords_es":["Lady Illucia Barov","Dominación mental","Silencio de área","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Lady Illucia Barov","Dominate Mind","area silence","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"La mayor amenaza de Lady Illucia Barov es Dominar mente: aturde o controla a quien quede bajo su efecto. También puede lanzar Silencio y Miedo de área, así que despeja la sala antes de atacarla.","text_en":"The main threat from Lady Illucia Barov is Dominate Mind: stun or control anyone affected. She can also cast area Silence and Fear, so clear the room before engaging.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Lady Illucia Barov","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:25f6328fdfa19c5b06aee2706f8ef9839cf576e6"]},{"id":"mazmorra-scholomance-darkmaster-gandling","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Maestro oscuro Gandling: teletransporte","title_en":"Darkmaster Gandling: Teleport","summary_es":"Interrumpe Misiles Arcanos y prepárate por si teletransporta al tanque o al sanador.","summary_en":"Interrupt Arcane Missiles and plan for the tank or healer to be teleported.","keywords_es":["Maestro oscuro Gandling","teletransporte de Gandling","Misiles Arcanos","jefes de Scholomance"],"keywords_en":["Darkmaster Gandling","Gandling teleport","Arcane Missiles","Scholomance bosses"],"text_es":"Maestro oscuro Gandling teletransporta periódicamente a un jugador a una sala contigua, donde queda encerrado hasta derrotar a los enemigos. Acordad cómo cubrir al tanque o al sanador si les ocurre e interrumpid Misiles Arcanos.","text_en":"Darkmaster Gandling periodically teleports a player to an adjacent room, where they are trapped until they defeat its enemies. Plan how to cover for the tank or healer if teleported, and interrupt Arcane Missiles.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Scholomance Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Darkmaster Gandling","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/scholomance-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-06"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:scholomance"],"source_hashes":["section:ba22a971bf26c2f0267d18b2e81f48279ac82a41"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Stratholme vivo: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Stratholme Live: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 55-60; vuela a la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz y sigue al noroeste.","summary_en":"Level 55-60; fly to Light’s Hope Chapel and travel northwest.","keywords_es":["stratholme vivo","nivel stratholme vivo","entrada de stratholme","cómo llegar a stratholme"],"keywords_en":["stratholme live","stratholme live level","stratholme entrance","how to reach stratholme"],"text_es":"Stratholme vivo está pensado para niveles 55-60, en el noroeste de las Tierras de la Peste del Este. Horda y Alianza pueden volar a la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz y seguir a pie al noroeste; la entrada no-muerta queda al este.","text_en":"Stratholme Live is intended for levels 55-60 in northwest Eastern Plaguelands. Horde and Alliance can fly to the chapel and travel northwest on foot; the Undead-side entrance is to the east.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Stratholme Live Side Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Stratholme Live Side in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:2c992c07c88619a8b9c731db4b4b45676006bad9","section:a57bc47a95ff17e5edf4bcecb59f9a4f21cdcbc5"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones antes de Stratholme vivo","title_en":"Quests Before Stratholme Live","summary_es":"El gran Ezra Grimm y El archivista se recogen en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz.","summary_en":"The Great Ezra Grimm and The Archivist start at Light’s Hope Chapel.","keywords_es":["misiones stratholme vivo","el gran ezra grimm","el archivista","misiones antes de stratholme"],"keywords_en":["stratholme live quests","the great ezra grimm","the archivist quest","quests before stratholme"],"text_es":"Acepta El gran Ezra Grimm con Smokey LaRue y El archivista con el Duque Nicholas Zverenhoff, ambos en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, en las Tierras de la Peste del Este. El archivista habilita el objeto que inicia La verdad cae del cielo tras derrotar a Balnazzar.","text_en":"Pick up The Great Ezra Grimm from Smokey LaRue and The Archivist from Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff, both at the chapel in Eastern Plaguelands. The Archivist enables the item that starts The Truth Comes Crashing Down after Balnazzar is defeated.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Great Ezra Grimm","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Archivist","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Truth Comes Crashing Down","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["guide:e400bff59d4a7ae9417f8759caa599935d64bb81","section:3b8558f4c4f57a156c81839bc857383e2def957c"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-misiones-cadena","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Otras misiones de Stratholme vivo","title_en":"Other Stratholme Live Quests","summary_es":"Espíritus inquietos empieza en la capilla; De amor y familia requiere una cadena previa.","summary_en":"The Restless Souls starts at the chapel; Of Love and Family requires a prior chain.","keywords_es":["espíritus inquietos","de amor y familia","misiones stratholme vivo","misiones tierras de la peste"],"keywords_en":["the restless souls","of love and family","stratholme live quests","plaguelands quests"],"text_es":"Espíritus inquietos comienza con el Custodio Alen en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, en las Tierras de la Peste del Este, y continúa con Egan, al suroeste de Stratholme. De amor y familia empieza con Tirión Vadín en las Tierras de la Peste del Oeste; completa la cadena hasta aceptar la misión de la Artista Renfray antes de entrar.","text_en":"The Restless Souls starts with Caretaker Alen at the chapel in Eastern Plaguelands and continues with Egan southwest of Stratholme. Of Love and Family begins with Tirion Fordring in Western Plaguelands; complete the chain through the quest from Artist Renfray before entering.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Restless Souls","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Of Love and Family","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["guide:e400bff59d4a7ae9417f8759caa599935d64bb81","section:3b8558f4c4f57a156c81839bc857383e2def957c"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-ezra-grimm","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ezra Grimm","title_en":"Ezra Grimm","summary_es":"Ezra Grimm lanza ataques de fuego y aturde en área; elimina los enemigos cercanos antes.","summary_en":"Ezra Grimm uses area fire and stun attacks; clear nearby enemies first.","keywords_es":["ezra grimm","jefe ezra grimm","estrategia ezra grimm"],"keywords_en":["ezra grimm","ezra grimm boss","ezra grimm strategy"],"text_es":"Ezra Grimm aparece al activar la caja de tabaco. Sus ataques de fuego y aturdimiento afectan en área; separarse ayuda. Invoca esbirros y puede atraer enemigos cercanos, así que despeja la zona antes del combate.","text_en":"Ezra Grimm appears when the tobacco box is activated. His fire and stun attacks affect an area, so spreading out helps. He summons adds and can pull nearby enemies, so clear the area before the fight.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ezra Grimm","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:2f225d3af41cfeb1a25cb1d637ca2d726e36e7a5"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-skul","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Skul, aparición poco común","title_en":"Skul, Rare Spawn","summary_es":"Interrumpe los hechizos de Skul para reducir el daño al grupo.","summary_en":"Interrupt Skul’s spells to reduce damage to the group.","keywords_es":["skul","skul jefe","skul aparición poco común"],"keywords_en":["skul","skul boss","skul rare spawn"],"text_es":"Skul puede aparecer antes de Ezra Grimm o en la zona este. Sus hechizos son su principal amenaza; interrúmpelos cuando sea posible.","text_en":"Skul may appear before Ezra Grimm or in the eastern area. His spells are his main threat; interrupt them when possible.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Skul (rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:7b5b9f974436e697b60f648c1778b0590e1815ab"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-hearthsinger-forresten","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Escupezones Foreste","title_en":"Hearthsinger Forresten","summary_es":"Escupezones Foreste duerme a un jugador y usa Multidisparo; separa al grupo.","summary_en":"Hearthsinger Forresten sleeps a player and uses Multi-Shot; spread out.","keywords_es":["escupezones foreste","hearthsinger forresten","jefe escupezones foreste"],"keywords_en":["hearthsinger forresten","escupezones foreste","hearthsinger boss"],"text_es":"Escupezones Foreste puede aparecer al norte de Ezra Grimm o al este, tras El imperdonable. Arrullo de encantamiento duerme a un jugador durante 8 segundos; contrarresta Multidisparo separándote.","text_en":"Hearthsinger Forresten may appear north of Ezra Grimm or east, beyond The Unforgiven. Enchanting Lullaby sleeps one player for 8 seconds; counter Multi-Shot by spreading out.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Hearthsinger Forresten (rare)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:b4820f3b8dd3e27198d850e691be08e8f51eadd2"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-el-imperdonable","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El imperdonable","title_en":"The Unforgiven","summary_es":"El imperdonable aparece con esbirros y ralentiza con un hechizo de las Sombras.","summary_en":"The Unforgiven appears with adds and slows with a Shadow spell.","keywords_es":["el imperdonable","the unforgiven","jefe el imperdonable"],"keywords_en":["the unforgiven","el imperdonable","the unforgiven boss"],"text_es":"El imperdonable aparece en un corredor y trae varios enemigos menores. Su hechizo de las Sombras también ralentiza; evita llegar al combate con otros enemigos encima.","text_en":"The Unforgiven appears in a corridor and brings several lesser enemies. Its shadow spell also slows; avoid starting the fight with other enemies already engaged.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Unforgiven","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:5ca1b206984389d559cd93de978e9a5e4a4d9bb8"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-balzaphon","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Balzaphon","title_en":"Balzaphon","summary_es":"Balzaphon solo aparece durante el evento de la Plaga y lanza Descarga de Escarcha.","summary_en":"Balzaphon appears only during the Scourge event and casts Frostbolt.","keywords_es":["balzaphon","jefe balzaphon","evento de la plaga"],"keywords_en":["balzaphon","balzaphon boss","scourge event"],"text_es":"Balzaphon solo aparece durante el evento de la Plaga de Naxxramas. No tiene mecánicas destacadas y lanza repetidamente Descarga de Escarcha.","text_en":"Balzaphon appears only during the Naxxramas Scourge event. He has no notable mechanics and repeatedly casts Frostbolt.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Balzaphon (scourge event only)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:a9e5bb2b1c286c17e940f085a53915729f1e9124"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-jefe-de-correos-gassol","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jefe de correos Gassol","title_en":"Postmaster Malown","summary_es":"Gassol teme al grupo; controla a los carteros y disipa su maldición acumulable.","summary_en":"Malown fears the group; control the postmen and dispel their stacking curse.","keywords_es":["jefe de correos gassol","postmaster malown","buzones stratholme"],"keywords_en":["postmaster malown","jefe de correos gassol","stratholme mailboxes"],"text_es":"Jefe de correos Gassol aparece al abrir el tercer buzón. Lucha junto a tres Carteros no-muertos, cuya maldición acumulable presiona al tanque; controla a los carteros o disipa la maldición. Despeja la zona porque Gassol también provoca miedo.","text_en":"Postmaster Malown appears when the third mailbox is opened. He fights with three postmen, whose stacking curse pressures the tank; control them or dispel the curse. Clear the area because Malown also fears the group.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Postmaster Malown","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:6e09ad64ea0dc84ecae68d425ce97653d293b201"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-timmy-el-cruel","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Timmy el Cruel","title_en":"Timmy the Cruel","summary_es":"Timmy el Cruel no tiene mecánicas especiales: es un combate directo.","summary_en":"Timmy the Cruel has no special mechanics; this is a straightforward fight.","keywords_es":["timmy el cruel","timmy the cruel","jefe timmy"],"keywords_en":["timmy the cruel","timmy el cruel","timmy boss"],"text_es":"Timmy el Cruel puede ser el primer jefe si el grupo va directamente al lado escarlata. No tiene mecánicas especiales: el combate es directo.","text_en":"Timmy the Cruel may be the first boss if the group heads straight to the Scarlet side. He has no special mechanics; the fight is straightforward.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Timmy the Cruel","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:fd114802352448fcac5aa54cb75e4dc824fe2373"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-malor-el-entusiasta","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Malor el Entusiasta","title_en":"Malor the Zealous","summary_es":"Malor el Entusiasta usa Imposición de manos; la caja contiene el Medallón de Fe.","summary_en":"Malor the Zealous uses Lay on Hands; the chest contains the Medallion of Faith.","keywords_es":["malor el entusiasta","malor the zealous","medallón de fe"],"keywords_en":["malor the zealous","malor el entusiasta","medallion of faith"],"text_es":"Malor el Entusiasta no tiene mecánicas destacadas aparte de Imposición de manos. Abre la caja fuerte tras él: contiene el Medallón de Fe para su misión.","text_en":"Malor the Zealous has no notable mechanics besides Lay on Hands. Open the strongbox behind him: it contains the Medallion of Faith for its quest.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Malor the Zealous and Medallion of Faith","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:a1d4eeee14a0b6785804f79a8f92e0242b63a67a"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-crimson-hammersmith","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Forjador de martillos carmesí","title_en":"Crimson Hammersmith","summary_es":"El Forjador de martillos carmesí se invoca al activar los planos; su botín es para herreros.","summary_en":"Crimson Hammersmith is summoned by activating the plans; his loot is for blacksmiths.","keywords_es":["crimson hammersmith","jefe crimson hammersmith","herrero de stratholme"],"keywords_en":["crimson hammersmith","crimson hammersmith boss","stratholme blacksmith"],"text_es":"El Forjador de martillos carmesí aparece al activar los planos de herrería del suelo. Es un combate sencillo y deja un plano de herrería avanzada para armeros.","text_en":"Crimson Hammersmith appears when the blacksmithing plans on the floor are activated. It is a simple fight and he drops an advanced blacksmithing plan for armorsmiths.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Crimson Hammersmith","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:b06ce82d4f10da1ae208cafd94e387ebde238f10"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-canonero-jefe-willey","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cañonero Jefe Willey","title_en":"Cannon Master Willey","summary_es":"Willey invoca atacantes a distancia; usa balas de cañón o céntrate en ellos.","summary_en":"Willey summons ranged attackers; use cannonballs or focus them.","keywords_es":["cañonero jefe willey","cannon master willey","jefe willey"],"keywords_en":["cannon master willey","cañonero jefe willey","willey boss"],"text_es":"Cañonero Jefe Willey invoca atacantes a distancia. El grupo puede eliminarlos o recoger una bala cercana y disparar un cañón contra ellos; Willey también puede interrumpir.","text_en":"Cannon Master Willey summons ranged attackers. The group can kill them or use a nearby cannonball to fire a cannon at them; Willey can also interrupt.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Cannon Master Willey","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:0aea365cb245a8f4caa11ca90abe8754dae59560"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-archivista-galford","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Archivista Galford","title_en":"Archivist Galford","summary_es":"Galford combina daño periódico y de área; saquea el cuadro antes de quemar el archivo.","summary_en":"Galford combines damage over time and area damage; loot the painting before burning the archive.","keywords_es":["archivista galford","archivist galford","misiones archivista galford"],"keywords_en":["archivist galford","archivista galford","archivist galford boss"],"text_es":"Archivista Galford usa Vientos ardientes como daño periódico y Nova de Fuego en área, lo que carga al sanador. Si haces De amor y familia, recoge primero el cuadro: quemar el archivo puede destruirlo.","text_en":"Archivist Galford uses Burning Winds for damage over time and Fire Nova for area damage, increasing healer pressure. If doing De amor y familia, loot the painting first: burning the archive can destroy it.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Archivist Galford","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:1711724b797782bb70834965a6f590063b9b38dc"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefe-dathrohan-balnazzar","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dathrohan y Balnazzar","title_en":"Dathrohan and Balnazzar","summary_es":"Dathrohan se transforma en Balnazzar, que usa control mental, miedo y sueño.","summary_en":"Dathrohan becomes Balnazzar, who uses mind control, fear, and sleep.","keywords_es":["gran cruzado dathrohan","balnazzar","jefe final stratholme vivo"],"keywords_en":["grand crusader dathrohan","balnazzar","stratholme live final boss"],"text_es":"Gran Cruzado Dathrohan se transforma en Balnazzar cuando su salud ronda la mitad. En su segunda forma, controla mentalmente y puede provocar miedo o dormir; controla al aliado dominado y disipa Dormir si es posible.","text_en":"Grand Crusader Dathrohan transforms into Balnazzar at about half health. In his second form, he mind-controls and can fear or sleep the group; control the dominated ally and dispel Sleep when possible.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Grand Crusader Dathrohan/Balnazzar","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:5e8908716c091cd00033ebab68b4487a4083e4c7"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-jefes-jarien-sothos","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Jarien y Sothos","title_en":"Jarien and Sothos","summary_es":"Jarien y Sothos se invocan en la sala final con el blandón de una misión de conjunto.","summary_en":"Jarien and Sothos are summoned in the final room with a tier-quest brazier.","keywords_es":["jarien","sothos","jarien y sothos","blandón de señalización"],"keywords_en":["jarien","sothos","jarien and sothos","brazier of beckoning"],"text_es":"Jarien y Sothos se invocan en la sala de Balnazzar con el Blandón de Señalización de una misión de conjunto. El Blandón de Invocación permite llamarlos más adelante; dejan un alijo con su equipo.","text_en":"Jarien and Sothos are summoned in Balnazzar’s room with the Brazier of Beckoning from a tier quest. The Brazier of Invocation can summon them later; they leave a cache containing their gear.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Jarien and Sothos","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["section:71ffd71ec6a5fe1665e0bba63e0603025a827b04"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-vivo-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Stratholme vivo","title_en":"Stratholme Live Rewards","summary_es":"Destacan el Manto de la Cruzada Escarlata y el Obús portátil de Willey.","summary_en":"Notable items include the Mantle of the Scarlet Crusade and Willey’s Portable Howitzer.","keywords_es":["recompensas stratholme vivo","botín stratholme vivo","manto de la cruzada escarlata","obús portátil de willey"],"keywords_en":["stratholme live rewards","stratholme live loot","mantle of the scarlet crusade","willeys portable howitzer"],"text_es":"Entre los objetos destacados están el Manto de la Cruzada Escarlata y el Obús portátil de Willey. El cañonero también puede dejar la Redención; la misión El gran Ezra Grimm recompensa con el Mechero de Smokey.","text_en":"Notable items include the Mantle of the Scarlet Crusade and Willey’s Portable Howitzer. The cannon master can also drop Redemption; the quest The Great Ezra Grimm rewards Smokey’s Lighter.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Great Ezra Grimm","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Live Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Stratholme Live Side Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-live-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-live-side"],"source_hashes":["guide:e400bff59d4a7ae9417f8759caa599935d64bb81","section:2751a7c9dd0bb089f79130528a7509acf76a9614"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-entrada","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Stratholme no-muerto: nivel y entrada","title_en":"Stratholme Undead: Level and Entrance","summary_es":"Nivel 55-60; vuela a la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz y sigue al noroeste.","summary_en":"Level 55-60; fly to Light’s Hope Chapel and travel northwest.","keywords_es":["stratholme no-muerto","nivel stratholme no-muerto","entrada de stratholme","cómo llegar a stratholme"],"keywords_en":["stratholme undead","stratholme undead level","stratholme entrance","how to reach stratholme"],"text_es":"Stratholme no-muerto está pensado para niveles 55-60, en el noroeste de las Tierras de la Peste del Este. Horda y Alianza pueden volar a la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz y seguir al noroeste; su entrada queda al este de la del lado vivo.","text_en":"Stratholme Undead is intended for levels 55-60 in northwest Eastern Plaguelands. Horde and Alliance can fly to the chapel and travel northwest; its entrance is east of the Live-side entrance.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Stratholme Undead Side Overview in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Location of Stratholme Undead Side in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["section:16631219b354cb56996b7b25119522ecb1b546cd","section:c1757b97b6fba6448e93b4c04431a7b3376e5184"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-misiones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones antes de Stratholme no-muerto","title_en":"Quests Before Stratholme Undead","summary_es":"Las casas de lo sagrado y El agente activo empiezan en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz.","summary_en":"Houses of the Holy and The Active Agent start at Light’s Hope Chapel.","keywords_es":["misiones stratholme no-muerto","las casas de lo sagrado","el agente activo","la carne no miente"],"keywords_en":["stratholme undead quests","houses of the holy","the active agent","the flesh does not lie"],"text_es":"Leonid Barthalomew el Venerado ofrece Las casas de lo sagrado en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz; recoge Agua bendita de Stratholme. Betina Bigglezink da La carne no miente; complétala para desbloquear El agente activo, que busca Datos de la Plaga en los zigurats.","text_en":"Leonid Barthalomew the Revered offers Houses of the Holy at Light’s Hope Chapel; collect Stratholme Holy Water. Betina Bigglezink gives The Flesh Does Not Lie; complete it to unlock The Active Agent, which sends you to find Scourge Data in the ziggurats.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Houses of the Holy","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Flesh Does Not Lie","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Active Agent","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["guide:93b07f159d315d3399fe3001f1315df0585dfedf","section:e455c744a2bfa591124e21401a2208dd3a9c52d9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-misiones-aurius","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones de Aurius y del Barón","title_en":"Aurius and Baron Quests","summary_es":"La estimación de Aurius requiere El medallón de Fe; Por encima y más allá continúa otra cadena.","summary_en":"Aurius’ Reckoning requires The Medallion of Faith; Above and Beyond continues another chain.","keywords_es":["la estimación de aurius","el medallón de fe","por encima y más allá","misiones barón osahendido"],"keywords_en":["aurius reckoning","the medallion of faith","above and beyond","baron rivendare quests"],"text_es":"El medallón de Fe se obtiene tras derrotar a Malor el Entusiasta en el lado vivo y abre La estimación de Aurius, que pide derrotar al Barón Osahendido. Por encima y más allá requiere una cadena previa y la cabeza del Barón; se acepta en la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, en las Tierras de la Peste del Este.","text_en":"The Medallion of Faith is obtained after defeating Malor the Zealous on the Live side and unlocks Aurius’ Reckoning, which asks you to defeat Baron Rivendare. Above and Beyond requires a prior chain and the head dropped by Baron Rivendare; pick it up at the chapel in Eastern Plaguelands.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › The Medallion of Faith","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Aurius' Reckoning","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Above and Beyond","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["guide:93b07f159d315d3399fe3001f1315df0585dfedf"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-mision-ramstein","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"La misión Ramstein","title_en":"The Ramstein Quest","summary_es":"La Horda puede aceptar Ramstein de Nathanos Clamañublo tras completar sus requisitos previos.","summary_en":"Horde can take Ramstein from Nathanos Blightcaller after completing its prerequisites.","keywords_es":["misión ramstein","ramstein horda","nathanos clamañublo","la orden del señor de exploradores"],"keywords_en":["ramstein quest","horde ramstein","nathanos blightcaller","the ranger lords behest"],"text_es":"Ramstein es una misión exclusiva de la Horda que da Nathanos Clamañublo en las Tierras de la Peste del Este. Completa antes La orden del Señor de exploradores, que incluye eliminar a un Especialista, y Alatardecer, cómo te odio…, que requiere derrotar a Alaocaso. Luego vence a Ramstein el Empachador y recoge su cabeza.","text_en":"Nathanos Blightcaller offers the Horde-only Ramstein quest in Eastern Plaguelands. Its prerequisites are The Ranger Lord’s Behest and the Duskwing quest, Oh How I Hate Thee; after both, defeat Ramstein the Gorger and loot his head.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ramstein","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["guide:93b07f159d315d3399fe3001f1315df0585dfedf","section:e455c744a2bfa591124e21401a2208dd3a9c52d9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-mision-menethil","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El Obsequio de Menethil","title_en":"Menethil’s Gift","summary_es":"El Obsequio de Menethil culmina una cadena que empieza con Eva Sarkhoff en las Tierras de la Peste del Oeste.","summary_en":"Menethil’s Gift ends a chain starting with Eva Sarkhoff in Western Plaguelands.","keywords_es":["el obsequio de menethil","eva sarkhoff","cadena de menethil","misiones de stratholme"],"keywords_en":["menethils gift","eva sarkhoff","menethil quest chain","stratholme quests"],"text_es":"La cadena de El Obsequio de Menethil comienza con Eva Sarkhoff en las Tierras de la Peste del Oeste y pasa por Scholomance y otras zonas. En el último tramo, Leonid Barthalomew el Venerado entrega la misión de Stratholme; usa el Recuerdo de Evocación junto al Barón Osahendido para completarla.","text_en":"Menethil’s Gift begins with Eva Sarkhoff in Western Plaguelands and includes Scholomance and other zones. In its final stage, Leonid Barthalomew the Revered gives the Stratholme quest; use the Keepsake of Remembrance near Baron Rivendare to complete it.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Quick Reference Table","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Menethil's Gift","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["guide:93b07f159d315d3399fe3001f1315df0585dfedf","section:e455c744a2bfa591124e21401a2208dd3a9c52d9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-jefe-magistrado-barthilas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Magistrado Barthilas","title_en":"Magistrate Barthilas","summary_es":"Su empujón puede lanzar al tanque contra otros enemigos; lucha de espaldas a una pared.","summary_en":"His knockback can throw the tank into other enemies; fight with your back to a wall.","keywords_es":["magistrado barthilas","magistrate barthilas","jefe barthilas"],"keywords_en":["magistrate barthilas","magistrado barthilas","barthilas boss"],"text_es":"Magistrado Barthilas puede aparecer en la iglesia inicial o correr hasta su puesto cerca del final. Arremetida poderosa empuja al tanque y puede llevarlo contra otros enemigos; colócate de espaldas a una pared.","text_en":"Magistrate Barthilas may appear at the starting church or run to his position near the end. Mighty Blow knocks the tank back and can send them into extra enemies; face a wall.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Magistrate Barthilas","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["section:be6accb8d99d4bb427d1a6086bfc018bfd4b3dd4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-jefe-pidrespina","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Pidrespina","title_en":"Stonespine","summary_es":"Pidrespina es poco común; su habilidad destacada es Desgarradura sanguinaria.","summary_en":"Stonespine is rare; its notable ability is Vicious Rend.","keywords_es":["pidrespina","stonespine","jefe pidrespina"],"keywords_en":["stonespine","pidrespina","stonespine boss"],"text_es":"Pidrespina es una aparición poco común que patrulla la zona indicada. No tiene otras mecánicas destacadas aparte de Desgarradura sanguinaria.","text_en":"Stonespine is a rare spawn that patrols the marked area. It has no notable mechanics besides Vicious Rend.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Stonespine (Rare Spawn)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["section:1b390fe360a8bfe423bfee156f5235be6eab16d4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-jefe-nerubenkan","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Nerub’enkan","title_en":"Nerub’enkan","summary_es":"Nerub’enkan invoca escarabajos y ralentiza; elimina los esbirros y vigila la armadura del tanque.","summary_en":"Nerub’enkan summons scarabs and slows; clear adds and watch the tank’s armor.","keywords_es":["nerub’enkan","nerub enkan","jefe nerub’enkan"],"keywords_en":["nerub’enkan","nerub enkan","nerubenkan boss"],"text_es":"Nerub’enkan invoca escarabajos y puede ralentizar al tanque y reducir su armadura. El DPS puede eliminar los esbirros mientras el tanque y el sanador vigilan el daño recibido.","text_en":"Nerub’enkan summons scarabs, can slow the tank, and reduces their armor. DPS can clear the adds while the tank and healer watch incoming damage.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Nerub'enkan","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["section:45b0e577386ad79da0f322160325393321f3e9dc"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-jefe-armero-guardia-negra","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armero Guardia Negra","title_en":"Black Guard Swordsmith","summary_es":"Armero Guardia Negra se invoca activando unos planos y no tiene mecánicas destacadas.","summary_en":"Black Guard Swordsmith is summoned by activating plans and has no notable mechanics.","keywords_es":["armero guardia negra","black guard swordsmith","jefe herrero stratholme"],"keywords_en":["black guard swordsmith","armero guardia negra","stratholme blacksmith boss"],"text_es":"Armero Guardia Negra es un minijefe invocado al activar los planos de herrería junto a la Baronesa Anastari. No tiene mecánicas destacadas; su único objeto destacado es un plano de herrería avanzada.","text_en":"Black Guard Swordsmith is summoned by activating the blacksmithing plans beside Baroness Anastari. He has no notable mechanics; his only notable item is an advanced blacksmithing plan.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Black Guard Swordsmith","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["section:6806bc7192f442b8dce55da0144201dab48283f9"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-jefe-baronesa-anastari","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Baronesa Anastari","title_en":"Baroness Anastari","summary_es":"Baronesa Anastari posee jugadores, silencia y reduce la probabilidad de golpe.","summary_en":"Baroness Anastari possesses players, silences, and lowers hit chance.","keywords_es":["baronesa anastari","baroness anastari","jefe anastari"],"keywords_en":["baroness anastari","baronesa anastari","anastari boss"],"text_es":"Baronesa Anastari puede usar Posesión; lleva al jugador poseído al 50% de salud para liberarlo. También silencia a los lanzadores y maldice al grupo, reduciendo la probabilidad de golpear.","text_en":"Baroness Anastari can use Possess; bring the possessed player to 50% health to break it. She also silences casters and curses the group, lowering hit chance.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Baroness Anastari","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["section:58004b2d1e93f187b868f97fb5a4a45e8070bf83"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-jefe-maleki-el-palido","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Maleki el Pálido","title_en":"Maleki the Pallid","summary_es":"Maleki el Pálido puede encerrar al tanque en una Tumba de hielo durante 6 segundos.","summary_en":"Maleki the Pallid can trap the tank in an Ice Tomb for 6 seconds.","keywords_es":["maleki el pálido","maleki the pallid","jefe maleki"],"keywords_en":["maleki the pallid","maleki el pálido","maleki boss"],"text_es":"Maleki el Pálido puede atrapar al tanque en Tumba de hielo durante 6 segundos. Mientras dure, el grupo debe vigilar la amenaza para evitar que los enemigos cambien de objetivo.","text_en":"Maleki the Pallid can trap the tank in Ice Tomb for 6 seconds. While it lasts, the group should watch threat to prevent enemies switching targets.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Maleki the Pallid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["section:928db49cddd19789e4f04134bb53a76824b9bdcd"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-jefe-ramstein-el-empachador","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ramstein el Empachador","title_en":"Ramstein the Gorger","summary_es":"Ramstein aparece tras limpiar las abominaciones y puede cambiar de objetivo.","summary_en":"Ramstein appears after clearing the abominations and can switch targets.","keywords_es":["ramstein el empachador","ramstein the gorger","jefe ramstein"],"keywords_en":["ramstein the gorger","ramstein el empachador","ramstein boss"],"text_es":"Ramstein el Empachador aparece tras eliminar las abominaciones de la sala; el acceso se cierra al iniciar el encuentro. Puede noquear al tanque y cambiar de objetivo; prepárate para sanar a los DPS y vigila Atropello.","text_en":"Ramstein the Gorger appears after clearing the abominations; the gate closes when the encounter begins. He can knock out the tank and switch targets; be ready to heal DPS and watch Trample.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Ramstein the Gorger","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["section:a1c500effb98de64ef9dbf1ce60cd58c84afbe8c"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-jefe-baron-osahendido","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Barón Osahendido","title_en":"Baron Rivendare","summary_es":"Reduce la sanación al tanque, daña en área e invoca esqueletos que deben eliminarse.","summary_en":"He reduces healing on the tank, deals area damage, and summons skeletons to kill.","keywords_es":["barón osahendido","baron rivendare","jefe final stratholme"],"keywords_en":["baron rivendare","barón osahendido","stratholme final boss"],"text_es":"Barón Osahendido es el jefe final. Aura profana y Mellar dañan a quienes están cerca; Golpe mortal reduce la sanación del tanque. Elimina pronto los esqueletos que invoca; los jugadores a distancia pueden mantenerse lejos del aura.","text_en":"Baron Rivendare is the final boss. Unholy Aura and Cleave damage nearby players; Mortal Strike reduces healing on the tank. Kill the skeletons he summons promptly; ranged players can stay away from the aura.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Baron Rivendare","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["section:7e59a2c5a42aa530bfc7f03d61cd2044e072a16e"]},{"id":"mazmorra-stratholme-no-muerto-recompensas","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de Stratholme no-muerto","title_en":"Stratholme Undead Rewards","summary_es":"Destacan las Riendas de Hemocargador, la Hoja rúnica del Barón Rivendare y la Corona del Penitente.","summary_en":"Notable rewards include Deathcharger’s Reins, Runeblade of Baron Rivendare, and Crown of the Penitent.","keywords_es":["recompensas stratholme no-muerto","botín stratholme no-muerto","riendas de hemocargador","corona del penitente"],"keywords_en":["stratholme undead rewards","stratholme undead loot","deathcharger reins","crown of the penitent"],"text_es":"Entre los objetos destacados están las Riendas de Hemocargador y la Hoja rúnica del Barón Rivendare. La misión Las casas de lo sagrado recompensa con la Corona del Penitente.","text_en":"Notable items include Deathcharger’s Reins and the Runeblade of Baron Rivendare. Houses of the Holy rewards the Crown of the Penitent.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Best Quest Rewards","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Stratholme Undead Side Dungeon Overview Guide: Quests, Location, Strategy & Rewards - WoW Forever › Stratholme Undead Side Loot in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/stratholme-undead-side-dungeon-overview-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["dungeon:stratholme-undead-side"],"source_hashes":["section:e1e3fe08453b5e44a8c8af36e4bd913fd2a832dd","section:f121de56f6d286dbab345b071a64b8e677843e22"]},{"id":"banda-general","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Fechas y tamaños de las bandas","title_en":"Barrow Deeps, Hyjal Summit, and Onyxia's Lair","summary_es":"Tres bandas de nivel 60 se abren el 9 de diciembre de 2026: 10, 20 y 40 jugadores.","summary_en":"Three level-60 raids open on December 9, 2026, for 10, 20 and 40 players.","keywords_es":["bandas de forever","cuándo salen las bandas","tamaño de las bandas","bandas nivel 60","bandas nuevas"],"keywords_en":["Barrow Deeps","Hyjal Summit","Onyxia’s Lair","raid release date","raid sizes"],"text_es":"El 9 de diciembre de 2026 se abren tres bandas de nivel 60: una nueva de 10 jugadores con ocho jefes, otra nueva de 20 con trece jefes y el regreso de la guarida de Onyxia, para 40. No se ha confirmado si Onyxia se rehará. Ninguna de las dos nuevas exige sintonización. Más adelante llegará otra banda ya confirmada, sin fecha.","text_en":"On December 9, 2026, three level-60 raids open: a new 10-player raid with eight bosses, a new 20-player raid with thirteen bosses, and Onyxia's Lair returning for 40. A rework of Onyxia's Lair is unconfirmed. Neither new raid requires attunement. Another confirmed raid, the Scarlet Enclave, will come later with no date.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: World of Warcraft: Forever Overview - New Features, Zones, Raids › New Raids in World of Warcraft: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/overview-features-zones-raids","date":"2026-11-04"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Raids Overview - Locations, Bosses and Guides › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids-overview-hub-dates-locations","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Raids Overview - Locations, Bosses and Guides › Hyjal Summit Raid in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids-overview-hub-dates-locations","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Raids Overview - Locations, Bosses and Guides › Barrow Deeps Raid in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids-overview-hub-dates-locations","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Raids Overview - Locations, Bosses and Guides › Onyxia's Lair Raid in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids-overview-hub-dates-locations","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["raid:overview-features-zones-raids","raid:raids-overview-hub-dates-locations"],"source_hashes":["guide:45ad9d3a5bf2e49b979cac9a36c50e5702967f49","section:081d1f42ac97fbe301950c69d8f8b6c8141e4229","section:6f1ce09ddf00c339c41e46331463d7ebf2ba1ae9","section:790a225d421d8119d7766d2a69d59615ef0a3822","section:883fb1c8db9c994132c9bfdce4cb7daf2cd65d70"]},{"id":"banda-ubicaciones","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Ubicación y accesos de las bandas","title_en":"Barrow Deeps, Hyjal Summit, and Onyxia Locations","summary_es":"Accesos de las tres bandas: la de 10 tiene tres entradas, la de 20 está en la cima de Hyjal.","summary_en":"Entrances to the three raids: the 10-player has three, the 20-player is at the top of Hyjal.","keywords_es":["dónde están las bandas","accesos a bandas","entrada banda de 10","zona de bandas","ubicación de Onyxia"],"keywords_en":["raid locations","raid entrances","10-player raid entrance","raid zone","Onyxia location"],"text_es":"La banda de 10 jugadores tiene tres accesos: Monte Hyjal, Cuna del Invierno y la mazmorra Bastión Faucenegra. La de 20 está en la cima de Monte Hyjal, junto a Nordrassil. La de 40, la guarida de Onyxia, es una cueva al sur del Marjal Revolcafango y exige sintonización; las otras dos no. Las tres son para nivel 60.","text_en":"The 10-player raid has three entrances: Mount Hyjal, Winterspring and the Blackmaw Hold dungeon. The 20-player raid is at the summit of Mount Hyjal, near Nordrassil. The 40-player Onyxia's Lair is a cave in the south of Dustwallow Marsh and requires attunement; the other two do not. All three are level 60.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Raids Overview - Locations, Bosses and Guides › Barrow Deeps Raid in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids-overview-hub-dates-locations","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Raids Overview - Locations, Bosses and Guides › Hyjal Summit Raid in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids-overview-hub-dates-locations","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Raids Overview - Locations, Bosses and Guides › Onyxia's Lair Raid in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids-overview-hub-dates-locations","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["raid:raids-overview-hub-dates-locations"],"source_hashes":["section:081d1f42ac97fbe301950c69d8f8b6c8141e4229","section:6f1ce09ddf00c339c41e46331463d7ebf2ba1ae9","section:883fb1c8db9c994132c9bfdce4cb7daf2cd65d70"]},{"id":"banda-onyxia-attunement","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Requisito para entrar en la guarida de Onyxia","title_en":"Onyxia’s Lair Attunement Requirement","summary_es":"Cada integrante debe llevar el Amuleto de Pirodraco; la cadena depende de la facción y puede iniciarse antes del 60.","summary_en":"Every raider needs the Drakefire Amulet; the quest chain is faction-specific and can start before level 60.","keywords_es":["requisito guarida de onyxia","amuleto de pirodraco","sintonización de onyxia","attunement onyxia","entrar en banda de onyxia"],"keywords_en":["Onyxia attunement","Drakefire Amulet","Onyxia raid requirement","start attunement before 60"],"text_es":"Para entrar, cada jugador debe tener equipado o en sus bolsas el Amuleto de Pirodraco; no basta con que lo lleve quien lidera la banda. Se obtiene al final de una cadena distinta para cada facción. Como lleva muchas horas, conviene avanzar antes del nivel 60, mientras aún se gana experiencia.","text_en":"To enter, every player must have the Drakefire Amulet equipped or in their bags; it is not enough for the raid leader to carry it. The amulet comes at the end of a faction-specific quest chain. Since the chain takes many hours, it is worth progressing before level 60 while quests still grant experience.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Onyxia's Lair Attunement in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["raid:onyxias-lair-attunement-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:3b523e06275e258a1aa8333419c78e2833a41b17"]},{"id":"banda-onyxia-alianza-inicio","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sintonización de la Alianza: primeros pasos","title_en":"Alliance Attunement: First Steps","summary_es":"La cadena de la Alianza pasa por La amenaza de los dragonantes, Los verdaderos maestros y Profundidades de Roca Negra.","summary_en":"The Alliance chain runs through Dragonkin Menace, The True Masters, and Blackrock Depths.","keywords_es":["misiones alianza onyxia","cadena alianza onyxia","la amenaza de los dragonantes","los verdaderos maestros","alguacil windsor"],"keywords_en":["Alliance Onyxia quests","Alliance attunement chain","Dragonkin Menace","The True Masters","Marshal Windsor"],"text_es":"Empieza con La amenaza de los dragonantes y elimina los dragonantes indicados en las Estepas Ardientes. Completa las seis partes de Los verdaderos maestros, que enlazan varias ciudades, y habla con el Mariscal Maxwell. En Profundidades de Roca Negra, sigue las pistas hasta El alguacil Windsor; tras Esperanza perdida, consigue Una nota arrugada y entrégasela. Luego derrota a General Forjira y Señor gólem Argelmach para recuperar la información perdida.","text_en":"Start with Dragonkin Menace and defeat the listed dragonkin in Burning Steppes. Complete the six parts of The True Masters, which send you between several cities, then speak with Marshal Maxwell. Marshal Windsor waits in a cell in Blackrock Depths; after Abandoned Hope, obtain A Crumpled Up Note and deliver it to him. Then defeat General Angerforge and Golem Lord Argelmach to recover the lost information.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Dragonkin Menace","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › The True Masters","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Marshal Windsor","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Abandoned Hope","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › A Crumpled Up Note","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › A Shred of Hope","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["raid:onyxias-lair-attunement-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:25057a303838ff466f63f626f3d3b731cb0a7b85","section:3a0a4c4dfab09ce8bd6059831c780f02d9c12dd5","section:40d165c25dc86694479840184736afe4be233ebd","section:48fcaa5f3ce2a294bd2f36be52039d74d30070de","section:7ee78ef8624dc31693baa1482780290541d7eff3","section:84e48d7e24b56c2e040ff76ac5087bcb4d344973"]},{"id":"banda-onyxia-alianza-final","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sintonización de la Alianza: tramo final","title_en":"Alliance Attunement: Final Steps","summary_es":"La fuga de la prisión y El Ojo del dragón conducen al Amuleto de Pirodraco.","summary_en":"Jail Break! and The Dragon’s Eye lead to the Drakefire Amulet.","keywords_es":["final cadena alianza onyxia","la fuga de la prisión","la gran farsa","el ojo del dragón","conseguir amuleto de pirodraco"],"keywords_en":["final Alliance Onyxia chain","Jail Break","The Great Masquerade","The Dragon’s Eye","get Drakefire Amulet"],"text_es":"Completa La fuga de la prisión y, en Tienes un cita en Ventormenta, reúnete con Windsor; después protégelo durante La gran farsa. Ojo de dragón te envía a una cueva con élites: puedes ir en grupo, usar sigilo o avanzar mediante resurrecciones. Para Amuleto Pirodraco, derrota a General Drakkisath en Cumbre de Roca Negra superior y vuelve con quien te dio la misión para recibir el amuleto.","text_en":"Jail Break! must be completed before you meet Windsor during Stormwind Rendezvous; then protect him through The Great Masquerade. The Dragon’s Eye sends you into an elite-filled cave: you can group up, use stealth, or corpse-hop through it. The final quest requires you to defeat General Drakkisath in Upper Blackrock Spire and return to the quest giver to receive the amulet.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Jail Break!","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Stormwind Rendezvous","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › The Great Masquerade","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › The Dragon's Eye","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Drakefire Amulet","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["raid:onyxias-lair-attunement-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:5b4387def462af2f77c8c229fb231ae5c954e029","section:62f1c0a7d8e70a49fde0dce03a792660ba917369","section:94b6af9deb7762099ac3aa646e601bc6531ef6dc","section:9d6d55701b13a15afcca8d46b7a7c246595edb7c","section:e7d19763d7ab7928759c4ec13c4f7adc854725bf"]},{"id":"banda-onyxia-horda-inicio","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sintonización de la Horda: primeros pasos","title_en":"Horde Attunement: First Steps","summary_es":"La orden exige tres jefes y documentos; después siguen Eitrigg y Jefe de Guerra Desgarro Puño Negro.","summary_en":"Warlord’s Command requires three bosses and documents; Eitrigg and Warchief Rend Blackhand follow.","keywords_es":["misiones horda onyxia","cadena horda onyxia","la orden del señor de la guerra","la sabiduría de eitrigg","por la horda"],"keywords_en":["Horde Onyxia quests","Horde attunement chain","Warlord’s Command","Eitrigg’s Wisdom","For The Horde"],"text_es":"Empieza en Kargath con La orden del Señor de la Guerra: en Cumbre de Roca Negra inferior, derrota a Alto Señor Omokk, Maestro de guerra Voone y Señor supremo Vermiothalak, y recoge Importantes documentos de Roca Negra. Después completa La sabiduría de Eitrigg y ¡Por la Horda!: mata a Jefe de Guerra Desgarro Puño Negro en Cumbre de Roca Negra superior, recoge su cabeza y vuelve con Thrall.","text_en":"Start in Kargath with Warlord’s Command: in Lower Blackrock Spire, defeat Highlord Omokk, War Master Voone, and Overlord Wyrmthalak, and recover Important Blackrock Documents. Then complete Eitrigg’s Wisdom and For The Horde!: kill Warchief Rend Blackhand in Upper Blackrock Spire, take his head, and return to Thrall.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Blood and Thunder / Warlord's Command","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Eitrigg's Wisdom","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › For The Horde!","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["raid:onyxias-lair-attunement-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:75e7a4d3fa688619577eb8db7a81e81dbc7f60a1","section:c6acf2ffc1e783c3df27191b62523d2cf7594b1c","section:f1ceb77c357f710432fe0943cb48538735e910c3"]},{"id":"banda-onyxia-horda-final","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sintonización de la Horda: pruebas y amuleto","title_en":"Horde Attunement: Trials and Amulet","summary_es":"La cadena continúa con pruebas de dragones en grupo y termina al llevar la sangre de Drakkisath al guía.","summary_en":"The chain continues with group dragon trials and ends by bringing Drakkisath’s blood to the quest giver.","keywords_es":["pruebas de dragones horda onyxia","ojo de dragauro negro","amuleto de subversión dracónica","brasaliza onyxia","sangre de drakkisath"],"keywords_en":["Horde dragon trials Onyxia","Black Dragonspawn Eye","Amulet of Draconic Subversion","Emberstrife Onyxia","Drakkisath blood"],"text_es":"Tras El Campeón de la Horda, entrega el Testamento de Rexxar a Myranda la Fada. Reúne 20 Ojos de dragauro negro en Cumbre de Roca Negra superior y usa el Amuleto de Subversión dracónica para hablar con Brasaliza. Sus pruebas exigen derrotar tres dragones en cualquier orden con un grupo y después vencer a otro. Por último, mata a General Drakkisath en la parte superior y entrega su sangre al guía de la cadena para recibir el Amuleto de Pirodraco.","text_en":"Once that quest is complete, deliver Rexxar’s Testament to Myranda the Hag. Collect 20 Black Dragonspawn Eyes in Upper Blackrock Spire and use the Amulet of Draconic Subversion to speak with Emberstrife. The trials require a group to defeat three dragons in any order and then defeat another. Finally, kill General Drakkisath in the upper spire and bring his blood to the chain’s quest giver to receive the Drakefire Amulet.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › The Champion of the Horde","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › The Testament of Rexxar","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Oculus Illusions","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Emberstrife","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › The Test of Skulls","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Ascension...","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Onyxia's Lair Attunement & Drakefire Amulet Guide - WoW: Forever › Blood of the Black Dragon Champion","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/raids/onyxias-lair-attunement-guide","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["raid:onyxias-lair-attunement-guide"],"source_hashes":["section:20989e228e2241178392b864de16d8dfd8910f86","section:742f5dfb1c16e487efe5510ec9f70a89803d1433","section:85a7652c8c627f748f6fb0a265766deb7edba584","section:8ebe229edd576e39f44cb8e3e58d8cc9dc44d85c","section:9d3bd473b2bcf6461d0a170ec9db49b09654bb8f","section:a86f98d28eb5c9c83322f77e5ee4cc65cf50cf46","section:c33ed01161b4539ac677031168d8f262fb6bd84f"]},{"id":"banda-paladin-sagrado-build","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Build de banda del Paladín Sagrado","title_en":"Holy Paladin Raid Build","summary_es":"La distribución 31/8/12 prioriza Vigilia de la Luz; un punto de talento retirado queda libre.","summary_en":"The 31/8/12 split prioritizes Light’s Vigil; one point from a removed talent remains free.","keywords_es":["build paladín sagrado bandas","talentos sanador paladín","build 31 8 12","vigilia de la luz paladín"],"keywords_en":["Holy Paladin raid build","Paladin healer talents","31 8 12 build","Light’s Vigil Paladin"],"tags":["PALADIN"],"text_es":"La build de banda de Sagrado reparte 31 puntos en Sagrado, 8 en Protección y 12 en Reprensión, con Vigilia de la Luz y talentos de utilidad y maná. El calculador descarta un punto asignado a un talento retirado, así que queda libre para gastar. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"The raid Holy build spends 31 points in Holy, 8 in Protection, and 12 in Retribution, taking Light’s Vigil and utility and mana talents. The calculator drops one point assigned to a removed talent, leaving it free to spend. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Raid/Dungeon Healer Holy Paladin Guide › The build: Raid Holy (31/8/12)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-raid-dungeon-healer-holy-paladin-guide-35023","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["raid:wow-forever-raid-dungeon-healer-holy-paladin-guide-35023"],"source_hashes":["section:a327be31b0c21267ed8abec705246700181a83da"]},{"id":"banda-paladin-sagrado-sanacion","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sanación de banda del Paladín Sagrado","title_en":"Holy Paladin Raid Healing","summary_es":"Combina curación constante con Choque Sagrado y Vigilia de la Luz para atender daño de grupo.","summary_en":"Combine steady healing with Holy Shock and Light’s Vigil to handle party damage.","keywords_es":["sanar banda paladín sagrado","consejos sanador paladín","choque sagrado banda","vigilia de la luz sanar grupo"],"keywords_en":["Holy Paladin raid healing","Paladin healer tips","Holy Shock raid","Light’s Vigil party healing"],"tags":["PALADIN"],"text_es":"Asigna Vigilia de la Luz al tanque de tu grupo. Usa Destello de Luz como respuesta habitual y lanza Choque Sagrado sobre el objetivo marcado cuando el grupo reciba daño; reserva Luz Sagrada para golpes grandes. Los críticos ayudan a recuperar maná y aceleran el siguiente uso de Luz Sagrada. Recomendación provisional hasta que se pruebe a nivel 60.","text_en":"Place Light’s Vigil on your party’s tank. Use Flash of Light as your steady heal and cast Holy Shock on the marked target when the group takes damage; save it for large hits. Critical heals help restore mana and speed up your next Holy Light. Provisional recommendation until tested at level 60.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Raid/Dungeon Healer Holy Paladin Guide › Healing playstyle","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-raid-dungeon-healer-holy-paladin-guide-35023","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Raid/Dungeon Healer Holy Paladin Guide › Healing toolkit","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-raid-dungeon-healer-holy-paladin-guide-35023","date":"2026-10-20"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: WoW: Forever Raid/Dungeon Healer Holy Paladin Guide › Beta notes to verify","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/wow-forever-raid-dungeon-healer-holy-paladin-guide-35023","date":"2026-10-20"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["raid:wow-forever-raid-dungeon-healer-holy-paladin-guide-35023"],"source_hashes":["section:37bd1616630c7cc00a39a6da3fbb18d4a7e94f60","section:a11c95a90583185db9fb275a46d41978626e4932","section:a3897a6602d81d459948c17bee3f0995d8e06972"]},{"id":"banda-tier-apariencia","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Aspecto de los conjuntos de Tier 1","title_en":"Tier 1 Set Appearance","summary_es":"Forever permite elegir modelos SD o HD; las imágenes disponibles muestran solo los HD.","summary_en":"Forever lets players choose SD or HD models; the available images show only HD.","keywords_es":["aspecto de los conjuntos","conjuntos de Tier 1","modelos SD y HD","aspecto de los conjuntos de temporada"],"keywords_en":["tier set appearance","season 1 sets","SD and HD models","tier 1 set models"],"text_es":"En la temporada 1 se añaden conjuntos de equipo para las clases. En Forever puedes elegir entre modelos SD y HD, pero las imágenes de estos conjuntos muestran solo la versión HD. Como las bandas aún no han salido, los datos proceden de información extraída del juego y pueden incluir marcadores que cambiarán.","text_en":"Season 1 adds class gear sets. In Forever, you can choose SD or HD models, but the images for these sets show only the HD version. Because the raids have not been released yet, the data comes from datamined information and may include placeholders that will change.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["guide:bb55e5db8497d0bb82a6c0c104aad289c4658fa6"]},{"id":"banda-tier-druida-equilibrio","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de Equilibrio del druida","title_en":"Druid Balance Set Bonuses","summary_es":"Las piezas de Equilibrio mejoran el golpe, las raíces y el daño contra demonios.","summary_en":"Balance pieces improve hit, roots, and damage against demons.","keywords_es":["conjunto de Equilibrio","bonificaciones de druida","Tier 1 del druida","bonos de Equilibrio"],"keywords_en":["Balance set bonuses","druid tier set","Balance pieces","druid season set"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta un 1% la probabilidad de golpe; con tres, se reduce 15 s la recarga del hechizo de raíces. Con cuatro, los hechizos infligen hasta 21 más de daño contra demonios, y con cinco aumenta 3 s la duración del efecto de daño periódico de insectos.","text_en":"Two pieces add 1% hit chance; three reduce the root spell's cooldown by 15 seconds. Four increase spell damage against demons by up to 21, and five add 3 seconds to the duration of the insect damage-over-time effect.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6f046b7d48b843c491e9c0835e78b98512eb1533"]},{"id":"banda-tier-druida-feral-dps","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones ferales de daño del druida","title_en":"Druid Feral DPS Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto feral de daño potencia la velocidad, el control y las facultades felinas.","summary_en":"The Feral damage set boosts speed, control, and cat abilities.","keywords_es":["conjunto feral de daño","bonificaciones ferales","Tier 1 del druida","equipo feral DPS"],"keywords_en":["Feral DPS set","Feral set bonuses","druid tier set","Feral damage gear"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta un 1% la velocidad de ataque y de lanzamiento. Con tres, puedes lanzar el hechizo de dormir en forma felina, con 1,5 s menos de lanzamiento y una recarga de 15 s; con cuatro obtienes 36 de poder de ataque contra demonios y con cinco reduces 3 s la recarga de la facultad de furia felina.","text_en":"Two pieces increase attack and casting speed by 1%. With three, the sleep spell can be cast in Cat Form with 1.5 seconds less cast time and a 15-second cooldown; four add 36 attack power against demons, and five reduce the cat-fury ability's cooldown by 3 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6f046b7d48b843c491e9c0835e78b98512eb1533"]},{"id":"banda-tier-druida-feral-tanque","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones ferales de tanque del druida","title_en":"Druid Feral Tank Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto feral de tanque mejora defensa, resurrección y mitigación cuerpo a cuerpo.","summary_en":"The Feral tank set improves defense, resurrection, and melee mitigation.","keywords_es":["conjunto feral de tanque","bonificaciones de tanque druida","Tier 1 del druida","equipo de oso"],"keywords_en":["Feral tank set","druid tank bonuses","druid tier set","bear tank gear"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta 7 la defensa. Con tres puedes resucitar en forma de oso o Forma de oso temible y tardas 2 s menos en lanzar; con cuatro reduces un 1,2% la probabilidad de que esquiven o paren tus ataques cuerpo a cuerpo, y con cinco reduces 15 s la recarga de tu facultad de frenesí.","text_en":"Two pieces add 7 defense. With three, you can resurrect in Bear or Dire Bear Form and cast 2 seconds faster; four reduce the chance of your melee attacks being dodged or parried by 1.2%, and five reduce your frenzy ability's cooldown by 15 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6f046b7d48b843c491e9c0835e78b98512eb1533"]},{"id":"banda-tier-druida-restauracion","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de Restauración del druida","title_en":"Druid Restoration Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto de Restauración aumenta el espíritu y potencia la sanación mágica.","summary_en":"The Restoration set adds spirit and improves magical healing.","keywords_es":["conjunto de Restauración","bonificaciones de druida","Tier 1 del druida","equipo de sanación druida"],"keywords_en":["Restoration set bonuses","druid tier set","druid healing gear","Restoration pieces"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta 10 el espíritu; con tres, se reduce 10 s la recarga de la facultad defensiva de corteza. Con cuatro, los hechizos y efectos mágicos sanan hasta 26 más y dañan hasta 9 más; con cinco se reduce 3 s la recarga de la sanación rápida.","text_en":"Two pieces add 10 spirit; three reduce the bark-like defensive ability's cooldown by 10 seconds. Four increase healing by up to 26 and damage by up to 9 for magical spells and effects; five reduce the quick-heal spell's cooldown by 3 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:6f046b7d48b843c491e9c0835e78b98512eb1533"]},{"id":"banda-tier-cazador","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones del conjunto del cazador","title_en":"Hunter Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto del cazador mejora la velocidad, las trampas y los disparos.","summary_en":"The Hunter set improves speed, traps, and shots.","keywords_es":["conjunto del cazador","bonificaciones de cazador","Tier 1 del cazador","equipo de cazador"],"keywords_en":["Hunter set bonuses","Hunter tier set","Hunter gear","season 1 Hunter set"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta un 1% la velocidad de ataque y de lanzamiento; con tres, las trampas de Escarcha y congelación recargan 3 s antes. Con cuatro obtienes 36 de poder de ataque contra bestias, y con cinco reduces 1 s la recarga de los disparos de puntería y múltiples objetivos.","text_en":"Two pieces increase attack and casting speed by 1%; three reduce the cooldown of Frost and freezing traps by 3 seconds. Four add 36 attack power against beasts, and five reduce the cooldown of aimed and multi-target shots by 1 second.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Hunter","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:ebc219521af2088543d55930e1a9d0e15caf8117"]},{"id":"banda-tier-mago","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones del conjunto del mago","title_en":"Mage Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto del mago mejora el golpe, la interrupción y los hechizos contra elementales.","summary_en":"The Mage set improves hit, interrupts, and spells against elementals.","keywords_es":["conjunto del mago","bonificaciones de mago","Tier 1 del mago","equipo de mago"],"keywords_en":["Mage set bonuses","Mage tier set","Mage gear","season 1 Mage set"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta un 1% la probabilidad de golpe; con tres, la interrupción de hechizos recarga 5 s antes. Con cuatro, tus hechizos infligen hasta 21 más de daño contra elementales; con cinco, el proyectil de fuego y escarcha tiene un 10% más de probabilidad de activar una descarga de misiles. Mientras está activo el efecto de combustión gana un 10% de probabilidad de crítico y tiene un 10% más de probabilidad de activar dedos helados.","text_en":"Two pieces add 1% hit chance; three reduce the spell-interrupt ability's cooldown by 5 seconds. Four increase spell damage against elementals by up to 21. With five, the fire-and-frost bolt has a 10% higher chance to trigger a missile volley; while the combustion effect is active, it gains 10% critical-strike chance and a 10% higher chance to trigger icy fingers.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Mage","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:10acba84dfd0688b2feb84756edf746c16ed3e4e"]},{"id":"banda-tier-paladin-sagrado","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones Sagradas del paladín","title_en":"Paladin Holy Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto Sagrado del paladín refuerza el espíritu y la sanación mágica.","summary_en":"The Paladin Holy set boosts spirit and magical healing.","keywords_es":["conjunto Sagrado del paladín","bonificaciones de sanación","Tier 1 del paladín","equipo de paladín Sagrado"],"keywords_en":["Paladin Holy set","Paladin healing bonuses","Paladin tier set","Holy Paladin gear"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta 10 el espíritu; con tres, la bendición que protege contra ataques reduce su recarga 30 s. Con cuatro, los hechizos y efectos mágicos sanan hasta 26 más y dañan hasta 9 más; con cinco, Choque Sagrado recarga 1 s antes.","text_en":"Two pieces add 10 spirit; three reduce the cooldown of the protection blessing by 30 seconds. Four increase healing by up to 26 and damage by up to 9 for magical spells and effects; five reduce the holy shock spell's cooldown by 1 second.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:216d9df1546085e163692768958d6e28215066e6"]},{"id":"banda-tier-paladin-proteccion","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de Protección del paladín","title_en":"Paladin Protection Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto de Protección del paladín aumenta la defensa y reduce el daño recibido.","summary_en":"The Paladin Protection set adds defense and reduces damage taken.","keywords_es":["conjunto de Protección del paladín","bonificaciones de tanque paladín","Tier 1 del paladín","equipo de Protección"],"keywords_en":["Paladin Protection set","Paladin tank bonuses","Paladin tier set","Protection Paladin gear"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta 7 la defensa; con tres, se reduce 1,5 s el lanzamiento de la facultad para ahuyentar no-muertos. Con cuatro reduces un 1,2% la probabilidad de que esquiven o paren tus ataques cuerpo a cuerpo, y con cinco se acorta 10 s la duración de la penalización que impide volver a usar ciertas facultades.","text_en":"Two pieces add 7 defense; three reduce the cast time of the undead-fearing ability by 1.5 seconds. Four reduce the chance of your melee attacks being dodged or parried by 1.2%, and five shorten by 10 seconds the duration of the debuff that prevents certain abilities from being used again.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:216d9df1546085e163692768958d6e28215066e6"]},{"id":"banda-tier-paladin-reprension","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de Reprensión del paladín","title_en":"Paladin Retribution Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto de Reprensión mejora la velocidad, el control y el daño contra no-muertos.","summary_en":"The Retribution set improves speed, control, and damage against undead.","keywords_es":["conjunto de Reprensión","bonificaciones de paladín","Tier 1 del paladín","equipo de Reprensión"],"keywords_en":["Retribution set bonuses","Paladin tier set","Paladin damage gear","Retribution pieces"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta un 1% la velocidad de ataque y de lanzamiento; con tres, el aturdimiento recarga 5 s antes. Con cuatro obtienes 36 de poder de ataque contra no-muertos, y con cinco se reduce 0,5 s la recarga de la facultad de sentencia.","text_en":"Two pieces increase attack and casting speed by 1%; three reduce the stun's cooldown by 5 seconds. Four add 36 attack power against undead, and five reduce the judgement ability's cooldown by 0.5 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:216d9df1546085e163692768958d6e28215066e6"]},{"id":"banda-tier-sacerdote-disciplina-sagrado","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de Disciplina y Sagrado del sacerdote","title_en":"Priest Discipline and Holy Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto de sanación del sacerdote aumenta el espíritu y reduce recargas.","summary_en":"The Priest healing set adds spirit and reduces cooldowns.","keywords_es":["conjunto de Disciplina","conjunto de Sagrado","bonificaciones del sacerdote","Tier 1 del sacerdote"],"keywords_en":["Discipline set","Holy Priest set","Priest set bonuses","Priest tier set"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta 10 el espíritu; con tres, la protección contra el miedo recarga 60 s antes. Con cuatro, los hechizos y efectos mágicos sanan hasta 26 más y dañan hasta 9 más; con cinco, la sanación canalizada y la que salta entre aliados recargan 1 s antes.","text_en":"Two pieces add 10 spirit; three reduce the fear-ward cooldown by 60 seconds. Four increase healing by up to 26 and damage by up to 9 for magical spells and effects; five reduce by 1 second the cooldowns of the channeled heal and the heal that bounces between allies.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Priest","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:1dcacf3e1724cab881657c512ea4ca14af95c90c"]},{"id":"banda-tier-sacerdote-sombra","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de Sombra del sacerdote","title_en":"Priest Shadow Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto de Sombra mejora el golpe, el control y el daño contra no-muertos.","summary_en":"The Shadow set improves hit, control, and damage against undead.","keywords_es":["conjunto de Sombra del sacerdote","bonificaciones de Sombra","Tier 1 del sacerdote","equipo de sacerdote Sombra"],"keywords_en":["Shadow Priest set","Shadow set bonuses","Priest tier set","Shadow gear"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta un 1% la probabilidad de golpe; con tres, el control sobre no-muertos dura 10 s más. Con cuatro, los hechizos infligen hasta 21 más de daño contra no-muertos, y con cinco se reduce 60 s la recarga de la enfermedad que consume vida.","text_en":"Two pieces add 1% hit chance; three extend undead crowd control by 10 seconds. Four increase spell damage against undead by up to 21, and five reduce the cooldown of the life-draining disease by 60 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Priest","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:1dcacf3e1724cab881657c512ea4ca14af95c90c"]},{"id":"banda-tier-chaman-elemental","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones Elementales del chamán","title_en":"Shaman Elemental Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto Elemental potencia el golpe, los tótems y el daño contra elementales.","summary_en":"The Elemental set boosts hit, totems, and damage against elementals.","keywords_es":["conjunto Elemental del chamán","bonificaciones de chamán","Tier 1 del chamán","equipo de Elemental"],"keywords_en":["Elemental Shaman set","Shaman set bonuses","Shaman tier set","Elemental gear"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta un 1% la probabilidad de golpe; con tres, el tótem que inmoviliza recarga 2 s antes. Con cuatro, los hechizos infligen hasta 21 más de daño contra elementales, y con cinco se reduce 1 s la recarga de la descarga de lava.","text_en":"Two pieces add 1% hit chance; three reduce the immobilizing totem's cooldown by 2 seconds. Four increase spell damage against elementals by up to 21, and five reduce the lava-burst spell's cooldown by 1 second.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:9c1a7df8a998f8d1ded8f624d1fd6667744f79e8"]},{"id":"banda-tier-chaman-mejora","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de Mejora del chamán","title_en":"Shaman Enhancement Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto de Mejora acelera los ataques y amplía el alcance de los tótems.","summary_en":"The Enhancement set speeds attacks and expands totem range.","keywords_es":["conjunto de Mejora del chamán","bonificaciones de chamán","Tier 1 del chamán","equipo de Mejora"],"keywords_en":["Enhancement Shaman set","Shaman set bonuses","Shaman tier set","Enhancement gear"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta un 1% la velocidad de ataque y de lanzamiento. Con tres, el radio de los tótems beneficiosos de Aire y de los Tótems de tierra aumenta 10 m; con cuatro obtienes 36 de poder de ataque contra elementales y con cinco la facultad de golpe con armas recarga 0,5 s antes.","text_en":"Two pieces increase attack and casting speed by 1%. With three, the radius of beneficial Air and Earth totems increases by 10 yards; four add 36 attack power against elementals, and five reduce the weapon-strike ability's cooldown by 0.5 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:9c1a7df8a998f8d1ded8f624d1fd6667744f79e8"]},{"id":"banda-tier-chaman-restauracion","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de Restauración del chamán","title_en":"Shaman Restoration Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto de Restauración mejora el espíritu, el alcance de tótems y la sanación.","summary_en":"The Restoration set improves spirit, totem range, and healing.","keywords_es":["conjunto de Restauración del chamán","bonificaciones de sanación","Tier 1 del chamán","equipo de chamán"],"keywords_en":["Restoration Shaman set","Shaman healing bonuses","Shaman tier set","Restoration gear"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta 10 el espíritu; con tres, el radio de los tótems beneficiosos de Fuego y de los Tótems de agua aumenta 10 m. Con cuatro, los hechizos y efectos mágicos sanan hasta 26 más y dañan hasta 9 más; con cinco se reduce 1 s la recarga de la sanación en oleada.","text_en":"Two pieces add 10 spirit; three increase the radius of beneficial Fire and Water totems by 10 yards. Four increase healing by up to 26 and damage by up to 9 for magical spells and effects; five reduce the wave-heal spell's cooldown by 1 second.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Shaman","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:9c1a7df8a998f8d1ded8f624d1fd6667744f79e8"]},{"id":"banda-tier-brujo","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones del conjunto del brujo","title_en":"Warlock Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto del brujo mejora el golpe, el destierro y el maná obtenido al gastar salud.","summary_en":"The Warlock set improves hit, banishing, and mana gained by spending health.","keywords_es":["conjunto del brujo","bonificaciones de brujo","Tier 1 del brujo","equipo de brujo"],"keywords_en":["Warlock set bonuses","Warlock tier set","Warlock gear","season 1 Warlock set"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta un 1% la probabilidad de golpe; con tres, el destierro se lanza 1,5 s más rápido. Con cuatro, los hechizos infligen hasta 21 más de daño contra demonios; con cinco, la facultad que intercambia salud por maná genera un 20% más de maná sin coste adicional de salud.","text_en":"Two pieces add 1% hit chance; three reduce the banishing spell's cast time by 1.5 seconds. Four increase spell damage against demons by up to 21; five make the ability that trades health for mana generate 20% more mana at no extra health cost.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Warlock","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:747cec1c979716704b76978926338d388d383acf"]},{"id":"banda-tier-guerrero-armas-furia","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de Armas y Furia del guerrero","title_en":"Warrior Arms and Fury Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto de daño del guerrero acelera ataques y mejora el daño contra humanoides.","summary_en":"The Warrior damage set speeds attacks and improves damage against humanoids.","keywords_es":["conjunto de Armas","conjunto de Furia","bonificaciones del guerrero","Tier 1 del guerrero"],"keywords_en":["Arms set","Fury set","Warrior set bonuses","Warrior tier set"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta un 1% la velocidad de ataque y de lanzamiento; con tres, el grito que intimida recarga 30 s antes. Con cuatro obtienes 36 de poder de ataque contra humanoides, y con cinco reduces 30 s la recarga de la facultad de temeridad.","text_en":"Two pieces increase attack and casting speed by 1%; three reduce the intimidating shout's cooldown by 30 seconds. Four add 36 attack power against humanoids, and five reduce the recklessness ability's cooldown by 30 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:046cf10211bdc8b64d9d711cd060563fbc764be4"]},{"id":"banda-tier-guerrero-proteccion","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Bonificaciones de Protección del guerrero","title_en":"Warrior Protection Set Bonuses","summary_es":"El conjunto de Protección del guerrero aumenta defensa y reduce recargas defensivas.","summary_en":"The Protection set adds defense and reduces defensive cooldowns.","keywords_es":["conjunto de Protección del guerrero","bonificaciones de tanque guerrero","Tier 1 del guerrero","equipo de Protección"],"keywords_en":["Warrior Protection set","Warrior tank bonuses","Warrior tier set","Protection Warrior gear"],"text_es":"Con dos piezas aumenta 7 la defensa; con tres, la facultad de intervenir recarga 10 s antes. Con cuatro reduces un 1,2% la probabilidad de que esquiven o paren tus ataques cuerpo a cuerpo, y con cinco la barrera de escudo recarga 30 s antes.","text_en":"Two pieces add 7 defense; three reduce the intervene ability's cooldown by 10 seconds. Four reduce the chance of your melee attacks being dodged or parried by 1.2%, and five reduce the shield-wall ability's cooldown by 30 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Forever Tier Set Overview for Season 1 - Appearances and Bonuses › Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:season-1-tier-set-bonus-appearance-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:046cf10211bdc8b64d9d711cd060563fbc764be4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-tierlist-dps","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clasificación de DPS JcE","title_en":"PvE DPS Rankings","summary_es":"Supervivencia, Demonología, Destrucción, Reprensión y Furia figuran en S por daño y utilidad.","summary_en":"Survival, Demonology, Destruction, Retribution, and Fury rank S for damage and utility.","keywords_es":["mejores DPS JcE","clasificación DPS","especializaciones DPS S","tier list de daño"],"keywords_en":["best PvE DPS","DPS tier list","S-tier DPS specs","damage rankings"],"text_es":"En daño JcE, el nivel S reúne Cazador Supervivencia, Brujo Demonología, Brujo Destrucción, Paladín Reprensión y Guerrero Furia. Supervivencia destaca por el daño a un objetivo y alternar ataques cuerpo a cuerpo y a distancia sin agotar el maná; Demonología combina daño a un objetivo y en área, mientras Destrucción suma daño competitivo, cleave y área. Reprensión une daño y utilidad de banda; Furia combina daño a un objetivo, cleave y utilidad. Es una predicción temprana que puede cambiar, y todas las especializaciones pueden completar el contenido.","text_en":"For PvE damage, S tier includes Survival Hunter, Demonology Warlock, Destruction Warlock, Retribution Paladin, and Fury Warrior. Survival stands out for single-target damage and alternating melee and ranged attacks without running out of mana; Demonology combines single-target and area damage, while Destruction adds competitive damage, cleave, and area damage. Retribution pairs damage with raid utility; Fury combines single-target damage, cleave, and utility. This is an early prediction that can change, and every specialization can clear the content.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: DPS Tier List for World of Warcraft: Forever - Best Specs & PvE Rankings › Best DPS Tier List for WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/tier-lists/dps-pve-rankings","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: DPS Tier List for World of Warcraft: Forever - Best Specs & PvE Rankings › WoW: Forever DPS Ranking and Explanations > S-Tier DPS Specs in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/tier-lists/dps-pve-rankings","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["tierlist:dps-pve-rankings"],"source_hashes":["guide:44f5c17d1da87172d0e57878f1260762f851d4df","section:2bc82c4e09a5df367d615ff559f4589f47b83360"]},{"id":"mazmorra-tierlist-healer","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clasificación de sanadores JcE","title_en":"PvE Healer Rankings","summary_es":"Restauración del chamán lidera; Restauración del druida y Sagrado del sacerdote están en A.","summary_en":"Restoration Shaman leads; Restoration Druid and Holy Priest rank A.","keywords_es":["mejores sanadores JcE","clasificación de sanadores","especializaciones de sanación","tier list de sanadores"],"keywords_en":["best PvE healers","healer tier list","healing rankings","top healer specs"],"text_es":"En sanación JcE, Chamán Restauración está en S; Druida Restauración y Sacerdote Sagrado, en A. El chamán sobresale por sus tótems y por sanar al tanque y a varios objetivos; el druida ofrece gran sanación de banda, y el sacerdote combina eficiencia de maná y buen rendimiento en varios objetivos. Todas las especializaciones pueden completar el contenido; las diferencias dependen del encuentro y la clasificación puede cambiar.","text_en":"For PvE healing, Restoration Shaman ranks S; Restoration Druid and Holy Priest rank A. The Shaman stands out for totems and healing the tank and multiple targets; the Druid offers strong raid healing, while the Priest combines mana efficiency with strong multi-target healing. Every specialization can clear the content; strengths vary by encounter and the ranking can change.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Healer Tier List for World of Warcraft: Forever - Best Specs & PvE Rankings › Best Healer Tier List for WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/tier-lists/healer-pve-rankings","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Healer Tier List for World of Warcraft: Forever - Best Specs & PvE Rankings › WoW: Forever Healer Ranking and Explanations > S-Tier Healing Specs in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/tier-lists/healer-pve-rankings","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Healer Tier List for World of Warcraft: Forever - Best Specs & PvE Rankings › WoW: Forever Healer Ranking and Explanations > A-Tier Healing Specs in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/tier-lists/healer-pve-rankings","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["tierlist:healer-pve-rankings"],"source_hashes":["guide:ba766a1a6641e33c4aa43ee8b3e19f4b151e71b0","section:4f361e36361bfadbd793f7544056105f6e686da4"]},{"id":"mazmorra-tierlist-tanque","chapter":7,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clasificación de tanques JcE","title_en":"PvE Tank Rankings","summary_es":"Druida Feral lidera por aguante; Guerrero y Paladín Protección están en A.","summary_en":"Feral Druid leads for durability; Protection Warrior and Paladin rank A.","keywords_es":["mejores tanques JcE","clasificación de tanques","especializaciones de tanque","tier list de tanques"],"keywords_en":["best PvE tanks","tank tier list","tank rankings","top tank specs"],"text_es":"En tanque JcE, Druida Feral está en S; Guerrero Protección y Paladín Protección, en A. El druida destaca por aguante, amenaza a un objetivo y función de tanque secundario; el guerrero aporta fuertes defensivos y perjuicios de banda; el paladín suma utilidad y responde bien al daño mágico, aunque es más vulnerable a picos de daño. Cualquier especialización puede completar el contenido; la clasificación es temprana y puede cambiar.","text_en":"For PvE tanking, Feral Druid ranks S; Protection Warrior and Protection Paladin rank A. Feral stands out for durability, single-target threat, and off-tanking; Protection Warrior brings strong defensive abilities and raid debuffs; Protection Paladin adds utility and handles magical damage well, though it is more vulnerable to damage spikes. Any specialization can clear the content; the ranking is an early prediction and can change.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Tank Tier List for World of Warcraft: Forever - Best Specs & PvE Rankings › Best Tank Spec Tier List for WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/tier-lists/tank-pve-rankings","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Tank Tier List for World of Warcraft: Forever - Best Specs & PvE Rankings › WOW: Forever Tank Tier List Breakdown and Explanations > S-Tier: Feral Druid","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/tier-lists/tank-pve-rankings","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Tank Tier List for World of Warcraft: Forever - Best Specs & PvE Rankings › WOW: Forever Tank Tier List Breakdown and Explanations > A-Tier: Protection Warrior","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/tier-lists/tank-pve-rankings","date":"2026-11-13"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Tank Tier List for World of Warcraft: Forever - Best Specs & PvE Rankings › WOW: Forever Tank Tier List Breakdown and Explanations > A-Tier: Protection Paladin","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/tier-lists/tank-pve-rankings","date":"2026-11-13"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["tierlist:tank-pve-rankings"],"source_hashes":["guide:c591c38bcd3e8a6976f1c78139a2db8b7d03be48","section:d2a636410e94f1553dc42977d752a35557d6e618"]}]},"08-comercio-reputacion.json":{"description":"Capítulo 8: Comercio y reputación. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"comercio-facciones","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Facciones comerciales de Forever","title_en":"Forever's Trade Factions","summary_es":"Autoridad Comercial de Azeroth y Suministros y Logística de Durotar tienen campamentos y recompensas propios.","summary_en":"Azeroth Commerce Authority and Durotar Supply and Logistics have their own camps and rewards.","keywords_es":["facciones comerciales","facción de la Alianza","facción de la Horda","cajones de suministros","moneda de las facciones"],"keywords_en":["trade factions","Alliance faction","Horde faction","supply crates","faction currency"],"text_es":"La Autoridad Comercial de Azeroth es exclusiva de la Alianza y su campamento está en Tres Caminos, en las Montañas Crestagrana. Suministros y Logística de Durotar es exclusiva de la Horda y su campamento está en Los Baldíos, a las afueras de El Cruce. Entregar cajones completados da Favor de mercader; las Escrituras del artesano aumentan la reputación.","text_en":"Azeroth Commerce Authority is Alliance-only, with its camp at Three Corners in Redridge Mountains. Durotar Supply and Logistics is Horde-only, with its camp in The Barrens outside Crossroads. Turning in filled crates grants Merchant's Favor; Craftsman's Writs raise reputation.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Azeroth Commerce Authority Guide: Waylaid Supply Crates, Location, Rewards - WoW: Forever › Overview of the Azeroth Commerce Authority in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Azeroth Commerce Authority Guide: Waylaid Supply Crates, Location, Rewards - WoW: Forever › Azeroth Commerce Authority Camp Locations","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Durotar Supply and Logistics Guide: Waylaid Supply Crates, Location, Rewards - WoW: Forever › Overview of Durotar Supply and Logistics in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/durotar-supply-and-logistics-reputation-professions","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Durotar Supply and Logistics Guide: Waylaid Supply Crates, Location, Rewards - WoW: Forever › Durotar Supply and Logistics Camp Location in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/durotar-supply-and-logistics-reputation-professions","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions","general:durotar-supply-and-logistics-reputation-professions"],"source_hashes":["section:0fc3d8e66f58466b08dda2f7d3f82300014db7ff","section:128b774bf6e4cfb5ee7defea5fc2bafa60276982","section:5efcc9608ca1094360d81d95adfaa9e9f5f57147","section:8a74e6287cd994280e8b36abd12f6dbb958a20cd"]},{"id":"comercio-reputacion-oficios","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Reputación con misiones de profesión","title_en":"Raise Reputation with Profession Writs","summary_es":"Las Escrituras del artesano inician misiones diarias que otorgan reputación y se pueden comerciar.","summary_en":"Craftsman's Writs start daily quests that grant reputation and can be traded.","keywords_es":["subir reputación con profesiones","misiones diarias de profesión","reputación de la facción comercial","objetos de profesión en subasta","entregar misiones de profesión"],"keywords_en":["profession reputation","Craftsman's Writs","daily profession quests","trade faction reputation","writs at the Auction House"],"text_es":"Las Escrituras del artesano son objetos que inician misiones diarias; al completar y entregar una misión, obtienes reputación según la calidad de los objetos requeridos. Se comercian en la casa de subastas, así que puedes elegir una cuyos requisitos te resulte más fácil reunir.","text_en":"Craftsman's Writs are items that start daily quests. Completing and turning one in grants reputation based on the quality of its required items. They can be traded at the Auction House, so you can choose one whose requirements are easier for you to gather.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Azeroth Commerce Authority Guide: Waylaid Supply Crates, Location, Rewards - WoW: Forever › Best way to earn Reputation with the Azeroth Commerce Authority","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Durotar Supply and Logistics Guide: Waylaid Supply Crates, Location, Rewards - WoW: Forever › Best way to earn Reputation with Durotar Supply & Logistics","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/durotar-supply-and-logistics-reputation-professions","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions","general:durotar-supply-and-logistics-reputation-professions"],"source_hashes":["section:a05a7c038653c2128c1ab0ed566a72abbb4da56e","section:ec7fe907da11731510efeee7327bd66775eddebc"]},{"id":"comercio-albaran-falsificado","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Reputación al entregar cajones","title_en":"Reputation from Turning In Crates","summary_es":"Con reputación Amistosa, el Albarán falsificado permite obtener 50 de reputación por cajón entregado.","summary_en":"At Friendly reputation, a Forged Delivery Receipt grants 50 reputation per turned-in crate.","keywords_es":["Albarán falsificado","reputación por cajones","subir reputación con suministros","reputación Amistosa","entregar cajones de suministros"],"keywords_en":["Forged Delivery Receipt","reputation from crates","raise reputation with supplies","Friendly reputation","turn in supply crates"],"text_es":"Un personaje que alcance el rango Amistoso con una de las facciones puede comprar el Albarán falsificado en el campamento de su bando. Entregar un cajón de suministro con este objeto otorga 50 p. de reputación; si los cajones te salen más baratos, este método puede ahorrar oro y viajes.","text_en":"A character who reaches Friendly with either faction can buy a Forged Delivery Receipt at their faction's camp. Turning in a supply crate with it grants 50 reputation; if crates are cheaper for you, this method may save gold and travel time.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Azeroth Commerce Authority Guide: Waylaid Supply Crates, Location, Rewards - WoW: Forever › Forged Delivery Receipt in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions"],"source_hashes":["section:22228e88dc4ccea309868b5687d20b04bce80871"]},{"id":"comercio-recompensas-facciones","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas de las facciones comerciales","title_en":"Trade Faction Rewards","summary_es":"La facción de la Alianza ofrece una licencia, un tabardo y una montura por moneda y reputación.","summary_en":"The Alliance faction offers a license, a tabard, and a mount for currency and reputation.","keywords_es":["recompensas de facción comercial","Solicitud de licencia publicitaria","Tabardo de la Autoridad Comercial de Azeroth","Riendas del kodo de carga","montura de carga"],"keywords_en":["trade faction rewards","Advertising License Application","Azeroth Commerce Authority Tabard","Reins of the Pack Kodo","pack mount"],"text_es":"Favor de mercader permite comprar recetas, monturas, mascotas, juguetes y cosméticos. En la Autoridad Comercial de Azeroth, la Solicitud de licencia publicitaria cuesta 1200 y requiere Honorable; el Tabardo de la Autoridad Comercial de Azeroth requiere Exaltado y cuesta 200. Las Riendas del kodo de carga cuestan 6000.","text_en":"Merchant's Favor buys recipes, mounts, pets, toys, and cosmetics. Azeroth Commerce Authority sells the Advertising License Application for 1200, with Honored required; its tabard costs 200 and requires Exalted. Reins of the Pack Kodo costs 6000.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Azeroth Commerce Authority Guide: Waylaid Supply Crates, Location, Rewards - WoW: Forever › Mounts, Pets and Other Rewards from the Azeroth Commerce Authority in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Azeroth Commerce Authority Guide: Waylaid Supply Crates, Location, Rewards - WoW: Forever › Overview of the Azeroth Commerce Authority in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions"],"source_hashes":["section:5efcc9608ca1094360d81d95adfaa9e9f5f57147","section:699439f95e85a92477590843345d15760073f41f"]},{"id":"comercio-titulos-profesion","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Títulos de profesión por certificación","title_en":"Profession Titles from Certifications","summary_es":"Con una profesión a 300 puedes comprar su certificación por 1000 de la moneda y obtener un título.","summary_en":"At profession skill 300, buy its certification for 1000 currency to earn a related title.","keywords_es":["certificación de profesión","títulos de profesión","profesión a 300","certificados de oficios","recompensa de profesión"],"keywords_en":["profession certification","profession titles","profession skill 300","trade certifications","profession reward"],"text_es":"Al alcanzar 300 de habilidad en una profesión, puedes comprar su certificación por 1000 de Favor de mercader. El certificado otorga un título relacionado con esa profesión.","text_en":"At profession skill 300, you can buy its certification for 1000 Merchant's Favor. The certificate grants a title related to that profession.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Azeroth Commerce Authority Guide: Waylaid Supply Crates, Location, Rewards - WoW: Forever › Profession Titles from the Azeroth Commerce Authority in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions","date":"2026-11-15"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Durotar Supply and Logistics Guide: Waylaid Supply Crates, Location, Rewards - WoW: Forever › Profession Titles from Durotar Supply and Logistics in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/durotar-supply-and-logistics-reputation-professions","date":"2026-11-15"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:azeroth-commerce-authority-reputation-professions","general:durotar-supply-and-logistics-reputation-professions"],"source_hashes":["section:03a90f7829ef88148c63bbe642483e5611ab302c","section:e4c038e56ac986d5d44bf293fc2097007d1fa371"]},{"id":"comercio-real-deslustrado-obtener","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo obtener Reales deslustrados","title_en":"How to Obtain Tarnished Undermine Reals","summary_es":"Aún no se ha confirmado cómo obtener esta moneda.","summary_en":"How to obtain this currency has not been confirmed.","keywords_es":["Real deslustrado de Minahonda","conseguir Reales deslustrados","moneda de Minahonda","obtención de moneda de Minahonda","caída del Real deslustrado"],"keywords_en":["Tarnished Undermine Real","get Tarnished Undermine Reals","Undermine currency","how to obtain Undermine currency","Tarnished Undermine Real drops"],"text_es":"El Real deslustrado de Minahonda lo sueltan los jefes de mazmorra, normalmente de nivel 55 o más. Puedes saquear cada jefe una vez al día: los últimos jefes de las mazmorras de nivel máximo dan 3 y los demás, 1.","text_en":"The Tarnished Undermine Real is dropped by dungeon bosses, normally level 55 or higher. Each boss can be looted once a day: final bosses of end-game dungeons give 3 and the rest give 1.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Tarnished Undermine Real Currency Guide: Earning and Spending - WoW: Forever › Earning Tarnished Undermine Real Currency","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/currency/tarnished-undermine-real-overview","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:tarnished-undermine-real-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:0f813a211d668ef830c98e5e27896839f417a342"]},{"id":"comercio-real-deslustrado-gastar","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"En qué gastar Reales deslustrados","title_en":"What to Spend Tarnished Undermine Reals On","summary_es":"Pix Xizzix cambia el Real deslustrado por objetos en Minahonda.","summary_en":"Pix Xizzix trades the Tarnished Undermine Real for items in Undermine.","keywords_es":["gastar Reales deslustrados","vendedor de Minahonda","recompensas de Reales deslustrados","equipo de Minahonda","abalorios y anillos de Minahonda"],"keywords_en":["spend Tarnished Undermine Reals","Undermine vendor","Tarnished Undermine Real rewards","Undermine gear","Undermine trinkets and rings"],"text_es":"En Minahonda, Pix Xizzix cambia el Real deslustrado de Minahonda por objetos (/way 28.4, 75.8).","text_en":"Pix Xizzix trades the Tarnished Undermine Real for items in Undermine at /way 28.4, 75.8.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Tarnished Undermine Real Currency Guide: Earning and Spending - WoW: Forever › Spending Tarnished Undermine Real Currency Vendor Location","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/currency/tarnished-undermine-real-overview","date":"2026-10-25"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:tarnished-undermine-real-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:417aa2776e7b0765d853b5936c1d3c7743798c81"]},{"id":"comercio-elegir-centauros-gelkis-magram","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Elegir entre Gelkis y Magram","title_en":"Choosing Between Gelkis and Magram","summary_es":"Ganar reputación con un clan reduce la del otro; cada uno abarata recetas de distintos oficios.","summary_en":"Gaining reputation with one clan lowers the other's; each makes different profession recipes cheaper.","keywords_es":["elegir entre Gelkis y Magram","reputación de los centauros","clanes de centauros rivales","recetas de los Gelkis","recetas de los Magram"],"keywords_en":["choose Gelkis or Magram","centaur reputation","rival centaur clans","Gelkis recipes","Magram recipes"],"text_es":"El Centauro del clan Gelkis y el Centauro del clan Magram son rivales: ganar reputación con uno reduce la del otro, así que debes escoger. Sus misiones tienen dificultad y experiencia parecidas. Cualquiera de los clanes permite conseguir las 12 recetas; Gelkis facilita Encantamiento, Peletería y Sastrería, mientras Magram favorece Alquimia, Herrería e Ingeniería. Elige según tus oficios.","text_en":"Gelkis Clan Centaur and Magram Clan Centaur are rivals: gaining reputation with one lowers the other's, so you must choose. Their quests have similar difficulty and experience rewards. Either side can acquire all 12 recipes; Gelkis makes Enchanting, Leatherworking, and Tailoring easier, while Magram favors Alchemy, Blacksmithing, and Engineering. Choose based on your professions.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gelkis Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Should You Pick Gelkis or Magram in Forever?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/gelkis-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Magram Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Should You Pick Magram or Gelkis in Forever?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/magram-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:gelkis-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","reputation:magram-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:04b10a007b5a2d730986b093798b86dc3d5fcb03","section:831d649e7cb46aba7e8f3551a0cefce76299c82b"]},{"id":"comercio-subir-reputacion-gelkis","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Subir reputación con Gelkis","title_en":"Gaining Gelkis Reputation","summary_es":"Matar Magram o hacer una misión inicial desbloquea las misiones y entregas repetibles de Gelkis.","summary_en":"Killing Magram or completing an initial quest unlocks Gelkis quests and repeatable turn-ins.","keywords_es":["subir reputación Gelkis","misiones de Gelkis","Tótem de los centauros tallado","Amistad comprada: Gelkis","centauros en Desolace"],"keywords_en":["raise Gelkis reputation","Gelkis quests","Carved Centaur Totem","Buying Friendship: Gelkis","centaurs in Desolace"],"text_es":"Los miembros del Centauro del clan Gelkis se encuentran al suroeste de Desolace y empiezas en Neutral. Puedes alcanzar Amistoso matando a miembros de la facción Centauro del clan Magram o completando Amistad comprada: Gelkis; esta misión desbloquea la entrega repetible de Tótem de los centauros tallados. Completa las misiones disponibles en Amistoso y Honorable y entrega tótems para avanzar hasta Exaltado.","text_en":"Gelkis Clan Centaur is in southwest Desolace, and you start at Neutral. You can reach Friendly by killing Magram centaurs or completing Buying Friendship: Gelkis; that quest unlocks a repeatable Carved Centaur Totem turn-in. Complete the quests available at Friendly and honored, then turn in totems to progress to Exalted.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gelkis Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Gelkis Clan Centaur Location in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/gelkis-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gelkis Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Unlocking Gelkis Clan Centaur in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/gelkis-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gelkis Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Way to Farm Gelkis Clan Centaur Reputation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/gelkis-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:gelkis-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:43be627fb529fb1aab9c22ddd40007979c75e4ec","section:c58083123ec5cd509a8fafe1caa87fb32831909c","section:e8cfa570b4d001a2d1a5690c45bf69d9e3820825"]},{"id":"comercio-recompensas-gelkis","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recetas del intendente Gelkis","title_en":"Gelkis Quartermaster Recipes","summary_es":"El intendente Gelkis vende recetas de tres oficios en Honorable por tótems.","summary_en":"The Gelkis quartermaster sells recipes for three professions at Honored for totems.","keywords_es":["intendente Gelkis","recompensas Gelkis","recetas de Encantamiento","recetas de Peletería","recetas de Sastrería"],"keywords_en":["Gelkis quartermaster","Gelkis rewards","Enchanting recipes","Leatherworking recipes","Tailoring recipes"],"text_es":"El intendente Gelkis vende fórmulas de Encantamiento y patrones de Peletería y Sastrería en Honorable, por 15 Tótems de los centauros tallados cada uno. Elegir a Gelkis facilita conseguir esas recetas: las de Alquimia, Herrería e Ingeniería requieren Exaltado y cuestan 60 tótems.","text_en":"The Gelkis quartermaster sells Enchanting formulas and Leatherworking and Tailoring patterns at Honored for 15 Carved Centaur Totems each. Those recipes are easier to obtain with this faction; Alchemy, Blacksmithing, and Engineering recipes require Exalted and cost 60 totems.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gelkis Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Should You Pick Gelkis or Magram in Forever?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/gelkis-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gelkis Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Quartermaster Vendor","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/gelkis-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:gelkis-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:04b10a007b5a2d730986b093798b86dc3d5fcb03","section:c1b24e8d0e8dc5474998c51b36bc90cdfff06e4d"]},{"id":"comercio-subir-reputacion-magram","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Subir reputación con Magram","title_en":"Gaining Magram Reputation","summary_es":"Matar Gelkis o hacer una misión inicial abre las misiones y entregas repetibles de Magram.","summary_en":"Killing Gelkis or completing an initial quest unlocks Magram quests and repeatable turn-ins.","keywords_es":["subir reputación Magram","misiones de Magram","Tótem de los centauros tallado","Amistad comprada: Magram","centauros en Desolace"],"keywords_en":["raise Magram reputation","Magram quests","Carved Centaur Totem","Buying Friendship: Magram","centaurs in Desolace"],"text_es":"Los miembros del Centauro del clan Magram están junto a un lago del sureste de Desolace y empiezas en Neutral. Puedes alcanzar Amistoso matando a miembros de la facción Centauro del clan Gelkis o completando Amistad comprada: Magram; esta misión desbloquea la entrega repetible de Tótem de los centauros tallados. Completa las misiones disponibles en Amistoso y Honorable y entrega tótems para avanzar hasta Exaltado.","text_en":"Magram Clan Centaur is by a lake in southeast Desolace, and you start at Neutral. You can reach Friendly by killing Gelkis centaurs or completing Buying Friendship: Magram; that quest unlocks a repeatable Carved Centaur Totem turn-in. Complete the quests available at Friendly and honored, then turn in totems to progress to Exalted.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Magram Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Magram Clan Centaur Location in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/magram-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Magram Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Unlocking Magram Clan Centaur in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/magram-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Magram Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Way to Farm Magram Clan Centaur Reputation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/magram-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:magram-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:65933059f5b5cc697bca2655a0d7c1ca7f44d564","section:b8ee87fcd5beef60806a0bb355df68ff82bdc482","section:bc32aec32a9ef23eff651783b3061c360390dc87"]},{"id":"comercio-recompensas-magram","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recetas del intendente Magram","title_en":"Magram Quartermaster Recipes","summary_es":"El intendente Magram vende recetas de tres oficios en Honorable por tótems.","summary_en":"The Magram quartermaster sells recipes for three professions at Honored for totems.","keywords_es":["intendente Magram","recompensas Magram","recetas de Alquimia","recetas de Herrería","recetas de Ingeniería"],"keywords_en":["Magram quartermaster","Magram rewards","Alchemy recipes","Blacksmithing recipes","Engineering recipes"],"text_es":"El intendente Magram vende recetas de Alquimia, diseños de Herrería y esquemas de Ingeniería en Honorable, por 15 Tótems de los centauros tallados cada uno. Elegir a Magram facilita conseguir esas recetas: las de Encantamiento, Peletería y Sastrería requieren Exaltado y cuestan 60 tótems.","text_en":"The Magram quartermaster sells Alchemy recipes, Blacksmithing plans, and Engineering schematics at Honored for 15 Carved Centaur Totems each. Those recipes are easier to obtain with this faction; Enchanting, Leatherworking, and Tailoring recipes require Exalted and cost 60 totems.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Magram Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Should You Pick Magram or Gelkis in Forever?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/magram-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Magram Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Quartermaster Vendor","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/magram-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:magram-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:4b39b706aaea731309f570d0c251f172e4216798","section:831d649e7cb46aba7e8f3551a0cefce76299c82b"]},{"id":"comercio-recompensas-finales-centauros","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Armas de las misiones finales centauro","title_en":"Centaur Final Quest Weapons","summary_es":"La misión final de cada clan permite elegir una de tres armas o piezas de mano izquierda.","summary_en":"Each clan's final quest lets you choose one of three weapons or off-hands.","keywords_es":["recompensa final Gelkis","recompensa final Magram","armas de los centauros","Cachiporra de virtudes traicionadas","Gran bastón de los necrokhanes"],"keywords_en":["Gelkis final reward","Magram final reward","centaur weapons","Bludgeon of Betrayed Virtues","Greatstaff of the Necrokhans"],"text_es":"La misión final Gelkis permite elegir Efigie tres veces maldita, Ferocidad abandonada o Cachiporra de virtudes traicionadas. La de Magram ofrece Armamento Magram saqueado, Gran bastón de los necrokhanes o Maza machacalmas.","text_en":"The Gelkis final quest offers a choice of Thrice-Damned Effigy, Abandoned Ferocity, or Bludgeon of Betrayed Virtues. The Magram quest offers Scavenged Magram Armament, Greatstaff of the Necrokhans, or Soulsplatter Mace.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Gelkis Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Should You Pick Gelkis or Magram in Forever?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/gelkis-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Magram Clan Centaur Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Should You Pick Magram or Gelkis in Forever?","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/magram-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:gelkis-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards","reputation:magram-clan-centaur-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:04b10a007b5a2d730986b093798b86dc3d5fcb03","section:831d649e7cb46aba7e8f3551a0cefce76299c82b"]},{"id":"comercio-ubicacion-garranoche","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dónde están los druidas Garranoche","title_en":"Where to Find the Nightclaw Druids","summary_es":"Los Druidas Garranoche viven en una cueva al noreste de la Isla de Zephras.","summary_en":"The Nightclaw Druids live in a cave in northeast Zephras Isle.","keywords_es":["Druidas Garranoche","reputación Garranoche","cueva Garranoche","Isla de Zephras","misión Un silencio inquietante"],"keywords_en":["Nightclaw Druids","Nightclaw reputation","Nightclaw cave","Zephras Isle","Unnerving Silence quest"],"text_es":"Los Druidas Garranoche son una facción neutral en el noreste de la Isla de Zephras. Lotheluum Brisa Estelar, en Valanaar, ofrece Un silencio inquietante, que te lleva hasta Elegael Pataespina, cerca de la cueva; allí comienzan más misiones de la facción.","text_en":"The Nightclaw Druids are a neutral faction in northeast Zephras Isle. Lotheluum Starbreeze in Valanaar offers Unnerving Silence, which sends you to Elegael Thornpaw near the cave; more faction quests begin there.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Nightclaw Druids Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Nightclaw Druids Location in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/nightclaw-druids-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Nightclaw Druids Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Unlocking Nightclaw Druids in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/nightclaw-druids-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:nightclaw-druids-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:14d04258c4228b99708673c5b392809d7386cb8f","section:566c532395d962505bca61363fb8d59c3207f9ff"]},{"id":"comercio-subir-reputacion-garranoche","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Subir reputación Garranoche","title_en":"Gaining Nightclaw Reputation","summary_es":"Tras las misiones iniciales, entrega orejas Al'Aketh en una misión repetible por reputación.","summary_en":"After the initial quests, turn in Al'Aketh ears for reputation through a repeatable quest.","keywords_es":["subir reputación Garranoche","Más orejas Al'Aketh","Oreja de cultor Al'Aketh","misiones repetibles Garranoche","reputación Amistosa Garranoche"],"keywords_en":["raise Nightclaw reputation","More Al'Aketh Ears","Al'Aketh Cultist's Ear","repeatable Nightclaw quests","Nightclaw Friendly reputation"],"text_es":"Completar todas las misiones no repetibles deja la reputación aproximadamente a un tercio del rango Amistoso; después, solo se progresa con una misión repetible. Entrega 5 Orejas de cultor Al'Aketh en Más orejas Al'Aketh para obtener 200 p. de reputación.","text_en":"Completing all non-repeatable quests puts reputation about one third of the way into Friendly; after that, progress comes only from a repeatable quest. Turn in 5 ears for More Al'Aketh Ears to gain 200 reputation.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Nightclaw Druids Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Farming Nightclaw Druids Reputation in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/nightclaw-druids-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Nightclaw Druids Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Way to Farm Nightclaw Druids Reputation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/nightclaw-druids-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:nightclaw-druids-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:00180668ee194a7a4ef86b8ce64b2e812fd3696e","section:41f2d4952cc488f51b8e5758a27b1524ec0b6e68"]},{"id":"comercio-recompensas-garranoche","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas Garranoche","title_en":"Nightclaw Rewards","summary_es":"Vayn Miraluna vende recetas en rangos bajos y artículos cosméticos en los superiores.","summary_en":"Vayn Moongaze sells recipes at lower ranks and cosmetics at higher ranks.","keywords_es":["recompensas Garranoche","intendente Garranoche","recetas Garranoche","Ardilla ventosombra","Vayn Miraluna"],"keywords_en":["Nightclaw rewards","Nightclaw quartermaster","Nightclaw recipes","Shadowgale Squirrel","Vayn Moongaze"],"text_es":"Vayn Miraluna sirve de intendente y vende recetas de Herrería, Sastrería y Peletería en Amistoso y Honorable. En Reverenciado y Exaltado ofrece recompensas cosméticas; entre ellas, la Ardilla ventosombra está disponible en Reverenciado.","text_en":"Vayn Moongaze serves as quartermaster and sells Blacksmithing, Tailoring, and Leatherworking recipes at Friendly and Honored. Revered and Exalted unlock cosmetic rewards; the Shadowgale Squirrel is available at Revered.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Nightclaw Druids Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Quartermaster Vendor","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/nightclaw-druids-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:nightclaw-druids-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:a5762c0b5d8b9fff169c5444ef91480ccd0af8af"]},{"id":"comercio-ubicacion-shendralar","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dónde encontrar a los Shen'dralar","title_en":"Where to Find the Shen'dralar","summary_es":"La facción está en la biblioteca de La Masacre y no tiene intendente propiamente dicho.","summary_en":"The faction is in Dire Maul's library and has no quartermaster as such.","keywords_es":["ubicación Shen'dralar","biblioteca de La Masacre","Athenaeum Shen'dralar","acceso a los Shen'dralar","Llave creciente"],"keywords_en":["Shen'dralar location","Dire Maul library","Shen'dralar Athenaeum","access the Shen'dralar","Crescent Key"],"text_es":"Los Shen'dralar habitan la biblioteca Athenaeum de La Masacre; se puede llegar desde las alas oeste o norte. No tienen intendente propiamente dicho. La Llave creciente abre cualquiera de las dos entradas, aunque también sirven otros métodos.","text_en":"The Shen'dralar live in the Athenaeum library in Dire Maul and can be reached from the West or North wings. They have no quartermaster as such. The Crescent Key opens either entrance, though other methods also work.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shen'dralar Reputation Faction:  Location, Quests and Rewards › Shen'dralar Location in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/shendralar-reputation-faction-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:shendralar-reputation-faction-location-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:6249c8546af75cf74e5cce3015c7826338b42d17"]},{"id":"comercio-subir-reputacion-shendralar","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Subir reputación Shen'dralar","title_en":"Gaining Shen'dralar Reputation","summary_es":"La reputación se obtiene entregando libros y librams mediante misiones en la biblioteca.","summary_en":"Reputation comes from turning in books and librams through quests at the library.","keywords_es":["subir reputación Shen'dralar","libro de clase Shen'dralar","reputación por librams","Arcano de Concentración","misiones Shen'dralar"],"keywords_en":["raise Shen'dralar reputation","Shen'dralar class book","libram reputation","Arcanum of Focus","Shen'dralar quests"],"text_es":"La reputación Shen'dralar se consigue mediante misiones entregadas en la biblioteca, no matando enemigos. Entregar el libro de clase da 500 p. una vez por personaje; cada libram para un Arcano da 200 p. y cada libro de Malla de placas de torio encantado, otros 200 p.","text_en":"Shen'dralar reputation comes from quests turned in at the library, not from killing enemies. Turning in a Class Book grants 500 reputation once per character; each libram for an Arcanum grants 200, and each Enchanted Thorium Platemail book grants another 200.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shen'dralar Reputation Faction:  Location, Quests and Rewards › How to Earn Shen'dralar Reputation in WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/shendralar-reputation-faction-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shen'dralar Reputation Faction:  Location, Quests and Rewards › Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas Class Trinkets","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/shendralar-reputation-faction-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shen'dralar Reputation Faction:  Location, Quests and Rewards › Librams and Arcanum Enchantments","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/shendralar-reputation-faction-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shen'dralar Reputation Faction:  Location, Quests and Rewards › Enchanted Thorium Blacksmithing Plans","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/shendralar-reputation-faction-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:shendralar-reputation-faction-location-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:25e7a8a1073079379bcc9dcd975c45b34acd963d","section:5e87a440a21c95b6b630cdf3cf7b6cc1106691a0","section:6111b574c138e662972a0721bdc7ab28011502db","section:9e47bf030d6b1da063be61d0c05a8b6b9a95bd5b"]},{"id":"comercio-recompensas-shendralar","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas Shen'dralar","title_en":"Shen'dralar Rewards","summary_es":"Los libros de clase dan un abalorio y el proveedor vende un patrón de toga de tela lunar.","summary_en":"Class books grant a trinket, and the provisioner sells a Mooncloth robe pattern.","keywords_es":["recompensas Shen'dralar","Lacre real de Eldre'Thalas","Proveedor Shen'dralar","Patrón: toga de tela lunar","abalorio de clase"],"keywords_en":["Shen'dralar rewards","Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas","Shen'dralar Provisioner","Pattern: Mooncloth Robe","class trinket"],"text_es":"Un libro para cada clase inicia una misión breve que recompensa con un Lacre real de Eldre'Thalas, un abalorio con Resistencia al Fuego y atributos adaptados a esa clase. El Proveedor Shen'dralar también vende el Patrón: toga de tela lunar en cantidades limitadas; no hace falta una misión para comprarlo.","text_en":"A book for each class starts a short quest that rewards a Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas, a trinket with Fire Resistance and class-tailored stats. The Shen'dralar Provisioner also sells the Pattern: Mooncloth Robe in limited supply; no quest is required to buy it.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shen'dralar Reputation Faction:  Location, Quests and Rewards › Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas Class Trinkets","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/shendralar-reputation-faction-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Shen'dralar Reputation Faction:  Location, Quests and Rewards › Mooncloth Robe Tailoring Pattern","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/shendralar-reputation-faction-location-rewards","date":"2026-11-10"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:shendralar-reputation-faction-location-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:25e7a8a1073079379bcc9dcd975c45b34acd963d","section:ac406bba4118f36bf43877ef992e6203ef5a8b9e"]},{"id":"comercio-ubicacion-fauces-madera","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dónde está el Bastión de los Fauces de Madera","title_en":"Where to Find Timbermaw Hold","summary_es":"La facción ocupa una cueva que conecta Frondavil, Claro de la Luna y Cuna del Invierno.","summary_en":"The faction occupies a cave connecting Felwood, Moonglade, and Winterspring.","keywords_es":["Bastión de los Fauces de Madera","ubicación Fauces de Madera","cueva Fauces de Madera","Frondavil","Cuna del Invierno"],"keywords_en":["Timbermaw Hold location","Timbermaw Hold cave","Timbermaw faction location","Felwood","Winterspring"],"text_es":"El Bastión de los Fauces de Madera ocupa una cueva entre Frondavil, Claro de la Luna y Cuna del Invierno. El intendente está en el cruce de las tres ramas; al principio, los furbolgs de la cueva pueden atacarte si aún no has ganado reputación suficiente. También puede empezar en la mazmorra Bastión Faucenegra, al matar a sus enemigos, o con las misiones de Ekkal en Azshara.","text_en":"Timbermaw Hold occupies a cave between Felwood, Moonglade, and Winterspring. The quartermaster is at the junction of its three branches; at first, the cave's furbolgs may attack you until you gain enough reputation. Reputation can also start from the Blackmaw Hold dungeon, by killing its enemies, or from Ekkal's quests in Azshara.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Timbermaw Hold Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Timbermaw Hold Location in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Timbermaw Hold Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Unlocking Timbermaw Hold in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["reputation:timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:04b7f9d98989b301f2c1e3c9621b7e0894ca7197","section:9141bfb6e1b31473955fe40a334c9ab41d82e9ef"]},{"id":"comercio-subir-reputacion-fauces-madera","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Subir reputación Fauces de Madera","title_en":"Gaining Timbermaw Reputation","summary_es":"Completa las misiones iniciales, mata furbolgs y entrega plumas o cuentas repetidamente.","summary_en":"Complete the initial quests, kill furbolgs, and repeatedly turn in feathers or beads.","keywords_es":["subir reputación Fauces de Madera","Pluma de penacho Muertobosque","Cuentas de Espíritu Nevada","misiones repetibles Fauces de Madera","reputación Exaltado Fauces de Madera"],"keywords_en":["raise Timbermaw reputation","Deadwood Headdress Feather","Winterfall Spirit Beads","repeatable Timbermaw quests","Timbermaw Exalted reputation"],"text_es":"Empiezas en Odio. Completa las misiones iniciales y mata furbolgs de otras tribus en Frondavil y Cuna del Invierno: dan reputación hasta Reverenciado (hasta Exaltado los jefes con nombre). Plumas para Grazle, Plumas para Nafien y Cuentas para Salfa piden 5 objetos y dan 50 p.; si buscas Exaltado, guarda las plumas y cuentas hasta Reverenciado. Lo más rápido, y caro, es comprar Faltriquera de los Faucenegra en la casa de subastas para la misión repetible de Ekkal, en Azshara: 5 por 100 p.","text_en":"You start at Hated. Complete the introductory quests and kill furbolgs from other tribes in Felwood and Winterspring: they give reputation up to Revered (up to Exalted for named bosses). Feathers for Grazle, Feathers for Nafien and Beads for Salfa take 5 items and give 50 reputation; if aiming for Exalted, hold the feathers and beads until Revered. The fastest, and expensive, way is buying Blackmaw Pouches on the Auction House for the repeatable quest from Ekkal in Azshara: 5 for 100 reputation.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Timbermaw Hold Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Farming Timbermaw Hold Reputation in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Timbermaw Hold Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Reputation Gains from Quests in Felwood and Winterspring","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Timbermaw Hold Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Best Way to Farm Timbermaw Hold Reputation","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["reputation:timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:00fc1d6efec72a9a3f142b0c7e3128f878792a9f","section:2f9216fb5afa8e705b4baf56f7e479772a584fc8","section:a501e0215ebc1d3f2576e246f108582cdb8ba62a"]},{"id":"comercio-reputacion-fauces-madera-azshara","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Reputación Fauces de Madera en Azshara y Bastión Faucenegra","title_en":"Timbermaw Hold reputation in Azshara and Blackmaw Hold","summary_es":"Misiones de Azshara y jefes del Bastión Faucenegra que dan reputación con los Fauces de Madera.","summary_en":"Azshara quests and Blackmaw Hold bosses that give Timbermaw Hold reputation.","keywords_es":["reputación Fauces de Madera en Azshara","Bastión Faucenegra reputación","misiones de Ekkal","subir Fauces de Madera con la mazmorra","cuernos Legashi"],"keywords_en":["Timbermaw Hold reputation Azshara","Blackmaw Hold reputation","Ekkal quests","Legashi horns","farm Timbermaw Hold in dungeon"],"text_es":"En Forever, Azshara y la mazmorra Bastión Faucenegra dan reputación con los Fauces de Madera. Las misiones de Ekkal en Azshara dan entre 10 y 150 p. cada una; salvo La amenaza Legashi y Cuernos Legashi (repetible, 100 p. por cada 5 cuernos), exigen Neutral. En la mazmorra, cada furbolg Faucenegra da 5 p. y cada jefe 100 (hay siete seguros), y sus misiones dan 100-150 p. Sirven de Odio a Exaltado.","text_en":"In Forever, Azshara and the Blackmaw Hold dungeon give Timbermaw Hold reputation. The quests from Ekkal in Azshara give 10 to 150 reputation each; apart from The Legashi Threat and Legashi Horns (repeatable, 100 reputation per 5 horns), they require Neutral. In the dungeon, each Blackmaw furbolg gives 5 and each boss 100 (seven are guaranteed), and its quests give 100-150. This works from Hated up to Exalted.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Timbermaw Hold Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Reputation Gains from Quests in Azshara and Blackmaw Hold","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-18"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Timbermaw Hold Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Reputation Gains from Mobs in Blackmaw Hold","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["reputation:timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:0156230cff49a573677383dffb3c4fe827b6e1dd","section:6afb33a9eb3b99fea912c13907362aeb649311e5"]},{"id":"comercio-recompensas-fauces-madera","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Vendedores y objetos Fauces de Madera","title_en":"Timbermaw Vendors and Items","summary_es":"Los vendedores ofrecen patrones de oficio y objetos fúrbolg desde Amistoso hasta Reverenciado.","summary_en":"The vendors offer profession patterns and furbolg items from Friendly through Revered.","keywords_es":["recompensas Fauces de Madera","recetas del intendente Fauces de Madera","Faltriquera de medicinas fúrbolg","Tótem medicinal fúrbolg","Patrón: arnés de oso de guerra"],"keywords_en":["Timbermaw rewards","Timbermaw quartermaster recipes","Furbolg Medicine Pouch","Furbolg Medicine Totem","Pattern: Warbear Harness"],"text_es":"Meilosh, el vendedor de recetas de la cueva, ofrece desde Amistoso Receta: transmutar tierra a agua, Fórmula: encantar arma de 2M: agilidad y dos patrones de oso de guerra; en Honorable, Fórmula: encantar arma: agilidad y tres patrones más; en Reverenciado, patrones de manto, camorristas y botas pesadas, además de Diseño: tallatormentas y Diseño: bagh nakh. Monóculo de Gorn, desde Honorable, vende la Faltriquera de medicinas fúrbolg y el Tótem medicinal fúrbolg.","text_en":"Meilosh, the recipe vendor in the cave, offers, starting at Friendly, Recipe: Transmute Earth to Water, Formula: Enchant 2H Weapon - Agility and two Warbear patterns; at Honored, Formula: Enchant Weapon - Agility and three more patterns; at Revered, patterns for the Mantle, Brawlers and Heavy Boots, plus Plans: Stormcarver and Plans: Bagh Nakh. Gorn One Eye, from Honored, sells the Furbolg Medicine Pouch and Furbolg Medicine Totem.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Timbermaw Hold Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Timbermaw Hold Vendors in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-18"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["reputation:timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:7a5f5a7244cb64e67355e26519f1e252392c9ce0"]},{"id":"comercio-abalorio-fauces-madera","chapter":8,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Abalorio de los Fauces de Madera","title_en":"Timbermaw Trinket","summary_es":"Al llegar a Exaltado, una misión difícil recompensa un abalorio y más reputación.","summary_en":"At Exalted, a difficult quest rewards a trinket and more reputation.","keywords_es":["Defensor de los Fauce de Madera","La raíz de todos los males","recompensa Exaltado Fauces de Madera","abalorio Fauces de Madera","misión final Fauces de Madera"],"keywords_en":["Defender of the Timbermaw","The Root of All Evil","Timbermaw Exalted reward","Timbermaw trinket","Timbermaw final quest"],"text_es":"Al alcanzar Exaltado, Monóculo de Gorn ofrece La raíz de todos los males. Derrotar al demonio de élite de nivel 62 completa la difícil misión y otorga el abalorio Defensor de los Fauce de Madera y 500 p. de reputación; probablemente necesitarás un grupo.","text_en":"At exalted, Gorn One Eye offers The Root of All Evil. Defeating the level 62 elite demon completes the difficult quest and grants the Defender of the Timbermaw trinket and 500 reputation; you will likely need a group.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Timbermaw Hold Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › Reputation Gains from Quests in Felwood and Winterspring","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Timbermaw Hold Reputation Guide - WoW: Forever › The Defender of the Timbermaw Trinket in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["reputation:timbermaw-hold-quests-quartermaster-rewards"],"source_hashes":["section:00fc1d6efec72a9a3f142b0c7e3128f878792a9f","section:5f8296f550758fd42c191305ffa743f320439983"]}]},"09-viajes-monturas.json":{"description":"Capítulo 9: Viajes y monturas. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"viaje-monturas","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo conseguir monturas","title_en":"Ways to Obtain Mounts","summary_es":"Las monturas se obtienen mediante misiones, reputación, el sistema Legacy y paquetes de la tienda.","summary_en":"Mounts come from quests, reputation, the Legacy system and store packs.","keywords_es":["conseguir monturas","monturas de reputación","monturas de misiones","monturas de Legacy"],"keywords_en":["get mounts","reputation mounts","quest mounts","Legacy mounts"],"text_es":"En Forever hay monturas ligadas a misiones, vendedores de reputación, puntos de Legacy y paquetes de la tienda. Algunas monturas de reputación cuestan oro; otras se desbloquean con una moneda de comerciante o con progreso de Legacy.","text_en":"In Forever, mounts are tied to quests, reputation vendors, Legacy Points and store packs. Some reputation mounts cost gold; others unlock through a merchant currency or Legacy progress.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: All Mounts in World of Warcraft: Forever - Models and Locations › Mounts Quick Reference for WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/collections/mounts-locations-appearances","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["collection:mounts-locations-appearances"],"source_hashes":["section:7e3c0d24ed1fcc0a5a273cc508322c9711f091a1"]},{"id":"viaje-monturas-nivel","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Aprendiz y Oficial jinete: niveles y coste","title_en":"Apprentice and Journeyman Riding: Levels and Cost","summary_es":"Aprendiz jinete se aprende al 40; Oficial jinete, al 60, con descuentos por reputación.","summary_en":"Apprentice Riding is learned at 40; Journeyman Riding at 60, with reputation discounts.","keywords_es":["nivel para montar","coste de equitación","montura de nivel 40","montura épica nivel 60"],"keywords_en":["riding level requirement","riding training cost","level 40 mount","level 60 epic mount"],"text_es":"Aprendiz jinete requiere nivel 40 y da acceso a monturas que aumentan un 60% la velocidad: entrenar cuesta 100 de oro y la montura 20, aunque la primera es gratis. Oficial jinete requiere nivel 60; cuesta 1000 de oro y su montura de 200 también es gratis la primera vez. Con reputación Honorable obtienes un 10% de descuento.","text_en":"Apprentice Riding requires level 40 and unlocks mounts that increase speed by 60%: training costs 100 gold and a mount 20, although the first is free. Journeyman Riding requires level 60; training costs 1000 gold and its 200-gold mount is also free the first time. Honored reputation gives a 10% discount.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Learning to Ride and Getting Your First Mount: Costs and Location - WoW: Forever › Learning to Ride Mounts in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/unlocking-riding-skill-mounts","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:unlocking-riding-skill-mounts"],"source_hashes":["section:f4820ee6eb966cece1aedfa9c61bcd5c4bec0b8b"]},{"id":"viaje-monturas-coleccion","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Monturas de ediciones","title_en":"Edition Mounts","summary_es":"Algunos paquetes de Forever incluyen monturas exclusivas de colección.","summary_en":"Some Forever packs include collectible mounts.","keywords_es":["monturas de edición","Garramanada cerúleo","Compañero fiel de aventurero veterano","montura de paquete"],"keywords_en":["edition mounts","Cerulean Prideclaw","Veteran Adventurer's Loyal Companion","pack mount"],"text_es":"La Garramanada cerúleo se incluye al comprar cualquier paquete de Forever. El Compañero fiel de aventurero veterano viene con una edición épica o con la colección de Forever.","text_en":"Forever packs include Cerulean Prideclaw. Veteran Adventurer's Loyal Companion comes with a Skyborne Epic Pack or Warcraft Forever Collection.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: All Mounts in World of Warcraft: Forever - Models and Locations › Mounts Quick Reference for WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/collections/mounts-locations-appearances","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["collection:mounts-locations-appearances"],"source_hashes":["section:7e3c0d24ed1fcc0a5a273cc508322c9711f091a1"]},{"id":"viaje-barcos-zeppelin-tranvia","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Barcos, zepelines y tranvía","title_en":"Ships, Zeppelins and Tram","summary_es":"Barcos, zepelines y el tranvía son transportes gratuitos con horarios y accesos distintos.","summary_en":"Ships, zeppelins and the tram are free transport with different schedules and access.","keywords_es":["barcos gratis","usar zepelín","tranvía de Forjaz","transporte entre ciudades"],"keywords_en":["free ships","ride a zeppelin","Deeprun Tram","city transport"],"text_es":"Los barcos y zepelines son gratuitos y suelen llegar cada 3–5 minutos, con cerca de un minuto para subir. Los barcos están pensados sobre todo para la Alianza y los zepelines para la Horda; la facción contraria puede sufrir ataques de guardias. El tranvía entre Forjaz y Ventormenta también es gratis: llega cada minuto y espera 10 segundos.","text_en":"Ships and zeppelins are free and usually arrive every 3–5 minutes, with about a minute to board. Ships are mainly intended for the Alliance and zeppelins for the Horde; guards may attack members of the opposing faction. The tram between Ironforge and Stormwind is also free: it arrives every minute and waits 10 seconds.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Flight Points, Zeppelins, and Ships - WoW: Forever › Ships and Airships in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Flight Points, Zeppelins, and Ships - WoW: Forever › Zeppelins in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships","date":"2026-11-16"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Flight Points, Zeppelins, and Ships - WoW: Forever › Deeprun Tram in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships"],"source_hashes":["section:29652c9ee07944238a8f7fda614df3e756ed9b78","section:8ce9649fd4ec1f403b2230e2f133bb92df85183b","section:b039ba53f4d9fa08735bfb9bd1ad592284dc3b20"]},{"id":"viaje-monturas-clases","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Monturas de misión para Paladines y Brujos","title_en":"Paladin and Warlock Class Mounts","summary_es":"Las misiones de clase de Paladín y Brujo otorgan monturas y la habilidad necesaria para usarlas.","summary_en":"Paladin and Warlock class quests grant mounts and the riding skill needed to use them.","keywords_es":["montura de paladín","montura de brujo","misión de montura","habilidad de equitación de clase"],"keywords_en":["Paladin mount","Warlock mount","class mount quest","class riding skill"],"text_es":"A nivel 40 y 60, las misiones de clase de Paladín y Brujo recompensan, respectivamente, una montura que aumenta la velocidad un 60% y otra un 100%. Cada una incluye la habilidad de equitación necesaria para montar esa recompensa.","text_en":"At levels 40 and 60, Paladin and Warlock class quests respectively reward a mount that increases speed by 60% and one that increases it by 100%. Each quest also grants the riding skill needed for its mount.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Learning to Ride and Getting Your First Mount: Costs and Location - WoW: Forever › Learning to Ride Mounts in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/unlocking-riding-skill-mounts","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:unlocking-riding-skill-mounts"],"source_hashes":["section:f4820ee6eb966cece1aedfa9c61bcd5c4bec0b8b"]},{"id":"viaje-mascotas-coleccion","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo conseguir mascotas de compañía","title_en":"How to Obtain Companion Pets","summary_es":"Las mascotas de compañía son cosméticas y se consiguen mediante varias actividades y vendedores.","summary_en":"Companion pets are cosmetic and come from several activities and vendors.","keywords_es":["conseguir mascotas de compañía","mascotas cosméticas","mascotas de misión","mascotas de vendedor"],"keywords_en":["obtain companion pets","cosmetic pets","quest pets","vendor pets"],"text_es":"Las mascotas de compañía no participan en combate: son cosméticas. Se obtienen, entre otras formas, en la tienda, con puntos de Legacy, como botín, mediante misiones o vendedores, y por pesca, profesiones o reputación.","text_en":"Companion pets do not take part in combat; they are cosmetic. Sources include the store, Legacy Points, drops, quests or vendors, as well as fishing, professions and reputation.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: All Companions in World of Warcraft: Forever - Models and Locations › (intro)","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/collections/pets-locations-sources","date":"2026-11-05"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: All Companions in World of Warcraft: Forever - Models and Locations › Companions Quick Reference for WoW: Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/collections/pets-locations-sources","date":"2026-11-05"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["collection:pets-locations-sources"],"source_hashes":["guide:31f23925ab44cf5818689e2cec92af47c2bbda42","section:eddb674c13a76d6fd015c8928e6c8a6f1d46b609"]},{"id":"viaje-riverglades","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Clarofluvial: nivel y cómo llegar","title_en":"Riverglades: Level Range and Access","summary_es":"Clarofluvial es una zona disputada de nivel 36–44, accesible a pie o en barco desde Tanaris.","summary_en":"Riverglades is a contested level 36–44 zone, reachable on foot or by boat from Tanaris.","keywords_es":["Clarofluvial","nivel de Clarofluvial","llegar a Clarofluvial","barco desde Tanaris"],"keywords_en":["Riverglades","Riverglades level range","reach Riverglades","boat from Tanaris"],"text_es":"Clarofluvial es una zona disputada para niveles 36–44. Puedes llegar por el camino al norte de Montañas Crestagrana o al sur de Tierras Inhóspitas; también hay conexión marítima con Tanaris.","text_en":"Riverglades is a contested zone for levels 36–44. Reach it by road north of Redridge Mountains or south of Badlands, or take the boat connection to Tanaris.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Riverglades Zone Overview - Maps, Factions, and Transport › Overview of Riverglades","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/riverglades-zone-overview","date":"2026-11-07"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Riverglades Zone Overview - Maps, Factions, and Transport › How to get to Riverglades","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/riverglades-zone-overview","date":"2026-11-07"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:riverglades-zone-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:28d0dc3a5891132b3bd68dd0df4ca35c3d43b6ad","section:f29b1f9a2e2738e4772783e1b76c71f5dfc0c780"]},{"id":"viaje-zephras-isle","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Isla de Zephras: zona inicial de los Cielonatos","title_en":"Zephras Isle: Skyborne Starting Zone","summary_es":"La zona inicial de los Cielonatos abarca los niveles 1–12 y se puede visitar sin comprar un paquete.","summary_en":"The Skyborne starting zone spans levels 1–12 and can be visited without buying a pack.","keywords_es":["zona inicial Cielonato","niveles de Isla de Zephras","acceso a Cielonatos","paquete Cielonato"],"keywords_en":["Skyborne starting zone","Zephras Isle level range","Skyborne access","Skyborne pack"],"text_es":"La Isla de Zephras es la zona inicial de los Cielonatos y está pensada para niveles 1–12. Puedes visitar la isla sin comprar nada, pero para crear un Cielonato y jugar su experiencia de inicio necesitas una edición Heroica o superior.","text_en":"Zephras Isle is the Skyborne starting zone, intended for levels 1–12. You can visit the island without a purchase, but creating a Skyborne character and playing its starting experience requires the Skyborne Heroic Pack or a higher edition.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zephras Isle Zone Overview - Maps, Locations, and Trainers › Overview of Zephras Isle","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zephras-isle-zone-overview","date":"2026-10-22"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:zephras-isle-zone-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:39b5735cc3fbc7ac9bb591fe9dc7574a016772a6"]},{"id":"viaje-barcos-zephras","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Barcos a Zephras Isle","title_en":"Boats to Zephras Isle","summary_es":"Dos barcos aéreos enlazan Valanaar con Dalaran y con las cercanías de Cima del Trueno.","summary_en":"Two skyboats connect Valanaar with Dalaran and the area near Thunder Bluff.","keywords_es":["barco a Zephras Isle","llegar desde Dalaran","llegar desde Cima del Trueno","barco aéreo Cielonato"],"keywords_en":["boat to Zephras Isle","travel from Dalaran","travel from Thunder Bluff","Skyborne skyboat"],"text_es":"Dos barcos aéreos pasan aproximadamente cada 5 minutos entre Valanaar y el exterior: uno va a Dalaran y el otro a un punto al norte de Cima del Trueno. Ambas facciones pueden usar cualquiera de las rutas, aunque suelen estar pensadas para la Alianza y la Horda, respectivamente.","text_en":"Two skyboats arrive about every 5 minutes between Valanaar and the outside world: one goes to Dalaran and the other to a point north of Thunder Bluff. Both factions can use either route, though they are generally intended for the Alliance and Horde, respectively.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Zephras Isle Zone Overview - Maps, Locations, and Trainers › How to get to and From Zephras Isle","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/zephras-isle-zone-overview","date":"2026-10-22"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:zephras-isle-zone-overview"],"source_hashes":["section:57c9dce99023ca0af358563496bbbfd15a8871a5"]},{"id":"viaje-monturas-coleccion-ventana","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dónde ver las monturas obtenidas","title_en":"Where to View Collected Mounts","summary_es":"La ventana de colecciones de cuenta reúne las monturas que ya has obtenido.","summary_en":"The Account Collections window gathers the mounts you have obtained.","keywords_es":["ver mis monturas","colección de monturas","monturas obtenidas","ventana de colecciones"],"keywords_en":["view my mounts","mount collection","collected mounts","collections window"],"text_es":"La ventana de colecciones de cuenta se abre con Mayús+P. Desde allí puedes encontrar y usar las monturas obtenidas.","text_en":"Open the Account Collections window with Shift+P. From there, you can find and use the mounts you have obtained.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Learning to Ride and Getting Your First Mount: Costs and Location - WoW: Forever › Learning to Ride Mounts in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/unlocking-riding-skill-mounts","date":"2026-11-17"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:unlocking-riding-skill-mounts"],"source_hashes":["section:f4820ee6eb966cece1aedfa9c61bcd5c4bec0b8b"]},{"id":"viaje-forma-viaje-druida","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Forma de viaje del Druida","title_en":"Druid Travel Form","summary_es":"La Forma de viaje del Druida aumenta mucho la velocidad, solo funciona al aire libre y sirve antes de tener montura.","summary_en":"Druid Travel Form greatly increases speed, only works outdoors and serves before you get a mount.","keywords_es":["forma de viaje druida","viajar como druida","velocidad druida","druida sin montura","forma de viaje"],"keywords_en":["druid travel form","travel as druid","druid speed","druid without mount","travel form"],"text_es":"La Forma de viaje del Druida aumenta mucho la velocidad de movimiento, pero solo puede usarse al aire libre. Antes de tener montura es el medio de desplazamiento principal del Druida, y después sigue siendo útil porque es instantánea y se puede usar en combate. Los Cielonatos tienen una apariencia propia para esta forma.","text_en":"Druid Travel Form greatly increases movement speed, but it can only be used outdoors. Before you get a mount it is the Druid's main way to travel, and afterwards it remains useful because it is instant and can be used in combat. Skyborne have their own appearance for this form.","tags":["DRUID"],"sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: World of Warcraft: Forever Druid Shapeshift Forms Guide › Travel Form","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/druid-shapeshift-forms","date":"2026-11-04"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["class:druid:general:druid-shapeshift-forms"],"source_hashes":["section:bf7368cd5b7349bb6823a504314fd65375a63f20"]},{"id":"viaje-puntos-vuelo","chapter":9,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo funcionan los puntos de vuelo","title_en":"How Flight Points Work","summary_es":"Desbloquea maestros de vuelo y conecta puntos intermedios para recorrer rutas largas.","summary_en":"Unlock flight masters and connect intermediate points to travel long routes.","keywords_es":["desbloquear punto de vuelo","rutas de vuelo","coste de vuelo","parar durante un vuelo"],"keywords_en":["unlock flight point","flight routes","flight cost","stop during a flight"],"text_es":"Habla con un maestro de vuelo para habilitar su punto. Las rutas enlazan puntos cercanos: para llegar lejos debes haber desbloqueado los tramos intermedios. Volar cuesta plata y el precio aumenta con la distancia; durante el trayecto puedes pedir que te dejen en el siguiente punto intermedio.","text_en":"Talk to a Flight Master to unlock that flight point. Routes connect nearby points, so a long trip requires the intermediate stops to be unlocked. Flights cost silver and become more expensive with distance; while travelling, you can request a drop-off at the next intermediate point.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Flight Points, Zeppelins, and Ships - WoW: Forever › Flight Points in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships","date":"2026-11-16"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:flight-points-zeppelins-and-ships"],"source_hashes":["section:8330235adff2e80958435979ec427edec9ad8151"]}]},"10-jcj.json":{"description":"Capítulo 10: JcJ. Secciones editoriales redactadas desde guías de terceros.","sections":[{"id":"jcj-que-cambia","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"El sistema de rangos de Forever","title_en":"Forever’s Ranking System","summary_es":"El JcJ usa 14 rangos con progreso por puntos y temporadas; también añade Islas Lanza Negra.","summary_en":"PvP uses 14 ranks with point-based seasonal progress; it also adds Darkspear Islands.","keywords_es":["rangos jcj forever","cómo funciona el rango","puntos de rango","temporadas de jcj","cambios jcj"],"keywords_en":["forever pvp ranks","how pvp ranks work","rank points","pvp seasons","pvp changes"],"text_es":"El JcJ de Forever se mide con Puntos de Rango (14 rangos, sin decaimiento) y Honor, no con tu posición frente al resto del reino. Hay cuatro campos de batalla (Garganta Grito de Guerra, Cuenca de Arathi, Valle de Alterac e Islas Lanza Negra, nuevo y de 15 contra 15), pero ni arena ni campos clasificados. El rango se reinicia cada pocos meses; los desafíos legacy conservan su progreso.","text_en":"Forever PvP is measured with Rank Points (14 ranks, no decay) and Honor, not by your position against the rest of the realm. There are four battlegrounds (Warsong Gulch, Arathi Basin, Alterac Valley and the new 15v15 Darkspear Islands), but no arena or rated battlegrounds. Rank resets every few months; legacy challenges keep their progress.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: PvP Overview in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Battlegrounds in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › PvP Rank Rewards in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › Legacy Challenges from PvP Ranks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:339d2bb8f0c88b91219501ade0a629b984077528","section:5650189e54f4cfbc28e504cc474e17b22768bdbd"]},{"id":"jcj-honor-puntos","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Honor y Puntos de Rango","title_en":"Honor and Rank Points","summary_es":"El Honor compra objetos y los Puntos de Rango suben de rango; las monedas son independientes.","summary_en":"Honor buys items and Rank Points raise your rank; the currencies are independent.","keywords_es":["honor y puntos de rango","para qué sirve el honor","cómo subir de rango jcj","límite de honor","monedas jcj forever"],"keywords_en":["honor and rank points","what is honor for","how to raise pvp rank","honor cap","wow forever pvp currencies"],"text_es":"El JcJ otorga Honor para comprar objetos y Puntos de Rango para subir de rango. Son monedas independientes: no se convierten entre sí y comprar equipo no frena el progreso. Puedes acumular hasta 15.000 de Honor; los Puntos de Rango no decaen durante la temporada y se ganan en campos de batalla, en JcJ del mundo y con las misiones semanales de Campo de honor. Subir de rango solo da el título; el equipo se compra con Honor.","text_en":"PvP grants Honor to buy items and Rank Points to climb ranks. They are independent currencies: they cannot be converted and buying gear does not slow your progress. You can hold up to 15,000 Honor; Rank Points do not decay during the season and come from battlegrounds, world PvP and the weekly Field of Honor quests. Reaching a rank only grants the title; gear is bought with Honor.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: PvP Overview in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › How PvP Rank Works","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Weekly PvP Season's Journey Quests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:03085d174c3727847bd3b31eb21125356a687a11"]},{"id":"jcj-rangos","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Los 14 rangos de JcJ","title_en":"The 14 PvP Ranks","summary_es":"El rango 14 requiere 24.750 Puntos de Rango acumulados; la barra no decae durante la temporada.","summary_en":"Rank 14 requires 24,750 accumulated Rank Points; the bar does not decay during a season.","keywords_es":["rangos de jcj","cuántos rangos hay","puntos para rango 14","rango jcj sin decadencia","progreso de rango forever"],"keywords_en":["pvp ranks","how many pvp ranks","rank 14 points","pvp rank no decay","forever rank progress"],"text_es":"Hay 14 rangos y cada uno pide más Puntos de Rango que el anterior; el rango 14 exige 24750 en total. A diferencia del sistema clásico de competir por puestos con otros jugadores, aquí el progreso no decae durante la temporada y se reinicia al acabar esta. Se ha informado de que no se puede pasar del rango 3 hasta el nivel 40; no está confirmado si es intencionado ni si hay otros límites por nivel.","text_en":"There are 14 ranks and each needs more Rank Points than the last; rank 14 takes 24,750 in total. Unlike the classic system of competing for standings against other players, progress here does not decay during the season and resets when it ends. Players report being unable to pass rank 3 until level 40; it is not confirmed whether that is intended or whether other level gates exist.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: PvP Overview in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › What Is The PvP Rank System?","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › Rank Points Needed for Every Rank","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:03e59c9051a43a44dc1b7c8c8f640e1fcd88ec64","section:984ff0277c99fd047fe00775b54dc47ddd0e217c"]},{"id":"jcj-recompensas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Recompensas por rango","title_en":"Rewards by Rank","summary_es":"Cada rango desbloquea compras; el 13 completa el conjunto y el 14 da acceso a armas.","summary_en":"Each rank unlocks purchases; rank 13 completes the set and rank 14 unlocks weapons.","keywords_es":["recompensas por rango jcj","qué da cada rango","montura de guerra negra","transfiguración jcj","armas rango 14"],"keywords_en":["pvp rank rewards","what each rank gives","black war mount","pvp transmog","rank 14 weapons"],"text_es":"Cada rango da un título de facción y desbloquea compras en el vendedor de Ventormenta u Orgrimmar: 1 tabardo; 2 abalorio; 3 capa; 4 collar; 5 pociones de combate; 6 colores o heraldo; 7 estandarte de batalla; 8 lacres de muñeca y cintura; 9 pies; 10 manos; 11 monturas de guerra negras; 12 hombros y piernas; 13 cabeza y pechera; 14 armas. El equipo raro no pide rango y los lacres lo convierten en épico. El rango 13 completa el aspecto; los rangos 3, 7, 10, 13 y 14 dan un punto legacy.","text_en":"Each rank grants a faction title and unlocks purchases from the Stormwind or Orgrimmar vendor: 1 tabard; 2 trinket; 3 cloak; 4 necklace; 5 combat potions; 6 colors or herald; 7 battle standard; 8 wrist and waist seals; 9 feet; 10 hands; 11 black war mounts; 12 shoulders and legs; 13 head and chest; 14 weapons. Rare gear needs no rank and the seals upgrade it to epic. Rank 13 completes the look; ranks 3, 7, 10, 13 and 14 give a legacy point.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: PvP Ranking Rewards in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › PvP Rank Rewards in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › Legacy Challenges from PvP Ranks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:339d2bb8f0c88b91219501ade0a629b984077528","section:5650189e54f4cfbc28e504cc474e17b22768bdbd"]},{"id":"jcj-honor-equipo","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Equipo de JcJ y Honor","title_en":"PvP Gear and Honor","summary_es":"El Honor compra equipo y consumibles; el equipo raro no exige rango y las armas, rango 14.","summary_en":"Honor buys gear and consumables; rare gear needs no rank, while weapons require rank 14.","keywords_es":["equipo de jcj","comprar equipo jcj","honor para equipo","equipo jcj en pve","armas de rango 14"],"keywords_en":["pvp gear","buy pvp gear","honor gear","pvp gear in pve","rank 14 weapons"],"text_es":"El Honor sirve para comprar equipo y consumibles; las piezas más potentes también piden marcas de campo. El equipo raro se compra sin rango y requiere nivel 55; al alcanzar ciertos rangos compras lacres envalentonados que lo mejoran a épico. El de JcJ compite con el de mazmorras y bandas, pero está orientado al JcJ y deja algo por detrás en PvE. Nada se regala: todo se compra a vendedores.","text_en":"Honor buys gear and consumables; the most powerful pieces also need battleground marks. Rare gear needs no rank and requires level 55; at certain ranks you buy emboldened seals that upgrade it to epic. PvP gear competes with dungeon and raid gear but is tuned for PvP, leaving you slightly behind in PvE. Nothing is given: it is all bought from vendors.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: PvP Overview in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: PvP Ranking Rewards in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › PvP Gear in Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › Common Questions","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:559fb7e41795f5edadf783975817f3578a5c97eb","section:9a4880e86942543e0426af17231d16a9173f890b"]},{"id":"jcj-vendedores-colas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Vendedores y colas de campos","title_en":"Vendors and Battleground Queues","summary_es":"Hay vendedores en ciudades principales y se entra en cola con maestros de batalla o por portales.","summary_en":"Vendors are in major cities, and queues are accessed through battlemasters or portals.","keywords_es":["vendedores jcj","dónde comprar equipo jcj","maestros de batalla","colas de campos de batalla","salón de los campeones"],"keywords_en":["pvp vendors","where to buy pvp gear","battlemasters","battleground queues","champions hall"],"text_es":"Para comprar equipo, visita los vendedores JcJ de Ventormenta u Orgrimmar; la Alianza tiene otra opción en las cloacas de Dalaran. En las ciudades, busca maestros de batalla en el Castillo de Ventormenta y el Valle del Honor, o acude al portal del campo. Los grupos prefabricados se emparejan con otros grupos prefabricados.","text_en":"PvP gear vendors can be found at Champions’ Hall (Stormwind) and Hall of Legends (Orgrimmar); Alliance also has another option in the Dalaran sewers. To queue, use a city battlemaster—at Stormwind Keep or the Valley of Honor—or the battleground portal. Premade groups are matched with other premades.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Locations of Battleground Battlemasters in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-10-24"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Battlegrounds in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-10-24"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › PvP Vendor Locations","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › Queues","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:cbaab0da3b5c4524ebd872353bd63b32c38bfad6","section:f9da479258408ccfe740d838e1ce29069aebac15"]},{"id":"jcj-temporadas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Temporadas y reinicios","title_en":"Seasons and Resets","summary_es":"El rango se reinicia entre temporadas, que traen recompensas nuevas; el progreso Legacy permanece.","summary_en":"Rank resets between seasons, which bring new rewards; Legacy progress persists.","keywords_es":["temporadas de jcj","reinicio de rango","recompensas de temporada","desafíos legacy jcj","progreso de temporada"],"keywords_en":["pvp seasons","rank reset","season rewards","pvp legacy challenges","season progress"],"text_es":"Los Puntos de Rango no decaen durante la temporada, pero el rango se reinicia al terminarla; se prevé un reinicio cada varios meses. Cada temporada ofrece recompensas nuevas y las de temporadas pasadas dejan de estar disponibles. El progreso de los desafíos legacy no se reinicia, así que basta con completar una vez el desafío de rango 14.","text_en":"Rank Points do not decay during a season, but rank resets when it ends; a reset is expected every few months. Each season offers new rewards, and past-season rewards are no longer available. Legacy challenge progress does not reset, so the rank 14 challenge only needs to be completed once.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: PvP Overview in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-10-24"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › Seasons and Resets","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › Legacy Challenges from PvP Ranks","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:339d2bb8f0c88b91219501ade0a629b984077528","section:ad95b47570f7ee7580c2e294c651b2d452245f62"]},{"id":"jcj-darkspear","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cómo se juega en Islas Lanza Negra","title_en":"How Darkspear Islands Plays","summary_es":"Controla posiciones para sumar puntos y lleva la bandera central a una posición de tu equipo.","summary_en":"Control positions to score points and carry the central flag to one your team controls.","keywords_es":["cómo jugar islas lanza negra","objetivos islas lanza negra","bases y bandera jcj","campo 15 contra 15","puntos islas lanza negra"],"keywords_en":["how to play darkspear islands","darkspear islands objectives","bases and flag pvp","15v15 battleground","darkspear islands points"],"text_es":"Islas Lanza Negra es un campo de batalla con quince jugadores por equipo y cuatro bases. Controlar posiciones genera puntos con el tiempo; además, lleva la bandera que aparece en el centro a una posición controlada para sumar puntos de inmediato. La captura aporta más puntos si tu equipo controla más posiciones, y el modo recuerda a Ojo de la Tormenta. Sus tramos son 30-39, 40-49, 50-59 y 60.","text_en":"Darkspear Islands is a battleground with fifteen players per team and four bases. Controlling positions generates points over time; you can also carry the flag that appears in the center to a controlled position for an immediate score. Capturing it scores more when your team controls more positions, and the mode is similar to Eye of the Storm. Its brackets are 30-39, 40-49, 50-59, and 60.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkspear Islands","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-10-24"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › Darkspear Islands","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:06227c0fa6107945e885a80c69b570dc7fb95ad3"]},{"id":"jcj-arena","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"No hay arena en Forever","title_en":"There Is No Arena in Forever","summary_es":"Forever no ofrece arena ni campos de batalla con clasificación.","summary_en":"Forever has no arena or rated battlegrounds.","keywords_es":["arena en forever","hay arena jcj","arena con clasificación","campos de batalla clasificados","modos jcj forever"],"keywords_en":["arena in forever","is there arena","rated arena","rated battlegrounds","forever pvp modes"],"text_es":"Forever no tiene arena ni campos de batalla con clasificación. La arena llegó en una expansión posterior y no está disponible aquí, así que no hay colas de arena.","text_en":"Forever has no arena or rated battlegrounds. Arena was added in a later expansion and is not available here, so there are no arena queues.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: PvP Overview in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-10-24"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › World PvP","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:765a5ee3b6901c3251038dec754a9e019e81b081"]},{"id":"jcj-primeras-partidas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Tus primeras partidas de JcJ","title_en":"Your First PvP Matches","summary_es":"Al empezar, practica en grupo y prioriza los objetivos del campo por encima de las bajas.","summary_en":"When starting out, practice in a group and prioritize battleground objectives over kills.","keywords_es":["empezar en jcj","primeras partidas jcj","consejos jcj","objetivos de campo","morir en jcj"],"keywords_en":["start pvp","first pvp matches","pvp tips","battleground objectives","dying in pvp"],"text_es":"Es normal morir mucho al empezar: el JcJ se juega de forma distinta a las misiones o las mazmorras. Practica, juega en grupo y céntrate en puntuar o capturar la bandera; acumular bajas no sustituye esos objetivos.","text_en":"It is normal to die a lot when starting out: PvP plays differently from questing or dungeons. Practice, play in a group, and focus on scoring or capturing the flag; getting kills does not replace those objectives.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › How to Start PvPing","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:0fe37440ca1da6e0a95740a302073c100082a07c"]},{"id":"jcj-clasificaciones","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Las clasificaciones aún no son finales","title_en":"Rankings Are Not Final Yet","summary_es":"La beta tenía nivel 30 y no hay puestos definitivos; se valoran daño, control, defensas y utilidad.","summary_en":"The beta was level 30 and there are no final placements; damage, control, defense, and utility are weighed.","keywords_es":["clasificación jcj","tier list jcj","especializaciones fuertes jcj","criterios jcj","beta nivel 30"],"keywords_en":["pvp rankings","pvp tier list","strong pvp specs","pvp criteria","level 30 beta"],"text_es":"Las clasificaciones de JcJ no están cerradas: la beta tenía nivel 30 y la lista sigue sin puestos definitivos, así que pueden cambiar con ajustes, conjuntos y estadísticas. Para valorar una especialización se mira el daño sostenido y el estallido, el control, las defensas y la utilidad; en sanadores, la curación, el maná, el control y las defensas. Las menciones siguientes son herramientas fuertes, no un orden definitivo.","text_en":"PvP rankings are not closed: the beta was level 30 and the list still has no final placements, so it can change with tuning, sets, and stats. A spec is judged on sustained and burst damage, control, defense, and utility; healers are judged on healing, mana, control, and defense. The mentions below are strong toolkits, not a definitive order.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: PvP DPS Spec Rankings › About the Tier List","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-tier-list-dps-specs","date":"2026-10-26"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: PvP Healer Spec Rankings › About the Tier List","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-tier-list-healer-specs","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["tierlist:pvp-tier-list-dps-specs","tierlist:pvp-tier-list-healer-specs"],"source_hashes":["section:3ff8d31a22b97c005c4d959787fe5f1f4759920e"]},{"id":"jcj-dps-cuerpo","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"DPS de cuerpo a cuerpo fuertes","title_en":"Strong Melee DPS","summary_es":"Guerrero Armas y Furia, Paladín Reprensión y Pícaro Sutileza, Combate y Asesinato destacan por presión y control.","summary_en":"Arms and Fury Warrior, Retribution Paladin, and all three Rogue specs stand out for pressure and control.","keywords_es":["dps cuerpo a cuerpo jcj","guerrero armas jcj","paladín reprensión jcj","pícaro sutileza jcj","guerrero furia jcj"],"keywords_en":["melee pvp dps","arms warrior pvp","retribution paladin pvp","subtlety rogue pvp","fury warrior pvp"],"text_es":"Se consideran entre las opciones más fuertes de cuerpo a cuerpo Guerrero Armas, Guerrero Furia, Paladín Reprensión y Pícaro Sutileza, Combate y Asesinato. Armas destaca por presión sostenida, control y reducción de curación; Furia por daño en área y aguante; Reprensión por utilidad, control, inmunidad y apoyo de curación; Sutileza por estallido y control, y los otros Pícaros por control y reinicios. Los Pícaros son difíciles de atrapar y pueden encadenar control.","text_en":"Arms Warrior, Fury Warrior, Retribution Paladin, and Subtlety, Combat, and Assassination Rogue are considered among the strongest melee options. Arms stands out for sustained pressure, control, and healing reduction; Fury for area damage and durability; Retribution for utility, control, immunity, and off-healing; Subtlety for burst and control, and the other Rogues for control and resets. Rogues are hard to catch and can chain control.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: PvP DPS Spec Rankings › PvP DPS Tier List for World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-tier-list-dps-specs","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["tierlist:pvp-tier-list-dps-specs"],"source_hashes":["section:e9abe25a91961bbe87fc139976d7bbae374c8199"]},{"id":"jcj-dps-distancia","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"DPS a distancia fuertes","title_en":"Strong Ranged DPS","summary_es":"Brujo Demonología y Aflicción, Mago Escarcha, Sacerdote Sombra y los Cazadores destacan por control y aguante.","summary_en":"Demonology and Affliction Warlock, Frost Mage, Shadow Priest, and Hunters stand out for control and durability.","keywords_es":["dps a distancia jcj","brujo demonología jcj","mago escarcha jcj","sacerdote sombra jcj","cazador jcj"],"keywords_en":["ranged pvp dps","demonology warlock pvp","frost mage pvp","shadow priest pvp","hunter pvp"],"text_es":"Se consideran entre las opciones más fuertes a distancia Brujo Demonología, Brujo Aflicción, Mago Escarcha, Sacerdote Sombra y los Cazadores. Demonología aguanta mucho en 1v1 con su demonio, maldiciones y control; Aflicción castiga a varios con daño en el tiempo y se sostiene; Escarcha frena, mantiene la distancia y tiene defensas; Sombra aporta daño, ejecución, control y apoyo de curación; Dominio de bestias y Puntería aportan daño a distancia y control, y Supervivencia aporta daño cuerpo a cuerpo y control. Otras ramas también tienen herramientas, pero estas destacan por su conjunto.","text_en":"Demonology Warlock, Affliction Warlock, Frost Mage, Shadow Priest, and Hunters are considered among the strongest ranged options. Demonology endures a lot in 1v1 with its demon, curses, and control; Affliction punishes several enemies with damage over time and sustains itself; Frost slows, keeps distance, and has defenses; Shadow brings damage, execute, control, and off-healing; Beast Mastery and Marksmanship bring ranged damage and control, and Survival brings melee damage and control. Other trees have tools too, but these stand out for their package.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: PvP DPS Spec Rankings › PvP DPS Tier List for World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-tier-list-dps-specs","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["tierlist:pvp-tier-list-dps-specs"],"source_hashes":["section:e9abe25a91961bbe87fc139976d7bbae374c8199"]},{"id":"jcj-sanadores","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Sanadores fuertes para JcJ","title_en":"Strong PvP Healers","summary_es":"Disciplina, Paladín Sagrado, Sacerdote Sagrado, Chamán y Druida de Recuperación destacan por su kit.","summary_en":"Discipline, Holy Paladin, Holy Priest, and Restoration Shaman and Druid stand out for their kits.","keywords_es":["sanadores jcj","sacerdote disciplina jcj","paladín sagrado jcj","chamán recuperación jcj","druida recuperación jcj"],"keywords_en":["pvp healers","discipline priest pvp","holy paladin pvp","restoration shaman pvp","restoration druid pvp"],"text_es":"Se consideran entre los sanadores más fuertes Sacerdote Disciplina, Paladín Sagrado, Sacerdote Sagrado, Chamán Recuperación y Druida Recuperación. Disciplina cura con escudos y una cura rápida y aporta una gran mejora ofensiva; Paladín Sagrado es muy duradero, mezcla curas instantáneas y casteadas y tiene mucha utilidad; Sacerdote Sagrado se centra en curación directa y tiene una segunda vida; Chamán Recuperación cubre tanque y grupo con tótems y es el único sanador con interrupción base; Druida Recuperación usa curas en el tiempo, control y puede hacer daño.","text_en":"Discipline Priest, Holy Paladin, Holy Priest, Restoration Shaman, and Restoration Druid are considered among the strongest healers. Discipline heals with shields and a fast heal and brings a strong offensive buff; Holy Paladin is very durable, mixes instant and cast heals, and has great utility; Holy Priest focuses on direct healing and has a second life; Restoration Shaman covers tank and group with totems and is the only healer with a baseline interrupt; Restoration Druid uses heal-over-time effects, control, and can deal damage. The list has no final order; these are complete toolkits.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: PvP Healer Spec Rankings › Healer DPS Tier List for World of Warcraft Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-tier-list-healer-specs","date":"2026-10-26"}],"updated":"2026-11-15","topics":["tierlist:pvp-tier-list-healer-specs"],"source_hashes":["section:cd7686951162acbb672b793e452f22975e2cb660"]},{"id":"jcj-desactivar-bandera","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cuándo se desactiva tu JcJ","title_en":"When Your PvP Flag Turns Off","summary_es":"La bandera tarda 5 minutos en apagarse y solo empieza la cuenta atrás en territorio amistoso.","summary_en":"The flag takes 5 minutes to turn off, and the timer starts only in friendly territory.","keywords_es":["quitar bandera jcj","desactivar pvp","cuánto tarda en quitarse pvp","comando /pvp","salir de combate jcj"],"keywords_en":["turn off pvp flag","disable pvp","pvp flag timer","/pvp command","leave pvp combat"],"text_es":"Para quitar tu bandera de JcJ, espera 5 minutos en territorio amistoso. Si la activaste a mano con /pvp, volver a escribirlo inicia la cuenta atrás de 5 minutos para desactivarla.","text_en":"To remove your PvP flag, wait 5 minutes in friendly territory. If you toggled it on manually with /pvp, typing it again starts a 5-minute timer to turn it off.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: World PvP in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59"]},{"id":"jcj-guardias-bandera","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Guardias contra jugadores marcados","title_en":"Guards and PvP-Flagged Players","summary_es":"Los guardias enemigos atacan si te acercas; los neutrales, solo si luchas cerca.","summary_en":"Enemy guards attack if you get close; neutral guards do so only if you fight nearby.","keywords_es":["guardias y pvp","guardias enemigos","guardias neutrales","bandera jcj cerca de guardias","atacar guardias marcado pvp"],"keywords_en":["guards and pvp","enemy guards","neutral guards","pvp flag near guards","flagged near guards"],"text_es":"Mientras tengas la bandera de JcJ activa, los guardias de la facción enemiga te atacarán si te acercas demasiado. Los guardias neutrales solo intervienen si estás luchando cerca de ellos.","text_en":"While your PvP flag is active, guards from the opposing faction attack if you get too close. Neutral guards intervene only if you are fighting nearby.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: World PvP in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-10-24"}],"updated":"2026-11-18","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59"]},{"id":"jcj-limite-semanal","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Límite semanal de rango","title_en":"Weekly Rank Cap","summary_es":"El tope de Puntos de Rango aumenta cada semana y limita el avance inicial.","summary_en":"The Rank Points cap rises weekly and limits early progression.","keywords_es":["límite semanal de rango","tope puntos de rango","cuándo se llega al rango 14","puntos rango 14","progreso semanal jcj","cuántas semanas hasta rango 14","ponerse al día en rango"],"keywords_en":["weekly rank cap","rank points cap","when can I reach rank 14","rank 14 points","weekly pvp progress","weeks to reach rank 14","catch up on rank"],"text_es":"Un tope de Puntos de Rango sube cada semana hasta 24750, el del rango 14; la temporada dura más de diez semanas. Datos extraídos del juego: rango máximo por semana 3, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 11, 12 y 13, y el 14 desde la semana 10. Puedes alcanzar el tope en cualquier momento, aunque te saltes semanas o empieces un personaje nuevo: el máximo es el mismo que el de quien llega cada semana.","text_en":"A Rank Points cap rises every week up to 24,750, the rank 14 total; the season lasts more than ten weeks. Datamined: max rank per week 3, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 11, 12 and 13, with rank 14 from week 10. You can catch up to the cap at any time, even if you skip weeks or start a new character: the maximum is the same as for someone who reaches it every week.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: PvP Overview in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › PvP Rank Weekly Cap","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:ffd0015eced931aee583523f166b113bd82a0339"]},{"id":"jcj-marcas-recompensas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Marcas y recompensas de los campos","title_en":"Battleground Marks and Rewards","summary_es":"Las marcas compran equipo o se canjean por experiencia y reputación; ganar también da Honor adicional.","summary_en":"Marks buy gear or trade for experience and reputation; winning also grants bonus Honor.","keywords_es":["marcas de campos de batalla","recompensa por ganar campo","honor por campos","cambiar marcas por experiencia","reputación con marcas"],"keywords_en":["battleground marks","battleground win reward","honor from battlegrounds","trade marks for experience","marks for reputation"],"text_es":"Ganar un campo de batalla concede tres marcas de ese campo y Honor adicional; perder solo da una. Las marcas sirven para comprar las piezas más potentes de JcJ o canjearlas por experiencia y reputación.","text_en":"Winning a battleground grants three of its marks and bonus Honor; losing grants only one. Marks buy the most powerful PvP pieces or can be traded for experience and reputation.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Battlegrounds in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › Battlegrounds in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:250e3b8babb410e16eace92d1ce7998e5ca26fce"]},{"id":"jcj-reputacion-islas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Reputación de Islas Lanza Negra","title_en":"Darkspear Islands Reputation","summary_es":"Participar en Islas Lanza Negra aumenta la reputación con dos facciones que ofrecen equipo.","summary_en":"Playing Darkspear Islands builds reputation with two factions that offer gear.","keywords_es":["reputación islas lanza negra","facciones de islas lanza negra","equipo de theramore jcj","asaltantes lanza negra","recompensas de reputación jcj","dónde comprar equipo de islas lanza negra","bryanna brisas"],"keywords_en":["darkspear islands reputation","darkspear islands factions","theramore pvp gear","darkspear raiders","pvp reputation rewards","where to buy darkspear islands gear","bryanna embreeze"],"text_es":"Participar en Islas Lanza Negra da reputación con la Fuerza Expedicionaria de Theramore (Alianza) y los Asaltantes Lanza Negra (Horda). Con ella compras equipo nuevo de JcJ en Los Baldíos: a Bryanna Brisas en el Fuerte del Norte (63,4 58,6) o a Creeg Bothunk al norte de Trinquete (65,0 34,6).","text_en":"Playing Darkspear Islands earns reputation with the Theramore Expeditionary Force (Alliance) and the Darkspear Raiders (Horde). It lets you buy new PvP gear in the Barrens: from Bryanna Embreeze at Northwatch Hold (63.4 58.6) or Creeg Bothunk north of Ratchet (65.0 34.6).","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkspear Islands","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59"]},{"id":"jcj-puntos-por-rango","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Puntos de Rango por cada rango","title_en":"Rank Points per rank","summary_es":"Puntos de Rango acumulados que pide cada uno de los 14 rangos.","summary_en":"Cumulative Rank Points needed for each of the 14 ranks.","keywords_es":["cuántos puntos para el rango 8","puntos de rango por rango","puntos para cada rango jcj","tabla de rangos jcj"],"keywords_en":["how many points for rank 8","rank points per rank","points needed for each pvp rank","pvp rank table"],"text_es":"Cada rango pide más que el anterior: del 1 al 14, 750, 900, 1050, 1200, 1350, 1500, 1650, 1800, 1950, 2100, 2350, 2500, 2650 y 3000. Acumulados: 750, 1650, 2700, 3900, 5250, 6750, 8400, 10200, 12150, 14250, 16600, 19100, 21750 y 24750 para el rango 14.","text_en":"Each rank costs more than the last: ranks 1 to 14 need 750, 900, 1,050, 1,200, 1,350, 1,500, 1,650, 1,800, 1,950, 2,100, 2,350, 2,500, 2,650 and 3,000. Cumulative: 750, 1,650, 2,700, 3,900, 5,250, 6,750, 8,400, 10,200, 12,150, 14,250, 16,600, 19,100, 21,750 and 24,750 for rank 14.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › Rank Points Needed for Every Rank","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:03e59c9051a43a44dc1b7c8c8f640e1fcd88ec64"]},{"id":"jcj-mision-semanal-honor","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Misiones semanales de Campo de honor","title_en":"Weekly Field of Honor quests","summary_es":"Misiones semanales de JcJ de Gadgetzan que dan Honor y Puntos de Rango.","summary_en":"Weekly Gadgetzan PvP quests that give Honor and Rank Points.","keywords_es":["misión semanal de jcj","campo de honor semana 1","dónde empezar misiones de jcj","wizzik polvoburbuja","puntos de rango rápidos"],"keywords_en":["weekly pvp quest","field of honor week 1","where to start pvp quests","wizzik dustfizz","quick rank points"],"text_es":"Wizzik Polvoburbuja, en Gadgetzan (Tanaris, 51,8 27,2), da cada semana una misión de Campo de honor a partir del nivel 60: 300 de Honor y 500 Puntos de Rango. Semana 1: ganar 10 duelos; semana 2: completar 3 batallas en la Garganta Grito de Guerra; semana 3: matar a 25 enemigos de la otra facción allí. No hay que hacerlas en su semana: las atrasadas siguen disponibles.","text_en":"Wizzik Dustfizz in Gadgetzan (Tanaris, 51.8 27.2) gives a Field of Honor quest each week from level 60: 300 Honor and 500 Rank Points. Week 1: win 10 duels; week 2: complete 3 Warsong Gulch battles; week 3: kill 25 enemy-faction players there. You do not need to do them in their week: missed ones stay available.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Weekly PvP Season's Journey Quests in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59"]},{"id":"jcj-maestros-batalla","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Dónde están los maestros de batalla","title_en":"Where the battlemasters are","summary_es":"Ciudades y coordenadas de los maestros de batalla de cada facción.","summary_en":"Cities and coordinates of each faction's battlemasters.","keywords_es":["dónde apuntarme a un campo de batalla","maestro de batalla ventormenta","maestro de batalla orgrimmar","maestros de batalla coordenadas","portal de campo de batalla"],"keywords_en":["where to queue for a battleground","stormwind battlemaster","orgrimmar battlemaster","battlemaster coordinates","battleground portal"],"text_es":"Alianza: Ventormenta (Castillo, 80 38,5), Forjaz (zona militar, 70 88), Darnassus (Bancal del Guerrero, 59 40,5) y Dalaran (centro, 16 66). Horda: Orgrimmar (Valle del Honor, 79 30,5), Entrañas (sala del trono, 57 91) y Cima del Trueno (Alto de los Cazadores, 57 78). También puedes entrar por el portal del campo en el mundo.","text_en":"Alliance: Stormwind (Keep, 80 38.5), Ironforge (military ward, 70 88), Darnassus (Warrior's Terrace, 59 40.5) and Dalaran (centre, 16 66). Horde: Orgrimmar (Valley of Honor, 79 30.5), Undercity (throne room, 57 91) and Thunder Bluff (Hunter Rise, 57 78). You can also enter through the battleground portal in the open world.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Locations of Battleground Battlemasters in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59"]},{"id":"jcj-tramos-campos","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Niveles y tamaños de los campos de batalla","title_en":"Battleground levels and sizes","summary_es":"Nivel mínimo, tramos y jugadores por equipo de cada campo de batalla.","summary_en":"Minimum level, brackets and team size of each battleground.","keywords_es":["nivel para campos de batalla","tramos de nivel jcj","cuántos jugadores en cada campo","desde qué nivel puedo entrar a arathi","nivel mínimo valle de alterac"],"keywords_en":["battleground level requirements","pvp level brackets","players per battleground","what level for arathi basin","alterac valley minimum level"],"text_es":"Se agrupa por tramos de nivel. Garganta Grito de Guerra (10 contra 10): 10-19, 20-29, 30-39, 40-49, 50-59 y 60. Cuenca de Arathi (15 contra 15): desde 20, mismos tramos. Islas Lanza Negra (15 contra 15): desde 30. Valle de Alterac (40 contra 40): un único tramo, 51-60.","text_en":"Players are grouped by level bracket. Warsong Gulch (10v10): 10-19, 20-29, 30-39, 40-49, 50-59 and 60. Arathi Basin (15v15): from 20, same brackets. Darkspear Islands (15v15): from 30. Alterac Valley (40v40): a single bracket, 51-60.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Battleground Level Brackets in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › Battlegrounds in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:250e3b8babb410e16eace92d1ce7998e5ca26fce"]},{"id":"jcj-reglas-bandera","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Cuándo te marcas para JcJ según el conjunto de reglas","title_en":"When you get PvP-flagged by ruleset","summary_es":"Marcado automático o voluntario según el conjunto de reglas y el territorio.","summary_en":"Automatic or voluntary flagging by ruleset and territory.","keywords_es":["cuándo se activa el pvp","pvp en conjunto de reglas normal","marcado automático de jcj","territorio disputado y enemigo","activar pvp con /pvp"],"keywords_en":["when does pvp turn on","pvp in normal ruleset","automatic pvp flag","contested and enemy territory","toggle pvp with /pvp"],"text_es":"En JcJ te marcas solo al entrar en territorio disputado o enemigo; en amistoso, solo si escribes /pvp, atacas a un enemigo o ayudas a un aliado marcado. En Normal, Rol y Hardcore te marcas solo al entrar en territorio enemigo; en amistoso y disputado, solo por voluntad. En general, casi toda zona por encima del nivel 15 es disputada. Se activa con /pvp o con clic derecho en tu retrato.","text_en":"In PvP you are flagged only when entering contested or enemy territory; in friendly territory only if you type /pvp, attack an enemy or help a flagged ally. In Normal, Roleplaying and Hardcore you are flagged only on entering enemy territory; in friendly and contested ones only by choice. Generally, nearly every zone above level 15 is contested. Toggle with /pvp or by right-clicking your portrait.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: PvP Ruleset","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Normal, Roleplaying, and Hardcore Rulesets","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › World PvP","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:765a5ee3b6901c3251038dec754a9e019e81b081"]},{"id":"jcj-colas-entre-reglas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Colas entre conjuntos de reglas","title_en":"Cross-ruleset queues","summary_es":"Las colas de campos de batalla mezclan jugadores de todos los conjuntos de reglas.","summary_en":"Battleground queues mix players from every ruleset.","keywords_es":["campos de batalla con amigos de otro conjunto de reglas","jugar con otros conjuntos de reglas","cola entre reglas","grupo con amigos de pvp y normal"],"keywords_en":["battlegrounds with friends on another ruleset","cross ruleset queue","queue with pvp and normal players"],"text_es":"Las colas de campos de batalla funcionan entre conjuntos de reglas: encuentras jugadores de Normal, JcJ y Rol, y es el único momento en que ocurre. Puedes cruzarte con amigos de otro conjunto, pero no agruparte con ellos ni entrar en cola juntos.","text_en":"Battleground queues work across rulesets: you meet players from Normal, PvP and Roleplaying, and it is the only time that happens. You may meet friends from another ruleset, but you cannot group with them or queue together.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › Queues","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: Everything You Need to Know About PvP in World of Warcraft: Forever › Battlegrounds in WoW Forever","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-overview","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:250e3b8babb410e16eace92d1ce7998e5ca26fce","section:f9da479258408ccfe740d838e1ce29069aebac15"]},{"id":"jcj-estandarte-batalla","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Estandarte de batalla (rango 7)","title_en":"Battle Standard (rank 7)","summary_es":"Objeto de rango 7 que se planta y aumenta la salud de los aliados cercanos.","summary_en":"Rank 7 item you plant that raises nearby allies' health.","keywords_es":["estandarte de batalla","qué hace el estandarte de jcj","estandarte de batalla de la horda","objeto de rango 7"],"keywords_en":["battle standard","what does the pvp standard do","horde battle standard","rank 7 item"],"text_es":"Al llegar al rango 7 puedes comprar el Estandarte de batalla de tu facción (de la Alianza o de la Horda). Se planta en el suelo, tiene 10 minutos de reutilización y aumenta un 15 % la salud de los aliados cercanos.","text_en":"At rank 7 you can buy your faction's Battle Standard (Alliance or Horde). You plant it on the ground, it has a 10-minute cooldown and raises nearby allies' health by 15%.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › Reward Highlights","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: PvP Ranking Rewards in Forever","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59","section:53075c2fb59608848a5598c06912aaaa027d954b"]},{"id":"jcj-costes-equipo","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Costes del equipo raro de JcJ","title_en":"Rare PvP gear costs","summary_es":"Honor y marcas que cuesta cada pieza de equipo raro de JcJ.","summary_en":"Honor and marks each rare PvP gear piece costs.","keywords_es":["cuánto cuesta el equipo de jcj","costes de honor del equipo","marcas para comprar equipo jcj","precio pechera de jcj","precio abalorio de jcj"],"keywords_en":["how much does pvp gear cost","honor cost of gear","marks needed for pvp gear","pvp chest price","pvp trinket price"],"text_es":"Costes de beta, sujetos a cambios. Abalorio: 3500 de Honor. Capa: 3000 y 10 marcas de Arathi. Muñequeras: 3000 y 10 de Garganta. Cinturón: 4000 y 10 de Arathi. Hombros: 4250 y 10 de Arathi. Guantes: 5000 y 10 de Garganta. Botas y collar: 5000 y 10 de Lanza Negra. Casco: 6000 y 15 de Alterac. Piernas: 6000 y 15 de Garganta. Pechera: 6250 y 15 de Arathi.","text_en":"Beta costs, subject to change. Trinket: 3,500 Honor. Cloak: 3,000 and 10 Arathi marks. Wrist: 3,000 and 10 Warsong marks. Belt: 4,000 and 10 Arathi. Shoulders: 4,250 and 10 Arathi. Gloves: 5,000 and 10 Warsong marks. Necklace and boots: 5,000 and 10 Darkspear marks. Helm: 6,000 and 15 Alterac. Legs: 6,000 and 15 Warsong. Chest: 6,250 and 15 Arathi.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › PvP Gear Costs","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:8fd4437f5df6a631d961b5b8e274af8d254468ed"]},{"id":"jcj-costes-mejora-epica","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Costes de la mejora a épico y de las armas","title_en":"Epic upgrade and weapon costs","summary_es":"Honor de la mejora a épico y precio de las armas de rango 14.","summary_en":"Honor cost of the epic upgrade and rank 14 weapon prices.","keywords_es":["cuánto cuesta mejorar a épico el equipo de jcj","precio armas de rango 14","coste armas jcj","cuántas marcas para arma jcj","mejora de equipo raro a épico"],"keywords_en":["cost to upgrade pvp gear to epic","rank 14 weapon price","pvp weapon cost","marks for pvp weapon","rare to epic upgrade"],"text_es":"Costes de beta. Mejora a épico, solo Honor: muñequeras 750, cinturón y botas 1000, hombros y guantes 1500, pechera 1750, piernas y abalorio 2000. Armas (rango 14): las de dos manos cuestan 20 marcas de Alterac y 15000 de Honor; las de una mano, dagas y de distancia, 10 de Lanza Negra y 8000; escudos y escritos, 10 de Lanza Negra y 7000.","text_en":"Beta costs. Epic upgrade, Honor only: wrist 750, belt and boots 1,000, shoulders and gloves 1,500, chest 1,750, legs and trinket 2,000. Weapons (rank 14): two-handers cost 20 Alterac marks and 15,000 Honor; one-handers, daggers and ranged, 10 Darkspear marks and 8,000; shields and tomes, 10 Darkspear marks and 7,000.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › PvP Weapon Costs","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"},{"type":"editorial","ref":"Icy Veins: WoW Forever - PvP Rank System Explained › PvP Gear Costs","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/pvp-rank-system","date":"2026-09-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["section:87cc0ed085ed72bf5345e21860297db21cdc2922","section:8fd4437f5df6a631d961b5b8e274af8d254468ed"]},{"id":"jcj-islas-recompensas","chapter":10,"status":"editorial","title_es":"Equipo de reputación de Islas Lanza Negra","title_en":"Darkspear Islands reputation gear","summary_es":"Qué piezas se compran con cada nivel de reputación de Islas Lanza Negra.","summary_en":"Which pieces each Darkspear Islands reputation level unlocks.","keywords_es":["qué equipo hay para Islas Lanza Negra","abalorios de theramore","reputación exaltado islas lanza negra","tabardo de batalla de theramore","hombreras de islas lanza negra"],"keywords_en":["what gear does darkspear islands offer","theramore trinkets","exalted darkspear islands","theramore battle tabard","darkspear islands shoulders"],"text_es":"Amistoso: abalorios (Sello enriquecido). Honorable: capa, sortijas y collar. Reverenciado: mano izquierda y armas. Exaltado: guantes, hombreras solo a nivel 60 y el tabardo de batalla de Theramore o de los Lanza Negra. Hay versiones por tramo de nivel (28, 38, 48 y 58; guantes en 50 y 60). En Los Baldíos, Bryanna Brisas y Creeg Bothunk las venden.","text_en":"Friendly: trinkets (Enriched Seal). Honored: cloak, rings and neck. Revered: off-hand and weapons. Exalted: gloves, shoulders at level 60 only, and the Theramore or Darkspear battle tabard. Versions exist per level bracket (28, 38, 48 and 58; gloves at 50 and 60). In the Barrens, Bryanna Embreeze and Creeg Bothunk sell them.","sources":[{"type":"editorial","ref":"Wowhead: Darkspear Islands","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards","date":"2026-11-19"}],"updated":"2026-11-19","topics":["general:pvp"],"source_hashes":["guide:d7f7d3c26ffbf818fe7a97ea014fa6d234bd6d59"]}]}}}
]==]
